#. ja: ミニオン「タイニーボム」を呼び出す。<br>人工孵化させたボムの幼生体。たぶん爆発しない
#. de: Du rufst deinen Kirschbomber als Begleiter herbei. Garantie gegen Selbstzerstöung, ansonsten Gil zurück.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bombino, un bombo miniature créé par la fusion occulte d'énergies éthérées et ombrales. Garanti sans explosion ou remboursé.
#. column 1: To maintain the white-hot temperatures within their cores, bombs will feed upon almost any combustible material, including wood, charcoal, ceruleum, fire crystals, and even dragon peppers.
#. column 2: Brilliant bombs─<br>breathtaking,<br>beautiful, brilliant!<br>  - Acolyte Ba Go
#. column 3: Self-destruct
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:1:0:0"
msgid "Summon your cherry bomb minion─a miniature recreation of a voidsent bomb, created via the thaumaturgical rendering of umbrally charged aetherial energy. Guaranteed never to self-destruct, or your gil back."
msgstr "Призови миньона «Вишнёвая бомба» — крошечную копию бомбы из Пустоты, созданную с помощью тауматургии из эфира, заряженного мраком. Самоподрыва не будет — или вернём гил!"

#. ja: ボムの幼生体。異界「ヴォイド」由来のガス状生物「ボム」を、錬金術の技術を応用して人工孵化させたもの。木炭や青燐水、ファイアクリスタルなどの燃料を与えると、喜んで食べる。たぶん爆発しない
#. de: Um die weißglühenden Temperaturen in ihren Kernen aufrechtzuerhalten, verschlingen die Bomber so gut wie jedes brennbare Material, einschließlich Holz, Kohle, Feuerkristalle und sogar Drachenpfeffer.
#. fr: Un bébé bombo mis au monde ar<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>ciellement par une technique d'alchimie de pointe. Cette entité de gaz venue du néant engloutit avec délectation charbon, céruleum et cristaux de feu. Garanti sans explosion ou remboursé.
#. column 0: Summon your cherry bomb minion─a miniature recreation of a voidsent bomb, created via the thaumaturgical rendering of umbrally charged aetherial energy. Guaranteed never to self-destruct, or your gil back.
#. column 2: Brilliant bombs─<br>breathtaking,<br>beautiful, brilliant!<br>  - Acolyte Ba Go
#. column 3: Self-destruct
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:1:0:1"
msgid "To maintain the white-hot temperatures within their cores, bombs will feed upon almost any combustible material, including wood, charcoal, ceruleum, fire crystals, and even dragon peppers."
msgstr "Чтобы поддерживать в ядре раскалённую добела температуру, бомбы пожирают почти всё, что горит: дерево, уголь, церулеум, огненные кристаллы и даже драконьи перцы."

#. ja: ギギ…ギギギ…
#. de: Bald ist eure Zeit zur Explosion gekommen! Hihi! Das wird schön ...<br><i>Ba Go, Akolyth des 789. Ordens</i>
#. fr: Tchik tchik tchik...
#. column 0: Summon your cherry bomb minion─a miniature recreation of a voidsent bomb, created via the thaumaturgical rendering of umbrally charged aetherial energy. Guaranteed never to self-destruct, or your gil back.
#. column 1: To maintain the white-hot temperatures within their cores, bombs will feed upon almost any combustible material, including wood, charcoal, ceruleum, fire crystals, and even dragon peppers.
#. column 3: Self-destruct
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:1:0:2"
msgid "Brilliant bombs─<br>breathtaking,<br>beautiful, brilliant!<br>  - Acolyte Ba Go"
msgstr "Бомбы — что за зрелище!<br>Захватывают дух,<br>красивы, великолепны!<br>  — аколит Ба Го"

#. ja: 自爆
#. de: Selbstzerstörung
#. fr: Auto-destruction
#. column 0: Summon your cherry bomb minion─a miniature recreation of a voidsent bomb, created via the thaumaturgical rendering of umbrally charged aetherial energy. Guaranteed never to self-destruct, or your gil back.
#. column 1: To maintain the white-hot temperatures within their cores, bombs will feed upon almost any combustible material, including wood, charcoal, ceruleum, fire crystals, and even dragon peppers.
#. column 2: Brilliant bombs─<br>breathtaking,<br>beautiful, brilliant!<br>  - Acolyte Ba Go
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:1:0:3"
msgid "Self-destruct"
msgstr "Самоподрыв"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK300のダメージを与える。ただし、特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンは強制帰還する。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 300 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus, aber die ausführenden Trabanten werden weggeschickt.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 300 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT sont au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment renvoyées.
#. column 0: Summon your cherry bomb minion─a miniature recreation of a voidsent bomb, created via the thaumaturgical rendering of umbrally charged aetherial energy. Guaranteed never to self-destruct, or your gil back.
#. column 1: To maintain the white-hot temperatures within their cores, bombs will feed upon almost any combustible material, including wood, charcoal, ceruleum, fire crystals, and even dragon peppers.
#. column 2: Brilliant bombs─<br>breathtaking,<br>beautiful, brilliant!<br>  - Acolyte Ba Go
#. column 3: Self-destruct
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:1:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам поблизости урон силой 300. После применения миньон немедленно покидает поле боя."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット001」を呼び出す。<br>錬金術師ギルドと彫金師ギルドが共作した、からくり人形
#. de: Du rufst deine Marionette Nr. 001 als Begleiter herbei. Eine voll funktionstüchtige Puppe, die in Zusammenarbeit der Alchemisten mit der Gold<shy>schmiede<shy>gilde erschaffen wurde.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte pantin P001, une marionnette mécanique fabriquée con<shy>join<shy>te<shy>ment par les guildes des alchimistes et des orfèvres.
#. column 1: The standard frill-free #001 model is not only the best-selling mammet on the market, but is the blueprint on which all other clockwork servitors are based.
#. column 2: Mammets can't<br>even taste food!<br>  - Serendipity
#. column 3: Deconstruct
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:2:0:0"
msgid "Summon your mammet #001 minion─a fully operational clockwork puppet built in a joint effort by the Alchemists' and Goldsmiths' Guilds."
msgstr "Призови миньона «Маммет № 001» — полностью функциональную заводную куклу, созданную совместными усилиями гильдий алхимиков и ювелиров."

#. ja: ウルダハの彫金師ギルドが、錬金術師ギルドの協力を得て開発、製造した魔法人形「マメット」の市販モデル。型式001は、ベーシックな汎用機種であり、これをベースに様々な亜種が作られている
#. de: Das Standardmodell 001 ist nicht nur ein Verkaufs- schlager, sondern auch die Vorlage, auf der alle anderen Uhrwerk-Diener basieren.
#. fr: La guilde des orfèvres a sollicité l'aide de celle des alchimistes pour développer cet automate magique destiné au grand public. Le modèle P001 propose des fonctions de base et a été décliné en divers sous-modèles spécialisés.
#. column 0: Summon your mammet #001 minion─a fully operational clockwork puppet built in a joint effort by the Alchemists' and Goldsmiths' Guilds.
#. column 2: Mammets can't<br>even taste food!<br>  - Serendipity
#. column 3: Deconstruct
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:2:0:1"
msgid "The standard frill-free #001 model is not only the best-selling mammet on the market, but is the blueprint on which all other clockwork servitors are based."
msgstr "Простая, без излишеств модель № 001 не только стала хитом продаж, но и послужила образцом для всех остальных заводных слуг."

#. ja: ピカピカ◎新品☆デス
#. de: Marionetten haben auch Gefühle.<br><i>Serendipity</i>
#. fr: Dzi-zz... Dz-zz-zi<nbsp>! Tout neuf, tout beau<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your mammet #001 minion─a fully operational clockwork puppet built in a joint effort by the Alchemists' and Goldsmiths' Guilds.
#. column 1: The standard frill-free #001 model is not only the best-selling mammet on the market, but is the blueprint on which all other clockwork servitors are based.
#. column 3: Deconstruct
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:2:0:2"
msgid "Mammets can't<br>even taste food!<br>  - Serendipity"
msgstr "Мамметы даже<br>не чувствуют вкус еды!<br>  — Серендипити"

#. ja: 解体
#. de: Demontage
#. fr: Démontage
#. column 0: Summon your mammet #001 minion─a fully operational clockwork puppet built in a joint effort by the Alchemists' and Goldsmiths' Guilds.
#. column 1: The standard frill-free #001 model is not only the best-selling mammet on the market, but is the blueprint on which all other clockwork servitors are based.
#. column 2: Mammets can't<br>even taste food!<br>  - Serendipity
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:2:0:3"
msgid "Deconstruct"
msgstr "Разобрать"

#. ja: 敵が配置したトラップがある場合、解除する。
#. de: Entfernt eine vom Gegner aufgestellte Falle.
#. fr: Enlève un piège mis en place par l'ennemi.
#. column 0: Summon your mammet #001 minion─a fully operational clockwork puppet built in a joint effort by the Alchemists' and Goldsmiths' Guilds.
#. column 1: The standard frill-free #001 model is not only the best-selling mammet on the market, but is the blueprint on which all other clockwork servitors are based.
#. column 2: Mammets can't<br>even taste food!<br>  - Serendipity
#. column 3: Deconstruct
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:2:0:4"
msgid "Disarms deployed enemy traps."
msgstr "Снимает ловушки, расставленные врагами."

#. ja: ミニオン「チョコチョコボ」を呼び出す。<br>チョコチョコ歩くチョコボの子
#. de: Du rufst dein Chocobo-Küken als Begleiter herbei. Solange es seine Mutter nicht findet, musst du als Ersatz herhalten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé chocobo, un jeune chocobo qui vous prend pour sa mère.
#. column 1: Even if this orphaned avian were to stumble across his birth parent, chances are he would not even blink an eye, for it is well documented that immediately after hatching, chocobos recognize the first thing they see as their mother─that being you.
#. column 2: Whoa, whoa, whoa!<br>Hooold your chocobos.<br>  - Buscarron
#. column 3: Choco Shuffle
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:3:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wayward hatchling minion. Until he finds his real mother, you'll have to suffice."
msgstr "Призови заблудившегося птенца. Пока он не найдёт настоящую маму, придётся ему обойтись тобой."

#. ja: チョコチョコ歩くチョコボの子。冒険者のことを親だと思い込んでおり、どこまででもついてくる。タマゴのカラを後生大事に身に着け続けているのは、防具を装備する冒険者をマネしてのことらしい
#. de: Selbst wenn dieser Waisenvogel zufällig auf seine Eltern träfe, würde er sie höchst<shy>wahr<shy>scheinlich nicht zur Kenntnis nehmen. Schließlich ist bekannt, dass Chocobos das erste Lebewesen, das sie erblicken, als ihre Mutter annehmen<nbsp>- und das wärest somit du.
#. fr: Ce minuscule chocobo trottine à bonne allure. Encore tout jeune, il vous prend pour sa mère et vous suit partout. S'il conserve sa coquille sur lui après éclosion, c'est parce qu'il a voulu imiter votre armure.
#. column 0: Summon your wayward hatchling minion. Until he finds his real mother, you'll have to suffice.
#. column 2: Whoa, whoa, whoa!<br>Hooold your chocobos.<br>  - Buscarron
#. column 3: Choco Shuffle
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:3:0:1"
msgid "Even if this orphaned avian were to stumble across his birth parent, chances are he would not even blink an eye, for it is well documented that immediately after hatching, chocobos recognize the first thing they see as their mother─that being you."
msgstr "Даже если этот осиротевший птенец случайно встретит родителя, вряд ли он его узнает. Известно ведь, что сразу после вылупления чокобо принимают за мать первое, что увидят. То есть тебя."

#. ja: クエーッ！
#. de: Ein wilder Bengel, aber er ist der Stolz unseres Gestüts.<br><i>Keitha</i>
#. fr: Kwéééé<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wayward hatchling minion. Until he finds his real mother, you'll have to suffice.
#. column 1: Even if this orphaned avian were to stumble across his birth parent, chances are he would not even blink an eye, for it is well documented that immediately after hatching, chocobos recognize the first thing they see as their mother─that being you.
#. column 3: Choco Shuffle
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:3:0:2"
msgid "Whoa, whoa, whoa!<br>Hooold your chocobos.<br>  - Buscarron"
msgstr "Эй, эй, эй!<br>Придержи своих чокобо!<br>  — Бускаррон"

#. ja: チョコダンス
#. de: Chocoboogie
#. fr: Chocodanse
#. column 0: Summon your wayward hatchling minion. Until he finds his real mother, you'll have to suffice.
#. column 1: Even if this orphaned avian were to stumble across his birth parent, chances are he would not even blink an eye, for it is well documented that immediately after hatching, chocobos recognize the first thing they see as their mother─that being you.
#. column 2: Whoa, whoa, whoa!<br>Hooold your chocobos.<br>  - Buscarron
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:3:0:3"
msgid "Choco Shuffle"
msgstr "Чокоданс"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、タイプ「アニマル」を弱点に加える。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>15秒
#. de: Fügt Gegnern in der Nähe eine Schwäche gegen Tiere zu.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 Sekunden
#. fr: Ajoute le type “Créature” aux points faibles des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
