#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ケットシー」を呼び出す。<br>ケットシーを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deine Cait Sith-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Der extra lange Schwanz hilft dem Kätzchen dabei, das Gleichgewicht zu halten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée Cait Sith, un pantin créé sur le modèle du célèbre félin. Sa queue lui permet de rester toujours en équilibre sur ses pattes arrières.
#. column 1: The clockwork rendition of an enigmatic cat spirit from the pages of Midlander mythology, Goldsmiths' Guild guildmaster Serendipity crafted this lifelike figurine to bring joy to those children who were orphaned in the Calamity.
#. column 2: What may be a few to<br>you was everything to<br>those who died...<br>  - Cait Sith
#. column 3: Toy Soldier
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:4:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Cait Sith minion. The ever-extended tail helps the kitten keep his balance."
msgstr "Призови миньона «Кейт Сит». Длиннющий хвост помогает котёнку держать равновесие."

#. ja: ミッドランダー族の民話に登場する妖精猫、ケットシーを模した魔法人形。彫金師ギルドマスター、セレンディピティーが、親を失った霊災遺児を慰めるために、ぬいぐるみにマメットを仕込んで作り上げた
#. de: Die Uhrwerk-Ausgabe eines schillernden Katzen-<br>geistes aus der Mythologie der Wiesländer. Die Gildenmeisterin der Goldschmiede, Serendipity, hat diese lebensechte Figur angefertigt, um den Kindern, die durch die Katastrophe zu Waisen wurden, eine Freude zu machen.
#. fr: Le chat du folklore hyurois est représenté ici sous la forme d'un automate. Serendipity, maître de la guilde des orfèvres, a conçu cette poupée mécanique à l'intention des orphelins du Fléau, lui donnant un toucher de peluche.
#. column 0: Summon your Cait Sith minion. The ever-extended tail helps the kitten keep his balance.
#. column 2: What may be a few to<br>you was everything to<br>those who died...<br>  - Cait Sith
#. column 3: Toy Soldier
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:4:0:1"
msgid "The clockwork rendition of an enigmatic cat spirit from the pages of Midlander mythology, Goldsmiths' Guild guildmaster Serendipity crafted this lifelike figurine to bring joy to those children who were orphaned in the Calamity."
msgstr "Заводная копия загадочного кошачьего духа из преданий срединников. Глава гильдии ювелиров Серендипити создала эту точную фигурку, чтобы порадовать детей, осиротевших во время Бедствия."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Im Kämpfen war ich immer eine Niete.<br><i>Cait Sith</i>
#. fr: Miaou...
#. column 0: Summon your Cait Sith minion. The ever-extended tail helps the kitten keep his balance.
#. column 1: The clockwork rendition of an enigmatic cat spirit from the pages of Midlander mythology, Goldsmiths' Guild guildmaster Serendipity crafted this lifelike figurine to bring joy to those children who were orphaned in the Calamity.
#. column 3: Toy Soldier
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:4:0:2"
msgid "What may be a few to<br>you was everything to<br>those who died...<br>  - Cait Sith"
msgstr "Для тебя это, может,<br>и мелочь, а для погибших<br>было всем...<br>  — Кейт Сит"

#. ja: トイソルジャー
#. de: Spielzeugsoldat
#. fr: Petit soldat
#. column 0: Summon your Cait Sith minion. The ever-extended tail helps the kitten keep his balance.
#. column 1: The clockwork rendition of an enigmatic cat spirit from the pages of Midlander mythology, Goldsmiths' Guild guildmaster Serendipity crafted this lifelike figurine to bring joy to those children who were orphaned in the Calamity.
#. column 2: What may be a few to<br>you was everything to<br>those who died...<br>  - Cait Sith
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:4:0:3"
msgid "Toy Soldier"
msgstr "Игрушечный солдатик"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your Cait Sith minion. The ever-extended tail helps the kitten keep his balance.
#. column 1: The clockwork rendition of an enigmatic cat spirit from the pages of Midlander mythology, Goldsmiths' Guild guildmaster Serendipity crafted this lifelike figurine to bring joy to those children who were orphaned in the Calamity.
#. column 2: What may be a few to<br>you was everything to<br>those who died...<br>  - Cait Sith
#. column 3: Toy Soldier
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:4:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Даёт 10 очков действий всем союзникам поблизости, у которых нет аналогичного умения."

#. ja: ミニオン「ベビーモス」を呼び出す。<br>ブヒーと鳴きそうな幼獣。親の顔が見てみたい
#. de: Du rufst deinen Baby-Behemoth als Begleiter herbei. Hoffentlich sucht seine Mutter nicht schon nach ihm.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébéhémoth. Étonnamment adorable, ce petit béhémoth grogne comme un marcassin. Il faut espérer que sa mère ne viendra pas le chercher...
#. column 1: Obtainable in Ul'dah's Sapphire Avenue Exchange for a fistful of coin and a smile, the pedigree of this baby beast is questionable at best. While displaying many behemoth-like features─a sleek violet hide, hungry eyes, and two polished horns─its squealing is not unlike a boar at slaughter.
#. column 2: Disaster follows the man<br>like a behemoth chasing<br>a butterfly.<br>  - Chechezan
#. column 3: Wild Horn
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:5:0:0"
msgid "Summon your baby behemoth minion. We can only hope his mother doesn't come looking for him."
msgstr "Призови миньона «Детёныш бехемота». Остаётся надеяться, что мама не станет его искать."

#. ja: 伝説の魔獣「ベヒーモス」の幼生体という触れ込みで、ウルダハの路上で売られていた謎の幼獣。紫色の肉体と黒いタテガミ、そして鈍く光る角を持っているが、ブヒーと鳴きそうな面構えをしている。親の顔が見てみたい
#. de: Da sie auf dem Saphirstraßenmarkt für nicht mehr als eine Handvoll Gil feilgeboten wird, ist die Abstamm-<br>ung dieser kleinen Bestie äußerst fraglich. Sie trägt zwar Züge, die einem Behemoth ähneln, aber ihr ständiges Gequieke erinnert dann doch eher an ein Wildschweinchen.
#. fr: Vendu par un marchand uldien comme progéniture de la célèbre créature, ce petit animal violet grogne comme un marcassin et possède une crinière noire et des cornes saillantes. Vous aimeriez voir à quoi ressemblent ses parents...
#. column 0: Summon your baby behemoth minion. We can only hope his mother doesn't come looking for him.
#. column 2: Disaster follows the man<br>like a behemoth chasing<br>a butterfly.<br>  - Chechezan
#. column 3: Wild Horn
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:5:0:1"
msgid "Obtainable in Ul'dah's Sapphire Avenue Exchange for a fistful of coin and a smile, the pedigree of this baby beast is questionable at best. While displaying many behemoth-like features─a sleek violet hide, hungry eyes, and two polished horns─its squealing is not unlike a boar at slaughter."
msgstr "Этого зверька продают на бирже Сапфировой аллеи в Уль'де за горсть монет и улыбку. Его родословная, мягко говоря, сомнительна. Есть почти всё, как у бехемота: лиловая гладкая шкура, голодный взгляд и два начищенных рога. Но визжит он точь-в-точь как свинья на бойне."

#. ja: ブ、ブヒッ！？
#. de: Tja, so läuft's halt manchmal im Leben. Mal verspeist<br>man den Behemoth, und manchmal wird man vom<br>Behemoth verspeist ...<br><i>Wymond</i>
#. fr: Gruic gruiiic<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your baby behemoth minion. We can only hope his mother doesn't come looking for him.
#. column 1: Obtainable in Ul'dah's Sapphire Avenue Exchange for a fistful of coin and a smile, the pedigree of this baby beast is questionable at best. While displaying many behemoth-like features─a sleek violet hide, hungry eyes, and two polished horns─its squealing is not unlike a boar at slaughter.
#. column 3: Wild Horn
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:5:0:2"
msgid "Disaster follows the man<br>like a behemoth chasing<br>a butterfly.<br>  - Chechezan"
msgstr "Беда ходит за человеком,<br>как бехемот за бабочкой.<br>  — Чечезан"

#. ja: ワイルドホーン
#. de: Wildes Horn
#. fr: Corne sauvage
#. column 0: Summon your baby behemoth minion. We can only hope his mother doesn't come looking for him.
#. column 1: Obtainable in Ul'dah's Sapphire Avenue Exchange for a fistful of coin and a smile, the pedigree of this baby beast is questionable at best. While displaying many behemoth-like features─a sleek violet hide, hungry eyes, and two polished horns─its squealing is not unlike a boar at slaughter.
#. column 2: Disaster follows the man<br>like a behemoth chasing<br>a butterfly.<br>  - Chechezan
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:5:0:3"
msgid "Wild Horn"
msgstr "Дикий рог"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your baby behemoth minion. We can only hope his mother doesn't come looking for him.
#. column 1: Obtainable in Ul'dah's Sapphire Avenue Exchange for a fistful of coin and a smile, the pedigree of this baby beast is questionable at best. While displaying many behemoth-like features─a sleek violet hide, hungry eyes, and two polished horns─its squealing is not unlike a boar at slaughter.
#. column 2: Disaster follows the man<br>like a behemoth chasing<br>a butterfly.<br>  - Chechezan
#. column 3: Wild Horn
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:5:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам поблизости урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット003L」を呼び出す。<br>黒渦団制式採用型からくり人形
#. de: Du rufst deine Marionette Nr. 003L als Begleiter herbei. Eine voll funktionstüchtige Puppe, die für den Mahlstrom gebaut wurde.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte pantin P003L, un automate conçu spé<shy>cia<shy>le<shy>ment pour amuser les unités du Maelstrom lors de leurs moments perdus.
#. column 1: Designed to be a standard-bearer in Maelstrom company parades, these handcrafted automata were soon decommissioned due to the fact that their small stature ensured that no one could see the flags they carried.
#. column 2: Feelings! Maybe she just<br>doesn't feel like part of<br>the team!?<br>  - Wedge
#. column 3: Storm Standard
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:6:0:0"
msgid "Summon your mammet #003L minion─a fully operational clockwork puppet built for the Maelstrom."
msgstr "Призвать миньона «маммет № 003L» — полностью исправную заводную куклу, созданную для Мальстрёма."

#. ja: リムサ・ロミンサのグランドカンパニー「黒渦団」が制式採用した魔法人形。軍事パレードの旗手役を務めるために設計されており、ピンと背筋を伸ばして雄々しく団旗を掲げる。しかし、背が低く、旗は誰にも見えなかった
#. de: Diese handgefertigten Marionetten sollten eigentlich als Flaggenträger bei Paraden des Mahlstroms dienen. Sie wurden jedoch schnell wieder außer Dienst gestellt, da aufgrund ihrer kleinen Statur niemand die Flaggen sehen konnte.
#. fr: Un pantin officiel du Maelstrom. Programmé pour servir de porte-drapeau lors des parades officielles, il arbore la bannière de la compagnie avec zèle. Mais sa petite taille affecte fortement sa visibilité.
#. column 0: Summon your mammet #003L minion─a fully operational clockwork puppet built for the Maelstrom.
#. column 2: Feelings! Maybe she just<br>doesn't feel like part of<br>the team!?<br>  - Wedge
#. column 3: Storm Standard
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:6:0:1"
msgid "Designed to be a standard-bearer in Maelstrom company parades, these handcrafted automata were soon decommissioned due to the fact that their small stature ensured that no one could see the flags they carried."
msgstr "Этих кукол ручной работы задумали как знаменосцев на парадах Водоворота. Но их быстро сняли со службы: из-за маленького роста никто не видел знамён, которые они несли."

#. ja: 提督ニ◎敬礼☆
