msgstr "Снижает очки действий всех врагов поблизости на 50% от максимума."

#. ja: ミニオン「モルボルバルブ」を呼び出す。<br>モルボルの幼生体。その息は使い古したブーツの香り
#. de: Du rufst deine Morbol-Knolle als Begleiter herbei. Hoffentlich macht dir der Mundgeruch nichts aus.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bulbe de morbol. Un bulbe du monstre végétal dont l'odeur rappelle celle de vieilles bottes d'aventuriers aguerris.
#. column 1: It is in fashion amongst wealthy Ul'dahn merchants and nobles to bring morbol seedlings to banquets, so that the upper crust might inhale the seedkin's “boot-like” bad breath to induce vomiting, allowing them to engorge themselves for the duration of the gatherings.
#. column 2: Did a morbol just empty<br>its innards? I feel ill...<br>  - Imperial Soldier
#. column 3: Bad Breath
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:12:0:0"
msgid "Summon your morbol seedling minion...if you think you can stand his breath."
msgstr "Призови миньона «Росток морбола»... если выдержишь его дыхание."

#. ja: オーラムヴェイルで捕獲されたモルボルの幼生体。その息は使い古したブーツの香り。臭いを嗅ぐと食欲が減退すること請け合いであるため、肥満に悩むウルダハの富裕層の中には、あえてペットとして飼う人もいるらしい
#. de: Es ist unter den Adligen von Ul'dah in Mode, Morbol-Knollen zu Banketten mitzunehmen, um die Anwe- senden mithilfe des fürchterlichen Mundgeruchs der Knolle dazu zu bringen, sich zu übergeben. Mit entleertem Magen können diese dann noch mehr schlemmen.
#. fr: Ce jeune morbol a été capturé dans le Val d'Aurum. Son haleine rappelle l'odeur de vieilles bottes d'aventurier. Cette puanteur ayant pour effet de couper l'appétit, certains Uldiens aisés s'en servent pour combattre l'obésité.
#. column 0: Summon your morbol seedling minion...if you think you can stand his breath.
#. column 2: Did a morbol just empty<br>its innards? I feel ill...<br>  - Imperial Soldier
#. column 3: Bad Breath
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:12:0:1"
msgid "It is in fashion amongst wealthy Ul'dahn merchants and nobles to bring morbol seedlings to banquets, so that the upper crust might inhale the seedkin's “boot-like” bad breath to induce vomiting, allowing them to engorge themselves for the duration of the gatherings."
msgstr "У богатых торговцев и аристократов Уль'ды вошло в моду приносить на пиры ростки морболов. Светское общество вдыхает их «аромат старого сапога», чтобы вызвать рвоту и потом пировать до отвала."

#. ja: モワ～ン…
#. de: Weeßte, uff wen wa hier in Jeisterzoll jar nich jut zu<br>sprechen sind? Uff die Morbol, dit sind quasi unsere Todfeinde.<br><i>Aganbold</i>
#. fr: Mwoam mwoam<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your morbol seedling minion...if you think you can stand his breath.
#. column 1: It is in fashion amongst wealthy Ul'dahn merchants and nobles to bring morbol seedlings to banquets, so that the upper crust might inhale the seedkin's “boot-like” bad breath to induce vomiting, allowing them to engorge themselves for the duration of the gatherings.
#. column 3: Bad Breath
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:12:0:2"
msgid "Did a morbol just empty<br>its innards? I feel ill...<br>  - Imperial Soldier"
msgstr "Морбол только что выпотрошился?<br>Мне дурно...<br>  — имперский солдат"

#. ja: くさい息
#. de: Schlechter Atem
#. fr: Mauvaise haleine
#. column 0: Summon your morbol seedling minion...if you think you can stand his breath.
