msgid "Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s"
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам поблизости 10 ед. периодического урона каждую секунду.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「タイニースクウィレル」を呼び出す。<br>スクウィレルの幼獣。しっぽを立てろ！
#. de: Du rufst deine kleine Ratte als Begleiter herbei. Lass dich von ihrer Niedlichkeit nicht allzu sehr ablenken.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte écureuil nain. Si vous aviez toujours rêvé de vivre des aventures accompagné d'un petit écureuil, votre souhait sera comblé.
#. column 1: It was only recently that an enterprising merchant from the Sapphire Avenue Exchange in Ul'dah was tossed into the sultanate's oubliettes for fluffing the tails of rats caught on Pearl Lane and selling prettied pests to tourists as “tiny squirrels.”
#. column 2: Pray waste no time<br>chasing rats.<br>  - Nanamo Ul Namo
#. column 3: The Plague
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 25%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:13:0:0"
msgid "Summon your tiny rat minion. He may infest your granaries, and he may carry the plague, but he's <i>simply too adorable</i> to condemn to the life-ending jaws of a metal trap."
msgstr "Призови миньона «Крошечная крыса». Она может расплодиться в твоих амбарах и разносить чуму, но она <i>просто слишком милая</i>, чтобы отправлять её на верную смерть в железный капкан."

#. ja: ウルダハ系商人が「かわいいリスの子」と称して売っていた幼獣。だが、フサフサであるはずの尻尾は、どう見てもほっそりしている。これはネズミなのではないか……そうした疑惑がプンプンするが、真相は闇の中である
#. de: Erst kürzlich wurde ein besonders kreativer Kaufmann von der Smaragdstraße in Ul'dah in den Kerker geworfen, da er die Schwänze der Ratten, die er in der Perlengasse fing, aufplusterte und die kleinen Plagegeister als „Mini-Baumhörnchen“ an Touristen verkaufte.
#. fr: Ce jeune mammifère a été vendu comme un écureuil par un marchand uldien, mais sa queue longue dénuée de fourrure semble trahir une tromperie sur la marchandise. Rat ou écureuil, le mystère demeure.
#. column 0: Summon your tiny rat minion. He may infest your granaries, and he may carry the plague, but he's <i>simply too adorable</i> to condemn to the life-ending jaws of a metal trap.
#. column 2: Pray waste no time<br>chasing rats.<br>  - Nanamo Ul Namo
#. column 3: The Plague
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 25%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:13:0:1"
msgid "It was only recently that an enterprising merchant from the Sapphire Avenue Exchange in Ul'dah was tossed into the sultanate's oubliettes for fluffing the tails of rats caught on Pearl Lane and selling prettied pests to tourists as “tiny squirrels.”"
msgstr "Недавно предприимчивого торговца с биржи Сапфировой аллеи в Уль'де бросили в султанскую темницу. Он распушал хвосты крыс, пойманных на Жемчужной улице, и продавал этих приукрашенных вредителей туристам как «крошечных белок»."

#. ja: チュー、チュー
#. de: Du hast alle Ratten getötet, selbst<br>ihren König? Ausgezeichnet!<br><i>Fousquenet</i>
#. fr: Squik squik<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your tiny rat minion. He may infest your granaries, and he may carry the plague, but he's <i>simply too adorable</i> to condemn to the life-ending jaws of a metal trap.
#. column 1: It was only recently that an enterprising merchant from the Sapphire Avenue Exchange in Ul'dah was tossed into the sultanate's oubliettes for fluffing the tails of rats caught on Pearl Lane and selling prettied pests to tourists as “tiny squirrels.”
#. column 3: The Plague
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 25%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:13:0:2"
msgid "Pray waste no time<br>chasing rats.<br>  - Nanamo Ul Namo"
msgstr "Прошу, не тратьте время<br>на охоту за крысами.<br>  — Нанамо Ул Намо"

#. ja: 疫病
#. de: Pest
#. fr: Épidémie
#. column 0: Summon your tiny rat minion. He may infest your granaries, and he may carry the plague, but he's <i>simply too adorable</i> to condemn to the life-ending jaws of a metal trap.
#. column 1: It was only recently that an enterprising merchant from the Sapphire Avenue Exchange in Ul'dah was tossed into the sultanate's oubliettes for fluffing the tails of rats caught on Pearl Lane and selling prettied pests to tourists as “tiny squirrels.”
