#. ja: ミニオン「ベイビーファンガー」を呼び出す。<br>ファンガーの幼生体。プリプリとした食感で大人気
#. de: Du rufst deinen Mini-Pilz als Begleiter herbei. Schmeckt gut zu Salaten oder in Eintöpfen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte fungus miniature. Ce champignon vous suivra partout.
#. column 1: For those wondering on the ill effects of inhaling spores released by common funguars, according to the <i>Encyclopedia Eorzea</i> (third edition), funguar spores “befoul the body's humours and claim control of an individual's very soul, rendering them a mindless thrall.”
#. column 2: You mushroom-headed,<br>spindly-legged, spore-<br>spewing abominations!<br>  - Gabineaux
#. column 3: Poison Spore
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 13%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:14:0:0"
msgid "Summon your baby bun minion. Tastes great on salads and in stews."
msgstr "Призови миньона «Малютка-гриб». В салатах и рагу — объедение."

#. ja: ファンガーの幼生体。プリプリとした食感で大人気。なお、「大エオルゼア博物誌」によれば、ファンガーの胞子を吸い込んだ場合、体内で発芽して脳を支配され、「動く植木鉢」状態にされてしまうことがあるという
#. de: Wer sich fragt, welche Neben<shy>wirkungen das Inhalieren von Pilzsporen hat, sollte einen Blick in die Enzyklopädie Eorzea werfen: „Pilzsporen verpesten den Körper und über<shy>nehmen die Kontrolle über die Seele. So machen sie ihr Opfer zu einem seelenlosen Knecht.“
#. fr: Ce tendre fungus est populaire chez les gourmets. Selon la Grande Histoire naturelle éorzéenne, le fungus peut prendre le contrôle du cerveau d'un être par le biais de ses spores, et faire de lui un véritable pot de fleur ambulant.
#. column 0: Summon your baby bun minion. Tastes great on salads and in stews.
#. column 2: You mushroom-headed,<br>spindly-legged, spore-<br>spewing abominations!<br>  - Gabineaux
#. column 3: Poison Spore
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 13%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:14:0:1"
msgid "For those wondering on the ill effects of inhaling spores released by common funguars, according to the <i>Encyclopedia Eorzea</i> (third edition), funguar spores “befoul the body's humours and claim control of an individual's very soul, rendering them a mindless thrall.”"
msgstr "Кто опасается вреда от спор обычных фангваров, пусть заглянет в <i>Энциклопедию Эорзеи</i> (3-е издание). Там сказано, что споры «отравляют телесные жидкости и завладевают самой душой человека, превращая его в безвольного раба»."

#. ja: プリプリ！
#. de: Ich bin ein Glückspilz! Dank der Großzügigkeit<br>des Kaiserreichs kann ich mir endlich das Leben<br>leisten, das mir zusteht.<br><i>Laurentius</i>
#. fr: Bwih bwih<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your baby bun minion. Tastes great on salads and in stews.
#. column 1: For those wondering on the ill effects of inhaling spores released by common funguars, according to the <i>Encyclopedia Eorzea</i> (third edition), funguar spores “befoul the body's humours and claim control of an individual's very soul, rendering them a mindless thrall.”
#. column 3: Poison Spore
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 13%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:14:0:2"
msgid "You mushroom-headed,<br>spindly-legged, spore-<br>spewing abominations!<br>  - Gabineaux"
msgstr "Грибоголовые,<br>тонконогие, плюющиеся<br>спорами уроды!<br>  — Габино"

#. ja: 毒胞子
#. de: Giftsporen
#. fr: Spores empoisonnées
#. column 0: Summon your baby bun minion. Tastes great on salads and in stews.
#. column 1: For those wondering on the ill effects of inhaling spores released by common funguars, according to the <i>Encyclopedia Eorzea</i> (third edition), funguar spores “befoul the body's humours and claim control of an individual's very soul, rendering them a mindless thrall.”
