#. ja: ミニオン「チゴーラーヴァ」を呼び出す。<br>チゴーの幼生体。血の契約を結びたいらしい
#. de: Du rufst deine Stechmücken-Larve als Begleiter herbei. Dieses kleine Insekt nimmt die Blutsbande mit seinem Meister sehr ernst.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte chigoe apprivoisé. Ce chigoe sera comme un frère de sang pour vous. Dans tous les sens du terme.
#. column 1: Chirurgeons of the fallen city of Gelmorra once used chigoes to leech the dark humours of the infirm until it was realized the patients were contracting additional maladies as a result of the treatment.
#. column 2: What am I going to do<br>with a pile of dead vilekin?<br>  - Waltheof
#. column 3: Blood Drain
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:15:0:0"
msgid "Summon your chigoe larva minion. This tiny vilekin takes the blood pact with his master <i>very</i> seriously."
msgstr "Призови миньона «Личинка чигу». Эта крошечная вредная тварь <i>очень</i> серьёзно относится к кровному союзу с хозяином."

#. ja: チゴーの幼生体。血の契約を結びたいらしい。かつて黒衣森に存在した地下都市「ゲルモラ」では、病人の体内から悪い毒気を抜くためと称して、チゴーに血を吸わせる自然療法が実践されていたという
#. de: Chirurgen der versunken Stadt von Gelmorra setzten einst Stechmücken ein, um bösartige Kör<shy>per<shy>flüs<shy>sig<shy>kei<shy>ten aus ihren Patienten zu entfernen. Bis sie bemerkten, dass diese durch die Behandlung noch ganz andere Krankheiten bekamen.
#. fr: Dans l'ancienne Cité de Gelmorra, les chigoes étaient employés pour saigner les malades, afin, pensait-on, de les débarrasser na<shy>tu<shy>rel<shy>le<shy>ment des esprits nocifs. Ce bébé est apprivoisé et veut conclure un pacte de sang avec son hôte.
#. column 0: Summon your chigoe larva minion. This tiny vilekin takes the blood pact with his master <i>very</i> seriously.
#. column 2: What am I going to do<br>with a pile of dead vilekin?<br>  - Waltheof
#. column 3: Blood Drain
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:15:0:1"
msgid "Chirurgeons of the fallen city of Gelmorra once used chigoes to leech the dark humours of the infirm until it was realized the patients were contracting additional maladies as a result of the treatment."
msgstr "Хирурги павшего города Гельморы когда-то пускали чигу пить кровь у больных, чтобы вывести дурные соки. Пока не выяснилось, что из-за этого лечения больные подхватывали ещё и другие хвори."

#. ja: ブゥ～ン…
#. de: Einige Stechmücken übertragen die gefährliche Kettenseuche,<br>und die Bruderschaft der Morgenviper und das Klageregiment<br>helfen uns dabei, die Überträger zu identifizieren.<br><i>Monranguin</i>
#. fr: Tchit tchit<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your chigoe larva minion. This tiny vilekin takes the blood pact with his master <i>very</i> seriously.
#. column 1: Chirurgeons of the fallen city of Gelmorra once used chigoes to leech the dark humours of the infirm until it was realized the patients were contracting additional maladies as a result of the treatment.
#. column 3: Blood Drain
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:15:0:2"
msgid "What am I going to do<br>with a pile of dead vilekin?<br>  - Waltheof"
msgstr "И что мне делать<br>с кучей дохлых вредных тварей?<br>  — Уолтеоф"

#. ja: 吸血
#. de: Blutsauger
#. fr: Suceur de sang
#. column 0: Summon your chigoe larva minion. This tiny vilekin takes the blood pact with his master <i>very</i> seriously.
#. column 1: Chirurgeons of the fallen city of Gelmorra once used chigoes to leech the dark humours of the infirm until it was realized the patients were contracting additional maladies as a result of the treatment.
#. column 2: What am I going to do<br>with a pile of dead vilekin?<br>  - Waltheof
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:15:0:3"
msgid "Blood Drain"
msgstr "Кровопускание"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンのATKを60上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
#. de: Erhöht die ATT der ausführenden Trabanten um 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 60 l'attaque des mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
