#. ja: ミニオン「ブルーバード」を呼び出す。<br>青い鳥のヒナ。幸運を運ぶと噂される
#. de: Du rufst dein blaues Vögelchen als Begleiter herbei. Es hat den Ruf, Leuten Glück zu bringen, die bereits viel Glück hatten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte oiseau bleu. Cet oiseau bleu, que vous avez enfin trouvé, vous portera peut-être chance.
#. column 1: Fortunate to hatch before being eaten by lizards. Unfortunate to fall from its nest before learning to fly. Fortunate to land in an empty treasure coffer. Unfortunate to still be in said coffer as it is filled with booty and locked up again. Fortunate to be plundered...by you.
#. column 2: The disbelieving cries<br>of our foe will be as<br>the sweetest birdsong.<br>  - Yadovv Gah
#. column 3: The Blues
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:16:0:0"
msgid "Summon your bluebird minion. Known to retroactively bring good fortune to those who have already experienced good fortune."
msgstr "Призови миньона «Синяя птица». Говорят, она приносит удачу тем, кому уже повезло."

#. ja: 幸運を運ぶと噂される青い鳥のヒナ。通常は樹上に巣を作るが、ごく稀に人が残した木箱などに営巣することがある。そのため、打ち捨てられた宝箱から見つかることがあり、「思いがけない宝」、「幸運」の象徴となった
#. de: Aus dem Nest gefallen, bevor es fliegen konnte. Glücklicherweise in einer leeren Schatztruhe ge-<br>landet. Leider noch in der Schatztruhe gewesen, als diese geschlossen wurde. Glücklicherweise wiederentdeckt worden ... von dir.
#. fr: Cet oisillon bleu serait un porte-bonheur. Il niche d'ordinaire dans les arbres, mais peut à de rares occasions s'établir dans des coffres de fabrication humaine. C'est une chance ex<shy>cep<shy>tion<shy>nelle que de trouver un de ces coffres.
#. column 0: Summon your bluebird minion. Known to retroactively bring good fortune to those who have already experienced good fortune.
#. column 2: The disbelieving cries<br>of our foe will be as<br>the sweetest birdsong.<br>  - Yadovv Gah
#. column 3: The Blues
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:16:0:1"
msgid "Fortunate to hatch before being eaten by lizards. Unfortunate to fall from its nest before learning to fly. Fortunate to land in an empty treasure coffer. Unfortunate to still be in said coffer as it is filled with booty and locked up again. Fortunate to be plundered...by you."
msgstr "Повезло вылупиться и не стать обедом ящериц. Не повезло выпасть из гнезда, не научившись летать. Повезло свалиться в пустой сундук с сокровищами. Не повезло остаться в нём, когда сундук наполнили добычей и снова заперли. Повезло, что сундук достался... тебе."

#. ja: チチチチチ…
#. de: Ich hab 'nen blauen Kanarienvogel gesehn!<br>Jawohl, einen blauen! \<hicks><br><i>Betrunkener Tor</i>
#. fr: Cui cui<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your bluebird minion. Known to retroactively bring good fortune to those who have already experienced good fortune.
#. column 1: Fortunate to hatch before being eaten by lizards. Unfortunate to fall from its nest before learning to fly. Fortunate to land in an empty treasure coffer. Unfortunate to still be in said coffer as it is filled with booty and locked up again. Fortunate to be plundered...by you.
#. column 3: The Blues
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:16:0:2"
msgid "The disbelieving cries<br>of our foe will be as<br>the sweetest birdsong.<br>  - Yadovv Gah"
msgstr "Недоверчивые вопли<br>наших врагов слаще<br>птичьего пения.<br>  — Ядовв Га"

#. ja: 青い鳥
#. de: Zwitschern
#. fr: Aile bleue
#. column 0: Summon your bluebird minion. Known to retroactively bring good fortune to those who have already experienced good fortune.
#. column 1: Fortunate to hatch before being eaten by lizards. Unfortunate to fall from its nest before learning to fly. Fortunate to land in an empty treasure coffer. Unfortunate to still be in said coffer as it is filled with booty and locked up again. Fortunate to be plundered...by you.
#. column 2: The disbelieving cries<br>of our foe will be as<br>the sweetest birdsong.<br>  - Yadovv Gah
