msgstr "Наносит всем врагам поблизости урон силой 90."

#. ja: ミニオン「アンテロープ・フォーン」を呼び出す。<br>アンテロープの幼獣。生まれてすぐ立ち上がった
#. de: Du rufst dein Rehkitz als Begleiter herbei. Seine Mutter hatte einen kleinen Jagdunfall ... oder hat sich einfach nur verlaufen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte faon aux yeux de biche. Ce faon a dû provoquer l'émotion générale de l'assistance lorsqu'il s'est mis debout pour la première fois.
#. column 1: An easy target for Eorzea's carnivorous fauna, antelopes must use every advantage they have to remain free from death's dripping jaws. One of those is the remarkable ability to run mere minutes from birth. Unfortunately, that trait did not save this specimen from capture.
#. column 2: When making an offering<br>of antelope innards, it is<br>proper they are still warm.<br>  - Common Knowledge
#. column 3: Dilation
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:17:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wide-eyed fawn minion. His mother was either lost in a terrible hunting accident...or perhaps is just lost."
msgstr "Призови миньона «Широкоглазый оленёнок». Его мать то ли погибла на ужасной охоте... то ли просто потерялась."

#. ja: アンテロープの幼獣。肉食獣から身を守るため、生まれてすぐに立ち上がる。細い脚を振るわせながら立ち上がった瞬間、地元猟師に捕まり、商人ロウェナに売り払われた。そのため、とても愛に飢えている
#. de: Die wehrlosen Antilopen müssen jeden Vorteil nutzen, um den hungrigen Mäulern ihrer Jäger zu entgehen. Erstaunlich ist ihre Fähigkeit, schon Minuten nach ihrer Geburt rennen zu können. Leider bewahrte das dieses Exemplar nicht vor der Gefangennahme.
#. fr: Ce jeune faon s'est dressé sur ses pattes dès la naissance pour se protéger des prédateurs, mais un chasseur l'a alors capturé et vendu à l'armurière Rowena. Arraché ainsi à sa mère dès la naissance, il a un grand besoin affectif.
#. column 0: Summon your wide-eyed fawn minion. His mother was either lost in a terrible hunting accident...or perhaps is just lost.
#. column 2: When making an offering<br>of antelope innards, it is<br>proper they are still warm.<br>  - Common Knowledge
#. column 3: Dilation
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:17:0:1"
msgid "An easy target for Eorzea's carnivorous fauna, antelopes must use every advantage they have to remain free from death's dripping jaws. One of those is the remarkable ability to run mere minutes from birth. Unfortunately, that trait did not save this specimen from capture."
msgstr "Антилопы — лёгкая добыча для хищников Эорзеи, поэтому используют любую возможность, чтобы не оказаться в зубах у смерти. Например, уже через несколько минут после рождения они умеют бегать. Увы, этому малышу и это не помогло избежать плена."

#. ja: キュッ？
#. de: Gästen serviert man die Innereien eines Rehs<br>am besten, solange sie noch körperwarm sind.<br><i>Aus dem Knigge der Amalj'aa</i>
#. fr: Kii kii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wide-eyed fawn minion. His mother was either lost in a terrible hunting accident...or perhaps is just lost.
#. column 1: An easy target for Eorzea's carnivorous fauna, antelopes must use every advantage they have to remain free from death's dripping jaws. One of those is the remarkable ability to run mere minutes from birth. Unfortunately, that trait did not save this specimen from capture.
#. column 3: Dilation
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:17:0:2"
msgid "When making an offering<br>of antelope innards, it is<br>proper they are still warm.<br>  - Common Knowledge"
msgstr "Если угощаете потрохами<br>антилопы, подавайте их<br>ещё тёплыми.<br>  — всем известно"

#. ja: つぶらな瞳
#. de: Rehaugen
#. fr: Œil de biche
#. column 0: Summon your wide-eyed fawn minion. His mother was either lost in a terrible hunting accident...or perhaps is just lost.
#. column 1: An easy target for Eorzea's carnivorous fauna, antelopes must use every advantage they have to remain free from death's dripping jaws. One of those is the remarkable ability to run mere minutes from birth. Unfortunately, that trait did not save this specimen from capture.
