#. ja: ミニオン「ベイビーインプ」を呼び出す。<br>インプの幼生体。七獄の魔王になる日を夢見る
#. de: Du rufst deinen Baby-Imp als Begleiter herbei. Hat Ambitionen, eines Tages über die Sieben Höllen zu herrschen. Fürs Erste musst du jedoch genügen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé imp. Ce petit démon rêve de devenir roi des sept enfers quand il sera grand. En attendant, il joue les âmes damnées.
#. column 1: Scholars believe there are three ways in which voidsent can make the journey from their realm to ours─tearing a hole in the aether on their side, having a hole torn for them on our side, or stumbling into a randomly occurring hole, the latter being the most common for imps.
#. column 2: This bastard's got<br>some nasty spells!<br>  - Stalwart Swordsman
#. column 3: Trick or Treat
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:18:0:0"
msgid "Summon your infant imp minion. Hopes that one day, he will rule the seven hells. But for now, your backside will do."
msgstr "Призови миньона «Малютка-бес». Мечтает однажды править семью преисподними. А пока сойдёт и твоя задница."

#. ja: インプの幼生体。異界「ヴォイド」で生まれたが、ひょんなことから「切れ目」に落ちてしまい、エオルゼアへと転がり込んできた。エオルゼアで悪戯を極めて実力をつけ、「七獄の魔王」として異界に凱旋する日を夢見る
#. de: Gelehrte glauben, dass Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>te drei Wege in unsere Welt nehmen: Ein Loch in den Äther reißen, ein Loch geöffnet bekommen, oder auf ein zufällig auftretendes Loch zu stoßen. Letzteres ist bei Imps am häufigsten der Fall.
#. fr: Ce jeune diablotin se serait introduit dans notre monde par une fissure du néant. Il élabore des farces et espiègleries avec beaucoup de zèle, rêvant de devenir roi des sept enfers quand il sera grand.
#. column 0: Summon your infant imp minion. Hopes that one day, he will rule the seven hells. But for now, your backside will do.
#. column 2: This bastard's got<br>some nasty spells!<br>  - Stalwart Swordsman
#. column 3: Trick or Treat
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:18:0:1"
msgid "Scholars believe there are three ways in which voidsent can make the journey from their realm to ours─tearing a hole in the aether on their side, having a hole torn for them on our side, or stumbling into a randomly occurring hole, the latter being the most common for imps."
msgstr "Учёные считают, что посланцы Пустоты могут попасть в наш мир тремя способами: пробить эфирную дыру со своей стороны, дождаться, пока дыру пробьют для них с нашей, или наткнуться на случайный разлом. Бесы чаще всего пользуются последним способом."

#. ja: ウケケケ！
#. de: Der Junge teilt ganz schön aus!<br>Pass auf seine Flächenzauber auf!<br><i>Kräftiger Gladiator</i>
#. fr: Gni hi hi hi<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your infant imp minion. Hopes that one day, he will rule the seven hells. But for now, your backside will do.
#. column 1: Scholars believe there are three ways in which voidsent can make the journey from their realm to ours─tearing a hole in the aether on their side, having a hole torn for them on our side, or stumbling into a randomly occurring hole, the latter being the most common for imps.
#. column 3: Trick or Treat
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:18:0:2"
msgid "This bastard's got<br>some nasty spells!<br>  - Stalwart Swordsman"
msgstr "Ублюдок ещё и<br>заклинаниями швыряется!<br>  — стойкий мечник"

#. ja: 小鬼のイタズラ
#. de: Süßes oder Saures
#. fr: Farce diabolique
#. column 0: Summon your infant imp minion. Hopes that one day, he will rule the seven hells. But for now, your backside will do.
#. column 1: Scholars believe there are three ways in which voidsent can make the journey from their realm to ours─tearing a hole in the aether on their side, having a hole torn for them on our side, or stumbling into a randomly occurring hole, the latter being the most common for imps.
#. column 2: This bastard's got<br>some nasty spells!<br>  - Stalwart Swordsman
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:18:0:3"
msgid "Trick or Treat"
msgstr "Шалость бесёнка"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
