msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам поблизости урон силой 90."

#. ja: ミニオン「タイニークァール」を呼び出す。<br>クァールの幼獣。ヒゲはまだ生えていない
#. de: Du rufst deinen Mini-Coeurl als Begleiter herbei. Es werden wohl noch einige Sommer vergehen, ehe seine berühmten Schnurrhaare wachsen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte joli coeurl. Ce coeurl est si jeune qu'il n'a pas encore la moustache.
#. column 1: Coeurls are extremely proud and defiant creatures, even when young. Faced with insurmountable odds, a coeurl will rarely shy away from a fight, choosing rather to perish in combat than run. This characteristic keeps coeurl numbers low, but ensures the strength of those who survive.
#. column 2: Coeurl got your tongue?<br>  - Wilred
#. column 3: Tiny Blaster
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:19:0:0"
msgid "Summon your coeurl kitten minion. It will still be several summers before his trademark whiskers grow out."
msgstr "Призови миньона «Котёнок-куэрл». До знаменитых усов ему ещё расти и расти — не одно лето пройдёт."

#. ja: 誇り高きクァールの幼獣。猟犬に追い詰められていたところを救ったことで、冒険者のことを親だと思い込んでいる。まだヒゲも生えていないほど幼いが、冒険者に敵対する者には、容赦なくクァールパンチで応戦する
#. de: Coeurl sind schon in jungen Jahren sehr kämpferisch. Ein Coeurl wird keiner Konfrontation aus dem Weg gehen und lieber im Kampf sterben als wegzulaufen. Aufgrund dieser Eigenschaft ist ihre Anzahl begrenzt, sie sichert aber auch die Stärke der Überlebenden.
#. fr: Un fier félin que vous avez sauvé d'un chien qui le poursuivait. Il vous prend depuis pour sa mère et attaque ceux qui sont agressifs envers vous. Il n'a pas encore les longues moustaches ca<shy>rac<shy>té<shy>ris<shy>ti<shy>ques de son espèce.
#. column 0: Summon your coeurl kitten minion. It will still be several summers before his trademark whiskers grow out.
#. column 2: Coeurl got your tongue?<br>  - Wilred
#. column 3: Tiny Blaster
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:19:0:1"
msgid "Coeurls are extremely proud and defiant creatures, even when young. Faced with insurmountable odds, a coeurl will rarely shy away from a fight, choosing rather to perish in combat than run. This characteristic keeps coeurl numbers low, but ensures the strength of those who survive."
msgstr "Куэрлы — гордые и дерзкие звери, даже в юном возрасте. Перед лицом превосходящего врага куэрл редко отступает: скорее погибнет в бою, чем убежит. Поэтому куэрлов мало, зато выжившие сильны."

#. ja: グルルル…
#. de: Höchste Konzentration und die Geschmeidigkeit eines<br>Coeurl-Jungen sind vonnöten, um den Tanz des Chevaliers<br>zu meistern.<br><i>Hildibrand</i>
#. fr: Ron ron...
#. column 0: Summon your coeurl kitten minion. It will still be several summers before his trademark whiskers grow out.
#. column 1: Coeurls are extremely proud and defiant creatures, even when young. Faced with insurmountable odds, a coeurl will rarely shy away from a fight, choosing rather to perish in combat than run. This characteristic keeps coeurl numbers low, but ensures the strength of those who survive.
#. column 3: Tiny Blaster
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:19:0:2"
msgid "Coeurl got your tongue?<br>  - Wilred"
msgstr "Язык проглотил, куэрл?<br>  — Уилред"

#. ja: タイニーブラスター
#. de: Minischlag
#. fr: Mini-électrochoc
#. column 0: Summon your coeurl kitten minion. It will still be several summers before his trademark whiskers grow out.
#. column 1: Coeurls are extremely proud and defiant creatures, even when young. Faced with insurmountable odds, a coeurl will rarely shy away from a fight, choosing rather to perish in combat than run. This characteristic keeps coeurl numbers low, but ensures the strength of those who survive.
#. column 2: Coeurl got your tongue?<br>  - Wilred
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:19:0:3"
msgid "Tiny Blaster"
msgstr "Маленький разряд"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your coeurl kitten minion. It will still be several summers before his trademark whiskers grow out.
#. column 1: Coeurls are extremely proud and defiant creatures, even when young. Faced with insurmountable odds, a coeurl will rarely shy away from a fight, choosing rather to perish in combat than run. This characteristic keeps coeurl numbers low, but ensures the strength of those who survive.
#. column 2: Coeurl got your tongue?<br>  - Wilred
#. column 3: Tiny Blaster
