msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам поблизости урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「ブラッククァール」を呼び出す。<br>クァールの幼獣。毛衣が黒い黒化個体
#. de: Du rufst deinen schwarzen Coeurl als Begleiter herbei. Pass auf, denn wenn dir dieser Coeurl über den Weg läuft, bedeutet das sieben Jahre ... Aaahhh!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte coeurl noir. Sa fourrure sombre est très douce au toucher.
#. column 1: To the untrained eye, this coeurl appears to be of an entirely new species, when in fact the only thing separating him from his mottled brethren is that his spots are so large, they overlap with one another, rendering him completely black.
#. column 2: Look what the<br>coeurl dragged in.<br>  - Momodi
#. column 3: Tiny Claw
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:20:0:0"
msgid "Summon your black coeurl minion. Beware, for if one should cross your path, you will experience seven years of...AWWWWWW."
msgstr "Призови миньона «Чёрный куэрл». Берегись: если он перебежит тебе дорогу, семь лет будешь... ААААА!"

#. ja: クァールの幼獣。通常のクァールは黒い斑点を持つが、稀に毛衣が真っ黒な黒化個体が生まれることがあるという。艶やかで美しい毛並みのほか、高い魔力を有するという特徴を持ち、幼くして王者の風格を漂わせている
#. de: Auch gewöhnliche Coeurl haben schwarze Tupfer, aber vollkommen schwarze Exemplare sind extrem selten. Ihr glänzendes Fell strahlt Erhabenheit aus und macht sich schick an der Seite jedes modebewussten Abenteurers.
#. fr: À la différence de ses cousins plus ordinaires, ce coeurl est entièrement recouvert de fourrure noire. La beauté et l'élégance de ce pelage si rare ne doivent pas faire oublier qu'il est également recouvert d'une aura magique im<shy>pres<shy>sion<shy>nante.
#. column 0: Summon your black coeurl minion. Beware, for if one should cross your path, you will experience seven years of...AWWWWWW.
#. column 2: Look what the<br>coeurl dragged in.<br>  - Momodi
#. column 3: Tiny Claw
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:20:0:1"
msgid "To the untrained eye, this coeurl appears to be of an entirely new species, when in fact the only thing separating him from his mottled brethren is that his spots are so large, they overlap with one another, rendering him completely black."
msgstr "Неопытному глазу этот куэрл покажется зверем неизвестного вида. Но от пятнистых собратьев его отличают лишь огромные пятна, слившиеся друг с другом и сделавшие его совершенно чёрным."

#. ja: グルルルゥ…
#. de: Wenn Pech kommt zu Großwachsenem,<br>Materiastein und Materie umsonstverschwendet.<br><i>Mutagenix</i>
#. fr: Grrr...
#. column 0: Summon your black coeurl minion. Beware, for if one should cross your path, you will experience seven years of...AWWWWWW.
#. column 1: To the untrained eye, this coeurl appears to be of an entirely new species, when in fact the only thing separating him from his mottled brethren is that his spots are so large, they overlap with one another, rendering him completely black.
#. column 3: Tiny Claw
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:20:0:2"
msgid "Look what the<br>coeurl dragged in.<br>  - Momodi"
msgstr "Гляди, что<br>куэрл притащил.<br>  — Момоди"

#. ja: タイニークロー
#. de: Weiche Pfoten
#. fr: Mini-coup de griffe
#. column 0: Summon your black coeurl minion. Beware, for if one should cross your path, you will experience seven years of...AWWWWWW.
#. column 1: To the untrained eye, this coeurl appears to be of an entirely new species, when in fact the only thing separating him from his mottled brethren is that his spots are so large, they overlap with one another, rendering him completely black.
#. column 2: Look what the<br>coeurl dragged in.<br>  - Momodi
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:20:0:3"
msgid "Tiny Claw"
msgstr "Маленький коготь"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のアルカナストーンに、5%のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Arkana-Stein 5 % Schaden zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 5% de sa solidité à la pierre arcanique ennemie la plus proche.
#. column 0: Summon your black coeurl minion. Beware, for if one should cross your path, you will experience seven years of...AWWWWWW.
#. column 1: To the untrained eye, this coeurl appears to be of an entirely new species, when in fact the only thing separating him from his mottled brethren is that his spots are so large, they overlap with one another, rendering him completely black.
#. column 2: Look what the<br>coeurl dragged in.<br>  - Momodi
#. column 3: Tiny Claw
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:20:0:4"
msgid "Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone."
msgstr "Наносит ближайшему вражескому арканическому камню урон в размере 5% его прочности."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ヒルディ」を呼び出す。<br>事件屋ヒルディブランドを模した魔法人形。もれなく助手付き！
#. de: Du rufst deine Hildibrand-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Der putzige Ermittler beherrscht nicht nur die berühmte Pose des Originals, er bringt sogar seine ganz persönliche Assistentin mit!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Hildibrand miniature. Attention, Nashu va être jalouse<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Though he has once more taken to the heavens in a selfless act of sacrifice, Inspector Hildibrand lives on in the hearts of all whose lives he touched with his inimitable brand of gallantry, perception, and panache. Wind him up and let him follow you as only a Manderville can.
#. column 2: I have peeled away the<br>foul scab of uncertainty<br>to reveal the truth within!<br>  - Hildibrand
#. column 3: Power of Deduction
#. column 4: Increases ATK and DEF of all allies within range by 40. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:21:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up gentleman minion. If “clockwork Hildibrand” doesn't quite roll off the tongue, both “minion of enquiry” and “mammet extraordinaire” are acceptable alternatives."
msgstr "Призовите заводного джентльмена-миньона. Если «заводной Хильдибранд» звучит неуклюже, можно назвать его «миньоном-сыщиком» или «мамметом высшего класса»."

#. ja: 大胆不敵で知的な紳士、事件屋ヒルディブランドを模した魔法人形。遙か天の彼方へと旅立った愛息子を偲び、エオルゼア最強の彫金師が情熱的に仕上げた。どういう原理かは不明だが、助手のナシュ人形も付随している
#. de: Diese liebevoll gearbeitete Marionette ist genauso stilvoll und galant wie ihr großes Vorbild. Hildibrands Vater Godbert höchstselbst hat sie angefertigt, um die Zeit bis zur Rückkehr seines unfreiwillig entflogenen Sohnes zu überbrücken.
#. fr: En vadrouille dans une lointaine contrée interstellaire, l'orfèvre le plus balèze d'Éorzéa voulut rendre hommage à son fils qui lui manquait tant. Il a donc fabriqué ces poupées de Hildibrand et de Nashu.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up gentleman minion. If “clockwork Hildibrand” doesn't quite roll off the tongue, both “minion of enquiry” and “mammet extraordinaire” are acceptable alternatives.
#. column 2: I have peeled away the<br>foul scab of uncertainty<br>to reveal the truth within!<br>  - Hildibrand
#. column 3: Power of Deduction
#. column 4: Increases ATK and DEF of all allies within range by 40. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:21:0:1"
msgid "Though he has once more taken to the heavens in a selfless act of sacrifice, Inspector Hildibrand lives on in the hearts of all whose lives he touched with his inimitable brand of gallantry, perception, and panache. Wind him up and let him follow you as only a Manderville can."
msgstr "Пожертвовав собой, он вновь вознёсся в небеса, но инспектор Хильдибранд навсегда останется в сердцах тех, чьи жизни он озарил своим неподражаемым благородством, проницательностью и блеском. Заведите его — и пусть он следует за вами, как подобает Мандервилю."

#. ja: ヒルディィィブランド！
#. de: Maaamiii!<br><i>Kriminologenkampfschrei</i>
#. fr: Hildibraaaand<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up gentleman minion. If “clockwork Hildibrand” doesn't quite roll off the tongue, both “minion of enquiry” and “mammet extraordinaire” are acceptable alternatives.
#. column 1: Though he has once more taken to the heavens in a selfless act of sacrifice, Inspector Hildibrand lives on in the hearts of all whose lives he touched with his inimitable brand of gallantry, perception, and panache. Wind him up and let him follow you as only a Manderville can.
#. column 3: Power of Deduction
#. column 4: Increases ATK and DEF of all allies within range by 40. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:21:0:2"
msgid "I have peeled away the<br>foul scab of uncertainty<br>to reveal the truth within!<br>  - Hildibrand"
msgstr "Я сорвал<br>гнусную коросту сомнений<br>и обнажил истину!<br>  — Хильдибранд"

#. ja: 紳士の推理
#. de: Konklusion
#. fr: Déduction du gentilhomme
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up gentleman minion. If “clockwork Hildibrand” doesn't quite roll off the tongue, both “minion of enquiry” and “mammet extraordinaire” are acceptable alternatives.
#. column 1: Though he has once more taken to the heavens in a selfless act of sacrifice, Inspector Hildibrand lives on in the hearts of all whose lives he touched with his inimitable brand of gallantry, perception, and panache. Wind him up and let him follow you as only a Manderville can.
#. column 2: I have peeled away the<br>foul scab of uncertainty<br>to reveal the truth within!<br>  - Hildibrand
#. column 4: Increases ATK and DEF of all allies within range by 40. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:21:0:3"
msgid "Power of Deduction"
msgstr "Сила дедукции"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のATKとDEFを40上昇させる。ただし効果終了後、特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンは強制帰還する。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>20秒
#. de: Erhöht ATT und ABW von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe um 40, aber die ausführenden Trabanten werden nach Ende des Effekts weggeschickt.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 40 l'attaque et la défense des alliés dans l'aire d'effet. À la fin de l'effet, les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT sont au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment renvoyées.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
