msgctxt "CompanionTransient:21:0:4"
msgid "Increases ATK and DEF of all allies within range by 40. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s"
msgstr "Повышает ATK и DEF всех союзников в радиусе действия на 40. Сразу после применения миньоны, использовавшие особый приём, покидают поле боя.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「グラベルゴーレム」を呼び出す。<br>ゴーレムを模した魔法人形。意外と柔らかい
#. de: Du rufst deinen Kiesgolem als Begleiter herbei. Ein ziemlich harter Bursche.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte golem graveleux. Ce golem miniature est moins rugueux qu'il n'en a l'air.
#. column 1: Mage-controlled golems were in such wide use by the end of the Fifth Astral Era that entire battles were waged by armies comprised of nothing but the lifeless soulkin. This recreation, however, is nothing but a standard model #001 mammet outfitted with simple gravel plating.
#. column 2: Gummice pollums? I fear<br>I'm not familiar with them.<br>  - Yhom Epocan
#. column 3: Gravelskin
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:22:0:0"
msgid "Summon your gravel golem minion. Only you stand between it and a hard place."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — гравийного голема. Только вы стоите между ним и твёрдой скалой."

#. ja: ゴーレムを模した魔法人形。第五星暦末期に作られた石人形を参考に作られているが、その原理はまったくの別物で、中身は通常のマメットとほぼ同じである。なお、外殻は硬そうだが、意外と柔らかい
#. de: Gegen Ende des Fünften Zeitalters des Lichts waren Golems so verbreitet, dass ganze Schlachten mit diesen leblosen Wesen geführt wurden. Dieser Nachbau ist jedoch nichts weiter als ein Standard-<br>modell, das mit Steinplatten versehen wurde.
#. fr: Ce pantin a été créé sur le modèle des golems de la fin de la 5e ère astrale. Il n'a cependant rien de magique et est identique aux autres pantins. Malgré son apparence rigide, son corps est plutôt doux au toucher.
#. column 0: Summon your gravel golem minion. Only you stand between it and a hard place.
#. column 2: Gummice pollums? I fear<br>I'm not familiar with them.<br>  - Yhom Epocan
#. column 3: Gravelskin
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:22:0:1"
msgid "Mage-controlled golems were in such wide use by the end of the Fifth Astral Era that entire battles were waged by armies comprised of nothing but the lifeless soulkin. This recreation, however, is nothing but a standard model #001 mammet outfitted with simple gravel plating."
msgstr "Голем, созданный по образу големов конца Пятой астральной эры, которыми управляли маги. Тогда они были настолько распространены, что целые армии состояли из этих бездушных созданий. А это всего лишь обычный маммет модели № 001, обшитый гравием."

#. ja: ゴゴゴゴゴ…
#. de: Golems sind keine normalen Lebewesen. Es bedarf<br>komplizierter Magie, sie zum Leben zu erwecken.<br><i>Y'shtola</i>
#. fr: Grwoooh...
#. column 0: Summon your gravel golem minion. Only you stand between it and a hard place.
#. column 1: Mage-controlled golems were in such wide use by the end of the Fifth Astral Era that entire battles were waged by armies comprised of nothing but the lifeless soulkin. This recreation, however, is nothing but a standard model #001 mammet outfitted with simple gravel plating.
#. column 3: Gravelskin
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:22:0:2"
msgid "Gummice pollums? I fear<br>I'm not familiar with them.<br>  - Yhom Epocan"
msgstr "Гуммовые поллумы? Боюсь,<br>мне о них ничего не известно.<br>  — Йом Эпокан"

#. ja: グラベルスキン
#. de: Steinchenhaut
#. fr: Cuirasse de gravier
#. column 0: Summon your gravel golem minion. Only you stand between it and a hard place.
#. column 1: Mage-controlled golems were in such wide use by the end of the Fifth Astral Era that entire battles were waged by armies comprised of nothing but the lifeless soulkin. This recreation, however, is nothing but a standard model #001 mammet outfitted with simple gravel plating.
#. column 2: Gummice pollums? I fear<br>I'm not familiar with them.<br>  - Yhom Epocan
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:22:0:3"
msgid "Gravelskin"
msgstr "Гравийная броня"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンのDEFを40上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
#. de: Erhöht die ABW der ausführenden Trabanten um 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 Sekunden
