#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・トンベリ」を呼び出す。<br>トンベリを象った魔法人形。怨みが込められている？
#. de: Du rufst dein Tomberry-Stofftier als Begleiter herbei. Jetzt mit 100 % weniger Groll.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte tomberry mécanique. Pensez à vous retourner de temps à autre quand il marche derrière vous, au cas où...
#. column 1: While merely a clockwork toy crafted to resemble the twisted survivors of Nym, owners of similar creations claim waking to find their wind-up tonberries propped upon their chests, wooden knives pressed firmly against their throats.
#. column 2: I came expectin' to fight<br>one tonberry, not a whole<br>bloody mess of 'em.<br>  - Soft Marauder
#. column 3: Everybody's Grudge
#. column 4: Increases ATK and DEF of all allies within range by 40. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:23:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up tonberry minion. Now with 100% less rancor."
msgstr "Призовите заводного миньона-томберри. Теперь на 100% меньше злобы."

#. ja: トンベリを象った魔法人形。一見すると愛らしいが、実は強い怨みを込めて作られている。それゆえ、持ち主が深い眠りにつくと勝手に動き出し、その柔らかい脇腹に包丁を突き立てるらしいが、包丁も布製なので害はない
#. de: Eigentlich ist dies lediglich ein Spielzeug, das den rätselhaften Überlebenden von Nym nachempfunden ist. Es mehren sich jedoch Berichte von Besitzern, die nachts aufwachen und ihr Tomberry-Stofftier auf ihre Brust gestützt vorfinden, das kleine Holzmesser an ihre Kehle gepresst.
#. fr: Ce Tomberry semble plutôt mignon à première vue, mais est empli d'une immense rancœur. On le dit capable de poignarder son maître pendant son sommeil. Heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment pour vous, ledit couteau est en tissu...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up tonberry minion. Now with 100% less rancor.
#. column 2: I came expectin' to fight<br>one tonberry, not a whole<br>bloody mess of 'em.<br>  - Soft Marauder
#. column 3: Everybody's Grudge
#. column 4: Increases ATK and DEF of all allies within range by 40. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:23:0:1"
msgid "While merely a clockwork toy crafted to resemble the twisted survivors of Nym, owners of similar creations claim waking to find their wind-up tonberries propped upon their chests, wooden knives pressed firmly against their throats."
msgstr "Это всего лишь заводная игрушка, изображающая искалеченных выживших из Нима. И всё же владельцы подобных игрушек уверяют, что просыпались с томберри на груди и деревянным ножом у самого горла."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Mach dich auf etwas gefasst, Tomberry. Alka Zolka und<br>die neuen Seesoldaten sind gekommen, um dir den Garaus<br>zu machen.<br><i>Alka Zolka</i>
#. fr: Tchac tchac...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up tonberry minion. Now with 100% less rancor.
#. column 1: While merely a clockwork toy crafted to resemble the twisted survivors of Nym, owners of similar creations claim waking to find their wind-up tonberries propped upon their chests, wooden knives pressed firmly against their throats.
#. column 3: Everybody's Grudge
#. column 4: Increases ATK and DEF of all allies within range by 40. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:23:0:2"
msgid "I came expectin' to fight<br>one tonberry, not a whole<br>bloody mess of 'em.<br>  - Soft Marauder"
msgstr "Я думал, придётся драться<br>с одним томберри, а не с целой<br>чёртовой оравой!<br>  — Смягчённый мародёр"

#. ja: みんなの怨み
#. de: Jedermanns Groll
#. fr: Rancune collective
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up tonberry minion. Now with 100% less rancor.
#. column 1: While merely a clockwork toy crafted to resemble the twisted survivors of Nym, owners of similar creations claim waking to find their wind-up tonberries propped upon their chests, wooden knives pressed firmly against their throats.
#. column 2: I came expectin' to fight<br>one tonberry, not a whole<br>bloody mess of 'em.<br>  - Soft Marauder
