msgctxt "CompanionTransient:23:0:4"
msgid "Increases ATK and DEF of all allies within range by 40. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s"
msgstr "Повышает ATK и DEF всех союзников в радиусе действия на 40. Сразу после применения миньоны, использовавшие особый приём, покидают поле боя.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「タイニーアダマンタス」を呼び出す。<br>アダマンタスの子亀。いつか賢者になるかもしれない
#. de: Du rufst deine Zwergschildkröte als Begleiter herbei. Sie wird dich jedoch nicht in ein Unterwasser-Königreich tragen, wenn du dich auf ihren Rücken setzt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte tortue naine. Si elle arrive à vivre sept cents ans, cette tortue deviendra peut-être un grand sage génial.
#. column 1: Hatched from an egg laid in the ivory sands of La Noscea's Salt Strand, if lucky, this baby adamantoise may live to see as many as ten score summers...that is, if it does not accidentally launch itself off a cliff with its constant spinning.
#. column 2: What is that foul stench!?<br>It's like the inside of an<br>adamantoise's arse!<br>  -  Wood Wailer Sentry
#. column 3: Baby Stomp
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 25%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:24:0:0"
msgid "Summon your tiny tortoise minion. Will not carry you to an underwater kingdom if you ride on its back."
msgstr "Призовите крошечную черепашку-миньона. Не унесёт вас в подводное царство, даже если вы сядете ей на спину."

#. ja: ソルトストランド産のアダマンタスの子亀。ご主人様についていきたいのは山々だが、歩くのが面倒らしく、いつの間にか身体をスピンさせて移動する技を編み出していた。いつか賢者になるかもしれない
#. de: Aus einem Ei geschlüpft, das an der Salzküste La Nosceas gelegt wurde. Wenn sie Glück hat, wird diese Zwergschildkröte bis zu 200 Sommer erleben ... wenn sie sich bei dem ganzen Gedrehe nicht selbst von einer Klippe katapultiert.
#. fr: Une adamankhélone venue des atolls de sel. Elle aime suivre son maître mais déteste marcher, aussi elle a mis au point une technique consistant à tourner sur elle-même pour se déplacer. Être une tortue peut avoir certains inconvénients.
#. column 0: Summon your tiny tortoise minion. Will not carry you to an underwater kingdom if you ride on its back.
#. column 2: What is that foul stench!?<br>It's like the inside of an<br>adamantoise's arse!<br>  -  Wood Wailer Sentry
#. column 3: Baby Stomp
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 25%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:24:0:1"
msgid "Hatched from an egg laid in the ivory sands of La Noscea's Salt Strand, if lucky, this baby adamantoise may live to see as many as ten score summers...that is, if it does not accidentally launch itself off a cliff with its constant spinning."
msgstr "Эта маленькая адамантовая черепаха вылупилась из яйца на белоснежных песках Солт-Стрэнда в Ла-Носкее. Если ей повезёт, она проживёт лет двести... если только не скатится со скалы, беспрестанно вращаясь."

#. ja: カメェェェッー！
#. de: Wie wär's mit Schildkrötensuppe zum Abendessen?!<br><i>Solkwyb</i>
#. fr: Kwuh kwuh...
#. column 0: Summon your tiny tortoise minion. Will not carry you to an underwater kingdom if you ride on its back.
#. column 1: Hatched from an egg laid in the ivory sands of La Noscea's Salt Strand, if lucky, this baby adamantoise may live to see as many as ten score summers...that is, if it does not accidentally launch itself off a cliff with its constant spinning.
#. column 3: Baby Stomp
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 25%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:24:0:2"
msgid "What is that foul stench!?<br>It's like the inside of an<br>adamantoise's arse!<br>  -  Wood Wailer Sentry"
msgstr "Что за мерзкая вонь!?<br>Будто в заднице адамантуаза!<br>  — Часовой Лесных Стражей"

#. ja: ベビーストンプ
#. de: Stampferchen
#. fr: Démarche de tortue naine
#. column 0: Summon your tiny tortoise minion. Will not carry you to an underwater kingdom if you ride on its back.
#. column 1: Hatched from an egg laid in the ivory sands of La Noscea's Salt Strand, if lucky, this baby adamantoise may live to see as many as ten score summers...that is, if it does not accidentally launch itself off a cliff with its constant spinning.
