#. ja: ミニオン「ベイビーラプトル」を呼び出す。<br>人工孵化させたラプトルの幼獣。甘噛みが得意
#. de: Du rufst deinen Baby-Raptor als Begleiter herbei. Zu deinem Glück sind seine Fangzähne noch nicht ausgewachsen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé raptor. Ce bébé raptor a été incubé ar<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>ciellement. Très joueur, il adore mordiller. Par chance, ses dents définitives n'ont pas encore poussé.
#. column 1: Taking a hint from goblin merchants who raise raptors to serve as beasts of burden, a shopkeep from the village of Boughbury has begun hatching raptor eggs of his own (stolen from nearby nests). One can only hope the mother raptors are not as clever as the shopkeep thinks <i>he</i> is.
#. column 2: By the gods...<br>This raptor is sublime!<br>  - Nonopesa
#. column 3: Prehistoric Park
#. column 4: Renders the action party immune to all attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:25:0:0"
msgid "Summon your baby raptor minion. Luckily for you, his teeth haven't all grown in...yet."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — детёныша раптора. К счастью, его зубы ещё не все прорезались... пока что."

#. ja: 人工孵化させたラプトルの幼獣。ゴブリン族がラプトルを家畜として扱っていることを知ったバウバリー村の商人が、試みに繁殖させたもの。このまま育てれば、頼れる相棒になるのかもしれない。得意技は甘噛み
#. de: Ein Händler aus Astlfingen brütet Raptor-Eier, die er aus Nestern in der Nähe gestohlen hat, selber aus. Ein Trick, den er sich bei Goblinhändlern abgeschaut hat. Man kann nur hoffen, dass die Raptoren-Mütter nicht so schlau sind, wie dieser Händler zu sein glaubt.
#. fr: Apprenant que les Gobelins apprivoisaient des raptors pour en faire des animaux de compagnie, un marchand de Ramebourg tenta d'en élever un avec un œuf. Le reptile aime mordiller et sera peut-être un allié précieux un jour.
#. column 0: Summon your baby raptor minion. Luckily for you, his teeth haven't all grown in...yet.
#. column 2: By the gods...<br>This raptor is sublime!<br>  - Nonopesa
#. column 3: Prehistoric Park
#. column 4: Renders the action party immune to all attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:25:0:1"
msgid "Taking a hint from goblin merchants who raise raptors to serve as beasts of burden, a shopkeep from the village of Boughbury has begun hatching raptor eggs of his own (stolen from nearby nests). One can only hope the mother raptors are not as clever as the shopkeep thinks <i>he</i> is."
msgstr "Вдохновившись гоблинскими торговцами, разводящими рапторов как вьючных животных, один лавочник из деревни Боубери принялся высиживать яйца рапторов (украденные из ближайших гнёзд). Остаётся надеяться, что мамаши-рапторы не так умны, как думает <i>он</i>."

#. ja: ガブガブ…
#. de: Bei den Göttern ... Dieser Raptor ist ein <i>Meisterwerk</i>!<br><i>Nonopesa</i>
#. fr: Groah<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your baby raptor minion. Luckily for you, his teeth haven't all grown in...yet.
#. column 1: Taking a hint from goblin merchants who raise raptors to serve as beasts of burden, a shopkeep from the village of Boughbury has begun hatching raptor eggs of his own (stolen from nearby nests). One can only hope the mother raptors are not as clever as the shopkeep thinks <i>he</i> is.
#. column 3: Prehistoric Park
#. column 4: Renders the action party immune to all attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:25:0:2"
msgid "By the gods...<br>This raptor is sublime!<br>  - Nonopesa"
msgstr "Боги...<br>Какой великолепный раптор!<br>  — Нонопеса"

#. ja: 太古の生命
#. de: Urlebensform
#. fr: Aura paléozoïque
