#. ja: ミニオン「ベイビーバット」を呼び出す。<br>小さなコウモリ。連れ歩けば吸血鬼気分
#. de: Du rufst deine Baby-Fledermaus als Begleiter herbei. Sie hat noch keinen Blutdurst entwickelt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé chauve-souris. Cette petite chauve-souris vous donnera l'illusion d'être un vampire.
#. column 1: Nonoroon, resident junkmonger at Memeroon's Trading Post, came up with the idea for capturing and selling baby bats one day while raiding caves for bat eggs...of which he could not find any.
#. column 2: Even ate a wing off one<br>afore I made up my mind<br>to climb down the wall.<br>  - Ahldfoet
#. column 3: Ultrasonics
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:26:0:0"
msgid "Summon your baby bat minion. Has yet to acquire a taste for blood."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — детёныша летучей мыши. Пока ещё не пристрастился к крови."

#. ja: メメルン交易商会の商人、ノノルンが売っていた小さなコウモリ。売り文句は「新鮮採れたて美味しいコウモリ」とのこと。とはいえ、とても美味しそうには見えない。連れ歩けば吸血鬼気分になれること請け合い
#. de: Nonoroon von Memeroons Handelsposten ist auf die Idee gekommen, Baby-Fledermäuse zu fangen und zu verkaufen, während er in einigen Höhlen auf der Jagd nach Fledermauseiern war ... die er nicht finden konnte.
#. fr: Une chauve-souris vendue par Nonoroon avec le slogan “une délicieuse chauve-souris toute fraîche”. Elle n'a pas l'air très bonne à manger, mais peut au moins vous donner l'illusion d'être un vampire.
#. column 0: Summon your baby bat minion. Has yet to acquire a taste for blood.
#. column 2: Even ate a wing off one<br>afore I made up my mind<br>to climb down the wall.<br>  - Ahldfoet
#. column 3: Ultrasonics
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:26:0:1"
msgid "Nonoroon, resident junkmonger at Memeroon's Trading Post, came up with the idea for capturing and selling baby bats one day while raiding caves for bat eggs...of which he could not find any."
msgstr "Торговец всякой всячиной Нонорун из торгового поста Мемеруна однажды решил ловить и продавать детёнышей летучих мышей. Идея пришла ему в голову, когда он обыскивал пещеры в поисках яиц летучих мышей... которых так и не нашёл."

#. ja: キィ、キィ
#. de: Den Höhlenfledermäusen in den Finstereisenminen wird<br>nachgesagt, dass ihre Bisse einen Krankheitserreger<br>übertragen, der Blutdurst bei seinem Opfer wecken soll.<br><i>Almanach der Nachtaktiven</i>
#. fr: Kriii kriii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your baby bat minion. Has yet to acquire a taste for blood.
#. column 1: Nonoroon, resident junkmonger at Memeroon's Trading Post, came up with the idea for capturing and selling baby bats one day while raiding caves for bat eggs...of which he could not find any.
#. column 3: Ultrasonics
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:26:0:2"
msgid "Even ate a wing off one<br>afore I made up my mind<br>to climb down the wall.<br>  - Ahldfoet"
msgstr "Я даже крыло у одной откусил,<br>прежде чем решил всё-таки<br>спуститься со стены.<br>  — Алдфоэт"

#. ja: 超音波
#. de: Ultraschall
#. fr: Ultrasons
#. column 0: Summon your baby bat minion. Has yet to acquire a taste for blood.
#. column 1: Nonoroon, resident junkmonger at Memeroon's Trading Post, came up with the idea for capturing and selling baby bats one day while raiding caves for bat eggs...of which he could not find any.
#. column 2: Even ate a wing off one<br>afore I made up my mind<br>to climb down the wall.<br>  - Ahldfoet
