#. ja: ミニオン「ダストバニー」を呼び出す。<br>スプリガンの幼生体。大好物は柔らかい宝石
#. de: Du rufst dein Staubhäschen als Begleiter herbei. Trotz der frappierenden Ähnlichkeiten sind Spriggans nicht mit Kaninchen verwandt. Allerdings haben sie diese zum Fressen gern.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte lapin mutin. Malgré leurs similitudes morphologiques, les spriggans n'ont aucun lien de parenté avec les lapins. Ils sont toutefois réputés pour les manger.
#. column 1: It is not fully known why spriggans hoard precious rocks and minerals, though scholars would have us believe that it is the rocks and minerals which are hoarding the spriggans, hence the creatures' scientific classification as soulkin.
#. column 2: Between the four of us,<br>surely we can outsmart<br>a few rogue spriggans.<br>  - Augustiniel
#. column 3: Romp
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:28:0:0"
msgid "Summon your dust bunny minion. Despite the striking similarities, spriggans are not related to rabbits. But they have been known to eat them."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — пыльного кролика. Несмотря на поразительное сходство, спригганы не родственники кроликов. Зато известно, что они охотно их едят."

#. ja: スプリガンの幼生体。歯が成長しておらず、まだ硬い鉱石は食べられないため、砂利や小石を掘り出して食べる。「ダストバニー」とは、埃まみれで廃石をあさる姿から付けられた愛称。大好物は柔らかい宝石らしい
#. de: Niemand weiß, warum Spriggans wertvolle Steine und Minerale horten, aber Gelehrte meinen, dass es umgekehrt die Steine und Minerale sind, die die Spriggans horten. Daher stamme auch die wissen-<br>schaftliche Einordnung der Kreaturen als Arkane.
#. fr: Ce bébé spriggan amateur de joyaux n'a pas encore toutes ses dents et dévore du gravier faute de pouvoir croquer plus dur. On le nomme “lapin” pour ses oreilles ou “noiraud” s'il se couvre de poussière en quête de minerai.
#. column 0: Summon your dust bunny minion. Despite the striking similarities, spriggans are not related to rabbits. But they have been known to eat them.
#. column 2: Between the four of us,<br>surely we can outsmart<br>a few rogue spriggans.<br>  - Augustiniel
#. column 3: Romp
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:28:0:1"
msgid "It is not fully known why spriggans hoard precious rocks and minerals, though scholars would have us believe that it is the rocks and minerals which are hoarding the spriggans, hence the creatures' scientific classification as soulkin."
msgstr "Учёные до сих пор не выяснили, почему спригганы собирают драгоценные камни и руду. По одной версии, это камни и руда собирают спригганов, отсюда и научная классификация этих созданий как одушевлённых."

#. ja: イシシシシ…
#. de: Jetzt weiß ich, was hier so stinkt. Das muss<br>der Speichel eines Spriggans sein.<br><i>Hedyn</i>
#. fr: Twi-dwi-dwi<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your dust bunny minion. Despite the striking similarities, spriggans are not related to rabbits. But they have been known to eat them.
#. column 1: It is not fully known why spriggans hoard precious rocks and minerals, though scholars would have us believe that it is the rocks and minerals which are hoarding the spriggans, hence the creatures' scientific classification as soulkin.
#. column 3: Romp
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:28:0:2"
msgid "Between the four of us,<br>surely we can outsmart<br>a few rogue spriggans.<br>  - Augustiniel"
msgstr "Нас четверо — уж с парой<br>сбежавших спригганов-то<br>мы как-нибудь справимся.<br>  — Огюстиниэль"

#. ja: ロンプ
#. de: Herumtollen
#. fr: Cabrioles
#. column 0: Summon your dust bunny minion. Despite the striking similarities, spriggans are not related to rabbits. But they have been known to eat them.
#. column 1: It is not fully known why spriggans hoard precious rocks and minerals, though scholars would have us believe that it is the rocks and minerals which are hoarding the spriggans, hence the creatures' scientific classification as soulkin.
