#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・デュラハン」を呼び出す。<br>デュラハンを模した魔法人形。小さな大剣使い
#. de: Du rufst deinen mechanischen Dullahan als Begleiter herbei. Vorsicht: Kann spitze Teile enthalten!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte dullahan nain. Vous vous sentirez plus en sécurité avec ce mini-chevalier en armure à vos côtés.
#. column 1: Some dullahans are believed to be shapeless entities who must first inhabit an inanimate host (such as a suit of armor) before gaining the ability to exert force upon the corporeal plane. Luckily, the only things inhabiting this wind-up contraption are manifold gears and rods.
#. column 2: Pray retrieve the gift ere<br>it is crushed beneath the<br>iron feet of the dullahans!<br>  - G'raha Tia
#. column 3: Wandering Armor
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:29:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up dullahan minion. Warning: may contain sharp parts."
msgstr "Призовите заводного миньона-дюрагана. Осторожно: внутри могут быть острые детали."

#. ja: 妖異「デュラハン」を模した魔法人形。本来のデュラハンは姿なき存在で、板金鎧に憑依することにより物質界で活動する。しかし、マメットの中には、からくり仕掛けがぎっちり。中身が見えないよう兜で隠している
#. de: Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>te Dullahan sind eigentlich gestaltlose Wesen, die erst einen leblosen Wirt (wie eine Rüstung) finden müssen, bevor sie ihre Macht in unserem Reich ausüben können. Glücklicherweise befinden sich in dieser Aufzieh-Variante nur Zahnräder und Gestänge.
#. fr: Ce pantin s'inspire des dullahans, entités immatérielles qui investissent des armures pour en faire leur corps dans le monde physique. Ce pantin dullahan recèle cependant un mécanisme à l'intérieur de son casque.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up dullahan minion. Warning: may contain sharp parts.
#. column 2: Pray retrieve the gift ere<br>it is crushed beneath the<br>iron feet of the dullahans!<br>  - G'raha Tia
#. column 3: Wandering Armor
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:29:0:1"
msgid "Some dullahans are believed to be shapeless entities who must first inhabit an inanimate host (such as a suit of armor) before gaining the ability to exert force upon the corporeal plane. Luckily, the only things inhabiting this wind-up contraption are manifold gears and rods. "
msgstr "Поговаривают, что дюраганы — бестелесные сущности. Чтобы воздействовать на материальный мир, им нужно вселиться в неживое тело, например в доспехи. К счастью, внутри этой заводной игрушки живут лишь бесчисленные шестерёнки и стержни."

#. ja: ガチャガチャ…
#. de: Klapper-di-klapp.<br><i>Aufzieh-Dullahan</i>
#. fr: Cling clang...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up dullahan minion. Warning: may contain sharp parts.
#. column 1: Some dullahans are believed to be shapeless entities who must first inhabit an inanimate host (such as a suit of armor) before gaining the ability to exert force upon the corporeal plane. Luckily, the only things inhabiting this wind-up contraption are manifold gears and rods.
#. column 3: Wandering Armor
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:29:0:2"
msgid "Pray retrieve the gift ere<br>it is crushed beneath the<br>iron feet of the dullahans!<br>  - G'raha Tia"
msgstr "Прошу, спасите подарок,<br>пока его не раздавили<br>железные ноги дюраганов!<br>  — Г'раха Тиа"

#. ja: 彷徨わぬ鎧
#. de: Ruhelose Rüstung
#. fr: Armure piégée
