#. ja: ミニオン「ギガンジャクシ」を呼び出す。<br>ギガントードのおたまじゃくし。カエルはいいな……
#. de: Du rufst deine Kaulquappe als Begleiter herbei. Ja, sie kann stundenlang ohne Wasser auskommen. Und ja, sie kann fliegen. Frag nicht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte têtard géant. Si vous vous occupez bien de ce têtard, il évoluera peut-être en crapaud géant. Mais est-ce vraiment ce que vous voulez<nbsp>?
#. column 1: Over countless generations, the gigantoads of Thanalan have adapted to the arid climes by taking on traits not seen in their cousins to the north, such as thick membranes to keep their skin hydrated out of water, and a set of extra fins which act as wings to propel them over land.
#. column 2: These toads are huge,<br>which means they have<br>huge guts.<br>  - Hamon
#. column 3: Huge Guts
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:30:0:0"
msgid "Summon your gigantpole minion. Yes, it can survive for hours on end without any water, and yes, it can fly. Your argument is invalid."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — гигантского головастика. Да, он часами обходится без воды. Да, он умеет летать. Ваши доводы не принимаются."

#. ja: ザナラーンの水辺で釣れたギガントードのおたまじゃくし。そのうち脚が生えて、立派なギガントードになるはずだ。大きくなったからといって捨てると、周辺住民が次々と失踪することになるだろう。責任をもって飼おう
#. de: Über viele Generationen hinweg haben sich die Karpfenkröten von Thanalan an das dürre Klima angepasst. Dicke Membranen halten ihre Haut auch außerhalb des Wassers feucht und ein zusätzliches Paar Flossen dient ihnen an Land als Flügel.
#. fr: Ce têtard est le petit d'un crapaud géant du Thanalan. Il deviendra lui aussi un crapaud lorsque ses pattes sortiront, qui s'en prendra peut-être aux riverains. Ah, être un batracien, c'est la belle vie<nbsp>! Nager, c'est le pied<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your gigantpole minion. Yes, it can survive for hours on end without any water, and yes, it can fly. Your argument is invalid.
#. column 2: These toads are huge,<br>which means they have<br>huge guts.<br>  - Hamon
#. column 3: Huge Guts
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:30:0:1"
msgid "Over countless generations, the gigantoads of Thanalan have adapted to the arid climes by taking on traits not seen in their cousins to the north, such as thick membranes to keep their skin hydrated out of water, and a set of extra fins which act as wings to propel them over land."
msgstr "За бесчисленные поколения гигантские жабы Таналана приспособились к засушливому климату. В отличие от северных сородичей, их толстая кожа не даёт влаге испаряться на суше, а дополнительные плавники служат крыльями и позволяют им летать."

#. ja: ピチャピチャ
#. de: Es wird behauptet, dass die zur Gattung der Karpfenkröten<br>gehörenden Winter-Nöcken von den alten Allagern durch Magie<br>künstlich vergrößert wurden, um sie dann zu essen.<br><i>Forscher Nazyl Duzyl</i>
#. fr: Tchh tchh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your gigantpole minion. Yes, it can survive for hours on end without any water, and yes, it can fly. Your argument is invalid.
#. column 1: Over countless generations, the gigantoads of Thanalan have adapted to the arid climes by taking on traits not seen in their cousins to the north, such as thick membranes to keep their skin hydrated out of water, and a set of extra fins which act as wings to propel them over land.
#. column 3: Huge Guts
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:30:0:2"
msgid "These toads are huge,<br>which means they have<br>huge guts.<br>  - Hamon"
msgstr "Жабы-то огромные,<br>значит, и потроха<br>у них огромные.<br>  — Хамон"

#. ja: ヌルヌル粘膜
#. de: Schleimschicht
#. fr: Muqueuse visqueuse
#. column 0: Summon your gigantpole minion. Yes, it can survive for hours on end without any water, and yes, it can fly. Your argument is invalid.
#. column 1: Over countless generations, the gigantoads of Thanalan have adapted to the arid climes by taking on traits not seen in their cousins to the north, such as thick membranes to keep their skin hydrated out of water, and a set of extra fins which act as wings to propel them over land.
#. column 2: These toads are huge,<br>which means they have<br>huge guts.<br>  - Hamon
