msgid "Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s"
msgstr "Снижает ATK всех врагов в радиусе действия на 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「パジープーク」を呼び出す。<br>プークの幼生体。そのお腹はプクプクとした感触
#. de: Du rufst deinen Schwabbelpuk als Begleiter herbei. Frag lieber nicht, was er gefressen hat, um so schwabbelig zu werden.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte puk potelé. Ce puk grassouillet aurait besoin de faire un régime s'il veut voler plus haut.
#. column 1: Fattened from birth to be a succulent snack for the sadistic Steropes, this fledgling puk's excess baggage ensures that even if he attempts to flee, he will not be getting that far.
#. column 2: Ul'dah ain't more'n a<br>sand-crusted pile o' puk<br>dung bakin' in the desert.<br>  - Baderon Tenfingers
#. column 3: Excess Baggage
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:31:0:0"
msgid "Summon your pudgy puk minion. Don't ask what he has eaten to grow so plump."
msgstr "Призовите пухлого миньона-пука. Не спрашивайте, чем он объелся."

#. ja: プークの幼生体。クルザス地方で暴れ回る単眼族「ステロペス」のおやつとして一生を終えるはずだったところを、冒険者によって救われた。その恩を忘れることはないだろう。成長して野生の本能に目覚めるまでは……
#. de: Von Geburt an gemästet, um an den sadistischen Steropes verfüttert zu werden. Die Speckschwarten dieses Schwabbelpucks vereiteln jegliche Fluchtversuche.
#. fr: Vous avez sauvé ce puk qui a bien failli servir de casse-croûte au cyclope Stéropès dans le Coerthas. Il vous en sera infiniment re<shy>con<shy>nais<shy>sant... du moins jusqu'à ce que son instinct sauvage reprenne le dessus.
#. column 0: Summon your pudgy puk minion. Don't ask what he has eaten to grow so plump.
#. column 2: Ul'dah ain't more'n a<br>sand-crusted pile o' puk<br>dung bakin' in the desert.<br>  - Baderon Tenfingers
#. column 3: Excess Baggage
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:31:0:1"
msgid "Fattened from birth to be a succulent snack for the sadistic Steropes, this fledgling puk's excess baggage ensures that even if he attempts to flee, he will not be getting that far."
msgstr "С самого рождения этого молодого пука откармливали, чтобы он стал лакомым кусочком для садиста Стеропа. Благодаря своему лишнему весу он далеко не убежит, даже если попробует."

#. ja: アタフタ…
#. de: Immer wieder haben wir Probleme mit Puks: Sie fressen die Insekten,<br>die die Orangenblüten bestäuben. Deswegen müssen wir die Blüten oft<br>einzeln per Hand bestäuben.<br><i>Bhirdraeg</i>
#. fr: Boing boing<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your pudgy puk minion. Don't ask what he has eaten to grow so plump.
#. column 1: Fattened from birth to be a succulent snack for the sadistic Steropes, this fledgling puk's excess baggage ensures that even if he attempts to flee, he will not be getting that far.
#. column 3: Excess Baggage
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:31:0:2"
msgid "Ul'dah ain't more'n a<br>sand-crusted pile o' puk<br>dung bakin' in the desert.<br>  - Baderon Tenfingers"
msgstr "Ульда — не больше чем<br>куча навоза пука,<br>засыпанная песком и жарящаяся в пустыне.<br>  — Бадерон Десятипалый"

#. ja: 野生の目覚め
#. de: Entschlacken
#. fr: Terreur sauvage
#. column 0: Summon your pudgy puk minion. Don't ask what he has eaten to grow so plump.
#. column 1: Fattened from birth to be a succulent snack for the sadistic Steropes, this fledgling puk's excess baggage ensures that even if he attempts to flee, he will not be getting that far.
