#. ja: ミニオン「バッファロー・カフ」を呼び出す。<br>バッファローの仔牛。肉質が柔らかく美味しそう
#. de: Du rufst dein Büffelkalb als Begleiter herbei. Zartes und saftiges Fleisch. Obwohl natürlich niemand jemals daran denken würde, es zu essen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bufflon. Ce bébé buffle a l'air si dodu et tendre qu'il met l'eau à la bouche.
#. column 1: When the Scions of the Seventh Dawn began clearing out the Waking Sands in preparation for the move to Revenant's Toll, this wide-eyed calf was discovered hiding in a disused linen closet. Though an inquiry was made by the Antecedent herself, it is still not known who was keeping the beast.
#. column 2: I made the grievous error<br>of visiting a great buffalo<br>with a handsaw.<br>  - Godbert
#. column 3: Bucking Bull
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:32:0:0"
msgid "Summon your buffalo calf minion. Milk-fed until tender and juicy. Not that anyone would <i>ever</i> think of eating him."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — телёнка буйвола. Молочный откорм — и мясо будет нежным и сочным. Не то чтобы кому-то <i>пришло</i> в голову его съесть."

#. ja: バッファローの仔牛。砂の家の倉庫の片隅でひっそりと暮らしていたことが、引っ越し作業により判明。一体、誰が飼っていたのか主が分からなかったため、冒険者が引き取ることになった。肉質が柔らかく美味しそう
#. de: Als der Bund der Morgenröte mit den Umzugs-<br>vorbereitungen nach Geisterzoll begann, wurde dieses glubschäugige Kalb in einem Wandschrank entdeckt. Minfilia selbst stellte eine Anfrage, aber es ist noch immer unklar, wer dieses Biest aufbewahrte.
#. fr: Ce bufflon vivait caché dans un coin du Refuge des sables, jusqu'au jour où il a été découvert à l'occasion du déménagement. On ignore qui l'y avait amené, mais vous l'avez recueilli. Il est si dodu que sa chair doit être délicieuse.
#. column 0: Summon your buffalo calf minion. Milk-fed until tender and juicy. Not that anyone would <i>ever</i> think of eating him.
#. column 2: I made the grievous error<br>of visiting a great buffalo<br>with a handsaw.<br>  - Godbert
#. column 3: Bucking Bull
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:32:0:1"
msgid "When the Scions of the Seventh Dawn began clearing out the Waking Sands in preparation for the move to Revenant's Toll, this wide-eyed calf was discovered hiding in a disused linen closet. Though an inquiry was made by the Antecedent herself, it is still not known who was keeping the beast."
msgstr "Когда Потомки Седьмого рассвета начали освобождать Пески Странствий перед переездом в Приют Странников, в заброшенном бельевом шкафу нашли этого телёнка с большими глазами. Даже Предстоятель лично расспрашивала всех вокруг, но так и не выяснила, кто держал там животное."

#. ja: ンモォ～！
#. de: Ich hatte ein etwas schmerzhaftes Zusammentreffen mit<br>einem Riesenbüffel. Und das nur, weil ich ihm im Schlaf die<br>Spitzen seiner Hörner absägen wollte.<br><i>Godbert</i>
#. fr: Meuh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your buffalo calf minion. Milk-fed until tender and juicy. Not that anyone would <i>ever</i> think of eating him.
#. column 1: When the Scions of the Seventh Dawn began clearing out the Waking Sands in preparation for the move to Revenant's Toll, this wide-eyed calf was discovered hiding in a disused linen closet. Though an inquiry was made by the Antecedent herself, it is still not known who was keeping the beast.
#. column 3: Bucking Bull
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:32:0:2"
msgid "I made the grievous error<br>of visiting a great buffalo<br>with a handsaw.<br>  - Godbert"
msgstr "Я допустил роковую ошибку:<br>навестил большого буйвола<br>с ножовкой в руках.<br>  — Годберт"

#. ja: 猛牛の怒り
#. de: Rotes Tuch
#. fr: Rage bovine
#. column 0: Summon your buffalo calf minion. Milk-fed until tender and juicy. Not that anyone would <i>ever</i> think of eating him.
#. column 1: When the Scions of the Seventh Dawn began clearing out the Waking Sands in preparation for the move to Revenant's Toll, this wide-eyed calf was discovered hiding in a disused linen closet. Though an inquiry was made by the Antecedent herself, it is still not known who was keeping the beast.
