#. ja: ミニオン「ミニテンダー」を呼び出す。<br>サボテンダーの幼生体。まだ針を飛ばせない
#. de: Du rufst deine Kaktorfigur als Begleiter herbei. Pass auf, dass du dich nicht aus Versehen draufsetzt!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-pampa. Ce cactus est si petit que s'il essayait de projeter ses épines, il n'arriverait pas à en lancer 100.
#. column 1: Hab, loneliest zombie in the realm, is certain that this cactuar cutting was taken from his trusty companion Sabotendrick. Or if not, then most positively Sabotendred. What he does not know, is that it is, in fact, from the oft forgotten Sabotendale.
#. column 2: The interior of its arm<br>holds a surprising amount<br>of fresh, drinkable water.<br>  - Common Knowledge
#. column 3: Run Amok
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:33:0:0"
msgid "Summon your cactuar cutting minion. Take care not to suffer 1,000 points of damage...to your heart."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — черенок кактуара. Берегите сердце: не получите тысячу единиц урона... по нему."

#. ja: サボテンダーの幼生体。サボテン1号とサボテン2号の間に生まれた子供だと、ゾンビーの青年「ハブ」は思ってる。だが、実はサボテン3号とサボテン2号の「過去の過ち」の結果であることは知られていない
#. de: Hab, der einsamste Zombie der Welt, ist sich sicher, dass diese Kaktorfigur seinem treuen Gefährten Sabotendrich nachempfunden ist. Oder wenn nicht, dann ganz sicher Sabotendrian. Was er nicht weiß, ist, dass sie eigentlich dem oft vergessenen Sabotendski ähneln soll.
#. fr: D'après le jeune zombi Hab, ce bébé pampa serait né de l'union des cactuars n°1 et n°2. Mais il s'agit peut-être en réalité d'un “accident” des cactuars n°3 et 2, qui sait...
#. column 0: Summon your cactuar cutting minion. Take care not to suffer 1,000 points of damage...to your heart.
#. column 2: The interior of its arm<br>holds a surprising amount<br>of fresh, drinkable water.<br>  - Common Knowledge
#. column 3: Run Amok
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:33:0:1"
msgid "Hab, loneliest zombie in the realm, is certain that this cactuar cutting was taken from his trusty companion Sabotendrick. Or if not, then most positively Sabotendred. What he does not know, is that it is, in fact, from the oft forgotten Sabotendale."
msgstr "Хаб, самый одинокий зомби на свете, уверен, что этот черенок кактуара взят у его верного друга Саботендрика. А если нет, то уж точно у Саботендреда. Он не знает, что на самом деле черенок от всеми забытого Саботендейла."

#. ja: ！？
#. de: Morgens und abends je eine Anwendung Kaktor-Milch<br>und Ihre Haut verjüngt sich um 25 Jahre, gnäd'ge Frau!<br><i>Guntram von den 77 Karawanen</i>
#. fr:    <nbsp>!?
#. column 0: Summon your cactuar cutting minion. Take care not to suffer 1,000 points of damage...to your heart.
#. column 1: Hab, loneliest zombie in the realm, is certain that this cactuar cutting was taken from his trusty companion Sabotendrick. Or if not, then most positively Sabotendred. What he does not know, is that it is, in fact, from the oft forgotten Sabotendale.
#. column 3: Run Amok
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:33:0:2"
msgid "The interior of its arm<br>holds a surprising amount<br>of fresh, drinkable water.<br>  - Common Knowledge"
msgstr "Внутри его руки<br>удивительно много<br>чистой питьевой воды.<br>  — Всем известно"

#. ja: 爆走
#. de: Amoklauf
#. fr: Course folle
#. column 0: Summon your cactuar cutting minion. Take care not to suffer 1,000 points of damage...to your heart.
#. column 1: Hab, loneliest zombie in the realm, is certain that this cactuar cutting was taken from his trusty companion Sabotendrick. Or if not, then most positively Sabotendred. What he does not know, is that it is, in fact, from the oft forgotten Sabotendale.
