#. ja: ミニオン「スモールシェル」を呼び出す。<br>シェルの幼生体。あなたの為に今日も走る
#. de: Du rufst deine Mini-Krabbe als Begleiter herbei. Der Anblick dieses süßen Meeresbewohners bereitet vielen Abenteurern, die ihre jungen Jahre mit dem Erschlagen seiner Verwandten verbracht haben, ein schlechtes Gewissen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte coquépique. Ce petit crabe à la démarche dodelinante serait par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement adapté à l'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment en équipe.
#. column 1: As is implied by its name, the smallshell's shell is small. What is not widely known is that unlike normal crabs whose shells grow thicker and, hence, larger as the crabs age, smallshell carapaces actually reduce in size due to erosion over the wavekin's lifespan, until nothing is left but legs.
#. column 2: Got naught but a sea<br>lion's share of crab offal<br>'twixt them ears, I reckon.<br>  - Ighii Moui
#. column 3: Tweezer
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:34:0:0"
msgid "Summon your smallshell minion. The mere sight of this wee wavekin may cause severe psychological trauma to those who spent years of their lives on faraway shores culling his relatives."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — маленькую ракушку. Один взгляд на это крохотное морское создание может травмировать тех, кто годами истреблял его сородичей на далёких берегах."

#. ja: シェルの幼生体。ブラッドショアの浜辺で石に擬態して休んでいたところ、冒険者の魔物退治に巻き込まれた末、踏みつけられて気絶していた。その後、戦利品として回収され飼われることに。あなたの為に今日も走る
#. de: Wie der Name schon sagt, ist das Gehäuse dieser Mini-Krabbe ziemlich klein. Weniger bekannt ist, dass das Gehäuse nicht wie bei normalen Krabben mit der Zeit wächst, sondern schrumpft, bis außer den Beinen der Krabbe nichts mehr vorhanden ist.
#. fr: Tombé en plein combat sur les Rives sanglantes, ce crabe a été sauvé de justesse en tombant dans le butin. Cette espèce est célèbre pour avoir fait la joie des guerriers désireux de se faire la main dans des tunnels ensablés, jadis...
#. column 0: Summon your smallshell minion. The mere sight of this wee wavekin may cause severe psychological trauma to those who spent years of their lives on faraway shores culling his relatives.
#. column 2: Got naught but a sea<br>lion's share of crab offal<br>'twixt them ears, I reckon.<br>  - Ighii Moui
#. column 3: Tweezer
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:34:0:1"
msgid "As is implied by its name, the smallshell's shell is small. What is not widely known is that unlike normal crabs whose shells grow thicker and, hence, larger as the crabs age, smallshell carapaces actually reduce in size due to erosion over the wavekin's lifespan, until nothing is left but legs."
msgstr "Как понятно из названия, панцирь у маленькой ракушки и правда мал. Но мало кто знает, что у обычных крабов панцирь с возрастом растёт и становится толще, а у этих морских созданий он, наоборот, стирается и уменьшается. В конце концов остаются одни ноги."

#. ja: カササササ…
#. de: Megalokrabben haben die Angewohnheit, bei Anzeichen<br>von Gefahr Zuflucht bei ihren Artgenossen zu suchen.<br><i>Swygskyf</i>
#. fr: Krt krt krt...
#. column 0: Summon your smallshell minion. The mere sight of this wee wavekin may cause severe psychological trauma to those who spent years of their lives on faraway shores culling his relatives.
#. column 1: As is implied by its name, the smallshell's shell is small. What is not widely known is that unlike normal crabs whose shells grow thicker and, hence, larger as the crabs age, smallshell carapaces actually reduce in size due to erosion over the wavekin's lifespan, until nothing is left but legs.
#. column 3: Tweezer
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:34:0:2"
msgid "Got naught but a sea<br>lion's share of crab offal<br>'twixt them ears, I reckon.<br>  - Ighii Moui"
msgstr "Меж ушей у тебя —<br>добрая доля крабьих потрохов,<br>не меньше, я бы сказал.<br>  — Игии Муи"

#. ja: 小さなハサミ
#. de: Kleine Scheren
#. fr: Petites pinces
#. column 0: Summon your smallshell minion. The mere sight of this wee wavekin may cause severe psychological trauma to those who spent years of their lives on faraway shores culling his relatives.
#. column 1: As is implied by its name, the smallshell's shell is small. What is not widely known is that unlike normal crabs whose shells grow thicker and, hence, larger as the crabs age, smallshell carapaces actually reduce in size due to erosion over the wavekin's lifespan, until nothing is left but legs.
#. column 2: Got naught but a sea<br>lion's share of crab offal<br>'twixt them ears, I reckon.<br>  - Ighii Moui
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:34:0:3"
msgid "Tweezer"
msgstr "Маленькие клешни"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵にかかっている、強化効果をすべて打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle positiven Effekte von den gegnerischen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe tous les effets bénéfiques des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your smallshell minion. The mere sight of this wee wavekin may cause severe psychological trauma to those who spent years of their lives on faraway shores culling his relatives.
#. column 1: As is implied by its name, the smallshell's shell is small. What is not widely known is that unlike normal crabs whose shells grow thicker and, hence, larger as the crabs age, smallshell carapaces actually reduce in size due to erosion over the wavekin's lifespan, until nothing is left but legs.
#. column 2: Got naught but a sea<br>lion's share of crab offal<br>'twixt them ears, I reckon.<br>  - Ighii Moui
#. column 3: Tweezer
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:34:0:4"
msgid "Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все положительные эффекты со всех врагов в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「ウルフ・パップ」を呼び出す。<br>ウルフの子狼。「漆黒の王狼」と呼ばれたい
#. de: Du rufst deinen Wolfshundwelpen als Begleiter herbei. Offensichtlich ein großer Verehrer von Gaius van Baelsar.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé chacal. Il rêve qu'on l'appelle “le loup noir” quand il sera grand.
#. column 1: Bred to serve as a war wolf in the Imperial Garlean Army, this pup was rescued before any permanent damage could be done to its playful spirit. He will follow you to the end of the world and back...as long as you toss him an occasional biscuit.
#. column 2: I've got no words to mince<br>with whelps...unless you're<br>here to become a wolf.<br>  - Curious Gorge
#. column 3: Teen Pup
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:35:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wolf pup minion. Idolizes one Gaius van Baelsar for obvious reasons."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — волчонка. Он явно поклонник Гая ван Баэльсара. И не зря."

#. ja: 助け出したウルフの子狼。軍用狼として飼育、訓練されてきた血統を継いでおり、誇り高くも従順な頼れる相棒となる。戦いの場に赴けば、精一杯いっしょに戦ってくれることだろう。いつか「漆黒の王狼」と呼ばれたい
#. de: Gezüchtet, um in der garleischen Armee als Kriegs-<br>wolf zu dienen. Dieser Welpe wurde jedoch gerettet, bevor sein verspieltes Gemüt ernsthaften Schaden nehmen konnte. Er wird dir bis ans Ende der Welt folgen ... solange du ihm hin und wieder einen Knochen zuwirfst.
#. fr: Ce jeune canidé a été entraîné pour le combat militaire. Il sera sans doute un fidèle compagnon sur le champ de bataille. Il rêve qu'on l'appelle “le loup noir” quand il sera grand.
#. column 0: Summon your wolf pup minion. Idolizes one Gaius van Baelsar for obvious reasons.
#. column 2: I've got no words to mince<br>with whelps...unless you're<br>here to become a wolf.<br>  - Curious Gorge
#. column 3: Teen Pup
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:35:0:1"
msgid "Bred to serve as a war wolf in the Imperial Garlean Army, this pup was rescued before any permanent damage could be done to its playful spirit. He will follow you to the end of the world and back...as long as you toss him an occasional biscuit. "
msgstr "Этого щенка вывели для службы боевым волком в гарлеанской армии, но спасли, пока его игривый нрав не испортили окончательно. Он пойдёт за вами хоть на край света и обратно... если иногда угощать его печеньем."

#. ja: ウォォォ～ン！
#. de: Ob ich noch andere gefährliche Tiere besitze?<br>Ich doch nicht!<br><i>R'kontai</i>
#. fr: Awouuuuh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wolf pup minion. Idolizes one Gaius van Baelsar for obvious reasons.
#. column 1: Bred to serve as a war wolf in the Imperial Garlean Army, this pup was rescued before any permanent damage could be done to its playful spirit. He will follow you to the end of the world and back...as long as you toss him an occasional biscuit.
#. column 3: Teen Pup
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:35:0:2"
msgid "I've got no words to mince<br>with whelps...unless you're<br>here to become a wolf.<br>  - Curious Gorge"
msgstr "Не умею я подбирать<br>слова для щенков... если только<br>ты не пришёл стать волком.<br>  — Любопытное Ущелье"

#. ja: フルムーンレイジ
#. de: Lykomanie
#. fr: Rage de la pleine lune
#. column 0: Summon your wolf pup minion. Idolizes one Gaius van Baelsar for obvious reasons.
#. column 1: Bred to serve as a war wolf in the Imperial Garlean Army, this pup was rescued before any permanent damage could be done to its playful spirit. He will follow you to the end of the world and back...as long as you toss him an occasional biscuit.
#. column 2: I've got no words to mince<br>with whelps...unless you're<br>here to become a wolf.<br>  - Curious Gorge
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:35:0:3"
msgid "Teen Pup"
msgstr "Юный щенок"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のATKを20上昇させる。味方がタイプ「アニマル」の場合は、ATKが40上昇する。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Erhöht die ATT von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe um 20, im Fall von Tieren um 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 20 l'attaque des alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou de 40 s'ils sont de type “Créature”.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your wolf pup minion. Idolizes one Gaius van Baelsar for obvious reasons.
#. column 1: Bred to serve as a war wolf in the Imperial Garlean Army, this pup was rescued before any permanent damage could be done to its playful spirit. He will follow you to the end of the world and back...as long as you toss him an occasional biscuit.
#. column 2: I've got no words to mince<br>with whelps...unless you're<br>here to become a wolf.<br>  - Curious Gorge
#. column 3: Teen Pup
