msgid "Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s"
msgstr "Повышает ATK всех союзников в радиусе действия на 20 (на 40, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>зверь</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「タイニーアイ」を呼び出す。<br>アーリマンの幼生体。視線が気になって眠れない
#. de: Du rufst dein Wächterauge als Begleiter herbei. Hast du auch manchmal das Gefühl beobachtet zu werden? Häufig liegt das an ihm.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte œil apprivoisé. Ce jeune ahriman facétieux vous suivra comme une ombre et ne vous quittera pas des yeux. Enfin, de l'œil...
#. column 1: One of the most outlandish theories recently posed by scholars of the void is that ahrimans do not reproduce by typical sexual means, but rather by shedding tears which eventually grow into new creatures.
#. column 2: Black scorpion to sharpen<br>one's wit; ahriman<br>membrane for the mind.<br>  - Severian
#. column 3: Eyes on Me
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:36:0:0"
msgid "Summon your beady eye minion. That feeling you get sometimes that you are being watched? More often than not it is him."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — глазастика. Знакомо чувство, будто за вами наблюдают? Скорее всего, это он."

#. ja: 妖異「アーリマン」の幼生体。ある妖異学者の研究によれば、アーリマンの涙から発生するらしいのだが、未だに現場を確認した者はいないようだ。じっと見つめてくるため、連れていると視線が気になって夜も眠れない
#. de: Eine der eigenartigsten Theorien, die Gelehrten des Nichts jüngst verbreiten, besagt, dass Ahriman sich nicht auf herkömmliche Art und Weise reproduzieren, sondern indem sie Tränen vergießen, aus denen dann neue Kreaturen entstehen.
#. fr: Un jeune ahriman. D'après un chercheur, cette entité serait née d'une larme d'ahriman, mais ce phénomène n'a jamais pu être observé. Il vous fixera jour et nuit jusqu'à l'obsession, ne vous quittant pas des yeux. Enfin, de l'œil.
#. column 0: Summon your beady eye minion. That feeling you get sometimes that you are being watched? More often than not it is him.
#. column 2: Black scorpion to sharpen<br>one's wit; ahriman<br>membrane for the mind.<br>  - Severian
#. column 3: Eyes on Me
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:36:0:1"
msgid "One of the most outlandish theories recently posed by scholars of the void is that ahrimans do not reproduce by typical sexual means, but rather by shedding tears which eventually grow into new creatures."
msgstr "Одна из самых необычных теорий учёных, изучающих Пустоту, гласит, что ахриманы размножаются не обычным способом, а роняя слёзы, из которых со временем вырастают новые существа."

#. ja: ジロリ…
#. de: Was guckst du?!<br><i>Unbekannt</i>
#. fr: Sbwih...
#. column 0: Summon your beady eye minion. That feeling you get sometimes that you are being watched? More often than not it is him.
#. column 1: One of the most outlandish theories recently posed by scholars of the void is that ahrimans do not reproduce by typical sexual means, but rather by shedding tears which eventually grow into new creatures.
#. column 3: Eyes on Me
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:36:0:2"
msgid "Black scorpion to sharpen<br>one's wit; ahriman<br>membrane for the mind.<br>  - Severian"
msgstr "Чёрный скорпион — для острого ума;<br>мембрана ахримана —<br>для ясности мысли.<br>  — Севериан"

#. ja: アイズオンミー
#. de: Augen auf mich
#. fr: Œil sur moi
#. column 0: Summon your beady eye minion. That feeling you get sometimes that you are being watched? More often than not it is him.
#. column 1: One of the most outlandish theories recently posed by scholars of the void is that ahrimans do not reproduce by typical sexual means, but rather by shedding tears which eventually grow into new creatures.
#. column 2: Black scorpion to sharpen<br>one's wit; ahriman<br>membrane for the mind.<br>  - Severian
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:36:0:3"
msgid "Eyes on Me"
msgstr "Глаза на мне"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your beady eye minion. That feeling you get sometimes that you are being watched? More often than not it is him.
#. column 1: One of the most outlandish theories recently posed by scholars of the void is that ahrimans do not reproduce by typical sexual means, but rather by shedding tears which eventually grow into new creatures.
#. column 2: Black scorpion to sharpen<br>one's wit; ahriman<br>membrane for the mind.<br>  - Severian
#. column 3: Eyes on Me
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:36:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「タイニードードー」を呼び出す。<br>ドードーのヒナ。毒腺を除去したので毒は吐かない
#. de: Du rufst dein Dodo-Küken als Begleiter herbei. Gut erzogen, um nicht den ganzen Tag über zu rülpsen, zu würgen und zu furzen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte dodu dodo. Ce dodo dodu dodeline doucement.
#. column 1: Dodos mature extremely fast, going from fledgling to full-grown fryer in but a few short moons. This, coupled with the fact an adult female can lay up to seven eggs a sennight, makes this particular cloudkin the perfect option for feeding the hungry masses.
#. column 2: Lightning Drools over the<br>Bismarck's Delightful<br>Grilled Dodo!<br>  - The <i>Harbor Herald</i>
#. column 3: New Nest
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:37:0:0"
msgid "Summon your fledgling dodo minion. Properly trained not to eructate, regurgitate, expectorate, or flatulate."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — птенца додо. Его как следует выдрессировали: он не отрыгивает, не срыгивает, не харкает и не пукает."

#. ja: マズラヤ島原産のドードーのヒナ。毒腺を除去してあるので毒のブレスは吐かない。丸々と育ててソテーにするも良し、タマゴを産ませてオムレツを作るも良し。いまからその成長が楽しみで仕方がない
#. de: Dodos wachsen in wenigen Monden zu legereifen Tieren heran und produzieren bis zu sieben Eier pro Woche. Daher sind Dodos als Nutztiere besonders geeignet. Was du mit deinem Dodo machst, ist jedoch deine Sache.
#. fr: Un poussin de dronte de Mazlaya. Sa glande à venin ayant été retirée, il ne crache pas de gaz empoisonné. Adulte, il pourra être mangé tel quel, et ses œufs peuvent être cuisinés en délicieuse omelette. Vous avez hâte d'y goûter...
#. column 0: Summon your fledgling dodo minion. Properly trained not to eructate, regurgitate, expectorate, or flatulate.
#. column 2: Lightning Drools over the<br>Bismarck's Delightful<br>Grilled Dodo!<br>  - The <i>Harbor Herald</i>
#. column 3: New Nest
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:37:0:1"
msgid "Dodos mature extremely fast, going from fledgling to full-grown fryer in but a few short moons. This, coupled with the fact an adult female can lay up to seven eggs a sennight, makes this particular cloudkin the perfect option for feeding the hungry masses."
msgstr "Додо взрослеют невероятно быстро: всего за несколько лун из птенца вырастает упитанная птица на жаркое. А поскольку взрослая самка может откладывать до семи яиц в неделю, этот представитель небесных созданий идеально подходит для пропитания голодающих."

#. ja: ドドドドド…
#. de: Gegrillter Dodo ist eigentlich ein einfaches Gericht, aber<br>kaum jemand schafft es, es perfekt zuzubereiten.<br><i>Ingham</i>
#. fr: Glou glou<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your fledgling dodo minion. Properly trained not to eructate, regurgitate, expectorate, or flatulate.
#. column 1: Dodos mature extremely fast, going from fledgling to full-grown fryer in but a few short moons. This, coupled with the fact an adult female can lay up to seven eggs a sennight, makes this particular cloudkin the perfect option for feeding the hungry masses.
#. column 3: New Nest
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:37:0:2"
msgid "Lightning Drools over the<br>Bismarck's Delightful<br>Grilled Dodo!<br>  - The <i>Harbor Herald</i>"
msgstr "Молния облизывается на<br>восхитительного жареного додо<br>из «Бисмарка»!<br>  — <i>«Вестник гавани»</i>"

#. ja: 巣作り
#. de: Nisten
#. fr: Nidification
#. column 0: Summon your fledgling dodo minion. Properly trained not to eructate, regurgitate, expectorate, or flatulate.
#. column 1: Dodos mature extremely fast, going from fledgling to full-grown fryer in but a few short moons. This, coupled with the fact an adult female can lay up to seven eggs a sennight, makes this particular cloudkin the perfect option for feeding the hungry masses.
#. column 2: Lightning Drools over the<br>Bismarck's Delightful<br>Grilled Dodo!<br>  - The <i>Harbor Herald</i>
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:37:0:3"
msgid "New Nest"
msgstr "Новое гнездо"

#. ja: シールドが破壊されていた場合、復活させる。
#. de: Stellt einen zerstörten Schild wieder her.
#. fr: Rétablit votre bouclier s'il a été détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your fledgling dodo minion. Properly trained not to eructate, regurgitate, expectorate, or flatulate.
#. column 1: Dodos mature extremely fast, going from fledgling to full-grown fryer in but a few short moons. This, coupled with the fact an adult female can lay up to seven eggs a sennight, makes this particular cloudkin the perfect option for feeding the hungry masses.
#. column 2: Lightning Drools over the<br>Bismarck's Delightful<br>Grilled Dodo!<br>  - The <i>Harbor Herald</i>
#. column 3: New Nest
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:37:0:4"
msgid "Instantly restores damaged ally Shield. "
msgstr "Мгновенно восстанавливает разрушенный щит союзника."

#. ja: ミニオン「コブランラーヴァ」を呼び出す。<br>コブランの幼生体。一時期乱獲されたらしい
#. de: Du rufst deine Kobalos-Larve als Begleiter herbei. Zu gefährlich, um sie weiter wachsen zu lassen ... aber zu süß, um sie jetzt schon zu beseitigen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte larve de coblyn. Les insectes sont nos amis, il faut les aimer aussi.
#. column 1: Coblyns will lay their eggs near ore deposits so that when the larvae emerge, they will have a ready supply of nourishment to form their protective outer carapaces. This is a slow process which involves dousing the ore in digestive fluid, waiting for it to clarify, then ingesting the ooze.
#. column 2: The lads go through gear<br>faster'n a coblyn chewin'<br>on a chunk of mythril.<br>  - Wawarukka
#. column 3: Vulcanize
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:38:0:0"
msgid "Summon your coblyn larva minion. Too dangerous to allow to grow any larger...too adorable to condemn to the furnace."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — личинку коблина. Нельзя позволять ей расти дальше... но и отправить такую прелесть в печь рука не поднимется."

#. ja: コブランの幼生体。外殻を成長させるため岩肌に長時間へばりつき、消化液を分泌してゆっくりと鉱物を溶かし、その成分を摂取する。それゆえコブランの棲息域では、稀に採掘場から幼生体が掘れることがある
#. de: Kobalosse legen ihre Eier in der Nähe von Erz-<br>vorkommen ab, damit die schlüpfenden Larven genug Nahrung vorfinden, um ihre schützenden Panzer zu bilden. Dies ist ein langwieriger Prozess, in dem das Erz mit Verdauungssäften zu Brei gemacht wird, den die Larven aufschlürfen.
#. fr: Le coblyn se fixe à une paroi rocheuse pendant de longues périodes pour faire grandir sa coquille. Sa sécrétion lui permet de disséquer et assimiler les minerais de sa roche hôte.
#. column 0: Summon your coblyn larva minion. Too dangerous to allow to grow any larger...too adorable to condemn to the furnace.
#. column 2: The lads go through gear<br>faster'n a coblyn chewin'<br>on a chunk of mythril.<br>  - Wawarukka
#. column 3: Vulcanize
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:38:0:1"
msgid "Coblyns will lay their eggs near ore deposits so that when the larvae emerge, they will have a ready supply of nourishment to form their protective outer carapaces. This is a slow process which involves dousing the ore in digestive fluid, waiting for it to clarify, then ingesting the ooze."
msgstr "Коблины откладывают яйца возле залежей руды, чтобы вылупившиеся личинки могли питаться и отращивать защитный панцирь. Процесс этот долгий: личинка покрывает руду пищеварительной жидкостью, ждёт, пока та растворится, а затем слизывает получившуюся жижу."

#. ja: カサコソカサコソ
#. de: Am Feuerwall und nirgendwo sonst leben<br>ganz besondere Kobalosse.<br><i>Schwimmender Stein</i>
#. fr: Krrt krrt krrt...
#. column 0: Summon your coblyn larva minion. Too dangerous to allow to grow any larger...too adorable to condemn to the furnace.
#. column 1: Coblyns will lay their eggs near ore deposits so that when the larvae emerge, they will have a ready supply of nourishment to form their protective outer carapaces. This is a slow process which involves dousing the ore in digestive fluid, waiting for it to clarify, then ingesting the ooze.
#. column 3: Vulcanize
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:38:0:2"
msgid "The lads go through gear<br>faster'n a coblyn chewin'<br>on a chunk of mythril.<br>  - Wawarukka"
msgstr "Парни снарягу изнашивают<br>быстрей, чем коблин жуёт<br>кусок мифрила.<br>  — Ваварукка"

#. ja: 硬質化
#. de: Vulkanisieren
#. fr: Vulcanisation
#. column 0: Summon your coblyn larva minion. Too dangerous to allow to grow any larger...too adorable to condemn to the furnace.
#. column 1: Coblyns will lay their eggs near ore deposits so that when the larvae emerge, they will have a ready supply of nourishment to form their protective outer carapaces. This is a slow process which involves dousing the ore in digestive fluid, waiting for it to clarify, then ingesting the ooze.
#. column 2: The lads go through gear<br>faster'n a coblyn chewin'<br>on a chunk of mythril.<br>  - Wawarukka
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:38:0:3"
msgid "Vulcanize"
msgstr "Вулканизация"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のDEFを10上昇させる。味方のタイプが「モンスター」の場合は、DEFが30上昇する。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Erhöht die ABW von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, im Fall von Monstern um 30.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 10 la défense des alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou de 30 s'ils sont de type “Monstre”.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your coblyn larva minion. Too dangerous to allow to grow any larger...too adorable to condemn to the furnace.
#. column 1: Coblyns will lay their eggs near ore deposits so that when the larvae emerge, they will have a ready supply of nourishment to form their protective outer carapaces. This is a slow process which involves dousing the ore in digestive fluid, waiting for it to clarify, then ingesting the ooze.
#. column 2: The lads go through gear<br>faster'n a coblyn chewin'<br>on a chunk of mythril.<br>  - Wawarukka
