msgctxt "CompanionTransient:38:0:4"
msgid "Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s"
msgstr "Повышает DEF всех союзников в радиусе действия на 10 (на 30, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>монстр</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ゴート」を呼び出す。<br>アルドゴートを模した魔法人形。モフモフしている
#. de: Du rufst dein Steinbock-Stofftier als Begleiter herbei. Bei der Herstellung dieses Begleiters sind keine Steinböcke zu Schaden gekommen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-bouquetin. Un bouquetin miniature à la fourrure soyeuse.
#. column 1: While in Ishgardian folklore the aldgoat is used to represent greed and gluttony, the Dunesfolk believe the insatiable creatures are a symbol of wealth and prosperity, and will present aldgoat fetishes to families with newborn children.
#. column 2: A nice big aldgoat steak<br>should put some color<br>back in 'er cheeks.<br>  - Lyngsath
#. column 3: Mouton
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:39:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up aldgoat minion. No aldgoats were harmed in the making of this automaton."
msgstr "Призовите заводного миньона — альдкозу. При его изготовлении ни одна альдкоза не пострадала."

#. ja: アルドゴートを模した魔法人形。クルザスの民話では悪食の一族として描かれる大山羊だが、デューンフォーク族は富の象徴と考えている。そのため子供が生まれると、豊かに暮らせるように願い、大山羊人形を贈る風習がある
#. de: Im Volksmund von Ishgard steht der Steinbock für Gier und Völlerei, während die Wüstenvölker ihn für ein Symbol von Reichtum und Wohlstand halten. Daher sind Steinbock-Abbilder ein beliebtes Geschenk für Familien mit neugeborenen Kindern.
#. fr: Même si ses habitudes alimentaires lui valent une mauvaise image dans la culture du Coerthas, le Peuple des dunes considère le bouquetin comme un symbole de fortune, et offre ces poupées porte-bonheur aux nouveaux-nés.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up aldgoat minion. No aldgoats were harmed in the making of this automaton.
#. column 2: A nice big aldgoat steak<br>should put some color<br>back in 'er cheeks.<br>  - Lyngsath
#. column 3: Mouton
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:39:0:1"
msgid "While in Ishgardian folklore the aldgoat is used to represent greed and gluttony, the Dunesfolk believe the insatiable creatures are a symbol of wealth and prosperity, and will present aldgoat fetishes to families with newborn children."
msgstr "В ишгардских сказаниях альдгоаты олицетворяют жадность и обжорство, а песчаные лалафеллы считают этих ненасытных созданий символом богатства и процветания. Поэтому семьям с новорождёнными дарят фигурки альдгоатов."

#. ja: モフモフ…
#. de: Bei der großen Katastrophe haben in Coerthas<br>viele Hochlandhirten ihre Steinbockherden verloren.<br><i>Juliembert</i>
#. fr: Bêê bêê<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up aldgoat minion. No aldgoats were harmed in the making of this automaton.
#. column 1: While in Ishgardian folklore the aldgoat is used to represent greed and gluttony, the Dunesfolk believe the insatiable creatures are a symbol of wealth and prosperity, and will present aldgoat fetishes to families with newborn children.
#. column 3: Mouton
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:39:0:2"
msgid "A nice big aldgoat steak<br>should put some color<br>back in 'er cheeks.<br>  - Lyngsath"
msgstr "Хороший сочный стейк<br>из альдкозы вернёт<br>ей румянец на щёки.<br>  — Лингсат"

#. ja: モフモフ
#. de: Blöken
#. fr: Bêlement apaisant
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up aldgoat minion. No aldgoats were harmed in the making of this automaton.
#. column 1: While in Ishgardian folklore the aldgoat is used to represent greed and gluttony, the Dunesfolk believe the insatiable creatures are a symbol of wealth and prosperity, and will present aldgoat fetishes to families with newborn children.
#. column 2: A nice big aldgoat steak<br>should put some color<br>back in 'er cheeks.<br>  - Lyngsath
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:39:0:3"
msgid "Mouton"
msgstr "Блеяние"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方にかかっている、弱体効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle negativen Effekte von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe toutes les altérations d'état des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up aldgoat minion. No aldgoats were harmed in the making of this automaton.
#. column 1: While in Ishgardian folklore the aldgoat is used to represent greed and gluttony, the Dunesfolk believe the insatiable creatures are a symbol of wealth and prosperity, and will present aldgoat fetishes to families with newborn children.
#. column 2: A nice big aldgoat steak<br>should put some color<br>back in 'er cheeks.<br>  - Lyngsath
#. column 3: Mouton
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:39:0:4"
msgid "Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все отрицательные эффекты со всех союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「タイニーアプカル」を呼び出す。<br>アプカルのヒナ。大型魚をあげなくても付いてくる
#. de: Du rufst dein Apkallu-Küken als Begleiter herbei. Folgt dir solange, bis du ihm einen Fisch gibst. Folgt dir weiter, nachdem du ihm einen Fisch gegeben hast.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte apkallu nain. Il vous suivra même sans que vous lui donniez du poisson.
#. column 1: While the hatchlings of other flightless cloudkin have been observed covered in a dull brown coat of down when they emerge from their eggs, apkallus enter the world covered in the same vivid green plumage they will bear for their entire lives.
#. column 2: Nesting hens do not spear<br>a failed egg thief a score<br>and a half times.<br>  - Frandelont Raimdelle
#. column 3: Waddle
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:40:0:0"
msgid "Summon your fledgling apkallu minion. Will follow you until you give him a fish. Will continue to follow you after being given a fish."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — птенца апкаллу. Он будет следовать за вами, пока вы не дадите ему рыбу. И после рыбы тоже будет следовать."

#. ja: アプカルのヒナ。探検の偉業を称えるため、友人でもあるミリスとジョナサスが冒険者のために用意した贈物。ミリスと冒険者が出会った場所でもある名所「アプカルの滝」にちなんだらしいが、当のヒナはそんな事など知らない
#. de: Während die Küken von anderen Laufvögeln mit einem langweiligen braunen Gefieder aus ihren Eiern schlüpfen, betreten die Apkallus die Welt in einem lebhaften grünen Federkleid, das sie ihr ganzes Leben lang behalten.
#. fr: Ce bébé apkallu vous a été offert par Millith et Jonathas pour récompenser votre esprit d'aventure remarquable, et en référence aux Chutes de l'Apkallu où vous les avez rencontrés. Mais tout ceci échappe à cet adorable poussin...
#. column 0: Summon your fledgling apkallu minion. Will follow you until you give him a fish. Will continue to follow you after being given a fish.
#. column 2: Nesting hens do not spear<br>a failed egg thief a score<br>and a half times.<br>  - Frandelont Raimdelle
#. column 3: Waddle
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:40:0:1"
msgid "While the hatchlings of other flightless cloudkin have been observed covered in a dull brown coat of down when they emerge from their eggs, apkallus enter the world covered in the same vivid green plumage they will bear for their entire lives."
msgstr "Птенцы других нелетающих небесных созданий вылупляются покрытыми тусклым коричневым пухом. А апкаллу с самого рождения щеголяют тем же ярко-зелёным оперением, с которым проживут всю жизнь."

#. ja: ペタペタペタ…
#. de: Apkallu-Omelett, aus Apkallu-Eiern, die in Butter luftig<br>leicht gebraten wurden, ist in den Weilern Vylbrands<br>sehr beliebt.<br><i>Kleiner Gourmet-Führer Vylbrand</i>
#. fr: Tap tap tap<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your fledgling apkallu minion. Will follow you until you give him a fish. Will continue to follow you after being given a fish.
#. column 1: While the hatchlings of other flightless cloudkin have been observed covered in a dull brown coat of down when they emerge from their eggs, apkallus enter the world covered in the same vivid green plumage they will bear for their entire lives.
#. column 3: Waddle
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:40:0:2"
msgid "Nesting hens do not spear<br>a failed egg thief a score<br>and a half times.<br>  - Frandelont Raimdelle"
msgstr "Курица не станет клевать<br>неудачливого похитителя яиц<br>двадцать пять раз.<br>  — Франдэлон Раймдель"

#. ja: ペタペタ歩き
#. de: Watschelgang
#. fr: Marche d'apkallu
#. column 0: Summon your fledgling apkallu minion. Will follow you until you give him a fish. Will continue to follow you after being given a fish.
#. column 1: While the hatchlings of other flightless cloudkin have been observed covered in a dull brown coat of down when they emerge from their eggs, apkallus enter the world covered in the same vivid green plumage they will bear for their entire lives.
#. column 2: Nesting hens do not spear<br>a failed egg thief a score<br>and a half times.<br>  - Frandelont Raimdelle
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:40:0:3"
msgid "Waddle"
msgstr "Переваливаясь"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンのオートアタックを範囲攻撃にする。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>12秒
#. de: Macht die Auto-Attacke der ausführenden Trabanten zu einem Flächenangriff.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12 Sekunden
#. fr: Donne une aire d'effet aux attaques automatiques des mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
#. column 0: Summon your fledgling apkallu minion. Will follow you until you give him a fish. Will continue to follow you after being given a fish.
#. column 1: While the hatchlings of other flightless cloudkin have been observed covered in a dull brown coat of down when they emerge from their eggs, apkallus enter the world covered in the same vivid green plumage they will bear for their entire lives.
#. column 2: Nesting hens do not spear<br>a failed egg thief a score<br>and a half times.<br>  - Frandelont Raimdelle
#. column 3: Waddle
