msgctxt "CompanionTransient:40:0:4"
msgid "Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s"
msgstr "Автоатаки миньонов, использовавших особый приём, становятся атаками по области.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「グゥーブー・スプラウト」を呼び出す。<br>グゥーブーの幼獣。エサ代が馬鹿にならないとの噂
#. de: Du rufst deine Baby-Goobbue als Begleiter herbei. Greift aus unerfindlichen Gründen gerne Kätzchen an.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte goobbue goulu. Attention de ne pas vous faire mordre les doigts.
#. column 1: To achieve their cyclopean size, goobbues must maintain a daily diet of several times their own weight. Luckily, the beastkin are not finicky eaters, and will consume almost anything that cannot outrun them. If rumors are to be believed, this includes Lalafells.
#. column 2: These goobbues are wont<br>to devour anything and<br>everything.<br>  - Aileen
#. column 3: Big Sneeze
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:41:0:0"
msgid "Summon your goobbue sproutling minion. Has been known to attack kittens for no apparent reason."
msgstr "Призови мини-гуубу. Говорят, он ни с того ни с сего нападает на котят."

#. ja: グゥーブーの幼獣。さほど成長していないため、頭頂部に生やした植物も未だに芽吹いたばかり。大食いで知られる魔物だけに、十分な大きさに成長するためには途方もない程の食料が必要。エサ代が馬鹿にならないとの噂
#. de: Um ihre volle Größe zu erreichen, müssen Goobbue täglich ein Vielfaches ihres Körpergewichts vertilgen. Deshalb sind sie bei der Auswahl ihrer Nahrung nicht wählerisch und verspeisen alles, was nicht schnell genug wegläuft. Dazu gehören mitunter auch lahme Lalafell.
#. fr: Un jeune goobbue. En raison de son jeune âge, seules quelques pousses vertes recouvrent sa tête. Connu pour être un glouton, ce petit risque de vous coûter cher en nourriture avant d'atteindre l'âge adulte.
#. column 0: Summon your goobbue sproutling minion. Has been known to attack kittens for no apparent reason.
#. column 2: These goobbues are wont<br>to devour anything and<br>everything.<br>  - Aileen
#. column 3: Big Sneeze
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:41:0:1"
msgid "To achieve their cyclopean size, goobbues must maintain a daily diet of several times their own weight. Luckily, the beastkin are not finicky eaters, and will consume almost anything that cannot outrun them. If rumors are to be believed, this includes Lalafells."
msgstr "Чтобы вырасти до циклопических размеров, гуубу ежедневно съедают в несколько раз больше собственного веса. К счастью, эти зверолюди не привередливы и готовы сожрать всё, что не убежит. Если верить слухам, даже лалафеллов."

#. ja: ふぁぁぁ…
#. de: Die Goobbue wird nämlich von dem Mehl angelockt und veranstaltet<br>in den Mühlen eine Riesensauerei. So ein hehrer Held des Heers der<br>Helden wie ich es bin, könnte sie natürlich im Nullkommanix beseitigen.<br><i>Trachtoum, notorischer Lügner</i>
#. fr: Mwom mwom<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your goobbue sproutling minion. Has been known to attack kittens for no apparent reason.
#. column 1: To achieve their cyclopean size, goobbues must maintain a daily diet of several times their own weight. Luckily, the beastkin are not finicky eaters, and will consume almost anything that cannot outrun them. If rumors are to be believed, this includes Lalafells.
#. column 3: Big Sneeze
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:41:0:2"
msgid "These goobbues are wont<br>to devour anything and<br>everything.<br>  - Aileen"
msgstr "Гуубу готовы<br>сожрать всё,<br>что попадётся.<br>  — Айлин"

#. ja: くしゃみ
#. de: Kleiner Nieser
#. fr: Éternuement
#. column 0: Summon your goobbue sproutling minion. Has been known to attack kittens for no apparent reason.
#. column 1: To achieve their cyclopean size, goobbues must maintain a daily diet of several times their own weight. Luckily, the beastkin are not finicky eaters, and will consume almost anything that cannot outrun them. If rumors are to be believed, this includes Lalafells.
#. column 2: These goobbues are wont<br>to devour anything and<br>everything.<br>  - Aileen
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:41:0:3"
msgid "Big Sneeze"
msgstr "Большое чихание"

#. ja: 敵が配置したトラップがある場合、解除する。
#. de: Entfernt eine vom Gegner aufgestellte Falle.
#. fr: Enlève un piège mis en place par l'ennemi.
#. column 0: Summon your goobbue sproutling minion. Has been known to attack kittens for no apparent reason.
#. column 1: To achieve their cyclopean size, goobbues must maintain a daily diet of several times their own weight. Luckily, the beastkin are not finicky eaters, and will consume almost anything that cannot outrun them. If rumors are to be believed, this includes Lalafells.
#. column 2: These goobbues are wont<br>to devour anything and<br>everything.<br>  - Aileen
#. column 3: Big Sneeze
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:41:0:4"
msgid "Disarms deployed enemy traps."
msgstr "Снимает установленные врагами ловушки."

#. ja: ミニオン「ミニプリン」を呼び出す。<br>小さなプリン。ご先祖様は黒かったという噂
#. de: Du rufst deinen Mini-Pudding als Begleiter herbei. Nicht zum Verzehr geeignet!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-pudding. Malgré les apparences, il ne s'agit pas d'un dessert lacté.
#. column 1: Unable to reproduce, puddings increase their number solely via mitosis. Because of this, it is widely believed that all Eorzea's puddings descended from a single entity─a proto-pudding, if you will. This, however, leaves us with the question: whence did the first pudding come?
#. column 2: A talking...pudding?<br>  - You
#. column 3: Silly Pudding
#. column 4: Renders the action party immune to all attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:42:0:0"
msgid "Summon your bite-sized pudding minion. Not intended for consumption."
msgstr "Призови заводную куклу-пудинг. Не предназначена для еды."

#. ja: 小さなプリン。プリンは分裂することで増殖する。チェストにしまっておくと、いつの間にかギッチリ詰まっていることがあるのは、たぶんそういうことなのだろう。ご先祖様は紫ではなく、黒かったという噂がある
#. de: Puddings pflanzen sich allein durch Teilung fort. Daher wird angenommen, dass alle Puddings Eorzeas aus einem einzigen Pudding hervorgegangen sind, dem Großen Ur-Pudding. Unbeantwortet bleibt allerdings die Frage, woher der Große Ur-Pudding kommt.
#. fr: Les puddings se reproduisent en se divisant. Laissez-en un au fond d'un coffre, et il se multipliera à l'infini<nbsp>! On raconte que l'ancêtre de ce pudding était de couleur noire et non violette.
#. column 0: Summon your bite-sized pudding minion. Not intended for consumption.
#. column 2: A talking...pudding?<br>  - You
#. column 3: Silly Pudding
#. column 4: Renders the action party immune to all attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:42:0:1"
msgid "Unable to reproduce, puddings increase their number solely via mitosis. Because of this, it is widely believed that all Eorzea's puddings descended from a single entity─a proto-pudding, if you will. This, however, leaves us with the question: whence did the first pudding come?"
msgstr "Пудинги не размножаются обычным способом, а только делятся надвое. Поэтому многие считают, что все пудинги Эорзеи произошли от одного прародителя. Но откуда взялся самый первый пудинг?"

#. ja: ぷりんぷりん
#. de: Ein Stück aus dem schwabbeligen Bauch eines Puddings ist<br>so fettig, dass bereits die bloße Berührung in der Lage ist,<br>eine Herzkranzgefäßverengung herbeizuführen.<br><i>Praktischer Ratgeber für Druiden und andere Heiler</i>
#. fr: Bwim bwim<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your bite-sized pudding minion. Not intended for consumption.
#. column 1: Unable to reproduce, puddings increase their number solely via mitosis. Because of this, it is widely believed that all Eorzea's puddings descended from a single entity─a proto-pudding, if you will. This, however, leaves us with the question: whence did the first pudding come?
#. column 3: Silly Pudding
#. column 4: Renders the action party immune to all attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:42:0:2"
msgid "A talking...pudding?<br>  - You"
msgstr "Говорящий... пудинг?<br>  — Ты"

#. ja: めにょーん
#. de: Winziges Wabbeln
#. fr: Flaccidité
#. column 0: Summon your bite-sized pudding minion. Not intended for consumption.
#. column 1: Unable to reproduce, puddings increase their number solely via mitosis. Because of this, it is widely believed that all Eorzea's puddings descended from a single entity─a proto-pudding, if you will. This, however, leaves us with the question: whence did the first pudding come?
#. column 2: A talking...pudding?<br>  - You
#. column 4: Renders the action party immune to all attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:42:0:3"
msgid "Silly Pudding"
msgstr "Забавный пудинг"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンはタイプ「ドール」からの攻撃に対して無敵になる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
#. de: Macht die ausführenden Trabanten unempfindlich für Angriffe von Puppen.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 Sekunden
#. fr: Rend les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT invulnérables aux attaques venant des ennemis de type “Poupée”.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
