msgid "Renders the action party immune to all attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
msgstr "Защищает использовавших особую способность миньонов от всех атак <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>кукол</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「魔導ヴァンガード追従型」を呼び出す。<br>1/9スケールモデル。帝国一般兵はついていません
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Frontbrecher als Begleiter herbei. Ein exaktes Modell eines Magitek-Frontbrechers im Maßstab 1:9.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte maquette magitek. Une réplique exacte au 1/9e. Soldat impérial vendu séparément.
#. column 1: Part of the Guildmaster Series, this high-quality replica is so exact in its rendition of the vanguard's build that Garlemald has banned the item's import into the Empire's outlying provinces, for fear the data gleaned from it will be used by rebel forces still active in these lands.
#. column 2: I'd sooner face a vanguard<br>while naked as my<br>nameday!<br>  - Flame Private
#. column 3: Overcharge
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:43:0:0"
msgid "Summon your model vanguard minion. An exact 1:9 scale replica of a ceruleum-powered magitek vanguard (imperial pilot action figure not included)."
msgstr "Призови заводного авангарда. Точная копия магитека на церулеуме в масштабе 1:9. Фигурка имперского пилота в комплект не входит."

#. ja: 彫金師ギルドが誇るギルドマスターグレードシリーズ第一弾。ガレマール帝国軍の無人型魔導アーマー「ヴァンガード」を、1/9スケールで忠実に再現している。このキットに帝国一般兵はついていません
#. de: Diese hochwertige Nachbildung ist so detailliert, dass Garlemand ihren Export in die rebellischen Regionen verbot, weil er fürchtete, dass die Aufständischen einen taktischen Vorteil aus der Kenntnis des genauen Aufbaus der Magitek-Frontbrecher gewinnen könnten.
#. fr: Une maquette de la série “chefs-d'œuvre miniatures par la guilde des orfèvres”. Il s'agit d'une reproduction fidèle d'une avant-garde magitek, une armure téléguidée impériale, au 1/9e. Le soldat n'est pas fourni.
#. column 0: Summon your model vanguard minion. An exact 1:9 scale replica of a ceruleum-powered magitek vanguard (imperial pilot action figure not included).
#. column 2: I'd sooner face a vanguard<br>while naked as my<br>nameday!<br>  - Flame Private
#. column 3: Overcharge
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:43:0:1"
msgid "Part of the Guildmaster Series, this high-quality replica is so exact in its rendition of the vanguard's build that Garlemald has banned the item's import into the Empire's outlying provinces, for fear the data gleaned from it will be used by rebel forces still active in these lands."
msgstr "Эта высококачественная модель из серии «Шедевры гильдии» настолько точно воспроизводит устройство авангарда, что Гарлемальд запретил ввозить её в отдалённые провинции Империи. Тамошние повстанцы могли бы использовать полученные сведения в своих целях."

#. ja: ギィ…ガシャン…
#. de: Kopf einziehen und den Frontbrecher wüten lassen.<br><i>Garleische Infanterie-Weisheit</i>
#. fr: Dzwang dzwang<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your model vanguard minion. An exact 1:9 scale replica of a ceruleum-powered magitek vanguard (imperial pilot action figure not included).
#. column 1: Part of the Guildmaster Series, this high-quality replica is so exact in its rendition of the vanguard's build that Garlemald has banned the item's import into the Empire's outlying provinces, for fear the data gleaned from it will be used by rebel forces still active in these lands.
#. column 3: Overcharge
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:43:0:2"
msgid "I'd sooner face a vanguard<br>while naked as my<br>nameday!<br>  - Flame Private"
msgstr "Лучше встречу авангард<br>голым, чем<br>в свой день рождения!<br>  — Рядовой Огненных"

#. ja: オーバーチャージ
#. de: Überladung
#. fr: Surcharge
#. column 0: Summon your model vanguard minion. An exact 1:9 scale replica of a ceruleum-powered magitek vanguard (imperial pilot action figure not included).
#. column 1: Part of the Guildmaster Series, this high-quality replica is so exact in its rendition of the vanguard's build that Garlemald has banned the item's import into the Empire's outlying provinces, for fear the data gleaned from it will be used by rebel forces still active in these lands.
#. column 2: I'd sooner face a vanguard<br>while naked as my<br>nameday!<br>  - Flame Private
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:43:0:3"
msgid "Overcharge"
msgstr "Перегрузка"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your model vanguard minion. An exact 1:9 scale replica of a ceruleum-powered magitek vanguard (imperial pilot action figure not included).
#. column 1: Part of the Guildmaster Series, this high-quality replica is so exact in its rendition of the vanguard's build that Garlemald has banned the item's import into the Empire's outlying provinces, for fear the data gleaned from it will be used by rebel forces still active in these lands.
#. column 2: I'd sooner face a vanguard<br>while naked as my<br>nameday!<br>  - Flame Private
#. column 3: Overcharge
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:43:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Повышает запас очков особых способностей союзных миньонов поблизости на 10. Не действует на миньонов с такой же способностью."

#. ja: ミニオン「デモンズブロック」を呼び出す。<br>魔法のブロック。古代の見習い妖術師が作った習作
#. de: Du rufst deinen Dämonenwürfel als Begleiter herbei. Es ist wohl besser, nicht zu wissen, welch dunkle Magie diesen gewöhnlichen Stein zum Leben erweckt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bloc démonique. Un sorcier des temps anciens a enchanté ce bloc pour s'entraîner. Si vous en aviez plusieurs, vous pourriez en faire un mur...
#. column 1: For many years, modern archaeologists did not understand how a seemingly primitive civilization without clockwork or steam technology could build the massive stone structures of Amdapor. Animated bricks, such as the one that has chosen to follow you, may be the missing link.
#. column 2: Underneath this gear, I'm<br>built like a brick privy!<br>  - Chachabi
#. column 3: Rebut
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:44:0:0"
msgid "Summon your demon brick minion. We are all better off not knowing what arcane magicks animate this ordinary stone block."
msgstr "Призови кирпич демонов. Лучше не знать, какая тёмная магия оживила этот обычный каменный блок."

#. ja: 魔法仕掛けで動く奇妙なブロック。古代アムダプールの見習い妖術師たちが作った習作のようだ。こうした小さなブロックで修行を積むことで、やがて壁面を覆うほど巨大な「デモンズウォール」を作れるようになるらしい
#. de: Seit vielen Jahren rätseln Archäologen darüber, wie eine scheinbare primitive Zivilisation, die weder Uhrwerke noch Dampfmaschinen kennt, die gigantischen Steingebilde von Amdapor errichten konnte. Belebte Steine wie dieser könnten die Antwort sein.
#. fr: Un étrange bloc fon<shy>ction<shy>nant grâce à la magie. Apparemment, un sorcier d'Amdapor aurait fabriqué celui-ci pour s'entraîner. En empiler un certain nombre pourrait donner naissance à un mur démonique.
#. column 0: Summon your demon brick minion. We are all better off not knowing what arcane magicks animate this ordinary stone block.
#. column 2: Underneath this gear, I'm<br>built like a brick privy!<br>  - Chachabi
#. column 3: Rebut
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:44:0:1"
msgid "For many years, modern archaeologists did not understand how a seemingly primitive civilization without clockwork or steam technology could build the massive stone structures of Amdapor. Animated bricks, such as the one that has chosen to follow you, may be the missing link."
msgstr "Долгие годы учёные не могли понять, как древняя цивилизация Амдапора, не знавшая ни часовых механизмов, ни паровых машин, возводила огромные каменные сооружения. Возможно, ожившие кирпичи, вроде этого, — недостающее звено."

#. ja: カタコト、カタコト
#. de: Du hast bestimmt schon davon gehört, dass Monster Steine<br>verschlucken, um ihre Mahlzeiten besser zu verdauen? Nein?<br>Na dann weißt du es jetzt.<br><i>Gerolt</i>
#. fr: Krrr krrr...
#. column 0: Summon your demon brick minion. We are all better off not knowing what arcane magicks animate this ordinary stone block.
#. column 1: For many years, modern archaeologists did not understand how a seemingly primitive civilization without clockwork or steam technology could build the massive stone structures of Amdapor. Animated bricks, such as the one that has chosen to follow you, may be the missing link.
#. column 3: Rebut
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:44:0:2"
msgid "Underneath this gear, I'm<br>built like a brick privy!<br>  - Chachabi"
msgstr "Под этими доспехами я<br>крепок, как кирпичная стена!<br>  — Чачаби"

#. ja: プチリペル
#. de: Vorstoß
#. fr: Petit repoussement
#. column 0: Summon your demon brick minion. We are all better off not knowing what arcane magicks animate this ordinary stone block.
#. column 1: For many years, modern archaeologists did not understand how a seemingly primitive civilization without clockwork or steam technology could build the massive stone structures of Amdapor. Animated bricks, such as the one that has chosen to follow you, may be the missing link.
#. column 2: Underneath this gear, I'm<br>built like a brick privy!<br>  - Chachabi
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:44:0:3"
msgid "Rebut"
msgstr "Отпор"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵をノックバックさせる。
#. de: Schleudert die Gegner in der Nähe zurück.
#. fr: Projette en arrière les ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your demon brick minion. We are all better off not knowing what arcane magicks animate this ordinary stone block.
#. column 1: For many years, modern archaeologists did not understand how a seemingly primitive civilization without clockwork or steam technology could build the massive stone structures of Amdapor. Animated bricks, such as the one that has chosen to follow you, may be the missing link.
#. column 2: Underneath this gear, I'm<br>built like a brick privy!<br>  - Chachabi
#. column 3: Rebut
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:44:0:4"
msgid "Knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Отбрасывает всех врагов поблизости."

#. ja: ミニオン「ミニモール」を呼び出す。<br>モグラの幼獣。掘れないモグラは、ただのモグラだ
#. de: Du rufst deinen Mini-Mull als Begleiter herbei. Wenn er nicht gerade saftige Regenwürmer und Maden verspeist, träumt er davon, Berge zu errichten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte taupe trapue. Malgré ce qu'on pourrait croire, cette taupe miniature n'essaye pas de s'enfouir sous le sol.
#. column 1: Snatched from its hill while still young by infamous naturalist Marcette Manne, this poor creature has suffered countless experiments filled with endless pokings, proddings, potations, and panaceas. Compared to that, following an adventurer around all day is a veritable vacation.
#. column 2: Hear me, you mole<br>bastards? I am steel!<br>  - Eager Red Swallow
#. column 3: Mountain Maker
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:45:0:0"
msgid "Summon your mini mole minion. When not dining on a protein-rich diet of earthworms and grubs, he dreams of making mountains."
msgstr "Призови маленького крота. Когда он не ест дождевых червей и личинок, то мечтает создавать горы."

#. ja: 王立ナナモ菜園で捕獲したモールの幼獣。博物学者マルセットの学説を証明するための実験体となり、数々の恐ろしい目に遭わされた。今は冒険者を慕っているが、実の母親を屠ったのが誰なのか、まだ気付いていない……
#. de: In jungen Jahren aus seinem Hügel getrieben und entführt worden, musste diese arme Kreatur bereits zahllose Experimente von Marcette über sich ergehen lassen. Im Vergleich dazu ist einem Abenteurer hinterherzutrotten fast schon wie Urlaub.
#. fr: Une jeune taupe née dans le potager royal et qui a subi les terribles expériences de la zoologiste Marcette. Vous l'avez recueillie, mais sait-elle seulement qui a abattu sa vraie mère...<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your mini mole minion. When not dining on a protein-rich diet of earthworms and grubs, he dreams of making mountains.
#. column 2: Hear me, you mole<br>bastards? I am steel!<br>  - Eager Red Swallow
#. column 3: Mountain Maker
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:45:0:1"
msgid "Snatched from its hill while still young by infamous naturalist Marcette Manne, this poor creature has suffered countless experiments filled with endless pokings, proddings, potations, and panaceas. Compared to that, following an adventurer around all day is a veritable vacation."
msgstr "Этот бедняга был совсем юным, когда знаменитая натуралистка Марсетт Манн похитила его с холма. С тех пор над ним ставили бесчисленные эксперименты: тыкали, кололи, поили снадобьями и лечили панацеями. По сравнению с этим целый день ходить за приключенцем — сущий отпуск."

#. ja: ホリホリホリ…
#. de: Ihre Mägen sind deutlich größer als ihre Hirne ...<br><i>Gagari</i>
#. fr: Pomp-pomp-pomp<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your mini mole minion. When not dining on a protein-rich diet of earthworms and grubs, he dreams of making mountains.
#. column 1: Snatched from its hill while still young by infamous naturalist Marcette Manne, this poor creature has suffered countless experiments filled with endless pokings, proddings, potations, and panaceas. Compared to that, following an adventurer around all day is a veritable vacation.
#. column 3: Mountain Maker
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:45:0:2"
msgid "Hear me, you mole<br>bastards? I am steel!<br>  - Eager Red Swallow"
msgstr "Слышите, кроты<br>вы этакие? Я — кремень!<br>  — Красная ласточка, задира"

#. ja: もぐらの怒り
#. de: Lockerer Hügel
#. fr: Colère des taupes
#. column 0: Summon your mini mole minion. When not dining on a protein-rich diet of earthworms and grubs, he dreams of making mountains.
#. column 1: Snatched from its hill while still young by infamous naturalist Marcette Manne, this poor creature has suffered countless experiments filled with endless pokings, proddings, potations, and panaceas. Compared to that, following an adventurer around all day is a veritable vacation.
#. column 2: Hear me, you mole<br>bastards? I am steel!<br>  - Eager Red Swallow
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:45:0:3"
msgid "Mountain Maker"
msgstr "Горный мастер"

