#. ja: ミニオン「タイニーラム」を呼び出す。<br>ひんがしの国からきた羊。まじないの力はもうない
#. de: Du rufst dein Schäfchen als Begleiter herbei. Es wurde im Fernen Osten für den Kampf gezüchtet, hat jedoch seine übernatürliche Hypnosekraft verloren.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte belin bêlant. Ce tendre mouton originaire d'Orient est aussi soyeux qu'adorable.
#. column 1: As if predestined, your path crossed with that of the tender lamb's after she was brought to Eorzea from the dark reaches of the Far East by a hitsuji bugyo. Since then, you have been inseparable, the fluffy ball of fleece following your every footstep.
#. column 2: But everywhere the little<br>lambs went, lice were sure<br>to go.<br>  - Chartain
#. column 3: Heart of Wool
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:46:0:0"
msgid "Summon your tender lamb minion. Mint jelly optional."
msgstr "Призови нежного ягнёнка. Мятный соус по желанию."

#. ja: 慈愛の神を迎えた「降神祭」で出会った羊。命令に背いて死にかけていたところを救い、そのまま譲り受けた。まじないの力は失ったが、敬愛する冒険者という主を得て、日々、幸せをかみしめているようだ
#. de: Zur Himmelswende sollte die Hypnosekraft dieses fernöstlichen Kampfschäfchens erforscht werden. Dabei hat es seine Kraft eingebüßt, doch deine Freund<shy>schaft gewonnen.
#. fr: Vous avez adopté ce petit mouton rebelle, après l'avoir sauvé d'un péril mortel lors de la fête de la transition qui célèbre Menphina la Bien-aimante. Bien qu'il ait perdu son pouvoir protecteur, il semble heureux de vous suivre partout dans vos aventures.
#. column 0: Summon your tender lamb minion. Mint jelly optional.
#. column 2: But everywhere the little<br>lambs went, lice were sure<br>to go.<br>  - Chartain
#. column 3: Heart of Wool
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:46:0:1"
msgid "As if predestined, your path crossed with that of the tender lamb's after she was brought to Eorzea from the dark reaches of the Far East by a hitsuji bugyo. Since then, you have been inseparable, the fluffy ball of fleece following your every footstep. "
msgstr "Будто сама судьба свела вас с этим ягнёнком, когда его привезли в Эорзею из дальних краёв Востока вместе с хицудзи-бугё. С тех пор вы неразлучны, и пушистый комочек повсюду следует за тобой."

#. ja: メエエ～
#. de: Durch die Gnade der Göttin Menphina ward es gerettet.<br>Möge es an deiner Seite glücklich sein.<br><i>Gesandter aus dem Fernen Osten</i>
#. fr: Bêêêh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your tender lamb minion. Mint jelly optional.
#. column 1: As if predestined, your path crossed with that of the tender lamb's after she was brought to Eorzea from the dark reaches of the Far East by a hitsuji bugyo. Since then, you have been inseparable, the fluffy ball of fleece following your every footstep.
#. column 3: Heart of Wool
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:46:0:2"
msgid "But everywhere the little<br>lambs went, lice were sure<br>to go.<br>  - Chartain"
msgstr "А куда бы ни шли<br>ягнята,<br>за ними шли вши.<br>  — Шартен"

#. ja: 慈愛の心
#. de: Wehrwolle
#. fr: Belinfaisance
#. column 0: Summon your tender lamb minion. Mint jelly optional.
#. column 1: As if predestined, your path crossed with that of the tender lamb's after she was brought to Eorzea from the dark reaches of the Far East by a hitsuji bugyo. Since then, you have been inseparable, the fluffy ball of fleece following your every footstep.
#. column 2: But everywhere the little<br>lambs went, lice were sure<br>to go.<br>  - Chartain
