#. ja: ミニオン「ミニスライム」を呼び出す。<br>有り体に言うと、細切れにされたスライム
#. de: Du rufst deine Schleimpfütze als Begleiter herbei. Spaß für die ganze Familie.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-gluant. Les petits garçons à travers Éorzéa rêvent de jouer avec ce gluant, tandis que les petites filles le trouvent dégoûtant.
#. column 1: Once stepped upon, slime can be nigh on impossible to remove from the soles of boots, making the shapeless creatures a nuisance to those who mine the mountains in which slimes reside. The <i>Encyclopedia Eorzea</i> recommends a squeeze of sun lemon to loosen their stony grip.
#. column 2: Silence the slimes, lest<br>you succumb to the<br>flames.<br>  - Ancient Proverb
#. column 3: Cytoplasm
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:47:0:0"
msgid "Summon your slime puddle minion. Fun for the whole family."
msgstr "Призови лужицу слизи. Веселье для всей семьи."

#. ja: 有り体に言うと、細切れにされたスライム。採掘作業時に生じる汚水溜まりに自然発生的に生じる魔物で、鉱山社の採掘師たちからは忌み嫌われている。しかし、玄人はスライムに個性と愛嬌を見いだすものである
#. de: Wenn man einmal in Schleim hineintritt, bekommt man ihn nur noch schwer von seinem Schuhwerk entfernt. Die Enzyklopädie Eorzea empfiehlt, Schleimrückstände mit Sonnenzitronensaft zu behandeln.
#. fr: Un gluant coupé en fines tranches. Ce monstre apparaît spontanément dans les eaux sales lors des travaux de forage, c'est pourquoi les mineurs le détestent. Et pourtant, quelques-uns lui portent une certaine affection...
#. column 0: Summon your slime puddle minion. Fun for the whole family.
#. column 2: Silence the slimes, lest<br>you succumb to the<br>flames.<br>  - Ancient Proverb
#. column 3: Cytoplasm
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:47:0:1"
msgid "Once stepped upon, slime can be nigh on impossible to remove from the soles of boots, making the shapeless creatures a nuisance to those who mine the mountains in which slimes reside. The <i>Encyclopedia Eorzea</i> recommends a squeeze of sun lemon to loosen their stony grip."
msgstr "Наступишь на слизь — и отмыть подошвы потом почти невозможно. Эти бесформенные твари изрядно досаждают шахтёрам, работающим в горах, где они обитают. <i>Энциклопедия Эорзеи</i> советует капнуть солнечного лимона, чтобы ослабить их каменную хватку."

#. ja: ヌメヌメ…
#. de: Wer den Schleim nicht ehrt,<br>ist des Puddings nicht wert.<br><i>Altes Sprichwort</i>
#. fr: Zwuh zwuh...
#. column 0: Summon your slime puddle minion. Fun for the whole family.
#. column 1: Once stepped upon, slime can be nigh on impossible to remove from the soles of boots, making the shapeless creatures a nuisance to those who mine the mountains in which slimes reside. The <i>Encyclopedia Eorzea</i> recommends a squeeze of sun lemon to loosen their stony grip.
#. column 3: Cytoplasm
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:47:0:2"
msgid "Silence the slimes, lest<br>you succumb to the<br>flames.<br>  - Ancient Proverb"
msgstr "Не тронь слизней,<br>а то сам<br>сгоришь в огне.<br>  — Древняя пословица"

#. ja: ネバネバ細胞
#. de: Zerrinnen
#. fr: Tissu gluant
#. column 0: Summon your slime puddle minion. Fun for the whole family.
#. column 1: Once stepped upon, slime can be nigh on impossible to remove from the soles of boots, making the shapeless creatures a nuisance to those who mine the mountains in which slimes reside. The <i>Encyclopedia Eorzea</i> recommends a squeeze of sun lemon to loosen their stony grip.
#. column 2: Silence the slimes, lest<br>you succumb to the<br>flames.<br>  - Ancient Proverb
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:47:0:3"
msgid "Cytoplasm"
msgstr "Цитоплазма"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、タイプ「モンスター」を弱点に加える。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>15秒
#. de: Fügt Gegnern in der Nähe eine Schwäche gegen Monster zu.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 Sekunden
#. fr: Ajoute le type “Monstre” aux points faibles des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
