msgstr "Накладывает на всех врагов поблизости слабость к <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>монстрам</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「ミニマンドラゴラ」を呼び出す。<br>マンドラゴラの幼生体。悲鳴を上げさせるのは危険
#. de: Du rufst deine Kindragora als Begleiter herbei. Selbst im Weltraum hört man diese Pflanze schreien.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-mini-mandragore. Malgré sa taille réduite, cette mandragore peut pousser des cris très perçants.
#. column 1: One must take care when harvesting mandragoras, for if the roots are disturbed they will emit a high-pitched scream powerful enough to shatter glass over a malm away.
#. column 2: While little is known about<br>them, what is known<br>tends to be disturbing.<br>  - Eorzean Naturalist
#. column 3: Head Butt
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:48:0:0"
msgid "Summon your kidragora minion. Even in space, everyone can hear this seedkin scream."
msgstr "Призови кидрагору. Даже в космосе все услышат вопль этого семенного создания."

#. ja: マンドラゴラの幼生体。自然豊かな場所で草刈りをしていると、稀に芽吹いたばかりの幼生体が見つかることがある。無理に土から引き抜こうとすると、聞く者の精神を蝕む危険な悲鳴を上げるので、刈り取るときは慎重に
#. de: Die Mandragora-Ernte ist mit großer Vorsicht zu betreiben. Denn wenn ihre Wurzeln gereizt werden, stoßen die pflanzenartigen Lebewesen einen hoch-<br>frequenzigen Schrei aus, der über Malme hinweg Glasscheiben zum Bersten bringt.
#. fr: Une jeune pousse de mandragore. Il peut arriver qu'on en trouve en fauchant les hautes herbes. Si l'on tente de l'arracher du sol, elle pousse alors des cris perçants insoutenables.
#. column 0: Summon your kidragora minion. Even in space, everyone can hear this seedkin scream.
#. column 2: While little is known about<br>them, what is known<br>tends to be disturbing.<br>  - Eorzean Naturalist
#. column 3: Head Butt
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:48:0:1"
msgid "One must take care when harvesting mandragoras, for if the roots are disturbed they will emit a high-pitched scream powerful enough to shatter glass over a malm away."
msgstr "Собирая мандрагор, будь осторожен: потревоженные корни издают такой пронзительный крик, что он способен разбить стёкла за милю отсюда."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ich habe das Kämpfen anhand von winzigen Mandragoras gelernt,<br>also achte ich bei meinen Gegnern auf das Wippen ihrer Blättchen.<br><i>Ehrgeiziger Hermetiker</i>
#. fr: ◎▼×◎◎～!
#. column 0: Summon your kidragora minion. Even in space, everyone can hear this seedkin scream.
#. column 1: One must take care when harvesting mandragoras, for if the roots are disturbed they will emit a high-pitched scream powerful enough to shatter glass over a malm away.
#. column 3: Head Butt
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:48:0:2"
msgid "While little is known about<br>them, what is known<br>tends to be disturbing.<br>  - Eorzean Naturalist"
msgstr "О них мало что<br>известно,<br>и всё известное пугает.<br>  — Натуралист из Эорзеи"

#. ja: ヘッドバット
#. de: Kopfstoß
#. fr: Coup de tête
#. column 0: Summon your kidragora minion. Even in space, everyone can hear this seedkin scream.
#. column 1: One must take care when harvesting mandragoras, for if the roots are disturbed they will emit a high-pitched scream powerful enough to shatter glass over a malm away.
#. column 2: While little is known about<br>them, what is known<br>tends to be disturbing.<br>  - Eorzean Naturalist
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:48:0:3"
msgid "Head Butt"
msgstr "Удар головой"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your kidragora minion. Even in space, everyone can hear this seedkin scream.
#. column 1: One must take care when harvesting mandragoras, for if the roots are disturbed they will emit a high-pitched scream powerful enough to shatter glass over a malm away.
#. column 2: While little is known about<br>them, what is known<br>tends to be disturbing.<br>  - Eorzean Naturalist
#. column 3: Head Butt
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:48:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range. "
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам поблизости урон силой 90."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ゴブリン」を呼び出す。<br>ゴブリンを模した魔法人形。その素顔を見た者はいない
#. de: Du rufst dein Goblin-Stofftier als Begleiter herbei. Sogar der Rucksack dieser Marionette ist größer als deiner.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Gobelin articulé. Ce Gobelin miniature vous suivra partout. Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, il ne peut pas agrandir votre sac.
#. column 1: Designed to resemble goblin hero Brayflox Alltalks, you cannot help but wonder at the symbol carved into the sole of its left foot─the mark of the dreaded Illuminati.
#. column 2: Illuminati brainfruit<br>is frontmost!<br>  - Illuminati Member
#. column 3: Gobjammer
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:49:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up goblin minion. Even this automaton's gobbiebag is bigger than yours."
msgstr "Призови заводного гоблина. Даже его сумка больше твоей."

#. ja: ゴブリン界に現れた現代の英雄、ブレイフロクスを模した魔法人形。その数々の偉業を称えるため作られた……という触れ込みだが、何故か科学者集団「青の手」の刻印が刻まれている。出所については聞かぬが花だろう
#. de: Der Goblinheldin Brüllvolx nachempfunden. Etwas merkwürdig ist jedoch das Symbol, das unter ihrem linken Fuß eingraviert ist<nbsp>- das Zeichen der gefürchteten <i>Indigohand</i>.
#. fr: Une poupée façonnée sur le modèle de Brayflox, la nouvelle coqueluche du monde gobelin, sans doute en l'honneur de ses exploits. Pourtant, vous y apercevez le sceau de la Main indigo, les ennemis jurés de cette dernière...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up goblin minion. Even this automaton's gobbiebag is bigger than yours.
#. column 2: Illuminati brainfruit<br>is frontmost!<br>  - Illuminati Member
#. column 3: Gobjammer
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:49:0:1"
msgid "Designed to resemble goblin hero Brayflox Alltalks, you cannot help but wonder at the symbol carved into the sole of its left foot─the mark of the dreaded Illuminati."
msgstr "Эта кукла изображает героя гоблинов Брейфлокса Всеболтушку. Но невольно задумываешься: что за символ вырезан на подошве её левой ноги? Знак зловещих Иллюминатов."

#. ja: シュコォ…シュコォ…
#. de: Essensache hat gute Schmack! Blick schweifen über<br>Weiteland! Brüllvolx bekommen Freude in Herz.<br><i>Brüllvolx</i>
#. fr: Psshhh... Pshhh...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up goblin minion. Even this automaton's gobbiebag is bigger than yours.
#. column 1: Designed to resemble goblin hero Brayflox Alltalks, you cannot help but wonder at the symbol carved into the sole of its left foot─the mark of the dreaded Illuminati.
#. column 3: Gobjammer
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:49:0:2"
msgid "Illuminati brainfruit<br>is frontmost!<br>  - Illuminati Member"
msgstr "Иллюминаты! Мозговые плоды<br>на первом месте!<br>  — Член Иллюминатов"

#. ja: ゴブリジャマー
#. de: Wirre Denkschale
#. fr: Gobbrouillage
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up goblin minion. Even this automaton's gobbiebag is bigger than yours.
#. column 1: Designed to resemble goblin hero Brayflox Alltalks, you cannot help but wonder at the symbol carved into the sole of its left foot─the mark of the dreaded Illuminati.
#. column 2: Illuminati brainfruit<br>is frontmost!<br>  - Illuminati Member
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:49:0:3"
msgid "Gobjammer"
msgstr "Гоблинский глушитель"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵の特殊技ポイントを、最大値の50%減少させる。
#. de: Verringert die Technikpunkte von Gegnern in der Nähe um 50 %.
#. fr: Réduit les PdT des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet de 50% de leur valeur maximale.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up goblin minion. Even this automaton's gobbiebag is bigger than yours.
#. column 1: Designed to resemble goblin hero Brayflox Alltalks, you cannot help but wonder at the symbol carved into the sole of its left foot─the mark of the dreaded Illuminati.
#. column 2: Illuminati brainfruit<br>is frontmost!<br>  - Illuminati Member
#. column 3: Gobjammer
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:49:0:4"
msgid "Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value."
msgstr "Уменьшает запас очков особых способностей всех врагов поблизости на 50% от максимума."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・シルフ」を呼び出す。<br>シルフを模した魔法人形なのでふっち
#. de: Du rufst deine Sylphen-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Wenn sie sprechen könnte, würde sie dies in der dritten Person tun.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Sylphe nain. <br>Cet adorable Sylphe en modèle réduit <br>Enchantera vos journées avec ses poésies.
#. column 1: Unlike most species in which the female bears the offspring, only sylph males are capable of reproduction, and they do so via the single flower found upon their heads. After the flower is fertilized, it will eventually fall off, giving rise to a child known as a podling.
#. column 2: Helping sylphs with their<br>problems is a jolly fine<br>way to make friends.<br>  - Path Companion
#. column 3: Sylphic Incantation
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:50:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up sylph minion. If he could speak, it would be in the third person."
msgstr "Призови заводную сильфу. Если бы она умела говорить, то говорила бы о себе в третьем лице."

#. ja: シルフ族を模した魔法人形。上質のシルフシルクで作ったぬいぐるみに、シルフ族特有のおまぢないをかけて仕上げたもの。非常に愛らしいその姿は、生まれて間もない「御子ちゃま」をモチーフにしているらしい
#. de: Bei den Sylphen gebären nur besondere Exemplare Nachkommen. Sie tragen eine Blume auf ihrem Kopf, die, wenn einmal befruchtet, nach einer Reifungsperiode abfällt und einen Abkömmling, Sprößling genannt, hervorbringt.
#. fr: Ce délicat pantin créé sur le modèle des créatures sylvestres a été con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>né avec le plus grand soin, en utilisant de la soie sylphe et un enchantement sylphe. Son apparence est basée sur celle de l'Inspiré venant de naître.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up sylph minion. If he could speak, it would be in the third person.
#. column 2: Helping sylphs with their<br>problems is a jolly fine<br>way to make friends.<br>  - Path Companion
#. column 3: Sylphic Incantation
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:50:0:1"
msgid "Unlike most species in which the female bears the offspring, only sylph males are capable of reproduction, and they do so via the single flower found upon their heads. After the flower is fertilized, it will eventually fall off, giving rise to a child known as a podling."
msgstr "В отличие от большинства народов, у сильфов потомство могут производить только самцы. Для этого им служит единственный цветок на голове. После оплодотворения цветок со временем отпадает, и появляется ребёнок, которого называют почкородком."

#. ja: フワフワ…
#. de: Die Meinige ist sehr traurig, weil die Finstrigen die<br>Kürbisse der Unsrigen gestohlen haben ...<br><i>Tonaxia</i>
#. fr: Flap flap<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up sylph minion. If he could speak, it would be in the third person.
#. column 1: Unlike most species in which the female bears the offspring, only sylph males are capable of reproduction, and they do so via the single flower found upon their heads. After the flower is fertilized, it will eventually fall off, giving rise to a child known as a podling.
#. column 3: Sylphic Incantation
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:50:0:2"
msgid "Helping sylphs with their<br>problems is a jolly fine<br>way to make friends.<br>  - Path Companion"
msgstr "Поможешь сильфам<br>с их бедами —<br>и станешь другом.<br>  — Путевой спутник"

#. ja: おまぢない
#. de: Zauberei
#. fr: Charme sylphe
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up sylph minion. If he could speak, it would be in the third person.
#. column 1: Unlike most species in which the female bears the offspring, only sylph males are capable of reproduction, and they do so via the single flower found upon their heads. After the flower is fertilized, it will eventually fall off, giving rise to a child known as a podling.
#. column 2: Helping sylphs with their<br>problems is a jolly fine<br>way to make friends.<br>  - Path Companion
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:50:0:3"
msgid "Sylphic Incantation"
msgstr "Сильфийское заклинание"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵のATKを、50%低下させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>15秒
#. de: Verringert die ATT von Gegnern in der Nähe um 50 %.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 Sekunden
