#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・カーソル」を呼び出す。<br>すべての運命を支配する古代神を模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst dein Zeigerhändchen als Begleiter herbei. Den Elfenbeinhandschuhen von Oschon nachempfunden. Folgt diese Hand dir, oder weist sie dir den Weg?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte curseur flottant. Attention, il faudra résister à la tentation de pointer ce doigt sur chaque personne que vous voudrez questionner.
#. column 1: If we are to believe the slurred ravings of a self-proclaimed goblin theologian deep in his cups, this seemingly inconspicuous white glove is actually the “Hand of Fate” by which all of us are controlled from a dimension beyond the aether.
#. column 2: I trust ye had enough<br>fingers to help ye through<br>the tallyin'.<br>  - Yulgi Honalgi
#. column 3: The Finger
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:51:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up cursor minion. Modeled after the ivory glove of Oschon, the Wanderer, does this clockwork hand follow you...or guide you?"
msgstr "Призови заводной указатель. Копия перчатки Ошона, Странника. Эта механическая рука следует за тобой... или указывает путь?"

#. ja: 古代神を模した魔法人形。あるゴブリン族の神学者が泥酔した末に語ったところによれば、この世界は14番目の世界であり、原初の世界では「指さす白き手袋」の姿をした神が、すべての運命を支配していたという
#. de: Wenn man dem wirren Geschwafel eines gewissen selbst<shy>er<shy>nann<shy>ten Goblin-Theologen Glauben schenkt, ist dieser unscheinbare weiße Handschuh die „Hand des Schicksals“, die unser aller Geschick von einer anderen Dimension jenseits des Äthers aus steuert.
#. fr: Un doigt inspiré d'une ancienne divinité. D'après les élucubrations d'un théologue gobelin ivre, nous serions ac<shy>tu<shy>el<shy>le<shy>ment dans le “14e monde”, et cet index au gant blanc serait en fait “celui qui contrôlait tout dans le 1er monde”.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up cursor minion. Modeled after the ivory glove of Oschon, the Wanderer, does this clockwork hand follow you...or guide you?
#. column 2: I trust ye had enough<br>fingers to help ye through<br>the tallyin'.<br>  - Yulgi Honalgi
#. column 3: The Finger
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:51:0:1"
msgid "If we are to believe the slurred ravings of a self-proclaimed goblin theologian deep in his cups, this seemingly inconspicuous white glove is actually the “Hand of Fate” by which all of us are controlled from a dimension beyond the aether."
msgstr "Если верить пьяным бредням одного гоблина, объявившего себя теологом, эта невзрачная белая перчатка и есть «Рука судьбы», управляющая всеми нами из измерения за пределами эфира."

#. ja: ピッ、ピッ、ピッ！
#. de: Sprich mit der Hand.<br><i>Genervter Barde</i>
#. fr: Bip bip<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up cursor minion. Modeled after the ivory glove of Oschon, the Wanderer, does this clockwork hand follow you...or guide you?
#. column 1: If we are to believe the slurred ravings of a self-proclaimed goblin theologian deep in his cups, this seemingly inconspicuous white glove is actually the “Hand of Fate” by which all of us are controlled from a dimension beyond the aether.
#. column 3: The Finger
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:51:0:2"
msgid "I trust ye had enough<br>fingers to help ye through<br>the tallyin'.<br>  - Yulgi Honalgi"
msgstr "Надеюсь, пальцев<br>хватило, чтобы<br>всё подсчитать.<br>  — Юлги Хоналги"

#. ja: 悪魔の選択
#. de: Böse Wahl
#. fr: Sélection démonique
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up cursor minion. Modeled after the ivory glove of Oschon, the Wanderer, does this clockwork hand follow you...or guide you?
