#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・インビンシブル」を呼び出す。<br>伝説の飛空艇インビンシブル号を模したからくり模型
#. de: Du rufst dein Aufzieh-Luftschiff als Begleiter herbei. Ein voll funktionstüchtiges Modell eines legendären Luftschiffes.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte aéronef mécanique. C'est une réplique au 1/1000e du légendaire aéronef de Tatanora, l'Invincible.
#. column 1: Despite it being the first, and most ambitious undertaking by Highwind Skyways founder Tatanora, the <i>Invincible</i> actually never took flight─its ten-year construction period plagued by accidents, material shortages, sabotage, and outright incompetence.
#. column 2: Up in the sky, look! It's a<br>bird─ No, it's an airship─<br>No! It's the inspector!<br>  - Nashu Mhakaracca
#. column 3: Cargo
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:52:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up airship minion. A fully operational model of the legendary vessel, the <i>Invincible</i>."
msgstr "Призови заводной дирижабль. Полностью действующая модель легендарного судна «<i>Непобедимый</i>»."

#. ja: 飛空艇のからくり模型。モデルはハイウィンド飛空社の創業者、タタノラ氏が大型船を流用して建造した飛空艇「インビンシブル号」である。なお、実物は空を飛ぶことができず、大金を無駄にしたことで伝説となった
#. de: Ein Modell der <i>Invincible</i>, das ehrgeizige Großprojekt Tatanoras, Gründer der Oberwind-Fluggesellschaft. Das angeblich revolutionäre Luftschiff erhob sich indes nie in die Lüfte<nbsp>- seine zehnjährige Bauphase war geplagt von Unfällen und Unfähigkeit.
#. fr: Cette maquette serait inspirée du célèbre Invincible de Tatanora, le fondateur des Vols Hautvent. Cet aéronef conçu sur le modèle d'un immense bateau aurait été un échec cuisant pour ce constructeur, étant incapable de quitter le sol.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up airship minion. A fully operational model of the legendary vessel, the <i>Invincible</i>.
#. column 2: Up in the sky, look! It's a<br>bird─ No, it's an airship─<br>No! It's the inspector!<br>  - Nashu Mhakaracca
#. column 3: Cargo
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:52:0:1"
msgid "Despite it being the first, and most ambitious undertaking by Highwind Skyways founder Tatanora, the <i>Invincible</i> actually never took flight─its ten-year construction period plagued by accidents, material shortages, sabotage, and outright incompetence."
msgstr "«<i>Непобедимый</i>» стал первым и самым амбициозным проектом Татаноры, основателя «Хайвинд Скайвейз». Но дирижабль так и не поднялся в небо: десять лет строительства сопровождались авариями, нехваткой материалов, саботажем и откровенной некомпетентностью."

#. ja: ブロロロロ…
#. de: Schon mal ein Luftschiff gesehen? Wahre<br>Wunderwerke und höchst komplex.<br><i>Brithael</i>
#. fr: Tk-tk-tk-tk...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up airship minion. A fully operational model of the legendary vessel, the <i>Invincible</i>.
#. column 1: Despite it being the first, and most ambitious undertaking by Highwind Skyways founder Tatanora, the <i>Invincible</i> actually never took flight─its ten-year construction period plagued by accidents, material shortages, sabotage, and outright incompetence.
#. column 3: Cargo
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:52:0:2"
msgid "Up in the sky, look! It's a<br>bird─ No, it's an airship─<br>No! It's the inspector!<br>  - Nashu Mhakaracca"
msgstr "Смотрите, в небе! Птица? Нет, дирижабль!<br>Нет! Инспектор!<br>  — Нашу Мхакаракка"

#. ja: 航空支援
#. de: Luftbrücke
#. fr: Appui aérien
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up airship minion. A fully operational model of the legendary vessel, the <i>Invincible</i>.
