msgid "Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s"
msgstr "Повышает атаку союзников поблизости на 20 (на 40, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>механизм</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・キキルン」を呼び出す。<br>キキルンを模した魔法人形っちゃ
#. de: Du rufst dein Qiqirn-Stofftier als Begleiter herbei. Genauso liebenswert wie das Original, aber ohne den bissigen Gestank.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Qiqirn mécanique. Aussi mignon qu'un vrai, l'odeur en moins<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Once upon a time, there was not a man, woman, or child in all of Limsa Lominsa who did not know the name Zazaroon, mummer extraordinaire. However, a taste for spiced rum, a failed marriage, and several run-ins with the Barracudas saw the Qiqirn fall from the limelight into oblivion.
#. column 2: The Qiqirn are a nuisance<br>at the best of times.<br>  - Roseline
#. column 3: Sparkly Shine
#. column 4: Grants action party the ability to deal extra damage to Arcana Stones.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:53:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Qiqirn minion. As adorable as the real thing, without the ratty odor."
msgstr "Призови заводного кикирна. Такой же милый, как настоящий, только не воняет крысой."

#. ja: リムサ・ロミンサで活躍したキキルン族大道芸人、ザザルンを模した魔法人形。一世を風靡したザザルンだったが、金銭トラブルを抱えて借金まみれに。その後、自らの人形の販売権を裁縫師ギルドに売却したという
#. de: Es gab einmal eine Zeit, da kannte jeder Bürger Limsa Lominsas den Namen Zazaroon, Schausteller der Extraklasse. Aber nach ständigen Trinkexzessen, einer gescheiterten Ehe und zwielichten Geschäften mit den Barrakudas verschwand der Qiqirn aus dem Rampenlicht.
#. fr: Zazaroon, un célèbre artiste de rue qiqirn, aurait inspiré ce pantin. Criblé de dettes, le saltimbanque symbole de son époque dut autoriser la guilde des couturiers à commercialiser cette poupée à son image.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Qiqirn minion. As adorable as the real thing, without the ratty odor.
#. column 2: The Qiqirn are a nuisance<br>at the best of times.<br>  - Roseline
#. column 3: Sparkly Shine
#. column 4: Grants action party the ability to deal extra damage to Arcana Stones.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:53:0:1"
msgid "Once upon a time, there was not a man, woman, or child in all of Limsa Lominsa who did not know the name Zazaroon, mummer extraordinaire. However, a taste for spiced rum, a failed marriage, and several run-ins with the Barracudas saw the Qiqirn fall from the limelight into oblivion."
msgstr "Когда-то в Лимсе Ломинсе не было ни мужчины, ни женщины, ни ребёнка, кто не знал бы имя Зазаруна, великого актёра. Но любовь к пряному рому, неудачный брак и несколько стычек с «Барракудами» погубили его славу. Кикирн канул в безвестность."

#. ja: チャリチャリクレクレ
#. de: Qiqirn-Diebe, die dem Glanz des Erzes nicht widerstehen<br>konnten, haben einige Truhen der Amajina Bergbau AG<br>mitgehen lassen.<br><i>Ausschnitt aus einer Meldung in „Der Rabe“</i>
#. fr: Clic clic, clic clic<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Qiqirn minion. As adorable as the real thing, without the ratty odor.
#. column 1: Once upon a time, there was not a man, woman, or child in all of Limsa Lominsa who did not know the name Zazaroon, mummer extraordinaire. However, a taste for spiced rum, a failed marriage, and several run-ins with the Barracudas saw the Qiqirn fall from the limelight into oblivion.
#. column 3: Sparkly Shine
#. column 4: Grants action party the ability to deal extra damage to Arcana Stones.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:53:0:2"
msgid "The Qiqirn are a nuisance<br>at the best of times.<br>  - Roseline"
msgstr "Кикирны — та ещё<br>заноза.<br>  — Розелин"

#. ja: きらきらブレイク
#. de: Glitzerstein
#. fr: Briser ding ding
