#. ja: ミニオン「黒チョコチョコボ」を呼び出す。<br>チョコチョコ歩くチョコボの子。マンボのリズムが好き
#. de: Du rufst dein schwarzes Chocobo-Küken als Begleiter herbei. Gerüchte, dass es fliegen kann, sind völlig aus der Luft gegriffen ... oder vielleicht doch nicht?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé chocobo noir. Cet adorable poussin vous suivra partout en trottinant sur un rythme de mambo.
#. column 1: This poor chocobo chick was as yellow as an ear of millioncorn before one day being doused in black ink by a random passerby bedecked in silver accessories. Try as the chocobokeeps might, none were able to remove the taint, and thus the realm's first black chocobo was born.
#. column 2: There is no finer feel<br>than that of a chocobo<br>between your legs.<br>  - L'dhakya
#. column 3: Choco Trap
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:54:0:0"
msgid "Summon your black chocobo chick minion. Rumors about her being able to fly are completely unfounded...or <i>are</i> they?"
msgstr "Призови чёрного птенца чокобо. Слухи о том, что он умеет летать, совершенно беспочвенны... Или <i>нет</i>?"

#. ja: チョコチョコ歩くチョコボの子。タマゴから孵ったときは黄色かったが、ある日やって来た銀のアクセサリーで着飾った男によって黒く塗られてしまった。それ以来、「黒チョコボ」として生きている。マンボのリズムが大好き
#. de: Dieses Küken war einst so gelb wie hochreifer Millionenmais, aber eines Tage tunkte ein mysteriöser, mit allerlei Silberschmuck behangener Wanderer das arme Ding in schwarze Tinte. Keinem gelang es, die Tinte zu entfernen, und so war der erste schwarze Chocobo geboren.
#. fr: Ce poussin jaune amateur de mambo a été un beau jour peint en noir par un barde errant aux nombreux bijoux. L'homme souhaitait l'offrir en cadeau à ses compagnons les plus fidèles.
#. column 0: Summon your black chocobo chick minion. Rumors about her being able to fly are completely unfounded...or <i>are</i> they?
#. column 2: There is no finer feel<br>than that of a chocobo<br>between your legs.<br>  - L'dhakya
#. column 3: Choco Trap
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:54:0:1"
msgid "This poor chocobo chick was as yellow as an ear of millioncorn before one day being doused in black ink by a random passerby bedecked in silver accessories. Try as the chocobokeeps might, none were able to remove the taint, and thus the realm's first black chocobo was born."
msgstr "Когда-то этот бедняга был жёлтым, как початок милликукурузы, но однажды случайный прохожий, увешанный серебряными украшениями, облил его чёрными чернилами. Чокобо-пастухи так и не смогли вывести пятна — так появился первый в мире чёрный чокобо."

#. ja: ン～クエッ！
#. de: Es gibt doch nichts Schöneres, als im Sattel<br>eines Chocobos zu wippen.<br><i>L'dhakya</i>
#. fr: Gn-kweeeh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your black chocobo chick minion. Rumors about her being able to fly are completely unfounded...or <i>are</i> they?
#. column 1: This poor chocobo chick was as yellow as an ear of millioncorn before one day being doused in black ink by a random passerby bedecked in silver accessories. Try as the chocobokeeps might, none were able to remove the taint, and thus the realm's first black chocobo was born.
#. column 3: Choco Trap
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:54:0:2"
msgid "There is no finer feel<br>than that of a chocobo<br>between your legs.<br>  - L'dhakya"
msgstr "Нет ничего приятней,<br>чем скакать на чокобо.<br>  — Л'дакия"

#. ja: チョコトラップ
#. de: Chocofalle
#. fr: Chocopiège
#. column 0: Summon your black chocobo chick minion. Rumors about her being able to fly are completely unfounded...or <i>are</i> they?
