#. ja: ミニオン「カインドフレア」を呼び出す。<br>親切にしたら懐いてしまった幼き妖異。名状しがたい恐怖を感じる
#. de: Du rufst - eine unerklärliche Angst unterdrückend - deinen freundlichen kleinen Gedankenschinder-Begleiter herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte gentil flagelleur. Ce jeune flagelleur s'est attaché aux êtres humains à force de bons traitements, même s'il inspire toujours la terreur.
#. column 1: Similar to voidsent dullahans, mindflayers also lack a corporeal form and must possess a host to be able to exert force on our realm. Whereas the dullahan, however, are limited to the possession of inorganic objects such as steel, mindflayers tend to prefer the dead as their vessels.
#. column 2: It has a grisly penchant<br>for sucking out the brains<br>of men.<br>  - Frandelont Raimdelle
#. column 3: Kind Blast
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 40%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:56:0:0"
msgid "Summon your minute mindflayer minion. Delights folk with its cuteness even as it fills them with an inexplicable sense of dread."
msgstr "Призови крошечного мыслекрада. Он радует всех своей милотой и одновременно внушает необъяснимый ужас."

#. ja: リテイナーが拾ってきた謎の存在。親切にしたら懐いてしまったらしい。妖異学者によると、亡者の骸を依代として物質界に降り立ち、人の精神を啜る妖異「マインドフレア」の幼体のようだ。名状しがたい恐怖を感じる
#. de: Wie andere Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>te hat auch der Gedanken-<br>schinder keine physische Manifestation und ist auf Wirtskörper angewiesen, um in unserer Dimension agieren zu können. Der Gedankenschinder bevorzugt dafür die Körper Verstorbener.
#. fr: Cette créature trouvée par un servant a pu être apprivoisée avec le temps. D'après un spécialiste en entités, c'est un bébé flagelleur. Ces créatures utilisent les cadavres pour se matérialiser dans notre monde et manipuler les esprits.
#. column 0: Summon your minute mindflayer minion. Delights folk with its cuteness even as it fills them with an inexplicable sense of dread.
#. column 2: It has a grisly penchant<br>for sucking out the brains<br>of men.<br>  - Frandelont Raimdelle
#. column 3: Kind Blast
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 40%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:56:0:1"
msgid "Similar to voidsent dullahans, mindflayers also lack a corporeal form and must possess a host to be able to exert force on our realm. Whereas the dullahan, however, are limited to the possession of inorganic objects such as steel, mindflayers tend to prefer the dead as their vessels. "
msgstr "Как и пустотные дуллаханы, мыслекрады лишены тела и могут воздействовать на наш мир, лишь вселившись в носителя. Дуллаханы занимают неодушевлённые предметы, например сталь, а мыслекрады предпочитают мёртвых."

#. ja: ズルルルル…
#. de: Diese Undinger haben die lästige Angewohnheit,<br>meinen Männern ihre Gehirne rauszusaugen.<br><i>Frandelont Raimdelle</i>
#. fr: Jbwo jbwoh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your minute mindflayer minion. Delights folk with its cuteness even as it fills them with an inexplicable sense of dread.
#. column 1: Similar to voidsent dullahans, mindflayers also lack a corporeal form and must possess a host to be able to exert force on our realm. Whereas the dullahan, however, are limited to the possession of inorganic objects such as steel, mindflayers tend to prefer the dead as their vessels.
#. column 3: Kind Blast
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 40%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:56:0:2"
msgid "It has a grisly penchant<br>for sucking out the brains<br>of men.<br>  - Frandelont Raimdelle"
msgstr "У него жуткая привычка<br>высасывать мозги<br>у людей.<br>  — Франдлон Раймдель"

#. ja: カインドブラスト
#. de: Geistschubs
#. fr: Opposition mentale
#. column 0: Summon your minute mindflayer minion. Delights folk with its cuteness even as it fills them with an inexplicable sense of dread.
#. column 1: Similar to voidsent dullahans, mindflayers also lack a corporeal form and must possess a host to be able to exert force on our realm. Whereas the dullahan, however, are limited to the possession of inorganic objects such as steel, mindflayers tend to prefer the dead as their vessels.
