#. ja: ミニオン「アントーキング・コリブリ」を呼び出す。<br>海賊に飼育されていたコリブリ。イヤラシイ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen schnatterfaulen Kolibri herbei. Für den größtmöglichen Effekt bitte beim Tragen einer Augenklappe rufen!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte perroquet taciturne. Ce perroquet a été élevé par le capitaine Madison, mais heureusement, il a appris à fermer son propre bec.
#. column 1: After witnessing the horrors experienced by his former master, Captain Madison, this once-outspoken oppo has gone silent, opening its beak only when offered a handful of sardines.
#. column 2: Parley! Parley!<br>Parley! Squaaawk!<br>  - Loose-beaked Parrot
#. column 3: Parley
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:57:0:0"
msgid "Summon your tight-beaked parrot minion. For best results, summon while wearing an eyepatch."
msgstr "Призови молчаливого попугая. Лучше всего призывать его, надев повязку на глаз."

#. ja: マディソン船長が飼っていたコリブリ。腹部に重傷を負いながらも、水神「リヴァイアサン」の祝福により化け物として復活を果たした主と共に、浸食洞へと舞い戻った。船長を称える必要がなくなったため、言葉数が減った
#. de: Nachdem er Zeuge der Gräuel wurde, die seinem einstigen Herren Kapitän Madison wiederfuhren, ist diesem Kolibri die Lust am Schnattern vergangen. Er öffnet seinen Schnabel nur noch, wenn man ihm Sardinen hinhält.
#. fr: Cet ancien perroquet et son maître seraient morts si Léviathan ne les avait pas épargnés. Grâce à lui, ils réapparurent à Sastasha sous forme de monstres. L'animal est cependant moins bavard sans capitaine à flagorner.
#. column 0: Summon your tight-beaked parrot minion. For best results, summon while wearing an eyepatch.
#. column 2: Parley! Parley!<br>Parley! Squaaawk!<br>  - Loose-beaked Parrot
#. column 3: Parley
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:57:0:1"
msgid "After witnessing the horrors experienced by his former master, Captain Madison, this once-outspoken oppo has gone silent, opening its beak only when offered a handful of sardines."
msgstr "Увидев, что пережил его прежний хозяин, капитан Мэдисон, этот прежде болтливый оппо замолчал. Теперь он открывает клюв, только если ему предложить горсть сардин."

#. ja: イヤラシイ！
#. de: Land unter, Land unter!<br>Kraaar!<br><i>Schnatterfreudiger Kolibri</i>
#. fr: Capitaine<nbsp>! Mon capitaine<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your tight-beaked parrot minion. For best results, summon while wearing an eyepatch.
#. column 1: After witnessing the horrors experienced by his former master, Captain Madison, this once-outspoken oppo has gone silent, opening its beak only when offered a handful of sardines.
#. column 3: Parley
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:57:0:2"
msgid "Parley! Parley!<br>Parley! Squaaawk!<br>  - Loose-beaked Parrot"
msgstr "Перемирие! Перемирие!<br>Перемирие! Карр!<br>  — Болтливый попугай"

#. ja: 急用
#. de: Erledigung
#. fr: Besoin urgent
#. column 0: Summon your tight-beaked parrot minion. For best results, summon while wearing an eyepatch.
#. column 1: After witnessing the horrors experienced by his former master, Captain Madison, this once-outspoken oppo has gone silent, opening its beak only when offered a handful of sardines.
#. column 2: Parley! Parley!<br>Parley! Squaaawk!<br>  - Loose-beaked Parrot
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:57:0:3"
msgid "Parley"
msgstr "Перемирие"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンを自軍の中央ゲート内へワープさせる。
#. de: Versetzt die ausführenden Trabanten zurück zu Tor B.
#. fr: Téléporte les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT vers le portail central.
#. column 0: Summon your tight-beaked parrot minion. For best results, summon while wearing an eyepatch.
#. column 1: After witnessing the horrors experienced by his former master, Captain Madison, this once-outspoken oppo has gone silent, opening its beak only when offered a handful of sardines.
#. column 2: Parley! Parley!<br>Parley! Squaaawk!<br>  - Loose-beaked Parrot
#. column 3: Parley
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:57:0:4"
msgid "Transports action party to the central summoning Gate. "
msgstr "Перемещает миньонов, применивших особую способность, к центральным воротам своей армии."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・アマルジャ」を呼び出す。<br>アマルジャを模した魔法人形。驚天動地！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Amalj'aa als Begleiter herbei. Putzig, nicht wahr?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Amalj'aa mécanique. Inspirée d'un homme-lézard, cette mascotte est. L'honneur des guerriers amalj'aa, elle perpétue.
#. column 1: Amalj'aa blacksmith Narujj Boh of the Brotherhood of Ash began dabbling in clockwork after rescuing the mammet minion of an adventurer slain near his forges. This particular sample is the product of moons of meticulous calculations made to reproduce the telltale Amalj'aa tail sway.
#. column 2: My people are the<br>Amalj'aa, proud and<br>strong.<br>  - Loonh Gah
#. column 3: Harder and Stronger
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:58:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Amalj'aa minion. What is burnt may never burn, but rises again, harder and stronger."
msgstr "Призови заводного амалджаа. Сгоревшее уже не сгорит, но восстанет вновь — крепче и сильнее."

#. ja: アマルジャ族を模した魔法人形。灰の一党の鍛冶師ナルジ・ボーが、冒険者が連れ歩くマメットを参考にして作ったもの。戯れに作ったものとはいえ、至強を目指す灰の一党らしく、屈強なる戦士として仕上げられている
#. de: Narujj Boh kam das erste Mal mit Uhrwerktechnik in Berührung, als er die Marionette eines Abenteurers aufnahm, der in der Nähe seiner Schmiedewerkstatt erschlagen wurde. Sein Aufzieh-Amalj'aa ist eine originalgetreu animinierte, technische Meisterleistung.
#. fr: Narujj Boh, forgeron de la Ligue des cendres, a créé ce pantin en observant ceux qui vous suivent. Même s'il a été conçu comme un simple jouet, il respecte l'esprit des guerriers de ses frères amalj'aa.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Amalj'aa minion. What is burnt may never burn, but rises again, harder and stronger.
#. column 2: My people are the<br>Amalj'aa, proud and<br>strong.<br>  - Loonh Gah
#. column 3: Harder and Stronger
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:58:0:1"
msgid "Amalj'aa blacksmith Narujj Boh of the Brotherhood of Ash began dabbling in clockwork after rescuing the mammet minion of an adventurer slain near his forges. This particular sample is the product of moons of meticulous calculations made to reproduce the telltale Amalj'aa tail sway."
msgstr "Кузнец Нарудж Бо из Братства Пепла заинтересовался часовыми механизмами после того, как спас миньона-куклу приключенца, убитого возле его кузницы. Этот экземпляр создавали месяцами, тщательно рассчитывая каждое движение хвоста, характерное для амалджаа."

#. ja: 驚天動地！
#. de: Wir Amalj'aa sind dazu bestimmt, die weiten Ebenen der<br>Paglth'an zu durchwandern und uns im ewigen Kampf gegen<br>würdige Gegner in den Augen unseres Gottes zu bewähren.<br><i>Hamujj Gah</i>
#. fr: Pour notre honneur<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Amalj'aa minion. What is burnt may never burn, but rises again, harder and stronger.
#. column 1: Amalj'aa blacksmith Narujj Boh of the Brotherhood of Ash began dabbling in clockwork after rescuing the mammet minion of an adventurer slain near his forges. This particular sample is the product of moons of meticulous calculations made to reproduce the telltale Amalj'aa tail sway.
#. column 3: Harder and Stronger
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:58:0:2"
msgid "My people are the<br>Amalj'aa, proud and<br>strong.<br>  - Loonh Gah"
msgstr "Наш народ —<br>амалджаа, гордый<br>и сильный.<br>  — Лун Га"

#. ja: 驚天動地
#. de: Stählung
#. fr: Honneur amalj'aa
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Amalj'aa minion. What is burnt may never burn, but rises again, harder and stronger.
#. column 1: Amalj'aa blacksmith Narujj Boh of the Brotherhood of Ash began dabbling in clockwork after rescuing the mammet minion of an adventurer slain near his forges. This particular sample is the product of moons of meticulous calculations made to reproduce the telltale Amalj'aa tail sway.
#. column 2: My people are the<br>Amalj'aa, proud and<br>strong.<br>  - Loonh Gah
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:58:0:3"
msgid "Harder and Stronger"
msgstr "Крепче и сильнее"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のDEFを10上昇させる。味方のタイプが「ドール」の場合は、DEFが30上昇する。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Erhöht die ABW von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, im Fall von Puppen um 30.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 10 la défense des alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou de 30 s'ils sont de type “Poupée”.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Amalj'aa minion. What is burnt may never burn, but rises again, harder and stronger.
#. column 1: Amalj'aa blacksmith Narujj Boh of the Brotherhood of Ash began dabbling in clockwork after rescuing the mammet minion of an adventurer slain near his forges. This particular sample is the product of moons of meticulous calculations made to reproduce the telltale Amalj'aa tail sway.
#. column 2: My people are the<br>Amalj'aa, proud and<br>strong.<br>  - Loonh Gah
#. column 3: Harder and Stronger
