msgid "Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s"
msgstr "Повышает защиту союзников поблизости на 10 (на 30, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>кукла</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・イクサル」を呼び出す。<br>イクサルを模したッァ、魔法人形なんだよッォ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Ixal-Stoffpuppe herbei. Halt sie, knuddel sie, hab sie lieb.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Ixal mécanique. Celui-ci est une reproduction fidèle des féroces hommes-bêtes du Natalan et suivra celui-là ou celle-là partout.
#. column 1: Using a mammet obtained from the Goldsmiths' Guild by the ever-resourceful Tataramu, members of the Ehcatl Nine have succeeded in creating an automaton of their own...who also happens to be as grounded as their brethren.
#. column 2: I heard a Wood Wailer<br>telling Mummy that an<br>Ixal teared his face off.<br>  - Gridanian Child
#. column 3: All for Nine
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:59:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Ixal minion. He believes he can fly. He believes he can touch the sky. Unfortunately he cannot."
msgstr "Призови заводного иксаля. Он верит, что может летать. Верит, что достанет до небес. Жаль, что это не так."

#. ja: エカトル空力団の団員たちが、ヒトの技術を学ぶために試作した魔法人形。タタラムが仕入れた彫金師ギルド製マメットを参考に、最高にワルでワイルドに仕上げたようだ。エオルゼアに「マメワル」が誕生した瞬間である
#. de: Mithilfe einer Marionette, die Tataramu bei der Gold<shy>schmiede<shy>gilde besorgt hat, konnten die Wolkengleiter von Ehcatl ihren eigenen Uhrwerk-Automaten bauen. Leider kann auch er nicht fliegen ...
#. fr: Cet automate a été créé par les Planeurs d'Ehcatl pour étudier les technologies humaines. Inspiré d'un pantin de la guilde des orfèvres fourni par Tataramu, celui-ci semble à la fois vicieux et agité. Inhabituel pour un pantin...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ixal minion. He believes he can fly. He believes he can touch the sky. Unfortunately he cannot.
#. column 2: I heard a Wood Wailer<br>telling Mummy that an<br>Ixal teared his face off.<br>  - Gridanian Child
#. column 3: All for Nine
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:59:0:1"
msgid "Using a mammet obtained from the Goldsmiths' Guild by the ever-resourceful Tataramu, members of the Ehcatl Nine have succeeded in creating an automaton of their own...who also happens to be as grounded as their brethren."
msgstr "Использовав куклу, которую находчивый Татараму раздобыл в гильдии ювелиров, члены Экатльской девятки сумели создать собственного механического помощника... Который, как и его сородичи, летать не умеет."

#. ja: 喧嘩上等ッォ！
#. de: Es waren also Ixal, ja? Verdammtes Federvieh! Mal wieder<br>haben sie niemanden am Leben gelassen.<br><i>Belmont</i>
#. fr: Celui-ci est prêt<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ixal minion. He believes he can fly. He believes he can touch the sky. Unfortunately he cannot.
#. column 1: Using a mammet obtained from the Goldsmiths' Guild by the ever-resourceful Tataramu, members of the Ehcatl Nine have succeeded in creating an automaton of their own...who also happens to be as grounded as their brethren.
#. column 3: All for Nine
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:59:0:2"
msgid "I heard a Wood Wailer<br>telling Mummy that an<br>Ixal teared his face off.<br>  - Gridanian Child"
msgstr "Слышала, как Страж Леса<br>сказал маме, что иксаль<br>содрал ему лицо.<br>  — Гриданийский ребёнок"

#. ja: 喧嘩上等
#. de: Große Klappe
#. fr: Dur à cuire
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ixal minion. He believes he can fly. He believes he can touch the sky. Unfortunately he cannot.
#. column 1: Using a mammet obtained from the Goldsmiths' Guild by the ever-resourceful Tataramu, members of the Ehcatl Nine have succeeded in creating an automaton of their own...who also happens to be as grounded as their brethren.
#. column 2: I heard a Wood Wailer<br>telling Mummy that an<br>Ixal teared his face off.<br>  - Gridanian Child
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:59:0:3"
msgid "All for Nine"
msgstr "Девятка заодно"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンのDEFを40上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
#. de: Erhöht die ABW der ausführenden Trabanten um 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 40 la défense des mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ixal minion. He believes he can fly. He believes he can touch the sky. Unfortunately he cannot.
#. column 1: Using a mammet obtained from the Goldsmiths' Guild by the ever-resourceful Tataramu, members of the Ehcatl Nine have succeeded in creating an automaton of their own...who also happens to be as grounded as their brethren.
#. column 2: I heard a Wood Wailer<br>telling Mummy that an<br>Ixal teared his face off.<br>  - Gridanian Child
#. column 3: All for Nine
