msgid "Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
msgstr "Повышает защиту миньонов, применивших особую способность, на 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・コボルド」を呼び出す。<br>コボルドを模しーた　魔法にんぎょーう
#. de: Du rufst deine Kobold-Stoffpuppe herbei. Pass auf, dass sie sich nicht gleich in die nächste Höhle verkriecht!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée kobolde. Une mascotte inspirée des habitants du monde souterrain, oui<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Another of 789th Order Acolyte Ba Go's masterpieces, this cuddly kobold miniature in fact houses several onzes of highly flammable firesand, designed to ignite when outward pressure is applied...such as with a tender hug.
#. column 2: Honestly, I will never<br>understand the kobolds'<br>sense of aesthetics.<br>  - R'ashaht
#. column 3: Adulation
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 40%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:60:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up kobold minion. With you, she will koboldly go where no kobold has gone before."
msgstr "Призови заводного кобольда. С тобой она отправится туда, где ещё не бывал ни один кобольд."

#. ja: コボルド族を模した魔法人形。実はアコライト789 バ・ゴが、愛らしさで敵の油断を誘うために開発した人形型爆弾である。第789洞穴団の商人が勝手に商材に加えたため、腹の中には危険な爆弾を抱えたままらしい
#. de: Ein weiteres Meisterstück aus der Werkstatt des Akolythen Ba Go vom 789. Orden, der als Füllmaterial für diesen niedlichen Kobold nichts anderes als Sprengstoff zur Hand hatte. Daher sollte man diese Puppe nicht zu fest an sich drücken.
#. fr: Ba Go du 789e ordre aurait conçu cette adorable poupée piégée pour endormir la méfiance de ses ennemis. Un marchand l'aurait ensuite mise en vente sans au<shy>to<shy>ri<shy>sa<shy>tion, et sans prendre la peine de la désamorcer...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up kobold minion. With you, she will koboldly go where no kobold has gone before.
#. column 2: Honestly, I will never<br>understand the kobolds'<br>sense of aesthetics.<br>  - R'ashaht
#. column 3: Adulation
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 40%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:60:0:1"
msgid "Another of 789th Order Acolyte Ba Go's masterpieces, this cuddly kobold miniature in fact houses several onzes of highly flammable firesand, designed to ignite when outward pressure is applied...such as with a tender hug."
msgstr "Очередной шедевр послушника 789-го ордена Ба Го. В этой милой кукле-кобольде спрятано несколько унций легковоспламеняющегося взрывного песка. Он взорвётся, если надавить снаружи... например, крепко обнять."

#. ja: シュゥゥゥゥゥ…
#. de: Nein, nein, nicht Kobold quälen! Gaaanz unschuldig Kobold ist!<br><i>Schuldiger Kobold</i>
#. fr: Shhh...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up kobold minion. With you, she will koboldly go where no kobold has gone before.
#. column 1: Another of 789th Order Acolyte Ba Go's masterpieces, this cuddly kobold miniature in fact houses several onzes of highly flammable firesand, designed to ignite when outward pressure is applied...such as with a tender hug.
#. column 3: Adulation
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 40%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:60:0:2"
msgid "Honestly, I will never<br>understand the kobolds'<br>sense of aesthetics.<br>  - R'ashaht"
msgstr "Честно, мне никогда<br>не понять, что кобольды<br>находят красивым.<br>  — Р'ашаашт"

#. ja: 媚びをうる
#. de: Erweichung
#. fr: Flagornerie
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up kobold minion. With you, she will koboldly go where no kobold has gone before.
#. column 1: Another of 789th Order Acolyte Ba Go's masterpieces, this cuddly kobold miniature in fact houses several onzes of highly flammable firesand, designed to ignite when outward pressure is applied...such as with a tender hug.
