#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・サハギン」を呼び出す。<br>サハギンを模した魔法人形。水泳は苦手
#. de: Du rufst deinen kleinen Sahagin-Begleiter herbei. Schwimmen kann er nicht so gut.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte pantin sahuagin. Une mascotte inspirée des hommes-poissons. Attention, il ne sait pas nager.
#. column 1: Ever the loving clutchfather, Novv had this toy crafted, complete with sharpened trident, for his infant spawnlings. When wound up, it displays various thrusts and parries to prepare the spawn for battle with their enemies.
#. column 2: A Sssahagin does not flail<br>and sssplash about so─<br>he rolls with the waves.<br>  - Clutchfather Novv
#. column 3: Pshhh
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:61:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Sahagin minion. He's got a trident and he's not afraid to use it."
msgstr "Призови заводного миньона-сахагина. У него трезубец, и он не побоится пустить его в ход."

#. ja: サハギン族を模した魔法人形。幼い末弟たちのために、ノォヴ一味の長兄たちが作ったものらしい。魚を狩る際に用いる三つ叉の銛を手に持つなど、精巧にサハギン族戦士を表現してある。ただし、水泳は苦手
#. de: Laichvater Novv ließ dieses Spielzeug für seine Jungen anfertigen, komplett mit spitzzahnigem Dreizack. Zieht man den Sahagin-Begleiter auf, führt er Hieb- und Stoßbewegungen aus, die die Jungen auf ihr Leben als Krieger vorbereiten sollen.
#. fr: Un pantin inspiré des hommes-bêtes aquatiques. Les enfants aînés de la fratrie de Novv l'auraient créé pour leurs benjamins. Le souci du détail est poussé jusqu'au trident qu'il tient en main. Hélas, cet alevin ne sait pas nager.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Sahagin minion. He's got a trident and he's not afraid to use it.
#. column 2: A Sssahagin does not flail<br>and sssplash about so─<br>he rolls with the waves.<br>  - Clutchfather Novv
#. column 3: Pshhh
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:61:0:1"
msgid "Ever the loving clutchfather, Novv had this toy crafted, complete with sharpened trident, for his infant spawnlings. When wound up, it displays various thrusts and parries to prepare the spawn for battle with their enemies."
msgstr "Заботливый отец выводка Новв заказал эту игрушку для своих крошечных детёнышей. Даже трезубец у неё заточен как настоящий. Если завести игрушку, она покажет несколько выпадов и блоков, чтобы подготовить малышей к битвам с врагами."

#. ja: フスィーッ
#. de: Sssobald ein junger Sahagin dann als vollwertiger Krieger<br>Anerkennung gefunden hat, erhält er von unserer einzigartigen<br>Königin, der Indigo-Mutter, das grosssartigste Geschenk: Eier!<br><i>Novv</i>
#. fr: Fsssh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Sahagin minion. He's got a trident and he's not afraid to use it.
#. column 1: Ever the loving clutchfather, Novv had this toy crafted, complete with sharpened trident, for his infant spawnlings. When wound up, it displays various thrusts and parries to prepare the spawn for battle with their enemies.
#. column 3: Pshhh
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:61:0:2"
msgid "A Sssahagin does not flail<br>and sssplash about so─<br>he rolls with the waves.<br>  - Clutchfather Novv"
msgstr "Настоящий сахагин не бьёт хвостом<br>по воде и не плещется —<br>он плывёт на волнах.<br>  — Отец выводка Новв"

#. ja: フスィー
#. de: Sssssh
#. fr: Disssparition
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Sahagin minion. He's got a trident and he's not afraid to use it.
#. column 1: Ever the loving clutchfather, Novv had this toy crafted, complete with sharpened trident, for his infant spawnlings. When wound up, it displays various thrusts and parries to prepare the spawn for battle with their enemies.
#. column 2: A Sssahagin does not flail<br>and sssplash about so─<br>he rolls with the waves.<br>  - Clutchfather Novv
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:61:0:3"
msgid "Pshhh"
msgstr "Фссшш"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵にかかっている、強化効果をすべて打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle positiven Effekte von den gegnerischen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe tous les effets bénéfiques des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Sahagin minion. He's got a trident and he's not afraid to use it.
#. column 1: Ever the loving clutchfather, Novv had this toy crafted, complete with sharpened trident, for his infant spawnlings. When wound up, it displays various thrusts and parries to prepare the spawn for battle with their enemies.
#. column 2: A Sssahagin does not flail<br>and sssplash about so─<br>he rolls with the waves.<br>  - Clutchfather Novv
#. column 3: Pshhh
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:61:0:4"
msgid "Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все положительные эффекты со всех врагов в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「ゴレムス」を呼び出す。<br>ゴーレムが　おきあがり　なかまに　なりたそうに　こちらをみている！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Golem als Begleiter herbei. Nicht so groß wie das Original, aber so süß, dass er jeden Stein zum Erweichen bringt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Siman mécanique. Bizarre<nbsp>! Le Siman se lève et regarde l'équipe comme s'il voulait en faire partie<nbsp>!
#. column 1: One unexpected side effect of the Calamity has been the significant increase in aetherial rifts appearing throughout the realm. As a result, strange creatures not of this world have been popping in and out of existence without warning─one of those being the bizarre brickman.
#. column 2: Can ye smell it?<br>'Tis the scent o' profit,<br>my friend!<br>  - Beefy Businessman
#. column 3: Charge Up
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:62:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up brickman minion. The brickman gets up and looks over as if it wants to join the party!"
msgstr "Призови заводного кирпичника. Он поднимается и смотрит на тебя, будто хочет вступить в отряд!"

#. ja: エオルゼアに突如として現れた未知なるゴーレムを調査していたときに発見し、仲間になりたそうにこちらを見ていたので拾っておいたもの。なお手に入れたときから、何故か「ゴレムス」という愛称がついていた
#. de: Ein überraschender Nebeneffekt der Katastrophe sind die vielen Ätherrisse, die sich überall in Eorzea auftaten, und aus denen die seltsamsten Geschöpfe entfernter Dimensionen hervortreten. Dieser bizarre Steinmann ist nur eins davon.
#. fr: Une créature de roche découverte lors d'une enquête sur de curieux golems apparus sou<shy>dai<shy>ne<shy>ment. Vous l'avez recueilli parce qu'il vous regardait comme s'il voulait faire partie de votre équipe, et vous l'avez surnommé “Siman”.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up brickman minion. The brickman gets up and looks over as if it wants to join the party!
#. column 2: Can ye smell it?<br>'Tis the scent o' profit,<br>my friend!<br>  - Beefy Businessman
#. column 3: Charge Up
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:62:0:1"
msgid "One unexpected side effect of the Calamity has been the significant increase in aetherial rifts appearing throughout the realm. As a result, strange creatures not of this world have been popping in and out of existence without warning─one of those being the bizarre brickman."
msgstr "Одно из неожиданных последствий Бедствия — повсюду в Эорзее стали появляться эфирные разломы. Из-за этого странные существа из других миров то и дело возникают и исчезают без всякого предупреждения. Одно из них — этот причудливый человечек из кирпичей."

#. ja: かいしんのいちげき！
#. de: Der große Bestand an Golems im südlichen Thanalan ist<br>auf die Magier der Belah'dia zurückzuführen, die die<br>robusten Wächter zum Schutz des Tempels von Qarn einsetzten.<br><i>Historie Thanalans, Kapitel II. „Das alte Belah'dia“</i>
#. fr: Siman frapper méchants<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up brickman minion. The brickman gets up and looks over as if it wants to join the party!
#. column 1: One unexpected side effect of the Calamity has been the significant increase in aetherial rifts appearing throughout the realm. As a result, strange creatures not of this world have been popping in and out of existence without warning─one of those being the bizarre brickman.
#. column 3: Charge Up
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:62:0:2"
msgid "Can ye smell it?<br>'Tis the scent o' profit,<br>my friend!<br>  - Beefy Businessman"
msgstr "Чуешь запах?<br>Это же прибылью пахнет,<br>друг мой!<br>  — Деловой толстяк"

#. ja: 気合いため
#. de: Kraftfokus
#. fr: Tension
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up brickman minion. The brickman gets up and looks over as if it wants to join the party!
#. column 1: One unexpected side effect of the Calamity has been the significant increase in aetherial rifts appearing throughout the realm. As a result, strange creatures not of this world have been popping in and out of existence without warning─one of those being the bizarre brickman.
#. column 2: Can ye smell it?<br>'Tis the scent o' profit,<br>my friend!<br>  - Beefy Businessman
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:62:0:3"
msgid "Charge Up"
msgstr "Заряд"

