#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・エドヴィア」を呼び出す。<br>エドヴィア姫を模したからくり仕掛けの魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-Edvya als Begleiter herbei. Behandle sie mit Respekt, sonst bekommst du Ärger mit dem Sultan.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-princesse Edvya. Une mascotte inspirée de la princesse fugueuse.
#. column 1: Forty years after the founding of the Thorne Dynasty, Sultan Baldric Thorne was blessed by the gods with a single daughter, Edvya, whom he loved fiercely. The history surrounding the two, now known as the “Legend of the Lost Lady” gave rise to the festival of Little Ladies' Day.
#. column 2: Did Princess Edvya<br>concern herself with glory<br>and riches? I think not!<br>  - Gossiping Girl
#. column 3: Curious Crafting Craze
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:64:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Edvya minion. Sometimes moonlights as a miller girl, much to her father the sultan's chagrin."
msgstr "Призови заводную Эдвию. Порой она подрабатывает дочерью мельника — к великому огорчению султана, своего отца."

#. ja: ソーン朝ウルダハのお転婆姫「エドヴィア」を模した魔法人形。「プリンセスデー」に際して開催された「姫人形コンテスト」に出品するために作られた。モデルとなった人物と同様、外の世界を見て回りたいようだ
#. de: Vierzig Jahre nach der Gründung der Thorne-Dynastie wurde Sultan Baldric Thorne mit einer einzigen Tochter gesegnet, Edvya, die er abgöttisch liebte. Ihre Geschichte liefert heutzutage die Grundlage für das Prinzessinnenfest.
#. fr: Une mascotte à l'effigie d'Edvya, jeune princesse de la civilisation Thorne au fort caractère. Cette poupée a été réalisée pour le concours de la fête des demoiselles. Comme Edvya, elle rêve de voir le vaste monde.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Edvya minion. Sometimes moonlights as a miller girl, much to her father the sultan's chagrin.
#. column 2: Did Princess Edvya<br>concern herself with glory<br>and riches? I think not!<br>  - Gossiping Girl
#. column 3: Curious Crafting Craze
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:64:0:1"
msgid "Forty years after the founding of the Thorne Dynasty, Sultan Baldric Thorne was blessed by the gods with a single daughter, Edvya, whom he loved fiercely. The history surrounding the two, now known as the “Legend of the Lost Lady” gave rise to the festival of Little Ladies' Day."
msgstr "Через сорок лет после основания династии Торнов султану Балдрику Торну боги даровали единственную дочь — Эдвию, которую он безмерно любил. История их двоих, ныне известная как «Легенда о пропавшей леди», положила начало Празднику маленьких леди."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Und sieh doch nur, der Aufzieh-Edvya scheint es auch<br>sehr gut an deiner Seite gefallen zu haben!<br><i>Serendipity</i>
#. fr: ~♪♪
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Edvya minion. Sometimes moonlights as a miller girl, much to her father the sultan's chagrin.
#. column 1: Forty years after the founding of the Thorne Dynasty, Sultan Baldric Thorne was blessed by the gods with a single daughter, Edvya, whom he loved fiercely. The history surrounding the two, now known as the “Legend of the Lost Lady” gave rise to the festival of Little Ladies' Day.
#. column 3: Curious Crafting Craze
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:64:0:2"
msgid "Did Princess Edvya<br>concern herself with glory<br>and riches? I think not!<br>  - Gossiping Girl"
msgstr "Неужто принцессу Эдвию<br>волновали слава<br>да богатство? Как бы не так!<br>  — Сплетница"

