#. ja: ミニオン「クロックワークサン」を呼び出す。<br>「つつく」で上下に位置を変える、明るいスポットライト
#. de: Du rufst deine kompakte, aber leistungsstarke Studioleuchte mit integriertem Reflexschirm an deinen Standort, wo sie sich für perfekt ausgeleuchtete Screenshots bereithält. Höhenverstellbar durch einfaches Anstupsen!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte soleil mécanique. Une mascotte brillante en forme d'astre solaire. L'emote “toucher” permet de changer sa hauteur.
#. column 1: Designed to provide light for road repairmen toiling during the small hours of the night, wind-up suns have become all the talk amongst Ul'dahn mesdames ever since it was discovered the extra light worked wonders at hiding unsightly blemishes and wrinkles.
#. column 2: We find the pages of our<br>memories are blank, as if<br>bleached by the sun.<br>  - Kan-E-Senna
#. column 3: Sunbathe
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:65:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up sun minion. May the sun never go down on you.  /poke to adjust elevation."
msgstr "Призови миньона-солнышко. Пусть солнце никогда не заходит над тобой. /poke меняет высоту."

#. ja: 「つつく」で上下に位置を変える、明るいスポットライト。ウルダハ社交界のとあるご婦人が、強烈な光によって小皺を隠すために、常に滞空する自立型投光器を所望。この発注に応え、彫金師ギルドが製造したもの
#. de: Studiosonnen wurden ursprünglich entworfen, um Straßenarbeiter auch nach Einbruch der Dunkelheit weiter schuften zu lassen. Jetzt erfreuen sie sich auch in der Damenwelt hoher Beliebtheit, da das zusätzliche Licht unschöne Falten verschwinden lässt.
#. fr: Ce luminaire monte ou descend avec l'emote “toucher”. La guilde d'orfèvrerie l'a mis au point sur commande d'une grande dame d'Ul'dah désireuse d'être toujours bien éclairée pour cacher l'emprise du temps sur sa peau.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up sun minion. May the sun never go down on you.  /poke to adjust elevation.
#. column 2: We find the pages of our<br>memories are blank, as if<br>bleached by the sun.<br>  - Kan-E-Senna
#. column 3: Sunbathe
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:65:0:1"
msgid "Designed to provide light for road repairmen toiling during the small hours of the night, wind-up suns have become all the talk amongst Ul'dahn mesdames ever since it was discovered the extra light worked wonders at hiding unsightly blemishes and wrinkles."
msgstr "Заводные солнца придумали для дорожных рабочих, трудившихся глубокой ночью. Но стоило дамам из высшего общества Ульды узнать, как дополнительный свет скрывает изъяны кожи и морщины, они тут же стали главной темой всех разговоров."

#. ja: ピカ～ッ！
#. de: Sonne dich im Glanz deines Sieges ...<br>solange du noch kannst.<br><i>Blanstyr</i>
#. fr: Dzzzz dzzzz...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up sun minion. May the sun never go down on you.  /poke to adjust elevation.
#. column 1: Designed to provide light for road repairmen toiling during the small hours of the night, wind-up suns have become all the talk amongst Ul'dahn mesdames ever since it was discovered the extra light worked wonders at hiding unsightly blemishes and wrinkles.
