msgid "Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все эффекты со всех врагов и союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・オブ・ライト」を呼び出す。<br>古の光の戦士を模した魔法人形。すべてのものに　かがやきを……
#. de: Du rufst deinen Begleiter des Lichts herbei. Eine wahrlich blendende Erscheinung.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte héros de la Lumière. Un héros de jadis dont le destin prophétique est de sauver le monde des ténèbres.
#. column 1: Ancient records show that almost every Astral Era has had its own Warriors of Light─brave souls who appeared before forthcoming disasters to unite the people of that time...only to disappear once again as catastrophe rained down from the heavens.
#. column 2: Next you'll be telling me<br>you're one of the Warriors<br>of Light.<br>  - Mother Miounne
#. column 3: None
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:67:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Minion of Light and make true the prophecy: “When Darkness veils the world, three Minions of Light shall come.”"
msgstr "Призови миньона Света — и исполни пророчество: «Когда тьма окутает мир, придут три миньона Света»."

#. ja: 古の「光の戦士たち」を模した魔法人形。伝承によれば、かつて様々な力を持つ若者が突如として現れ、暗黒に染まった世界を救った後に、元の世界へと還っていったという。すべてのものに　かがやきを……
#. de: Aus antiken Auf<shy>zeich<shy>nun<shy>gen geht hervor, dass fast jedes Zeitalter seine eigenen Krieger des Lichts hatte. Mutige Helden, die vor drohenden Katastrophen erschienen, um die Völker zu vereinen ... nur um kurz darauf wieder in der Versenkung zu verschwinden.
#. fr: Un pantin inspiré des fameux Guerriers de la Lumière mythiques. D'après la légende, ils firent leur apparition pour sauver le monde enseveli dans les ténèbres avant de s'éclipser. Que la lumière guide vos pas...
#. column 0: Summon your Minion of Light and make true the prophecy: “When Darkness veils the world, three Minions of Light shall come.”
#. column 2: Next you'll be telling me<br>you're one of the Warriors<br>of Light.<br>  - Mother Miounne
#. column 3: None
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:67:0:1"
msgid "Ancient records show that almost every Astral Era has had its own Warriors of Light─brave souls who appeared before forthcoming disasters to unite the people of that time...only to disappear once again as catastrophe rained down from the heavens."
msgstr "Согласно древним летописям, почти в каждую астральную эпоху появлялись свои воины Света — отважные герои, которые объединяли людей перед грядущей бедой... а затем вновь исчезали, когда с небес обрушивалась катастрофа."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Die „Krieger des Lichts“, die euch bei<br>Carteneau gerettet haben, sind tot.<br><i>Gaius van Baelsar</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon your Minion of Light and make true the prophecy: “When Darkness veils the world, three Minions of Light shall come.”
#. column 1: Ancient records show that almost every Astral Era has had its own Warriors of Light─brave souls who appeared before forthcoming disasters to unite the people of that time...only to disappear once again as catastrophe rained down from the heavens.
#. column 3: None
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
