#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・リーダー」を呼び出す。<br>グランドカンパニーの首領を模したからくり仕掛けの魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Anführer als Begleiter herbei. Er folgt dir überall hin, für Geld und Vaterland, für Stille, Besinnung und Frieden, oder bis die See ihn im Tod umfängt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte dirigeant miniature. Un automate sur le modèle du dirigeant d'une grande compagnie.
#. column 1: Originally crafted to promote the Grand Companies of Eorzea, these clockwork dolls are often rewarded to company members for exceptional service. There are three models of wind-up leaders, one to represent each of the three heads of Limsa Lominsa, Gridania, and Ul'dah.
#. column 2: The leaders of Eorzea had<br>lost their way─I merely<br>helped them find it again.<br>  - Minfilia
#. column 3: None
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:71:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up leader minion, who will follow you unquestioningly─for coin and country; for serenity, purity, sanctity─till sea swallows all."
msgstr "Призови заводного лидера. Он будет безропотно следовать за тобой — за золото и родину, за покой, чистоту и святость, пока море не поглотит всё."

#. ja: 各都市のグランドカンパニーが、宣伝用に作った首領を模した魔法人形。黒渦団のメルウィブ提督、不滅隊のラウバーン局長、双蛇党のカヌ・エ・センナの3タイプが存在している。組織への貢献著しい者にも配布された
#. de: Ursprünglich hergestellt, um für die Staatlichen Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaften von Eorzea zu werben, werden diese Uhrwerk-Puppen nun für herausragende Dienste an der Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaft verliehen. Es gibt drei Modelle, jeweils eines für Limsa Lominsa, Gridania und Ul'dah.
#. fr: Une poupée à l'effigie d'un des 3 dirigeants des grandes compagnies, créée à des fins pro<shy>mo<shy>tion<shy>nelles. Cette création est distribuée aux unités s'étant par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement distinguées pour leur armée.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up leader minion, who will follow you unquestioningly─for coin and country; for serenity, purity, sanctity─till sea swallows all.
#. column 2: The leaders of Eorzea had<br>lost their way─I merely<br>helped them find it again.<br>  - Minfilia
#. column 3: None
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:71:0:1"
msgid "Originally crafted to promote the Grand Companies of Eorzea, these clockwork dolls are often rewarded to company members for exceptional service. There are three models of wind-up leaders, one to represent each of the three heads of Limsa Lominsa, Gridania, and Ul'dah."
msgstr "Эти заводные куклы создали для рекламы Великих компаний Эорзеи. Их часто дарят отличившимся членам компаний. Существуют три заводных лидера — по одному на каждого из глав Лимсы Ломинсы, Гридании и Ульды."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Schnell, zur Weihrauchkammer! Noch ist das Feuer der<br>Morgenröte nicht erloschen. Wir müssen die Anführer überzeugen!<br><i>Minfilia</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up leader minion, who will follow you unquestioningly─for coin and country; for serenity, purity, sanctity─till sea swallows all.
#. column 1: Originally crafted to promote the Grand Companies of Eorzea, these clockwork dolls are often rewarded to company members for exceptional service. There are three models of wind-up leaders, one to represent each of the three heads of Limsa Lominsa, Gridania, and Ul'dah.
#. column 3: None
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:71:0:2"
msgid "The leaders of Eorzea had<br>lost their way─I merely<br>helped them find it again.<br>  - Minfilia"
msgstr "Главы Эорзеи сбились<br>с пути. Я лишь помогла<br>им найти его снова.<br>  — Минфилия"

