#. ja: ミニオン「チョコチョコボ・プリンス」を呼び出す。<br>チョコチョコ歩くチョコボの王子
#. de: Du rufst deinen Chocobo-Prinzen als Begleiter herbei. Er trabt gemächlich hinter dir her.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte prince bébé chocobo. Un prince chocobo qui trottine à bonne allure.
#. column 1: A thoroughbred descended from the legendary Veillantif, this noble bird of Ishgard seeks a rider who will not sully his family's name.
#. column 2: I had a feeling you'd be<br>riding up on your golden<br>chocobo.<br>  - Path Companion
#. column 3: Choco Coronation
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:75:0:0"
msgid "Summon the princely hatchling minion, the chocobo who would be king."
msgstr "Призови принца-чокобо — птенца, которому суждено стать королём."

#. ja: チョコチョコ歩くチョコボの王子。決して玉子と呼ぶなかれ。イシュガルドの伝説的な名チョコボ「ブリリアドロ」の血を引く、由緒正しきチョコボらしい。自分の乗り手に相応しい、評判のいい冒険者を探しているようだ
#. de: Ein reinrassiges Tier, das von dem legendären Veillantif abstammt. Dieser edle Vogel aus Ishgard benötigt einen Reiter, der den Namen seiner Familie nicht beschmutzen wird.
#. fr: Un prince chocobo qui trottine à bonne allure. Ce chocobo serait un descendant direct de Brigliadoro, le célèbre chocobo ishgardais. Cette haute lignée lui vaut de chercher un cavalier d'exception, digne d'être porté par lui.
#. column 0: Summon the princely hatchling minion, the chocobo who would be king.
#. column 2: I had a feeling you'd be<br>riding up on your golden<br>chocobo.<br>  - Path Companion
#. column 3: Choco Coronation
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:75:0:1"
msgid "A thoroughbred descended from the legendary Veillantif, this noble bird of Ishgard seeks a rider who will not sully his family's name."
msgstr "Этот благородный ишгардский чокобо — чистокровный потомок легендарного Вейянтифа. Он ищет наездника, который не запятнает доброе имя его семьи."

#. ja: クエッ、クエッ～！
#. de: Sie sind nicht nur fleißige Reittiere und Lastenträger,<br>sondern kämpfen auch treu an deiner Seite. Bestimmt hast<br>du schon von dem berühmten Fortemps-Kampfstil gehört?<br><i>Luquelot</i>
#. fr: Kwé, kwéééé<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon the princely hatchling minion, the chocobo who would be king.
#. column 1: A thoroughbred descended from the legendary Veillantif, this noble bird of Ishgard seeks a rider who will not sully his family's name.
#. column 3: Choco Coronation
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:75:0:2"
msgid "I had a feeling you'd be<br>riding up on your golden<br>chocobo.<br>  - Path Companion"
msgstr "Я так и знал,<br>что ты прискачешь<br>на своём золотом чокобо.<br>  — Спутник в пути"

#. ja: チョコクラウン
#. de: Chocokrönung
