#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・バハムート」を呼び出す。<br>落として割れたマメット・ダラガブから出てきた謎の存在
#. de: Du rufst eine Miniaturversion des furchtbaren Primae herbei. Sie entstieg dem mechanischen Dalamud, als dieser am Boden zerschellte (die Schäden waren nicht katastrophal).
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé Bahamut. Un dragon miniature sorti tout droit d'un Dalamud mécanique fracturé.
#. column 1: Despite strict orders from the Goldsmiths' Guild to <i>never</i> open up the Dalamud minion under any circumstances, someone decided to unleash their inner Pandora and release the terrors hidden within─a wind-up Bahamut...which no one from the guild recalls creating!
#. column 2: Bahamut can't live on <br>good wishes and a smile,<br>so why should I?<br>  - Flame Private
#. column 3: Fizzle Flare
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:78:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Bahamut minion. This mysterious being emerged from within a broken wind-up Dalamud, and is nigh inseparable from its former prison."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — заводного Багамута. Это загадочное существо появилось из расколотого заводного Даламуда и, похоже, неразлучно со своей прежней темницей."

#. ja: 落として割れたマメット・ダラガブから出てきた謎の存在。製造元の彫金師ギルドでは、この様なものを中に入れた記録は残されていないと主張している。一体これは何者なのか。謎が謎を呼んでいる
#. de: Trotz der strikten Anweisung der Gilde der Gold- schmiede, den Mini-Dalamud unter keinen Umständen zu öffnen, konnte ein Narr nicht widerstehen und brach den Mini-Meteor auf<nbsp>- und entfesselte damit den Aufzieh-Bahamut!
#. fr: Une curieuse créature sortie d'un Dalamud mécanique fracturé. La guilde des orfèvres, qui a fabriqué le Dalamud mécanique, affirme n'avoir rien à voir avec la présence de ce qui ressemble à un dragon.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Bahamut minion. This mysterious being emerged from within a broken wind-up Dalamud, and is nigh inseparable from its former prison.
#. column 2: Bahamut can't live on <br>good wishes and a smile,<br>so why should I?<br>  - Flame Private
#. column 3: Fizzle Flare
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:78:0:1"
msgid "Despite strict orders from the Goldsmiths' Guild to <i>never</i> open up the Dalamud minion under any circumstances, someone decided to unleash their inner Pandora and release the terrors hidden within─a wind-up Bahamut...which no one from the guild recalls creating!"
msgstr "Гильдия ювелиров строго-настрого запретила вскрывать заводного Даламуда. Но кто-то всё же выпустил на волю Пандору внутри него — и явил миру ужасы, что там таились: заводного Багамута... которого, как утверждают в гильдии, никто не создавал!"

#. ja: グオォォォン！
#. de: Der Primae Bahamut ... Dass ich ihn<br>noch einmal sehen darf ...<br><i>???</i>
#. fr: Grooooh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Bahamut minion. This mysterious being emerged from within a broken wind-up Dalamud, and is nigh inseparable from its former prison.
#. column 1: Despite strict orders from the Goldsmiths' Guild to <i>never</i> open up the Dalamud minion under any circumstances, someone decided to unleash their inner Pandora and release the terrors hidden within─a wind-up Bahamut...which no one from the guild recalls creating!
#. column 3: Fizzle Flare
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:78:0:2"
msgid "Bahamut can't live on <br>good wishes and a smile,<br>so why should I?<br>  - Flame Private"
msgstr "Багамут не может жить<br>одними добрыми пожеланиями<br>и улыбками. А мне-то почему<br>можно?<br>   — рядовой Бессмертных"

#. ja: プチフレア
#. de: Flämmchen
#. fr: Petit brasier
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Bahamut minion. This mysterious being emerged from within a broken wind-up Dalamud, and is nigh inseparable from its former prison.
