#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・モーグリ」を呼び出す。<br>モーグリを模した魔法人形クポ！　踊りが大好きクポ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen putzigen Mogry herbei, kupo.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée mog. Une mascotte inspirée de la charmante créature amicale. Il adore la danse, kupo<nbsp>!
#. column 1: A creation born of 90% love and 10% jealousy (or was that 90% jealousy and 10% love?), this clockwork masterpiece was conceived after the moogles of the Black Shroud began noticing all the adventurers with their new shiny minions, and decided they were not about to be left out.
#. column 2: What the moogles lack in<br>grace, they amply make<br>up for in wit.<br>  - Jehantel
#. column 3: Morose Mogdance
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:79:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up moogle minion. With its button nose and fluffy pom, this clockwork moogle will make you the envy of all your friends."
msgstr "Призови заводного миньона-мугла. Пуговичный нос и пушистый помпон — с ним все твои друзья обзавидуются!"

#. ja: モーグリ族を模した魔法人形。冒険者が連れ歩くマメットを見て、猛烈に欲しくなったモーグリ族が、魔法の力で作りだしたものらしい。作り手と同様に音楽をこよなく愛するため、集まると自然と輪を作って踊り出す
#. de: Eine Kreatur, die aus 90 % Liebe und 10 % Eifersucht besteht<nbsp>- oder waren es 90 % Eifersucht und 10 % Liebe? Dieses Meisterwerk wurde erschaffen, nachdem die Mogrys im Finsterwald all die schicken Begleiter der Abenteurer bemerkten und mit von der Partie sein wollten.
#. fr: Jaloux des pantins des aventuriers, les Mogs auraient cédé à l'envie d'avoir eux aussi leur mascotte. Ces Mogs miniatures aiment la musique comme leurs créateurs et forment spontanément des rondes lorsqu'ils se rassemblent.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up moogle minion. With its button nose and fluffy pom, this clockwork moogle will make you the envy of all your friends.
#. column 2: What the moogles lack in<br>grace, they amply make<br>up for in wit.<br>  - Jehantel
#. column 3: Morose Mogdance
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:79:0:1"
msgid "A creation born of 90% love and 10% jealousy (or was that 90% jealousy and 10% love?), this clockwork masterpiece was conceived after the moogles of the Black Shroud began noticing all the adventurers with their new shiny minions, and decided they were not about to be left out."
msgstr "В этом творении 90% любви и 10% зависти (или всё-таки 90% зависти и 10% любви?). Заводных муглов придумали, когда обитатели Чёрной чащи заметили у искателей приключений новых блестящих миньонов и решили, что тоже не хотят оставаться в стороне."

#. ja: クポクポ！
#. de: Grüß dich, Große! Ich bin ein Mogry-Postbote, kupo!<br><i>Freundlicher Mogry-Postbote</i>
#. fr: Kupo kupo<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up moogle minion. With its button nose and fluffy pom, this clockwork moogle will make you the envy of all your friends.
#. column 1: A creation born of 90% love and 10% jealousy (or was that 90% jealousy and 10% love?), this clockwork masterpiece was conceived after the moogles of the Black Shroud began noticing all the adventurers with their new shiny minions, and decided they were not about to be left out.
#. column 3: Morose Mogdance
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:79:0:2"
msgid "What the moogles lack in<br>grace, they amply make<br>up for in wit.<br>  - Jehantel"
msgstr "Муглы грацией<br>не блещут, зато<br>умом не обделены.<br>  — Жантель"

#. ja: モグモグダンス
#. de: Mogry-Menuett
#. fr: Danse mog
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up moogle minion. With its button nose and fluffy pom, this clockwork moogle will make you the envy of all your friends.
