msgid "These beans are covered<br>in opo-opo droppings!<br>  - Mun<hyphen>Tuy Cellarkeep"
msgstr "В этой фасоли<br>опо-опо нагадили!<br>  — Кладовщик Ман-Туй"

#. ja: 猿知恵
#. de: Affentheater
#. fr: Singerie
#. column 0: Summon your baby opo-opo minion. The only thing he loves more than you is a juicy sprite apple.
#. column 1: A daring rescue from the clutches of the goblin hero Brayflox's minions is the only thing separating this opo-opo from a life of swinging free from tree to tree through the lush jungles of the Longstop...and forever trudging in the wake of the brave adventurer who “saved” him.
#. column 2: These beans are covered<br>in opo-opo droppings!<br>  - Mun<hyphen>Tuy Cellarkeep
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:80:0:3"
msgid "Opo See, Opo Do"
msgstr "Что вижу, то и делаю"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、タイプ「アニマル」を弱点に加える。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Fügt Gegnern in der Nähe eine Schwäche gegen Tiere zu.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Ajoute le type “Créature” aux points faibles des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
