msgstr "Накладывает на всех врагов в радиусе действия слабость к <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>животным</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ブルーム」を呼び出す。<br>不思議な呪文さ　サッサカサ！<br>どんまことすきて　むえーえーしふえらす
#. de: Du rufst deinen Besen herbei. Völlig selbstständig macht er sich ans Werk und fegt die Umgebung blitzblank!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte balai enchanté. Avant, arrière, et un coup d'balai enchanté<nbsp>!<br>Voici la formule d'un bien étrange sort<nbsp>:<br>“macf/ etxet ednammoC”<br>Mais peut-être est-ce une simple farce<nbsp>?
#. column 1: While you may not hear many of the realm's mages admit it, magicking a household broom to become a self-propelled sweeping servitor (albeit one which does very little actual cleaning) is far more complicated than it sounds, requiring no fewer than seven cants of binding.
#. column 2: A lancer who fears to<br>attack is naught but a<br>man holding a pole.<br>  - Ywain
#. column 3: Flipp'er Over
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:81:0:0"
msgid "Summon your magic broom minion. For safety reasons, do not fall asleep while it is at work."
msgstr "Призови миньона-волшебную метлу. На всякий случай не засыпай, пока она работает."

#. ja: 魔法仕掛けのほうき。掃除するかのように勝手に動き回るが、気が向くままに動いているだけなので、一向に綺麗にならない。しかし、棒状の物体を動作させるためには、思いの外、高い技術力がつぎ込まれている
#. de: Die meisten Magier Eorzeas werden es nicht zugeben wollen, aber einen gewöhnlichen Besen zu einem selbstgetriebenen Hausdiener zu machen, ist deutlich komplizierter, als es den Anschein hat, und benötigt nicht weniger als sieben Phasen der Bindung.
#. fr: Un balai enchanté qui bouge tout seul, sans être guère efficace pour le ménage avec ses mouvements aléatoires. Un objet de cette forme est, dit-on, très difficile à enchanter. Celui-ci semble avoir un penchant pour les farces...
#. column 0: Summon your magic broom minion. For safety reasons, do not fall asleep while it is at work.
#. column 2: A lancer who fears to<br>attack is naught but a<br>man holding a pole.<br>  - Ywain
#. column 3: Flipp'er Over
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:81:0:1"
msgid "While you may not hear many of the realm's mages admit it, magicking a household broom to become a self-propelled sweeping servitor (albeit one which does very little actual cleaning) is far more complicated than it sounds, requiring no fewer than seven cants of binding."
msgstr "Мало кто из магов Эорзеи признается, но зачаровать обычную метлу, чтобы она сама носилась по дому и подметала (пусть и не особенно хорошо), гораздо сложнее, чем кажется. Для этого требуется не меньше семи заклинаний связывания."

#. ja: サッサカサ
#. de: Zum Putzen in deinem Stall empfehle ich dir<br>einen Zauberbesen. Damit geht die Arbeit leicht<br>von der Hand.<br><i>Luquelot</i>
#. fr: Fwit, fwit<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your magic broom minion. For safety reasons, do not fall asleep while it is at work.
#. column 1: While you may not hear many of the realm's mages admit it, magicking a household broom to become a self-propelled sweeping servitor (albeit one which does very little actual cleaning) is far more complicated than it sounds, requiring no fewer than seven cants of binding.
#. column 3: Flipp'er Over
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:81:0:2"
msgid "A lancer who fears to<br>attack is naught but a<br>man holding a pole.<br>  - Ywain"
msgstr "Копьеносец, боящийся<br>атаковать, — всего лишь<br>человек с шестом.<br>  — Ивейн"

#. ja: サッサカサ
#. de: Husch
#. fr: Coup de balai
#. column 0: Summon your magic broom minion. For safety reasons, do not fall asleep while it is at work.
#. column 1: While you may not hear many of the realm's mages admit it, magicking a household broom to become a self-propelled sweeping servitor (albeit one which does very little actual cleaning) is far more complicated than it sounds, requiring no fewer than seven cants of binding.
#. column 2: A lancer who fears to<br>attack is naught but a<br>man holding a pole.<br>  - Ywain
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:81:0:3"
msgid "Flipp'er Over"
msgstr "Переворот"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵、味方すべてにかかっている、効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle Effekte von allen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe les effets de tous les alliés et ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your magic broom minion. For safety reasons, do not fall asleep while it is at work.
#. column 1: While you may not hear many of the realm's mages admit it, magicking a household broom to become a self-propelled sweeping servitor (albeit one which does very little actual cleaning) is far more complicated than it sounds, requiring no fewer than seven cants of binding.
#. column 2: A lancer who fears to<br>attack is naught but a<br>man holding a pole.<br>  - Ywain
#. column 3: Flipp'er Over
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:81:0:4"
msgid "Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все эффекты со всех врагов и союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・サキュバス」を呼び出す。<br>妖異サキュバスを模した魔法人形。おとなしく生贄となるがいい！
#. de: Du rufst deine Sukkubus-Puppe herbei. Hundertprozentig anatomisch korrekt. Bitte sorgfältig behandeln!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée succube. Cette poupée semble tout droit venue du monde du néant. Prenez garde à ne pas la laisser vous prendre votre âme...
#. column 1: One of countless clockwork servitors discovered in the home of a Gridanian goldsmith recently hanged for the crime of ritual summoning. It is believed while crafting the automata, he became increasingly obsessed with the void, until the darkness bid him do the unthinkable.
#. column 2: That succubus will drain<br>you to a lifeless husk!<br>  - Cocobygo
#. column 3: Carnal Knowledge
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:82:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up succubus minion. 100% anatomically correct. Handle with tender loving care."
msgstr "Призови заводную суккубу. Анатомически точна на все 100%. Обращайся с ней нежно и бережно."

#. ja: 妖異召喚未遂容疑で逮捕された、とある彫金師が所有していた魔法人形。どうやら妖異「サキュバス」に魅せられ、魔法人形を作ったものの、それでは満足できず禁忌の妖術に手を出したらしい。これは、その証拠品……
#. de: Einer der vielen Uhrwerk-Diener, die im Haus des gridanischen Goldschmieds entdeckt wurden, der vor kurzem wegen rituellen Beschwörungen belangt wurde. Während er an seinen Werken arbeitete, wurde er zunehmend besessen von dem Nichts.
#. fr: Cette poupée appartenait à un certain orfèvre qui aurait tenté d'invoquer une entité. Après avoir fabriqué cette poupée, il serait passé à la vitesse supérieure en essayant d'invoquer réellement une de ces créatures.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up succubus minion. 100% anatomically correct. Handle with tender loving care.
#. column 2: That succubus will drain<br>you to a lifeless husk!<br>  - Cocobygo
#. column 3: Carnal Knowledge
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:82:0:1"
msgid "One of countless clockwork servitors discovered in the home of a Gridanian goldsmith recently hanged for the crime of ritual summoning. It is believed while crafting the automata, he became increasingly obsessed with the void, until the darkness bid him do the unthinkable."
msgstr "Эта заводная кукла — одна из множества, найденных в доме гриданского ювелира, которого недавно повесили за ритуальное призывание. Считается, что, создавая автоматонов, он всё сильнее одержим был Пустотой — пока тьма не толкнула его на немыслимое."

#. ja: 生贄ト◎ナルガイイ！
#. de: Sukkuben saugen einem das letzte bisschen<br>Äther aus den Adern!<br><i>Unbekannter Thaumaturg</i>
#. fr: Sacrifice... humain<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up succubus minion. 100% anatomically correct. Handle with tender loving care.
#. column 1: One of countless clockwork servitors discovered in the home of a Gridanian goldsmith recently hanged for the crime of ritual summoning. It is believed while crafting the automata, he became increasingly obsessed with the void, until the darkness bid him do the unthinkable.
#. column 3: Carnal Knowledge
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:82:0:2"
msgid "That succubus will drain<br>you to a lifeless husk!<br>  - Cocobygo"
msgstr "Суккуба высосет из тебя<br>все соки!<br>  — Кокобайго"

#. ja: おいろけ
#. de: Betörung
#. fr: Sex-appeal
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up succubus minion. 100% anatomically correct. Handle with tender loving care.
#. column 1: One of countless clockwork servitors discovered in the home of a Gridanian goldsmith recently hanged for the crime of ritual summoning. It is believed while crafting the automata, he became increasingly obsessed with the void, until the darkness bid him do the unthinkable.
