msgctxt "CompanionTransient:82:0:3"
msgid "Carnal Knowledge"
msgstr "Плотские утехи"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のATKを20上昇させる。味方がタイプ「モンスター」の場合は、ATKが40上昇する。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Erhöht die ATT von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe um 20, im Fall von Monstern um 40. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 20 l'attaque des alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou de 40 s'ils sont de type “Monstre”.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up succubus minion. 100% anatomically correct. Handle with tender loving care.
#. column 1: One of countless clockwork servitors discovered in the home of a Gridanian goldsmith recently hanged for the crime of ritual summoning. It is believed while crafting the automata, he became increasingly obsessed with the void, until the darkness bid him do the unthinkable.
#. column 2: That succubus will drain<br>you to a lifeless husk!<br>  - Cocobygo
#. column 3: Carnal Knowledge
