#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ナナモ」を呼び出す。<br>ナナモ・ウル・ナモ女王陛下を模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deine Nanamo-Puppe herbei. Sie weigert sich, auf irgendjemandes Schulter außer Raubahns zu sitzen - und deiner.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Nanamo miniature. Cette poupée à l'air altier ressemble à s'y méprendre à la sultane d'Ul'dah.
#. column 1: This clockwork doll is a reproduction of a model first crafted in the year of the Calamity to celebrate the tenth anniversary of Nanamo Ul Namo's ascendance to the Ul'dahn throne. Seventeenth in her line, the sultana was crowned when she had seen but five summers.
#. column 2: Take me, Raubahn... I am<br>your sultana... \<snore><br>   - Slumbering Lalafell
#. column 3: Bloodline
#. column 4: Increases caster ATK by 10 and DEF by 5 for every 5% of HP lost.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:84:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Nanamo minion. She vehemently refuses to sit upon any shoulder but Raubahn's...and yours."
msgstr "Призвать заводную куклу Нанамо. На плечо она наотрез отказывается садиться кому-либо, кроме Раубана... и тебя."

#. ja: ウルダハ第十七代国王、ナナモ・ウル・ナモを模した魔法人形。かつて、ナナモ女王の在位十年を記念して、彫金師ギルドが製作したものを、同じレシピで再生産したもの。当時、15歳のナナモ女王の姿を元にしている
#. de: Geschaffen, um das zehnjährige Jubiläum der Thronbesteigung durch Ihre Hoheit Sultana Nanamo Ul Namo, Siebzehnte derer von Ul, zu feiern. Mit ihren damals fünfzehn Jahren war sie dennoch nicht die jüngste Herrscherin der Perle der Wüste.
#. fr: Ce pantin à l'effigie de la 17e sultane d'Ul'dah a été fabriqué par la guilde des orfèvres pour commémorer le dixième anniversaire de l'accès au trône de la jeune monarque, alors seulement âgée de quinze ans.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Nanamo minion. She vehemently refuses to sit upon any shoulder but Raubahn's...and yours.
#. column 2: Take me, Raubahn... I am<br>your sultana... \<snore><br>   - Slumbering Lalafell
#. column 3: Bloodline
#. column 4: Increases caster ATK by 10 and DEF by 5 for every 5% of HP lost.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:84:0:1"
msgid "This clockwork doll is a reproduction of a model first crafted in the year of the Calamity to celebrate the tenth anniversary of Nanamo Ul Namo's ascendance to the Ul'dahn throne. Seventeenth in her line, the sultana was crowned when she had seen but five summers. "
msgstr "Эту заводную куклу создали по образцу модели, изготовленной в год Бедствия к десятилетию восшествия Нанамо Ул Намо на престол Ульды. Семнадцатая в своём роду султана взошла на трон, когда ей исполнилось всего пять лет."

#. ja: 苦シュウナイ！
#. de: Kämpf für die Sultana, Junge! Für Ul'dah!<br><i>Papashan</i>
#. fr: Notre véritable trésor, c'est vous<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Nanamo minion. She vehemently refuses to sit upon any shoulder but Raubahn's...and yours.
#. column 1: This clockwork doll is a reproduction of a model first crafted in the year of the Calamity to celebrate the tenth anniversary of Nanamo Ul Namo's ascendance to the Ul'dahn throne. Seventeenth in her line, the sultana was crowned when she had seen but five summers.
#. column 3: Bloodline
#. column 4: Increases caster ATK by 10 and DEF by 5 for every 5% of HP lost.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:84:0:2"
msgid "Take me, Raubahn... I am<br>your sultana... \\<snore><br>   - Slumbering Lalafell"
msgstr "Возьми меня, Раубан... Я же<br>твоя султана... \\<хр-р-р><br>   — Спящий лалафелл"

#. ja: ウルの血筋
#. de: Blut derer von Ul
#. fr: Sang des Ul
