msgstr "Повышает АТК призвавшего миньона на 10, а ЗАЩ — на 5 за каждые 5% потерянных ОЗ.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ギルガメッシュ」を呼び出す。<br>剣豪ギルガメッシュを模した魔法人形。生きてたら、また会おうぜ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Gilgamesch herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte pantin Gilgamesh. Le grand, le fantasque, l'inénarrable Gilgamesh est en miniature<nbsp>! Gardez quand même un œil sur vos armes...
#. column 1: The masterwork of one of Eorzea's finest goldsmiths, this wind-up automaton, designed to resemble a close acquaintance of the smith's son, was pieced together using parts left over from other projects─his only regret being that he was unable to incorporate hip-gyrating functionality.
#. column 2: For Gilgamesh... It is<br>embiggening time!<br>  - Gilgamesh
#. column 3: Bitter End
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:85:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Gilgamesh minion. Several arms appear to be missing, but that does not seem to otherwise hinder basic functionality."
msgstr "Призвать заводную куклу Гильгамеша. Кажется, ей не хватает нескольких рук, но на работе это никак не сказывается."

#. ja: とあるエオルゼア最強の彫金師が、自宅の魔法人形を修理した際に、勢い余って作り上げてしまったもの。一人息子の友人、ギルガメッシュの姿を模したようだ。息子をよろしく頼みます、という思いが込められている
#. de: Das Meisterwerk von einem der besten Gold-<br>schmiede Eorzeas. Zusammengesetzt aus Ersatz-<br>teilen anderer Projekte, ist es dem Antlitz eines guten Bekannten des Sohnes des Goldschmieds nachempfunden. Leider konnte kein Hüftschwung mehr eingebaut werden.
#. fr: Ce pantin aurait été fabriqué avec des pièces en trop par un certain orfèvre d'exception qui venait de réparer son propre automate. Il l'a façonné à l'image d'un ami de son fils. Peut-être espère-t-il qu'il veillera sur le fils en question...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gilgamesh minion. Several arms appear to be missing, but that does not seem to otherwise hinder basic functionality.
#. column 2: For Gilgamesh... It is<br>embiggening time!<br>  - Gilgamesh
#. column 3: Bitter End
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:85:0:1"
msgid "The masterwork of one of Eorzea's finest goldsmiths, this wind-up automaton, designed to resemble a close acquaintance of the smith's son, was pieced together using parts left over from other projects─his only regret being that he was unable to incorporate hip-gyrating functionality."
msgstr "Этот заводной автомат — шедевр одного из лучших ювелиров Эорзеи. Он сделал его похожим на близкого друга своего сына, использовав детали, оставшиеся от других поделок. Жаль только, что не удалось добавить вращение бёдрами."

#. ja: オマエなのか…バ…？
#. de: Gilgamesch-Metamorphooose!<br><i>Gilgamesch<i>
#. fr: Je suis le fantasque, l'inénarrable Gilgamesh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gilgamesh minion. Several arms appear to be missing, but that does not seem to otherwise hinder basic functionality.
#. column 1: The masterwork of one of Eorzea's finest goldsmiths, this wind-up automaton, designed to resemble a close acquaintance of the smith's son, was pieced together using parts left over from other projects─his only regret being that he was unable to incorporate hip-gyrating functionality.
#. column 3: Bitter End
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:85:0:2"
msgid "For Gilgamesh... It is<br>embiggening time!<br>  - Gilgamesh"
msgstr "За Гильгамеша... Пора<br>становиться побольше!<br>  — Гильгамеш"

#. ja: ヒット・ジ・エンド
#. de: Klingenschimmer
#. fr: Éradication
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gilgamesh minion. Several arms appear to be missing, but that does not seem to otherwise hinder basic functionality.
#. column 1: The masterwork of one of Eorzea's finest goldsmiths, this wind-up automaton, designed to resemble a close acquaintance of the smith's son, was pieced together using parts left over from other projects─his only regret being that he was unable to incorporate hip-gyrating functionality.
#. column 2: For Gilgamesh... It is<br>embiggening time!<br>  - Gilgamesh
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:85:0:3"
msgid "Bitter End"
msgstr "Последний удар"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK300のダメージを与える。ただし、特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンは強制帰還する。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 300 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus, aber die ausführenden Trabanten werden weggeschickt.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 300 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT sont au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment renvoyées.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gilgamesh minion. Several arms appear to be missing, but that does not seem to otherwise hinder basic functionality.
#. column 1: The masterwork of one of Eorzea's finest goldsmiths, this wind-up automaton, designed to resemble a close acquaintance of the smith's son, was pieced together using parts left over from other projects─his only regret being that he was unable to incorporate hip-gyrating functionality.
#. column 2: For Gilgamesh... It is<br>embiggening time!<br>  - Gilgamesh
#. column 3: Bitter End
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:85:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 300. После применения миньон, использовавший особый приём, немедленно покидает поле боя."

#. ja: ミニオン「オニオンプリンス」を呼び出す。<br>何故か畑に生えていたオニオンプリンス。マンドラゴラの王子！
#. de: Du rufst Prinz Zwiebel herbei. Er würde für dich sterben. Oder um dich weinen. Oder dich zum Weinen bringen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Prince oignon. Le Prince oignon, du gang des légumes, est devenu inoffensif<nbsp>! Il vous fera quand même pleurer si vous l'épluchez...
#. column 1: After learning his parents married not for love, but for duty, the Onion Prince vowed he would never walk in the footsteps of his parents, and to this day promises his baseborn sweetheart, the Leek Maid, that they will run away and be wed.
#. column 2: Aw, bloody hells! Who's<br>cutting onions back<br>there!?<br>  - Buscarron
#. column 3: Teary Twirl
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:86:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Onion Prince minion. He would die 4 U. Or possibly cry 4 U. Or most likely make U cry. 4 U."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — Лукового принца. Он бы умер за тебя. Или, может, плакал бы за тебя. А скорее всего — заставил бы тебя плакать. За тебя."

#. ja: 自称マンドラゴラの王子。両親が政略結婚で結ばれたことを知り、一時期はグレていた。だが、自分に注がれる両親の愛が、真実と悟り更正。今では、キングトマトの花粉を受け継いだことを誇りに思っている……らしい
#. de: Nachdem er erfahren musste, dass seine Eltern nicht aus Liebe heirateten, sondern weil sie es als ihre Pflicht ansahen, schwor sich Prinz Zwiebel, nie in ihre Fußstapfen zu treten und stattdessen mit seiner Geliebten davonzulaufen.
#. fr: Apprenant qu'il était le fruit, ou plutôt le légume, d'un mariage stratégique, le Prince sombra un temps vers le côté obscur. Mais l'amour de ses parents le remit dans le droit chemin, et il est fier de porter le pollen du Roi tomate... Paraît-il.
#. column 0: Summon your Onion Prince minion. He would die 4 U. Or possibly cry 4 U. Or most likely make U cry. 4 U.
#. column 2: Aw, bloody hells! Who's<br>cutting onions back<br>there!?<br>  - Buscarron
#. column 3: Teary Twirl
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:86:0:1"
msgid "After learning his parents married not for love, but for duty, the Onion Prince vowed he would never walk in the footsteps of his parents, and to this day promises his baseborn sweetheart, the Leek Maid, that they will run away and be wed."
msgstr "Узнав, что родители поженились не по любви, а по долгу, Луковый принц поклялся не идти по их стопам. И по сей день обещает своей возлюбленной из простого народа, Деве-луковке, что они сбегут и поженятся."

#. ja: ●×▼……！
#. de: Mit so ein paar kleinen Gemüsezwiebeln<br>mach ich kurzen Prozess.<br><i>Hildibrand, Meister-Kriminologe</i>
#. fr: ●×▼...<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Onion Prince minion. He would die 4 U. Or possibly cry 4 U. Or most likely make U cry. 4 U.
#. column 1: After learning his parents married not for love, but for duty, the Onion Prince vowed he would never walk in the footsteps of his parents, and to this day promises his baseborn sweetheart, the Leek Maid, that they will run away and be wed.
#. column 3: Teary Twirl
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:86:0:2"
msgid "Aw, bloody hells! Who's<br>cutting onions back<br>there!?<br>  - Buscarron"
msgstr "Ох, чтоб вас! Кто там<br>лук режет!?<br>  — Бускаррон"

#. ja: オニオン汁
#. de: Dicke Tränen
#. fr: Jus d'oignon
#. column 0: Summon your Onion Prince minion. He would die 4 U. Or possibly cry 4 U. Or most likely make U cry. 4 U.
#. column 1: After learning his parents married not for love, but for duty, the Onion Prince vowed he would never walk in the footsteps of his parents, and to this day promises his baseborn sweetheart, the Leek Maid, that they will run away and be wed.
#. column 2: Aw, bloody hells! Who's<br>cutting onions back<br>there!?<br>  - Buscarron
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:86:0:3"
msgid "Teary Twirl"
msgstr "Слёзный вихрь"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のアルカナストーンに、5%のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Arkana-Stein 5 % Schaden zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 5% de sa solidité à la pierre arcanique ennemie la plus proche.
#. column 0: Summon your Onion Prince minion. He would die 4 U. Or possibly cry 4 U. Or most likely make U cry. 4 U.
#. column 1: After learning his parents married not for love, but for duty, the Onion Prince vowed he would never walk in the footsteps of his parents, and to this day promises his baseborn sweetheart, the Leek Maid, that they will run away and be wed.
#. column 2: Aw, bloody hells! Who's<br>cutting onions back<br>there!?<br>  - Buscarron
#. column 3: Teary Twirl
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:86:0:4"
msgid "Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone."
msgstr "Наносит ближайшему вражескому арканическому камню урон в размере 5% прочности."

#. ja: ミニオン「エッグナイト」を呼び出す。<br>何故か畑に生えていたエッグナイト。マンドラゴラの騎士！
#. de: Du rufst Ritter Aubergine herbei. Sein Kindheitstraum, ein Magier zu werden, missfiel seinem strengen Vater zutiefst.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Chevalier aubergine. Le Chevalier aubergine, du gang des légumes, est devenu inoffensif<nbsp>! Il a même l'air appétissant...
#. column 1: House Eggplant has faithfully served the royal line of Tomato kings for eighteen generations, never once betraying the throne...until, that is, the knight of the nineteenth generation laid eyes on the fair Mandragora Queen.
#. column 2: If you eat too many of<br>this vegetable, you will<br>turn into one.<br>  - Common Wives' Tale
#. column 3: Eggvincible
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:87:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Eggplant Knight minion. His childhood dream to become a wizard was frowned upon by his overbearing father."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — Рыцаря-баклажана. Его властный отец был совсем не в восторге от детской мечты сына стать чародеем."

#. ja: 自称マンドラゴラの騎士。18代前の先祖がキングトマトの先祖と同じ畑で栽培されていた縁で、野菜国家「マンドラ帝国」の樹立を目指す闘争に参加した。王子の武術指南役を任される程、王からの信頼は厚い……らしい
#. de: Das Haus Aubergine hat den Tomatenkönigen achtzehn Generationen lang treu gedient und war dem Thron gegenüber stets loyal ... bis dieser Ritter der neunzehnten Generation ein Auge auf die hübsche Königin Mandragora warf.
#. fr: Apprenant que son ancêtre était frère de terreau du 18e aïeul du Roi tomate, le Chevalier ambitionna un temps d'aider à créer le royaume des mandragores. Il est aujourd'hui entraîneur du prince, avec toute la confiance du roi... Paraît-il.
#. column 0: Summon your Eggplant Knight minion. His childhood dream to become a wizard was frowned upon by his overbearing father.
#. column 2: If you eat too many of<br>this vegetable, you will<br>turn into one.<br>  - Common Wives' Tale
#. column 3: Eggvincible
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:87:0:1"
msgid "House Eggplant has faithfully served the royal line of Tomato kings for eighteen generations, never once betraying the throne...until, that is, the knight of the nineteenth generation laid eyes on the fair Mandragora Queen."
msgstr "Род Баклажанов верно служил королевской династии Помидоров восемнадцать поколений, ни разу не предав трон... пока рыцарь девятнадцатого поколения не встретил прекрасную Королеву мандрагору."

#. ja: ◎◎×△□！！
#. de: Wer zu viele Auberginen isst,<br>wird selber eine.<br><i>Hausfrauenweisheit</i>
#. fr: ◎◎×△□<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon your Eggplant Knight minion. His childhood dream to become a wizard was frowned upon by his overbearing father.
#. column 1: House Eggplant has faithfully served the royal line of Tomato kings for eighteen generations, never once betraying the throne...until, that is, the knight of the nineteenth generation laid eyes on the fair Mandragora Queen.
#. column 3: Eggvincible
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:87:0:2"
msgid "If you eat too many of<br>this vegetable, you will<br>turn into one.<br>  - Common Wives' Tale"
msgstr "Будешь есть слишком много<br>этого овоща — сам<br>в него превратишься.<br>  — Народная мудрость"

#. ja: ナス式インビンシブル
#. de: Nachtschatten
#. fr: Auberginvincible
#. column 0: Summon your Eggplant Knight minion. His childhood dream to become a wizard was frowned upon by his overbearing father.
#. column 1: House Eggplant has faithfully served the royal line of Tomato kings for eighteen generations, never once betraying the throne...until, that is, the knight of the nineteenth generation laid eyes on the fair Mandragora Queen.
#. column 2: If you eat too many of<br>this vegetable, you will<br>turn into one.<br>  - Common Wives' Tale
