#. column 0: Summon your Eggplant Knight minion. His childhood dream to become a wizard was frowned upon by his overbearing father.
#. column 1: House Eggplant has faithfully served the royal line of Tomato kings for eighteen generations, never once betraying the throne...until, that is, the knight of the nineteenth generation laid eyes on the fair Mandragora Queen.
#. column 2: If you eat too many of<br>this vegetable, you will<br>turn into one.<br>  - Common Wives' Tale
#. column 3: Eggvincible
