#. ja: ミニオン「ガーリックスター」を呼び出す。<br>何故か畑に生えていたガーリックスター。マンドラゴラの道化！
#. de: Du rufst Sir Knoblauch herbei. Jeder deiner Atemzüge wird dich daran erinnern, dass der stinkende Kerl direkt hinter dir ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Baron ail. Le Baron ail, du gang des légumes, est devenu inoffensif<nbsp>! Il sent assez fort, cela dit...
#. column 1: The son of a traveling mummer who performed under the name Garlic Star, the jester swore he would never follow in the footsteps of his father. However, after being deemed too malodorous to serve in the royal guard, he swallowed his pride and fell back on the only trade he knew.
#. column 2: And this irresistible<br>aroma... Mmmmmmmmm...<br>  - Ingham
#. column 3: Irresistible Aroma
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:88:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Garlic Jester minion. Every breath you take will act as a reminder that your pungent pal is right behind you."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — Чесночного шута. Каждый твой вздох будет напоминать, что пахучий дружок прямо за спиной."

#. ja: 自称マンドラゴラの道化。危うくシチューの隠し味にされそうになっていたところを、エッグナイトに助けられ、以後、行動を共にしている。本当は騎士になりたかったが、臭かったので宮廷道化師に任命された……らしい
#. de: Der Sohn eines wandernden Maskierten, der unter dem Namen Knoblauchstern auftrat. Er schwor sich, nie in die Fußstapfen seines Vaters zu treten, aber musste seinen Stolz überwinden, da er der Palastwache zu übelriechend war.
#. fr: Fou du gang des légumes, il a été sauvé par le Chevalier aubergine alors qu'on allait le jeter en pot-au-feu. Il rêvait de se faire lui aussi adouber, mais à cause de son odeur, il a dû se contenter d'être Fou... Paraît-il.
#. column 0: Summon your Garlic Jester minion. Every breath you take will act as a reminder that your pungent pal is right behind you.
#. column 2: And this irresistible<br>aroma... Mmmmmmmmm...<br>  - Ingham
#. column 3: Irresistible Aroma
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:88:0:1"
msgid "The son of a traveling mummer who performed under the name Garlic Star, the jester swore he would never follow in the footsteps of his father. However, after being deemed too malodorous to serve in the royal guard, he swallowed his pride and fell back on the only trade he knew."
msgstr "Сын бродячего скомороха, выступавшего под именем Чесночная звезда, поклялся никогда не идти по стопам отца. Но стражником его не взяли — уж больно дурно пах. Пришлось смирить гордость и заняться единственным ремеслом, какое он знал."

#. ja: ××◎～！
#. de: Und dieses herrliche Aroma!<br><i>Ingham</i>
#. fr: ××◎～<nbsp>!
