#. ja: ミニオン「キングトマト」を呼び出す。<br>何故か畑に生えていたキングトマト。マンドラゴラの王！
#. de: Du rufst König Tomate herbei. Hat einen königlichen Erlass verabschiedet, der es seinen Untertanen untersagt, ihn als Gemüse zu bezeichnen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Roi tomate. Le Roi tomate, du gang des légumes, est devenu inoffensif<nbsp>! Ne le laissez pas trop au soleil, il est déjà bien assez rouge...
#. column 1: After the flames of the Calamity rendered Lord Tomato a king without a kingdom, the ruby red regent packed up his seeds and set out on a journey to find a new land to rule. He currently roams the realm recruiting any taproot, tuber, or corm who will follow his standard.
#. column 2: It is apparently a rogue,<br>outcast from its kin, a<br>stranger in a strange land.<br>  - Tomaj
#. column 3: Killer Attack
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:89:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Tomato King minion. Has issued a royal decree for the public defenestration of any and all who mistakenly claim the king is a vegetable."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — Короля-помидора. Издал королевский указ: всех, кто посмеет назвать его овощем, выбрасывать из окна."

#. ja: 自称マンドラゴラの王。野菜国家「マンドラ帝国」を樹立すべく、全マンドラゴラに団結を呼びかける。その汁の赤さはヒトに求める「血の犠牲」を、汁の酸味は「食われ続けてきた野菜の無念」を示している……らしい
#. de: Nachdem die Katastrophe den König ohne ein Königreich hinterlassen hatte, machte sich dieser auf den Weg, um ein neues Reich zu finden, über das er herrschen könnte. Streift derzeit durch die Lande, um jede Rübe und Knolle davon zu überzeugen, ihm zu folgen.
#. fr: Ayant levé une armée pour créer le royaume des mandragores, le Roi vit sa révolte noyée dans le sang, ou plutôt le jus (de tomate). Sa couleur rouge vif et l'acidité de sa chair sont le fruit d'années de répression légumière... Paraît-il.
#. column 0: Summon your Tomato King minion. Has issued a royal decree for the public defenestration of any and all who mistakenly claim the king is a vegetable.
#. column 2: It is apparently a rogue,<br>outcast from its kin, a<br>stranger in a strange land.<br>  - Tomaj
#. column 3: Killer Attack
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:89:0:1"
msgid "After the flames of the Calamity rendered Lord Tomato a king without a kingdom, the ruby red regent packed up his seeds and set out on a journey to find a new land to rule. He currently roams the realm recruiting any taproot, tuber, or corm who will follow his standard. "
msgstr "Когда Бедствие оставило лорда Томатного короля без королевства, алый правитель собрал свои семена и отправился искать новые земли. Теперь он бродит по свету, собирая под своё знамя всех, кто согласен за ним последовать: корнеплоды, клубни и луковицы."

#. ja: ■＄◎×△□◎◎…♪
#. de: Um mich zu beruhigen, genehmige ich<br>mir erst mal eine dieser köstlichen<br>gridanischen Tomatenpasteten.<br><i>Ahctkoen</i>
#. fr: ■＄◎×△□◎◎... ♪
#. column 0: Summon your Tomato King minion. Has issued a royal decree for the public defenestration of any and all who mistakenly claim the king is a vegetable.
#. column 1: After the flames of the Calamity rendered Lord Tomato a king without a kingdom, the ruby red regent packed up his seeds and set out on a journey to find a new land to rule. He currently roams the realm recruiting any taproot, tuber, or corm who will follow his standard.
#. column 3: Killer Attack
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:89:0:2"
msgid "It is apparently a rogue,<br>outcast from its kin, a<br>stranger in a strange land.<br>  - Tomaj"
msgstr "Похоже, это изгнанник,<br>оторванный от родни,<br>чужак в чужой стране.<br>  — Томай"

#. ja: 怒りのトマト
#. de: Killerangriff
#. fr: Rouge comme une tomate
