#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ヤ・シュトラ」を呼び出す。<br>ヤ・シュトラを模した魔法人形。永遠の23歳を完全再現！
#. de: Eine Puppe in der Gestalt der berühmten Exegetin. 23 Jahr, weißes Haar, so steht sie vor dir!<br>
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Y'shtola miniature. Ce pantin reproduit les traits de l'érudite des Héritiers avec une telle perfection que son regard dénote une certaine in<shy>tel<shy>li<shy>gence.
#. column 1: Nearly half of the coin provided to the Goldsmiths' Guild for the crafting of this wind-up doll bearing the likeness of Scion of the Seventh Dawn Y'shtola was paid to Atelier Fen-Yll for hand-sewn leather boots matching those worn by the enigmatic Archon.
#. column 2: Gods forfend...<br>   - Y'shtola
#. column 3: Aetherial Field
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:91:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Y'shtola minion. If we are to take her word for it, the Circle of Knowing Archon has seen but twenty-three summers."
msgstr "Призвать заводную куклу Я'штолы. Если верить ей самой, мудрец из Круга Познания прожил всего двадцать три весны."

#. ja: 「暁の血盟」の賢人、ヤ・シュトラを模した魔法人形。暁の金庫番、タタル嬢の発注により、ウルダハの彫金師ギルドで製作された。工芸「フェン・イル」特製のマメット用本革ブーツをはかせたコダワリの逸品
#. de: Von Tataru bei der Goldschmiede-Gilde in Auftrag gegeben, ging beinahe die Hälfte der Kosten an das Atelier Fen-Yll, das die präzise gearbeiteten Lederstiefel dieser Puppe anfertigte. Sie sieht der rätselhaften Druidin in der Tat sehr ähnlich.
#. fr: C'est Tataru, la trésorière des Héritiers de la Septième Aube, qui a eu l'idée de commander cette poupée re<shy>pré<shy>sen<shy>tant Y'shtola, et dont les bottes ont été réalisées avec minutie par l'Atelier Fen-Yll.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Y'shtola minion. If we are to take her word for it, the Circle of Knowing Archon has seen but twenty-three summers.
#. column 2: Gods forfend...<br>   - Y'shtola
#. column 3: Aetherial Field
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:91:0:1"
msgid "Nearly half of the coin provided to the Goldsmiths' Guild for the crafting of this wind-up doll bearing the likeness of Scion of the Seventh Dawn Y'shtola was paid to Atelier Fen-Yll for hand-sewn leather boots matching those worn by the enigmatic Archon."
msgstr "Почти половина суммы, уплаченной Гильдии ювелиров за эту заводную куклу в образе Я'штолы, члена «Седьмого рассвета», ушла мастерской Фен-Илл за сшитые вручную кожаные сапожки — точь-в-точь как у загадочной арконы."

#. ja: シッポヲ、ギュ…
#. de: Nun werden wir sehen,<br>ob ich als Sharlayanerin etwas auf mich halten darf ...<br><i>Y'shtola</i>
#. fr: Le savoir est la clef de la réussite.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Y'shtola minion. If we are to take her word for it, the Circle of Knowing Archon has seen but twenty-three summers.
#. column 1: Nearly half of the coin provided to the Goldsmiths' Guild for the crafting of this wind-up doll bearing the likeness of Scion of the Seventh Dawn Y'shtola was paid to Atelier Fen-Yll for hand-sewn leather boots matching those worn by the enigmatic Archon.
#. column 3: Aetherial Field
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:91:0:2"
msgid "Gods forfend...<br>   - Y'shtola"
msgstr "Боги упаси...<br>   — Я'штола"

#. ja: エーテリアルフィールド
#. de: Ätherfeld
#. fr: Champ de force éthéréen
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Y'shtola minion. If we are to take her word for it, the Circle of Knowing Archon has seen but twenty-three summers.
