#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・オニオン」を呼び出す。<br>古のオニオンナイトを模した魔法人形。晴れない雲はないんだ！
#. de: Du rufst eine verhexte Puppe in Gestalt eines Zwiebelritters herbei. Treibt selbst dem härtesten Hund Tränen in die Augen!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée chevalier oignon. Cette adorable poupée est à l'effigie du chevalier oignon des temps anciens. Son épée a l'air très tranchante pour un jouet...
#. column 1: If Sons of Saint Coinach anthropogeographer Rammbroes is to be believed, towards the end of their civilization, the Allagans began using automata such as this to fight their wars (which had been deemed inhumane, yet ultimately necessary to spread imperial peace).
#. column 2: By the onion!<br>  - Bloezoeng
#. column 3: Onion Skin
#. column 4: Renders action party immune to all attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:92:0:0"
msgid "Summon your magic wind-up onion knight minion. An accurate representation of the soldiers who once made up the greater portion of the Allagan Imperial Army."
msgstr "Призвать заводную куклу Рыцаря-луковки. Точная копия солдат, некогда составлявших большую часть армии Аллаганской империи."

#. ja: クリスタルタワーで発見された魔法人形。ラムブルース氏の見解では、親衛隊「玉葱兵」を模した玩具らしいとのこと。足裏に「ルーネス」と記されていたが、これが持ち主の名なのか、人形の名なのかは判然としていない
#. de: Laut Rammbroes von der Sankt Coinach-Stiftung begannen die Allager gegen Ende ihrer Zivilisation, ihre Kriege mit solchen Puppen auszutragen, um den Frieden im Reich sicherzustellen.
#. fr: Une poupée découverte dans la Tour de Cristal. D'après Rammbroes, ce serait un jouet inspiré de la garde des chevaliers oignon. Il est écrit “Luneth” sous son pied, mais on ignore si c'est son nom ou celui du pro<shy>prié<shy>taire...
#. column 0: Summon your magic wind-up onion knight minion. An accurate representation of the soldiers who once made up the greater portion of the Allagan Imperial Army.
#. column 2: By the onion!<br>  - Bloezoeng
#. column 3: Onion Skin
#. column 4: Renders action party immune to all attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:92:0:1"
msgid "If Sons of Saint Coinach anthropogeographer Rammbroes is to be believed, towards the end of their civilization, the Allagans began using automata such as this to fight their wars (which had been deemed inhumane, yet ultimately necessary to spread imperial peace)."
msgstr "Если верить Раммброэсу, антропогеографу из «Сынов Святого Койнаха», к концу своей цивилизации аллаганы начали использовать такие автоматы в войнах. Война считалась бесчеловечной, но необходимой для распространения имперского мира."

#. ja: 32かいヒット！
#. de: Wir sollten schleunigst in die Sagolii-Wüste aufbrechen,<br>um den Machenschaften dieser verrückten Zombies<br>ein Regal, äh, eine Zwiebel vorzuschieben.<br><i>Nashu Mhakaracca</i>
#. fr: 32 coups<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your magic wind-up onion knight minion. An accurate representation of the soldiers who once made up the greater portion of the Allagan Imperial Army.
#. column 1: If Sons of Saint Coinach anthropogeographer Rammbroes is to be believed, towards the end of their civilization, the Allagans began using automata such as this to fight their wars (which had been deemed inhumane, yet ultimately necessary to spread imperial peace).
#. column 3: Onion Skin
#. column 4: Renders action party immune to all attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:92:0:2"
msgid "By the onion!<br>  - Bloezoeng"
msgstr "Луковкой клянусь!<br>  — Блёзонг"

#. ja: オニオン装備
#. de: Zwiebelschale
#. fr: Armure oignon
#. column 0: Summon your magic wind-up onion knight minion. An accurate representation of the soldiers who once made up the greater portion of the Allagan Imperial Army.
#. column 1: If Sons of Saint Coinach anthropogeographer Rammbroes is to be believed, towards the end of their civilization, the Allagans began using automata such as this to fight their wars (which had been deemed inhumane, yet ultimately necessary to spread imperial peace).
