#. ja: ミニオン「トレジャーボックス」を呼び出す。<br>小箱に憑依した妖異。不用意に開けると咬まれるらしい
#. de: Du rufst eine Schatzkiste herbei. Beim Öffnen schön auf die Fingerchen Acht geben!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte coffre au trésor mécanique. Un étrange coffre pourvu de dents comme on en trouve dans les donjons, paraît-il. Attention où vous mettez les doigts...
#. column 1: Originally used by an Eorzean Alliance paymaster to store Allied Seals...until the box began eating them. She sold the box in hopes of recouping some of her losses (skimming off adventurer rewards to cover the rest...until she was caught and sentenced to a public flogging).
#. column 2: A pirate don't abandon<br>'is treasures!<br>  - Ahtzapfyn
#. column 3: Leaden Lid
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to all enemies within range while increasing action party ATK by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:93:0:0"
msgid "Summon your treasure box minion. It is unknown what manner of spirit possesses this tiny treasure chest, but the fact that it will not hesitate to nip at the fingers of any who try and pry it open is painfully evident."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — сундук с сокровищами. Неизвестно, какой дух вселился в этот крошечный ларец, но то, что он без раздумий кусает пальцы всякого, кто пытается его открыть, — факт."

#. ja: グランドカンパニーの倉庫で保管されていた、小箱に憑依した妖異。箱の中に納められていた同盟記章を食べてしまったため、責任を取らせるため売りに出されることとなった。ムシャムシャして食べた、今は反省している
#. de: Ursprünglich mal von einem Jagdmeister zur Auf-<br>bewahrung von Jagdabzeichen verwendet<nbsp>... bis die Kiste begann, diese aufzufressen. Um die Verluste ein Stück weit wieder wettzumachen, verkaufte er die Schatzkiste.
#. fr: Une entité ressemblant comme deux gouttes d'eau à un coffre, retrouvée dans la réserve d'une grande compagnie. Ayant dévoré tous les insignes de ladite réserve, elle a été vendue pour l'exemple. Visiblement, elle regrette.
#. column 0: Summon your treasure box minion. It is unknown what manner of spirit possesses this tiny treasure chest, but the fact that it will not hesitate to nip at the fingers of any who try and pry it open is painfully evident.
#. column 2: A pirate don't abandon<br>'is treasures!<br>  - Ahtzapfyn
#. column 3: Leaden Lid
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to all enemies within range while increasing action party ATK by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:93:0:1"
msgid "Originally used by an Eorzean Alliance paymaster to store Allied Seals...until the box began eating them. She sold the box in hopes of recouping some of her losses (skimming off adventurer rewards to cover the rest...until she was caught and sentenced to a public flogging)."
msgstr "Сначала казначей Альянса Эорзеи хранила в сундуке знаки отличия Альянса... пока тот не принялся их пожирать. Она продала его, надеясь хоть немного возместить убытки (а остальное покрывала, понемногу присваивая награды искателей приключений... пока её не поймали и не приговорили к публичной порке)."

#. ja: ギィィ…バタン…
#. de: Piraten wissen, wo ihre Schatzkiste ist.<br><i>Ahtzapfyn</i>
#. fr: Tchomp<nbsp>! Désolé...
#. column 0: Summon your treasure box minion. It is unknown what manner of spirit possesses this tiny treasure chest, but the fact that it will not hesitate to nip at the fingers of any who try and pry it open is painfully evident.
#. column 1: Originally used by an Eorzean Alliance paymaster to store Allied Seals...until the box began eating them. She sold the box in hopes of recouping some of her losses (skimming off adventurer rewards to cover the rest...until she was caught and sentenced to a public flogging).
#. column 3: Leaden Lid
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to all enemies within range while increasing action party ATK by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:93:0:2"
msgid "A pirate don't abandon<br>'is treasures!<br>  - Ahtzapfyn"
msgstr "Пират не бросит<br>свои сокровища!<br>  — Ахтцафин"

#. ja: ムシャムシャ
#. de: Bleideckel
#. fr: Miam miam
