#. ja: ミニオン「ナナッコ・ベアー」を呼び出す。<br>ベアーの幼獣を模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deinen Nana-Stoffbären herbei. Gelehrte sind der Ansicht, dass Bären zu den tödlichsten Bestien im Reich gehören. Offensichtlich haben sie nie in die Augen <i>dieses</i> süßen kleinen Exemplars geschaut.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte ourson de Nanakko. Cette poupée est une reproduction tout à fait inoffensive et adorable d'un petit ours.
#. column 1: The Nana bear's origins can be traced back to Ul'dahn princess Nanakko who, on her eighth nameday, asked her father for a bear. Despite a realm-wide search, no bears were found, and so the Goldsmiths' Guild was commissioned to craft one from a drawing found in an ancient bestiary.
#. column 2: There isn't enough honey<br>in all the Yard to satisfy<br>that sweet-toothed sellary.<br>  - Honey Yard Hivekeep
#. column 3: Stuffed Stomp
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:95:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Nana bear minion. Pundits claim bears to be the deadliest beasts in the realm─obviously having never stared into <i>this</i> cute cub's nebulous eyes."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — мишку Нанакко. Знатоки твердят, что медведи — самые опасные звери на свете. Видать, они ни разу не заглядывали в эти <i>милые</i> глазки."

#. ja: ベアーの幼獣を模した魔法人形。約80年前、「熊が見たい」と駄々をこねていたウルダハ王女、ナナッコ姫のために、魔法人形を仕込んだぬいぐるみが作られ、8歳の誕生日に贈られた。以来、定番の玩具として定着している
#. de: Der Nana-Stoffbär geht zurück auf die ul'dhische Prinzessin Nanakko, die sich zu ihrem 8. Geburtstag einen Bären von ihrem Vater wünschte. Der Sultan ließ ganz Eorzea absuchen<nbsp>- erfolglos. Also wurden die Goldschmiede damit beauftragt, einen Spielzeugbären zu bauen.
#. fr: L'ourson de Nanakko a été créé il y a 80 ans à Ul'dah, afin d'être offert à la princesse du même nom pour ses 8 ans. Elle avait lourdement insisté pour voir des ours et c'est la seule solution que ses parents avaient trouvée pour la faire taire. C'est le cadeau dont tous les enfants rêvent.
#. column 0: Summon your Nana bear minion. Pundits claim bears to be the deadliest beasts in the realm─obviously having never stared into <i>this</i> cute cub's nebulous eyes.
#. column 2: There isn't enough honey<br>in all the Yard to satisfy<br>that sweet-toothed sellary.<br>  - Honey Yard Hivekeep
#. column 3: Stuffed Stomp
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:95:0:1"
msgid "The Nana bear's origins can be traced back to Ul'dahn princess Nanakko who, on her eighth nameday, asked her father for a bear. Despite a realm-wide search, no bears were found, and so the Goldsmiths' Guild was commissioned to craft one from a drawing found in an ancient bestiary."
msgstr "История мишки Нанакко началась с ульдинской принцессы Нанакко, попросившей отца подарить ей медведя на восьмой день рождения. После поисков по всей Эорзее медведя так и не нашли, и тогда Гильдии ювелиров поручили изготовить игрушку по рисунку из древнего бестиария."

#. ja: ガオォ～！
#. de: Im ganzen Honighof gibt<br>gibt es nicht genug Honig,<br>um dieses kleine Schleckermaul<br>zufriedenzustellen.<br><i>Anonymer Imker</i>
#. fr: Grouh... ouh ouh... Graouuuh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Nana bear minion. Pundits claim bears to be the deadliest beasts in the realm─obviously having never stared into <i>this</i> cute cub's nebulous eyes.
#. column 1: The Nana bear's origins can be traced back to Ul'dahn princess Nanakko who, on her eighth nameday, asked her father for a bear. Despite a realm-wide search, no bears were found, and so the Goldsmiths' Guild was commissioned to craft one from a drawing found in an ancient bestiary.
#. column 3: Stuffed Stomp
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:95:0:2"
msgid "There isn't enough honey<br>in all the Yard to satisfy<br>that sweet-toothed sellary.<br>  - Honey Yard Hivekeep"
msgstr "Во всём Медовом саду<br>не найдётся столько мёда,<br>чтобы насытить эту сладкоежку.<br>  — Пасечник Медового сада"

#. ja: ベアーストンプ
#. de: Plüschtritt
#. fr: Patte d'ourson
#. column 0: Summon your Nana bear minion. Pundits claim bears to be the deadliest beasts in the realm─obviously having never stared into <i>this</i> cute cub's nebulous eyes.
