msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「クロックワークトロッコ」を呼び出す。<br>小さなトロッコ玩具。鉱山労働バンザイ
#. de: Du rufst deine Miniaturlore herbei. Eignet sich am besten für verlassene Minen und Tempel des Todes.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte wagonnet mécanique. Ce petit wagonnet est le jouet préféré de tous les enfants d'Éorzéa.
#. column 1: Despite adamant claims by Amajina & Sons Mineral Concern that their donation of over five score carts to the orphans of Stonesthrow was a simple act of charity, opponents of the guild insist it was a scheme to recruit inexpensive child labor for Thanalan's myriad mines.
#. column 2: Mines mine!<br>Mines all miiiiiiiiine!<br>  - Biggy the Spriggan
#. column 3: On Track
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:96:0:0"
msgid "Summon your miniature minecart minion. Best when ridden in abandoned mines and temples of doom."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — миниатюрную вагонетку. Лучше всего кататься на ней по заброшенным шахтам и храмам погибели."

#. ja: からくり仕掛けの小さなトロッコ。アマジナ鉱山社が、「鉱山労働の素晴らしさ」を幼少期から教え込むために作った教育的玩具らしい。与えられた子どもの中には、それはそれは大切に宝物のように扱う子もいたようだ
#. de: Die Amajina Bergbau AG behauptet, ihre Spende von über Hundert dieser Gefährten an die Waisen von Steinwurf sei ein Akt der Wohltätigkeit gewesen. Kritiker vermuten jedoch, die Kinder sollen so für die Arbeit in den Minen von Thanalan begeistert werden.
#. fr: Ce wagonnet a été conçu par Amajina et Fils pour montrer aux jeunes enfants d'Éorzéa à quel point le travail de mineur est fantastique. Bien des garnements chérissent ce jouet éducatif comme un trésor...
#. column 0: Summon your miniature minecart minion. Best when ridden in abandoned mines and temples of doom.
#. column 2: Mines mine!<br>Mines all miiiiiiiiine!<br>  - Biggy the Spriggan
#. column 3: On Track
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:96:0:1"
msgid "Despite adamant claims by Amajina & Sons Mineral Concern that their donation of over five score carts to the orphans of Stonesthrow was a simple act of charity, opponents of the guild insist it was a scheme to recruit inexpensive child labor for Thanalan's myriad mines."
msgstr "Горнорудная компания «Амажина и сыновья» упорно твердит, что пожертвовала больше сотни вагонеток сиротам из Камнеброса из чистого милосердия. Но противники гильдии уверены: так детей заманивали на дешёвую работу в бесчисленных шахтах Таналана."

#. ja: ガタン、ゴトン
#. de: Miiiine alles meiiins!<br><i>Biggy, der Spriggan</i>
#. fr: Klang klong...
#. column 0: Summon your miniature minecart minion. Best when ridden in abandoned mines and temples of doom.
#. column 1: Despite adamant claims by Amajina & Sons Mineral Concern that their donation of over five score carts to the orphans of Stonesthrow was a simple act of charity, opponents of the guild insist it was a scheme to recruit inexpensive child labor for Thanalan's myriad mines.
#. column 3: On Track
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:96:0:2"
msgid "Mines mine!<br>Mines all miiiiiiiiine!<br>  - Biggy the Spriggan"
msgstr "Шахта моя!<br>Всё-всё моёёёё!<br>  — Бигги, спригган"

#. ja: お宝ザクザク
#. de: Spurlatte
#. fr: Wagonnée précieuse
#. column 0: Summon your miniature minecart minion. Best when ridden in abandoned mines and temples of doom.
#. column 1: Despite adamant claims by Amajina & Sons Mineral Concern that their donation of over five score carts to the orphans of Stonesthrow was a simple act of charity, opponents of the guild insist it was a scheme to recruit inexpensive child labor for Thanalan's myriad mines.
#. column 2: Mines mine!<br>Mines all miiiiiiiiine!<br>  - Biggy the Spriggan
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
