msgid "On Track"
msgstr "Путь к сокровищам"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your miniature minecart minion. Best when ridden in abandoned mines and temples of doom.
#. column 1: Despite adamant claims by Amajina & Sons Mineral Concern that their donation of over five score carts to the orphans of Stonesthrow was a simple act of charity, opponents of the guild insist it was a scheme to recruit inexpensive child labor for Thanalan's myriad mines.
#. column 2: Mines mine!<br>Mines all miiiiiiiiine!<br>  - Biggy the Spriggan
#. column 3: On Track
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:96:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Даёт 10 очков особого приёма всем союзникам в радиусе действия, кроме миньонов с таким же приёмом."

#. ja: ミニオン「ナッツイーター」を呼び出す。<br>小さな愛らしいリス。大好物は、ラノシア産のアイアンエーコン
#. de: Du rufst deinen Nussfresser herbei. Komplett mit einem Paar Eicheln.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte écureuil grignoteur. Ce petit rongeur protège jalousement son délicieux gland.
#. column 1: Inspired by the words of Millith Ironheart, this daring squirrel longs to travel the realm in search of the legendary golden acorn, and hopes that trailing in your shadow will ensure that he isn't eaten before he discovers the mother lode.
#. column 2: I had no idea squirrels<br>could bite so hard!<br>  - Arold
#. column 3: Skull Eater
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:97:0:0"
msgid "Summon your nutkin minion. That nutkins are infamous for being shy and timid creatures shows that this brave beastkin comes complete with a pair of iron acorns on him."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — бельчонка. Белки известны своей робостью, но этот смельчак щеголяет парой железных желудей!"

#. ja: 探検家ミリス・アイアンハートが、バイルブランド島を探検していたときに出会ったリス。世界のどこかにあるという、ゴールドエーコンを手に入れるため、各地を放ろうしている。名うての探検家と共に、旅したいようだ
#. de: Inspiriert von den Worten von Milith Ironheart streift dieses Baumhörnchen auf der Suche nach der legendären goldenen Eichel durch die Lande. Wobei seine Über<shy>lebens<shy>chancen deutlich höher sind, wenn es dir hinterhertrottet.
#. fr: L'exploratrice Millith Ironheart a rencontré cet écureuil par hasard au cours d'un voyage dans l'île de Vylbrand. Il rêve de découvrir le gland d'or caché quelque part dans le monde, et espère voyager avec un grand aventurier...
#. column 0: Summon your nutkin minion. That nutkins are infamous for being shy and timid creatures shows that this brave beastkin comes complete with a pair of iron acorns on him.
#. column 2: I had no idea squirrels<br>could bite so hard!<br>  - Arold
#. column 3: Skull Eater
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:97:0:1"
msgid "Inspired by the words of Millith Ironheart, this daring squirrel longs to travel the realm in search of the legendary golden acorn, and hopes that trailing in your shadow will ensure that he isn't eaten before he discovers the mother lode."
msgstr "Вдохновлённая словами путешественницы Миллит Айронхарт, эта отважная белка мечтает объехать весь свет в поисках легендарного золотого желудя. А пока надеется, что рядом с тобой её не съедят раньше, чем она найдёт сокровище."

#. ja: ムキュッ！
#. de: Du hast all meine Bewegungen durchschaut ...<br>Du bist kein gewöhnliches Murmelhörnchen ...<br><i>Hamon</i>
#. fr: Squiiiik<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your nutkin minion. That nutkins are infamous for being shy and timid creatures shows that this brave beastkin comes complete with a pair of iron acorns on him.
#. column 1: Inspired by the words of Millith Ironheart, this daring squirrel longs to travel the realm in search of the legendary golden acorn, and hopes that trailing in your shadow will ensure that he isn't eaten before he discovers the mother lode.
#. column 3: Skull Eater
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:97:0:2"
msgid "I had no idea squirrels<br>could bite so hard!<br>  - Arold"
msgstr "И не думал, что белки<br>так больно кусаются!<br>  — Арольд"

#. ja: ドクロイーター
#. de: Schädelfresser
#. fr: Ronger jusqu'a l'os
#. column 0: Summon your nutkin minion. That nutkins are infamous for being shy and timid creatures shows that this brave beastkin comes complete with a pair of iron acorns on him.
#. column 1: Inspired by the words of Millith Ironheart, this daring squirrel longs to travel the realm in search of the legendary golden acorn, and hopes that trailing in your shadow will ensure that he isn't eaten before he discovers the mother lode.
#. column 2: I had no idea squirrels<br>could bite so hard!<br>  - Arold
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:97:0:3"
msgid "Skull Eater"
msgstr "Грызун черепов"

#. ja: トラップを配置する。10秒後トラップ発動ボタンにより起爆可能。範囲内にいる敵の移動速度を70%低下させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>20秒
#. de: Stellt eine Falle auf, die nach 10 Sekunden ausgelöst werden kann. Bewirkt die Verlangsamung von Gegnern in der Nähe um 70<nbsp>%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 Sekunden
#. fr: Place un piège qui peut être déclenché 10 secondes plus tard.<br>Piège<nbsp>: réduit de 70% la vitesse de déplacement des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. column 0: Summon your nutkin minion. That nutkins are infamous for being shy and timid creatures shows that this brave beastkin comes complete with a pair of iron acorns on him.
#. column 1: Inspired by the words of Millith Ironheart, this daring squirrel longs to travel the realm in search of the legendary golden acorn, and hopes that trailing in your shadow will ensure that he isn't eaten before he discovers the mother lode.
#. column 2: I had no idea squirrels<br>could bite so hard!<br>  - Arold
#. column 3: Skull Eater
