msgctxt "CompanionTransient:97:0:4"
msgid "Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
msgstr "Устанавливает ловушку. Через 10 сек. её можно привести в действие кнопкой активации ловушки. Снижает скорость передвижения врагов в радиусе действия на 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 сек.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Задержка активации:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ミンフィリア」を呼び出す。<br>ミンフィリアを模した魔法人形。こっちは一緒に来てくれる
#. de: Du rufst deine Minfilia-Puppe herbei. Im Gegensatz zur echten Minfilia begleitet sie dich wirklich auf deinen Abenteuern.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Minfilia miniature. Cette poupée ressemble comme deux gouttes d'eau au chef des Héritiers de la Septième Aube.
#. column 1: This clockwork automaton has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. All linkshell privileges have been revoked so one not need dread incessant calls throughout the small hours of night.
#. column 2: ...Hello? Hello? Can you<br>hear me? It is I, Minfilia.<br>  - Minfilia
#. column 3: Hello Hello
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:98:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Minfilia minion. Unlike the real Minfilia, this one actually accompanies you on your adventures."
msgstr "Призвать заводную куклу Минфилии. В отличие от настоящей Минфилии, эта и правда сопровождает тебя в приключениях."

#. ja: 冒険者ギルドが、エオルゼアの新生を祝して用意した魔法人形。協力関係にある組織「暁の血盟」の盟主、ミンフィリアを模している。いつも呼びつけてくるあの人を、思う存分、呼びつけることができると評判だ
#. de: Dieser Uhrwerk-Automat wurde auf Geheiß der Aben<shy>teurer<shy>gilde für die jährliche Feier der Wiedergeburt Eorzeas angefertigt. Man hat ihr die Kontaktkreis-Privilegien entzogen, du brauchst also keine nächtlichen Anrufe fürchten.
#. fr: Cette poupée magique créée par la guilde des aventuriers pour célébrer la renaissance d'Éorzéa s'inspire de la ravissante leader des Héritiers de la Septième Aube. Pour une fois, c'est vous qui la menez par le bout du nez...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Minfilia minion. Unlike the real Minfilia, this one actually accompanies you on your adventures.
#. column 2: ...Hello? Hello? Can you<br>hear me? It is I, Minfilia.<br>  - Minfilia
#. column 3: Hello Hello
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:98:0:1"
msgid "This clockwork automaton has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. All linkshell privileges have been revoked so one not need dread incessant calls throughout the small hours of night."
msgstr "Эту заводную куклу заказала Гильдия искателей приключений к Возрождению — ежегодному празднику обновления Эорзеи. У неё отобрали все права на использование говорящего камня, так что ночные звонки больше не побеспокоят."

#. ja: モシモシ…モシモシ…
#. de: Freut mich sehr! Ich bin Minfilia, die<br>Anführerin des Bundes der Morgenröte.<br><i>Minfilia</i>
#. fr: Allô<nbsp>? Ici Minfilia<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Minfilia minion. Unlike the real Minfilia, this one actually accompanies you on your adventures.
#. column 1: This clockwork automaton has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. All linkshell privileges have been revoked so one not need dread incessant calls throughout the small hours of night.
#. column 3: Hello Hello
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:98:0:2"
msgid "...Hello? Hello? Can you<br>hear me? It is I, Minfilia.<br>  - Minfilia"
msgstr "...Алло? Алло? Ты<br>меня слышишь? Это я, Минфилия.<br>  — Минфилия"

#. ja: モシモシ
#. de: Ich bin's, Minfilia
#. fr: Non, mais allô, quoi<nbsp>!?
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Minfilia minion. Unlike the real Minfilia, this one actually accompanies you on your adventures.
#. column 1: This clockwork automaton has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. All linkshell privileges have been revoked so one not need dread incessant calls throughout the small hours of night.
#. column 2: ...Hello? Hello? Can you<br>hear me? It is I, Minfilia.<br>  - Minfilia
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:98:0:3"
msgid "Hello Hello"
msgstr "Алло-алло"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Minfilia minion. Unlike the real Minfilia, this one actually accompanies you on your adventures.
#. column 1: This clockwork automaton has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. All linkshell privileges have been revoked so one not need dread incessant calls throughout the small hours of night.
#. column 2: ...Hello? Hello? Can you<br>hear me? It is I, Minfilia.<br>  - Minfilia
#. column 3: Hello Hello
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:98:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・サンクレッド」を呼び出す。<br>サンクレッドを模した魔法人形。お上品に戦うのはここまでだ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Thancred-Puppe herbei. 200 % verträumter als frühere Modelle.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Thancred miniature. Ce pantin à l'effigie de Thancred a autant de charme que l'original. Mieux vaut le tenir à l'écart des poupées féminines.
#. column 1: This clockwork automaton has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. Reports of crazed Thancred fans stalking the summoned servitors are more common than one might believe.
#. column 2: I suppose any name is as<br>good as another, though<br>most call me Thancred.<br>  - Thancred
#. column 3: Love, Eventually
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:99:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Thancred minion. 200% more dreamy than previous models."
msgstr "Призвать заводную куклу Танкрада. На 200% мечтательнее предыдущих моделей."

#. ja: 冒険者ギルドが、エオルゼアの新生を祝して用意した魔法人形。協力関係にある組織「暁の血盟」の賢人、サンクレッドを模している。彼に対して淡い恋心を抱く女性や、暗い感情を抱く女性に絶大な人気を誇るという
#. de: Dieser Uhrwerk-Automat wurde auf Geheiß der Aben<shy>teurer<shy>gilde für die jährliche Feier der Wiedergeburt Eorzeas angefertigt. Berichte über Thancred-Fans, die selbst von den Puppen magisch angezogen werden, sind nicht völlig an den Haaren herbeigezogen.
#. fr: Cet automate créé par la guilde des aventuriers pour célébrer la renaissance d'Éorzéa s'inspire du charmant séducteur des Héritiers de la Septième Aube. Les femmes enthousiastes comme furieuses se l'arrachent...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Thancred minion. 200% more dreamy than previous models.
#. column 2: I suppose any name is as<br>good as another, though<br>most call me Thancred.<br>  - Thancred
#. column 3: Love, Eventually
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:99:0:1"
msgid "This clockwork automaton has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. Reports of crazed Thancred fans stalking the summoned servitors are more common than one might believe."
msgstr "Эту заводную куклу заказала Гильдия искателей приключений к Возрождению — ежегодному празднику обновления Эорзеи. Говорят, обезумевшие поклонницы Танкрада выслеживают призванных кукол чаще, чем можно подумать."

#. ja: フッ…
#. de: Unsere Organisation heißt übrigens der „Bund der Morgenröte“<br>und es ist keine Übertreibung, wenn ich sage, dass wir die <i>Guten</i><br>sind!<br><i>Thancred</i>
#. fr: On vous a déjà dit que vous aviez de beaux yeux<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Thancred minion. 200% more dreamy than previous models.
#. column 1: This clockwork automaton has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. Reports of crazed Thancred fans stalking the summoned servitors are more common than one might believe.
#. column 3: Love, Eventually
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:99:0:2"
msgid "I suppose any name is as<br>good as another, though<br>most call me Thancred.<br>  - Thancred"
msgstr "Пожалуй, имя подойдёт любое,<br>хотя большинство зовёт меня<br>Танкредом.<br>  — Танкред"

#. ja: 恋のかけひき
#. de: Herzensbrecher
#. fr: Périls de l'amour
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Thancred minion. 200% more dreamy than previous models.
#. column 1: This clockwork automaton has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. Reports of crazed Thancred fans stalking the summoned servitors are more common than one might believe.
#. column 2: I suppose any name is as<br>good as another, though<br>most call me Thancred.<br>  - Thancred
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:99:0:3"
msgid "Love, Eventually"
msgstr "Любовь не сразу"

