#. ja: ミニオン「魔導ビット自律型」を呼び出す。<br>1/9スケールモデル。アルテマウェポンはついていません
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-Magitek-Drohne herbei. Eine exakte Nachbildung einer mit Erdseim betriebenen Magitek-Drohne im Maßstab 1:9 (Ultima-Waffe-Actionfigur nicht im Lieferumfang enthalten).
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte micro-drone magitek. Échelle 1/9. Ultima Arma fournie séparément.
#. column 1: This miracle of modern mechanics is actually a miracle of ancient Allagan mechanics reverse engineered and then modified with advanced Garlean magitek technology.
#. column 2: The Empire owes<br>its might to magitek.<br>  - Yda
#. column 3: All-range Attack
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:100:0:0"
msgid "Summon your model magitek bit minion. An exact 1:9 scale replica of a ceruleum-powered magitek bit (Ultima Weapon action figure not included)."
msgstr "Призвать модель миньона — магитех-бит. Точная копия магитех-бита на церулеуме в масштабе 1:9 (фигурка Оружия «Альтима» в комплект не входит)."

#. ja: ガレマール帝国軍の無人攻撃端末「魔導ビット」を忠実に再現した最高の玩具。アラグ帝国製の無人兵器を高い魔導技術により、リバースエンジニアリングしたンだぜ。お前の技術より、優れてンだろ？ガーロンドォ……
#. de: Dieses Wunder moderner Mechanik ist eigentlich ein Wunder antiker allagischer Technik, die man rekonstruiert und dann mit garleischer Magitek-Technologie verfeinert hat.
#. fr: Cette version miniature du drone magitek garlemaldais reproduit ses moindres détails à la perfection. Ce drone est la preuve que les scien<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>ques de l'Empire sont les seuls à avoir percé les mystères de la technologie allagoise.
#. column 0: Summon your model magitek bit minion. An exact 1:9 scale replica of a ceruleum-powered magitek bit (Ultima Weapon action figure not included).
#. column 2: The Empire owes<br>its might to magitek.<br>  - Yda
#. column 3: All-range Attack
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:100:0:1"
msgid "This miracle of modern mechanics is actually a miracle of ancient Allagan mechanics reverse engineered and then modified with advanced Garlean magitek technology."
msgstr "Это чудо современной механики на самом деле — чудо древней аллаганской инженерии, восстановленное по обратному образцу и усовершенствованное передовыми магитех-технологиями Гарлемальда."

#. ja: パタパタパタ…
#. de: Vorwärts, Magitek-Frontbrecher!<br>Demonstriere diesen Würmern<br>unsere Überlegenheit.<br><i>Garleischer Centurio</i>
#. fr: Bzzzzz...
#. column 0: Summon your model magitek bit minion. An exact 1:9 scale replica of a ceruleum-powered magitek bit (Ultima Weapon action figure not included).
#. column 1: This miracle of modern mechanics is actually a miracle of ancient Allagan mechanics reverse engineered and then modified with advanced Garlean magitek technology.
#. column 3: All-range Attack
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:100:0:2"
msgid "The Empire owes<br>its might to magitek.<br>  - Yda"
msgstr "Сила Империи — в<br>магитеке.<br>  — Ида"

#. ja: オールレンジアタック
#. de: Totalattacke
#. fr: Attaque totale
#. column 0: Summon your model magitek bit minion. An exact 1:9 scale replica of a ceruleum-powered magitek bit (Ultima Weapon action figure not included).
#. column 1: This miracle of modern mechanics is actually a miracle of ancient Allagan mechanics reverse engineered and then modified with advanced Garlean magitek technology.
#. column 2: The Empire owes<br>its might to magitek.<br>  - Yda
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:100:0:3"
msgid "All-range Attack"
msgstr "Атака по всем направлениям"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your model magitek bit minion. An exact 1:9 scale replica of a ceruleum-powered magitek bit (Ultima Weapon action figure not included).
#. column 1: This miracle of modern mechanics is actually a miracle of ancient Allagan mechanics reverse engineered and then modified with advanced Garlean magitek technology.
#. column 2: The Empire owes<br>its might to magitek.<br>  - Yda
