#. ja: ミニオン「タイニーナンカ」を呼び出す。<br>ニンキ・ナンカの幼獣。油断していると、すぐ増える
#. de: Du rufst deine Ninki Nanka-Puppe herbei. Genau wie seine Eltern wird sich dieses schuppige Wesen rasant fortpflanzen, wenn man es unbeaufsichtigt lässt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte nanka narquois. Même s'il a l'air inoffensif de prime abord, ce petit nanka pourrait pondre des œufs et provoquer une invasion...
#. column 1: Instead of laying her eggs in a pond or river where they might be devoured by predators, the ninki nanka female deposits her offspring upon the back of the father, who then carries and protects the brood until it is ready to face the world on its own. Unless, however, one falls off.
#. column 2: Shiiiiiiny! Preeeeeetty!<br>Need more eeeeeeggs!<br>Eeeeeeggs!<br>  - Giggity the Spriggan
#. column 3: Ninki Nonka
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:102:0:0"
msgid "Summon your naughty nanka minion. Like its parent, the ninki nanka, this slippery wavekin will breed like a rabbit if left unsupervised."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — озорного нанку. Как и его родитель, нинкинанка, этот скользкий водный зверёк размножается как кролик, если за ним не следить."

#. ja: 産卵した卵を背負って育てる奇妙な両生類、ニンキ・ナンカの幼獣。親獣の背の上でまどろんでいたところ、ポロリと落ちて取り残されてしまった。仕方がないので、エサをくれる新しい保護者を探していたようだ
#. de: Anstatt ihre Eier in einem Teich oder Fluss abzulegen, wo sie leicht anderen wilden Tieren zum Opfer fallen könnten, lagert das Ninki Nanka-Weibchen diese auf dem Rücken des Vaters, der sie trägt und beschützt, bis der Nachwuchs schlüpft. Sofern er nicht vorher runterfällt ...
#. fr: Le ninki nanka a pour curieuse habitude de couver ses œufs sur son dos, en y gardant ses petits jusqu'au sevrage. Apparemment, ce bébé a eu le malheur de tomber en chemin. Vous allez devoir veiller sur lui et l'élever.
#. column 0: Summon your naughty nanka minion. Like its parent, the ninki nanka, this slippery wavekin will breed like a rabbit if left unsupervised.
#. column 2: Shiiiiiiny! Preeeeeetty!<br>Need more eeeeeeggs!<br>Eeeeeeggs!<br>  - Giggity the Spriggan
#. column 3: Ninki Nonka
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:102:0:1"
msgid "Instead of laying her eggs in a pond or river where they might be devoured by predators, the ninki nanka female deposits her offspring upon the back of the father, who then carries and protects the brood until it is ready to face the world on its own. Unless, however, one falls off."
msgstr "Самка нинкинанки откладывает яйца не в пруду или реке, где их могут съесть хищники, а на спину самца. Тот носит и оберегает потомство, пока оно не будет готово к самостоятельной жизни. Если, конечно, кто-нибудь не свалится."

#. ja: モサモサモサ…
#. de: Eierstich und Dottergelb! Ei, viele Eier, mehr Eier, alle Eier!<br>Wundereierbar!<br><i>Gigitty, der Spriggan</i>
#. fr: Msah msah<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your naughty nanka minion. Like its parent, the ninki nanka, this slippery wavekin will breed like a rabbit if left unsupervised.
#. column 1: Instead of laying her eggs in a pond or river where they might be devoured by predators, the ninki nanka female deposits her offspring upon the back of the father, who then carries and protects the brood until it is ready to face the world on its own. Unless, however, one falls off.
#. column 3: Ninki Nonka
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:102:0:2"
msgid "Shiiiiiiny! Preeeeeetty!<br>Need more eeeeeeggs!<br>Eeeeeeggs!<br>  - Giggity the Spriggan"
msgstr "Бле-е-е-стит! Красота-а-а!<br>Нужно ещё я-я-яиц!<br>Яи-и-ица!<br>  — Гиггити, спригган"

#. ja: ナンカの人気
#. de: Ninki-Stänker
#. fr: En-cas nanka
#. column 0: Summon your naughty nanka minion. Like its parent, the ninki nanka, this slippery wavekin will breed like a rabbit if left unsupervised.
#. column 1: Instead of laying her eggs in a pond or river where they might be devoured by predators, the ninki nanka female deposits her offspring upon the back of the father, who then carries and protects the brood until it is ready to face the world on its own. Unless, however, one falls off.
