#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・パンダ」を呼び出す。<br>東方の珍獣パンダを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst dein Panda-Stofftier herbei. Angenehm weich und exotisch zugleich.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petit panda pataud. Ce bébé panda est originaire du continent oriental d'Othard.
#. column 1: So popular are pandas in the Far East, that there are tales of the creatures being promoted to powerful positions within local governmental agencies. This particular mechanical reproduction is thought to have been brought to Eorzea by a Doman wise man.
#. column 2: Beings held as gods also<br>exist in what you call the<br>Far East.<br>  - Yugiri
#. column 3: Tasty History
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:103:0:0"
msgid "Summon your panda cub minion. Untrained in arts both martial and magical, but as scrumptiously adorable as chicken glazed in a tangy orange reduction."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — детёныша панды. Боевых и магических искусств не знает, зато так же аппетитно мил, как курица под кисло-сладким апельсиновым соусом."

#. ja: 旅の老師が東方ゆかりの贈物として持ってきた魔法人形。東州「オサード小大陸」の辺境に棲まうという珍獣、パンダを模したもののようだ。実際は獰猛な獣らしいが、非常に愛らしい姿で人々を魅了して止まない
#. de: Im Fernen Osten sollen Pandas so beliebt sein, dass sie angeblich sogar Positionen in der Regierung einnehmen. Andererseits gibt es auch Berichte, sie seien ganz im Gegensatz zu ihrem Aussehen wild und unbändig.
#. fr: Une adorable peluche rapportée d'Orient par un vieux voyageur, inspirée de l'animal rare qui vit dans les régions frontalières du continent d'Othard. Les Éorzéens sont tombés sous son charme, mais attention car il s'agit en fait d'une créature féroce<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your panda cub minion. Untrained in arts both martial and magical, but as scrumptiously adorable as chicken glazed in a tangy orange reduction.
#. column 2: Beings held as gods also<br>exist in what you call the<br>Far East.<br>  - Yugiri
#. column 3: Tasty History
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:103:0:1"
msgid "So popular are pandas in the Far East, that there are tales of the creatures being promoted to powerful positions within local governmental agencies. This particular mechanical reproduction is thought to have been brought to Eorzea by a Doman wise man."
msgstr "На Дальнем Востоке панды так популярны, что поговаривают, будто им даже доверяют важные посты в местных ведомствах. Считается, что эту механическую копию привёз в Эорзею доманский мудрец."

#. ja: ア～ウ、ア～ウ！
#. de: Auch im Fernen Osten, wie ihr es nennt, gibt es<br>Lebewesen, die wie Götter verehrt werden.<br><i>Yugiri</i>
#. fr: Mnyuh mnyuh...
#. column 0: Summon your panda cub minion. Untrained in arts both martial and magical, but as scrumptiously adorable as chicken glazed in a tangy orange reduction.
#. column 1: So popular are pandas in the Far East, that there are tales of the creatures being promoted to powerful positions within local governmental agencies. This particular mechanical reproduction is thought to have been brought to Eorzea by a Doman wise man.
#. column 3: Tasty History
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:103:0:2"
msgid "Beings held as gods also<br>exist in what you call the<br>Far East.<br>  - Yugiri"
msgstr "Среди тех, кого вы называете<br>Дальним Востоком, тоже есть<br>существа, которым поклоняются как богам.<br>  — Югири"

#. ja: 野生の知恵
#. de: Bambusgrube
#. fr: Guet-a-panda
#. column 0: Summon your panda cub minion. Untrained in arts both martial and magical, but as scrumptiously adorable as chicken glazed in a tangy orange reduction.
#. column 1: So popular are pandas in the Far East, that there are tales of the creatures being promoted to powerful positions within local governmental agencies. This particular mechanical reproduction is thought to have been brought to Eorzea by a Doman wise man.
