msgstr "Повышает скорость передвижения всех союзников в радиусе действия на 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・スノーマン」を呼び出す。<br>雪だるまを模した魔法人形。サヨナラナノダ……
#. de: Du rufst deinen Zuckerschneemann herbei. Dank karamelisiertem Überzug eignet sich dieser wohlerzogene Begleiter auch für Spaziergänge durch Thanalan.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé bonhomme de neige. Ce pantin a tendance à fondre au soleil, comme l'original.
#. column 1: While no one knows the exact origins of Hoary the Snowman and the legends surrounding this animated mass of ice and snow, the gifting of dolls created in his likeness to good girls and boys is not uncommon during the Starlight Celebration.
#. column 2: On your feet, Hoary!<br>  - Coultenet
#. column 3: Thumpety Thump
#. column 4: Grants action party the ability to deal extra damage to Arcana Stones.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:105:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Hoary the Snowman minion. Hoary the Snowman was a jolly happy soul, without a pipe, and without a nose, and two eyes made out of something other than coal. Probably slag."
msgstr "Призовите миньона Снежка. Снежок был весёлой снежной душой: без трубки, без носа, с двумя угольками вместо глаз. Хотя, скорее всего, это был шлак."

#. ja: 雪だるまを模した魔法人形。星芒祭の開催にあたって、プレゼントとして子どもたちに配るために、匿名の「白いお髭の紳士様」が作った品らしい。冷たいものが大好きで、雪玉を投げつけると喜ぶようだ
#. de: Ein rauschbärtiger Wohltäter konstruierte diese putzige Marionette in Zusammenarbeit mit Eorzeas Zuckerbäckern, um den Kindern zum Sternenlichtfest eine Freude zu bereiten. Angeblich freut sich der Schneemann, wenn man ihn ordentlich mit Schneebällen einseift.
#. fr: Un gentilhomme à la chevelure opaline aurait fabriqué cette créature afin de l'offrir à des enfants lors de la fête des étoiles. Inconditionnelle du froid, elle aime qu'on lui jette des boules de neige au visage.
#. column 0: Summon your Hoary the Snowman minion. Hoary the Snowman was a jolly happy soul, without a pipe, and without a nose, and two eyes made out of something other than coal. Probably slag.
#. column 2: On your feet, Hoary!<br>  - Coultenet
#. column 3: Thumpety Thump
#. column 4: Grants action party the ability to deal extra damage to Arcana Stones.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:105:0:1"
msgid "While no one knows the exact origins of Hoary the Snowman and the legends surrounding this animated mass of ice and snow, the gifting of dolls created in his likeness to good girls and boys is not uncommon during the Starlight Celebration."
msgstr "Никто не знает, откуда взялся Снежок и какие легенды связаны с этой ожившей глыбой льда и снега. Но на Звёздном празднике детям нередко дарят кукол, сделанных по его образу."

#. ja: サヨナラナノダ…
#. de: Gut zielen, kräftiger werfen und niemals ducken.<br>Ducken ist was für Warmbader.<br><i>Die Kunst der Schneeballschlacht</i>
#. fr: Adieu...
#. column 0: Summon your Hoary the Snowman minion. Hoary the Snowman was a jolly happy soul, without a pipe, and without a nose, and two eyes made out of something other than coal. Probably slag.
#. column 1: While no one knows the exact origins of Hoary the Snowman and the legends surrounding this animated mass of ice and snow, the gifting of dolls created in his likeness to good girls and boys is not uncommon during the Starlight Celebration.
#. column 3: Thumpety Thump
#. column 4: Grants action party the ability to deal extra damage to Arcana Stones.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:105:0:2"
msgid "On your feet, Hoary!<br>  - Coultenet"
msgstr "Вставай, Снежок!<br>  — Култене"

#. ja: さよならなのだ
#. de: Schmelzwasser
#. fr: Érosion glaciaire
