#. ja: ミニオン「ポチャチョコボ」を呼び出す。<br>ポチャポチャしているチョコボの子
#. de: Du rufst dein Chocopummelchen herbei. Noch kann sich dieses Küken mit Babyspeck herausreden, aber das wird nicht ewig funktionieren.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé chocobo grassouillet. Ce jeune volatile a un gros appétit et ne fait pas beaucoup d'exercice.
#. column 1: It would be foolish to believe that a chocobo could achieve this size dining on greens alone, regardless of how many hundreds of bushels were devoured...in a single sitting. Chicken bones found beneath the chick's bedding suggest he may have a taste for his succulent cousins.
#. column 2: I cannot deny what you say is<br>true any more than I can deny<br>a chocobo's arse is yellow.<br>  - Path Companion
#. column 3: Insatiable
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:106:0:0"
msgid "Summon your heavy hatchling minion. Currently, “baby fat” is the prevailing excuse for this cherubic chick's gigant-like girth."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — пухлого птенца. Пока что его необъятные размеры объясняют «детским жирком»."

#. ja: ポチャポチャしているチョコボの子。異常なほど食欲旺盛で、食べ物の匂いには敏感。いつか、武器や防具まで食べられるようになるのが夢らしい
#. de: Es wäre naiv zu glauben, dass allein der Verzehr von Gizar-Kraut für ein solches Kampfgewicht sorgt. Behemoth-Knochen unter dem Nest dieses Kükens lassen vermuten, dass es auch proteinreicher Nahrung nicht abgeneigt ist.
#. fr: Ce bébé chocobo est capable d'engloutir des tonz de nourriture et de flairer un mets à des yalms à la ronde. Il se laisse guider par n'importe quel fumet et rêve de croquer un jour une armure ou un bouclier.
#. column 0: Summon your heavy hatchling minion. Currently, “baby fat” is the prevailing excuse for this cherubic chick's gigant-like girth.
#. column 2: I cannot deny what you say is<br>true any more than I can deny<br>a chocobo's arse is yellow.<br>  - Path Companion
#. column 3: Insatiable
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:106:0:1"
msgid "It would be foolish to believe that a chocobo could achieve this size dining on greens alone, regardless of how many hundreds of bushels were devoured...in a single sitting. Chicken bones found beneath the chick's bedding suggest he may have a taste for his succulent cousins."
msgstr "Глупо думать, будто чокобо может так растолстеть, питаясь одними травами, сколько бы сотен охапок он ни съедал за раз... Под подстилкой птенца нашли куриные кости — похоже, он не прочь полакомиться сочными сородичами."

#. ja: よーお！
#. de: Wenn ich groß bin,<br>werd ich ein Moppel!<br><i>Chocopummelchen</i>
#. fr: Pyoh, pyoh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your heavy hatchling minion. Currently, “baby fat” is the prevailing excuse for this cherubic chick's gigant-like girth.
#. column 1: It would be foolish to believe that a chocobo could achieve this size dining on greens alone, regardless of how many hundreds of bushels were devoured...in a single sitting. Chicken bones found beneath the chick's bedding suggest he may have a taste for his succulent cousins.
#. column 3: Insatiable
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:106:0:2"
msgid "I cannot deny what you say is<br>true any more than I can deny<br>a chocobo's arse is yellow.<br>  - Path Companion"
msgstr "Не могу отрицать, что ты прав,<br>так же как не стану отрицать,<br>что у чокобо жёлтый зад.<br>  — Спутник с тракта"

