#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・イダ」を呼び出す。<br>イダを模した魔法人形。うっしゃ、気合いーッ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Yda-Puppe herbei. Mit unabnehmbarer Maske und unerschütterlichem Optimismus.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Yda miniature. Elle ressemble tellement à l'originale qu'elle donne l'impression d'être prête à se battre à tout moment.
#. column 1: Due to her apparent lack of wit and tendency to be in the wrong place at the wrong time, people are quick to forget that Yda is not only a Scion of the Seventh Dawn, but also an Archon of the Circle of Knowing, handpicked by the legendary Louisoix to serve Eorzea.
#. column 2: The great beyond!<br>I do believe we're<br>dead, Papalymo.<br>   - Yda
#. column 3: Final Hell
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:107:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Yda minion. Comes complete with irremovable mask."
msgstr "Призовите заводного миньона Иды. Маска не снимается."

#. ja: 「暁の血盟」の賢人、イダを模した魔法人形。暁の金庫番、タタル嬢の発注により、ウルダハの彫金師ギルドで製作された。仮面の下まで精巧に作られているようだが、どうやっても仮面を剥がすことができない……
#. de: Ydas oft mangelnde Geistesgegenwart und ihr Talent, Schwie<shy>rig<shy>keiten anzuziehen, lässt einen oft vergessen, dass sie nicht nur dem Bund der Morgenröte angehört, sondern auch vom großen Louisoix selbst zum Mitglied der Exegeten gemacht wurde.
#. fr: C'est Tataru, la trésorière des Héritiers de la Septième Aube, qui a eu l'idée de commander cette poupée re<shy>pré<shy>sen<shy>tant Yda et dont le masque est très réaliste... mais ne semble pas amovible.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Yda minion. Comes complete with irremovable mask.
#. column 2: The great beyond!<br>I do believe we're<br>dead, Papalymo.<br>   - Yda
#. column 3: Final Hell
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:107:0:1"
msgid "Due to her apparent lack of wit and tendency to be in the wrong place at the wrong time, people are quick to forget that Yda is not only a Scion of the Seventh Dawn, but also an Archon of the Circle of Knowing, handpicked by the legendary Louisoix to serve Eorzea."
msgstr "Из-за своей кажущейся недалёкости и привычки попадать не туда и не вовремя Ида нередко даёт людям забыть, что она не только член «Седьмого рассвета», но и аркона Круга Знаний, которую сам легендарный Луизуа избрал на службу Эорзее."

#. ja: ウッシャーッ！
#. de: Das Jenseits!<br>Ich glaube, wir sind gestorben, Papalymo!<br><i>Yda</i>
#. fr: Yaaah<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Yda minion. Comes complete with irremovable mask.
#. column 1: Due to her apparent lack of wit and tendency to be in the wrong place at the wrong time, people are quick to forget that Yda is not only a Scion of the Seventh Dawn, but also an Archon of the Circle of Knowing, handpicked by the legendary Louisoix to serve Eorzea.
#. column 3: Final Hell
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:107:0:2"
msgid "The great beyond!<br>I do believe we're<br>dead, Papalymo.<br>   - Yda"
msgstr "Загробный мир!<br>Кажется, мы умерли,<br>Папалимо.<br>   — Ида"

#. ja: ファイナルヘル
#. de: Endgültiges Jenseits
#. fr: Ultime enfer
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Yda minion. Comes complete with irremovable mask.
#. column 1: Due to her apparent lack of wit and tendency to be in the wrong place at the wrong time, people are quick to forget that Yda is not only a Scion of the Seventh Dawn, but also an Archon of the Circle of Knowing, handpicked by the legendary Louisoix to serve Eorzea.
#. column 2: The great beyond!<br>I do believe we're<br>dead, Papalymo.<br>   - Yda
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:107:0:3"
msgid "Final Hell"
msgstr "Последний ад"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Yda minion. Comes complete with irremovable mask.
#. column 1: Due to her apparent lack of wit and tendency to be in the wrong place at the wrong time, people are quick to forget that Yda is not only a Scion of the Seventh Dawn, but also an Archon of the Circle of Knowing, handpicked by the legendary Louisoix to serve Eorzea.
#. column 2: The great beyond!<br>I do believe we're<br>dead, Papalymo.<br>   - Yda
#. column 3: Final Hell
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:107:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・パパリモ」を呼び出す。<br>パパリモを模した魔法人形。やれやれ……
#. de: Du rufst deine Papalymo-Puppe herbei. Stets mit einem überlegenen Lächeln auf den Lippen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Papalymo miniature. Ce petit pantin pourrait presque passer pour le vrai, mais il lui manque la parole.
#. column 1: After a clerical error resulted in a sizable windfall for the organization, Scions of the Seventh Dawn coinkeeper Tataru took it upon herself to use the funds to commission wind-up automata crafted in the likeness of her own favorite members─Papalymo being the first.
#. column 2: He'd sooner swallow<br>his staff than admit<br>that he's wrong.<br>   - Yda
#. column 3: Sparkler
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:108:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Papalymo minion. Comes complete with irremovable smirk."
msgstr "Призовите заводного миньона Папалимо. Улыбка с лица не сходит."

#. ja: 「暁の血盟」の賢人、パパリモを模した魔法人形。暁の金庫番、タタル嬢の発注により、ウルダハの彫金師ギルドで製作された。実に愛らしい姿をしているが、モデルのパパリモは、こう見えて40代なのである
#. de: Als unverhofft eine größere Menge Gil in die Kasse des Bunds der Morgenröte gespült wurde, nutzte Tataru die Gunst der Stunde, um bei der Gold<shy>schmiede<shy>gilde in Ul'dah Puppen ihrer Lieblings-Exegeten in Auftrag zu geben, zuallererst die Puppe von Papalymo.
#. fr: C'est Tataru, la trésorière des Héritiers de la Septième Aube, qui a eu l'idée de commander ce pantin re<shy>pré<shy>sen<shy>tant Papalymo... qui au moins ne va faire la leçon à personne.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Papalymo minion. Comes complete with irremovable smirk.
#. column 2: He'd sooner swallow<br>his staff than admit<br>that he's wrong.<br>   - Yda
#. column 3: Sparkler
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:108:0:1"
msgid "After a clerical error resulted in a sizable windfall for the organization, Scions of the Seventh Dawn coinkeeper Tataru took it upon herself to use the funds to commission wind-up automata crafted in the likeness of her own favorite members─Papalymo being the first."
msgstr "Из-за бухгалтерской ошибки организация неожиданно получила крупную сумму. Казначей «Седьмого рассвета» Татару решила потратить её на заводные куклы в образе любимых членов союза. Первым стал Папалимо."

#. ja: ヤレヤレ…
#. de: Der kleine Dickschädel würde eher seinen Stab fressen,<br>als einen eigenen Fehler einzugestehen!<br><i>Yda</i>
#. fr: C'est bien ce que je pensais.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Papalymo minion. Comes complete with irremovable smirk.
#. column 1: After a clerical error resulted in a sizable windfall for the organization, Scions of the Seventh Dawn coinkeeper Tataru took it upon herself to use the funds to commission wind-up automata crafted in the likeness of her own favorite members─Papalymo being the first.
#. column 3: Sparkler
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:108:0:2"
msgid "He'd sooner swallow<br>his staff than admit<br>that he's wrong.<br>   - Yda"
msgstr "Он скорее проглотит<br>свой посох, чем признает,<br>что ошибся.<br>   — Ида"

#. ja: プチサンダー
#. de: Pikoblitz
#. fr: Petite foudre
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Papalymo minion. Comes complete with irremovable smirk.
#. column 1: After a clerical error resulted in a sizable windfall for the organization, Scions of the Seventh Dawn coinkeeper Tataru took it upon herself to use the funds to commission wind-up automata crafted in the likeness of her own favorite members─Papalymo being the first.
