msgid "Sparkler"
msgstr "Бенгальский огонь"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、1秒ごとに10の継続ダメージを与える。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>20秒
#. de: Fügt Gegnern in der Nähe im Sekundentakt 10 Schaden über Zeit zu.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 Sekunden
#. fr: Inflige 10 points de dégâts périodiques par seconde aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Papalymo minion. Comes complete with irremovable smirk.
#. column 1: After a clerical error resulted in a sizable windfall for the organization, Scions of the Seventh Dawn coinkeeper Tataru took it upon herself to use the funds to commission wind-up automata crafted in the likeness of her own favorite members─Papalymo being the first.
#. column 2: He'd sooner swallow<br>his staff than admit<br>that he's wrong.<br>   - Yda
#. column 3: Sparkler
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 505> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 505 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:108:0:4"
msgid "Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s"
msgstr "Каждую секунду наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия 10 ед. периодического урона.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ウリエンジェ」を呼び出す。<br>ウリエンジェを模した魔法人形。<br>月明輝けども　必ずや暁迎えん……
#. de: Du rufst deine Urianger-Puppe herbei. Folgt deinem Ruf so gewiss, wie die Dämmerung am Morgen kommt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Urianger miniature. Ce pantin à l'effigie du sage des Héritiers a un air tout aussi énigmatique que l'original.
#. column 1: After commissioning several other wind-up Archons, the Scions of the Seventh Dawn coinkeeper realized that she had almost enough gil to order a seventh...almost. And so the robed and hooded Urianger was crafted without hair or other anatomical features to keep the cost down.
#. column 2: Frustratingly, Urianger's<br>words leave rather a lot<br>to interpretation.<br>   - Papalymo
#. column 3: Big Words
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:109:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Urianger minion. When the senary moon did wane, there sounded a garrulous and convoluted monologue. A new minion had roused, one whose identity lieth within our ken."
msgstr "Призовите заводного миньона Урианже. Когда шестая луна пошла на убыль, прозвучал многословный и запутанный монолог. Так пробудился новый миньон — тот, чьё имя нам ведомо."

#. ja: 「暁の血盟」の賢人、ウリエンジェを模した魔法人形。暁の金庫番、タタル嬢の発注により、ウルダハの彫金師ギルドで製作された。モデルのウリエンジェが決してフードを脱ごうとしなかったため、頭髪は再現されていない
#. de: Nachdem Tataru bereits sechs andere Puppen der Exegeten in Auftrag gegeben hatte, ging ihr langsam das Geld aus, sodass bei Uriangers Puppe gespart werden musste.
#. fr: Tataru a eu l'étrange idée de commander cet automate re<shy>pré<shy>sen<shy>tant Urianger. D'ailleurs, pour des raisons obscures, ce dernier n'ayant pas voulu retirer sa capuche, ses cheveux ne sont pas reproduits.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Urianger minion. When the senary moon did wane, there sounded a garrulous and convoluted monologue. A new minion had roused, one whose identity lieth within our ken.
#. column 2: Frustratingly, Urianger's<br>words leave rather a lot<br>to interpretation.<br>   - Papalymo
#. column 3: Big Words
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:109:0:1"
msgid "After commissioning several other wind-up Archons, the Scions of the Seventh Dawn coinkeeper realized that she had almost enough gil to order a seventh...almost. And so the robed and hooded Urianger was crafted without hair or other anatomical features to keep the cost down."
msgstr "Заказав несколько заводных кукол арконов, казначей «Седьмого рассвета» поняла, что гила хватит ещё почти на одну. Поэтому Урианже в мантии и капюшоне достался самый скромный вариант: без волос и прочих анатомических подробностей."

#. ja: 必ズヤ、暁迎エン…
#. de: Uriangers Ausführungen lassen immer<br>so schrecklich viel Raum für Spekulationen!<br><i>Papalymo</i>
#. fr: L'aube toujours resplendit...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Urianger minion. When the senary moon did wane, there sounded a garrulous and convoluted monologue. A new minion had roused, one whose identity lieth within our ken.
#. column 1: After commissioning several other wind-up Archons, the Scions of the Seventh Dawn coinkeeper realized that she had almost enough gil to order a seventh...almost. And so the robed and hooded Urianger was crafted without hair or other anatomical features to keep the cost down.
#. column 3: Big Words
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:109:0:2"
msgid "Frustratingly, Urianger's<br>words leave rather a lot<br>to interpretation.<br>   - Papalymo"
msgstr "Как же раздражает, что<br>слова Урианже можно<br>толковать как угодно!<br>   — Папалимо"

#. ja: 預言詩入門講座
#. de: Prophezeiung
#. fr: Prophétie accomplie
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Urianger minion. When the senary moon did wane, there sounded a garrulous and convoluted monologue. A new minion had roused, one whose identity lieth within our ken.
#. column 1: After commissioning several other wind-up Archons, the Scions of the Seventh Dawn coinkeeper realized that she had almost enough gil to order a seventh...almost. And so the robed and hooded Urianger was crafted without hair or other anatomical features to keep the cost down.
#. column 2: Frustratingly, Urianger's<br>words leave rather a lot<br>to interpretation.<br>   - Papalymo
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
