msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 90."

#. ja: ミニオン「ファットキャット」を呼び出す。<br>おでぶな子猫。意外と素早い
#. de: Du rufst deine dicke Katze herbei. Trotz überzeugender Studien von Spitzenwissenschaftlern aus ganz Eorzea weigern sich die meisten Miqo'te-Gelehrten, an die Theorie zu glauben, ihr Volk könnte von Katzen abstammen (egal ob dick oder nicht).
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte gros minou. Ce chaton a pas mal d'embonpoint, mais sait se déplacer rapidement.
#. column 1: Born in an unmarked alley in an unnamed town, this poor creature had to hunt the mean streets just to stay alive...until learning that following retainers and feeding off the slaughter left in their wakes was a safer, easier way to a full belly.
#. column 2: When the master's away,<br>the cat will play.<br>  - Miqo'te Retainer
#. column 3: Perfect Purr
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:110:0:0"
msgid "Summon your fat cat minion. Despite convincing research by top academics from around the realm and beyond, most Miqo'te scholars refuse to believe that there may be some ancestral connection between their race and cats (fat or not)."
msgstr "Призовите миньона Толстый кот. Несмотря на убедительные исследования учёных со всего света, большинство учёных-мико'те отказывается верить, что их народ может приходиться кошкам роднёй. Хоть толстым, хоть худым."

#. ja: 小太りな愛らしい子猫。元々は、都市の裏通りに棲んでいた野良猫らしい。リテイナーが仕事帰りに会う度に、余った雑魚をあげていたところ、懐いたとのこと。餌付けの効果により忠誠心が高いが、体重も重くなっている
#. de: Geboren in einer namenlosen Straße einer namen-<br>losen Stadt, musste sich dieses be<shy>mit<shy>leidens<shy>werte Kätzchen lange Zeit in Gossenkämpfen behaupten. Bis es herausfand, dass Gehilfen auf ihren Streifzügen ziemlich viel Essbares zurücklassen.
#. fr: Ce chat, aussi enrobé que mignon, vagabondait autrefois dans les cités. Un servant l'apprivoisa en lui offrant des restes de poisson dès qu'il croisait sa route en rentrant du travail. Sa loyauté n'a d'égale que son adiposité.
#. column 0: Summon your fat cat minion. Despite convincing research by top academics from around the realm and beyond, most Miqo'te scholars refuse to believe that there may be some ancestral connection between their race and cats (fat or not).
#. column 2: When the master's away,<br>the cat will play.<br>  - Miqo'te Retainer
#. column 3: Perfect Purr
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:110:0:1"
msgid "Born in an unmarked alley in an unnamed town, this poor creature had to hunt the mean streets just to stay alive...until learning that following retainers and feeding off the slaughter left in their wakes was a safer, easier way to a full belly."
msgstr "Родившись в безымянном переулке безымянного города, это бедное создание вынуждено было охотиться на жестоких улицах, чтобы выжить... Пока не поняло, что куда проще и безопаснее идти за слугами и подбирать оставшиеся после них объедки."

#. ja: ブニャー！
#. de: Pass auf! Das Kätzchen plant etwas.<br><i>Aldis Nald-Klinge</i>
#. fr: Meuh...iaou<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your fat cat minion. Despite convincing research by top academics from around the realm and beyond, most Miqo'te scholars refuse to believe that there may be some ancestral connection between their race and cats (fat or not).
#. column 1: Born in an unmarked alley in an unnamed town, this poor creature had to hunt the mean streets just to stay alive...until learning that following retainers and feeding off the slaughter left in their wakes was a safer, easier way to a full belly.
#. column 3: Perfect Purr
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:110:0:2"
msgid "When the master's away,<br>the cat will play.<br>  - Miqo'te Retainer"
msgstr "Когда хозяина нет,<br>кот развлекается.<br>  — Слуга-мико'те"

#. ja: 肥える力
#. de: Fettpolster
#. fr: Embonpoint
#. column 0: Summon your fat cat minion. Despite convincing research by top academics from around the realm and beyond, most Miqo'te scholars refuse to believe that there may be some ancestral connection between their race and cats (fat or not).
#. column 1: Born in an unmarked alley in an unnamed town, this poor creature had to hunt the mean streets just to stay alive...until learning that following retainers and feeding off the slaughter left in their wakes was a safer, easier way to a full belly.
