#. ja: ミニオン「リトルフット」を呼び出す。<br>イエティの幼獣。その足跡は小さい
#. de: Du rufst deinen Kleinfuß herbei. Dieser niedliche Yeti hat erkannt, dass größer nicht immer gleich besser ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petit yéti. Il s'agit d'une version miniature de l'abominable homme des neiges... en moins abominable.
#. column 1: When discovered by your retainer on a foray deep into the highlands of Coerthas, this miniature monstrosity was both cold and hungry (though the former condition most likely did not affect him much), and a bowl of hot broth was all it took to lure him from the forest back home.
#. column 2: It is good to see you<br>on your feet again.<br>  - Merlwyb Bloefhiswyn
#. column 3: Absolute Zero
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:111:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Littlefoot minion. This particular yeti is content in knowing that bigger is not always necessarily better."
msgstr "Призовите миньона Маленькая лапка. Этот йети знает: большое не всегда лучше."

#. ja: イエティの幼獣。珍しい山菜を探し求めていたリテイナーが、クルザスの山奥にて発見。周囲に親獣の姿はなく、腹を空かせて弱っていたため、手持ちのお弁当をあげたところ懐いたのだという。その足跡は、まだまだ小さい
#. de: Als dein Gehilfe dieses Wesen tief im Hochland von Coerthas fand, war ihm kalt und es hatte Hunger (wenn auch Ersteres ihm kaum etwas ausgemacht haben dürfte). Ein Teller Suppe reichte aus, um es nach Hause zu locken.
#. fr: Un servant à la recherche de plantes rares découvrit cette créature, seule et affaiblie, dans les hauteurs du Coerthas. Il lui donna à manger<nbsp>; elle lui emboîta le pas avec ses petites pattes.
#. column 0: Summon your Littlefoot minion. This particular yeti is content in knowing that bigger is not always necessarily better.
#. column 2: It is good to see you<br>on your feet again.<br>  - Merlwyb Bloefhiswyn
#. column 3: Absolute Zero
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:111:0:1"
msgid "When discovered by your retainer on a foray deep into the highlands of Coerthas, this miniature monstrosity was both cold and hungry (though the former condition most likely did not affect him much), and a bowl of hot broth was all it took to lure him from the forest back home."
msgstr "Слуга нашёл этого крошечного монстра во время вылазки в глубь гор Керса. Тот замёрз и проголодался (хотя холод его, скорее всего, мало беспокоил), а тарелки горячего бульона хватило, чтобы выманить его из леса и увести домой."

#. ja: イェーイ！
#. de: Mit schönen Grüßen<br>von meinen Füßen.<br><i>Unbekannter Mönch</i>
#. fr: Yéééti<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Littlefoot minion. This particular yeti is content in knowing that bigger is not always necessarily better.
#. column 1: When discovered by your retainer on a foray deep into the highlands of Coerthas, this miniature monstrosity was both cold and hungry (though the former condition most likely did not affect him much), and a bowl of hot broth was all it took to lure him from the forest back home.
#. column 3: Absolute Zero
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:111:0:2"
msgid "It is good to see you<br>on your feet again.<br>  - Merlwyb Bloefhiswyn"
msgstr "Рада видеть, что ты<br>снова на ногах.<br>  — Мервиб Блёфисвин"

#. ja: 絶対零度
#. de: Absoluter Nullpunkt
#. fr: Zéro absolu
#. column 0: Summon your Littlefoot minion. This particular yeti is content in knowing that bigger is not always necessarily better.
#. column 1: When discovered by your retainer on a foray deep into the highlands of Coerthas, this miniature monstrosity was both cold and hungry (though the former condition most likely did not affect him much), and a bowl of hot broth was all it took to lure him from the forest back home.
#. column 2: It is good to see you<br>on your feet again.<br>  - Merlwyb Bloefhiswyn
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:111:0:3"
msgid "Absolute Zero"
msgstr "Абсолютный ноль"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
