#. column 1: When discovered by your retainer on a foray deep into the highlands of Coerthas, this miniature monstrosity was both cold and hungry (though the former condition most likely did not affect him much), and a bowl of hot broth was all it took to lure him from the forest back home.
#. column 2: It is good to see you<br>on your feet again.<br>  - Merlwyb Bloefhiswyn
#. column 3: Absolute Zero
