#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・エンタープライズ」を呼び出す。<br>シドの飛空艇「エンタープライズ号」を模したからくり模型
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-Enterprise herbei. Dringt mutig in Regionen vor, wo bestimmt irgendjemand schon zuvor gewesen ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte maquette de l'Entreprise. C'est une réplique au 1/1000e du célèbre aéronef de Cid nan Garlond.
#. column 1: The original <i>Enterprise</i> was designed and built while Garlond family prodigy Cid was still working as a military engineer for the Garlean Empire. The aft crane─intended for the loading of imperial weaponry─was added to the airship in the days before Cid's defection.
#. column 2: <i>Enterprise</i>, engage!<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Aft Crane
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:113:0:0"
msgid "Summon your model <i>Enterprise</i> minion. Designed to boldly go where you have gone before."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — модель <i>Энтерпрайза</i>. Смело отправляйтесь туда, где вы уже бывали."

#. ja: ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社製のからくり模型。モデルは、天才機工師シド・ガーロンドが、帝国時代に設計、建造した飛空艇「エンタープライズ号」。艇尾の作業アームはもちろん、操舵するシドまで精巧に作られている
#. de: Cid Garlond entwarf die <i>Enterprise</i> zu seiner Zeit als Militäringenieur für das Garleische Kaiserreich. Der Kran am Heck war ursprünglich dafür gedacht, das Luftschiff mit Munition zu beladen.
#. fr: Cette maquette représente dans tous ses détails “l'Entreprise”, un aéronef que le génial Cid nan Garlond a mis au point du temps où il était à Garlemald.
#. column 0: Summon your model <i>Enterprise</i> minion. Designed to boldly go where you have gone before.
#. column 2: <i>Enterprise</i>, engage!<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Aft Crane
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:113:0:1"
msgid "The original <i>Enterprise</i> was designed and built while Garlond family prodigy Cid was still working as a military engineer for the Garlean Empire. The aft crane─intended for the loading of imperial weaponry─was added to the airship in the days before Cid's defection."
msgstr "Настоящий <i>Энтерпрайз</i> спроектировал и построил гений из рода Гарлонда, Сид, ещё когда служил военным инженером Гарлеанской империи. Кормовой кран, предназначенный для погрузки имперского оружия, установили на дирижабль незадолго до того, как Сид дезертировал."

#. ja: エンタープライズ発進！
#. de: Also dann ... Abflug!<br><i>Alphinaud</i>
#. fr: En avant toute<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your model <i>Enterprise</i> minion. Designed to boldly go where you have gone before.
#. column 1: The original <i>Enterprise</i> was designed and built while Garlond family prodigy Cid was still working as a military engineer for the Garlean Empire. The aft crane─intended for the loading of imperial weaponry─was added to the airship in the days before Cid's defection.
#. column 3: Aft Crane
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:113:0:2"
msgid "<i>Enterprise</i>, engage!<br>   - Alphinaud"
msgstr "<i>Энтерпрайз</i>, взлёт!<br>   — Альфино"

#. ja: クレーンアーム
#. de: Ladebaum
#. fr: Bras mécanique
#. column 0: Summon your model <i>Enterprise</i> minion. Designed to boldly go where you have gone before.
#. column 1: The original <i>Enterprise</i> was designed and built while Garlond family prodigy Cid was still working as a military engineer for the Garlean Empire. The aft crane─intended for the loading of imperial weaponry─was added to the airship in the days before Cid's defection.
#. column 2: <i>Enterprise</i>, engage!<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
