#. ja: ミニオン「アサシンフライ」を呼び出す。<br>アサシンベタの稚魚。泳ぐことを忘れた
#. de: Du rufst deinen fliegenden Kampffisch herbei. Es war mal 'n Kampffisch, der schluckte 'ne Fliege. Warum, weiß der Wind, und nun seh'n wir ihn fliegen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte fretin assassin. Ce jeune betta assassin a préféré quitter le milieu aquatique pour jouer les filles de l'air.
#. column 1: After several turns of the sun sloshing about in the depths of a ninja betta's belly, this freshly hatched fry has given up swimming altogether and taken to the skies. How spending time in a belly can inspire a fish to flight is something only one who has spent time in a belly can know.
#. column 2: They say never to look<br>a gift fish in the mouth.<br>  - Sisipu
#. column 3: Assassinate
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:115:0:0"
msgid "Summon your assassin fry minion. There was an old betta who swallowed a fry. No one knows why it swallowed the fry, but for some reason, the fry can now fly."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — малька-убийцу. Жил-был старый петушок, проглотил малька. Никто не знает зачем, но теперь малёк умеет летать."

#. ja: アサシンベタの稚魚。ニンジャベタを解体したところ、その腹の中から出てきた。胃の中で過ごすうちに泳ぎ方を忘れ、うっかり宙を舞うことを覚えたらしい。それでも水辺を見ると、懐かしいらしく飛び込まずにはいられない
#. de: Nach mehreren Sonnen im Bauch eines Ninja-Kampffisches hat dieser frisch geschlüpfte Kampffisch das Schwimmen komplett an den Nagel gehängt und fliegt dafür. Warum, weiß wohl nur jemand, der schon mal längere Zeit in einem Bauch verbracht hat.
#. fr: Ce poisson a été extrait du ventre d'un betta ninja que des cuisiniers débitaient. Après des années d'enfermement, il ne savait plus nager... Il volait<nbsp>! Mais comment s'empêcher de piquer une tête en voyant la mer<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your assassin fry minion. There was an old betta who swallowed a fry. No one knows why it swallowed the fry, but for some reason, the fry can now fly.
#. column 2: They say never to look<br>a gift fish in the mouth.<br>  - Sisipu
#. column 3: Assassinate
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:115:0:1"
msgid "After several turns of the sun sloshing about in the depths of a ninja betta's belly, this freshly hatched fry has given up swimming altogether and taken to the skies. How spending time in a belly can inspire a fish to flight is something only one who has spent time in a belly can know."
msgstr "Проведя несколько солнечных кругов в брюхе ниндзя-бетты, этот только что вылупившийся малёк совсем разучился плавать и принялся летать. Как пребывание в чужом животе могло вдохновить рыбу взмыть в небо, знает только тот, кто сам там побывал."

#. ja: ア　サ　シ　ン　ベ　タ
#. de: Fisch schwimmt am liebsten<br> in Dunkelbier, hehe.<br><i>Trinkfester Fischfreund</i>
#. fr: Blob... blooob<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your assassin fry minion. There was an old betta who swallowed a fry. No one knows why it swallowed the fry, but for some reason, the fry can now fly.
#. column 1: After several turns of the sun sloshing about in the depths of a ninja betta's belly, this freshly hatched fry has given up swimming altogether and taken to the skies. How spending time in a belly can inspire a fish to flight is something only one who has spent time in a belly can know.
#. column 3: Assassinate
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:115:0:2"
msgid "They say never to look<br>a gift fish in the mouth.<br>  - Sisipu"
msgstr "Говорят, дарёному рыбаку<br>в рот не заглядывают.<br>  — Сисипу"

#. ja: 暗殺
#. de: Meuchelmord
#. fr: Assassinat
