msgid "Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK."
msgstr "Наносит противникам в радиусе действия урон, в пять раз превышающий ATK заклинателя."

#. ja: ミニオン「プレゼンター」を呼び出す。<br>エターナルセレモニーの招待客へのプレゼント。末永くお幸せに！
#. de: Du rufst ein Geschenkpäckchen herbei, das ein Eigenleben zu haben scheint. Möge es dich am Glück des Schenkers teilhaben lassen!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte cadeau ambulant. Cette boîte qui marche est offerte en gage de re<shy>mer<shy>cie<shy>ment aux convives de la cérémonie du lien éternel.
#. column 1: Lacking the spells required to animate a gift in the same manner in which the ancients animated bricks, the crafter of this quaint creation simply cut a pair of holes into a wooden box and slipped it on a spriggan.<br>Problem solved.
#. column 2: That Miqo'te lass said<br>someone'd be bringin' me a<br>gift what I couldn't refuse.<br>  - Drogo
#. column 3: Jack-out-the-box
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:116:0:0"
msgid "Summon your demon box minion. There is no better way to tell a special someone “Thank you for attending my Ceremony of Eternal Bonding” than by giving them a sentient box that may or may not devour their pets."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — коробку-демона. Лучшего способа сказать кому-то «спасибо, что пришли на мою Церемонию Вечного союза» нет, чем подарить живую коробку, которая, возможно, съест их питомцев."

#. ja: 綺麗にラッピングされたデモンズブロック……を作ろうとしたが、製造法が解らなかったため妥協した。中に入れられているものが何であれ、エターナルバンドを祝福する想いがたっぷり込められているので、良しとしよう
#. de: In Ermangelung fort<shy>ge<shy>schrit<shy>te<shy>ner magischer Techniken schnitt der Schöpfer dieser kuriosen Kreation kurzerhand zwei Löcher in einen Karton und stülpte ihn einem Spriggan über. Auch eine Art, unbelebter Materie Leben einzuhauchen.
#. fr: Cette boîte est offerte tra<shy>di<shy>tion<shy>nel<shy>lement par un couple à ses invités lors de la cérémonie du lien éternel. Elle inspire le bonheur, mais se transforme en un véritable cadeau empoisonné lorsque les conjoints donateurs se séparent.
#. column 0: Summon your demon box minion. There is no better way to tell a special someone “Thank you for attending my Ceremony of Eternal Bonding” than by giving them a sentient box that may or may not devour their pets.
#. column 2: That Miqo'te lass said<br>someone'd be bringin' me a<br>gift what I couldn't refuse.<br>  - Drogo
#. column 3: Jack-out-the-box
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:116:0:1"
msgid "Lacking the spells required to animate a gift in the same manner in which the ancients animated bricks, the crafter of this quaint creation simply cut a pair of holes into a wooden box and slipped it on a spriggan.<br>Problem solved."
msgstr "Умения оживлять подарки, как древние оживляли кирпичи, у мастера не нашлось. Поэтому он просто проделал в деревянной коробке две дырки и надел её на сприггана.<br>Готово!"

#. ja: エターナル！
#. de: Ziggy sooo fröööhlich!<br><i>Ziggy</i>
#. fr: Pour l'éternité<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your demon box minion. There is no better way to tell a special someone “Thank you for attending my Ceremony of Eternal Bonding” than by giving them a sentient box that may or may not devour their pets.
#. column 1: Lacking the spells required to animate a gift in the same manner in which the ancients animated bricks, the crafter of this quaint creation simply cut a pair of holes into a wooden box and slipped it on a spriggan.<br>Problem solved.
#. column 3: Jack-out-the-box
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:116:0:2"
msgid "That Miqo'te lass said<br>someone'd be bringin' me a<br>gift what I couldn't refuse.<br>  - Drogo"
msgstr "Та кошечка сказала,<br>что мне принесут подарок,<br>от которого я не смогу отказаться.<br>  — Дрого"

#. ja: プレゼント交換
#. de: Bescherung
#. fr: Échange de cadeaux
#. column 0: Summon your demon box minion. There is no better way to tell a special someone “Thank you for attending my Ceremony of Eternal Bonding” than by giving them a sentient box that may or may not devour their pets.
