msgid "Disarms deployed enemy traps."
msgstr "Обезвреживает установленную противником ловушку."

#. ja: ミニオン「カッパッパ」を呼び出す。<br>正体不明のカッパ。沙悟浄の槍は持っていない
#. de: Du rufst deinen Flusskobold als Begleiter herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petit kappa. Cette créature étrange et singulière semble avoir perdu sa lance quelque part.
#. column 1: Even a child knows that there are no such things as water imps...but if that is true, then what in the world could this undeniably imp-like creature be? An undocumented species of gigantoad/salamander hybrid? Or perhaps simply the hapless victim of a misdirected Imp spell?
#. column 2: Not <i>more</i> imps!<br>They'll have all our honey!<br>  - Befuddled Beekeeper
#. column 3: Waterline
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 40%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:117:0:0"
msgid "Summon your water imp minion. Legend states these strange creatures can only survive on land as long as the plate atop their heads remains wet."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — водяного беса. По легенде, эти странные создания могут жить на суше, только пока тарелка у них на голове остаётся мокрой."

#. ja: カッパ。カッパである。まごうことなきカッパである。魔法人形ではないところを見ると、これは古代魔法「カッパー」によって、姿を変えられた人である可能性が高い。しかし、彼、もしくは彼女が何者なのかは解っていない
#. de: Jedes Kind weiß, dass es keine Flusskobolde gibt ... Aber wenn das wahr ist, was stellt dein Begleiter dann dar? Eine unbekannte Kreuzung aus Karpfenkröte und Salamander vielleicht? Oder doch bloß ein Opfer eines fehlgelenkten Imp-Zaubers?
#. fr: Ce kappa n'est indubitablement pas un pantin. Un être humain a cer<shy>tai<shy>ne<shy>ment fait appel à la magie pour prendre cette forme, mais qui cela peut-il bien être<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your water imp minion. Legend states these strange creatures can only survive on land as long as the plate atop their heads remains wet.
#. column 2: Not <i>more</i> imps!<br>They'll have all our honey!<br>  - Befuddled Beekeeper
#. column 3: Waterline
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 40%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:117:0:1"
msgid "Even a child knows that there are no such things as water imps...but if that is true, then what in the world could this undeniably imp-like creature be? An undocumented species of gigantoad/salamander hybrid? Or perhaps simply the hapless victim of a misdirected Imp spell?"
msgstr "Даже ребёнок знает, что водяных бесов не бывает... Но если это правда, то кто же тогда это существо, так похожее на беса? Неизвестный гибрид гигантской жабы и саламандры? Или просто жертва неудачного заклинания превращения в беса?"

#. ja: カッパッパーーーー！！
#. de: Schwippdischwapp, schwippdischwapp,<br>ohne Wasser mach ich schlapp.<br><i>Flusskobold-Weise</i>
#. fr: Kappappaaa<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your water imp minion. Legend states these strange creatures can only survive on land as long as the plate atop their heads remains wet.
#. column 1: Even a child knows that there are no such things as water imps...but if that is true, then what in the world could this undeniably imp-like creature be? An undocumented species of gigantoad/salamander hybrid? Or perhaps simply the hapless victim of a misdirected Imp spell?
#. column 3: Waterline
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 40%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
