#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ルイゾワ」を呼び出す。<br>ルイゾワを模した魔法人形。おわりの名は希望
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Louisoix herbei. Rundumschutz vor Primae in der Siebten Ära des Lichts bietet dieser putzige Begleiter aus der Exegeten-Kollektion!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Louisoix miniature. Ce pantin reproduit fidèlement le sage sharlayanais qui a donné sa vie pour sauver Éorzéa.
#. column 1: When asked why the Goldsmiths' Guild began manufacture of the wind-up delivery moogles before even drawing up designs for their wind-up Louisoix─the single greatest hero in the history of history─Guildmaster Serendipity replied, “Moogles are cuter.”
#. column 2: I swear by Louisoix's beard,<br>I'll tear the skin from his─<br>  - Geva
#. column 3: Flames of Rebirth
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:118:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Louisoix minion. The Seventh Astral Era is secure as long as the Archon is ever at our sides."
msgstr "Призовите заводного миньона Луизуа. Пока архонт рядом, Седьмой астральной эре ничто не грозит."

#. ja: 賢人ルイゾワを模した魔法人形。月の衛星「ダラガブ」の落下を阻止するため、命を賭して戦った故人の偉業を称えるために、彫金師ギルドによって作られた
#. de: Als sie gefragt wurde, warum die Gilde der Goldschmiede mit dem Bau von Mogry-Stofftieren begonnen hatte, bevor überhaupt an einen Aufzieh-Louisoix gedacht wurde, kam Seredipitys Antwort wie aus der Pistole geschossen: „Mogrys sind einfach süßer!“
#. fr: La guilde des orfèvres a tenu à rendre hommage au sage qui s'est sacrifié lors de la chute de l'astre Dalamud en façonnant cette poupée à son image. Ne la laissez jamais s'approcher d'un bébé Bahamut<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Louisoix minion. The Seventh Astral Era is secure as long as the Archon is ever at our sides.
#. column 2: I swear by Louisoix's beard,<br>I'll tear the skin from his─<br>  - Geva
#. column 3: Flames of Rebirth
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:118:0:1"
msgid "When asked why the Goldsmiths' Guild began manufacture of the wind-up delivery moogles before even drawing up designs for their wind-up Louisoix─the single greatest hero in the history of history─Guildmaster Serendipity replied, “Moogles are cuter.”"
msgstr "Когда мастера ювелиров спросили, почему они начали делать заводных могри-почтальонов, не придумав даже, как будет выглядеть заводной Луизуа — величайший герой всей истории истории, — Серендипити ответила: «Могри милее»."

#. ja: 希望ヲ未来ニ…
#. de: Und Louisoix! Wollt ihr den<br>krepieren lassen, ja?<br><i>Raubahn</i>
#. fr: L'avenir sera porteur d'espoir.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Louisoix minion. The Seventh Astral Era is secure as long as the Archon is ever at our sides.
#. column 1: When asked why the Goldsmiths' Guild began manufacture of the wind-up delivery moogles before even drawing up designs for their wind-up Louisoix─the single greatest hero in the history of history─Guildmaster Serendipity replied, “Moogles are cuter.”
#. column 3: Flames of Rebirth
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:118:0:2"
msgid "I swear by Louisoix's beard,<br>I'll tear the skin from his─<br>  - Geva"
msgstr "Клянусь бородой Луизуа,<br>я с него шкуру спущу—<br>  — Гева"

#. ja: 転生の炎
#. de: Flammen der Wiedergeburt
#. fr: Feu résurrecteur
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Louisoix minion. The Seventh Astral Era is secure as long as the Archon is ever at our sides.
