#. ja: 「ミドガルズオルム」を呼び出す
#. de: Du rufst Midgardsormr herbei. Nicht den großen. Die kleine Variante.
#. fr: Vous appelez Midgardsormr.
#. column 1: Father of Dragons, Keeper of the Lake, Bane of the XIVth Legion─while it is difficult to believe the yalm-long pup could be any of these things, he assures you his current form is only temporary while he awaits the reconstruction of a new corporeal vessel.
#. column 2: Midgardsormr was a king<br>amongst kings who reigned<br>for centuries on end...<br>  - Minfilia
#. column 3: Open Beta
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:119:0:0"
msgid "Summon Midgardsormr. Not the big one. The little one."
msgstr "Призовите Мидгардсормра. Не большого. Маленького."

#. ja: すべてのドラゴン族の始祖、幻龍「ミドガルズオルム」が創りだした幻体。ドラゴンパピーに見えるが、幻龍の魂が宿っており、意外とシブい声で語りかけてくる。光の戦士の行く末を見守るため、旅に同行することに
#. de: Der Vater aller Drachen macht in Puppenform eine ganz niedliche Figur, von der man sich aber nicht täuschen lassen sollte: Seine Stimme klingt so ehrfurchtseinflößend wie die des großen Originals. Schließlich trägt er einen Teil von Midgardsormr in sich.
#. fr: Cette larve, engendrée par Midgardsormr, renferme l'âme du dragon originel. Malgré son aspect charmant, elle parle avec une voix caverneuse qui donne des frissons. Elle vous accompagne et vous observe en permanence.
#. column 0: Summon Midgardsormr. Not the big one. The little one.
#. column 2: Midgardsormr was a king<br>amongst kings who reigned<br>for centuries on end...<br>  - Minfilia
#. column 3: Open Beta
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:119:0:1"
msgid "Father of Dragons, Keeper of the Lake, Bane of the XIVth Legion─while it is difficult to believe the yalm-long pup could be any of these things, he assures you his current form is only temporary while he awaits the reconstruction of a new corporeal vessel."
msgstr "Отец драконов, Хранитель озера, Гроза Четырнадцатого легиона... Трудно поверить, что этот щенок длиной в ярд — кто-то из них, но он уверяет, что нынешнее тело временное: он ждёт, пока ему восстановят новое."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Wer schreitet über mich hinweg<br>und reißt mich aus meinem Schlaf?<br><i>Midgardsormr</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon Midgardsormr. Not the big one. The little one.
#. column 1: Father of Dragons, Keeper of the Lake, Bane of the XIVth Legion─while it is difficult to believe the yalm-long pup could be any of these things, he assures you his current form is only temporary while he awaits the reconstruction of a new corporeal vessel.
#. column 3: Open Beta
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:119:0:2"
msgid "Midgardsormr was a king<br>amongst kings who reigned<br>for centuries on end...<br>  - Minfilia"
msgstr "Мидгардсормр был царём<br>царей и правил<br>многие столетия...<br>  — Минфилия"

#. ja: オープンベータ
#. de: Geht ins Auge
#. fr: Tape-à-l'œil
#. column 0: Summon Midgardsormr. Not the big one. The little one.
#. column 1: Father of Dragons, Keeper of the Lake, Bane of the XIVth Legion─while it is difficult to believe the yalm-long pup could be any of these things, he assures you his current form is only temporary while he awaits the reconstruction of a new corporeal vessel.
#. column 2: Midgardsormr was a king<br>amongst kings who reigned<br>for centuries on end...<br>  - Minfilia
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:119:0:3"
msgid "Open Beta"
msgstr "Открытая бета"

#. ja: 敵軍のサーチ・アイへ90%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt einem gegnerischen Suchenden Auge 90 % Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls es schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 90% de sa solidité à l'œil scrutateur ennemi. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon Midgardsormr. Not the big one. The little one.
#. column 1: Father of Dragons, Keeper of the Lake, Bane of the XIVth Legion─while it is difficult to believe the yalm-long pup could be any of these things, he assures you his current form is only temporary while he awaits the reconstruction of a new corporeal vessel.
#. column 2: Midgardsormr was a king<br>amongst kings who reigned<br>for centuries on end...<br>  - Minfilia
#. column 3: Open Beta
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:119:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable."
msgstr "Наносит 90% урона вражескому Наблюдающему оку. Не действует, если оно уже выведено из строя."

#. ja: ミニオン「ピカピカ」を呼び出す。<br>勝利を呼ぶとされる縁起の良い鳥
#. de: Du rufst deine kleine Elster herbei. Angeblich kündet ihr Zwitschern von glorreichen Siegen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte pie pimpante. Cet oiseau serait annonciateur d'une victoire proche.
#. column 1: Magpies have historically been portrayed as loyal messengers of Menphina, bearing the word of the Lover's favor in war. There are some generals even today who will wait to advance their armies until one of the birds has been sighted on their side of the battlefield.
#. column 2: Fancy some feathers...<br>bird brain?<br>   - Gilgamesh
#. column 3: Love Song
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:121:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Doman magpie minion. Approximately 3.14159 times more intelligent than the average swallow."
msgstr "Призовите миньона — доманскую сороку. Примерно в 3,14159 раза умнее средней ласточки."

#. ja: 勝利を呼ぶとされる縁起の良い鳥。また、月神メネフィナの使いとして、星空を舞い愛を運ぶ役割を担うという伝説がある。本来、エオルゼアには棲息していない鳥だが、「伝説の鳥」という謳い文句で東方から持ち込まれた
#. de: Der Legende nach ist sie eine Botin der Mondgöttin Menphina und fliegt durch den Sternenhimmel, um ihre Liebe zu überbringen. Eine im Fernen Osten heimische Vogelart, die als „Sagenvogel“ beworben nach Eorzea gebracht wurde.
#. fr: Si Menphina a autrefois envoyé cet oiseau semer le bonheur à tire-d'aile en Éorzéa, il a aujourd'hui disparu de la région. La légende qui le lie à la déesse a cependant encouragé certaines personnes à importer quelques spécimens des contrées orientales.
#. column 0: Summon your Doman magpie minion. Approximately 3.14159 times more intelligent than the average swallow.
#. column 2: Fancy some feathers...<br>bird brain?<br>   - Gilgamesh
#. column 3: Love Song
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:121:0:1"
msgid "Magpies have historically been portrayed as loyal messengers of Menphina, bearing the word of the Lover's favor in war. There are some generals even today who will wait to advance their armies until one of the birds has been sighted on their side of the battlefield."
msgstr "Издавна считалось, что сороки — верные посланницы Менфины, которые приносят на войну благосклонность Богини Любви. И по сей день некоторые полководцы не двигают войска, пока не увидят птицу на своей стороне поля боя."

#. ja: カチカチ！
#. de: Eine Elster macht noch keinen Sieg.<br><i>Altes Sprichwort</i>
#. fr: Kakakakakaka<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Doman magpie minion. Approximately 3.14159 times more intelligent than the average swallow.
#. column 1: Magpies have historically been portrayed as loyal messengers of Menphina, bearing the word of the Lover's favor in war. There are some generals even today who will wait to advance their armies until one of the birds has been sighted on their side of the battlefield.
#. column 3: Love Song
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:121:0:2"
msgid "Fancy some feathers...<br>bird brain?<br>   - Gilgamesh"
msgstr "Перья не желаешь...<br>птица ты этакая?<br>   — Гильгамеш"

#. ja: 愛のセレナーデ
#. de: Liebesserenade
#. fr: Sérénade
#. column 0: Summon your Doman magpie minion. Approximately 3.14159 times more intelligent than the average swallow.
#. column 1: Magpies have historically been portrayed as loyal messengers of Menphina, bearing the word of the Lover's favor in war. There are some generals even today who will wait to advance their armies until one of the birds has been sighted on their side of the battlefield.
