#. ja: ミニオン「エンキドゥ」を呼び出す。<br>友だちになったニワトリ。洗っても色あせない
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Enkidu als Begleiter herbei. Auch als Wecker benutzbar. Und selbst bei Kochwäsche geht die grüne Farbe nicht raus!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Enkidu. La couleur de son plumage résiste au lavage.
#. column 1: Legend has that Gilgamesh first found Enkidu while searching for a meal. Without the means to make a fire, he attempted to eat the fowl raw, only to find himself the victim of a furious counterattack. Impressed by the bird's tenacity, he promptly made him his pet.
#. column 2: Enkidu, do you hear me!?<br>ENKIIIDUUUUUUUUUUUU!<br>  - Gilgamesh
#. column 3: Eerie Soundwave
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:122:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Enkidu minion. That green is not coming out, even with multiple washings."
msgstr "Призовите миньона Энкиду. Хоть стирай, хоть не стирай — зелёный цвет не сойдёт."

#. ja: 旅の剣豪ギルガメッシュが、空腹のあまり農家から盗んだニワトリ。調理法が解らなかったため、生で頂こうとしたところ、鋭いクチバシで猛反撃！　その強さに惚れ込んだ彼は、以後、このニワトリを旅の供にしたという
#. de: Beeindruckt von der Stärke dieses Huhns, das Gilgamesch eigentlich zum Mittagessen verspeisen wollte, verpasste der Fechtmeister ihm einen frischen Anstrich und ernannte es zu seinem offiziellen Aushilfsbegleiter.
#. fr: Affamé au cours d'un de ses nombreux voyages, le guerrier de légende Gilgamesh a volé ce coq à des paysans. Il a voulu le dévorer tout cru, mais le volatile lui a troué le crâne à coups de bec<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Enkidu minion. That green is not coming out, even with multiple washings.
#. column 2: Enkidu, do you hear me!?<br>ENKIIIDUUUUUUUUUUUU!<br>  - Gilgamesh
#. column 3: Eerie Soundwave
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:122:0:1"
msgid "Legend has that Gilgamesh first found Enkidu while searching for a meal. Without the means to make a fire, he attempted to eat the fowl raw, only to find himself the victim of a furious counterattack. Impressed by the bird's tenacity, he promptly made him his pet."
msgstr "По легенде, Гильгамеш впервые встретил Энкиду, когда искал, чем бы пообедать. Развести огонь он не сумел и решил съесть птицу сырой. Та яростно отбилась. Впечатлённый её упорством, он тут же сделал её своим питомцем."

#. ja: コケー！
#. de: Ich wollt, ich wär ein Huhn,<br>ich hätt nicht viel zu tun.<br><i>Alte Volksweise</i>
#. fr: Cocorico<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Enkidu minion. That green is not coming out, even with multiple washings.
#. column 1: Legend has that Gilgamesh first found Enkidu while searching for a meal. Without the means to make a fire, he attempted to eat the fowl raw, only to find himself the victim of a furious counterattack. Impressed by the bird's tenacity, he promptly made him his pet.
#. column 3: Eerie Soundwave
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:122:0:2"
msgid "Enkidu, do you hear me!?<br>ENKIIIDUUUUUUUUUUUU!<br>  - Gilgamesh"
msgstr "Энкиду, ты слышишь меня!?<br>ЭНКИИИДУУУУУУУУУУ!<br>  — Гильгамеш"

#. ja: 怪音波
#. de: Ekplexie
#. fr: Onde lugubre
#. column 0: Summon your Enkidu minion. That green is not coming out, even with multiple washings.
#. column 1: Legend has that Gilgamesh first found Enkidu while searching for a meal. Without the means to make a fire, he attempted to eat the fowl raw, only to find himself the victim of a furious counterattack. Impressed by the bird's tenacity, he promptly made him his pet.
#. column 2: Enkidu, do you hear me!?<br>ENKIIIDUUUUUUUUUUUU!<br>  - Gilgamesh
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:122:0:3"
msgid "Eerie Soundwave"
msgstr "Жуткая звуковая волна"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵にかかっている、強化効果をすべて打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle positiven Effekte von den gegnerischen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe tous les effets bénéfiques des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Enkidu minion. That green is not coming out, even with multiple washings.
#. column 1: Legend has that Gilgamesh first found Enkidu while searching for a meal. Without the means to make a fire, he attempted to eat the fowl raw, only to find himself the victim of a furious counterattack. Impressed by the bird's tenacity, he promptly made him his pet.
#. column 2: Enkidu, do you hear me!?<br>ENKIIIDUUUUUUUUUUUU!<br>  - Gilgamesh
#. column 3: Eerie Soundwave
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:122:0:4"
msgid "Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все положительные эффекты со всех противников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・バイオレット」を呼び出す。<br>悪い子シルフを模した魔法人形なのでふっち
#. de: Von Ramuh besessen und bis auf den Grund ihres violetten Herzens böse - und doch herzallerliebst.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée de méchant Sylphe. Cette poupée à l'air sinistre représente un Dénaturé, l'un des méchants Sylphes. Elle vous lancera pro<shy>ba<shy>ble<shy>ment le sort Foudre si vous lui tournez le dos.
#. column 1: After being harried by their hostile sylvan cousins one time too many, the sylphs of Little Solace turned to a traveling goldsmith from faraway Ul'dah to help them create an automated decoy that might keep the touched ones away.
#. column 2: This one is in the mood for<br>dancing! And prancing!<br>  - Hostile Sylph
#. column 3: Squee
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:123:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Violet minion. Touched by a primal and corrupted to the core...yet adorable nonetheless."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — заводную Виолетту. Она осквернена праймалом и испорчена до мозга костей... но всё равно очаровательна."

#. ja: 悪い子シルフを模した魔法人形。仮宿のシルフ族が、悪い子シルフたちに悪戯をしかけるために作ったもの。そのリアルな色合いを出すために、シルフたちは様々な染料を試し、最終的には紫キャベツに行き着いたらしい
#. de: Geplagt von den ständigen Angriffen ihrer bösen Schwestern, bauten die Sylphen der Zuflucht diese Puppe, um die Finstrigen fernzuhalten.
#. fr: Un pantin inspiré des Sylphes dénaturés et fabriqué par les Sylphes du Refuge pour faire des farces. Pour obtenir une couleur aussi réaliste que possible, ils ont expérimenté divers pigments jusqu'à trouver la teinte idéale<nbsp>: le chou rouge.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Violet minion. Touched by a primal and corrupted to the core...yet adorable nonetheless.
#. column 2: This one is in the mood for<br>dancing! And prancing!<br>  - Hostile Sylph
#. column 3: Squee
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:123:0:1"
msgid "After being harried by their hostile sylvan cousins one time too many, the sylphs of Little Solace turned to a traveling goldsmith from faraway Ul'dah to help them create an automated decoy that might keep the touched ones away."
msgstr "После того как злые сородичи в очередной раз изрядно досадили сильфам Малого Утешения, те обратились к странствующему ювелиру из далёкой Уль'ды. Попросили сделать заводную приманку, которая отпугивала бы осквернённых."

#. ja: ふっちっち！
#. de: Die Farben!<br>Der Wald ist voller Farben!<br><i>Böse Sylphe</i>
#. fr: Ô grand Ramuh<nbsp>!<br>Protège-nous des intrus<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Violet minion. Touched by a primal and corrupted to the core...yet adorable nonetheless.
#. column 1: After being harried by their hostile sylvan cousins one time too many, the sylphs of Little Solace turned to a traveling goldsmith from faraway Ul'dah to help them create an automated decoy that might keep the touched ones away.
#. column 3: Squee
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:123:0:2"
msgid "This one is in the mood for<br>dancing! And prancing!<br>  - Hostile Sylph"
msgstr "Этому хочется<br>танцевать! И скакать!<br>  — Злой сильф"

#. ja: 不吉なおまぢない
#. de: Listige Zauberei
#. fr: Sortilège sylphe
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Violet minion. Touched by a primal and corrupted to the core...yet adorable nonetheless.
#. column 1: After being harried by their hostile sylvan cousins one time too many, the sylphs of Little Solace turned to a traveling goldsmith from faraway Ul'dah to help them create an automated decoy that might keep the touched ones away.
