#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ファウンダー」を呼び出す。<br>アマルジャ族の歴史的偉人を模した魔法人形
#. de: Einst träumten die Amalj'aa-Gründerväter davon, dass possierliche Begleiter ihnen auf Schritt und Tritt folgen würden. Dieser Tag ist endlich gekommen!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée du maître fondateur. Cette fière poupée représente le fondateur légendaire d'un ancien art martial amalj'aa.
#. column 1: Amalj'aa legend tells of Whiteknuckle Kerigg Roh─undefeated on the battlefield, he is a hero to many, including Warleader Hamujj Gah. The champion is also father of the brawling style of martial arts utilized by the beast tribe to this day.
#. column 2: Do you know, honored ally,<br>what is most distasteful to<br>the Amalj'aa?<br>  - Narujj Boh
#. column 3: Undefeated
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:124:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up founder minion. Four score and many more years ago, the Amalj'aa founding fathers dreamed of a day when in their footsteps would walk adorable minions. That day has finally come."
msgstr "Призывает заводного основателя. Много-много лет назад отцы-основатели Амалджа мечтали о дне, когда по их стопам пойдут очаровательные миньоны. И вот этот день настал."

#. ja: アマルジャ族の歴史的偉人、「輝拳のケリグ・ロー」を模した魔法人形。ケリグはアマルジャ式古武術の開祖であり、ハムジ・ガーも尊敬してやまない人物だという。その拳は、太陽のように輝きを放ったと伝えられている
#. de: Amalj'aa-Legenden berichten von dem legendären Krieger Kerigg „Weißknöchel“ Roh, der unbesiegt aus all seinen Kämpfen hervorgegangen sein soll. Selbst Hamujj Gah verehrt diesen Helden. Kerigg Rohs brachialer Kampfstil wird noch heute von den Amalj'aa gepflegt.
#. fr: Un pantin à l'effigie de Kerigg Roh poing-éclatant, fondateur d'un ancien art martial amalj'aa. Guerrier légendaire respecté de tous les Amalj'aa, notamment Hamujj Gah, son poing brillerait comme l'astre solaire, ce qui lui a valu son épithète.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up founder minion. Four score and many more years ago, the Amalj'aa founding fathers dreamed of a day when in their footsteps would walk adorable minions. That day has finally come.
#. column 2: Do you know, honored ally,<br>what is most distasteful to<br>the Amalj'aa?<br>  - Narujj Boh
#. column 3: Undefeated
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:124:0:1"
msgid "Amalj'aa legend tells of Whiteknuckle Kerigg Roh─undefeated on the battlefield, he is a hero to many, including Warleader Hamujj Gah. The champion is also father of the brawling style of martial arts utilized by the beast tribe to this day. "
msgstr "Легенды амалджа сказывают о Керигге Ро Белом Кулаке, непобедимом воине и герое многих, в том числе военачальника Хамуджа Га. Он не только прославился на поле боя, но и основал боевое искусство, которым племя амалджа пользуется по сей день."

#. ja: 質実剛健！
#. de: Wir Amalj'aa sind starke und<br>stolze Krieger. Doch weißt du,<br>was unsere Schwäche ist?<br><i>Narujj Boh</i>
#. fr: Son ennemi, un guerrier doit respecter.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up founder minion. Four score and many more years ago, the Amalj'aa founding fathers dreamed of a day when in their footsteps would walk adorable minions. That day has finally come.
#. column 1: Amalj'aa legend tells of Whiteknuckle Kerigg Roh─undefeated on the battlefield, he is a hero to many, including Warleader Hamujj Gah. The champion is also father of the brawling style of martial arts utilized by the beast tribe to this day.
#. column 3: Undefeated
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
