#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・デズル」を呼び出す。<br>名気球技師デズル・クワランを模した魔法人形
#. de: Es heißt, dass Dezul Qualan mit dem Bau von Ballons begann, nachdem er im Traum eine Minnesängerweise mit dem Titel „Über den Wolken“ vernommen hatte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Dezul miniature. Cette poupée est à l'effigie du célèbre ingénieur aéronautique ixal, Dezul Qualan.
#. column 1: The last time Ixali engineer Dezul Qualan was seen was the day he boarded his greatest creation─a war balloon thrice the size of any ever built, and equipped with enough provisions to last a man a full moon in the clouds. His destination: the floating continent of Ayatlan.
#. column 2: Soar once again, we shall.<br>Within <i>Dezul Qualan</i>,<br>our salvation lies!<br>  - Sezul Totoloc
#. column 3: Fly Like the Wind
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:125:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Dezul Qualan minion. It is said Ixali engineer Dezul Qualan began crafting war dirigibles after having a vision of ninety-nine red balloons floating over the Black Shroud."
msgstr "Призывает заводного Дезула Квалана. Говорят, инженер-иксал Дезул Квалан начал строить боевые дирижабли после того, как увидел во сне девяносто девять красных воздушных шаров над Чёрной чащей."

#. ja: セズル・トトロックが恩師でもあるイクサル族の名気球技師「デズル・クワラン」を模して作った魔法人形。彼は自ら開発した超大型気球に乗り、伝説の地「アヤトラン」を目指し飛び立ったまま、行方不明になったという
#. de: Das letzte Mal, als der geniale Ixal-Ingenieur Dezul Qualan gesehen ward, stieg er in einen gewaltigen Panzerballon, der genug Proviant für einen vollen Mond in den Wolken geladen hatte. Sein Ziel: der fliegende Kontinent Ayatlan.
#. fr: Une poupée fabriquée par Sezul Totoloc à l'effigie de son maître Dezul Qualan, célèbre ingénieur aéronautique qui a disparu à bord d'un ballon géant de son invention, dans un voyage à la recherche d'Ayatlan, la terre sacrée ixale.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Dezul Qualan minion. It is said Ixali engineer Dezul Qualan began crafting war dirigibles after having a vision of ninety-nine red balloons floating over the Black Shroud.
#. column 2: Soar once again, we shall.<br>Within <i>Dezul Qualan</i>,<br>our salvation lies!<br>  - Sezul Totoloc
#. column 3: Fly Like the Wind
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:125:0:1"
msgid "The last time Ixali engineer Dezul Qualan was seen was the day he boarded his greatest creation─a war balloon thrice the size of any ever built, and equipped with enough provisions to last a man a full moon in the clouds. His destination: the floating continent of Ayatlan."
msgstr "Последний раз инженера-иксала Дезула Квалана видели, когда он поднялся на борт своего величайшего творения — боевого аэростата втрое больше всех построенных прежде, с запасом провизии на целый месяц в облаках. Его целью был парящий континент Аятлан."

#. ja: 風の如くッゥ！
#. de: Klemm ich dir gleich Kopf in Drehbank.<br>Vielleicht macht Oberstübchen wieder klar. Kha!<br><i>Sezul Totoloc</i>
#. fr: Celui-ci s'envolera<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Dezul Qualan minion. It is said Ixali engineer Dezul Qualan began crafting war dirigibles after having a vision of ninety-nine red balloons floating over the Black Shroud.
#. column 1: The last time Ixali engineer Dezul Qualan was seen was the day he boarded his greatest creation─a war balloon thrice the size of any ever built, and equipped with enough provisions to last a man a full moon in the clouds. His destination: the floating continent of Ayatlan.
#. column 3: Fly Like the Wind
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:125:0:2"
msgid "Soar once again, we shall.<br>Within <i>Dezul Qualan</i>,<br>our salvation lies!<br>  - Sezul Totoloc"
msgstr "Мы снова взмоем ввысь!<br>В <i>Дезуле Квалане</i><br>наше спасение!<br>  — Сезул Тотолок"

#. ja: シバキ上げ
#. de: Bist du kaputt
#. fr: Dérouillée
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Dezul Qualan minion. It is said Ixali engineer Dezul Qualan began crafting war dirigibles after having a vision of ninety-nine red balloons floating over the Black Shroud.
#. column 1: The last time Ixali engineer Dezul Qualan was seen was the day he boarded his greatest creation─a war balloon thrice the size of any ever built, and equipped with enough provisions to last a man a full moon in the clouds. His destination: the floating continent of Ayatlan.
#. column 2: Soar once again, we shall.<br>Within <i>Dezul Qualan</i>,<br>our salvation lies!<br>  - Sezul Totoloc
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:125:0:3"
msgid "Fly Like the Wind"
msgstr "Лети, как ветер"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のアルカナストーンに、5%のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Arkana-Stein 5 % Schaden zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 5% de sa solidité à la pierre arcanique ennemie la plus proche.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Dezul Qualan minion. It is said Ixali engineer Dezul Qualan began crafting war dirigibles after having a vision of ninety-nine red balloons floating over the Black Shroud.
#. column 1: The last time Ixali engineer Dezul Qualan was seen was the day he boarded his greatest creation─a war balloon thrice the size of any ever built, and equipped with enough provisions to last a man a full moon in the clouds. His destination: the floating continent of Ayatlan.
#. column 2: Soar once again, we shall.<br>Within <i>Dezul Qualan</i>,<br>our salvation lies!<br>  - Sezul Totoloc
#. column 3: Fly Like the Wind
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:125:0:4"
msgid "Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone."
msgstr "Наносит ближайшему вражескому арканум-камню 5% урона."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・コボルド2号」を呼び出す。<br>コボルドを模しーた　魔法にんぎょーう　２号ちゃーん
#. de: Die unbestrittene - und ewige - Nummer 2 der Kobolde.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée kobolde n°2. Une autre mascotte de Kobold, oui, comme l'autre mais pas la même, non<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Unsatisfied with the explosive power of his first creation, 789th Order Acolyte Ba Go returned to his laboratories deep within the faction dig to create the “kobolder” (a name he was quite pleased with), only to see it sold for scrap by his dim-witted brethren.
#. column 2: Doings of small minds<br>and grubby hands are<br>of no interest to Ba Go.<br>  - Acolyte Ba Go
#. column 3: Untested Prototype
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:126:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up kobolder minion. Bolder than a wind-up kobold, yet not any older."
msgstr "Призывает заводного коболдера. Коболд смелее — но не старше."

#. ja: アコライト789 バ・ゴが開発した新型爆弾。爆発力を増しつつ、武装鉱山のコボルド族に似せて外見を調整したのが特徴。しかし、またもや第789洞穴団の商人が勝手に商材に加えたため、危険物が出回ることとなった
#. de: Unzufrieden mit der Explosivkraft des ersten Exemplars, kehrte Ba Go in sein Laboratorium zurück und erschuf den Kobold Nr. 2. Mit Erfolg, denn Nr. 2 lebt!
#. fr: Bombe d'un nouveau type mise au point par Ba Go, plus puissante que les précédentes, elle ressemble à s'y méprendre à une inoffensive poupée. Un marchand l'ayant mise en vente, mieux vaut éviter les jouets kobolds un moment.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up kobolder minion. Bolder than a wind-up kobold, yet not any older.
#. column 2: Doings of small minds<br>and grubby hands are<br>of no interest to Ba Go.<br>  - Acolyte Ba Go
#. column 3: Untested Prototype
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:126:0:1"
msgid "Unsatisfied with the explosive power of his first creation, 789th Order Acolyte Ba Go returned to his laboratories deep within the faction dig to create the “kobolder” (a name he was quite pleased with), only to see it sold for scrap by his dim-witted brethren."
msgstr "Не удовлетворившись мощью своего первого творения, послушник 789-го отряда Ба Го вернулся в лабораторию в глубине шахты и создал «коболдера» (название ему очень нравилось). Но собратья-тугодумы продали игрушку на металлолом."

#. ja: チクタクチクタク…
#. de: Neues du willst wissen?<br>Ja, bei meinen lieben Bombern es gibt Neues!<br><i>Ba Go</i>
#. fr: Tic tac tic tac...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up kobolder minion. Bolder than a wind-up kobold, yet not any older.
#. column 1: Unsatisfied with the explosive power of his first creation, 789th Order Acolyte Ba Go returned to his laboratories deep within the faction dig to create the “kobolder” (a name he was quite pleased with), only to see it sold for scrap by his dim-witted brethren.
#. column 3: Untested Prototype
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:126:0:2"
msgid "Doings of small minds<br>and grubby hands are<br>of no interest to Ba Go.<br>  - Acolyte Ba Go"
msgstr "Ба Го не интересуют<br>делишки мелких умов<br>и грязных лап.<br>  — Послушник Ба Го"

#. ja: 新型爆弾
#. de: Supersprengstoff
#. fr: Bombe prototype
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up kobolder minion. Bolder than a wind-up kobold, yet not any older.
#. column 1: Unsatisfied with the explosive power of his first creation, 789th Order Acolyte Ba Go returned to his laboratories deep within the faction dig to create the “kobolder” (a name he was quite pleased with), only to see it sold for scrap by his dim-witted brethren.
#. column 2: Doings of small minds<br>and grubby hands are<br>of no interest to Ba Go.<br>  - Acolyte Ba Go
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:126:0:3"
msgid "Untested Prototype"
msgstr "Непроверенный прототип"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK300のダメージを与える。ただし、特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンは強制帰還する。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 300 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus, aber die ausführenden Trabanten werden weggeschickt.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 300 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT sont au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment renvoyées.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up kobolder minion. Bolder than a wind-up kobold, yet not any older.
#. column 1: Unsatisfied with the explosive power of his first creation, 789th Order Acolyte Ba Go returned to his laboratories deep within the faction dig to create the “kobolder” (a name he was quite pleased with), only to see it sold for scrap by his dim-witted brethren.
#. column 2: Doings of small minds<br>and grubby hands are<br>of no interest to Ba Go.<br>  - Acolyte Ba Go
#. column 3: Untested Prototype
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:126:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 300. После применения миньоны, потратившие очки особого приёма, немедленно покидают поле боя."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・シーデビル」を呼び出す。<br>紅珊瑚の海魔を模した魔法人形
#. de: Eine Marionette, die dem berüchtigten Anführer der Riff-Harpunen nachempfunden ist. Pikst nur ganz selten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte démon des mers mécanique. Un pantin à l'effigie du plus puissant Sssahuagin, le terrible démon des mers écarlate<nbsp>! Fssshhh<nbsp>!!
#. column 1: Ever the loving clutchfather, Novv had this toy crafted, complete with blood red accents, for his infant spawnlings. When wound up, it displays the ferocity and cunning that was the clutch's first patriarch─the Scarlet Sea Devil.
#. column 2: The white coral necklace<br>he wore was stained<br>perpetually red with blood.<br>  - Ururu Kogururu
#. column 3: Trident
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:127:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Sea Devil minion. A clockwork automaton expertly crafted to resemble the infamous Scarlet Sea Devil, leader of the Coral Tridents."
msgstr "Призывает заводного Морского Дьявола. Искусно выполненная игрушка изображает печально известного Алого Морского Дьявола, предводителя Коралловых Трезубцев."

#. ja: 現役時代の「紅珊瑚の海魔」を模した魔法人形。父親の武勇を伝えつつも、その行いを反面教師とするため、一味の長兄たちが作ったもの。当時のノォヴは、「海魔の兵糧丸」を常食していたため、体色が濃かったらしい
#. de: Als fürsorglicher Laichvater ließ Novv dieses putzige Spielzeug mit aufgemalten Blutspritzern für seine Kleinen bauen. An Wildheit und Verschlagenheit kann der kleine Seeteufel es mit dem Original durchaus aufnehmen.
#. fr: Un automate inspiré du démon des mers écarlate. Les aînés de la Couvée l'ont fabriqué à la fois pour montrer les exploits de leur père et en faire un exemple à ne pas suivre. Son régime à base de rations serpent de mer l'a fait brunir...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Sea Devil minion. A clockwork automaton expertly crafted to resemble the infamous Scarlet Sea Devil, leader of the Coral Tridents.
#. column 2: The white coral necklace<br>he wore was stained<br>perpetually red with blood.<br>  - Ururu Kogururu
#. column 3: Trident
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:127:0:1"
msgid "Ever the loving clutchfather, Novv had this toy crafted, complete with blood red accents, for his infant spawnlings. When wound up, it displays the ferocity and cunning that was the clutch's first patriarch─the Scarlet Sea Devil."
msgstr "Из заботы о своих крошечных детёнышах Новв заказал игрушку с алыми, словно кровь, отметинами. Стоит завести её, и она покажет свирепость и хитрость первого патриарха выводка — Алого Морского Дьявола."

#. ja: フスィーッ！！
#. de: Erwähne seinen Namen in einer Hafenkneipe,<br>und die Arme und Beine vieler Seemänner fangen<br>wie von Geisterhand an zu schlottern!<br><i>Ururu Kogururu</i>
#. fr: Fssshh<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Sea Devil minion. A clockwork automaton expertly crafted to resemble the infamous Scarlet Sea Devil, leader of the Coral Tridents.
#. column 1: Ever the loving clutchfather, Novv had this toy crafted, complete with blood red accents, for his infant spawnlings. When wound up, it displays the ferocity and cunning that was the clutch's first patriarch─the Scarlet Sea Devil.
#. column 3: Trident
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:127:0:2"
msgid "The white coral necklace<br>he wore was stained<br>perpetually red with blood.<br>  - Ururu Kogururu"
msgstr "Белое коралловое ожерелье<br>на его шее всегда было<br>залито кровью.<br>  — Уруру Когуруру"

#. ja: 珊瑚の銛
#. de: Sapsa-Pikser
#. fr: Harpon de corail
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Sea Devil minion. A clockwork automaton expertly crafted to resemble the infamous Scarlet Sea Devil, leader of the Coral Tridents.
#. column 1: Ever the loving clutchfather, Novv had this toy crafted, complete with blood red accents, for his infant spawnlings. When wound up, it displays the ferocity and cunning that was the clutch's first patriarch─the Scarlet Sea Devil.
#. column 2: The white coral necklace<br>he wore was stained<br>perpetually red with blood.<br>  - Ururu Kogururu
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:127:0:3"
msgid "Trident"
msgstr "Трезубец"

