#. ja: ミニオン「黒チョコチョコボ・フライヤー」を呼び出す。<br>チョコチョコ空飛ぶチョコボの子。この毛色は産まれながら
#. de: Du rufst dein Brief-Chocobo-Küken als Begleiter herbei. Eines Tages wird dieser Chocobo eilige Nachrichten durch die Lüfte tragen, aber noch traut er sich keine fünf Yalme von dir weg.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé chocobo noir volant. Il vaudrait peut-être mieux pour vous ne pas lui confier votre courrier important tout de suite.
#. column 1: Spiteful claims that this adorable black chocobo hatchling is, in fact, simply another plain yellow chocobo colored with pine tar in a feeble attempt to prey on prospective buyers have only fueled the natural-born flyer's passion to take to the skies.
#. column 2: Kweh!<br>   - Every Chocobo Ever
#. column 3: Choco Trap
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:128:0:0"
msgid "Summon your chocobo chick courier minion. It may not be in your best interest to entrust him with any important missives just yet."
msgstr "Призывает миньона-почтальона — птенца чокобо. Важные письма ему пока лучше не доверять."

#. ja: チョコチョコ空飛ぶチョコボの子。飛行用に品種改良されたフライヤー種のチョコボであり、黒々としたその毛色は産まれながらのもの。断じて塗られたものではないのだと証明するため、日々、飛行訓練に励む
#. de: Böse Zungen, die behaupten, dass dieses niedliche schwarze Küken nur ein gewöhnlicher gelber Chocobo ist, der in eine Teergrube geplumpst ist, halten den Racker nicht von seinen Flugversuchen ab.
#. fr: Ce petit chocobo est de la race des volants, son plumage est noir de naissance et non teint. Pour prouver qu'il est un authentique volant, il s'entraîne chaque jour à s'élever plus haut dans les airs.
#. column 0: Summon your chocobo chick courier minion. It may not be in your best interest to entrust him with any important missives just yet.
#. column 2: Kweh!<br>   - Every Chocobo Ever
#. column 3: Choco Trap
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:128:0:1"
msgid "Spiteful claims that this adorable black chocobo hatchling is, in fact, simply another plain yellow chocobo colored with pine tar in a feeble attempt to prey on prospective buyers have only fueled the natural-born flyer's passion to take to the skies."
msgstr "Злые языки твердят, будто этот очаровательный чёрный птенец — обычный жёлтый чокобо, вымазанный сосновой смолой ради наживы. Но такие слухи лишь разжигают в прирождённом летуне страсть к небу."

#. ja: クエッ、クエ～ッ！
#. de: Kweh!<br><i>Jeder Chocobo, zu jeder Tageszeit</i>
#. fr: Kwééé<nbsp>! Kwéééé<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon your chocobo chick courier minion. It may not be in your best interest to entrust him with any important missives just yet.
#. column 1: Spiteful claims that this adorable black chocobo hatchling is, in fact, simply another plain yellow chocobo colored with pine tar in a feeble attempt to prey on prospective buyers have only fueled the natural-born flyer's passion to take to the skies.
#. column 3: Choco Trap
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:128:0:2"
msgid "Kweh!<br>   - Every Chocobo Ever"
msgstr "Кве!<br>  — Любой чокобо на свете"

#. ja: チョコトラップ
#. de: Chocofalle
#. fr: Chocopiège
#. column 0: Summon your chocobo chick courier minion. It may not be in your best interest to entrust him with any important missives just yet.
