msgid "Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
msgstr "Устанавливает ловушку, которая срабатывает через 10 секунд и наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 260.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Задержка срабатывания:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・カイン」を呼び出す。<br>伝説の竜騎士を模した魔法人形。俺は正気に戻った！
#. de: Du rufst deine Kain-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Beliebt bei Ishgardern ab 4 Jahren.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Kaïn miniature. Un légendaire chevalier dragon. Il semble être atteint de troubles de la personnalité...
#. column 1: The tale of Kain─the dragoon who abandoned his duty for honor─is well known amongst Ishgardian children. To maximize the height on his jumps, the craftsman of this clockwork automaton lined the main control springs with over-aspected wind crystals.
#. column 2: It's all right. I...I'm back<br>in control of myself.<br>   - Kain
#. column 3: Dragoon's Might
#. column 4: Renders ally Gates, Shield, and Search Eye impervious to damage.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:129:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Kain minion. A few moments may be needed to allow him to regain control of himself."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — заводного Кейна. Возможно, ему понадобится немного времени, чтобы снова взять себя в руки."

#. ja: 伝説の竜騎士「カイン」を模した魔法人形。誰よりも高く大空へと「ジャンプ」したという伝承を再現すべく、偏属性クリスタルを埋め込んでいる。そのせいなのか、時折、不審な動きをするらしい。大丈夫だ、俺は正気に戻った！
#. de: Jedes Kind in Ishgard kennt die Geschichte von Kain, dem Dragoon, der Ehre vor seine Pflicht stellte. Um die Sprungkraft der Aufziehpuppe zu maximieren, verstärkte der Handwerker die Haupt-<br>federvorrichtung mit Windkristallen.
#. fr: Un pantin à l'effigie du fameux chevalier dragon Kaïn qui contient un cristal corrompu afin de reproduire son légendaire Saut. Est-ce pour cela qu'il disparaît parfois sans raison<nbsp>? Il faut espérer qu'il a bel et bien repris le contrôle de lui-même...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Kain minion. A few moments may be needed to allow him to regain control of himself.
#. column 2: It's all right. I...I'm back<br>in control of myself.<br>   - Kain
#. column 3: Dragoon's Might
#. column 4: Renders ally Gates, Shield, and Search Eye impervious to damage.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:129:0:1"
msgid "The tale of Kain─the dragoon who abandoned his duty for honor─is well known amongst Ishgardian children. To maximize the height on his jumps, the craftsman of this clockwork automaton lined the main control springs with over-aspected wind crystals."
msgstr ""

#. ja: フッ、任セテオケ
#. de: Schon bald wirst du erkennen, dass ich mehr bin,<br>als Cecil jemals sein könnte.<br><i>Kain</i>
#. fr: Je m'en occupe. Un jeu d'enfant<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Kain minion. A few moments may be needed to allow him to regain control of himself.
#. column 1: The tale of Kain─the dragoon who abandoned his duty for honor─is well known amongst Ishgardian children. To maximize the height on his jumps, the craftsman of this clockwork automaton lined the main control springs with over-aspected wind crystals.
#. column 3: Dragoon's Might
#. column 4: Renders ally Gates, Shield, and Search Eye impervious to damage.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:129:0:2"
msgid "It's all right. I...I'm back<br>in control of myself.<br>   - Kain"
msgstr "Всё в порядке. Я... снова<br>взял себя в руки.<br>   — Кейн"

#. ja: 竜騎士の意地
#. de: Schutz des Dragoons
#. fr: Insaisissabilité
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Kain minion. A few moments may be needed to allow him to regain control of himself.
#. column 1: The tale of Kain─the dragoon who abandoned his duty for honor─is well known amongst Ishgardian children. To maximize the height on his jumps, the craftsman of this clockwork automaton lined the main control springs with over-aspected wind crystals.
