#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・アルフィノ」を呼び出す。<br>アルフィノを模した魔法人形。すべてはエオルゼアのために！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Alphinaud als Begleiter herbei. Perfekt geeignet für internationale Gipfeltreffen, Familienfeiern, Zusammenkünfte vor und nach Schlachten sowie jede andere Gelegenheit, bei der die Rekapitulation vergangener Ereignisse absolut unabdingbar ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Alphinaud miniature. Ce pantin à l'effigie du jeune commandant des Braves du Cristal semble tout aussi prétentieux et agaçant que le vrai. Pour Éorzéa<nbsp>!
#. column 1: In an attempt to secure funding for the financially strapped organization, the Crystal Braves treasurer took it upon himself to have three score thousand crafted and delivered to Rowena's House of Splendors for sale...where they have been collecting dust since...
#. column 2: Coming from an influential<br>family certainly has its<br>advantages!<br>  - Wedge
#. column 3: Operation Archon
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 13%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:130:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Alphinaud minion. Perfect for international summits, family get-togethers, pre- or post-battle gatherings, or any other occasion where the recapitulation of past occurrences is absolutely, positively necessary."
msgstr "Призывает заводного Альфино. Идеален для международных саммитов, семейных встреч, собраний до и после битвы и любых других случаев, когда крайне необходимо подвести итоги минувших событий."

#. ja: シャーレアンの名門、ルヴェユール家の御曹司を模した魔法人形。クリスタルブレイブの主計官が、活動費を稼ぐために製造したものの、総帥にバレて販売中止命令を受けてしまった。結果的に、倉庫に山積みされることに
#. de: Zur Aufbringung von finanziellen Mitteln ließ der Schatzmeister der Kristallstreiter zehntausende dieser Marionetten herstellen, um sie in Rowenas Haus der Wunder zu verkaufen ... wo sie seitdem wie Blei in den Regalen liegen.
#. fr: Le trésorier des Braves du Cristal avait lancé la fabrication de ce pantin dans le but de remplir les coffres de l'or<shy>ga<shy>ni<shy>sa<shy>tion, mais le commandant Leveilleur a ordonné l'arrêt de la production dès qu'il s'en est aperçu. Il en reste depuis un stock...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Alphinaud minion. Perfect for international summits, family get-togethers, pre- or post-battle gatherings, or any other occasion where the recapitulation of past occurrences is absolutely, positively necessary.
#. column 2: Coming from an influential<br>family certainly has its<br>advantages!<br>  - Wedge
#. column 3: Operation Archon
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 13%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:130:0:1"
msgid "In an attempt to secure funding for the financially strapped organization, the Crystal Braves treasurer took it upon himself to have three score thousand crafted and delivered to Rowena's House of Splendors for sale...where they have been collecting dust since... "
msgstr "Пытаясь раздобыть денег для испытывающего финансовые трудности ордена, казначей Бравых Кристалла самолично заказал шестьдесят тысяч куколок в образе Альфино и отправил их на продажу в лавку Великолепия Ровены... Где они с тех пор и пылятся..."

#. ja: ヤメテクレタマエ…
#. de: Zahlt sich wohl aus, aus vornehmem<br>Hause zu stammen, was?<br><i>Wedge</i>
#. fr: Pour Éorzéa<nbsp>!
