msgctxt "CompanionTransient:131:0:3"
msgid "Futures Past"
msgstr "Будущее из прошлого"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Alisaie minion. For those who believe the better half deserves more time in the spotlight.
#. column 1: In an attempt to cover the financial losses suffered when creating three score thousand wind-up Alphinauds, the Crystal Braves treasurer took it upon himself to simply swap the mammet's hair bows and rebrand the dolls as wind-up Alisaies.
#. column 2: For the future of Eorzea!<br>  - Alisaie (and Alphinaud)
#. column 3: Futures Past
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:131:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range. "
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 90."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・タタル」を呼び出す。<br>タタルを模した魔法人形。よろしくでっす
#. de: Du rufst deine Tataru-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. So ehrgeizig, so reizend ...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Tataru miniature. Elle est si mignonne qu'elle va vous faire fondre<nbsp>!
#. column 1: A routine inspection of Scion spending ledgers uncovered an order placed for ten score automata crafted in Tataru's image. When probed about the unauthorized use of organization funds for personal use, the receptionist merely smiled and struck an adorable pose.
#. column 2: Hmm. Tataru has ever<br>been full of surprises.<br>   - Minfilia
#. column 3: Special Tonic
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:132:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Tataru minion and prepare to have your heart melt."
msgstr "Призывает заводную Татары — берегитесь, сердце растает!"

#. ja: 「暁の血盟」の受付、タタル嬢を模した魔法人形。金庫番でもあるタタル自ら、彫金師ギルドに依頼して製作。重要な情報提供者や、物資を格安で卸してくれる商人に、感謝の気持ちを込めて配っているのだとか
#. de: Niemand weiß, wer die Herstellung einer Tataru-Puppe in Auftrag gab ... Doch die Überprüfung der Geschäftsbücher des Bundes der Morgenröte ergaben Un<shy>stimmig<shy>keiten, über die die Rezeptionistin einfach hinweglächelte.
#. fr: Une poupée inspirée de la réceptionniste des Héritiers de la Septième Aube, commandée par Tataru en personne. Apparemment, elle l'offre à certains marchands complaisants et à des informateurs pour les remercier.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Tataru minion and prepare to have your heart melt.
#. column 2: Hmm. Tataru has ever<br>been full of surprises.<br>   - Minfilia
#. column 3: Special Tonic
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:132:0:1"
msgid "A routine inspection of Scion spending ledgers uncovered an order placed for ten score automata crafted in Tataru's image. When probed about the unauthorized use of organization funds for personal use, the receptionist merely smiled and struck an adorable pose."
msgstr "Плановая проверка расходов Потомков обнаружила заказ на двести куколок в образе Татары. Когда у секретаря спросили, почему она тратит деньги организации на себя, та лишь улыбнулась и приняла очаровательную позу."

#. ja: ヨロシクデッス！
#. de: Wir haben jetzt alle Hände voll zu tun. Besonders<br>die arme Tataru, aber sie würde sich natürlich nie<br>beklagen.<br><i>Minfilia</i>
#. fr: ♪ Une jolie rose a fleuri...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Tataru minion and prepare to have your heart melt.
#. column 1: A routine inspection of Scion spending ledgers uncovered an order placed for ten score automata crafted in Tataru's image. When probed about the unauthorized use of organization funds for personal use, the receptionist merely smiled and struck an adorable pose.
#. column 3: Special Tonic
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:132:0:2"
msgid "Hmm. Tataru has ever<br>been full of surprises.<br>   - Minfilia"
msgstr "Хм. Татара всегда<br>умела удивлять.<br>  — Минфилия"

#. ja: 特製薬茶
#. de: Spezialtee
#. fr: Tisane spéciale
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Tataru minion and prepare to have your heart melt.
#. column 1: A routine inspection of Scion spending ledgers uncovered an order placed for ten score automata crafted in Tataru's image. When probed about the unauthorized use of organization funds for personal use, the receptionist merely smiled and struck an adorable pose.
#. column 2: Hmm. Tataru has ever<br>been full of surprises.<br>   - Minfilia
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:132:0:3"
msgid "Special Tonic"
msgstr "Особый тоник"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のDEFを10上昇させる。味方のタイプが「ドール」の場合は、DEFが30上昇する。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Erhöht die ABW von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, im Fall von Puppen um 30.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 10 la défense des alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou de 30 s'ils sont de type “Poupée”.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Tataru minion and prepare to have your heart melt.
#. column 1: A routine inspection of Scion spending ledgers uncovered an order placed for ten score automata crafted in Tataru's image. When probed about the unauthorized use of organization funds for personal use, the receptionist merely smiled and struck an adorable pose.
#. column 2: Hmm. Tataru has ever<br>been full of surprises.<br>   - Minfilia
#. column 3: Special Tonic
