msgctxt "CompanionTransient:132:0:4"
msgid "Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s"
msgstr "Повышает ЗАЩ всех союзников в радиусе действия на 10 (на 30, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>кукла</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・シド」を呼び出す。<br>シドを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deine Cid-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Legendäres Luftschiff nicht in der Packung enthalten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Cid miniature. L'ingénieur en chef des Forges de Garlond. Il n'a pas peur de mettre les mains dans le cambouis<nbsp>!
#. column 1: When faced with a lack of coin to fund projects, Garlond Ironworks engineers designed the wind-up Cid, with hopes that sales of the automaton would fill their coffers. Indeed, sales have been impressive, the item bringing in just enough gil to pay for the founder's debts.
#. column 2: Run, Cid. Or stay.<br>It makes no matter. You<br>cannot escape the past.<br>   - Gaius van Baelsar
#. column 3: Magitrap
#. column 4: Sets a trap which can be activated by button after 10 seconds. When triggered, it delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:133:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Cid minion. When asked, if he had a granddaughter, what would he like to see her named, the Ironworks founder replied, “Gertrude.”"
msgstr "Призывает заводного Сида. На вопрос, как бы он назвал внучку, если бы она у него была, основатель мастерских ответил: «Гертруда»."

#. ja: 天才機工師シドを模した魔法人形。「ガーロンド・アイアンワークス」の会長代行が、企画・設計・販売を行った商品。売れ行きは好調らしく、「売上にならない活動ばかりの会長より、よほど稼いでくれる」とのこと
#. de: Die Spielzeugversion des legendären Ingenieurs erweist sich als Verkaufsschlager, der den Wert der Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ke in neue Höhen treibt.
#. fr: Une poupée s'inspirant de l'inventeur de génie, et conçue par le suppléant du directeur des Forges de Garlond. Elle rencontre un succès commercial étonnant qui aidera peut-être à éponger les dépenses du véritable directeur...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Cid minion. When asked, if he had a granddaughter, what would he like to see her named, the Ironworks founder replied, “Gertrude.”
#. column 2: Run, Cid. Or stay.<br>It makes no matter. You<br>cannot escape the past.<br>   - Gaius van Baelsar
#. column 3: Magitrap
#. column 4: Sets a trap which can be activated by button after 10 seconds. When triggered, it delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:133:0:1"
msgid "When faced with a lack of coin to fund projects, Garlond Ironworks engineers designed the wind-up Cid, with hopes that sales of the automaton would fill their coffers. Indeed, sales have been impressive, the item bringing in just enough gil to pay for the founder's debts."
msgstr "Когда Гэрлондским мастерским понадобились деньги на проекты, инженеры сконструировали заводного Сида в надежде пополнить казну продажами. Игрушка и правда разошлась на ура — выручки как раз хватило, чтобы расплатиться с долгами основателя."

#. ja: エエイ、突ッコムゾ！
#. de: Cid Garlond, du <i>lebst</i>?!<br><i>Drillemont</i>
#. fr: Allez, on plonge<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Cid minion. When asked, if he had a granddaughter, what would he like to see her named, the Ironworks founder replied, “Gertrude.”
#. column 1: When faced with a lack of coin to fund projects, Garlond Ironworks engineers designed the wind-up Cid, with hopes that sales of the automaton would fill their coffers. Indeed, sales have been impressive, the item bringing in just enough gil to pay for the founder's debts.
#. column 3: Magitrap
#. column 4: Sets a trap which can be activated by button after 10 seconds. When triggered, it delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:133:0:2"
msgid "Run, Cid. Or stay.<br>It makes no matter. You<br>cannot escape the past.<br>   - Gaius van Baelsar"
msgstr "Беги, Сид. Или оставайся.<br>Какая разница? От прошлого<br>тебе всё равно не уйти.<br>  — Гай ван Баэлсар"

#. ja: 魔導トラップ
#. de: Magitek-Falle
#. fr: Piège magitek
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Cid minion. When asked, if he had a granddaughter, what would he like to see her named, the Ironworks founder replied, “Gertrude.”
#. column 1: When faced with a lack of coin to fund projects, Garlond Ironworks engineers designed the wind-up Cid, with hopes that sales of the automaton would fill their coffers. Indeed, sales have been impressive, the item bringing in just enough gil to pay for the founder's debts.
#. column 2: Run, Cid. Or stay.<br>It makes no matter. You<br>cannot escape the past.<br>   - Gaius van Baelsar
#. column 4: Sets a trap which can be activated by button after 10 seconds. When triggered, it delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:133:0:3"
msgid "Magitrap"
msgstr "Магитех-ловушка"

#. ja: トラップを配置する。10秒後トラップ発動ボタンにより起爆可能。範囲内にいる敵にATK180のダメージを与える。
#. de: Stellt eine Falle auf, die nach 10 Sekunden ausgelöst werden kann. Bewirkt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 180 auf die Feinde in der Nähe.
#. fr: Place un piège qui peut être déclenché 10 secondes plus tard.<br>Piège<nbsp>: inflige des dégâts d'attaque 180 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Cid minion. When asked, if he had a granddaughter, what would he like to see her named, the Ironworks founder replied, “Gertrude.”
#. column 1: When faced with a lack of coin to fund projects, Garlond Ironworks engineers designed the wind-up Cid, with hopes that sales of the automaton would fill their coffers. Indeed, sales have been impressive, the item bringing in just enough gil to pay for the founder's debts.
#. column 2: Run, Cid. Or stay.<br>It makes no matter. You<br>cannot escape the past.<br>   - Gaius van Baelsar
#. column 3: Magitrap
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:133:0:4"
msgid "Sets a trap which can be activated by button after 10 seconds. When triggered, it delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range. "
msgstr "Устанавливает ловушку, которую можно привести в действие кнопкой через 10 секунд. При срабатывании наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 180."

#. ja: ミニオン「ユニコルト」を呼び出す。<br>ユニコーンの幼獣。心の清らかな者にしか懐かない
#. de: Du rufst dein Kleinhorn als Begleiter herbei. Vorsicht, Kleinhorn macht auch Mist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé licorne. On dit souvent que deux cornes valent mieux qu'une, mais elle n'est pas du tout d'accord.
#. column 1: Symbols of purity and innocence, newborn unicorns are kept by the Ishgardian church to create holy water used in sacred rites─a process that involves the creatures dipping their horns in spring water while a sanctified priest blesses it.
#. column 2: Four-legged and tall, with a<br>pristine white coat and a single<br>horn protruding from its brow!<br>   - Braya
#. column 3: Alicorn
#. column 4: Increases speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:134:0:0"
msgid "Summon your unicolt minion. Because two horns are not always better than one."
msgstr "Призывает единорожка. Два рога — не всегда лучше одного."

#. ja: ユニコーンの幼獣。額の角に秘められた力によって、儀式に用いる聖水を浄化するために、イシュガルド教皇庁の庭園にて飼育されていた。冒険者による突入騒ぎの混乱に乗じ、広い世界に旅立つ決心をしたらしい
#. de: Dem magischen Einhorn nachempfunden, das bei den Priestern Ishgards als Symbol der Reinheit gilt und eine wichtige Rolle bei der Herstellung von Weihwasser spielt.
#. fr: Cette jeune licorne a été élevée dans les jardins royaux d'Ishgard pour purifier l'eau bénite des cérémonies avec sa corne. Elle a profité de l'agitation récente pour partir faire un grand voyage dans le monde extérieur.
#. column 0: Summon your unicolt minion. Because two horns are not always better than one.
#. column 2: Four-legged and tall, with a<br>pristine white coat and a single<br>horn protruding from its brow!<br>   - Braya
#. column 3: Alicorn
#. column 4: Increases speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:134:0:1"
msgid "Symbols of purity and innocence, newborn unicorns are kept by the Ishgardian church to create holy water used in sacred rites─a process that involves the creatures dipping their horns in spring water while a sanctified priest blesses it."
msgstr "Символы чистоты и невинности, новорождённые единороги живут при церкви Ишгарда и помогают готовить святую воду для обрядов. Они окунают рога в родниковую воду, а освящённый жрец благословляет её."

#. ja: ヒヒィーン！
#. de: Das war kein gewöhnliches Pferd ...<br><i>Braya</i>
#. fr: Hiiih...
#. column 0: Summon your unicolt minion. Because two horns are not always better than one.
#. column 1: Symbols of purity and innocence, newborn unicorns are kept by the Ishgardian church to create holy water used in sacred rites─a process that involves the creatures dipping their horns in spring water while a sanctified priest blesses it.
#. column 3: Alicorn
#. column 4: Increases speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:134:0:2"
msgid "Four-legged and tall, with a<br>pristine white coat and a single<br>horn protruding from its brow!<br>   - Braya"
msgstr "Четвероногий, высокий,<br>в белоснежной шёрстке,<br>с рогом на лбу!<br>  — Брайя"

#. ja: アリコーン
#. de: Ainkhürn
#. fr: Alicorne
#. column 0: Summon your unicolt minion. Because two horns are not always better than one.
#. column 1: Symbols of purity and innocence, newborn unicorns are kept by the Ishgardian church to create holy water used in sacred rites─a process that involves the creatures dipping their horns in spring water while a sanctified priest blesses it.
#. column 2: Four-legged and tall, with a<br>pristine white coat and a single<br>horn protruding from its brow!<br>   - Braya
#. column 4: Increases speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:134:0:3"
msgid "Alicorn"
msgstr "Аликорн"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の移動速度を35%上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Erhöht die GSW von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe um 35 %.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 35% la vitesse de déplacement des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your unicolt minion. Because two horns are not always better than one.
