#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・グンド」を呼び出す。<br>グンド族を模した魔法人形。虹のように鮮やかだ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Gundo als Begleiter herbei. Sieht schwerer aus, als er ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée gundu. Elle est beaucoup plus légère qu'elle en a l'air.
#. column 1: Created by a Gundu shaman using techniques similar to those employed to craft battle totems, this animated doll contains no wheels or gears, but is rather propelled by an ancient Gundu enchantment known only to a handful of village elders.
#. column 2: Like breeze guides leaves to<br>rest, come and lay down your<br>burdens, netherlings!<br>   - Lonu Vanu
#. column 3: Sunrise Dance
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:135:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Gundu warrior minion. He weighs far less than he appears."
msgstr "Призывает заводного воина гундов. Он куда легче, чем кажется."

#. ja: バヌバヌ族を模した魔法人形。鮮やかなグンド族のまじない師が、トーテムを操る術式を応用して創り上げた。バヌバヌ族にとって、理想の体型である美しいボディラインを再現するのに、かなり苦心したという
#. de: Geschaffen von einem gefräßigen Gundo-Schamanen, der dem Abbild eines Vanu-Kriegers dadurch Leben einhauchte, dass er nach einem deftigen Essen dezent aushauchte.
#. fr: Un chaman de la tribu des Gundu a con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>né cette poupée en s'inspirant des méthodes de fabrication des totems vanu vanu. Il a mis un point d'honneur à reproduire une silhouette arrondie, symbole de prospérité chez les Vanu Vanu.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gundu warrior minion. He weighs far less than he appears.
#. column 2: Like breeze guides leaves to<br>rest, come and lay down your<br>burdens, netherlings!<br>   - Lonu Vanu
#. column 3: Sunrise Dance
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:135:0:1"
msgid "Created by a Gundu shaman using techniques similar to those employed to craft battle totems, this animated doll contains no wheels or gears, but is rather propelled by an ancient Gundu enchantment known only to a handful of village elders."
msgstr "Эту куклу создал шаман гундов, применив древнее заклинание, которым оживляют боевые тотемы. Внутри нет ни колёс, ни шестерёнок — лишь тайное заклятие, известное немногим старейшинам деревни."

#. ja: グンド、グンド！
#. de: Seid willkommen, Na-Vanu-eeh,<br>wie milder Frühlingstag!<br><i>Lonu Vanu</i>
#. fr: Gens d'en bas<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gundu warrior minion. He weighs far less than he appears.
#. column 1: Created by a Gundu shaman using techniques similar to those employed to craft battle totems, this animated doll contains no wheels or gears, but is rather propelled by an ancient Gundu enchantment known only to a handful of village elders.
#. column 3: Sunrise Dance
