#. ja: ミニオン「ミニマムアトモス」を呼び出す。<br>小さなアトモス。吸引力が落ちないただひとつのミニオン
#. de: Du rufst deinen Mini-Atomos als Begleiter herbei. Reißt gerne mal das Maul auf.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte atomos atrophié. Ne vous amusez pas à jeter des gils dans sa gueule, car vous ne les reverrez sûrement jamais.
#. column 1: While the means by which this otherworldly devourer of aether became trapped in a treasure coffer is most certainly a mystery worthy of further investigation, the real question on everyone's minds here is, “Why did you let it out?”
#. column 2: Let all know that<br>a new threat to the<br>peace has emerged.<br>   - Sixth Astral Era Crier
#. column 3: Cyclone
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:136:0:0"
msgid "Summon your atrophied Atomos minion. Putting money where this voidsent's mouth is merely results in devoured money."
msgstr "Призывает усохшего Атомоса. Подкормите эту тварь из Пустоты деньгами — и она их проглотит."

#. ja: 小さなアトモス。宝箱から見つけたピクピク動く謎の肉片に、栄養素になりそうな素材を適当に与えたところ培養に成功。冒険者がカバンから捨てる物を、何でも吸い込むようになった。吸引力が落ちないただひとつのミニオン
#. de: Ein Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>ter ist niemals eine angenehme Erscheinung. Sogar in Miniaturform ist Atomos von einer Aura umgehen, die sagt: Renn und dreh dich nicht um.
#. fr: Un atomos miniature qui aurait été élevé en nourrissant un étrange morceau de chair frétillante trouvé dans un coffre. Il absorbe goulûment tout ce qu'on lui jette. Garanti sans perte d'aspiration.
#. column 0: Summon your atrophied Atomos minion. Putting money where this voidsent's mouth is merely results in devoured money.
#. column 2: Let all know that<br>a new threat to the<br>peace has emerged.<br>   - Sixth Astral Era Crier
#. column 3: Cyclone
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:136:0:1"
msgid "While the means by which this otherworldly devourer of aether became trapped in a treasure coffer is most certainly a mystery worthy of further investigation, the real question on everyone's minds here is, “Why did you let it out?”"
msgstr "Как именно пожиратель эфира из иного мира попал в сундук с сокровищами — тайна, достойная подробного расследования. Но всех волнует другое: зачем ты его выпустил?"

#. ja: 好きなようにはさせん！
#. de: Das Ende der Welt naht! Entledigt<br>euch eurer Habseligkeiten!<br><i>Weltuntergangsprediger<br>der Sechsten Ära des Lichts</i>
#. fr: Vwooohhm...
#. column 0: Summon your atrophied Atomos minion. Putting money where this voidsent's mouth is merely results in devoured money.
#. column 1: While the means by which this otherworldly devourer of aether became trapped in a treasure coffer is most certainly a mystery worthy of further investigation, the real question on everyone's minds here is, “Why did you let it out?”
#. column 3: Cyclone
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:136:0:2"
msgid "Let all know that<br>a new threat to the<br>peace has emerged.<br>   - Sixth Astral Era Crier"
msgstr "Пусть все знают:<br>миру грозит<br>новая опасность!<br>  — Глашатай Шестой астральной эры"

#. ja: サイクロン
#. de: Zyklon
#. fr: Cyclone
