#. ja: ミニオン「オウレット」を呼び出す。<br>オウルの幼鳥。実は読書家という噂
#. de: Du rufst deine Eulette als Begleiter herbei. Komplett mit um 360° drehbarem Kopf.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé hibou. Pas besoin d'avoir des yeux derrière la tête quand celle-ci peut quasiment faire un tour sur elle-même<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Preserved with temporal magicks and placed on display in the Fractal Continuum, this genetically enhanced cloudkin is documented as being one of the genetic components used in the creation of mirrorknights. He appears to have developed the capacity for reading.
#. column 2: It is difficult to even remember<br>the last time I spoke with<br>someone other than my<br>good friends the owls.<br>   - Roiteloin
#. column 3: Fundamental Reading
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:137:0:0"
msgid "Summon your owlet minion. Who needs eyes in the back of their head when you can spin your head full circle?"
msgstr "Призывает совёнка. Зачем глаза на затылке, если можно повернуть голову на все 360 градусов?"

#. ja: オウルの幼鳥。博物戦艦にて、ミラーナイト型キメラ生物の合成元として、時魔法をかけられ展示されていた。品種改良の影響か、非常に賢く読書を趣味とする。最近のお気に入りは、ゴシップ誌「週刊レイヴン」らしい
#. de: Es gibt Gelehrte, die diese Geschöpfe für intelligent halten, da sie ihre Augen wie beim Lesen von links nach rechts bewegen, wenn sie Nester aus den Seiten zerrupfter Geschichtsbücher bauen.
#. fr: Ce hibou était exposé dans Le Continuum fractal sous un sort de magie temporelle, en tant que créature chimérique de chevalier miroir. Il serait un grand lecteur, notamment du journal Le Corbeau. Phénomène d'amélioration de l'espèce<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your owlet minion. Who needs eyes in the back of their head when you can spin your head full circle?
#. column 2: It is difficult to even remember<br>the last time I spoke with<br>someone other than my<br>good friends the owls.<br>   - Roiteloin
#. column 3: Fundamental Reading
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:137:0:1"
msgid "Preserved with temporal magicks and placed on display in the Fractal Continuum, this genetically enhanced cloudkin is documented as being one of the genetic components used in the creation of mirrorknights. He appears to have developed the capacity for reading."
msgstr "Сохранённое магией времени и выставленное в «Фрактальном континууме», это улучшенное облачное создание, как установлено, послужило одним из компонентов для создания зеркальных рыцарей. Похоже, оно научилось читать."

#. ja: ホゥホゥ…
#. de: Hätte ich nur einen Eulensicht-Gürtel, der zu<br>meinem Eulensicht-Beinkleid passt.<br><i>Eitle Astrologin</i>
#. fr: Hou hou...
#. column 0: Summon your owlet minion. Who needs eyes in the back of their head when you can spin your head full circle?
#. column 1: Preserved with temporal magicks and placed on display in the Fractal Continuum, this genetically enhanced cloudkin is documented as being one of the genetic components used in the creation of mirrorknights. He appears to have developed the capacity for reading.
#. column 3: Fundamental Reading
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:137:0:2"
msgid "It is difficult to even remember<br>the last time I spoke with<br>someone other than my<br>good friends the owls.<br>   - Roiteloin"
msgstr "Уже и не вспомнить,<br>когда я в последний раз говорил<br>с кем-то, кроме моих<br>добрых друзей-сов.<br>   — Руатлуан"

#. ja: 読書
#. de: Querlesen
#. fr: Lecture rapide
