#. ja: ミニオン「アグリー・ダックリング」を呼び出す。<br>自称白鳥の幼鳥。何事にも保険をかけるタイプ
#. de: Du rufst dein hässliches Entlein als Begleiter herbei. Kann zu einem schönen Schwan heranwachsen - oder auch nicht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte vilain petit canard. Il adore regarder son reflet dans l'eau. Mais au fait, est-il vraiment un canard<nbsp>?
#. column 1: After suffering countless barbs from his bullying brothers, this tiny cloudkin had enough and left its home on Neverreap to find someplace he'd be called beautiful, too.
#. column 2: Hiss at me, he did;<br>fierce as goose, he was.<br>   - Jezul Ahuatan
#. column 3: Miserable Company
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:138:0:0"
msgid "Summon your ugly duckling minion. Will he turn into a graceful swan? Inquiring minds want to know."
msgstr "Призывает гадкого утёнка. Превратится ли он в прекрасного лебедя? Любопытные хотят знать!"

#. ja: 自称白鳥の幼鳥。バヌバヌ族の神域、ネバーリープの泉にて生まれ育ったが、意地悪な兄弟たちに愛想を尽かし旅立ちを決意。とはいえ飛べないので、冒険者の保護を受けることに。何事にも保険をかける慎重派のようだ
#. de: Irgendwann reichten dem Entlein die mitleidvollen Blicke seiner Artgenossen und es verließ das heimatliche Nimmerreich, um einen Ort zu finden, an dem es einfach nur es selbst sein kann.
#. fr: Ce caneton prétend qu'il est un bébé cygne. Né dans Nalloncques, la terre sainte des Vanu Vanu, il a quitté le nid familial suite à un conflit de canards. Incapable de voler, il trottera sagement à vos côtés.
#. column 0: Summon your ugly duckling minion. Will he turn into a graceful swan? Inquiring minds want to know.
#. column 2: Hiss at me, he did;<br>fierce as goose, he was.<br>   - Jezul Ahuatan
#. column 3: Miserable Company
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:138:0:1"
msgid "After suffering countless barbs from his bullying brothers, this tiny cloudkin had enough and left its home on Neverreap to find someplace he'd be called beautiful, too."
msgstr "Наслушавшись бесконечных насмешек братьев, этот крохотный облачный зверёк сбежал из дома на Неверлипе. Он надеется найти место, где и его будут считать красавцем."

#. ja: ガァガァ！
#. de: Ente serviert man am besten geröstet,<br>mit einer milden Orangensauce.<br><i>Lyngsath</i>
#. fr: Coin coin<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your ugly duckling minion. Will he turn into a graceful swan? Inquiring minds want to know.
#. column 1: After suffering countless barbs from his bullying brothers, this tiny cloudkin had enough and left its home on Neverreap to find someplace he'd be called beautiful, too.
#. column 3: Miserable Company
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:138:0:2"
msgid "Hiss at me, he did;<br>fierce as goose, he was.<br>   - Jezul Ahuatan"
msgstr "Шипел он на меня,<br>грозен был, как гусь.<br>  — Джезул Ауатан"

#. ja: 予期せぬ不幸
#. de: Rache des Schwans
#. fr: Malheur im<shy>pré<shy>vi<shy>si<shy>ble
#. column 0: Summon your ugly duckling minion. Will he turn into a graceful swan? Inquiring minds want to know.
#. column 1: After suffering countless barbs from his bullying brothers, this tiny cloudkin had enough and left its home on Neverreap to find someplace he'd be called beautiful, too.
#. column 2: Hiss at me, he did;<br>fierce as goose, he was.<br>   - Jezul Ahuatan
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:138:0:3"
msgid "Miserable Company"
msgstr "Несчастье подкралось"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your ugly duckling minion. Will he turn into a graceful swan? Inquiring minds want to know.
#. column 1: After suffering countless barbs from his bullying brothers, this tiny cloudkin had enough and left its home on Neverreap to find someplace he'd be called beautiful, too.
#. column 2: Hiss at me, he did;<br>fierce as goose, he was.<br>   - Jezul Ahuatan
