msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「ゲイラキトン」を呼び出す。<br>ゲイラキャットの幼獣。猫なのか鳥なのか、それが問題だ
#. de: Du rufst dein Geira-Kätzchen als Begleiter herbei. Abgegriffene Reisetagebücher mit Geschichten über putzige Kätzchen sind der Renner in den Gästezimmern Eorzeas.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte gaélichaton. Chaque fois qu'Alphinaud lève le doigt, les Dieux tuent une de ces adorables créatures.
#. column 1: Though its wings appear to be constructs of some sort rather than actual body parts, any who draw close are met with a violent flurry of scratching and punching, making it impossible to thoroughly inspect the creature's backside.
#. column 2: Watch it!<br>This kitten has claws!<br>   - Aldis
#. column 3: Gaelikick
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range while inflicting a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:139:0:0"
msgid "Summon your gaelikitten minion. Rumors that the gods kill one of these adorable creatures every time a young man thinks pleasurable thoughts are unfounded."
msgstr "Призывает миньона-гаэликотёнка. Слухи, будто боги убивают по одному такому милашке всякий раз, как юноша думает о приятном, не имеют оснований."

#. ja: ゲイラキャットの幼獣。霊峰「ソーム・アル」の山中で迷子になっていたところを保護した。背中の翼は背負っているようにも見えるが、外そうとすると嫌がるので試せない。実は下級妖異であるという説もあるが……
#. de: Die Flügel scheinen eher mechanischer Natur zu sein, aber die Kratzbürstigkeit der Geira-Kätzchen macht es schwer, sie genauer zu begutachten.
#. fr: Ce jeune gaélichat s'est perdu dans la montagne sacrée Sohm Al. Ses ailes semblent amovibles, mais il refuse que l'on y touche, ce qui rend la chose impossible à vérifier. Certains pensent que ce félin serait en fait un démon de bas rang...
#. column 0: Summon your gaelikitten minion. Rumors that the gods kill one of these adorable creatures every time a young man thinks pleasurable thoughts are unfounded.
#. column 2: Watch it!<br>This kitten has claws!<br>   - Aldis
#. column 3: Gaelikick
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range while inflicting a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:139:0:1"
msgid "Though its wings appear to be constructs of some sort rather than actual body parts, any who draw close are met with a violent flurry of scratching and punching, making it impossible to thoroughly inspect the creature's backside."
msgstr "Хотя крылья у него выглядят скорее приделанными, чем настоящими, стоит кому-то подойти поближе — и котёнок принимается яростно царапаться и лупить лапами. Осмотреть его спину толком никому не удаётся."

#. ja: マタタビッチ！
#. de: Guter Wein und ein süßes Kätzchen,<br>das wird dem Kapitän gefallen!<br><i>Hirskskrat</i>
#. fr: Maouh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your gaelikitten minion. Rumors that the gods kill one of these adorable creatures every time a young man thinks pleasurable thoughts are unfounded.
#. column 1: Though its wings appear to be constructs of some sort rather than actual body parts, any who draw close are met with a violent flurry of scratching and punching, making it impossible to thoroughly inspect the creature's backside.
#. column 3: Gaelikick
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range while inflicting a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:139:0:2"
msgid "Watch it!<br>This kitten has claws!<br>   - Aldis"
msgstr "Осторожно!<br>У котёнка когти!<br>  — Алдис"

#. ja: ネコキック
#. de: Zerkratzen
#. fr: Coup de gaélipatte
#. column 0: Summon your gaelikitten minion. Rumors that the gods kill one of these adorable creatures every time a young man thinks pleasurable thoughts are unfounded.
#. column 1: Though its wings appear to be constructs of some sort rather than actual body parts, any who draw close are met with a violent flurry of scratching and punching, making it impossible to thoroughly inspect the creature's backside.
