msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range while inflicting a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 90 и делает их уязвимыми к <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>животным</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「クロックワークカート」を呼び出す。<br>小さな手押し車玩具
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-Schubkarre als Begleiter herbei. Hast du einen kampfunfähigen Golem zu transportieren?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte brouette mécanique. Elle est pas chou, avec sa petite roue<nbsp>?
#. column 1: This self-propelled handcart was purchased from the Oak Atrium as a prize for the Greatloam Growery's gysahl green growing contest. The cart, however, was never awarded, for on the final day of the competition, it was discovered vilekin had devoured all the entries.
#. column 2: May Zo Ga singe his arse on<br>what's left of the wain!<br>   - Craftsman Bo Gu
#. column 3: Wax Fruit
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:140:0:0"
msgid "Summon your clockwork barrow minion and take a load off your shoulders."
msgstr "Призывает заводную тачку и помогает снять груз с плеч."

#. ja: からくり仕掛けの小さな手押し車。園芸師ギルド主催、ギサールの野菜コンテストの上位入賞者向けに、古樫の高堂の熟練職人が製作した品。しかし、野菜を投げる様が批判の対象となり回収され、お蔵入りとなったらしい
#. de: Dieses Gärtnerutensil mit Eigenantrieb wurde ursprünglich als Preis für einen Gizar-Zuchtwett- bewerb der Ährenkranzkolonie hergestellt, doch kam es nie zu einer Preisverleihung, da alle Gizar-Pflanzen von Ungeziefer aufgefressen wurden.
#. fr: Cette adorable brouette a été réalisée par un artisan pour être offerte comme prix d'un concours de légumes de Gysahl. Son habitude de lancer des légumes en l'air aurait déplu à la guilde, et on l'aurait retirée de la circulation.
#. column 0: Summon your clockwork barrow minion and take a load off your shoulders.
#. column 2: May Zo Ga singe his arse on<br>what's left of the wain!<br>   - Craftsman Bo Gu
#. column 3: Wax Fruit
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:140:0:1"
msgid "This self-propelled handcart was purchased from the Oak Atrium as a prize for the Greatloam Growery's gysahl green growing contest. The cart, however, was never awarded, for on the final day of the competition, it was discovered vilekin had devoured all the entries."
msgstr "Эту самоходную тачку купили в Дубовом атриуме как приз для конкурса по выращиванию гизальских овощей в Большой земледельческой оранжерее. Впрочем, вручить её так и не успели: в последний день состязания оказалось, что все работы съели вредители."

#. ja: コロコロコロ…
#. de: Die Abenteurer schleppen Allagische Steine<br>schubkarrenweise zu Rowena!<br><i>Eginolf</i>
#. fr: Krui krui...
#. column 0: Summon your clockwork barrow minion and take a load off your shoulders.
#. column 1: This self-propelled handcart was purchased from the Oak Atrium as a prize for the Greatloam Growery's gysahl green growing contest. The cart, however, was never awarded, for on the final day of the competition, it was discovered vilekin had devoured all the entries.
#. column 3: Wax Fruit
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
