#. ja: ミニオン「レッサーパンダ」を呼び出す。<br>レッサーパンダの幼獣。立つのは得意な方
#. de: Du rufst dein Rotpanda-Stofftier als Begleiter herbei. Flauschig, niedlich und rot.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petit panda roux. Il est plus petit qu'un panda normal, il vit moins longtemps, il est moins intelligent, et moins doux. Bon, peut-être pas moins doux.
#. column 1: There are several theories as to how a beastkin native to the mist-covered peaks of southeastern Ilsabard ended up thousands of leagues away from its home...and most involve an unhealthy infatuation with the furry creature by a certain imperial legatus.
#. column 2: Stand up straight, maggot!<br>   - Berkoeya
#. column 3: Take a Stand
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:141:0:0"
msgid "Summon your lesser panda minion. Lesser only in size to normal pandas. And in life expectancy. And intelligence. And fluffiness. Well, perhaps not fluffiness."
msgstr "Призывает малую панду. Она меньше обычной панды — ростом, сроком жизни, умом и пушистостью. Хотя, пожалуй, не пушистостью."

#. ja: レッサーパンダの幼獣。北州の南部や、東州辺境の山岳地帯に棲息するこの獣が、なぜ竜の巣にいたのかは不明。はるか東方まで旅したドラゴンが、連れ帰ってきたのかもしれない。とりあえず、立つのは得意な方らしい
#. de: Man munkelt, dass ein gewisser Legatus des Kaiserreichs mit einem Rotpanda-Stofftier zu schlafen pflegte, doch bei Gerüchten solcher Art handelt es sich meist um mhigische Schmutzkampagnen.
#. fr: Un bébé panda roux. On ignore ce qu'il faisait dans le Nid du dragon alors qu'il vit dans les montagnes du sud des provinces nordiques et à la lisière des provinces orientales. Un dragon l'a peut-être ramené lors d'un long voyage.
#. column 0: Summon your lesser panda minion. Lesser only in size to normal pandas. And in life expectancy. And intelligence. And fluffiness. Well, perhaps not fluffiness.
#. column 2: Stand up straight, maggot!<br>   - Berkoeya
#. column 3: Take a Stand
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:141:0:1"
msgid "There are several theories as to how a beastkin native to the mist-covered peaks of southeastern Ilsabard ended up thousands of leagues away from its home...and most involve an unhealthy infatuation with the furry creature by a certain imperial legatus."
msgstr "Есть разные теории, как зверёк из туманных гор юго-восточного Илсабарда оказался за тысячи лиг от дома... но почти все они сводятся к нездоровой привязанности одного имперского легата к этому пушистику."

#. ja: キュィ～！
#. de: Modisch bin ich nicht so bewandert,<br>aber in letzter Zeit sehe ich auffallend<br>viele rote Kleider und Accessoires.<br><i>Aubelet</i>
#. fr: Kwiiiih<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your lesser panda minion. Lesser only in size to normal pandas. And in life expectancy. And intelligence. And fluffiness. Well, perhaps not fluffiness.
#. column 1: There are several theories as to how a beastkin native to the mist-covered peaks of southeastern Ilsabard ended up thousands of leagues away from its home...and most involve an unhealthy infatuation with the furry creature by a certain imperial legatus.
#. column 3: Take a Stand
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:141:0:2"
msgid "Stand up straight, maggot!<br>   - Berkoeya"
msgstr "Выпрямись, червь!<br>  — Беркоя"

#. ja: たちあがる
#. de: Zähnefletschen
#. fr: Bipédisme
#. column 0: Summon your lesser panda minion. Lesser only in size to normal pandas. And in life expectancy. And intelligence. And fluffiness. Well, perhaps not fluffiness.
#. column 1: There are several theories as to how a beastkin native to the mist-covered peaks of southeastern Ilsabard ended up thousands of leagues away from its home...and most involve an unhealthy infatuation with the furry creature by a certain imperial legatus.
#. column 2: Stand up straight, maggot!<br>   - Berkoeya
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:141:0:3"
msgid "Take a Stand"
msgstr "Встать на дыбы"

#. ja: 敵軍のシールドに70%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt einem gegnerischen Schild 70 % Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls er schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 70% de sa solidité au bouclier ennemi. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your lesser panda minion. Lesser only in size to normal pandas. And in life expectancy. And intelligence. And fluffiness. Well, perhaps not fluffiness.
#. column 1: There are several theories as to how a beastkin native to the mist-covered peaks of southeastern Ilsabard ended up thousands of leagues away from its home...and most involve an unhealthy infatuation with the furry creature by a certain imperial legatus.
#. column 2: Stand up straight, maggot!<br>   - Berkoeya
#. column 3: Take a Stand
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:141:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable."
msgstr "Наносит вражескому щиту 70% урона. Не действует, если щит уже разрушен."

#. ja: ミニオン「63ページ」を呼び出す。<br>本に封じられた何か。その正体はわからない
#. de: Du rufst deine Seite 63 als Begleiter herbei. Weiß sie, was auf den 62 Seiten vor ihr stand?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte page 63. Un résumé détaillé des soixante-deux premières pages n'est pas nécessaire pour apprécier le contenu de la soixante-troisième.
#. column 1: Though unable to read the arcane script penned in blood across this forbidden tome discovered in the Great Gubal Library, you sense much power in the words. Or it could simply be the fact that the book follows you.
#. column 2: No dusty tome doth capture<br>in ink what these terrible<br>beings are now become.<br>   - Urianger
#. column 3: Censored Passage
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:142:0:0"
msgid "Summon your page 63 minion. A detailed recapitulation of the preceding sixty-two pages is not necessary to fully enjoy the content of the sixty-third."
msgstr "Призывает миньона «Страница 63». Чтобы сполна насладиться содержимым шестьдесят третьей страницы, вовсе не обязательно подробно пересказывать предыдущие шестьдесят две."

#. ja: グブラ幻想図書館の禁書庫に収蔵されていた書物。63ページに封印魔法が施されており、何かが封印されている。ただし、禁書に指定された理由は、封印された存在ではなく、書かれている内容のいかがわしさだという
#. de: Die in Blut gefassten Geheimzeichen auf der Pergamentseite lassen ein unbehagliches Gefühl in dir aufkommen. Vielleicht ist es auch nur die Tatsache, dass die Seite dir auf Schritt und Tritt folgt.
#. fr: La page d'un ouvrage du rayon “Interdits” de la Grande bibliothèque de Gubal. Visiblement, cette page 63 renferme une présence. Pourtant, ce n'est pas à cause d'elle que ce livre a été interdit, mais à cause de son contenu.
#. column 0: Summon your page 63 minion. A detailed recapitulation of the preceding sixty-two pages is not necessary to fully enjoy the content of the sixty-third.
#. column 2: No dusty tome doth capture<br>in ink what these terrible<br>beings are now become.<br>   - Urianger
#. column 3: Censored Passage
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:142:0:1"
msgid "Though unable to read the arcane script penned in blood across this forbidden tome discovered in the Great Gubal Library, you sense much power in the words. Or it could simply be the fact that the book follows you."
msgstr "Эту запретную книгу нашли в Большой библиотеке Губала. Кровавые руны на её страницах не разобрать, но в них чувствуется огромная сила. Хотя, возможно, всё дело в том, что книга ходит за вами следом."

#. ja: 閲覧禁止！
#. de: Lesen ist nicht meine Stärke, und<br>mit so einem Wälzer werde ich nicht<br>von heute auf morgen fertig.<br><i>Gerolt</i>
#. fr: Défense de lire.
#. column 0: Summon your page 63 minion. A detailed recapitulation of the preceding sixty-two pages is not necessary to fully enjoy the content of the sixty-third.
#. column 1: Though unable to read the arcane script penned in blood across this forbidden tome discovered in the Great Gubal Library, you sense much power in the words. Or it could simply be the fact that the book follows you.
#. column 3: Censored Passage
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:142:0:2"
msgid "No dusty tome doth capture<br>in ink what these terrible<br>beings are now become.<br>   - Urianger"
msgstr "Ни одна пыльная книга<br>не опишет чернилами,<br>во что обратились эти<br>ужасные существа.<br>  — Урианже"

#. ja: 発禁処分
#. de: Zensuraufhebung
#. fr: Censure
#. column 0: Summon your page 63 minion. A detailed recapitulation of the preceding sixty-two pages is not necessary to fully enjoy the content of the sixty-third.
#. column 1: Though unable to read the arcane script penned in blood across this forbidden tome discovered in the Great Gubal Library, you sense much power in the words. Or it could simply be the fact that the book follows you.
#. column 2: No dusty tome doth capture<br>in ink what these terrible<br>beings are now become.<br>   - Urianger
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:142:0:3"
msgid "Censored Passage"
msgstr "Запретный отрывок"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your page 63 minion. A detailed recapitulation of the preceding sixty-two pages is not necessary to fully enjoy the content of the sixty-third.
#. column 1: Though unable to read the arcane script penned in blood across this forbidden tome discovered in the Great Gubal Library, you sense much power in the words. Or it could simply be the fact that the book follows you.
#. column 2: No dusty tome doth capture<br>in ink what these terrible<br>beings are now become.<br>   - Urianger
#. column 3: Censored Passage
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:142:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 90."

#. ja: ミニオン「鉄小人」を呼び出す。<br>鉄巨人を模した玩具。巨人にはなりきれなかった
#. de: Du rufst deinen Eisenzwerg als Begleiter herbei. Er bevorzugt allerdings den Namen „kleiner Eisengigant“.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte nain d'acier. Il préfère le terme “personne d'acier de petite taille”.
#. column 1: What was reported as a “chance discovery” by your mammet voyager, has actually turned out to be a pet project of the automaton to kill the time while piloting the long journeys to the lonely north.
#. column 2: But if ye've got iron<br>in yer veins...speak up.<br>   - Randwulf
#. column 3: Fist of Iron
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:143:0:0"
msgid "Summon your iron dwarf minion (though he prefers the term “little iron person”)."
msgstr "Призывает миньона «Железный коротыш» (хотя ему больше нравится «маленький железный человек»)."

#. ja: からくり仕掛けの小さな鉄巨人。そのコアは、飛空艇操縦マメットが自動航行中にヒマなので、コツコツ作っていた品らしい。製作に没頭しすぎて、目的地を通り過ぎてしまった言い訳に、それを発見の成果として提出したようだ
#. de: Deine Abenteurer-Marionette nennt ihn eine „Zufallsbekanntschaft“, aber dir dünkt, dass sie den Begleiter zu ihrer Unterhaltung auf langen Reisen selbst gebaut hat.
#. fr: Un géant d'acier miniature renfermant un cœur fabriqué par un pantin pilote d'aéronef à ses heures perdues. Un jour, il s'est tellement laissé absorber par son ouvrage qu'il a dépassé sa destination, si bien que son secret a été découvert.
#. column 0: Summon your iron dwarf minion (though he prefers the term “little iron person”).
#. column 2: But if ye've got iron<br>in yer veins...speak up.<br>   - Randwulf
#. column 3: Fist of Iron
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:143:0:1"
msgid "What was reported as a “chance discovery” by your mammet voyager, has actually turned out to be a pet project of the automaton to kill the time while piloting the long journeys to the lonely north."
msgstr "То, что кукла-путешественник назвала «случайной находкой», на деле оказалось её личным проектом. Она мастерила его от скуки во время долгих перелётов на север."

#. ja: ガオー！
#. de: Aber wenn du Eisen im Blut hast<br>und dich zum Schmied berufen fühlst,<br>dann bist du hier genau richtig.<br><i>Randwulf</i>
#. fr: Kruik kruik<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your iron dwarf minion (though he prefers the term “little iron person”).
#. column 1: What was reported as a “chance discovery” by your mammet voyager, has actually turned out to be a pet project of the automaton to kill the time while piloting the long journeys to the lonely north.
#. column 3: Fist of Iron
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:143:0:2"
msgid "But if ye've got iron<br>in yer veins...speak up.<br>   - Randwulf"
msgstr "Но если в жилах<br>у тебя железо... скажись!<br>  — Рандвульф"

#. ja: ガオーン
#. de: Klonk
#. fr: Volonté d'acier
#. column 0: Summon your iron dwarf minion (though he prefers the term “little iron person”).
#. column 1: What was reported as a “chance discovery” by your mammet voyager, has actually turned out to be a pet project of the automaton to kill the time while piloting the long journeys to the lonely north.
#. column 2: But if ye've got iron<br>in yer veins...speak up.<br>   - Randwulf
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:143:0:3"
msgid "Fist of Iron"
msgstr "Железный кулак"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンのATKを60上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
#. de: Erhöht die ATT der ausführenden Trabanten um 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 60 l'attaque des mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
