#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・イゼル」を呼び出す。<br>イゼルを模した魔法人形。祈りを捧げよう
#. de: Du rufst deine Eisherz-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie ist erstaunlich heißblütig.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Ysayle miniature. Vous êtes bien Cœur-de-glace, je me trompe<nbsp>?
#. column 1: The brainchild of one of Lady Iceheart's fanatical followers, this lifelike automaton was to be sold in Ishgardian toy shoppes under the name “Ice Princess” with hopes of secretly indoctrinating young children in the ways of the heretics.
#. column 2: Whether it takes days,<br>weeks, moons, or even years,<br>my knights will find her.<br>   - Aymeric
#. column 3: Dreams of Ice
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:145:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Iceheart minion. Too hot to handle, too cold to hold."
msgstr "Призывает заводного миньона «Ледяное Сердце». Горяча, как огонь, холодна, как лёд."

#. ja: イゼルを模した魔法人形。とある異端者が新人を勧誘するために、指導者である「氷の巫女」をモチーフに、これを製作。しかし、苦心の末に完成させた直後に、当の本人にバレてしまい、急遽、配布が中止となった経緯を持つ
#. de: Immer wieder schmuggeln im Exil lebende Häretiker Exemplare dieser Aufziehpuppe nach Ishgard, um der kirchlichen Autorität einen Streich zu spielen.
#. fr: Une poupée à l'effigie de Cœur-de-glace, qui devait servir pour le recrutement de nouveaux membres. Mais l'intéressée a découvert ce projet dès que la poupée a été terminée, ce qui fait que sa dis<shy>tri<shy>bu<shy>tion a connu une fin brutale.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Iceheart minion. Too hot to handle, too cold to hold.
#. column 2: Whether it takes days,<br>weeks, moons, or even years,<br>my knights will find her.<br>   - Aymeric
#. column 3: Dreams of Ice
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:145:0:1"
msgid "The brainchild of one of Lady Iceheart's fanatical followers, this lifelike automaton was to be sold in Ishgardian toy shoppes under the name “Ice Princess” with hopes of secretly indoctrinating young children in the ways of the heretics."
msgstr "Эту похожую на живую куклу придумал один из фанатичных последователей Ледяного Сердца. Её собирались продавать в игрушечных лавках Ишгарда под именем «Ледяная принцесса», чтобы тайно наставлять детей на путь еретиков."

#. ja: コノ祈リヲ捧ゲヨウ！
#. de: Eisherz, diese kaltblütige Hexe!<br><i>Haurchefant</i>
#. fr: Nous serons les acteurs de<br>notre propre délivrance<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Iceheart minion. Too hot to handle, too cold to hold.
#. column 1: The brainchild of one of Lady Iceheart's fanatical followers, this lifelike automaton was to be sold in Ishgardian toy shoppes under the name “Ice Princess” with hopes of secretly indoctrinating young children in the ways of the heretics.
#. column 3: Dreams of Ice
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:145:0:2"
msgid "Whether it takes days,<br>weeks, moons, or even years,<br>my knights will find her.<br>   - Aymeric"
msgstr "Пусть пройдут дни,<br>недели, месяцы и даже годы,<br>мои рыцари её найдут.<br>   — Эймерик"

#. ja: 氷結の幻想
#. de: Eisige Träume
#. fr: Illusions glacées
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Iceheart minion. Too hot to handle, too cold to hold.
#. column 1: The brainchild of one of Lady Iceheart's fanatical followers, this lifelike automaton was to be sold in Ishgardian toy shoppes under the name “Ice Princess” with hopes of secretly indoctrinating young children in the ways of the heretics.
