#. ja: ミニオン「VII号スチームウォーカー」を呼び出す。<br>蒸気仕掛けのウォーカーマシン
#. de: Du rufst deinen Dampf-Stampfer als Begleiter herbei. Der Auspuff befindet sich am unteren Ende des Rückens.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte gobblindé G-VII à vapeur. Ses vapeurs d'échappement peuvent servir à cuire du jambon à l'étouffée.
#. column 1: This tiny machine is a prototype for the newest model of steam-powered warmachina being mass-produced by the fanatical goblin academics known as the Illuminati. Over a thousand crabs were caught, studied, and subsequently devoured to perfect the current design.
#. column 2: Spill bladder not<br>over unstrong<br>firebooms of Illuminati!<br>   - Brayflox
#. column 3: Steam Cannon
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 60%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:147:0:0"
msgid "Summon your steam-powered gobwalker G-VII minion. Exhaust can be used to steam hams."
msgstr "Призывает миньона «Паровой гобблиход Г-VII». Его выхлопом можно готовить ветчину на пару."

#. ja: 蒸気仕掛けのウォーカーマシン。科学者集団「青の手」が、新型兵器「VII号ゴブリウォーカー」を開発する際に、設計を確認するための小サイズ試作機として作製したものらしい。疾風のように、野心を乗せて走る！
#. de: Diesen winzigen Prototyp einer neuen Kampf-<br>maschine haben die Techniker der Indigohand nach eingehender Unter<shy>such<shy>ung unzähliger Krabbenschalen entwickelt. Die Studienobjekte wurden im Anschluss verspeist.
#. fr: Cette armure à vapeur a été mise au point par les Gobelins de la Main indigo comme prototype pour tester le fonc<shy>tion<shy>ne<shy>ment de la version grandeur nature. Un merveilleux robot de lumière et d'acier...
#. column 0: Summon your steam-powered gobwalker G-VII minion. Exhaust can be used to steam hams.
#. column 2: Spill bladder not<br>over unstrong<br>firebooms of Illuminati!<br>   - Brayflox
#. column 3: Steam Cannon
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 60%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:147:0:1"
msgid "This tiny machine is a prototype for the newest model of steam-powered warmachina being mass-produced by the fanatical goblin academics known as the Illuminati. Over a thousand crabs were caught, studied, and subsequently devoured to perfect the current design."
msgstr "Эта крошечная машина — прототип новейшей паровой боевой машины, которую массово выпускают фанатичные учёные-гоблины, известные как Иллюминаты. Чтобы довести нынешнюю модель до совершенства, поймали, изучили, а затем съели больше тысячи крабов."

#. ja: プシュー！
#. de: Pshhkhoo ... Kleinebombe ist nicht schlimm!<br>Brauchzzu nicht laufen.<br><i>Brüllvolx</i>
#. fr: Tchouuu<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon your steam-powered gobwalker G-VII minion. Exhaust can be used to steam hams.
#. column 1: This tiny machine is a prototype for the newest model of steam-powered warmachina being mass-produced by the fanatical goblin academics known as the Illuminati. Over a thousand crabs were caught, studied, and subsequently devoured to perfect the current design.
#. column 3: Steam Cannon
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 60%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:147:0:2"
msgid "Spill bladder not<br>over unstrong<br>firebooms of Illuminati!<br>   - Brayflox"
msgstr "Не проливать из пузыря<br>на слабые<br>бах-бумы Иллюминатов!<br>   — Брейфлокс"

#. ja: 蒸気砲
#. de: Verbrühenluft
#. fr: Canon à vapeur
#. column 0: Summon your steam-powered gobwalker G-VII minion. Exhaust can be used to steam hams.
#. column 1: This tiny machine is a prototype for the newest model of steam-powered warmachina being mass-produced by the fanatical goblin academics known as the Illuminati. Over a thousand crabs were caught, studied, and subsequently devoured to perfect the current design.
