msgid "Steam Cannon"
msgstr "Паровая пушка"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のゲートに60%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Tor 60<nbsp>% Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls es schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 60% de sa solidité au portail ennemi le plus proche. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your steam-powered gobwalker G-VII minion. Exhaust can be used to steam hams.
#. column 1: This tiny machine is a prototype for the newest model of steam-powered warmachina being mass-produced by the fanatical goblin academics known as the Illuminati. Over a thousand crabs were caught, studied, and subsequently devoured to perfect the current design.
#. column 2: Spill bladder not<br>over unstrong<br>firebooms of Illuminati!<br>   - Brayflox
#. column 3: Steam Cannon
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:147:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 60%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable."
msgstr "Снижает прочность ближайших вражеских ворот на 60%. Не действует, если ворота уже выведены из строя."

#. ja: ミニオン「ロイヤルベビーモス」を呼び出す。<br>ブヒーと鳴きそうな幼獣。怪しい血統書付き
#. de: Du rufst deinen blaublütigen Behemoth als Begleiter herbei. Nummer 47 in der Thronfolge.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte prince bébéhémoth. Il est quarante-septième dans l'ordre de succession au trône béhémoth.
#. column 1: To prove his bravery, a recently inducted member of Clan Centurio journeyed alone into the untamed north and somehow returned unscathed with the broodling of the legendary kaiser behemoth. Not wishing to bring ill fortune on the clan, the pup was quickly passed on...to you.
#. column 2: Yer mistress fights<br>like a bloody behemoth<br>ten times her size!<br>   - Wounded Chocobo Hunter
#. column 3: Princely Roar
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:148:0:0"
msgid "Summon your behemoth heir minion, currently forty-seventh in line to the behemoth throne."
msgstr "Призывает миньона — наследника бехемота, сорок седьмого в очереди на трон."

#. ja: 伝説の魔獣「カイザーベヒーモス」の子という触れ込みの幼獣。クラン・セントリオに所属する、とあるモブハンターが意気揚々と捕まえてきた。皇子として遇されており、ガウンまで与えられているが、その正体は定かではない
#. de: Ein junger Jäger des Clan Centurio fand diesen Sprössling des Kaiser-Behemoths auf seinen Reisen durch den eisigen Norden. Überwältigt von dessen Fressgier, gab er ihn weiter ... an dich.
#. fr: Ce petit serait un descendant du légendaire béhémoth empereur, capturé par un chasseur d'élite au clan Centurio. On lui a donné une mante royale correspondant à son rang, mais on ignore s'il est vraiment un prince.
#. column 0: Summon your behemoth heir minion, currently forty-seventh in line to the behemoth throne.
#. column 2: Yer mistress fights<br>like a bloody behemoth<br>ten times her size!<br>   - Wounded Chocobo Hunter
#. column 3: Princely Roar
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:148:0:1"
msgid "To prove his bravery, a recently inducted member of Clan Centurio journeyed alone into the untamed north and somehow returned unscathed with the broodling of the legendary kaiser behemoth. Not wishing to bring ill fortune on the clan, the pup was quickly passed on...to you."
msgstr "Чтобы доказать свою храбрость, недавно принятый в клан Центурио охотник в одиночку отправился на дикий север и каким-то чудом вернулся невредимым с детёнышем легендарного императорского бехемота. Не желая навлечь беду на клан, щенка поскорее пристроили... к тебе."

#. ja: ブヒブヒッ！
#. de: Diese holde Dame kämpft wie<br>ein verdammter Behemoth!<br><i>Verwundeter Chocobo-Jäger</i>
#. fr: Gruic<nbsp>? Gruic<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your behemoth heir minion, currently forty-seventh in line to the behemoth throne.
#. column 1: To prove his bravery, a recently inducted member of Clan Centurio journeyed alone into the untamed north and somehow returned unscathed with the broodling of the legendary kaiser behemoth. Not wishing to bring ill fortune on the clan, the pup was quickly passed on...to you.
#. column 3: Princely Roar
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:148:0:2"
msgid "Yer mistress fights<br>like a bloody behemoth<br>ten times her size!<br>   - Wounded Chocobo Hunter"
msgstr "Твоя госпожа дерётся<br>как проклятый бехемот,<br>в десять раз крупнее неё!<br>   — Раненый охотник на чокобо"

#. ja: おたけび
#. de: Gravitätisches Gebrüll
#. fr: Cri galvanisant
#. column 0: Summon your behemoth heir minion, currently forty-seventh in line to the behemoth throne.
#. column 1: To prove his bravery, a recently inducted member of Clan Centurio journeyed alone into the untamed north and somehow returned unscathed with the broodling of the legendary kaiser behemoth. Not wishing to bring ill fortune on the clan, the pup was quickly passed on...to you.
