msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 60 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 60 и снижает скорость их передвижения на 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ユウギリ」を呼び出す。<br>ユウギリを模した魔法人形。東方風の顔立ち
#. de: Du rufst deine Yugiri-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Ihre Maske erzeugt eine geheimnisvolle Aura ...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Yugiri miniature. Si jamais vous trouvez son masque, faites-lui signe, elle le cherche toujours.
#. column 1: In an effort to see his skills remain sharp, a displaced Doman dollmaker now working in the crystal quarries near Revenant's Toll spends his nights crafting wind-up automata, Yugiri serving as his sole model.
#. column 2: She's <i>really</i> good at<br>hide-and-seek, too!<br>   - Koharu
#. column 3: Suiyaku
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:150:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Yugiri minion, her mask no longer holding any mystery."
msgstr "Призывает заводного миньона «Югири». Её маска больше не таит загадок."

#. ja: ユウギリを模した魔法人形。レヴナンツトール開拓団で働く、ドマ出身の人形師が、エオルゼアの魔法人形に触発されて製作した。「人形は顔がいのち」と語る熟練職人の手により、東方風の顔立ちが再現されている
#. de: Ein domanischer Puppenmacher mit Heimweh erschuf dieses Abbild seiner mutigen Anführerin, als er mit ihr vor den Garlearn nach Ul'dah floh.
#. fr: Un Domien de la colonie du Glas des revenants s'est inspiré des mascottes éorzéennes pour concevoir cette poupée. Il a reproduit le visage de son modèle avec soin, persuadé que c'est en lui que réside toute la vie d'un pantin.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Yugiri minion, her mask no longer holding any mystery.
#. column 2: She's <i>really</i> good at<br>hide-and-seek, too!<br>   - Koharu
#. column 3: Suiyaku
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:150:0:1"
msgid "In an effort to see his skills remain sharp, a displaced Doman dollmaker now working in the crystal quarries near Revenant's Toll spends his nights crafting wind-up automata, Yugiri serving as his sole model."
msgstr "Мастер-кукольник из Домы, ныне работающий в кристальных карьерах близ Пристанища Скитальцев, по ночам мастерит заводных кукол, чтобы не растерять сноровку. Единственной моделью для него служит Югири."

#. ja: カタジケナイ！
#. de: Die kann ganz toll kämpfen, ist superschlau<br>und außerdem immer total nett zu uns!<br><i>Koharu</i>
#. fr: Merci mille fois...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Yugiri minion, her mask no longer holding any mystery.
#. column 1: In an effort to see his skills remain sharp, a displaced Doman dollmaker now working in the crystal quarries near Revenant's Toll spends his nights crafting wind-up automata, Yugiri serving as his sole model.
#. column 3: Suiyaku
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
