#. ja: ミニオン「カーバンクル・ペリドット」を呼び出す。<br>カーバンクルを模した魔法人形。核はペリドット製
#. de: Du rufst dein Peridot-Karfunkel als Begleiter herbei. Mit Treuegarantie.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Carbuncle péridot. Ce Carbuncle aime qu'on caresse sa longue queue soyeuse.
#. column 1: The pain of being betrayed by her first summoned pet still fresh in her heart, Tataru vowed she would never again fall victim to the whims of a fickle familiar and commissioned the Goldsmiths' Guild to craft her an ever-loyal companion. The furry outer shell is a Tataru original.
#. column 2: Uwaaah! Come back,<br>Carbuncle! Come baaack!<br>   - Tataru
#. column 3: Backdraft
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:151:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Peridot Carbuncle minion. If ever unfaithful, return for a full refund."
msgstr "Призыв перидотового карбункула. Если он когда-нибудь окажется неверен, вам вернут все деньги."

#. ja: カーバンクルを模した魔法人形。召喚したカーバンクルに裏切られるという苦い経験をしたタタルが、自らに忠実な下僕を手にすべく彫金師ギルドに依頼して製作したもの。なお、外装のぬいぐるみは、彼女自身の手による
#. de: Tataru selbst beauftragte die Gilde der Hermetiker, dieses Karfunkel an unsere Welt zu binden. Damit wenigstens ein Karfunkel kommt, wenn sie eins ruft.
#. fr: Tataru ayant été abandonnée par son Carbuncle, elle a demandé à la guilde des orfèvres de fabriquer cette réplique plus <i>fidèle</i> que nature. Le revêtement en peluche a été con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>né par la Lalafelle elle-même.
#. column 0: Summon your Peridot Carbuncle minion. If ever unfaithful, return for a full refund.
#. column 2: Uwaaah! Come back,<br>Carbuncle! Come baaack!<br>   - Tataru
#. column 3: Backdraft
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:151:0:1"
msgid "The pain of being betrayed by her first summoned pet still fresh in her heart, Tataru vowed she would never again fall victim to the whims of a fickle familiar and commissioned the Goldsmiths' Guild to craft her an ever-loyal companion. The furry outer shell is a Tataru original."
msgstr "После горького опыта предательства со стороны первого призванного питомца Татара поклялась больше не зависеть от прихотей ненадёжного фамильяра и заказала гильдии ювелиров верного спутника. Пушистую оболочку она сшила сама."

#. ja: ムキュー！
#. de: Huch! Ein böses Tier! Na warte! Ich<br>hermetisiere dich weg! Fass, Karfunkel!<br><i>Tataru</i>
#. fr: Kwih<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Peridot Carbuncle minion. If ever unfaithful, return for a full refund.
#. column 1: The pain of being betrayed by her first summoned pet still fresh in her heart, Tataru vowed she would never again fall victim to the whims of a fickle familiar and commissioned the Goldsmiths' Guild to craft her an ever-loyal companion. The furry outer shell is a Tataru original.
#. column 3: Backdraft
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:151:0:2"
msgid "Uwaaah! Come back,<br>Carbuncle! Come baaack!<br>   - Tataru"
msgstr "А-а-а! Вернись,<br>карбункул! Ну вернись же!<br>   — Татару"

#. ja: ふきとばし
#. de: Rückstoß
#. fr: Éjection
#. column 0: Summon your Peridot Carbuncle minion. If ever unfaithful, return for a full refund.
#. column 1: The pain of being betrayed by her first summoned pet still fresh in her heart, Tataru vowed she would never again fall victim to the whims of a fickle familiar and commissioned the Goldsmiths' Guild to craft her an ever-loyal companion. The furry outer shell is a Tataru original.
#. column 2: Uwaaah! Come back,<br>Carbuncle! Come baaack!<br>   - Tataru
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:151:0:3"
msgid "Backdraft"
msgstr "Обратный поток"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵をノックバックさせる。
#. de: Schleudert die Gegner in der Nähe zurück.
#. fr: Projette en arrière les ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Peridot Carbuncle minion. If ever unfaithful, return for a full refund.
#. column 1: The pain of being betrayed by her first summoned pet still fresh in her heart, Tataru vowed she would never again fall victim to the whims of a fickle familiar and commissioned the Goldsmiths' Guild to craft her an ever-loyal companion. The furry outer shell is a Tataru original.
#. column 2: Uwaaah! Come back,<br>Carbuncle! Come baaack!<br>   - Tataru
#. column 3: Backdraft
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:151:0:4"
msgid "Knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Отбрасывает всех врагов в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「カーバンクル・ヘリオドール」を呼び出す。<br>カーバンクルを模した魔法人形。核はヘリオドール製
#. de: Du rufst dein Heliodor-Karfunkel herbei. Mit Treuegarantie.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Carbuncle héliodore. Ce Carbuncle aime qu'on caresse sa longue queue soyeuse.
#. column 1: The pain of being unable to summon her own Topaz Carbuncle still fresh in her heart, Tataru vowed she would never again be discouraged by her own failures and commissioned the Goldsmiths' Guild to craft her an ever-loyal companion. The furry outer shell is a Tataru original.
#. column 2: I hope to...create a new<br>variety of Carbuncle, perhaps.<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Curl
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:152:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Heliodor Carbuncle minion. If ever unfaithful, return for a full refund."
msgstr "Призыв Гелиодорового карбункула. Если он когда-нибудь окажется неверен, вам вернут все деньги."

#. ja: カーバンクルを模した魔法人形。ついに召喚することができなかったカーバンクル・トパーズに代わる下僕として、タタルが彫金師ギルドに依頼して製作したもの。外装がぬいぐるみだけに、本物よりは打たれ弱い
#. de: Voller Mitleid mit der armen Tataru, die sich mit dem Beschwören von Karfunkeln abplagte, orderte Alphinaud dieses magische Meisterwerk bei der Hermetikergilde.
#. fr: Tataru a commandé à la guilde des orfèvres cette réplique du Carbuncle qu'elle n'a finalement pas réussi à invoquer. Le revêtement en peluche a été con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>né par la Lalafelle elle-même.
#. column 0: Summon your Heliodor Carbuncle minion. If ever unfaithful, return for a full refund.
#. column 2: I hope to...create a new<br>variety of Carbuncle, perhaps.<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Curl
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:152:0:1"
msgid "The pain of being unable to summon her own Topaz Carbuncle still fresh in her heart, Tataru vowed she would never again be discouraged by her own failures and commissioned the Goldsmiths' Guild to craft her an ever-loyal companion. The furry outer shell is a Tataru original."
msgstr "Татару до сих пор не могла забыть, как ей не удалось призвать собственного Топазового карбункула. Поклявшись больше не падать духом из-за неудач, она заказала Гильдии ювелиров верного помощника. А мохнатую оболочку придумала сама Татару."

#. ja: ムギュー！
#. de: Wenn ich das mit meinem Wissen kombiniere ...<br>könnte ich sogar eine neue Art von Karfunkel<br>hervorbringen!<br><i>Alphinaud</i>
#. fr: Gwih<nbsp>!?
#. column 0: Summon your Heliodor Carbuncle minion. If ever unfaithful, return for a full refund.
#. column 1: The pain of being unable to summon her own Topaz Carbuncle still fresh in her heart, Tataru vowed she would never again be discouraged by her own failures and commissioned the Goldsmiths' Guild to craft her an ever-loyal companion. The furry outer shell is a Tataru original.
#. column 3: Curl
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:152:0:2"
msgid "I hope to...create a new<br>variety of Carbuncle, perhaps.<br>   - Alphinaud"
msgstr "Надеюсь... я смогу создать<br>новую разновидность<br>карбункула.<br>   — Альфино"

#. ja: かたまり
#. de: Einrollen
#. fr: Pelotonnement
