#. ja: ミニオン「パイッサ・ブラット」を呼び出す。<br>パイッサの幼生体。その目は真理を見つめる
#. de: Du rufst deinen Paissa-Fratz herbei. Diese Augen sehen angeblich nichts als die Wahrheit. Die Wahrheit und Nahrung.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petiot païssa. Son regard inquisiteur semble lui permettre de voir au plus profond de votre âme.
#. column 1: In addition to being quite tasty, paissas are often bred by Vanu tribes for fighting. One such creature was given as a gift to the Rose Knights when the Ishgardians were still on good terms with the Sea of Clouds natives...and then subsequently lost in a card game.
#. column 2: Even cowardly paissa<br>cannot hide forever!<br>   - Gundu Warrior
#. column 3: Infinity
#. column 4: Renders ally Gates, Shield, and Search Eye impervious to damage.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:157:0:0"
msgid "Summon your paissa brat minion. The eyes of a newborn paissa are said to see only the truth. The truth and food."
msgstr "Призывает миньона «Детёныш пайссы». Говорят, новорождённый пайсса видит только правду. И еду."

#. ja: パイッサの幼生体。闘パイッサ用にバヌバヌ族が育てていたものだが、かつて交流があった時期に、ある薔薇騎兵の手に渡った。しかし、その騎兵が酒席での賭けに敗れ……巡り巡って行き着いたのが宝箱の中だったらしい
#. de: Von den Vanu Vanu aufgezogen gelangte der junge Paissa in die Obhut eines Rosenkavalleristen. Leider verlor er das arme kleine Ding nach nicht allzu langer Zeit am Kartentisch, irgendwie landete es schließlich in einer Schatztruhe.
#. fr: Ce tout jeune païssa entraîné au combat a été offert par des Vanu Vanu amicaux à un chevalier de la Rose, mais ce dernier l'aurait ensuite parié puis perdu dans une taverne, et c'est finalement dans un coffre au trésor que la pauvre créature aurait terminé.
#. column 0: Summon your paissa brat minion. The eyes of a newborn paissa are said to see only the truth. The truth and food.
#. column 2: Even cowardly paissa<br>cannot hide forever!<br>   - Gundu Warrior
#. column 3: Infinity
#. column 4: Renders ally Gates, Shield, and Search Eye impervious to damage.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:157:0:1"
msgid "In addition to being quite tasty, paissas are often bred by Vanu tribes for fighting. One such creature was given as a gift to the Rose Knights when the Ishgardians were still on good terms with the Sea of Clouds natives...and then subsequently lost in a card game."
msgstr "Пайсс часто выращивают у племён вану для боёв — мясо у них, кстати, тоже вкусное. Одного такого зверя подарили Рыцарям розы, когда ишгардцы ещё ладили с жителями Моря Облаков... а потом проиграли его в карты."

#. ja: ……！？
#. de: Eine Partie Karten? Gerne doch!<br>Ich bin allerdings nicht besonders gut darin.<br><i>Verdächtig grinsender Spieler</i>
#. fr:    <nbsp>!?
#. column 0: Summon your paissa brat minion. The eyes of a newborn paissa are said to see only the truth. The truth and food.
#. column 1: In addition to being quite tasty, paissas are often bred by Vanu tribes for fighting. One such creature was given as a gift to the Rose Knights when the Ishgardians were still on good terms with the Sea of Clouds natives...and then subsequently lost in a card game.
