#. ja: ミニオン「パンプキンバトラー」を呼び出す。<br>どさくさ紛れにもらったパンプキンバトラー。マンドラゴラの執事！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Kürbis-Butler als Begleiter herbei, der sich selbst als treuer Diener der Königin Mandragora bezeichnet und über viele Umwege bei dir gelandet ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte majordome citrouille. Beaucoup pensent que le gang des légumes ne compte que cinq individus, mais ils se trompent. En effet, le sixième membre est aujourd'hui à votre service... et il ne semble pas très heureux de son sort.
#. column 1: Unhappy with his treatment in the Tomato King's court, the Pumpkin Butler fled his place of longtime servitude only to wind up in the hands of the Continental Circus. Here, he worked twice as hard until an Adventurers' Guild investigator freed him once and for all.
#. column 2: Pumpkins sort of remind<br>me of...um... No, it's gone.<br>Never mind!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca
#. column 3: Winter's Call
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:159:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Pumpkin Butler minion. Oft-forgotten member of the Mandragoras, if the Pumpkin Butler harbors any ill will for those who have so easily forsaken him, he does a fine job of hiding it."
msgstr "Призывает миньона «Тыквенный дворецкий». Его часто забывают среди мандрагор. Если он и затаил обиду на тех, кто так легко его бросил, то отлично это скрывает."

#. ja: 自称マンドラゴラの執事。元はキングトマトの執事だったが、雑な扱いに耐えかね出奔。だが、一人旅の途中でコンチネンタル・サーカスに捕獲され、働かされていた。その後、冒険者ギルドの調査員に救出された……らしい
#. de: Der Kürbis-Butler diente ursprünglich König Tomate, doch hielt er dessen Launen nicht mehr aus und riss aus. Auf der Flucht wurde er von den Gauklern gefangen genommen und zur Zwangsarbeit genötigt, bis ihn ein herzensguter Abenteurer befreite.
#. fr: Mécontent du traitement qu'il recevait, le majordome a fui la cour du Roi tomate. Hélas, il s'est fait capturer par le Cirque intercontinental, pour qui il a dû travailler sans relâche jusqu'à ce qu'un enquêteur de la guilde des aventuriers vienne le sauver... et vous le confie.
#. column 0: Summon your Pumpkin Butler minion. Oft-forgotten member of the Mandragoras, if the Pumpkin Butler harbors any ill will for those who have so easily forsaken him, he does a fine job of hiding it.
#. column 2: Pumpkins sort of remind<br>me of...um... No, it's gone.<br>Never mind!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca
#. column 3: Winter's Call
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:159:0:1"
msgid "Unhappy with his treatment in the Tomato King's court, the Pumpkin Butler fled his place of longtime servitude only to wind up in the hands of the Continental Circus. Here, he worked twice as hard until an Adventurers' Guild investigator freed him once and for all. "
msgstr "Недовольный обращением при дворе Короля Помидора, Тыквенный дворецкий сбежал от хозяина, которому служил долгие годы, но угодил в руки Континентального цирка. Там ему пришлось вкалывать вдвое больше, пока следователь Гильдии искателей приключений не освободил его раз и навсегда."

#. ja: ♪×＄◎？
#. de: Nimm dich vor sprechenden Kürbissen in Acht!<br>Sprechende Melonen? Das ist eine andere Sache.<br>Aber sprechende Kürbisse? Ich hab dich gewarnt!<br><i>Impresario</i>
#. fr: ♪X$◎?
#. column 0: Summon your Pumpkin Butler minion. Oft-forgotten member of the Mandragoras, if the Pumpkin Butler harbors any ill will for those who have so easily forsaken him, he does a fine job of hiding it.
#. column 1: Unhappy with his treatment in the Tomato King's court, the Pumpkin Butler fled his place of longtime servitude only to wind up in the hands of the Continental Circus. Here, he worked twice as hard until an Adventurers' Guild investigator freed him once and for all.
#. column 3: Winter's Call
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:159:0:2"
msgid "Pumpkins sort of remind<br>me of...um... No, it's gone.<br>Never mind!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca"
msgstr "Тыквы мне что-то<br>напоминают... Э-э... Да нет, забыла.<br>Ладно, неважно!<br>   — Нашу Мхакаракка"

