#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・エキドナ」を呼び出す。<br>エキドナを模した魔法人形。寝起きは悪い方……
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-Echidna herbei. Bei aller Niedlichkeit irgendwie bedrohlich ...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Echidna miniature. Quelque chose vous dit qu'elle s'est levée du mauvais pied.
#. column 1: Possibly one of countless clockwork servitors crafted by a Gridanian goldsmith whose body went missing after being hanged for the crime of ritual summoning. Upon the doll's back is carved the following: “And in the endless darkness I found her. Or was it she found me?”
#. column 2: Advances in Mhachi sorcery<br>were made for one reason only:<br>cataclysmic destructive power.<br>   - Cait Sith
#. column 3: Death Knell
#. column 4: Renders both ally and enemy Shields and Search Eyes inoperable. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:160:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Echidna minion. A remarkably lifelike recreation of the shape-shifting seductress. Perhaps a tad <i>too</i> lifelike..."
msgstr "Призывает заводного миньона «Эхидна». Удивительно точное подобие коварной искусительницы-перевёртыша. Возможно, даже <i>слишком</i> точное..."

#. ja: エキドナを模した作者不明の魔法人形。その棺の裏側には、なぜか現代風の共通語で、「帰りたい一心で裂け目に飛び込むと、奇妙な船の中に辿り着いた。そこで私は眠れる美女と出会ったのだ」と文字が刻まれている
#. de: Wer diese Puppe konstruiert hat, ist unklar, aber zumindest der Sarg kann nicht alt sein: Da steht etwas auf Neu-Eorzäisch über eine Begegnung mit einer unsterblichen Schönheit auf einer Arche. Sie ist trotz ihrer geringen Größe so grausam wie betörend.
#. fr: Personne ne sait qui a réalisé cette miniature de la cruelle Echidna. Il est néanmoins inscrit en dessous du cercueil qu'elle a été découverte dans un étrange navire qui repose au-delà d'une fissure.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Echidna minion. A remarkably lifelike recreation of the shape-shifting seductress. Perhaps a tad <i>too</i> lifelike...
#. column 2: Advances in Mhachi sorcery<br>were made for one reason only:<br>cataclysmic destructive power.<br>   - Cait Sith
#. column 3: Death Knell
#. column 4: Renders both ally and enemy Shields and Search Eyes inoperable. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:160:0:1"
msgid "Possibly one of countless clockwork servitors crafted by a Gridanian goldsmith whose body went missing after being hanged for the crime of ritual summoning. Upon the doll's back is carved the following: “And in the endless darkness I found her. Or was it she found me?”"
msgstr "Возможно, одна из множества заводных служанок, созданных гриданским ювелиром, которого повесили за ритуальное призывание. Позже его тело пропало. На спине куклы вырезаны слова: «В бесконечной тьме я нашёл её. Или это она нашла меня?»"

#. ja: ZZZ……
#. de: „Mhach“? Redest du von der alten Stadt der Magie?<br>Aus dem Märchen? Das Zuhause der Magier der Zerstörung?<br><i>Alka Zolka</i>
#. fr: ZzzzZZZZzzz...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Echidna minion. A remarkably lifelike recreation of the shape-shifting seductress. Perhaps a tad <i>too</i> lifelike...
#. column 1: Possibly one of countless clockwork servitors crafted by a Gridanian goldsmith whose body went missing after being hanged for the crime of ritual summoning. Upon the doll's back is carved the following: “And in the endless darkness I found her. Or was it she found me?”
#. column 3: Death Knell
#. column 4: Renders both ally and enemy Shields and Search Eyes inoperable. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:160:0:2"
msgid "Advances in Mhachi sorcery<br>were made for one reason only:<br>cataclysmic destructive power.<br>   - Cait Sith"
msgstr "Мхачская магия развивалась<br>лишь ради одной цели:<br>разрушительной силы катаклизма.<br>   — Кейт Сит"

#. ja: 死の鎌
#. de: Todessense
#. fr: Faux de la mort
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Echidna minion. A remarkably lifelike recreation of the shape-shifting seductress. Perhaps a tad <i>too</i> lifelike...
