#. ja: 自軍、敵軍のシールドとサーチ・アイを破壊する。特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンは強制撤退する。
#. de: Zerstört eigene und feindliche Schilde und Suchende Augen. Die ausführenden Trabanten werden weggeschickt.
#. fr: Détruit votre bouclier et votre œil scrutateur ainsi que ceux de l'ennemi. Les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT sont au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment renvoyées.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Echidna minion. A remarkably lifelike recreation of the shape-shifting seductress. Perhaps a tad <i>too</i> lifelike...
#. column 1: Possibly one of countless clockwork servitors crafted by a Gridanian goldsmith whose body went missing after being hanged for the crime of ritual summoning. Upon the doll's back is carved the following: “And in the endless darkness I found her. Or was it she found me?”
#. column 2: Advances in Mhachi sorcery<br>were made for one reason only:<br>cataclysmic destructive power.<br>   - Cait Sith
#. column 3: Death Knell
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:160:0:4"
msgid "Renders both ally and enemy Shields and Search Eyes inoperable. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution."
msgstr "Выводит из строя щиты и поисковые ока обеих команд. Миньоны, использовавшие особый приём, немедленно покидают поле боя."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・リルム」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。しゃきっとせんかあ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Relm-Puppe herbei. Hoffentlich wird sie nicht ungehalten darüber.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Relm miniature. Où a-t-elle pu cacher son pinceau<nbsp>?
#. column 1: This automaton was crafted to resemble one of the characters appearing in an ancient Eorzean faerie tale. In the story, a young girl named Relm is able to conjure the images of great beasts simply by sketching them─a feature this doll unfortunately lacks.
#. column 2: Snap out of it!<br>   - Relm
#. column 3: Enchanted Artistry
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:161:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Relm minion. Come on now, you stubborn old bag of bones!"
msgstr "Призывает заводного миньона «Релм». Ну же, старый упрямый мешок костей, встряхнись!"

#. ja: 古の英雄「リルム」を模した魔法人形。優れた魔道士でもあり、スケッチすることで魔物の幻影を生み出したという言い伝えに従い、絵筆を取り出し何かを描く仕草をする。しかしながら、絵心までは再現できなかったようだ
#. de: Die Puppe stellt eine überragende Magierin alter Zeiten dar. Mit wenigen Strichen konnte sie furchtbare Kreaturen kontrollieren. Hüte dich davor, ihr künstlerisches Gespür zu kritisieren.
#. fr: Cette poupée représente une célèbre magicienne des temps anciens, qui avait la faculté de pouvoir donner vie aux créatures qu'elle peignait. Le pinceau est inclus, mais il n'a aucun pouvoir magique.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Relm minion. Come on now, you stubborn old bag of bones!
#. column 2: Snap out of it!<br>   - Relm
#. column 3: Enchanted Artistry
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:161:0:1"
msgid "This automaton was crafted to resemble one of the characters appearing in an ancient Eorzean faerie tale. In the story, a young girl named Relm is able to conjure the images of great beasts simply by sketching them─a feature this doll unfortunately lacks."
msgstr "Эта кукла изображает одного из героев древней эорзейской сказки. Девочка по имени Релм умела создавать изображения могучих чудовищ простыми набросками — увы, кукле этот дар не передался."

#. ja: しゃきっとせんかあ！
#. de: Sein gute Arbeit. Würde Große Schwinge sagen: <i>prozessorientiert</i>.<br>Bist wahre Kunsthandwerkerin!<br><i>Jezul Ahuatan</i>
#. fr: Vieux débris<nbsp>! Secoue-toi un peu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Relm minion. Come on now, you stubborn old bag of bones!
#. column 1: This automaton was crafted to resemble one of the characters appearing in an ancient Eorzean faerie tale. In the story, a young girl named Relm is able to conjure the images of great beasts simply by sketching them─a feature this doll unfortunately lacks.
#. column 3: Enchanted Artistry
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:161:0:2"
msgid "Snap out of it!<br>   - Relm"
msgstr "Да очнись же ты!<br>   — Релм"

