#. ja: ミニオン「ハンティング・ホーク」を呼び出す。<br>狩猟用のタカ。来いっ、ハンティング・ホーク！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Jagdfalken herbei. Sehr kleine Beutetiere sollten kein Problem für ihn sein.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte buse chasseuse. Rien n'échappe à son regard perçant<nbsp>!
#. column 1: After losing her master, this raptor expertly trained in the art of falconry wandered the skies in search of purpose, finally arriving in the Diadem where she has since awaited the arrival of one worthy to lead her once more into the field to pursue new quarry.
#. column 2: Our companions gliding proudly<br>through the skies will be as they<br>always have and always will be.<br>   - Josseloux
#. column 3: Hawk's Eye
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:162:0:0"
msgid "Summon your hunting hawk minion. She loves you more than life itself. She's had to."
msgstr "Призывает миньона «Охотничий ястреб». Она любит тебя больше жизни. Ей пришлось."

#. ja: 狩猟用のタカ。ディアデム諸島で出会った冒険者の腕を認め、狩りの相棒として選び、付いていくことにしたらしい。古代獣ひしめく危険な空域を独力で生き抜いてきただけあって非常に逞しく、獲物を見つける目は鋭い
#. de: Ein sehr niedliches Andenken vom Diadem. Du fragst dich ernsthaft, wie er die reißenden Bestien dort oben überlebt hat. Aber das ist wohl der Jagdinstinkt<nbsp>- zu wissen, wie <i>andere</i> jagen.
#. fr: Cette buse entraînée à la chasse a apparemment décidé de vous accompagner partout où vous allez. C'est avant tout grâce à sa vigueur et sa capacité à détecter ses proies qu'elle doit sa survie dans le milieu hostile qu'est le Diadème.
#. column 0: Summon your hunting hawk minion. She loves you more than life itself. She's had to.
#. column 2: Our companions gliding proudly<br>through the skies will be as they<br>always have and always will be.<br>   - Josseloux
#. column 3: Hawk's Eye
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:162:0:1"
msgid "After losing her master, this raptor expertly trained in the art of falconry wandered the skies in search of purpose, finally arriving in the Diadem where she has since awaited the arrival of one worthy to lead her once more into the field to pursue new quarry."
msgstr "Лишившись хозяина, эта обученная охотничья птица скиталась в небесах в поисках цели. Наконец она прилетела на Диадему и с тех пор ждёт того, кто заслужит право снова повести её на охоту."

#. ja: ホークアイ！
#. de: Beobachte die Falken.<br>Sie weisen dir den Weg zu deiner Beute.<br><i>Graf Haillenarte</i>
#. fr: Piiiy<nbsp>!
