#. ja: ミニオン「プリンスペンギン」を呼び出す。<br>皇帝ペンギンの幼鳥。夢は自らの帝国を築くこと
#. de: Du rufst deinen Pinguinprinz herbei. Irgendwann wird er ein Königreich regieren.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte manchot prince. Il vient à peine de sortir de l'œuf, mais se voit déjà à la tête d'un empire.
#. column 1: This emperor penguin fledgling dreams of one day ruling his own empire and has set off on a journey to seek the loyal subjects who will make up his imperial court. Or at least that is what the Gold Saucer attendant who found the flightless cloudkin claims.
#. column 2: I am no prince! I am but the<br>privileged brat of an...empire!<br>   - Tataramu
#. column 3: Black Ice
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 10 every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:164:0:0"
msgid "Summon your penguin prince minion. An empire awaits."
msgstr "Призывает миньона «Принц-пингвин». Империю ждёт его приход."

#. ja: 皇帝ペンギンの幼鳥。自らの帝国を築くため、家臣を集めるべく旅に出た後、巡り巡って辿り着いたのがゴールドソーサーだったらしい。過酷を極める建国戦争に勝利するため、優秀な軍略家を探し求めているようだ
#. de: Er weiß, seinen Anspruch auf den Thron wird er irgendwann mit Gewalt durchsetzen müssen. So kam er in den Gold Saucer, wo er nach loyalen Kriegern suchte<nbsp>- und dich fand. Ob du ihm folgst oder er dir, ist fürs Erste nicht so wichtig. Hauptsache, ihr seid auf derselben Seite.
#. fr: Cet adorable petit manchot empereur aurait décidé de partir à la recherche de fidèles sujets, notamment un excellent stratège, pour fonder son empire, et c'est ainsi qu'il serait arrivé au Gold Saucer.
#. column 0: Summon your penguin prince minion. An empire awaits.
#. column 2: I am no prince! I am but the<br>privileged brat of an...empire!<br>   - Tataramu
#. column 3: Black Ice
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 10 every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:164:0:1"
msgid "This emperor penguin fledgling dreams of one day ruling his own empire and has set off on a journey to seek the loyal subjects who will make up his imperial court. Or at least that is what the Gold Saucer attendant who found the flightless cloudkin claims."
msgstr "Этот птенец императорского пингвина мечтает однажды править собственной империей и отправился искать верных подданных для своего двора. По крайней мере, так утверждает служитель Золотого блекджека, нашедший эту нелетающую птицу."

#. ja: キュイッ！？
#. de: Du würdest dich auf der <i>Eisprinzessin</i> wirklich gut machen!<br><i>Kapitänin H'rhanbolo</i>
#. fr: Cuiii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your penguin prince minion. An empire awaits.
#. column 1: This emperor penguin fledgling dreams of one day ruling his own empire and has set off on a journey to seek the loyal subjects who will make up his imperial court. Or at least that is what the Gold Saucer attendant who found the flightless cloudkin claims.
#. column 3: Black Ice
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 10 every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
