msgctxt "CompanionTransient:164:0:4"
msgid "Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 10 every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
msgstr "Устанавливает ловушку. При срабатывании она наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 10 каждую секунду.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 сек.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Задержка срабатывания:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ツインタニア」を呼び出す。<br>ツインタニアを模したアラグ製魔法人形。またアラグか！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Uhrwerk-Twintania herbei. Noch so eine fortschrittliche Kreation der Allager. Gibt es irgendwas, das die Allager nicht herstellen konnten? Gerüchten zufolge haben sie ein Gerät gebaut, um genau diese Frage zu beantworten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-Gémellia. Cette réplique allagoise du terrible dragon est très bien réalisée... et po<shy>ten<shy>tiel<shy>le<shy>ment aussi dangereuse que le vrai.
#. column 1: Despite being thousands of years old, this Allagan-crafted machina still runs as if it were activated yesterday. Tomestone analysis reveals that the automaton was created to celebrate the empire's subjugation of Meracydian territories across the Rhotano Sea.
#. column 2: Do a barrel roll!<br>   - A Slippy Scalekin
#. column 3: Neurolink
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:165:0:0"
msgid "Summon your clockwork Twintania minion. Another advanced Allagan creation. Is there anything the Allagans couldn't create? The Allagans are believed to have created an instrument to answer this very question."
msgstr "Призвать заводного миньона Твинтанию. Ещё одно творение аллагов! Интересно, было ли хоть что-то им не под силу? Говорят, они даже создали прибор, чтобы ответить на этот вопрос."

#. ja: ツインタニアを模したアラグ製魔法人形。南方大陸メラシディアの制圧を記念して、アラグ帝国魔科学省が子ども向けに製作した記念品らしい。リング状拘束具に至るまで、リアルに仕上げられている。またアラグか！
#. de: Zum Jubiläum der Unterwerfung Meracydias von allagischen Wissenschaftlern gebaut, um auch den Kindern die Freuden eines gewonnenen Krieges begreiflich zu machen. Sogar der Kontrollring um den Hals ist naturgetreu nachgebildet.
#. fr: Ce serait pour célébrer leur conquête du continent de Méracydia que les Allagois auraient créé cette miniature de Gémellia. Par souci du détail sans doute, ils ont également fabriqué les anneaux de contrôle.
#. column 0: Summon your clockwork Twintania minion. Another advanced Allagan creation. Is there anything the Allagans couldn't create? The Allagans are believed to have created an instrument to answer this very question.
#. column 2: Do a barrel roll!<br>   - A Slippy Scalekin
#. column 3: Neurolink
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:165:0:1"
msgid "Despite being thousands of years old, this Allagan-crafted machina still runs as if it were activated yesterday. Tomestone analysis reveals that the automaton was created to celebrate the empire's subjugation of Meracydian territories across the Rhotano Sea."
msgstr "Этой аллагской машине тысячи лет, но она работает так, будто её включили только вчера. Анализ тома показал, что автоматон создали в честь покорения империей земель Мерасидии за Ротанским морем."

#. ja: デスセンテンス！
#. de: Lass dich von den Allagern nicht einschüchtern.<br>Sie mögen uns kulturell weit überlegen gewesen sein,<br>aber es wird schon seine Gründe haben,<br>dass sie nicht bis heute überdauert haben.<br><i>G'raha Tia</i>
#. fr: Peine de mort<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your clockwork Twintania minion. Another advanced Allagan creation. Is there anything the Allagans couldn't create? The Allagans are believed to have created an instrument to answer this very question.
#. column 1: Despite being thousands of years old, this Allagan-crafted machina still runs as if it were activated yesterday. Tomestone analysis reveals that the automaton was created to celebrate the empire's subjugation of Meracydian territories across the Rhotano Sea.
