#. ja: ミニオン「コロコロポックル」を呼び出す。<br>コロポックルの幼獣。水分補給には気を配るタイプ
#. de: Du rufst deinen kleinen Korpokkur herbei. Bitte den Wasserhaushalt immer im Gleichgewicht halten!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte pon-korpokkur. Cette jolie créature végétale a besoin d'un apport régulier en eau pour survivre.
#. column 1: Before their exodus back to the Old World, Sharlayan botanists conducted extensive studies on korpokkurs at Saint Mocianne's Arboretum. In their haste, the scientists left behind several samples which have, over the past decades, continued to thrive and reproduce...
#. column 2: Feels so soft and moist as<br>fresh spring shower!<br>   - Ranu Vali
#. column 3: Seedbed
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 10 every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:166:0:0"
msgid "Summon your korpokkur kid minion. For best results, keep moist at all times."
msgstr "Призвать миньона-корпоккура. Для наилучшего самочувствия всегда держите его во влажной среде."

#. ja: コロポックルの幼獣。かつて聖モシャーヌ植物園にて研究目的で栽培されていた草木綱コロポックル属の子孫。原産地は極東の島国「ひんがしの国」だが、生まれはシャーレアンだ。新たな住まいを探している
#. de: Ein Abkömmling der Korpokkur-Pflanze, die im Sankt Mocianne-Arboretum gezüchtet wurde. Ursprünglich eine indigene Pflanze des Fernen Ostens, wurde das Gewächs nach Sharlayan gebracht und sucht jetzt ein neues Zuhause.
#. fr: Cette jeune pousse de korpokkur a été créée et cultivée à l'Arboretum Sainte-Mocianne pour les besoins des recherches que menaient les Sharlayanais avant leur exode.
#. column 0: Summon your korpokkur kid minion. For best results, keep moist at all times.
#. column 2: Feels so soft and moist as<br>fresh spring shower!<br>   - Ranu Vali
#. column 3: Seedbed
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 10 every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:166:0:1"
msgid "Before their exodus back to the Old World, Sharlayan botanists conducted extensive studies on korpokkurs at Saint Mocianne's Arboretum. In their haste, the scientists left behind several samples which have, over the past decades, continued to thrive and reproduce..."
msgstr "До возвращения в Старый Свет шалейские ботаники тщательно изучали корпоккуров в дендрарии Святой Мосианны. В спешке учёные оставили несколько экземпляров, которые за прошедшие десятилетия успели прижиться и расплодиться..."

#. ja: コロリン、コロリン……
#. de: Die Pflanze wirklich vernichten?<br><i>Stimme des Gewissens im Garten der Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaft</i>
#. fr: Wakka, wakka<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your korpokkur kid minion. For best results, keep moist at all times.
#. column 1: Before their exodus back to the Old World, Sharlayan botanists conducted extensive studies on korpokkurs at Saint Mocianne's Arboretum. In their haste, the scientists left behind several samples which have, over the past decades, continued to thrive and reproduce...
#. column 3: Seedbed
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 10 every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:166:0:2"
msgid "Feels so soft and moist as<br>fresh spring shower!<br>   - Ranu Vali"
msgstr "Такой мягкий и влажный,<br>словно после весеннего дождя!<br>   — Рану Вали"

#. ja: 苗床
#. de: Saatbett
#. fr: Semis
#. column 0: Summon your korpokkur kid minion. For best results, keep moist at all times.
#. column 1: Before their exodus back to the Old World, Sharlayan botanists conducted extensive studies on korpokkurs at Saint Mocianne's Arboretum. In their haste, the scientists left behind several samples which have, over the past decades, continued to thrive and reproduce...
