msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 10 every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s"
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 10 каждую секунду.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・フリオニール」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。いいじゃないか！　タダだし！
#. de: Du rufst deine Firion-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Nicht ganz so stattlich wie der echte Held, doch die Puppe war schließlich ein Geschenk.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Firion miniature. Ce pantin, créé sur le modèle du héros d'autrefois, sent bon la rose sauvage.
#. column 1: The craftsmanship used in creating this clockwork automaton is far more impressive than anything you have ever seen...which poses the question: why would anyone part with the doll without asking anything in return?
#. column 2: I can't believe he's just<br>giving them away free<br>of charge, kupo!<br>   - Mogzun
#. column 3: Name of the Rose
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 13%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:167:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Firion minion. Free is a very good price."
msgstr "Призвать заводного миньона Фириона. Дарёному коню в зубы не смотрят."

#. ja: 古の英雄「フリオニール」を模した魔法人形。非常に手の込んだ逸品だが、現代の英雄に贈りたいと、さる船乗りが持ってきた。その裏に何か意図がありそうで妖しいが、受け取っておこう。いいじゃないか！　タダだし！
#. de: Ein Matrose hat dir diese Nachbildung des legendären Helden Firion in die Hand gedrückt mit den Worten „Ein Held ist bei einem Helden am besten aufge-<br>hoben“. Du witterst eine Falle, nimmst das Geschenk aber dennoch entgegen. Es kostet dich ja nichts!
#. fr: Cette poupée magique finement ouvragée s'inspire du célèbre héros d'autrefois. Elle aurait été apportée en Éorzéa par un mystérieux matelot qui souhaitait l'offrir à “un héros d'aujourd'hui”. Beaucoup pensent que ce geste n'était pas désintéressé...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Firion minion. Free is a very good price.
#. column 2: I can't believe he's just<br>giving them away free<br>of charge, kupo!<br>   - Mogzun
#. column 3: Name of the Rose
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 13%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:167:0:1"
msgid "The craftsmanship used in creating this clockwork automaton is far more impressive than anything you have ever seen...which poses the question: why would anyone part with the doll without asking anything in return? "
msgstr "Этот заводной автомат сделан куда искуснее всего, что тебе доводилось видеть... И невольно возникает вопрос: с какой стати кто-то отдаёт такую куклу даром?"

#. ja: ……ゴクッ……
#. de: Er ist ein wahrer Held.<br><i>Guy</i>
#. fr: Mon rêve n'est pas encore terminé<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Firion minion. Free is a very good price.
#. column 1: The craftsmanship used in creating this clockwork automaton is far more impressive than anything you have ever seen...which poses the question: why would anyone part with the doll without asking anything in return?
#. column 3: Name of the Rose
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 13%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
