msgctxt "CompanionTransient:167:0:2"
msgid "I can't believe he's just<br>giving them away free<br>of charge, kupo!<br>   - Mogzun"
msgstr "Купо, не верится, что он<br>просто так их раздаёт!<br>   — Могзун"

#. ja: ゴクッ
#. de: Schluck
#. fr: Gloups<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Firion minion. Free is a very good price.
