#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・イフリート」を呼び出す。<br>焔神イフリートを模した魔法人形。我が「地獄の火炎」に焼かれよ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Mini-Ifrit herbei. Noch kleiner als ein Egi und auch viel weniger furcht<shy>ein<shy>flö<shy>ßend.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petit Ifrit. L'ardeur de sa droiture... euh non, il semble aussi ardent que le grand Primordial du feu.
#. column 1: To celebrate your slaying of the fell primal, the Weavers' Guild crafted scores of these lifelike replicas which were, much to the chagrin of Ul'dah's youth, immediately snatched up by wealthy collectors and locked away for no one to see.
#. column 2: Ifrit's fiery piss! Just how<br>many of these damned<br>rogues are there!?<br>   - Quimperain
#. column 3: Hellfire
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:168:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Ifrit minion. It doesn't bleed. You cannot kill it. (But you may discard it at your leisure.)"
msgstr "Призвать заводного миньона Ифрита. Он не кровоточит. Его не убить. (Но избавиться от него можно в любой момент.)"

#. ja: 焔神イフリートを模した魔法人形。冒険者の手による焔神討滅を記念して、裁縫師ギルドが発表した戦勝記念人形。蛮神さえをも従えるというコンセプトが流行に敏感なウルダハっ子の心を掴み、一気に人気に火が付いた
#. de: Von der Webergilde anlässlich des sich jährenden Triumphes über den Herrn des Infernos angefertigt. Ein brandheißer Artikel, der sich in Ul'dah blendend verkauft.
#. fr: Cette poupée a été créée par la guilde des couturiers pour marquer votre victoire contre le Seigneur des flammes. L'idée qu'un Primordial puisse être ainsi “subjugué” a beaucoup plu aux Uldiens.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ifrit minion. It doesn't bleed. You cannot kill it. (But you may discard it at your leisure.)
#. column 2: Ifrit's fiery piss! Just how<br>many of these damned<br>rogues are there!?<br>   - Quimperain
#. column 3: Hellfire
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:168:0:1"
msgid "To celebrate your slaying of the fell primal, the Weavers' Guild crafted scores of these lifelike replicas which were, much to the chagrin of Ul'dah's youth, immediately snatched up by wealthy collectors and locked away for no one to see."
msgstr "В честь победы над праймалом Гильдия ткачей изготовила множество таких реалистичных фигурок. К досаде ульдинской молодёжи, богатые коллекционеры тут же скупили их и заперли у себя — чтобы никто больше не увидел."

#. ja: 力戦奮闘！
#. de: Lasst euch umflackern von meinem Inferno!<br><i>Ifrit</i>
#. fr: Succombez aux enfers<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ifrit minion. It doesn't bleed. You cannot kill it. (But you may discard it at your leisure.)
#. column 1: To celebrate your slaying of the fell primal, the Weavers' Guild crafted scores of these lifelike replicas which were, much to the chagrin of Ul'dah's youth, immediately snatched up by wealthy collectors and locked away for no one to see.
#. column 3: Hellfire
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:168:0:2"
msgid "Ifrit's fiery piss! Just how<br>many of these damned<br>rogues are there!?<br>   - Quimperain"
msgstr "Огненная моча Ифрита! Да сколько<br>же этих проклятых<br>негодяев!?<br>   — Кемперен"

#. ja: じごくのかえん
#. de: Höllenfeuer
#. fr: Flammes de l'enfer
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ifrit minion. It doesn't bleed. You cannot kill it. (But you may discard it at your leisure.)
#. column 1: To celebrate your slaying of the fell primal, the Weavers' Guild crafted scores of these lifelike replicas which were, much to the chagrin of Ul'dah's youth, immediately snatched up by wealthy collectors and locked away for no one to see.
#. column 2: Ifrit's fiery piss! Just how<br>many of these damned<br>rogues are there!?<br>   - Quimperain
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:168:0:3"
msgid "Hellfire"
msgstr "Адское пламя"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ifrit minion. It doesn't bleed. You cannot kill it. (But you may discard it at your leisure.)
#. column 1: To celebrate your slaying of the fell primal, the Weavers' Guild crafted scores of these lifelike replicas which were, much to the chagrin of Ul'dah's youth, immediately snatched up by wealthy collectors and locked away for no one to see.
#. column 2: Ifrit's fiery piss! Just how<br>many of these damned<br>rogues are there!?<br>   - Quimperain
#. column 3: Hellfire
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:168:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 90."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ガルーダ」を呼び出す。<br>嵐神ガルーダを模した魔法人形。その首、引き裂いてくれるッ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Mini-Garuda als Begleiter herbei. Ihr aufbrausender Charakter macht sie gerade so attraktiv.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petite Garuda. Elle a beau avoir un air attendrissant, il ne faut pas se fier aux apparences. Ça va saigner<nbsp>!!
#. column 1: Understandably, many in Gridania opposed the manufacture of an automaton depicting the Ixal's chosen primal. However, since the publication of an article in <i>The Raven</i> espousing the puppet's efficacy as a good-luck charm, production can barely keep up with demand.
#. column 2: Heehee HAHA hahaha<br>HEEHEE haha HEEEEEE!!!<br>    - Garuda
#. column 3: Airy Blast
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 30% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:169:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Garuda minion. Hopefully she will not HEEHEE haha HEEE!!! too loudly in your ear."
msgstr "Призвать заводного миньона Гаруды. Надеюсь, она не станет слишком громко хихикать тебе в ухо! Хи-хи, ха-ха, хеее!!!"

#. ja: 嵐神ガルーダを模した魔法人形。当初、グリダニアでは敵対種族が崇める蛮神を人形とすることに、不謹慎だという反発があった。しかし、週刊「レイヴン」に厄除けに良いという記事が掲載されるや、大人気になったという
#. de: Obwohl nicht wenige Gridanier anfänglich Vorbehalte gegen eine Puppe in Gestalt des Primae der Ixal hatten, verflüchtigten sich diese rasch, nachdem im Wochenmagazin „Der Rabe“ ein Artikel über die unheilabwehrenden magischen Kräfte der Puppe erschienen war.
#. fr: Les Gridaniens étaient farouchement opposés à la fabrication d'une poupée à l'effigie de la divinité des Ixali, mais depuis la parution d'un article dans Le Corbeau vantant ses mérites de porte-bonheur, la production parvient tout juste à satisfaire la demande.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Garuda minion. Hopefully she will not HEEHEE haha HEEE!!! too loudly in your ear.
#. column 2: Heehee HAHA hahaha<br>HEEHEE haha HEEEEEE!!!<br>    - Garuda
#. column 3: Airy Blast
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 30% of the maximum value.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:169:0:1"
msgid "Understandably, many in Gridania opposed the manufacture of an automaton depicting the Ixal's chosen primal. However, since the publication of an article in <i>The Raven</i> espousing the puppet's efficacy as a good-luck charm, production can barely keep up with demand."
msgstr "Многие в Гридании, разумеется, выступали против создания куклы в образе праймала, которому поклоняются иксали. Но в еженедельнике «Ворон» напечатали статью о том, что кукла приносит удачу, и теперь производство едва поспевает за спросом."

#. ja: ナウ、フォール！
#. de: Wenn das Federvieh wirklich Garuda beschwören will,<br>dann wird es im wahrsten Sinne des Wortes stürmisch.<br><i>Belmont</i>
#. fr: Ahahahaha<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Garuda minion. Hopefully she will not HEEHEE haha HEEE!!! too loudly in your ear.
#. column 1: Understandably, many in Gridania opposed the manufacture of an automaton depicting the Ixal's chosen primal. However, since the publication of an article in <i>The Raven</i> espousing the puppet's efficacy as a good-luck charm, production can barely keep up with demand.
#. column 3: Airy Blast
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 30% of the maximum value.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:169:0:2"
msgid "Heehee HAHA hahaha<br>HEEHEE haha HEEEEEE!!!<br>    - Garuda"
msgstr "Хи-хи, ха-ха, ха-ха-ха!<br>Хи-хи, ха-ха, ХЕЕЕЕ!!!<br>    — Гаруда"

#. ja: えりあるぶらすと
#. de: Windstoß
#. fr: Rafale aérienne
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Garuda minion. Hopefully she will not HEEHEE haha HEEE!!! too loudly in your ear.
#. column 1: Understandably, many in Gridania opposed the manufacture of an automaton depicting the Ixal's chosen primal. However, since the publication of an article in <i>The Raven</i> espousing the puppet's efficacy as a good-luck charm, production can barely keep up with demand.
#. column 2: Heehee HAHA hahaha<br>HEEHEE haha HEEEEEE!!!<br>    - Garuda
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 30% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:169:0:3"
msgid "Airy Blast"
msgstr "Воздушный взрыв"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵の特殊技ポイントを、最大値の30%減少させる。
#. de: Verringert die Technikpunkte der Gegner in der Nähe um 30 % des Maximalwerts.
#. fr: Réduit les PdT des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet de 30% de leur valeur maximale.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Garuda minion. Hopefully she will not HEEHEE haha HEEE!!! too loudly in your ear.
#. column 1: Understandably, many in Gridania opposed the manufacture of an automaton depicting the Ixal's chosen primal. However, since the publication of an article in <i>The Raven</i> espousing the puppet's efficacy as a good-luck charm, production can barely keep up with demand.
#. column 2: Heehee HAHA hahaha<br>HEEHEE haha HEEEEEE!!!<br>    - Garuda
#. column 3: Airy Blast
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:169:0:4"
msgid "Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 30% of the maximum value."
msgstr "Уменьшает запас очков умений всех противников в радиусе действия на 30% от максимального значения."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・タイタン」を呼び出す。<br>岩神タイタンを模した魔法人形。 「大地の怒り」に砕け散れぇぇぇぇぇ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Mini-Titan als Begleiter herbei. Leise, damit er nicht in Wut gerät.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petit Titan. Il adore renverser tout ce qui lui passe sous la main. Tremblez devant la puissance de la terre<nbsp>!
#. column 1: The second in the Weavers' Guild's popular series of primal automata. The guild consulted with Trachtoum─a master axeman from the Company of Heroes─whose firsthand account of his battle against “Tidus” formed the basis of this true-to-life design.
#. column 2: Aye, we defeated him─in the<br>end─but he took from us some<br>of our very best.<br>    - Wheiskaet
#. column 3: Crag Prison
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:170:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Titan minion. Placing this puppet on an elevated surface may compel it to knock everything else to the ground."
msgstr "Призвать заводного миньона Титана. Поставь куклу повыше — и, возможно, она повалит на землю всё вокруг."

#. ja: 岩神タイタンを模した魔法人形。裁縫師ギルドが発表した蛮神シリーズ第二弾。レシピ製作にあたり、岩神討伐経験がある元海雄旅団のエース、トラッハトゥーム氏を特別顧問に招き、彼の証言に基づいてリアルにデザインした
#. de: Um die Puppe möglichst originaltreu zu gestalten, wurde Trachtoum, Held der Maulhelden, als Sonderberater in die Webergilde eingeladen. Seine Schilderungen über den heldenhaften Kampf gegen <i>Gigant</i> stießen auf ungläubiges Staunen.
#. fr: La deuxième création de la guilde des couturiers dans la série des Primordiaux. Trachtoum, illustre combattant de la Fratrie des gabiers ayant déjà affronté l'Ébranleur des terres, a prodigué ses conseils pour atteindre un réalisme maximal.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Titan minion. Placing this puppet on an elevated surface may compel it to knock everything else to the ground.
#. column 2: Aye, we defeated him─in the<br>end─but he took from us some<br>of our very best.<br>    - Wheiskaet
#. column 3: Crag Prison
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:170:0:1"
msgid "The second in the Weavers' Guild's popular series of primal automata. The guild consulted with Trachtoum─a master axeman from the Company of Heroes─whose firsthand account of his battle against “Tidus” formed the basis of this true-to-life design."
msgstr "Вторая модель из популярной серии праймальных кукол Гильдии ткачей. Для её создания гильдия обратилась к Трахтуму — мастеру топора из Братства героев. За основу взяли его рассказ о битве с «Тидусом»."

#. ja: バナナモゲラ！
#. de: Stark war der, viel stärker als Gigant<br>und gar nicht vergleichbar mit Ingrid!<br><i>Trachtoum</i>
#. fr: Raaaaahmmm...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Titan minion. Placing this puppet on an elevated surface may compel it to knock everything else to the ground.
#. column 1: The second in the Weavers' Guild's popular series of primal automata. The guild consulted with Trachtoum─a master axeman from the Company of Heroes─whose firsthand account of his battle against “Tidus” formed the basis of this true-to-life design.
#. column 3: Crag Prison
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:170:0:2"
msgid "Aye, we defeated him─in the<br>end─but he took from us some<br>of our very best.<br>    - Wheiskaet"
msgstr "Да, мы его одолели — в<br>конце концов. Но он забрал<br>у нас лучших людей.<br>    — Вайскет"

#. ja: グラグラジェイル
#. de: Felsverlies
#. fr: Geôle rocheuse
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Titan minion. Placing this puppet on an elevated surface may compel it to knock everything else to the ground.
#. column 1: The second in the Weavers' Guild's popular series of primal automata. The guild consulted with Trachtoum─a master axeman from the Company of Heroes─whose firsthand account of his battle against “Tidus” formed the basis of this true-to-life design.
#. column 2: Aye, we defeated him─in the<br>end─but he took from us some<br>of our very best.<br>    - Wheiskaet
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:170:0:3"
msgid "Crag Prison"
msgstr "Скальная тюрьма"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵を移動不可にする。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>5秒
#. de: Macht Gegner in der Nähe be<shy>we<shy>gungs<shy>un<shy>fäh<shy>ig.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5 Sekunden
#. fr: Immobilise les ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Titan minion. Placing this puppet on an elevated surface may compel it to knock everything else to the ground.
#. column 1: The second in the Weavers' Guild's popular series of primal automata. The guild consulted with Trachtoum─a master axeman from the Company of Heroes─whose firsthand account of his battle against “Tidus” formed the basis of this true-to-life design.
#. column 2: Aye, we defeated him─in the<br>end─but he took from us some<br>of our very best.<br>    - Wheiskaet
#. column 3: Crag Prison
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 505> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 505 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:170:0:4"
msgid "Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s"
msgstr "Обездвиживает всех противников в радиусе действия.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・リヴァイアサン」を呼び出す。<br>水神リヴァイアサンを模した魔法人形。全てを押し流す！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Mini-Leviathan herbei. In deinen Gartenteich solltest du ihn nicht aussetzen, wenn dir etwas am Wohl deiner Koi-Karpfen liegt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petit Léviathan. Il est si mignon que tous les aventuriers que vous croisez sont comme <i>subjugués</i>.
#. column 1: Following the release of their wind-up Titan, the Weavers' Guild once again approached Trachtoum for consultation─a task to which he eagerly “rose,” providing the guild with a crude sketch of a certain body part he insists is identical in length and girth to “the” Leviathan.
#. column 2: Leviathan's scaly arse!<br>    - Wilfalk
#. column 3: Leviath
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:171:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Leviathan minion. Your flesh cannot feed this minion of the deep. "
msgstr "Призвать заводного миньона Левиафана. Эта морская тварь не станет питаться твоей плотью."

#. ja: 水神リヴァイアサンを模した魔法人形。マメット・タイタンに引き続き、元海雄旅団のトラッハトゥーム氏を特別顧問に起用。同氏が「こんくらい」と指示したバランスにより、水神の特徴的な身体のラインが再現されている
#. de: Auch für das Design der Leviathan-Puppe zog die Webegilde Trachtoum, selbsternannter Bezwinger mehrerer Primae, herbei. Um die Seeschlange möglichst plastisch zu beschreiben, behalf sich der Maulheld mit schauerlichen Arm- und Zungenverrenkungen.
#. fr: Une fois de plus, la guilde des couturiers a fait appel à Trachtoum pour la réalisation de cette mascotte. Malgré le témoignage plus qu'approximatif de l'ancien de la Fratrie, les artisans sont parvenus à un résultat saisissant de réalisme.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Leviathan minion. Your flesh cannot feed this minion of the deep.
#. column 2: Leviathan's scaly arse!<br>    - Wilfalk
#. column 3: Leviath
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:171:0:1"
msgid "Following the release of their wind-up Titan, the Weavers' Guild once again approached Trachtoum for consultation─a task to which he eagerly “rose,” providing the guild with a crude sketch of a certain body part he insists is identical in length and girth to “the” Leviathan."
msgstr "Когда заводной Титан вышел в свет, гильдия ткачей вновь обратилась к Трахтуму за советом. Он с готовностью «восстал» и вручил гильдии грубый набросок одной части тела, утверждая, что она точь-в-точь такой же длины и толщины, как у самого Левиафана."

#. ja: パンヤサン！
#. de: Lebertran, dieses Ungeheuer, hat das Meer<br>aufgepeitscht, dass es ein Fest war!<br><i>Trachtoum</i>
#. fr: Fsssss...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Leviathan minion. Your flesh cannot feed this minion of the deep.
#. column 1: Following the release of their wind-up Titan, the Weavers' Guild once again approached Trachtoum for consultation─a task to which he eagerly “rose,” providing the guild with a crude sketch of a certain body part he insists is identical in length and girth to “the” Leviathan.
#. column 3: Leviath
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:171:0:2"
msgid "Leviathan's scaly arse!<br>    - Wilfalk"
msgstr "Чешуйчатая задница Левиафана!<br>    — Вильтфальк"

#. ja: リバイア
#. de: Laberathan
#. fr: Léviath
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Leviathan minion. Your flesh cannot feed this minion of the deep.
#. column 1: Following the release of their wind-up Titan, the Weavers' Guild once again approached Trachtoum for consultation─a task to which he eagerly “rose,” providing the guild with a crude sketch of a certain body part he insists is identical in length and girth to “the” Leviathan.
#. column 2: Leviathan's scaly arse!<br>    - Wilfalk
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:171:0:3"
msgid "Leviath"
msgstr "Левиаф"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のゲートに90%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Tor 90<nbsp>% Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls es schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 90% de sa solidité au portail ennemi le plus proche. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Leviathan minion. Your flesh cannot feed this minion of the deep.
#. column 1: Following the release of their wind-up Titan, the Weavers' Guild once again approached Trachtoum for consultation─a task to which he eagerly “rose,” providing the guild with a crude sketch of a certain body part he insists is identical in length and girth to “the” Leviathan.
#. column 2: Leviathan's scaly arse!<br>    - Wilfalk
#. column 3: Leviath
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:171:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable."
msgstr "Наносит ближайшим вражеским воротам урон в размере 90% их прочности. Не действует, если ворота уже разрушены."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ズンド」を呼び出す。<br>ズンド族を模した魔法人形。春風のようにおおらかだ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen kleinen Zundo-Krieger herbei. Er wird dir nachfolgen wie Wirbelwind!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée zundu. Elle est très paisible.
#. column 1: A sign of friendship between the Zundu and Gundu tribes, this animated doll was created using a myriad of sacred items enchanted by an elder shaman. It is unclear how, without clockwork, the warrior can walk on its own, but its maker remains silent on the techniques he employed.
#. column 2: Like the most precious<br>of crystals, Gundu culture<br>possesses many facets.<br>   - Sonu Vanu
#. column 3: Sundrop Dance
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:172:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Zundu warrior minion. Like a spring wind, the Zundu warrior is strong...until he winds down."
msgstr "Призвать заводного воина зунду. Как весенний ветер, он силён... пока не заводится."

#. ja: バヌバヌ族を模した魔法人形。鮮やかなグンド族のまじない師が、大らかなズンド族との友好を記念して創り上げた。輝く日射しのようなズンド族の羽根の色を再現するために、文字にするのもはばかられる材料を使ったらしい
#. de: Ein Gundo-Schamane hat diesen kleinen Krieger als Zeichen der Freund<shy>schaft zu den Zundo angefertigt und ihm Leben eingehaucht. In der naturgetreuen Nachbildung bis in die kleinste Feder zeigt sich die Liebe zum Detail.
#. fr: Un chaman de la tribu des Gundu a con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>né cette poupée en s'inspirant des méthodes de fabrication des totems vanu vanu. Il a mis un point d'honneur à lui donner un aspect paisible par respect pour le caractère des Zundu.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Zundu warrior minion. Like a spring wind, the Zundu warrior is strong...until he winds down.
#. column 2: Like the most precious<br>of crystals, Gundu culture<br>possesses many facets.<br>   - Sonu Vanu
#. column 3: Sundrop Dance
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:172:0:1"
msgid "A sign of friendship between the Zundu and Gundu tribes, this animated doll was created using a myriad of sacred items enchanted by an elder shaman. It is unclear how, without clockwork, the warrior can walk on its own, but its maker remains silent on the techniques he employed."
msgstr "Эта ожившая кукла — знак дружбы между племенами зунду и гунду. Старый шаман создал её из множества священных зачарованных предметов. Как воину удаётся ходить без заводного механизма, неясно, а создатель хранит секрет своей работы."

#. ja: ズンド、ズンド！
#. de: So wird Sonnentanz getanzt! Huh! Hah! Huh! Hah!<br>Gundo-eeh und Zundo-eeh sollen zittern wie Laub von Espen!<br><i>Honu Vanu</i>
#. fr: Paisible comme le ciel bleu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Zundu warrior minion. Like a spring wind, the Zundu warrior is strong...until he winds down.
#. column 1: A sign of friendship between the Zundu and Gundu tribes, this animated doll was created using a myriad of sacred items enchanted by an elder shaman. It is unclear how, without clockwork, the warrior can walk on its own, but its maker remains silent on the techniques he employed.
#. column 3: Sundrop Dance
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:172:0:2"
msgid "Like the most precious<br>of crystals, Gundu culture<br>possesses many facets.<br>   - Sonu Vanu"
msgstr "Культура гунду, словно<br>драгоценнейший кристалл,<br>многогранна.<br>   — Сону Вану"

#. ja: 大らかな太陽の舞
#. de: Großer Sonnentanz
#. fr: Danse du soleil zundu
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Zundu warrior minion. Like a spring wind, the Zundu warrior is strong...until he winds down.
#. column 1: A sign of friendship between the Zundu and Gundu tribes, this animated doll was created using a myriad of sacred items enchanted by an elder shaman. It is unclear how, without clockwork, the warrior can walk on its own, but its maker remains silent on the techniques he employed.
#. column 2: Like the most precious<br>of crystals, Gundu culture<br>possesses many facets.<br>   - Sonu Vanu
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:172:0:3"
msgid "Sundrop Dance"
msgstr "Солнечный танец"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のATKを25上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Erhöht die ATT eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 25 l'attaque des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Zundu warrior minion. Like a spring wind, the Zundu warrior is strong...until he winds down.
#. column 1: A sign of friendship between the Zundu and Gundu tribes, this animated doll was created using a myriad of sacred items enchanted by an elder shaman. It is unclear how, without clockwork, the warrior can walk on its own, but its maker remains silent on the techniques he employed.
#. column 2: Like the most precious<br>of crystals, Gundu culture<br>possesses many facets.<br>   - Sonu Vanu
#. column 3: Sundrop Dance
