#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・オルシュファン」を呼び出す。<br>オルシュファンを模した魔法人形。イイ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Haurchefant-Puppe herbei. Nun kannst <i>du</i> ihn beschützen und für ihn einstehen wie ein wahrer Ritter.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Haurchefant miniature. Tout comme le célèbre chevalier des Fortemps, elle passe son temps à tâter ses muscles.
#. column 1: Crafted by the first son of House Haillenarte to honor the passing of one of House Fortemps's greatest knights, this miniature replica of the great Haurchefant Greystone only begins to tell the tale of a man who devoted his life to the service of his nation and his friends.
#. column 2: Lord Haurchefant is, from all<br>indications, quite fond of you.<br>   - Discomposed Cataloger
#. column 3: E
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:173:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Haurchefant minion. What isn't dead (or is recreated in a goldsmith's workshop) can never die."
msgstr "Призвать заводного миньона Оршфана. Что не умерло (или не было заново создано в мастерской ювелира), то не умрёт никогда."

#. ja: フォルタン家の騎士、オルシュファンを模した魔法人形。民と友のために戦い続けたひとりの騎士の想いを後の世に伝えるために、アインハルト家の長男ステファニヴィアンが製作した。その姿は、在りし日の姿を思い出させる
#. de: Eine von Stephanivien Haillenarte angefertigte Stoffpuppe von dem selbstlosesten, mutigsten Ritter, den Ishgard gesehen hat.
#. fr: Cette poupée plus vraie que nature du célèbre commandant du camp de la Tête du dragon a été mise au point par Stephanivien de Haillenarte pour inspirer le courage à tous les jeunes Ishgardais.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Haurchefant minion. What isn't dead (or is recreated in a goldsmith's workshop) can never die.
#. column 2: Lord Haurchefant is, from all<br>indications, quite fond of you.<br>   - Discomposed Cataloger
#. column 3: E
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:173:0:1"
msgid "Crafted by the first son of House Haillenarte to honor the passing of one of House Fortemps's greatest knights, this miniature replica of the great Haurchefant Greystone only begins to tell the tale of a man who devoted his life to the service of his nation and his friends."
msgstr "Чтобы почтить память одного из величайших рыцарей дома Фор-Тэмпестов, старший сын дома Айленарт изготовил эту миниатюрную копию Оршфана Грейстоуна. Она лишь начало рассказа о человеке, посвятившем жизнь служению родине и друзьям."

#. ja: イイ！
#. de: Haurchefant ...! Bitte sei doch vernünftig!<br><i>Graf Edmont Fortemps</i>
#. fr: Tu veux toucher mes muscles<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Haurchefant minion. What isn't dead (or is recreated in a goldsmith's workshop) can never die.
#. column 1: Crafted by the first son of House Haillenarte to honor the passing of one of House Fortemps's greatest knights, this miniature replica of the great Haurchefant Greystone only begins to tell the tale of a man who devoted his life to the service of his nation and his friends.
#. column 3: E
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:173:0:2"
msgid "Lord Haurchefant is, from all<br>indications, quite fond of you.<br>   - Discomposed Cataloger"
msgstr "Судя по всему,<br>лорд Оршфан к тебе<br>неравнодушен.<br>   — Смущённый каталогизатор"

#. ja: イイ！
#. de: Silberklinge
#. fr: Musculation
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Haurchefant minion. What isn't dead (or is recreated in a goldsmith's workshop) can never die.
#. column 1: Crafted by the first son of House Haillenarte to honor the passing of one of House Fortemps's greatest knights, this miniature replica of the great Haurchefant Greystone only begins to tell the tale of a man who devoted his life to the service of his nation and his friends.
