#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ネロ」を呼び出す。<br>超天才ネロを模した魔法人形。ガンハンマー「ミョルニル」付き
#. de: Du rufst deine Nero-Puppe herbei. Sie mag es gar nicht, dass du auf sie herabsehen kannst.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Nero tol Scaeva miniature. Il a toujours son marteau-canon à portée de main, au cas où il croiserait un Cid miniature.
#. column 1: This automaton incorporates a special mechanism that allows it to grip its weapon more effectively. This revolutionary innovation puts it above any wind-up toy currently in production, especially those crafted by the Garlond Ironworks.
#. column 2: If it were up to me, I'd<br>lock him up and throw the<br>key into Silvertear Lake.<br>    - Biggs
#. column 3: Reverse Engineering
#. column 4: Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:174:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Nero tol Scaeva minion. Better engineered than the wind-up Cid. In every way. "
msgstr "Призвать заводного миньона Неро тол Скаввы. Сделан лучше заводного Сида. Во всём."

#. ja: 超天才機工師、ネロ・トル・スカエウァを模した最高の魔法人形。最高にイカした武器、ガンハンマー「ミョルニル」も付属。お前の会社が売り出してるチャチな魔法人形なンざ、目じゃねぇンだよ、ガーロンドォ……
#. de: Eine Miniaturabbildung des genialen garleischen Maschinisten Nero tol Scaeva mitsamt seiner Hammerwaffe, mit der er Cid gerne den Kopf einschlagen würde ...
#. fr: Cette mascotte est équipée d'un dispositif lui permettant de tenir fermement son arme, ce qui la rend redoutable. Surtout lorsqu'elle croise un re<shy>pré<shy>sen<shy>tant des Forges de Garlond...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Nero tol Scaeva minion. Better engineered than the wind-up Cid. In every way.
#. column 2: If it were up to me, I'd<br>lock him up and throw the<br>key into Silvertear Lake.<br>    - Biggs
#. column 3: Reverse Engineering
#. column 4: Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:174:0:1"
msgid "This automaton incorporates a special mechanism that allows it to grip its weapon more effectively. This revolutionary innovation puts it above any wind-up toy currently in production, especially those crafted by the Garlond Ironworks."
msgstr "В этот автоматон встроен особый механизм, благодаря которому он надёжнее держит оружие. Это революционное новшество выводит его далеко вперёд по сравнению со всеми заводными игрушками, особенно с теми, что выпускает мастерская Гарлонда."

#. ja: ガーロンドォ……
#. de: Ich traue Nero keinen Ilm weit. Und das solltest du ebenfalls nicht.<br><i>Cid Garlond</i>
#. fr: Ciiiid<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Nero tol Scaeva minion. Better engineered than the wind-up Cid. In every way.
#. column 1: This automaton incorporates a special mechanism that allows it to grip its weapon more effectively. This revolutionary innovation puts it above any wind-up toy currently in production, especially those crafted by the Garlond Ironworks.
#. column 3: Reverse Engineering
#. column 4: Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:174:0:2"
msgid "If it were up to me, I'd<br>lock him up and throw the<br>key into Silvertear Lake.<br>    - Biggs"
msgstr "Я бы запер его,<br>а ключ выбросил<br>в Серебряное озеро.<br>    — Биггс"

#. ja: リバースエンジニアリング
#. de: Fallendreher
#. fr: Rétroingénierie
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Nero tol Scaeva minion. Better engineered than the wind-up Cid. In every way.
#. column 1: This automaton incorporates a special mechanism that allows it to grip its weapon more effectively. This revolutionary innovation puts it above any wind-up toy currently in production, especially those crafted by the Garlond Ironworks.
#. column 2: If it were up to me, I'd<br>lock him up and throw the<br>key into Silvertear Lake.<br>    - Biggs
#. column 4: Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:174:0:3"
msgid "Reverse Engineering"
msgstr "Обратная разработка"

#. ja: 敵軍が配置したトラップがある場合、自軍のトラップとして発動させる。トラップがATKダメージの場合はダメージを1.5倍にする。
#. de: Wandelt gegnerische Fallen in eigene um. Wenn die Falle eine Attacke ausführt, wird der Attacke-Wert um das 1,5-fache erhöht.
#. fr: Déclenche un piège ennemi comme s'il vous appartenait. S'il inflige des dégâts d'attaque, sa puissance est multipliée par 1,5.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Nero tol Scaeva minion. Better engineered than the wind-up Cid. In every way.
#. column 1: This automaton incorporates a special mechanism that allows it to grip its weapon more effectively. This revolutionary innovation puts it above any wind-up toy currently in production, especially those crafted by the Garlond Ironworks.
#. column 2: If it were up to me, I'd<br>lock him up and throw the<br>key into Silvertear Lake.<br>    - Biggs
#. column 3: Reverse Engineering
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:174:0:4"
msgid "Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%."
msgstr "Срабатывает вражеская ловушка, словно она принадлежит твоей команде. Если ловушка наносит физический урон, его сила увеличивается на 150%."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ヴァス」を呼び出す。<br>「分かたれし者たち」を模した魔法人形。シシシシシ……
#. de: Du rufst deine Vath-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Solange du sie als Individuum respektierst, wird sie dir überallhin folgen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée vathe. Ce petit Vathe a trouvé sa vocation<nbsp>: vous suivre partout où vous irez.
#. column 1: The idea for this design came when a Vath observed an automaton following on the heels of a fleshling he encountered. So impressed was the Vath by the gadget's intricacy that he endeavored to create his own, after which he started calling himself “Needleclaw.”
#. column 2: We are not of the Onemind.<br>We are Vath!<br>    - The Nameless One
#. column 3: Fleetfeet
#. column 4: Increases the movement speed of the action party by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:175:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Vath minion. \\<click> \\<click> He seeks purpose. So he will follow you. Everywhere."
msgstr "Призвать заводного миньона вата. \\<click> \\<click> Он ищет своё предназначение. Вот и следует за тобой. Повсюду."

#. ja: グナース族の「分かたれし者たち」を模した魔法人形。あるグナース族が任務中に、人が連れていたマメットを目撃。これに感銘を受けて、製作したという。以降、このグナース族は「ニンギョウツカイ」と名乗るようになった
#. de: Ein Vath bemerkte eines Tages eine Puppe, die einem Jäger auf Schritt und Tritt folgte. Tief beeindruckt von solcher Loyalität, beschloss er, selbst eine Puppe zu kreieren. Fortan nannte er sich „der Puppenmacher“.
#. fr: Un jour, un Vathe en mission aperçut un automate suivant son maître aventurier comme son ombre, et il eut l'idée de fabriquer cette mascotte. Ayant trouvé sa vocation, il se fait désormais appeler “maître des poupées”.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Vath minion. \<click> \<click> He seeks purpose. So he will follow you. Everywhere.
#. column 2: We are not of the Onemind.<br>We are Vath!<br>    - The Nameless One
#. column 3: Fleetfeet
#. column 4: Increases the movement speed of the action party by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:175:0:1"
msgid "The idea for this design came when a Vath observed an automaton following on the heels of a fleshling he encountered. So impressed was the Vath by the gadget's intricacy that he endeavored to create his own, after which he started calling himself “Needleclaw.”"
msgstr "Идея этой куклы пришла одному вату, когда он увидел автоматона, который следовал за встреченным им двуногим. Впечатлённый сложностью устройства, ват решил создать собственную куклу и с тех пор зовёт себя «Игольчатой Лапой»."

#. ja: シシシシシ……
#. de: Ihr könnt machen, was ihr wollt, das<br>überlasse ich jedem individuellen Selbst.<br><i>Der Erzähler</i>
#. fr: Ksss...<nbsp>? Ksss<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Vath minion. \<click> \<click> He seeks purpose. So he will follow you. Everywhere.
#. column 1: The idea for this design came when a Vath observed an automaton following on the heels of a fleshling he encountered. So impressed was the Vath by the gadget's intricacy that he endeavored to create his own, after which he started calling himself “Needleclaw.”
#. column 3: Fleetfeet
#. column 4: Increases the movement speed of the action party by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:175:0:2"
msgid "We are not of the Onemind.<br>We are Vath!<br>    - The Nameless One"
msgstr "Мы не единый разум.<br>Мы — ваты!<br>    — Безымянный"

#. ja: イダテン
#. de: Krabbelbein
#. fr: Hâte vathe
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Vath minion. \<click> \<click> He seeks purpose. So he will follow you. Everywhere.
#. column 1: The idea for this design came when a Vath observed an automaton following on the heels of a fleshling he encountered. So impressed was the Vath by the gadget's intricacy that he endeavored to create his own, after which he started calling himself “Needleclaw.”
#. column 2: We are not of the Onemind.<br>We are Vath!<br>    - The Nameless One
#. column 4: Increases the movement speed of the action party by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:175:0:3"
msgid "Fleetfeet"
msgstr "Быстроног"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンの移動速度を30%上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
#. de: Erhöht die GSW der ausführenden Trabanten um 30 %.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 30% la vitesse de déplacement des mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
