#. ja: ミニオン「ミニファウスト」を呼び出す。<br>「青の手」が開発した総合火力評価用の小型機工兵
#. de: Du rufst dein Fäustchen als Begleiter herbei. Weitaus kleiner als das Original, doch seine Wut bringt Berge zum Einstürzen und Erze zum Schmelzen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte faust articulé, un soldat mécanique miniature mis au point par la Mimine bleue.
#. column 1: The Illuminati reportedly designed this minute automaton for the purpose of testing the effectiveness of their newest weapons. Perhaps being used as target practice has filled it with the need to lash out against imagined enemies.
#. column 2: It's only a massive<br>mammet, after all.<br>    - Cid
#. column 3: Exemplar
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 380 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:176:0:0"
msgid "Summon your faustlet minion. He will shelter you from the sturms."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Фаустёнка. Он укроет тебя от бурь."

#. ja: ファウストを縮小再設計した小型機工兵。ゴブリン族の科学者集団「青の手」が、新兵器の総合火力を評価するための標的として設計したものらしい。全力で身体を張って挑戦者を受け止める姿は、多くのことを教えてくれる
#. de: Die Ingenieure der Indigohand erschufen diese Abwandlung ihrer Kampfmaschine <i>Faust</i>, um die Zielgenauigkeit von neu entwickelten Waffen zu testen. Dies kann ein Grund dafür sein, warum das Fäustchen sich verselbstständigte.
#. fr: Ce petit soldat a été mis au point par la Mimine bleue pour tester l'efficacité de leurs nouvelles armes. Il a tellement été pris pour cible qu'il semble désormais combattre contre des ennemis imaginaires.
#. column 0: Summon your faustlet minion. He will shelter you from the sturms.
#. column 2: It's only a massive<br>mammet, after all.<br>    - Cid
#. column 3: Exemplar
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 380 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:176:0:1"
msgid "The Illuminati reportedly designed this minute automaton for the purpose of testing the effectiveness of their newest weapons. Perhaps being used as target practice has filled it with the need to lash out against imagined enemies."
msgstr "По слухам, иллюминаты создали этот крошечный автоматон, чтобы проверять эффективность нового оружия. Возможно, постоянные тренировки в роли мишени заставили его бросаться на воображаемых врагов."

#. ja: トリアエズ修行ダナ
#. de: Das sind durchgedrehte Tüftler, die ihre<br>technischen Projekte ohne jede Rücksicht<br>auf Verluste umsetzen wollen.<br><i>Cid Garlond</i>
#. fr: Entraînement<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your faustlet minion. He will shelter you from the sturms.
#. column 1: The Illuminati reportedly designed this minute automaton for the purpose of testing the effectiveness of their newest weapons. Perhaps being used as target practice has filled it with the need to lash out against imagined enemies.
#. column 3: Exemplar
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 380 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:176:0:2"
msgid "It's only a massive<br>mammet, after all.<br>    - Cid"
msgstr "В конце концов, это всего лишь<br>огромная кукла.<br>    — Сид"

#. ja: おてほん
#. de: Exemplar
#. fr: Leçon
#. column 0: Summon your faustlet minion. He will shelter you from the sturms.
#. column 1: The Illuminati reportedly designed this minute automaton for the purpose of testing the effectiveness of their newest weapons. Perhaps being used as target practice has filled it with the need to lash out against imagined enemies.
#. column 2: It's only a massive<br>mammet, after all.<br>    - Cid
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 380 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:176:0:3"
msgid "Exemplar"
msgstr "Образец"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK380のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 380 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 380 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your faustlet minion. He will shelter you from the sturms.
#. column 1: The Illuminati reportedly designed this minute automaton for the purpose of testing the effectiveness of their newest weapons. Perhaps being used as target practice has filled it with the need to lash out against imagined enemies.
#. column 2: It's only a massive<br>mammet, after all.<br>    - Cid
#. column 3: Exemplar
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:176:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 380 to all enemies within range. "
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 380."

#. ja: ミニオン「ニュー・ヤ・シュトラ」を呼び出す。<br>ヤ・シュトラを模した魔法人形。装いも新たに登場
#. de: Du rufst deine neue Y'shtola-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Die Flucht durch den Äther hat sie sichtbar verändert.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte nouvelle Y'shtola miniature. Ce pantin reproduit les traits de l'élé<shy>men<shy>ta<shy>lis<shy>te sharlayanaise depuis qu'elle est revenue du flux éthéré. Son regard est si clair qu'on dirait qu'elle voit à travers les choses.
#. column 1: This clockwork automaton has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. Alphinaud Leveilleur was apparently more than happy to submit a rough sketch for the design, despite never being asked.
#. column 2: Tataru has truly outdone<br>herself this time.<br>   - Y'shtola
#. column 3: Aetherial Pulse
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:177:0:0"
msgid "Summon your dress-up Y'shtola minion. Now with more aetheric...enhancements?"
msgstr "Призвать миньона Я'штолу в новом наряде. Теперь с дополнительными эфирными... улучшениями?"

#. ja: 冒険者ギルドが、エオルゼアの新生を祝して用意した魔法人形。「暁の血盟」の賢人、ヤ・シュトラをモチーフにするにあたり、某ルヴェユール家の御曹司が記憶を頼りに描いた緻密な人物画が参考にされたという
#. de: Dieser Uhrwerk-Automat wurde auf Geheiß der Aben<shy>teurer<shy>gilde für die jährliche Feier der Wiedergeburt Eorzeas angefertigt. Alphinaud Leveilleur hat begeistert eine Skizze eingereicht, um bei der Anfertigung zu helfen.
#. fr: Cette poupée magique créée par la guilde des aventuriers pour célébrer la renaissance d'Éorzéa s'inspire de la belle et intelligente Miqo'te. Un soin particulier a été apporté à ses yeux, donnant l'impression qu'elle peut voir à travers les êtres et les choses.
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Y'shtola minion. Now with more aetheric...enhancements?
#. column 2: Tataru has truly outdone<br>herself this time.<br>   - Y'shtola
#. column 3: Aetherial Pulse
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:177:0:1"
msgid "This clockwork automaton has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. Alphinaud Leveilleur was apparently more than happy to submit a rough sketch for the design, despite never being asked."
msgstr "Эту заводную куклу изготовили по заказу Гильдии искателей приключений к ежегодному Празднику возрождения — в честь обновления Эорзеи. Похоже, Альфино Левейер с радостью предложил эскиз, хотя его никто об этом не просил."

#. ja: マタセタワネ！
#. de: Das wird eine harte Schlacht!
#. fr: Je suis prête<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Y'shtola minion. Now with more aetheric...enhancements?
#. column 1: This clockwork automaton has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. Alphinaud Leveilleur was apparently more than happy to submit a rough sketch for the design, despite never being asked.
#. column 3: Aetherial Pulse
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:177:0:2"
msgid "Tataru has truly outdone<br>herself this time.<br>   - Y'shtola"
msgstr "На этот раз Татара<br>превзошла саму себя.<br>   — Я'штола"

#. ja: エーテリアルパルス
#. de: Ätherimpuls
#. fr: Impulsion éthérée
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Y'shtola minion. Now with more aetheric...enhancements?
#. column 1: This clockwork automaton has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. Alphinaud Leveilleur was apparently more than happy to submit a rough sketch for the design, despite never being asked.
#. column 2: Tataru has truly outdone<br>herself this time.<br>   - Y'shtola
