#. ja: ミニオン「カルコ」を呼び出す。<br>怖くて可愛い魔法人形。ノコノコやってくるからさ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Calco-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie wird dich bis in deine Albträume verfolgen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Calca, une poupée magique aussi adorable qu'inquiétante. Peut-être est-ce son regard vide qui vous met mal à l'aise<nbsp>?
#. column 1: Upon realizing the Antitower would require several layers of defenses to keep out unwanted visitors, the spire's creator breathed life into several common dolls. Hairless at first, its maker adorned it with blonde locks, along with other aesthetically pleasing accessories.
#. column 2: Adorable dolls!<br>Terrible dolls!<br>Yip-ho-ho!<br>    - Calcabrina
#. column 3: Jive
#. column 4: Increases the DEF of all allies within range by 10. If Brina is within range, DEF is raised by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:178:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Calca minion. Whether she is cute or creepy has been oft debated, but all agree it is best not to leave her to her own devices."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Кальки. Споры о том, милая она или жуткая, не утихают, но все сходятся в одном: лучше не оставлять её без присмотра."

#. ja: 怖くて可愛い魔法人形。「逆さの塔」を守らせるために、シャーレアンの偉大な魔道士が人形に魔力を込めて造り上げた。なお、当初は頭髪がなかったが、あまりに不気味だったため、植毛するなど手を加えたらしい
#. de: Ein großer Sharlayaner Magier hauchte dieser Puppe durch Magie Leben ein, um sie für die Bewachung des Antiturms einzusetzen. Ohne ihre blonde Haarpracht, die ihr der Magier erst später verpasste, muss ihre abschreckende Wirkung noch größer gewesen sein.
#. fr: Le créateur de l'Antitour a donné vie à cette poupée dans le but de protéger son antre. D'abord dépourvue de cheveux, elle arbore maintenant de ravissantes couettes blondes.
#. column 0: Summon your Calca minion. Whether she is cute or creepy has been oft debated, but all agree it is best not to leave her to her own devices.
#. column 2: Adorable dolls!<br>Terrible dolls!<br>Yip-ho-ho!<br>    - Calcabrina
#. column 3: Jive
#. column 4: Increases the DEF of all allies within range by 10. If Brina is within range, DEF is raised by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:178:0:1"
msgid "Upon realizing the Antitower would require several layers of defenses to keep out unwanted visitors, the spire's creator breathed life into several common dolls. Hairless at first, its maker adorned it with blonde locks, along with other aesthetically pleasing accessories."
msgstr "Осознав, что для защиты Антибашни от непрошеных гостей понадобится несколько уровней обороны, её создатель оживил магией несколько обычных кукол. Поначалу они были лысыми, но создатель добавил им светлые локоны и прочие украшения."

#. ja: バーカめ！
#. de: Vereint sind wir ... die zauberhafte, herzallerliebste, schaurige Calcobrina!<br><i>Calcobrina</i>
#. fr: Bande de simplets<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Calca minion. Whether she is cute or creepy has been oft debated, but all agree it is best not to leave her to her own devices.
#. column 1: Upon realizing the Antitower would require several layers of defenses to keep out unwanted visitors, the spire's creator breathed life into several common dolls. Hairless at first, its maker adorned it with blonde locks, along with other aesthetically pleasing accessories.
#. column 3: Jive
#. column 4: Increases the DEF of all allies within range by 10. If Brina is within range, DEF is raised by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:178:0:2"
msgid "Adorable dolls!<br>Terrible dolls!<br>Yip-ho-ho!<br>    - Calcabrina"
msgstr "Милые куклы!<br>Страшные куклы!<br>И-хо-хо!<br>    — Калькобрина"

#. ja: 陰気な踊り
#. de: Polka
#. fr: Morne valse
#. column 0: Summon your Calca minion. Whether she is cute or creepy has been oft debated, but all agree it is best not to leave her to her own devices.
#. column 1: Upon realizing the Antitower would require several layers of defenses to keep out unwanted visitors, the spire's creator breathed life into several common dolls. Hairless at first, its maker adorned it with blonde locks, along with other aesthetically pleasing accessories.
