msgctxt "CompanionTransient:179:0:4"
msgid "Increases the ATK of all allies within range by 20. If Calca is within range, ATK is raised by 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s"
msgstr "Повышает силу атаки всех союзников в радиусе действия на 20. Если в радиусе действия есть Калька, её сила атаки повышается на 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「モルフォ」を呼び出す。<br>幻想的な光を放つ青い蝶
#. de: Du rufst einen Morpho als Begleiter herbei. Wenn er sich sachte auf deine Schulter setzt, könntest du vor Rührung weinen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte morpho, un petit papillon bleu. Ses ailes sont si brillantes que vous vous demandez s'il n'est pas une illusion.
#. column 1: The wings of this butterfly were highly sought after during the War of the Magi, as their scales could be used to make poison that inhibited the restoration of magical energy. As a result, they were hunted to near extinction, and now very few remain.
#. column 2: The War of the Magi must have<br>been a conflict of truly terrifying<br>proportions.<br>    - E-Sumi-Yan
#. column 3: Poison Scales
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:180:0:0"
msgid "Summon your morpho minion. With blue wings practically glowing, this butterfly feels almost like a spirit. Almost."
msgstr "Призвать миньона-морфо. Его синие крылья так ярко сияют, что бабочка кажется почти духом. Почти."

#. ja: 幻想的な光を放つ青い蝶。魔大戦が巻き起こった時代、その羽根に魔力回復を妨げる効能があったため、対魔道士用の毒物を作るための錬金素材として重宝されていた。その時代に乱獲されたため、現在、棲息数は少ない
#. de: Diese Schmetterlingsart war während des Krieges der Magi bei Alchemisten heiß begehrt, da sich aus den Flügeln des Morphos ein magiehemmendes Mittel herstellen lässt. Aus diesem Grund gibt es heute nur noch wenige Morphos.
#. fr: Ce papillon a été intensément chassé pour les écailles de ses ailes, qui permettent de concocter un poison puissant. Aujourd'hui, il ne reste que quelques rares spécimens encore en vie.
#. column 0: Summon your morpho minion. With blue wings practically glowing, this butterfly feels almost like a spirit. Almost.
#. column 2: The War of the Magi must have<br>been a conflict of truly terrifying<br>proportions.<br>    - E-Sumi-Yan
#. column 3: Poison Scales
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:180:0:1"
msgid "The wings of this butterfly were highly sought after during the War of the Magi, as their scales could be used to make poison that inhibited the restoration of magical energy. As a result, they were hunted to near extinction, and now very few remain."
msgstr "Во время Войны магов крылья этой бабочки ценились на вес золота: из их чешуек делали яд, мешавший восстанавливать магическую энергию. Морфо истребляли, и теперь их осталось совсем мало."

#. ja: キラキラキラ……
#. de: Wir reden hier von potenziellen Katastrophen gewaltigen Ausmaßes.<br>Vielleicht war es ja etwas ganz Ähnliches, das damals den Krieg der Magi<br>ausgelöst hat!<br><i>Zhai'a Nelhah</i>
#. fr: Flap flap<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your morpho minion. With blue wings practically glowing, this butterfly feels almost like a spirit. Almost.
#. column 1: The wings of this butterfly were highly sought after during the War of the Magi, as their scales could be used to make poison that inhibited the restoration of magical energy. As a result, they were hunted to near extinction, and now very few remain.
#. column 3: Poison Scales
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:180:0:2"
msgid "The War of the Magi must have<br>been a conflict of truly terrifying<br>proportions.<br>    - E-Sumi-Yan"
msgstr "Война магов, должно быть,<br>была поистине ужасным<br>конфликтом.<br>    — Э-Суми-Ян"

#. ja: 猛毒の鱗粉
#. de: Giftiger Flügelstaub
#. fr: Poussière nocive
#. column 0: Summon your morpho minion. With blue wings practically glowing, this butterfly feels almost like a spirit. Almost.
#. column 1: The wings of this butterfly were highly sought after during the War of the Magi, as their scales could be used to make poison that inhibited the restoration of magical energy. As a result, they were hunted to near extinction, and now very few remain.
#. column 2: The War of the Magi must have<br>been a conflict of truly terrifying<br>proportions.<br>    - E-Sumi-Yan
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:180:0:3"
msgid "Poison Scales"
msgstr "Ядовитые чешуйки"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、1秒ごとに10の継続ダメージを与える。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>30秒
#. de: Fügt Gegnern in der Nähe im Sekundentakt 10 Schaden über Zeit zu.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30 Sekunden
#. fr: Inflige 10 points de dégâts périodiques par seconde aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30s
