#. ja: ミニオン「ポロ・ロッゴ」を呼び出す。<br>魔法をかけられ知恵を付けた使い魔トード
#. de: Du rufst Poro Roggo als deinen Begleiter herbei. Auch ein Kuss wird diesen Hexenzauber nicht brechen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Poro Roggo, un petit crapaud à qui on a jeté un sort. Embrassez-le à vos risques et périls<nbsp>!
#. column 1: A product of Matoya's mind-altering magicks, this particular familiar served the mistress for almost fifty summers before becoming struck with a sense of wanderlust following several fetch quests into the wild. Matoya allowed it to accompany you on your journey.
#. column 2: Indeed, there is no end to the<br>tasks that want for doing, ribbit.<br>    - Toro Roggo
#. column 3: Providence
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:181:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Poro Roggo minion. Enchanted familiar though it may be, kissing it will do nothing to alter its corporeal form."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Поро Рогго. Пусть он и зачарованный фамильяр, поцелуй не превратит его обратно в кого-то другого."

#. ja: 老賢者マトーヤが、トードに魔法をかけることで創り出した使い魔。50年以上に渡り忠実に働いてきたが、この程、広い世界を見て回りたいと主に願い出た。これをマトーヤが受け入れ、光の戦士とともに旅することになった
#. de: Matoya benutzt schon seit langer Zeit verzauberte Frösche als ihre Helferlein. Dieses Exemplar stand über fünfzig Jahre in ihrem Dienst, bevor es von der Wanderlust gepackt wurde. Die gutmütige Matoya gewährte diesem Poroggo die Freiheit, auf dass er die Welt erkunde.
#. fr: Créé par un sortilège de Matoya, ce petit batracien a gagné sa liberté après avoir travaillé pendant plus de cinquante années au service de l'érudite. Il est maintenant prêt à parcourir le monde aux côtés de quiconque le prendra sous son aile.
#. column 0: Summon your Poro Roggo minion. Enchanted familiar though it may be, kissing it will do nothing to alter its corporeal form.
#. column 2: Indeed, there is no end to the<br>tasks that want for doing, ribbit.<br>    - Toro Roggo
#. column 3: Providence
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:181:0:1"
msgid "A product of Matoya's mind-altering magicks, this particular familiar served the mistress for almost fifty summers before becoming struck with a sense of wanderlust following several fetch quests into the wild. Matoya allowed it to accompany you on your journey."
msgstr "Этого фамильяра создала Матойя своими чарами, меняющими разум. Почти пятьдесят лет он служил хозяйке, пока после нескольких поручений в дикой местности его не охватила жажда странствий. Матойя разрешила ему отправиться с тобой в путь."

#. ja: ケロケロ……
#. de: Sie hat mich aus dem Tümpel geholt und<br>mir einen Namen und Verstand gegeben.<br>Eine wirklich wundervolle Taaat, quaaak!<br><i>Toro Roggo</i>
#. fr: Crôa crôôôa...
#. column 0: Summon your Poro Roggo minion. Enchanted familiar though it may be, kissing it will do nothing to alter its corporeal form.
#. column 1: A product of Matoya's mind-altering magicks, this particular familiar served the mistress for almost fifty summers before becoming struck with a sense of wanderlust following several fetch quests into the wild. Matoya allowed it to accompany you on your journey.
#. column 3: Providence
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:181:0:2"
msgid "Indeed, there is no end to the<br>tasks that want for doing, ribbit.<br>    - Toro Roggo"
msgstr "Ква-ква... Дел невпроворот,<br>и конца им не видно.<br>    — Торо Рогго"

#. ja: 天乞い
#. de: Herzenswunsch
#. fr: Providence
#. column 0: Summon your Poro Roggo minion. Enchanted familiar though it may be, kissing it will do nothing to alter its corporeal form.
#. column 1: A product of Matoya's mind-altering magicks, this particular familiar served the mistress for almost fifty summers before becoming struck with a sense of wanderlust following several fetch quests into the wild. Matoya allowed it to accompany you on your journey.
#. column 2: Indeed, there is no end to the<br>tasks that want for doing, ribbit.<br>    - Toro Roggo
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:181:0:3"
msgid "Providence"
msgstr "Мольба к небесам"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et les projette en arrière.
#. column 0: Summon your Poro Roggo minion. Enchanted familiar though it may be, kissing it will do nothing to alter its corporeal form.
#. column 1: A product of Matoya's mind-altering magicks, this particular familiar served the mistress for almost fifty summers before becoming struck with a sense of wanderlust following several fetch quests into the wild. Matoya allowed it to accompany you on your journey.
#. column 2: Indeed, there is no end to the<br>tasks that want for doing, ribbit.<br>    - Toro Roggo
#. column 3: Providence
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:181:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 90 и отбрасывает их назад."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ギルバート」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。うわあ！
#. de: Du rufst Edward Chris von Muir als deinen Begleiter herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Edward miniature. Derrière son air timide, ce petit barde légendaire cache un cœur plein d'amour.
#. column 1: This colorfully outfitted automaton was crafted to resemble the legendary Edward Chris von Muir. The proud descendant of a peerless bard, it was said Edward's voice could unravel the very fabric of magic. The prince of a lost kingdom, he stood against darkness in the name of love.
#. column 2: You spoony bard!<br>    - Tellah
#. column 3: Bardsong
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:182:0:0"
msgid "Summon your spoony bard minion. Although there are many different accounts of what was actually said during the famous altercation, all agree on the single utterance that became his legacy. "
msgstr "Призвать миньона-сладкопевца. О том, что именно прозвучало в знаменитой перебранке, рассказывают по-разному, но все помнят единственную фразу, ставшую его наследием."

#. ja: 古の英雄「ギルバート」を模した魔法人形。特異な才を持つ吟遊詩人の末裔であり、その歌声には魔を退ける不可思議な力が宿っているという。亡国の王子でもあり、愛のために闇と戦い続けたと伝えられている
#. de: Edward war von königlicher Abstammung, doch nachdem er seine Geliebte Anna in einem brutalen Überfall verlor, zog er aus, um singend auf Abenteuer zu gehen.
#. fr: Un jeune barde introverti qui ne se sépare jamais de sa harpe et adore chanter pour les autres. Prince héritier d'un royaume dévasté, on raconte qu'il aurait combattu les forces du mal pour venger un amour perdu.
#. column 0: Summon your spoony bard minion. Although there are many different accounts of what was actually said during the famous altercation, all agree on the single utterance that became his legacy.
#. column 2: You spoony bard!<br>    - Tellah
#. column 3: Bardsong
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:182:0:1"
msgid "This colorfully outfitted automaton was crafted to resemble the legendary Edward Chris von Muir. The proud descendant of a peerless bard, it was said Edward's voice could unravel the very fabric of magic. The prince of a lost kingdom, he stood against darkness in the name of love."
msgstr "Этого ярко одетого автоматона создали по образу легендарного Эдварда Криса фон Мюира. Говорят, голос Эдварда, потомка непревзойдённого барда, мог разорвать саму ткань магии. Принц павшего королевства, он сражался с тьмой во имя любви."

#. ja: うわあ！
#. de: Du Schnösel von einem Barden!<br><i>Tellah</i>
#. fr: Pour Damcyan<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your spoony bard minion. Although there are many different accounts of what was actually said during the famous altercation, all agree on the single utterance that became his legacy.
#. column 1: This colorfully outfitted automaton was crafted to resemble the legendary Edward Chris von Muir. The proud descendant of a peerless bard, it was said Edward's voice could unravel the very fabric of magic. The prince of a lost kingdom, he stood against darkness in the name of love.
#. column 3: Bardsong
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:182:0:2"
msgid "You spoony bard!<br>    - Tellah"
msgstr "Ну и бард же ты!<br>    — Телла"

#. ja: うたう
#. de: Bardenlied
#. fr: Chanter
#. column 0: Summon your spoony bard minion. Although there are many different accounts of what was actually said during the famous altercation, all agree on the single utterance that became his legacy.
#. column 1: This colorfully outfitted automaton was crafted to resemble the legendary Edward Chris von Muir. The proud descendant of a peerless bard, it was said Edward's voice could unravel the very fabric of magic. The prince of a lost kingdom, he stood against darkness in the name of love.
#. column 2: You spoony bard!<br>    - Tellah
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:182:0:3"
msgid "Bardsong"
msgstr "Песнь барда"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のDEFを20上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
