#. ja: ミニオン「フェンリル・パップ」を呼び出す。<br>古代獣ホアハウンドの子狼。幼くも気高く猛々しい
#. de: Du rufst deinen Fenrir-Welpen als Begleiter herbei. Der wilde Höllenhund will nicht spielen, er will lernen, Beute zu reißen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé Fenrir, progéniture d'un loup polaire ancien. Malgré son jeune âge, il est déjà très fier et féroce.
#. column 1: Torn from his mother's teat immediately after birth and weaned on the manblood spilled daily in the Wolves' Den, this young hoarhound with soft blue fur was named after the spirit-beast of legend with hopes that he would grow to become as fierce and powerful.
#. column 2: Wolves. Swivin' wolves...<br>    - Hundred Eyes
#. column 3: Howling Moon
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:183:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Fenrir pup minion. This stray hoarhound pup is as feisty as the leader of his pack, and just as aloof. "
msgstr "Призвать щенка Фенрира. Этот бездомный щенок древнего волкодава так же задирист и нелюдим, как вожак стаи."

#. ja: 古代獣ホアハウンドの子狼。月光に似た冷たい青の毛並みを持つことから、伝説の幻獣、月狼「フェンリル」の名で呼ばれることも。狼どもが凌ぎを削る「ウルヴズジェイル」で育てられているため、幼くも気高く猛々しい
#. de: Dieser junge Höllenhund kennt kein anderes Zuhause als die blutigen Winkel der Wolfshöhle. Auch wenn seine Erscheinung noch nichts davon erahnen lässt, wird er sich bald zu einem ebenso brutalen wie effektiven Kampfbegleiter entwickeln, wie sein legendärer Namensvetter.
#. fr: Arraché à sa mère à la naissance et nourri du sang humain versé chaque jour dans l'Antre des loups, ce canidé a reçu son nom en raison de sa ressemblance avec une ancienne créature légendaire.
#. column 0: Summon your Fenrir pup minion. This stray hoarhound pup is as feisty as the leader of his pack, and just as aloof.
#. column 2: Wolves. Swivin' wolves...<br>    - Hundred Eyes
#. column 3: Howling Moon
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:183:0:1"
msgid "Torn from his mother's teat immediately after birth and weaned on the manblood spilled daily in the Wolves' Den, this young hoarhound with soft blue fur was named after the spirit-beast of legend with hopes that he would grow to become as fierce and powerful."
msgstr "Сразу после рождения этого молодого волкодава оторвали от матери и вскармливали человеческой кровью, ежедневно проливаемой в Волчьем логове. Надеясь, что щенок вырастет свирепым и могучим, ему дали имя легендарного зверя-духа. У него мягкая голубая шерсть."

#. ja: わおーん！
#. de: Na endlich! Wird ja verdammt noch mal auch Zeit, dass hier ein anständiger Wolf aufkreuzt!<br><i>Berkoeya</i>
#. fr: Grrrr<nbsp>!!!
#. column 0: Summon your Fenrir pup minion. This stray hoarhound pup is as feisty as the leader of his pack, and just as aloof.
#. column 1: Torn from his mother's teat immediately after birth and weaned on the manblood spilled daily in the Wolves' Den, this young hoarhound with soft blue fur was named after the spirit-beast of legend with hopes that he would grow to become as fierce and powerful.
#. column 3: Howling Moon
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:183:0:2"
msgid "Wolves. Swivin' wolves...<br>    - Hundred Eyes"
msgstr "Волки. Проклятые волки...<br>    — Сотня Глаз"

#. ja: ハウリングムーン
#. de: Wimmermond
#. fr: Lune hurlante
#. column 0: Summon your Fenrir pup minion. This stray hoarhound pup is as feisty as the leader of his pack, and just as aloof.
#. column 1: Torn from his mother's teat immediately after birth and weaned on the manblood spilled daily in the Wolves' Den, this young hoarhound with soft blue fur was named after the spirit-beast of legend with hopes that he would grow to become as fierce and powerful.
#. column 2: Wolves. Swivin' wolves...<br>    - Hundred Eyes
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:183:0:3"
msgid "Howling Moon"
msgstr "Воющая луна"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のATKを20上昇させる。味方がタイプ「モンスター」の場合は、ATKが40上昇する。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Erhöht die ATT von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe um 20, im Fall von Monstern um 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 20 l'attaque des alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou de 40 s'ils sont de type “Monstre”.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
