#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ドラゴネット」を呼び出す。<br>幼竜カル・ミークを模した魔法人形。ずっと友だちだよ！
#. de: Du rufst ein Drachenjunges herbei. Diese Puppe, für die der junge Drache Kal Myhk Modell stand, wird dir ein treuer Freund sein.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-dragonnet. Cette réplique d'un jeune dragon est plus petite que l'original... et aussi inoffensive.
#. column 1: After learning of Ishgardian artistry, the Moghome moogles' first endeavor was to create a wind-up automaton similar. A plucky dragonet named Kal Myhk volunteered to serve as the model, and even offered some of his scales to provide it a more lifelike texture.
#. column 2: Mother asks that I hunt,<br>but I have never dared<br>to hunt alone.<br>   - Kal Myhk
#. column 3: Dragon Puff
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:184:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up dragonet minion. For the adventurer who has always longed to be a mother of dragons."
msgstr "Призвать заводного дракончика. Для тех искателей приключений, кто всегда мечтал стать матерью драконов."

#. ja: 幼竜を模した魔法人形。モーグリ族の職人が、人の技術を学ぶ過程で造り上げたもの。弱冠30歳の若き竜、カル・ミークをモデルに、リアルな質感を再現するため、脱皮で剥がれ落ちた本物の鱗を利用して造り上げた
#. de: Mogry-Handwerker haben diese Puppe nicht nur äußerlich dem gerade einmal 30 Jahre jungen Drachen Kal Myhk nachempfunden, sondern dafür sogar echte Schuppen verwendet, die der Drache bei einer Häutung abgestreift hat.
#. fr: Ce pantin a été conçu à l'effigie de Kal Myhk par un apprenti artisan mog. Pour une première œuvre, le résultat est ex<shy>cep<shy>tion<shy>nellement fidèle à l'original, et pour cause<nbsp>: l'auteur aurait réutilisé des écailles d'une mue du dragonnet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up dragonet minion. For the adventurer who has always longed to be a mother of dragons.
#. column 2: Mother asks that I hunt,<br>but I have never dared<br>to hunt alone.<br>   - Kal Myhk
#. column 3: Dragon Puff
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:184:0:1"
msgid "After learning of Ishgardian artistry, the Moghome moogles' first endeavor was to create a wind-up automaton similar. A plucky dragonet named Kal Myhk volunteered to serve as the model, and even offered some of his scales to provide it a more lifelike texture."
msgstr "Узнав о мастерстве ишгардцев, муги из Могдома решили создать заводную куклу. Моделью вызвался стать отважный дракончик по имени Кал-Мик и даже отдал несколько чешуек, чтобы кукла выглядела как настоящая."

#. ja: コ、コウサンダァ～
#. de: Ein Meisterwerk der Mogry-Kunst, kupo!<br><i>Vorarbeiter Mogzin</i>
#. fr: J-je me rends, ayez pitié de moi<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up dragonet minion. For the adventurer who has always longed to be a mother of dragons.
#. column 1: After learning of Ishgardian artistry, the Moghome moogles' first endeavor was to create a wind-up automaton similar. A plucky dragonet named Kal Myhk volunteered to serve as the model, and even offered some of his scales to provide it a more lifelike texture.
#. column 3: Dragon Puff
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:184:0:2"
msgid "Mother asks that I hunt,<br>but I have never dared<br>to hunt alone.<br>   - Kal Myhk"
msgstr "Мама велит мне охотиться,<br>но я никогда не решался<br>охотиться в одиночку.<br>   — Кал Михк"

#. ja: ドラゴネットブレス
#. de: Jungdrachenatem
#. fr: Souffle de dragonnet
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up dragonet minion. For the adventurer who has always longed to be a mother of dragons.
#. column 1: After learning of Ishgardian artistry, the Moghome moogles' first endeavor was to create a wind-up automaton similar. A plucky dragonet named Kal Myhk volunteered to serve as the model, and even offered some of his scales to provide it a more lifelike texture.
#. column 2: Mother asks that I hunt,<br>but I have never dared<br>to hunt alone.<br>   - Kal Myhk
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:184:0:3"
msgid "Dragon Puff"
msgstr "Драконий пшик"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up dragonet minion. For the adventurer who has always longed to be a mother of dragons.
#. column 1: After learning of Ishgardian artistry, the Moghome moogles' first endeavor was to create a wind-up automaton similar. A plucky dragonet named Kal Myhk volunteered to serve as the model, and even offered some of his scales to provide it a more lifelike texture.
#. column 2: Mother asks that I hunt,<br>but I have never dared<br>to hunt alone.<br>   - Kal Myhk
#. column 3: Dragon Puff
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:184:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам поблизости урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ラムウ」を呼び出す。<br>雷神ラムウを模した魔法人形。これより裁きを下す……心せよ！
#. de: Du rufst einen Mini-Ramuh als Begleiter herbei. Mach dich darauf gefasst, vom Herrn der Blitze verurteilt zu werden!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petit Ramuh. À défaut d'être aussi sage que le Patriarche fulgurant, il a l'air très... électrique.
#. column 1: While Garuda-themed automata flew from the shelves of the Shaded Bower, the Weavers' Guild had already begun work on another local primal. Sylphs were interviewed regarding Ramuh's wizened visage, but none could agree on the length and fullness of his beard.
#. column 2: By the radiance of<br>eld be thee judged!<br>   - Ramuh
#. column 3: Judgment Sparkle
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:185:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Ramuh minion. He's silently judging you."
msgstr "Призывает заводного Рамуха. Он безмолвно тебя осуждает."

#. ja: 雷神ラムウを模した魔法人形。ガルーダの魔法人形が人気を博したことを受けて、ただちにラムウの設計も開始された。仮宿のシルフ族の証言を参考に作られたため、どことなく頭身がシルフ風味になっているようだ
#. de: Nachdem sich die Mini-Garuda großer Beliebtheit erfreut hat, wurden die Designer mit der Gestaltung einer Miniaturversion des Herrn der Blitze beauftragt. Um Informationen aus erster Hand zu erhalten, befragten sie die Sylphen, was dem Endprodukt durchaus anzusehen ist.
#. fr: Suite au franc succès qu'a connu le pantin à l'effigie de Garuda, il a été décidé d'en faire un inspiré par le Patriarche fulgurant. Les artisans s'étant basés sur les témoignages des Sylphes du Refuge pour le concevoir, sa tête rappelle étrangement la morphologie de ce peuple.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ramuh minion. He's silently judging you.
#. column 2: By the radiance of<br>eld be thee judged!<br>   - Ramuh
#. column 3: Judgment Sparkle
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:185:0:1"
msgid "While Garuda-themed automata flew from the shelves of the Shaded Bower, the Weavers' Guild had already begun work on another local primal. Sylphs were interviewed regarding Ramuh's wizened visage, but none could agree on the length and fullness of his beard."
msgstr "Пока куклы в образе Гаруды разлетались с полок Тенистой беседки, Гильдия ткачей уже принялась за другого местного праймала. Мастера расспросили сильфов о старческом лице Раму, но никто так и не смог договориться, насколько длинной и густой должна быть его борода."

#. ja: ウラ・メニダ トゥラ・オ
#. de: Erfahre mein Urteil!<br><i>Ramuh, Herr der Blitze</i>
#. fr: Ula menida tula oh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ramuh minion. He's silently judging you.
#. column 1: While Garuda-themed automata flew from the shelves of the Shaded Bower, the Weavers' Guild had already begun work on another local primal. Sylphs were interviewed regarding Ramuh's wizened visage, but none could agree on the length and fullness of his beard.
#. column 3: Judgment Sparkle
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:185:0:2"
msgid "By the radiance of<br>eld be thee judged!<br>   - Ramuh"
msgstr "Сияньем древним<br>тебе приговор!<br>   — Рамух"

#. ja: さばきのいかずち
#. de: Ionenschlag
#. fr: Mini-éclair du jugement
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ramuh minion. He's silently judging you.
#. column 1: While Garuda-themed automata flew from the shelves of the Shaded Bower, the Weavers' Guild had already begun work on another local primal. Sylphs were interviewed regarding Ramuh's wizened visage, but none could agree on the length and fullness of his beard.
#. column 2: By the radiance of<br>eld be thee judged!<br>   - Ramuh
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:185:0:3"
msgid "Judgment Sparkle"
msgstr "Искра правосудия"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ramuh minion. He's silently judging you.
#. column 1: While Garuda-themed automata flew from the shelves of the Shaded Bower, the Weavers' Guild had already begun work on another local primal. Sylphs were interviewed regarding Ramuh's wizened visage, but none could agree on the length and fullness of his beard.
#. column 2: By the radiance of<br>eld be thee judged!<br>   - Ramuh
#. column 3: Judgment Sparkle
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:185:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам поблизости урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・シヴァ」を呼び出す。<br>氷神シヴァを模した魔法人形。砕け散れ！　ダイアモンドダスト！
#. de: Du rufst eine Mini-Shiva herbei. Ihr eisiger Blick lässt das Blut in den Adern gefrieren!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petite Shiva. Elle ne ramènera peut-être pas la paix entre les humains et les dragons, mais elle sait refroidir les ardeurs.
#. column 1: When followers of Iceheart heard the Weavers' Guild was creating clockwork effigies, they made the long trek from Ishgard to commission one in the likeness of Saint Shiva. However, the final product was so endearing, they puzzled over whether to pay it solemn tribute or cuddle it.
#. column 2: Is it I who am elated...<br>or Saint Shiva?<br>   - Ysayle
#. column 3: Diamond Speck
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:186:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Shiva minion. Renounce the hatreds that consume you, and she will scatter them like sawdust into the wind."
msgstr "Призывает заводную Шиву. Отринь ненависть, что снедает тебя, — и она развеет её, словно опилки на ветру."

#. ja: 氷神シヴァを模した魔法人形。各都市にて蛮神を模した魔法人形が製造されていると知った異端者たちが、それならば我らもと意気込んで作り、製法を公開。信仰心の成せる技なのか、物凄く愛らしい表情をしている
#. de: Als sie von den Miniaturversionen der verschiedenen Primae erfuhren, beschlossen die Häretiker in Ishgard, ein Abbild ihrer Göttin Shiva anzufertigen. Mit bedingungsloser Hingabe haben sie ein Werk geschaffen, dass der Herrin des Eises zu großer Ehre gereicht.
#. fr: Ishgard ne pouvait pas échapper à la récente mode des pantins à l'effigie des Primordiaux. C'est ainsi qu'a été créé celui qui représente Shiva, la Furie des neiges, et force est de constater qu'il est tout aussi réussi que les autres.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Shiva minion. Renounce the hatreds that consume you, and she will scatter them like sawdust into the wind.
#. column 2: Is it I who am elated...<br>or Saint Shiva?<br>   - Ysayle
#. column 3: Diamond Speck
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:186:0:1"
msgid "When followers of Iceheart heard the Weavers' Guild was creating clockwork effigies, they made the long trek from Ishgard to commission one in the likeness of Saint Shiva. However, the final product was so endearing, they puzzled over whether to pay it solemn tribute or cuddle it."
msgstr "Услышав, что Гильдия ткачей создаёт заводные изображения первобытных, последователи Ледяного Сердца проделали долгий путь из Ишгарда, чтобы заказать фигурку святой Шивы. Но вышла она такой очаровательной, что заказчики никак не могли решить: воздать ей торжественные почести или потискать."

#. ja: オブリビオン！
#. de: Zerbersten sollt ihr! Alle!<br><i>Shiva, Herrin des Eises</i>
#. fr: HA HA HA HA<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Shiva minion. Renounce the hatreds that consume you, and she will scatter them like sawdust into the wind.
#. column 1: When followers of Iceheart heard the Weavers' Guild was creating clockwork effigies, they made the long trek from Ishgard to commission one in the likeness of Saint Shiva. However, the final product was so endearing, they puzzled over whether to pay it solemn tribute or cuddle it.
#. column 3: Diamond Speck
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:186:0:2"
msgid "Is it I who am elated...<br>or Saint Shiva?<br>   - Ysayle"
msgstr "То ли я так счастлива...<br>то ли святая Шива?<br>   — Изейль"

#. ja: だいあもんどだすと
#. de: Diamantenstaub
#. fr: Poupoussière de diamant
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Shiva minion. Renounce the hatreds that consume you, and she will scatter them like sawdust into the wind.
#. column 1: When followers of Iceheart heard the Weavers' Guild was creating clockwork effigies, they made the long trek from Ishgard to commission one in the likeness of Saint Shiva. However, the final product was so endearing, they puzzled over whether to pay it solemn tribute or cuddle it.
#. column 2: Is it I who am elated...<br>or Saint Shiva?<br>   - Ysayle
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:186:0:3"
msgid "Diamond Speck"
msgstr "Алмазная пыль"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵を移動不可にする。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>5秒
#. de: Macht Gegner in der Nähe be<shy>we<shy>gungs<shy>un<shy>fäh<shy>ig.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5 Sekunden
#. fr: Immobilise les ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Shiva minion. Renounce the hatreds that consume you, and she will scatter them like sawdust into the wind.
#. column 1: When followers of Iceheart heard the Weavers' Guild was creating clockwork effigies, they made the long trek from Ishgard to commission one in the likeness of Saint Shiva. However, the final product was so endearing, they puzzled over whether to pay it solemn tribute or cuddle it.
#. column 2: Is it I who am elated...<br>or Saint Shiva?<br>   - Ysayle
