#. ja: ミニオン「ポーキー」を呼び出す。<br>二本脚で歩く謎のブタ。ぷ～っ
#. de: Du rufst ein Ferkelchen herbei, das auf zwei Beinen läuft und dadurch großes Erstaunen hervorruft.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte porcelet promeneur. Cet étrange petit cochon aime se balader ici et là sur ses deux pattes arrières.
#. column 1: A mysterious bipedal swine given away as a prize after it was discovered gorging itself in the Manderville Gold Saucer kitchens. Assuming he is not a real pig, many have tried poking, unmasking, and dispelling the portly pork's guise...but to no avail.
#. column 2: The sultana's pigs've<br>come to wallow!<br>   - Gisfrid the Grinder
#. column 3: Oink
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:187:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Piggy minion. Many have tried casting Esuna on what they thought was a struggling adventurer, only to find they had wasted their magic."
msgstr "Призывает поросёнка. Многие пытались снять заклинанием Эсуна то, что принимали за страдающего приключенца, — и лишь зря тратили магию."

#. ja: 二本脚で歩く謎のブタ。マンダヴィル・ゴールドソーサー内のカフェテリアで、無銭飲食をしたため、捕縛され景品にされることになった。だがしかし、このブタが何者で、どこから来たのかを知る者はいない……
#. de: Ein Ferkelchen, das auf zwei Beinen läuft, mit einer mysteriösen Ver<shy>gangen<shy>heit. Es wurde im Gold Saucer verhaftet, als es dort versuchte, nach einem üppigen Mahl die Zeche zu prellen. Doch niemand weiß, woher es stammt oder was es vorhat.
#. fr: Ce petit cochon a été attrapé à la cafétéria du Gold Saucer alors qu'il essayait de manger sans payer. Il a alors été décidé d'en faire un prix pour les clients... N'empêche que l'on ignore toujours d'où il vient et comment il est arrivé au parc d'attraction.
#. column 0: Summon your Piggy minion. Many have tried casting Esuna on what they thought was a struggling adventurer, only to find they had wasted their magic.
#. column 2: The sultana's pigs've<br>come to wallow!<br>   - Gisfrid the Grinder
#. column 3: Oink
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:187:0:1"
msgid "A mysterious bipedal swine given away as a prize after it was discovered gorging itself in the Manderville Gold Saucer kitchens. Assuming he is not a real pig, many have tried poking, unmasking, and dispelling the portly pork's guise...but to no avail."
msgstr "Загадочная двуногая свинья, которую отдали в качестве приза после того, как её застали за обжорством на кухне «Золотого блюдца» Мандервилей. Решив, что перед ними не настоящая свинья, многие пытались потыкать толстого хряка, сорвать с него маску и развеять его обличье... Без толку."

#. ja: ぷ～っ
#. de: Haltet das Ferkelchen!<br>Es hat sein Essen nicht bezahlt!<br><i>Wirt im Gold Saucer</i>
#. fr: Grouik grouik<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Piggy minion. Many have tried casting Esuna on what they thought was a struggling adventurer, only to find they had wasted their magic.
#. column 1: A mysterious bipedal swine given away as a prize after it was discovered gorging itself in the Manderville Gold Saucer kitchens. Assuming he is not a real pig, many have tried poking, unmasking, and dispelling the portly pork's guise...but to no avail.
#. column 3: Oink
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:187:0:2"
msgid "The sultana's pigs've<br>come to wallow!<br>   - Gisfrid the Grinder"
msgstr "Свиньи султаны<br>пришли валяться в грязи!<br>   — Гисфрид Мясник"

#. ja: ぷ～っ
#. de: Quieken
#. fr: Grouik
#. column 0: Summon your Piggy minion. Many have tried casting Esuna on what they thought was a struggling adventurer, only to find they had wasted their magic.
#. column 1: A mysterious bipedal swine given away as a prize after it was discovered gorging itself in the Manderville Gold Saucer kitchens. Assuming he is not a real pig, many have tried poking, unmasking, and dispelling the portly pork's guise...but to no avail.
#. column 2: The sultana's pigs've<br>come to wallow!<br>   - Gisfrid the Grinder
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:187:0:3"
msgid "Oink"
msgstr "Хрю"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方にかかっている、弱体効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle negativen Effekte von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe toutes les altérations d'état des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Piggy minion. Many have tried casting Esuna on what they thought was a struggling adventurer, only to find they had wasted their magic.
#. column 1: A mysterious bipedal swine given away as a prize after it was discovered gorging itself in the Manderville Gold Saucer kitchens. Assuming he is not a real pig, many have tried poking, unmasking, and dispelling the portly pork's guise...but to no avail.
#. column 2: The sultana's pigs've<br>come to wallow!<br>   - Gisfrid the Grinder
#. column 3: Oink
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:187:0:4"
msgid "Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все негативные эффекты со всех союзников поблизости."

#. ja: ミニオン「マジックバケツ」を呼び出す。<br>魔法人形の技術で造られた動くバケツ
#. de: Du rufst einen magischen Eimer herbei, der dank neuester Marionettentechnik laufen kann.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte seau d'eau magique. Il aurait été idéal pour nettoyer les parquets de paire avec un balai... si un petit poisson rouge n'y avait pas élu domicile.
#. column 1: This curiosity is said to have once belonged to an angler who wanted a bottomless pail that would shadow him hither and yon. Upon releasing a live Nepto Dragon into the markets, he had a change of heart and tossed the bucket back brinewards, never looking back.
#. column 2: Throw back a guppy today,<br>and reel in ten fish tomorrow.<br>   - N'nmulika
#. column 3: Slippery Floor
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:188:0:0"
msgid "Summon your magic bucket minion. A fisherman's best friend. He sloshes instead of slobbers."
msgstr "Призывает волшебное ведро. Лучший друг рыбака. Оно плещется, а не пускает слюни."

#. ja: 魔法人形の技術で造られた動くバケツ。とある漁師が、釣果を持ち帰るのが面倒だという理由で開発した。何度空っぽにしても、いつの間にか水と生き物を溜め込んでしまう。いったいどこから仕入れてきているのだろうか
#. de: Ein Fischer war es leid, seinen schweren Fang immer nach Hause tragen zu müssen. Also wurde kurzer-<br>hand ein laufender Eimer entwickelt. Ein Rätsel bleibt, woher das Wasser und die Fische darin kommen, denn selbst wenn man den Eimer leert, ist er kurz darauf wieder voll.
#. fr: Ce seau a été créé magiquement pour un pêcheur paresseux. Préférant passer son temps à autre chose qu'à attraper des poissons, celui-ci a eu l'idée de ce récipient qui se remplirait tout seul d'eau et de créatures aquatiques. Personne ne sait d'où elles proviennent.
#. column 0: Summon your magic bucket minion. A fisherman's best friend. He sloshes instead of slobbers.
#. column 2: Throw back a guppy today,<br>and reel in ten fish tomorrow.<br>   - N'nmulika
#. column 3: Slippery Floor
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:188:0:1"
msgid "This curiosity is said to have once belonged to an angler who wanted a bottomless pail that would shadow him hither and yon. Upon releasing a live Nepto Dragon into the markets, he had a change of heart and tossed the bucket back brinewards, never looking back."
msgstr "Говорят, когда-то это диковинное ведро принадлежало рыбаку, мечтавшему о бездонном ведре, которое всюду ходило бы за ним следом. Но стоило ему выпустить на рынок живого дракона Непто, как он передумал и забросил ведро обратно в море. И больше не оглядывался."

#. ja: ジャバジャバ
#. de: Endlich mal eine praktische Erfindung!<br><i>Fischer</i>
#. fr: Plouf plouf plouf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your magic bucket minion. A fisherman's best friend. He sloshes instead of slobbers.
#. column 1: This curiosity is said to have once belonged to an angler who wanted a bottomless pail that would shadow him hither and yon. Upon releasing a live Nepto Dragon into the markets, he had a change of heart and tossed the bucket back brinewards, never looking back.
#. column 3: Slippery Floor
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:188:0:2"
msgid "Throw back a guppy today,<br>and reel in ten fish tomorrow.<br>   - N'nmulika"
msgstr "Отпусти малька сегодня,<br>а завтра выловишь десять рыб.<br>   — Н'нмулика"

#. ja: バケツリレー
#. de: Eimerkette
#. fr: Passage de seau
