#. ja: ミニオン「ゲソ」を呼び出す。<br>冒険者にぶった切られたクラーケンの触手の切れ端
#. de: Du rufst ein Tentakel herbei, das dem Aquadon abgeschlagen wurde.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte tentacule minuscule. Il est tout ce qu'il reste du légendaire Kraken, et il semble bien décidé à vous suivre partout. Peut-être compte-il un jour dominer le monde...
#. column 1: Academics visiting Hullbreaker Isle determined, upon discovery of this strange creature, this tiny tentacle is a regenerating arm of a slain kraken. Unlike the hostile body from which it was severed, it bears you no ill will. Rather, this appendage seems to have taken a liking to you...
#. column 2: RELEASE THE KRAKEN!<br>   - Captain Madison
#. column 3: Jet Spray
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:189:0:0"
msgid "Summon your calamari minion. (Or is it a trap!?)"
msgstr "Призывает кальмара. (Или это ловушка?!)"

#. ja: 冒険者にぶった切られたクラーケンの触手の切れ端。海を漂った末に、ふたたびハルブレーカー・アイルに戻ってきた。復讐に燃える本体とは異なり、切れ端の方に戦意はないらしい。それよりも自由な人生を謳歌しているようだ
#. de: Nachdem Abenteurer auf der Schiffbrecher-Insel dem Aquadon ein Tentakel abgeschlagen hatten, flog dieses ins Meer, kroch kurze Zeit später aber wieder an Land. Während der Aquadon auf Rache aus ist, scheint das Tentakel friedlich zu sein.
#. fr: Ce bout de tentacule ridiculement minuscule provient du légendaire monstre marin, le Kraken. Il aurait longtemps dérivé en mer avant de retourner sur l'Île de Crèvecarène. Bien qu'inoffensif, il garde un peu de l'agressivité de la créature d'origine.
#. column 0: Summon your calamari minion. (Or is it a trap!?)
#. column 2: RELEASE THE KRAKEN!<br>   - Captain Madison
#. column 3: Jet Spray
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:189:0:1"
msgid "Academics visiting Hullbreaker Isle determined, upon discovery of this strange creature, this tiny tentacle is a regenerating arm of a slain kraken. Unlike the hostile body from which it was severed, it bears you no ill will. Rather, this appendage seems to have taken a liking to you..."
msgstr "Учёные, посетившие остров Халбрейкер, обнаружили это странное создание и выяснили: крошечное щупальце — отрастающая конечность убитого кракена. В отличие от свирепого чудовища, от которого его отрубили, оно не таит на тебя зла. Скорее, оно, похоже, к тебе привязалось..."

#. ja: ゲッソー！
#. de: Mh, sieht das lecker aus!<br><i>Domaner</i>
#. fr: Chplouc chplouc<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your calamari minion. (Or is it a trap!?)
#. column 1: Academics visiting Hullbreaker Isle determined, upon discovery of this strange creature, this tiny tentacle is a regenerating arm of a slain kraken. Unlike the hostile body from which it was severed, it bears you no ill will. Rather, this appendage seems to have taken a liking to you...
#. column 3: Jet Spray
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:189:0:2"
msgid "RELEASE THE KRAKEN!<br>   - Captain Madison"
msgstr "Выпустить кракена!<br>   — Капитан Мэдисон"

#. ja: スプラッシュシューター
#. de: Spritzwasser
#. fr: Tir éclaboussant
#. column 0: Summon your calamari minion. (Or is it a trap!?)
#. column 1: Academics visiting Hullbreaker Isle determined, upon discovery of this strange creature, this tiny tentacle is a regenerating arm of a slain kraken. Unlike the hostile body from which it was severed, it bears you no ill will. Rather, this appendage seems to have taken a liking to you...
#. column 2: RELEASE THE KRAKEN!<br>   - Captain Madison
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:189:0:3"
msgid "Jet Spray"
msgstr "Водяной залп"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et les projette en arrière.
#. column 0: Summon your calamari minion. (Or is it a trap!?)
#. column 1: Academics visiting Hullbreaker Isle determined, upon discovery of this strange creature, this tiny tentacle is a regenerating arm of a slain kraken. Unlike the hostile body from which it was severed, it bears you no ill will. Rather, this appendage seems to have taken a liking to you...
#. column 2: RELEASE THE KRAKEN!<br>   - Captain Madison
#. column 3: Jet Spray
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:189:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам поблизости урон силой 90 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ブラキオ」を呼び出す。<br>ブラキオレイドスを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst ein Brachiosaurus-Baby herbei, das zum Glück keine Windel benötigt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé brachiosaure. À part la taille, il n'a rien à envier à son homologue du Diadème.
#. column 1: This adorable automaton was cobbled together by a sky pirate (who had once apprenticed as a goldsmith) after claiming to have spotted one of the mythical creatures from the deck of his crew's airship on a journey deep into the Diadem.
#. column 2: Don't be a baby!<br>Get a grip!<br>   - Sisipu
#. column 3: Starstorm
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:190:0:0"
msgid "Summon your baby brachiosaur minion."
msgstr "Призывает детёныша брахиозавра."

#. ja: ブラキオレイドスを模した魔法人形。とある空賊が、ディアデム諸島で目撃された超大型の古代生物を模して造り上げた。それにしても、なぜこのような巨大生物が浮島に存在したのか……謎が謎を呼んでいる
#. de: Diese Miniatur ist einem riesigen, uralten Lebewesen nachempfunden, das ein Luftpirat beim Diadem beobachtet haben will. Da stellt sich die Frage, warum dort oben so ein Wesen existieren sollte?
#. fr: Cette mascotte a été créée à l'effigie du légendaire animal préhistorique qui aurait été aperçu sur les îles du Diadème par plusieurs pirates des cieux. Comment une créature de cette taille a-t-elle pu se hisser sur ces îles flottantes<nbsp>? Le mystère reste entier.
#. column 0: Summon your baby brachiosaur minion.
#. column 2: Don't be a baby!<br>Get a grip!<br>   - Sisipu
#. column 3: Starstorm
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:190:0:1"
msgid "This adorable automaton was cobbled together by a sky pirate (who had once apprenticed as a goldsmith) after claiming to have spotted one of the mythical creatures from the deck of his crew's airship on a journey deep into the Diadem."
msgstr "Этот очаровательный автоматон собрал один небесный пират, когда-то учившийся на ювелира. Он уверял, что увидел одно из мифических созданий с борта дирижабля своей команды во время путешествия в глубины Диадема."

#. ja: メテオ！
#. de: Salamander-Öl?<br>Soll ich dir deinen runden Babypopo damit einreiben, wie früher?<br><i>Julyan</i>
#. fr: Météore<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your baby brachiosaur minion.
#. column 1: This adorable automaton was cobbled together by a sky pirate (who had once apprenticed as a goldsmith) after claiming to have spotted one of the mythical creatures from the deck of his crew's airship on a journey deep into the Diadem.
#. column 3: Starstorm
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:190:0:2"
msgid "Don't be a baby!<br>Get a grip!<br>   - Sisipu"
msgstr "Не будь размазнёй!<br>Возьми себя в руки!<br>   — Сисипу"

#. ja: プチメテオ
#. de: Sternensturm
#. fr: Petit météore
#. column 0: Summon your baby brachiosaur minion.
#. column 1: This adorable automaton was cobbled together by a sky pirate (who had once apprenticed as a goldsmith) after claiming to have spotted one of the mythical creatures from the deck of his crew's airship on a journey deep into the Diadem.
#. column 2: Don't be a baby!<br>Get a grip!<br>   - Sisipu
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:190:0:3"
msgid "Starstorm"
msgstr "Звёздный шторм"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、タイプ「ドール」を弱点に加える。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>15秒
#. de: Fügt Gegnern in der Nähe eine Schwäche gegen Puppen zu.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 Sekunden
#. fr: Ajoute le type “Poupée” aux points faibles des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. column 0: Summon your baby brachiosaur minion.
#. column 1: This adorable automaton was cobbled together by a sky pirate (who had once apprenticed as a goldsmith) after claiming to have spotted one of the mythical creatures from the deck of his crew's airship on a journey deep into the Diadem.
#. column 2: Don't be a baby!<br>Get a grip!<br>   - Sisipu
#. column 3: Starstorm
