msgstr "Накладывает на всех противников поблизости слабость к <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>куклам</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・チアガール」を呼び出す。<br>チアガール風の魔法人形。とにかく応援してくれる
#. de: Du rufst eine Aufzieh-Cheerleaderin herbei, die dich stets gut gelaunt auf deinen anstrengenden Abenteuern anfeuert.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte marionnette majorette. Elle semble avoir beaucoup d'admiration pour vous. Ses encouragements vous porteront peut-être chance à l'Antre des loups...
#. column 1: Commissioned by officers stationed in the Wolves' Den, the cheerleader was designed to enkindle the spirits of the arena's competitors. Some have noticed, however, that if a match begins to stagnate, her chants devolve from little lady cheers into Lominsan sailor jeers.
#. column 2: Oh, do cheer up. Better to die<br>once than live ever in shame.<br>   - Hunt Billmaster
#. column 3: Rallying Cheer
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:191:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up cheerleader minion. Oh, I think that you've found yourself a cheerleader."
msgstr "Призывает заводную чирлидершу. Ой, кажется, у тебя появилась своя болельщица."

#. ja: チアガール風の魔法人形。ウルヴズジェイルで熱戦を繰り広げる、すべての狼たちを応援するために作られた。しかし、試合が停滞しはじめると、とたんにデンジャーな目付きになり、口汚いヤジを飛ばすとか飛ばさないとか
#. de: Die kleine Cheerleaderin wurde geschaffen, um die Kämpfer in der Wolfshöhle anzufeuern. Doch wehe, wenn die Kämpfe unterbrochen werden. Dann guckt die Cheerleaderin ganz böse und fängt an zu fluchen.
#. fr: Cette jolie petite marionnette a été créée pour encourager les combattants de l'Antre des loups à donner le meilleur d'eux-mêmes. Elle aurait toutefois tendance à devenir odieuse si personne ne mord la poussière pendant un certain temps...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up cheerleader minion. Oh, I think that you've found yourself a cheerleader.
#. column 2: Oh, do cheer up. Better to die<br>once than live ever in shame.<br>   - Hunt Billmaster
#. column 3: Rallying Cheer
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:191:0:1"
msgid "Commissioned by officers stationed in the Wolves' Den, the cheerleader was designed to enkindle the spirits of the arena's competitors. Some have noticed, however, that if a match begins to stagnate, her chants devolve from little lady cheers into Lominsan sailor jeers."
msgstr "Офицеры Волчьей заставы заказали чирлидершу, чтобы раззадорить бойцов на арене. Правда, некоторые заметили: стоит поединку затянуться, как вместо милых кричалок она начинает орать ругань, достойную лимсийского матроса."

#. ja: ガンバッテ！
#. de: Ja, weiter so, du schaffst es!<br><i>Cheerleaderin</i>
#. fr: Courage<nbsp>! Battez-vous<nbsp>!<nbsp>... Entre-tuez-vous<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up cheerleader minion. Oh, I think that you've found yourself a cheerleader.
#. column 1: Commissioned by officers stationed in the Wolves' Den, the cheerleader was designed to enkindle the spirits of the arena's competitors. Some have noticed, however, that if a match begins to stagnate, her chants devolve from little lady cheers into Lominsan sailor jeers.
#. column 3: Rallying Cheer
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
