#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・クルル」を呼び出す。<br>クルルを模した魔法人形。ごめんなさい。お待たせしてしまったみたいね
#. de: Du rufst deine Krile-Puppe herbei, die dich mit Sharlayaner Weisheit und ihrer eigenen Heiterkeit bedenken wird.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Krile miniature. Elle semble receler autant de sagesse sharlayanaise que la vraie<nbsp>!
#. column 1: This clockwork contraption has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. The enormous feline ears attached to her hood are thought to represent Krile's ability to hear the whispers of the soul.
#. column 2: Would you care to<br>attempt a more<br>dextrous deflection?<br>   - Krile
#. column 3: Rejoinder
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:192:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Krile minion. She is terribly, terribly sorry to have kept you waiting."
msgstr "Призывает заводную Крилю. Она ужасно, ужасно извиняется за то, что заставила тебя ждать."

#. ja: 冒険者ギルドが、エオルゼアの新生を祝して用意した魔法人形。シャーレアン出身の魔道士、クルル嬢を模している。ちなみに、フードに付けられたミコッテ族のような大きな耳は、彼女が持つある「力」を示すものらしい
#. de: Dieser Uhrwerk-Automat wurde auf Geheiß der Aben<shy>teurer<shy>gilde für die jährliche Feier der Wiedergeburt Eorzeas angefertigt. Die großen Miqo'te-Ohren an ihrer Kapuze stehen für ihre angebliche Fähigkeit, das Flüstern der Seele zu hören.
#. fr: Cette poupée magique créée par la guilde des aventuriers pour célébrer la renaissance d'Éorzéa s'inspire de la jeune élève et petite fille de Baldesion. Les oreilles du bonnet seraient un symbole du pouvoir spécial de la vraie Krile.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Krile minion. She is terribly, terribly sorry to have kept you waiting.
#. column 2: Would you care to<br>attempt a more<br>dextrous deflection?<br>   - Krile
#. column 3: Rejoinder
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:192:0:1"
msgid "This clockwork contraption has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. The enormous feline ears attached to her hood are thought to represent Krile's ability to hear the whispers of the soul."
msgstr "Этот часовой автоматон изготовлен по заказу Гильдии искателей приключений к Возрождению — ежегодному празднику обновления Эорзеи. Огромные кошачьи уши на капюшоне должны символизировать способность Крили слышать шёпот души."

#. ja: イイノカナ～？
#. de: Ich teile deine Hoffnung, aber bedenke auch die Gefahren.<br><i>Krile</i>
#. fr: Un peu de respect pour ton aînée<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Krile minion. She is terribly, terribly sorry to have kept you waiting.
#. column 1: This clockwork contraption has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. The enormous feline ears attached to her hood are thought to represent Krile's ability to hear the whispers of the soul.
#. column 3: Rejoinder
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:192:0:2"
msgid "Would you care to<br>attempt a more<br>dextrous deflection?<br>   - Krile"
msgstr "Не хотите<br>попробовать<br>отразить удар ловчее?<br>   — Крилия"

#. ja: 隣のお姉さん
#. de: Mädchen von nebenan
#. fr: Sagesse de l'aînée
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Krile minion. She is terribly, terribly sorry to have kept you waiting.
#. column 1: This clockwork contraption has been crafted at the behest of the Adventurers' Guild in celebration of the Rising, Eorzea's annual celebration of rebirth. The enormous feline ears attached to her hood are thought to represent Krile's ability to hear the whispers of the soul.
