#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・アイメリク」を呼び出す。<br>アイメリク卿を模した魔法人形。何故なのです、父上ッ！
#. de: Du rufst eine Aymeric-Puppe herbei. Der Großmeister der Tempelritter wird sich freuen, die weite Welt außerhalb Ishgards an deiner Seite zu erkunden.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Aymeric miniature. Il en impose tellement qu'il pourrait sûrement commander toute une troupe de templiers... miniatures, bien sûr<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Noting the popularity of other clockwork leaders, the Temple Knights attempted to make one of their own beloved commander. The face was so far-removed from the true Aymeric's handsome mien, however, that one of the knights' wives volunteered to sew a new one from scratch.
#. column 2: A divided Ishgard<br>will not survive.<br>   - Aymeric
#. column 3: True Blue
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:193:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Aymeric minion. His many obligations prevent him from accompanying you on your journeys, but hopefully this dutiful substitute will suffice."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — заводного Аймерика. У него слишком много дел, чтобы сопровождать тебя в путешествиях, но будем надеяться, что эта старательная кукла его заменит."

#. ja: アイメリク卿を模した魔法人形。とある神殿騎士コマンドが、敬愛する上官を模して魔法人形を作ろうとしたものの、あまりに不器用すぎて失敗。その姿が不憫すぎたため、教皇庁お抱えの技師がこっそり造り直したものらしい
#. de: Zuerst hatten die Tempelritter selbst versucht, eine Miniatur ihres verehrten Großmeisters Aymeric anzufertigen, doch der Versuch scheiterte kläglich. Aus Mitleid fertigte daraufhin ein Techniker der Maschinistengilde dieses naturgetreue Abbild.
#. fr: Ce pantin de sire Aymeric a d'abord été conçu par un officier des templiers pour lui rendre hommage, mais le résultat était si mauvais qu'un artisan du Saint-Siège a dû le retravailler com<shy>plè<shy>te<shy>ment... pour le plus grand plaisir des fans du courageux capitaine général.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Aymeric minion. His many obligations prevent him from accompanying you on your journeys, but hopefully this dutiful substitute will suffice.
#. column 2: A divided Ishgard<br>will not survive.<br>   - Aymeric
#. column 3: True Blue
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:193:0:1"
msgid "Noting the popularity of other clockwork leaders, the Temple Knights attempted to make one of their own beloved commander. The face was so far-removed from the true Aymeric's handsome mien, however, that one of the knights' wives volunteered to sew a new one from scratch."
msgstr "Заметив популярность других заводных лидеров, храмовники решили создать фигурку своего любимого командира. Но лицо получилось так непохоже на красавца Аймерика, что жена одного из рыцарей вызвалась сшить новое с нуля."

#. ja: 変革ヲッ！
#. de: Wieso, Vater? Wieso tust du das?<br><i>Großmeister Aymeric</i>
#. fr: Pour Ishgard<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Aymeric minion. His many obligations prevent him from accompanying you on your journeys, but hopefully this dutiful substitute will suffice.
#. column 1: Noting the popularity of other clockwork leaders, the Temple Knights attempted to make one of their own beloved commander. The face was so far-removed from the true Aymeric's handsome mien, however, that one of the knights' wives volunteered to sew a new one from scratch.
#. column 3: True Blue
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:193:0:2"
msgid "A divided Ishgard<br>will not survive.<br>   - Aymeric"
msgstr "Разделённый Ишгард<br>не выстоит.<br>   — Эймерик"

#. ja: 神殿騎士団突撃
#. de: Tempelritter-Sturmangriff
#. fr: Charge templière<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Aymeric minion. His many obligations prevent him from accompanying you on your journeys, but hopefully this dutiful substitute will suffice.
#. column 1: Noting the popularity of other clockwork leaders, the Temple Knights attempted to make one of their own beloved commander. The face was so far-removed from the true Aymeric's handsome mien, however, that one of the knights' wives volunteered to sew a new one from scratch.
#. column 2: A divided Ishgard<br>will not survive.<br>   - Aymeric
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:193:0:3"
msgid "True Blue "
msgstr "Натиск храмовников"

#. ja: 敵軍のシールドに70%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt einem gegnerischen Schild 70 % Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls er schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 70% de sa solidité au bouclier ennemi. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Aymeric minion. His many obligations prevent him from accompanying you on your journeys, but hopefully this dutiful substitute will suffice.
#. column 1: Noting the popularity of other clockwork leaders, the Temple Knights attempted to make one of their own beloved commander. The face was so far-removed from the true Aymeric's handsome mien, however, that one of the knights' wives volunteered to sew a new one from scratch.
#. column 2: A divided Ishgard<br>will not survive.<br>   - Aymeric
#. column 3: True Blue
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:193:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable."
msgstr "Уменьшает прочность щита противника на 70%. Не действует, если щит уже разрушен."

#. ja: ミニオン「ペガサスコルト」を呼び出す。<br>ペガサスの幼獣。最近、空を走れるようになった
#. de: Du rufst ein Pegasus-Fohlen herbei. Leider verschießt es aus keiner seiner Körperöffnungen Regenbögen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poulain pégase. Petit du légendaire cheval ailé, il vient tout juste d'apprendre à voler.
#. column 1: Having lost his mother, this winged steed from the Diadem has settled upon a decidedly wingless bipedal surrogate to lead him somewhere over the rainbow.
#. column 2: I still don't understand<br>why a horn is so important<br>to you.<br>   - Ohl Deeh
#. column 3: Tail 'n Mane
#. column 4: Increases speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:194:0:0"
msgid "Summon your pegasus colt minion. Unfortunately does not emit rainbows from any of its orifices."
msgstr "Призывает жеребёнка-пегаса. К сожалению, ни из одного его отверстия не бьёт радуга."

#. ja: ペガサスの幼獣。親馬からはぐれてしまったらしく、恐ろしい古代獣がひしめくディアデム諸島を逃げ回っていた。冒険者によって古代獣から救われたことで、いつの間にかその後ろに付いてくるようになっていた
#. de: Seit dieses Fohlen von seiner Mutter getrennt wurde, musste es auf dem Diadem, auf dem es von ur-<br>zeitlichen Bestien nur so wimmelt, um sein Leben fürchten. Von Abenteurern vor besagten Gefahren gerettet, folgt es seinen neuen Beschützern nun auf Schritt und Tritt.
#. fr: Alors qu'il flânait gaiement dans les îles du Diadème, ce jeune poulain ailé a perdu ses parents de vue et s'est vite retrouvé la cible de prédateurs préhistoriques... Heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, vous lui avez sauvé la vie. Depuis, il ne vous lâche plus d'une semelle.
#. column 0: Summon your pegasus colt minion. Unfortunately does not emit rainbows from any of its orifices.
#. column 2: I still don't understand<br>why a horn is so important<br>to you.<br>   - Ohl Deeh
#. column 3: Tail 'n Mane
#. column 4: Increases speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:194:0:1"
msgid "Having lost his mother, this winged steed from the Diadem has settled upon a decidedly wingless bipedal surrogate to lead him somewhere over the rainbow."
msgstr "Оставшись без матери, крылатый скакун из Диадема выбрал своим поводырём бескрылое двуногое существо, чтобы оно отвело его туда, где радуга."

#. ja: ピヒーン！
#. de: Diese unförmige Tröte ist das, was du wolltest?<br><i>Ohl Deeh</i>
#. fr: Hiiihihiii<nbsp>!!!
#. column 0: Summon your pegasus colt minion. Unfortunately does not emit rainbows from any of its orifices.
#. column 1: Having lost his mother, this winged steed from the Diadem has settled upon a decidedly wingless bipedal surrogate to lead him somewhere over the rainbow.
#. column 3: Tail 'n Mane
#. column 4: Increases speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:194:0:2"
msgid "I still don't understand<br>why a horn is so important<br>to you.<br>   - Ohl Deeh"
msgstr "Я всё ещё не понимаю,<br>почему тебе так важен<br>рог.<br>   — Оль Ди"

#. ja: 流星
#. de: Schweif und Mähne
#. fr: Étoile filante
#. column 0: Summon your pegasus colt minion. Unfortunately does not emit rainbows from any of its orifices.
#. column 1: Having lost his mother, this winged steed from the Diadem has settled upon a decidedly wingless bipedal surrogate to lead him somewhere over the rainbow.
#. column 2: I still don't understand<br>why a horn is so important<br>to you.<br>   - Ohl Deeh
