#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・カロフィステリ」を呼び出す。<br>カロフィステリを模した魔法人形。光り物が大好き……
#. de: Du rufst eine Mini-Calofisteri herbei. Sie liebt alles, was glitzert und leuchtet!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée Calofisteri. Con<shy>trai<shy>re<shy>ment à la vraie, elle semble très amicale... au point même que vous vous sentez presque de mèche avec elle.
#. column 1: This clockwork creation is similar to others made by a deranged Gridanian goldsmith, whose body went missing after he was executed for conjuring the dark arts. Found in the remnants of the city of Mhach, an explorer swore he could hear cackling from behind the crumbling walls.
#. column 2: By the blood of voidsent<br>have I ascended<br>to the sublime...<br>    - Calofisteri
#. column 3: Split End
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:195:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Calofisteri minion. She seems so peaceful. Why don't you keep her with you...FOR ALL ETERNITY!"
msgstr "Призывает заводную Калофистери. Она кажется такой мирной. Почему бы не оставить её себе... НАВЕЧНО!"

#. ja: カロフィステリを模した作者不明の魔法人形。冒険者とカロフィステリの戦いを、影から食い入るように見つめていた何者かが、迸る熱いパトスを注ぎ込んで即興で作ったもの。その後、彼は消え去る妖異とともに姿を消した……
#. de: Ein geheimnisvoller Schöpfer hat den Kampf der Abenteurer gegen Calofisteri heimlich beobachtet und daraufhin diese magische Puppe erschaffen. Danach verschwand er wie eine Feengestalt, seine Identität ist bis heute ungeklärt.
#. fr: L'auteur inconnu de ce pantin a vraisemblablement observé en cachette le combat entre Calofisteri et des aventuriers. Il est clair qu'il vouait une immense admiration pour cette créature... et a pro<shy>ba<shy>ble<shy>ment disparu en même temps qu'elle.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Calofisteri minion. She seems so peaceful. Why don't you keep her with you...FOR ALL ETERNITY!
#. column 2: By the blood of voidsent<br>have I ascended<br>to the sublime...<br>    - Calofisteri
#. column 3: Split End
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:195:0:1"
msgid "This clockwork creation is similar to others made by a deranged Gridanian goldsmith, whose body went missing after he was executed for conjuring the dark arts. Found in the remnants of the city of Mhach, an explorer swore he could hear cackling from behind the crumbling walls."
msgstr "Эту заводную куклу создал безумный гриданийский ювелир — такой же, как и другие его работы. Его тело пропало после казни за призыв тёмных сил. Исследователь, нашедший куклу среди руин Мхача, поклялся, что слышал из-за осыпавшихся стен чей-то хохот."

#. ja: サラサラ…
#. de: Warum ruht ihr euch nicht hier aus ... bis in alle Ewigkeit!<br><i>Calofisteri</i>
#. fr: Aucun d'entre vous ne m'échappera<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Calofisteri minion. She seems so peaceful. Why don't you keep her with you...FOR ALL ETERNITY!
#. column 1: This clockwork creation is similar to others made by a deranged Gridanian goldsmith, whose body went missing after he was executed for conjuring the dark arts. Found in the remnants of the city of Mhach, an explorer swore he could hear cackling from behind the crumbling walls.
#. column 3: Split End
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:195:0:2"
msgid "By the blood of voidsent<br>have I ascended<br>to the sublime...<br>    - Calofisteri"
msgstr "Кровь порождений Бездны<br>вознесла меня<br>к вершинам...<br>   — Калофистери"

#. ja: きらーん
#. de: Glitzer
#. fr: Mèches protectrices
