#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・サスカッチ」を呼び出す。<br>サスカッチを模した魔法人形。野生生物の乱獲禁止を訴える
#. de: Du rufst dein Sasquatch-Stofftier herbei. Füttern auf eigene Gefahr.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-sasquatch. Cette reproduction fidèle et articulée du primate géant donne l'impression d'être au beau milieu de la jungle.
#. column 1: Crafted by the Leatherworkers' Guild, this lifelike clockwork replica of a sasquatch is hoped to bring attention to the creatures' dwindling numbers in the wild.
#. column 2: I've decided to follow<br>in your footsteps.<br>   - Sisipu
#. column 3: Agitation
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:196:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up sasquatch minion. It thankfully cannot pelt you with its steaming stool."
msgstr "Призывает заводного снежного человека. К счастью, он не может закидать тебя дымящимися лепёшками."

#. ja: 革細工師ギルドが自然保護の啓蒙活動用に作った、サスカッチを模した魔法人形。一時の流行で需要が喚起された結果、特定の野生生物が乱獲され、絶滅の危機に追い込まれることがあると、広く知って貰いたいとのこと
#. de: Ein fleißiges Mitglied der Gerber-Gilde schuf dieses Stofftier aus echter Sasquatch-Haut, um auf die Ausbeutung von Wildtieren aufmerksam zu machen.
#. fr: La guilde des tanneurs a mis au point ce pantin à l'effigie d'un sasquatch sur la base des témoignages d'aventuriers qui en ont vu sur l'Île de Crèvecarène. Il est toutefois fort probable que cet animal y ait été introduit par des pirates.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up sasquatch minion. It thankfully cannot pelt you with its steaming stool.
#. column 2: I've decided to follow<br>in your footsteps.<br>   - Sisipu
#. column 3: Agitation
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:196:0:1"
msgid "Crafted by the Leatherworkers' Guild, this lifelike clockwork replica of a sasquatch is hoped to bring attention to the creatures' dwindling numbers in the wild."
msgstr "Кожевенная гильдия изготовила эту реалистичную заводную копию снежного человека, надеясь привлечь внимание к сокращению численности этих существ в дикой природе."

#. ja: ウホッ！
#. de: Uh uh ...
#. fr: Mraaoouum<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up sasquatch minion. It thankfully cannot pelt you with its steaming stool.
#. column 1: Crafted by the Leatherworkers' Guild, this lifelike clockwork replica of a sasquatch is hoped to bring attention to the creatures' dwindling numbers in the wild.
#. column 3: Agitation
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:196:0:2"
msgid "I've decided to follow<br>in your footsteps.<br>   - Sisipu"
msgstr "Решила пойти<br>по твоим стопам.<br>   — Сисипу"

#. ja: ウホッ
#. de: Affentheater
#. fr: Sas-saccage
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up sasquatch minion. It thankfully cannot pelt you with its steaming stool.
#. column 1: Crafted by the Leatherworkers' Guild, this lifelike clockwork replica of a sasquatch is hoped to bring attention to the creatures' dwindling numbers in the wild.
#. column 2: I've decided to follow<br>in your footsteps.<br>   - Sisipu
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:196:0:3"
msgid "Agitation"
msgstr "Шум"

#. ja: 敵が配置したトラップがある場合、解除する。
#. de: Entfernt eine vom Gegner aufgestellte Falle.
#. fr: Enlève un piège mis en place par l'ennemi.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up sasquatch minion. It thankfully cannot pelt you with its steaming stool.
#. column 1: Crafted by the Leatherworkers' Guild, this lifelike clockwork replica of a sasquatch is hoped to bring attention to the creatures' dwindling numbers in the wild.
#. column 2: I've decided to follow<br>in your footsteps.<br>   - Sisipu
