msgid "Disarms deployed enemy traps."
msgstr "Обезвреживает установленные противником ловушки."

#. ja: ミニオン「ドワーフラビット」を呼び出す。<br>愛らしい小型のウサギ。無類の寂しがり屋
#. de: Du rufst ein Zwergkaninchen herbei. Mit so einem kleinen, niedlichen Begleiter wirst du dich niemals einsam fühlen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte lapin nain. Il est tellement mignon qu'on a envie de le prendre dans ses bras pour lui faire un gros câlin. Attention à ne pas l'étouffer toutefois.
#. column 1: After his father was baked into a pie by a farmer's wife for stealing their vegetables, he invoked the time-honored code of rabbit revenge and hopped off to destroy every garden patch he could find.
#. column 2: But know that she who chases<br>two rabbits catches neither one.<br>   - J'moldva
#. column 3: Carrots and Sticks
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 10 to all enemies within range every second.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:197:0:0"
msgid "Summon your dwarf rabbit minion. He may have a penchant for nibbling at your neighbor's garden patches."
msgstr "Призывает карликового кролика. Он, пожалуй, любит обгрызать соседские грядки."

#. ja: 愛らしい小型のウサギ。片田舎で幸せに暮らしていたが、ある日、畑に作物を盗みにいった父が、農家の奥さんによってパイにされるという事件が発生。その悲しみを癒やすため、放浪の旅に出た結果、冒険者と出会ったのだった
#. de: Einst lebte das Zwergkaninchen friedlich auf dem Land, doch als sein Vater Gemüse von einem Feld stibitzte, wurde er von der Bäuerin geschnappt und zu einer Pastete verarbeitet. Nach dieser Tragödie zog das Zwergkaninchen hinaus in die weite Welt.
#. fr: Ce lapin de petite taille vivait paisiblement à la campagne jusqu'au jour où son père s'est fait prendre en volant les légumes d'un jardin et a fini en civet. Seul, il a décidé d'aller où le destin le mènerait et c'est ainsi qu'il a fait votre rencontre.
#. column 0: Summon your dwarf rabbit minion. He may have a penchant for nibbling at your neighbor's garden patches.
#. column 2: But know that she who chases<br>two rabbits catches neither one.<br>   - J'moldva
#. column 3: Carrots and Sticks
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 10 to all enemies within range every second.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:197:0:1"
msgid "After his father was baked into a pie by a farmer's wife for stealing their vegetables, he invoked the time-honored code of rabbit revenge and hopped off to destroy every garden patch he could find."
msgstr "После того как женушка фермера испекла пирог из его отца за кражу овощей, кролик решил отомстить по старинному кроличьему обычаю и пустился уничтожать все грядки, какие только находил."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Es gibt kein niedlicheres Wesen in Eorzea!<br><i>Mädchen aus Gridania</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon your dwarf rabbit minion. He may have a penchant for nibbling at your neighbor's garden patches.
#. column 1: After his father was baked into a pie by a farmer's wife for stealing their vegetables, he invoked the time-honored code of rabbit revenge and hopped off to destroy every garden patch he could find.
#. column 3: Carrots and Sticks
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 10 to all enemies within range every second.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:197:0:2"
msgid "But know that she who chases<br>two rabbits catches neither one.<br>   - J'moldva"
msgstr "Но знай: тот, кто гонится<br>за двумя кроликами,<br>не поймает ни одного.<br>   — Дж'Молдва"

#. ja: ニンジン爆弾
#. de: Möhrengranate
#. fr: Carotte piégée
#. column 0: Summon your dwarf rabbit minion. He may have a penchant for nibbling at your neighbor's garden patches.
#. column 1: After his father was baked into a pie by a farmer's wife for stealing their vegetables, he invoked the time-honored code of rabbit revenge and hopped off to destroy every garden patch he could find.
#. column 2: But know that she who chases<br>two rabbits catches neither one.<br>   - J'moldva
