msgid "Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 10 to all enemies within range every second.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
