#. ja: ミニオン「ヘクトアイ」を呼び出す。<br>ヘクトアイズから剥がれ落ちた眼球。複数形ではなく単数形
#. de: Du rufst dein Hektokulinchen als Begleiter herbei. Es ist die Antwort auf die Frage, was passiert, wenn ein Hektokulus ein Auge zudrückt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte hectoculus monoculaire. Cet œil rampant est en réalité un bout qui s'est détaché du monstre du même nom.
#. column 1: This single optic detached from a larger mass of hecteyes finds itself in a constant state of restlessness, given the inability to simultaneously survey its surroundings in all directions. Until it grows more, your eyes will have to suffice.
#. column 2: I keep one eye open at<br>all times, an' two more<br>often than not.<br>   - Baderon
#. column 3: Surveillance
#. column 4: Reduces movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:198:0:0"
msgid "Summon your hecteye minion. Got no Hyuran grace, you're an eye without a face."
msgstr "Призывает гектооко. Ни грации хьюра, ни лица — одни глаза."

#. ja: ヘクトアイズから剥がれ落ちた眼球。常に全方位を見つめてきたため、一方向しか確認できない状況が落ち着かないらしい。いつか沢山の眼が生えて安心できるようになるまで、強い者と行動をともにしようと考えているようだ
#. de: Dieser arme Augapfel fiel nicht weit vom Hektokulus-Stamm, doch es reichte, um nun mutterseelenallein durch die Welt rutschen zu müssen. Er ist es nicht gewohnt, nur einen Teil seiner Umgebung auf einmal sehen zu können und gleitet daher etwas nervös hin und her.
#. fr: Détaché du reste de son corps d'origine, cet œil a été qualifié d'hectoculus monoculaire, à défaut de meilleure appellation. Désormais incapable de voir tout autour de lui, il est d'un naturel nerveux et bouge constamment.
#. column 0: Summon your hecteye minion. Got no Hyuran grace, you're an eye without a face.
#. column 2: I keep one eye open at<br>all times, an' two more<br>often than not.<br>   - Baderon
#. column 3: Surveillance
#. column 4: Reduces movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:198:0:1"
msgid "This single optic detached from a larger mass of hecteyes finds itself in a constant state of restlessness, given the inability to simultaneously survey its surroundings in all directions. Until it grows more, your eyes will have to suffice."
msgstr "Этот единственный глаз отделился от огромной массы гектоок. Он не может сразу обозревать всё вокруг и потому постоянно беспокоится. Пока новых глаз не отросло, ему придётся обходиться твоими."

#. ja: ギロリ！
#. de: Glupsch.
#. fr: Gpshh...
#. column 0: Summon your hecteye minion. Got no Hyuran grace, you're an eye without a face.
#. column 1: This single optic detached from a larger mass of hecteyes finds itself in a constant state of restlessness, given the inability to simultaneously survey its surroundings in all directions. Until it grows more, your eyes will have to suffice.
#. column 3: Surveillance
#. column 4: Reduces movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:198:0:2"
msgid "I keep one eye open at<br>all times, an' two more<br>often than not.<br>   - Baderon"
msgstr "Я всегда держу один глаз открытым,<br>а то и все три — чаще, чем нет.<br>   — Бадерон"

#. ja: ネットネト
#. de: Holzauge
#. fr: Mucus hectoculaire
#. column 0: Summon your hecteye minion. Got no Hyuran grace, you're an eye without a face.
#. column 1: This single optic detached from a larger mass of hecteyes finds itself in a constant state of restlessness, given the inability to simultaneously survey its surroundings in all directions. Until it grows more, your eyes will have to suffice.
#. column 2: I keep one eye open at<br>all times, an' two more<br>often than not.<br>   - Baderon
