#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:198:0:4"
msgid "Reduces movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s"
msgstr "Снижает скорость передвижения всех противников поблизости на 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「道士モーグリ」を呼び出す。<br>東方風に着飾ったモーグリの魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deinen Daoisten-Mogry als Begleiter herbei. Seine fernöstliche Weisheit beschränkt sich darauf, dir zu folgen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Mog dàoshi, vêtue dans la plus pure tradition orientale.
#. column 1: Enrei, acolyte to renowned Far Eastern monk, Master Togen, is believed to have handcrafted this quaint automaton for a kind adventurer who once lent her aid to the pair. How it ended up for sale in a foreign market remains a mystery.
#. column 2: I wasn't joking, by the way.<br>About the moogle punching.<br>   - Sidurgu
#. column 3: Enter the Moogle
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:199:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Taoist moogle minion. The mogpath that can be spoken of is not the true mogpath, kupo."
msgstr "Призывает миньона-могла-даоса. Истинный путь могла нельзя выразить словами, купо."

#. ja: 東方風に着飾ったモーグリの魔法人形。トウゲン老師のお供、エンレイが、冒険者への贈り物として、ひそかに手作りしていたもの。エオルゼアで有名なモーグリをモチーフに、東方風の道士の衣装を着用させている
#. de: Enrei, Akolyt des legendären fernöstlichen Mönchs Meister Togen, soll diese Marionette für eine Abenteurerin hergestellt haben, die den beiden aus einer Notlage half. Wie das Geschenk in den Handel kam, ist nicht bekannt.
#. fr: Enrei, le compagnon de Togen, a fabriqué ce petit pantin volant à l'effigie d'un Mog éorzéen en se disant que cela plairait aux aventuriers. Il l'a ensuite vêtu d'une tenue typiquement orientale pour le marquer de son empreinte.
#. column 0: Summon your Taoist moogle minion. The mogpath that can be spoken of is not the true mogpath, kupo.
#. column 2: I wasn't joking, by the way.<br>About the moogle punching.<br>   - Sidurgu
#. column 3: Enter the Moogle
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:199:0:1"
msgid "Enrei, acolyte to renowned Far Eastern monk, Master Togen, is believed to have handcrafted this quaint automaton for a kind adventurer who once lent her aid to the pair. How it ended up for sale in a foreign market remains a mystery."
msgstr "Считается, что Энрэй, ученик прославленного монаха с Дальнего Востока, мастера Тогэна, собственноручно создал этот забавный автоматон для доброй приключенки, однажды помогшей им обоим. Как он оказался на чужеземном рынке — загадка."

#. ja: クーポクポ！
#. de: Und den Rest von euch zerstampf ich<br>zu Mogry-Mus!<br><i>Sidurgu</i>
#. fr: Kupopo<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Taoist moogle minion. The mogpath that can be spoken of is not the true mogpath, kupo.
#. column 1: Enrei, acolyte to renowned Far Eastern monk, Master Togen, is believed to have handcrafted this quaint automaton for a kind adventurer who once lent her aid to the pair. How it ended up for sale in a foreign market remains a mystery.
#. column 3: Enter the Moogle
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:199:0:2"
msgid "I wasn't joking, by the way.<br>About the moogle punching.<br>   - Sidurgu"
msgstr "Я не шутил, если что.<br>Насчёт того, чтобы бить моглов.<br>   — Сидургу"

#. ja: カンフー
#. de: Weisheit des Mogrys
#. fr: Kung-fu
#. column 0: Summon your Taoist moogle minion. The mogpath that can be spoken of is not the true mogpath, kupo.
#. column 1: Enrei, acolyte to renowned Far Eastern monk, Master Togen, is believed to have handcrafted this quaint automaton for a kind adventurer who once lent her aid to the pair. How it ended up for sale in a foreign market remains a mystery.
#. column 2: I wasn't joking, by the way.<br>About the moogle punching.<br>   - Sidurgu
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:199:0:3"
msgid "Enter the Moogle"
msgstr "Могл-кунг-фу"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵をノックバックさせる。
#. de: Schleudert die Gegner in der Nähe zurück.
#. fr: Projette en arrière les ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Taoist moogle minion. The mogpath that can be spoken of is not the true mogpath, kupo.
#. column 1: Enrei, acolyte to renowned Far Eastern monk, Master Togen, is believed to have handcrafted this quaint automaton for a kind adventurer who once lent her aid to the pair. How it ended up for sale in a foreign market remains a mystery.
#. column 2: I wasn't joking, by the way.<br>About the moogle punching.<br>   - Sidurgu
#. column 3: Enter the Moogle
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:199:0:4"
msgid "Knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Отбрасывает всех противников поблизости."

#. ja: ミニオン「ジバニャン」を呼び出す。<br>地縛霊のネコ妖怪。目指すはクルマへのリベンジ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Jibanyan-Begleiter herbei. Vorsicht - er ist dafür bekannt, seine Wut an vorbeifahrenden Chocobo-Karren auszulassen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Jibanyan. Ce chat mystérieux semble avoir une dent contre tous les véhicules à roues.
#. column 1: After being run over, Jibanyan was bound to a busy crossroad where he spent his days taking revenge on any passing vehicle that stood in his way.
#. column 2: I'm kind of busy right nyao.
#. column 3: Paws of Fury
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:200:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Jibanyan minion. He might take his anger out on passing vehicles."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Джибаняна. Он может сорвать злость на проезжающих повозках."

#. ja: クルマにハネられて死んでしまったネコが地縛霊になった姿。クルマにリベンジをするがいつも失敗している
#. de: Nachdem er von einem Laster überfahren worden war, beseelt er nun eine Kreuzung, um sich an den Lastern zu rächen.
#. fr: Ayant perdu la vie après avoir été renversé, l'esprit de Jibanyan s'est retrouvé lié au croisement où s'est produit l'accident et cherche désormais à se venger sur tous les véhicules qui passent, mais sans succès.
#. column 0: Summon your Jibanyan minion. He might take his anger out on passing vehicles.
#. column 2: I'm kind of busy right nyao.
#. column 3: Paws of Fury
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:200:0:1"
msgid "After being run over, Jibanyan was bound to a busy crossroad where he spent his days taking revenge on any passing vehicle that stood in his way."
msgstr "Джибанян погиб под колёсами и привязался к оживлённому перекрёстку. Теперь он целыми днями мстит любому экипажу, который попадётся ему на пути."

#. ja: ニャン！
#. de: Jetzt nyicht, nyachher!
#. fr: Je m'occupe de chat<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Jibanyan minion. He might take his anger out on passing vehicles.
#. column 1: After being run over, Jibanyan was bound to a busy crossroad where he spent his days taking revenge on any passing vehicle that stood in his way.
#. column 3: Paws of Fury
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:200:0:2"
msgid "I'm kind of busy right nyao."
msgstr "Я тут вообще-то занят мяу."

#. ja: ひゃくれつ肉球
#. de: Pfoten des Zorns
#. fr: Fureur du chaton
#. column 0: Summon your Jibanyan minion. He might take his anger out on passing vehicles.
#. column 1: After being run over, Jibanyan was bound to a busy crossroad where he spent his days taking revenge on any passing vehicle that stood in his way.
#. column 2: I'm kind of busy right nyao.
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:200:0:3"
msgid "Paws of Fury"
msgstr "Ярость лап"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Jibanyan minion. He might take his anger out on passing vehicles.
#. column 1: After being run over, Jibanyan was bound to a busy crossroad where he spent his days taking revenge on any passing vehicle that stood in his way.
#. column 2: I'm kind of busy right nyao.
#. column 3: Paws of Fury
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:200:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам поблизости урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「コマさん」を呼び出す。<br>コマイヌの妖怪。田舎の神社を出て都会にやって来た
#. de: Du rufst deinen Komasan-Begleiter herbei. Ob er an deiner Seite einen neuen Schrein findet, den er bewachen kann?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Komasan. Cette créature exotique a apparemment décidé de quitter le temple dont il assurait la garde pour vivre des aventures.
#. column 1: Komasan is a lion-dog that came from a rural area. He often expresses awe when traveling in the city.
#. column 2: Oh my swirls!
#. column 3: Spirit Dance
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:201:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Komasan minion. He got bored with guarding his shrine. Now he wants to guard you."
msgstr "Призывает миньона Комасана. Ему наскучило охранять святилище. Теперь он хочет охранять тебя."

#. ja: 神社のお守りにあきて家出してしまったコマイヌの妖怪。都会のすごさに、いつも「もんげ～！」と驚いている
#. de: Ein Wach-Löwen-Hund, der von seinem alten Schrein gelangweilt war und deshalb auf der Suche nach einem neuen ist.
#. fr: Komasan est un chien-lion qui gardait l'entrée d'un temple dans une région rurale, mais il a depuis décidé de partir à la découverte du monde et ne peut s'empêcher d'exprimer son admiration lorsqu'il visite une grande cité.
#. column 0: Summon your Komasan minion. He got bored with guarding his shrine. Now he wants to guard you.
#. column 2: Oh my swirls!
#. column 3: Spirit Dance
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:201:0:1"
msgid "Komasan is a lion-dog that came from a rural area. He often expresses awe when traveling in the city."
msgstr "Комасан — собака-лев, прибывшая из сельской местности. В городе он то и дело изумляется всему вокруг."

#. ja: もんげ～！
#. de: Ich dreh' am Rad.
#. fr: Tourneboulant<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Komasan minion. He got bored with guarding his shrine. Now he wants to guard you.
#. column 1: Komasan is a lion-dog that came from a rural area. He often expresses awe when traveling in the city.
#. column 3: Spirit Dance
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:201:0:2"
msgid "Oh my swirls!"
msgstr "Ух ты ж завитки!"

#. ja: ひとだま乱舞
#. de: Geisterreigen
#. fr: Valse des esprits
#. column 0: Summon your Komasan minion. He got bored with guarding his shrine. Now he wants to guard you.
#. column 1: Komasan is a lion-dog that came from a rural area. He often expresses awe when traveling in the city.
#. column 2: Oh my swirls!
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:201:0:3"
msgid "Spirit Dance"
msgstr "Танец духов"

#. ja: トラップを配置する。10秒後トラップ発動ボタンにより起爆可能。範囲内にいる敵にATK260のダメージを与える。
#. de: Stellt eine Falle auf, die nach 10 Sekunden ausgelöst werden kann. Bewirkt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 260 auf die Gegner in der Nähe.
#. fr: Place un piège qui peut être déclenché 10 secondes plus tard.<br>Piège<nbsp>: inflige des dégâts d'attaque 260 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Komasan minion. He got bored with guarding his shrine. Now he wants to guard you.
#. column 1: Komasan is a lion-dog that came from a rural area. He often expresses awe when traveling in the city.
#. column 2: Oh my swirls!
#. column 3: Spirit Dance
