msgstr "Устанавливает ловушку, которая при срабатывании наносит всем противникам поблизости урон силой 260.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Задержка активации:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「ウィスパー」を呼び出す。<br>妖怪執事を名乗る妖怪。実は知ったかぶり
#. de: Du rufst deinen Whisper-Begleiter herbei, der dir als Diener dienlich sein wird.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Whisper. Ce curieux spectre se définit lui-même comme majordome et aime prétendre tout savoir.
#. column 1: A self-proclaimed “Yo-kai butler.” With the way he talks, you would think him a know-it-all, but he is really a know-nothing.
#. column 2: Hold on to your butler!
#. column 3: Blabbermouth
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:202:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Whisper minion. Your very own Yo-kai butler, at your service."
msgstr "Призывает миньона Уиспера. Твой личный слуга-йокай к твоим услугам."

#. ja: 妖怪執事を名乗る妖怪。たいていの妖怪の情報をスラスラと教えてくれるが実は妖怪パッドを見ながら、知ったかぶりをしているだけ
#. de: Redet gerne, schnell und viel, und scheint alles über die anderen Yo-kai zu wissen.
#. fr: Se présentant lui-même comme un majordome, Whisper aime parler au sujet des Yo-kai en affichant un air pédant alors qu'il se contente simplement de lire un livre sur le sujet.
#. column 0: Summon your Whisper minion. Your very own Yo-kai butler, at your service.
#. column 2: Hold on to your butler!
#. column 3: Blabbermouth
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:202:0:1"
msgid "A self-proclaimed “Yo-kai butler.” With the way he talks, you would think him a know-it-all, but he is really a know-nothing."
msgstr "Самозваный «слуга-йокай». Говорит так, будто знает всё на свете, а на деле не знает ничего."

#. ja: うぃす！
#. de: Stets zu Diensten!
#. fr: Votre majordome est avancé<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Whisper minion. Your very own Yo-kai butler, at your service.
#. column 1: A self-proclaimed “Yo-kai butler.” With the way he talks, you would think him a know-it-all, but he is really a know-nothing.
#. column 3: Blabbermouth
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:202:0:2"
msgid "Hold on to your butler!"
msgstr "Держись за своего слугу!"

#. ja: 口からでまかせブレス
#. de: Plappermaul
#. fr: BlaBlAttaque
#. column 0: Summon your Whisper minion. Your very own Yo-kai butler, at your service.
#. column 1: A self-proclaimed “Yo-kai butler.” With the way he talks, you would think him a know-it-all, but he is really a know-nothing.
#. column 2: Hold on to your butler!
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:202:0:3"
msgid "Blabbermouth"
msgstr "Болтун"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵のDEFを、50%低下させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>15秒
#. de: Verringert die ABW von Gegnern in der Nähe um 50 %.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 Sekunden
#. fr: Réduit de 50% la défense des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
