#. ja: ミニオン「ふぶき姫」を呼び出す。<br>何でも凍らせる愛らしい妖怪。冷気パワーを自由にあやつる
#. de: Du rufst deinen Glazia-Begleiter herbei. Kann angeblich Schneestürme im Sommer verursachen und Vulkane einfrieren.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Blizzaria. Malgré ses charmes, cette femme est aussi froide que la glace qu'elle semble contrôler comme bon lui semble.
#. column 1: A Yo-kai with the power to make temperatures drop, Blizzaria can make snow fall in summer and freeze volcanoes.
#. column 2: Summer fever...
#. column 3: Shiny Snowdrifts
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:203:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Blizzaria minion. She's a Yo-kai with an immense chilling power."
msgstr "Призывает миньона Близарию. Она — йокай с невероятной силой холода."

#. ja: 冷気パワーを自由に操れる、愛らしい妖怪。夏に雪を降らせたり、火山を雪山に変えることもできるらしい
#. de: Kann die Temperatur rapide sinken lassen, es im Sommer schneien lassen und sogar Vulkane einfrieren.
#. fr: Possédant le pouvoir de faire baisser la température où elle veut et comme bon lui semble, Blizzaria est capable de provoquer des chutes de neige en plein été ou de geler la lave des volcans.
#. column 0: Summon your Blizzaria minion. She's a Yo-kai with an immense chilling power.
#. column 2: Summer fever...
#. column 3: Shiny Snowdrifts
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:203:0:1"
msgid "A Yo-kai with the power to make temperatures drop, Blizzaria can make snow fall in summer and freeze volcanoes."
msgstr "Близария умеет понижать температуру, насылая снег посреди лета и замораживая вулканы."

#. ja: 夏バテだわ…
#. de: Diese Sommerhitze ...
#. fr: Ça va jeter un froid<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Blizzaria minion. She's a Yo-kai with an immense chilling power.
#. column 1: A Yo-kai with the power to make temperatures drop, Blizzaria can make snow fall in summer and freeze volcanoes.
#. column 3: Shiny Snowdrifts
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:203:0:2"
msgid "Summer fever..."
msgstr "Летняя хандра..."

#. ja: キラキラ雪化粧
#. de: Schimmernde Schneewehe
#. fr: Congère luisante
#. column 0: Summon your Blizzaria minion. She's a Yo-kai with an immense chilling power.
#. column 1: A Yo-kai with the power to make temperatures drop, Blizzaria can make snow fall in summer and freeze volcanoes.
#. column 2: Summer fever...
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:203:0:3"
msgid "Shiny Snowdrifts"
msgstr "Сверкающий снегопад"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のATKを20上昇させる。味方がタイプ「モンスター」の場合は、ATKが40上昇する。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Erhöht die ATT von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe um 20, im Fall von Monstern um 40. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 20 l'attaque des alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou de 40 s'ils sont de type “Monstre”.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
