msgid "Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s"
