#. ja: ミニオン「キュウビ」を呼び出す。<br>九つの尾を持つキツネの妖怪。妖怪の中でも最上位の存在
#. de: Du rufst deinen Kyubi-Begleiter herbei. Er ist eigentlich ganz nett, wenn man ihn mal näher kennengelernt hat.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Kyubi. Cet étrange renard n'a pas moins de neuf queues et semble se placer haut dans la hiérarchie des Yo-kai.
#. column 1: This fox Yo-kai is one of the strongest Yo-kai around. He can easily erupt with power, like a volcano.
#. column 2: How ridiculous.
#. column 3: Inferno
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:204:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Kyubi minion. He's actually quite charming once you get to know him."
msgstr "Призывает миньона Кюби. Если познакомишься с ним поближе, он окажется весьма обаятельным."

#. ja: 妖怪の中でも、最上位とされる九つの尾を持つキツネの妖怪。火山の噴火と同じくらいの力を、いとも簡単に生み出すことができる
#. de: Dieser Fuchs-Yo-kai ist einer der stärksten unter den Yo-kai. Kann mit Leichtigkeit einen Vulkan zum Ausbruch bringen.
#. fr: Ce mystérieux renard pourvu de neuf queues est considéré comme l'un des Yo-kai les plus puissants qui soient, étant même capable de faire entrer un volcan en éruption.
#. column 0: Summon your Kyubi minion. He's actually quite charming once you get to know him.
#. column 2: How ridiculous.
#. column 3: Inferno
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:204:0:1"
msgid "This fox Yo-kai is one of the strongest Yo-kai around. He can easily erupt with power, like a volcano."
msgstr "Этот лис-йокай — один из сильнейших среди йокаев. Он с лёгкостью высвобождает силу, способную вызвать извержение вулкана."

#. ja: バカバカしい…
#. de: Einfach lächerlich ...
#. fr: Pathétique...
#. column 0: Summon your Kyubi minion. He's actually quite charming once you get to know him.
#. column 1: This fox Yo-kai is one of the strongest Yo-kai around. He can easily erupt with power, like a volcano.
#. column 3: Inferno
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:204:0:2"
msgid "How ridiculous."
msgstr "Какая чушь..."

#. ja: 紅蓮地獄
#. de: Inferno
#. fr: Inferno
#. column 0: Summon your Kyubi minion. He's actually quite charming once you get to know him.
#. column 1: This fox Yo-kai is one of the strongest Yo-kai around. He can easily erupt with power, like a volcano.
#. column 2: How ridiculous.
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:204:0:3"
msgid "Inferno"
msgstr "Инферно"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Kyubi minion. He's actually quite charming once you get to know him.
#. column 1: This fox Yo-kai is one of the strongest Yo-kai around. He can easily erupt with power, like a volcano.
#. column 2: How ridiculous.
#. column 3: Inferno
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:204:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 90."

#. ja: ミニオン「コマじろう」を呼び出す。<br>コマさんの双子の弟。適応能力は兄より高い
#. de: Du rufst deinen Komajiro-Begleiter herbei. Während er seinen älteren Bruder sucht, kann er dich doch eigentlich gut auf deinen Abenteuern begleiten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Komajiro. Cette créature est le frère jumeau du Yo-kai Komasan, qu'il surpasse pour ce qui est de la faculté d'adaptation.
#. column 1: Komajiro is Komasan's younger twin. He looks for his runaway brother, but he can't find him anywhere.
#. column 2: Oh my swirls!
#. column 3: Wild Zaps
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:205:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Komajiro minion. He might as well tag along on your adventures as he searches for his older brother."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Комадзиро. Пока он ищет старшего брата, пусть сопровождает вас в приключениях."

#. ja: コマさんの双子の弟。都会に慣れない兄とは違い、すぐ都会に適応した。兄であるコマさんをいつも尊敬している
#. de: Ist Komasans jüngerer Bruder. Er sucht überall nach dem entlaufenen Familienmitglied, kann es aber nirgendwo finden.
#. fr: Ce chien-lion n'est autre que le jeune frère jumeau de Komasan. Il est à la recherche de ce dernier depuis qu'il s'est enfui du temple qu'ils gardaient ensemble, mais n'arrive à le trouver nulle part.
#. column 0: Summon your Komajiro minion. He might as well tag along on your adventures as he searches for his older brother.
#. column 2: Oh my swirls!
#. column 3: Wild Zaps
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:205:0:1"
msgid "Komajiro is Komasan's younger twin. He looks for his runaway brother, but he can't find him anywhere."
msgstr "Комадзиро — младший брат-близнец Комасана. Он ищет сбежавшего брата, но никак не может его найти."

#. ja: ズラ…
#. de: Ich dreh' am Rad.
#. fr: C'est tourneboulant<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Komajiro minion. He might as well tag along on your adventures as he searches for his older brother.
#. column 1: Komajiro is Komasan's younger twin. He looks for his runaway brother, but he can't find him anywhere.
#. column 3: Wild Zaps
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:205:0:2"
msgid "Oh my swirls!"
msgstr "Ох, мои завитушки!"

#. ja: 風来サンダー
#. de: Gewitterfront
#. fr: Fulguration
#. column 0: Summon your Komajiro minion. He might as well tag along on your adventures as he searches for his older brother.
#. column 1: Komajiro is Komasan's younger twin. He looks for his runaway brother, but he can't find him anywhere.
#. column 2: Oh my swirls!
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:205:0:3"
msgid "Wild Zaps"
msgstr "Дикие молнии"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、1秒ごとに10の継続ダメージを与える。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>20秒
#. de: Fügt Gegnern in der Nähe im Sekundentakt 10 Schaden über Zeit zu.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 Sekunden
#. fr: Inflige 10 points de dégâts périodiques par seconde aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. column 0: Summon your Komajiro minion. He might as well tag along on your adventures as he searches for his older brother.
#. column 1: Komajiro is Komasan's younger twin. He looks for his runaway brother, but he can't find him anywhere.
#. column 2: Oh my swirls!
#. column 3: Wild Zaps
