msgstr "Каждую секунду наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия 10 единиц урона.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「じんめん犬」を呼び出す。<br>今風の犬種の人面犬。モテモテになるのが夢
#. de: Du rufst deinen Möter-Begleiter herbei. Halb Hund, halb Mittvierziger.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Corniot. Malgré son apparence pour le moins repoussante, ce chien à visage humain cherche à se faire aimer de tout le monde.
#. column 1: A man-faced poodle who enjoys scaring people frightened by a poodle with a man's face.
#. column 2: Doggone it!
#. column 3: Creepy Superbite
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:206:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Manjimutt minion. He hopes to become a CEO someday."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Манджимутта. Надеется когда-нибудь стать генеральным директором."

#. ja: 今風の犬種の人面犬。後ろ姿のかわいさにつられて寄ってきた人を、よくビックリさせる。モテモテになるのが夢
#. de: Ein Pudel mit dem Gesicht eines Mannes. Erschreckt gerne Leute mit seinem Aussehen. Möchte eines Tages Firmenchef sein.
#. fr: Ce caniche à tête d'homme prend un malin plaisir à effrayer les gens qui s'approchent de lui par derrière, pensant avoir affaire à un joli petit chien. Il n'a toutefois qu'une envie<nbsp>: se faire aimer de tout le monde.
#. column 0: Summon your Manjimutt minion. He hopes to become a CEO someday.
#. column 2: Doggone it!
#. column 3: Creepy Superbite
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:206:0:1"
msgid "A man-faced poodle who enjoys scaring people frightened by a poodle with a man's face."
msgstr "Пудель с человеческим лицом, который любит пугать людей, боящихся пуделей с человеческими лицами."

#. ja: チクショー！
#. de: Kötelköter!
#. fr: Nom d'un chien<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Manjimutt minion. He hopes to become a CEO someday.
#. column 1: A man-faced poodle who enjoys scaring people frightened by a poodle with a man's face.
#. column 3: Creepy Superbite
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:206:0:2"
msgid "Doggone it!"
msgstr "Вот же пёс!"

#. ja: おっさんかみマックス
#. de: Wadenbeißer
#. fr: Grand caninvore
#. column 0: Summon your Manjimutt minion. He hopes to become a CEO someday.
#. column 1: A man-faced poodle who enjoys scaring people frightened by a poodle with a man's face.
#. column 2: Doggone it!
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:206:0:3"
msgid "Creepy Superbite"
msgstr "Жуткий укус"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Manjimutt minion. He hopes to become a CEO someday.
