#. column 2: Doggone it!
#. column 3: Creepy Superbite
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:206:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 90."

#. ja: ミニオン「ツチノコ」を呼び出す。<br>幸運を呼びよせる、めでたいヘビの妖怪
#. de: Du rufst deinen Noko-Begleiter herbei. Er soll angeblich Glück bringen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Noko. Ce serpent fantastique est paraît-il une sorte de porte-bonheur vivant.
#. column 1: Noko is always scared of being seen by humans. Which happens a lot, since it's terrible at hiding.
#. column 2: Noko noko!
#. column 3: Noko Smile
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:207:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Noko minion. This Yo-kai is one lucky snake!"
msgstr "Призвать миньона Ноко. Этот ёкай — змея на удачу!"

#. ja: 幸運を呼びよせる、めでたいヘビの妖怪。姿を隠すのが苦手で、よく人に見つかってしまうのが悩みのタネ
#. de: Dieser Schlangen-Yo-kai hat es schwer. Er hat Angst, dass Leute ihn entdecken, ist aber schlecht im Verstecken.
#. fr: Étant réputé pour apporter chance et bonheur, cet étrange serpent est tétanisé à l'idée d'être découvert et attrapé par des humains... ce qui arrive très souvent, car le pauvre reptile n'est absolument pas doué pour se cacher.
#. column 0: Summon your Noko minion. This Yo-kai is one lucky snake!
#. column 2: Noko noko!
#. column 3: Noko Smile
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:207:0:1"
msgid "Noko is always scared of being seen by humans. Which happens a lot, since it's terrible at hiding."
msgstr "Ноко боится попадаться людям на глаза. А это случается часто: прятаться он совсем не умеет."

#. ja: キュピーン！
#. de: Noko noko!
#. fr: Noko noko<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Noko minion. This Yo-kai is one lucky snake!
#. column 1: Noko is always scared of being seen by humans. Which happens a lot, since it's terrible at hiding.
#. column 3: Noko Smile
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:207:0:2"
msgid "Noko noko!"
msgstr "Ноко-ноко!"

#. ja: ツチノコスマイル
#. de: Beruhigendes Lächeln
#. fr: Sourire de Noko
#. column 0: Summon your Noko minion. This Yo-kai is one lucky snake!
#. column 1: Noko is always scared of being seen by humans. Which happens a lot, since it's terrible at hiding.
#. column 2: Noko noko!
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:207:0:3"
msgid "Noko Smile"
msgstr "Улыбка Ноко"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のHPを、100回復する。味方のタイプが「モンスター」の場合は、HPが150回復する。
#. de: Regeneriert bei den eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe 100 LP, im Fall von Monstern 150.
