msgstr "Восстанавливает 100 HP всем союзникам в радиусе действия (150, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>монстр</ui-edge-color></ui-color>)."

#. ja: ミニオン「オロチ」を呼び出す。<br>妖怪ワールドのエリート妖怪。実力はトップクラス
#. de: Du rufst deinen Viptor-Begleiter mit einem ausgefallenen Schal herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Octorgone. Ce petit personnage à l'étrange écharpe est l'un des plus puissants Yo-kai qui soient.
#. column 1: An elite Yo-kai who fights with his dragon scarf.
#. column 2: Hmph...!
#. column 3: Octo Snake
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 100 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:208:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Venoct minion. All of his abilities are truly first class."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Венокта. Все его способности и впрямь высшего класса."

#. ja: 自分のオーラで作り出した龍のマフラーを使って戦う、妖怪ワールドのエリート妖怪。その実力は、すべてにおいてトップクラス
#. de: Ein Elite-Yo-kai mit einem Drachenschal. All seine Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten sind wirklich erstklassig.
#. fr: Ce garçon appartient à l'élite des Yo-kai, notamment grâce à la manière qu'il a de se battre avec l'écharpe en forme de dragon créée par son aura.
#. column 0: Summon your Venoct minion. All of his abilities are truly first class.
#. column 2: Hmph...!
#. column 3: Octo Snake
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 100 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:208:0:1"
msgid "An elite Yo-kai who fights with his dragon scarf."
msgstr "Элитный ёкай, сражающийся шарфом в виде дракона."

#. ja: フン…！
#. de: Hmpf ...!
#. fr: Tsss<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Venoct minion. All of his abilities are truly first class.
#. column 1: An elite Yo-kai who fights with his dragon scarf.
#. column 3: Octo Snake
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 100 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:208:0:2"
msgid "Hmph...!"
msgstr "Хм...!"

#. ja: やまたのおろち
#. de: Achtköpfige Schlange
#. fr: Octoreptile
#. column 0: Summon your Venoct minion. All of his abilities are truly first class.
#. column 1: An elite Yo-kai who fights with his dragon scarf.
#. column 2: Hmph...!
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 100 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:208:0:3"
msgid "Octo Snake"
msgstr "Змей восьмиглавый"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK100のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 100 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 100 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
