msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 100 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 100."

#. ja: ミニオン「ブシニャン」を呼び出す。<br>ジバニャンのご先祖さま。何でも真っ二つ斬り！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Shogunyan-Begleiter herbei. Seine prächtige Samurai-Rüstung riecht etwas nach rohem Thunfisch.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Shogunyan. Cet ancêtre du Yo-kai Jibanyan est un redoutable guerrier capable de trancher n'importe quel ennemi avec son sabre.
#. column 1: This Yo-kai is Jibanyan's legendary warrior ancestor. He just loves skipjack tuna and carries it around in his armor.
#. column 2: Heart of a Warrior!
