msgid "Heart of a Warrior!"
msgstr "Сердце воина!"

#. ja: かつおブシ斬り
#. de: Samurai-Stakkato
#. fr: Chatana
#. column 0: Summon your Shogunyan minion. This legendary warrior's armor smells faintly of tuna.
#. column 1: This Yo-kai is Jibanyan's legendary warrior ancestor. He just loves skipjack tuna and carries it around in his armor.
