#. ja: ミニオン「フユニャン」を呼び出す。<br>浮遊霊のネコ妖怪。額のキズは名誉の負傷
#. de: Du rufst deinen superheldigen Hovernyan-Begleiter herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Hovernyan. Ce chat Yo-kai volant porte sur son front une blessure reçue au combat.
#. column 1: Although he is floating, he is actually very down-to-earth. The white mark on his forehead is an honorable battle scar.
#. column 2: I've got your back!
#. column 3: Gusty Cross Paw
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:210:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Hovernyan minion. He may be a wanderer, but he's actually quite dependable."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Ховерньяна. Он, может, и скиталец, но на него можно положиться."

#. ja: 浮遊霊のネコ妖怪。地面から少し浮いているが性格は、地に足が着いており、とっても頼りになる。額のキズは名誉の負傷
#. de: Obwohl er ständig schwebt, ist er eigentlich ziemlich bodenständig. Das weiße Zeichen auf seiner Stirn ist eine Kampfnarbe.
#. fr: Bien qu'il flotte dans les airs, ce Yo-kai félin a bien les pattes sur terre et est quelqu'un sur qui on peut compter. Il tire une grande fierté de la cicatrice qu'il porte au front et qu'il a reçue lors d'un combat.
#. column 0: Summon your Hovernyan minion. He may be a wanderer, but he's actually quite dependable.
#. column 2: I've got your back!
#. column 3: Gusty Cross Paw
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:210:0:1"
msgid "Although he is floating, he is actually very down-to-earth. The white mark on his forehead is an honorable battle scar."
msgstr "Парящий кот-ёкай. Хоть он и летает над землёй, характер у него приземлённый — на него всегда можно положиться. Белый след на лбу — почётная боевая рана."

#. ja: いくゼ！
#. de: Ich halt dir den Rücken frei!
#. fr: Je te couvre<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Hovernyan minion. He may be a wanderer, but he's actually quite dependable.
#. column 1: Although he is floating, he is actually very down-to-earth. The white mark on his forehead is an honorable battle scar.
#. column 3: Gusty Cross Paw
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:210:0:2"
msgid "I've got your back!"
msgstr "Я прикрою!"

#. ja: ど根性ストレート肉球
#. de: Power-Pfote
#. fr: Aplanissement
#. column 0: Summon your Hovernyan minion. He may be a wanderer, but he's actually quite dependable.
#. column 1: Although he is floating, he is actually very down-to-earth. The white mark on his forehead is an honorable battle scar.
#. column 2: I've got your back!
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:210:0:3"
msgid "Gusty Cross Paw"
msgstr "Могучая перекрёстная лапа"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Hovernyan minion. He may be a wanderer, but he's actually quite dependable.
#. column 1: Although he is floating, he is actually very down-to-earth. The white mark on his forehead is an honorable battle scar.
#. column 2: I've got your back!
#. column 3: Gusty Cross Paw
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:210:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「ロボニャンＦ型」を呼び出す。<br>グレードアップ版として開発されたという、最新型のロボニャン
#. de: Du rufst deinen Robonyan Type-F-Begleiter herbei. Die Gold<shy>schmiede<shy>gilde würde ihn zu gerne mal auseinandernehmen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Robonyan F-Type. Ce chat-robot serait la version améliorée d'un autre modèle et semble en être par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement fier.
#. column 1: An upgraded model of Robonyan, he removed all of his unnecessary functions to become the perfect robot cat.
#. column 2: Activating Sleep Mode...
#. column 3: I'll Be Blast
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:211:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Robonyan F-type minion. It's an upgraded robot that thinks it's a cat."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Робоняна F-типа. Это усовершенствованный робот, который считает себя котом."

#. ja: グレードアップ版として開発されたという、最新型のロボニャン。ムダな機能をすべて排除し、美しいフォルムを実現した
#. de: Ein verbessertes Modell von Robonyan, das all seine unnötigen Funktionen entfernt hat, um die perfekte Roboterkatze zu werden.
#. fr: Ce Yo-kai mécanique est un modèle amélioré de celui appelé Robonyan, auquel toutes les fonctions inutiles ont été retirées et dont l'apparence a été améliorée pour devenir le chat-robot parfait.
#. column 0: Summon your Robonyan F-type minion. It's an upgraded robot that thinks it's a cat.
#. column 2: Activating Sleep Mode...
#. column 3: I'll Be Blast
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:211:0:1"
msgid "An upgraded model of Robonyan, he removed all of his unnecessary functions to become the perfect robot cat."
msgstr "Усовершенствованная модель Робоняна. Из неё убрали все лишние функции, чтобы получился идеальный кот-робот."

#. ja: セツデンチュウ…
#. de: Energiesparmodus an ...
#. fr: Mode Sommeil activé<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Robonyan F-type minion. It's an upgraded robot that thinks it's a cat.
#. column 1: An upgraded model of Robonyan, he removed all of his unnecessary functions to become the perfect robot cat.
#. column 3: I'll Be Blast
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:211:0:2"
msgid "Activating Sleep Mode..."
msgstr "Включаю спящий режим..."

#. ja: アイルビー自バーック
#. de: Selbstzerstörung
#. fr: Autodestruction
#. column 0: Summon your Robonyan F-type minion. It's an upgraded robot that thinks it's a cat.
#. column 1: An upgraded model of Robonyan, he removed all of his unnecessary functions to become the perfect robot cat.
#. column 2: Activating Sleep Mode...
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:211:0:3"
msgid "I'll Be Blast"
msgstr "Я буду взрываться"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK300のダメージを与える。ただし、特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンは強制帰還する。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 300 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus, aber die ausführenden Trabanten werden weggeschickt.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 300 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT sont au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment renvoyées.
#. column 0: Summon your Robonyan F-type minion. It's an upgraded robot that thinks it's a cat.
#. column 1: An upgraded model of Robonyan, he removed all of his unnecessary functions to become the perfect robot cat.
#. column 2: Activating Sleep Mode...
#. column 3: I'll Be Blast
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:211:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 300. После применения миньоны, потратившие очки особых приёмов, немедленно возвращаются."

#. ja: ミニオン「ＵＳＡピョン」を呼び出す。<br>外国からやって来た妖怪
#. de: Du rufst deinen Usapyon-Begleiter herbei. Was ist das nur für ein rätselhafter Gegenstand in seiner Hand?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Usapyon. Ce Yo-kai serait originaire d'une contrée différente des autres, située en Occident.
#. column 1: A Yo-kai from across the sea, USApyon hopes to someday venture into space. He uses Vader mode when he is angry.
#. column 2: Shoot!
#. column 3: Bunny Beam
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:212:0:0"
msgid "Summon your USApyon minion. A Yo-kai who aims for the moon."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Усапёна. Ёкай, который метит к звёздам."

#. ja: 海の向こうの外国からやってきた妖怪。いつか宇宙を旅するのが夢。怒りが頂点に達すると、ベイダーモードに変身する
#. de: Usapyon hofft, eines Tages ins Weltall reisen zu können. Wenn er böse wird, zeigt er seine dunkle Seite.
#. fr: Originaire d'une lointaine contrée occidentale, ce Yo-kai nourrit le secret espoir de pouvoir un jour aller dans l'espace. Lorsque sa colère atteint son paroxysme, il déclenche son mode Vador.
#. column 0: Summon your USApyon minion. A Yo-kai who aims for the moon.
#. column 2: Shoot!
#. column 3: Bunny Beam
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:212:0:1"
msgid "A Yo-kai from across the sea, USApyon hopes to someday venture into space. He uses Vader mode when he is angry."
msgstr "Усапён — ёкай из-за моря, мечтающий однажды отправиться в космос. Когда он злится, то переходит в режим Вейдера."

#. ja: ダニ！！
#. de: Vermümmelt!
#. fr: Tir à vue<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your USApyon minion. A Yo-kai who aims for the moon.
#. column 1: A Yo-kai from across the sea, USApyon hopes to someday venture into space. He uses Vader mode when he is angry.
#. column 3: Bunny Beam
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:212:0:2"
msgid "Shoot!"
msgstr "Стреляй!"

#. ja: 極太ＵＳＡビーム
#. de: Megamümmelstrahl
#. fr: Lapinou Rayon
#. column 0: Summon your USApyon minion. A Yo-kai who aims for the moon.
#. column 1: A Yo-kai from across the sea, USApyon hopes to someday venture into space. He uses Vader mode when he is angry.
#. column 2: Shoot!
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:212:0:3"
msgid "Bunny Beam"
msgstr "Зайчик-луч"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your USApyon minion. A Yo-kai who aims for the moon.
#. column 1: A Yo-kai from across the sea, USApyon hopes to someday venture into space. He uses Vader mode when he is angry.
#. column 2: Shoot!
#. column 3: Bunny Beam
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:212:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「ネミングウェイ」を呼び出す。<br>伝説の放浪者を模した魔法人形。あだ名をつけるのが得意
#. de: Du rufst deine Namingway-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie ist einem Helden vergangener Zeiten nachempfunden.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée Namingway, con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>née à l'image d'un vagabond légendaire qui avait le chic pour trouver des surnoms.
#. column 1: While it is whispered that this cheerful vagrant is the sole surviving member of a tribe hailing from none other than the moon, most see Namingway for who he is─a queer fellow with a penchant for giving all he meets absurd nicknames then jotting them down in his mysterious journal.
#. column 2: I do not expect all moogles<br>to be well versed in<br>Roegadyn naming conventions.<br>   - Klynthota
#. column 3: Hummingway
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:214:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Namingway minion. Do not think this means you can now change your character name."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Неймингвея. Только не думайте, что теперь сможете сменить имя персонажа."

#. ja: 伝説の放浪者「ネミングウェイ」を模した魔法人形。月に住む風変わりな民の生き残りとも言われ、各地を旅しながら出会った者に片端から「あだ名」を付けていくらしい。手にした書物には、命名した者たちの名が記されている
#. de: Eine Puppe des legendären Wanderers Namingway. Es heißt, dass er von einem seltsamen Volk abstammt, das auf dem Mond lebt. Er reist durch die Welt und liebt es, den Leuten, denen er begegnet, Spitznamen anzugedenken. In seinem dicken Notizbuch sind sie alle vermerkt.
#. fr: Selon certains, il serait un survivant du peuple de la Lune. Ce qui est sûr, c'est qu'il ne peut pas s'empêcher de donner des surnoms à tous ceux qu'il rencontre sur sa route. Il ne sort jamais sans son livre dans lequel il consigne tous ces nouveaux noms.
#. column 0: Summon your Namingway minion. Do not think this means you can now change your character name.
#. column 2: I do not expect all moogles<br>to be well versed in<br>Roegadyn naming conventions.<br>   - Klynthota
#. column 3: Hummingway
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:214:0:1"
msgid "While it is whispered that this cheerful vagrant is the sole surviving member of a tribe hailing from none other than the moon, most see Namingway for who he is─a queer fellow with a penchant for giving all he meets absurd nicknames then jotting them down in his mysterious journal."
msgstr "Говорят, этот весёлый бродяга — последний выживший из племени с Луны. Но большинство знает Неймингвея как чудаковатого типа, который даёт всем встречным нелепые прозвища и записывает их в загадочный дневник."

#. ja: ゴーイングマイウェイ！
#. de: Going-my-way!<br><i>Namingway</i>
#. fr: Going-My-Way !
#. column 0: Summon your Namingway minion. Do not think this means you can now change your character name.
#. column 1: While it is whispered that this cheerful vagrant is the sole surviving member of a tribe hailing from none other than the moon, most see Namingway for who he is─a queer fellow with a penchant for giving all he meets absurd nicknames then jotting them down in his mysterious journal.
#. column 3: Hummingway
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:214:0:2"
msgid "I do not expect all moogles<br>to be well versed in<br>Roegadyn naming conventions.<br>   - Klynthota"
msgstr "Не жду, что все муги<br>разбираются в обычаях<br>имён рогадинов.<br>   — Клинтота"

#. ja: ハミングウェイ
#. de: Hummingway
#. fr: Hummingway
#. column 0: Summon your Namingway minion. Do not think this means you can now change your character name.
#. column 1: While it is whispered that this cheerful vagrant is the sole surviving member of a tribe hailing from none other than the moon, most see Namingway for who he is─a queer fellow with a penchant for giving all he meets absurd nicknames then jotting them down in his mysterious journal.
#. column 2: I do not expect all moogles<br>to be well versed in<br>Roegadyn naming conventions.<br>   - Klynthota
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:214:0:3"
msgid "Hummingway"
msgstr "Хаммингвей"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方にかかっている、弱体効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle negativen Effekte von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe toutes les altérations d'état des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Namingway minion. Do not think this means you can now change your character name.
#. column 1: While it is whispered that this cheerful vagrant is the sole surviving member of a tribe hailing from none other than the moon, most see Namingway for who he is─a queer fellow with a penchant for giving all he meets absurd nicknames then jotting them down in his mysterious journal.
#. column 2: I do not expect all moogles<br>to be well versed in<br>Roegadyn naming conventions.<br>   - Klynthota
#. column 3: Hummingway
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:214:0:4"
msgid "Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все негативные эффекты со всех союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「ミニアレキサンダー」を呼び出す。<br>「青の手」が開発した縮小実験機。そこに脚があったのか！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Mini-Alexander als Begleiter herbei. Die Ingenieure der Indigohand haben eine Vielzahl dieser Miniaturen als Modell für die Konstruktion des Kolosses hergestellt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Alexander articulé. Il semble même plus détaillé que le vrai.
#. column 1: At first dismissed as a quaint oddity, it has recently been discovered that the Illuminati use this fully functional replica of the primal Alexander to educate young goblins in the fields of metallurgy and engineering.
#. column 2: From what I understand, this<br>“Alexander” was active for no<br>more than a few seconds.<br>   - Biggs
#. column 3: Rise Up
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:215:0:0"
msgid "Summon your toy Alexander minion. A special something for all good Illuminati gobs and girls."
msgstr "Призвать игрушечного миньона Александра. Подарок всем хорошим гоблинам из Иллюминатов."

#. ja: 「青の手」が機工城の構造を学ぶために開発した教育的縮小実験機。この機体を見た者すべてが、一様に「そこに脚があったのか！」と驚くことから、教育的価値は非常に高いと思われる。素早く動く様には、どこか恐怖を感じる
#. de: An diesem Modell des Maschinen-Primae aus der Fertigung der Indigohand kann man sehr viel lernen. Alle Teile sind für die Ausbildung der Ingenieure exakt nachgebildet. Und Neulinge sind verblüfft, endlich auch Alexanders Beine zu sehen!
#. fr: Développé par la Main indigo afin d'en apprendre plus sur sa structure, les gens s'étonnent encore de son niveau de détails. Sa faculté à se déplacer rapidement en effrayera cependant plus d'un.
#. column 0: Summon your toy Alexander minion. A special something for all good Illuminati gobs and girls.
#. column 2: From what I understand, this<br>“Alexander” was active for no<br>more than a few seconds.<br>   - Biggs
#. column 3: Rise Up
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:215:0:1"
msgid "At first dismissed as a quaint oddity, it has recently been discovered that the Illuminati use this fully functional replica of the primal Alexander to educate young goblins in the fields of metallurgy and engineering."
msgstr "Сначала эту куклу считали просто занятной безделушкой. Но недавно выяснилось, что Иллюминаты используют её — полностью рабочую копию праймала Александра — чтобы учить юных гоблинов металлургии и инженерному делу."

#. ja: シャカシャカシャカ…
#. de: Und die Ursache ist wieder mal unser Freund Alexander.<br><i>Cid</i>
#. fr: Schklink Schklonk  !
#. column 0: Summon your toy Alexander minion. A special something for all good Illuminati gobs and girls.
#. column 1: At first dismissed as a quaint oddity, it has recently been discovered that the Illuminati use this fully functional replica of the primal Alexander to educate young goblins in the fields of metallurgy and engineering.
#. column 3: Rise Up
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
