#. ja: ミニオン「うり坊」を呼び出す。<br>ワイルドボアの幼獣。突進力は大人並み！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Frischling als Begleiter herbei. Dieses Wildschweinjunge haut den stärksten Roegadyn aus den Latschen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte marcassin. Ce petit sanglier sauvage n'a pas froid aux yeux et n'hésite pas à charger comme les grands.
#. column 1: The orphaned offspring of one of the many wild boars that inhabit the deep ravines of Xelphatol. Having lost its mother, the tiny beast seeks someone of unmatched strength and boundless courage to teach it the ways of survival. Until that someone is found, you will do most nicely.
#. column 2: He is a giant amongst boars,<br>unrivaled in strength and savagery,<br>and ruler over all his kind.<br>   - Ywain
#. column 3: Are You My Mother
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 9s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:216:0:0"
msgid "Summon your shaggy shoat minion. This adorable piglet will gore your heart and leave you yearning for more."
msgstr "Призвать лохматого поросёнка-миньона. Этот милашка пронзит вам сердце — и вы захотите ещё!"

#. ja: ワイルドボアの幼獣。ゼルファトルの大渓谷地帯に棲んでいたが、武者修行の旅に出ることを決意し、冒険者の背を追い始めた。将来は立派な「猪武者」になりたいらしく、猪突猛進を繰り返している。その突進力は既に大人並み
#. de: Ein gar nicht so wilder Keiler aus den zerklüfteten Schluchten von Xelphatol. Vor einiger Zeit begab er sich auf Ritterfahrt, wo er sich einem Abenteurer anschloss, und übt nun fleißig den wildschweinhaft-rücksichtslosen Ansturm.
#. fr: Ce marcassin menait une vie paisible dans sa bauge des vallées de Xelphatol, jusqu'au jour où il prit la décision de suivre un aventurier pour devenir aussi téméraire que ses pairs. Il s'entraîne sans relâche à per<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>ner sa charge porcine déjà im<shy>pres<shy>sion<shy>nante.
#. column 0: Summon your shaggy shoat minion. This adorable piglet will gore your heart and leave you yearning for more.
#. column 2: He is a giant amongst boars,<br>unrivaled in strength and savagery,<br>and ruler over all his kind.<br>   - Ywain
#. column 3: Are You My Mother
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 9s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:216:0:1"
msgid "The orphaned offspring of one of the many wild boars that inhabit the deep ravines of Xelphatol. Having lost its mother, the tiny beast seeks someone of unmatched strength and boundless courage to teach it the ways of survival. Until that someone is found, you will do most nicely."
msgstr "Осиротевший детёныш одного из диких кабанов, обитающих в глубоких ущельях Кселфатола. Потеряв мать, он ищет кого-нибудь сильного и отважного, кто научит его выживать. Пока такой наставник не найдётся, сгодишься и ты."

#. ja: トテトテトテトテ
#. de: Haldrath hätte diese Sauerei nicht gutgeheißen!<br><i>Tempelritter</i>
#. fr: Clop clop clop !
#. column 0: Summon your shaggy shoat minion. This adorable piglet will gore your heart and leave you yearning for more.
#. column 1: The orphaned offspring of one of the many wild boars that inhabit the deep ravines of Xelphatol. Having lost its mother, the tiny beast seeks someone of unmatched strength and boundless courage to teach it the ways of survival. Until that someone is found, you will do most nicely.
#. column 3: Are You My Mother
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 9s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:216:0:2"
msgid "He is a giant amongst boars,<br>unrivaled in strength and savagery,<br>and ruler over all his kind.<br>   - Ywain"
msgstr "Среди кабанов он — великан,<br>равных ему нет ни в силе,<br>ни в свирепости, он — царь<br>всего кабаньего рода.<br>   — Ивейн"

#. ja: 猪突猛進
#. de: Wilder Ansturm
#. fr: Charge porcine
#. column 0: Summon your shaggy shoat minion. This adorable piglet will gore your heart and leave you yearning for more.
#. column 1: The orphaned offspring of one of the many wild boars that inhabit the deep ravines of Xelphatol. Having lost its mother, the tiny beast seeks someone of unmatched strength and boundless courage to teach it the ways of survival. Until that someone is found, you will do most nicely.
