#. ja: ミニオン「ニュー・サンクレッド」を呼び出す。<br>サンクレッドを模した魔法人形。ワイルドになって帰ってきた
#. de: Du rufst deine neue Thancred-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Der Aufenthalt im Äther hat ihn irgendwie noch draufgängerischer gemacht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte nouveau Thancred miniature. Il porte maintenant un bandeau cachant son œil gauche et a adopté un style plus sauvage depuis qu'il est revenu du flux éthéré.
#. column 1: Several moons in the wild, removed from civilization and forced to adopt a more bestial means of survival transformed not only Thancred's body, but his mind. Due to the limitations of clockwork technology, this automaton only depicts those changes to the former.
#. column 2: I say, did you not see Thancred<br>anywhere? I'm beginning to fear<br>for the fellow...<br>   - Papalymo
#. column 3: Going Commando
#. column 4: Reduces movement speed of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:217:0:0"
msgid "Summon your dress-up Thancred minion. Take a walk on Thancred's wild side...but with fewer nutkins."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Танкрада в новом образе. Погуляйте по дикой стороне Танкрада... только без грызунов."

#. ja: サンクレッドを模した魔法人形。高地ドラヴァニアでのサバイバル生活を経て、ワイルドになって帰ってきた姿を再現している。ヴァスの塚のグナース族と取引して得た装束もよく似合っている。相棒はナッツイーター
#. de: Wilder, härter, stärker. Diese Puppe spiegelt die Entwicklung wider, die Thancred aufgrund seiner einschneidenden Erlebnisse im dravanischen Vorland durchgemacht hat. Die Kleidung der Gnath steht ihm ausgezeichnet. Sein niedlicher Nussfresser ist stets an seiner Seite.
#. fr: Après son long séjour passé à survivre dans l'Avant-pays dravanien, Thancred a obtenu de nouveaux vêtements très seyants en faisant du troc avec les Gnathes de Loth ast Vath. Il a par ailleurs sympathisé avec un écureuil grignoteur.
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Thancred minion. Take a walk on Thancred's wild side...but with fewer nutkins.
#. column 2: I say, did you not see Thancred<br>anywhere? I'm beginning to fear<br>for the fellow...<br>   - Papalymo
#. column 3: Going Commando
#. column 4: Reduces movement speed of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:217:0:1"
msgid "Several moons in the wild, removed from civilization and forced to adopt a more bestial means of survival transformed not only Thancred's body, but his mind. Due to the limitations of clockwork technology, this automaton only depicts those changes to the former."
msgstr "Несколько лун в дикой глуши вдали от цивилизации, где приходилось жить по-звериному, изменили не только тело Танкрада, но и его разум. Увы, заводной механизм способен передать лишь внешние перемены."

#. ja: サバイバル！
#. de: Es war ein harter Kampf ums Überleben.<br><i>Thancred</i>
#. fr: La survie, ça me connaît !
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Thancred minion. Take a walk on Thancred's wild side...but with fewer nutkins.
#. column 1: Several moons in the wild, removed from civilization and forced to adopt a more bestial means of survival transformed not only Thancred's body, but his mind. Due to the limitations of clockwork technology, this automaton only depicts those changes to the former.
#. column 3: Going Commando
#. column 4: Reduces movement speed of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:217:0:2"
msgid "I say, did you not see Thancred<br>anywhere? I'm beginning to fear<br>for the fellow...<br>   - Papalymo"
msgstr "Скажите, вы нигде не видели Танкрада?<br>Я уже начинаю за него беспокоиться...<br>   — Папалимо"

#. ja: サバイバルテクニック
#. de: Der Weg nach Hause
#. fr: Technique de survie
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Thancred minion. Take a walk on Thancred's wild side...but with fewer nutkins.
#. column 1: Several moons in the wild, removed from civilization and forced to adopt a more bestial means of survival transformed not only Thancred's body, but his mind. Due to the limitations of clockwork technology, this automaton only depicts those changes to the former.
