#. ja: ミニオン「ニュー・アリゼー」を呼び出す。<br>アリゼーを模した魔法人形。見分けが付きやすくなっている
#. de: Du rufst deine neue Alisaie-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Jetzt sollte es dir etwas leichter fallen, sie von ihrem Bruder zu unterscheiden.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte nouvelle Alisaie miniature. On ne la confond plus avec la miniature de son frère jumeau grâce à ses nouveaux vêtements.
#. column 1: After finding that she could simply not tell her wind-up Alisaie and Alphinaud automata apart, Tataru went about modifying the former's garments, creating something both new and bold...all while keeping manufacturing costs at an absolute minimum!
#. column 2: Is it just my imagination,<br>or is Alisaie staring daggers<br>at me?<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Emery-thing I Do
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:218:0:0"
msgid "Summon your dress-up Alisaie minion. Now 120% more discernable from the wind-up Alphinaud minion."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Ализе в новом наряде. Теперь её на 120% проще отличить от заводного Альфино."

#. ja: アリゼーを模した魔法人形。いつかアリゼーが帰還した時に備え、ひそかにタタルが作っていたもの。新たな衣装のデザインを考えるのに、手元にあったマメットを着飾って練習していたらしい。製造コストが安いのが最高
#. de: Eine der zahlreichen Puppen, die Tataru anfertigte, um neue Kleider für Alisaie zu entwerfen<nbsp>- nur für den Fall, dass sie einmal zurückkommen würde. Sie wirkt reifer, weiser und keineswegs mehr wehrlos!
#. fr: Tataru, n'ayant jamais douté du retour d'Alisaie, lui avait tissé de nouveaux vêtements. Pour ce faire elle avait commencé par con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>ner un modèle à taille réduite avant de sauter le pas. Rien de tel pour réduire les coûts de production !
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Alisaie minion. Now 120% more discernable from the wind-up Alphinaud minion.
#. column 2: Is it just my imagination,<br>or is Alisaie staring daggers<br>at me?<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Emery-thing I Do
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:218:0:1"
msgid "After finding that she could simply not tell her wind-up Alisaie and Alphinaud automata apart, Tataru went about modifying the former's garments, creating something both new and bold...all while keeping manufacturing costs at an absolute minimum!"
msgstr "Татару никак не удавалось отличить заводных Ализе и Альфино друг от друга. Тогда она переделала одежду первой — получилось нечто новое и смелое... и обошлось совсем недорого!"

#. ja: 私ニ力ヲ貸シテ！
#. de: Ich bin das Schwert Eorzeas!<br><i>Alisaie</i>
#. fr: Prêtez-moi main-forte !
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Alisaie minion. Now 120% more discernable from the wind-up Alphinaud minion.
#. column 1: After finding that she could simply not tell her wind-up Alisaie and Alphinaud automata apart, Tataru went about modifying the former's garments, creating something both new and bold...all while keeping manufacturing costs at an absolute minimum!
#. column 3: Emery-thing I Do
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:218:0:2"
msgid "Is it just my imagination,<br>or is Alisaie staring daggers<br>at me?<br>   - Alphinaud"
msgstr "Мне кажется,<br>или Ализе прожигает меня<br>взглядом?<br>   — Альфино"

#. ja: エメリーのために
#. de: Für Emery
#. fr: Pour Emery
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Alisaie minion. Now 120% more discernable from the wind-up Alphinaud minion.
#. column 1: After finding that she could simply not tell her wind-up Alisaie and Alphinaud automata apart, Tataru went about modifying the former's garments, creating something both new and bold...all while keeping manufacturing costs at an absolute minimum!
#. column 2: Is it just my imagination,<br>or is Alisaie staring daggers<br>at me?<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:218:0:3"
msgid "Emery-thing I Do"
msgstr "Ради Эмери"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンのATKを40上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>15秒
#. de: Erhöht die ATT der ausführenden Trabanten um 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 40 l'attaque des mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
