msgid "Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s"
msgstr "Повышает атаку миньонов, потративших очки особых приёмов, на 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・エッダ」を呼び出す。<br>エッダを模した魔法人形。あの出来事を忘れないために……
#. de: Du rufst deine Edda-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie ist ein Symbol für alle gefallenen Kameraden - und die, die ihren Fall zu verantworten haben.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Edda miniature. Ce pantin reproduit les traits d'Edda Cœur-noir après sa chute dans les abysses. Il a été con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>né dans l'espoir de ne jamais oublier les tristes événements passés.
#. column 1: While not confirmed, it is thought this eerily lifelike replica of Edda Blackbosom was created by a former companion of the now-deceased(?) adventurer. Those who have possessed the dark fetish assert that its hair grows at night when no one is looking.
#. column 2: Edda, you're so slow, you'd<br>lose a footrace to a tree slug.<br>   - Liavinne
#. column 3: Dead Weight
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:219:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Edda minion. Because true love never dies."
msgstr "Призвать заводного миньона Эдду. Ведь настоящая любовь не умирает."

#. ja: 漆黒のエッダを模した魔法人形。とある呪術士が、かつての仲間を供養するために作ったらしい。久しぶりに見てみると、髪の毛が伸びている気がすることがあるのは、やっぱり気のせいということにしておこう。そうしよう
#. de: Eine düstere Nachbildung der unglückseligen Edda. Ein gewisser Thaumaturg hat sie einst angefertigt, um sie im Gedenken an seine verschwundene Kameradin darzubringen. Man hat irgendwie den Eindruck, dass ihre Haare stetig länger werden ...
#. fr: Un certain occultiste a créé ce pantin en mémoire de son amie disparue. Ses cheveux ont l'air de s'être allongés depuis la dernière fois que vous l'avez sorti de sa malle. À mettre sur le compte de votre imagination... n'est-ce pas<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Edda minion. Because true love never dies.
#. column 2: Edda, you're so slow, you'd<br>lose a footrace to a tree slug.<br>   - Liavinne
#. column 3: Dead Weight
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:219:0:1"
msgid "While not confirmed, it is thought this eerily lifelike replica of Edda Blackbosom was created by a former companion of the now-deceased(?) adventurer. Those who have possessed the dark fetish assert that its hair grows at night when no one is looking."
msgstr "Хоть это и не подтверждено, считается, что пугающе живая копия Эдды Чёрной Груди создана бывшим спутником ныне покойной (?) авантюристки. Те, кому довелось владеть этой мрачной куклой, уверяют, что по ночам, когда никто не видит, её волосы растут."

#. ja: AVEREAVEREAVERE
#. de: AVEEERE!<br><i>Edda</i>
#. fr: AVEREAVEREAVERE<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Edda minion. Because true love never dies.
#. column 1: While not confirmed, it is thought this eerily lifelike replica of Edda Blackbosom was created by a former companion of the now-deceased(?) adventurer. Those who have possessed the dark fetish assert that its hair grows at night when no one is looking.
#. column 3: Dead Weight
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:219:0:2"
msgid "Edda, you're so slow, you'd<br>lose a footrace to a tree slug.<br>   - Liavinne"
msgstr "Эдда, ты такая медленная,<br>что проиграла бы улитке<br>забег вокруг дерева.<br>   — Лиавин"

#. ja: 愛の重み
#. de: Schuldgefühl
#. fr: Le fardeau de l'amour
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Edda minion. Because true love never dies.
#. column 1: While not confirmed, it is thought this eerily lifelike replica of Edda Blackbosom was created by a former companion of the now-deceased(?) adventurer. Those who have possessed the dark fetish assert that its hair grows at night when no one is looking.
