#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ユウナ」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。 迷わないって、決めたんだ……！
#. de: Du rufst deine Yuna-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Diese Heldin aus einer anderen Zeit wird nicht weichen ...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Yuna miniature, un pantin créé à l'image d'une héroïne des temps anciens.
#. column 1: Peoples of the Far East tell the tale of a beautiful summoner who embarked on a perilous journey to deliver restless souls to the afterlife and thus bring peace to the world. Her name was Yuna...
#. column 2: I'm ready!<br>   - Yuna
#. column 3: Way of the Summoner
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:220:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Yuna minion. “My will is strong!” So is this automaton's resistance to rust."
msgstr "Призвать заводного миньона Юны. «Я не сверну с пути!» Этот механизм тоже не ржавеет."

#. ja: 古の英雄「ユウナ」を模した魔法人形。 類い希な召喚士であったとも伝えられる彼女は、世に平和をもたらすために旅に出たという。どこかオリエンタルな衣装も非常に美しい。迷わないって、決めたんだ……！
#. de: Eine magische Puppe zum Gedenken an eine große Heldin vergangener Tage. Die Legende handelt von dem jungen Mädchen Yuna, das auszog, um ein Medium zu werden und der Welt Frieden zu bringen. Die orientalisch angehauchte Kleidung ist ein echter Hingucker!
#. fr: Un pantin créé à l'image de Yuna, une héroïne des temps anciens. On raconte qu'elle était un Invokeur hors du commun, partie en voyage afin d'apporter la paix sur le monde. Son magnifique costume ressemble aux vêtements portés dans les contrées d'Orient.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Yuna minion. “My will is strong!” So is this automaton's resistance to rust.
#. column 2: I'm ready!<br>   - Yuna
#. column 3: Way of the Summoner
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:220:0:1"
msgid "Peoples of the Far East tell the tale of a beautiful summoner who embarked on a perilous journey to deliver restless souls to the afterlife and thus bring peace to the world. Her name was Yuna..."
msgstr "На Дальнем Востоке рассказывают о прекрасной призывательнице, отправившейся в опасное путешествие, чтобы проводить мятежные души в загробный мир и принести покой всему миру. Её звали Юна..."

#. ja: ユウナ、入リマス！
#. de: Verliebe dich nicht in Yuna.<br><i>Lulu</i>
#. fr: Je suis prête<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Yuna minion. “My will is strong!” So is this automaton's resistance to rust.
#. column 1: Peoples of the Far East tell the tale of a beautiful summoner who embarked on a perilous journey to deliver restless souls to the afterlife and thus bring peace to the world. Her name was Yuna...
#. column 3: Way of the Summoner
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:220:0:2"
msgid "I'm ready!<br>   - Yuna"
msgstr "Я готова!<br>   — Юна"

#. ja: 召喚士の心得
#. de: Heilende Hand der Beschwörerin
#. fr: Credo de l'Invokeur
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Yuna minion. “My will is strong!” So is this automaton's resistance to rust.
#. column 1: Peoples of the Far East tell the tale of a beautiful summoner who embarked on a perilous journey to deliver restless souls to the afterlife and thus bring peace to the world. Her name was Yuna...
#. column 2: I'm ready!<br>   - Yuna
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:220:0:3"
msgid "Way of the Summoner"
msgstr "Путь призывателя"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のHPを、100回復する。味方のタイプが「ドール」の場合は、HPが150回復する。
#. de: Regeneriert bei den eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe 100 LP, im Fall von Puppen 150.
#. fr: Soigne 100 PV aux alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou 150 PV s'ils sont de type “Poupée”.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Yuna minion. “My will is strong!” So is this automaton's resistance to rust.
#. column 1: Peoples of the Far East tell the tale of a beautiful summoner who embarked on a perilous journey to deliver restless souls to the afterlife and thus bring peace to the world. Her name was Yuna...
#. column 2: I'm ready!<br>   - Yuna
#. column 3: Way of the Summoner
