msgctxt "CompanionTransient:220:0:4"
msgid "Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>)."
msgstr "Восстанавливает 100 HP всем союзникам в радиусе действия (150, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>кукла</ui-edge-color></ui-color>)."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・リュック」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。 な～んか燃えてきたぁ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Rikku-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie ist sich sicher: Wir werden gewinnen!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Rikku miniature, un pantin créé à l'image d'une héroïne des temps anciens.
#. column 1: Peoples of the Far East tell the tale of a plucky young lass with a fiery heart and questionable taste in finery who accompanied a summoner on her journey to bring peace to the world. That young lass's name was Rikku...
#. column 2: Bring it on!<br>   - Rikku
#. column 3: Mix
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:221:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Rikku minion. “Victory is ours!” This automaton is yours."
msgstr "Призвать заводного миньона Рикку. «Победа за нами!» А этот механизм — ваш."

#. ja: 古の英雄「リュック」を模した魔法人形。 かつてある召喚士を守るために、ガードとして旅に同行したと伝えられる。突然、何かを投げつける仕草をするのは、アイテムの使い手だったという彼女を再現したもの。 な～んか燃えてきたぁ！
#. de: Eine magische Puppe zum Gedenken an eine große Heldin vergangener Tage. Die Legende erzählt, wie Rikku ihr Leben riskierte, um das Medium Yuna zu beschützen. Dabei soll sie es mit den Habseligkeiten anderer Leute nicht allzu genau genommen haben.
#. fr: On raconte que cette héroïne choisit de devenir la gardienne d'une jeune Invokeur et l'accompagna lors de son voyage. La légende dit qu'elle avait toujours plus d'un tour dans son sac, tradition renforcée par le geste du pantin qui fouille dans sa besace avant de mimer un jet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Rikku minion. “Victory is ours!” This automaton is yours.
#. column 2: Bring it on!<br>   - Rikku
#. column 3: Mix
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:221:0:1"
msgid "Peoples of the Far East tell the tale of a plucky young lass with a fiery heart and questionable taste in finery who accompanied a summoner on her journey to bring peace to the world. That young lass's name was Rikku..."
msgstr "На Дальнем Востоке рассказывают о бойкой девушке с огненным сердцем и весьма сомнительным вкусом в одежде, которая сопровождала призывательницу в путешествии ради спасения мира. Звали её Рикку..."

#. ja: マッカセッナサーイ！
#. de: Iht fahh an tulr aeh Sahclr ecd?<br><i>Rikku</i>
#. fr: Laissez-moi faire<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Rikku minion. “Victory is ours!” This automaton is yours.
#. column 1: Peoples of the Far East tell the tale of a plucky young lass with a fiery heart and questionable taste in finery who accompanied a summoner on her journey to bring peace to the world. That young lass's name was Rikku...
#. column 3: Mix
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:221:0:2"
msgid "Bring it on!<br>   - Rikku"
msgstr "Ну давай, я готова!<br>   — Рикку"

#. ja: 調合
#. de: Mischung
#. fr: Alchimie
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Rikku minion. “Victory is ours!” This automaton is yours.
#. column 1: Peoples of the Far East tell the tale of a plucky young lass with a fiery heart and questionable taste in finery who accompanied a summoner on her journey to bring peace to the world. That young lass's name was Rikku...
#. column 2: Bring it on!<br>   - Rikku
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:221:0:3"
msgid "Mix"
msgstr "Смешивание"

#. ja: トラップを配置する。10秒後トラップ発動ボタンにより起爆可能。範囲内にいる敵にATK260のダメージを与える。
#. de: Stellt eine Falle auf, die nach 10 Sekunden ausgelöst werden kann. Bewirkt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 260 auf die Gegner in der Nähe.
#. fr: Place un piège qui peut être déclenché 10 secondes plus tard.<br>Piège<nbsp>: inflige des dégâts d'attaque 260 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
