msgid "Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
msgstr "Ставит ловушку, которую можно активировать через 10 секунд. При срабатывании наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 260.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Задержка активации:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ルールー」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。限界こえてあげようか
#. de: Du rufst deine Lulu-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie steht für Zauber ohne Grenzen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Lulu miniature, un pantin créé à l'image d'une héroïne des temps anciens.
#. column 1: Peoples of the Far East tell the tale of a powerful mage and master of puppets who would rain destruction down on any that might harm her companions as they made their journey to save the world. Her name was Lulu...
#. column 2: Let's see how tough you are.<br>   - Lulu
#. column 3: Black Magicks
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:222:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Lulu minion. “Magic has no limits.” Nor does the list of exciting things you can do with this automaton."
msgstr "Призвать заводного миньона Лулу. «Магия не знает границ». Как и список забав, которые можно устроить с этой куклой."

#. ja: 古の英雄「ルールー」を模した魔法人形。 優れた魔道士であり、人形使いでもあったとも語り継がれている彼女を再現するにあたり、さらに小さなマメットを仕込んである。まさに職人芸と言える仕上がりだ。限界こえてあげようか
#. de: Eine magische Puppe zum Gedenken an eine große Heldin vergangener Tage. Die Legende erzählt, wie sich Lulu der Leibgarde von Yuna anschloss und mit ihr gefährliche Abenteuer erlebte. Sie soll eine mächtige Magierin gewesen sein und magische Puppen kontrolliert haben.
#. fr: Bien que passée maîtresse dans l'art de la magie noire, cette héroïne se servait aussi d'une peluche au cours des combats. Cette dernière a bien sûr été elle aussi reproduite. Un exploit technique témoignant du talent de son créateur.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Lulu minion. “Magic has no limits.” Nor does the list of exciting things you can do with this automaton.
#. column 2: Let's see how tough you are.<br>   - Lulu
#. column 3: Black Magicks
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:222:0:1"
msgid "Peoples of the Far East tell the tale of a powerful mage and master of puppets who would rain destruction down on any that might harm her companions as they made their journey to save the world. Her name was Lulu..."
msgstr "На Дальнем Востоке рассказывают о могущественной волшебнице и мастерице кукол, которая обрушивала разрушительную магию на любого, кто угрожал её спутникам в путешествии ради спасения мира. Её звали Лулу..."

#. ja: 最後まで耐えられる？
#. de: Egal wie dunkel die Nacht, der Morgen kommt immer.<br><i>Lulu</i>
#. fr: Voyons ce que tu as dans le ventre.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Lulu minion. “Magic has no limits.” Nor does the list of exciting things you can do with this automaton.
#. column 1: Peoples of the Far East tell the tale of a powerful mage and master of puppets who would rain destruction down on any that might harm her companions as they made their journey to save the world. Her name was Lulu...
#. column 3: Black Magicks
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:222:0:2"
msgid "Let's see how tough you are.<br>   - Lulu"
msgstr "Посмотрим, как долго ты продержишься.<br>   — Лулу"

#. ja: 黒魔法
#. de: Schwarze Magie
#. fr: Magie noire
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Lulu minion. “Magic has no limits.” Nor does the list of exciting things you can do with this automaton.
#. column 1: Peoples of the Far East tell the tale of a powerful mage and master of puppets who would rain destruction down on any that might harm her companions as they made their journey to save the world. Her name was Lulu...
#. column 2: Let's see how tough you are.<br>   - Lulu
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:222:0:3"
msgid "Black Magicks"
msgstr "Чёрная магия"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Lulu minion. “Magic has no limits.” Nor does the list of exciting things you can do with this automaton.
#. column 1: Peoples of the Far East tell the tale of a powerful mage and master of puppets who would rain destruction down on any that might harm her companions as they made their journey to save the world. Her name was Lulu...
#. column 2: Let's see how tough you are.<br>   - Lulu
#. column 3: Black Magicks
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:222:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 90."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ムーンブリダ」を呼び出す。<br>ムーンブリダを模した魔法人形。野郎、逢いたかったぜ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Moenbryda-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie wird für immer einen Platz in den Herzen des Bunds der Morgenröte haben.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Moenbryda miniature. Ce pantin fait preuve d'une ressemblance si frappante qu'Urianger s'y tromperait... s'il la voyait de loin.
#. column 1: This finely detailed tribute to Moenbryda was crafted in secret by none other than Urianger following the untimely passing of his beloved companion. Though known for her warm and jovial nature, the resolve within this doll's eyes perhaps speaks to the strength he admired in her.
#. column 2: I shall allow no foe to harm<br>the lovely Moenbryda.<br>   - Thancred
#. column 3: Dual Haken
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 50%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:224:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Moenbryda minion. Destined to die a hero...and live on as a mechanized servitor."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — заводную Моэнбридду. Ей суждено погибнуть героем... и продолжить жить в виде механической куклы."

#. ja: ムーンブリダを模した魔法人形。ウリエンジェが、失って初めて気付かされた気持ちを整理するために、ひとりこっそりと作っていたものらしい。その顔が優しげな面持ちなのは、彼に見せていた素顔を模しているからなのだろう
#. de: Offen würde er es nie eingestehen, doch diese Puppe hat Urianger im Gedenken an seine ehemalige Kameradin Moenbryda angefertigt. Erst als er sie verlor, erkannte er, wie viel sie ihm bedeutet hatte. Ihr sanfter Ge<shy>sichts<shy>aus<shy>druck zeigt, dass Urianger ihr eigentliches Wesen kannte.
#. fr: Urianger a con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>né ce pantin en cachette suite à la disparition de Moenbryda. Il espérait ainsi mettre de l'ordre dans les sentiments qu'il avait ignorés jusqu'ici. L'expression chaleureuse sur son visage doit être celle qu'elle lui réservait.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Moenbryda minion. Destined to die a hero...and live on as a mechanized servitor.
#. column 2: I shall allow no foe to harm<br>the lovely Moenbryda.<br>   - Thancred
#. column 3: Dual Haken
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 50%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:224:0:1"
msgid "This finely detailed tribute to Moenbryda was crafted in secret by none other than Urianger following the untimely passing of his beloved companion. Though known for her warm and jovial nature, the resolve within this doll's eyes perhaps speaks to the strength he admired in her."
msgstr "Эту искусно выполненную куклу Моэнбридды тайком создал сам Урианже после безвременной гибели любимой подруги. Все знали её как добрую и весёлую, но решимость во взгляде куклы, возможно, напоминает о силе духа, которой он в ней восхищался."

#. ja: 野郎、逢イタカッタゼ！
#. de: Oh, Urianger! Wie ich dich vermisst habe!<br><i>Moenbryda</i>
#. fr: Où est-ce que tu te cachais, vieille canaille<nbsp>!?
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Moenbryda minion. Destined to die a hero...and live on as a mechanized servitor.
#. column 1: This finely detailed tribute to Moenbryda was crafted in secret by none other than Urianger following the untimely passing of his beloved companion. Though known for her warm and jovial nature, the resolve within this doll's eyes perhaps speaks to the strength he admired in her.
#. column 3: Dual Haken
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 50%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:224:0:2"
msgid "I shall allow no foe to harm<br>the lovely Moenbryda.<br>   - Thancred"
msgstr "Не позволю врагу обидеть<br>прекрасную Моэнбридду.<br>   — Танкрет"

#. ja: ダブルハーケン
#. de: Barbarenaxt
#. fr: Hache double
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Moenbryda minion. Destined to die a hero...and live on as a mechanized servitor.
#. column 1: This finely detailed tribute to Moenbryda was crafted in secret by none other than Urianger following the untimely passing of his beloved companion. Though known for her warm and jovial nature, the resolve within this doll's eyes perhaps speaks to the strength he admired in her.
#. column 2: I shall allow no foe to harm<br>the lovely Moenbryda.<br>   - Thancred
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 50%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:224:0:3"
msgid "Dual Haken"
msgstr "Двойной крюк"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のゲートに50%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Tor 50<nbsp>% Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls es schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 50% de sa solidité au portail ennemi le plus proche. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Moenbryda minion. Destined to die a hero...and live on as a mechanized servitor.
#. column 1: This finely detailed tribute to Moenbryda was crafted in secret by none other than Urianger following the untimely passing of his beloved companion. Though known for her warm and jovial nature, the resolve within this doll's eyes perhaps speaks to the strength he admired in her.
#. column 2: I shall allow no foe to harm<br>the lovely Moenbryda.<br>   - Thancred
#. column 3: Dual Haken
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:224:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 50%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable."
msgstr "Наносит 50% урона ближайшим вражеским воротам. Не действует, если ворота уже разрушены."

#. ja: ミニオン「コンチネンタルアイ」を呼び出す。<br>アーリマンの幼生体。サーカスに売られた悲しい過去を持つ
#. de: Du rufst dein Circus-Auge als Begleiter herbei. Es wurde schon als kleines Äuglein an den Circus Continental verkauft.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte œil du Cirque. Ce rejeton d'ahriman a un triste passé. Vendu au Cirque intercontinental, il était leur propriété avant de devenir votre compagnon.
#. column 1: Cursed with a weak vessel upon its arrival in the corporeal realm, this malformed and maladroit voidsent was summarily captured and put to work at the Continental Circus...until being sold for a handful of coin to a new owner─you.
#. column 2: The business of which I<br>speak involves keeping<br>an eye on that troublesome<br>troupe of entertainers.<br>   - Godriquelain
#. column 3: Single Gaze
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:225:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Continental eye minion. I see you. You see me."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Континентального Ока. Я вижу тебя. Ты видишь меня."

#. ja: アーリマンの幼生体。物質界に召喚されたはいいものの、あまりにもか弱い存在だったため、すぐに猟師に捕らえられてしまう。その後、コンチネンタル・サーカスに見世物として売られたという、悲しい過去を持っている
#. de: Ein sehr junger Ahriman, der in die Welt der Sterblichen beschworen wurde, doch so schwach war, dass er bald von einem Jäger gefangen wurde. Der Jäger verkaufte den kleinen Ahriman als Kuriosität an den Circus Continental.
#. fr: Alors qu'il allait enfin pouvoir goûter à l'air frais du monde matériel, ce rejeton d'ahriman encore bien trop chétif pour se défendre fut aussitôt capturé par un chasseur et vendu au Cirque intercontinental, qui l'exposa en spectacle de foire.
#. column 0: Summon your Continental eye minion. I see you. You see me.
#. column 2: The business of which I<br>speak involves keeping<br>an eye on that troublesome<br>troupe of entertainers.<br>   - Godriquelain
#. column 3: Single Gaze
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:225:0:1"
msgid "Cursed with a weak vessel upon its arrival in the corporeal realm, this malformed and maladroit voidsent was summarily captured and put to work at the Continental Circus...until being sold for a handful of coin to a new owner─you."
msgstr "Призванный в материальный мир в слишком слабом теле, этот неуклюжий уродец из Пустоты был тут же пойман и отправлен работать в Континентальный цирк... пока его не продали за пару монет новому хозяину — вам."

#. ja: チラリ…
#. de: Ich kann kaum noch meine Tränen zurückhalten.<br><i>Zagozz Teh</i>
#. fr: (scrute scrute)
#. column 0: Summon your Continental eye minion. I see you. You see me.
#. column 1: Cursed with a weak vessel upon its arrival in the corporeal realm, this malformed and maladroit voidsent was summarily captured and put to work at the Continental Circus...until being sold for a handful of coin to a new owner─you.
#. column 3: Single Gaze
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:225:0:2"
msgid "The business of which I<br>speak involves keeping<br>an eye on that troublesome<br>troupe of entertainers.<br>   - Godriquelain"
msgstr "Дело, о котором я<br>говорю, — присматривать<br>за этой скандальной<br>бродячей труппой.<br>   — Годриклен"

#. ja: ひとにらみ
#. de: Böser Blick
#. fr: Combat de regard
#. column 0: Summon your Continental eye minion. I see you. You see me.
#. column 1: Cursed with a weak vessel upon its arrival in the corporeal realm, this malformed and maladroit voidsent was summarily captured and put to work at the Continental Circus...until being sold for a handful of coin to a new owner─you.
#. column 2: The business of which I<br>speak involves keeping<br>an eye on that troublesome<br>troupe of entertainers.<br>   - Godriquelain
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:225:0:3"
msgid "Single Gaze"
msgstr "Один взгляд"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵にかかっている、強化効果をすべて打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle positiven Effekte von den gegnerischen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe tous les effets bénéfiques des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Continental eye minion. I see you. You see me.
#. column 1: Cursed with a weak vessel upon its arrival in the corporeal realm, this malformed and maladroit voidsent was summarily captured and put to work at the Continental Circus...until being sold for a handful of coin to a new owner─you.
#. column 2: The business of which I<br>speak involves keeping<br>an eye on that troublesome<br>troupe of entertainers.<br>   - Godriquelain
#. column 3: Single Gaze
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:225:0:4"
msgid "Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все положительные эффекты со всех противников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「ブルパピー」を呼び出す。<br>温厚すぎて落ちこぼれた軍用犬の幼獣
#. de: Du rufst deinen Bulldoggenwelpen als Begleiter herbei. Er war zu sanftmütig für die garleischen Streitkräfte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte chiot bulldog. Une petite boule de poils bien trop gentille et trop mimi pour achever l'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment destiné à en faire un chien de guerre.
#. column 1: The Garleans have a long history of canine breeding that extends far back into the nation's days as a republic. The intent of this practice is to produce fearless, loyal killing machines, and those that fail to display the desired traits are...discarded.
#. column 2: He may be a pup, but he'll<br>likely make a meal of anyone<br>what gets close to him.<br>   - R'kontai
#. column 3: Fighting Instinct
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:226:0:0"
msgid "Summon your bullpup minion. Runt of the canis pugnaces litter. "
msgstr "Призвать миньона бульдожки. Самый слабый щенок в помёте боевых псов."

#. ja: カストルム・オリエンスにて、軍用犬にするため飼育されていたものの、性格が温厚すぎて任を解かれた落ちこぼれた軍用犬の幼獣。魔獣と犬を闘わせる見世物のために帝国本国にて品種改良された犬種のため、本来は恐ろしく獰猛である
#. de: Dieser Welpe sollte im Castrum Oriens zu einem Militärhund ausgebildet werden, doch eigentlich wollte er immer nur schmusen, sodass der Ausbilder ihn aufgab.
#. fr: Ce chiot est le fruit d'un programme eugénique de l'empire de Garlemald visant à intégrer canidés et monstres aux bataillons. Il s'est cependant vite avéré manquer de férocité malgré son pedigree hors pair dès le premier jour de son en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment à Castrum Oriens.
#. column 0: Summon your bullpup minion. Runt of the canis pugnaces litter.
#. column 2: He may be a pup, but he'll<br>likely make a meal of anyone<br>what gets close to him.<br>   - R'kontai
#. column 3: Fighting Instinct
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:226:0:1"
msgid "The Garleans have a long history of canine breeding that extends far back into the nation's days as a republic. The intent of this practice is to produce fearless, loyal killing machines, and those that fail to display the desired traits are...discarded."
msgstr "Гарлеанцы разводят собак ещё со времён республики. Так они выводят бесстрашных и преданных машин для убийства. А тех, кто не проявляет нужных качеств... выбрасывают."

#. ja: バウバウ！
#. de: Er ist noch recht scheu und hat bestimmt Angst vor dir.<br><i>R'kontai</i>
#. fr: Ouaf ouaf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your bullpup minion. Runt of the canis pugnaces litter.
#. column 1: The Garleans have a long history of canine breeding that extends far back into the nation's days as a republic. The intent of this practice is to produce fearless, loyal killing machines, and those that fail to display the desired traits are...discarded.
#. column 3: Fighting Instinct
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:226:0:2"
msgid "He may be a pup, but he'll<br>likely make a meal of anyone<br>what gets close to him.<br>   - R'kontai"
msgstr "Он ещё щенок, но, пожалуй,<br>сожрёт любого, кто<br>подойдёт слишком близко.<br>   — Р’контай"

#. ja: 闘争本能
#. de: Kampfinstinkt
#. fr: Instinct combatif
#. column 0: Summon your bullpup minion. Runt of the canis pugnaces litter.
#. column 1: The Garleans have a long history of canine breeding that extends far back into the nation's days as a republic. The intent of this practice is to produce fearless, loyal killing machines, and those that fail to display the desired traits are...discarded.
#. column 2: He may be a pup, but he'll<br>likely make a meal of anyone<br>what gets close to him.<br>   - R'kontai
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:226:0:3"
msgid "Fighting Instinct"
msgstr "Боевой инстинкт"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方を、タイプ「モンスター」からの攻撃に対して無敵にする。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>5秒
#. de: Macht eigene Trabanten in der Nähe unempfindlich für Angriffe von Monstern.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5 Sekunden
#. fr: Rend les mascottes dans l'aire d'effet invulnérables aux attaques venant des ennemis de type “Monstre”.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. column 0: Summon your bullpup minion. Runt of the canis pugnaces litter.
#. column 1: The Garleans have a long history of canine breeding that extends far back into the nation's days as a republic. The intent of this practice is to produce fearless, loyal killing machines, and those that fail to display the desired traits are...discarded.
#. column 2: He may be a pup, but he'll<br>likely make a meal of anyone<br>what gets close to him.<br>   - R'kontai
#. column 3: Fighting Instinct
