msgid "Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s"
msgstr "Делает всех союзников в радиусе действия невосприимчивыми к атакам <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>монстров</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「レイズエンジェル」を呼び出す。<br>愛と癒やしを届ける天使人形
#. de: Du rufst deinen Liebesengel als Begleiter herbei. Er lässt die Herzen in Seligkeit schwelgen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte ange de la résurrection. Une poupée apaisante et pleine d'amour.
#. column 1: A missing tinker has recently returned to Ul'dah claiming to have been “rescued by an angel.” While most believe the man to merely be a recipient of a passerby mage's kindness, he has since dedicated his life to creating automata in the image of his heavenly savior.
#. column 2: <i>You</i> are the angel of beauty<br>who gave me my life and<br>stole away with my heart!<br>   - Hortefense
#. column 3: Raise Shields
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:227:0:0"
msgid "Summon your angel of mercy minion. Come and save me tonight."
msgstr "Призовите ангела-хранителя. Приди и спаси меня этой ночью."

#. ja: 愛と癒やしを届ける天使人形。気を失い戦闘不能状態になった者を蘇生させる魔法「レイズ」の体験者が、しばしば夢現の状態で見るという「天使らしき何か」を再現したもの。実在するか否かで、しばしば論争が巻き起こる
#. de: Dieser kleine Engel lindert nicht nur den Herz-<br>schmerz. Jeder Abenteurer, der auf dem Schlachtfeld bereits in die Verlegenheit gekommen ist, wiederbelebt werden zu müssen, hat schon einmal so einen Engel gesehen ... oder es sich zumindest eingebildet.
#. fr: Les aventuriers tombés au combat et en attente d'un sort de résurrection disent souvent avoir aperçu une silhouette angélique lors de leur errance dans les limbes. Cette poupée a été con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>née afin d'en reproduire les traits, mais on doute encore de ces témoignages.
#. column 0: Summon your angel of mercy minion. Come and save me tonight.
#. column 2: <i>You</i> are the angel of beauty<br>who gave me my life and<br>stole away with my heart!<br>   - Hortefense
#. column 3: Raise Shields
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:227:0:1"
msgid "A missing tinker has recently returned to Ul'dah claiming to have been “rescued by an angel.” While most believe the man to merely be a recipient of a passerby mage's kindness, he has since dedicated his life to creating automata in the image of his heavenly savior."
msgstr "Недавно пропавший мастер-кукольник вернулся в Ульду, заявив, что его «спас ангел». Большинство считает, что просто проходивший мимо маг проявил к нему доброту. Но с тех пор мастер посвятил жизнь созданию кукол, похожих на его небесную спасительницу."

#. ja: プイプイプイ、ピロリーン
#. de: Du bist die Heilige, die mir aus purer Herzensgüte das Leben gerettet hat!<br><i>Hortefense</i>
#. fr: Poui poui poui. Piririne<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your angel of mercy minion. Come and save me tonight.
#. column 1: A missing tinker has recently returned to Ul'dah claiming to have been “rescued by an angel.” While most believe the man to merely be a recipient of a passerby mage's kindness, he has since dedicated his life to creating automata in the image of his heavenly savior.
#. column 3: Raise Shields
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:227:0:2"
msgid "<i>You</i> are the angel of beauty<br>who gave me my life and<br>stole away with my heart!<br>   - Hortefense"
msgstr "<i>Ты</i> — ангел красоты,<br>что жизнь мне подарила<br>и сердце похитила!<br>   — Ортефанс"

#. ja: シールドレイズ
#. de: Schildwall
#. fr: Levée de bouclier
#. column 0: Summon your angel of mercy minion. Come and save me tonight.
#. column 1: A missing tinker has recently returned to Ul'dah claiming to have been “rescued by an angel.” While most believe the man to merely be a recipient of a passerby mage's kindness, he has since dedicated his life to creating automata in the image of his heavenly savior.
#. column 2: <i>You</i> are the angel of beauty<br>who gave me my life and<br>stole away with my heart!<br>   - Hortefense
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:227:0:3"
msgid "Raise Shields"
msgstr "Восстановление щита"

#. ja: シールドが破壊されていた場合、復活させる。
#. de: Stellt einen zerstörten Schild wieder her.
#. fr: Rétablit votre bouclier s'il a été détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your angel of mercy minion. Come and save me tonight.
#. column 1: A missing tinker has recently returned to Ul'dah claiming to have been “rescued by an angel.” While most believe the man to merely be a recipient of a passerby mage's kindness, he has since dedicated his life to creating automata in the image of his heavenly savior.
#. column 2: <i>You</i> are the angel of beauty<br>who gave me my life and<br>stole away with my heart!<br>   - Hortefense
#. column 3: Raise Shields
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:227:0:4"
msgid "Instantly restores damaged ally Shield. "
msgstr "Мгновенно восстанавливает повреждённый щит союзника."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・エスティニアン」を呼び出す。<br>蒼の竜騎士エスティニアンを模した魔法人形。チッ…
#. de: Du rufst deine Estinien-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie ist dem Azur-Drachenreiter nachempfunden.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Estinien miniature. Ce pantin à l'effigie d'Estinien, le Dragon céleste, ressemble trait pour trait à son modèle d'origine.
#. column 1: It is said the creators of this lifelike replica spent several days quarreling over what color to paint the now-infamous dragoon's armor─blue or red. After consultation with Vault officials, the decision was made to proceed with the former.
#. column 2: Estinien...<br>You gave your word...<br>   - Lady Iceheart
#. column 3: Super Jump
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:228:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Estinien minion. Absolutely, positively not possessed by an evil dragon bent on ridding the world of mankind."
msgstr "Призовите заводного Эстиниена. Совершенно точно не одержим злым драконом, мечтающим истребить человечество."

#. ja: 蒼の竜騎士エスティニアンを模した魔法人形。製作者たちの間でも、蒼に塗るべきか、赤に塗るべきか、果ては桃を付けるのかで一騒動あったらしい。結局のところ、邪竜狩りに挑む直前の姿で再現されたようだ
#. de: Als diese Puppe entworfen wurde, gab es angeblich Streit darum, ob auf der Lanze ein Pfirsich aufgespießt sein sollte. Letztendlich zeigt sie den Azur-Drachenreiter kurz bevor er Nidhogg zum Kampf herausfordert.
#. fr: Les artisans ont longuement débattu de l'aspect de cette poupée. Quant à la peindre en bleu, en rouge, ou à fixer une pêche au bout de sa lance pour plus de sécurité. Finalement, il fut décidé qu'elle aurait l'apparence du chevalier dragon partant au combat.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Estinien minion. Absolutely, positively not possessed by an evil dragon bent on ridding the world of mankind.
#. column 2: Estinien...<br>You gave your word...<br>   - Lady Iceheart
#. column 3: Super Jump
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:228:0:1"
msgid "It is said the creators of this lifelike replica spent several days quarreling over what color to paint the now-infamous dragoon's armor─blue or red. After consultation with Vault officials, the decision was made to proceed with the former."
msgstr "Говорят, создатели этой удивительно точной копии несколько дней спорили, в какой цвет покрасить броню прославленного драгуна — в синий или красный. Посоветовавшись с представителями Склепа, они решили остановиться на первом варианте."

#. ja: チッ…
#. de: Estinien ... wirst du deinen Schwur halten?<br><i>Eisherz</i>
#. fr: Espèce de...<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Estinien minion. Absolutely, positively not possessed by an evil dragon bent on ridding the world of mankind.
#. column 1: It is said the creators of this lifelike replica spent several days quarreling over what color to paint the now-infamous dragoon's armor─blue or red. After consultation with Vault officials, the decision was made to proceed with the former.
#. column 3: Super Jump
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:228:0:2"
msgid "Estinien...<br>You gave your word...<br>   - Lady Iceheart"
msgstr "Эстиниен...<br>Ты дал слово...<br>   — Леди Ледяное Сердце"

#. ja: スーパージャンプ
#. de: Supersprung
#. fr: Super saut
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Estinien minion. Absolutely, positively not possessed by an evil dragon bent on ridding the world of mankind.
#. column 1: It is said the creators of this lifelike replica spent several days quarreling over what color to paint the now-infamous dragoon's armor─blue or red. After consultation with Vault officials, the decision was made to proceed with the former.
#. column 2: Estinien...<br>You gave your word...<br>   - Lady Iceheart
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:228:0:3"
msgid "Super Jump"
msgstr "Суперпрыжок"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンを自軍の中央ゲート内へワープさせる。
#. de: Versetzt die ausführenden Trabanten zurück zu Tor B.
#. fr: Téléporte les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT vers le portail central.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Estinien minion. Absolutely, positively not possessed by an evil dragon bent on ridding the world of mankind.
#. column 1: It is said the creators of this lifelike replica spent several days quarreling over what color to paint the now-infamous dragoon's armor─blue or red. After consultation with Vault officials, the decision was made to proceed with the former.
#. column 2: Estinien...<br>You gave your word...<br>   - Lady Iceheart
#. column 3: Super Jump
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:228:0:4"
msgid "Transports action party to the central summoning Gate. "
msgstr "Перемещает отряд с активными умениями к центральным вратам призыва."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・フレースヴェルグ」を呼び出す。<br>七大天竜の一翼、聖竜フレースヴェルグを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst dein Hraesvelgr-Stofftier als Begleiter herbei. Einem der sieben Hohen Drachen nachempfunden, die Midgardsormr einst zeugte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Hraesvelgr miniature. Un pantin partageant les traits d'un des sept dragons anciens.
#. column 1: An uncanny attention to detail has been paid in the creation of this automaton, commissioned to help Ishgardians remember a time when hate did not rule the hearts of man and dragon. This is especially true of Hraesvelgr's eyes in which can be seen both love and sadness.
#. column 2: I somehow doubt that<br>Hraesvelgr will be pleased<br>to see us.<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Holy Covenant
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:229:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Hraesvelgr minion. Comes complete with overhead nameplate to help with spelling."
msgstr "Призыв заводного Хресвельгра. На нём даже есть табличка с именем — чтобы не ошибиться в написании."

#. ja: 七大天竜の一翼、聖竜フレースヴェルグを模した魔法人形。かつて、聖女シヴァと種族を超えた愛を交わして、人と竜との融和のきっかけを作ったという伝承に基づいているため、その瞳はどこか優しい輝きをたたえている
#. de: Ein Stofftier des Hohen Drachen Hraesvelgr, der einst Shiva liebte. Diese Liebe ebnete den Weg für Ishgard, mit den Drachen in friedlicher Eintracht leben zu können. Ein Funke dieser längst vergangenen Liebe ist als sanftes Glühen in den Augen des Drachen erkennbar.
#. fr: Son créateur a fait en sorte qu'on puisse lire un soupçon de gentillesse au fond des yeux de ce pantin. Sûrement afin de rappeler l'amour tabou entre Hraesvelgr et Shiva qui amorça une nouvelle ère d'entente entre humains et dragons.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Hraesvelgr minion. Comes complete with overhead nameplate to help with spelling.
#. column 2: I somehow doubt that<br>Hraesvelgr will be pleased<br>to see us.<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Holy Covenant
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:229:0:1"
msgid "An uncanny attention to detail has been paid in the creation of this automaton, commissioned to help Ishgardians remember a time when hate did not rule the hearts of man and dragon. This is especially true of Hraesvelgr's eyes in which can be seen both love and sadness."
msgstr "При создании этой механической куклы, заказанной, чтобы напоминать ишгардам о временах, когда сердца людей и драконов ещё не были полны ненависти, уделили внимание каждой детали. Особенно выразительны глаза Фресвельгра — в них читаются и любовь, и печаль."

#. ja: シヴァ…
#. de: Hraesvelgr?! Er wird sich nicht gerade freuen, uns zu sehen, fürchte ich.<br><i>Alphinaud</i>
#. fr: Shiva...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Hraesvelgr minion. Comes complete with overhead nameplate to help with spelling.
#. column 1: An uncanny attention to detail has been paid in the creation of this automaton, commissioned to help Ishgardians remember a time when hate did not rule the hearts of man and dragon. This is especially true of Hraesvelgr's eyes in which can be seen both love and sadness.
#. column 3: Holy Covenant
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:229:0:2"
msgid "I somehow doubt that<br>Hraesvelgr will be pleased<br>to see us.<br>   - Alphinaud"
msgstr "Сомневаюсь, что Хресвельгр<br>обрадуется нашей встрече.<br>   — Альфино"

#. ja: 聖竜の加護
#. de: Drachensegen
#. fr: Bénédiction du dragon
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Hraesvelgr minion. Comes complete with overhead nameplate to help with spelling.
#. column 1: An uncanny attention to detail has been paid in the creation of this automaton, commissioned to help Ishgardians remember a time when hate did not rule the hearts of man and dragon. This is especially true of Hraesvelgr's eyes in which can be seen both love and sadness.
#. column 2: I somehow doubt that<br>Hraesvelgr will be pleased<br>to see us.<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:229:0:3"
msgid "Holy Covenant"
msgstr "Священный завет"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方にかかっている、弱体効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle negativen Effekte von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe toutes les altérations d'état des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Hraesvelgr minion. Comes complete with overhead nameplate to help with spelling.
#. column 1: An uncanny attention to detail has been paid in the creation of this automaton, commissioned to help Ishgardians remember a time when hate did not rule the hearts of man and dragon. This is especially true of Hraesvelgr's eyes in which can be seen both love and sadness.
#. column 2: I somehow doubt that<br>Hraesvelgr will be pleased<br>to see us.<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Holy Covenant
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:229:0:4"
msgid "Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все отрицательные эффекты со всех союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「ギギ」を呼び出す。<br>時魔法を封じた魔法人形。たいせつな仲間
#. de: Du rufst deinen Gigi als Begleiter herbei. In dieser Marionette steckt ein Zeitzauber.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Gigi. Un précieux ami fabriqué par un grand mage sharlayanais du nom de Kwane.
#. column 1: The secret to the lost art of temporal magicks is believed to be buried deep within this ancient automaton created by the legendary Sharlayan archmagus Quan. Vitality levels are dangerously low due to a power drainage necessary to save the lives of his companions.
#. column 2: I daresay you have the<br>potential to be an exemplary<br>inspector someday!<br>   - Hildibrand
#. column 3: Temporal Magicks
#. column 4: Delivers 6% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:230:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Gigi minion. Also known as Vivi...but his secret is safe with you."
msgstr "Призовите Гиги. Он же Виви... но его секрет останется между нами."

#. ja: シャーレアンの大魔導士「クワン」が製作した魔法人形。本名「ビビ」。その身体には「時魔法」の力が秘められている。ヒルディブランドや冒険者を救うため力を使い果たしたため、現在は魔力を蓄積するため休眠中……
#. de: Der Sharlayaner Magier Quan hat diese Marionette erschaffen und einen Zeitzauber in ihren Körper eingewoben. Um Hildibrand und die Abenteurer zu retten, hat sie ihre gesamte Kraft verbraucht, doch die Magie der Marionette lädt sich langsam wieder auf ...
#. fr: Ce pantin, autrefois nommé Bibi par son créateur, manipulait la chronomancie. Il est malheureusement devenu momentanément incapable de recourir à la magie depuis qu'il a puisé dans ses dernières forces pour vous sauver la vie, à vous et à Hildibrand.
#. column 0: Summon your Gigi minion. Also known as Vivi...but his secret is safe with you.
#. column 2: I daresay you have the<br>potential to be an exemplary<br>inspector someday!<br>   - Hildibrand
#. column 3: Temporal Magicks
#. column 4: Delivers 6% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:230:0:1"
msgid "The secret to the lost art of temporal magicks is believed to be buried deep within this ancient automaton created by the legendary Sharlayan archmagus Quan. Vitality levels are dangerously low due to a power drainage necessary to save the lives of his companions."
msgstr "Считается, что секрет утраченного искусства магии времени скрыт в глубине этого древнего механизма, созданного легендарным архимагом Шарлаяна Куаном. Его жизненные силы на опасно низком уровне: он потратил их, чтобы спасти товарищей."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Du bist ein echtes Naturtalent, Blaujäckchen. Sind wir womöglich verwandt?<br><i>Hildibrand</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon your Gigi minion. Also known as Vivi...but his secret is safe with you.
#. column 1: The secret to the lost art of temporal magicks is believed to be buried deep within this ancient automaton created by the legendary Sharlayan archmagus Quan. Vitality levels are dangerously low due to a power drainage necessary to save the lives of his companions.
#. column 3: Temporal Magicks
#. column 4: Delivers 6% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:230:0:2"
msgid "I daresay you have the<br>potential to be an exemplary<br>inspector someday!<br>   - Hildibrand"
msgstr "Полагаю, из тебя<br>вышел бы отменный<br>инспектор!<br>   — Хильдибранд"

#. ja: 時魔法
#. de: Zeitzauber
#. fr: Chronomancie
#. column 0: Summon your Gigi minion. Also known as Vivi...but his secret is safe with you.
#. column 1: The secret to the lost art of temporal magicks is believed to be buried deep within this ancient automaton created by the legendary Sharlayan archmagus Quan. Vitality levels are dangerously low due to a power drainage necessary to save the lives of his companions.
#. column 2: I daresay you have the<br>potential to be an exemplary<br>inspector someday!<br>   - Hildibrand
#. column 4: Delivers 6% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:230:0:3"
msgid "Temporal Magicks"
msgstr "Магия времени"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のアルカナストーンに、6%のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Arkana-Stein 6 % Schaden zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 6% de sa solidité à la pierre arcanique ennemie la plus proche.
#. column 0: Summon your Gigi minion. Also known as Vivi...but his secret is safe with you.
#. column 1: The secret to the lost art of temporal magicks is believed to be buried deep within this ancient automaton created by the legendary Sharlayan archmagus Quan. Vitality levels are dangerously low due to a power drainage necessary to save the lives of his companions.
#. column 2: I daresay you have the<br>potential to be an exemplary<br>inspector someday!<br>   - Hildibrand
#. column 3: Temporal Magicks
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:230:0:4"
msgid "Delivers 6% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone."
msgstr "Наносит ближайшему вражескому арканум-камню урон в размере 6%."

#. ja: ミニオン「人造精霊」を呼び出す。<br>主と冒険するために作られた人造精霊の新しい身体
#. de: Du rufst deine Anima als Begleiter herbei. Ein neuer Körper für die synthetische Seele.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte esprit synthétique. Grâce à ce nouveau corps, il est toujours prêt à partir à l'aventure à vos côtés.
#. column 1: Ardashir fashioned this new body utilizing the anima's original soulstone. No longer limited to the immediate vicinity of the anima weapon, it is free to explore the realm at your side. Whether it will grow to become a real boy or girl, however, remains to be seen.
#. column 2: The anima took on<br>a corporeal form!?<br>   - Ardashir
#. column 3: All That You Are
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:231:0:0"
msgid "Summon your anima minion. From your heart and from your hand. Finally people will understand your intentions."
msgstr "Призовите аниму. Из сердца и из рук твоих. Наконец-то все поймут, чего ты хотел."

#. ja: アルダシールが古いソウルストーンを使って製作した、人造精霊用の新しい身体。アニマウェポンを持っていない時でも、人造精霊がつねに「主」である冒険者といっしょに冒険できるようにとの配慮から作られた
#. de: Ardashir hat dieses Gefäß mithilfe eines alten Seelensteins manifestiert, damit die synthetische Seele dich auch dann auf deinen Abenteuern begleiten kann, wenn du mal keine Anima-Waffe dabeihast.
#. fr: Cet être arcanique a été créé par Ardashir à l'aide d'une pierre d'âme. Grâce à cette enveloppe corporelle, il peut quitter l'arme anima qui l'héberge ha<shy>bi<shy>tuel<shy>le<shy>ment pour vous tenir compagnie en toutes cir<shy>cons<shy>tan<shy>ces.
#. column 0: Summon your anima minion. From your heart and from your hand. Finally people will understand your intentions.
#. column 2: The anima took on<br>a corporeal form!?<br>   - Ardashir
#. column 3: All That You Are
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:231:0:1"
msgid "Ardashir fashioned this new body utilizing the anima's original soulstone. No longer limited to the immediate vicinity of the anima weapon, it is free to explore the realm at your side. Whether it will grow to become a real boy or girl, however, remains to be seen."
msgstr "Ардаширу удалось создать новое тело, используя прежний камень души анимы. Теперь она не привязана к оружию анимы и может путешествовать по миру рядом с вами. А вот станет ли она настоящим мальчиком или девочкой — покажет время."

#. ja: 主！
#. de: Die Seele hat sich manifestiert?<br><i>Ardashir</i>
#. fr: Comptez sur moi, <if $gn4>Maîtresse<else>Maître</if><nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your anima minion. From your heart and from your hand. Finally people will understand your intentions.
#. column 1: Ardashir fashioned this new body utilizing the anima's original soulstone. No longer limited to the immediate vicinity of the anima weapon, it is free to explore the realm at your side. Whether it will grow to become a real boy or girl, however, remains to be seen.
#. column 3: All That You Are
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:231:0:2"
msgid "The anima took on<br>a corporeal form!?<br>   - Ardashir"
msgstr "Анима обрела<br>плоть и кровь!?<br>   — Ардашир"

#. ja: アニマの輝き
#. de: Strahlende Anima
#. fr: Éclat anima
#. column 0: Summon your anima minion. From your heart and from your hand. Finally people will understand your intentions.
#. column 1: Ardashir fashioned this new body utilizing the anima's original soulstone. No longer limited to the immediate vicinity of the anima weapon, it is free to explore the realm at your side. Whether it will grow to become a real boy or girl, however, remains to be seen.
#. column 2: The anima took on<br>a corporeal form!?<br>   - Ardashir
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:231:0:3"
msgid "All That You Are"
msgstr "Ты — это всё"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のATKを25上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Erhöht die ATT eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 25 l'attaque des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your anima minion. From your heart and from your hand. Finally people will understand your intentions.
#. column 1: Ardashir fashioned this new body utilizing the anima's original soulstone. No longer limited to the immediate vicinity of the anima weapon, it is free to explore the realm at your side. Whether it will grow to become a real boy or girl, however, remains to be seen.
#. column 2: The anima took on<br>a corporeal form!?<br>   - Ardashir
#. column 3: All That You Are
