#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・スカアハ」を呼び出す。<br>影の女王スカアハを模した作者不明の魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-Scathach als Begleiter herbei. Der Schattenkönigin nachempfunden. Wer sie wohl hergestellt hat?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Scáthach miniature, une poupée magique à l'image de la Reine des ombres. Son créateur reste étrangement inconnu à ce jour.
#. column 1: On the sole of her left foot can be seen the inscription, “With this, I profess my love to thee.” The lettering, however, does not match the Eorzean used during the latter Fourth Astral Era, suggesting that the automaton was crafted far after the fall of Mhach.
#. column 2: If the Shadow Queen were to<br>return, it would have dire<br>consequences for this<br>entire star!<br>   - Cait Sith
#. column 3: Pitch Slap
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:232:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Scathach minion. Surprisingly visible despite being a queen of the shadows."
msgstr "Призовите заводную Скатах. Удивительно заметная для королевы теней."

#. ja: 影の女王スカアハを模した作者不明の魔法人形。足の裏に「我が愛の証しとして」とエオルゼア文字で記されているが、文体は現代的であり、マハ時代のものとは思えない。異様な完成度からは、何やら偏執的な愛を感じる
#. de: Es ist nicht bekannt, wer diese kleine Schattenkönigin Scathach hergestellt hat, doch auf ihrer Unterseite steht in eorzäischen Lettern geschrieben: „Als Zeichen meiner Liebe.“ Insgesamt wirkt das Modell zu modern, um aus dem Mhach-Zeitalter zu stammen.
#. fr: Les mots “Une preuve de mon amour” sont inscrits sous un de ses pieds en éorzéen moderne, un signe que la poupée est bien trop récente pour dater de l'époque de Mhach. Le souci du détail qu'il a fallu pour la créer relève plus de l'obsession que du savoir-faire.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Scathach minion. Surprisingly visible despite being a queen of the shadows.
#. column 2: If the Shadow Queen were to<br>return, it would have dire<br>consequences for this<br>entire star!<br>   - Cait Sith
#. column 3: Pitch Slap
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:232:0:1"
msgid "On the sole of her left foot can be seen the inscription, “With this, I profess my love to thee.” The lettering, however, does not match the Eorzean used during the latter Fourth Astral Era, suggesting that the automaton was crafted far after the fall of Mhach."
msgstr "На подошве левой ноги видна надпись: «Сим я признаюсь тебе в любви». Но буквы не похожи на эорзейские письмена конца Четвёртой Звёздной эры. Значит, куклу изготовили задолго после падения Мхача."

#. ja: ジットリ…
#. de: Wenn die Schattenkönigin zu alter Stärke gelangt, wird dieser ganze Planet verwüstet!<br><i>Cait Sith</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Scathach minion. Surprisingly visible despite being a queen of the shadows.
#. column 1: On the sole of her left foot can be seen the inscription, “With this, I profess my love to thee.” The lettering, however, does not match the Eorzean used during the latter Fourth Astral Era, suggesting that the automaton was crafted far after the fall of Mhach.
#. column 3: Pitch Slap
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:232:0:2"
msgid "If the Shadow Queen were to<br>return, it would have dire<br>consequences for this<br>entire star!<br>   - Cait Sith"
msgstr "Если Королева теней<br>вернётся, беда грозит<br>всей этой звезде!<br>   — Кайт Сит"

#. ja: シャドウビンタ
#. de: Schattenklatsche
#. fr: Gifle de l'ombre
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Scathach minion. Surprisingly visible despite being a queen of the shadows.
#. column 1: On the sole of her left foot can be seen the inscription, “With this, I profess my love to thee.” The lettering, however, does not match the Eorzean used during the latter Fourth Astral Era, suggesting that the automaton was crafted far after the fall of Mhach.
#. column 2: If the Shadow Queen were to<br>return, it would have dire<br>consequences for this<br>entire star!<br>   - Cait Sith
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:232:0:3"
msgid "Pitch Slap"
msgstr "Шлепок тени"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵をノックバックさせる。
#. de: Schleudert die Gegner in der Nähe zurück.
#. fr: Projette en arrière les ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Scathach minion. Surprisingly visible despite being a queen of the shadows.
#. column 1: On the sole of her left foot can be seen the inscription, “With this, I profess my love to thee.” The lettering, however, does not match the Eorzean used during the latter Fourth Astral Era, suggesting that the automaton was crafted far after the fall of Mhach.
#. column 2: If the Shadow Queen were to<br>return, it would have dire<br>consequences for this<br>entire star!<br>   - Cait Sith
#. column 3: Pitch Slap
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:232:0:4"
msgid "Knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Отбрасывает всех противников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ニーズヘッグ」を呼び出す。<br>七大天竜の一翼、邪竜ニーズヘッグを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst dein Nidhogg-Stofftier als Begleiter herbei. Einem der sieben Hohen Drachen nachempfunden, die Midgardsormr einst zeugte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Nidhogg miniature, un pantin partageant les traits d'un des sept dragons anciens.
#. column 1: An enemy of the Holy See for over a thousand years, it is difficult for the people of Ishgard to not experience feelings of intense loathing when setting their eyes upon this harmless replica.
#. column 2: Eternal is a dragon's rage,<br>Dread Nidhogg's wrath did<br>span an age.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
#. column 3: Dragonsong
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 110 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:233:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Nidhogg minion. Now with more eyes."
msgstr "Призовите заводного Нидхёгга. Теперь с ещё большим количеством глаз."

#. ja: 七大天竜の一翼、邪竜ニーズヘッグを模した魔法人形。イシュガルドの仇敵として、千年に渡って戦い続けてきた存在らしく、小さくなっても威厳ある姿をしている。蒼の竜騎士の好敵手であることは、マメットになっても変わらない
#. de: Ein Stofftier des Hohen Drachen Nidhogg<nbsp>- Erzfeind von Ishgard. Seit tausend Jahren führt dieser Drache Krieg gegen Ishgard und selbst in dieser kleinen Gestalt versprüht er noch Hass und Zer<shy>störungs<shy>kraft. Den Azur-Drachenreiter kann er auch als Puppe nicht ausstehen.
#. fr: Même au format de poche, ce dragon survivant dans le seul but d'assouvir sa vengeance millénaire contre Ishgard ne perd rien de sa majesté, et reste aussi l'ennemi juré du Dragon céleste.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Nidhogg minion. Now with more eyes.
#. column 2: Eternal is a dragon's rage,<br>Dread Nidhogg's wrath did<br>span an age.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
#. column 3: Dragonsong
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 110 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:233:0:1"
msgid "An enemy of the Holy See for over a thousand years, it is difficult for the people of Ishgard to not experience feelings of intense loathing when setting their eyes upon this harmless replica."
msgstr "Святой Престол Ишгарда воевал с ним больше тысячи лет, так что жителям города трудно не испытывать жгучую ненависть, глядя на эту безобидную копию."

#. ja: アク・モーン！
#. de: Der Bruder fühlt, die Zeit ist da, dass man den Hass besiege ♪<br><i>Fahrender Sänger</i>
#. fr: Akh Morn<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Nidhogg minion. Now with more eyes.
#. column 1: An enemy of the Holy See for over a thousand years, it is difficult for the people of Ishgard to not experience feelings of intense loathing when setting their eyes upon this harmless replica.
#. column 3: Dragonsong
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 110 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:233:0:2"
msgid "Eternal is a dragon's rage,<br>Dread Nidhogg's wrath did<br>span an age.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel"
msgstr "Драконья ярость вечна,<br>гнев Нидхёгга длился<br>целую эпоху.<br>   — Странствующий менестрель"

#. ja: 終焉の竜詩
#. de: Drachenchoral
#. fr: Chant ultime
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Nidhogg minion. Now with more eyes.
#. column 1: An enemy of the Holy See for over a thousand years, it is difficult for the people of Ishgard to not experience feelings of intense loathing when setting their eyes upon this harmless replica.
#. column 2: Eternal is a dragon's rage,<br>Dread Nidhogg's wrath did<br>span an age.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 110 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:233:0:3"
msgid "Dragonsong"
msgstr "Песнь драконов"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK110のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 110 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 110 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Nidhogg minion. Now with more eyes.
#. column 1: An enemy of the Holy See for over a thousand years, it is difficult for the people of Ishgard to not experience feelings of intense loathing when setting their eyes upon this harmless replica.
#. column 2: Eternal is a dragon's rage,<br>Dread Nidhogg's wrath did<br>span an age.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
#. column 3: Dragonsong
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:233:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 110 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия удар силой 110."

#. ja: ミニオン「ヘルパピー」を呼び出す。<br>魔獣ヘルハウンドの幼獣。その眼光は鋭い
#. de: Du rufst deinen Höllenhundwelpen als Begleiter herbei. So süß, aber blicke ihm nicht in die Augen!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte chiot des enfers. Petit du limier des enfers, son regard et son odorat sont déjà par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement affûtés.
#. column 1: Whelped in the blackness of the void, only to be abandoned by her mother, this hellpup survived by devouring the flesh of the litter's remaining hounds. Since then, she has wandered alone, searching for someone to love.
#. column 2: Another wolf pup itchin'<br>to get in the ring, are ye?<br>   - Maelstrom Drill Sergeant
#. column 3: Yelp
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:234:0:0"
msgid "Summon your hellpup minion. Not all children are products of their environment. This one, however, is."
msgstr "Призовите щенка ада. Не все дети становятся такими, как их окружение. Но этот — именно такой."

#. ja: 魔獣ヘルハウンドの幼獣。異界ヴォイドで厳しい生存競争を勝ち抜いてきただけあって、幼いながらも、その眼光は鋭い。基本的に人となれ合うことは嫌うが、一度、相棒と認めた者に対しては忠実に付き従うらしい
#. de: Höllenhunde sind so wild, dass sie sich sogar im Nichts gegen andere Monster behaupten, und obgleich dieses Exemplar noch ein Welpe ist, leuchten seine Augen schon so eindringlich, dass einem bei Blickkontakt das Blut in den Adern gefriert.
#. fr: Dès leur plus jeune âge, les limiers des enfers développent une acuité visuelle extrême afin de survivre aux périls du monde du néant. S'ils abhorrent d'ordinaire la compagnie des hommes, ils restent très fidèles envers les rares élus qui parviennent à gagner leur confiance.
#. column 0: Summon your hellpup minion. Not all children are products of their environment. This one, however, is.
#. column 2: Another wolf pup itchin'<br>to get in the ring, are ye?<br>   - Maelstrom Drill Sergeant
#. column 3: Yelp
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:234:0:1"
msgid "Whelped in the blackness of the void, only to be abandoned by her mother, this hellpup survived by devouring the flesh of the litter's remaining hounds. Since then, she has wandered alone, searching for someone to love."
msgstr "Щенок появился на свет во тьме Пустоты, но мать бросила его. Он выжил, пожирая плоть остальных щенков из помёта. С тех пор он бродит в одиночестве, надеясь найти того, кого сможет полюбить."

#. ja: グルルルルル…
#. de: Bist du hier, um deine Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten im Einzelkampf<br>mit einem anderen Abenteurer zu trainieren?<br><i>Ausbilderin des Mahlstroms</i>
#. fr: Kaï, kaï<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your hellpup minion. Not all children are products of their environment. This one, however, is.
#. column 1: Whelped in the blackness of the void, only to be abandoned by her mother, this hellpup survived by devouring the flesh of the litter's remaining hounds. Since then, she has wandered alone, searching for someone to love.
#. column 3: Yelp
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:234:0:2"
msgid "Another wolf pup itchin'<br>to get in the ring, are ye?<br>   - Maelstrom Drill Sergeant"
msgstr "Опять волчонок рвётся<br>на арену, да?<br>   — Инструктор Водоворота"

#. ja: ほえる
#. de: Geheul
#. fr: Jappement
#. column 0: Summon your hellpup minion. Not all children are products of their environment. This one, however, is.
#. column 1: Whelped in the blackness of the void, only to be abandoned by her mother, this hellpup survived by devouring the flesh of the litter's remaining hounds. Since then, she has wandered alone, searching for someone to love.
#. column 2: Another wolf pup itchin'<br>to get in the ring, are ye?<br>   - Maelstrom Drill Sergeant
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:234:0:3"
msgid "Yelp"
msgstr "Тявканье"

#. ja: ミニオン召喚時のリキャストを半分にする。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
#. de: Halbiert den Ruf-Timer von Trabanten beim Herbeirufen.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 Sekunden
#. fr: Réduit de moitié le temps de recharge pour l'invocation des mascottes.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. column 0: Summon your hellpup minion. Not all children are products of their environment. This one, however, is.
#. column 1: Whelped in the blackness of the void, only to be abandoned by her mother, this hellpup survived by devouring the flesh of the litter's remaining hounds. Since then, she has wandered alone, searching for someone to love.
#. column 2: Another wolf pup itchin'<br>to get in the ring, are ye?<br>   - Maelstrom Drill Sergeant
#. column 3: Yelp
