#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・オル・ディー」を呼び出す。<br>子竜オル・ディーを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Ohl Deeh als Begleiter herbei. Der kleine Drache Ohl Deeh - jetzt noch kleiner.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Ohl Deeh miniature, re<shy>pré<shy>sen<shy>tant le dragonnet au fort caractère dans ses moindres détails.
#. column 1: This remarkably true-to-life replica of his bosom buddy Ohl Deeh was carefully handcrafted by Master Mogzin not as an expression of his undying friendship, but “to scare his wits all the way to Weston Waters.”
#. column 2: Ohl Deeh, I was made to believe<br>you could hurl boulders through<br>the skies with but a flick<br>of your powerful claws.<br>   - Tarresson
#. column 3: Mischief
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:235:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Ohl Deeh minion. 100% less subject to violent mood swings than its living counterpart."
msgstr "Призовите заводного Ол Дии. На 100% меньше подвержен резким перепадам настроения, чем его живой собрат."

#. ja: 子竜オル・ディーを模した魔法人形。モーグリ族の職人、モグジンが友人であるオル・ディーを驚かせるイタズラのために作ったもの。いっさいの妥協を許さず丁寧に作られているため、その再現度は一級品である
#. de: Der talentierte Mogry Mogzin hat diese Aufziehpuppe geschaffen, um damit seinem Freund, dem echten Ohl Deeh, einen Streich zu spielen. Eine meisterhafte Nachbildung des Drachen, bei der der Künstler keine Kompromisse gemacht hat.
#. fr: Mogzin, un artisan des Mogs célestes, a con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>né ce pantin afin de faire une farce mog à son ami de toujours, le dragonnet Ohl Deeh. Réalisé sans la moindre concession, ce n'est ni plus ni moins qu'une véritable œuvre d'art.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ohl Deeh minion. 100% less subject to violent mood swings than its living counterpart.
#. column 2: Ohl Deeh, I was made to believe<br>you could hurl boulders through<br>the skies with but a flick<br>of your powerful claws.<br>   - Tarresson
#. column 3: Mischief
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:235:0:1"
msgid "This remarkably true-to-life replica of his bosom buddy Ohl Deeh was carefully handcrafted by Master Mogzin not as an expression of his undying friendship, but “to scare his wits all the way to Weston Waters.”"
msgstr "Эта поразительно точная копия Ол Дии, закадычного друга мастера Могзина, была кропотливо изготовлена вовсе не в знак вечной дружбы, а «чтобы напугать его до усрачки»."

#. ja: テヤンデイ！
#. de: Ohl Deeh, Donnerwetter! Und was kannst du mit deinen <i>Superkräften</i>? Kieselsteine aufheben?<br><i>Tarresson</i>
#. fr: Répète un peu ça pour voir<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ohl Deeh minion. 100% less subject to violent mood swings than its living counterpart.
#. column 1: This remarkably true-to-life replica of his bosom buddy Ohl Deeh was carefully handcrafted by Master Mogzin not as an expression of his undying friendship, but “to scare his wits all the way to Weston Waters.”
#. column 3: Mischief
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:235:0:2"
msgid "Ohl Deeh, I was made to believe<br>you could hurl boulders through<br>the skies with but a flick<br>of your powerful claws.<br>   - Tarresson"
msgstr "Ол Дии, а я-то думал,<br>ты можешь одним взмахом<br>мощных когтей поднять<br>в небо целые валуны.<br>   — Таррессон"

#. ja: いたずら
#. de: Unfug
#. fr: Farce
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ohl Deeh minion. 100% less subject to violent mood swings than its living counterpart.
#. column 1: This remarkably true-to-life replica of his bosom buddy Ohl Deeh was carefully handcrafted by Master Mogzin not as an expression of his undying friendship, but “to scare his wits all the way to Weston Waters.”
#. column 2: Ohl Deeh, I was made to believe<br>you could hurl boulders through<br>the skies with but a flick<br>of your powerful claws.<br>   - Tarresson
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:235:0:3"
msgid "Mischief"
msgstr "Проказы"

#. ja: トラップを配置する。10秒後トラップ発動ボタンにより起爆可能。範囲内にいる敵にATK260のダメージを与える。
#. de: Stellt eine Falle auf, die nach 10 Sekunden ausgelöst werden kann. Bewirkt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 260 auf die Gegner in der Nähe.
#. fr: Place un piège qui peut être déclenché 10 secondes plus tard.<br>Piège<nbsp>: inflige des dégâts d'attaque 260 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
