msgid "Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
msgstr "Устанавливает ловушку. После срабатывания наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия удар силой 260.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Задержка срабатывания:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「クロックワークムーン」を呼び出す。<br>「つつく」で上下に位置を変える、明るいスポットライト
#. de: Du rufst deinen portablen Studiomond als Begleiter herbei. Höhenverstellbar durch einfaches Anstupsen, ermöglicht er tolle Screenshots.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte lune mécanique. Une mascotte brillante en forme d'astre lunaire. L'emote “toucher” permet de changer sa hauteur.
#. column 1: Following a report that excessive exposure to the bright light emitted by wind-up suns may be causing the very blemishes that Ul'dahn mesdames thought to hide, demand for a less-radiant alternative skyrocketed, ultimately giving rise to the wind-up moon.
#. column 2: I am but the moon<br>which reflects his radiance.<br>   - Lebrassoir
#. column 3: Moonlight
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:236:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up moon minion. /poke to adjust elevation. /point to inform others of its location. /blowkiss to get strange looks from passersby."
msgstr "Призовите заводную луну. Команда /poke меняет высоту. Команда /point указывает на неё. Команда /blowkiss заставит прохожих странно на вас посмотреть."

#. ja: 「つつく」で上下に位置を変える、明るいスポットライト。小皺が気になるご婦人方に、クロックワークサンが大好評だったことを受けて、光の色調を調整したモデルが製作された。少し冷たい印象の光を放ってくれる
#. de: Da sich die Studiosonne so großer Beliebtheit erfreute, kommt nun ein auf ihr basierendes, neues Modell auf den Markt, bei dem der Farbton des Lichts kühler ist und dem Licht des Mondes ähnelt. Die Empfehlung für alle, die sich mit Warzen und Krähenfüßen plagen.
#. fr: Ce luminaire monte ou descend avec l'emote “toucher”. Il a été développé suite au succès du soleil mécanique pour toutes les personnes soucieuses de leur peau. La couleur ainsi que l'intensité de la lumière ont été ajustées afin d'éviter les rides et de trop bronzer.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up moon minion. /poke to adjust elevation. /point to inform others of its location. /blowkiss to get strange looks from passersby.
#. column 2: I am but the moon<br>which reflects his radiance.<br>   - Lebrassoir
#. column 3: Moonlight
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:236:0:1"
msgid "Following a report that excessive exposure to the bright light emitted by wind-up suns may be causing the very blemishes that Ul'dahn mesdames thought to hide, demand for a less-radiant alternative skyrocketed, ultimately giving rise to the wind-up moon."
msgstr "После того как выяснилось, что яркий свет заводных солнц может вызвать именно те пятна, которые дамы Ульды так стараются скрыть, спрос на менее яркий источник света резко вырос. Так появилась заводная луна."

#. ja: ム～ン…
#. de: Er ist der Mond, der mich seither umkreist ... <br><i>Minfilia</i>
#. fr: Bzzzz... bzzzz...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up moon minion. /poke to adjust elevation. /point to inform others of its location. /blowkiss to get strange looks from passersby.
#. column 1: Following a report that excessive exposure to the bright light emitted by wind-up suns may be causing the very blemishes that Ul'dahn mesdames thought to hide, demand for a less-radiant alternative skyrocketed, ultimately giving rise to the wind-up moon.
#. column 3: Moonlight
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:236:0:2"
msgid "I am but the moon<br>which reflects his radiance.<br>   - Lebrassoir"
msgstr "Я лишь луна,<br>что отражает его сияние.<br>   — Лебрассуар"

#. ja: 月光
#. de: Blasses Mondlicht
#. fr: Éclat lunaire
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up moon minion. /poke to adjust elevation. /point to inform others of its location. /blowkiss to get strange looks from passersby.
