#. ja: ミニオン「海チョコチョコボ」を呼び出す。<br>海をも渡るチョコボの子。でも泳げない
#. de: Du rufst dein schiffbrüchiges Chocobo-Küken als Begleiter herbei. Es guckt so traurig ...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé chocobo des mers, une petite créature armée pour traverser les mers, mais qui ne sait pas nager.
#. column 1: You won't hear this from his beak, but the chocobo chick you rescued from the sea's slippery grasp cannot actually swim─the only thing keeping the bird afloat is a life preserver some kind sailor tossed from his ship before sailing off into the sunset.
#. column 2: You can lead a chocobo to water...<br>   - Redolent Rose
#. column 3: Tidal Sploosh
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 100 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 40%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:237:0:0"
msgid "Summon your castaway chocobo chick minion. Currently without a name. “Wilson” recommended."
msgstr "Призовите потерпевшего кораблекрушение птенца чокобо. Пока безымянный. Предлагаем имя «Уилсон»."

#. ja: 海をも渡るチョコボの子。自分では決して認めないが、泳げない。親切な誰かが溺れないようにと、浮き輪を付けてくれたらしい。だが、調子に乗って沖まで出て大漂流。助かりたい一心で食い付いたのが、釣り針だった
#. de: Dieses schiffbrüchige Küken hatte gleich zwei Retter: ein Matrose, der ihm etwas zuwarf, um sich daran festzuklammern, und dich.
#. fr: Une personne craignant que ce chocobo ne se noie lui donna cette bouée. Elle fut très utile le jour où la créature s'approcha du bord de mer et fut emportée par une vague<nbsp>! Elle ne dut son salut qu'à la première chose qu'elle pinça de son bec... un hameçon<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your castaway chocobo chick minion. Currently without a name. “Wilson” recommended.
#. column 2: You can lead a chocobo to water...<br>   - Redolent Rose
#. column 3: Tidal Sploosh
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 100 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 40%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:237:0:1"
msgid "You won't hear this from his beak, but the chocobo chick you rescued from the sea's slippery grasp cannot actually swim─the only thing keeping the bird afloat is a life preserver some kind sailor tossed from his ship before sailing off into the sunset."
msgstr "Сам птенец об этом не скажет, но спасённый вами из морских волн чокобо совсем не умеет плавать. Держится на воде он только благодаря спасательному кругу, который бросил ему какой-то добрый моряк, прежде чем уплыть навстречу закату."

#. ja: クエッ！
#. de: Soll er doch Schiffbruch erleiden, der Drückeberger!<br><i>Grynewyda</i>
#. fr: Kwé kwé<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your castaway chocobo chick minion. Currently without a name. “Wilson” recommended.
#. column 1: You won't hear this from his beak, but the chocobo chick you rescued from the sea's slippery grasp cannot actually swim─the only thing keeping the bird afloat is a life preserver some kind sailor tossed from his ship before sailing off into the sunset.
#. column 3: Tidal Sploosh
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 100 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 40%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:237:0:2"
msgid "You can lead a chocobo to water...<br>   - Redolent Rose"
msgstr "Можно привести чокобо к воде...<br>   — Редолант Роуз"

#. ja: たいだるうぇいぶ
#. de: Nasse Schwemme
#. fr: Larme de fond
#. column 0: Summon your castaway chocobo chick minion. Currently without a name. “Wilson” recommended.
#. column 1: You won't hear this from his beak, but the chocobo chick you rescued from the sea's slippery grasp cannot actually swim─the only thing keeping the bird afloat is a life preserver some kind sailor tossed from his ship before sailing off into the sunset.
