msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия удар силой 100 и снижает их ЗАЩ на 40%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・バッツ」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。風がよんでる……
#. de: Du rufst deine Bartz-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Zeige dem Helden vergangener Zeiten deine Welt!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Bartz miniature, qui chevauche son chocobo à toute vitesse comme si le vent l'appelait...
#. column 1: The legend of Bartz and his trusty chocobo steed Boko is known far and wide, their journeys inspiring entire generations to adventure. Though, disagreement as to the appropriate spelling of the carefree youth's name has led to many a hurt butz.
#. column 2: Since last we spoke,<br>I've spent every spare<br>moment at the butts.<br>   - Barthovieu
#. column 3: Boko Bump
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:238:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Bartz minion. I like small Bartz and I cannot lie."
msgstr "Призовите заводного Барца. Люблю маленького Барца, чего уж там."

#. ja: 古の英雄「バッツ」を模した魔法人形。相棒であるチョコボの「ボコ」まで、完全再現されている。風の心に身を任せ、気の向くまま心の向くまま、冒険の旅に連れて行こう。こりゃあ、おもしろいや！！
#. de: In manchen Regionen wird um die richtige Schreibweise seines Namens gestritten, aber die Legende von Bartz und seinem Chocobo Boko hat ganze Abenteurergenerationen fasziniert.
#. fr: Ce pantin reproduit à la perfection Bartz, un ancien héros, chevauchant son ami chocobo. N'écoutez que votre cœur et laissez-vous porter par le vent, l'aventure vous appelle<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Bartz minion. I like small Bartz and I cannot lie.
#. column 2: Since last we spoke,<br>I've spent every spare<br>moment at the butts.<br>   - Barthovieu
#. column 3: Boko Bump
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:238:0:1"
msgid "The legend of Bartz and his trusty chocobo steed Boko is known far and wide, their journeys inspiring entire generations to adventure. Though, disagreement as to the appropriate spelling of the carefree youth's name has led to many a hurt butz."
msgstr "Легенда о Барце и его верном чокобо Боко известна повсюду. Их странствия вдохновили не одно поколение отправиться в приключения. Правда, из-за споров о правильном написании имени беззаботного юноши немало людей оказалось в дураках."

#. ja: 「え」っと…ないか…
#. de: Tja, ist eben ein Trick, den ich von meinem Vater gelernt habe.<br><i>Bartz Klauser</i>
#. fr: Moi et mon chocobo, nous allons là où le sentier nous mène.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Bartz minion. I like small Bartz and I cannot lie.
#. column 1: The legend of Bartz and his trusty chocobo steed Boko is known far and wide, their journeys inspiring entire generations to adventure. Though, disagreement as to the appropriate spelling of the carefree youth's name has led to many a hurt butz.
#. column 3: Boko Bump
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:238:0:2"
msgid "Since last we spoke,<br>I've spent every spare<br>moment at the butts.<br>   - Barthovieu"
msgstr "С нашей прошлой встречи<br>я каждую свободную минуту<br>провожу у задниц.<br>   — Бартовьё"

#. ja: ボコ！
#. de: Boko-Schupser
#. fr: Bond Boko
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Bartz minion. I like small Bartz and I cannot lie.
#. column 1: The legend of Bartz and his trusty chocobo steed Boko is known far and wide, their journeys inspiring entire generations to adventure. Though, disagreement as to the appropriate spelling of the carefree youth's name has led to many a hurt butz.
#. column 2: Since last we spoke,<br>I've spent every spare<br>moment at the butts.<br>   - Barthovieu
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:238:0:3"
msgid "Boko Bump"
msgstr "Толчок Боко"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK300のダメージを与える。ただし、特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンは強制帰還する。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 300 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus, aber die ausführenden Trabanten werden weggeschickt.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 300 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT sont au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment renvoyées.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Bartz minion. I like small Bartz and I cannot lie.
#. column 1: The legend of Bartz and his trusty chocobo steed Boko is known far and wide, their journeys inspiring entire generations to adventure. Though, disagreement as to the appropriate spelling of the carefree youth's name has led to many a hurt butz.
#. column 2: Since last we spoke,<br>I've spent every spare<br>moment at the butts.<br>   - Barthovieu
#. column 3: Boko Bump
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:238:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия удар силой 300. После применения отряд с активными умениями немедленно покидает поле боя."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・レッドメイジ」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。ハンターではない
#. de: Du rufst deine Rotmagier-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Ein Meister der Balance.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mage rouge mécanique, un petit mage à fière allure avec son chapeau et sa cape rouges<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Tales of mages dabbling in the schools of both black and white abound, but most end in the adept realizing that she should have focused on a single art rather than allowing hubris to drive her to believe that she might excel in both.
#. column 2: A red mage must strive to<br>achieve the greatest good.<br>   - X'rhun Tia
#. column 3: Return to Garlaige
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:239:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up red mage minion. He'd rather be red than dead."
msgstr "Призовите заводного красного мага. Он скорее будет красным, чем мёртвым."

#. ja: 古の英雄を模した魔法人形。伝承によれば、白魔法と黒魔法の双方を会得しており、攻めてよし、守ってよしの万能戦士であったという。だが、一方では、攻守が中途半端であったという真逆の評価も伝わっている
#. de: Von jeher träumen Magier davon, sowohl Schwarze als auch Weiße Magie auszuüben, doch die, die es vermögen, leiden oft an dem Gefühl, nichts richtig zu können.
#. fr: Ce pantin articulé ressemble comme deux gouttes d'eau à un ancien héros. On raconte qu'il avait étudié la magie blanche et la magie noire, si bien qu'il était capable d'utiliser les deux. Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, on dit également qu'il n'excellait dans aucune de ces disciplines...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up red mage minion. He'd rather be red than dead.
#. column 2: A red mage must strive to<br>achieve the greatest good.<br>   - X'rhun Tia
#. column 3: Return to Garlaige
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:239:0:1"
msgid "Tales of mages dabbling in the schools of both black and white abound, but most end in the adept realizing that she should have focused on a single art rather than allowing hubris to drive her to believe that she might excel in both."
msgstr "Легенд о магах, изучавших и белую, и чёрную магию, хватает. Но обычно всё заканчивается тем, что ученик понимает: стоило сосредоточиться на одном искусстве, а не позволять гордыне внушить себе, будто можно в совершенстве овладеть обоими."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Genau so sollte ein gelungener Angriff eines Rotmagiers aussehen!<br><i>X'rhun Tia</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up red mage minion. He'd rather be red than dead.
#. column 1: Tales of mages dabbling in the schools of both black and white abound, but most end in the adept realizing that she should have focused on a single art rather than allowing hubris to drive her to believe that she might excel in both.
#. column 3: Return to Garlaige
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:239:0:2"
msgid "A red mage must strive to<br>achieve the greatest good.<br>   - X'rhun Tia"
msgstr "Красный маг должен стремиться<br>творить как можно больше добра.<br>   — Кс'рун Тиа"

#. ja: 生麦生米生卵！
#. de: Rückzug zur Garlaige-Zitadelle
#. fr: Retour à Garlaige
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up red mage minion. He'd rather be red than dead.
#. column 1: Tales of mages dabbling in the schools of both black and white abound, but most end in the adept realizing that she should have focused on a single art rather than allowing hubris to drive her to believe that she might excel in both.
#. column 2: A red mage must strive to<br>achieve the greatest good.<br>   - X'rhun Tia
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:239:0:3"
msgid "Return to Garlaige"
msgstr "Возвращение в Гарлейж"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の移動速度を35%上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Erhöht die GSW eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 35<nbsp>%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 35% la vitesse de déplacement des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up red mage minion. He'd rather be red than dead.
#. column 1: Tales of mages dabbling in the schools of both black and white abound, but most end in the adept realizing that she should have focused on a single art rather than allowing hubris to drive her to believe that she might excel in both.
#. column 2: A red mage must strive to<br>achieve the greatest good.<br>   - X'rhun Tia
#. column 3: Return to Garlaige
