msgctxt "CompanionTransient:239:0:4"
msgid "Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s"
msgstr "Повышает скорость передвижения всех союзников в радиусе действия на 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「フェイパピー」を呼び出す。<br>魔獣フェイハウンドの幼獣。その殺気は鋭い
#. de: Du rufst deinen Feenhundwelpen als Begleiter herbei. So süß, aber erwidere nie seinen Blick!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte chiot fantasmagorique. Si jeune et déjà l'instinct de tuer.
#. column 1: Whelped in the blackness of the void, and raised to be a proud and merciless killer, this deceptively adorable pup does not (obviously) take well to companionship. The rare exception, however, has been made for those who have shown they will not back down in fear.
#. column 2: Pup that he is,<br>having a trophy will<br>mean much to him.<br>   - Bloeidin
#. column 3: Teething
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:240:0:0"
msgid "Summon your faepup minion. Every dog has its fae."
msgstr "Призовите щенка фей. У каждой собаки есть своя фейская сторона."

#. ja: 魔獣フェイハウンドの幼獣。異界ヴォイドの魔獣たちと縄張り争いを繰り広げてきたため、幼いながらも、その殺気は鋭い。非常に誇り高い存在で孤独を好むが、自分の主に相応しいと認めた者に対しては、忠誠を尽くす
#. de: Das Nichts ist ein so unwirtlicher Lebensraum, dass Welpen dort nur mit ausgeprägtem Killerinstinkt überleben können. Dieser Welpe ist ein genauso stolzer wie kampferprobter Einzelgänger, doch er wird zum treuen Begleiter, wenn er sein Herrchen erst einmal akzeptiert hat.
#. fr: Les petits du limier fantasmagorique doivent apprendre très tôt à défendre leur territoire dans le monde du néant, et donc à tuer. Solitaires de nature, il est néanmoins possible de les apprivoiser, auquel cas ce sont des compagnons tout à fait dévoués.
#. column 0: Summon your faepup minion. Every dog has its fae.
#. column 2: Pup that he is,<br>having a trophy will<br>mean much to him.<br>   - Bloeidin
#. column 3: Teething
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:240:0:1"
msgid "Whelped in the blackness of the void, and raised to be a proud and merciless killer, this deceptively adorable pup does not (obviously) take well to companionship. The rare exception, however, has been made for those who have shown they will not back down in fear."
msgstr "Рождённый во тьме Пустоты щенок с виду очарователен, но его растили как гордого и безжалостного убийцу, и он, разумеется, не жалует компанию. Впрочем, он может сделать редкое исключение для тех, кто не отступает от страха."

#. ja: ガルルルルル…
#. de: Hier werden aus jungen Welpen furchterregende Jäger gemacht!<br><i>Berkoeya</i>
#. fr: Ouaf, ouaf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your faepup minion. Every dog has its fae.
#. column 1: Whelped in the blackness of the void, and raised to be a proud and merciless killer, this deceptively adorable pup does not (obviously) take well to companionship. The rare exception, however, has been made for those who have shown they will not back down in fear.
#. column 3: Teething
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:240:0:2"
msgid "Pup that he is,<br>having a trophy will<br>mean much to him.<br>   - Bloeidin"
msgstr "Пусть он пока щенок,<br>трофей для него<br>много значит.<br>   — Блоэйдин"

#. ja: かみつき
#. de: Zahnen
#. fr: Dents de lait
#. column 0: Summon your faepup minion. Every dog has its fae.
#. column 1: Whelped in the blackness of the void, and raised to be a proud and merciless killer, this deceptively adorable pup does not (obviously) take well to companionship. The rare exception, however, has been made for those who have shown they will not back down in fear.
#. column 2: Pup that he is,<br>having a trophy will<br>mean much to him.<br>   - Bloeidin
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:240:0:3"
msgid "Teething"
msgstr "Кусание"

#. ja: 敵軍のシールドに70%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt einem gegnerischen Schild 70<nbsp>% Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls er schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 70% de sa solidité au bouclier ennemi. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your faepup minion. Every dog has its fae.
#. column 1: Whelped in the blackness of the void, and raised to be a proud and merciless killer, this deceptively adorable pup does not (obviously) take well to companionship. The rare exception, however, has been made for those who have shown they will not back down in fear.
#. column 2: Pup that he is,<br>having a trophy will<br>mean much to him.<br>   - Bloeidin
#. column 3: Teething
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:240:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable."
msgstr "Наносит 70% урона прочности вражескому щиту. Не действует, если щит уже разрушен."

#. ja: ミニオン「ウソウソ」を呼び出す。<br>川から離れたカワウソの子。ウソウソ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen obskuren Otter als Begleiter herbei. Er hat so ein niedliches Näschen!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte loutre choute. Une loutre tout ce qu'il y a de plus normale, mais beaucoup plus choute<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Otters of the Far East are highly cunning creatures, some scholars having ventured as far as to claim the rodents' intelligence is, in fact, comparable to that of a Qiqirn, despite lacking the latter's propensity for spoken communication.
#. column 2: He seemed...odd.<br>Well, odder than usual.<br>   - Cocobezi
#. column 3: Backstroke
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:241:0:0"
msgid "Summon your odder otter minion. Is there anything odder than an otter who lives out of water?"
msgstr "Призовите странную выдру. Что может быть страннее выдры, живущей вдали от воды?"

#. ja: 川から離れたカワウソの子。言葉こそ発することができないが、極めて知能が高く、道具を扱うこともできる。そのため、東方地域の貴人の中には、こうした獣を仕込んで、使いとして使役する者もいるという
#. de: Die Otter des Fernen Ostens sind intelligente Geschöpfe. In Sachen Planungsfähigkeit und Risikoanalyse übertreffen sie sogar die Qiqirn.
#. fr: Cette créature est dotée d'une in<shy>tel<shy>li<shy>gence ex<shy>cep<shy>tion<shy>nelle, en plus d'être douée de ses petites pattes. Il ne lui manque vraiment que la parole<nbsp>! Les nobles des contrées orientales l'aiment tant que certains en dressent pour en faire l'animal de compagnie parfait.
#. column 0: Summon your odder otter minion. Is there anything odder than an otter who lives out of water?
#. column 2: He seemed...odd.<br>Well, odder than usual.<br>   - Cocobezi
#. column 3: Backstroke
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:241:0:1"
msgid "Otters of the Far East are highly cunning creatures, some scholars having ventured as far as to claim the rodents' intelligence is, in fact, comparable to that of a Qiqirn, despite lacking the latter's propensity for spoken communication."
msgstr "Выдры Дальнего Востока — невероятно хитрые зверьки. Некоторые учёные даже утверждают, что по уму они не уступают кикирнам, хотя и не умеют разговаривать."

#. ja: ウソウソ！
#. de: Gäste sind uns immer willkommen ... solange sie uns<br>keine obskuren Badetänze vorführen wollen.<br><i>Bronzesee-Bewohner</i>
#. fr: Kiii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your odder otter minion. Is there anything odder than an otter who lives out of water?
#. column 1: Otters of the Far East are highly cunning creatures, some scholars having ventured as far as to claim the rodents' intelligence is, in fact, comparable to that of a Qiqirn, despite lacking the latter's propensity for spoken communication.
#. column 3: Backstroke
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:241:0:2"
msgid "He seemed...odd.<br>Well, odder than usual.<br>   - Cocobezi"
msgstr "Он показался... странным.<br>Ну, страннее обычного.<br>   — Кокобези"

#. ja: 大嘘
#. de: Planschen
#. fr: Brasse de dos
#. column 0: Summon your odder otter minion. Is there anything odder than an otter who lives out of water?
#. column 1: Otters of the Far East are highly cunning creatures, some scholars having ventured as far as to claim the rodents' intelligence is, in fact, comparable to that of a Qiqirn, despite lacking the latter's propensity for spoken communication.
#. column 2: He seemed...odd.<br>Well, odder than usual.<br>   - Cocobezi
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:241:0:3"
msgid "Backstroke"
msgstr "Плавание на спине"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、タイプ「アニマル」を弱点に加える。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Fügt Gegnern in der Nähe eine Schwäche gegen Tiere zu.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Ajoute le type “Créature” aux points faibles des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
