msgstr "Накладывает на всех противников в радиусе действия слабость к <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>животным</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「豆妖狐」を呼び出す。<br>千年生きた妖狐の子。それはただの狐
#. de: Du rufst deinen Fuchswelpen als Begleiter herbei. Hat <i>er</i> die Gans gestohlen?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé renard, un renardeau dont la mère a vécu un millénaire.
#. column 1: Despite its appearance, this fox kit is actually the offspring of a thousand<hyphen>year<hyphen>old vulpine spirit yet incapable of taking on the body of a man that it may seduce its prey into relinquishing their very souls. Or not. There truly is no way to tell.
#. column 2: The hungry fox starves<br>staring at the bull's testicles.<br>   - Cirina
#. column 3: Crazy
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:242:0:0"
msgid "Summon your fox kit minion. His devotion toward you will prove fair and balanced."
msgstr "Призовите лисёнка. Его преданность вам окажется справедливой и беспристрастной."

#. ja: 千年生きた妖狐の子。ただし、生まれてさほど時が経っていないため、親のように魔力を有しているわけでも、ましてや人に化けることもできない。それはつまり、ただの狐ということではないだろうか
#. de: Wenn der Fuchswelpe ausgewachsen ist, wird der Geist, der in ihm haust, in der Lage sein, die Seelen Unschuldiger zu verspeisen. Zum Glück lässt sich der schlaue Welpe Zeit mit dem Erwachsenwerden.
#. fr: Cette créature a beau descendre d'animaux fantastiques, elle est encore trop jeune pour avoir quoi que ce soit de particulier. Ce n'est pas demain que vous la verrez se transformer en être humain<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your fox kit minion. His devotion toward you will prove fair and balanced.
#. column 2: The hungry fox starves<br>staring at the bull's testicles.<br>   - Cirina
#. column 3: Crazy
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:242:0:1"
msgid "Despite its appearance, this fox kit is actually the offspring of a thousand<hyphen>year<hyphen>old vulpine spirit yet incapable of taking on the body of a man that it may seduce its prey into relinquishing their very souls. Or not. There truly is no way to tell."
msgstr "На вид это обычный лисёнок, но на самом деле он потомок лисьего духа, прожившего тысячу лет. Правда, пока он слишком мал, чтобы принять человеческий облик и соблазнять добычу, отбирая у неё душу. А может, и нет. Кто ж разберёт."

#. ja: キュ？
#. de: Ist schon ein schlauer Fuchs, dieser Franz.<br><i>Bobonima</i>
#. fr: Kiii<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your fox kit minion. His devotion toward you will prove fair and balanced.
#. column 1: Despite its appearance, this fox kit is actually the offspring of a thousand<hyphen>year<hyphen>old vulpine spirit yet incapable of taking on the body of a man that it may seduce its prey into relinquishing their very souls. Or not. There truly is no way to tell.
#. column 3: Crazy
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:242:0:2"
msgid "The hungry fox starves<br>staring at the bull's testicles.<br>   - Cirina"
msgstr "Голодная лиса сохнет,<br>глядя на бычьи яйца.<br>   — Цирина"

#. ja: キツネの寝入り
#. de: Fuchsig
#. fr: Endormissement du renard
#. column 0: Summon your fox kit minion. His devotion toward you will prove fair and balanced.
#. column 1: Despite its appearance, this fox kit is actually the offspring of a thousand<hyphen>year<hyphen>old vulpine spirit yet incapable of taking on the body of a man that it may seduce its prey into relinquishing their very souls. Or not. There truly is no way to tell.
#. column 2: The hungry fox starves<br>staring at the bull's testicles.<br>   - Cirina
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:242:0:3"
msgid "Crazy"
msgstr "Безумие"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のHPを、100回復する。味方のタイプが「アニマル」の場合は、HPが150回復する。
#. de: Regeneriert 100 LP bei eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe, im Fall von Tieren 150.
#. fr: Soigne 100 PV aux alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou 150 PV s'ils sont de type “Créature”.
