msgid "Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>)."
msgstr "Восстанавливает 100 ОЗ всем союзникам в радиусе действия (150, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>животное</ui-edge-color></ui-color>)."

#. ja: ミニオン「トラジロウ」を呼び出す。<br>茶虎の子猫。タロウはいずこ？
#. de: Du rufst Tora-jiro als Begleiter herbei. Als Tigerbändiger kann man es weit bringen, zum Beispiel im Gold Saucer.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Tora-jiro, un chaton roux qui ne connaît pas son aîné.
#. column 1: Being saved by the selfsame hunter who brutally slayed your family for a sack of coin and a punny title can be awkward for a growing tiger cub. On one hand, he brutally slayed your family. On the other, he provides you bowls of rich, tasty cream.
#. column 2: It has been too long<br>since I last dined on tiger.<br>   - Masatsuchi
#. column 3: Eye of the Tora
#. column 4: Reduces movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:243:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Tora-jiro minion. His name suggests that this tiny tiger cub has an older brother. His parents deny everything."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Торадзиро. Судя по имени, у тигрёнка должен быть старший брат. Родители всё отрицают."

#. ja: 茶虎の毛並みが愛らしい子猫。とあるリスキーモブに食べられそうになっていたところを、熟練モブハンターに救出された。名付け親でもある彼は語った。せめてこの子が助かっただけでも、よしとしよう。タロウはいずこ？
#. de: Ausgerechnet von der Person aufgezogen zu werden, die seine Familie getötet hat, kann einen jungen Tiger schon zum Grübeln bringen. Aber die Schüsseln mit cremiger Milch schmecken einfach zu köstlich.
#. fr: Un chaton roux ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment mignon qui aurait fini dans l'estomac d'un gros monstre si un expert de la Chasse n'était pas passé par là. Il le nomma Tora-jiro avant de repartir, ce qui veut po<shy>ten<shy>tiel<shy>le<shy>ment dire qu'il y a quelque part un Tora-taro.
#. column 0: Summon your Tora-jiro minion. His name suggests that this tiny tiger cub has an older brother. His parents deny everything.
#. column 2: It has been too long<br>since I last dined on tiger.<br>   - Masatsuchi
#. column 3: Eye of the Tora
#. column 4: Reduces movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:243:0:1"
msgid "Being saved by the selfsame hunter who brutally slayed your family for a sack of coin and a punny title can be awkward for a growing tiger cub. On one hand, he brutally slayed your family. On the other, he provides you bowls of rich, tasty cream."
msgstr "Этот милый полосатый котёнок едва не стал добычей одного опасного монстра, но опытный охотник успел его спасти. Он же и дал ему имя. «Хорошо хоть этот малыш выжил», — сказал охотник. Интересно, где теперь Таро?"

#. ja: ニャ～ン！
#. de: Es ist schon lange her, dass ich das letzte Mal Tiger zu essen bekam.<br><i>Masatsuchi</i>
#. fr: Miaaaou<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Tora-jiro minion. His name suggests that this tiny tiger cub has an older brother. His parents deny everything.
#. column 1: Being saved by the selfsame hunter who brutally slayed your family for a sack of coin and a punny title can be awkward for a growing tiger cub. On one hand, he brutally slayed your family. On the other, he provides you bowls of rich, tasty cream.
