msgctxt "CompanionTransient:243:0:2"
msgid "It has been too long<br>since I last dined on tiger.<br>   - Masatsuchi"
msgstr "Давно я не ел<br>тигрятины.<br>   — Масацути"

#. ja: 野生の衝動
#. de: Tigerbalsam
#. fr: Impulsion sauvage
#. column 0: Summon your Tora-jiro minion. His name suggests that this tiny tiger cub has an older brother. His parents deny everything.
