#. ja: ミニオン「タツマゴ」を呼び出す。<br>タツノコの幼生体。子どもの子は孫
#. de: Du rufst deinen Tatsunoko als Begleiter herbei. Er wiehert nicht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte hippocampoupon, la progéniture d'un hippocampe légendaire.
#. column 1: A single ilm to the right or left and this cute creature would have been kebab. Fate, however, intervened, and now the wavekin follows its would-be transfixer─the tiny tyke having taken quite well to the upper world's drier climes.
#. column 2: His tiny minions won't<br>stand a chance!<br>   - Haermaga
#. column 3: Trapdoor
#. column 4: Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:244:0:0"
msgid "Summon your tiny tatsunoko minion. If the Hingan word for sea horse is tatsunoko, would that make this a sea pony? <i>Your</i> little sea pony?"
msgstr "Призовите крошечного тацуноко. По-хингански «тацуноко» — это морской конёк. Значит, это морской пони? <i>Твой</i> маленький морской пони?"

#. ja: タツノコの幼生体。突き出された銛の先を、咄嗟に避けようとしたところ、つい反射的に尾を絡みつかせてしまい、あえなく捕獲された。とはいえ海の外の世界も、意外と気に入っているらしく、活き活きとしている
#. de: Um einen Ilm wäre der Tatsunoko aufgespießt worden. Jetzt folgt der Meeresbewohner dir und man muss sagen, er hat sich hervorragend an das trockene Klima gewöhnt.
#. fr: Cette créature a enroulé par réflexe sa queue autour du harpon qu'on venait de lancer sur elle et qu'elle avait réussi à esquiver. C'est comme ça qu'un pêcheur l'a capturée. Elle vit depuis à la surface avec les humains, mais ça ne semble pas lui déplaire.
#. column 0: Summon your tiny tatsunoko minion. If the Hingan word for sea horse is tatsunoko, would that make this a sea pony? <i>Your</i> little sea pony?
#. column 2: His tiny minions won't<br>stand a chance!<br>   - Haermaga
#. column 3: Trapdoor
#. column 4: Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:244:0:1"
msgid "A single ilm to the right or left and this cute creature would have been kebab. Fate, however, intervened, and now the wavekin follows its would-be transfixer─the tiny tyke having taken quite well to the upper world's drier climes."
msgstr "Ещё один илм в сторону — и это милое создание стало бы шашлыком. Но судьба распорядилась иначе: теперь водяной следует за тем, кто едва не пронзил его гарпуном. И, надо сказать, малыш прекрасно освоился в сухом мире."

#. ja: ！？
#. de: Der ist aber winzig, kupohoho.<br><i>Mogkon</i>
#. fr: !?
#. column 0: Summon your tiny tatsunoko minion. If the Hingan word for sea horse is tatsunoko, would that make this a sea pony? <i>Your</i> little sea pony?
#. column 1: A single ilm to the right or left and this cute creature would have been kebab. Fate, however, intervened, and now the wavekin follows its would-be transfixer─the tiny tyke having taken quite well to the upper world's drier climes.
#. column 3: Trapdoor
#. column 4: Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:244:0:2"
msgid "His tiny minions won't<br>stand a chance!<br>   - Haermaga"
msgstr "Его крошечным миньонам<br>не поздоровится!<br>   — Хаэрмага"

#. ja: トラップオトシ
#. de: Fallentrick
#. fr: Piégeur de piège
#. column 0: Summon your tiny tatsunoko minion. If the Hingan word for sea horse is tatsunoko, would that make this a sea pony? <i>Your</i> little sea pony?
#. column 1: A single ilm to the right or left and this cute creature would have been kebab. Fate, however, intervened, and now the wavekin follows its would-be transfixer─the tiny tyke having taken quite well to the upper world's drier climes.
#. column 2: His tiny minions won't<br>stand a chance!<br>   - Haermaga
#. column 4: Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:244:0:3"
msgid "Trapdoor"
msgstr "Ловушка-ловушка"

#. ja: 敵軍が配置したトラップがある場合、自軍のトラップとして発動させる。トラップがATKダメージの場合はダメージを1.5倍にする。
#. de: Wandelt gegnerische Fallen in eigene um. Wenn die Falle eine Attacke ausführt, wird der Attacke-Wert um das 1,5-fache erhöht.
#. fr: Déclenche un piège ennemi comme s'il vous appartenait. S'il inflige des dégâts d'attaque, sa puissance est multipliée par 1,5.
#. column 0: Summon your tiny tatsunoko minion. If the Hingan word for sea horse is tatsunoko, would that make this a sea pony? <i>Your</i> little sea pony?
#. column 1: A single ilm to the right or left and this cute creature would have been kebab. Fate, however, intervened, and now the wavekin follows its would-be transfixer─the tiny tyke having taken quite well to the upper world's drier climes.
#. column 2: His tiny minions won't<br>stand a chance!<br>   - Haermaga
#. column 3: Trapdoor
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:244:0:4"
msgid "Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%."
msgstr "Срабатывает вражескую ловушку так, будто она ваша. Если ловушка наносит физический урон, сила удара увеличивается на 150%."

#. ja: ミニオン「ハリセンボム」を呼び出す。<br>ハリセンボムの幼生体。爆発はしない
#. de: Du rufst deinen Igelbomber als Begleiter herbei. Stachelige Angelegenheit, das.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poisson-bombo, un jeune spécimen qui ne vous explosera pas à la figure.
#. column 1: Given its name after a fisher claimed to witness the wavekin explode after tossing it on a grill, the bombfish is, in fact, neither related to bombs of voidsent origin or even that combustible.
#. column 2: Won't get nowhere up its<br>crack, yunz won't, not with<br>that piddly bomb.<br>   - 13th Order Alchemist Ga Zi
#. column 3: Inflate
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:245:0:0"
msgid "Summon your bombfish minion. He will give you an offer that can't be defused."
msgstr "Призовите рыбу-бомбу. У неё для вас предложение, от которого невозможно отказаться."

#. ja: ハリセンボムの幼生体。危機を感じると大きく膨らむところや、脂分が豊富でよく燃えることなどが、西方に棲まうという伝説の妖異「ボム」に似ていることから、そう呼ばれるようになった。決してボムの一種ではない
#. de: Mit den nichtsgesandten Bombern hat dieser Fisch nichts zu tun, und explodieren tut er auch nur, wenn man ihn mit Sprengstoff füttert. Aber warum sollte man das tun?
#. fr: Un poisson qui tire son nom de sa ressemblance avec les bombos, car comme eux, il se gonfle lorsqu'il se sent en danger. Il est lui aussi recouvert d'une pellicule grasse qui pourrait laisser penser qu'il peut s'enflammer s'il le veut, mais pas d'inquiétude, il en est incapable.
#. column 0: Summon your bombfish minion. He will give you an offer that can't be defused.
#. column 2: Won't get nowhere up its<br>crack, yunz won't, not with<br>that piddly bomb.<br>   - 13th Order Alchemist Ga Zi
#. column 3: Inflate
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:245:0:1"
msgid "Given its name after a fisher claimed to witness the wavekin explode after tossing it on a grill, the bombfish is, in fact, neither related to bombs of voidsent origin or even that combustible."
msgstr "Рыба-бомба получила своё название после того, как один рыбак заявил, будто видел, как она взорвалась на гриле. На самом деле она не имеет ничего общего с бомбами из Пустоты и совершенно не взрывоопасна."

#. ja: じばく！
#. de: A-Aber diese Igelbomber sind gefährlich!<br><i>Nayoshi</i>
#. fr: Boum<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your bombfish minion. He will give you an offer that can't be defused.
#. column 1: Given its name after a fisher claimed to witness the wavekin explode after tossing it on a grill, the bombfish is, in fact, neither related to bombs of voidsent origin or even that combustible.
#. column 3: Inflate
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:245:0:2"
msgid "Won't get nowhere up its<br>crack, yunz won't, not with<br>that piddly bomb.<br>   - 13th Order Alchemist Ga Zi"
msgstr "Не пробьёте её шкуру,<br>не пробьёте, как ни бей,<br>такой-то крохотной бомбой.<br>   — Алхимик 13-го отряда Га Зи"

#. ja: 巨大化
#. de: Aufblasen
#. fr: Grossissement
#. column 0: Summon your bombfish minion. He will give you an offer that can't be defused.
#. column 1: Given its name after a fisher claimed to witness the wavekin explode after tossing it on a grill, the bombfish is, in fact, neither related to bombs of voidsent origin or even that combustible.
