#. ja: ミニオン「ブンブク」を呼び出す。<br>変化が得意なタヌキの幼獣。恩は返すほう
#. de: Du rufst Bom Boko als Begleiter herbei. Was für ein drolliges Geschöpf!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Bunbuku, un petit chien viverrin capable de changer d'apparence.
#. column 1: Supposedly Far Eastern raccoon dogs are nothing like the raccoons of Eorzea, shunning a life of rifling through garbage for one of transmogrification into everyday kitchenware such as tea crocks.<br>Go figure.
#. column 2: Now there's a trick<br>what took some bollocks.<br>   - Perimu Haurimu
#. column 3: Astral Era Raccoon Dog War
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:246:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Bom Boko minion. An adorable raccoon dog pup with a big heart and even bigger testicles."
msgstr "Призовите Бом Боко. Очаровательный детёныш енотовидной собаки с огромным сердцем и ещё более огромными яйцами."

#. ja: リテイナーが手に入れた茶釜。どうやら変化の術の腕比べをしているうちに、元に戻れなくなったタヌキの子らしい。哀れに思ったリテイナーが、しばらく腕利きの冒険者の下で修行するといいと考え、連れ帰ってきたようだ
#. de: Die Marderhunde des Fernen Ostens führen ein vollkommen anderes Leben als ihre eorzäischen Artgenossen. Sie durchwühlen keinen Müll und verwandeln sich liebend gerne in Teekessel. Warum auch immer.
#. fr: Ce petit chien viverrin a eu chaud. Il était resté bloqué sous forme de bouilloire après avoir tenté de comparer ses pouvoirs de métamorphe à ceux d'un compère. Le servant qui l'a aidé ne pouvait pas le garder. Il l'a confié à un aventurier expérimenté.
#. column 0: Summon your Bom Boko minion. An adorable raccoon dog pup with a big heart and even bigger testicles.
#. column 2: Now there's a trick<br>what took some bollocks.<br>   - Perimu Haurimu
#. column 3: Astral Era Raccoon Dog War
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:246:0:1"
msgid "Supposedly Far Eastern raccoon dogs are nothing like the raccoons of Eorzea, shunning a life of rifling through garbage for one of transmogrification into everyday kitchenware such as tea crocks.<br>Go figure."
msgstr "Говорят, енотовидные собаки Дальнего Востока совсем не похожи на эорзейских енотов: вместо того чтобы рыться в мусоре, они предпочитают превращаться в обычную кухонную утварь вроде чайников.<br>Вот такие дела."

#. ja: あちち！
#. de: Was ist denn das für eine Masche?<br><i>Pudding zu Allerschutzheiligen</i>
#. fr: Aïe aïe<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Bom Boko minion. An adorable raccoon dog pup with a big heart and even bigger testicles.
#. column 1: Supposedly Far Eastern raccoon dogs are nothing like the raccoons of Eorzea, shunning a life of rifling through garbage for one of transmogrification into everyday kitchenware such as tea crocks.<br>Go figure.
#. column 3: Astral Era Raccoon Dog War
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:246:0:2"
msgid "Now there's a trick<br>what took some bollocks.<br>   - Perimu Haurimu"
msgstr "Вот это фокус!<br>Яиц не пожалел.<br>   — Периму Хариму"

#. ja: ブンブク茶釜
#. de: Mardermasche
#. fr: Chaud bouillant
#. column 0: Summon your Bom Boko minion. An adorable raccoon dog pup with a big heart and even bigger testicles.
#. column 1: Supposedly Far Eastern raccoon dogs are nothing like the raccoons of Eorzea, shunning a life of rifling through garbage for one of transmogrification into everyday kitchenware such as tea crocks.<br>Go figure.
#. column 2: Now there's a trick<br>what took some bollocks.<br>   - Perimu Haurimu
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:246:0:3"
msgid "Astral Era Raccoon Dog War"
msgstr "Война енотовидных собак Астральной эры"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンのDEFを40上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
