#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・リセ」を呼び出す。<br>リセを模した魔法人形。パパリモ、見てて……
#. de: Du rufst deine Lyse-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie ist ja so erwachsen geworden.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Lyse miniature, un petit pantin qui espère ne pas décevoir Papalymo.
#. column 1: Tataru's choice of raiment for this lifelike recreation of Ala Mhigo's newest heroine was, by no means, made with the sole intention of confusing the public into believing Lyse was a dancer by profession. Honest.
#. column 2: It was brave of Lyse<br>to remove her mask<br>after so long...<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Final Heaven
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:248:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Lyse minion. Most certainly not a repurposed wind-up Yda."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Лиз. Разумеется, это вовсе не переделанная заводная миниатюра Иды."

#. ja: リセを模した魔法人形。暁の金庫番にして、腕利き裁縫師でもあるタタルの手によって、アラミゴ伝統の美しい装束までもが再現されている。その姿は、まるで踊り子のようだが、決して、断じて、踊り子ではない
#. de: Der Hersteller dieser Puppe rühmt sich damit, dass er für Lyses Kleidung die Originalschnittmuster der berühmten Näherin Tataru verwendet hat.
#. fr: C'est Tataru, la trésorière des Héritiers de la Septième Aube aux dons de couturière, qui a fabriqué le joli costume traditionnel mhigois de cette poupée. Si ce pantin a tout d'une petite danseuse, méfiez-vous car il tape dur.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Lyse minion. Most certainly not a repurposed wind-up Yda.
#. column 2: It was brave of Lyse<br>to remove her mask<br>after so long...<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Final Heaven
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:248:0:1"
msgid "Tataru's choice of raiment for this lifelike recreation of Ala Mhigo's newest heroine was, by no means, made with the sole intention of confusing the public into believing Lyse was a dancer by profession. Honest."
msgstr "Татару выбрала наряд для этой удивительно реалистичной миниатюры новой героини Ала Миго не затем, чтобы публика приняла Лиз за танцовщицу по профессии. Честное слово."

#. ja: イッケー！
#. de: Yda war also eigentlich Lyse ... und nun hat sie endlich ihre Maske abgenommen.<br><i>Alphinaud</i>
#. fr: Allez<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Lyse minion. Most certainly not a repurposed wind-up Yda.
#. column 1: Tataru's choice of raiment for this lifelike recreation of Ala Mhigo's newest heroine was, by no means, made with the sole intention of confusing the public into believing Lyse was a dancer by profession. Honest.
#. column 3: Final Heaven
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:248:0:2"
msgid "It was brave of Lyse<br>to remove her mask<br>after so long...<br>   - Alphinaud"
msgstr "Лиз хватило смелости<br>снять маску<br>после стольких лет...<br>   — Альфино"

#. ja: ファイナルヘヴン
#. de: Endgültiger Himmel
#. fr: Paradis final
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Lyse minion. Most certainly not a repurposed wind-up Yda.
#. column 1: Tataru's choice of raiment for this lifelike recreation of Ala Mhigo's newest heroine was, by no means, made with the sole intention of confusing the public into believing Lyse was a dancer by profession. Honest.
#. column 2: It was brave of Lyse<br>to remove her mask<br>after so long...<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:248:0:3"
msgid "Final Heaven"
msgstr "Последний рай"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Lyse minion. Most certainly not a repurposed wind-up Yda.
#. column 1: Tataru's choice of raiment for this lifelike recreation of Ala Mhigo's newest heroine was, by no means, made with the sole intention of confusing the public into believing Lyse was a dancer by profession. Honest.
#. column 2: It was brave of Lyse<br>to remove her mask<br>after so long...<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Final Heaven
