msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「ニュー・ユウギリ」を呼び出す。<br>ユウギリを模した魔法人形。承知……
#. de: Du rufst deine neue Yugiri-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Ihre Messer sind tödlich.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Yugiri miniature revisitée, un nouveau modèle du pantin qui sera tout aussi honoré de vous servir.
#. column 1: Inspired by an automaton brought across the sea from faraway Aldenard, a Doman dollmaker set out to see if he could replicate the foreign techniques used to breathe life into the creation, the result being this fairly faithful rendition.
#. column 2: Her name is Yugiri.<br>Perchance you know of her?<br>   - Ihanami
#. column 3: Assassin's Kiss
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:249:0:0"
msgid "Summon your dress-up Yugiri minion. One Yugiri is never enough."
msgstr "Призвать нарядную миниатюру Югири. Одной Югири всегда мало."

#. ja: ユウギリを模した魔法人形。烈士庵のとある人形師が、冒険者の持っていたマメットに触発されて作ったものらしい。ドマ解放を記念して生産したものが、流れ流れてクガネ奉行に献上されたらしいのだが……
#. de: Ein domanischer Puppenmacher bekam eine Marionette aus dem fernen Aldenard in die Hände und schickte sich an, die Techniken zu kopieren. Das Ergebnis kann sich sehen lassen.
#. fr: Cette poupée aurait été conçue par un artisan du Cercle des Intrépides touché en voyant l'autre mascotte de Yugiri et désireux de célébrer la libération de Doma. Elle avait même été offerte au gouverneur de Kugane... Que fait-elle ici<nbsp>!?
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Yugiri minion. One Yugiri is never enough.
#. column 2: Her name is Yugiri.<br>Perchance you know of her?<br>   - Ihanami
#. column 3: Assassin's Kiss
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:249:0:1"
msgid "Inspired by an automaton brought across the sea from faraway Aldenard, a Doman dollmaker set out to see if he could replicate the foreign techniques used to breathe life into the creation, the result being this fairly faithful rendition."
msgstr "Вдохновившись автоматоном, привезённым из далёкого Алденарда, доманский мастер кукол решил попробовать повторить чужеземные приёмы, что оживили ту игрушку. Так появилась эта довольно точная копия."

#. ja: 承知…
#. de: Sie heißt Yugiri. Vielleicht habt ihr ja von ihr gehört?<br><i>Ihanami</i>
#. fr: À votre service...
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Yugiri minion. One Yugiri is never enough.
#. column 1: Inspired by an automaton brought across the sea from faraway Aldenard, a Doman dollmaker set out to see if he could replicate the foreign techniques used to breathe life into the creation, the result being this fairly faithful rendition.
#. column 3: Assassin's Kiss
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:249:0:2"
msgid "Her name is Yugiri.<br>Perchance you know of her?<br>   - Ihanami"
msgstr "Её зовут Югири.<br>Не доводилось о ней слышать?<br>   — Иханами"

#. ja: 暗殺刃
#. de: Messer im Rücken
#. fr: Lame discrète
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Yugiri minion. One Yugiri is never enough.
#. column 1: Inspired by an automaton brought across the sea from faraway Aldenard, a Doman dollmaker set out to see if he could replicate the foreign techniques used to breathe life into the creation, the result being this fairly faithful rendition.
#. column 2: Her name is Yugiri.<br>Perchance you know of her?<br>   - Ihanami
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:249:0:3"
msgid "Assassin's Kiss"
msgstr "Поцелуй убийцы"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、1秒ごとに10の継続ダメージを与える。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>20秒
