#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ゴウセツ」を呼び出す。<br>ゴウセツを模した魔法人形。斬り捨てご免ッ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Gosetsu-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Seine Ehre ist sein Leben.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Gosetsu miniature, un pantin articulé qui a grandement envie de trancher dans le vif.
#. column 1: Crafted to honor Gosetsu─hero and leader of the oppressed peoples of Far Eastern Doma─this miniature replica is faithful down to the blademaster's sword, Samonji.
#. column 2: Notorious fugitive wanted<br>dead or alive by the Empire!<br>   - Isse
#. column 3: Iai
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:250:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Gosetsu minion. Wanted by the Empire...and good little boys and girls across Othard."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — куклу Госэцу. Империя разыскивает его... а ещё его хотят заполучить все хорошие мальчики и девочки Отарда."

#. ja: ゴウセツを模した魔法人形。東州オサード小大陸の辺境国、ドマにおいて侍大将の地位にあった人物の姿を再現してある。剣豪としても知られた彼らしく、腰には愛刀「サモンジ」の模型を佩いている
#. de: Die Nachahmung des stämmigen Samuraikriegers erfreut sich besonders in seiner Heimat Doma großer Beliebtheit. Dort ist man von der realistischen Ausarbeitung seines Schwertes besonders angetan.
#. fr: Ce pantin a été fabriqué à l'image de Gosetsu, l'un des plus grands généraux samouraïs domiens. Compte tenu de la réputation de l'homme quant à son habilité au sabre, cette poupée n'aurait pas été complète sans l'arme préférée de ce guerrier à la hanche.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gosetsu minion. Wanted by the Empire...and good little boys and girls across Othard.
#. column 2: Notorious fugitive wanted<br>dead or alive by the Empire!<br>   - Isse
#. column 3: Iai
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:250:0:1"
msgid "Crafted to honor Gosetsu─hero and leader of the oppressed peoples of Far Eastern Doma─this miniature replica is faithful down to the blademaster's sword, Samonji."
msgstr "Эту миниатюрную копию создали в честь Госэцу — героя и предводителя угнетённого народа Дома на Дальнем Востоке. Кукла точь-в-точь повторяет его облик, вплоть до меча мастера клинка по имени Самондзи."

#. ja: セイヤーッ！
#. de: Samurai von Kaien und Anführer des Widerstands,<br>seit einem Jahr auf der Flucht vor den Häschern der Garlear!<br><i>Isse</i>
#. fr: Yaaah<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gosetsu minion. Wanted by the Empire...and good little boys and girls across Othard.
#. column 1: Crafted to honor Gosetsu─hero and leader of the oppressed peoples of Far Eastern Doma─this miniature replica is faithful down to the blademaster's sword, Samonji.
#. column 3: Iai
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:250:0:2"
msgid "Notorious fugitive wanted<br>dead or alive by the Empire!<br>   - Isse"
msgstr "Опасный беглец! Империя<br>разыскивает его живым или мёртвым!<br>   — Иссэ"

#. ja: 居合
#. de: Iai
#. fr: Iai
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gosetsu minion. Wanted by the Empire...and good little boys and girls across Othard.
#. column 1: Crafted to honor Gosetsu─hero and leader of the oppressed peoples of Far Eastern Doma─this miniature replica is faithful down to the blademaster's sword, Samonji.
#. column 2: Notorious fugitive wanted<br>dead or alive by the Empire!<br>   - Isse
