msgid "Iai"
msgstr "Иай"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK150のダメージを与え、さらにDEFを30%低下させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 150 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und verringert ihre ABW um 30<nbsp>%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 150 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et réduit leur défense de 30%.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gosetsu minion. Wanted by the Empire...and good little boys and girls across Othard.
#. column 1: Crafted to honor Gosetsu─hero and leader of the oppressed peoples of Far Eastern Doma─this miniature replica is faithful down to the blademaster's sword, Samonji.
#. column 2: Notorious fugitive wanted<br>dead or alive by the Empire!<br>   - Isse
#. column 3: Iai
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 505> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 505 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:250:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s"
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 150 и понижает их ЗАЩ на 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ヨツユ」を呼び出す。<br>ヨツユを模した魔法人形。アッハ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Yotsuyu-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Alles ist vergeben. Sie hatte eine harte Kindheit.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Yotsuyu miniature, une petite poupée à l'air mauvais...
#. column 1: Searching for artistic inspiration, a goldsmith chanced to see an imported painting of a Doman beauty. The woman was apparently a renowned courtesan, and her exquisitely haughty features so enthralled him that he decided to immortalize her in mammet form.
#. column 2: Surely Yotsuyu has<br>crossed the line now...<br>   - Alisaie
#. column 3: Pipe Dream
#. column 4: Sets a trap which can be activated by button after 10 seconds. When triggered, it delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:251:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Yotsuyu minion. For that delicious disdain you never knew you needed."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Ёцуя. Для тех, кому не хватало её сладкого презрения."

#. ja: ヨツユを模した魔法人形。東方地域から輸入された美人絵を見た、とある彫金師が、そこに描かれていた女性を模して作ったもの。どうやら、かつてドマで絶大な人気を誇った遊女らしく、妖艶な顔立ちをしている
#. de: Die Nachbildung der verhassten Statthalterin findet eigentlich nur in Eorzea Absatz. Der ul'dhische Marionettenmacher kümmerte sich wenig um Authentizität und formte das Gesicht nach einer berühmten Geiko aus Sanjo Hanamachi.
#. fr: Un orfèvre aurait créé ce pantin après avoir vu un tableau importé re<shy>pré<shy>sen<shy>tant une beauté orientale. C'est à peine s'il savait que cette femme lui inspirant tant de fascination était en fait l'une des prostituées les plus populaires qui fut à Doma.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Yotsuyu minion. For that delicious disdain you never knew you needed.
#. column 2: Surely Yotsuyu has<br>crossed the line now...<br>   - Alisaie
#. column 3: Pipe Dream
#. column 4: Sets a trap which can be activated by button after 10 seconds. When triggered, it delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:251:0:1"
msgid "Searching for artistic inspiration, a goldsmith chanced to see an imported painting of a Doman beauty. The woman was apparently a renowned courtesan, and her exquisitely haughty features so enthralled him that he decided to immortalize her in mammet form."
msgstr "В поисках вдохновения ювелир случайно увидел привезённую из Дома картину с изображением красавицы. Та, как выяснилось, была знаменитой куртизанкой. Её надменная красота так пленила мастера, что он решил увековечить её в виде куклы."

#. ja: アッハ！
#. de: Das ist sie, unsere Erzfeindin, die schändliche Statthalterin Yotsuyu.<br><i>Gosetsu</i>
#. fr: Ha ha ha<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Yotsuyu minion. For that delicious disdain you never knew you needed.
#. column 1: Searching for artistic inspiration, a goldsmith chanced to see an imported painting of a Doman beauty. The woman was apparently a renowned courtesan, and her exquisitely haughty features so enthralled him that he decided to immortalize her in mammet form.
#. column 3: Pipe Dream
#. column 4: Sets a trap which can be activated by button after 10 seconds. When triggered, it delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:251:0:2"
msgid "Surely Yotsuyu has<br>crossed the line now...<br>   - Alisaie"
msgstr "Кажется, Ёцуя<br>перешла все границы...<br>   — Ализе"

#. ja: キセル
#. de: Übler Plan
#. fr: Pipe fumante
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Yotsuyu minion. For that delicious disdain you never knew you needed.
#. column 1: Searching for artistic inspiration, a goldsmith chanced to see an imported painting of a Doman beauty. The woman was apparently a renowned courtesan, and her exquisitely haughty features so enthralled him that he decided to immortalize her in mammet form.
#. column 2: Surely Yotsuyu has<br>crossed the line now...<br>   - Alisaie
#. column 4: Sets a trap which can be activated by button after 10 seconds. When triggered, it delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:251:0:3"
msgid "Pipe Dream"
msgstr "Дым без огня"

#. ja: トラップを配置する。10秒後トラップ発動ボタンにより起爆可能。範囲内にいる敵にATK180のダメージを与える。
#. de: Stellt eine Falle auf, die nach 10 Sekunden ausgelöst werden kann. Bewirkt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 180 auf die Feinde in der Nähe.
#. fr: Place un piège qui peut être déclenché 10 secondes plus tard.<br>Piège<nbsp>: inflige des dégâts d'attaque 180 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Yotsuyu minion. For that delicious disdain you never knew you needed.
#. column 1: Searching for artistic inspiration, a goldsmith chanced to see an imported painting of a Doman beauty. The woman was apparently a renowned courtesan, and her exquisitely haughty features so enthralled him that he decided to immortalize her in mammet form.
#. column 2: Surely Yotsuyu has<br>crossed the line now...<br>   - Alisaie
#. column 3: Pipe Dream
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:251:0:4"
msgid "Sets a trap which can be activated by button after 10 seconds. When triggered, it delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range. "
msgstr "Устанавливает ловушку. Через 10 секунд её можно взорвать кнопкой. При срабатывании наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 180."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・グリーンワート」を呼び出す。<br>グリーンワートを模した魔法人形。ブワーハッハッ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Grynewaht als Begleiter herbei. Ist schwerer, als er aussieht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Grynewaht miniature, un pantin pris d'accès de folie.
#. column 1: This anatomically accurate simulacrum of the imperial soldier Grynewaht appears to have been built by magitek engineers to determine the most efficient means by which to incorporate magitek implants into the Roegadyn's body.
#. column 2: It's like all my namedays<br>have come at once!<br>  - Grynewaht
#. column 3: Gunsaw
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:252:0:0"
msgid "Summon your mock-up Grynewaht minion. Bwahahahaha!"
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Гриневарта. Бва-ха-ха-ха!"

#. ja: グリーンワートを模した魔法人形。魔導装置との融合手術における手順を確認するための模型として作られたものらしい。そこかしこに、帝国公用語で注意書きが記されている。帝国軍の非道さを裏付ける物証のひとつ
#. de: Diese anatomisch korrekte Nachbildung des garleischen Soldaten Grynewaht half den Magitek-Ingenieuren dabei zu ermitteln, wie viel Magitek-Implantate man wohl in den Körper eines Roegadyn stopfen kann.
#. fr: Ce pantin, couvert çà et là d'avertissements écrits en langue officielle garlemaldaise, a été conçu pour mieux visualiser les étapes de pose d'équipement magitek sur Grynewaht. C'est la preuve matérielle de l'une des atrocités commises par l'Empire.
#. column 0: Summon your mock-up Grynewaht minion. Bwahahahaha!
#. column 2: It's like all my namedays<br>have come at once!<br>  - Grynewaht
#. column 3: Gunsaw
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:252:0:1"
msgid "This anatomically accurate simulacrum of the imperial soldier Grynewaht appears to have been built by magitek engineers to determine the most efficient means by which to incorporate magitek implants into the Roegadyn's body."
msgstr "Похоже, этот анатомически точный двойник имперского солдата Гриневарта был создан инженерами магитека, чтобы выяснить, как эффективнее вживлять магитековые импланты в тело рогадина."

#. ja: ブワーハッハッ！
#. de: Hahahahaaa! Heute muss mein Glückstag sein!<br><i>Grynewaht</i>
#. fr: Bouah ha ha<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your mock-up Grynewaht minion. Bwahahahaha!
#. column 1: This anatomically accurate simulacrum of the imperial soldier Grynewaht appears to have been built by magitek engineers to determine the most efficient means by which to incorporate magitek implants into the Roegadyn's body.
#. column 3: Gunsaw
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:252:0:2"
msgid "It's like all my namedays<br>have come at once!<br>  - Grynewaht"
msgstr "Будто все мои именинные дни<br>разом настали!<br>   — Гриневарт"

#. ja: ガンチェーンソー
#. de: Knall
#. fr: Canon-tronçonneur
#. column 0: Summon your mock-up Grynewaht minion. Bwahahahaha!
#. column 1: This anatomically accurate simulacrum of the imperial soldier Grynewaht appears to have been built by magitek engineers to determine the most efficient means by which to incorporate magitek implants into the Roegadyn's body.
#. column 2: It's like all my namedays<br>have come at once!<br>  - Grynewaht
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:252:0:3"
msgid "Gunsaw"
msgstr "Пушка-пила"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et les projette en arrière.
#. column 0: Summon your mock-up Grynewaht minion. Bwahahahaha!
#. column 1: This anatomically accurate simulacrum of the imperial soldier Grynewaht appears to have been built by magitek engineers to determine the most efficient means by which to incorporate magitek implants into the Roegadyn's body.
#. column 2: It's like all my namedays<br>have come at once!<br>  - Grynewaht
#. column 3: Gunsaw
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:252:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 90 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ナマズオ」を呼び出す。<br>ナマズオを模した魔法人形っぺよ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Namazuo als Begleiter herbei. Bitte regelmäßig befeuchten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Namazu mécanique, une poupée qui semble presque aussi visqueuse qu'un vrai Namazu.
#. column 1: Not too many summers past, there wasn't a house in all Radz-at-Han that didn't echo with the pitter-patter of Hingan-made wind-up Namazu dolls, their misplaced eyes and bewhiskered lips the source of much mirth in the Near Eastern nation.
#. column 2: He's not heavy,<br>but gods, the smell...<br>   - Lyse
#. column 3: Catty Cunning
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:253:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Namazu minion. Half cat. Half fish. All fish."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру намадзу. Полукот. Полурыба. Сплошная рыба."

#. ja: ナマズオを模した魔法人形。ひんがしの国の人形師たちが作ったもので、一昔前にクガネにて土産品として販売されていた。これが近東のサベネアでは、一時期、大ブームになったことがあったらしい
#. de: Die Händler von Radz-at-Han haben selten einen Verkaufsschlager erlebt wie die Nachbildung der Fffischwesen mit der fffeuchten Aussprache. Manche Haushalte hatten sogar zwei.
#. fr: Un marionnettiste hingashien a fabriqué cette poupée, qui était autrefois un jouet populaire dans les boutiques de souvenirs. On raconte même qu'il y en avait partout sur l'île proche-orientale de Thavnair<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Namazu minion. Half cat. Half fish. All fish.
#. column 2: He's not heavy,<br>but gods, the smell...<br>   - Lyse
#. column 3: Catty Cunning
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:253:0:1"
msgid "Not too many summers past, there wasn't a house in all Radz-at-Han that didn't echo with the pitter-patter of Hingan-made wind-up Namazu dolls, their misplaced eyes and bewhiskered lips the source of much mirth in the Near Eastern nation."
msgstr "Не так уж много лет назад в каждом доме Радз-ат-Хана раздавался топот заводных намадзу, изготовленных в Хингаси. Их косые глаза и усатые мордочки веселили жителей ближневосточной страны."

#. ja: ギョギョギョ！？
#. de: Gyodo sieht nicht nur wie ein Fisch aus, er riecht auch so.<br><i>Lyse</i>
#. fr: Du poisson<nbsp>!?
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Namazu minion. Half cat. Half fish. All fish.
#. column 1: Not too many summers past, there wasn't a house in all Radz-at-Han that didn't echo with the pitter-patter of Hingan-made wind-up Namazu dolls, their misplaced eyes and bewhiskered lips the source of much mirth in the Near Eastern nation.
#. column 3: Catty Cunning
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:253:0:2"
msgid "He's not heavy,<br>but gods, the smell...<br>   - Lyse"
msgstr "Тяжёлый не он,<br>а вот запах...<br>   — Лиз"

#. ja: 悪知恵
#. de: Bartelgrapscher
#. fr: Poisson-chat échaudé
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Namazu minion. Half cat. Half fish. All fish.
#. column 1: Not too many summers past, there wasn't a house in all Radz-at-Han that didn't echo with the pitter-patter of Hingan-made wind-up Namazu dolls, their misplaced eyes and bewhiskered lips the source of much mirth in the Near Eastern nation.
#. column 2: He's not heavy,<br>but gods, the smell...<br>   - Lyse
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:253:0:3"
msgid "Catty Cunning"
msgstr "Кошачья хитрость"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵にかかっている、強化効果をすべて打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle positiven Effekte von den gegnerischen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe tous les effets bénéfiques des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Namazu minion. Half cat. Half fish. All fish.
#. column 1: Not too many summers past, there wasn't a house in all Radz-at-Han that didn't echo with the pitter-patter of Hingan-made wind-up Namazu dolls, their misplaced eyes and bewhiskered lips the source of much mirth in the Near Eastern nation.
#. column 2: He's not heavy,<br>but gods, the smell...<br>   - Lyse
#. column 3: Catty Cunning
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:253:0:4"
msgid "Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все положительные эффекты со всех противников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「イヴォン人形」を呼び出す。<br>双豹のイヴォンを模したただの人形。なぜか動く
#. de: Du rufst deine Ivon Coeurlfaust-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Mit echtem Naturhaar.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée Ivon le Coeurl, un jouet étrangement très actif.
#. column 1: A complete dismantling of the coeurl-fisted caricature shows that, unlike the automata of Ul'dah, the puffered paunch of this poppet contains naught but cotton and straw, leading one to wonder...how in the seven hells does it walk!?
#. column 2: He had a pair o' Sphairai<br>crafted─fists what looked<br>like coeurls.<br>   - Gerolt
#. column 3: Spiritfist
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:254:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Ivon Coeurlfist doll minion. Technically “Coeurl<i>paw</i>.”"
msgstr "Призвать куклу-прислужника Ивона Кёрлфиста. Точнее, «кёрл<i>лапу</i>»."

#. ja: 双豹のイヴォンを模したただの人形……のはずだが、なぜか動く。調べてみても、中には何もカラクリ仕掛けらしきものは入っていない。だが、やっぱり動く。これはもう、何かが取り憑いているとしか思えない
#. de: Anders als die ul'dhischen Marionetten ist dieser mächtige Mönch aus nichts als Tuch, Stroh und Garn gefertigt. Man fragt sich: Wie im Namen Nalds kann es sein, dass er läuft?
#. fr: Cette poupée, qui devrait être inanimée, bouge... Des spé<shy>cia<shy>listes l'ont longuement analysée, mais ils n'ont trouvé aucun rouage, mécanisme ou fil qui pourrait lui permettre de se déplacer... Serait-elle possédée<nbsp>!?
#. column 0: Summon your Ivon Coeurlfist doll minion. Technically “Coeurl<i>paw</i>.”
#. column 2: He had a pair o' Sphairai<br>crafted─fists what looked<br>like coeurls.<br>   - Gerolt
#. column 3: Spiritfist
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:254:0:1"
msgid "A complete dismantling of the coeurl-fisted caricature shows that, unlike the automata of Ul'dah, the puffered paunch of this poppet contains naught but cotton and straw, leading one to wonder...how in the seven hells does it walk!?"
msgstr "Полная разборка этой карикатурной куклы с кулачками в виде кёрлов показала: в отличие от автоматонов Ульды, в её пухлом брюшке нет ничего, кроме ваты и соломы. И всё же... как, во имя всех семи преисподних, она ходит?!"

#. ja: フンッ！
#. de: Seine Sphairai hat er Coeurl-Köpfen nachempfunden.<br>Genie und Wahnsinn liegen halt immer nah beieinander.<br><i>Gerolt</i>
#. fr: Humpf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Ivon Coeurlfist doll minion. Technically “Coeurl<i>paw</i>.”
#. column 1: A complete dismantling of the coeurl-fisted caricature shows that, unlike the automata of Ul'dah, the puffered paunch of this poppet contains naught but cotton and straw, leading one to wonder...how in the seven hells does it walk!?
#. column 3: Spiritfist
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:254:0:2"
msgid "He had a pair o' Sphairai<br>crafted─fists what looked<br>like coeurls.<br>   - Gerolt"
msgstr "Он заказал пару «Сфайраев»<br>с кулаками в виде кёрлов.<br>   — Герольт"

#. ja: 霊丹
#. de: Mentalfaust
#. fr: Coup de coeurl
#. column 0: Summon your Ivon Coeurlfist doll minion. Technically “Coeurl<i>paw</i>.”
#. column 1: A complete dismantling of the coeurl-fisted caricature shows that, unlike the automata of Ul'dah, the puffered paunch of this poppet contains naught but cotton and straw, leading one to wonder...how in the seven hells does it walk!?
#. column 2: He had a pair o' Sphairai<br>crafted─fists what looked<br>like coeurls.<br>   - Gerolt
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:254:0:3"
msgid "Spiritfist"
msgstr "Духовный кулак"

#. ja: ゲート内にいるミニオンのHP回復量を2倍にする。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>20秒
#. de: Verdoppelt die LP-Regeneration der Trabanten innerhalb eines Tors.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 Sekunden
#. fr: Double le montant de PV récupérés par les mascottes qui se trouvent à l'intérieur des portails.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. column 0: Summon your Ivon Coeurlfist doll minion. Technically “Coeurl<i>paw</i>.”
#. column 1: A complete dismantling of the coeurl-fisted caricature shows that, unlike the automata of Ul'dah, the puffered paunch of this poppet contains naught but cotton and straw, leading one to wonder...how in the seven hells does it walk!?
#. column 2: He had a pair o' Sphairai<br>crafted─fists what looked<br>like coeurls.<br>   - Gerolt
