msgctxt "CompanionTransient:254:0:4"
msgid "Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s"
msgstr "Удваивает количество восстанавливаемых ОЗ у союзников, находящихся в воротах.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメットキメラ」を呼び出す。<br>パペットキメラを模した魔法人形。悪趣味
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-Chimära als Begleiter herbei. Vorsicht, beißt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte chimère mécanique, une poupée enchantée reconstituée et de relativement mauvais goût.
#. column 1: It is hard to imagine anyone taking pleasure in creating to-scale replicas of the very abominations that contributed to the end of an entire civilization. Then again, it is so utterly <i>adorable</i>.
#. column 2: That chimera must be<br>his latest prize.<br>   - Hildibrand
#. column 3: Night Terror
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:255:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up chimera minion. Crafted by piecing together the remnants of unsold automata."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру химеры. Сделана из остатков непроданных автоматонов."

#. ja: 妖異パペットキメラを模した、グロテスクな魔法人形。こんな悪趣味なデザインの人形を作るなんて、信じられないと言いかけて、作ったのが誰かを思い起こして、口をつぐむ。それが大人というものだろう
#. de: Chimära sind für den Untergang einer ganzen Zivilisation verantwortlich, weshalb sich die Frage stellt, wer sich solche Bestien als Spielzeug kauft. Vielleicht weil die Marionetten so süß aussehen.
#. fr: Une poupée enchantée qui vous donnera des sueurs froides. Personne ne sait qui a fabriqué cette abomination... pas même le pantin. Et lorsqu'il croit s'en souvenir, son visage s'assombrit. C'est que ce n'était pro<shy>ba<shy>ble<shy>ment pas un enfant innocent...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up chimera minion. Crafted by piecing together the remnants of unsold automata.
#. column 2: That chimera must be<br>his latest prize.<br>   - Hildibrand
#. column 3: Night Terror
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:255:0:1"
msgid "It is hard to imagine anyone taking pleasure in creating to-scale replicas of the very abominations that contributed to the end of an entire civilization. Then again, it is so utterly <i>adorable</i>."
msgstr "Трудно представить, что кому-то доставляет удовольствие создавать точные копии чудовищ, погубивших целую цивилизацию. Хотя... она такая <i>очаровательная</i>."

#. ja: ケケケケケ！
#. de: Dein Lachen wird dir im Halse stecken bleiben, sobald du der Chimära ge<shy>gen<shy>über<shy>stehst.<br><i>Norman</i>
#. fr: Hé hé<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up chimera minion. Crafted by piecing together the remnants of unsold automata.
#. column 1: It is hard to imagine anyone taking pleasure in creating to-scale replicas of the very abominations that contributed to the end of an entire civilization. Then again, it is so utterly <i>adorable</i>.
#. column 3: Night Terror
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:255:0:2"
msgid "That chimera must be<br>his latest prize.<br>   - Hildibrand"
msgstr "Эта химера — должно быть,<br>его очередной трофей.<br>   — Хильдибранд"

#. ja: 悪夢
#. de: Nachtschrecken
#. fr: Cauchemar
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up chimera minion. Crafted by piecing together the remnants of unsold automata.
#. column 1: It is hard to imagine anyone taking pleasure in creating to-scale replicas of the very abominations that contributed to the end of an entire civilization. Then again, it is so utterly <i>adorable</i>.
#. column 2: That chimera must be<br>his latest prize.<br>   - Hildibrand
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:255:0:3"
msgid "Night Terror"
msgstr "Ночной кошмар"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵の特殊技ポイントを、最大値の50%減少させる。
#. de: Verringert die Technikpunkte der Gegner in der Nähe um 50<nbsp>% des Maximalwerts.
#. fr: Réduit les PdT des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet de 50% de leur valeur maximale.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up chimera minion. Crafted by piecing together the remnants of unsold automata.
#. column 1: It is hard to imagine anyone taking pleasure in creating to-scale replicas of the very abominations that contributed to the end of an entire civilization. Then again, it is so utterly <i>adorable</i>.
#. column 2: That chimera must be<br>his latest prize.<br>   - Hildibrand
#. column 3: Night Terror
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:255:0:4"
msgid "Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value."
msgstr "Понижает очки особых приёмов всех противников в радиусе действия на 50% от максимума."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ミートイーター」を呼び出す。<br>キキルンを模した魔法人形。荒々しい山賊仕様
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Fleischfresser als Begleiter herbei. Tofu-Fleischersatz führt zum Verlust der Garantie.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte croque-viande mécanique, une poupée en forme de Qiqirn qui est aussi im<shy>pré<shy>vi<shy>si<shy>ble qu'un bandit.
#. column 1: This fully functioning automaton was discovered in the pack of a Qiqirn bandit slain on the Hunt. Why a Qiqirn was carrying a copy of itself on its person is a question you <i>could</i> ask yourself, but as they say, “ignorance is bliss.”
#. column 2: Empty bellies send<br>blood aboiling!<br>   - Qiqirn Bandit
#. column 3: Tiny Intuition
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:256:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up meateater minion. Watch out boys, he'll (literally) chew you up."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру мясоеда. Берегись, дружок: он тебя (буквально) сожрёт."

#. ja: とある名物モブハンターが、襲ってきたキキルン族の山賊を返り討ちにした際に、戦利品として手に入れたもの。どうやら山賊の親玉が、手下たちに配っていたものらしい。どこか恐ろしげな山賊風衣装がチャームポイント
#. de: Diese vollfunktionstüchtige Marionette fand man im Beutel eines Qiqirn, der auf der Hohen Jagd erlegt wurde. Ob er sich selbst in ihm wiedererkannte? Ob er ihn für einen<nbsp>- seltsamen<nbsp>- Artgenossen hielt? Man wird es nie erfahren.
#. fr: Un célèbre expert de la Chasse l'aurait rapporté d'une expédition punitive chez des Qiqirns qui sévissaient dans les montagnes. Aussi étrange que cela puisse paraître, le chef des bandits en distribuait à ses hommes... Une chose est sûre, son accoutrement le rend adorable<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up meateater minion. Watch out boys, he'll (literally) chew you up.
#. column 2: Empty bellies send<br>blood aboiling!<br>   - Qiqirn Bandit
#. column 3: Tiny Intuition
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:256:0:1"
msgid "This fully functioning automaton was discovered in the pack of a Qiqirn bandit slain on the Hunt. Why a Qiqirn was carrying a copy of itself on its person is a question you <i>could</i> ask yourself, but as they say, “ignorance is bliss.”"
msgstr "Этот исправно работающий автоматон нашли в сумке кикирнского разбойника, убитого на Охоте. Зачем кикирну таскать с собой собственную копию — вопрос, который ты <i>можешь</i> себе задать. Но, как говорится, меньше знаешь — крепче спишь."

#. ja: ニクニククレクレ！
#. de: Wollt ihr unser Frischfleisch haben? Wir geben nichts ab!<br><i>Qiqirn</i>
#. fr: Donne la viande<nbsp>! Miam miam la viande<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up meateater minion. Watch out boys, he'll (literally) chew you up.
#. column 1: This fully functioning automaton was discovered in the pack of a Qiqirn bandit slain on the Hunt. Why a Qiqirn was carrying a copy of itself on its person is a question you <i>could</i> ask yourself, but as they say, “ignorance is bliss.”
#. column 3: Tiny Intuition
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:256:0:2"
msgid "Empty bellies send<br>blood aboiling!<br>   - Qiqirn Bandit"
msgstr "Пустой желудок<br>вскипятит кровь!<br>   — Кикирн-разбойник"

#. ja: ネズミの直感
#. de: Auge des Qiqirn
#. fr: Méfiance
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up meateater minion. Watch out boys, he'll (literally) chew you up.
#. column 1: This fully functioning automaton was discovered in the pack of a Qiqirn bandit slain on the Hunt. Why a Qiqirn was carrying a copy of itself on its person is a question you <i>could</i> ask yourself, but as they say, “ignorance is bliss.”
#. column 2: Empty bellies send<br>blood aboiling!<br>   - Qiqirn Bandit
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:256:0:3"
msgid "Tiny Intuition"
msgstr "Чутьё мыши"

#. ja: 敵が配置したトラップがある場合、解除する。
#. de: Entfernt eine vom Gegner aufgestellte Falle.
#. fr: Enlève un piège mis en place par l'ennemi.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up meateater minion. Watch out boys, he'll (literally) chew you up.
#. column 1: This fully functioning automaton was discovered in the pack of a Qiqirn bandit slain on the Hunt. Why a Qiqirn was carrying a copy of itself on its person is a question you <i>could</i> ask yourself, but as they say, “ignorance is bliss.”
#. column 2: Empty bellies send<br>blood aboiling!<br>   - Qiqirn Bandit
#. column 3: Tiny Intuition
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:256:0:4"
msgid "Disarms deployed enemy traps."
msgstr "Обезвреживает расставленные противником ловушки."

#. ja: ミニオン「魔導アヴェンジャー追従型」を呼び出す。<br>魔導アヴェンジャーを模したからくり模型。山が動いた！
#. de: Du rufst deinen A-Rächer der XII. Legion als Begleiter herbei. Er hat längst vergessen, was er eigentlich rächen will.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte vengeur magitek S1, une poupée mécanique qui reproduit à la perfection les suiveurs impériaux et qui fait elle aussi trembler les forêts lorsqu'elle se frappe le torse.
#. column 1: It appears the Empire created these faithful reproductions to train field engineers on how to repair actual avenger-class warmachina. The fact that the selfsame models are sold to imperial children as toys is a telling sign of the invaders' mindset.
#. column 2: The desire to protect and the<br>desire to avenge are opposing<br>forces that can ill be reconciled.<br>   - Alberic
#. column 3: Autopilot
#. column 4: Increases caster ATK by 10 and DEF by 5 for every 5% of HP lost.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:257:0:0"
msgid "Summon your magitek avenger F1 minion. Avenger, assembled!"
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Магитековый мститель F1». Мститель, к бою!"

#. ja: 帝国軍が訓練用に製作した魔導アヴェンジャーの縮小模型。無人機である同機の配備を受ける部隊の指揮官に、その特性と有効な運用法を伝授するために用いられた。なお、帝国本国では玩具としても販売されている
#. de: Die technischen Ausstatter der kaiserlichen Armee geben diese Reproduktionen ihren Ingenieuren, um die Reparatur der echten Einheiten im Feld zu erleichtern. Auf die Idee, sie auch an Kinder zu verteilen, kann nur ein Garlear kommen.
#. fr: Cette poupée a été fabriquée par les Impériaux afin de permettre aux commandants qui auraient à en incorporer dans leur unité de mieux comprendre les particularités de ces dispositifs de combat sans pilote. Ces pantins ont fini vendus comme de simples jouets.
#. column 0: Summon your magitek avenger F1 minion. Avenger, assembled!
#. column 2: The desire to protect and the<br>desire to avenge are opposing<br>forces that can ill be reconciled.<br>   - Alberic
#. column 3: Autopilot
#. column 4: Increases caster ATK by 10 and DEF by 5 for every 5% of HP lost.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:257:0:1"
msgid "It appears the Empire created these faithful reproductions to train field engineers on how to repair actual avenger-class warmachina. The fact that the selfsame models are sold to imperial children as toys is a telling sign of the invaders' mindset."
msgstr "Похоже, Империя создала точные копии магитековых боевых машин класса «Мститель», чтобы обучать полевых инженеров их ремонту. А тот факт, что такие же модели продают имперским детям как игрушки, красноречиво говорит о мышлении захватчиков."

#. ja: ウィーン…
#. de: Rache tut gut! Sooo gut!<br><i>Bo Zu</i>
#. fr: Identification en cours...
#. column 0: Summon your magitek avenger F1 minion. Avenger, assembled!
#. column 1: It appears the Empire created these faithful reproductions to train field engineers on how to repair actual avenger-class warmachina. The fact that the selfsame models are sold to imperial children as toys is a telling sign of the invaders' mindset.
#. column 3: Autopilot
#. column 4: Increases caster ATK by 10 and DEF by 5 for every 5% of HP lost.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:257:0:2"
msgid "The desire to protect and the<br>desire to avenge are opposing<br>forces that can ill be reconciled.<br>   - Alberic"
msgstr "Желание защищать и<br>желание мстить — силы<br>противоположные и несовместимые.<br>   — Альберик"

#. ja: ドラミング
#. de: Autopilot
#. fr: Tambourinage
#. column 0: Summon your magitek avenger F1 minion. Avenger, assembled!
#. column 1: It appears the Empire created these faithful reproductions to train field engineers on how to repair actual avenger-class warmachina. The fact that the selfsame models are sold to imperial children as toys is a telling sign of the invaders' mindset.
#. column 2: The desire to protect and the<br>desire to avenge are opposing<br>forces that can ill be reconciled.<br>   - Alberic
#. column 4: Increases caster ATK by 10 and DEF by 5 for every 5% of HP lost.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:257:0:3"
msgid "Autopilot"
msgstr "Автопилот"

#. ja: 自身のATKとDEFを上昇させる。自身の残りHPが少ないほど上昇量が増し、ATKはHPの減った量5%につき10、DEFはHPの減った量5%につき5上昇する。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Erhöht die ATT und ABW der ausführenden Trabanten. Pro 5<nbsp>% verlorener LP steigt die ATT um 10 und die ABW um 5.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente son attaque et sa défense. Les montants sont majorés de 10 pour l'attaque et de 5 pour la défense par tranche de 5% de PV perdus.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your magitek avenger F1 minion. Avenger, assembled!
#. column 1: It appears the Empire created these faithful reproductions to train field engineers on how to repair actual avenger-class warmachina. The fact that the selfsame models are sold to imperial children as toys is a telling sign of the invaders' mindset.
#. column 2: The desire to protect and the<br>desire to avenge are opposing<br>forces that can ill be reconciled.<br>   - Alberic
#. column 3: Autopilot
