msgctxt "CompanionTransient:257:0:4"
msgid "Increases caster ATK by 10 and DEF by 5 for every 5% of HP lost.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s"
msgstr "Повышает АТК призвавшего на 10, а ЗАЩ — на 5 за каждые потерянные 5% ОЗ.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「ギード」を呼び出す。<br>なぜか空を泳ぐ老亀。まあよい、まあよい！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Ghido als Begleiter herbei. Er riecht ein wenig nach Seewasser.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Ghido, une tortue qui vole...
#. column 1: Some say this denizen of the Sirensong Sea has seen upwards of seven hundred summers, and in that time his hate for blue-blazoned armor has only grown. As for why, no one knows.
#. column 2: Matron's teats,<br>those turtles are huge!<br>   - Waemlydir
#. column 3: Turtle Infestation
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:258:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Ghido minion. There is most likely a logical explanation as to why this aged turtle can navigate the skies. Most likely."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника Гидо. Наверняка есть разумное объяснение тому, как эта старая черепаха летает. Наверняка."

#. ja: セイレーン海で出会った老亀。一説では700歳以上とも言われるほど、長い時を生きてきたらしく、強力な魔力を有しており、空中を泳いで移動する。なぜか青い甲冑を見ると激高するのだが、その理由は定かではない
#. de: Manche glauben, dass dieser Bewohner der Sirenen-See schon siebenhundert Sommer gesehen hat. Mit jedem Sommer wuchs sein Hass auf die Blaupanzer, aus Gründen, die er nur selber kennt.
#. fr: Vous avez fait la rencontre de cette tortue dans la Mer du Chant des sirènes. Elle aurait plus de sept cents ans et sa longévité lui aurait permis d'acquérir de grands pouvoirs. La vue de certaines armures bleues provoque d'inexplicables paniques chez elle.
#. column 0: Summon your Ghido minion. There is most likely a logical explanation as to why this aged turtle can navigate the skies. Most likely.
#. column 2: Matron's teats,<br>those turtles are huge!<br>   - Waemlydir
#. column 3: Turtle Infestation
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:258:0:1"
msgid "Some say this denizen of the Sirensong Sea has seen upwards of seven hundred summers, and in that time his hate for blue-blazoned armor has only grown. As for why, no one knows."
msgstr "Говорят, этот обитатель Моря песен сирен прожил больше семисот лет. И всё это время его ненависть к синим доспехам лишь крепла. Почему — никто не знает."

#. ja: まあよい、まあよい！
#. de: Verdammt, hab ich mich erschreckt!<br>Wenn diese Schildkrötenbiester stillstehen, sehen sie aus wie Felsen.<br><i>Waemlydir</i>
#. fr: Tu crois que j'ai passé sept cents ans à me goinfrer<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your Ghido minion. There is most likely a logical explanation as to why this aged turtle can navigate the skies. Most likely.
#. column 1: Some say this denizen of the Sirensong Sea has seen upwards of seven hundred summers, and in that time his hate for blue-blazoned armor has only grown. As for why, no one knows.
#. column 3: Turtle Infestation
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:258:0:2"
msgid "Matron's teats,<br>those turtles are huge!<br>   - Waemlydir"
msgstr "Святые соски!<br>Да они же огромные!<br>   — Веймлидир"

#. ja: 大賢者
#. de: Schildkrötentempo
#. fr: Grande sagesse
#. column 0: Summon your Ghido minion. There is most likely a logical explanation as to why this aged turtle can navigate the skies. Most likely.
#. column 1: Some say this denizen of the Sirensong Sea has seen upwards of seven hundred summers, and in that time his hate for blue-blazoned armor has only grown. As for why, no one knows.
