msgctxt "CompanionTransient:259:0:2"
msgid "Death is but the blissful<br>terminus of the lives of<br>the weak.<br>   - Nhazaa Jaab"
msgstr "Смерть — лишь блаженный<br>конец жизни<br>слабых.<br>   — Нхаза Джааб"

#. ja: 無の力
#. de: Todesursache
#. fr: Puissance du néant
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Exdeath minion. Most maniacal tree beings bent on world domination are usually not intimidated by turtles. This one is.
