#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・クロ」を呼び出す。<br>クロ・アリアポーを模した魔法人形。やっほー！
#. de: Du rufst deine Khloe-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Der Hit im Kinderheim.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Khloe miniature, un charmant petit pantin qui ressemble à s'y méprendre à Khloe Aliapoh.
#. column 1: Ever since she began receiving them on her doorstep─one a day, every day, without fail─Khloe Aliapoh can't help but think there is something seriously wrong with whoever is sending her these disturbingly lifelike automata.
#. column 2: This will make Khloe's<br>best friend so happy!<br>   - Khloe Aliapoh
#. column 3: Wondrous Tale
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:260:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Khloe minion. Because there is nothing wrong with a fully automated mechanical reconstruction of a young girl of three and ten summers."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Хлои. Ведь нет ничего странного в полностью автоматической механической копии девочки тринадцати лет."

#. ja: クロ・アリアポーを模した魔法人形。ある日、ロウェナ商会お抱えの職人が、これをそっとクロに渡し、無言で立ち去った。それを無言でご褒美のラインナップに加えるあたりに、大物さを感じずにはいられない
#. de: Khloe ist verunsichert. Wer wäre das nicht, wenn er von einem Unbekannten angefertigte voll-<br>automatische Nachbildungen seiner selbst auf seiner Türschwelle fände? Und das jeden Tag.
#. fr: Un artisan qui travaille pour Rowena a donné sans un mot cette poupée à Khloe, avant de s'en aller très gêné. Incapable de comprendre ce geste, la Miqo'te l'a posée à côté des autres cadeaux qui lui avaient été remis de la même façon. Faut-il s'inquiéter<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Khloe minion. Because there is nothing wrong with a fully automated mechanical reconstruction of a young girl of three and ten summers.
#. column 2: This will make Khloe's<br>best friend so happy!<br>   - Khloe Aliapoh
#. column 3: Wondrous Tale
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:260:0:1"
msgid "Ever since she began receiving them on her doorstep─one a day, every day, without fail─Khloe Aliapoh can't help but think there is something seriously wrong with whoever is sending her these disturbingly lifelike automata."
msgstr "С тех пор как Хлоя Алиапо начала каждый день находить на пороге по одной такой пугающе реалистичной кукле, она не может отделаться от мысли, что с тем, кто их ей присылает, что-то неладно."

#. ja: やっほー！
#. de: Mit deiner Hilfe werde ich meine Freundin tage- und nächtelang<br>mit Abenteuergeschichten erfreuen können.<br><i>Khloe Aliapoh</i>
#. fr: J'ai une histoirrre pour vous<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Khloe minion. Because there is nothing wrong with a fully automated mechanical reconstruction of a young girl of three and ten summers.
#. column 1: Ever since she began receiving them on her doorstep─one a day, every day, without fail─Khloe Aliapoh can't help but think there is something seriously wrong with whoever is sending her these disturbingly lifelike automata.
#. column 3: Wondrous Tale
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:260:0:2"
msgid "This will make Khloe's<br>best friend so happy!<br>   - Khloe Aliapoh"
msgstr "Подруге Хлои<br>это точно понравится!<br>   — Хлоя Алиапо"

#. ja: 空想大冒険
#. de: Abenteuerliche Geschichte
#. fr: Récit imaginaire
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Khloe minion. Because there is nothing wrong with a fully automated mechanical reconstruction of a young girl of three and ten summers.
#. column 1: Ever since she began receiving them on her doorstep─one a day, every day, without fail─Khloe Aliapoh can't help but think there is something seriously wrong with whoever is sending her these disturbingly lifelike automata.
#. column 2: This will make Khloe's<br>best friend so happy!<br>   - Khloe Aliapoh
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:260:0:3"
msgid "Wondrous Tale"
msgstr "Удивительная история"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Khloe minion. Because there is nothing wrong with a fully automated mechanical reconstruction of a young girl of three and ten summers.
#. column 1: Ever since she began receiving them on her doorstep─one a day, every day, without fail─Khloe Aliapoh can't help but think there is something seriously wrong with whoever is sending her these disturbingly lifelike automata.
#. column 2: This will make Khloe's<br>best friend so happy!<br>   - Khloe Aliapoh
#. column 3: Wondrous Tale
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:260:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Даёт 10 очков особых приёмов всем союзникам в радиусе действия, кроме тех, у кого есть приём с таким же эффектом."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・スサノオ」を呼び出す。<br>豪神スサノオを模した魔法人形。カッカッカッ、興が乗ったわ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Susano-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Feier mit dem Herrn der Feste!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petit Susano, un pantin articulé à l'image de Susano, le puissant kami.
#. column 1: With an itsy Yata-no-Kagami in his left hand and a bitsy Ame-no-Murakumo in his right, one might almost forget the miniature Magatama throbbing wildly in this liliputian Lord of the Revel's breast. Almost.
#. column 2: We are Susano, and in<br>revelry do we rejoice!<br>   - Lord of the Revel
#. column 3: Mini Murakumo
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:261:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Susano minion. If the Kojin believe that within every item resides a deity, then who exactly resides inside this automaton?"
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Сусано. Если кудзины верят, что в каждом предмете живёт божество, то кто же обитает в этом автоматоне?"

#. ja: 豪神スサノオを模した魔法人形。左手にヤタノカガミ、右手にアメノムラクモ、体内にヤサカニノマガタマの縮小模型を備えている。東方文化をこよなく愛する者たちの間で、今、ひそかに注目されている逸品らしい
#. de: Diese Puppe ist mit besonders viel Liebe zum Detail gefertigt. Alles ist da: Yata no Kagami in der linken und Ame no Murakumo in der rechten Hand, und sogar ein pulsierendes Mini-Magatama.
#. fr: Comme le véritable kami, ce pantin tient le Yata no Kagami dans sa main gauche, l'Ame no Murakumo dans la droite, et a le Yasakani no Magatama en lui. C'est un article rare qui attise les convoitises des amoureux de la culture des contrées orientales.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Susano minion. If the Kojin believe that within every item resides a deity, then who exactly resides inside this automaton?
#. column 2: We are Susano, and in<br>revelry do we rejoice!<br>   - Lord of the Revel
#. column 3: Mini Murakumo
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:261:0:1"
msgid "With an itsy Yata-no-Kagami in his left hand and a bitsy Ame-no-Murakumo in his right, one might almost forget the miniature Magatama throbbing wildly in this liliputian Lord of the Revel's breast. Almost."
msgstr "В левой руке этого крошечного Владыки Празднеств — малюсенький Ята-но-Кагами, в правой — крошечная Аме-но-Муракумо. И почти забываешь о маленькой магатаме, что бешено бьётся у него в груди. Почти."

#. ja: カッカッカッ！
#. de: Ich, Susano, erwarte ein rauschendes Fest!<br><i>Herr der Feste</i>
#. fr: HA HA, HA<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Susano minion. If the Kojin believe that within every item resides a deity, then who exactly resides inside this automaton?
#. column 1: With an itsy Yata-no-Kagami in his left hand and a bitsy Ame-no-Murakumo in his right, one might almost forget the miniature Magatama throbbing wildly in this liliputian Lord of the Revel's breast. Almost.
#. column 3: Mini Murakumo
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:261:0:2"
msgid "We are Susano, and in<br>revelry do we rejoice!<br>   - Lord of the Revel"
msgstr "Мы — Сусано, и радость<br>празднеств нам милей всего!<br>   — Владыка Празднеств"

#. ja: あめのむらくも
#. de: Ame no Murakumo
#. fr: Frappe d'Ame no Murakumo
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Susano minion. If the Kojin believe that within every item resides a deity, then who exactly resides inside this automaton?
#. column 1: With an itsy Yata-no-Kagami in his left hand and a bitsy Ame-no-Murakumo in his right, one might almost forget the miniature Magatama throbbing wildly in this liliputian Lord of the Revel's breast. Almost.
#. column 2: We are Susano, and in<br>revelry do we rejoice!<br>   - Lord of the Revel
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:261:0:3"
msgid "Mini Murakumo"
msgstr "Мини-Муракумо"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et les projette en arrière.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Susano minion. If the Kojin believe that within every item resides a deity, then who exactly resides inside this automaton?
#. column 1: With an itsy Yata-no-Kagami in his left hand and a bitsy Ame-no-Murakumo in his right, one might almost forget the miniature Magatama throbbing wildly in this liliputian Lord of the Revel's breast. Almost.
#. column 2: We are Susano, and in<br>revelry do we rejoice!<br>   - Lord of the Revel
#. column 3: Mini Murakumo
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:261:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 90 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ラクシュミ」を呼び出す。<br>美神ラクシュミを模した魔法人形。我が抱擁を受けるがいい……！
#. de: Du rufst deine Lakshmi-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie ist wunderschön.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petite Lakshmi, une poupée fabriquée à l'image de la divine Lakshmi, et dont on ne demande qu'à recevoir la douce étreinte.
#. column 1: Created to epitomize Lakshmi's flawless beauty, a certain minstrel prone to wandering flippantly deemed it “not to his liking,” ultimately driving the original craftsman to take his own life, and leaving his apprentice to hastily touch up the features.
#. column 2: There isss naught<br>She would not give.<br>   - Sarisha
#. column 3: Peck on the Cheek
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:262:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Lakshmi minion. Your, your, your serpentine."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Лакшми. З-з-змея!"

#. ja: 美神ラクシュミを模した魔法人形。奇跡の生還を果たした、とある彫金師が究極の美を再現するために作ったが、これを見た詩人がダメ出し。紆余曲折を経て、再調整された設計図が公開される運びとなった
#. de: Dass die Puppe nicht unvollendet blieb, ist nur einem Lehrling zu verdanken, dessen zur Perfektion neigender Meister sich nach der flapsigen Bemerkung des Auftraggebers („Geht so.“) das Leben nahm.
#. fr: Ce pantin a été conçu par un orfèvre désireux de recréer la beauté de Lakshmi, mais un ménestrel errant lui a dit que sa poupée était loin d'égaler l'originale. Après moult essais, il a abandonné, mais a rendu ses plans publics pour que d'autres essaient.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Lakshmi minion. Your, your, your serpentine.
#. column 2: There isss naught<br>She would not give.<br>   - Sarisha
#. column 3: Peck on the Cheek
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:262:0:1"
msgid "Created to epitomize Lakshmi's flawless beauty, a certain minstrel prone to wandering flippantly deemed it “not to his liking,” ultimately driving the original craftsman to take his own life, and leaving his apprentice to hastily touch up the features."
msgstr "Созданная, чтобы передать безупречную красоту Лакшми, эта кукла не пришлась по вкусу одному странствующему менестрелю. Его небрежное замечание довело мастера до самоубийства, а ученику пришлось наспех исправлять черты лица."

#. ja: 魅惑ノ抱擁…
#. de: Sie hat unssser Volk erschaffen.<br><i>Sarisha</i>
#. fr: Laissez-moi vous étreindre...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Lakshmi minion. Your, your, your serpentine.
#. column 1: Created to epitomize Lakshmi's flawless beauty, a certain minstrel prone to wandering flippantly deemed it “not to his liking,” ultimately driving the original craftsman to take his own life, and leaving his apprentice to hastily touch up the features.
#. column 3: Peck on the Cheek
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:262:0:2"
msgid "There isss naught<br>She would not give.<br>   - Sarisha"
msgstr "Она бы отдала<br>всё, что ни попроси.<br>   — Сариша"

#. ja: みわくのほうよう
#. de: Feuchter Schmatzer
#. fr: Étreinte fascinante
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Lakshmi minion. Your, your, your serpentine.
#. column 1: Created to epitomize Lakshmi's flawless beauty, a certain minstrel prone to wandering flippantly deemed it “not to his liking,” ultimately driving the original craftsman to take his own life, and leaving his apprentice to hastily touch up the features.
#. column 2: There isss naught<br>She would not give.<br>   - Sarisha
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:262:0:3"
msgid "Peck on the Cheek"
msgstr "Поцелуй в щёку"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のHPを、100回復する。味方のタイプが「モンスター」の場合は、HPが150回復する。
#. de: Regeneriert bei den eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe 100 LP, im Fall von Monstern 150.
#. fr: Soigne 100 PV aux alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou 150 PV s'ils sont de type “Monstre”.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Lakshmi minion. Your, your, your serpentine.
#. column 1: Created to epitomize Lakshmi's flawless beauty, a certain minstrel prone to wandering flippantly deemed it “not to his liking,” ultimately driving the original craftsman to take his own life, and leaving his apprentice to hastily touch up the features.
#. column 2: There isss naught<br>She would not give.<br>   - Sarisha
#. column 3: Peck on the Cheek
