msgid "Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>)."
msgstr "Восстанавливает 100 ОЗ всем союзникам в радиусе действия (150, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>монстр</ui-edge-color></ui-color>)."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ビスマルク」を呼び出す。<br>雲神ビスマルクを模した魔法人形。ブオォォォン！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Bismarck als Begleiter herbei. Über den Wolken muss die Freiheit wohl grenzenlos sein.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petit Bismarck, une réplique absolument parfaite du Migrateur des brumes.
#. column 1: Seeing Limsa Lominsa crawling with wind-up Ifrits, Titans, Ramuhs, even Ravanas, the Bismarck proprietor wondered why there were still no automata designed in the likeness of his establishment's namesake, and so commissioned one made.
#. column 2: The Bismarck is as good as mine.<br>   - H'mhasi Tia
#. column 3: Bubble Puff
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:263:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Bismarck minion. The hairiest whale you will see this fortnight."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Бисмарка. Самый волосатый кит, какого ты увидишь за две недели."

#. ja: 雲神ビスマルクを模した魔法人形。レストラン・ビスマルクのオーナーが、雲神召喚の噂を聞き、一目見てみたいということで裁縫師ギルドに魔法人形の製作を依頼。なんだか、美味しそうな逸品として仕上がった
#. de: Nachdem die Spielwarenmärkte von Limsa Lominsa von Aufzieh-Ifrits, -Titans, -Ramuhs und sogar -Ravanas überflutet waren, fragten sich die Verkäufer, warum Bismarck bislang übersehen wurde, und orderten zehntausend Einheiten.
#. fr: Le pro<shy>prié<shy>taire du Bismarck a demandé à un couturier de fabriquer ce pantin après avoir entendu parler de la divinité du même nom que son restaurant. Il n'a pas été déçu du résultat<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Bismarck minion. The hairiest whale you will see this fortnight.
#. column 2: The Bismarck is as good as mine.<br>   - H'mhasi Tia
#. column 3: Bubble Puff
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:263:0:1"
msgid "Seeing Limsa Lominsa crawling with wind-up Ifrits, Titans, Ramuhs, even Ravanas, the Bismarck proprietor wondered why there were still no automata designed in the likeness of his establishment's namesake, and so commissioned one made."
msgstr "Глядя, как Лимса Ломинса кишит заводными Ифритами, Титанами, Раму и даже Раванами, владелец ресторана «Бисмарк» задумался, почему никто не сделал автоматон в честь заведения, названного в честь Бисмарка. И заказал такого."

#. ja: ブオォォォン！
#. de: Mit einem doppelten Eiersandwich à la Bismarck!<br><i>Die Streunerin</i>
#. fr: Ouuuuuh...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Bismarck minion. The hairiest whale you will see this fortnight.
#. column 1: Seeing Limsa Lominsa crawling with wind-up Ifrits, Titans, Ramuhs, even Ravanas, the Bismarck proprietor wondered why there were still no automata designed in the likeness of his establishment's namesake, and so commissioned one made.
#. column 3: Bubble Puff
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:263:0:2"
msgid "The Bismarck is as good as mine.<br>   - H'mhasi Tia"
msgstr "Бисмарк у меня в кармане.<br>   — Х'мхаси Тиа"

#. ja: ばぶるぶろう
#. de: Wolkenbruch
#. fr: Jet de bulles
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Bismarck minion. The hairiest whale you will see this fortnight.
#. column 1: Seeing Limsa Lominsa crawling with wind-up Ifrits, Titans, Ramuhs, even Ravanas, the Bismarck proprietor wondered why there were still no automata designed in the likeness of his establishment's namesake, and so commissioned one made.
#. column 2: The Bismarck is as good as mine.<br>   - H'mhasi Tia
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:263:0:3"
msgid "Bubble Puff"
msgstr "Пузырьковый плевок"

#. ja: 敵軍のシールドに70%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt einem gegnerischen Schild 70<nbsp>% Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls er schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 70% de sa solidité au bouclier ennemi. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Bismarck minion. The hairiest whale you will see this fortnight.
#. column 1: Seeing Limsa Lominsa crawling with wind-up Ifrits, Titans, Ramuhs, even Ravanas, the Bismarck proprietor wondered why there were still no automata designed in the likeness of his establishment's namesake, and so commissioned one made.
#. column 2: The Bismarck is as good as mine.<br>   - H'mhasi Tia
#. column 3: Bubble Puff
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:263:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable."
msgstr "Наносит 70% урона щиту противника. Не действует, если щит уже разрушен."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ヒエン」を呼び出す。<br>ヒエンを模した魔法人形。まこと、大義であった！
#. de: Du rufst deine Hien-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie steht für ein Doma, auf das man stolz sein kann.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Hien miniature, un pantin avec autant d'entrain que son modèle<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Under imperial rule, Doman dollmakers were forbidden from crafting automata such as the kiyofusa, but this did not stop one brave soul from honoring the popular young Lord Hien with a mammet in his likeness. Its creator can rightly be proud!
#. column 2: There is no denying that<br>he has a presence...<br>   - Haname
#. column 3: True Steel
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:264:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Hien minion. Be proud, my new owner. Be proud."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Хиэна. Гордись, новый хозяин. Гордись."

#. ja: ドマの国主、ヒエンを模した魔法人形。帝国圧政下にあったドマにおいて、元々、キヨフサなどの武装カラクリ人形の製作を禁じられた人形師たちが、密かに反抗の意志を示すために作っていたものらしい。まこと、大義であった！
#. de: Diese Puppe ist Hien, dem König von Doma, nachempfunden. Sie ist zugleich Symbol des Widerstands, denn während der garleischen Besatzung waren in Doma Marionetten und Puppen strengstens verboten.
#. fr: Les marionnettistes de Doma tissaient à l'origine ces pantins pour secrètement afficher leur ressentiment face à l'in<shy>ter<shy>dic<shy>tion imposée par les Garlemaldais de con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>ner des automates ou des kiyofusa.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Hien minion. Be proud, my new owner. Be proud.
#. column 2: There is no denying that<br>he has a presence...<br>   - Haname
#. column 3: True Steel
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:264:0:1"
msgid "Under imperial rule, Doman dollmakers were forbidden from crafting automata such as the kiyofusa, but this did not stop one brave soul from honoring the popular young Lord Hien with a mammet in his likeness. Its creator can rightly be proud!"
msgstr "При имперской оккупации доманским мастерам кукол запретили создавать автоматоны вроде киёфусы, но это не остановило одного смельчака: он почтил популярного юного лорда Хиэна миниатюрой в его образе. Создателю есть чем гордиться!"

#. ja: まこと、大義であった！
#. de: Ich habe ein Land, das auf mich wartet.<br><i>Hien</i>
#. fr: Tu peux vraiment être fier de toi<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Hien minion. Be proud, my new owner. Be proud.
#. column 1: Under imperial rule, Doman dollmakers were forbidden from crafting automata such as the kiyofusa, but this did not stop one brave soul from honoring the popular young Lord Hien with a mammet in his likeness. Its creator can rightly be proud!
#. column 3: True Steel
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:264:0:2"
msgid "There is no denying that<br>he has a presence...<br>   - Haname"
msgstr "Нельзя отрицать,<br>что в нём есть стать...<br>   — Ханаме"

#. ja: 名将の器
#. de: Hiens Rückkehr
#. fr: L'étoffe des héros
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Hien minion. Be proud, my new owner. Be proud.
#. column 1: Under imperial rule, Doman dollmakers were forbidden from crafting automata such as the kiyofusa, but this did not stop one brave soul from honoring the popular young Lord Hien with a mammet in his likeness. Its creator can rightly be proud!
#. column 2: There is no denying that<br>he has a presence...<br>   - Haname
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:264:0:3"
msgid "True Steel"
msgstr "Сталь героя"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のATKを20上昇させる。味方がタイプ「ドール」の場合は、ATKが40上昇する。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
#. de: Erhöht die ATT eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 20, im Fall von Puppen um 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 20 l'attaque des alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou de 40 s'ils sont de type “Poupée”.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Hien minion. Be proud, my new owner. Be proud.
#. column 1: Under imperial rule, Doman dollmakers were forbidden from crafting automata such as the kiyofusa, but this did not stop one brave soul from honoring the popular young Lord Hien with a mammet in his likeness. Its creator can rightly be proud!
#. column 2: There is no denying that<br>he has a presence...<br>   - Haname
#. column 3: True Steel
