msgstr "Повышает АТК всех союзников в радиусе действия на 20 (на 40, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>кукла</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ラーヴァナ」を呼び出す。<br>武神ラーヴァナを模した魔法人形。耐えてみせよ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Mini-Ravana als Begleiter herbei. Achtung, die Klingen schneiden!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petit Ravana, une réplique absolument parfaite du Maître des lames.
#. column 1: Desiring that the tale of Ravana's clash with the Warrior of Light be preserved for posterity, a Gnath historian commissioned the Weavers' Guild to recreate the Lord of the Hive as a mammet. Comes complete with Chandrahas and fierce love of battle.
#. column 2: O Lord Ravana! Master of the<br>Sacred Blades! Wrath of the<br>Colony! Conqueror of the World!<br>   - Gnath Priest
#. column 3: Chandrahas
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:265:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Ravana minion. Low on low he stands, gazing up to see."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Раваны. Низко-низко стоит он, взирая вверх."

#. ja: 武神ラーヴァナを模した魔法人形。歴史家を自称するグナース族が、武神と英雄の戦いを後世に伝えるため、裁縫師ギルドに製作を依頼。武を誇り、勇を好む、猛々しい姿を再現しているのが特徴。耐えてみせよ！
#. de: Die Miniaturausführung dieses Primae wurde im Auftrag eines geschichtsbewussten Gnath von der Gold<shy>schmiede<shy>gilde erschaffen, um den Kampf des Kriegers des Lichts zu würdigen. Sowohl seine Waffen als auch seine unbändige Wut sind originalgetreu wiedergegeben.
#. fr: Les Gnates ont commandé cette poupée à la guilde des couturiers afin de garder un souvenir de l'af<shy>fron<shy>te<shy>ment titanesque qui marqua la défaite du Maître des lames. Les artisans ont pris soin de reproduire l'allure féroce du seigneur du combat et de la guerre.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ravana minion. Low on low he stands, gazing up to see.
#. column 2: O Lord Ravana! Master of the<br>Sacred Blades! Wrath of the<br>Colony! Conqueror of the World!<br>   - Gnath Priest
#. column 3: Chandrahas
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:265:0:1"
msgid "Desiring that the tale of Ravana's clash with the Warrior of Light be preserved for posterity, a Gnath historian commissioned the Weavers' Guild to recreate the Lord of the Hive as a mammet. Comes complete with Chandrahas and fierce love of battle."
msgstr "Желая сохранить для потомков рассказ о схватке Раваны с Воином Света, гнатский историк заказал Гильдии ткачей миниатюру Владыки Улья. В комплекте — Чандрахас и неукротимая любовь к битвам."

#. ja: 耐えてみせよ！
#. de: Zeige mir, dass du in der Lage dazu bist,<br>meine letzte Prüfung zu bestehen!<br><i>Ravana</i>
#. fr: Survivras-tu à ma charge<nbsp>!?
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ravana minion. Low on low he stands, gazing up to see.
#. column 1: Desiring that the tale of Ravana's clash with the Warrior of Light be preserved for posterity, a Gnath historian commissioned the Weavers' Guild to recreate the Lord of the Hive as a mammet. Comes complete with Chandrahas and fierce love of battle.
#. column 3: Chandrahas
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:265:0:2"
msgid "O Lord Ravana! Master of the<br>Sacred Blades! Wrath of the<br>Colony! Conqueror of the World!<br>   - Gnath Priest"
msgstr "О владыка Равана! Мастер<br>священных клинков! Гнев<br>колонии! Покоритель мира!<br>   — Жрец гнатов"

#. ja: ちゃんどらはーす
#. de: Mini-Chandrahas
#. fr: Chandrahas
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ravana minion. Low on low he stands, gazing up to see.
#. column 1: Desiring that the tale of Ravana's clash with the Warrior of Light be preserved for posterity, a Gnath historian commissioned the Weavers' Guild to recreate the Lord of the Hive as a mammet. Comes complete with Chandrahas and fierce love of battle.
#. column 2: O Lord Ravana! Master of the<br>Sacred Blades! Wrath of the<br>Colony! Conqueror of the World!<br>   - Gnath Priest
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:265:0:3"
msgid "Chandrahas"
msgstr "Чандрахас"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK120のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 120 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 120 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et les projette en arrière.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ravana minion. Low on low he stands, gazing up to see.
#. column 1: Desiring that the tale of Ravana's clash with the Warrior of Light be preserved for posterity, a Gnath historian commissioned the Weavers' Guild to recreate the Lord of the Hive as a mammet. Comes complete with Chandrahas and fierce love of battle.
#. column 2: O Lord Ravana! Master of the<br>Sacred Blades! Wrath of the<br>Colony! Conqueror of the World!<br>   - Gnath Priest
#. column 3: Chandrahas
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:265:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 120 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・コウジン」を呼び出す。<br>ツクモを模した魔法人形なんだなぁ～
#. de: Du rufst deine Kojin-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie erinnert dich an Tsukumo.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Kojin mécanique, un automate identique à celui habité par Tsukumo. (Kami non inclus)
#. column 1: A mammet made in the likeness of the vessel for the kami Tsukumo, but given a green rather than blue coat of paint in order to differentiate it from the actual divinity. The Blue Kojin are hopeful of making a tidy profit by selling scores of these in Kugane.
#. column 2: Tsukumo is no ordinary<br>puppet. He is of the divine!<br>   - Kabuto
#. column 3: Treasure Trove
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:266:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Kojin minion. Is it green? Is it blue? Or...is it neither?"
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру кудзина. Она зелёная? Синяя? Или... ни то ни другое?"

#. ja: 付喪神が宿った古びた人形、「ツクモ」を模した魔法人形。本物のツクモと区別するため、碧甲羅のコウジン族に合わせて緑色に塗られている。碧甲羅たちは、この人形を名産品としてクガネで売りさばこうと計画中のようだ
#. de: Diese Puppe ähnelt der Kojin-Puppe, die von dem Tsukumo-Kami bewohnt war, aufs Haar<nbsp>- abgesehen von der Farbe, aber damit nehmen es die Kojin ja nicht so genau. Die Blaupanzer beabsichtigen, diese Puppe in Kugane zum Verkaufsschlager zu machen.
#. fr: Les Kojin verts confectionnent ces automates en s'inspirant de Tsukumo. Ils les peignent toutefois à la couleur de leur tribu afin de les différencier de l'original et ainsi de ne pas commettre une triste erreur lors de l'envoi des commandes à Kugane.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Kojin minion. Is it green? Is it blue? Or...is it neither?
#. column 2: Tsukumo is no ordinary<br>puppet. He is of the divine!<br>   - Kabuto
#. column 3: Treasure Trove
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:266:0:1"
msgid "A mammet made in the likeness of the vessel for the kami Tsukumo, but given a green rather than blue coat of paint in order to differentiate it from the actual divinity. The Blue Kojin are hopeful of making a tidy profit by selling scores of these in Kugane."
msgstr "Эта миниатюра изображает старую куклу-сосуд Цукумо, в которой обитал ками. Чтобы не спутать её с настоящим божеством, куклу выкрасили в зелёный цвет, под стать Зелёным Панцирям. Они надеются неплохо заработать, продавая такие игрушки в Куганэ."

#. ja: 商売繁盛なんだなぁ～
#. de: Bande der Freund<shy>schaft sollt ihr knüpfen!<br><i>Tsukumo</i>
#. fr: Les affaires tournent rondemeeeent<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Kojin minion. Is it green? Is it blue? Or...is it neither?
#. column 1: A mammet made in the likeness of the vessel for the kami Tsukumo, but given a green rather than blue coat of paint in order to differentiate it from the actual divinity. The Blue Kojin are hopeful of making a tidy profit by selling scores of these in Kugane.
#. column 3: Treasure Trove
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:266:0:2"
msgid "Tsukumo is no ordinary<br>puppet. He is of the divine!<br>   - Kabuto"
msgstr "Цукумо — не обычная<br>кукла. Он божественен!<br>   — Кабуто"

#. ja: おたからザクザク
#. de: Band der Freund<shy>schaft
#. fr: Chasse au trésor
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Kojin minion. Is it green? Is it blue? Or...is it neither?
#. column 1: A mammet made in the likeness of the vessel for the kami Tsukumo, but given a green rather than blue coat of paint in order to differentiate it from the actual divinity. The Blue Kojin are hopeful of making a tidy profit by selling scores of these in Kugane.
#. column 2: Tsukumo is no ordinary<br>puppet. He is of the divine!<br>   - Kabuto
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:266:0:3"
msgid "Treasure Trove"
msgstr "Сокровищница"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のHPを、100回復する。味方のタイプが「ドール」の場合は、HPが150回復する。
#. de: Regeneriert bei den eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe 100 LP, im Fall von Puppen 150.
#. fr: Soigne 100 PV aux alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou 150 PV s'ils sont de type “Poupée”.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Kojin minion. Is it green? Is it blue? Or...is it neither?
#. column 1: A mammet made in the likeness of the vessel for the kami Tsukumo, but given a green rather than blue coat of paint in order to differentiate it from the actual divinity. The Blue Kojin are hopeful of making a tidy profit by selling scores of these in Kugane.
#. column 2: Tsukumo is no ordinary<br>puppet. He is of the divine!<br>   - Kabuto
#. column 3: Treasure Trove
