#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・マタンガ」を呼び出す。<br>マタンガ族を模した魔法人形。なぜか全裸
#. de: Du rufst deine Matanga-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Aber warum ist sie denn nackt?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Matanga mécanique. Ses oreilles sont si grandes qu'il pourrait presque s'en servir pour s'envoler.
#. column 1: A mammet made to resemble a Matanga found in the Hidden Canals of Uznair. Originally clothed, it was divested of its modesty by thieves targeting the jewels that adorned its lavish garments, hence its embarrassment. If only someone would cover up its shame. Shame. Shame.
#. column 2: To think you beat<br>a Matanga with<br>just your fists.<br>   - Impressed Dotharl
#. column 3: Rear Naked Smash
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:269:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Matanga minion. This is not Matanga. Matanga is graceful."
msgstr "Призови заводного миньона-матангу. Это не матанга. Матанги изящны."

#. ja: ウズネアカナル深層にて発見されたマタンガ族を模した魔法人形。豪奢な衣装付きで作られたのだが、宝石目当ての盗人によって、服だけ持ち去られたため現在は全裸。どことなく恥ずかしげにしているのはそのため
#. de: Der Stamm der Matanga ist im Nahen Osten ansässig und behaust auch die unteren Ebenen der Kanäle von Uznair. Ein Räuber, der es auf die Edelsteine des Elefantenwesens abgesehen hatte, stahl ihm seine Kleidung<nbsp>- und einen Teil seiner Würde.
#. fr: Cet automate a été créé à l'image d'Abharamu, le Matanga richement vêtu rodant les Canaux cachés d'Uznair. Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, les luxueuses étoffes et joyaux qui l'habillaient ont fait la joie de brigands et le voilà maintenant honteux de sa nudité.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Matanga minion. This is not Matanga. Matanga is graceful.
#. column 2: To think you beat<br>a Matanga with<br>just your fists.<br>   - Impressed Dotharl
#. column 3: Rear Naked Smash
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:269:0:1"
msgid "A mammet made to resemble a Matanga found in the Hidden Canals of Uznair. Originally clothed, it was divested of its modesty by thieves targeting the jewels that adorned its lavish garments, hence its embarrassment. If only someone would cover up its shame. Shame. Shame."
msgstr "Магическая кукла, сделанная по образу матанги из Скрытых каналов Узнаира. Изначально её одели в роскошные одежды, но воры, охотившиеся за драгоценностями на них, украли всю одежду. Вот она и стесняется. Стыдно-то как. Стыдно."

#. ja: パオーン！
#. de: Tröööt!
#. fr: PAOOON<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Matanga minion. This is not Matanga. Matanga is graceful.
#. column 1: A mammet made to resemble a Matanga found in the Hidden Canals of Uznair. Originally clothed, it was divested of its modesty by thieves targeting the jewels that adorned its lavish garments, hence its embarrassment. If only someone would cover up its shame. Shame. Shame.
#. column 3: Rear Naked Smash
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:269:0:2"
msgid "To think you beat<br>a Matanga with<br>just your fists.<br>   - Impressed Dotharl"
msgstr "Вот это да! Ты одолел<br>матангу голыми<br>кулаками!<br>   — Впечатлённый дотхарл"

#. ja: ぶんなぐーる
#. de: Rüsselklöppe
#. fr: Papatte d'eph
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Matanga minion. This is not Matanga. Matanga is graceful.
#. column 1: A mammet made to resemble a Matanga found in the Hidden Canals of Uznair. Originally clothed, it was divested of its modesty by thieves targeting the jewels that adorned its lavish garments, hence its embarrassment. If only someone would cover up its shame. Shame. Shame.
#. column 2: To think you beat<br>a Matanga with<br>just your fists.<br>   - Impressed Dotharl
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:269:0:3"
msgid "Rear Naked Smash"
msgstr "Удар голыми кулаками"

