#. ja: ミニオン「子コアラ」を呼び出す。<br>コアラの幼獣。行進したいお年頃
#. de: Du rufst dein Koala-Bärchen als Begleiter herbei. Es ist sooo anhänglich!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé koala, un petit marsupial tout mignon qui adore grimper sur les épaules de son maître.
#. column 1: This small ursine creature dropped onto the retainer who was cutting down its tree and has apparently decided to see the world. Though ordinarily placid, it can be savage when threatened, and folk are cautioned against─ Awww, look at the adorable little critter!
#. column 2: Fool is the man who<br>calls a koala a bear<br>within its hearing.<br>   - Ancient Saying
#. column 3: Koala Cuddle
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:271:0:0"
msgid "Summon your koala joey minion. Shows no signs of stress or crotch rot, so hug away."
msgstr "Призови миньона-коалу. Никаких признаков стресса или опрелостей — обнимай на здоровье!"

#. ja: コアラの幼獣。自分が棲んでいた樹木を伐採しに来たリテイナーにしがみつき、そのまま冒険の旅に出たらしい。ちなみに可愛い顔をしているが、威嚇するときには、かなり恐ろしい声で鳴く。外見に惑わされるなかれ
#. de: Das Koala-Jungtier warf sich dem Sammlergehilfen um den Hals, der an seinem Baum sägte, und landete so in deinem Inventar. Sieht süß aus, hat aber ein garstiges Stimmchen.
#. fr: Ce bébé koala coulait une vie tranquille jusqu'à ce que votre servant abatte son logis à coups de hache. Le pauvre s'est alors agrippé au bûcheron et a vécu d'incroyables aventures à ses côtés. Attention au cri strident qu'il pousse au moindre signe de menace.
#. column 0: Summon your koala joey minion. Shows no signs of stress or crotch rot, so hug away.
#. column 2: Fool is the man who<br>calls a koala a bear<br>within its hearing.<br>   - Ancient Saying
#. column 3: Koala Cuddle
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:271:0:1"
msgid "This small ursine creature dropped onto the retainer who was cutting down its tree and has apparently decided to see the world. Though ordinarily placid, it can be savage when threatened, and folk are cautioned against─ Awww, look at the adorable little critter!"
msgstr "Этот маленький зверёк свалился на слугу, который рубил его дерево, и, похоже, решил посмотреть мир. Обычно он мирный, но в опасности может стать свирепым, так что берегитесь— Ах, гляньте на эту прелесть!"

#. ja: ゲアアァァァ！
#. de: Graaaaah!
#. fr: Krèèè<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your koala joey minion. Shows no signs of stress or crotch rot, so hug away.
#. column 1: This small ursine creature dropped onto the retainer who was cutting down its tree and has apparently decided to see the world. Though ordinarily placid, it can be savage when threatened, and folk are cautioned against─ Awww, look at the adorable little critter!
#. column 3: Koala Cuddle
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:271:0:2"
msgid "Fool is the man who<br>calls a koala a bear<br>within its hearing.<br>   - Ancient Saying"
msgstr "Горе тому, кто<br>назовёт коалу медведем<br>при ней.<br>   — Древняя поговорка"

#. ja: 行軍
#. de: Frischer Atem
#. fr: Ordre de marche
#. column 0: Summon your koala joey minion. Shows no signs of stress or crotch rot, so hug away.
#. column 1: This small ursine creature dropped onto the retainer who was cutting down its tree and has apparently decided to see the world. Though ordinarily placid, it can be savage when threatened, and folk are cautioned against─ Awww, look at the adorable little critter!
#. column 2: Fool is the man who<br>calls a koala a bear<br>within its hearing.<br>   - Ancient Saying
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:271:0:3"
msgid "Koala Cuddle"
msgstr "Обнимашки с коалой"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方にかかっている、弱体効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle negativen Effekte von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe toutes les altérations d'état des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your koala joey minion. Shows no signs of stress or crotch rot, so hug away.
#. column 1: This small ursine creature dropped onto the retainer who was cutting down its tree and has apparently decided to see the world. Though ordinarily placid, it can be savage when threatened, and folk are cautioned against─ Awww, look at the adorable little critter!
#. column 2: Fool is the man who<br>calls a koala a bear<br>within its hearing.<br>   - Ancient Saying
#. column 3: Koala Cuddle
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:271:0:4"
msgid "Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все отрицательные эффекты со всех союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「ゴマ塩アザラシ」を呼び出す。<br>塩湖に迷い込んだアザラシの幼獣
#. de: Du rufst deinen Gomashio-Seehund als Begleiter herbei. Genauso salzig wie der Seldsee.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé phoque, un pauvre petit mammiphère qui s'était perdu dans le lac Seld.
#. column 1: None can say how this seal pup came to be at Loch Seld, but the person who first saw it took to calling it “salt” for the briny water, then someone else came along and added “pepper,” because why not. The rest, as they say, is history.
#. column 2: Love makes for the<br>best seasoning.<br>   - Gildon
#. column 3: Puppy-seal Eyes
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 70% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:272:0:0"
msgid "Summon your salt & pepper seal minion. What a seal, what a mighty good seal."
msgstr "Призови миньона-тюленёнка в соль и перец. Ну и тюлень, ну и славный тюлень."

#. ja: どういった経緯なのかは不明だが、ロッホ・セル湖に迷い込んでいたアザラシの幼獣。とりあえず塩湖にいたから「塩」とか付けておけば、それっぽいかと思い「ゴマ塩」と名付けたものの、そもそも海に棲んでいる動物なのだった
#. de: Unter welchen Umständen die Gomashio-Seehunde sich im Seldsee angesiedelt haben, ist unbekannt. Vielleicht war ihnen die Rubinsee einfach nicht salzig genug.
#. fr: Chacun sait que les phoques sont des mammifères marins, cependant la présence de ce bébé dans le lac Seld reste à ce jour un mystère.
#. column 0: Summon your salt & pepper seal minion. What a seal, what a mighty good seal.
#. column 2: Love makes for the<br>best seasoning.<br>   - Gildon
#. column 3: Puppy-seal Eyes
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 70% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:272:0:1"
msgid "None can say how this seal pup came to be at Loch Seld, but the person who first saw it took to calling it “salt” for the briny water, then someone else came along and added “pepper,” because why not. The rest, as they say, is history."
msgstr "Никто не знает, как этот тюленёнок оказался в озере Зельд. Первый, кто его увидел, назвал его «солью» — из-за солёной воды. А кто-то другой добавил «перец». Просто так. Ну а дальше, как говорится, история."

#. ja: ゴマゴーマ！
#. de: Gomagoooma!
#. fr: Hon<nbsp>! Hon<nbsp>! Hon<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your salt & pepper seal minion. What a seal, what a mighty good seal.
#. column 1: None can say how this seal pup came to be at Loch Seld, but the person who first saw it took to calling it “salt” for the briny water, then someone else came along and added “pepper,” because why not. The rest, as they say, is history.
#. column 3: Puppy-seal Eyes
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 70% of the maximum value.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:272:0:2"
msgid "Love makes for the<br>best seasoning.<br>   - Gildon"
msgstr "Любовь — лучшая<br>приправа.<br>   — Жильдон"

#. ja: 甘える
#. de: Salz in der Suppe
#. fr: Demande de câlins
#. column 0: Summon your salt & pepper seal minion. What a seal, what a mighty good seal.
#. column 1: None can say how this seal pup came to be at Loch Seld, but the person who first saw it took to calling it “salt” for the briny water, then someone else came along and added “pepper,” because why not. The rest, as they say, is history.
#. column 2: Love makes for the<br>best seasoning.<br>   - Gildon
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 70% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:272:0:3"
msgid "Puppy-seal Eyes"
msgstr "Глазки тюленёнка"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵の特殊技ポイントを、最大値の70%減少させる。
#. de: Verringert die Technikpunkte der Gegner in der Nähe um 70<nbsp>% des Maximalwerts.
#. fr: Réduit les PdT des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet de 70% de leur valeur maximale.
#. column 0: Summon your salt & pepper seal minion. What a seal, what a mighty good seal.
#. column 1: None can say how this seal pup came to be at Loch Seld, but the person who first saw it took to calling it “salt” for the briny water, then someone else came along and added “pepper,” because why not. The rest, as they say, is history.
#. column 2: Love makes for the<br>best seasoning.<br>   - Gildon
