msgstr "Сюжет закручивается,<br>как масло саламандры.<br>   — Годберт"

#. ja: ルーパーダンシング
#. de: Axopotheke
#. fr: Danse axolotl
#. column 0: Summon your axolotl eft minion. Because there truly is nothing more adorable than an oddly Lalafellin face on the body of a moist, frilled salamander.
