#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・神龍」を呼び出す。<br>神龍を模した魔法人形。中からモンスターが！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Mini-Shinryu als Begleiter herbei. Mit praktischer Tragetruhe.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-Shinryu, une reproduction miniature du dragon divin. Il se met à grogner dès que quelqu'un prononce le nom d'Oméga.
#. column 1: The designer of this mammet was tasked with recreating the dread-filled moment when Shinryu gains his freedom, bursting forth from a cocoon of light. The result is a rather loose interpretation, to say the least.
#. column 2: I should very much like<br>to see this “Shinryu”<br>creature for myself.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva
#. column 3: Toodle Wave
#. column 4: Renders both ally and enemy Shields and Search Eyes inoperable. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:275:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Shinryu minion. Exhibits an almost preternatural urge to hide in treasure chests and guard powerful weapons."
msgstr "Призови заводного миньона Синрю. Он так и норовит спрятаться в сундуке с сокровищами и охранять могучее оружие."

#. ja: 神龍を模した魔法人形。どうやら封印から現れる様子を再現したようなのだが、なぜか宝箱の中から現れる。この件について問われた設計担当者は、だってこうだったでしょ？と語ったというが、何を勘違いしているのだろうか……
#. de: Eine Nachbildung des verehrerlosen Primae Shinryu. Versiegelt ist dieser Mini-Drachengott nur in einer einfachen Truhe, was vielleicht auf einem Miss<shy>ver<shy>ständ<shy>nis seitens seines Erbauers beruht.
#. fr: Cette mascotte a été créee en mémoire de votre altercation avec Shinryu, mais étrangement, celle-ci vient enfermée dans un coffre. Questionné à ce sujet, son concepteur aurait répondu<nbsp>: “Eh bien quoi<nbsp>? Il était caché dans un coffre, non<nbsp>?”
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Shinryu minion. Exhibits an almost preternatural urge to hide in treasure chests and guard powerful weapons.
#. column 2: I should very much like<br>to see this “Shinryu”<br>creature for myself.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva
#. column 3: Toodle Wave
#. column 4: Renders both ally and enemy Shields and Search Eyes inoperable. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:275:0:1"
msgid "The designer of this mammet was tasked with recreating the dread-filled moment when Shinryu gains his freedom, bursting forth from a cocoon of light. The result is a rather loose interpretation, to say the least."
msgstr "Создателю этой мамметы поручили воссоздать жуткий миг, когда Синрю вырвался на свободу из кокона света. Результат, мягко говоря, получился довольно вольным."

#. ja: 中からモンスターが！
#. de: Was würdest du mit Shinryu machen?<br><i>Eine Frage des Gewissens</i>
#. fr: C'est un piège<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Shinryu minion. Exhibits an almost preternatural urge to hide in treasure chests and guard powerful weapons.
#. column 1: The designer of this mammet was tasked with recreating the dread-filled moment when Shinryu gains his freedom, bursting forth from a cocoon of light. The result is a rather loose interpretation, to say the least.
#. column 3: Toodle Wave
#. column 4: Renders both ally and enemy Shields and Search Eyes inoperable. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:275:0:2"
msgid "I should very much like<br>to see this “Shinryu”<br>creature for myself.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva"
msgstr "Мне бы очень хотелось<br>самому увидеть это<br>существо по имени «Синрю».<br>   — Неро тол Сцево"

#. ja: たいだるうぇーぶ
#. de: Flutige Welle
#. fr: Raz-de-marée
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Shinryu minion. Exhibits an almost preternatural urge to hide in treasure chests and guard powerful weapons.
#. column 1: The designer of this mammet was tasked with recreating the dread-filled moment when Shinryu gains his freedom, bursting forth from a cocoon of light. The result is a rather loose interpretation, to say the least.
#. column 2: I should very much like<br>to see this “Shinryu”<br>creature for myself.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva
#. column 4: Renders both ally and enemy Shields and Search Eyes inoperable. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:275:0:3"
msgid "Toodle Wave"
msgstr "Волна-волна"

#. ja: 自軍、敵軍のシールドとサーチ・アイを破壊する。特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンは強制撤退する。
#. de: Zerstört eigene und feindliche Schilde und Suchende Augen. Die ausführenden Trabanten werden weggeschickt.
#. fr: Détruit votre bouclier et votre œil scrutateur ainsi que ceux de l'ennemi. Les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT sont au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment renvoyées.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Shinryu minion. Exhibits an almost preternatural urge to hide in treasure chests and guard powerful weapons.
#. column 1: The designer of this mammet was tasked with recreating the dread-filled moment when Shinryu gains his freedom, bursting forth from a cocoon of light. The result is a rather loose interpretation, to say the least.
#. column 2: I should very much like<br>to see this “Shinryu”<br>creature for myself.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva
#. column 3: Toodle Wave
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:275:0:4"
msgid "Renders both ally and enemy Shields and Search Eyes inoperable. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution."
msgstr "Отключает щиты и поисковые глаза и союзников, и врагов. Миньоны, использовавшие особый приём, немедленно покидают поле боя."

#. ja: ミニオン「ニュー・ラウバーン」を呼び出す。<br>ラウバーンを模した魔法人形。ここは通さん！
#. de: Du rufst deine neue Raubahn-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Weniger Phönix, mehr Bulle.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte nouveau Raubahn miniature, un pantin manchot à l'effigie de Raubahn. “Vous ne passerez pas<nbsp>!”
#. column 1: Ostensibly produced to commemorate Ala Mhigo's liberation, this avatar of the Flame General was originally meant to serve as an apology for the campaign's troubled start. To that end, it was said to have been programmed to beg forgiveness a dozen different ways.
#. column 2: Wait till the Flame General<br>hears about this!<br>   - M'naago
#. column 3: Immortal Flame
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:276:0:0"
msgid "Summon your dress-up Raubahn minion. Detachable arm optional."
msgstr "Призови наряженного миньона Раубана. Съёмная рука в комплект не входит."

#. ja: エオルゼア同盟軍の工兵部隊が製作した、ラウバーンを模した魔法人形。表向きはアラミゴ解放の記念品として作られたことになっているが、実際は序盤の軍事作戦の失敗に対するお詫びらしい。大変、申し訳ありませんでした
#. de: Zur Feier der Befreiung Ala Mhigos geschaffen, ist diese Puppe nach wie vor hochbeliebt, diesseits und jenseits des Baelsar-Walls.
#. fr: Les ingénieurs de l'Alliance éorzéenne avaient assemblé cet automate à l'image de Raubahn pour célébrer la future libération d'Ala Mhigo, mais ils ont finalement cru bon de l'offrir en guise de pardon après l'échec de leur première mission.
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Raubahn minion. Detachable arm optional.
#. column 2: Wait till the Flame General<br>hears about this!<br>   - M'naago
#. column 3: Immortal Flame
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:276:0:1"
msgid "Ostensibly produced to commemorate Ala Mhigo's liberation, this avatar of the Flame General was originally meant to serve as an apology for the campaign's troubled start. To that end, it was said to have been programmed to beg forgiveness a dozen different ways."
msgstr "Эту куклу в облике генерала Пламени якобы создали в честь освобождения Ала-Миго. На деле же она должна была извиниться за провал военной кампании на самом первом этапе. Говорят, её запрограммировали просить прощения двенадцатью разными способами."

#. ja: すまなかった……
#. de: Offensichtlich kommt man in Ul'dah<br>jetzt auch ohne mich aus.<br><i>Raubahn</i>
#. fr: Je m'en veux tellement...
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Raubahn minion. Detachable arm optional.
#. column 1: Ostensibly produced to commemorate Ala Mhigo's liberation, this avatar of the Flame General was originally meant to serve as an apology for the campaign's troubled start. To that end, it was said to have been programmed to beg forgiveness a dozen different ways.
#. column 3: Immortal Flame
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:276:0:2"
msgid "Wait till the Flame General<br>hears about this!<br>   - M'naago"
msgstr "Вот вернётся генерал Пламени,<br>всё ему расскажу!<br>   — М'нааго"

#. ja: イモータルフレイム
#. de: Flamme der Unsterblichen
#. fr: Flamme des Immortels
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Raubahn minion. Detachable arm optional.
#. column 1: Ostensibly produced to commemorate Ala Mhigo's liberation, this avatar of the Flame General was originally meant to serve as an apology for the campaign's troubled start. To that end, it was said to have been programmed to beg forgiveness a dozen different ways.
#. column 2: Wait till the Flame General<br>hears about this!<br>   - M'naago
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:276:0:3"
msgid "Immortal Flame"
msgstr "Бессмертное Пламя"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et les projette en arrière.
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Raubahn minion. Detachable arm optional.
#. column 1: Ostensibly produced to commemorate Ala Mhigo's liberation, this avatar of the Flame General was originally meant to serve as an apology for the campaign's troubled start. To that end, it was said to have been programmed to beg forgiveness a dozen different ways.
#. column 2: Wait till the Flame General<br>hears about this!<br>   - M'naago
#. column 3: Immortal Flame
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:276:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 90 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・アナンタ」を呼び出す。<br>アナンタを模した魔法人形。シュー……
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-Ananta als Begleiter herbei. Beißt, würgt und klappert nicht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée ananta. Elle représente une femme-serpent de Gyr Abania. Ssss...
#. column 1: The ex-Gatekeeper sapper who crafted this doll claims her model was a recently molted Sarisha─new scales glistening in the sun. Proceeds from the sale of each piece are used as remuneration to those who aid the battlemaids in their endeavors.
#. column 2: Someone bring the snake!<br>   - Fordola rem Lupis
#. column 3: Snake Charmer
#. column 4: Restores 200 HP to all allies within range (250 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:277:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Ananta minion. Why did it have to be a snake?"
msgstr "Призови заводного миньона-ананту. Ну почему обязательно змея?"

#. ja: アルパ国境警備隊の元工兵が製作した、アナンタを模した魔法人形。モデルは、脱皮直後で鱗が艶やかな状態のサリーシャらしい。なお、この魔法人形の売上は、任務に協力してくれる冒険者たちへの報酬の費用に充てられている
#. de: Die Handwerkerin der Grenzwache Velodyna, die diese Marionette schuf, nahm eine frischgehäutete Ananta als Modell. Alle Erlöse aus dem Verkauf dienen dem Aufbau der Grenzstation.
#. fr: Cette adorable poupée en forme de guerrière ananta a été créée par un ancien ingénieur des garde-frontières de la Velodyna en s'inspirant de la belle Sarisha après sa mue. Les ventes servent à récompenser les aventuriers aidant l'unité de défense gyrabanienne.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ananta minion. Why did it have to be a snake?
#. column 2: Someone bring the snake!<br>   - Fordola rem Lupis
#. column 3: Snake Charmer
#. column 4: Restores 200 HP to all allies within range (250 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:277:0:1"
msgid "The ex-Gatekeeper sapper who crafted this doll claims her model was a recently molted Sarisha─new scales glistening in the sun. Proceeds from the sale of each piece are used as remuneration to those who aid the battlemaids in their endeavors."
msgstr "По словам бывшей сапёрши из пограничной стражи, создавшей эту куклу, моделью ей послужила Сариша сразу после линьки — с чешуёй, блестящей на солнце. Выручка от продажи каждой куклы идёт на награды тем, кто помогает боевым девам в их делах."

#. ja: 鱗っゃっゃ
#. de: Wie bitte, du giftige Schlange?<br>Wenn die Sache hier ausgestanden ist, dann klären wir das!<br><i>Wissbegierige Klamm</i>
#. fr: Ssss...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ananta minion. Why did it have to be a snake?
#. column 1: The ex-Gatekeeper sapper who crafted this doll claims her model was a recently molted Sarisha─new scales glistening in the sun. Proceeds from the sale of each piece are used as remuneration to those who aid the battlemaids in their endeavors.
#. column 3: Snake Charmer
#. column 4: Restores 200 HP to all allies within range (250 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:277:0:2"
msgid "Someone bring the snake!<br>   - Fordola rem Lupis"
msgstr "Кто-нибудь, принесите змею!<br>   — Фордола рем Лупис"

#. ja: いやしのおどり
#. de: Schlangenöl
#. fr: Danse ananta
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ananta minion. Why did it have to be a snake?
#. column 1: The ex-Gatekeeper sapper who crafted this doll claims her model was a recently molted Sarisha─new scales glistening in the sun. Proceeds from the sale of each piece are used as remuneration to those who aid the battlemaids in their endeavors.
#. column 2: Someone bring the snake!<br>   - Fordola rem Lupis
#. column 4: Restores 200 HP to all allies within range (250 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:277:0:3"
msgid "Snake Charmer"
msgstr "Заклинательница змей"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のHPを、200回復する。味方のタイプが「ドール」の場合は、HPが250回復する。
#. de: Regeneriert 200 LP bei eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe, im Fall von Puppen 250.
#. fr: Soigne 200 PV aux alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou 250 PV s'ils sont de type “Poupée”.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ananta minion. Why did it have to be a snake?
#. column 1: The ex-Gatekeeper sapper who crafted this doll claims her model was a recently molted Sarisha─new scales glistening in the sun. Proceeds from the sale of each piece are used as remuneration to those who aid the battlemaids in their endeavors.
#. column 2: Someone bring the snake!<br>   - Fordola rem Lupis
#. column 3: Snake Charmer
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
