msgctxt "CompanionTransient:277:0:4"
msgid "Restores 200 HP to all allies within range (250 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>)."
msgstr "Восстанавливает 200 HP всем союзникам в радиусе действия (250, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>кукла</ui-edge-color></ui-color>)."

#. ja: ミニオン「ミニモアイ」を呼び出す。<br>小さなモアイ像。なぜ動くのかはわからない
#. de: Du rufst deine Moai-Statuette als Begleiter herbei. Man hat selten einen so stoischen Begleiter gesehen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-moai, une minuscule statuette, qui pour une raison inconnue est capable de suivre son maître.
#. column 1: Carved from the remnants of a larger statue found deep beneath the Ruby Sea, the reasons why or even how it can propel itself remain unknown. Rumors of bright rings pouring forth from the effigy's mouth, however, are largely exaggerated.
#. column 2: Either that was a trick<br>of the light, or that statue<br>just moved...<br>   - Shigure
#. column 3: Stone Cold
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:278:0:0"
msgid "Summon your private moai minion. It's watching you, watching you, watching you."
msgstr "Призови личного миньона-моаи. Он смотрит на тебя, смотрит, смотрит."

#. ja: 溺没海で発見された巨像の欠片から作った小さな石像。世界各地で発見されている謎の石像、通称「モアイ像」を模して作ったところ、突然、動き出した。なお、口から光るリングを出しそうにも見えるが、それはできない
#. de: Wie sich diese Statuette fortbewegt, bleibt ein Rätsel, aber das gilt natürlich umso mehr für die tonzen- schweren Originalstatuen der Rubinsee, denen dieses Exemplar nachempfunden ist.
#. fr: Cette statuette a été fabriquée grâce à un morceau d'un immense moai, et pour une raison inconnue, elle s'est mise à se déplacer après avoir été créée. Elle ouvre parfois la bouche comme pour libérer un anneau de lumière, mais il n'apparaît jamais.
#. column 0: Summon your private moai minion. It's watching you, watching you, watching you.
#. column 2: Either that was a trick<br>of the light, or that statue<br>just moved...<br>   - Shigure
#. column 3: Stone Cold
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:278:0:1"
msgid "Carved from the remnants of a larger statue found deep beneath the Ruby Sea, the reasons why or even how it can propel itself remain unknown. Rumors of bright rings pouring forth from the effigy's mouth, however, are largely exaggerated."
msgstr "Из обломка огромной статуи, найденной глубоко под Рубиновым морем, вырезали эту маленькую фигурку. Как она передвигается — да и зачем — неизвестно. А слухи о сияющих кольцах, вылетающих из её рта, сильно преувеличены."

#. ja: スタスタスタ……
#. de: Hm, die Statue soll verzaubert sein? Was kann sie denn?<br>Kupo-Nüsse herbeizaubern? Das wär toll, kupo!<br><i>Mogry</i>
#. fr: Bom-bom-bom...
#. column 0: Summon your private moai minion. It's watching you, watching you, watching you.
#. column 1: Carved from the remnants of a larger statue found deep beneath the Ruby Sea, the reasons why or even how it can propel itself remain unknown. Rumors of bright rings pouring forth from the effigy's mouth, however, are largely exaggerated.
#. column 3: Stone Cold
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
