#. ja: ミニオン「シロイタチ」を呼び出す。<br>雪のように白い毛並みのイタチ
#. de: Du rufst dein Schneewiesel als Begleiter herbei. Wieselflink, aber das ist ja klar.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte fouine blanche, un petit animal dont la couleur du pelage rappelle la neige.
#. column 1: This young male weasel with fur as yellow? as the winter's first snow once dreamed of becoming a pupil of the great auspice Kamaitachi. However, upon witnessing the Warrior of Light's prowess in Hells' Lid, he decided he would be better off siding with the latter.
#. column 2: Don't talk to me! Talk<br>to the cat...or the weasel.<br>   - Tataru
#. column 3: Wind Slash
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:279:0:0"
msgid "Summon your white whittret minion. Once you pop..."
msgstr "Призови миньона-белого хорька. Стоит тебе его выпустить..."

#. ja: 雪のように白い毛並みのイタチ。故郷の森で見かけた瑞獣「カマイタチ」に憧れ、弟子入りするために獄之蓋に潜入したのだが、そこで冒険者との戦いを目撃。どうせ弟子になるなら、より強い方が良いと鞍替えしたらしい
#. de: Dieses Wiesel träumte einst davon, unter dem großen Kamaitachi Dienst zu tun. Doch die beeindruckende Kampfkraft, die der Held des Lichts im Höllenspund an den Tag legte, überzeugte es, sich doch lieber dem überlegenen Helden anzuschließen.
#. fr: Cette fouine à la belle fourrure immaculée serait tombée sous le charme du Zuijû Kamaitachi, le suivant secrètement jusqu'au Couvercle des enfers pour devenir son disciple, mais en voyant son combat contre vous, son admiration s'est portée sur vous.
#. column 0: Summon your white whittret minion. Once you pop...
#. column 2: Don't talk to me! Talk<br>to the cat...or the weasel.<br>   - Tataru
#. column 3: Wind Slash
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:279:0:1"
msgid "This young male weasel with fur as yellow? as the winter's first snow once dreamed of becoming a pupil of the great auspice Kamaitachi. However, upon witnessing the Warrior of Light's prowess in Hells' Lid, he decided he would be better off siding with the latter."
msgstr "Этот молодой самец-хорёк с шерстью цвета первого снега (хотя, может, и жёлтого) мечтал стать учеником великого покровителя Камайтати. Но, увидев, как Воин Света проявил себя в Подземелье ада, решил, что лучше примкнуть к сильнейшему."

#. ja: キューキュー！
#. de: Flink wie ein Wieselbasilisk, die Brüder.<br><i>Widargelt</i>
#. fr: (couine)... (couine)...
#. column 0: Summon your white whittret minion. Once you pop...
#. column 1: This young male weasel with fur as yellow? as the winter's first snow once dreamed of becoming a pupil of the great auspice Kamaitachi. However, upon witnessing the Warrior of Light's prowess in Hells' Lid, he decided he would be better off siding with the latter.
#. column 3: Wind Slash
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:279:0:2"
msgid "Don't talk to me! Talk<br>to the cat...or the weasel.<br>   - Tataru"
msgstr "Не разговаривай со мной! Поговори<br>с кошкой... или с хорьком.<br>   — Татари"

#. ja: かまいたち
#. de: Schneidender Wind
#. fr: Fouine fouettillante
#. column 0: Summon your white whittret minion. Once you pop...
#. column 1: This young male weasel with fur as yellow? as the winter's first snow once dreamed of becoming a pupil of the great auspice Kamaitachi. However, upon witnessing the Warrior of Light's prowess in Hells' Lid, he decided he would be better off siding with the latter.
#. column 2: Don't talk to me! Talk<br>to the cat...or the weasel.<br>   - Tataru
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:279:0:3"
msgid "Wind Slash"
msgstr "Ветряной разрез"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your white whittret minion. Once you pop...
#. column 1: This young male weasel with fur as yellow? as the winter's first snow once dreamed of becoming a pupil of the great auspice Kamaitachi. However, upon witnessing the Warrior of Light's prowess in Hells' Lid, he decided he would be better off siding with the latter.
#. column 2: Don't talk to me! Talk<br>to the cat...or the weasel.<br>   - Tataru
#. column 3: Wind Slash
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:279:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 90."

#. ja: ミニオン「ジョーカーエッグ」を呼び出す。<br>エッグハントの飾りタマゴ。古の賢者を模した魔法人形が入っている
#. de: Du rufst dein Joker-Ei als Begleiter herbei. Ist da schon was geschlüpft?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte œuf bouffon, une décoration de la chasse aux Prœufs, dans laquelle se cache un pantin à l'effigie d'un ancien Preux.
#. column 1: As thanks for aiding Jihli Aliapoh in the retrieval of several stolen eggs, the original Egg Dreamer has gifted you with an eggspertly crafted automaton featuring Radcliffe the Red, famed first Archon of the Sixth Umbral Era.
#. column 2: Personally, I've always<br>had a thing for a motley.<br>   - Cornell
#. column 3: Mummer's Farce
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:280:0:0"
msgid "Summon your motley egg minion. The tiny Archon inside is certain to kickstart your heart."
msgstr "Призови миньона-пёстрое яйцо. Маленький архонт внутри непременно разгонит кровь."

#. ja: エッグハントを揺るがした「飾りタマゴ盗難事件」を解決に導いたことにより、ジリ・アリアポーから贈られた特別な飾りタマゴ。その中には、第六霊災時に活躍した十二賢者のひとり、ラドクリッフを模した魔法人形が入っている
#. de: Das Dankeschön aus den Händen von Jihli Aliapoh beherbergt Radcliffe den Roten, einen Weisen aus der Zeit der Sechsten Katastrophe.
#. fr: Cette mascotte ovoïde vous a été offerte par Jihli Aliapoh pour votre aide dans la résolution de l'affaire du vol des Prœufs. Elle contient un petit pantin à l'effigie de Radcliffe, l'un des douze Preux légendaires du sixième fléau.
#. column 0: Summon your motley egg minion. The tiny Archon inside is certain to kickstart your heart.
#. column 2: Personally, I've always<br>had a thing for a motley.<br>   - Cornell
#. column 3: Mummer's Farce
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:280:0:1"
msgid "As thanks for aiding Jihli Aliapoh in the retrieval of several stolen eggs, the original Egg Dreamer has gifted you with an eggspertly crafted automaton featuring Radcliffe the Red, famed first Archon of the Sixth Umbral Era."
msgstr "В благодарность за помощь в поисках похищенных яиц Джили Алиапо подарила тебе это искусно сделанное яйцо. Внутри — магическая кукла Радклиффа Рыжего, знаменитого первого архонта Шестой Умбральной эры."

#. ja: エッグルルルゥ～ッ♪
#. de: Hab Gnade, Nophica ... So ein verdammter Qiqirn hat eines meiner Eier zermalmt!<br><i>Keitha</i>
#. fr: Mouœuf<nbsp>! Mouœuf<nbsp>! Mouœuf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your motley egg minion. The tiny Archon inside is certain to kickstart your heart.
#. column 1: As thanks for aiding Jihli Aliapoh in the retrieval of several stolen eggs, the original Egg Dreamer has gifted you with an eggspertly crafted automaton featuring Radcliffe the Red, famed first Archon of the Sixth Umbral Era.
#. column 3: Mummer's Farce
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:280:0:2"
msgid "Personally, I've always<br>had a thing for a motley.<br>   - Cornell"
msgstr "А мне всегда<br>нравились пёстрые наряды.<br>   — Корнелл"

#. ja: 道化のおどり
#. de: Joker-Pokerface
#. fr: Danse de bouffon
#. column 0: Summon your motley egg minion. The tiny Archon inside is certain to kickstart your heart.
#. column 1: As thanks for aiding Jihli Aliapoh in the retrieval of several stolen eggs, the original Egg Dreamer has gifted you with an eggspertly crafted automaton featuring Radcliffe the Red, famed first Archon of the Sixth Umbral Era.
#. column 2: Personally, I've always<br>had a thing for a motley.<br>   - Cornell
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:280:0:3"
msgid "Mummer's Farce"
msgstr "Представление шута"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方にかかっている、弱体効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle negativen Effekte von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe toutes les altérations d'état des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your motley egg minion. The tiny Archon inside is certain to kickstart your heart.
#. column 1: As thanks for aiding Jihli Aliapoh in the retrieval of several stolen eggs, the original Egg Dreamer has gifted you with an eggspertly crafted automaton featuring Radcliffe the Red, famed first Archon of the Sixth Umbral Era.
#. column 2: Personally, I've always<br>had a thing for a motley.<br>   - Cornell
#. column 3: Mummer's Farce
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:280:0:4"
msgid "Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все отрицательные эффекты со всех союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ケフカ」を呼び出す。<br>ケフカを模した魔法人形。シンジラレナーイ！！！
#. de: Du rufst deine Kefka-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Eine schöne Erinnerung an Abenteuer vergangener Tage.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Kefka miniature, un pantin à l'effigie d'un clown imaginaire... ou vrai. Dans les deux cas, c'est incroyable.
#. column 1: Other than a vague claim by Y'shtola that the doll you discovered in Omega's Sigmascape seems “eerily familiar,” none of your companions can recall ever hearing of a wicked jester known as Kefka, be it in history books or children's tales.
#. column 2: Now, if you'll excuse me,<br>I have an appointment<br>with Kefka!<br>   - Locke Cole
#. column 3: Forsaken
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:281:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Kefka minion. Just can't believe it? Believe it!"
msgstr "Призови заводного миньона Кефки. Не веришь? А зря!"

#. ja: 被検世界「シグマ」にて回収された魔法人形。元となった道化師「ケフカ」なる人物が創作上の存在なのか、実在した人物なのかは不明。この人形を見た暁の賢人、ヤ・シュトラは、どこかで見覚えがある気がすると語るが……
#. de: Y'shtola hat beim Anblick der Puppe, die du in der Sigmametrie gefunden hast, gesagt, dass sie ihr „entfernt bekannt“ vorkomme. Aber keiner deiner Begleiter hat je zuvor von einem bösen Joker namens Kefka gehört.
#. fr: Ce petit pantin retrouvé dans le monde expérimental du Sigmastice représente un saltimbanque du nom de Kefka. S'agit-il d'une vraie personne ou d'un personnage imaginaire, rien n'est moins sûr, mais Y'shtola a dit avoir l'impression de le connaître...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Kefka minion. Just can't believe it? Believe it!
#. column 2: Now, if you'll excuse me,<br>I have an appointment<br>with Kefka!<br>   - Locke Cole
#. column 3: Forsaken
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:281:0:1"
msgid "Other than a vague claim by Y'shtola that the doll you discovered in Omega's Sigmascape seems “eerily familiar,” none of your companions can recall ever hearing of a wicked jester known as Kefka, be it in history books or children's tales."
msgstr "Все твои спутники, кроме Я'штолы, смутно припоминающей эту куклу из «Сигма-массива» Омеги, впервые слышат о злобном шуте по имени Кефка. Ни в исторических книгах, ни в детских сказках о нём никто не читал."

#. ja: シンジラレナーイ！！！
#. de: Kann es kaum erwarten, Kefka seine Abreibung zu verpassen ...!<br><i>Lock Cole</i>
#. fr: Je n'y crois pas<nbsp>!!!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Kefka minion. Just can't believe it? Believe it!
#. column 1: Other than a vague claim by Y'shtola that the doll you discovered in Omega's Sigmascape seems “eerily familiar,” none of your companions can recall ever hearing of a wicked jester known as Kefka, be it in history books or children's tales.
#. column 3: Forsaken
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:281:0:2"
msgid "Now, if you'll excuse me,<br>I have an appointment<br>with Kefka!<br>   - Locke Cole"
msgstr "Ну что ж, извини,<br>мне пора на встречу<br>с Кефкой!<br>   — Локк Коул"

#. ja: シンジラレナーイ！！！
#. de: Ansicht eines Clowns
#. fr: Incroyable<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Kefka minion. Just can't believe it? Believe it!
#. column 1: Other than a vague claim by Y'shtola that the doll you discovered in Omega's Sigmascape seems “eerily familiar,” none of your companions can recall ever hearing of a wicked jester known as Kefka, be it in history books or children's tales.
#. column 2: Now, if you'll excuse me,<br>I have an appointment<br>with Kefka!<br>   - Locke Cole
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:281:0:3"
msgid "Forsaken"
msgstr "Проклятый"

#. ja: ミニオン召喚時のリキャストを半分にする。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
#. de: Halbiert den Ruf-Timer von Trabanten beim Herbeirufen.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 Sekunden
#. fr: Réduit de moitié le temps de recharge pour l'invocation des mascottes.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Kefka minion. Just can't believe it? Believe it!
#. column 1: Other than a vague claim by Y'shtola that the doll you discovered in Omega's Sigmascape seems “eerily familiar,” none of your companions can recall ever hearing of a wicked jester known as Kefka, be it in history books or children's tales.
#. column 2: Now, if you'll excuse me,<br>I have an appointment<br>with Kefka!<br>   - Locke Cole
#. column 3: Forsaken
