#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・マグナイ」を呼び出す。<br>マグナイを模した魔法人形。ナーマを探し続ける
#. de: Du rufst deine Magnai-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sucht immer noch nach der wahren Liebe.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Magnai miniature, un pantin à l'effigie du magnifique fils du Dieu-soleil.
#. column 1: When, after countless moons, their most radiant brother could still not find a suitable wife, several of the Oronir visited Kugane to have poppets created in Magnai's likeness. As of this writing, the outspoken leader remains alone.
#. column 2: You're not related or<br>something, are you?<br>   - Lyse
#. column 3: Angry Brother
#. column 4: Delivers 10% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:282:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Magnai minion. Ever in search of true love."
msgstr "Призови заводного миньона Магная. Всё ещё ищет настоящую любовь."

#. ja: オロニル族の長兄、マグナイを模した魔法人形。伴侶を見つけることができない長兄を慮った弟たちが、男マグナイを売り込むために製法を考案し、公開したようだ。持ち味である武力を誇示するように、戦斧が付属している
#. de: Als ihr Anführer nach einer gefühlten Ewigkeit immer noch keine passende Frau fürs Leben finden konnte, reisten einige Oronir nach Kugane, um niedliche Puppen von ihm anfertigen zu lassen. Diese sollten die Damenwelt auf Magnai aufmerksam machen. Bis heute leider ohne Erfolg.
#. fr: Alors que, après plusieurs lunes, le frère suprême n'avait toujours pas réussi à trouver de femme convenable, plusieurs Oronir se rendirent à Kugane pour faire fabriquer des pantins à l'effigie de Magnai. À l'heure qu'il est, ce dernier est encore célibataire.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Magnai minion. Ever in search of true love.
#. column 2: You're not related or<br>something, are you?<br>   - Lyse
#. column 3: Angry Brother
#. column 4: Delivers 10% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:282:0:1"
msgid "When, after countless moons, their most radiant brother could still not find a suitable wife, several of the Oronir visited Kugane to have poppets created in Magnai's likeness. As of this writing, the outspoken leader remains alone."
msgstr "Когда даже спустя бессчётные луны их самый лучезарный брат так и не смог найти достойную супругу, несколько оронор отправились в Куганэ заказать куклы с его изображением. Пока что их прямолинейный вождь всё ещё одинок."

#. ja: 余輩ノなーまハ！
#. de: Ich habe die endlosen Weiten der Steppe abgesucht,<br>ohne fündig zu werden.<br><i>Magnai</i>
#. fr: Où te caches-tu, fille de Nhaamaaa<nbsp>!?
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Magnai minion. Ever in search of true love.
#. column 1: When, after countless moons, their most radiant brother could still not find a suitable wife, several of the Oronir visited Kugane to have poppets created in Magnai's likeness. As of this writing, the outspoken leader remains alone.
#. column 3: Angry Brother
#. column 4: Delivers 10% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:282:0:2"
msgid "You're not related or<br>something, are you?<br>   - Lyse"
msgstr "Где же ты, моя наама,<br>где ты?!<br>   — Магнай"

#. ja: 長兄の威厳
#. de: Großer Bruder
#. fr: Frère en colère
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Magnai minion. Ever in search of true love.
#. column 1: When, after countless moons, their most radiant brother could still not find a suitable wife, several of the Oronir visited Kugane to have poppets created in Magnai's likeness. As of this writing, the outspoken leader remains alone.
#. column 2: You're not related or<br>something, are you?<br>   - Lyse
#. column 4: Delivers 10% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:282:0:3"
msgid "Angry Brother"
msgstr "Гнев старшего брата"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のアルカナストーンに、10%のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Arkana-Stein 10 % Schaden zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 10% de sa solidité à la pierre arcanique ennemie la plus proche.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Magnai minion. Ever in search of true love.
#. column 1: When, after countless moons, their most radiant brother could still not find a suitable wife, several of the Oronir visited Kugane to have poppets created in Magnai's likeness. As of this writing, the outspoken leader remains alone.
#. column 2: You're not related or<br>something, are you?<br>   - Lyse
#. column 3: Angry Brother
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:282:0:4"
msgid "Delivers 10% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone."
msgstr "Наносит 10% урона ближайшему вражескому арканному камню."

#. ja: ミニオン「舞海月」を呼び出す。<br>空を舞う浮きクラゲの幼生体。フワリフワリ
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aurelia-Polypen als Begleiter herbei. Der ist so leicht, der schwimmt sogar in Wasser - und schwebt in der Luft!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte aurélie polype, une jeune méduse qui en est encore au stade de polype de sa croissance.
#. column 1: Hitching a ride in the ballast tank of a submersible proved an enlightening experience for this infant wavekin, allowing it to listen in on the incessant mumblings of the vessel's pilot─a mammet voyager tasked with taking an audio log of all discoveries made.
#. column 2: Tonight we will feast on the<br>jellyfish while my jealous fish<br>of a brother drinks in his tears!<br>   - Nortmoen
#. column 3: Irritating Tendrils
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:283:0:0"
msgid "Summon your aurelia polyp minion. Lighter than air─er...water."
msgstr "Призови миньона-полипа аурелии. Легче воздуха... э-э, воды."

#. ja: 溺没海に派遣した潜水艦に、張り付いていた浮きクラゲの幼生体。長い航海の最中に、操縦士のマメットから冒険者の話を伝え聞き、ともに旅することを決意したらしい。その姿には、癒やされるともっぱらの評判
#. de: Der Aurelia-Polyp hat eine lange, frustrierende Reise im finsteren Ballasttank eines Tauchboots hinter sich. Jetzt freut er sich über jeden Moment, den er außerhalb von Gepäcktaschen und Inventarkisten verbringen kann.
#. fr: Ce polype d'aurélie a été récupéré par un pantin lors d'une expédition en sous-marin dans la Mer des noyades. Le récit de vos aventures qu'a fait l'automate à la jeune méduse a apparemment convaincu cette dernière à vous suivre partout.
#. column 0: Summon your aurelia polyp minion. Lighter than air─er...water.
#. column 2: Tonight we will feast on the<br>jellyfish while my jealous fish<br>of a brother drinks in his tears!<br>   - Nortmoen
#. column 3: Irritating Tendrils
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:283:0:1"
msgid "Hitching a ride in the ballast tank of a submersible proved an enlightening experience for this infant wavekin, allowing it to listen in on the incessant mumblings of the vessel's pilot─a mammet voyager tasked with taking an audio log of all discoveries made."
msgstr "Маленький парящий полип прицепился к подводной лодке, отправленной в Море утопленников. В долгом плавании он наслушался бесконечных бормотаний пилота-маммета, которому поручили записывать на звук все открытия. Похоже, это стало для него настоящим откровением."

#. ja: フワ～リ、フワ～リ♪
#. de: Da brat mir doch einer 'ne Qualle!<br><i>Melkoko</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon your aurelia polyp minion. Lighter than air─er...water.
#. column 1: Hitching a ride in the ballast tank of a submersible proved an enlightening experience for this infant wavekin, allowing it to listen in on the incessant mumblings of the vessel's pilot─a mammet voyager tasked with taking an audio log of all discoveries made.
#. column 3: Irritating Tendrils
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:283:0:2"
msgid "Tonight we will feast on the<br>jellyfish while my jealous fish<br>of a brother drinks in his tears!<br>   - Nortmoen"
msgstr "Сегодня мы пируем медузой,<br>пока мой завистливый брат-рыба<br>захлёбывается слезами!<br>   — Нортмуэн"

#. ja: 刺胞
#. de: Nesselfessel
#. fr: Tentacules horripilants
#. column 0: Summon your aurelia polyp minion. Lighter than air─er...water.
