#. ja: ミニオン「白小虎」を呼び出す。<br>白い小虎を模した魔法人形。白虎ではない
#. de: Du rufst dein Byakko-Jungtier als Begleiter herbei. 100<nbsp>% verschmuster als das Original.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé Byakko, une peluche articulée à l'effigie du Tigre blanc de l'ouest.
#. column 1: While not the actual progeny of the thousand-year-old auspice lord, this eponymous recreation (in newborn form) is sought after by Hingans hoping to see their luck turn for the better.
#. column 2: Genbu may be the oldest,<br>but Byakko's got to be the<br>fuzziest.<br>   - Kamaitachi
#. column 3: White Courier
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:284:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Byakko cub minion. Got to be the fuzziest."
msgstr "Призови миньона-тигрёнка Бякко. Пушистее зверя не сыскать."

#. ja: 白い小虎を模した魔法人形。白い小虎を真似たのであって、断じて小さな白虎ではない。ひんがしの国では、白い虎を見た者は運気が上がり、幸せが訪れるといい、この種の人形は一種の縁起物として珍重されているようだ
#. de: Dieses Jungtier ist kein echter Abkömmling des tausendjährigen Tierheiligen, aber unter den Bewohnern von Gyr Abania nichsdestotrotz als Glücksbringer beliebt.
#. fr: Cette petite mascotte représente un tigre blanc, considéré comme un bon présage en Hingashi, et est inspirée de Byakko, l'un des quatre animaux sacrés et protecteur des énergies de l'ouest. De quoi vous apporter la chance lors de vos aventures.
#. column 0: Summon your Byakko cub minion. Got to be the fuzziest.
#. column 2: Genbu may be the oldest,<br>but Byakko's got to be the<br>fuzziest.<br>   - Kamaitachi
#. column 3: White Courier
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:284:0:1"
msgid "While not the actual progeny of the thousand-year-old auspice lord, this eponymous recreation (in newborn form) is sought after by Hingans hoping to see their luck turn for the better."
msgstr "Это не настоящий детёныш тысячелетнего покровителя, а лишь кукла в его образе. Жители Хингаси охотно раскупают таких тигрят: верят, что они принесут удачу."

#. ja: ガオ～！
#. de: Keine Angst, er beißt nur, wenn er schlechte Laune hat, haha.<br><i>Genbu</i>
#. fr: Grrraaaoh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Byakko cub minion. Got to be the fuzziest.
#. column 1: While not the actual progeny of the thousand-year-old auspice lord, this eponymous recreation (in newborn form) is sought after by Hingans hoping to see their luck turn for the better.
#. column 3: White Courier
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:284:0:2"
msgid "Genbu may be the oldest,<br>but Byakko's got to be the<br>fuzziest.<br>   - Kamaitachi"
msgstr "Гэнбу, может, и старейшина,<br>зато Бякко —<br>пушистее всех!<br>   — Камайтати"

#. ja: 小白帝衝
#. de: Weißer Kurier
#. fr: Bébé héraut blanc
#. column 0: Summon your Byakko cub minion. Got to be the fuzziest.
#. column 1: While not the actual progeny of the thousand-year-old auspice lord, this eponymous recreation (in newborn form) is sought after by Hingans hoping to see their luck turn for the better.
#. column 2: Genbu may be the oldest,<br>but Byakko's got to be the<br>fuzziest.<br>   - Kamaitachi
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:284:0:3"
msgid "White Courier"
msgstr "Белый курьер"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵をノックバックさせる。
#. de: Schleudert die Gegner in der Nähe zurück.
#. fr: Projette en arrière les ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Byakko cub minion. Got to be the fuzziest.
#. column 1: While not the actual progeny of the thousand-year-old auspice lord, this eponymous recreation (in newborn form) is sought after by Hingans hoping to see their luck turn for the better.
#. column 2: Genbu may be the oldest,<br>but Byakko's got to be the<br>fuzziest.<br>   - Kamaitachi
#. column 3: White Courier
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:284:0:4"
msgid "Knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Отбрасывает всех врагов в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ファヴニル」を呼び出す。<br>ファヴニルを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deinen Mini-Fafnir als Begleiter herbei. Ein mächtiges Monster aus Legenden, gefürchtet auf der Jagd und in der Arena.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Fafnir mécanique, un automate créé à l'image du légendaire dragon Fafnir.
#. column 1: Why the scholar who crafted this mechanical marvel felt that an already deadly dragon need carry a sword (and a legendary one, at that) remains unclear. When questioned, he simply refused to alter the design and began muttering about “drop rates.”
#. column 2: Those hard scales, those<br>claws...that puny body. Are you<br>some kind of lesser dragon, kupo?<br>   - Mogzin
#. column 3: Ridill
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:285:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Fafnir minion. Protective eyewear highly recommended."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — механического Фафнира. Защитные очки настоятельно рекомендуются."

#. ja: バルデシオン委員会の研究員が製作した魔法人形。ドラゴン型妖異「ファヴニル」の姿を模して作られている。なぜ名剣を持った姿で作られているのかは不明。製作者は「確率は低いが持っているもの」と語り、譲らないが……
#. de: Ein Mechaniker der Gelehrten Baldesions schuf diese Marionette nach Vorbild des gefürchteten Drachen-<br>biestes Fafnir. Dass er eine Visitenkarte in der Tatze hält, empfinden manche als praktisch, andere als albern.
#. fr: Cet automate reprenant les traits du dragon Fafnir a été assemblé par un savant des Élèves de Baldesion. Personne ne sait ce qu'il fait une épée légendaire à la main. Questionné à ce sujet, son créateur a répondu<nbsp>: “C'était rare, mais je vous jure que parfois il l'avait sur lui.”
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Fafnir minion. Protective eyewear highly recommended.
#. column 2: Those hard scales, those<br>claws...that puny body. Are you<br>some kind of lesser dragon, kupo?<br>   - Mogzin
#. column 3: Ridill
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:285:0:1"
msgid "Why the scholar who crafted this mechanical marvel felt that an already deadly dragon need carry a sword (and a legendary one, at that) remains unclear. When questioned, he simply refused to alter the design and began muttering about “drop rates.”"
msgstr "Почему учёный, создавший это механическое чудо, решил вооружить и без того смертоносного дракона мечом — да ещё и легендарным, — неизвестно. На расспросы он только отказался менять конструкцию и забормотал что-то о «шансах выпадения»."

#. ja: 3回攻撃！
#. de: H-Heiliger Bommel! Ein ... Drache?!<br><i>Mogzin</i>
#. fr: Triple attaque<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Fafnir minion. Protective eyewear highly recommended.
#. column 1: Why the scholar who crafted this mechanical marvel felt that an already deadly dragon need carry a sword (and a legendary one, at that) remains unclear. When questioned, he simply refused to alter the design and began muttering about “drop rates.”
#. column 3: Ridill
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:285:0:2"
msgid "Those hard scales, those<br>claws...that puny body. Are you<br>some kind of lesser dragon, kupo?<br>   - Mogzin"
msgstr "Твёрдая чешуя, когти...<br>а тело-то мелкое. Ты что,<br>какой-то низший дракон, купо?<br>   — Могзин"

#. ja: リディル
#. de: Ridill
#. fr: Ridill
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Fafnir minion. Protective eyewear highly recommended.
#. column 1: Why the scholar who crafted this mechanical marvel felt that an already deadly dragon need carry a sword (and a legendary one, at that) remains unclear. When questioned, he simply refused to alter the design and began muttering about “drop rates.”
#. column 2: Those hard scales, those<br>claws...that puny body. Are you<br>some kind of lesser dragon, kupo?<br>   - Mogzin
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:285:0:3"
msgid "Ridill"
msgstr "Ридилл"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et les projette en arrière.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Fafnir minion. Protective eyewear highly recommended.
#. column 1: Why the scholar who crafted this mechanical marvel felt that an already deadly dragon need carry a sword (and a legendary one, at that) remains unclear. When questioned, he simply refused to alter the design and began muttering about “drop rates.”
#. column 2: Those hard scales, those<br>claws...that puny body. Are you<br>some kind of lesser dragon, kupo?<br>   - Mogzin
#. column 3: Ridill
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:285:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 90 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ミスラ」を呼び出す。<br>伝説のミスラを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deine Mithra-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Nicht zu verwechseln mit anderen Felidae.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée mithra, une poupée à l'effigie d'une Mithra, membre d'un peuple légendaire.
#. column 1: A stack of dusty tomes and a healthy imagination served as inspiration for this automaton designed to depict the Mithra─supposed ancestor of the Miqo'te. She wears a traditional scorpion harness rendered in painstaking—and pointless—detail by her Sharlayan creator.
#. column 2: Looking to make<br>a new frrriend, are we?<br>   - Nanaa Mihgo
#. column 3: Mihgo's Amigos
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:286:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Mithra minion. Opinions on how Miqo'te rate compared to their supposed ancestors are best kept to oneself."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — механическую Митру. О том, насколько Микоте похожи на предполагаемых предков, лучше помалкивать."

#. ja: バルデシオン委員会の研究員が製作した魔法人形。「ミコッテ族」の想像上の祖先を再現したものらしい。古代の文献に登場する「スコピオハーネス」なる装備を着せている点に、製作者の異様なコダワリを感じる
#. de: Ein Mechaniker der Gelehrten Baldesions schuf diese Puppe. Historiker können glockenlang darüber sprechen, warum sie einer Miqo'te ähnelt oder was es mit dem Scorpio-Rüstschutz auf sich hat, den die Puppe trägt.
#. fr: Un savant des Élèves de Baldesion a tenté de représenter ce à quoi les anciens Miqo'tes pouvaient ressembler. Bien qu'on retrouve le harnais scorpion dans les livres d'Histoire, on se demande pourquoi il a tenu a en affubler cette poupée.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Mithra minion. Opinions on how Miqo'te rate compared to their supposed ancestors are best kept to oneself.
#. column 2: Looking to make<br>a new frrriend, are we?<br>   - Nanaa Mihgo
#. column 3: Mihgo's Amigos
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:286:0:1"
msgid "A stack of dusty tomes and a healthy imagination served as inspiration for this automaton designed to depict the Mithra─supposed ancestor of the Miqo'te. She wears a traditional scorpion harness rendered in painstaking—and pointless—detail by her Sharlayan creator."
msgstr "Создатель этой куклы вдохновлялся пыльными фолиантами и богатым воображением. Она изображает митру — предполагаемую прародительницу микоте. Её снаряжение «Скорпион» мастер из Шарлаяна воспроизвёл с кропотливой — и совершенно бессмысленной — точностью."

#. ja: スコハネミスラ！
#. de: M-Miau ... Schnurrr schnurrr schnurrr ♪<br><i>Traditionelle Grußworte der Mithra</i>
#. fr: Ce harrrnais scorpion me va<br>comme un gant<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Mithra minion. Opinions on how Miqo'te rate compared to their supposed ancestors are best kept to oneself.
#. column 1: A stack of dusty tomes and a healthy imagination served as inspiration for this automaton designed to depict the Mithra─supposed ancestor of the Miqo'te. She wears a traditional scorpion harness rendered in painstaking—and pointless—detail by her Sharlayan creator.
#. column 3: Mihgo's Amigos
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:286:0:2"
msgid "Looking to make<br>a new frrriend, are we?<br>   - Nanaa Mihgo"
msgstr "Ищешь новых<br>друзей-мурррчиков?<br>   — Нанаа Миго"

#. ja: ミーゴズアミーゴ
#. de: Mhigos Amigos
#. fr: Mhigo amigos
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Mithra minion. Opinions on how Miqo'te rate compared to their supposed ancestors are best kept to oneself.
#. column 1: A stack of dusty tomes and a healthy imagination served as inspiration for this automaton designed to depict the Mithra─supposed ancestor of the Miqo'te. She wears a traditional scorpion harness rendered in painstaking—and pointless—detail by her Sharlayan creator.
#. column 2: Looking to make<br>a new frrriend, are we?<br>   - Nanaa Mihgo
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:286:0:3"
msgid "Mihgo's Amigos"
msgstr "Друзья Михго"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のATKを20上昇させる。味方がタイプ「ドール」の場合は、ATKが40上昇する。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Erhöht die ATT eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 20, im Fall von Puppen um 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 20 l'attaque des alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou de 40 s'ils sont de type “Poupée”.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Mithra minion. Opinions on how Miqo'te rate compared to their supposed ancestors are best kept to oneself.
#. column 1: A stack of dusty tomes and a healthy imagination served as inspiration for this automaton designed to depict the Mithra─supposed ancestor of the Miqo'te. She wears a traditional scorpion harness rendered in painstaking—and pointless—detail by her Sharlayan creator.
#. column 2: Looking to make<br>a new frrriend, are we?<br>   - Nanaa Mihgo
#. column 3: Mihgo's Amigos
