msgctxt "CompanionTransient:286:0:4"
msgid "Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s"
msgstr "Увеличивает АТК всех союзников в радиусе действия на 20 (на 40, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>кукла</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「プリンス・オブ・アネモス」を呼び出す。<br>ロード・オブ・アネモスの血を引く若き王子
#. de: Du rufst deinen Prinz von Anemos als Begleiter herbei. Schwebt so gut wie er glitschig ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Prince d'Anemos, une petite pieuvre que l'on dit être le successeur direct du terrible Seigneur d'Anemos.
#. column 1: Much to the chagrin of his father─the Lord of Anemos─the young heir has yet to outgrow the odd habit of concealing cudgels and using them to bludgeon anyone who dares question his merits. Thankfully, an absence of thew leaves his lively blows lacking.
#. column 2: By the Twelve, what a hideous,<br>monstrous abomination!<br>   - The Impresario
#. column 3: Dipsy Duel
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:287:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Prince of Anemos minion. Cute and cudgely."
msgstr "Призовите миниатюрного принца Анемоса. Милый и с дубинками."

#. ja: ロード・オブ・アネモスの血を引く若き王子。なぜか、懐に片手棍（クラブ）を忍ばせており、気にくわないことがあると二刀流で振り回し、複数回攻撃をしかけてくる。しかし、幼生体のため力が弱く、大したダメージは出ない
#. de: Dieser männliche Nachfolger des Herrschers von Anemos verbirgt eine schwere Schlagwaffe in seiner Tasche, die eigentlich zu mächtigen Kombiattacken befähigt, doch der Prinz vermag ob seines jungen Alters damit noch nicht allzu viel Schaden anzurichten.
#. fr: Lorsqu'on l'agace, cet irascible descendant du Seigneur d'Anemos étend deux de ses tentacules pour les faire tournoyer à toute vitesse. Fort heureusement, il ne pourra jamais blesser quelqu'un tant qu'il sera bébé.
#. column 0: Summon your Prince of Anemos minion. Cute and cudgely.
#. column 2: By the Twelve, what a hideous,<br>monstrous abomination!<br>   - The Impresario
#. column 3: Dipsy Duel
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:287:0:1"
msgid "Much to the chagrin of his father─the Lord of Anemos─the young heir has yet to outgrow the odd habit of concealing cudgels and using them to bludgeon anyone who dares question his merits. Thankfully, an absence of thew leaves his lively blows lacking."
msgstr "Отец — лорд Анемоса — наверняка не в восторге от выходок юного наследника. Тот никак не расстанется с привычкой прятать дубинки и охаживать ими всякого, кто усомнится в его достоинствах. Благо силёнок у него пока маловато, так что удары выходят скорее задорными, чем опасными."

#. ja: クラクラ！
#. de: Huch!!! \<glups> D-Du siehst<br>ja wirklich zum Fürchten aus!<br><i>Impresario</i>
#. fr: Bloub...<nbsp>? Bloub<nbsp>!? Bloub bloub<nbsp>!!!
#. column 0: Summon your Prince of Anemos minion. Cute and cudgely.
#. column 1: Much to the chagrin of his father─the Lord of Anemos─the young heir has yet to outgrow the odd habit of concealing cudgels and using them to bludgeon anyone who dares question his merits. Thankfully, an absence of thew leaves his lively blows lacking.
#. column 3: Dipsy Duel
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:287:0:2"
msgid "By the Twelve, what a hideous,<br>monstrous abomination!<br>   - The Impresario"
msgstr "Клянусь Двенадцатью, какое жуткое,<br>омерзительное создание!<br>   — Импресарио"

#. ja: クラクラ二刀流
#. de: Hick-Hack
#. fr: Double taloche tentaculaire
#. column 0: Summon your Prince of Anemos minion. Cute and cudgely.
#. column 1: Much to the chagrin of his father─the Lord of Anemos─the young heir has yet to outgrow the odd habit of concealing cudgels and using them to bludgeon anyone who dares question his merits. Thankfully, an absence of thew leaves his lively blows lacking.
#. column 2: By the Twelve, what a hideous,<br>monstrous abomination!<br>   - The Impresario
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:287:0:3"
msgid "Dipsy Duel"
msgstr "Дубинка наперевес"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK150のダメージを与え、さらにDEFを30%低下させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 150 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und verringert ihre ABW um 30 %.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 150 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et réduit leur défense de 30%.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your Prince of Anemos minion. Cute and cudgely.
#. column 1: Much to the chagrin of his father─the Lord of Anemos─the young heir has yet to outgrow the odd habit of concealing cudgels and using them to bludgeon anyone who dares question his merits. Thankfully, an absence of thew leaves his lively blows lacking.
#. column 2: By the Twelve, what a hideous,<br>monstrous abomination!<br>   - The Impresario
#. column 3: Dipsy Duel
