msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s"
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 150 и снижает их ЗАЩ на 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「狛犬」を呼び出す。<br>東方に伝わる幻獣を模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deinen Komainu als Begleiter herbei. Halb Löwe, halb Hund, ganz Löwenhund.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petit Komainu, une poupée à l'effigie d'une créature réputée pour protéger les sanctuaires en Orient.
#. column 1: Believed to ward the places from intruders with evil intent, statues of these mythical lion-dog creatures are oft erected at the gates of sacred locations such as shrines. When paired with another, they will always face forward.
#. column 2: Bright as a lamp,<br>brave as a lion.<br>   - Haermaga
#. column 3: Two Pups in a Pod
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:288:0:0"
msgid "Summon your komainu minion. Part lion, part dog, all lion-dog."
msgstr "Призовите миньона-комайну. Наполовину лев, наполовину пёс, а в целом — львопёс."

#. ja: 東方に伝わる幻獣、狛犬を模した魔法人形。伝承では神社など、神聖な場所の守り手として語られており、多くの場合、獅子と一対で座し、悪しき者を見張るという。そのためか、自分と似た姿の存在を見ると、正対してしまう
#. de: Zwei Statuen dieser mythischen Löwenhunde werden häufig als Wächter vor heiligen Orten errichtet, um Bösgesinnte abzuhalten. Häufig hat der eine Löwenhund sein Maul geöffnet, während der andere seins geschlossen hat.
#. fr: Cette poupée représente une célèbre créature orientale chargée de protéger les lieux sacrés contre les mauvais esprits. D'apparence léonine, les Komainu vont souvent par paire, ce qui fait que cette mascotte fera na<shy>tu<shy>rel<shy>le<shy>ment face à une autre du même genre.
#. column 0: Summon your komainu minion. Part lion, part dog, all lion-dog.
#. column 2: Bright as a lamp,<br>brave as a lion.<br>   - Haermaga
#. column 3: Two Pups in a Pod
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:288:0:1"
msgid "Believed to ward the places from intruders with evil intent, statues of these mythical lion-dog creatures are oft erected at the gates of sacred locations such as shrines. When paired with another, they will always face forward."
msgstr "Считается, что статуи этих мифических львособак охраняют священные места от злоумышленников. Их часто ставят у входа в храмы и святилища. Если поставить рядом двух таких стражей, они всегда будут смотреть вперёд."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Einer dieser ... Hunde hat dich leicht verletzt, hm?<br><i>Sylphie</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon your komainu minion. Part lion, part dog, all lion-dog.
#. column 1: Believed to ward the places from intruders with evil intent, statues of these mythical lion-dog creatures are oft erected at the gates of sacred locations such as shrines. When paired with another, they will always face forward.
#. column 3: Two Pups in a Pod
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:288:0:2"
msgid "Bright as a lamp,<br>brave as a lion.<br>   - Haermaga"
msgstr "Светел, как фонарь,<br>и храбр, как лев.<br>   — Хаэрмага"

#. ja: 阿吽の呼吸
#. de: Gib Acht
#. fr: Aun-no-Kokyû
#. column 0: Summon your komainu minion. Part lion, part dog, all lion-dog.
#. column 1: Believed to ward the places from intruders with evil intent, statues of these mythical lion-dog creatures are oft erected at the gates of sacred locations such as shrines. When paired with another, they will always face forward.
#. column 2: Bright as a lamp,<br>brave as a lion.<br>   - Haermaga
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:288:0:3"
msgid "Two Pups in a Pod"
msgstr "Взгляд в один миг"

#. ja: 敵が配置したトラップがある場合、解除する。
#. de: Entfernt eine vom Gegner aufgestellte Falle.
#. fr: Enlève un piège mis en place par l'ennemi.
#. column 0: Summon your komainu minion. Part lion, part dog, all lion-dog.
#. column 1: Believed to ward the places from intruders with evil intent, statues of these mythical lion-dog creatures are oft erected at the gates of sacred locations such as shrines. When paired with another, they will always face forward.
#. column 2: Bright as a lamp,<br>brave as a lion.<br>   - Haermaga
#. column 3: Two Pups in a Pod
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:288:0:4"
msgid "Disarms deployed enemy traps."
msgstr "Снимает ловушки, установленные противником."

#. ja: ミニオン「ナマキン」を呼び出す。<br>黄金に輝くナマズオの魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst Goldbartel als Begleiter herbei. Winkt gelegentlich Nichtsahnende in seine Tonne, aber nur ein Narr würde der Einladung folgen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Namazu nain doré, une marionnette de namazu entièrement recouverte d'or. Elle frétille si bien qu'on dirait un vrai<nbsp>!
#. column 1: This gaudy rendition of a Namazu is not actually solid gold, but merely a wooden automaton adorned with gold leaf. Its creator, however, hopes that will be enough to fool trade ships from the West to import his “lucky catfish.”
#. column 2: Within these whiskers<br>lies unbound potential.<br>   - Old Namazu Master
#. column 3: Ring My Bell
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:289:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Gold Whisker minion. Beckons you to enter his barrel of sin, but don't go in."
msgstr "Призовите миньона «Золотой ус». Манит залезть в бочку греха, но не поддавайтесь."

#. ja: 黄金に輝くナマズオの魔法人形。ひんがしの国の人形師が、近東地域への輸出用の縁起物として作ったものらしい。蒔絵の技法を応用することで、全身に金粉を散らしているため、なんとなく金運が上昇しそうな気がする
#. de: Der Schein trügt: Diese Namazuo-Nachbildung ist nicht aus purem Gold, sondern aus Holz mit Goldüberzug gefertigt. Was findige Händler nicht davon abhält, sie als kostbare Glücksbringer zu verkaufen.
#. fr: Cette mascotte en forme de Namazu doré aurait été con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>née en tant que porte-bonheur pour le Proche-Orient par un fabricant de marionnettes hingashien. La dorure aurait été appliquée grâce à une technique locale appelée <i>maki-e</i>.
#. column 0: Summon your Gold Whisker minion. Beckons you to enter his barrel of sin, but don't go in.
#. column 2: Within these whiskers<br>lies unbound potential.<br>   - Old Namazu Master
#. column 3: Ring My Bell
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:289:0:1"
msgid "This gaudy rendition of a Namazu is not actually solid gold, but merely a wooden automaton adorned with gold leaf. Its creator, however, hopes that will be enough to fool trade ships from the West to import his “lucky catfish.”"
msgstr "Этот щегольской намазу вовсе не сделан из чистого золота: это всего лишь деревянная кукла, покрытая сусальным золотом. Но создатель надеется, что этого хватит, чтобы обмануть западных торговцев и сбыть им своего «счастливого сомика»."

#. ja: ぺっかぺか！
#. de: Meine Barteln sind wie 'ne Wünschelrute. \<schmatz> Mit ihnen fffind ich 'nen großen Schatz!<br><i>Gyorin</i>
#. fr: Plop-plop...
#. column 0: Summon your Gold Whisker minion. Beckons you to enter his barrel of sin, but don't go in.
#. column 1: This gaudy rendition of a Namazu is not actually solid gold, but merely a wooden automaton adorned with gold leaf. Its creator, however, hopes that will be enough to fool trade ships from the West to import his “lucky catfish.”
#. column 3: Ring My Bell
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:289:0:2"
msgid "Within these whiskers<br>lies unbound potential.<br>   - Old Namazu Master"
msgstr "В этих усах<br>скрыт безграничный потенциал.<br>   — Старый мастер намазу"

#. ja: 黄金の鈴
#. de: Kling Glöckchen
#. fr: Clochette dorée
#. column 0: Summon your Gold Whisker minion. Beckons you to enter his barrel of sin, but don't go in.
#. column 1: This gaudy rendition of a Namazu is not actually solid gold, but merely a wooden automaton adorned with gold leaf. Its creator, however, hopes that will be enough to fool trade ships from the West to import his “lucky catfish.”
#. column 2: Within these whiskers<br>lies unbound potential.<br>   - Old Namazu Master
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:289:0:3"
msgid "Ring My Bell"
msgstr "Позвони в колокольчик"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your Gold Whisker minion. Beckons you to enter his barrel of sin, but don't go in.
#. column 1: This gaudy rendition of a Namazu is not actually solid gold, but merely a wooden automaton adorned with gold leaf. Its creator, however, hopes that will be enough to fool trade ships from the West to import his “lucky catfish.”
#. column 2: Within these whiskers<br>lies unbound potential.<br>   - Old Namazu Master
#. column 3: Ring My Bell
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:289:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Даёт 10 очков особых приёмов всем союзникам в радиусе действия, кроме миньонов с таким же приёмом."

#. ja: ミニオン「セイテンショウセイ」を呼び出す。<br>瑞獣セイテンタイセイが神通力で作り出した幻影体
#. de: Du rufst deinen Affenkönig als Begleiter herbei. Zu niedlich, um wahr zu sein!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petit Qitian Dasheng, un pantin créé par le Zuijû Qitian Dasheng grâce à ses pouvoirs magiques.
#. column 1: A miniature doppelganger of Qitian Dasheng magically brought into being by the ancient auspice himself. Originally used by the monkey king to cozen corrival and companion alike, now it merely serves to act adorable as it hovers nearby its new owner.
#. column 2: It seems this year<br>shall belong to the<br>monkey after all!<br>   - Saru Doshin
#. column 3: Jingu Bang
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:290:0:0"
msgid "Summon your magic monkey minion. King of monkeys. Equal of heaven. Inspirer of “awww.”"
msgstr "Призовите миньона-обезьянку. Царь обезьян. Равный Небу. Умиление гарантировано."

#. ja: 瑞獣セイテンタイセイが神通力で作り出した幻影体。若き頃、いたずら好きの猿だったセイテンタイセイは、特別な力を得てからも、他者を欺く技を得意とした。神通力で編んだ雲に乗り、自在に空を駆け巡る
#. de: Von Qitian Dasheng höchstselbst in seinem Abbild geschaffen. Einst nutzte der König der Affen die niedliche Puppe, um Freund wie Feind schelmische Streiche zu spielen. Heute dient sie jedoch einzig dem Zweck, ihre Umwelt durch ihre Niedlichkeit zu erfreuen. Kann schweben!
#. fr: Une version miniature de Qitian Dasheng créée par le Zuijû lui-même. Autrefois un singe espiègle, il a continué à taquiner son entourage même après avoir acquis ses pouvoirs. Il adore virevolter sur son petit nuage magique.
#. column 0: Summon your magic monkey minion. King of monkeys. Equal of heaven. Inspirer of “awww.”
#. column 2: It seems this year<br>shall belong to the<br>monkey after all!<br>   - Saru Doshin
#. column 3: Jingu Bang
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:290:0:1"
msgid "A miniature doppelganger of Qitian Dasheng magically brought into being by the ancient auspice himself. Originally used by the monkey king to cozen corrival and companion alike, now it merely serves to act adorable as it hovers nearby its new owner."
msgstr "Миниатюрная копия Цитянь Дашэна, сотворённая волшебной силой самим древним покровителем. Когда-то царь обезьян обманывал с её помощью и соперников, и друзей, а теперь она просто мило парит рядом с новым хозяином."

#. ja: ヘッチャラ！
#. de: Trotz eines turbulenten Startes<br>scheint dieses Jahr wahrhaftig im<br>Zeichen des Affen zu stehen!<br><i>Affenleutnant</i>
#. fr: À moi, nuage magique<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your magic monkey minion. King of monkeys. Equal of heaven. Inspirer of “awww.”
#. column 1: A miniature doppelganger of Qitian Dasheng magically brought into being by the ancient auspice himself. Originally used by the monkey king to cozen corrival and companion alike, now it merely serves to act adorable as it hovers nearby its new owner.
#. column 3: Jingu Bang
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:290:0:2"
msgid "It seems this year<br>shall belong to the<br>monkey after all!<br>   - Saru Doshin"
msgstr "Похоже, этот год<br>всё-таки будет годом<br>обезьяны!<br>   — Обезьяний десятник"

#. ja: きんこぼう
#. de: Jingu Bang
#. fr: Roi des singes
#. column 0: Summon your magic monkey minion. King of monkeys. Equal of heaven. Inspirer of “awww.”
#. column 1: A miniature doppelganger of Qitian Dasheng magically brought into being by the ancient auspice himself. Originally used by the monkey king to cozen corrival and companion alike, now it merely serves to act adorable as it hovers nearby its new owner.
#. column 2: It seems this year<br>shall belong to the<br>monkey after all!<br>   - Saru Doshin
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:290:0:3"
msgid "Jingu Bang"
msgstr "Золотой жезл"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your magic monkey minion. King of monkeys. Equal of heaven. Inspirer of “awww.”
#. column 1: A miniature doppelganger of Qitian Dasheng magically brought into being by the ancient auspice himself. Originally used by the monkey king to cozen corrival and companion alike, now it merely serves to act adorable as it hovers nearby its new owner.
#. column 2: It seems this year<br>shall belong to the<br>monkey after all!<br>   - Saru Doshin
#. column 3: Jingu Bang
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:290:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「クロックワークランタン」を呼び出す。<br>カラクリ仕掛けの自走ランタン
#. de: Du rufst deine Uhrwerk-Laterne als Begleiter herbei. Hände frei und trotzdem hell. Perfekt für betriebsame Nachteulen!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte lanterne mécanique, capable de se déplacer toute seule grâce à des mécanismes avancés.
#. column 1: Seeing as collaborations are now all the rage in Eorzea, it did not take long for the tinkers of Eshtaime's Lapidaries to find their way to Frondale's Phrontistery to see what madness their collective minds could conceive. (A lantern. They made a lantern.)
#. column 2: They can scarce make do<br>without their lanterns.<br>   - Armelle
#. column 3: Light My Fire
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:291:0:0"
msgid "Summon your clockwork lantern minion. Hands-free illumination for the busy insomniac."
msgstr "Призовите миньона-механический фонарь. Освободит руки и осветит путь полуночникам."

#. ja: カラクリ仕掛けの自走ランタン。冒険者たちの熱烈な要望に応える形で、彫金師ギルドと錬金術師ギルドが共同開発した。魔法人形の技術を応用した自走機構と、錬金術による魅惑の光源により、どこでも光を届ける
#. de: Eorzea hat das Kollaborationsfieber erfasst! Auch die Goldschmiede und Alchemisten wollten da nicht hinten anstehen und brüteten lange Nächte über etwas, das ihre genialen Geister gemeinsam kreieren könnten. Heraus kam ... eine Laterne.
#. fr: Cette lanterne mécanique est le fruit d'une col<shy>la<shy>bo<shy>ra<shy>tion entre les guildes des orfèvres et des alchimistes pour satisfaire le souhait des aventuriers. Elle peut se déplacer seule grâce à des mécanismes avancés et produire de la lumière par le biais de procédés alchimiques.
#. column 0: Summon your clockwork lantern minion. Hands-free illumination for the busy insomniac.
#. column 2: They can scarce make do<br>without their lanterns.<br>   - Armelle
#. column 3: Light My Fire
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:291:0:1"
msgid "Seeing as collaborations are now all the rage in Eorzea, it did not take long for the tinkers of Eshtaime's Lapidaries to find their way to Frondale's Phrontistery to see what madness their collective minds could conceive. (A lantern. They made a lantern.)"
msgstr "Раз уж совместные проекты вошли в моду в Эорзее, мастера из Мастерской Эштайма вскоре заглянули в Аптекарскую академию Фрондейл — обсудить, что же их общий гений способен сотворить. (Фонарь. Они сделали фонарь.)"

#. ja: ピッカピカ！
#. de: Das Monster in der Laterne?<br>Das gehört nicht zu uns.<br><i>Imp</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon your clockwork lantern minion. Hands-free illumination for the busy insomniac.
#. column 1: Seeing as collaborations are now all the rage in Eorzea, it did not take long for the tinkers of Eshtaime's Lapidaries to find their way to Frondale's Phrontistery to see what madness their collective minds could conceive. (A lantern. They made a lantern.)
#. column 3: Light My Fire
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:291:0:2"
msgid "They can scarce make do<br>without their lanterns.<br>   - Armelle"
msgstr "Без фонарей им<br>жизнь не мила.<br>   — Армель"

#. ja: 道案内
#. de: Wegweiser
#. fr: Jeux de lumière
#. column 0: Summon your clockwork lantern minion. Hands-free illumination for the busy insomniac.
#. column 1: Seeing as collaborations are now all the rage in Eorzea, it did not take long for the tinkers of Eshtaime's Lapidaries to find their way to Frondale's Phrontistery to see what madness their collective minds could conceive. (A lantern. They made a lantern.)
