#. ja: ミニオン「クラミドサウルス」を呼び出す。<br>樹上棲の小型甲鱗綱。後ろ足だけで疾走する
#. de: Du rufst deine Kragenechse als Begleiter herbei. Rede dich nie wieder um Kopf und Kragen!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte lézard à collerette. Ce petit reptile a la particularité d'avoir une sorte de collerette autour de son cou, et il est également connu sous le nom de chlamydo... saurus.
#. column 1: Tree-dwellers by nature, frilled dragons only descend to hunt, using their powerful rear legs to propel them forward at speeds that rival most Lalafell. When intimidated, they will spread out the spiked frills adorning their necks, hoping to frighten would-be predators.
#. column 2: Are you some kind of<br>lesser dragon, kupo?<br>   - Mogzin
#. column 3: Desert Sprint
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:292:0:0"
msgid "Summon your frilled dragon minion. Also known as the <i>chlamydosaurus</i> but...uh, yeah."
msgstr "Призовите миньона-ящерицу с воротником. Её ещё зовут <i>хамелеозавром</i>, но... ну, вы поняли."

#. ja: ミラージュプリズムが大好きで、冒険者についてきたトカゲ。普段は樹上で過ごしているが、エサを求めるときには地上に降りて、後ろ足だけで疾走する。また、危険を察知するとエリマキ状の皮膚飾りを広げて威嚇するようだ
#. de: Die eigentlich auf Bäumen beheimatete Kragenechse jagt ihre Beute aufrecht rennend am Boden. Bei Gefahr stellt sie ihren Kragen drohend auf. Aus unbekanntem Grund liebt sie Projektionsprismen über alles. Ob sie deshalb in deiner Nähe bleibt?
#. fr: Ce petit lézard vit dans les arbres et en descend ré<shy>gu<shy>liè<shy>re<shy>ment pour se nourrir. Il chasse en piquant des pointes de vitesse sur ses pattes arrière, et lorsque les rôles sont inversés, il déploie sa collerette pour intimider ses prédateurs.
#. column 0: Summon your frilled dragon minion. Also known as the <i>chlamydosaurus</i> but...uh, yeah.
#. column 2: Are you some kind of<br>lesser dragon, kupo?<br>   - Mogzin
#. column 3: Desert Sprint
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:292:0:1"
msgid "Tree-dwellers by nature, frilled dragons only descend to hunt, using their powerful rear legs to propel them forward at speeds that rival most Lalafell. When intimidated, they will spread out the spiked frills adorning their necks, hoping to frighten would-be predators."
msgstr "По природе своей эти ящерицы живут на деревьях и спускаются лишь на охоту. Мощные задние лапы разгоняют их не хуже, чем любого лалафелла. Почувствовав угрозу, они расправляют шипастый воротник и надеются отпугнуть хищника."

#. ja: オッ
#. de: Dann geht's dem Papst jetzt an<br>den goldbestickten Kragen, ja?<br><i>Hilda</i>
#. fr: Uhonn<nbsp>! Uhonn<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your frilled dragon minion. Also known as the <i>chlamydosaurus</i> but...uh, yeah.
#. column 1: Tree-dwellers by nature, frilled dragons only descend to hunt, using their powerful rear legs to propel them forward at speeds that rival most Lalafell. When intimidated, they will spread out the spiked frills adorning their necks, hoping to frighten would-be predators.
#. column 3: Desert Sprint
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:292:0:2"
msgid "Are you some kind of<br>lesser dragon, kupo?<br>   - Mogzin"
msgstr "Ты что, какой-то<br>мелкий дракон, кхупо?<br>   — Могзин"

#. ja: ミラージュスプリント
#. de: Prismensprint
#. fr: Sprint mirage
#. column 0: Summon your frilled dragon minion. Also known as the <i>chlamydosaurus</i> but...uh, yeah.
