#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・シリナ」を呼び出す。<br>シリナを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deine Cirina-Puppe als Begleiter herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Cirina miniature, un pantin à l'effigie d'une jeune femme de la tribu des Mol.
#. column 1: Commissioned for the Rising to promote interest in Xaela culture, this fully operational automaton was designed with painstaking detail, using the Mol youth Cirina as a model.
#. column 2: She's braver than she looks.<br>   - Lyse
#. column 3: Word of the Gods
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:293:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Cirina minion. Hungry for divine guidance. Also buuz."
msgstr "Призовите заводную миньонку Цирину. Ждёт божественного знамения. И бууза."

#. ja: モル族の少女、シリナを模した魔法人形。アウラ・ゼラの遊牧民たちが常用する伝統的な衣装も、細部の刺繍に至るまでしっかりと再現されている。アジムステップの文化を感じさせる品として、新生祭で配布された
#. de: Eine Puppe, die der jungen Mol Cirina nach-<br>empfunden ist und zur Jahresfeier von Eorzeas Wiedergeburt verteilt wurde. Ihre Kleidung gleicht bis in die feinsten Nähte der traditionellen Gewandung der Au Ra Xaela.
#. fr: Ce pantin était offert durant la fête de la Commémoration afin de promouvoir la culture xaela. Cirina, son modèle, est représentée comme au quotidien, vêtue d'une tenue tra<shy>di<shy>tion<shy>nel<shy>le ornée de broderies magnifiquement ouvragées.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Cirina minion. Hungry for divine guidance. Also buuz.
#. column 2: She's braver than she looks.<br>   - Lyse
#. column 3: Word of the Gods
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:293:0:1"
msgid "Commissioned for the Rising to promote interest in Xaela culture, this fully operational automaton was designed with painstaking detail, using the Mol youth Cirina as a model."
msgstr "Эту полностью исправную механическую куклу заказали к Празднику возрождения, чтобы познакомить людей с культурой кэла. Её тщательно выполнили по образу юной мол Цирины."

#. ja: モル族デスカ？
#. de: So manch ein Herausforderer hat<br>seinen Wagemut mit dem Leben<br>bezahlt<nbsp>...<br><i>Cirina</i>
#. fr: Hors de question que vous partiez le ventre vide<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Cirina minion. Hungry for divine guidance. Also buuz.
#. column 1: Commissioned for the Rising to promote interest in Xaela culture, this fully operational automaton was designed with painstaking detail, using the Mol youth Cirina as a model.
#. column 3: Word of the Gods
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:293:0:2"
msgid "She's braver than she looks.<br>   - Lyse"
msgstr "Она храбрее, чем кажется.<br>   — Лиза"

#. ja: 神託
#. de: Götterorakel
#. fr: Ôracle sacré
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Cirina minion. Hungry for divine guidance. Also buuz.
#. column 1: Commissioned for the Rising to promote interest in Xaela culture, this fully operational automaton was designed with painstaking detail, using the Mol youth Cirina as a model.
#. column 2: She's braver than she looks.<br>   - Lyse
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:293:0:3"
msgid "Word of the Gods"
msgstr "Глас богов"

