#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・サドゥ」を呼び出す。<br>サドゥを模した魔法人形。フン・チョローは呼び出さない
#. de: Du rufst deine Sadu-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Nennt hoffentlich keinen deiner Freunde einen watschelnden Schleimbeutel.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Sadu miniature, un pantin à l'effigie de la fière chef de la tribu des Dotharl.
#. column 1: There once lived a young Dotharli warrior who dreamed of taking the khatun into his arms and, well, doing things that young Dotharli warriors dream of doing. He quickly realized he valued his life and instead crafted this less imposing stand-in.
#. column 2: Is the khatun woman<br>or man? A stupid question.<br>She is Sadu.<br>   - Koko
#. column 3: Falling Dusk
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:294:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Sadu minion. Will most likely not call any of your companions a stunted chuluu."
msgstr "Призовите заводную миньонку Саду. Скорее всего, никого из ваших спутников она не назовёт чулу — недорослем."

#. ja: ドタール族の族長、サドゥを模した魔法人形。その美しさに恋心を抱きながらも、燃やし尽くされることを恐れて声に出せない、ドタールの若者たちが製法を考案したらしい。しかし、実際に作り切るだけの勇気はなかったようだ
#. de: Ein junger Krieger der Dotharl träumte einst davon, seine Anführerin in die Arme zu schließen und Dinge mit ihr zu tun, von denen junge Männer manchmal träumen. Er begriff jedoch schnell, dass er an seinem Leben hing und fertigte zum Kuscheln stattdessen lieber diese Puppe an.
#. fr: Ce pantin à l'effigie de Sadu a été conçu par un guerrier Dotharl qui rêvait d'étreindre la chef de sa tribu. Lorsqu'il a réalisé à quel point la jeune femme était farouche, il s'est résolu à fabriquer cette reproduction fidèle à la place.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Sadu minion. Will most likely not call any of your companions a stunted chuluu.
#. column 2: Is the khatun woman<br>or man? A stupid question.<br>She is Sadu.<br>   - Koko
#. column 3: Falling Dusk
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:294:0:1"
msgid "There once lived a young Dotharli warrior who dreamed of taking the khatun into his arms and, well, doing things that young Dotharli warriors dream of doing. He quickly realized he valued his life and instead crafted this less imposing stand-in."
msgstr "Жил-был юный воин-дотарл, мечтавший заключить хатун в объятия и, ну... заняться тем, о чём мечтают юные воины-дотарл. Но он быстро понял, что жизнь ему дороже, и сделал себе куклу — куда менее грозную замену."

#. ja: 滾ルナァ、オイ！
#. de: Als ich dich zum ersten Mal sah,<br>hielt ich dich für einen wandelnden<br>Schleimbeutel!<br><i>Sadu</i>
#. fr: Les Dotharl ne craignent rien, pas même la mort.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Sadu minion. Will most likely not call any of your companions a stunted chuluu.
#. column 1: There once lived a young Dotharli warrior who dreamed of taking the khatun into his arms and, well, doing things that young Dotharli warriors dream of doing. He quickly realized he valued his life and instead crafted this less imposing stand-in.
#. column 3: Falling Dusk
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:294:0:2"
msgid "Is the khatun woman<br>or man? A stupid question.<br>She is Sadu.<br>   - Koko"
msgstr "Хатун — мужчина<br>или женщина? Глупый вопрос.<br>Она — Саду.<br>   — Коко"

#. ja: ナーマの流星
#. de: Nhaamas Herabkunft
#. fr: Tombée du crépuscule
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Sadu minion. Will most likely not call any of your companions a stunted chuluu.
#. column 1: There once lived a young Dotharli warrior who dreamed of taking the khatun into his arms and, well, doing things that young Dotharli warriors dream of doing. He quickly realized he valued his life and instead crafted this less imposing stand-in.
#. column 2: Is the khatun woman<br>or man? A stupid question.<br>She is Sadu.<br>   - Koko
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:294:0:3"
msgid "Falling Dusk"
msgstr "Закатный сумрак"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK300のダメージを与える。ただし、特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンは強制帰還する。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 300 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus, aber die ausführenden Trabanten werden weggeschickt.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 300 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT sont au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment renvoyées.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Sadu minion. Will most likely not call any of your companions a stunted chuluu.
#. column 1: There once lived a young Dotharli warrior who dreamed of taking the khatun into his arms and, well, doing things that young Dotharli warriors dream of doing. He quickly realized he valued his life and instead crafted this less imposing stand-in.
#. column 2: Is the khatun woman<br>or man? A stupid question.<br>She is Sadu.<br>   - Koko
#. column 3: Falling Dusk
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:294:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 300. После выполнения приёма миньон немедленно возвращается."

#. ja: ミニオン「キャシーバルブ」を呼び出す。<br>キャシーから剥落した種が発芽した幼生体
#. de: Du rufst deine Cassie-Knolle als Begleiter herbei. Abgefallen vom großen Original und erkeimt zu noch größerer Niedlichkeit.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte pousse de Cassie, un bourgeon issu de la morbole éponyme.
#. column 1: Swaddled in crimson cloth and transfixed with an all-too-familiar earring, this shambling seedkin─seemingly fallen from the infamously fetid Cassie─reeks of rotting rutabagas and sour spirits.
#. column 2: The sapling is well on its<br>way to becoming a tree.<br>   - Beatin
#. column 3: Sickly Sweet Breath
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:295:0:0"
msgid "Summon your copycat bulb minion. The only companion you need if you want no other companions."
msgstr "Призовите миньона-копию луковицы. Если не хотите никого видеть, вам хватит и её одной."

#. ja: キャシーから剥落した種が発芽した幼生体。自身を着飾ることが好きなようで、朱色の布切れを器用に巻き付け、ドレスを仕立ててしまった。また、どこから拾ってきたのか、イヤリングまで付けているが、やっぱり臭い
#. de: Diese putzige Morbol-Knolle ist aus dem Samenkorn der Kapriziösen Cassie entstanden. Sie ist äußerst modebewusst, aber ihren Gestank macht das leider nicht erträglicher.
#. fr: La jeune pousse morbole aime déjà se faire belle. Elle a utilisé un morceau d'étoffe vermeil pour s'en faire une robe et porte même des boucles d'oreilles trouvées on ne sait où. Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, son haleine reste toujours aussi fétide.
#. column 0: Summon your copycat bulb minion. The only companion you need if you want no other companions.
#. column 2: The sapling is well on its<br>way to becoming a tree.<br>   - Beatin
#. column 3: Sickly Sweet Breath
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:295:0:1"
msgid "Swaddled in crimson cloth and transfixed with an all-too-familiar earring, this shambling seedkin─seemingly fallen from the infamously fetid Cassie─reeks of rotting rutabagas and sour spirits."
msgstr "Эта семенная оболочка, похоже, отпала от печально известной вонючки Кэсси. Она бредёт, укутавшись в алую ткань и украсив себя до боли знакомой серёжкой, а от неё несёт гниющей брюквой и прокисшим пойлом."

#. ja: ぷぅ～ん♥
#. de: Eine Morbol-Briefbombe! Wenn die dich voll erwischt hätte,<br>hättest du deinen nächsten Kampf im Krankenbett erlebt!<br><i>Bubudoga</i>
#. fr: Smack<nbsp>!♥
#. column 0: Summon your copycat bulb minion. The only companion you need if you want no other companions.
#. column 1: Swaddled in crimson cloth and transfixed with an all-too-familiar earring, this shambling seedkin─seemingly fallen from the infamously fetid Cassie─reeks of rotting rutabagas and sour spirits.
#. column 3: Sickly Sweet Breath
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:295:0:2"
msgid "The sapling is well on its<br>way to becoming a tree.<br>   - Beatin"
msgstr "Молодой побег уже<br>вот-вот станет деревом.<br>   — Битин"

#. ja: 甘ったるい息
#. de: Faulig süßer Atem
#. fr: Haleine sucrée
#. column 0: Summon your copycat bulb minion. The only companion you need if you want no other companions.
#. column 1: Swaddled in crimson cloth and transfixed with an all-too-familiar earring, this shambling seedkin─seemingly fallen from the infamously fetid Cassie─reeks of rotting rutabagas and sour spirits.
#. column 2: The sapling is well on its<br>way to becoming a tree.<br>   - Beatin
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:295:0:3"
msgid "Sickly Sweet Breath"
msgstr "Приторно-сладкое дыхание"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵を移動不可にする。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>5秒
#. de: Macht Gegner in der Nähe be<shy>we<shy>gungs<shy>un<shy>fäh<shy>ig.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5 Sekunden
#. fr: Immobilise les ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. column 0: Summon your copycat bulb minion. The only companion you need if you want no other companions.
#. column 1: Swaddled in crimson cloth and transfixed with an all-too-familiar earring, this shambling seedkin─seemingly fallen from the infamously fetid Cassie─reeks of rotting rutabagas and sour spirits.
#. column 2: The sapling is well on its<br>way to becoming a tree.<br>   - Beatin
#. column 3: Sickly Sweet Breath
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 505> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 505 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
