msgctxt "CompanionTransient:295:0:4"
msgid "Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s"
msgstr "Обездвиживает всех противников в радиусе действия.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・タルタル」を呼び出す。<br>伝説のタルタルを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deine Tarutaru-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Klein, aber oho!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée tarutaru, une poupée à l'effigie d'une Tarutaru, membre d'un peuple légendaire.
#. column 1: A stack of dusty tomes and a healthy imagination served as inspiration for this automaton designed to depict the Tarutaru─supposed ancestor of the Lalafell. She wears a gaudy vermilion cloak rendered in painstaking—and pointless—detail by her Sharlayan creator.
#. column 2: Ages ago, there lived a female<br>mage of no small repute who<br>was known by all sorts of<br>unsavory epithets.<br>   - Gerolt
#. column 3: Refresh
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:296:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Tarutaru minion. Remarks relating to a certain people's stature and the diminutiveness thereof are best kept to oneself."
msgstr "Призовите заводную миньонку тарутару. О чужом росте и миниатюрности лучше помалкивать."

#. ja: バルデシオン委員会の研究員が製作した魔法人形。「ララフェル族」の想像上の祖先を再現したものらしい。その朱色の衣は、「バーミリオクローク」と呼ばれる高級法衣を再現したもの。魔力回復の効果があったというが……
#. de: Ein Haufen staubiger Schmöker und viel Fantasie halfen einem Forscher von Baldesions Gelehrten dabei, diese Puppe zu schaffen, die einen Urahnen der Lalafell darstellen soll. Dem Zinnober-Umhang wohnen angeblich Zauberkräfte inne.
#. fr: Un savant des Élèves de Baldesion a tenté de représenter ce à quoi les anciennes Lalafelles pouvaient ressembler. Il l'a habillée d'une pelisse vermillon, un manteau à capuche affectionné des mages qui régénérerait les forces magiques.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Tarutaru minion. Remarks relating to a certain people's stature and the diminutiveness thereof are best kept to oneself.
#. column 2: Ages ago, there lived a female<br>mage of no small repute who<br>was known by all sorts of<br>unsavory epithets.<br>   - Gerolt
#. column 3: Refresh
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:296:0:1"
msgid "A stack of dusty tomes and a healthy imagination served as inspiration for this automaton designed to depict the Tarutaru─supposed ancestor of the Lalafell. She wears a gaudy vermilion cloak rendered in painstaking—and pointless—detail by her Sharlayan creator."
msgstr "Создатель этой куклы из Шарлаяна вдохновлялся пыльными фолиантами и богатым воображением. Она изображает тарутару — предполагаемого предка лалафеллов. Её пышный алый плащ воспроизведён с кропотливой — и совершенно бессмысленной — точностью."

#. ja: バミクロタルタル！
#. de: Du bist meine letzte Hoffnung!<br>Mach mich zum charmantesten Lalafell dieser Stadt!<br><i>Wawarukka</i>
#. fr: Ma pelisse vermillon est magnifique<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Tarutaru minion. Remarks relating to a certain people's stature and the diminutiveness thereof are best kept to oneself.
#. column 1: A stack of dusty tomes and a healthy imagination served as inspiration for this automaton designed to depict the Tarutaru─supposed ancestor of the Lalafell. She wears a gaudy vermilion cloak rendered in painstaking—and pointless—detail by her Sharlayan creator.
#. column 3: Refresh
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:296:0:2"
msgid "Ages ago, there lived a female<br>mage of no small repute who<br>was known by all sorts of<br>unsavory epithets.<br>   - Gerolt"
msgstr "Давным-давно жила<br>знаменитая волшебница,<br>которую поминали<br>самыми неприличными словами.<br>   — Герольт"

#. ja: リフレッシュ
#. de: Erfrischung
#. fr: Recharge
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Tarutaru minion. Remarks relating to a certain people's stature and the diminutiveness thereof are best kept to oneself.
#. column 1: A stack of dusty tomes and a healthy imagination served as inspiration for this automaton designed to depict the Tarutaru─supposed ancestor of the Lalafell. She wears a gaudy vermilion cloak rendered in painstaking—and pointless—detail by her Sharlayan creator.
#. column 2: Ages ago, there lived a female<br>mage of no small repute who<br>was known by all sorts of<br>unsavory epithets.<br>   - Gerolt
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:296:0:3"
msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Восстановление"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Tarutaru minion. Remarks relating to a certain people's stature and the diminutiveness thereof are best kept to oneself.
#. column 1: A stack of dusty tomes and a healthy imagination served as inspiration for this automaton designed to depict the Tarutaru─supposed ancestor of the Lalafell. She wears a gaudy vermilion cloak rendered in painstaking—and pointless—detail by her Sharlayan creator.
#. column 2: Ages ago, there lived a female<br>mage of no small repute who<br>was known by all sorts of<br>unsavory epithets.<br>   - Gerolt
#. column 3: Refresh
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:296:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Даёт 10 очков особых приёмов всем союзникам в радиусе действия, кроме миньонов с таким же приёмом."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ツクヨミ」を呼び出す。<br>夜神ツクヨミを模した魔法人形。いいよぅ
#. de: Du rufst deine Tsukuyomi-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Wird sie dich im Namen des Mondlichts bestrafen?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée Tsukuyomi, un pantin à l'effigie de la Maîtresse de la lune et de la nuit qui pourrait bien vous attirer dans des ténèbres sans fin.
#. column 1: Conscripted into the imperial army, only to be handed over to Eorzean Alliance officials in an unreported prisoner exchange, one humble goldsmith celebrated his regained freedom how most goldsmiths do─he crafted a lifelike replica of the Lady of the Moon, Tsukuyomi.
#. column 2: And I am but the moon.<br>   - Lebrassoir
#. column 3: Nightbloom
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:297:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Tsukuyomi minion. Barren waters, heed unto the tide."
msgstr "Призовите заводную миньонку Цукуёми. Пустые воды, внимайте приливу."

#. ja: 夜神ツクヨミを模した魔法人形。複雑な経緯を経て、帝国軍に強制徴募され、なぜか捕虜交換の対象となった彫金師が、即興で作り上げた品らしい。自由の喜びがそうさせたのか、異様な愛情を以て美しく仕上げられている
#. de: Zwangsrekrutiert in die imperiale Armee, später bei einem inoffiziellen Gefangenen<shy>austausch an die Eorzäische Allianz übergeben, feierte ein Gold-<br>schmied seine wiedergewonnene Freiheit, wie es jeder Goldschmied tun würde: Mit einer Replik der Herrscherin der Nacht.
#. fr: Un orfèvre enrôlé de force par Garlemald aurait con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>né cette poupée aussitôt après avoir retrouvé sa liberté grâce à un échange de prisonniers. L'émotion qu'il ressentit alors transparaît dans la finition magnifique de son œuvre.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Tsukuyomi minion. Barren waters, heed unto the tide.
#. column 2: And I am but the moon.<br>   - Lebrassoir
#. column 3: Nightbloom
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:297:0:1"
msgid "Conscripted into the imperial army, only to be handed over to Eorzean Alliance officials in an unreported prisoner exchange, one humble goldsmith celebrated his regained freedom how most goldsmiths do─he crafted a lifelike replica of the Lady of the Moon, Tsukuyomi."
msgstr "Одного скромного ювелира насильно забрали в имперскую армию, а затем передали властям Эорзейского альянса в ходе тайного обмена пленными. Вернув свободу, он отпраздновал это так, как и подобает ювелиру: создал реалистичную копию Госпожи Луны, Цукуёми."

#. ja: いいよぅ
#. de: Du kannst doch nicht einfach hier aufkreuzen<br>und dir die Sachen unter den Nagel reißen,<br>die ich einen Mond im Voraus reserviert habe!<br><i>Junger Lalafell</i>
#. fr: Haa...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Tsukuyomi minion. Barren waters, heed unto the tide.
#. column 1: Conscripted into the imperial army, only to be handed over to Eorzean Alliance officials in an unreported prisoner exchange, one humble goldsmith celebrated his regained freedom how most goldsmiths do─he crafted a lifelike replica of the Lady of the Moon, Tsukuyomi.
#. column 3: Nightbloom
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:297:0:2"
msgid "And I am but the moon.<br>   - Lebrassoir"
msgstr "А я — лишь луна.<br>   — Лебрассуар"

#. ja: 月下彼岸花
#. de: Monddämmerung
#. fr: Lis araignée
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Tsukuyomi minion. Barren waters, heed unto the tide.
#. column 1: Conscripted into the imperial army, only to be handed over to Eorzean Alliance officials in an unreported prisoner exchange, one humble goldsmith celebrated his regained freedom how most goldsmiths do─he crafted a lifelike replica of the Lady of the Moon, Tsukuyomi.
#. column 2: And I am but the moon.<br>   - Lebrassoir
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:297:0:3"
msgid "Nightbloom"
msgstr "Лунный цветок"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Tsukuyomi minion. Barren waters, heed unto the tide.
#. column 1: Conscripted into the imperial army, only to be handed over to Eorzean Alliance officials in an unreported prisoner exchange, one humble goldsmith celebrated his regained freedom how most goldsmiths do─he crafted a lifelike replica of the Lady of the Moon, Tsukuyomi.
#. column 2: And I am but the moon.<br>   - Lebrassoir
#. column 3: Nightbloom
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:297:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 90."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・シロ」を呼び出す。<br>シロ・アリアポーを模した魔法人形。ありがとうございます！
#. de: Du rufst deine Zhloe-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Kann dir gar nicht genug danken, wird es vermutlich aber trotzdem versuchen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Zhloe miniature, un pantin à l'effigie de la jeune Miqo'te qui a décidé de se lancer dans les affaires pour ouvrir un orphelinat.
#. column 1: Impressed with Zhloe's tireless efforts at the orphanage, a craftsman employed by Rowena's House of Splendors created an automaton version of the altruist and gifted it to her sister, Khloe...who silently added it to her table of rewards.
#. column 2: But deep down, I knew that<br>Mummy and Daddy were<br>never coming back.<br>   - T'kebbe
#. column 3: Fresh-baked Flatbread
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:298:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Zhloe minion. Cannot thank you enough, but will certainly try."
msgstr "Призовите заводную миньонку Жлоэ. Не знает, как вас отблагодарить, но обязательно попытается."

#. ja: シロ・アリアポーを模した魔法人形。孤児院を運営するために奮闘する彼女を、そっと見守っていたロウェナ商会お抱えの職人が作ったもの。それを無言で受け取り、そっと、ご褒美のラインナップに加える妹クロであった
#. de: Beeindruckt von Zhloes Verdiensten um das Waisenhaus fertigte ein Handwerker im Dienst von Rowenas Haus der Wunder diese Puppe an und gab sie Zhloes Schwester Khloe, die sie klammheimlich ihrer Trophäensammlung einverleibte.
#. fr: Touché par le combat de Zhloe Aliapoh pour son orphelinat, un artisan de la maison des splendeurs de Rowena a décidé de fabriquer ce pantin à l'effigie de la Miqo'te. Il l'a ensuite offert à la sœur de cette dernière, Khloe, pour qu'elle l'ajoute à sa collection de récompenses.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Zhloe minion. Cannot thank you enough, but will certainly try.
#. column 2: But deep down, I knew that<br>Mummy and Daddy were<br>never coming back.<br>   - T'kebbe
#. column 3: Fresh-baked Flatbread
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:298:0:1"
msgid "Impressed with Zhloe's tireless efforts at the orphanage, a craftsman employed by Rowena's House of Splendors created an automaton version of the altruist and gifted it to her sister, Khloe...who silently added it to her table of rewards."
msgstr "Мастера из дома великолепия Ровены так впечатлило, как не покладая рук Жлоэ помогает сиротам, что он изготовил её механическую копию. Подарок достался сестре Жлоэ, Клоэ... которая молча добавила куклу в список наград."

#. ja: ありがとうございます！
#. de: Wenn Fladenbrot hart wie Stein geworden ist,<br>kann man es immer noch in warmen Wasser aufweichen.<br><i>Zhloe</i>
#. fr: Merrrci beaucoup<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Zhloe minion. Cannot thank you enough, but will certainly try.
#. column 1: Impressed with Zhloe's tireless efforts at the orphanage, a craftsman employed by Rowena's House of Splendors created an automaton version of the altruist and gifted it to her sister, Khloe...who silently added it to her table of rewards.
#. column 3: Fresh-baked Flatbread
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
