#. ja: ミニオン「労働八号」を呼び出す。<br>機工都市ゴーグにて発掘された労働型鉄巨人
#. de: Du rufst Automat Nr. 8 als Begleiter herbei. Ausgegraben in der Uhrwerksstadt Gog. Batterien bitte extra kaufen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Bâtisseur n°8, un robot bâtisseur découvert dans l'ancienne cité des machines de Goug.
#. column 1: Inoperative when discovered in the Clockwork City of Goug, the queer device whirred to life when a crystal was inserted under its chest plate. As long as the crystal is not replaced with auracite, the automaton should prove harmless.
#. column 2: A construct born of<br>desperation and denial.<br>   - Penitent Heretic
#. column 3: Compute
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:299:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Construct 8 minion. Batteries not included."
msgstr "Призовите миньона «Конструкт 8». Батарейки в комплект не входят."

#. ja: 機工都市ゴーグにて発掘された労働型鉄巨人。発見されたときには休眠状態だったが、余っていたクリスタルをはめ込んだところ、動き出して追従してくるようになった。聖石を動力源としていないため、危険はないはずだ
#. de: Als diese Maschine in der Uhrwerksstadt Gog gefunden wurde, war sie nicht funktionstüchtig, doch ein Kristall verhalf ihr zu neuem Leben. Solange du ihn nicht gegen einen Auraciten austauschst, solltest du sicher sein.
#. fr: Inactif lorsqu'il a été découvert dans l'ancienne cité des machines de Goug, ce robot bâtisseur s'est subitement animé lorsqu'on a inséré un cristal dans son torse. Il devrait rester inoffensif, tant que personne ne remplace sa source d'énergie par une auralithe...
#. column 0: Summon your Construct 8 minion. Batteries not included.
#. column 2: A construct born of<br>desperation and denial.<br>   - Penitent Heretic
#. column 3: Compute
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:299:0:1"
msgid "Inoperative when discovered in the Clockwork City of Goug, the queer device whirred to life when a crystal was inserted under its chest plate. As long as the crystal is not replaced with auracite, the automaton should prove harmless."
msgstr "Когда его обнаружили в часовом городе Гог, странный механизм не работал. Но стоило вставить кристалл под нагрудную пластину, как он ожил. Пока кристалл не заменят на священный камень, автоматон должен быть безвреден."

#. ja: ゴメイレイヲ ドウゾ！
#. de: Bitte schön, aber lass deine Bärenkräfte<br>des Transzendierens nicht am<br>Hau-den-Gilli-Automaten aus, ja?<br><i>Godbert</i>
#. fr: J'ATTENDS VOS ORDRES, MAÎTRE<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Construct 8 minion. Batteries not included.
#. column 1: Inoperative when discovered in the Clockwork City of Goug, the queer device whirred to life when a crystal was inserted under its chest plate. As long as the crystal is not replaced with auracite, the automaton should prove harmless.
#. column 3: Compute
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:299:0:2"
msgid "A construct born of<br>desperation and denial.<br>   - Penitent Heretic"
msgstr "Порождение<br>отчаяния и отрицания.<br>   — Кающийся еретик"

#. ja: 処理する
#. de: Reparatur
#. fr: Traitement
#. column 0: Summon your Construct 8 minion. Batteries not included.
#. column 1: Inoperative when discovered in the Clockwork City of Goug, the queer device whirred to life when a crystal was inserted under its chest plate. As long as the crystal is not replaced with auracite, the automaton should prove harmless.
#. column 2: A construct born of<br>desperation and denial.<br>   - Penitent Heretic
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:299:0:3"
msgid "Compute"
msgstr "Вычисление"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATKの5倍のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt Gegnern in der Nähe Schaden in 5-facher Höhe des Attacke-Werts zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à cinq fois l'attaque aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Construct 8 minion. Batteries not included.
#. column 1: Inoperative when discovered in the Clockwork City of Goug, the queer device whirred to life when a crystal was inserted under its chest plate. As long as the crystal is not replaced with auracite, the automaton should prove harmless.
#. column 2: A construct born of<br>desperation and denial.<br>   - Penitent Heretic
#. column 3: Compute
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:299:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон, равный пятикратной АТК применившего приём."

#. ja: ミニオン「アイルー」を呼び出す。<br>オトモになったアイルー
#. de: Du rufst Felyne als Begleiter herbei. So knuffig!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Felyne, un Palico des plus amicaux<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Hailing from a land so distant it does not appear on any map, this catlike hunter has traveled to far eastern Othard in pursuit of his quarry─the fire-breathing Rathalos. How he came to fight by your side is a story better told over a roast leg of wyvern.
#. column 2: They allowed him to bring the<br>sum of his skills to bear...or<br>maybe <i>cat</i>, on his foes.<br>   - Gerolt
#. column 3: Coral Orchestra
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:300:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Palico minion. Very punny."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Фелина. Вот уж каламбур так каламбур."

#. ja: はるか彼方の異邦からやってきた小柄な獣人。火竜リオレウスを追いかけていたらしく、討伐依頼をクガネのモブハントボードに掲載した。その後、火竜の狩猟をめぐって冒険者と出会い、そのオトモになったのである
#. de: Dieses Katzenwesen kommt aus einem fernen Land, einzig um den flammenspeienden Rathalos zu erjagen. Wie sie den Weg nach Kugane hinter sich gebracht hat, ist eine Geschichte, die am besten bei einer saftigen Wyvernkeule am Lagerfeuer erzählt wird.
#. fr: Les Felynes sont des hommes-bêtes ayant pactisé avec les chasseurs pour les assister durant les quêtes. Après avoir formé cette alliance, ils prennent le surnom de “Palico”.
#. column 0: Summon your Palico minion. Very punny.
#. column 2: They allowed him to bring the<br>sum of his skills to bear...or<br>maybe <i>cat</i>, on his foes.<br>   - Gerolt
#. column 3: Coral Orchestra
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:300:0:1"
msgid "Hailing from a land so distant it does not appear on any map, this catlike hunter has traveled to far eastern Othard in pursuit of his quarry─the fire-breathing Rathalos. How he came to fight by your side is a story better told over a roast leg of wyvern."
msgstr "Этот кошкоподобный охотник прибыл из края столь далёкого, что его нет ни на одной карте. Он добрался до восточного Отхарда в погоне за своей добычей — огнедышащим Раталосом. А о том, как он стал сражаться бок о бок с вами, лучше рассказывать у костра, за жареной вивернской ножкой."

#. ja: ニャー
#. de: Schnurrr!
#. fr: Chat c'est sûr<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Palico minion. Very punny.
#. column 1: Hailing from a land so distant it does not appear on any map, this catlike hunter has traveled to far eastern Othard in pursuit of his quarry─the fire-breathing Rathalos. How he came to fight by your side is a story better told over a roast leg of wyvern.
#. column 3: Coral Orchestra
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
