#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:300:0:2"
msgid "They allowed him to bring the<br>sum of his skills to bear...or<br>maybe <i>cat</i>, on his foes.<br>   - Gerolt"
msgstr "Они позволили ему применить<br>всю свою сноровку... или<br><i>когти</i> против врагов.<br>   — Герольт"

#. ja: はげましホルン
#. de: Korallenorchester
#. fr: Orchestre de corail
#. column 0: Summon your Palico minion. Very punny.
