#. ja: ミニオン「プーギー」を呼び出す。<br>ハンターたちを魅了してやまない存在
#. de: Du rufst Poogie als Begleiter herbei. Beliebt bei Jägern, nah und fern. Nur gegessen wird's nicht gern.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Poogie, un adorable petit cochon capable de rendre n'importe quel chasseur com<shy>plè<shy>te<shy>ment gaga.
#. column 1: Many a hunter from lands both near and far has proclaimed this tiny piglet “cute enough to eat.” Not literally, of course. Alright, sometimes literally, but not this time. There will be no eating of Poogie, and that is final.
#. column 2: Ungodly swine! I would sooner<br><i>die</i> than surrender to you!<br>   - Vault Priest
#. column 3: Dig
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:301:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Poogie minion. Beloved by hunters, though the feeling is not always mutual."
msgstr "Призовите миньона Пуги. Охотники его обожают, хотя он не всегда отвечает им взаимностью."

#. ja: 愛らしい仔豚。はるか彼方にあるという、異邦の地ではハンターたちを魅了してやまない存在だという。もちろん、三大州におけるモブハンターたちにも大人気であり、その魅力の虜となる者が続出しているようだ
#. de: Wer kennt nicht die Jäger, die behaupten, dieses kleine Schweinchen sei „einfach zu süß, um es aufzuessen“? Gewiss hält die Behauptung nur bis zum nächsten Magenknurren. Aber Scherz beiseite: Poogie ist des Jägers bester Freund!
#. fr: Les Poogies ont tellement de fans au sein des chasseurs de monstres que certains en ont fait l'emblème de leur guilde, sans oublier ceux qui viennent des quatre coins du monde pour leur faire quelques caresses.
#. column 0: Summon your Poogie minion. Beloved by hunters, though the feeling is not always mutual.
#. column 2: Ungodly swine! I would sooner<br><i>die</i> than surrender to you!<br>   - Vault Priest
#. column 3: Dig
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:301:0:1"
msgid "Many a hunter from lands both near and far has proclaimed this tiny piglet “cute enough to eat.” Not literally, of course. Alright, sometimes literally, but not this time. There will be no eating of Poogie, and that is final."
msgstr "Охотники из самых дальних краёв твердят, что этот поросёнок «такой милый, что съел бы». В переносном смысле, конечно. Ладно, иногда и в прямом. Но только не сейчас. Пуги никто есть не будет, и точка."

#. ja: プヒ？
#. de: Ich glaub, mein Schweinchen pfeift!<br><i>Biggs</i>
#. fr: Grouik<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Poogie minion. Beloved by hunters, though the feeling is not always mutual.
#. column 1: Many a hunter from lands both near and far has proclaimed this tiny piglet “cute enough to eat.” Not literally, of course. Alright, sometimes literally, but not this time. There will be no eating of Poogie, and that is final.
#. column 3: Dig
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
