#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:301:0:2"
msgid "Ungodly swine! I would sooner<br><i>die</i> than surrender to you!<br>   - Vault Priest"
msgstr "Проклятая свинья! Я скорее<br><i>умру</i>, чем сдамся тебе!<br>   — Священник из Хранилища"

#. ja: ここ掘れプーギー
#. de: Such, Poogie, such!
#. fr: Creuser
#. column 0: Summon your Poogie minion. Beloved by hunters, though the feeling is not always mutual.
#. column 1: Many a hunter from lands both near and far has proclaimed this tiny piglet “cute enough to eat.” Not literally, of course. Alright, sometimes literally, but not this time. There will be no eating of Poogie, and that is final.
#. column 2: Ungodly swine! I would sooner<br><i>die</i> than surrender to you!<br>   - Vault Priest
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:301:0:3"
msgid "Dig"
msgstr "Копай, Пуги!"

#. ja: 敵が配置したトラップがある場合、解除する。
#. de: Entfernt eine vom Gegner aufgestellte Falle.
#. fr: Désamorce les pièges des ennemis.
#. column 0: Summon your Poogie minion. Beloved by hunters, though the feeling is not always mutual.
#. column 1: Many a hunter from lands both near and far has proclaimed this tiny piglet “cute enough to eat.” Not literally, of course. Alright, sometimes literally, but not this time. There will be no eating of Poogie, and that is final.
#. column 2: Ungodly swine! I would sooner<br><i>die</i> than surrender to you!<br>   - Vault Priest
#. column 3: Dig
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:301:0:4"
msgid "Disarms deployed enemy traps."
msgstr "Снимает ловушки, установленные противником."

#. ja: ミニオン「祭ナマズオ」を呼び出す。<br>ナマズオを模した魔法人形。わっしょいっぺよ♪
#. de: Du rufst deinen Festival-Namazuo als Begleiter herbei. Feiert bis zum Abwinken. Wasshoi ♪
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Namazu nain festif, un pantin portant la tenue de la grande frairie namazu.
#. column 1: Gyoshin labored through several nights to fincraft this tiny Namazu (though the happi stitchwork is clearly Gyorei's). He intended to make it in the likeness of the 777th attendee, but soon lost count, so model selection was ultimately random.
#. column 2: I am happy to have met some-<br>one so delici─deft of hand.<br>   - Cirina
#. column 3: Dawn of Civilization
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:302:0:0"
msgid "Summon your attendee #777 minion. Wasshoi, yes, yes."
msgstr "Призовите миньона № 777. Вассой! Йес-йес."

#. ja: ナマズオを模した魔法人形。大鯰大祭の開催資金を捻出するために、職人ギョシンが夜なべをして作ったものらしい。精巧なねじり鉢巻とハッピは、裁縫が得意なギョレイの手によるもの。縁起物として人気のようだ
#. de: Ein Meisterwerk des Handwerkers Gyoshin, erschaffen anlässlich des Festes der Großen Flosse. Hachimaki und Happi wurden von der Meisterschneiderin Gyorei angefertigt. Beliebt als Glücksbringer mit Gute-Laune-Garantie.
#. fr: Gyoshin a travaillé pendant plusieurs nuits pour con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>ner ce petit Namazu (même si le happi est manifestement l'œuvre de Gyorei). Il a d'abord eu l'intention de le créer à l'image du 777e festivalier, mais ayant vite perdu le compte, il finit par choisir un modèle au hasard.
#. column 0: Summon your attendee #777 minion. Wasshoi, yes, yes.
#. column 2: I am happy to have met some-<br>one so delici─deft of hand.<br>   - Cirina
#. column 3: Dawn of Civilization
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:302:0:1"
msgid "Gyoshin labored through several nights to fincraft this tiny Namazu (though the happi stitchwork is clearly Gyorei's). He intended to make it in the likeness of the 777th attendee, but soon lost count, so model selection was ultimately random."
msgstr "Гёсён несколько ночей корпел над этой крошечной куклой-намазу. Правда, узор на хаппи явно вышивала Гёри. Сначала он хотел изобразить семисот семьдесят седьмого гостя праздника, но быстро сбился со счёта. В итоге модель выбрали наугад."

#. ja: ぺぺぺ！
#. de: Wasshoi  ♪ Wasshoi  ♪
#. fr: Oyoyoyo<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your attendee #777 minion. Wasshoi, yes, yes.
#. column 1: Gyoshin labored through several nights to fincraft this tiny Namazu (though the happi stitchwork is clearly Gyorei's). He intended to make it in the likeness of the 777th attendee, but soon lost count, so model selection was ultimately random.
#. column 3: Dawn of Civilization
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:302:0:2"
msgid "I am happy to have met some-<br>one so delici─deft of hand.<br>   - Cirina"
msgstr "Как же я рад встрече<br>с таким сладкоречивым —<br>ловким мастером.<br>   — Цирина"

#. ja: 文明開化
#. de: Sieben Jahre Party
#. fr: Vent de l'llumination
#. column 0: Summon your attendee #777 minion. Wasshoi, yes, yes.
#. column 1: Gyoshin labored through several nights to fincraft this tiny Namazu (though the happi stitchwork is clearly Gyorei's). He intended to make it in the likeness of the 777th attendee, but soon lost count, so model selection was ultimately random.
#. column 2: I am happy to have met some-<br>one so delici─deft of hand.<br>   - Cirina
