#. ja: ミニオン「陰気なゴースト人形」を呼び出す。<br>なにやら陰気そうなゴースト人形。なぜか動く
#. de: Du rufst dein mürrisches Geistlein herbei. Scheint stets mit dem falschen Fuß aufzustehen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte fantôme triste, une pauvre âme errante qui semble quelque peu dépressive.
#. column 1: One half of a pair of (literally) animated decorations you stumbled across during the All Saints' Wake festivities. Members of the Continental Circus are at a loss as to why this sullen specter appears to have a will of its own, though “possession” is high on their list of theories.
#. column 2: Are we really sleepin' at<br>a graveyard? 'Cause I'm<br>afraid of ghosts...<br>   - Hal
#. column 3: Devilish Dispel
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:307:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Little Yin minion. Turn around."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Маленький инь». Обернись."

#. ja: 守護天節の祝祭にて出会った陰気なゴースト人形。催し物を主催しているコンチネンタル・サーカスの道化師たちも、これらの人形がなぜ動くのかは理解していなかった。それにしても陰気そうな表情をしている
#. de: Eine zum Leben erwachte Geisterpuppe, die du auf dem Allerschutzheiligen-Fest getroffen hast. Warum sie schweben und sprechen kann, wissen nicht mal die Gaukler vom Circus Continental. Wirkt ständig mies gelaunt.
#. fr: Même les arlequins du Cirque intercontinental ignorent comment ce fantôme de la Veillée des saints fait pour se mouvoir. Se pourrait-il que ce soit dû à sa dépression chronique<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your Little Yin minion. Turn around.
#. column 2: Are we really sleepin' at<br>a graveyard? 'Cause I'm<br>afraid of ghosts...<br>   - Hal
#. column 3: Devilish Dispel
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:307:0:1"
msgid "One half of a pair of (literally) animated decorations you stumbled across during the All Saints' Wake festivities. Members of the Continental Circus are at a loss as to why this sullen specter appears to have a will of its own, though “possession” is high on their list of theories."
msgstr "Одна из пары буквально оживших украшений, которые ты повстречал на празднике Поминовения всех святых. Клоуны Континентального цирка не могут понять, почему этот мрачный призрак будто живёт своей жизнью, но в их списке версий на первом месте — одержимость."

#. ja: オドロオドロ…
#. de: Ob ich mit dem Buch fertig bin?<br>Du hast vielleicht Nerven,<br>mir so auf den Geist zu gehen.<br><i>Gerolt</i>
#. fr: Pfff... Bouh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Little Yin minion. Turn around.
#. column 1: One half of a pair of (literally) animated decorations you stumbled across during the All Saints' Wake festivities. Members of the Continental Circus are at a loss as to why this sullen specter appears to have a will of its own, though “possession” is high on their list of theories.
#. column 3: Devilish Dispel
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:307:0:2"
msgid "Are we really sleepin' at<br>a graveyard? 'Cause I'm<br>afraid of ghosts...<br>   - Hal"
msgstr "Мы и правда ночуем<br>на кладбище? А то я<br>призраков боюсь...<br>   — Хэл"

#. ja: ですぺる
#. de: Böser Bann
#. fr: Dissipation blasée
#. column 0: Summon your Little Yin minion. Turn around.
#. column 1: One half of a pair of (literally) animated decorations you stumbled across during the All Saints' Wake festivities. Members of the Continental Circus are at a loss as to why this sullen specter appears to have a will of its own, though “possession” is high on their list of theories.
#. column 2: Are we really sleepin' at<br>a graveyard? 'Cause I'm<br>afraid of ghosts...<br>   - Hal
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:307:0:3"
msgid "Devilish Dispel"
msgstr "Дьявольское рассеивание"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵にかかっている、強化効果をすべて打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle positiven Effekte von den gegnerischen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe tous les effets bénéfiques des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Little Yin minion. Turn around.
#. column 1: One half of a pair of (literally) animated decorations you stumbled across during the All Saints' Wake festivities. Members of the Continental Circus are at a loss as to why this sullen specter appears to have a will of its own, though “possession” is high on their list of theories.
#. column 2: Are we really sleepin' at<br>a graveyard? 'Cause I'm<br>afraid of ghosts...<br>   - Hal
#. column 3: Devilish Dispel
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:307:0:4"
msgid "Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все положительные эффекты со всех врагов в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「陽気なゴースト人形」を呼び出す。<br>なにやら陽気そうなゴースト人形。なぜか動く
#. de: Du rufst dein munteres Geistlein herbei. Wie immer spitzenmäßig aufgelegt!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte fantôme joyeux, un gai luron toujours souriant<nbsp>!
#. column 1: One half of a pair of (literally) animated decorations you stumbled across during the All Saints' Wake festivities. Members of the Continental Circus are at a loss as to why this spry specter appears to have a will of its own, though “possession” is high on their list of theories.
#. column 2: Everyone'll think you a ghost!<br>   - Erapi Taropi
#. column 3: Villainous Vanish
#. column 4: Renders action party immune to all attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:308:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Little Yang minion. Every now and then he gets a little bit closer."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Маленький ян». Время от времени он становится чуточку ближе."

#. ja: 守護天節の祝祭にて出会った陽気なゴースト人形。本来であれば、決して動くはずはないのだが、なぜだかどうしてだか動く。本物の幽霊なのか、あるいは何者かが人形に魔力を込めただけなのか、真相は不明である
#. de: Eine zum Leben erwachte Geisterpuppe, die du auf dem Allerschutzheiligen-Fest getroffen hast. Warum sie schweben und sprechen kann, wissen nicht mal die Gaukler vom Circus Continental. Immer gut drauf!
#. fr: Depuis qu'il a obtenu une forme physique, ce fantôme à l'air enjoué virevolte dans les airs sans que personne ne sache comment il fait<nbsp>! Est-ce vraiment un pur esprit, ou une poupée à qui on aurait insufflé la vie à l'aide d'un pouvoir magique<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your Little Yang minion. Every now and then he gets a little bit closer.
#. column 2: Everyone'll think you a ghost!<br>   - Erapi Taropi
#. column 3: Villainous Vanish
#. column 4: Renders action party immune to all attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:308:0:1"
msgid "One half of a pair of (literally) animated decorations you stumbled across during the All Saints' Wake festivities. Members of the Continental Circus are at a loss as to why this spry specter appears to have a will of its own, though “possession” is high on their list of theories."
msgstr "Одна из пары буквально оживших украшений, которые ты повстречал на празднике Поминовения всех святых. Клоуны Континентального цирка не могут понять, почему этот проворный призрак будто живёт своей жизнью, но в их списке версий на первом месте — одержимость."

#. ja: オドロオドロ♪
#. de: Hast du nicht vielleicht einen Trank,<br>der meinem müden Geist auf die Sprünge hilft?<br><i>Yayaroku</i>
#. fr: Hi hi<nbsp>! Bouh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Little Yang minion. Every now and then he gets a little bit closer.
#. column 1: One half of a pair of (literally) animated decorations you stumbled across during the All Saints' Wake festivities. Members of the Continental Circus are at a loss as to why this spry specter appears to have a will of its own, though “possession” is high on their list of theories.
#. column 3: Villainous Vanish
#. column 4: Renders action party immune to all attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:308:0:2"
msgid "Everyone'll think you a ghost!<br>   - Erapi Taropi"
msgstr "Все будут думать, что ты призрак!<br>   — Эрапи Таропи"

#. ja: とうめい
#. de: Verschwinden
#. fr: Transparence joviale
#. column 0: Summon your Little Yang minion. Every now and then he gets a little bit closer.
#. column 1: One half of a pair of (literally) animated decorations you stumbled across during the All Saints' Wake festivities. Members of the Continental Circus are at a loss as to why this spry specter appears to have a will of its own, though “possession” is high on their list of theories.
