#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・クラウド」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。興味ないね……
#. de: Du rufst deine Cloud-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Ist einem legendären Helden nachempfunden und wirkt<nbsp>... schrecklich desinteressiert.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Cloud miniature, avec ses cheveux pleins de gel et son air indifférent.
#. column 1: At first glance, it appears that the artisan took numerous liberties in this rendition of the legendary hero─the distinct lack of upper-body muscle mass suggesting Cloud would have been unable to even lift a weapon the size of the Buster Sword, let alone brandish it over his head.
#. column 2: ...something.<br>   - Cloud
#. column 3: Finishing Touch
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 380 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:309:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Cloud minion. Sharp hair, don't care."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Клауда. Волосы дыбом — хоть стой, хоть падай."

#. ja: 古の英雄「クラウド」を模した魔法人形。伝説的な兵士であり、類まれなる戦闘能力を誇っていたという彼を再現するため、愛用していたとされる身の丈ほどもある剣、バスターソードも製作されている。興味ないね……
#. de: Um den legendären SOLDAT-Kämpfer Cloud möglichst getreu nachzubilden, hat man keine Kosten und Mühen gescheut und sogar das berühmte Panzerschwert bis auf die letzte Scharte repliziert. Ist dem Original natürlich völlig egal<nbsp>...
#. fr: Ce soldat est à n'en point douter une véritable légende, mais comment fait-il pour soulever une telle épée avec des bras aussi frêles<nbsp>? Aujourd'hui encore, la question reste en suspens.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Cloud minion. Sharp hair, don't care.
#. column 2: ...something.<br>   - Cloud
#. column 3: Finishing Touch
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 380 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:309:0:1"
msgid "At first glance, it appears that the artisan took numerous liberties in this rendition of the legendary hero─the distinct lack of upper-body muscle mass suggesting Cloud would have been unable to even lift a weapon the size of the Buster Sword, let alone brandish it over his head."
msgstr "На первый взгляд, мастер позволил себе немало вольностей, создавая легендарного героя. Судя по полному отсутствию мышц на торсе, Клауд вряд ли смог бы даже поднять меч «Меч разрушения», не говоря уже о том, чтобы размахивать им над головой."

#. ja: 興味ナイネ…
#. de: Kein Interesse<nbsp>...<br><i>Cloud</i>
#. fr: Ça m'intéresse pas.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Cloud minion. Sharp hair, don't care.
#. column 1: At first glance, it appears that the artisan took numerous liberties in this rendition of the legendary hero─the distinct lack of upper-body muscle mass suggesting Cloud would have been unable to even lift a weapon the size of the Buster Sword, let alone brandish it over his head.
#. column 3: Finishing Touch
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 380 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:309:0:2"
msgid "...something.<br>   - Cloud"
msgstr "...что-то.<br>   — Клауд"

#. ja: 画竜点睛
#. de: Omnischlag
#. fr: Finition
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Cloud minion. Sharp hair, don't care.
#. column 1: At first glance, it appears that the artisan took numerous liberties in this rendition of the legendary hero─the distinct lack of upper-body muscle mass suggesting Cloud would have been unable to even lift a weapon the size of the Buster Sword, let alone brandish it over his head.
#. column 2: ...something.<br>   - Cloud
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 380 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:309:0:3"
msgid "Finishing Touch"
msgstr "Последний штрих"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK380のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 380 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 380 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Cloud minion. Sharp hair, don't care.
#. column 1: At first glance, it appears that the artisan took numerous liberties in this rendition of the legendary hero─the distinct lack of upper-body muscle mass suggesting Cloud would have been unable to even lift a weapon the size of the Buster Sword, let alone brandish it over his head.
#. column 2: ...something.<br>   - Cloud
