msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 380 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 380."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・エアリス」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。全部終わったらまた、ね？
#. de: Du rufst deine Aerith-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Wenn alles vorbei ist, seht ihr euch wieder!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Aerith miniature, au charme qui rappelle quelque peu les temps anciens.
#. column 1: A somber reimagining of the ill-fated flowermonger who would set off on a journey to discover herself, only to find more than she bargained for. What is wind-up can never die.
#. column 2: This guy are sick.<br>   - Aerith
#. column 3: Great Gospel
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:310:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Aerith minion. The future ith not only yourth."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Аэрис. Будущее принадлежит не только тебе."

#. ja: 古の英雄「エアリス」を模した魔法人形。かつて花売りとして裏通りで生きていた彼女は、その身に流れる血という運命に翻弄されつつも、やがて星を救うための決断を下すことになったという。全部終わったらまた、ね？
#. de: Vom Blumenmädchen aus dem Hinterhof zur Retterin des Planeten: Was für eine beeindruckende Karriere! Ob es zum Date im Riesenrad gereicht hat, wissen nur Eingeweihte. Ansonsten sieht man sich, wenn alles vorbei ist!
#. fr: Après avoir passé son temps dans des ruelles sombres, cette vendeuse de fleurs au destin ex<shy>cep<shy>tion<shy>nel mais tragique a acquis l'immortalité grâce à sa version réduite.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Aerith minion. The future ith not only yourth.
#. column 2: This guy are sick.<br>   - Aerith
#. column 3: Great Gospel
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:310:0:1"
msgid "A somber reimagining of the ill-fated flowermonger who would set off on a journey to discover herself, only to find more than she bargained for. What is wind-up can never die."
msgstr "Мрачное воплощение несчастной цветочницы, отправившейся на поиски себя и обнаружившей куда больше, чем рассчитывала. Заводным игрушкам смерть не страшна."

#. ja: デート1回！
#. de: Ein Date!<br><i>Aerith</i>
#. fr: Va pour un rendez-vous<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Aerith minion. The future ith not only yourth.
#. column 1: A somber reimagining of the ill-fated flowermonger who would set off on a journey to discover herself, only to find more than she bargained for. What is wind-up can never die.
#. column 3: Great Gospel
