#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ティファ」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。想いを伝えられるのは言葉だけじゃないよ
#. de: Du rufst deine Tifa-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Gefühle kann man nicht immer in Worte fassen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Tifa miniature, au charme qui évoque clairement les temps modernes.
#. column 1: A gravity-defying rendition of the legendary bartending brawler, carved with tender loving care by a seven-fingered craftsman who is oft overheard mumbling to himself, “Words aren't the only way to tell someone how you feel.”
#. column 2: Fu, fu, fu... Be nice, Don.<br>   - Tifa
#. column 3: Final Heaven
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:311:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Tifa minion. Not the wrong person."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Тифы. Не перепутай её ни с кем."

#. ja: 古の英雄「ティファ」を模した魔法人形。酒場を切り盛りする傍らで、巨悪と戦い続けてきた人物。格闘術の達人でもあった彼女を再現するため、ありったけの職人技が注がれている。想いを伝えられるのは言葉だけじゃないよ
#. de: Tagsüber Kneipenwirtin, nachts Untergrund-<br>kämpferin. Mit Tifa hat man lieber keine Rechnung offen, es sei denn, man steht auf Schläge. Gefühle kann man halt nicht immer in Worte fassen.
#. fr: Cette tenancière de bar aux arguments imparables sait mieux que personne botter les fesses de ses adversaires à l'aide de puissantes techniques d'arts martiaux, mais elle garde souvent le silence sur ses véritables sentiments.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Tifa minion. Not the wrong person.
#. column 2: Fu, fu, fu... Be nice, Don.<br>   - Tifa
#. column 3: Final Heaven
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:311:0:1"
msgid "A gravity-defying rendition of the legendary bartending brawler, carved with tender loving care by a seven-fingered craftsman who is oft overheard mumbling to himself, “Words aren't the only way to tell someone how you feel.”"
msgstr "Парящую в воздухе миниатюру легендарной хозяйки бара и бойца вырезал с любовью мастер с семью пальцами. Его частенько слышат, когда он бормочет себе под нос: «Чувства можно выразить не только словами»."

#. ja: 会イニ行コウ！
#. de: Lass uns zu ihr gehen!<br><i>Tifa</i>
#. fr: En avant toute<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Tifa minion. Not the wrong person.
#. column 1: A gravity-defying rendition of the legendary bartending brawler, carved with tender loving care by a seven-fingered craftsman who is oft overheard mumbling to himself, “Words aren't the only way to tell someone how you feel.”
#. column 3: Final Heaven
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:311:0:2"
msgid "Fu, fu, fu... Be nice, Don.<br>   - Tifa"
msgstr "Фу-фу-фу... Дон, будь паинькой.<br>   — Тифа"

#. ja: ファイナルヘヴン
#. de: Himmelsfaust
#. fr: Dernier paradis
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Tifa minion. Not the wrong person.
#. column 1: A gravity-defying rendition of the legendary bartending brawler, carved with tender loving care by a seven-fingered craftsman who is oft overheard mumbling to himself, “Words aren't the only way to tell someone how you feel.”
#. column 2: Fu, fu, fu... Be nice, Don.<br>   - Tifa
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:311:0:3"
msgid "Final Heaven"
msgstr "Последний рай"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK150のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 150 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 150 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et les projette en arrière.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Tifa minion. Not the wrong person.
#. column 1: A gravity-defying rendition of the legendary bartending brawler, carved with tender loving care by a seven-fingered craftsman who is oft overheard mumbling to himself, “Words aren't the only way to tell someone how you feel.”
#. column 2: Fu, fu, fu... Be nice, Don.<br>   - Tifa
#. column 3: Final Heaven
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:311:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 150 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「ドロップチ」を呼び出す。<br>トカップチから剥がれ落ちた泥の一欠片。やっぱりドロドロ
#. de: Du rufst deinen Schlammprinzen als Begleiter herbei. Weil man nie genug Schlamm um sich haben kann.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte pâté de boue. La joie d'avoir été libéré de l'emprise de Tokkapchi se lit sur son visage.
#. column 1: A thick, brown mass of living effluence squeezed forth from one of the horror Tokkapchi's many hidden orifices. Though the squirt stinks of sopping sod, one might find themselves pressed to deny the amorphous alluvium is anything but adorable.
#. column 2: I was almost certain you'd<br>want to muddy the waters.<br>   - Jessie
#. column 3: Muddy Waters
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 60 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:312:0:0"
msgid "Summon your mudpie minion. At last, portable filth."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Грязевой пирожок». Наконец-то грязь всегда под рукой."

#. ja: トカップチから剥がれ落ちた泥の一欠片。かなり小さくなってしまったが、それでも元気に動き回れるのは、草木綱の魔物を活性化させるという神秘の泥の影響だろうか。愛嬌がある姿をしているが、泥臭いのが玉にキズ
#. de: Eine dickflüssige, braune Masse, die aus einer der vielen versteckten Öffnungen des schrecklichen Tokkapchi herausgepresst wurde. Wäre nicht die keck sitzende Krone, würde man diesen Begleiter in der nächsten Kanalisation entsorgen.
#. fr: Ce gentil petit tas de fange a beau arborer un sourire ravageur, il n'en reste pas moins qu'il ne sent pas la rose... Heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment que les végétaux de toutes les sortes en raffolent<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your mudpie minion. At last, portable filth.
#. column 2: I was almost certain you'd<br>want to muddy the waters.<br>   - Jessie
#. column 3: Muddy Waters
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 60 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:312:0:1"
msgid "A thick, brown mass of living effluence squeezed forth from one of the horror Tokkapchi's many hidden orifices. Though the squirt stinks of sopping sod, one might find themselves pressed to deny the amorphous alluvium is anything but adorable."
msgstr "Густая бурая жижа, выдавленная из одного из многочисленных потаённых отверстий чудовища Токкапчи. От этой кляксы несёт мокрой землёй, но попробуй отрицать, что бесформенная жижа просто очаровательна."

#. ja: ドロドロ…
#. de: In den Eingeweiden unserer Feinde sollen unsere Hände wühlen, nicht in Schlamm und Dreck!<br><i>Burduga-Krieger</i>
#. fr: Bloup bloup...
#. column 0: Summon your mudpie minion. At last, portable filth.
#. column 1: A thick, brown mass of living effluence squeezed forth from one of the horror Tokkapchi's many hidden orifices. Though the squirt stinks of sopping sod, one might find themselves pressed to deny the amorphous alluvium is anything but adorable.
#. column 3: Muddy Waters
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 60 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:312:0:2"
msgid "I was almost certain you'd<br>want to muddy the waters.<br>   - Jessie"
msgstr "Я почти не сомневалась, что ты<br>захочешь замутить воду.<br>   — Джесси"

#. ja: ドロドロ
#. de: Schlammpfütze
#. fr: Gadoue
#. column 0: Summon your mudpie minion. At last, portable filth.
#. column 1: A thick, brown mass of living effluence squeezed forth from one of the horror Tokkapchi's many hidden orifices. Though the squirt stinks of sopping sod, one might find themselves pressed to deny the amorphous alluvium is anything but adorable.
