#. ja: ミニオン「ブーケモーグリ」を呼び出す。<br>エターナルセレモニーの引き出物。幸せを呼ぶらしい
#. de: Du rufst deinen Brautjungfer-Mogry als Begleiter herbei. Nichts betont die Bescheidenheit einer Frau mehr, als ihren Weg mit Blütenblättern zu schmücken.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Mog d'honneur, un souvenir reçu lors d'une cérémonie du lien éternel.
#. column 1: Moogles serving the Sanctum of the Twelve claim the magicked poppets (provided with purchase of a lavish Ceremony of Eternal Bonding) are guaranteed to bring happiness. Conveniently offer no refunds if you do not hap upon said happiness.
#. column 2: Wh-What have you done<br>with my bride!?<br>   - Vannes
#. column 3: Never the Bride
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 10.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:313:0:0"
msgid "Summon your bridesmoogle minion. What is a blushing bride without a dutiful bridesmoogle to scatter petals in her general vicinity?"
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Мугл-подружка невесты». Какая же невеста без верного мугла, который осыплет округу лепестками?"

#. ja: モーグリを模した魔法人形。エターナルセレモニーの引き出物として製作されたため、華やかなブーケが付属している。十二神大聖堂にいたモーグリによれば、幸せを呼ぶ効果があるらしいが、本当なのだろうか？
#. de: Die Mogrys vom Dom der Einkehr sagen, dass die magischen Puppen (die bei Erwerb einer Zeremonie des Ewigen Bundes ausgegeben werden) Garanten des Glücks sind. Sollte der Ewige Bund doch nicht ewig halten, gibt es allerdings kein Geld zurück.
#. fr: Cette adorable mascotte articulée tient dans ses pattes un petit panier pour vous baigner de pétales et vous rappeler la cérémonie du lien éternel au cours de laquelle vous l'avez reçue. On dit d'elle qu'elle porte bonheur<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your bridesmoogle minion. What is a blushing bride without a dutiful bridesmoogle to scatter petals in her general vicinity?
#. column 2: Wh-What have you done<br>with my bride!?<br>   - Vannes
#. column 3: Never the Bride
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 10.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:313:0:1"
msgid "Moogles serving the Sanctum of the Twelve claim the magicked poppets (provided with purchase of a lavish Ceremony of Eternal Bonding) are guaranteed to bring happiness. Conveniently offer no refunds if you do not hap upon said happiness."
msgstr "Муглы из святилища Двенадцати уверяют, что волшебные куколки (их дарят при покупке роскошной церемонии Вечного союза) гарантированно приносят счастье. Удобно, что деньги не возвращают, если счастье так и не нашлось."

#. ja: ク～ポクポ♪
#. de: Ring futsch, Braut futsch ... \<wimmer><br><i>Karawanenkutscher</i>
#. fr: Kuuupo kupo<nbsp>!♪
#. column 0: Summon your bridesmoogle minion. What is a blushing bride without a dutiful bridesmoogle to scatter petals in her general vicinity?
#. column 1: Moogles serving the Sanctum of the Twelve claim the magicked poppets (provided with purchase of a lavish Ceremony of Eternal Bonding) are guaranteed to bring happiness. Conveniently offer no refunds if you do not hap upon said happiness.
#. column 3: Never the Bride
