#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・エルヴァーン」を呼び出す。<br>伝説のエルヴァーンを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deine Elvaan-Marionette als Begleiter herbei. Detailgetreu bis hin zum säuerlichen Ge<shy>sichts<shy>aus<shy>druck.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée elvaan, une poupée à l'effigie d'un Elvaan, membre d'un peuple légendaire.
#. column 1: A stack of dusty tomes and a healthy imagination served as inspiration for this automaton designed to depict an Elvaan─possible (but improbable) ancestor of the Elezen. He wears a blue cotehardie rendered in painstaking—and pointless—detail by his Sharlayan creator.
#. column 2: Curious pointed ears...<br>I wonder where they could<br>have come from, kupo?<br>   - Mogleo
#. column 3: Fan Dance
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:314:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Elvaan minion. Remarks relating to a certain people's perpetually dour facial expressions are best kept to oneself."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру эльвана. О замечательном хмуром выражении лиц одного народа лучше помалкивать."

#. ja: バルデシオン委員会の研究員が製作した魔法人形。「エレゼン族」の想像上の祖先を再現したものらしい。その特徴的な上衣は、「ブルーコタルディ」という名なのだとか。ブラックじゃないところがポイントとは、製作者の談
#. de: Ein Stapel staubiger Schmöker und eine blühende Fantasie waren die Vorlage für diese mechanische Puppe eines Elvaan, die von manchen für die Vorgänger der Elezen gehalten werden. Der Erbauer, ein Sharlayaner, hielt die altertümliche blaue Cotte für authentisch.
#. fr: Un savant des Élèves de Baldesion a tenté de représenter ce à quoi les anciens Élézens pouvaient ressembler. La poupée porte la tra<shy>di<shy>tion<shy>nel<shy>le cotte-hardie bleue (et non pas noire comme tient à le préciser son créateur).
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Elvaan minion. Remarks relating to a certain people's perpetually dour facial expressions are best kept to oneself.
#. column 2: Curious pointed ears...<br>I wonder where they could<br>have come from, kupo?<br>   - Mogleo
#. column 3: Fan Dance
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:314:0:1"
msgid "A stack of dusty tomes and a healthy imagination served as inspiration for this automaton designed to depict an Elvaan─possible (but improbable) ancestor of the Elezen. He wears a blue cotehardie rendered in painstaking—and pointless—detail by his Sharlayan creator."
msgstr "Пачка пыльных книг и богатое воображение вдохновили создателя этого автомата изобразить элезена — возможного, хоть и маловероятного, предка элезенов. Он носит синюю коттарди, воссозданную его шарлаянским мастером с кропотливостью... и совершенно зря."

#. ja: ブルコタエル！
#. de: Du dummer Elvaan, ich will's dir sagen,<br>beleid'gen mich auch deine Fragen.<br><i>Shantotto</i>
#. fr: Jamais sans ma cotte-hardie bleue<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Elvaan minion. Remarks relating to a certain people's perpetually dour facial expressions are best kept to oneself.
#. column 1: A stack of dusty tomes and a healthy imagination served as inspiration for this automaton designed to depict an Elvaan─possible (but improbable) ancestor of the Elezen. He wears a blue cotehardie rendered in painstaking—and pointless—detail by his Sharlayan creator.
#. column 3: Fan Dance
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:314:0:2"
msgid "Curious pointed ears...<br>I wonder where they could<br>have come from, kupo?<br>   - Mogleo"
msgstr "Любопытно, откуда<br>взялись эти острые уши?<br>Купо!<br>   — Моглео"

#. ja: 扇の舞い
#. de: Fächertanz
#. fr: Danse de l'éventail
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Elvaan minion. Remarks relating to a certain people's perpetually dour facial expressions are best kept to oneself.
#. column 1: A stack of dusty tomes and a healthy imagination served as inspiration for this automaton designed to depict an Elvaan─possible (but improbable) ancestor of the Elezen. He wears a blue cotehardie rendered in painstaking—and pointless—detail by his Sharlayan creator.
#. column 2: Curious pointed ears...<br>I wonder where they could<br>have come from, kupo?<br>   - Mogleo
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:314:0:3"
msgid "Fan Dance"
msgstr "Танец вееров"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンのDEFを40上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
#. de: Erhöht die ABW der ausführenden Trabanten um 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 40 la défense des mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Elvaan minion. Remarks relating to a certain people's perpetually dour facial expressions are best kept to oneself.
#. column 1: A stack of dusty tomes and a healthy imagination served as inspiration for this automaton designed to depict an Elvaan─possible (but improbable) ancestor of the Elezen. He wears a blue cotehardie rendered in painstaking—and pointless—detail by his Sharlayan creator.
#. column 2: Curious pointed ears...<br>I wonder where they could<br>have come from, kupo?<br>   - Mogleo
#. column 3: Fan Dance
