#. ja: ミニオン「ダルメル・カフ」を呼び出す。<br>ダルメルの幼獣。首が長いような短いような
#. de: Du rufst dein Dhalmel-Kalb als Begleiter herbei. Klein, aber oho-ch!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé dhalmel, une jeune bête sauvage au long cou, enfin... relativement à son corps.
#. column 1: Considering this young specimen was most likely bred in captivity for the purpose of research, it is nothing short of a miracle that the calf has managed to survive the harsh environment of Eureka for as long as it has.
#. column 2: Yes, you─with the long neck.<br>   - Tsukumo
#. column 3: Cold Stare
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:315:0:0"
msgid "Summon your dhalmel calf minion. Oddly short yet alarmingly tall."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Детёныш дальмеля». Странно короткий, но пугающе высокий."

#. ja: ダルメルの幼獣。おそらく研究用に飼育されていたダルメルの1体だと思われる。属性の乱れによって、凶暴化した魔物がうろつくエウレカにおいて、奇跡的に生存していた。首は長いような短いような微妙な長さである
#. de: Es grenzt an ein Wunder, dass das Jungtier so lange in der harschen Umgebung von Eureka überlebt hat. Insbesondere weil es zu Forschungszwecken in Gefangenschaft großgezogen wurde.
#. fr: On soupçonne que ce jeune animal au cou bizarrement proportionné a été élevé pour servir de cobaye. Le plus étonnant cependant, est qu'il soit encore vivant après avoir vécu sur Eurêka, une île où grouille une multitude de monstres pernicieux.
#. column 0: Summon your dhalmel calf minion. Oddly short yet alarmingly tall.
#. column 2: Yes, you─with the long neck.<br>   - Tsukumo
#. column 3: Cold Stare
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:315:0:1"
msgid "Considering this young specimen was most likely bred in captivity for the purpose of research, it is nothing short of a miracle that the calf has managed to survive the harsh environment of Eureka for as long as it has."
msgstr "Похоже, этого детёныша держали в неволе для исследований. Настоящее чудо, что он так долго продержался в суровых условиях Эврики."

#. ja: 【ダルメル】
#. de: Mein Nacken ... fühlt sich so geschmeidig an wie der eines Dhalmels!<br><i>Orland</i>
#. fr: Gniiiinn<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your dhalmel calf minion. Oddly short yet alarmingly tall.
#. column 1: Considering this young specimen was most likely bred in captivity for the purpose of research, it is nothing short of a miracle that the calf has managed to survive the harsh environment of Eureka for as long as it has.
#. column 3: Cold Stare
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:315:0:2"
msgid "Yes, you─with the long neck.<br>   - Tsukumo"
msgstr "Да, ты! Тот, что с длинной шеей.<br>   — Цукумо"

#. ja: 白眼視
#. de: Kalter Blick
#. fr: Regard froid
#. column 0: Summon your dhalmel calf minion. Oddly short yet alarmingly tall.
#. column 1: Considering this young specimen was most likely bred in captivity for the purpose of research, it is nothing short of a miracle that the calf has managed to survive the harsh environment of Eureka for as long as it has.
#. column 2: Yes, you─with the long neck.<br>   - Tsukumo
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:315:0:3"
msgid "Cold Stare"
msgstr "Холодный взгляд"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵の特殊技ポイントを、最大値の50%減少させる。
#. de: Verringert die Technikpunkte der Gegner in der Nähe um 50 % des Maximalwerts.
#. fr: Réduit les PdT des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet de 50% de leur valeur maximale.
#. column 0: Summon your dhalmel calf minion. Oddly short yet alarmingly tall.
#. column 1: Considering this young specimen was most likely bred in captivity for the purpose of research, it is nothing short of a miracle that the calf has managed to survive the harsh environment of Eureka for as long as it has.
#. column 2: Yes, you─with the long neck.<br>   - Tsukumo
#. column 3: Cold Stare
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:315:0:4"
msgid "Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value."
msgstr "Уменьшает запас очков особых приёмов всех врагов в радиусе действия на 50% от максимума."

#. ja: ミニオン「カピバラ・パップ」を呼び出す。<br>カピバラの幼獣。温泉に入ることを好むらしい
#. de: Du rufst dein Capybara-Jungtier als Begleiter herbei. Ausgesprochener Badefreund, der Kleine.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé cabiaï, un rongeur qui adore barboter dans l'eau.
#. column 1: Known in Hingashi as the “onitenjikunezumi” (quite liberally translated as “Near Eastern demon rat”), this rodent auspice of unknown age has developed a fondness for Far Eastern hot springs, and will spend days in the restorative waters if not reminded to come out and eat.
#. column 2: Such simple creatures, rats.<br>   - Charibert
#. column 3: Bucktooth
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:316:0:0"
msgid "Summon your capybara pup minion. Loves bath time, and you."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Детёныш капибары». Любит купаться. И тебя."

#. ja: カピバラの幼獣。どこで覚えたのか不明であるが、温泉に入ることを好むらしい。ちなみに、多くの温泉があることで知られるひんがしの国では、「オニテンジクネズミ」という奇妙な名で呼ばれているようだ
#. de: In Hingashi kennt man die mal putzigen, mal bissigen Nager als „Onitenjikunezumi“, die „Dämonenratte des Nahen Ostens“. Ihre Vorliebe für heiße Quellen ist wohlbekannt, sie sind dort oft als ungebetene Gäste anzutreffen.
#. fr: Ce rongeur aime tellement se prélasser dans les sources d'eau qu'il lui arrive d'oublier de se nourrir. Quant à son nom hingashien, il est d'une complexité telle que même les Orientaux préfèrent l'ignorer.
#. column 0: Summon your capybara pup minion. Loves bath time, and you.
#. column 2: Such simple creatures, rats.<br>   - Charibert
#. column 3: Bucktooth
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:316:0:1"
msgid "Known in Hingashi as the “onitenjikunezumi” (quite liberally translated as “Near Eastern demon rat”), this rodent auspice of unknown age has developed a fondness for Far Eastern hot springs, and will spend days in the restorative waters if not reminded to come out and eat."
msgstr "На Хингане этого грызуна называют «онитэндзикунэдзуми» — примерно «демоническая крыса с Дальнего Востока». Никто не знает, сколько ему лет, но он полюбил горячие источники Дальнего Востока и может провести в целебной воде несколько дней, если не напомнить ему выйти и поесть."

#. ja: キュルキュル！
#. de: Du hast bestimmt keine Angst vor Ratten, oder?<br><i>Gerbert</i>
#. fr: Kyu kyu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your capybara pup minion. Loves bath time, and you.
#. column 1: Known in Hingashi as the “onitenjikunezumi” (quite liberally translated as “Near Eastern demon rat”), this rodent auspice of unknown age has developed a fondness for Far Eastern hot springs, and will spend days in the restorative waters if not reminded to come out and eat.
#. column 3: Bucktooth
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:316:0:2"
msgid "Such simple creatures, rats.<br>   - Charibert"
msgstr "Крысы — такие простые существа.<br>   — Шариберт"

#. ja: がじがじ
#. de: Rattenzahn
#. fr: Dents de devant
#. column 0: Summon your capybara pup minion. Loves bath time, and you.
#. column 1: Known in Hingashi as the “onitenjikunezumi” (quite liberally translated as “Near Eastern demon rat”), this rodent auspice of unknown age has developed a fondness for Far Eastern hot springs, and will spend days in the restorative waters if not reminded to come out and eat.
#. column 2: Such simple creatures, rats.<br>   - Charibert
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:316:0:3"
msgid "Bucktooth"
msgstr "Передние зубы"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のアルカナストーンに、5%のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Arkana-Stein 5 % Schaden zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 5% de sa solidité à la pierre arcanique ennemie la plus proche.
#. column 0: Summon your capybara pup minion. Loves bath time, and you.
#. column 1: Known in Hingashi as the “onitenjikunezumi” (quite liberally translated as “Near Eastern demon rat”), this rodent auspice of unknown age has developed a fondness for Far Eastern hot springs, and will spend days in the restorative waters if not reminded to come out and eat.
#. column 2: Such simple creatures, rats.<br>   - Charibert
#. column 3: Bucktooth
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:316:0:4"
msgid "Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone."
msgstr "Наносит ближайшему вражескому арканическому камню урон в размере 5% от прочности."

#. ja: ミニオン「ベイビーグレムリン」を呼び出す。<br>グレムリンの幼体。水に濡れても増えない
#. de: Du rufst deinen Baby-Gremlin als Begleiter herbei.<br>Aus unerfindlichen Gründen wird von Kontakt mit Wasser und Licht abgeraten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé gremlin. Ce jeune gremlin ne se multiplie pas au contact de l'eau.
#. column 1: Be not fooled by a gremlin's snow-white fur, for its intentions are as black as the night in which it thrives. Unlike more common stock, this particular breed appears to be resistant to both light and water, making them perfect pets for someone who doesn't mind a bit of mischief.
#. column 2: Thin skin and big<br>mouths make for an<br>uneasy combination.<br>   - Hunter-scholar
#. column 3: Foul Mouth
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:317:0:0"
msgid "Summon your baby gremlin minion. Feeding after midnight may result in injury. Yours."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Малыш-гремлин». Не корми после полуночи — а то покалечит. Твой."

#. ja: 低級妖異グレムリンの幼体。真っ白な毛並みが美しいが、その心も純白とは言えないようで、何かにつけて罵ってくる。ただし、最近のグレムリンは飼育しやすく、光に当てても死なないし、水に濡れても増えはしない
#. de: Ein mysteriöses Wesen der Gattung „Gremlin“. Flauschiges Fell und unglaublich liebenswert. Normalerweise. In letzter Zeit vermehren sie sich wie Unkraut, sind keineswegs mehr empfindlich gegen grelles Licht, und Wasser hat auch keinen erkennbaren Effekt mehr.
#. fr: Un démon de bas rang dans la Hiérarchie du néant. Son beau pelage immaculé contraste avec sa tendance à injurier les gens. Ce spécimen ne craint pas la lumière et ne se multiplie plus au contact de l'eau.
#. column 0: Summon your baby gremlin minion. Feeding after midnight may result in injury. Yours.
#. column 2: Thin skin and big<br>mouths make for an<br>uneasy combination.<br>   - Hunter-scholar
#. column 3: Foul Mouth
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:317:0:1"
msgid "Be not fooled by a gremlin's snow-white fur, for its intentions are as black as the night in which it thrives. Unlike more common stock, this particular breed appears to be resistant to both light and water, making them perfect pets for someone who doesn't mind a bit of mischief."
msgstr "Не обманывайся белоснежной шерстью гремлина: намерения у него чёрные, как ночь, в которой он обитает. Эта порода, в отличие от большинства, похоже, не боится ни света, ни воды. Идеальный питомец для тех, кто не против мелких пакостей."

#. ja: ケケケ！
#. de: Gurrruuu!
#. fr: Hou-hou-hou<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your baby gremlin minion. Feeding after midnight may result in injury. Yours.
#. column 1: Be not fooled by a gremlin's snow-white fur, for its intentions are as black as the night in which it thrives. Unlike more common stock, this particular breed appears to be resistant to both light and water, making them perfect pets for someone who doesn't mind a bit of mischief.
#. column 3: Foul Mouth
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:317:0:2"
msgid "Thin skin and big<br>mouths make for an<br>uneasy combination.<br>   - Hunter-scholar"
msgstr "Тонкая кожа и большой<br>рот — сочетание<br>не из приятных.<br>   — Охотник-учёный"

#. ja: ののしる
#. de: Gezeter
#. fr: Injure
#. column 0: Summon your baby gremlin minion. Feeding after midnight may result in injury. Yours.
#. column 1: Be not fooled by a gremlin's snow-white fur, for its intentions are as black as the night in which it thrives. Unlike more common stock, this particular breed appears to be resistant to both light and water, making them perfect pets for someone who doesn't mind a bit of mischief.
#. column 2: Thin skin and big<br>mouths make for an<br>uneasy combination.<br>   - Hunter-scholar
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:317:0:3"
msgid "Foul Mouth"
msgstr "Оскорбления"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵のATKを、50%低下させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>15秒
#. de: Verringert die ATT von Gegnern in der Nähe um 50 %.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 Sekunden
#. fr: Réduit de 50% l'attaque des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
