#. ja: ミニオン「プチヴァーチュー」を呼び出す。<br>剥がれ落ちたアブソリュートヴァーチューの一部らしい
#. de: Du rufst deinen Tugendhaften Begleiter herbei.<br>Angeblich ein Stück vom Leib der Absoluten Tugend, nach ihrer Teilung.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-vertu. Il s'agirait d'un fragment tombé de Vertu absolue.
#. column 1: From a pulsating mass of aetherial flesh sloughed off the Eurekan elemental Absolute Virtue did rise this uncanny facsimile, identical to its progenitor in every way─every way, that is, except size and, well, absoluteness.
#. column 2: Men measure virtue<br>in many ways.<br>   - Yayaroku
#. column 3: Last Virtue Standing
#. column 4: Increases caster ATK by 10 and DEF by 5 for every 5% of HP lost.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:318:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Conditional Virtue minion. Cuddle not to dullness; coddle not to elevation."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Условная добродетель». Не заласкай до отупения, не балуй до величия."

#. ja: エウレカにて発見された大型魔法生物、アブソリュートヴァーチューから剥がれ落ちたエーテル塊から再生された存在。高濃度のエーテル体であることから、スプライトなど妖精綱の魔物に近しい半生命体だと思われる
#. de: Dieses semi-materielle Wesen entstand angeblich aus dem Leib des auf Eureka aufgetauchten, riesenhaften magischen Ungeheuers, das als „Absolute Tugend“ bezeichnet wird. Manche ordnen das Wesen den Exergonen zu.
#. fr: Un être né d'un fragment de l'immense entité magique Vertu absolue découverte à Eurêka. De par sa grande con<shy>cen<shy>tra<shy>tion en éther, on la rapproche des élémentaires et autres êtres semi-vivants. Ne disparaît pas après deux heures.
#. column 0: Summon your Conditional Virtue minion. Cuddle not to dullness; coddle not to elevation.
#. column 2: Men measure virtue<br>in many ways.<br>   - Yayaroku
#. column 3: Last Virtue Standing
#. column 4: Increases caster ATK by 10 and DEF by 5 for every 5% of HP lost.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:318:0:1"
msgid "From a pulsating mass of aetherial flesh sloughed off the Eurekan elemental Absolute Virtue did rise this uncanny facsimile, identical to its progenitor in every way─every way, that is, except size and, well, absoluteness."
msgstr "Это странное подобие появилось из пульсирующей массы эфирной плоти, сброшенной стихийной тварью из Эврики — Абсолютной добродетелью. Оно во всём похоже на прародителя... во всём, кроме размера и, ну, абсолютности."

#. ja: 万古ノ呪縛ヨリ解キ放タレリ
#. de: Befreit vom uralten Bann<br>werde ich wieder frei sein!
#. fr: Par vos principes... j'ai été... libéré... des chaînes...
#. column 0: Summon your Conditional Virtue minion. Cuddle not to dullness; coddle not to elevation.
#. column 1: From a pulsating mass of aetherial flesh sloughed off the Eurekan elemental Absolute Virtue did rise this uncanny facsimile, identical to its progenitor in every way─every way, that is, except size and, well, absoluteness.
#. column 3: Last Virtue Standing
#. column 4: Increases caster ATK by 10 and DEF by 5 for every 5% of HP lost.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
