msgid "Men measure virtue<br>in many ways.<br>   - Yayaroku"
msgstr "Добродетель меряют<br>по-разному.<br>   — Яяроку"

#. ja: 最強の存在
#. de: Die letzte Tugend
#. fr: Existence suprême
#. column 0: Summon your Conditional Virtue minion. Cuddle not to dullness; coddle not to elevation.
#. column 1: From a pulsating mass of aetherial flesh sloughed off the Eurekan elemental Absolute Virtue did rise this uncanny facsimile, identical to its progenitor in every way─every way, that is, except size and, well, absoluteness.
#. column 2: Men measure virtue<br>in many ways.<br>   - Yayaroku
