#. ja: ミニオン「コユキンコ」を呼び出す。<br>ユキンコの幼体。寒さに負けない強さを秘める
#. de: Du rufst deinen Schnee-Korpokkur herbei.<br>Die Gattung der Flöckchen, einer Unterart der Korpokkur, ist bekannt für ihre Winterfestigkeit.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte ko-yukinko. Une jeune yukinko qui est parée pour le froid de l'hiver.
#. column 1: The yukinko's woven headdress serves not only to protect the creature from the elements, but spare it the embarrassment of having its nakedness exposed unto the world─not that any sane man would dare peek under the straw, lest he risk eternal damnation.
#. column 2: It is the enemy that weighs<br>on me─snow, rather than fire.<br>   - Martiallais
#. column 3: Snozzle
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 70 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:319:0:0"
msgid "Summon your yukinko snowflake minion. Falling, falling, falling, falling, falling...falling on his head."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Снежинка юкинко». Падает, падает, падает, падает, падает... прямо ему на голову."

#. ja: ユキンコの幼体。きれい好きであるため、頻繁にイネ科のワラを編んで、新しいみのに作り変えているらしい。しかし、警戒心が強いため、人前でみのを交換し頭上を晒すことはない。強引に見ようものなら、呪われるという噂も
#. de: Dieses Flöckchen ist sehr reinlich und wechselt daher häufig sein kleines Strohmäntelchen. Aber da es auch sehr scheu ist, macht es das nur wenn es vor neu-<br>gierigen Blicken sicher ist. Voyeure enden schon mal als Eiszapfen.
#. fr: Une jeune yukinko. D'une nature maniaque, elle renouvelle sa coiffe de chaume en permanence avec de la paille de graminée. Timide, elle ne montre jamais sa tête découverte en public. Ceux qui ont tenté de la voir de force auraient été maudits...
#. column 0: Summon your yukinko snowflake minion. Falling, falling, falling, falling, falling...falling on his head.
#. column 2: It is the enemy that weighs<br>on me─snow, rather than fire.<br>   - Martiallais
#. column 3: Snozzle
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 70 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:319:0:1"
msgid "The yukinko's woven headdress serves not only to protect the creature from the elements, but spare it the embarrassment of having its nakedness exposed unto the world─not that any sane man would dare peek under the straw, lest he risk eternal damnation."
msgstr "Плетёный головной убор юкинко защищает его от непогоды и не даёт ему красоваться на весь мир голышом. Впрочем, ни один здравомыслящий человек не сунет нос под солому: рисковать вечным проклятием себе дороже."

#. ja: しんしんしん…
#. de: Der einzige Feind, der schwer auf meinen<br>Schultern lastet, ist der Schnee.<br><i>Martiallais</i>
#. fr: Pom-pom-pom...
#. column 0: Summon your yukinko snowflake minion. Falling, falling, falling, falling, falling...falling on his head.
#. column 1: The yukinko's woven headdress serves not only to protect the creature from the elements, but spare it the embarrassment of having its nakedness exposed unto the world─not that any sane man would dare peek under the straw, lest he risk eternal damnation.
#. column 3: Snozzle
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 70 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
