#. ja: ミニオン「ニュー・タタル」を呼び出す。<br>タタルを模した魔法人形。ひんがし風の着物姿で登場
#. de: Du rufst deine neue Tataru-Puppe herbei.<br>Das besondere Merkmal dieser Puppe ist ihre typisch hinganische Kleidung.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte nouvelle Tataru miniature. Elle est vêtue à la mode hingashienne.
#. column 1: To thank those adventurers who have come to her aid while in Kugane, Tataru Taru of the Scions of the Seventh Dawn has been presenting her knights in shining armor with handcrafted replicas of...herself, fully clad in the finest silks from Bukyo.
#. column 2: Tataru's expression grows<br>ever darker each time I<br>see her pass by.<br>   - Slafborn
#. column 3: Scion Song
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:320:0:0"
msgid "Summon your dress-up Tataru minion. Say what you will, she wears it well."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Татару в кимоно». Говори что хочешь, а ей идёт."

#. ja: 「暁の血盟」の受付、タタル嬢を模した魔法人形。クガネでの活動でお世話になった人々に贈るために、クガネの人形師に依頼して製作したものらしい。その着物には、ブキョウ産の高級絹織物が使用されている
#. de: Eine Neuauflage der Tataru-Puppe, welche die beliebte Empfangsdame des Bundes der Morgenröte in einem traditionellen hinganischen Kleid zeigt. Der Kimono-Stoff stammt aus Bukyo, der Hauptstadt von Hingashi.
#. fr: Une poupée inspirée de ma<shy>de<shy>moi<shy>sel<shy>le Tataru, réceptionniste des Héritiers. Elle l'aurait commandée exprès à un artisan oriental pour l'offrir aux personnes l'ayant aidée à Kugane. Son kimono est tissé en fine soie de Bukyo.
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Tataru minion. Say what you will, she wears it well.
#. column 2: Tataru's expression grows<br>ever darker each time I<br>see her pass by.<br>   - Slafborn
#. column 3: Scion Song
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:320:0:1"
msgid "To thank those adventurers who have come to her aid while in Kugane, Tataru Taru of the Scions of the Seventh Dawn has been presenting her knights in shining armor with handcrafted replicas of...herself, fully clad in the finest silks from Bukyo."
msgstr "Чтобы отблагодарить искателей приключений, помогавших ей в Куганэ, Татару Тару из «Потомков Седьмой Зари» дарит своим рыцарям в сияющих доспехах куклы ручной работы... с собственным изображением, в роскошных шёлках из Букё."

#. ja: ナンダッテーン！
#. de: Es ist so schön, dich gesund und munter wiederzusehen!<br><i>Tataru</i>
#. fr: ♪ Les Héritiers n'ont pas à s'inquiéter,<br>♪ Car Tataru est là pour les aider<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Tataru minion. Say what you will, she wears it well.
#. column 1: To thank those adventurers who have come to her aid while in Kugane, Tataru Taru of the Scions of the Seventh Dawn has been presenting her knights in shining armor with handcrafted replicas of...herself, fully clad in the finest silks from Bukyo.
#. column 3: Scion Song
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:320:0:2"
msgid "Tataru's expression grows<br>ever darker each time I<br>see her pass by.<br>   - Slafborn"
msgstr "С каждым разом, как я вижу Татарино лицо,<br>оно становится всё мрачнее.<br>   — Слафборн"

#. ja: ナンダッテーン！
#. de: Stets zu Diensten
#. fr: Jolie rose
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Tataru minion. Say what you will, she wears it well.
#. column 1: To thank those adventurers who have come to her aid while in Kugane, Tataru Taru of the Scions of the Seventh Dawn has been presenting her knights in shining armor with handcrafted replicas of...herself, fully clad in the finest silks from Bukyo.
