#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・カリヤナ」を呼び出す。<br>カリヤナ派のアナンタを模した魔法人形。シュー……
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-Qalyana herbei.<br>Eine kunssstvoll gefertigte Marionette, welche dem Qalyana-Stamm der Ananta nachempfunden ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée qalyana, un automate inspiré d'une Ananta de la tribu des Qalyanas. Ssss...
#. column 1: The ex-Gatekeeper who crafted this doll claims her model was a Qalyana battlemaid who awoke from her reverie to join Alpa in the headstrong Vira's endeavor to protect the realm. She hopes it serves to strengthen the bond 'twixt the Ananta tribes.
#. column 2: The Qalyana are another<br>Ananta tribe─the strongest<br>and the most influential.<br>   - M'naago
#. column 3: Tail Thwap
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:322:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Qalyana minion. She may or may not break through the borderline."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру калианы. Перейдёт ли она границу — кто знает."

#. ja: アルパ国境警備隊の元工兵が製作した、カリヤナ派のアナンタを模した魔法人形。カリヤナ派から脱して、国境警備隊に合流した新たな仲間をモデルにした人形を作ることで、結束力を高めようという狙いがあるようだ
#. de: Ein ehemaliger Soldat der Grenzwache Velodyna entwarf diese Aufziehmarionette, um diejenigen Qalyana zu ehren, die den Mut besaßen, ihre Schwestern zu verlassen und als Mitglieder der Grenzwache ihrer Heimat zu dienen.
#. fr: Une poupée con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>née par un ancien garde-frontière de la Velodyna, dans l'espoir que cet objet évoquant les Qalyanas ayant fui pour rejoindre les garde-frontières aide à resserrer les liens entre tribus.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Qalyana minion. She may or may not break through the borderline.
#. column 2: The Qalyana are another<br>Ananta tribe─the strongest<br>and the most influential.<br>   - M'naago
#. column 3: Tail Thwap
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:322:0:1"
msgid "The ex-Gatekeeper who crafted this doll claims her model was a Qalyana battlemaid who awoke from her reverie to join Alpa in the headstrong Vira's endeavor to protect the realm. She hopes it serves to strengthen the bond 'twixt the Ananta tribes."
msgstr "Бывший страж Врат, создавший эту куклу, утверждает, что моделью послужила воительница калиана. Она пробудилась от грёз и присоединилась к Алпе, чтобы помочь отважной вире защитить край. Создатель надеется, что кукла укрепит связи между племенами ананта."

#. ja: シュー…
#. de: Sss ...
#. fr: Ssss...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Qalyana minion. She may or may not break through the borderline.
#. column 1: The ex-Gatekeeper who crafted this doll claims her model was a Qalyana battlemaid who awoke from her reverie to join Alpa in the headstrong Vira's endeavor to protect the realm. She hopes it serves to strengthen the bond 'twixt the Ananta tribes.
#. column 3: Tail Thwap
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:322:0:2"
msgid "The Qalyana are another<br>Ananta tribe─the strongest<br>and the most influential.<br>   - M'naago"
msgstr "Калианы — другое<br>племя ананта: самое сильное<br>и влиятельное.<br>   — М'нааго"

#. ja: テールスラップ
#. de: Schwanzschlag
#. fr: Gifle caudale
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Qalyana minion. She may or may not break through the borderline.
#. column 1: The ex-Gatekeeper who crafted this doll claims her model was a Qalyana battlemaid who awoke from her reverie to join Alpa in the headstrong Vira's endeavor to protect the realm. She hopes it serves to strengthen the bond 'twixt the Ananta tribes.
#. column 2: The Qalyana are another<br>Ananta tribe─the strongest<br>and the most influential.<br>   - M'naago
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:322:0:3"
msgid "Tail Thwap"
msgstr "Удар хвостом"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK30のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 30 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 30 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Qalyana minion. She may or may not break through the borderline.
#. column 1: The ex-Gatekeeper who crafted this doll claims her model was a Qalyana battlemaid who awoke from her reverie to join Alpa in the headstrong Vira's endeavor to protect the realm. She hopes it serves to strengthen the bond 'twixt the Ananta tribes.
#. column 2: The Qalyana are another<br>Ananta tribe─the strongest<br>and the most influential.<br>   - M'naago
#. column 3: Tail Thwap
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:322:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 30 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ベニコウラ」を呼び出す。<br>紅甲羅のコウジン族を模した魔法人形。たいへんだァー！
#. de: Ruft eine Rotpanzer-Puppe als Begleiter herbei.<br>Magische Puppe eines Rotpanzer-Kojin.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Kojin rouge mécanique, un automate inspiré de la tribu des Rouges. C'est terriiiible<nbsp>!
#. column 1: A master craftsman hailing from the Kojin of the Blue conceived this miniature automaton with the hopes that it might one day bring together his clan and the Kojin of the Red. How exactly an automaton might do that has yet to be determined...
#. column 2: I'm a giant tortoise!<br>A tortoise!<br>   - Soroban
#. column 3: Kasaya
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 10%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:323:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Redback minion. Don't tell mom the Kojin minion's red."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Красноспинного. Не говори маме, что прислужник кудзин красный."

#. ja: 紅甲羅のコウジン族を模した魔法人形。いつの日か対立する紅甲羅との和解できるようにと、碧甲羅たちが融和祈願の一環として愛情込めて作り上げた一品。かつて、ゼッキ島の鬼と恐れられた朱色の甲羅を再現している
#. de: Magische Puppe eines Rotpanzer-Kojin. In der Hoffnung, irgendwann einmal mit den Rotpanzer-Kojin in Harmonie leben zu können, haben die besten Handwerker der Blaupanzer diese Rotpanzer-Puppe erschaffen, als Zeichen ihres Respekts und ihrer Demut.
#. fr: Un automate inspiré de la tribu des Rouges. Les Kojin verts confectionnent ces objets avec amour, dans l'espoir de se réconcilier un jour avec les Rouges. Il représente un Rouge jadis vu comme le démon de l'île de Zekki.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Redback minion. Don't tell mom the Kojin minion's red.
#. column 2: I'm a giant tortoise!<br>A tortoise!<br>   - Soroban
#. column 3: Kasaya
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 10%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:323:0:1"
msgid "A master craftsman hailing from the Kojin of the Blue conceived this miniature automaton with the hopes that it might one day bring together his clan and the Kojin of the Red. How exactly an automaton might do that has yet to be determined..."
msgstr "Мастер-ремесленник из Синепанцирных создал эту миниатюрную куклу в надежде однажды объединить своё племя с Краснопанцирными. Как именно автоматон должен этого добиться, пока неясно..."

#. ja: タイヘンダァー！
#. de: Gute Reise! Wir werden euch noch ein<br>bisschen<nbsp>...... hinterherschwimmen.<br><i>Soroban</i>
#. fr: C'est terriiiible<nbsp>!
