#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・フラン」を呼び出す。<br>フランを模した魔法人形。霧ではないわ
#. de: Du rufst deine Fran-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Hasenlöffel inbegriffen.<br>Von ihr stammen die berühmten Worte: „Kein Nebel. Mysth.“
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Fran miniature. Ce pantin à l'effigie de la Viéra a des oreilles aussi longues que son modèle.
#. column 1: Taking a page from the Scions of the Seventh Dawn, Bangaa fusilier Rinok secretly commissioned the creation of scores of miniature Fran fetishes in an effort to fill the coffers of the perpetually under-funded resistance movement spearheaded by Lente's Tears.
#. column 2: Fran is not too bad,<br>once you're on her<br>good side.<br>   - Rinok
#. column 3: Feral Strike
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:325:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Fran minion. Stilettos guaranteed not to impede progress through markedly rough terrain such as jungles, bogs, and abandoned monasteries serving as prisons for extra-dimensional forces of evil."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Франа. Каблуки не помешают пробираться сквозь самые гиблые места: джунгли, болота и заброшенные монастыри-тюрьмы для межпространственных сил зла."

#. ja: ダルマスカ系レジスタンス「レンテの涙」の幹部、フランを模した魔法人形。同組織に属すバンガ族の女闘士、リノが活動資金を得るために、夜なべして作ったものらしい。その完成度はかなりのもので、売れ行きも好調とのこと
#. de: Diese lebensecht wirkende, magische Puppe stellt Fran, die Anführerin der dalmascanischen Widerstandsgruppe „Lentes Träne“ dar. Hergestellt von Befreiungskämpferinnen der Bangaa und viel zu schade zum Verkaufen!
#. fr: La chef des Larmes de Lenté, un groupe de résistants dalmasquiens. Rinok, guerrière vangaa des Larmes, aurait passé une nuit à con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>ner ces poupées pour décrocher un budget. Très abouties, elles se vendent comme des petits pains.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Fran minion. Stilettos guaranteed not to impede progress through markedly rough terrain such as jungles, bogs, and abandoned monasteries serving as prisons for extra-dimensional forces of evil.
#. column 2: Fran is not too bad,<br>once you're on her<br>good side.<br>   - Rinok
#. column 3: Feral Strike
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:325:0:1"
msgid "Taking a page from the Scions of the Seventh Dawn, Bangaa fusilier Rinok secretly commissioned the creation of scores of miniature Fran fetishes in an effort to fill the coffers of the perpetually under-funded resistance movement spearheaded by Lente's Tears."
msgstr "Последовав примеру «Потомков Седьмой Зари», стрелок бангаа Ринок тайком заказала целую партию миниатюрных фигурок Фран, чтобы пополнить вечно пустую казну повстанцев «Слёз Ленте»."

#. ja: ミストよ！
#. de: Das ist Mysth!
#. fr: Pas du brouillard... du myste.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Fran minion. Stilettos guaranteed not to impede progress through markedly rough terrain such as jungles, bogs, and abandoned monasteries serving as prisons for extra-dimensional forces of evil.
#. column 1: Taking a page from the Scions of the Seventh Dawn, Bangaa fusilier Rinok secretly commissioned the creation of scores of miniature Fran fetishes in an effort to fill the coffers of the perpetually under-funded resistance movement spearheaded by Lente's Tears.
#. column 3: Feral Strike
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:325:0:2"
msgid "Fran is not too bad,<br>once you're on her<br>good side.<br>   - Rinok"
msgstr "Фран не так уж плоха,<br>если быть у неё<br>на хорошем счету.<br>   — Ринок"

#. ja: 乱命割殺掌
#. de: Faustpresche
#. fr: Avalanche de coups
