msgid "Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable."
msgstr "Снижает ОЗ вражеского щита на 70%. Не действует, если щит уже разрушен."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ン・モゥ」を呼び出す。<br>ン・モゥ族を模した魔法人形。抱き心地は抜群
#. de: Du rufst dein Nu Mou-Stofftier als Begleiter herbei.<br>Unübertroffen knuffig.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Nu Mou miniature, profitez-en pour lui faire un gros câlin.
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of a former member of Clan Nutsy, this automaton appears so cuddlesome as if it were made of cotton. Most folk think twice about cuddling it, however, when they learn it was actually made by a Nu Mou claybender using mud and mushroom spores.
#. column 2: A ring, a ring, a wondrous thing,<br>when its metal band hides<br>a Nu Mou's sting!♪<br>    - Nee Marn
#. column 3: Fitting Payment
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:326:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Nu Mou minion. So cuddlesome it hurts."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру ну-му. Такая милая, что аж больно."

#. ja: かつてナッツクランに所属していた、とあるン・モゥ族を模した魔法人形。抱き心地は抜群で、綿が詰まっているかのようにフカフカ。しかし、実はン・モゥ族の陶器魔道士が、キノコの胞子と泥をコネて作ったものらしい
#. de: Dieses putzige Stofftier ist einem Nu Mou vom Clan Kupo nachempfunden. Wenn man es drückt und herzt, fühlt es sich seidig weich an. In Wirklichkeit wurde es jedoch von einem Töpfermagier der Nu Mou aus Lehm und Pilzsporen gefertigt.
#. fr: Cette poupée a été façonnée par un Nu Mou du clan Kupo. Parfaite pour les câlins, elle est douce comme une grosse boule de coton. Il s'avère cependant que son créateur se sert uniquement de spores de champignons et d'argile sèche pour la fabriquer.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Nu Mou minion. So cuddlesome it hurts.
#. column 2: A ring, a ring, a wondrous thing,<br>when its metal band hides<br>a Nu Mou's sting!♪<br>    - Nee Marn
#. column 3: Fitting Payment
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:326:0:1"
msgid "Designed in the likeness of a former member of Clan Nutsy, this automaton appears so cuddlesome as if it were made of cotton. Most folk think twice about cuddling it, however, when they learn it was actually made by a Nu Mou claybender using mud and mushroom spores."
msgstr "Эту куклу сделали по образу бывшего члена клана Нацци. На вид она такая мягкая и уютная, будто набита хлопком. Но желающих обниматься с ней поубавится, когда они узнают, что глиняный маг ну-му изготовил её из грязи и грибных спор."

#. ja: ん、もぉ～！
#. de: Gnihihi! Mit diesen Sporen lassen sich lustige Sachen anstellen!
#. fr: Hé oh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Nu Mou minion. So cuddlesome it hurts.
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of a former member of Clan Nutsy, this automaton appears so cuddlesome as if it were made of cotton. Most folk think twice about cuddling it, however, when they learn it was actually made by a Nu Mou claybender using mud and mushroom spores.
#. column 3: Fitting Payment
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:326:0:2"
msgid "A ring, a ring, a wondrous thing,<br>when its metal band hides<br>a Nu Mou's sting!♪<br>    - Nee Marn"
msgstr "Кольцо, колечко — чудесный предмет,<br>в металлической оправе<br>жало ну-му!♪<br>    — Ни Марн"

#. ja: 対価
#. de: Kompensation
#. fr: Transaction équitable
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Nu Mou minion. So cuddlesome it hurts.
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of a former member of Clan Nutsy, this automaton appears so cuddlesome as if it were made of cotton. Most folk think twice about cuddling it, however, when they learn it was actually made by a Nu Mou claybender using mud and mushroom spores.
#. column 2: A ring, a ring, a wondrous thing,<br>when its metal band hides<br>a Nu Mou's sting!♪<br>    - Nee Marn
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:326:0:3"
msgid "Fitting Payment"
msgstr "Справедливая плата"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Nu Mou minion. So cuddlesome it hurts.
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of a former member of Clan Nutsy, this automaton appears so cuddlesome as if it were made of cotton. Most folk think twice about cuddling it, however, when they learn it was actually made by a Nu Mou claybender using mud and mushroom spores.
#. column 2: A ring, a ring, a wondrous thing,<br>when its metal band hides<br>a Nu Mou's sting!♪<br>    - Nee Marn
#. column 3: Fitting Payment
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:326:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Даёт 10 очков особых приёмов всем союзникам в радиусе действия, кроме тех, чьи особые приёмы дают такой же эффект."

#. ja: ミニオン「青帝」を呼び出す。<br>伝承上の青龍を模した魔法人形。なお、青帝とは青龍の別名である
#. de: Du rufst Seitei als Begleiter herbei.<br>Abbild Seiryus, dem mächtigsten der Tierheiligen. Die Marionette ist als kunstvoller östlicher Drache entworfen und wurde mit hochwertigen Materialien hergestellt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte dragonnet azur, une repré<shy>sen<shy>ta<shy>tion tra<shy>di<shy>tion<shy>nel<shy>le de Seiryû quand il n'était encore qu'un bébé.
#. column 1: While the true Seiryu has been documented as being more serpent than dragon, this replica of the azure auspice bears a striking resemblance to Kirin (though assurances have been made that this design decision was by no means a cost-cutting measure).
#. column 2: Hurry up and knock some<br>sense into Seiryu's noggin!<br>   - Kamaitachi
#. column 3: Monster Party
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:327:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Seitei minion. Dragon-ness is in the eye of the beholder."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника Сейтея. Дракон — дело вкуса."

#. ja: 青龍を模した魔法人形。実物の青龍は、巨大な蛇であるが、こちらはあくまで伝承上の「龍」を模している。その姿は、奇しくも幻獣「麒麟」に似ているが、身体のどこを探しても「キリン」の文字は見当たらない
#. de: Abbild Seiryus, dem mächtigsten der Tierheiligen. Die Erbauer dieser Miniatur kennen offenbar den echten Seiryu nur vom Hörensagen, denn das mächtige Original ist bekanntlich eine schlangenhafte Chimära und kein östlicher Drache.
#. fr: Seiryû a beau avoir l'apparence d'un serpent géant, il prend ici la forme d'un petit dragon semblable au légendaire Kirin, bien que les lettres de ce nom ne figurent nulle part sur son corps fluet.
#. column 0: Summon your Seitei minion. Dragon-ness is in the eye of the beholder.
#. column 2: Hurry up and knock some<br>sense into Seiryu's noggin!<br>   - Kamaitachi
#. column 3: Monster Party
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:327:0:1"
msgid "While the true Seiryu has been documented as being more serpent than dragon, this replica of the azure auspice bears a striking resemblance to Kirin (though assurances have been made that this design decision was by no means a cost-cutting measure)."
msgstr "Настоящий Сэйрю, как известно, больше похож на змею, чем на дракона. А эта копия лазурного покровителя удивительно напоминает кирина. Впрочем, создатели уверяют, что выбрали такой облик вовсе не ради экономии."

#. ja: …………
#. de: ... ... ...
#. fr: Prépare-toi à être surpassé, Tenzen<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Seitei minion. Dragon-ness is in the eye of the beholder.
#. column 1: While the true Seiryu has been documented as being more serpent than dragon, this replica of the azure auspice bears a striking resemblance to Kirin (though assurances have been made that this design decision was by no means a cost-cutting measure).
#. column 3: Monster Party
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:327:0:2"
msgid "Hurry up and knock some<br>sense into Seiryu's noggin!<br>   - Kamaitachi"
msgstr "Пора бы уже вбить хоть немного ума в голову Сэйрю!<br>   — Камайтати"

#. ja: 一鬼夜行
#. de: Seelendämmerung
#. fr: Parade azur
#. column 0: Summon your Seitei minion. Dragon-ness is in the eye of the beholder.
#. column 1: While the true Seiryu has been documented as being more serpent than dragon, this replica of the azure auspice bears a striking resemblance to Kirin (though assurances have been made that this design decision was by no means a cost-cutting measure).
#. column 2: Hurry up and knock some<br>sense into Seiryu's noggin!<br>   - Kamaitachi
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:327:0:3"
msgid "Monster Party"
msgstr "Монстры в сборе"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Seitei minion. Dragon-ness is in the eye of the beholder.
#. column 1: While the true Seiryu has been documented as being more serpent than dragon, this replica of the azure auspice bears a striking resemblance to Kirin (though assurances have been made that this design decision was by no means a cost-cutting measure).
#. column 2: Hurry up and knock some<br>sense into Seiryu's noggin!<br>   - Kamaitachi
#. column 3: Monster Party
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:327:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 90."

#. ja: ミニオン「ふかふか座布団」を呼び出す。<br>ふかふかの座布団。座布団一枚差し上げて！
#. de: Du rufst dein Zabuton-Sitzkissen als Begleiter herbei.<br>Denn wo du gern bist, da lass dich nieder.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte coussin zabuton moelleux. Un coussin ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment confortable, accessoire in<shy>dis<shy>pen<shy>sa<shy>ble dans les régions où l'ont s'assoit beaucoup par terre.
#. column 1: It is well documented that Hingans shun chairs, preferring instead to sit upon the floor. What is less known, however, is that when a speaker utters something deemed clever, she is rewarded with cushions that she may sit in a position elevated above her peers.
#. column 2: We would be singing of<br>mending socks and<br>sitting on cushions.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
#. column 3: Out from Under
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:328:0:0"
msgid "Summon your zephyrous zabuton minion. More pushing for another cushion."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — воздушную циновку дзабутон. Ещё немного — и дадут вторую."

#. ja: 床に座ることの多い東方地域では、必需品とも言えるふかふかの座布団。なお、ひんがしの国では、トンチの効いたことを発言すると余分に座布団がもらえ、不謹慎な発言をすると奪われるという、奇妙な風習があるらしい
#. de: Stühle sind im Fernen Osten Mangelware, traditionell flezt man sich lieber auf dem Boden. Aber nicht ohne ein weiches Sitzkissen! Deswegen ist dieser Begleiter unerlässlich für alle Besucher der östlichen Regionen, sofern sie nicht über eine gehörige Portion Sitzfleisch verfügen.
#. fr: Dans les terres orientales, où l'on s'assoit beaucoup par terre, cet objet de confort est in<shy>dis<shy>pen<shy>sa<shy>ble. On raconte aussi que dans certaines cultures, il peut servir d'arme lors de batailles épiques...
#. column 0: Summon your zephyrous zabuton minion. More pushing for another cushion.
#. column 2: We would be singing of<br>mending socks and<br>sitting on cushions.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
#. column 3: Out from Under
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:328:0:1"
msgid "It is well documented that Hingans shun chairs, preferring instead to sit upon the floor. What is less known, however, is that when a speaker utters something deemed clever, she is rewarded with cushions that she may sit in a position elevated above her peers."
msgstr "Хиганцы не жалуют стулья и предпочитают сидеть на полу. Но мало кто знает: если кто-нибудь скажет что-то остроумное, ему в награду дают циновку, чтобы он мог воссесть повыше остальных."

#. ja: 全部持ってって！
#. de: Die Prinzessin hat Mumm. Sie könnte sich auch<br>auf einem teuren Seidenkissen den Hintern platt<br>sitzen und kostbaren Tee einschenken lassen.<br><i>Oboro</i>
#. fr: Fwih fwih...
#. column 0: Summon your zephyrous zabuton minion. More pushing for another cushion.
#. column 1: It is well documented that Hingans shun chairs, preferring instead to sit upon the floor. What is less known, however, is that when a speaker utters something deemed clever, she is rewarded with cushions that she may sit in a position elevated above her peers.
#. column 3: Out from Under
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:328:0:2"
msgid "We would be singing of<br>mending socks and<br>sitting on cushions.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel"
msgstr "И мы бы пели<br>о починке носков<br>да циновках на полу.<br>   — Странствующий менестрель"

#. ja: 一枚持ってって！
#. de: Jeder nur ein Kissen
#. fr: Lancer de zabuton
#. column 0: Summon your zephyrous zabuton minion. More pushing for another cushion.
#. column 1: It is well documented that Hingans shun chairs, preferring instead to sit upon the floor. What is less known, however, is that when a speaker utters something deemed clever, she is rewarded with cushions that she may sit in a position elevated above her peers.
#. column 2: We would be singing of<br>mending socks and<br>sitting on cushions.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:328:0:3"
msgid "Out from Under"
msgstr "Не оставайся в долгу"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンを自軍の中央ゲート内へワープさせる。
#. de: Versetzt die ausführenden Trabanten zurück zu Tor B.
#. fr: Téléporte les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT vers le portail central.
#. column 0: Summon your zephyrous zabuton minion. More pushing for another cushion.
#. column 1: It is well documented that Hingans shun chairs, preferring instead to sit upon the floor. What is less known, however, is that when a speaker utters something deemed clever, she is rewarded with cushions that she may sit in a position elevated above her peers.
#. column 2: We would be singing of<br>mending socks and<br>sitting on cushions.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
#. column 3: Out from Under
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:328:0:4"
msgid "Transports action party to the central summoning Gate. "
msgstr "Перемещает миньонов, потративших очки особых приёмов, к центральным воротам."

#. ja: ミニオン「アロハウソウソ」を呼び出す。<br>南洋風のウソウソ。アロハ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aloha-Otter als Begleiter herbei.<br>Hobbys: (1) Am Sandstrand bummeln, (2) die Sonne auf den Pelz brennen lassen, (3) Müßiggang.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte loutre aloha, une version méridionale de la loutre choute.
#. column 1: Legend tells of a right mad otter who, dissatisfied with the fare of his home waters, bought a ship and made south for more bountiful seas. There, he ate like a king...until his boat sank in a storm, leaving the slippery pup alone on stranger tides.
#. column 2: He seemed...odd.<br>Well, odder than usual.<br>   - Cocobezi
#. column 3: Surf's Up
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:329:0:0"
msgid "Summon your abroader otter minion. Hobbies include playing and having fun on an island in the sun."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — южную выдру. Любит играть и веселиться на солнечном острове."

#. ja: 南洋風の衣装を身にまとったウソウソ。出身は東方らしいが、すっかり南洋文化に染まりきっており、身も心もアロハな雰囲気をまとっている。釣り道楽でもあるようだが、ある日、釣り船が転覆し漂流していたらしい
#. de: Ein kleiner Otter in Südsee-Outfit und mit Angel auf der Schulter. Gute Laune und Meeresrauschen inbegriffen. Sein größter Traum ist es, auf einem kleinen Fischerboot in der ruhigen See zu treiben und die Seele baumeln zu lassen.
#. fr: Cette loutre est habillée façon méridionale. Elle vient à l'origine d'Orient, mais semble s'être totalement acclimatée aux us et coutumes des îles du sud. Elle semble apprécier la pêche, mais un beau jour, son bateau a chaviré et fait naufrage, semble-t-il.
#. column 0: Summon your abroader otter minion. Hobbies include playing and having fun on an island in the sun.
#. column 2: He seemed...odd.<br>Well, odder than usual.<br>   - Cocobezi
#. column 3: Surf's Up
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:329:0:1"
msgid "Legend tells of a right mad otter who, dissatisfied with the fare of his home waters, bought a ship and made south for more bountiful seas. There, he ate like a king...until his boat sank in a storm, leaving the slippery pup alone on stranger tides."
msgstr "Сказывают, жила-была одна чокнутая выдра, которой надоела скудная добыча в родных водах. Купила она корабль и отправилась на юг, где моря щедрее. Там она ела как королева... пока шторм не потопил корабль и не оставил бедняжку одну в незнакомых водах."

#. ja: アロハ！
#. de: Aloha!
#. fr: Aloha<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your abroader otter minion. Hobbies include playing and having fun on an island in the sun.
#. column 1: Legend tells of a right mad otter who, dissatisfied with the fare of his home waters, bought a ship and made south for more bountiful seas. There, he ate like a king...until his boat sank in a storm, leaving the slippery pup alone on stranger tides.
#. column 3: Surf's Up
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:329:0:2"
msgid "He seemed...odd.<br>Well, odder than usual.<br>   - Cocobezi"
msgstr "Странный он был...<br>Ну, ещё страннее обычного.<br>   — Кокобези"

#. ja: アロハ！
#. de: Aloha!
#. fr: Aloha<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your abroader otter minion. Hobbies include playing and having fun on an island in the sun.
#. column 1: Legend tells of a right mad otter who, dissatisfied with the fare of his home waters, bought a ship and made south for more bountiful seas. There, he ate like a king...until his boat sank in a storm, leaving the slippery pup alone on stranger tides.
#. column 2: He seemed...odd.<br>Well, odder than usual.<br>   - Cocobezi
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:329:0:3"
msgid "Surf's Up"
msgstr "Волна накрывает"

#. ja: ゲート内にいるミニオンのHP回復量を2倍にする。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>20秒
#. de: Verdoppelt die LP-Regeneration der Trabanten innerhalb eines Tors.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 Sekunden
#. fr: Double le montant de PV récupérés par les mascottes qui se trouvent à l'intérieur des portails.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. column 0: Summon your abroader otter minion. Hobbies include playing and having fun on an island in the sun.
#. column 1: Legend tells of a right mad otter who, dissatisfied with the fare of his home waters, bought a ship and made south for more bountiful seas. There, he ate like a king...until his boat sank in a storm, leaving the slippery pup alone on stranger tides.
