#. ja: ミニオン「ヘッジホッグ」を呼び出す。<br>愛らしいハリネズミ。ジレンマは抱えていない
#. de: Du rufst deinen Igel als Begleiter herbei.<br>Nur liebevollste Fürsorge kann dieses possierliche Wesen vor allerlei Ungemach bewahren!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte hérisson mignon, un adorable mammifère qui n'est victime d'aucun complexe à l'heure actuelle.
#. column 1: For centuries, hedgehogs have been considered a delicacy in the Far East, their succulent flesh supped upon by prince and pauper alike. An influx of Western traders more interested in keeping the pups as pets, however, has all but put an end to this grisly tradition.
#. column 2: I need not explain what<br>a needle is, I trust?<br>   - Redolent Rose
#. column 3: Acupuncture
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:330:0:0"
msgid "Summon your hedgehoglet minion. Only your selfless love and affection can keep him blissfully dilemma-free."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — ёжика. Только твоя бескорыстная любовь и забота избавят его от вечных терзаний."

#. ja: 小さなハリネズミ。かつて近東地域では食用として捕獲されていたが、近年では、その愛らしさから愛玩動物としての地位を確立したらしい。悩みのタネは、ヤマアラシと間違えられること。特にジレンマは抱えていない
#. de: Kleiner stacheliger Nager mit Lizenz zum Vergöttern. Wurde einst als Delikatesse gejagt und verspeist, doch in letzter Zeit weitaus beliebter als Haustier denn als Hauptgericht. Wird oft mit Stachelschweinen verwechselt.
#. fr: Cet insectivore était jadis élevé pour l'ali<shy>men<shy>ta<shy>tion au Proche-Orient, mais il s'est récemment élevé au rang d'animal familier grâce à son apparence adorable. Il n'a aucun complexe, si ce n'est qu'on le confonde fréquemment avec le porc-épic...
#. column 0: Summon your hedgehoglet minion. Only your selfless love and affection can keep him blissfully dilemma-free.
#. column 2: I need not explain what<br>a needle is, I trust?<br>   - Redolent Rose
#. column 3: Acupuncture
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:330:0:1"
msgid "For centuries, hedgehogs have been considered a delicacy in the Far East, their succulent flesh supped upon by prince and pauper alike. An influx of Western traders more interested in keeping the pups as pets, however, has all but put an end to this grisly tradition."
msgstr "На Дальнем Востоке ежей веками считали деликатесом. Их сочное мясо подавали и князьям, и простолюдинам. Но когда с Запада хлынули торговцы, которым куда больше хотелось завести себе такого зверька, кровавая традиция почти сошла на нет."

#. ja: ツンツン！
#. de: Hassu Nüsse?
#. fr: Tchui tchui<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your hedgehoglet minion. Only your selfless love and affection can keep him blissfully dilemma-free.
#. column 1: For centuries, hedgehogs have been considered a delicacy in the Far East, their succulent flesh supped upon by prince and pauper alike. An influx of Western traders more interested in keeping the pups as pets, however, has all but put an end to this grisly tradition.
#. column 3: Acupuncture
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:330:0:2"
msgid "I need not explain what<br>a needle is, I trust?<br>   - Redolent Rose"
msgstr "Не стану объяснять,<br>что такое игла. Надеюсь?<br>   — Благоуханная Роза"

#. ja: ハリ治療
#. de: Akupunktur
#. fr: Acupuncture
#. column 0: Summon your hedgehoglet minion. Only your selfless love and affection can keep him blissfully dilemma-free.
#. column 1: For centuries, hedgehogs have been considered a delicacy in the Far East, their succulent flesh supped upon by prince and pauper alike. An influx of Western traders more interested in keeping the pups as pets, however, has all but put an end to this grisly tradition.
#. column 2: I need not explain what<br>a needle is, I trust?<br>   - Redolent Rose
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:330:0:3"
msgid "Acupuncture"
msgstr "Иглоукалывание"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方にかかっている、弱体効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle negativen Effekte von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe toutes les altérations d'état des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your hedgehoglet minion. Only your selfless love and affection can keep him blissfully dilemma-free.
#. column 1: For centuries, hedgehogs have been considered a delicacy in the Far East, their succulent flesh supped upon by prince and pauper alike. An influx of Western traders more interested in keeping the pups as pets, however, has all but put an end to this grisly tradition.
#. column 2: I need not explain what<br>a needle is, I trust?<br>   - Redolent Rose
#. column 3: Acupuncture
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:330:0:4"
msgid "Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все отрицательные эффекты со всех союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「ファースト・ヤ・シュトラ」を呼び出す。<br>ヤ・シュトラを模した魔法人形。逃げる？　そんな必要ないわ
#. de: Du rufst deine Splitter<shy>welt-Y'shtola als Begleiterin herbei.<br>Die magische Puppe blickt entschlossen zu dir auf. In der Tat<nbsp>- es gibt keinen Grund davonzulaufen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Y'shtola miniature (premier reflet). À l'instar de son modèle, ce pantin n'a pas l'intention de fuir ses problèmes.
#. column 1: Lovingly crafted by the Night's Blessed, this tiny mechanical Y'shtola─“Master Matoya,” to some─wears the black garb that marks her a member of their community, and bears a deadwood rod symbolizing her commitment to driving back the Light.
#. column 2: Did you really think I would<br>go gently into that dark night<br>with so much left undone?<br>   - Y'shtola
#. column 3: Matoya's Mystique
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:331:0:0"
msgid "Summon your brave new Y'shtola minion. Not wont to run from her troubles─and couldn't get very far, anyway."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — отважную Я'штолу. От неприятностей она не бегает — да и далеко бы не убежала."

#. ja: ヤ・シュトラを模した魔法人形。その黒き衣は、闇を信仰する「夜の民」の支えとなることを決意した証、その枯木の杖は、破壊魔法を用いて罪喰いに抗おうとした覚悟の証。かくして彼女は、魔女マトーヤとなったのである
#. de: Sonst meist in weiß gekleidet hüllt sich Y'shtola auf der Splitter<shy>welt in die edlen Gewänder der Untertanen der Nacht. Mit ihrem Stab fest in der Hand stellt sich die „Hexe Matoya“ entschlossen gegen Sünden<shy>ver<shy>tilger und Störenfriede.
#. fr: Ce pantin à l'effigie de Y'shtola possède deux accessoires notables<nbsp>: la robe noire, symbole du soutien de l'Héritière au peuple de la Nuit, et le bâton, avec lequel elle entend combattre les purgateurs. Il ne reste plus qu'à l'appeler “Matoya miniature”...
#. column 0: Summon your brave new Y'shtola minion. Not wont to run from her troubles─and couldn't get very far, anyway.
#. column 2: Did you really think I would<br>go gently into that dark night<br>with so much left undone?<br>   - Y'shtola
#. column 3: Matoya's Mystique
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:331:0:1"
msgid "Lovingly crafted by the Night's Blessed, this tiny mechanical Y'shtola─“Master Matoya,” to some─wears the black garb that marks her a member of their community, and bears a deadwood rod symbolizing her commitment to driving back the Light."
msgstr "Эту крошечную механическую Я'штолу с любовью создали Ночные благословенные. На ней чёрные одежды, знак принадлежности к их общине, и посох из сухого дерева — символ решимости дать отпор Свету. Некоторые зовут её «мастер Матоя»."

#. ja: コノ地ハ、私ガ制スル！
#. de: Es ist Zeit, in die Offensive zu gehen.
#. fr: Je continuerai de tenir bon<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your brave new Y'shtola minion. Not wont to run from her troubles─and couldn't get very far, anyway.
#. column 1: Lovingly crafted by the Night's Blessed, this tiny mechanical Y'shtola─“Master Matoya,” to some─wears the black garb that marks her a member of their community, and bears a deadwood rod symbolizing her commitment to driving back the Light.
#. column 3: Matoya's Mystique
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:331:0:2"
msgid "Did you really think I would<br>go gently into that dark night<br>with so much left undone?<br>   - Y'shtola"
msgstr "Неужели ты думал, что я<br>тихо уйду в ту тёмную ночь,<br>когда столько дел не закончено?<br>   — Я'штола"

#. ja: 魔女マトーヤ
#. de: Hexe Matoya
#. fr: Fureur de Matoya
#. column 0: Summon your brave new Y'shtola minion. Not wont to run from her troubles─and couldn't get very far, anyway.
#. column 1: Lovingly crafted by the Night's Blessed, this tiny mechanical Y'shtola─“Master Matoya,” to some─wears the black garb that marks her a member of their community, and bears a deadwood rod symbolizing her commitment to driving back the Light.
#. column 2: Did you really think I would<br>go gently into that dark night<br>with so much left undone?<br>   - Y'shtola
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:331:0:3"
msgid "Matoya's Mystique"
msgstr "Тайна Матои"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your brave new Y'shtola minion. Not wont to run from her troubles─and couldn't get very far, anyway.
#. column 1: Lovingly crafted by the Night's Blessed, this tiny mechanical Y'shtola─“Master Matoya,” to some─wears the black garb that marks her a member of their community, and bears a deadwood rod symbolizing her commitment to driving back the Light.
#. column 2: Did you really think I would<br>go gently into that dark night<br>with so much left undone?<br>   - Y'shtola
#. column 3: Matoya's Mystique
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:331:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 90."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・リーン」を呼び出す。<br>リーンを模した魔法人形。ありがとう、とても嬉しい……！
#. de: Du rufst deine Ryne-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. <br>Wie ihr Original gefällt es ihr sehr, bei ihrem neuen Namen gerufen zu werden.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Ryne miniature. Comme l'originale, elle semble apprécier son nouveau nom.
#. column 1: With hair of spun gold and eyes of clearest sapphire, this young maiden was an incarnation of Minfilia, by whose name she was known. In the course of her journey, however, she chose to take her destiny into her own hands, and with it came a new look, name, and automaton likeness.
#. column 2: What about... Ryne?<br>   - Thancred
#. column 3: Minfilia's Power
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:332:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Ryne minion. Not merely a palette swap."
msgstr "Призвать заводного миньона Райн. Не просто перекрасили."

#. ja: リーンを模した魔法人形。その星の海を写したかのような青すぎる瞳は、彼女が「ミンフィリア」の転生体として生まれたことを意味している。だが、長き旅と戦いの果てに、彼女は彼女としての道を定め、「リーン」の名を得るのだった
#. de: In diesen Augen, in denen sich das tiefe Blau des Ozeans widerzuspiegeln scheint, funkelt nicht nur der Geist Minfilias, sondern auch der Wille einer Frau, die nach langer Reise ihre Bestimmung und einen neuen Namen fand.
#. fr: Ce pantin a été fabriqué après que Ryne a pris les rênes de sa destinée. Ce n'est donc pas le regard turquoise des réincarnations de Minfilia qui emplit ses yeux, mais l'éclat d'une détermination acquise au cours de son voyage initiatique.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ryne minion. Not merely a palette swap.
#. column 2: What about... Ryne?<br>   - Thancred
#. column 3: Minfilia's Power
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:332:0:1"
msgid "With hair of spun gold and eyes of clearest sapphire, this young maiden was an incarnation of Minfilia, by whose name she was known. In the course of her journey, however, she chose to take her destiny into her own hands, and with it came a new look, name, and automaton likeness."
msgstr "Златокудрая девушка с ясными сапфировыми глазами была воплощением Минфилии и носила её имя. Но в долгом пути она решила сама вершить свою судьбу — и обрела новый облик, имя и заводную куклу в своё подобие."

#. ja: トテモ嬉シイ…！
#. de: Ja. Ich heiße Ryne!
#. fr: Merci, Thancred<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ryne minion. Not merely a palette swap.
#. column 1: With hair of spun gold and eyes of clearest sapphire, this young maiden was an incarnation of Minfilia, by whose name she was known. In the course of her journey, however, she chose to take her destiny into her own hands, and with it came a new look, name, and automaton likeness.
#. column 3: Minfilia's Power
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:332:0:2"
msgid "What about... Ryne?<br>   - Thancred"
msgstr "Может... Райн?<br>   — Танкред"

#. ja: ミンフィリアの力
#. de: Minfilias Segen
#. fr: Pouvoir de Minfilia
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ryne minion. Not merely a palette swap.
#. column 1: With hair of spun gold and eyes of clearest sapphire, this young maiden was an incarnation of Minfilia, by whose name she was known. In the course of her journey, however, she chose to take her destiny into her own hands, and with it came a new look, name, and automaton likeness.
#. column 2: What about... Ryne?<br>   - Thancred
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:332:0:3"
msgid "Minfilia's Power"
msgstr "Сила Минфилии"

#. ja: ゲート内にいるミニオンのHP回復量を2倍にする。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>20秒
#. de: Verdoppelt die LP-Regeneration der Trabanten innerhalb eines Tors.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 Sekunden
#. fr: Double le montant de PV récupérés par les mascottes qui se trouvent à l'intérieur des portails.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
