#. ja: ミニオン「黒柴」を呼び出す。<br>柴犬の幼犬。黒毛の個体は、黒柴の俗称で呼ばれる
#. de: Du rufst deinen schwarzen Shiba-Welpen als Begleiter herbei.<br>Dieser junge, verspielte Shiba-inu hat ein schwarzes Fell.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte kuro shiba, qui a le poil aussi noir que l'ébène.
#. column 1: Despite their endearing appearance, black hayate are oft employed as guard and sheep dogs, as they react to threats with shocking ferocity. It was for this reason that the breed was named after a piece of lethal weaponry from its eastern homeland, now lost to the Flood.
#. column 2: They expected hounds<br>on their trail and I sssent<br>them a dragon!<br>   - Eshana
#. column 3: Hound Oath
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:333:0:0"
msgid "Summon your black hayate minion. Gaze upon the visage of a ruthless killer."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — чёрного хаята. Полюбуйся на морду безжалостного убийцы."

#. ja: 黒毛が特徴的な柴犬の幼犬。柴犬は愛らしい外見をしているが、数ある犬の中でも古い血統とされ、極めて狼に近い犬種である。古くから狩猟や番犬として利用されており、ホルミンスターでも牧羊犬として用いられていた
#. de: Obwohl Shibas unglaublich niedlich aussehen, handelt es sich um eine sehr alte Hunderasse, die dem Wolf ähnlicher ist, als es so mancher Hunde-<br>liebhaber wahrhaben möchte. Sie werden in Holminster als Hütehunde verwendet.
#. fr: Ce mame shiba a le poil noir, et est ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment mignon. Attention à ne pas se méprendre, cependant, car ce spécimen est en réalité très proche du loup, et on l'utilise depuis belle lurette pour la chasse ou en tant que chien de garde.
#. column 0: Summon your black hayate minion. Gaze upon the visage of a ruthless killer.
#. column 2: They expected hounds<br>on their trail and I sssent<br>them a dragon!<br>   - Eshana
#. column 3: Hound Oath
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:333:0:1"
msgid "Despite their endearing appearance, black hayate are oft employed as guard and sheep dogs, as they react to threats with shocking ferocity. It was for this reason that the breed was named after a piece of lethal weaponry from its eastern homeland, now lost to the Flood."
msgstr "Несмотря на милую внешность, чёрных хаята часто держат в качестве сторожевых и пастушьих собак. При угрозе они становятся на удивление свирепыми. Породу назвали в честь смертоносного оружия из их восточной родины, ныне затопленной."

#. ja: ワンワン！
#. de: Rwuff!
#. fr: Ouaf<nbsp>! Ouaf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your black hayate minion. Gaze upon the visage of a ruthless killer.
#. column 1: Despite their endearing appearance, black hayate are oft employed as guard and sheep dogs, as they react to threats with shocking ferocity. It was for this reason that the breed was named after a piece of lethal weaponry from its eastern homeland, now lost to the Flood.
#. column 3: Hound Oath
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:333:0:2"
msgid "They expected hounds<br>on their trail and I sssent<br>them a dragon!<br>   - Eshana"
msgstr "Они ждали, что по следу<br>пойдут гончие, а я послала<br>им дракона!<br>   — Эшана"

#. ja: 忠義の犬
#. de: Treuer Hund
#. fr: Dévotion canine
#. column 0: Summon your black hayate minion. Gaze upon the visage of a ruthless killer.
#. column 1: Despite their endearing appearance, black hayate are oft employed as guard and sheep dogs, as they react to threats with shocking ferocity. It was for this reason that the breed was named after a piece of lethal weaponry from its eastern homeland, now lost to the Flood.
#. column 2: They expected hounds<br>on their trail and I sssent<br>them a dragon!<br>   - Eshana
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:333:0:3"
msgid "Hound Oath"
msgstr "Верный пёс"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンのATKを40上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>15秒
#. de: Erhöht die ATT der ausführenden Trabanten um 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 40 l'attaque des mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
