#. ja: ミニオン「カメレオン」を呼び出す。<br>カメレオンの成体。周囲に溶け込むのが得意
#. de: Du rufst dein Zwergchamäleon als Begleiter herbei.<br>Obwohl es aufgrund seiner Größe leicht zu übersehen ist, verschmilzt es gern mit seiner Umgebung.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte caméléon, dont la spécialité est de se fondre dans le décor.
#. column 1: By channeling aether into its crystal-coated scales, the chameleon can alter its appearance to blend into the surrounding environment in a mechanism not unlike that of glamour prisms. For its penchant for adopting new looks, it has earned a reputation as the “glamourous scalekin.”
#. column 2: Oh, I suggest nothing<br>so glamorous.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva
#. column 3: Invisible
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 50%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:334:0:0"
msgid "Summon your chameleon minion and marvel as it melts into your surrounds."
msgstr "Призвать миньона-хамелеона и смотреть, как он растворяется в окружении."

#. ja: カメレオンの立派な成体。鱗の表面に微小な結晶が付着しており、そこに魔力を流すことで、周囲の景色に溶け込むことができる。原理的にはミラージュプリズムのそれに近く、一部では甲鱗綱随一の洒落者とも呼ばれるらしい
#. de: Chamäleons sind unglaubliche Geschöpfe. Aus ihren Schuppen befinden sich klitzekleine Kristalle, durch die sie Äther leiten, um optisch vollkommen mit ihrer Umgebung zu verschmelzen<nbsp>- Projektionsprismen funktionien auf ganz ähnliche Art und Weise.
#. fr: Un caméléon adulte de belle taille, dont les écailles sont recouvertes de cristaux microscopiques. Il utilise la magie contenue dans ces cristaux pour se camoufler n'importe où. Certains l'appellent “le reptile endimanché”.
#. column 0: Summon your chameleon minion and marvel as it melts into your surrounds.
#. column 2: Oh, I suggest nothing<br>so glamorous.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva
#. column 3: Invisible
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 50%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:334:0:1"
msgid "By channeling aether into its crystal-coated scales, the chameleon can alter its appearance to blend into the surrounding environment in a mechanism not unlike that of glamour prisms. For its penchant for adopting new looks, it has earned a reputation as the “glamourous scalekin.”"
msgstr "Направляя эфир в покрытые кристаллами чешуйки, хамелеон меняет окраску и сливается с окружением. Механизм похож на действие призм иллюзии. За любовь к смене облика его прозвали «модником среди чешуйчатых»."

#. ja: スッ……
#. de: Niemand kann sich einfach unsichtbar machen.<br><i>Alphinaud</i>
#. fr: Pffft...
#. column 0: Summon your chameleon minion and marvel as it melts into your surrounds.
#. column 1: By channeling aether into its crystal-coated scales, the chameleon can alter its appearance to blend into the surrounding environment in a mechanism not unlike that of glamour prisms. For its penchant for adopting new looks, it has earned a reputation as the “glamourous scalekin.”
#. column 3: Invisible
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 50%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:334:0:2"
msgid "Oh, I suggest nothing<br>so glamorous.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva"
msgstr "О, ничего столь<br>эффектного я не предлагаю.<br>   — Неро тол Скаевах"

#. ja: いんびじぶる
#. de: Unsichtbarkeit
#. fr: Disparition
#. column 0: Summon your chameleon minion and marvel as it melts into your surrounds.
#. column 1: By channeling aether into its crystal-coated scales, the chameleon can alter its appearance to blend into the surrounding environment in a mechanism not unlike that of glamour prisms. For its penchant for adopting new looks, it has earned a reputation as the “glamourous scalekin.”
