msgid "Invisible"
msgstr "Невидимость"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のゲートに50%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Tor 50<nbsp>% Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls es schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 50% de sa solidité au portail ennemi le plus proche. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your chameleon minion and marvel as it melts into your surrounds.
#. column 1: By channeling aether into its crystal-coated scales, the chameleon can alter its appearance to blend into the surrounding environment in a mechanism not unlike that of glamour prisms. For its penchant for adopting new looks, it has earned a reputation as the “glamourous scalekin.”
#. column 2: Oh, I suggest nothing<br>so glamorous.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva
#. column 3: Invisible
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:334:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 50%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable."
msgstr "Снижает HP ближайших вражеских ворот на 50%. Не действует, если ворота уже разрушены."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・フーア」を呼び出す。<br>フーア族を模した魔法人形。トリック・オア・トリック！
#. de: Du rufst deine Fuath-Puppe als Begleiter herbei.<br>Mit schelmischem Schabernack muss gerechnet werden!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Fuath miniature. Attention à ses “Fuath et attrapes”<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Though this clockwork automaton─magically rendered waterproof for amphibious adventuring─possess no heart in which to harbor malice, the fact that it was created at the hands of <i>real</i> Fuath is cause enough to wonder what tricks it may be hiding up its tiny sleeve.
#. column 2: The first rule of dealing<br>with the Fuath...is do <i>not</i><br>deal with the Fuath.<br>   - Ardbert
#. column 3: Jolly Good Sport
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:335:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Fuath minion. Markedly less murderous than the real thing."
msgstr "Призвать заводного миньона Фуат. Он куда менее кровожаден, чем настоящие фуаты."

#. ja: フーア族を模した魔法人形。他の妖精と同様に幻惑の術を得意とし、ありとあらゆる対象にイタズラを仕掛ける。となると、彼らが作ったこの魔法人形にも、何らかの質の悪いイタズラが仕込まれているのではないかとの疑いが……
#. de: Die froschigen Fuath aus dem Feenreich sind wahre Meister der Illusionsmagie<nbsp>- nichts und niemand ist vor ihrem oft grausamen Spaß und Schabernack sicher. Dieser plüschige Vertreter ist allerdings harmlos. Froschehrenwort!
#. fr: Ce sont les Fuath eux-mêmes qui ont créé ce pantin à leur effigie. Étant donné leur goût immodéré pour les illusions et les farces en tout genre, cette version miniature pourrait bien renfermer quelque attrape-nigaud...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Fuath minion. Markedly less murderous than the real thing.
#. column 2: The first rule of dealing<br>with the Fuath...is do <i>not</i><br>deal with the Fuath.<br>   - Ardbert
#. column 3: Jolly Good Sport
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:335:0:1"
msgid "Though this clockwork automaton─magically rendered waterproof for amphibious adventuring─possess no heart in which to harbor malice, the fact that it was created at the hands of <i>real</i> Fuath is cause enough to wonder what tricks it may be hiding up its tiny sleeve."
msgstr "У этой заводной куклы нет сердца, способного таить злобу, да и для приключений в воде её магией сделали водонепроницаемой. Но ведь её создали <i>настоящие</i> фуаты — кто знает, какую проделку они спрятали в крошечном рукаве?"

#. ja: ウケケケケ！
#. de: Gnehehe!
#. fr: Kékéké... qu'est-ce qu'on s'amuse<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Fuath minion. Markedly less murderous than the real thing.
#. column 1: Though this clockwork automaton─magically rendered waterproof for amphibious adventuring─possess no heart in which to harbor malice, the fact that it was created at the hands of <i>real</i> Fuath is cause enough to wonder what tricks it may be hiding up its tiny sleeve.
