#. ja: ミニオン「アルマジロ・ボーラー」を呼び出す。<br>アルマジロの幼体。玉乗りは得意な方
#. de: Du rufst dein artistisches Gürteltier als Begleiter herbei.<br>Dieses junge Gürteltier kann ausgezeichnet auf einem Laufball balancieren.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte tatou-boule. Son activité préférée est de se tenir en équilibre sur un ballon.
#. column 1: Armadillos are seldom caught without their rocks, which they use to defend themselves from enemies. As a large rock bespeaks strength and status, one may occasionally see bravado-bound beasts that unwisely choose something beyond their ability to lift.
#. column 2: Who was that<br>armored devil!? <br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Ball Up
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:336:0:0"
msgid "Summon your armadillo bowler minion. Possessed of a superior sense of balance."
msgstr "Призвать миньона-броненосца-эквилибриста. Равновесие у него отменное."

#. ja: アルマジロの幼体。アルマジロには、持ち歩く護身用の岩が大きいほど力ある存在として一目置かれるという習性がある。そのため、稀に尻尾では持ち上げられないほど大きな岩を選ぶ、見栄っ張りな個体が現れるのだという
#. de: Selbst dieses Jungtier ist bereits von einem so festen Panzer geschützt, dass es sich nur zusammenrollen braucht, um jeder Gefahr zu trotzen. Dieses besondere Exemplar liebt seine steinerne Kugel über alles und wurde noch nie ohne sie gesehen.
#. fr: Les tatous mesurent leur force à la grosseur de la pierre qu'ils transportent. À cause de cette habitude, certains spécimens par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement orgueilleux s'acharnent parfois à essayer de soulever des pierres beaucoup trop énormes jusqu'à l'épuisement.
#. column 0: Summon your armadillo bowler minion. Possessed of a superior sense of balance.
#. column 2: Who was that<br>armored devil!? <br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Ball Up
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:336:0:1"
msgid "Armadillos are seldom caught without their rocks, which they use to defend themselves from enemies. As a large rock bespeaks strength and status, one may occasionally see bravado-bound beasts that unwisely choose something beyond their ability to lift."
msgstr "Броненосцы редко расстаются с камнями, которыми защищаются от врагов. Чем камень крупнее, тем он солиднее — и тем внушительнее его хозяин. Поэтому иногда попадаются хвастуны, выбирающие такую глыбу, что им её и не поднять."

#. ja: ゴロゴロ…
#. de: \<kuller> ... \<kuller> ...
#. fr: Bulubulubulu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your armadillo bowler minion. Possessed of a superior sense of balance.
#. column 1: Armadillos are seldom caught without their rocks, which they use to defend themselves from enemies. As a large rock bespeaks strength and status, one may occasionally see bravado-bound beasts that unwisely choose something beyond their ability to lift.
#. column 3: Ball Up
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
