#. ja: ミニオン「ロンカの水蛇？」を呼び出す。<br>ロンカの水蛇の化身とされる何か。何かって何だ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Kleine Schlange von Ronka als Begleiter herbei.<br>Handelt es sich bei diesem Wurm womöglich um eine Inkarnation der Großen Schlange von Ronka?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte serpent marin de Ronka<nbsp>?, que vous pensez être le Grand Serpent ronka. En réalité, personne ne sait ce qu'il est vraiment.
#. column 1: This creature, Quinfort insists, is none other than the all-seeing, all-powerful Great Serpent of Ronka. Though its wobbly girth may deceive the eye, that is, presumably, a mere mark of the serpent's mercy, for its true form would be too terrible for mortal minds to comprehend.
#. column 2: Screee!<br>   - The Great Serpent of Ronka
#. column 3: Lost Secret
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:337:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Great Serpent of Ronka minion. Tremble, child of man, for a creature of purest divinity wiggleth before thee."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — Великого Змея Ронка. Трепещи, смертный: перед тобой извивается само божество!"

#. ja: ロンカの水蛇の化身とされる何か。「夜の民」の導師見習い、キンフォートの夢に現れ、森に迫る危機を伝えたとされるが、正直なところ正体は不明である。原初世界の東方地域に伝わる「ツチノコ」の様にも見えるが……
#. de: Quinfort hat im Traum die Große Schlange von Ronka gesehen. Diese kleine Schlange, wenn es sich um eine Schlange handelt, ähnelt ihr angeblich. Sie weist allerdings auch eine große Ähnlichkeit mit den Nokos im Fernen Osten der Ursprungs<shy>welt auf.
#. fr: Peut-être le Grand Serpent ronka, peut-être pas. On dit qu'il serait apparu à Quinfort dans un rêve pour le prévenir du danger qui menaçait la forêt, mais tout le monde ignore sa réelle forme. Certains disent qu'il ressemblerait au Yo-kai Noko du monde originel...
#. column 0: Summon your Great Serpent of Ronka minion. Tremble, child of man, for a creature of purest divinity wiggleth before thee.
#. column 2: Screee!<br>   - The Great Serpent of Ronka
#. column 3: Lost Secret
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:337:0:1"
msgid "This creature, Quinfort insists, is none other than the all-seeing, all-powerful Great Serpent of Ronka. Though its wobbly girth may deceive the eye, that is, presumably, a mere mark of the serpent's mercy, for its true form would be too terrible for mortal minds to comprehend."
msgstr "Квинфорт уверяет, что это существо — не кто иной, как всевидящий и всемогущий Великий змей Ронки. Пусть его увесистое, покачивающееся тело и обманет глаз, но это, вероятно, лишь знак милосердия змея: истинный его облик смертному разуму не постичь."

#. ja: キィっキュィ～！！
#. de: Man kennt sie unter vielen Namen ...<br>Die Wasserschlange von Ronka,<br>die Beschützerin des finsteren Waldes,<br>die Zerstörerin ...<br><i>Quinfort</i>
#. fr: Kii kii<nbsp>! Kiiiiii<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon your Great Serpent of Ronka minion. Tremble, child of man, for a creature of purest divinity wiggleth before thee.
#. column 1: This creature, Quinfort insists, is none other than the all-seeing, all-powerful Great Serpent of Ronka. Though its wobbly girth may deceive the eye, that is, presumably, a mere mark of the serpent's mercy, for its true form would be too terrible for mortal minds to comprehend.
#. column 3: Lost Secret
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:337:0:2"
msgid "Screee!<br>   - The Great Serpent of Ronka"
msgstr "Кии-и!<br>   — Великий Змей Ронка"

#. ja: ロンカの秘法
#. de: Geheime Technik von Ronka
#. fr: Secret ronka
#. column 0: Summon your Great Serpent of Ronka minion. Tremble, child of man, for a creature of purest divinity wiggleth before thee.
#. column 1: This creature, Quinfort insists, is none other than the all-seeing, all-powerful Great Serpent of Ronka. Though its wobbly girth may deceive the eye, that is, presumably, a mere mark of the serpent's mercy, for its true form would be too terrible for mortal minds to comprehend.
#. column 2: Screee!<br>   - The Great Serpent of Ronka
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:337:0:3"
msgid "Lost Secret"
msgstr "Тайное искусство Ронка"

