#. ja: ミニオン「ミニエデン」を呼び出す。<br>エデンを模した疑似再現体。本体によって生成された
#. de: Du rufst dein Mini-Eden als Begleiter herbei.<br>Es ist frei von jeglicher Sünde.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-Éden, une reproduction miniature créée par Éden lui-même.
#. column 1: In a demonstration of its godlike power that may be generously termed “unfathomable,” Eden created this tiny being in its image. Fortunately, the amount of aether Eden Minor can manipulate is so minuscule that, despite its best efforts, it poses little danger to the world at large.
#. column 2: For what was once<br>shattered may be<br>forged anew.<br>   - Ryne
#. column 3: Eternal Breath
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 380 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:341:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Eden Minor minion. Free of sin, though not for lack of trying."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — младшего Эдема. Безгрешен, но только потому, что не старался."

#. ja: 世界初の罪喰いである「エデン」が自動生成した疑似再現体。時折、頭上に魔法陣を展開させて、破壊的な光線を放射しようとするがエーテル保有量が少ないため、必ず失敗に終わる。おそらく無害であろうとは、ウリエンジェの弁
#. de: Um seine gottgleichen Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten zu demonstrieren, erschuf Eden dieses winzig kleine Abbild seiner Selbst. Zum Glück vermag das Mini-Eden nur verschwindend geringe Mengen an Äther zu manipulieren und stellt keine Gefahr für die Welt dar.
#. fr: Cette réplique du purgateur originel concentre ré<shy>gu<shy>liè<shy>re<shy>ment son énergie en un cercle au-dessus d'elle. Fort heureusement, son éther limité ne lui permet pas de lancer de rayons de Lumière dévastateur. Selon Urianger, tout du moins...
#. column 0: Summon your Eden Minor minion. Free of sin, though not for lack of trying.
#. column 2: For what was once<br>shattered may be<br>forged anew.<br>   - Ryne
#. column 3: Eternal Breath
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 380 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:341:0:1"
msgid "In a demonstration of its godlike power that may be generously termed “unfathomable,” Eden created this tiny being in its image. Fortunately, the amount of aether Eden Minor can manipulate is so minuscule that, despite its best efforts, it poses little danger to the world at large."
msgstr "Создав это крошечное существо по своему образу и подобию, Эдем решил продемонстрировать свою божественную мощь. Назвать её непостижимой — ещё мягко сказано. К счастью, младший Эдем управляет ничтожным количеством эфира и, несмотря на все усилия, вряд ли представляет серьёзную угрозу для мира."

#. ja: ズズズズズ…
#. de: Damit das, was einst zerfallen war,<br>neu erschaffen werden kann.<br><i>Ryne</i>
#. fr: BZZZZZZ...
#. column 0: Summon your Eden Minor minion. Free of sin, though not for lack of trying.
#. column 1: In a demonstration of its godlike power that may be generously termed “unfathomable,” Eden created this tiny being in its image. Fortunately, the amount of aether Eden Minor can manipulate is so minuscule that, despite its best efforts, it poses little danger to the world at large.
#. column 3: Eternal Breath
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 380 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:341:0:2"
msgid "For what was once<br>shattered may be<br>forged anew.<br>   - Ryne"
msgstr "То, что однажды<br>было разрушено, можно<br>создать заново.<br>   — Райн"

#. ja: えたーなるぶれす
#. de: Ewiger Atem
#. fr: Souffle éternel
#. column 0: Summon your Eden Minor minion. Free of sin, though not for lack of trying.
#. column 1: In a demonstration of its godlike power that may be generously termed “unfathomable,” Eden created this tiny being in its image. Fortunately, the amount of aether Eden Minor can manipulate is so minuscule that, despite its best efforts, it poses little danger to the world at large.
#. column 2: For what was once<br>shattered may be<br>forged anew.<br>   - Ryne
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 380 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:341:0:3"
msgid "Eternal Breath"
msgstr "Вечное дыхание"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK380のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 380 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 380 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Eden Minor minion. Free of sin, though not for lack of trying.
#. column 1: In a demonstration of its godlike power that may be generously termed “unfathomable,” Eden created this tiny being in its image. Fortunately, the amount of aether Eden Minor can manipulate is so minuscule that, despite its best efforts, it poses little danger to the world at large.
#. column 2: For what was once<br>shattered may be<br>forged anew.<br>   - Ryne
#. column 3: Eternal Breath
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:341:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 380 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 380."

#. ja: ミニオン「ジャイアントビーバー」を呼び出す。<br>謎の存在。謎のままにしておいた方がいいこともあるのだ
#. de: Du rufst deinen Riesenbiber als Begleiter herbei.<br>Ein rätselhaftes Wesen. Manche Rätsel sollte man besser ungelöst lassen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte castor géant, un être mystérieux. Mieux vaut ne pas trop essayer de comprendre ce qu'il est en réalité...
#. column 1: A mysterious being that appeared at Phisor Lran. Whatever may be the truth of its identity, some mysteries in the world are better left unsolved. Let it be enough that everyone has their heart's desire...
#. column 2: Something tells me<br>that's one more mystery<br>better left unsolved.<br>   - Ellie
#. column 3: Squeal
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:342:0:0"
msgid "Summon your giant beaver minion, a mystery better left unsolved."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — гигантского бобра. Некоторые загадки лучше не разгадывать."

#. ja: フィソー・ラーンに現れる謎の存在。皆が、望む物を手に入れることができたのであれば、それでいいじゃないか。世の中には、謎のままにしておいた方がいいこともあるのだ、という人生に役立つ教訓を教えてくれる
#. de: Ein ebenso legendäres wie rätselhaftes Wesen aus Phisor Lran. Von ihm lernt man, dass es auch Rätsel gibt, die man besser nicht auflöst.
#. fr: Animal étrange qu'on ne trouve qu'à Phisor Lran. La leçon à tirer de son existence est qu'on ne doit pas toujours chercher à aller au fond des choses, sous peine d'avoir à faire face à de terribles con<shy>sé<shy>quen<shy>ces. Néanmoins, si tout le monde a obtenu ce qu'il désirait, c'est peut-être aussi bien.
#. column 0: Summon your giant beaver minion, a mystery better left unsolved.
#. column 2: Something tells me<br>that's one more mystery<br>better left unsolved.<br>   - Ellie
#. column 3: Squeal
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:342:0:1"
msgid "A mysterious being that appeared at Phisor Lran. Whatever may be the truth of its identity, some mysteries in the world are better left unsolved. Let it be enough that everyone has their heart's desire..."
msgstr "Таинственное существо, появившееся в Фисор-Лране. Какова бы ни была правда о его происхождении, некоторые загадки лучше оставить без ответа. Хватит и того, что каждый получил желаемое..."

#. ja: ガウー！　ウウー！
#. de: ♪ Milch, das war sein letztes Wort<nbsp>...<nbsp>♪
#. fr: Graou<nbsp>! Graou<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your giant beaver minion, a mystery better left unsolved.
#. column 1: A mysterious being that appeared at Phisor Lran. Whatever may be the truth of its identity, some mysteries in the world are better left unsolved. Let it be enough that everyone has their heart's desire...
#. column 3: Squeal
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:342:0:2"
msgid "Something tells me<br>that's one more mystery<br>better left unsolved.<br>   - Ellie"
msgstr "Что-то мне подсказывает,<br>эту загадку тоже лучше<br>оставить без ответа.<br>   — Элли"

#. ja: ガウガウガウ！
#. de: Biberburg
#. fr: Graougraougraou<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your giant beaver minion, a mystery better left unsolved.
#. column 1: A mysterious being that appeared at Phisor Lran. Whatever may be the truth of its identity, some mysteries in the world are better left unsolved. Let it be enough that everyone has their heart's desire...
#. column 2: Something tells me<br>that's one more mystery<br>better left unsolved.<br>   - Ellie
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:342:0:3"
msgid "Squeal"
msgstr "Писк"

#. ja: シールドが破壊されていた場合、復活させる。
#. de: Stellt einen zerstörten Schild wieder her.
#. fr: Rétablit votre bouclier s'il a été détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your giant beaver minion, a mystery better left unsolved.
#. column 1: A mysterious being that appeared at Phisor Lran. Whatever may be the truth of its identity, some mysteries in the world are better left unsolved. Let it be enough that everyone has their heart's desire...
#. column 2: Something tells me<br>that's one more mystery<br>better left unsolved.<br>   - Ellie
#. column 3: Squeal
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:342:0:4"
msgid "Instantly restores damaged ally Shield. "
msgstr "Мгновенно восстанавливает повреждённый союзный щит."

#. ja: ミニオン「からくり朱雀」を呼び出す。<br>朱雀を模したからくり人形。正気にもどってください！
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-Suzaku als Begleiter herbei.<br>Komm bitte wieder zur Besinnung!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Suzaku mécanique, qui vous demande de recouvrer vos esprits, et vite<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Upon hearing the tale of his compatriot Soroban's adventures, a Kojin dollmaker was moved to honor the Four Lords, guardians of the Ruby Sea. This recreation of Suzaku is one of the fruits of his efforts, masterfully capturing the essence of the legendary auspice.
#. column 2: If anyone can make Suzaku<br>see reason, it's you. Good luck!<br>   - Senri
#. column 3: Twinkling Interlude
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 110 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:343:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Suzaku minion, complete with her flute and her senses."
msgstr "Призвать заводную Судзаку. Флейта при ней, и с разумом всё в порядке."

#. ja: 朱雀を模したからくり人形。同胞ソロバンが体験した奇譚を伝え聞いた碧甲羅の人形師が、紅玉海を護った四聖獣たちを称えるために作った逸品。愛に生きた瑞獣であり、優れた笛の奏者でもあった朱雀を鮮やかに再現している
#. de: Diese Marionette ist Tierheiligen und Flötenspielerin Suzaku nachempfunden. Ein Blaupanzer-Puppenmacher wurde von Sorobans ungewöhnlicher Geschichte dazu inspiriert, sie anzufertigen.
#. fr: Cette poupée a été façonnée par un artisan de la tribu des Verts à qui quelqu'un avait raconté l'étrange aventure de Soroban. Elle a pour rôle de rendre hommage aux quatre bêtes sacrées qui protègent la Mer de Rubis, en re<shy>pré<shy>sen<shy>tant Suzaku.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Suzaku minion, complete with her flute and her senses.
#. column 2: If anyone can make Suzaku<br>see reason, it's you. Good luck!<br>   - Senri
#. column 3: Twinkling Interlude
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 110 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:343:0:1"
msgid "Upon hearing the tale of his compatriot Soroban's adventures, a Kojin dollmaker was moved to honor the Four Lords, guardians of the Ruby Sea. This recreation of Suzaku is one of the fruits of his efforts, masterfully capturing the essence of the legendary auspice."
msgstr "Услышав о приключениях своего соплеменника Соробана, мастер-кукольник из кудзин решил почтить Четырёх владык, хранителей Рубинового моря. Так появилась эта искусная копия Судзаку, во всей красе передающая образ легендарного божества."

#. ja: 正気ニモドッテクダサイ！
#. de: Von klein auf war Suzakus Federkleid rot wie Feuer.<br><i>Senri</i>
#. fr: Recouvre tes esprits, je t'en prie<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Suzaku minion, complete with her flute and her senses.
#. column 1: Upon hearing the tale of his compatriot Soroban's adventures, a Kojin dollmaker was moved to honor the Four Lords, guardians of the Ruby Sea. This recreation of Suzaku is one of the fruits of his efforts, masterfully capturing the essence of the legendary auspice.
#. column 3: Twinkling Interlude
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 110 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:343:0:2"
msgid "If anyone can make Suzaku<br>see reason, it's you. Good luck!<br>   - Senri"
msgstr "Кто угодно сумеет вразумить Судзаку —<br>но ты справишься лучше всех. Удачи!<br>   — Сэнри"

#. ja: 微熱の調べ
#. de: Fieberhaftes Verhör
#. fr: Prise de température
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Suzaku minion, complete with her flute and her senses.
#. column 1: Upon hearing the tale of his compatriot Soroban's adventures, a Kojin dollmaker was moved to honor the Four Lords, guardians of the Ruby Sea. This recreation of Suzaku is one of the fruits of his efforts, masterfully capturing the essence of the legendary auspice.
#. column 2: If anyone can make Suzaku<br>see reason, it's you. Good luck!<br>   - Senri
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 110 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:343:0:3"
msgid "Twinkling Interlude"
msgstr "Мелодия лёгкого жара"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK110のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 110 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 110 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Suzaku minion, complete with her flute and her senses.
#. column 1: Upon hearing the tale of his compatriot Soroban's adventures, a Kojin dollmaker was moved to honor the Four Lords, guardians of the Ruby Sea. This recreation of Suzaku is one of the fruits of his efforts, masterfully capturing the essence of the legendary auspice.
#. column 2: If anyone can make Suzaku<br>see reason, it's you. Good luck!<br>   - Senri
#. column 3: Twinkling Interlude
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:343:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 110 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 110."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・オメガM」を呼び出す。<br>オメガMを模した魔法人形。確認…不可解な行動…
#. de: Du rufst deine männliche Omega-Puppe als Begleiter herbei.<br>Ihr Verhalten lässt sich nicht analysieren.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Oméga-M miniature. Vérification... Action incom<shy>pré<shy>hen<shy>si<shy>ble...
#. column 1: This automaton is the work of a goldsmith who desired to explore new definitions of beauty. Upon delivering a batch to the House of Splendors, the man is said to have declared, “To understand the one, one must understand the other. For their beauty lies in the whole.”
#. column 2: \<bleep><br>hELLo, WOrlD!?
#. column 3: Resonance M
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (40 if the ally is wind-up Omega-F).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:344:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Omega-M minion to observe your irrational behavior."
msgstr "Призвать заводную Омегу-М, чтобы понаблюдать за твоим нелогичным поведением."

#. ja: オメガMを模した魔法人形。とある彫金師が「新たなる美の形」として製作したもの。作品をロウェナ商会に卸した際、作者はこう語ったという。一方を理解するには、もう一方も深く知る必要があった。これは表裏一体の美なのだ、と
#. de: Ein Goldschmied hat diese Puppe geschaffen, um damit alle anderen Puppen an Schönheit zu über-<br>treffen. Das soll er gesagt haben, als er sie in großer Stückzahl an Rowenas Haus der Wunder verkauft hat.
#. fr: Cette poupée est l'œuvre d'un orfèvre qui cherchait à inventer “une nouvelle forme de beauté”. Lorsque cet artisan l'a mis en vente à l'échoppe de Rowena, il aurait dit ceci<nbsp>: “Il est important de toujours prendre en considération les deux faces d'une même pièce.”
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Omega-M minion to observe your irrational behavior.
#. column 2: \<bleep><br>hELLo, WOrlD!?
#. column 3: Resonance M
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (40 if the ally is wind-up Omega-F).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:344:0:1"
msgid "This automaton is the work of a goldsmith who desired to explore new definitions of beauty. Upon delivering a batch to the House of Splendors, the man is said to have declared, “To understand the one, one must understand the other. For their beauty lies in the whole.”"
msgstr "Эта кукла — работа ювелира, решившего исследовать новые грани красоты. Когда он привёз партию в Дом дивинаторов, то, говорят, заявил: «Чтобы понять одно, нужно понять и другое. Ведь их красота — в целом»."

#. ja: ハローワールド！
#. de: Hallo Welt!
#. fr: bOnJouR, Le MoNDe<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Omega-M minion to observe your irrational behavior.
#. column 1: This automaton is the work of a goldsmith who desired to explore new definitions of beauty. Upon delivering a batch to the House of Splendors, the man is said to have declared, “To understand the one, one must understand the other. For their beauty lies in the whole.”
#. column 3: Resonance M
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (40 if the ally is wind-up Omega-F).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:344:0:2"
msgid "\\<bleep><br>hELLo, WOrlD!?"
msgstr "\\<бип><br>ПРИвЕт, МИр!?"

#. ja: レゾナンスM
#. de: Resonanz M
#. fr: Résonance M
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Omega-M minion to observe your irrational behavior.
#. column 1: This automaton is the work of a goldsmith who desired to explore new definitions of beauty. Upon delivering a batch to the House of Splendors, the man is said to have declared, “To understand the one, one must understand the other. For their beauty lies in the whole.”
#. column 2: \<bleep><br>hELLo, WOrlD!?
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (40 if the ally is wind-up Omega-F).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:344:0:3"
msgid "Resonance M"
msgstr "Резонанс М"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のDEFを10上昇させる。<br>味方がマメット・オメガFの場合は、DEFを40上昇する。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Erhöht die ABW von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, im Fall der weiblichen Omega-Puppe um 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 10 la défense des alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou de 40 dans le cas d'Oméga-F miniature.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Omega-M minion to observe your irrational behavior.
#. column 1: This automaton is the work of a goldsmith who desired to explore new definitions of beauty. Upon delivering a batch to the House of Splendors, the man is said to have declared, “To understand the one, one must understand the other. For their beauty lies in the whole.”
