#. ja: ミニオン「タイニーエケボア」を呼び出す。<br>エケボアの幼獣。尻尾の先は蜜の味
#. de: Du rufst deinen kleinen Echevoren als Begleiter herbei.<br>Der Bürzel dieses magischen Wesens duftet nach süßem Honig.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte échevore nain, dont le bout de la queue a le goût du miel.
#. column 1: The scales on this critter's back are arranged in such a way as to put one in mind of the succulent echeveria. Lying concealed in tall grass, it lures insects with its tail, which secretes a sweet-tasting fluid akin to nectar.
#. column 2: I shall enjoy sucking on<br>its tail for that sweet, sweet<br>nectar taste!<br>   - Overzealous Nu Mou
#. column 3: Taste of Nectar
#. column 4: Grants action party the ability to deal extra damage to Arcana Stones.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:347:0:0"
msgid "Summon your tiny echevore minion. Its tail tastes like nectar...but you wouldn't know such things."
msgstr "Призвать миньона крошечного эхевора. Его хвост на вкус как нектар... но откуда тебе это знать?"

#. ja: エケボアの幼獣。背面が多肉植物エケベリアに似た鱗甲板で覆われており、草原で身を隠すと簡単には発見できない。尻尾の先から、蜜のような甘い分泌液を出し、虫を誘引して捕食するという極めて珍しい性質を持つ
#. de: Die Schuppen auf seinem Rücken ähneln den Blättern des Dickblattgewächses Echeveria und dienen zur Tarnung. Die Spitze seines Schwanzes lockt mit süßem Honigduft Insekten an, die zur Haupt-<br>nahrungsquelle des Echevoren zählen.
#. fr: Cet échevore a le dos recouvert d'une carapace faite de malacophytes, ce qui lui permet de se camoufler facilement dans la végétation. Le bout de sa queue sécrète un liquide qui exhale une délicieuse odeur sucrée dont il se sert pour attirer les insectes, son mets favori.
#. column 0: Summon your tiny echevore minion. Its tail tastes like nectar...but you wouldn't know such things.
#. column 2: I shall enjoy sucking on<br>its tail for that sweet, sweet<br>nectar taste!<br>   - Overzealous Nu Mou
#. column 3: Taste of Nectar
#. column 4: Grants action party the ability to deal extra damage to Arcana Stones.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:347:0:1"
msgid "The scales on this critter's back are arranged in such a way as to put one in mind of the succulent echeveria. Lying concealed in tall grass, it lures insects with its tail, which secretes a sweet-tasting fluid akin to nectar."
msgstr "Чешуйки на спине этого зверька напоминают листья суккулента эхеверии. Затаившись в высокой траве, он приманивает насекомых хвостом, выделяющим сладкую жидкость, похожую на нектар."

#. ja: キュ！？
#. de: Oh, jaaa! Beste Ware, ich sag's dir!
#. fr: Kyu<nbsp>!?
#. column 0: Summon your tiny echevore minion. Its tail tastes like nectar...but you wouldn't know such things.
#. column 1: The scales on this critter's back are arranged in such a way as to put one in mind of the succulent echeveria. Lying concealed in tall grass, it lures insects with its tail, which secretes a sweet-tasting fluid akin to nectar.
