#. ja: ミニオン「バタフライエフェクト」を呼び出す。<br>番いの蝶の幻影を投射する不思議な結晶
#. de: Du rufst dein Schmetterlingspaar als Begleiter herbei.<br>Dieses Trugbild von zwei Schmetterlingen wird von einem Kristall in die Luft projiziert.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte couple de papillons, une illusion projetée par un cristal mystérieux.
#. column 1: There is a theory which states that the fluttering of a butterfly's wings may give rise to a raging storm a thousand malms away. This crystal has nothing to do with that theory; rather, it is said to simply be the work of a priest of Ronka, created during a bout of boredom.
#. column 2: Take wing,<br>ye souls of war!<br>   - Ravana
#. column 3: Butterfly Effect
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:350:0:0"
msgid "Summon your butterfly effect minion. Illusory and therefore incapable of invoking any history-shattering consequences...right?"
msgstr "Призвать миньона «Эффект бабочки». Это всего лишь иллюзия, так что никаких судьбоносных последствий быть не может... верно?"

#. ja: 番いの蝶の幻影を投射する不思議な結晶。蝶の羽ばたきが起こす撹乱のような小さな変化でさえ、あるとないとでは結果的に大きな差異を生むという説話を表現するための品ではなく、古代ロンカ帝国の神官が戯れに創った品らしい
#. de: Diesen Kristall soll ein Priester im alten Ronka-Kaiserreich angefertigt haben. Nicht etwa, um den Schmetterlingseffekt damit zu veranschaulichen, sondern einfach nur aus Spaß an der Freude.
#. fr: Ces papillons ne sont qu'une illusion, façonnée par un prêtre de l'empire ronka. On pourrait croire que leur créateur voulait par son œuvre rappeler aux humains l'impact parfois énorme que peut avoir un acte anodin, mais pas du tout. Il voulait juste s'amuser.
#. column 0: Summon your butterfly effect minion. Illusory and therefore incapable of invoking any history-shattering consequences...right?
#. column 2: Take wing,<br>ye souls of war!<br>   - Ravana
#. column 3: Butterfly Effect
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:350:0:1"
msgid "There is a theory which states that the fluttering of a butterfly's wings may give rise to a raging storm a thousand malms away. This crystal has nothing to do with that theory; rather, it is said to simply be the work of a priest of Ronka, created during a bout of boredom."
msgstr "Есть теория, что взмах крыльев бабочки может вызвать бурю за тысячу мальмов. Этот кристалл к ней отношения не имеет. Говорят, его просто создал от скуки жрец древней Ронки."

#. ja: フワフワフワ
#. de: Herz von Linu Vanu-ooh tanzt wie Schmetterling in Luft.<br><i> Linu Vanu-ooh</i>
#. fr: fl fl fl...
#. column 0: Summon your butterfly effect minion. Illusory and therefore incapable of invoking any history-shattering consequences...right?
#. column 1: There is a theory which states that the fluttering of a butterfly's wings may give rise to a raging storm a thousand malms away. This crystal has nothing to do with that theory; rather, it is said to simply be the work of a priest of Ronka, created during a bout of boredom.
#. column 3: Butterfly Effect
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:350:0:2"
msgid "Take wing,<br>ye souls of war!<br>   - Ravana"
msgstr "Взмахните крыльями,<br>о души войны!<br>   — Равана"

#. ja: バタフライ効果
#. de: Schmetterlingseffekt
#. fr: Effet papillon
#. column 0: Summon your butterfly effect minion. Illusory and therefore incapable of invoking any history-shattering consequences...right?
#. column 1: There is a theory which states that the fluttering of a butterfly's wings may give rise to a raging storm a thousand malms away. This crystal has nothing to do with that theory; rather, it is said to simply be the work of a priest of Ronka, created during a bout of boredom.
#. column 2: Take wing,<br>ye souls of war!<br>   - Ravana
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:350:0:3"
msgid "Butterfly Effect"
msgstr "Эффект бабочки"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your butterfly effect minion. Illusory and therefore incapable of invoking any history-shattering consequences...right?
#. column 1: There is a theory which states that the fluttering of a butterfly's wings may give rise to a raging storm a thousand malms away. This crystal has nothing to do with that theory; rather, it is said to simply be the work of a priest of Ronka, created during a bout of boredom.
#. column 2: Take wing,<br>ye souls of war!<br>   - Ravana
#. column 3: Butterfly Effect
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:350:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Повышает на 10 очков особых приёмов у союзников в радиусе действия, кроме миньонов с таким же особым приёмом."

#. ja: ミニオン「フロッガーA」を呼び出す。<br>ドワーフ族の職人が製造した小型オートマトン
#. de: Du rufst deinen Eisenfrosch als Begleiter herbei.<br>Diese kleine Marionette wurde von Zwergenhandwerkern angefertigt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte grenouilleur A, un petit automate fabriqué par un artisan nain.
#. column 1: This diminutive automaton is designed to automatically load itself with the ore which serves as its energy source. However, the function appears to be overactive, resulting in it compulsively checking whether the ore is present. The wind-up key is a purely aesthetic addition.
#. column 2: A-digging we will go!<br>   - Korutt
#. column 3: Soul of Mining
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:351:0:0"
msgid "Summon your ironfrog ambler minion, a darling, diminutive, dwarven-made...automaton."
msgstr "Призвать миньона «Железный лягушонок». Очаровательный крошечный автоматон, созданный гномами..."

#. ja: ドワーフ族の職人が製造した小型オートマトン。動力源となる鉱物を、自動的に本体に入れる機能を持っているが、ついつい本当に入っているか心配になり出して確かめてしまう。なお、背中の巻ネジは雰囲気出し用のフェイクらしい
#. de: Diese Marionette kann sich selbst mit Erz befüllen, das ihr als Treibstoff dient. Leider neigt sie dazu, immer wieder nachzuschauen, ob noch genug Erz vorhanden ist. Der Schlüssel im Rücken dient nur zur Zierde.
#. fr: Cet automate a été pensé pour qu'il puisse recharger son moteur tout seul avec le minerai nécessaire à son bon fonc<shy>tion<shy>ne<shy>ment, ce qui ne vous empêche pas de vérifier quand même ré<shy>gu<shy>liè<shy>re<shy>ment s'il n'est pas tombé en panne. La clé de remontage dans son dos est juste là pour faire joli.
#. column 0: Summon your ironfrog ambler minion, a darling, diminutive, dwarven-made...automaton.
#. column 2: A-digging we will go!<br>   - Korutt
#. column 3: Soul of Mining
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:351:0:1"
msgid "This diminutive automaton is designed to automatically load itself with the ore which serves as its energy source. However, the function appears to be overactive, resulting in it compulsively checking whether the ore is present. The wind-up key is a purely aesthetic addition."
msgstr "Этот крошечный автоматон сам загружает в себя руду, служащую ему источником энергии. Но, похоже, функция работает чересчур усердно: он постоянно проверяет, на месте ли руда. Заводной ключик на спине — просто украшение."

#. ja: グィーン♪
#. de: Quaaak! ... \<quietsch> ...
#. fr: Gouing<nbsp>!♪
#. column 0: Summon your ironfrog ambler minion, a darling, diminutive, dwarven-made...automaton.
#. column 1: This diminutive automaton is designed to automatically load itself with the ore which serves as its energy source. However, the function appears to be overactive, resulting in it compulsively checking whether the ore is present. The wind-up key is a purely aesthetic addition.
#. column 3: Soul of Mining
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:351:0:2"
msgid "A-digging we will go!<br>   - Korutt"
msgstr "За кирки — айда!<br>   — Корутт"

#. ja: 採掘魂
#. de: Bergbauerseele
#. fr: Esprit de la mine
#. column 0: Summon your ironfrog ambler minion, a darling, diminutive, dwarven-made...automaton.
#. column 1: This diminutive automaton is designed to automatically load itself with the ore which serves as its energy source. However, the function appears to be overactive, resulting in it compulsively checking whether the ore is present. The wind-up key is a purely aesthetic addition.
#. column 2: A-digging we will go!<br>   - Korutt
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:351:0:3"
msgid "Soul of Mining"
msgstr "Душа шахтёра"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のアルカナストーンに、5%のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Arkana-Stein 5 % Schaden zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 5% de sa solidité à la pierre arcanique ennemie la plus proche.
#. column 0: Summon your ironfrog ambler minion, a darling, diminutive, dwarven-made...automaton.
#. column 1: This diminutive automaton is designed to automatically load itself with the ore which serves as its energy source. However, the function appears to be overactive, resulting in it compulsively checking whether the ore is present. The wind-up key is a purely aesthetic addition.
#. column 2: A-digging we will go!<br>   - Korutt
#. column 3: Soul of Mining
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:351:0:4"
msgid "Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone."
msgstr "Наносит ближайшему вражескому арканному камню урон в размере 5% его прочности."

#. ja: ミニオン「フォーギヴン・ヘイト」を呼び出す。<br>超小型の罪喰いらしき何か。過去の罪を悔いたため害はない
#. de: Du rufst deinen vergebenen Hass als Begleiter herbei.<br>Dieses winzig kleine Etwas ähnelt einem Sünden<shy>ver<shy>tilger. Es bereut seine Schuld.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte haine pardonnée. Cette créature ressemble à un purgateur riquiqui, mais n'est pas dangereuse.
#. column 1: A sin eater-esque something or other found on Mt. Gulg. Though it follows you relentlessly, as if driven by hate, it can do little save flutter about and occasionally unravel itself. There seems to be no harm in keeping it with you for now...
#. column 2: I'm just going to assume<br>that cube is an eater.<br>   - Thancred
#. column 3: Trigger and Push
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:352:0:0"
msgid "Summon your forgiven hate minion. Having repented its sins, it poses no danger."
msgstr "Призвать миньона «Прощённая ненависть». Он раскаялся в грехах и больше не опасен."

#. ja: グルグ火山で発見された超小型の罪喰いらしき何か。拾った者に「敵視（ヘイト）」を向けて、その背後を追い続けるが、実際のところ何ができる訳でもなく、ただクルクル回転するだけ。特に害はないので、持っていてもいいだろう
#. de: Dieses kleine Wesen, das an einen Sünden<shy>ver<shy>tilger erinnert, wurde auf dem Gulg entdeckt. Es verfolgt denjenigen, der es gefunden hat. Da es nichts weiter anstellen kann, außer sich zu drehen, kann man es gefahrlos mitnehmen.
#. fr: Cette créature que l'on pourrait prendre pour un petit purgateur est apparue pas loin du Mont Gulg. Elle a pour habitude de poursuivre les personnes qui s'en approchent, mais comme elle ne peut rien faire d'autre que rouler sur elle-même, elle n'est pas vraiment dangereuse.
#. column 0: Summon your forgiven hate minion. Having repented its sins, it poses no danger.
#. column 2: I'm just going to assume<br>that cube is an eater.<br>   - Thancred
#. column 3: Trigger and Push
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:352:0:1"
msgid "A sin eater-esque something or other found on Mt. Gulg. Though it follows you relentlessly, as if driven by hate, it can do little save flutter about and occasionally unravel itself. There seems to be no harm in keeping it with you for now..."
msgstr "Неизвестно что, похожее на пожирателя грехов. Его нашли на горе Гулг. Оно неотступно следует за тобой, словно движимое ненавистью, но почти ничего не умеет: лишь порхает вокруг да время от времени распадается на части. Пока что держать его при себе вроде бы безопасно..."

#. ja: クルクルクル…
#. de: Wenn wir uns dem Gulg nähern, werden wir ohne Zweifel mit Sünden<shy>ver<shy>tilgern zu tun bekommen.<br><i>Mysteriöse Stimme</i>
#. fr: Kr kr kr...
#. column 0: Summon your forgiven hate minion. Having repented its sins, it poses no danger.
#. column 1: A sin eater-esque something or other found on Mt. Gulg. Though it follows you relentlessly, as if driven by hate, it can do little save flutter about and occasionally unravel itself. There seems to be no harm in keeping it with you for now...
#. column 3: Trigger and Push
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:352:0:2"
msgid "I'm just going to assume<br>that cube is an eater.<br>   - Thancred"
msgstr "Буду считать, что этот куб — пожиратель грехов.<br>   — Танкред"

#. ja: トリガー＆プッシュ
#. de: Würfelkombination
#. fr: gâchette & bouton
#. column 0: Summon your forgiven hate minion. Having repented its sins, it poses no danger.
#. column 1: A sin eater-esque something or other found on Mt. Gulg. Though it follows you relentlessly, as if driven by hate, it can do little save flutter about and occasionally unravel itself. There seems to be no harm in keeping it with you for now...
#. column 2: I'm just going to assume<br>that cube is an eater.<br>   - Thancred
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:352:0:3"
msgid "Trigger and Push"
msgstr "Удар и толчок"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK30のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 30 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 30 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your forgiven hate minion. Having repented its sins, it poses no danger.
#. column 1: A sin eater-esque something or other found on Mt. Gulg. Though it follows you relentlessly, as if driven by hate, it can do little save flutter about and occasionally unravel itself. There seems to be no harm in keeping it with you for now...
#. column 2: I'm just going to assume<br>that cube is an eater.<br>   - Thancred
#. column 3: Trigger and Push
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:352:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 30 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「ポークシー・ビッツ」を呼び出す。<br>小さな豚型使い魔。火の通りは、約1分！
#. de: Du rufst deine Mini-Quiexie als Begleiter herbei.<br>Man könnte sie mit einem Happs verspeisen, falls man Lehm essen wollte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bout-de-cochon. Cette petite créature magique mignonne à croquer dégage un délicieux fumet.
#. column 1: After seeing a dream wherein they were being followed by a flying pig, a retainer out gathering absent-mindedly worked some clay into the creature's likeness. To their surprise, the creature suddenly sprang to life─most likely at the hands of a pixie bent on mischief.
#. column 2: I am curious as to what<br>mischief the flying pig<br>has in mind...<br>   - Sue-Rend
#. column 3: Porky Puff
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:353:0:0"
msgid "Summon your bacon bits minion. Tastes like bacon...if bacon and clay taste the same to you."
msgstr "Призвать миньона «Беконные кусочки». На вкус как бекон... если для тебя бекон и глина одно и то же."

#. ja: 空飛ぶ豚に追い回される夢を見たリテイナーが、採集の合間に見つけた粘土を捏ねた結果、なぜか生じた存在。おそらく、ピクシー族がイタズラ心で「妖精のランプ」の火種を吹き込んだために、使い魔として成立したのだろう
#. de: Es gibt Erkundungen, die gibt's gar nicht. Dein Gehilfe ist auf eine Lehmablagerung gestoßen, aus der spontan dieser Familiar entsprang. Ob hier eine abenteuerlustige Pixie einen Streich mit einer Feenlampe gespielt hat?
#. fr: Après avoir rêvé d'un joli petit cochon volant, batifolant librement dans les champs, votre servant décida d'en créer une réplique en terre glaise. Pour une raison inconnue, même si un mauvais tour des Pixies semble très probable, la créature s'anima et prit vie.
#. column 0: Summon your bacon bits minion. Tastes like bacon...if bacon and clay taste the same to you.
#. column 2: I am curious as to what<br>mischief the flying pig<br>has in mind...<br>   - Sue-Rend
#. column 3: Porky Puff
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:353:0:1"
msgid "After seeing a dream wherein they were being followed by a flying pig, a retainer out gathering absent-mindedly worked some clay into the creature's likeness. To their surprise, the creature suddenly sprang to life─most likely at the hands of a pixie bent on mischief."
msgstr "Слуга отправился собирать припасы и, вспомнив сон о летающей свинье, машинально слепил её из найденной глины. К его удивлению, свинка вдруг ожила — скорее всего, благодаря проказливой пикси."

#. ja: ブヒィッ！
#. de: Was heckt das fliegende Schweinchen jetzt schon wieder aus?<br><i>Sue-Rend</i>
#. fr: Grouik<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your bacon bits minion. Tastes like bacon...if bacon and clay taste the same to you.
#. column 1: After seeing a dream wherein they were being followed by a flying pig, a retainer out gathering absent-mindedly worked some clay into the creature's likeness. To their surprise, the creature suddenly sprang to life─most likely at the hands of a pixie bent on mischief.
#. column 3: Porky Puff
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:353:0:2"
msgid "I am curious as to what<br>mischief the flying pig<br>has in mind...<br>   - Sue-Rend"
msgstr "Интересно, какую проказу<br>задумала эта летающая<br>свинка...<br>   — Сью-Ренд"

#. ja: 豚風
#. de: Schweinehauch
#. fr: Vent Porcin
#. column 0: Summon your bacon bits minion. Tastes like bacon...if bacon and clay taste the same to you.
#. column 1: After seeing a dream wherein they were being followed by a flying pig, a retainer out gathering absent-mindedly worked some clay into the creature's likeness. To their surprise, the creature suddenly sprang to life─most likely at the hands of a pixie bent on mischief.
#. column 2: I am curious as to what<br>mischief the flying pig<br>has in mind...<br>   - Sue-Rend
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:353:0:3"
msgid "Porky Puff"
msgstr "Свиной пых"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵、味方すべてにかかっている、効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle Effekte von allen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe les effets de tous les alliés et ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your bacon bits minion. Tastes like bacon...if bacon and clay taste the same to you.
#. column 1: After seeing a dream wherein they were being followed by a flying pig, a retainer out gathering absent-mindedly worked some clay into the creature's likeness. To their surprise, the creature suddenly sprang to life─most likely at the hands of a pixie bent on mischief.
#. column 2: I am curious as to what<br>mischief the flying pig<br>has in mind...<br>   - Sue-Rend
#. column 3: Porky Puff
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:353:0:4"
msgid "Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все эффекты со всех противников и союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ピクシー」を呼び出す。<br>ピクシーを模した魔法人形。イタズラはしてこない
#. de: Du rufst deine Pixie-Puppe als Begleiter herbei.<br>Sie wird dir ganz sicher keine Streiche spielen. Pixie-Ehrenwort!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Pixie miniature. Pas d'inquiétude, cette poupée ne joue pas de mauvais tours<nbsp>!
#. column 1: The Dreamspinners present this mammet as a gift to those children whom they have befriended. Unlike a real pixie, it doesn't make mischief, so you don't need to constantly be looking over your shoulders.
#. column 2: Come and play with us...<br>   - Titania
#. column 3: Pixual Healing
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:354:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up pixie minion. Won't make mischief at your expense─pixie's honor."
msgstr "Призвать заводную пикси. Честное пиксийское: она не станет над тобой подшучивать."

#. ja: ピクシーを模した魔法人形。リェー・メグのピクシーたちが、夢の中で仲良くなった子どもたちにプレゼントするために造った品のひとつらしい。本物と違ってイタズラを仕掛けてくることはないので、かなり付き合いやすい
#. de: Die Traumweberinnen schenken Kindern, mit denen sie sich angefreundet haben, Pixie-Puppen. Im Gegensatz zu echten Pixies muss man bei den Puppen nicht ständig auf der Hut sein, ob sie einem einen Streich spielen.
#. fr: Cette réplique miniature est offerte par les Pixies aux enfants qui acceptent de jouer avec elles dans leurs rêves. Heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, au contraire d'une vraie Pixie, elle ne cherchera pas à vous transformer en enfeuillé<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up pixie minion. Won't make mischief at your expense─pixie's honor.
#. column 2: Come and play with us...<br>   - Titania
#. column 3: Pixual Healing
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:354:0:1"
msgid "The Dreamspinners present this mammet as a gift to those children whom they have befriended. Unlike a real pixie, it doesn't make mischief, so you don't need to constantly be looking over your shoulders."
msgstr "Ткачихи снов дарят эту марионетку детям, с которыми подружились. В отличие от настоящей пикси, она не проказничает, так что постоянно оглядываться не придётся."

#. ja: ぴかりん♪
#. de: Spiel mit uns!<br><i>Titania</i>
#. fr: Ta-daa<nbsp>!♪
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up pixie minion. Won't make mischief at your expense─pixie's honor.
#. column 1: The Dreamspinners present this mammet as a gift to those children whom they have befriended. Unlike a real pixie, it doesn't make mischief, so you don't need to constantly be looking over your shoulders.
#. column 3: Pixual Healing
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:354:0:2"
msgid "Come and play with us...<br>   - Titania"
msgstr "Иди поиграй с нами...<br>   — Титания"

#. ja: ピクシーの癒やし
#. de: Pixie-Heilung
#. fr: Soin des Pixies
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up pixie minion. Won't make mischief at your expense─pixie's honor.
#. column 1: The Dreamspinners present this mammet as a gift to those children whom they have befriended. Unlike a real pixie, it doesn't make mischief, so you don't need to constantly be looking over your shoulders.
#. column 2: Come and play with us...<br>   - Titania
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:354:0:3"
msgid "Pixual Healing"
msgstr "Пиксийское исцеление"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のHPを、100回復する。味方のタイプが「ドール」の場合は、HPが150回復する。
#. de: Regeneriert bei den eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe 100 LP, im Fall von Puppen 150.
#. fr: Soigne 100 PV aux alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou 150 PV s'ils sont de type “Poupée”.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up pixie minion. Won't make mischief at your expense─pixie's honor.
#. column 1: The Dreamspinners present this mammet as a gift to those children whom they have befriended. Unlike a real pixie, it doesn't make mischief, so you don't need to constantly be looking over your shoulders.
#. column 2: Come and play with us...<br>   - Titania
#. column 3: Pixual Healing
