msgctxt "CompanionTransient:354:0:4"
msgid "Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>)."
msgstr "Восстанавливает 100 HP всем союзникам в радиусе действия (150, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>кукла</ui-edge-color></ui-color>)."

#. ja: ミニオン「ミスティックウェポン」を呼び出す。<br>リテイナーが旅先で発見した剣、のはずだったのだが……
#. de: Du rufst deine Mystische Waffe als Begleiter herbei.<br>Wenn du Glück hast, ist sie nur ganz schwach verflucht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte arme mystique. Au départ, ce n'était qu'une petite épée trouvée par un servant lors d'un voyage mais...
#. column 1: While out on a venture, your retainer discovered a timeworn blade and took it in their hand...whereupon a peculiar creature manifested. Though the weapon was believed to be cursed, the retainer was reportedly not concerned, as it was to be given to you in any case.
#. column 2: I ain't got the patience for<br>no mystic rubbish today.<br>   - Gerolt
#. column 3: Smite of Rage
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:355:0:0"
msgid "Summon your mystic weapon minion. Only slightly cursed."
msgstr "Призвать миньона «Мистическое оружие». Проклято совсем чуть-чуть."

#. ja: リテイナーが旅先で発見した古びた剣。しかし、触れたとたんに古代の魔法が発動したようで、奇妙な魔法生物が現れて歩き始めた。なんだか呪われそうな気もするが、どうせご主人様に渡すのだからと気軽に持ち帰られたようだ
#. de: Als dein Gehilfe ein seltsames Schwert entdeckte, manifestierte sich vor ihm eine Kreatur. Er vermutete, dass sie verflucht sein könnte, machte sich aber keine Sorgen, da er das Schwert ohnehin an dich weitergeben wollte.
#. fr: Cette petite épée ancienne découverte par un servant lors d'un voyage s'est mise à prendre vie, animée par une magie ancestrale. Une étrange créature est apparue et elle semble être le fruit d'une malédiction millénaire... Votre servant était plus que soulagé de vous la remettre.
#. column 0: Summon your mystic weapon minion. Only slightly cursed.
#. column 2: I ain't got the patience for<br>no mystic rubbish today.<br>   - Gerolt
#. column 3: Smite of Rage
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:355:0:1"
msgid "While out on a venture, your retainer discovered a timeworn blade and took it in their hand...whereupon a peculiar creature manifested. Though the weapon was believed to be cursed, the retainer was reportedly not concerned, as it was to be given to you in any case."
msgstr "Во время вылазки слуга нашёл старый клинок и взял его в руки... Тут-то и появилось странное существо. Говорят, меч проклят, но слугу это не смутило: всё равно он собирался отдать его тебе."

#. ja: 呪…呪…呪…
#. de: Der mystische Kram kann mir gestohlen bleiben!<br><i>Gerolt</i>
#. fr: Meurs... Meurs...
#. column 0: Summon your mystic weapon minion. Only slightly cursed.
#. column 1: While out on a venture, your retainer discovered a timeworn blade and took it in their hand...whereupon a peculiar creature manifested. Though the weapon was believed to be cursed, the retainer was reportedly not concerned, as it was to be given to you in any case.
#. column 3: Smite of Rage
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:355:0:2"
msgid "I ain't got the patience for<br>no mystic rubbish today.<br>   - Gerolt"
msgstr "Мне сегодня совсем не до<br>всякой мистической чепухи!<br>   — Герольт"

#. ja: 怒りの一撃
#. de: Zornesschlag
#. fr: Coup de rage
#. column 0: Summon your mystic weapon minion. Only slightly cursed.
#. column 1: While out on a venture, your retainer discovered a timeworn blade and took it in their hand...whereupon a peculiar creature manifested. Though the weapon was believed to be cursed, the retainer was reportedly not concerned, as it was to be given to you in any case.
#. column 2: I ain't got the patience for<br>no mystic rubbish today.<br>   - Gerolt
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:355:0:3"
msgid "Smite of Rage"
msgstr "Яростный удар"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your mystic weapon minion. Only slightly cursed.
#. column 1: While out on a venture, your retainer discovered a timeworn blade and took it in their hand...whereupon a peculiar creature manifested. Though the weapon was believed to be cursed, the retainer was reportedly not concerned, as it was to be given to you in any case.
#. column 2: I ain't got the patience for<br>no mystic rubbish today.<br>   - Gerolt
#. column 3: Smite of Rage
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:355:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「ミーアキャット」を呼び出す。<br>巣穴を掘って暮らす小動物。太陽が好き
#. de: Du rufst dein Erdmännchen als Begleiter herbei.<br>Es hält aufmerksam nach Gefahr Ausschau, während es sich die Sonne auf den Pelz brennen lässt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte suricate. Un petit animal mignon comme tout qui adore les insectes et vivre sans aucun soucis.
#. column 1: Native to lands bordering the Sea of Ash, these small beastkin dwell in underground colonies, emerging from their burrows as the sun rises in order to bask in the warmth. Curiosity brought this creature to a submersible undergoing repairs on the shore, and it hasn't looked back since.
#. column 2: I am rather looking forward<br> to basking in the sunshine<br>of her praise.<br>   - Emmanellain
#. column 3: Sunbathe
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:356:0:0"
msgid "Summon your meerkat minion. Keeps an eye out for danger while basking in the sun."
msgstr "Призвать миньона-суриката. Греется на солнышке, но и за опасностью следит."

#. ja: 灰海周辺に棲息する小動物。地面に巣穴を掘って、家族単位で暮らしており、太陽が昇ると地表に現れ、直立不動で身体を温める。海岸で修理を行っていた潜水艦に、好奇心を抱いて侵入したことで大冒険の旅に出ることに
#. de: Erdmännchen leben in Gängen unter dem Verbrannten Meer. Morgens, sobald die Sonne aufgeht, kommen sie an die Oberfläche, um sich zu wärmen. Neugierde trieb dieses Exemplar zu einem Tauchboot, das am Strand repariert wurde.
#. fr: Ce petit animal très sociable vit ha<shy>bi<shy>tuel<shy>le<shy>ment autour de terriers complexes creusés dans le sol aux alentours de la Mer de Cendre. Curieux par nature, il s'est faufilé dans votre sous-marin pendant que celui-ci était en cours de réparations.
#. column 0: Summon your meerkat minion. Keeps an eye out for danger while basking in the sun.
#. column 2: I am rather looking forward<br> to basking in the sunshine<br>of her praise.<br>   - Emmanellain
#. column 3: Sunbathe
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:356:0:1"
msgid "Native to lands bordering the Sea of Ash, these small beastkin dwell in underground colonies, emerging from their burrows as the sun rises in order to bask in the warmth. Curiosity brought this creature to a submersible undergoing repairs on the shore, and it hasn't looked back since."
msgstr "Эти маленькие зверьки водятся в землях у Пепельного моря. Они живут семьями в подземных норах, а на рассвете выходят погреться на солнце. Из любопытства этот сурикат забрался в подлодку, которую чинили на берегу, — и с тех пор уже не оглядывался назад."

#. ja: グェ、グェ、グェ！
#. de: Ich freue mich darauf, im Glanz ihres Lobes zu baden.<br><i>Emmanellain</i>
#. fr: Couic, couic！
#. column 0: Summon your meerkat minion. Keeps an eye out for danger while basking in the sun.
#. column 1: Native to lands bordering the Sea of Ash, these small beastkin dwell in underground colonies, emerging from their burrows as the sun rises in order to bask in the warmth. Curiosity brought this creature to a submersible undergoing repairs on the shore, and it hasn't looked back since.
#. column 3: Sunbathe
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:356:0:2"
msgid "I am rather looking forward<br> to basking in the sunshine<br>of her praise.<br>   - Emmanellain"
msgstr "Как же я жду, когда смогу<br>погреться в лучах её похвалы!<br>   — Эмманеллен"

#. ja: 日向ぼっこ
#. de: Sonnenbad
#. fr: Bain de soleil
#. column 0: Summon your meerkat minion. Keeps an eye out for danger while basking in the sun.
#. column 1: Native to lands bordering the Sea of Ash, these small beastkin dwell in underground colonies, emerging from their burrows as the sun rises in order to bask in the warmth. Curiosity brought this creature to a submersible undergoing repairs on the shore, and it hasn't looked back since.
#. column 2: I am rather looking forward<br> to basking in the sunshine<br>of her praise.<br>   - Emmanellain
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:356:0:3"
msgid "Sunbathe"
msgstr "Греться на солнышке"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方にかかっている、弱体効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle negativen Effekte von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe toutes les altérations d'état des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your meerkat minion. Keeps an eye out for danger while basking in the sun.
#. column 1: Native to lands bordering the Sea of Ash, these small beastkin dwell in underground colonies, emerging from their burrows as the sun rises in order to bask in the warmth. Curiosity brought this creature to a submersible undergoing repairs on the shore, and it hasn't looked back since.
#. column 2: I am rather looking forward<br> to basking in the sunshine<br>of her praise.<br>   - Emmanellain
#. column 3: Sunbathe
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:356:0:4"
msgid "Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все негативные эффекты со всех союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「ホワイト・ミニナイト」を呼び出す。<br>スカイスチール機工房で製造された機工人形
#. de: Du rufst deinen weißen Miniaturritter als Begleiter herbei.<br>Ein neues Produkt der Himmelsstahl-Werkstätte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-cavalier blanc, un automate de métal forgé par la manufacture de Cielacier.
#. column 1: Crafted by the Skysteel Manufactory, this mammet was originally conceived for the Temple Knights to use in their strategizing, its mobility allowing for greater realism in battle simulations. Programmed to seek out formidable opponents.
#. column 2: Only a knight errant may<br>break a stalemate.<br>   - Drillemont
#. column 3: Underclock
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:357:0:0"
msgid "Summon your miniature white knight minion. Aids in the purging of sickness. Or not."
msgstr "Призвать миньона — маленького белого рыцаря. Помогает изгонять недуги. Или нет."

#. ja: スカイスチール機工房で製造された機工人形。元は神殿騎士団の机上演習用のコマとして造られたもので、これを地図上に並べて作戦行動を再現し、検証する軍事研究に用いられていた。常に好敵手を探し求めているらしい
#. de: Diese Marionette aus der Himmelsstahl-Werkstätte war ursprünglich als bewegliche Spielfigur für Strategiespiele der Tempelritter konzipiert. Sie ist darauf programmiert, sich ebenbürtige Gegner zu suchen.
#. fr: Fabriqué par la manufacture de Cielacier, cet automate de métal était utilisé par l'ordre des templiers comme pièce pour leurs jeux de stratégies mais aussi dans leurs simulations de batailles. Il est à la recherche d'un adversaire à sa hauteur.
#. column 0: Summon your miniature white knight minion. Aids in the purging of sickness. Or not.
#. column 2: Only a knight errant may<br>break a stalemate.<br>   - Drillemont
#. column 3: Underclock
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:357:0:1"
msgid "Crafted by the Skysteel Manufactory, this mammet was originally conceived for the Temple Knights to use in their strategizing, its mobility allowing for greater realism in battle simulations. Programmed to seek out formidable opponents."
msgstr "Созданная в мастерской «Небесная сталь» марионетка изначально предназначалась для тактических игр Храмовых рыцарей. Благодаря подвижности она делала военные симуляции реалистичнее. Запрограммирована искать достойных противников."

#. ja: 前ヘ、進メ！
#. de: Nur ein edler Ritter kann jetzt noch eine Niederlage verhindern.<br><i>Drillemont</i>
#. fr: Deux en avant, un de côté<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your miniature white knight minion. Aids in the purging of sickness. Or not.
#. column 1: Crafted by the Skysteel Manufactory, this mammet was originally conceived for the Temple Knights to use in their strategizing, its mobility allowing for greater realism in battle simulations. Programmed to seek out formidable opponents.
#. column 3: Underclock
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:357:0:2"
msgid "Only a knight errant may<br>break a stalemate.<br>   - Drillemont"
msgstr "Только странствующий рыцарь<br>способен нарушить равновесие.<br>   — Дрийемон"

#. ja: 限界無可動
#. de: Weißer Schild
#. fr: Immobilisme illimité
#. column 0: Summon your miniature white knight minion. Aids in the purging of sickness. Or not.
#. column 1: Crafted by the Skysteel Manufactory, this mammet was originally conceived for the Temple Knights to use in their strategizing, its mobility allowing for greater realism in battle simulations. Programmed to seek out formidable opponents.
#. column 2: Only a knight errant may<br>break a stalemate.<br>   - Drillemont
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:357:0:3"
msgid "Underclock"
msgstr "Безостановочный часовой механизм"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンのDEFを40上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
#. de: Erhöht die ABW der ausführenden Trabanten um 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 40 la défense des mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. column 0: Summon your miniature white knight minion. Aids in the purging of sickness. Or not.
#. column 1: Crafted by the Skysteel Manufactory, this mammet was originally conceived for the Temple Knights to use in their strategizing, its mobility allowing for greater realism in battle simulations. Programmed to seek out formidable opponents.
