#. ja: ミニオン「ドマキン」を呼び出す。<br>リテイナーが釣り上げてきた金魚。丸くて可愛い
#. de: Du rufst deinen Domakin als Begleiter herbei.<br>Ein niedlicher Goldfisch, den dein Gehilfe gefangen hat.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte domakin, un joli petit poisson rouge tout rond, trouvé par votre servant.
#. column 1: Reeled in by your retainer, this delightfully plump fish was created by a Doman goldfish enthusiast, its name a portmanteau of his nation and the local word for gold. It floats in the air by virtue of the cloudsbreath seeds it devoured, though how it manages to breathe is unknown.
#. column 2: Quite a catch indeed!<br>   - Nortmoen
#. column 3: Flashy Fins
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:359:0:0"
msgid "Summon your domakin minion. Close, but not a warrior with the body of a mortal and soul of a dragon."
msgstr "Призвать миньона-домакина. Похож на воина с телом смертного и душой дракона, но это просто рыбка."

#. ja: リテイナーが釣り上げてきた金魚。その丸みを帯びた魚体は、ドマの金魚愛好家の手で固定化された品種、通称「ドマキン」であることを示している。ウキグモソウの種を飲み込んだことで、浮行するようになってしまったらしい
#. de: Dieser Goldfisch wurde von einem domanischen Goldfisch-Sammler gezüchtet. Sein Name ist eine Kombination aus Doma und dem Wort für Gold in der Landessprache. Dank Pustewolken-Samen kann er schweben, wie er atmet, bleibt jedoch ein Rätsel.
#. fr: Ce petit poisson rouge pêché par votre servant tire son nom de la région dont il est originaire ainsi que de “kingyo”, le nom domien des poissons rouges. Il serait devenu rond et ballonné en avalant une graine de jasmin céleste.
#. column 0: Summon your domakin minion. Close, but not a warrior with the body of a mortal and soul of a dragon.
#. column 2: Quite a catch indeed!<br>   - Nortmoen
#. column 3: Flashy Fins
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:359:0:1"
msgid "Reeled in by your retainer, this delightfully plump fish was created by a Doman goldfish enthusiast, its name a portmanteau of his nation and the local word for gold. It floats in the air by virtue of the cloudsbreath seeds it devoured, though how it manages to breathe is unknown."
msgstr "Слуга выудил эту очаровательную пухлую рыбку. Её вывел любитель золотых рыбок из Домы, а название составлено из имени страны и местного слова «золото». Рыбка летает благодаря семенам облачного жасмина, которые проглотила, но как она при этом дышит — загадка."

#. ja: パチャパチャ…
#. de: Ein toller Fang!<br><i>Nortmoen</i>
#. fr: Bloub, bloub...
#. column 0: Summon your domakin minion. Close, but not a warrior with the body of a mortal and soul of a dragon.
#. column 1: Reeled in by your retainer, this delightfully plump fish was created by a Doman goldfish enthusiast, its name a portmanteau of his nation and the local word for gold. It floats in the air by virtue of the cloudsbreath seeds it devoured, though how it manages to breathe is unknown.
#. column 3: Flashy Fins
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:359:0:2"
msgid "Quite a catch indeed!<br>   - Nortmoen"
msgstr "Вот это улов!<br>   — Нортмуэн"

#. ja: ヒレビンタ
#. de: Goldflosse
#. fr: Baffe-aileron
#. column 0: Summon your domakin minion. Close, but not a warrior with the body of a mortal and soul of a dragon.
#. column 1: Reeled in by your retainer, this delightfully plump fish was created by a Doman goldfish enthusiast, its name a portmanteau of his nation and the local word for gold. It floats in the air by virtue of the cloudsbreath seeds it devoured, though how it manages to breathe is unknown.
#. column 2: Quite a catch indeed!<br>   - Nortmoen
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:359:0:3"
msgid "Flashy Fins"
msgstr "Блестящие плавники"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK30のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 30 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 30 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your domakin minion. Close, but not a warrior with the body of a mortal and soul of a dragon.
#. column 1: Reeled in by your retainer, this delightfully plump fish was created by a Doman goldfish enthusiast, its name a portmanteau of his nation and the local word for gold. It floats in the air by virtue of the cloudsbreath seeds it devoured, though how it manages to breathe is unknown.
#. column 2: Quite a catch indeed!<br>   - Nortmoen
#. column 3: Flashy Fins
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:359:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 30 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「ニュー・エスティニアン」を呼び出す。<br>竜騎士団を辞したエスティニアンを模した魔法人形。スルメは付属しない
#. de: Du rufst deine neue Estinien-Puppe als Begleiter herbei.<br>Getrockneter Tintenfisch ist nicht enthalten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte nouvel Estinien miniature, une poupée magique re<shy>pré<shy>sen<shy>tant l'ancien chevalier dragon dans sa nouvelle tenue. Attention surume non inclus<nbsp>!
#. column 1: A mammet fashioned in the likeness of the Azure Dragoon Estinien following his retirement from service. Created for the purpose of educating the younger generation about the Dragonsong War, it has been distributed to places of learning throughout Ishgard.
#. column 2: I find myself less and less<br>inclined to sear your squid!<br>   - Orn Khai
#. column 3: Dragon-seared Squid
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to all enemies within range while increasing action party ATK by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:360:0:0"
msgid "Summon your dress-up Estinien minion. Sun-dried squid not included."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Эстиниена в новом наряде. Вяленый кальмар не прилагается."

#. ja: 竜騎士団を辞したエスティニアンを模した魔法人形。それってつまり、無職ということなのではないかとは、考えてはいけない。竜詩戦争を語り継ぐという目的で造られ、イシュガルドの教育施設に配布されたもののようだ
#. de: Diese mechanische Puppe wurde dem Azur-Drachenreiter Estinien nachempfunden, nachdem er sich aus dem aktiven Dienst zurückgezogen hatte. Die Puppe soll die jüngere Generation von Rittern inspirieren.
#. fr: Cette poupée représente Estinien après avoir quitté l'ordre des chevaliers dragons. Elle a été créée afin d'instruire les plus jeunes d'Ishgard sur la Guerre du chant des dragons.
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Estinien minion. Sun-dried squid not included.
#. column 2: I find myself less and less<br>inclined to sear your squid!<br>   - Orn Khai
#. column 3: Dragon-seared Squid
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to all enemies within range while increasing action party ATK by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:360:0:1"
msgid "A mammet fashioned in the likeness of the Azure Dragoon Estinien following his retirement from service. Created for the purpose of educating the younger generation about the Dragonsong War, it has been distributed to places of learning throughout Ishgard."
msgstr "Марионетку создали по образу драгуна Азурового Дракона Эстиниена после его ухода со службы. Её сделали, чтобы рассказывать молодому поколению о Войне Песни драконов, и раздали учебным заведениям по всему Ишгарду."

#. ja: 美味イ…
#. de: Ich bin es leid, deinen Tintenfisch zu trocknen!<br><i>Orn Khai</i>
#. fr: Délicieux...
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Estinien minion. Sun-dried squid not included.
#. column 1: A mammet fashioned in the likeness of the Azure Dragoon Estinien following his retirement from service. Created for the purpose of educating the younger generation about the Dragonsong War, it has been distributed to places of learning throughout Ishgard.
#. column 3: Dragon-seared Squid
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to all enemies within range while increasing action party ATK by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:360:0:2"
msgid "I find myself less and less<br>inclined to sear your squid!<br>   - Orn Khai"
msgstr "Что-то всё меньше хочется<br>жарить для тебя кальмара!<br>   — Орн Кхай"

#. ja: スルメの竜炙り
#. de: Drachengetrockneter Tintenfisch
#. fr: Grillade au feu draconique
#. column 0: Summon your dress-up Estinien minion. Sun-dried squid not included.
#. column 1: A mammet fashioned in the likeness of the Azure Dragoon Estinien following his retirement from service. Created for the purpose of educating the younger generation about the Dragonsong War, it has been distributed to places of learning throughout Ishgard.
