#. ja: ミニオン「プチリャナンシー」を呼び出す。<br>リャナンシーの幼体。まだ発芽したばかり
#. de: Du rufst deine kleine Leanan als Begleiter herbei.<br>Noch ist sie klein und ungefährlich.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-Leannan Sith, une jeune pousse de Leannan Sith, à peine éclose.
#. column 1: Having just recently sprouted, this leannan young still possesses a mild temperament, but as its demands for nutrients grow, it will begin to hunt men and beasts alike. In preparation for this, it has already begun practicing its skills of enthrallment.
#. column 2: Seeds know no borders; they<br>will sprout wheresoever the<br>earth embraces them.<br>   - Martineau
#. column 3: Spring Breeze
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 60%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:361:0:0"
msgid "Summon your little leannan minion. Doesn't see you as food. Yet."
msgstr "Призвать миньона-лянанши. Пока он не считает тебя пищей. Пока."

#. ja: リャナンシーの幼体。まだ発芽したばかりで、気性も荒くはない。しかし、成長するにつれて、栄養源の確保に貪欲になり、あの手この手で動物やヒトを誘引しようとするらしい。現在、魅了の技の修得に向けて猛特訓中だ
#. de: Diese junge Leanan ist gerade erst gesprossen und noch recht zahm. Doch mit zunehmender Größe wird auch ihr Appetit auf lebende Beute wachsen. Sie übt schon fleißig die Kunst des Einwickelns.
#. fr: Cette jeune pousse de Leannan Sith n'est pas aussi colérique que sa grande sœur. Cependant son appétit augmente et elle devrait bientôt commencer à chasser hommes et bêtes. Elle a déjà maîtrisé un sort d'enchantement de base et fait tout pour se per<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>ner.
#. column 0: Summon your little leannan minion. Doesn't see you as food. Yet.
#. column 2: Seeds know no borders; they<br>will sprout wheresoever the<br>earth embraces them.<br>   - Martineau
#. column 3: Spring Breeze
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 60%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:361:0:1"
msgid "Having just recently sprouted, this leannan young still possesses a mild temperament, but as its demands for nutrients grow, it will begin to hunt men and beasts alike. In preparation for this, it has already begun practicing its skills of enthrallment."
msgstr "Этот молодой росток лянанши только-только проклюнулся и пока ещё незлобив. Но чем больше ему требуется питательных веществ, тем активнее он будет охотиться на людей и зверей. Уже сейчас он учится очаровывать добычу."

#. ja: オイデ、オイデ♪
#. de: Samen kennen keine Grenzen. Die gedeihen, wo immer sie auf fruchtbaren Boden fallen.<br><i>Martineau</i>
#. fr: Viens, approche<nbsp>!♪
#. column 0: Summon your little leannan minion. Doesn't see you as food. Yet.
#. column 1: Having just recently sprouted, this leannan young still possesses a mild temperament, but as its demands for nutrients grow, it will begin to hunt men and beasts alike. In preparation for this, it has already begun practicing its skills of enthrallment.
#. column 3: Spring Breeze
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 60%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:361:0:2"
msgid "Seeds know no borders; they<br>will sprout wheresoever the<br>earth embraces them.<br>   - Martineau"
msgstr "Семена не знают границ:<br>они прорастают там,<br>где их примет земля.<br>   — Мартино"

#. ja: 春風
#. de: Frühlingswind
#. fr: Vent printanier
#. column 0: Summon your little leannan minion. Doesn't see you as food. Yet.
#. column 1: Having just recently sprouted, this leannan young still possesses a mild temperament, but as its demands for nutrients grow, it will begin to hunt men and beasts alike. In preparation for this, it has already begun practicing its skills of enthrallment.
#. column 2: Seeds know no borders; they<br>will sprout wheresoever the<br>earth embraces them.<br>   - Martineau
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 60%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:361:0:3"
msgid "Spring Breeze"
msgstr "Весенний ветерок"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のゲートに60%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Tor 60<nbsp>% Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls es schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 60% de sa solidité au portail ennemi le plus proche. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your little leannan minion. Doesn't see you as food. Yet.
