msgctxt "CompanionTransient:361:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 60%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable."
msgstr "Снижает HP ближайших вражеских ворот на 60%. Не действует, если ворота уже разрушены."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ホブゴブリン」を呼び出す。<br>ホブゴブリンを模した魔法人形。母ちゃんではない
#. de: Du rufst deine Hobgoblin-Puppe als Begleiter herbei.<br>Auf gar keinen Fall zu verwechseln mit der Mutter eines Zwerges.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte hobgobelin miniature. Con<shy>trai<shy>re<shy>ment à ce que pourrait dire Giott, ce n'est pas une poupée de votre maman<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Contrary to what certain dwarves may claim, the hobgoblin upon which this mammet was based is no relation of yours; rather, it was a creature that was haunting your retainer's dreams. By crafting this minion and gifting it to another, they hoped to pass on the nightmare.
#. column 2: Your mother was<br>a hobgoblin!<br>   - Giott
#. column 3: Goblin Punch
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 270 to all enemies within range.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:362:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up hobgoblin minion. Crafted in the likeness of your mother...or so certain dwarves would say."
msgstr "Призвать заводного хобгоблина. Сделан по образу твоей матери... по крайней мере, так говорят некоторые гномы."

#. ja: ホブゴブリンを模した魔法人形。毎晩、老婆のような顔の「ホブゴブリン」なる怪物が夢に現れ、うなされ続けたリテイナーが厄払いのために自作した。これを、他人に渡すことで、悪夢を押し付けようという魂胆らしい
#. de: Diese Puppe erschien immer wieder in den Träumen deines Gehilfen, bis er sie eines Tages selbst anfertigte und dir schenkte. Seitdem schläft er ruhig und friedlich.
#. fr: Cette poupée re<shy>pré<shy>sen<shy>tant un hobgobelin a été con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>née par votre servant, hanté par la vision d'une créature hideuse hantant ses rêves. En vous la remettant, il espère lever la malédiction qui pèse sur lui...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up hobgoblin minion. Crafted in the likeness of your mother...or so certain dwarves would say.
#. column 2: Your mother was<br>a hobgoblin!<br>   - Giott
#. column 3: Goblin Punch
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 270 to all enemies within range.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:362:0:1"
msgid "Contrary to what certain dwarves may claim, the hobgoblin upon which this mammet was based is no relation of yours; rather, it was a creature that was haunting your retainer's dreams. By crafting this minion and gifting it to another, they hoped to pass on the nightmare."
msgstr "Вопреки словам некоторых гномов, хобгоблин, по образу которого сделали эту марионетку, тебе не родственник. Это существо преследовало слугу в кошмарах. Слуга создал миньона и подарил его другому, надеясь передать тому свой кошмар."

#. ja: お前の母ちゃん<br>ホブゴブリン！
#. de: Deine Mutter war ein Hobgoblin!<br><i>Giott</i>
#. fr: Ta mère la hobgobeline<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up hobgoblin minion. Crafted in the likeness of your mother...or so certain dwarves would say.
#. column 1: Contrary to what certain dwarves may claim, the hobgoblin upon which this mammet was based is no relation of yours; rather, it was a creature that was haunting your retainer's dreams. By crafting this minion and gifting it to another, they hoped to pass on the nightmare.
#. column 3: Goblin Punch
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 270 to all enemies within range.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:362:0:2"
msgid "Your mother was<br>a hobgoblin!<br>   - Giott"
msgstr "Твоя мать была<br>хобгоблином!<br>   — Джиотт"

#. ja: ゴブリンパンチ
#. de: Goblingruß
#. fr: Coup de poing gobelin<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up hobgoblin minion. Crafted in the likeness of your mother...or so certain dwarves would say.
#. column 1: Contrary to what certain dwarves may claim, the hobgoblin upon which this mammet was based is no relation of yours; rather, it was a creature that was haunting your retainer's dreams. By crafting this minion and gifting it to another, they hoped to pass on the nightmare.
