msgid "Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 270 to all enemies within range.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
msgstr "Ставит ловушку, которую можно активировать через 10 секунд. При срабатывании наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 270.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Задержка активации:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「ケルベロス・パピー」を呼び出す。<br>三つ首の犬のような何か。鳴き声も通常の三倍
#. de: Du rufst deinen Cerberus-Welpen als Begleiter herbei.<br>Ein Welpe mit drei Köpfen zum Streicheln!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte cerbère chiot, un adorable chien à trois têtes pour trois fois plus de papouilles<nbsp>!
#. column 1: This peculiar creature was found in a dark corner of a storehouse belonging to House Haillenarte. As voidsent are not uncommon in the wilds of Coerthas, it was at first thought to be a lesser such monstrosity, but─aside from the three heads─it appears to be an ordinary pup.
#. column 2: We'll see if our bite's<br>worse than our bark.<br>   - Hilda
#. column 3: Hell Charge
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:363:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Cerberpup minion. With three wet little noses and three sets of adorable staring eyes, what's not to love? Aside from all of the teeth, obviously."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Щенок Цербера». Три мокрых носа и три пары милых глаз — ну как тут не влюбиться? Разве что зубов многовато."

#. ja: アインハルト家が所有する物資倉庫の暗がりで発見された三つ首の犬のような何か。クルザスは野生化した妖異が多い土地としても知られているため、これも下級妖異の類と思われる。頭が3つあること以外は、割と普通の子犬である
#. de: Dieser dreiköpfige Hund wurde in einer dunklen Ecke des Warenspeichers der Grafenfamilie Haillenarte gefunden. Es wird angenommen, dass es sich um einen niederen Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>ten handelt. Angeblich stellt er keine Gefahr dar.
#. fr: La maison Haillenarte a trouvé cet étrange chiot dans un de leurs entrepôts. Une découverte pas si étonnante dans le Coerthas où des êtres du néant deviennent parfois de simples bêtes sauvages. Hormis ses origines, il n'est pas si différent des autres chiots.
#. column 0: Summon your Cerberpup minion. With three wet little noses and three sets of adorable staring eyes, what's not to love? Aside from all of the teeth, obviously.
#. column 2: We'll see if our bite's<br>worse than our bark.<br>   - Hilda
#. column 3: Hell Charge
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:363:0:1"
msgid "This peculiar creature was found in a dark corner of a storehouse belonging to House Haillenarte. As voidsent are not uncommon in the wilds of Coerthas, it was at first thought to be a lesser such monstrosity, but─aside from the three heads─it appears to be an ordinary pup."
msgstr "Этого странного зверька нашли в тёмном углу склада дома Эйзенард. Поскольку в дикой природе Коэртаса нередко встречаются выходцы из Пустоты, сперва его приняли за низшее чудовище. Но, если не считать трёх голов, он самый обычный щенок."

#. ja: ワン、ワン、ワン！
#. de: Ich bin gespannt, ob du nur kläffen oder auch beißen kannst!<br><i>Hilda</i>
#. fr: Waf, waf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Cerberpup minion. With three wet little noses and three sets of adorable staring eyes, what's not to love? Aside from all of the teeth, obviously.
#. column 1: This peculiar creature was found in a dark corner of a storehouse belonging to House Haillenarte. As voidsent are not uncommon in the wilds of Coerthas, it was at first thought to be a lesser such monstrosity, but─aside from the three heads─it appears to be an ordinary pup.
#. column 3: Hell Charge
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:363:0:2"
msgid "We'll see if our bite's<br>worse than our bark.<br>   - Hilda"
msgstr "Посмотрим, чей укус<br>страшнее лая.<br>   — Хильда"

#. ja: へるちゃーじ
#. de: Höllenbiss
#. fr: Ruée infernale
#. column 0: Summon your Cerberpup minion. With three wet little noses and three sets of adorable staring eyes, what's not to love? Aside from all of the teeth, obviously.
#. column 1: This peculiar creature was found in a dark corner of a storehouse belonging to House Haillenarte. As voidsent are not uncommon in the wilds of Coerthas, it was at first thought to be a lesser such monstrosity, but─aside from the three heads─it appears to be an ordinary pup.
#. column 2: We'll see if our bite's<br>worse than our bark.<br>   - Hilda
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:363:0:3"
msgid "Hell Charge"
msgstr "Адский бросок"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵の特殊技ポイントを、最大値の50%減少させる。
#. de: Verringert die Technikpunkte der Gegner in der Nähe um 50 % des Maximalwerts.
#. fr: Réduit les PdT des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet de 50% de leur valeur maximale.
#. column 0: Summon your Cerberpup minion. With three wet little noses and three sets of adorable staring eyes, what's not to love? Aside from all of the teeth, obviously.
#. column 1: This peculiar creature was found in a dark corner of a storehouse belonging to House Haillenarte. As voidsent are not uncommon in the wilds of Coerthas, it was at first thought to be a lesser such monstrosity, but─aside from the three heads─it appears to be an ordinary pup.
#. column 2: We'll see if our bite's<br>worse than our bark.<br>   - Hilda
#. column 3: Hell Charge
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:363:0:4"
msgid "Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value."
msgstr "Снижает очки особых приёмов всех противников в радиусе действия на 50% от максимального значения."

#. ja: ミニオン「ポッド054」を呼び出す。<br>機械遺跡で発見された白い支援随行ユニット
#. de: Du rufst deinen Pod 054 als Begleiter herbei.<br>Der perfekte Abenteuerbegleiter, wenn er denn ordentlich funktionieren würde.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte pod 054, une unité de support blanche découverte dans les ruines mécaniques.
#. column 1: Dug up in the depths of a factory fallen to ruin, this diminutive white machina was apparently designed to provide tactical support to a YoRHa. Though equipped with myriad functions, from support fire to advance conversation, none of these are operational at present.
#. column 2: Machines are not to be trusted,<br>least of all those that can think.<br>   - Estinien
#. column 3: A014: Point Up
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:364:0:0"
msgid "Summon your pod 054 minion. The perfect assistant for adventuring...or it would be, if it worked properly."
msgstr "Призвать миньона «Под 054». Идеальный помощник в приключениях... если бы только он работал как надо."

#. ja: 機械遺跡の奥深くにて発見された白い小型機械。２Ｐの証言によれば、この機械はヨルハ機体に随伴し、支援するために開発された存在らしい。援護射撃用の火器や高度な会話機能が実装されていたようだが、現在は機能していない
#. de: Diese weiße Maschine wurde aus einer alten Fabrikruine geborgen. Vermutlich wurde sie ursprünglich als taktische Unterstützungseinheit für YoRHa erschaffen.
#. fr: Cette unité blanche a été découverte au fond des ruines mécaniques. D'après 2P, son but est de servir de support à l'infanterie YoRHa. Elle était équipée de diverses fonctions, comme d'un lance-flammes, ou d'une synthèse vocale, mais plus aucune n'est opérationnelle.
#. column 0: Summon your pod 054 minion. The perfect assistant for adventuring...or it would be, if it worked properly.
#. column 2: Machines are not to be trusted,<br>least of all those that can think.<br>   - Estinien
#. column 3: A014: Point Up
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:364:0:1"
msgid "Dug up in the depths of a factory fallen to ruin, this diminutive white machina was apparently designed to provide tactical support to a YoRHa. Though equipped with myriad functions, from support fire to advance conversation, none of these are operational at present."
msgstr "Эту крошечную белую машину раскопали в глубине заброшенной фабрики. По всей видимости, она была создана для тактической поддержки бойца ЙорХа. В ней предусмотрено множество функций — от огневой поддержки до сложных бесед, — но сейчас ни одна из них не работает."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Maschinen ist nicht zu trauen, schon gar nicht intelligenten Maschinen.<br><i>Estinien</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon your pod 054 minion. The perfect assistant for adventuring...or it would be, if it worked properly.
#. column 1: Dug up in the depths of a factory fallen to ruin, this diminutive white machina was apparently designed to provide tactical support to a YoRHa. Though equipped with myriad functions, from support fire to advance conversation, none of these are operational at present.
#. column 3: A014: Point Up
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:364:0:2"
msgid "Machines are not to be trusted,<br>least of all those that can think.<br>   - Estinien"
msgstr "Машинам доверять нельзя,<br>особенно разумным.<br>   — Эстиниен"

#. ja: A014：ポイントアップ
#. de: A014: Technikschub
#. fr: A014<nbsp>: points max
#. column 0: Summon your pod 054 minion. The perfect assistant for adventuring...or it would be, if it worked properly.
#. column 1: Dug up in the depths of a factory fallen to ruin, this diminutive white machina was apparently designed to provide tactical support to a YoRHa. Though equipped with myriad functions, from support fire to advance conversation, none of these are operational at present.
#. column 2: Machines are not to be trusted,<br>least of all those that can think.<br>   - Estinien
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:364:0:3"
msgid "A014: Point Up"
msgstr "A014: Повышение очков"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your pod 054 minion. The perfect assistant for adventuring...or it would be, if it worked properly.
#. column 1: Dug up in the depths of a factory fallen to ruin, this diminutive white machina was apparently designed to provide tactical support to a YoRHa. Though equipped with myriad functions, from support fire to advance conversation, none of these are operational at present.
#. column 2: Machines are not to be trusted,<br>least of all those that can think.<br>   - Estinien
#. column 3: A014: Point Up
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:364:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Повышает на 10 очков особых приёмов у союзников в радиусе действия, кроме миньонов с таким же особым приёмом."

#. ja: ミニオン「ポッド316」を呼び出す。<br>機械遺跡で発見された黒い支援随行ユニット
#. de: Du rufst deinen Pod 316 als Begleiter herbei.<br>Der perfekte Abenteuerbegleiter, wenn er denn ordentlich funktionieren würde.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte pod 316, une unité de support noire découverte dans les ruines mécaniques.
#. column 1: Dug up in the depths of a factory fallen to ruin, this diminutive black machina was apparently designed to provide tactical support to a YoRHa. While most of its functions are no longer operational, it remains determined to attend the object of its support.
#. column 2: Machina are mighty and<br>can smite muchly, yes, but<br>they need fuel.<br>   - Softknox
#. column 3: R014: Speed Up
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:365:0:0"
msgid "Summon your pod 316 minion. The perfect assistant for adventuring...or it would be, if it worked properly."
msgstr "Призвать миньона «Под 316». Идеальный помощник в приключениях... если бы только он работал как надо."

#. ja: 機械遺跡の奥深くにて発見された黒い小型機械。元々、ヨルハ機体の支援随行ユニットとして開発された存在だけに、火器を含む多くの機能が故障してしまった今でも、支援対象に追随することだけはやめようとしない
#. de: Diese schwarze Maschine wurde aus einer alten Fabrikruine geborgen. Vermutlich wurde sie ursprünglich als taktische Unterstützungseinheit für YoRHa erschaffen.
#. fr: Cette unité noire, découverte au fond des ruines mécaniques, était censée servir de support à l'infanterie YoRHa, mais la majorité de ses fonctions ne sont plus opérationnelles. Malgré tout, elle essaye toujours de mener sa mission à bien.
#. column 0: Summon your pod 316 minion. The perfect assistant for adventuring...or it would be, if it worked properly.
#. column 2: Machina are mighty and<br>can smite muchly, yes, but<br>they need fuel.<br>   - Softknox
#. column 3: R014: Speed Up
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:365:0:1"
msgid "Dug up in the depths of a factory fallen to ruin, this diminutive black machina was apparently designed to provide tactical support to a YoRHa. While most of its functions are no longer operational, it remains determined to attend the object of its support."
msgstr "Эту крошечную чёрную машину раскопали в глубине заброшенной фабрики. По всей видимости, она была создана для тактической поддержки бойца ЙорХа. Хотя большая часть функций уже не работает, она всё ещё намерена сопровождать того, кого должна поддерживать."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Maschinen sind mächtig, ja, aber brauchen Treibstoff.<br><i>Sanftbox</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon your pod 316 minion. The perfect assistant for adventuring...or it would be, if it worked properly.
#. column 1: Dug up in the depths of a factory fallen to ruin, this diminutive black machina was apparently designed to provide tactical support to a YoRHa. While most of its functions are no longer operational, it remains determined to attend the object of its support.
#. column 3: R014: Speed Up
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:365:0:2"
msgid "Machina are mighty and<br>can smite muchly, yes, but<br>they need fuel.<br>   - Softknox"
msgstr "Машины сильны и<br>могут здорово бить, но<br>им нужно топливо.<br>   — Софтнокс"

#. ja: R014：スピードアップ
#. de: R014: Ge<shy>schwindig<shy>keitsschub
#. fr: R014<nbsp>: vitesse max
