#. ja: ミニオン「ゴールドタロース」を呼び出す。<br>ダイダロス社製の小型玩具。かつて爆発的人気を誇った
#. de: Du ruftst deinen Gold-Talos als Begleiter herbei. <br>Ein kleines solides Spielzeug aus der Daedalus-Steinhauerei, das selbst ungeschickte Kinderhände schlecht kaputt kriegen können.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte talos d'or, un jouet produit par la Daedalus qui bénéficia à sa sortie d'un succès sans précédent.
#. column 1: During its heyday, Daedalus Stoneworks created this miniature Talos, which boasts true-to-life detail and a premium gold overlay. It proved so popular, the story goes that, to meet demand, the company had to recruit master gilders from all over Norvrandt.
#. column 2: A much smaller Talos from our<br>company could just as easily<br>perform the same task!<br>   - Chai-Nuzz
#. column 3: Golden Crush
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:366:0:0"
msgid "Summon your sungold Talos minion. Guaranteed to make you the envy of collectors and younglings alike."
msgstr "Призвать миньона «Золотой талос». Коллекционеры и дети будут вам завидовать!"

#. ja: ダイダロス社製の小型玩具。同社のタロースを模し、さらに金箔を貼って高級感を演出した。そのデザインが評判を呼び、売れに売れた結果、ノルヴラント全土から金箔職人が集められたという逸話があるほどである
#. de: Die Veredelung mit Blattgold verleiht dieser Miniaturversion eines Talos einen Hauch von Luxus und ist wohl auch der Grund für den überwältigenden Verkaufserfolg dieses Spielzeugs.
#. fr: La Daedalus a produit elle-même ces talos miniatures et est allée jusqu'à les plaquer or pour un aspect des plus luxueux. On raconte que tous les batteurs d'or de Norvrandt furent mis à profit tant le jouet eut du succès.
#. column 0: Summon your sungold Talos minion. Guaranteed to make you the envy of collectors and younglings alike.
#. column 2: A much smaller Talos from our<br>company could just as easily<br>perform the same task!<br>   - Chai-Nuzz
#. column 3: Golden Crush
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:366:0:1"
msgid "During its heyday, Daedalus Stoneworks created this miniature Talos, which boasts true-to-life detail and a premium gold overlay. It proved so popular, the story goes that, to meet demand, the company had to recruit master gilders from all over Norvrandt."
msgstr "В пору своего расцвета компания «Дедал» создала эту миниатюрную копию талоса с безупречной детализацией и покрытием из чистого золота. Игрушка стала настолько популярной, что, по слухам, компании пришлось нанимать мастеров-золотильщиков со всего Норврандта."

#. ja: とーりゃっ！
#. de: Ein kleiner vergoldeter Talos? Wozu soll der gut sein <br><i>Chai-Nuzz</i>
#. fr: Yaaah<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your sungold Talos minion. Guaranteed to make you the envy of collectors and younglings alike.
#. column 1: During its heyday, Daedalus Stoneworks created this miniature Talos, which boasts true-to-life detail and a premium gold overlay. It proved so popular, the story goes that, to meet demand, the company had to recruit master gilders from all over Norvrandt.
#. column 3: Golden Crush
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:366:0:2"
msgid "A much smaller Talos from our<br>company could just as easily<br>perform the same task!<br>   - Chai-Nuzz"
msgstr "Наша компания могла бы<br>сделать талоса куда меньше<br>и он справился бы не хуже!<br>   — Чай-Нуз"

#. ja: ゴールデンクラッシュ
#. de: Goldschlag
#. fr: Pesant d'or
#. column 0: Summon your sungold Talos minion. Guaranteed to make you the envy of collectors and younglings alike.
#. column 1: During its heyday, Daedalus Stoneworks created this miniature Talos, which boasts true-to-life detail and a premium gold overlay. It proved so popular, the story goes that, to meet demand, the company had to recruit master gilders from all over Norvrandt.
#. column 2: A much smaller Talos from our<br>company could just as easily<br>perform the same task!<br>   - Chai-Nuzz
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:366:0:3"
msgid "Golden Crush"
msgstr "Золотой удар"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のゲートに90%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Tor 90<nbsp>% Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls es schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 90% de sa solidité au portail ennemi le plus proche. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your sungold Talos minion. Guaranteed to make you the envy of collectors and younglings alike.
#. column 1: During its heyday, Daedalus Stoneworks created this miniature Talos, which boasts true-to-life detail and a premium gold overlay. It proved so popular, the story goes that, to meet demand, the company had to recruit master gilders from all over Norvrandt.
#. column 2: A much smaller Talos from our<br>company could just as easily<br>perform the same task!<br>   - Chai-Nuzz
#. column 3: Golden Crush
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:366:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable."
msgstr "Наносит ближайшим вражеским воротам урон в размере 90% их прочности. Не действует, если ворота уже разрушены."

#. ja: ミニオン「マローン」を呼び出す。<br>古代生物の幼体。隔絶されたディアデム諸島で生き抜いてきた
#. de: Du rufst deinen Malonen als Begleiter herbei.<br>Er ist ein kleiner Dinosaurier, der es geschafft hat, auf den unwirtlichen Inseln des Diadems zu überleben.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Malone, un petit animal préhistorique qui a survécu sur les îles du Diadème.
#. column 1: A young prehistoric creature found on the Diadem, whose unforgiving environment forged its kind into ruthless predators. For reasons unknown, it saw you as friend instead of food, and began following you. Ever ravenous, it snaps at its own tail whenever it comes into view.
#. column 2: There are too many of them.<br>Too many dinosaurs for us<br>to face alone!<br>   - Vath Braveheart
#. column 3: Spinnosaurus
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:367:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Malone minion. If it weren't following you around, it would be tearing hapless adventurers apart on the Diadem."
msgstr "Призвать миньона Малона. Не будь он рядом с тобой, на Диадеме он разрывал бы на части беспечных авантюристов."

#. ja: ディアデム諸島にて発見された古代生物の幼体。発見者である冒険者にすっかり懐いてしまい、雲海の外へと飛び出すことに。かなりの大食漢で、いつもお腹が空いているらしく、自分の尻尾を見ては食いつこうとする
#. de: Dieser Malone wurde auf einer der Diadem-Inseln gefunden. Obwohl noch nicht ausgewachsen, verfügt er bereits über beachtlichen Appetit. Wenn sein Hunger zu groß wird, beißt er sich manchmal in den eigenen Schwanz.
#. fr: Ce bébé dinosaure a toujours vécu au Diadème, mais l'a quitté après s'être entiché de vous. Esclave de son féroce appétit, il lui arrive souvent de courir après sa propre queue en espérant pouvoir la manger.
#. column 0: Summon your Malone minion. If it weren't following you around, it would be tearing hapless adventurers apart on the Diadem.
#. column 2: There are too many of them.<br>Too many dinosaurs for us<br>to face alone!<br>   - Vath Braveheart
#. column 3: Spinnosaurus
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:367:0:1"
msgid "A young prehistoric creature found on the Diadem, whose unforgiving environment forged its kind into ruthless predators. For reasons unknown, it saw you as friend instead of food, and began following you. Ever ravenous, it snaps at its own tail whenever it comes into view."
msgstr "Это юное доисторическое существо нашли на Диадеме. Суровый край превратил его сородичей в беспощадных хищников. Неизвестно почему, но он увидел в тебе друга, а не обед, и пошёл следом. Он вечно голоден и так и норовит вцепиться в собственный хвост, стоит тому показаться."

#. ja: ダイナソー！
#. de: Die Tiere hier sind seltsam.<br><i>Lyolf</i>
#. fr: Nosaure<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Malone minion. If it weren't following you around, it would be tearing hapless adventurers apart on the Diadem.
#. column 1: A young prehistoric creature found on the Diadem, whose unforgiving environment forged its kind into ruthless predators. For reasons unknown, it saw you as friend instead of food, and began following you. Ever ravenous, it snaps at its own tail whenever it comes into view.
#. column 3: Spinnosaurus
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:367:0:2"
msgid "There are too many of them.<br>Too many dinosaurs for us<br>to face alone!<br>   - Vath Braveheart"
msgstr "Их слишком много.<br>Одним нам<br>с динозаврами не справиться!<br>   — Храбрец ватов"

#. ja: グルグルダイナソー
#. de: Dino-Dynamik
#. fr: Dinomoulinette
