#. ja: ミニオン「草こびと」を呼び出す。<br>草人に似た何か。なぜか動く
#. de: Du rufst dein Grasgrummelchen als Begleiter herbei.<br>Aus unerfindlichen Gründen schüttelt es sich von Zeit zu Zeit.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte enfeuillé miniature. Con<shy>trai<shy>re<shy>ment aux autres de taille normale, il lui arrive parfois de s'ébrouer...
#. column 1: This curious being was found amongst the wares peddled by a pixie playing merchant. While it does bear resemblance to the leafmen scattered across Il Mheg, that it is able to move raises eyebrows, but inquiring after the reason only elicits impish laughter from the pixie.
#. column 2: We're going to get<br>along like a leafman<br>on fire, I just know it!<br>   - Uin Nee
#. column 3: Bush Bash
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:368:0:0"
msgid "Summon your little leafman minion. Definitely a leafman. The pixie said so."
msgstr "Призвать миньона травяного человечка. Самый настоящий травяной человечек. Пикси сказала!"

#. ja: イル・メグにて「広域交易商ごっこ」をしているピクシー族が販売していたシロモノ。見た目としては草人にそっくりだが、こちらはなぜか動く。その正体はいったい何なのか。問いただしても、件のピクシー族はケラケラ笑うばかりである
#. de: Dieses seltsame Lebewesen wurde im „Geschäft“ einer Pixie in Il Mheg angeboten. Es zuckt zuweilen recht merkwürdig. Befragt man die Pixie-Verkäuferin dazu, erntet man nur ein albernes Kichern.
#. fr: Une des “camelotes” qu'une Pixie soi-disant marchande vend en Il Mheg. Les enfeuillés ne sont pas censés gesticuler, et pourtant... Quand on la questionne à ce sujet, la vendeuse se contente de ricaner.
#. column 0: Summon your little leafman minion. Definitely a leafman. The pixie said so.
#. column 2: We're going to get<br>along like a leafman<br>on fire, I just know it!<br>   - Uin Nee
#. column 3: Bush Bash
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:368:0:1"
msgid "This curious being was found amongst the wares peddled by a pixie playing merchant. While it does bear resemblance to the leafmen scattered across Il Mheg, that it is able to move raises eyebrows, but inquiring after the reason only elicits impish laughter from the pixie."
msgstr "Это странное существо нашли среди товаров, которые продавала пикси, играя в торговку. Оно похоже на травяных человечков, что водятся по всему Ил-Мегу, но ведь оно ещё и двигается! А на расспросы пикси лишь хитро хихикает."

#. ja: モシャモシャ…
#. de: Grasgrummelchen rüttel dich, Grasgrummelchen schüttel dich!<br><i>Kichernde Pixie</i>
#. fr: Fshh... Fshhshhshh...
#. column 0: Summon your little leafman minion. Definitely a leafman. The pixie said so.
#. column 1: This curious being was found amongst the wares peddled by a pixie playing merchant. While it does bear resemblance to the leafmen scattered across Il Mheg, that it is able to move raises eyebrows, but inquiring after the reason only elicits impish laughter from the pixie.
#. column 3: Bush Bash
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:368:0:2"
msgid "We're going to get<br>along like a leafman<br>on fire, I just know it!<br>   - Uin Nee"
msgstr "Мы с этим травяным человечком<br>поладим — хоть в огонь за ним!<br>Я прямо чувствую!<br>   — Уин-Ни"

#. ja: モシャモシャ
#. de: Grummelgrummel
#. fr: Fshhshhshh...
#. column 0: Summon your little leafman minion. Definitely a leafman. The pixie said so.
#. column 1: This curious being was found amongst the wares peddled by a pixie playing merchant. While it does bear resemblance to the leafmen scattered across Il Mheg, that it is able to move raises eyebrows, but inquiring after the reason only elicits impish laughter from the pixie.
