#. ja: ミニオン「パイッサ・クリナリアン」を呼び出す。<br>パイッサの幼生体。調理師の助手として修行中
#. de: Du rufst deinen Paissa-Gourmet als Begleiter herbei.<br>Ein junger Paissa in Ausbildung zum Gourmet. Dem kugeligen Aussehen nach zu urteilen auch ein Gourmand.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte païssa cuisinier. Il est petit mais sait déjà se rendre utile en tant qu'apprenti.
#. column 1: This paissa young was found amongst supplies sent from Camp Cloudtop. As punishment for pillaging the victuals, it was put to work in the kitchens, where it surprised everyone by demonstrating an aptitude for the culinary arts. The caramel milk tea it makes is to die for.
#. column 2: They don't come much<br>curiouser than the paissa.<br>   - Noelle
#. column 3: Taste of Infinity
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:372:0:0"
msgid "Summon your paissa patissier minion. Currently in training as a culinarian, and looks the part."
msgstr "Призвать миньона-пайссу-кондитера. Учится на кулинара и уже выглядит как настоящий мастер."

#. ja: キャンプ・クラウドトップの薔薇騎兵団から送られてきた支援物資の中に、紛れ込んでいたパイッサの幼生体。物資内の食料を食い荒らした罰として、調理師の助手として働くことになった。キャラメルミルクティーを作るのが上手い
#. de: Dieser noch junge Paissa hatte es sich in einer der Nahrungsmittelkisten der Rosenkavalleristen in Camp Wolkenwipfel gemütlich gemacht und tüchtig zugelangt. Als Strafe für seine Gier wurde er zum Küchendienst verdonnert.
#. fr: Ce petit païssa s'était caché dans une caisse de vivres envoyée par les chevaliers de la Rose afin d'en dévorer le contenu. Il a ensuite été enrôlé de force pour expier son crime. Il se débrouille bien depuis, et son thé au caramel est un vrai délice.
#. column 0: Summon your paissa patissier minion. Currently in training as a culinarian, and looks the part.
#. column 2: They don't come much<br>curiouser than the paissa.<br>   - Noelle
#. column 3: Taste of Infinity
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:372:0:1"
msgid "This paissa young was found amongst supplies sent from Camp Cloudtop. As punishment for pillaging the victuals, it was put to work in the kitchens, where it surprised everyone by demonstrating an aptitude for the culinary arts. The caramel milk tea it makes is to die for."
msgstr "Этого юного пайссу нашли среди припасов из Лагеря Облачной Вершины. В наказание за набег на провизию его отправили работать на кухню, где он удивил всех кулинарным талантом. А карамельный чай с молоком у него — пальчики оближешь."

#. ja: ……！！
#. de: Paissas sind so dick, weil sie sich auf Lauer legen und dicke Fische von Angel wegschnappen.<br><i>Eenu Vanu</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>!!!
#. column 0: Summon your paissa patissier minion. Currently in training as a culinarian, and looks the part.
#. column 1: This paissa young was found amongst supplies sent from Camp Cloudtop. As punishment for pillaging the victuals, it was put to work in the kitchens, where it surprised everyone by demonstrating an aptitude for the culinary arts. The caramel milk tea it makes is to die for.
#. column 3: Taste of Infinity
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:372:0:2"
msgid "They don't come much<br>curiouser than the paissa.<br>   - Noelle"
msgstr "Пайссы — те ещё<br>чудики.<br>   — Ноэль"

#. ja: 料理の宇宙
#. de: Kochkosmos
#. fr: Univers de la gastronomie
#. column 0: Summon your paissa patissier minion. Currently in training as a culinarian, and looks the part.
#. column 1: This paissa young was found amongst supplies sent from Camp Cloudtop. As punishment for pillaging the victuals, it was put to work in the kitchens, where it surprised everyone by demonstrating an aptitude for the culinary arts. The caramel milk tea it makes is to die for.
#. column 2: They don't come much<br>curiouser than the paissa.<br>   - Noelle
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:372:0:3"
msgid "Taste of Infinity"
msgstr "Вкус бесконечности"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵にかかっている、強化効果をすべて打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle positiven Effekte von den gegnerischen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe tous les effets bénéfiques des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your paissa patissier minion. Currently in training as a culinarian, and looks the part.
#. column 1: This paissa young was found amongst supplies sent from Camp Cloudtop. As punishment for pillaging the victuals, it was put to work in the kitchens, where it surprised everyone by demonstrating an aptitude for the culinary arts. The caramel milk tea it makes is to die for.
#. column 2: They don't come much<br>curiouser than the paissa.<br>   - Noelle
#. column 3: Taste of Infinity
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:372:0:4"
msgid "Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все положительные эффекты со всех противников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「パイッサ・ウィーバー」を呼び出す。<br>パイッサの幼生体。裁縫師の助手として修行中
#. de: Du rufst deinen Paissa-Weber als Begleiter herbei.<br>Ein junger Paissa in Ausbildung zum Weber.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte païssa couturier. Il est petit mais sait déjà se rendre utile en tant qu'apprenti.
#. column 1: When mysterious embroidery began appearing on the garments of her Rose Knights, Lady Laniaitte set out to uncover the perpetrator. Her surveillance led to the capture of this paissa young, which was made to work in Ishgard's restoration as punishment, though it appears happy enough.
#. column 2: Death by ungainly paissa...<br>thought mortifies Vanu worse<br>than forgetting sundrop dance!<br>   - Eenu Vanu
#. column 3: Weave of Infinity
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:373:0:0"
msgid "Summon your paissa threadpuller minion. Currently in training as a weaver, and looks the part."
msgstr "Призвать миньона-пайссу-ткача. Учится на ткача и уже выглядит как настоящий мастер."

#. ja: 薔薇騎兵たちの私服に、夜な夜な手の込んだ刺繍が施されるという謎の連続イタズラ事件が発生。張り込みを行ったラニエット卿が捕縛したのは、このパイッサの幼生体であり、罰として復興事業で働くことになったのである
#. de: Dieser junge Paissa machte sich einen Spaß daraus, heimlich Nacht für Nacht die Uniformen der Rosenkavalleristen mit kunstvollen Stickereien zu versehen. Als Strafe wurde er zum Weberdienst verdonnert.
#. fr: Chaque matin, les chevaliers de la Rose retrouvaient leurs uniformes décorés de mys<shy>té<shy>rieu<shy>ses broderies. Laniaitte mena l'enquête et identifia le coupable, un petit païssa. En guise de punition, l'animal a été enrôlé de force pour aider à la recon<shy>struc<shy>tion.
#. column 0: Summon your paissa threadpuller minion. Currently in training as a weaver, and looks the part.
#. column 2: Death by ungainly paissa...<br>thought mortifies Vanu worse<br>than forgetting sundrop dance!<br>   - Eenu Vanu
#. column 3: Weave of Infinity
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:373:0:1"
msgid "When mysterious embroidery began appearing on the garments of her Rose Knights, Lady Laniaitte set out to uncover the perpetrator. Her surveillance led to the capture of this paissa young, which was made to work in Ishgard's restoration as punishment, though it appears happy enough."
msgstr "Когда на одежде рыцарей Розы стали появляться загадочные вышивки, леди Ланиетт решила найти виновника. Она устроила слежку и поймала этого юного пайссу. В наказание его отправили помогать в восстановлении Ишгарда, хотя, похоже, он совсем не против."

#. ja: ……？？
#. de: Paissas haben es fffaustdick hinter den Ohren. <br><i>Gyoka</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>???
#. column 0: Summon your paissa threadpuller minion. Currently in training as a weaver, and looks the part.
#. column 1: When mysterious embroidery began appearing on the garments of her Rose Knights, Lady Laniaitte set out to uncover the perpetrator. Her surveillance led to the capture of this paissa young, which was made to work in Ishgard's restoration as punishment, though it appears happy enough.
#. column 3: Weave of Infinity
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:373:0:2"
msgid "Death by ungainly paissa...<br>thought mortifies Vanu worse<br>than forgetting sundrop dance!<br>   - Eenu Vanu"
msgstr "Убиться о неуклюжую пайссу...<br>Вату страшнее, чем<br>забыть танец солнечной росы!<br>   — Ину Вану"

