#. column 2: Death by ungainly paissa...<br>thought mortifies Vanu worse<br>than forgetting sundrop dance!<br>   - Eenu Vanu
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:373:0:3"
msgid "Weave of Infinity"
msgstr "Ткацкая бесконечность"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方にかかっている、弱体効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle negativen Effekte von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe toutes les altérations d'état des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your paissa threadpuller minion. Currently in training as a weaver, and looks the part.
#. column 1: When mysterious embroidery began appearing on the garments of her Rose Knights, Lady Laniaitte set out to uncover the perpetrator. Her surveillance led to the capture of this paissa young, which was made to work in Ishgard's restoration as punishment, though it appears happy enough.
#. column 2: Death by ungainly paissa...<br>thought mortifies Vanu worse<br>than forgetting sundrop dance!<br>   - Eenu Vanu
#. column 3: Weave of Infinity
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:373:0:4"
msgid "Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все отрицательные эффекты со всех союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「古代人形」を呼び出す。<br>古代人を模した魔法人形。古代人の玩具と思われる
#. de: Du rufst deine Ascian-Puppe als Begleiter herbei.<br>Eine Puppe, die amaurotanischen Kindern bestimmt viel Freude bereitet hat.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poupée ascienne, sans doute un jouet comme un autre pour l'humanité originelle.
#. column 1: This lifelike miniature of an ancient was recreated from a small concept crystal discovered in Anamnesis Anyder. Though believed to have been some manner of toy, given the towering stature of the ancients, its size is comparable to that of a Lalafellin child.
#. column 2: The challenge of deciphering<br>the wisdom of the ancients<br>is a researcher's dream.<br>   - Y'mhitra
#. column 3: Bewilderment
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:374:0:0"
msgid "Summon your ancient one minion. Small and appearing to be fractured, but whole."
msgstr "Призвать миньона-древнего. С виду маленький и расколотый, а на деле целый."

#. ja: アニドラス・アナムネーシスにて発見された小さなイデア入りクリスタルから再現された品。おそらく、古代人の玩具と思われるが、現代の人に比べると高身長な彼らが創った品だけに、ララフェルに匹敵するサイズを誇る
#. de: Die Puppe wurde aus einem Kristall mit eingeprägter Idee gefertigt, die im Anamnesis Anyder entdeckt wurde. Vermutlich ein Spielzeug der Amaurotaner, was die für eine Puppe beachtliche Größe erklären würde.
#. fr: Cette poupée a été con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>née en prenant pour patron un “concept” que renfermait un cristal de l'Anamnesis Anydre. Malgré sa taille rivalisant avec celle d'un Lalafell, elle devait être un petit jouet aux yeux d'un enfant amaurotain.
#. column 0: Summon your ancient one minion. Small and appearing to be fractured, but whole.
#. column 2: The challenge of deciphering<br>the wisdom of the ancients<br>is a researcher's dream.<br>   - Y'mhitra
#. column 3: Bewilderment
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:374:0:1"
msgid "This lifelike miniature of an ancient was recreated from a small concept crystal discovered in Anamnesis Anyder. Though believed to have been some manner of toy, given the towering stature of the ancients, its size is comparable to that of a Lalafellin child."
msgstr "Эту точную миниатюру древнего воссоздали по небольшому кристаллу с идеей, найденному в Анамнезис Анидере. Считается, что это была игрушка. Древние были рослыми, так что размером она примерно с ребёнка-лаллафелла."

#. ja: ◎◆▽♥
#. de: ◎◆▽♥
#. fr: ◎◆▽♥
#. column 0: Summon your ancient one minion. Small and appearing to be fractured, but whole.
#. column 1: This lifelike miniature of an ancient was recreated from a small concept crystal discovered in Anamnesis Anyder. Though believed to have been some manner of toy, given the towering stature of the ancients, its size is comparable to that of a Lalafellin child.
#. column 3: Bewilderment
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
