#. ja: ミニオン「コマンダー・シャーク」を呼び出す。<br>手足が生えたサメ。コマンドーではない
#. de: Du rufst deinen Haikrieger als Begleiter herbei.<br>Vor einem Hai mit Beinen ist man auch an Land nicht sicher.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte requin commandeur, un poisson doté de bras et de jambes.
#. column 1: “Many heads are so passé. Legs are the wave of the future,” someone did say. Little did they know that there already were sharks that possessed not only legs, but arms besides. How these killing machines came to be, however, is a question left unpondered if you value your sanity.
#. column 2: To think I almost 'ad<br>ye fed to the sharks!<br>   - Rhoswen
#. column 3: Feeding Frenzy
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:375:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Major-General minion. It's a shark. With legs."
msgstr "Призвать миньона генерал-акулы. Это акула. С ногами."

#. ja: 頭を増やす時代は終わった、と誰かが言った。次は足であると。だが、すでに足どころか手まで生えたサメがいたのである。それは古代の殺人兵器なのか、突然変異なのか。深いことを考えるのは止めておこう
#. de: Was wird aus dem gefährlichsten Jäger der Meere, wenn ihm Beine und sogar Arme wachsen? Das muss sich wohl irgendjemand gedacht haben, als er diesen Hai erschuf. Ob er für den Krieg eingesetzt werden sollte, ist nicht bekannt.
#. fr: Un homme dit un jour<nbsp>: “Nos requins ont assez de têtes, ce qui leur faut, c'est plus de pieds.” Ce spécimen bipède l'aurait bien surpris. “Concept” amaurotain pour une arme<nbsp>? Mutation spontanée<nbsp>? Nulle ne le sait, et il vaut sûrement mieux l'ignorer.
#. column 0: Summon your Major-General minion. It's a shark. With legs.
#. column 2: To think I almost 'ad<br>ye fed to the sharks!<br>   - Rhoswen
#. column 3: Feeding Frenzy
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:375:0:1"
msgid "“Many heads are so passé. Legs are the wave of the future,” someone did say. Little did they know that there already were sharks that possessed not only legs, but arms besides. How these killing machines came to be, however, is a question left unpondered if you value your sanity."
msgstr "«Много голов — уже не модно. Будущее за ногами», — сказал кто-то. И не знал, что акулы уже обзавелись не только ногами, но и руками. Откуда взялись эти машины для убийства? Если дорожите рассудком, лучше не задавайтесь этим вопросом."

#. ja: シャーーッ！
#. de: Achtung, ein Hai!<br><i>Dryskthota</i>
#. fr: GRRAAÔÔÔ<nbsp>!!!
#. column 0: Summon your Major-General minion. It's a shark. With legs.
#. column 1: “Many heads are so passé. Legs are the wave of the future,” someone did say. Little did they know that there already were sharks that possessed not only legs, but arms besides. How these killing machines came to be, however, is a question left unpondered if you value your sanity.
#. column 3: Feeding Frenzy
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:375:0:2"
msgid "To think I almost 'ad<br>ye fed to the sharks!<br>   - Rhoswen"
msgstr "Подумать только, я ведь чуть было<br>не скормил вас акулам!<br>   — Росвен"

#. ja: 地獄の殺人部隊
#. de: Höllenjäger
#. fr: Assassins des enfers
#. column 0: Summon your Major-General minion. It's a shark. With legs.
#. column 1: “Many heads are so passé. Legs are the wave of the future,” someone did say. Little did they know that there already were sharks that possessed not only legs, but arms besides. How these killing machines came to be, however, is a question left unpondered if you value your sanity.
#. column 2: To think I almost 'ad<br>ye fed to the sharks!<br>   - Rhoswen
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:375:0:3"
msgid "Feeding Frenzy"
msgstr "Кормёжка акул"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et les projette en arrière.
#. column 0: Summon your Major-General minion. It's a shark. With legs.
#. column 1: “Many heads are so passé. Legs are the wave of the future,” someone did say. Little did they know that there already were sharks that possessed not only legs, but arms besides. How these killing machines came to be, however, is a question left unpondered if you value your sanity.
#. column 2: To think I almost 'ad<br>ye fed to the sharks!<br>   - Rhoswen
#. column 3: Feeding Frenzy
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:375:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 90 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ドゥリア」を呼び出す。<br>ドゥリア・チャイを模した魔法人形。まあまあまあ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Dulia-Chai-Puppe als Begleiter herbei.<br>Einfach ein „entzückendes Püppchen“, wie die werte Frau Chai sie beschreiben würde.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Dulia-Chai miniature, un pantin à l'effigie d'une Eulmorienne folle amoureuse de son mari.
#. column 1: On the occasion of their twentieth anniversary, Chai-Nuzz gifted his wife her mammet likeness, which he made using Talos construction techniques. It was subsequently presented to the departing Warrior of Darkness as a memento─with one small addition.
#. column 2: Dear─ Dearest─<br>I─ I can't─<br>   - Chai-Nuzz
#. column 3: Crush of Love
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:376:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Dulia-Chai minion. Complete with asphyxiated Chai-Nuzz."
msgstr "Призвать заводную Дулию-Чай. Чай-Нузз задохнётся от восторга."

#. ja: ドゥリア・チャイを模した魔法人形。チャイ・ヌズがタロースの技術を転用して製作し、結婚20周年記念に夫人に贈ったもの。そこに夫人が最愛の夫の人形を自作して持たせた上、帰郷する「闇の戦士」に彼らを忘れぬようにと送ったという
#. de: Diese Puppe fertigte Meister Chai-Nuzz seiner Gattin zum zwanzigsten Jahrestag ihrer Hochzeit an, wozu er all seine Kenntnisse im Taloi-Bau aufbot. Davon inspiriert nahm Dulia-Chai Nadel und Faden in die Hand und überreichte sie dir mit den Worten „Damit du uns niemals vergisst“.
#. fr: Chai-Nuzz fit produire ce pantin dans une de ses fabriques à talos pour ses vingt ans de mariage. Sa femme y ajouta une poupée de lui cousue de ses propres mains, puis elle vous en fit cadeau afin que vous n'oubliiez jamais les Chai.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Dulia-Chai minion. Complete with asphyxiated Chai-Nuzz.
#. column 2: Dear─ Dearest─<br>I─ I can't─<br>   - Chai-Nuzz
#. column 3: Crush of Love
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:376:0:1"
msgid "On the occasion of their twentieth anniversary, Chai-Nuzz gifted his wife her mammet likeness, which he made using Talos construction techniques. It was subsequently presented to the departing Warrior of Darkness as a memento─with one small addition."
msgstr "К двадцатой годовщине свадьбы Чай-Нузз подарил жене её кукольную копию, изготовленную по технологии создания талосов. Перед отъездом куклу вручили Воину Тьмы на память — с одним небольшим дополнением."

#. ja: まあまあまあ！
#. de: Wie viel Arbeit mein Liebster darein gesteckt hat!<br><i>Dulia-Chai</i>
#. fr: Oooh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Dulia-Chai minion. Complete with asphyxiated Chai-Nuzz.
#. column 1: On the occasion of their twentieth anniversary, Chai-Nuzz gifted his wife her mammet likeness, which he made using Talos construction techniques. It was subsequently presented to the departing Warrior of Darkness as a memento─with one small addition.
#. column 3: Crush of Love
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:376:0:2"
msgid "Dear─ Dearest─<br>I─ I can't─<br>   - Chai-Nuzz"
msgstr "Милый... Любимый...<br>Я... не могу...<br>   — Чай-Нузз"

#. ja: 愛の抱擁
#. de: Erdrückende Liebe
#. fr: Étreinte passionnelle
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Dulia-Chai minion. Complete with asphyxiated Chai-Nuzz.
#. column 1: On the occasion of their twentieth anniversary, Chai-Nuzz gifted his wife her mammet likeness, which he made using Talos construction techniques. It was subsequently presented to the departing Warrior of Darkness as a memento─with one small addition.
#. column 2: Dear─ Dearest─<br>I─ I can't─<br>   - Chai-Nuzz
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:376:0:3"
msgid "Crush of Love"
msgstr "Любовные объятия"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、1秒ごとに10の継続ダメージを与える。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>20秒
#. de: Fügt Gegnern in der Nähe im Sekundentakt 10 Schaden über Zeit zu.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 Sekunden
#. fr: Inflige 10 points de dégâts périodiques par seconde aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Dulia-Chai minion. Complete with asphyxiated Chai-Nuzz.
#. column 1: On the occasion of their twentieth anniversary, Chai-Nuzz gifted his wife her mammet likeness, which he made using Talos construction techniques. It was subsequently presented to the departing Warrior of Darkness as a memento─with one small addition.
#. column 2: Dear─ Dearest─<br>I─ I can't─<br>   - Chai-Nuzz
#. column 3: Crush of Love
