#. ja: ミニオン「アンラッキーラビット」を呼び出す。<br>酸いも甘いも知り尽くしたウサギの魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deinen Unglückshasen als Begleiter herbei.<br>Ein Hase, der die Höhen und Tiefen des Lebens kennt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte lapin malchanceux, une poupée qui a eu des hauts et des bas.
#. column 1: Born of an idea proposed by Godbert Manderville, this leporine mammet proved tremendously popular in Ul'dah, but questions of ownership rights led to it serving as the mascot of the Platinum Mirage for a spell. It eventually returned to the Gold Saucer after legal matters were settled.
#. column 2: The damn things reproduce<br>faster than rabbits in heat.<br>   - Raganher
#. column 3: What's Up
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:379:0:0"
msgid "Summon your unlucky rabbit minion. Has known the bitterest lows and the sweetest highs."
msgstr "Призвать миньона невезучего кролика. Познал и горечь поражений, и сладость побед."

#. ja: ゴッドベルト氏が考案したウサギを模した魔法人形。ウルダハで爆発的な人気を得たが、複雑な権利上の問題から、しばらくプラチナミラージュのマスコットをやっていた。その後、権利が取り戻されゴールドソーサーに復帰したという
#. de: Dieser Hase, eine Kreation des talentierten Godbert, erfreute sich großer Beliebtheit in Ul'dah, doch wegen urheberrechtlichen Problemen war er eine Zeit lang nur als Maskottchen im Palais Platin anzutreffen.
#. fr: Ce pantin imaginé par le grand Godbert bénéficiait d'une forte popularité à Ul'dah à sa sortie. Relégué un temps au rang de mascotte du Mirage de platine en raison d'un obscur problème de droit à l'image, il fit son retour au Gold Saucer une fois l'affaire résolue.
#. column 0: Summon your unlucky rabbit minion. Has known the bitterest lows and the sweetest highs.
#. column 2: The damn things reproduce<br>faster than rabbits in heat.<br>   - Raganher
#. column 3: What's Up
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:379:0:1"
msgid "Born of an idea proposed by Godbert Manderville, this leporine mammet proved tremendously popular in Ul'dah, but questions of ownership rights led to it serving as the mascot of the Platinum Mirage for a spell. It eventually returned to the Gold Saucer after legal matters were settled."
msgstr "Эта механическая кукла-кролик появилась на свет благодаря идее Годберта Мандервиля. Она стала невероятно популярна в Ульде, но из-за споров о правах какое-то время служила талисманом Платинового Миража. Когда вопрос уладили, кролик вернулся в Золотое Блюдце."

#. ja: どったの？
#. de: Jeder verdient die Chance, im Gold Saucer zu arbeiten.<br><i>Godbert Manderville</i>
#. fr: Quoi de neuf<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your unlucky rabbit minion. Has known the bitterest lows and the sweetest highs.
