#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ミステル」を呼び出す。<br>名もなきミステル族の魔法人形。誰を模しているのかは言わぬが花……
#. de: Du rufst deine Mystel-Puppe als Begleiter herbei.<br>Eine zauberhafte Marionettenversion eines Mystel, der dir bekannt vorkommt. Mit ihr hast du stets einen Freund an deiner Seite.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Mystel miniature, une poupée magique dont le véritable nom ne doit pas être prononcé, selon la volonté de son modèle.
#. column 1: Desiring to honor a certain individual with a mammet likeness but knowing that it would go against his wishes to do so, the artisans of the Crystalline Mean came up with the perfect solution: make a mammet likeness anyway but give it a vague name. That makes everything all right...right?
#. column 2: By any other name,<br>I would still be a rose!<br>   - Masked Rose
#. column 3: Wisdom of Allag
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:381:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Mystel minion. Modeled upon no one in particular. No, really."
msgstr "Призвать заводного миньона-мистеля. Ни с кого конкретно не скопирован. Нет, правда."

#. ja: 誰を模しているのかは明らかだが、あの人は自身が偶像となることを望まないと皆が知っていた。だからこそ、それぞれが彼との想い出を偲ぶことができるようにと、ミーン工芸館の職人たちは、名もなきミステル族の魔法人形として作ったのである
#. de: In dieser Marionette steckt das Herzblut eines jeden einzelnen Handwerkers der Manufaktur der Gemeinschaft. Wörter reichen ihnen nicht, um den einstigen Herren des Crystariums zu ehren und Statuen genügen ihnen nicht, um seiner zu gedenken.
#. fr: Conscients de la volonté de leur modèle de ne pas être reconverti en idole, les artisans de la halle du Juste sont tout de même parvenus à faire émerger ne serait-ce qu'un petit fragment de l'essence de l'illustre personnage dans cette poupée miniature à l'effigie d'un Mystel.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Mystel minion. Modeled upon no one in particular. No, really.
#. column 2: By any other name,<br>I would still be a rose!<br>   - Masked Rose
#. column 3: Wisdom of Allag
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:381:0:1"
msgid "Desiring to honor a certain individual with a mammet likeness but knowing that it would go against his wishes to do so, the artisans of the Crystalline Mean came up with the perfect solution: make a mammet likeness anyway but give it a vague name. That makes everything all right...right?"
msgstr "Ремесленники Кристального Центра хотели почтить одного человека его кукольной копией, но знали, что он этого не одобрил бы. Они нашли идеальное решение: всё равно сделали куклу, но дали ей расплывчатое название. Теперь-то всё в порядке... да?"

#. ja: 時ガキタラバ、立チ上ガレ！
#. de: Die Zeit zum Aufstand wird kommen.<br><i>Kristall<shy>exarch</i>
#. fr: Le moment venu, j'aurai besoin de vous à mes côtés...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Mystel minion. Modeled upon no one in particular. No, really.
#. column 1: Desiring to honor a certain individual with a mammet likeness but knowing that it would go against his wishes to do so, the artisans of the Crystalline Mean came up with the perfect solution: make a mammet likeness anyway but give it a vague name. That makes everything all right...right?
#. column 3: Wisdom of Allag
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:381:0:2"
msgid "By any other name,<br>I would still be a rose!<br>   - Masked Rose"
msgstr "Как розу ни назови,<br>она всё равно роза!<br>   — Роза в маске"

#. ja: アラグの秘術
#. de: Wissen der Allager
#. fr: Secret d'Allag
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Mystel minion. Modeled upon no one in particular. No, really.
#. column 1: Desiring to honor a certain individual with a mammet likeness but knowing that it would go against his wishes to do so, the artisans of the Crystalline Mean came up with the perfect solution: make a mammet likeness anyway but give it a vague name. That makes everything all right...right?
