msgstr "Повышает защиту всех союзников в радиусе действия на 10 (на 30, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>кукла</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・アルバート」を呼び出す。<br>アルバートを模した魔法人形。わかれよッ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Ardbert als Begleiter herbei.<br>Auf seine Axt kannst du dich stets verlassen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Ardbert miniature, une poupée magique qui ressent fortement le besoin d'être comprise.
#. column 1: This mammet was created to honor Ardbert, the hero who fought to save the First as a Warrior of Light and Darkness both. His spirit lives on in all who has ever thought to lend a helping hand to his fellow man.
#. column 2: As brightly as a hero's tale shines,<br>it is not without its shadows.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
#. column 3: Hero's Pledge
#. column 4: Renders ally Gates, Shield, and Search Eye impervious to damage.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:382:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Ardbert minion. What he lacks in size, he makes up for in heart...and his disproportionately large axe."
msgstr "Призвать заводного Ардберта. Чего ему недостаёт в росте, с лихвой восполняет его сердце... и несоразмерно огромный топор."

#. ja: 光の戦士にして、闇の戦士たるアルバートを模した魔法人形。第一世界を救うために戦い続けた彼の偉業を、決して忘れないために作られた。その想いは、魂を託された者によって、たしかに継がれてゆくことだろう
#. de: Die Marionette ist eine naturgetreue Darstellung von Ardbert, Krieger des Lichts und der Dunkelheit. Auf dass das Opfer, das er für den ersten Splitter brachte, niemals wieder in Vergessenheit gerät.
#. fr: Le combat éprouvant d'Ardbert, Guerrier de la Lumière devenu celui des Ténèbres sous l'impulsion du destin, a fourni son salut au premier reflet. Cette poupée magique a été créée afin qu'il ne tombe jamais dans l'oubli.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ardbert minion. What he lacks in size, he makes up for in heart...and his disproportionately large axe.
#. column 2: As brightly as a hero's tale shines,<br>it is not without its shadows.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
#. column 3: Hero's Pledge
#. column 4: Renders ally Gates, Shield, and Search Eye impervious to damage.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:382:0:1"
msgid "This mammet was created to honor Ardbert, the hero who fought to save the First as a Warrior of Light and Darkness both. His spirit lives on in all who has ever thought to lend a helping hand to his fellow man."
msgstr "Эту куклу создали в честь Ардберта, героя, сражавшегося за спасение Первого осколка как Воин Света и Воин Тьмы. Его дух живёт в каждом, кто хоть раз хотел протянуть ближнему руку помощи."

#. ja: ワカルダロ…ワカレヨッ！
#. de: Ob du es glaubst oder nicht, ich habe auch noch andere Dinge zu tun, als dir überallhin zu folgen.<br><i>Ardbert</i>
#. fr: Tu vois forcément ce que je veux dire, toi<nbsp>! Tu me comprends, non<nbsp>!?
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ardbert minion. What he lacks in size, he makes up for in heart...and his disproportionately large axe.
#. column 1: This mammet was created to honor Ardbert, the hero who fought to save the First as a Warrior of Light and Darkness both. His spirit lives on in all who has ever thought to lend a helping hand to his fellow man.
#. column 3: Hero's Pledge
#. column 4: Renders ally Gates, Shield, and Search Eye impervious to damage.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:382:0:2"
msgid "As brightly as a hero's tale shines,<br>it is not without its shadows.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel"
msgstr "Как ярко ни сияет<br>сказание о герое,<br>в нём найдутся тени.<br>   — Странствующий менестрель"

#. ja: 英雄との約束
#. de: Heldenversprechen
#. fr: Promesse des héros
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Ardbert minion. What he lacks in size, he makes up for in heart...and his disproportionately large axe.
#. column 1: This mammet was created to honor Ardbert, the hero who fought to save the First as a Warrior of Light and Darkness both. His spirit lives on in all who has ever thought to lend a helping hand to his fellow man.
#. column 2: As brightly as a hero's tale shines,<br>it is not without its shadows.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
#. column 4: Renders ally Gates, Shield, and Search Eye impervious to damage.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:382:0:3"
msgid "Hero's Pledge"
msgstr "Обет героя"

#. ja: 自軍のゲート、シールド、サーチ・アイを、すべての攻撃に対して無敵にする。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>20秒
#. de: Macht die eigenen Einrichtungen (Tore, Schild und Suchendes Auge) unempfindlich für alle Angriffe.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 Sekunden
#. fr: Rend vos portails, votre bouclier et votre œil scrutateur invulnérables à toutes les attaques.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
