#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:383:0:2"
msgid "Did that man just bring down<br>flying armor with a single stroke<br><i>in midair</i>?<br>   - Aymeric"
msgstr "Этот человек только что одним ударом<br>сбил летающую броню — да ещё и<br><i>на лету</i>?<br>   — Эймерик"

#. ja: エアガン
#. de: Luftangriff
#. fr: Canon à air comprimé
#. column 0: Summon your magitek helldiver F1 minion. Minimal firepower, maximum attitude.
#. column 1: Although a single-rider flying machina like the sky armor, the helldiver is an entirely different beast to handle due to its fundamentally distinct design. Thus were such scale models produced, that would-be pilots might study their flight dynamics prior to taking the helm.
#. column 2: Did that man just bring down<br>flying armor with a single stroke<br><i>in midair</i>?<br>   - Aymeric
#. column 4: Delivers 10% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:383:0:3"
msgid "Air Gun"
msgstr "Воздушная пушка"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のアルカナストーンに、10%のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Arkana-Stein 5 % Schaden zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 10% de sa solidité à la pierre arcanique ennemie la plus proche.
#. column 0: Summon your magitek helldiver F1 minion. Minimal firepower, maximum attitude.
#. column 1: Although a single-rider flying machina like the sky armor, the helldiver is an entirely different beast to handle due to its fundamentally distinct design. Thus were such scale models produced, that would-be pilots might study their flight dynamics prior to taking the helm.
#. column 2: Did that man just bring down<br>flying armor with a single stroke<br><i>in midair</i>?<br>   - Aymeric
#. column 3: Air Gun
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:383:0:4"
msgid "Delivers 10% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone."
msgstr "Наносит ближайшему вражескому арканному камню урон в размере 10% его прочности."

#. ja: ミニオン「もちもちゲイラキャット」を呼び出す。<br>もちもちに育ったゲイラキャット。その香りは、干したシーツの香り
#. de: Du rufst deine Geira-Flauschekatze als Begleiter herbei.<br>Wer ist ein weiches Kätzchen?!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte gaélichat emmitouflé, un félin volant qui sent bon comme des draps propres.
#. column 1: It is theorized that the gaelicat's garb is no garb at all, but an extension of its corporeal form. That this specimen appears to be wearing a winter coat is the result of its adaptation to Coerthan climes, while its ample girth came about via a more mundane process: overeating.
#. column 2: There is no creature so<br>heavenly as the cat!<br>   - Feline Fanatic
#. column 3: Fluff-housing
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 13%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:384:0:0"
msgid "Summon your weatherproof gaelicat minion. Makes you feel toasty warm simply to behold it."
msgstr "Призвать миньона непромокаемого гаэликэта. От одного взгляда на него становится тепло и уютно."

#. ja: もちもちに育ったゲイラキャット。寒冷地に適応するためか、皮下脂肪を蓄えた上で、なぜか防寒着のようなものを着込んでいる。だが、これを脱がそうとしてはならない。強引に事を運べば、トラウマを抱えることになるだろう
#. de: Gelehrte und Studierte vermuten, dass diese Geira-Katzenart in extrem kalten Gefilden beheimatet ist. Ob ihr possierliches Äußeres nun Fett, Fell oder ein Mäntelchen ist, konnte aufgrund scharfer Krallen bislang nicht festgestellt werden.
#. fr: L'embonpoint de ce gaélichat le protège déjà suf<shy>fi<shy>sam<shy>ment du froid, mais il ne retirerait sa confortable doudoune pour rien au monde. Le traumatisme qui en résulterait serait bien trop grand.
#. column 0: Summon your weatherproof gaelicat minion. Makes you feel toasty warm simply to behold it.
#. column 2: There is no creature so<br>heavenly as the cat!<br>   - Feline Fanatic
#. column 3: Fluff-housing
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 13%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:384:0:1"
msgid "It is theorized that the gaelicat's garb is no garb at all, but an extension of its corporeal form. That this specimen appears to be wearing a winter coat is the result of its adaptation to Coerthan climes, while its ample girth came about via a more mundane process: overeating."
msgstr "Считается, что одежда гаэликэта — вовсе не одежда, а часть его тела. Этот экземпляр будто укутан в зимнюю шубку, потому что приспособился к холодному климата Кертаса. А упитался он по куда более прозаичной причине: переедает."

#. ja: モッチモチ！
#. de: Je weicher, desto wilder das Temperament.<br><i>Laniaitte Haillenarte</i>
#. fr: Kshhh<nbsp>!!!
#. column 0: Summon your weatherproof gaelicat minion. Makes you feel toasty warm simply to behold it.
#. column 1: It is theorized that the gaelicat's garb is no garb at all, but an extension of its corporeal form. That this specimen appears to be wearing a winter coat is the result of its adaptation to Coerthan climes, while its ample girth came about via a more mundane process: overeating.
#. column 3: Fluff-housing
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 13%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
