#. ja: ミニオン「幻影のネクロマンサー」を呼び出す。<br>幻光のネクロマンサーを模した幻影。死体は操らない
#. de: Du rufst deine illusionäre Phantom-Nekromantin als Begleiter herbei. Tote beschwört sie keine, denn es handelt sich schließlich um eine bloße Illusion.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte nécromancienne évanescente, une réplique miniature de la nécromancienne spectrale qui ne ranime pas les morts.
#. column 1: As a token of gratitude for playing with them, a pixie created for you this miniature version of the spectral necromancer, the hero from a distant world whom you fought. Whoever that mysterious maiden may have been, her tale may never be known.
#. column 2: If you go and die on me, I'll pay a <br>necromancer to raise you from the<br>dead so I can kill you out of spite!<br>   - Renda-Rae
#. column 3: Necromancy
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:385:0:0"
msgid "Summon your ephemeral necromancer minion. If it could, it would summon forth an army of equally adorable undead."
msgstr "Призвать миньона призрачной некромантки. Умей он это, вызвал бы целую армию таких же милых мертвецов."

#. ja: 幻光のネクロマンサーの姿を目撃したピクシー族が、遊んでくれたお礼にと紡いだ幻影。なお、モデルとなった女性も、いずれかの世界において悪と戦った英雄のひとりなのであろう。だが、その名も来歴も知るすべはない
#. de: Eine Pixie erschuf dieses Trugbild einer Phantom-Nekromantin, um ihr dafür zu danken, sich als Spielpartnerin zur Verfügung gestellt zu haben. Die Frau, die Modell stand, soll gegen das Böse heldenhaft gekämpft haben.
#. fr: Les Pixies ont créé ce double miniature de la nécromancienne spectrale pour la remercier d'avoir joué avec elles. La femme qui leur a servi de modèle serait une héroïne ayant combattu les forces du mal dans un autre monde, mais personne ne se souvient de son nom.
#. column 0: Summon your ephemeral necromancer minion. If it could, it would summon forth an army of equally adorable undead.
#. column 2: If you go and die on me, I'll pay a <br>necromancer to raise you from the<br>dead so I can kill you out of spite!<br>   - Renda-Rae
#. column 3: Necromancy
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:385:0:1"
msgid "As a token of gratitude for playing with them, a pixie created for you this miniature version of the spectral necromancer, the hero from a distant world whom you fought. Whoever that mysterious maiden may have been, her tale may never be known."
msgstr "В благодарность за то, что ты с ними поиграл, пикси создали для тебя миниатюрную копию призрачной некромантки — героини из далёкого мира, с которой ты сражался. Кто была эта загадочная девушка, мы, похоже, так и не узнаем."

#. ja: ♪
#. de: Wenn ihr dabei draufgeht, werde ich einen Totenbeschwörer anheuern, um euch wiederzubeleben, damit ich euch zur Strafe noch mal töten kann! <br><i>Renda-Rae</i>
#. fr: ♪
#. column 0: Summon your ephemeral necromancer minion. If it could, it would summon forth an army of equally adorable undead.
#. column 1: As a token of gratitude for playing with them, a pixie created for you this miniature version of the spectral necromancer, the hero from a distant world whom you fought. Whoever that mysterious maiden may have been, her tale may never be known.
#. column 3: Necromancy
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:385:0:2"
msgid "If you go and die on me, I'll pay a <br>necromancer to raise you from the<br>dead so I can kill you out of spite!<br>   - Renda-Rae"
msgstr "Если ты вздумаешь умереть,<br>я найму некроманта, чтобы он<br>вернул тебя с того света.<br>А потом сама тебя прикончу!<br>   — Ренда-Рей"

#. ja: ネクロマンシー
#. de: Nekromantie
#. fr: Nécromancie
#. column 0: Summon your ephemeral necromancer minion. If it could, it would summon forth an army of equally adorable undead.
#. column 1: As a token of gratitude for playing with them, a pixie created for you this miniature version of the spectral necromancer, the hero from a distant world whom you fought. Whoever that mysterious maiden may have been, her tale may never be known.
#. column 2: If you go and die on me, I'll pay a <br>necromancer to raise you from the<br>dead so I can kill you out of spite!<br>   - Renda-Rae
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:385:0:3"
msgid "Necromancy"
msgstr "Некромантия"

#. ja: シールドが破壊されていた場合、復活させる。
#. de: Stellt einen zerstörten Schild wieder her.
#. fr: Rétablit votre bouclier s'il a été détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your ephemeral necromancer minion. If it could, it would summon forth an army of equally adorable undead.
#. column 1: As a token of gratitude for playing with them, a pixie created for you this miniature version of the spectral necromancer, the hero from a distant world whom you fought. Whoever that mysterious maiden may have been, her tale may never be known.
#. column 2: If you go and die on me, I'll pay a <br>necromancer to raise you from the<br>dead so I can kill you out of spite!<br>   - Renda-Rae
#. column 3: Necromancy
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:385:0:4"
msgid "Instantly restores damaged ally Shield."
msgstr "Мгновенно восстанавливает разрушенный союзный щит."

#. ja: ミニオン「アラガンメロン」を呼び出す。<br>たっぷりと水分を含んだスイカ。なぜか動く
#. de: Du rufst deine allagische Melone als Begleiter herbei.<br>Warum bewegt sich diese Melone von alleine?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte melon allagois, un fruit autonome riche en vitamines.
#. column 1: Since ancient times, melons have been favored in many cultures as nature's drinking flask. Not satisfied with merely their thirst-quenching property, however, Allagan scientists set out to make them portable, and this self-propelled melon is the fruit of their labors.
#. column 2: And you say his muscles swelled<br>to bursting, like firm melons<br>ripening in the summer sun!?<br>   - Company Muscle
#. column 3: Melon Mine
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 270 to all enemies within range.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:386:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Allagan melon minion. Capable of movement and tremendously juicy."
msgstr "Призвать миньона аллаганской дыни. Очень сочная и умеет передвигаться."

#. ja: 死後の旅路における水筒として墓に供える風習があったことからも解るように、古来よりスイカは飲用水として利用されてきた。だが、スイカを持ち運ぶのは不便だ。そこでアラグの農学者は、自動追尾機能を付与したのである
#. de: Schon in grauer Vorzeit dienten Melonen als Wasserbehälter und wurden gerne als Grabbeigaben mitgegeben, um die Reise ins Jenseits zu erleichtern. Den Allagern waren die großen Früchte jedoch zu schwer, also musste eine Lösung her.
#. fr: Offrir aux morts de quoi boire durant leur voyage par-delà la vie est une coutume répandue, et le melon est un fruit gorgé d'eau, mais il n'en reste pas moins lourd à transporter. C'est ainsi que les agronomes allagois ont eu l'idée de mettre au point cette variété autonome.
#. column 0: Summon your Allagan melon minion. Capable of movement and tremendously juicy.
#. column 2: And you say his muscles swelled<br>to bursting, like firm melons<br>ripening in the summer sun!?<br>   - Company Muscle
#. column 3: Melon Mine
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 270 to all enemies within range.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:386:0:1"
msgid "Since ancient times, melons have been favored in many cultures as nature's drinking flask. Not satisfied with merely their thirst-quenching property, however, Allagan scientists set out to make them portable, and this self-propelled melon is the fruit of their labors."
msgstr "С древних времён во многих культурах дыни служили природными флягами. Аллаганским учёным было мало их способности утолять жажду — они решили сделать дыни переносными. Так и появилась эта дыня, которая передвигается сама."

#. ja: ゴロリン、ゴロゴロ…
#. de: So wunderbar grrroß und rrrund!<br><i>Miezekätzchen</i>
#. fr: Bulun, bulun...
#. column 0: Summon your Allagan melon minion. Capable of movement and tremendously juicy.
#. column 1: Since ancient times, melons have been favored in many cultures as nature's drinking flask. Not satisfied with merely their thirst-quenching property, however, Allagan scientists set out to make them portable, and this self-propelled melon is the fruit of their labors.
#. column 3: Melon Mine
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 270 to all enemies within range.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:386:0:2"
msgid "And you say his muscles swelled<br>to bursting, like firm melons<br>ripening in the summer sun!?<br>   - Company Muscle"
msgstr "И ты говоришь, его мускулы<br>раздулись до предела —<br>как спелые дыни под солнцем!?<br>   — Мускул роты"

#. ja: スイカ爆弾
#. de: Melonenbombe
#. fr: Melon explosif
#. column 0: Summon your Allagan melon minion. Capable of movement and tremendously juicy.
#. column 1: Since ancient times, melons have been favored in many cultures as nature's drinking flask. Not satisfied with merely their thirst-quenching property, however, Allagan scientists set out to make them portable, and this self-propelled melon is the fruit of their labors.
#. column 2: And you say his muscles swelled<br>to bursting, like firm melons<br>ripening in the summer sun!?<br>   - Company Muscle
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 270 to all enemies within range.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:386:0:3"
msgid "Melon Mine"
msgstr "Мина-дыня"

#. ja: トラップを配置する。10秒後トラップ発動ボタンにより起爆可能。範囲内にいる敵にATK270のダメージを与える。
#. de: Stellt eine Falle auf, die nach 10 Sekunden ausgelöst werden kann. Bewirkt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 270 auf die Gegner in der Nähe.
#. fr: Place un piège qui peut être déclenché 10 secondes plus tard.<br>Piège<nbsp>: inflige des dégâts d'attaque 270 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
