msgstr "Устанавливает ловушку, которая при срабатывании наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия удар силой 270.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Задержка срабатывания:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「サンドフォックス」を呼び出す。<br>千年生きた妖狐の子孫。好物はバーチシロップ
#. de: Du rufst deinen Sandfuchs als Begleiter herbei.<br>So klein und doch so gefräßig<nbsp>...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte renard des sables, un descendant d'un renard légendaire qui adore le sirop de bouleau.
#. column 1: The descendant of a thousand-year-old vulpine spirit, this creature dreamed of training under the tutelage of its legendary forebear, Sotan. Alas, it was turned away, and ended up taking you as its master instead. Though it will devour most anything you give it, it has grown fond of birch syrup.
#. column 2: You can't smoke out<br>a fox with hot air.<br>   - Bran
#. column 3: Burrow
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:387:0:0"
msgid "Summon your sand fox minion. Will perform tricks for a lick of birch syrup."
msgstr "Призовите песчаного лиса. Он готов показывать фокусы за глоток берёзового сиропа."

#. ja: 千年生きた妖狐の子孫。伝説的な先祖ソウタンに弟子入りを志願するも、あっけなく断られた結果、冒険者を新たな師と仰ぐことに決めたらしい。雑食性で肉も果実も食べるが、最近は特にバーチシロップの味にご執心らしい
#. de: Der Nachkomme einer uralten Wolfsart. Eigentlich wollte er sich dem großen Sotan anschließen, doch dieser schüttelte nur schweigend den Kopf. Stattdessen hat sich der Fuchs ein neues Vorbild gesucht<nbsp>- dich!
#. fr: Son aïeul Sotan n'ayant pas voulu prendre ce pauvre renard sous son égide, il a bien été obligé de se trouver un nouveau maître, et a jeté son dévolu sur les aventuriers. Il mange de tout avec un appétit vorace, mais le sirop de bouleau est de loin son péché le plus mignon.
#. column 0: Summon your sand fox minion. Will perform tricks for a lick of birch syrup.
#. column 2: You can't smoke out<br>a fox with hot air.<br>   - Bran
#. column 3: Burrow
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:387:0:1"
msgid "The descendant of a thousand-year-old vulpine spirit, this creature dreamed of training under the tutelage of its legendary forebear, Sotan. Alas, it was turned away, and ended up taking you as its master instead. Though it will devour most anything you give it, it has grown fond of birch syrup."
msgstr "Потомок лисьего духа, прожившего тысячу лет. Он мечтал обучаться у своего легендарного предка Сотана, но тот его прогнал, и теперь лисёнок считает своим наставником вас. Ест он почти всё, что ему дадут, но особенно полюбил берёзовый сироп."

#. ja: グルルルル…
#. de: Wie macht der Fuchs?<br><i>Khloe Aliapoh</i>
#. fr: Groonnn...
#. column 0: Summon your sand fox minion. Will perform tricks for a lick of birch syrup.
#. column 1: The descendant of a thousand-year-old vulpine spirit, this creature dreamed of training under the tutelage of its legendary forebear, Sotan. Alas, it was turned away, and ended up taking you as its master instead. Though it will devour most anything you give it, it has grown fond of birch syrup.
#. column 3: Burrow
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:387:0:2"
msgid "You can't smoke out<br>a fox with hot air.<br>   - Bran"
msgstr "Лиса горячим воздухом<br>из норы не выкуришь.<br>   — Бран"

#. ja: あなほり
#. de: Löchergraben
#. fr: Terrier
#. column 0: Summon your sand fox minion. Will perform tricks for a lick of birch syrup.
#. column 1: The descendant of a thousand-year-old vulpine spirit, this creature dreamed of training under the tutelage of its legendary forebear, Sotan. Alas, it was turned away, and ended up taking you as its master instead. Though it will devour most anything you give it, it has grown fond of birch syrup.
#. column 2: You can't smoke out<br>a fox with hot air.<br>   - Bran
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:387:0:3"
msgid "Burrow"
msgstr "Нора"

#. ja: 敵が配置したトラップがある場合、解除する。
#. de: Entfernt eine vom Gegner aufgestellte Falle.
#. fr: Désamorce les pièges des ennemis.
#. column 0: Summon your sand fox minion. Will perform tricks for a lick of birch syrup.
#. column 1: The descendant of a thousand-year-old vulpine spirit, this creature dreamed of training under the tutelage of its legendary forebear, Sotan. Alas, it was turned away, and ended up taking you as its master instead. Though it will devour most anything you give it, it has grown fond of birch syrup.
#. column 2: You can't smoke out<br>a fox with hot air.<br>   - Bran
#. column 3: Burrow
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:387:0:4"
msgid "Disarms deployed enemy traps."
msgstr "Обезвреживает установленные противником ловушки."

#. ja: ミニオン「プチラノドン」を呼び出す。<br>プテラノドンの幼体。小さいが飛行技術は超一流
#. de: Du rufst deinen Pteranoknirps als Begleiter herbei.<br>So klein und doch so gefräßig<nbsp>...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte ptiranodon, un bébé ptéranodon tout aussi à l'aise dans les airs qu'un adulte.
#. column 1: Abandoned by its parents, this pteranodon young was discovered by an Ishgardian botanist during a foray on the Diadem. Though initially aloof, through regular hand-feeding it grew fond of people, and was placed in your care that it might become a worldly sort of prehistoric creature.
#. column 2: When is a dinosaur<br>not a dinosaur?<br>   - Folk Riddle
#. column 3: Glide
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:388:0:0"
msgid "Summon your petit pteranodon minion. It might be cute now, but wait till it grows and becomes a scourge of the skies."
msgstr "Призовите птенца птеродактиля. Сейчас он милый, но подождите, пока подрастёт и станет грозой небес."

#. ja: プテラノドンの幼体。ディアデム諸島にて採集活動中のイシュガルド人園芸師が、親獣に捨てられたこの個体を発見。熱心に餌をやった結果、人によく懐いた。より広い世界で成長させるため、里親を募集していたらしい
#. de: Dieses winzige Fliegerass wurde von einem Ishgarder Gartenbauexperten auf dem Diadem geborgen, wo es in seinem Nest ganz verlassen vor sich hin kreischte. Hingebungsvolle Pflege brachte das Jungtier aber schnell wieder in die Lüfte.
#. fr: Découvert par les botanistes ishgardais durant leurs explorations du Diadème, ce petit volatile orphelin s'est vite pris d'affection pour les humains qui le nourrissaient. Depuis, il rêve de partir à la découverte du monde avec ses parents adoptifs.
#. column 0: Summon your petit pteranodon minion. It might be cute now, but wait till it grows and becomes a scourge of the skies.
#. column 2: When is a dinosaur<br>not a dinosaur?<br>   - Folk Riddle
#. column 3: Glide
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:388:0:1"
msgid "Abandoned by its parents, this pteranodon young was discovered by an Ishgardian botanist during a foray on the Diadem. Though initially aloof, through regular hand-feeding it grew fond of people, and was placed in your care that it might become a worldly sort of prehistoric creature."
msgstr "Родители бросили этого птенца птеродактиля, и его нашёл ишгардский ботаник во время экспедиции на Диадем. Сперва малыш сторонился людей, но привык к ним, когда его регулярно кормили с рук. В итоге ему решили найти приёмного хозяина, чтобы он увидел большой мир."

#. ja: キュルーン♪
#. de: ♪ Kyieeeeeh! ♪
#. fr: Croaaa<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon your petit pteranodon minion. It might be cute now, but wait till it grows and becomes a scourge of the skies.
#. column 1: Abandoned by its parents, this pteranodon young was discovered by an Ishgardian botanist during a foray on the Diadem. Though initially aloof, through regular hand-feeding it grew fond of people, and was placed in your care that it might become a worldly sort of prehistoric creature.
#. column 3: Glide
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
