msgstr "Планирование"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンの移動速度を30%上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
#. de: Erhöht die GSW der ausführenden Trabanten um 30 %.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 30% la vitesse de déplacement des mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. column 0: Summon your petit pteranodon minion. It might be cute now, but wait till it grows and becomes a scourge of the skies.
#. column 1: Abandoned by its parents, this pteranodon young was discovered by an Ishgardian botanist during a foray on the Diadem. Though initially aloof, through regular hand-feeding it grew fond of people, and was placed in your care that it might become a worldly sort of prehistoric creature.
#. column 2: When is a dinosaur<br>not a dinosaur?<br>   - Folk Riddle
#. column 3: Glide
