#. ja: ミニオン「ダーインスレイヴ追従型」を呼び出す。<br>ダーインスレイヴを模したからくり模型。再・起動
#. de: Du rufst deinen A-Dáinsleif als Begleiter herbei.<br>Wird ohne die üblichen, irritierenden Gliedmaßen ausgeliefert.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Dáinsleif S1, un modèle réduit qui a été utilisé durant la conception de l'armure magitek du même nom.
#. column 1: Following the success of the magitek avenger, imperial scientists looked to various other creatures for inspiration in designing their next warmachina, this feline automaton being the test model for their studies into quadrupedal carnivores.
#. column 2: They're fierce carnivores, who<br>see steel-clad knights as nothing<br>more than a packed lunch.<br>   - Alexondre
#. column 3: Magitek Fang
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:389:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Dáinsleif F1 minion. Does not form the head. Or any other part of the body, for that matter."
msgstr "Призовите заводного Дайнслейфа F1. Без головы. Да и вообще без каких-либо частей тела."

#. ja: ダーインスレイヴを模したからくり模型。動物を模した魔導アヴェンジャーが一定の成果を挙げたことを受け、次期主力機候補のベースとして複数の生物が検討された。これは、その一環で製造された四足肉食獣型の検証モデルである
#. de: Nach dem überwältigenden Erfolg des Rächers suchten die kaiserlichen Ingenieure nach weiteren Geschöpfen als Inspiration für ihre Kampf<shy>maschinen, und dieses katzenhafte Modell war ein Testobjekt für ihre Bewegungsstudien.
#. fr: Après que le vengeur magitek a fait ses preuves, plusieurs candidats ont été sélectionnés pour développer une nouvelle série d'armes magitek inspirées d'animaux féroces. Ce modèle de test à échelle réduite emprunte à la morphologie des carnivores quadrupèdes.
#. column 0: Summon your Dáinsleif F1 minion. Does not form the head. Or any other part of the body, for that matter.
#. column 2: They're fierce carnivores, who<br>see steel-clad knights as nothing<br>more than a packed lunch.<br>   - Alexondre
#. column 3: Magitek Fang
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:389:0:1"
msgid "Following the success of the magitek avenger, imperial scientists looked to various other creatures for inspiration in designing their next warmachina, this feline automaton being the test model for their studies into quadrupedal carnivores."
msgstr "После успеха магитехнического мстителя имперские учёные задумались, какие ещё существа могли бы вдохновить их на создание новой боевой машины. Этот кошачий автоматон стал испытательной моделью для изучения четвероногих хищников."

#. ja: 再・起動
#. de: Das Biest aus Eisen hat zehn Mann mit einem Haps gefressen, ich schwöre es!<br><i>Trunkener Soldat des Widerstands</i>
#. fr: Redémarrage en cours...
#. column 0: Summon your Dáinsleif F1 minion. Does not form the head. Or any other part of the body, for that matter.
#. column 1: Following the success of the magitek avenger, imperial scientists looked to various other creatures for inspiration in designing their next warmachina, this feline automaton being the test model for their studies into quadrupedal carnivores.
#. column 3: Magitek Fang
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:389:0:2"
msgid "They're fierce carnivores, who<br>see steel-clad knights as nothing<br>more than a packed lunch.<br>   - Alexondre"
msgstr "Это свирепые хищники:<br>рыцарь в стальных доспехах<br>для них — просто обед.<br>   — Александр"

#. ja: 魔導ファング
#. de: Magitek-Kralle
#. fr: Crocs magitek
#. column 0: Summon your Dáinsleif F1 minion. Does not form the head. Or any other part of the body, for that matter.
#. column 1: Following the success of the magitek avenger, imperial scientists looked to various other creatures for inspiration in designing their next warmachina, this feline automaton being the test model for their studies into quadrupedal carnivores.
#. column 2: They're fierce carnivores, who<br>see steel-clad knights as nothing<br>more than a packed lunch.<br>   - Alexondre
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:389:0:3"
msgid "Magitek Fang"
msgstr "Магитехнический клык"

#. ja: 敵軍のサーチ・アイへ90%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt einem gegnerischen Suchenden Auge 90 % Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls es schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 90% de sa solidité à l'œil scrutateur ennemi. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your Dáinsleif F1 minion. Does not form the head. Or any other part of the body, for that matter.
#. column 1: Following the success of the magitek avenger, imperial scientists looked to various other creatures for inspiration in designing their next warmachina, this feline automaton being the test model for their studies into quadrupedal carnivores.
#. column 2: They're fierce carnivores, who<br>see steel-clad knights as nothing<br>more than a packed lunch.<br>   - Alexondre
#. column 3: Magitek Fang
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:389:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable."
msgstr "Снижает прочность вражеского поискового глаза на 90%. Не действует, если он уже выведен из строя."

#. ja: ミニオン「エンマ」を呼び出す。<br>妖怪たちの頂点に立ち続け、妖魔界の行く末を導く大王
#. de: Du rufst deinen Meister Enma-Begleiter herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte baron Enma, le dernier roi du monde des Yo-kai portant ce nom.
#. column 1: The last in a line of kings who guided the fate of the Yo-kai World. Within him dwell both the souls of a courageous young human boy and an all-powerful Yo-kai.
#. column 2: Bring it on!
#. column 3: Supreme Enma Blast
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:390:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Lord Enma minion. The last in a line of kings who guided the fate of the Yo-kai World."
msgstr "Призовите владыку Энму. Последний из череды королей, направлявших судьбу мира ёкаев."

#. ja: 妖怪たちの頂点に立ち続け、妖魔界の行く末を導く大王。彼の中には、勇気あるひとりの少年と、絶大な力を備えた妖怪の魂が宿る
#. de: In diesem letzten einer langen Reihe von Königen, welche die Geschicke der Welt der Yo-kais lenkten, schlummert die Seele eines mutigen Knaben und eines äußerst mächtigen Yo-kais.
#. fr: En dépit de son jeune âge, le courage et la persévérance du baron Enma n'ont d'égale que la toute-puissance de son âme.
#. column 0: Summon your Lord Enma minion. The last in a line of kings who guided the fate of the Yo-kai World.
#. column 2: Bring it on!
#. column 3: Supreme Enma Blast
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:390:0:1"
msgid "The last in a line of kings who guided the fate of the Yo-kai World. Within him dwell both the souls of a courageous young human boy and an all-powerful Yo-kai."
msgstr "Последний из череды королей, направлявших судьбу мира ёкаев. В нём живут души отважного мальчика и всемогущего ёкая."

#. ja: 待たせたな！
#. de: Jetzt geht's los!
#. fr: Je ne faiblirai pas<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Lord Enma minion. The last in a line of kings who guided the fate of the Yo-kai World.
#. column 1: The last in a line of kings who guided the fate of the Yo-kai World. Within him dwell both the souls of a courageous young human boy and an all-powerful Yo-kai.
#. column 3: Supreme Enma Blast
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:390:0:2"
msgid "Bring it on!"
msgstr "Ну что, дождались?"

#. ja: 覇王閻魔玉
#. de: Enmas Megaladung
#. fr: Balle Enma suprême
#. column 0: Summon your Lord Enma minion. The last in a line of kings who guided the fate of the Yo-kai World.
#. column 1: The last in a line of kings who guided the fate of the Yo-kai World. Within him dwell both the souls of a courageous young human boy and an all-powerful Yo-kai.
#. column 2: Bring it on!
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:390:0:3"
msgid "Supreme Enma Blast"
msgstr "Высший взрыв Энмы"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Lord Enma minion. The last in a line of kings who guided the fate of the Yo-kai World.
#. column 1: The last in a line of kings who guided the fate of the Yo-kai World. Within him dwell both the souls of a courageous young human boy and an all-powerful Yo-kai.
#. column 2: Bring it on!
#. column 3: Supreme Enma Blast
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:390:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия удар силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「蛇王カイラ」を呼び出す。<br>エンマの後を継ぎ、妖魔界の大王として君臨している妖怪
#. de: Du rufst deinen Meister Ananta-Begleiter herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte baron Ananta, le nouveau souverain du monde des Yo-kai.
#. column 1: The new ruler of the Yo-kai World. Once a rival of the now abdicated King Enma, he became a trusted ally and friend.
#. column 2: Let us be off!
#. column 3: Serpent Surge
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:391:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Lord Ananta minion. The new ruler of the Yo-kai World."
msgstr "Призовите владыку Ананту. Нового правителя мира ёкаев."

#. ja: エンマの後を継ぎ、妖魔界の大王として君臨している妖怪。かつてはエンマと敵対していたが、今ではこまめに連絡を取り合う仲だ
#. de: Er ist der Nachfolger Meister Enmas als Herrscher der Welt der Yo-kais. Einst erbitterte Rivalen, sind die beiden mittlerweile enge Vertraute geworden.
#. fr: Autrefois rival de la dynastie des Enma, le baron Ananta compte aujourd'hui parmi ses plus solides alliés.
#. column 0: Summon your Lord Ananta minion. The new ruler of the Yo-kai World.
#. column 2: Let us be off!
#. column 3: Serpent Surge
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:391:0:1"
msgid "The new ruler of the Yo-kai World. Once a rival of the now abdicated King Enma, he became a trusted ally and friend."
msgstr "Новый правитель мира ёкаев. Некогда он соперничал с королём Энмой, но после отречения того от престола они стали верными союзниками и друзьями."

#. ja: ゆくぞ、皆の者！
#. de: Brechen wir auf!
#. fr: Qui m'aime me suive<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Lord Ananta minion. The new ruler of the Yo-kai World.
#. column 1: The new ruler of the Yo-kai World. Once a rival of the now abdicated King Enma, he became a trusted ally and friend.
#. column 3: Serpent Surge
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:391:0:2"
msgid "Let us be off!"
msgstr "В путь, друзья!"

#. ja: 蛇王叛獄波
#. de: Schlangenstoß
#. fr: Déluge du serpent
#. column 0: Summon your Lord Ananta minion. The new ruler of the Yo-kai World.
#. column 1: The new ruler of the Yo-kai World. Once a rival of the now abdicated King Enma, he became a trusted ally and friend.
#. column 2: Let us be off!
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:391:0:3"
msgid "Serpent Surge"
msgstr "Змеиный удар"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵にかかっている、強化効果をすべて打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle positiven Effekte von den gegnerischen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe tous les effets bénéfiques des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Lord Ananta minion. The new ruler of the Yo-kai World.
#. column 1: The new ruler of the Yo-kai World. Once a rival of the now abdicated King Enma, he became a trusted ally and friend.
#. column 2: Let us be off!
#. column 3: Serpent Surge
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:391:0:4"
msgid "Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все положительные эффекты со всех противников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「ぬらりひょん」を呼び出す。<br>エンマ大王に仕える参謀
#. de: Du rufst deinen Sasel-Begleiter herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Zazel, le conseiller chargé de la protection du baron Enma.
#. column 1: Counselor to generations of Enmas, the Yo-kai kings. He repelled the corruption of the Overseer with the last Enma after he abdicated the throne.
#. column 2: My lord!
#. column 3: Judgment Wave
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:392:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Zazel minion. Counselor to generations of Enmas, the Yo-kai kings."
msgstr "Призовите Зазела. Советника нескольких поколений королей-Энм."

#. ja: エンマ大王に仕える参謀。大王の座を降りたエンマと共に、妖魔界に潜む闇を追う。妖怪評議会の議長職は、腹心の妖怪に委ねている
#. de: Er fungiert seit Generationen als Berater der Enmas, der Könige der Yo-kai Welt. An der Seite Meister Enmas half er mit, die Finsternis aus der Welt der Yo-kais zu vertreiben.
#. fr: Conseiller des rois des Yo-kai depuis des générations, Zazel a prouvé maintes fois que sa fidélité envers ses maîtres était à toute épreuve.
#. column 0: Summon your Zazel minion. Counselor to generations of Enmas, the Yo-kai kings.
#. column 2: My lord!
#. column 3: Judgment Wave
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:392:0:1"
msgid "Counselor to generations of Enmas, the Yo-kai kings. He repelled the corruption of the Overseer with the last Enma after he abdicated the throne."
msgstr "Советник нескольких поколений королей-Энм. После отречения последнего Энмы от престола он помог ему изгнать Скверну надзирателя."

#. ja: エンマ様！
#. de: Meister!
#. fr: Votre Altesse<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Zazel minion. Counselor to generations of Enmas, the Yo-kai kings.
#. column 1: Counselor to generations of Enmas, the Yo-kai kings. He repelled the corruption of the Overseer with the last Enma after he abdicated the throne.
#. column 3: Judgment Wave
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:392:0:2"
msgid "My lord!"
msgstr "Владыка!"

#. ja: 裁きの超波動
#. de: Urteilsspruch
#. fr: Vague de jugement
#. column 0: Summon your Zazel minion. Counselor to generations of Enmas, the Yo-kai kings.
#. column 1: Counselor to generations of Enmas, the Yo-kai kings. He repelled the corruption of the Overseer with the last Enma after he abdicated the throne.
#. column 2: My lord!
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:392:0:3"
msgid "Judgment Wave"
msgstr "Волна правосудия"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your Zazel minion. Counselor to generations of Enmas, the Yo-kai kings.
#. column 1: Counselor to generations of Enmas, the Yo-kai kings. He repelled the corruption of the Overseer with the last Enma after he abdicated the throne.
#. column 2: My lord!
#. column 3: Judgment Wave
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:392:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Даёт 10 очков особых умений всем союзникам в радиусе действия, кроме тех, чьи умения имеют такой же эффект."

#. ja: ミニオン「百鬼姫」を呼び出す。<br>地獄の小国に生まれた姫
#. de: Du rufst deine Dämona-Begleiterin herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Damona, la fille du chef des Onis, Boucanos.
#. column 1: The daughter of an Oni pirate king. She is learned in the mystic arts but, as a trade-off, lacks emotion.
#. column 2: The time has come.
#. column 3: ☆Shiny Chaos
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:393:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Damona minion. The daughter of an Oni pirate king."
msgstr "Призовите Дамону. Дочь короля пиратов-они."

#. ja: 地獄の小国に生まれた姫。幼いころから教育された、闇の妖術は超一流。それと引きかえに、ほとんどの感情を失っている
#. de: Als Prinzessin eines kleinen Landes der Unterwelt wurde sie von klein auf in dunkler Magie unterrichtet und hat große Stärke erlangt. Allerdings ist sie im Gegenzug unfähig, Emotionen zu empfinden.
#. fr: Damona a of<shy>fi<shy>ciel<shy>le<shy>ment échangé sa capacité à avoir des émotions contre plus de pouvoirs, mais en réalité, elle cache ce qu'elle ressent pour que son père s'intéresse à elle.
#. column 0: Summon your Damona minion. The daughter of an Oni pirate king.
#. column 2: The time has come.
#. column 3: ☆Shiny Chaos
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:393:0:1"
msgid "The daughter of an Oni pirate king. She is learned in the mystic arts but, as a trade-off, lacks emotion."
msgstr "Дочь короля пиратов-они. Она сведуща в магических искусствах, но за это лишилась чувств."

#. ja: 参るのじゃ！
#. de: Wenn's sein muss ...
#. fr: Quel ennui...
#. column 0: Summon your Damona minion. The daughter of an Oni pirate king.
#. column 1: The daughter of an Oni pirate king. She is learned in the mystic arts but, as a trade-off, lacks emotion.
#. column 3: ☆Shiny Chaos
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:393:0:2"
msgid "The time has come."
msgstr "Пора."

#. ja: ときめき☆百鬼夜行
#. de: Funkelchaos
#. fr: Chaos éclatant
#. column 0: Summon your Damona minion. The daughter of an Oni pirate king.
#. column 1: The daughter of an Oni pirate king. She is learned in the mystic arts but, as a trade-off, lacks emotion.
#. column 2: The time has come.
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:393:0:3"
msgid "☆Shiny Chaos"
msgstr "☆Блестящий хаос"

