#. de: Macht Gegner in der Nähe be<shy>we<shy>gungs<shy>un<shy>fäh<shy>ig.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5 Sekunden
#. fr: Immobilise les ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. column 0: Summon your Damona minion. The daughter of an Oni pirate king.
#. column 1: The daughter of an Oni pirate king. She is learned in the mystic arts but, as a trade-off, lacks emotion.
#. column 2: The time has come.
#. column 3: ☆Shiny Chaos
