msgctxt "CompanionTransient:393:0:4"
msgid "Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s"
msgstr "Обездвиживает всех противников в радиусе действия.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「オートマトン２Ｂ」を呼び出す。<br>軍事基地深部で発見された黒い小型オートマトン
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-2B als Begleiter herbei.<br>Eine winzige Androidin ganz in Schwarz, geborgen aus den Tiefen der Festung.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte automate 2B, un automate miniature vêtu de noir et issu de la base militaire des Pantins.
#. column 1: Recovered from deep within the Puppets' Bunker, this diminutive automaton bears a resemblance to the android known as YoRHa No.2 Type B. Why such a thing was created and by whom, however, are questions that will likely remain unanswered.
#. column 2: So there're androids, which<br>are machines, but also other<br>machines, and also...<br>   - Dig Site Chief
#. column 3: One Battle Ends
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:394:0:0"
msgid "Summon your 2B automaton minion. For when you need the company of a compact version of an advanced combat android dressed in a distinctive subculture style."
msgstr "Призовите автоматона 2B. Когда хочется общества миниатюрной боевой андроидки в узнаваемом готическом образе."

#. ja: 軍事基地深部で発見された黒い小型オートマトン。その姿は「ヨルハ機体二号Ｂ型」を名乗るアンドロイドによく似ている。しかし、いったい誰が何のために、このオートマトンを作ったのか、判然としていない
#. de: Diese kleine Marionette schlummerte in den Tiefen einer mysteriösen Militärbasis. Sie ähnelt der echten 2B bis aufs Haar, ist allerdings noch schweigsamer als das Original. Zu welchem Zweck dieses winzige YoRHa-Modell geschaffen wurde, ist unbekannt.
#. fr: Cet automate miniature ressemble comme deux gouttes d'eau à l'androïde nommé “unité YoRHa numéro 2 modèle B”, mais les raisons de son existence restent drapées de mystère.
#. column 0: Summon your 2B automaton minion. For when you need the company of a compact version of an advanced combat android dressed in a distinctive subculture style.
#. column 2: So there're androids, which<br>are machines, but also other<br>machines, and also...<br>   - Dig Site Chief
#. column 3: One Battle Ends
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:394:0:1"
msgid "Recovered from deep within the Puppets' Bunker, this diminutive automaton bears a resemblance to the android known as YoRHa No.2 Type B. Why such a thing was created and by whom, however, are questions that will likely remain unanswered."
msgstr "Найденный в глубинах Бункера марионеток крошечный автоматон похож на андроида, известного как «ЙорХа № 2, модель B». Кто и зачем его создал — загадка, которую, похоже, так никто и не разгадает."

#. ja: …………
#. de: ... ...
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon your 2B automaton minion. For when you need the company of a compact version of an advanced combat android dressed in a distinctive subculture style.
#. column 1: Recovered from deep within the Puppets' Bunker, this diminutive automaton bears a resemblance to the android known as YoRHa No.2 Type B. Why such a thing was created and by whom, however, are questions that will likely remain unanswered.
#. column 3: One Battle Ends
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:394:0:2"
msgid "So there're androids, which<br>are machines, but also other<br>machines, and also...<br>   - Dig Site Chief"
msgstr "Так, значит, есть андроиды,<br>то есть машины, но есть и<br>другие машины, и ещё...<br>   — Начальник раскопок"

#. ja: 戦いの終わり
#. de: Ein Kampf endet
#. fr: Fin d'une bataille
#. column 0: Summon your 2B automaton minion. For when you need the company of a compact version of an advanced combat android dressed in a distinctive subculture style.
#. column 1: Recovered from deep within the Puppets' Bunker, this diminutive automaton bears a resemblance to the android known as YoRHa No.2 Type B. Why such a thing was created and by whom, however, are questions that will likely remain unanswered.
#. column 2: So there're androids, which<br>are machines, but also other<br>machines, and also...<br>   - Dig Site Chief
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:394:0:3"
msgid "One Battle Ends"
msgstr "Одна битва окончена"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK150のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 150 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 150 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et les projette en arrière.
#. column 0: Summon your 2B automaton minion. For when you need the company of a compact version of an advanced combat android dressed in a distinctive subculture style.
#. column 1: Recovered from deep within the Puppets' Bunker, this diminutive automaton bears a resemblance to the android known as YoRHa No.2 Type B. Why such a thing was created and by whom, however, are questions that will likely remain unanswered.
#. column 2: So there're androids, which<br>are machines, but also other<br>machines, and also...<br>   - Dig Site Chief
#. column 3: One Battle Ends
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:394:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия удар силой 150 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「オートマトン２Ｐ」を呼び出す。<br>軍事基地深部で発見された白い小型オートマトン
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-2P als Begleiter herbei.<br>Eine winzige Androidin ganz in Weiß, geborgen aus den Tiefen der Festung.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte automate 2P, un automate miniature vêtu de blanc et issu de la base militaire des Pantins.
#. column 1: Though this automaton found within the Puppets' Bunker bears a resemblance to the android known as YoRHa No.2 Type P, it thankfully doesn't appear to be hostile. Created through unknown technology, how it operates is a complete mystery.
#. column 2: Not that I'm not eager to<br>take apart an android,<br>but...how do we...do that?<br>   - Konogg
#. column 3: The War Rages On
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:395:0:0"
msgid "Summon your 2P automaton minion. For when you need the company of a compact version of an advanced combat android dressed in a distinctive subculture style."
msgstr "Призовите автоматона 2P. Когда хочется общества миниатюрной боевой андроидки в узнаваемом готическом образе."

#. ja: 軍事基地深部で発見された白い小型オートマトン。「２Ｐ」を模したかのような姿をしているが、特に敵対してくる様子はないため、ひとまずは安全だろう。なお、未知の技術で作られているらしく、動力源なども一切不明である
#. de: Diese kleine Marionette schlummerte in den Tiefen einer mysteriösen Militärbasis. Sie ähnelt der echten 2P bis aufs Haar, scheint allerdings weniger angriffslustig. Zu welchem Zweck dieses winzige Modell geschaffen wurde, ist unbekannt.
#. fr: Malgré sa très forte ressemblance avec 2P, cet automate miniature est toutefois bien moins hostile de prime abord. Les origines de sa conception et de la technologie qui l'anime restent inconnues à ce jour.
#. column 0: Summon your 2P automaton minion. For when you need the company of a compact version of an advanced combat android dressed in a distinctive subculture style.
#. column 2: Not that I'm not eager to<br>take apart an android,<br>but...how do we...do that?<br>   - Konogg
#. column 3: The War Rages On
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:395:0:1"
msgid "Though this automaton found within the Puppets' Bunker bears a resemblance to the android known as YoRHa No.2 Type P, it thankfully doesn't appear to be hostile. Created through unknown technology, how it operates is a complete mystery."
msgstr "Этот автоматон нашли в Бункере марионеток. Он похож на андроида, известного как «ЙорХа № 2, модель P», но, к счастью, не проявляет враждебности. Его создали с помощью неизвестной технологии, и как он работает — полная загадка."

#. ja: …………
#. de: ... ...
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon your 2P automaton minion. For when you need the company of a compact version of an advanced combat android dressed in a distinctive subculture style.
#. column 1: Though this automaton found within the Puppets' Bunker bears a resemblance to the android known as YoRHa No.2 Type P, it thankfully doesn't appear to be hostile. Created through unknown technology, how it operates is a complete mystery.
#. column 3: The War Rages On
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:395:0:2"
msgid "Not that I'm not eager to<br>take apart an android,<br>but...how do we...do that?<br>   - Konogg"
msgstr "Я бы и рад разобрать<br>андроида на части, но...<br>как вообще это сделать?.. <br>   — Коногг"

#. ja: 戦いの続き
#. de: Ein Kampf setzt sich fort
#. fr: Suite d'une bataille
#. column 0: Summon your 2P automaton minion. For when you need the company of a compact version of an advanced combat android dressed in a distinctive subculture style.
#. column 1: Though this automaton found within the Puppets' Bunker bears a resemblance to the android known as YoRHa No.2 Type P, it thankfully doesn't appear to be hostile. Created through unknown technology, how it operates is a complete mystery.
#. column 2: Not that I'm not eager to<br>take apart an android,<br>but...how do we...do that?<br>   - Konogg
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:395:0:3"
msgid "The War Rages On"
msgstr "Битва продолжается"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵の特殊技ポイントを、最大値の50%減少させる。
#. de: Verringert die Technikpunkte der Gegner in der Nähe um 50<nbsp>% des Maximalwerts.
#. fr: Réduit les PdT des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet de 50% de leur valeur maximale.
#. column 0: Summon your 2P automaton minion. For when you need the company of a compact version of an advanced combat android dressed in a distinctive subculture style.
#. column 1: Though this automaton found within the Puppets' Bunker bears a resemblance to the android known as YoRHa No.2 Type P, it thankfully doesn't appear to be hostile. Created through unknown technology, how it operates is a complete mystery.
#. column 2: Not that I'm not eager to<br>take apart an android,<br>but...how do we...do that?<br>   - Konogg
#. column 3: The War Rages On
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:395:0:4"
msgid "Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value."
msgstr "Снижает очки особых умений всех противников в радиусе действия на 50% от максимального значения."

#. ja: ミニオン「モモラ・モラ！！！」を呼び出す。<br>モモラ・モラの幼魚。もういらない？　もう一匹！
#. de: Du rufst deinen anhänglichen Momora Mora als Begleiter herbei. Ein anhänglicher Fisch im wortwörtlichen Sinne.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Momo Ramora, un petit momora mora pas comme les autres.
#. column 1: The bane of many an ocean fisher, the Momora Mora exhibits all the qualities of much rarer and more desirable catches...until it is hoisted out of the water.
#. column 2: Fishing's like philanderin'─<br>ye never know what ye'll catch!<br>   - Wawalago Momolago
#. column 3: Something Bites
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:396:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your much-coveted Mora minion. Few wavekin have ever been the object of so much anticipation, only to be followed by such crushing disappointment."
msgstr "Призовите желанного всеми Мору. Немногие водяные удостаивались такого нетерпеливого ожидания, за которым следовало столь сокрушительное разочарование."

#. ja: メルトール海峡周辺の海面で見かけられる巨大海水魚、モモラ・モラの幼魚。もういらないと思ったときに限って釣れるとして、漁師たちの伝説となった。しかし、嫌わないでほしい。モモラ・モラは、あなたと旅がしたいだけなのだ
#. de: Der Jungfisch des riesigen Salz<shy>was<shy>ser<shy>fisches Momora Mora, der in der Straße von Merlthor gesichtet werden kann. Unter den Fischern gilt er wegen der Häufigkeit, mit der er an der Angel hängt, als „Unkraut-Fisch“.
#. fr: Cet alevin originaire du détroit de Merlthor prend un malin plaisir à mordre à l'hameçon des pêcheurs au moment où ceux-ci s'apprêtent à ranger leur canne. Ne voulant pas s'encombrer davantage, ils ne manquent jamais de le renvoyer dans l'eau.
#. column 0: Summon forth your much-coveted Mora minion. Few wavekin have ever been the object of so much anticipation, only to be followed by such crushing disappointment.
#. column 2: Fishing's like philanderin'─<br>ye never know what ye'll catch!<br>   - Wawalago Momolago
#. column 3: Something Bites
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:396:0:1"
msgid "The bane of many an ocean fisher, the Momora Mora exhibits all the qualities of much rarer and more desirable catches...until it is hoisted out of the water."
msgstr "Бич многих морских рыбаков, момора-мора обладает всеми достоинствами редкой и желанной добычи... пока её не вытащат из воды."

#. ja: ！！！
#. de: Noch mehr Momora Mora?!<br><i>Entgeisterter Fischer</i>
#. fr: !!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your much-coveted Mora minion. Few wavekin have ever been the object of so much anticipation, only to be followed by such crushing disappointment.
#. column 1: The bane of many an ocean fisher, the Momora Mora exhibits all the qualities of much rarer and more desirable catches...until it is hoisted out of the water.
#. column 3: Something Bites
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:396:0:2"
msgid "Fishing's like philanderin'─<br>ye never know what ye'll catch!<br>   - Wawalago Momolago"
msgstr "Рыбалка как измена:<br>никогда не знаешь, что<br>поймаешь!<br>   — Вавалаго Момолаго"

#. ja: ！！！
#. de: Adhärenz
#. fr: !!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your much-coveted Mora minion. Few wavekin have ever been the object of so much anticipation, only to be followed by such crushing disappointment.
#. column 1: The bane of many an ocean fisher, the Momora Mora exhibits all the qualities of much rarer and more desirable catches...until it is hoisted out of the water.
#. column 2: Fishing's like philanderin'─<br>ye never know what ye'll catch!<br>   - Wawalago Momolago
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:396:0:3"
msgid "Something Bites"
msgstr "Что-то клюёт"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンを自軍の中央ゲート内へワープさせる。
#. de: Versetzt die ausführenden Trabanten zurück zu Tor B.
#. fr: Téléporte les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT vers le portail central.
#. column 0: Summon forth your much-coveted Mora minion. Few wavekin have ever been the object of so much anticipation, only to be followed by such crushing disappointment.
#. column 1: The bane of many an ocean fisher, the Momora Mora exhibits all the qualities of much rarer and more desirable catches...until it is hoisted out of the water.
#. column 2: Fishing's like philanderin'─<br>ye never know what ye'll catch!<br>   - Wawalago Momolago
#. column 3: Something Bites
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:396:0:4"
msgid "Transports action party to the central summoning Gate. "
msgstr "Перемещает отряд с активными умениями к центральным Вратам призыва."

#. ja: ミニオン「シルドラ級潜水艦P型」を呼び出す。<br>シルドラ級潜水艦の縮小模型。ピューイ！
#. de: Du rufst dein P-Tauchboot der Klasse „Syldra“ als Begleiter herbei, eine Miniaturausgabe des Tauchboots der Klasse „Syldra“.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte sous-marin aérien de classe Syldra. Son cri de guerre est “piou piou”.
#. column 1: Despite being an incredibly realistic replica of a Syldra-class submersible, it lacks any such aquatic capabilities. It is, however, able to hover in midair for a seemingly limitless amount of time, which is considerably more impressive.
#. column 2: I'll stick to swimming, thank you very much.<br>   - Alisaie Leveilleur
#. column 3: Cannon Salvo
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:397:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Syldrion-class insubmersible minion. Unlike the craft on which it is modeled, it will break immediately upon coming into contact with water."
msgstr "Призовите подводную лодку «Сильдрион» класса P. В отличие от настоящей, эта модель развалится, едва коснувшись воды."

#. ja: 潜水艦の操舵を担当するマメットが、ボイジャー任務の合間にコツコツと設計していたからくり模型。シルドラ級潜水艦を縮小したもの。その名は、ピューイと鳴くから付けられたのではなく、プロトタイプを示すらしい
#. de: Ein Miniaturmodell, das von einer Tauchboot-Steuerpuppe zwischen Erkundungen gebaut wurde. Der Buchstabe P steht nicht etwa für das kaum hörbare „Pfff“, mit dem das Tauchboot durch die Luft gleitet, sondern schlicht und einfach für „Prototyp“.
#. fr: Malgré sa forte ressemblance avec les sous-marins de classe Syldra habituels, ce prototype n'est absolument pas fait pour se mouvoir dans l'eau. En revanche, il est capable de rester en lévitation constante sans jamais tomber en panne, ce qui est un exploit autrement plus im<shy>pres<shy>sion<shy>nant.
#. column 0: Summon your Syldrion-class insubmersible minion. Unlike the craft on which it is modeled, it will break immediately upon coming into contact with water.
#. column 2: I'll stick to swimming, thank you very much.<br>   - Alisaie Leveilleur
#. column 3: Cannon Salvo
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:397:0:1"
msgid "Despite being an incredibly realistic replica of a Syldra-class submersible, it lacks any such aquatic capabilities. It is, however, able to hover in midair for a seemingly limitless amount of time, which is considerably more impressive."
msgstr "Эта невероятно точная копия подводной лодки класса «Сильдра» совсем не приспособлена к плаванию. Зато она может, кажется, бесконечно парить в воздухе — вот это куда впечатляющее достижение."

#. ja: ピューイ！
#. de: Pfff...
#. fr: Piou piou<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon your Syldrion-class insubmersible minion. Unlike the craft on which it is modeled, it will break immediately upon coming into contact with water.
#. column 1: Despite being an incredibly realistic replica of a Syldra-class submersible, it lacks any such aquatic capabilities. It is, however, able to hover in midair for a seemingly limitless amount of time, which is considerably more impressive.
#. column 3: Cannon Salvo
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:397:0:2"
msgid "I'll stick to swimming, thank you very much.<br>   - Alisaie Leveilleur"
msgstr "Я уж лучше поплаваю сама, спасибо.<br>   — Ализе Левейёр"

#. ja: 砲撃戦
#. de: Schiffe versenken
#. fr: Canon piou piou
#. column 0: Summon your Syldrion-class insubmersible minion. Unlike the craft on which it is modeled, it will break immediately upon coming into contact with water.
#. column 1: Despite being an incredibly realistic replica of a Syldra-class submersible, it lacks any such aquatic capabilities. It is, however, able to hover in midair for a seemingly limitless amount of time, which is considerably more impressive.
#. column 2: I'll stick to swimming, thank you very much.<br>   - Alisaie Leveilleur
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:397:0:3"
msgid "Cannon Salvo"
msgstr "Залп из пушек"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Syldrion-class insubmersible minion. Unlike the craft on which it is modeled, it will break immediately upon coming into contact with water.
#. column 1: Despite being an incredibly realistic replica of a Syldra-class submersible, it lacks any such aquatic capabilities. It is, however, able to hover in midair for a seemingly limitless amount of time, which is considerably more impressive.
#. column 2: I'll stick to swimming, thank you very much.<br>   - Alisaie Leveilleur
#. column 3: Cannon Salvo
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:397:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия удар силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ガイア」を呼び出す。<br>ガイアを模した魔法人形。……約束よ
#. de: Du rufst deine Gaia-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie wird deinen Feinden zeigen, wo der Hammer hängt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Gaïa miniature, une poupée magique très prometteuse.
#. column 1: Supposedly discovered by those investigating the Empty, its appearance there is both inexplicable and implausible. Considering all the other unlikely events that occurred there, however, perhaps the sudden materialization of a hammer-wielding mammet is not so unusual after all.
#. column 2: Let me get this straight.<br>You came to talk to me about<br><i>biscuits</i>?<br>   - Gaia
#. column 3: Hellacious Hammer
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 60%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:398:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Gaia minion. Those who think the hammer is just for show had best watch their toes."
msgstr "Призовите заводную Гайю. Тем, кто считает молот просто украшением, лучше поберечь пальцы на ногах."

#. ja: ガイアを模した魔法人形。永遠の理想郷として創造された空間の中で発見された。あるいはそれは、ミトロンがアログリフを想い、その転生体を模して創ったものかもしれない。その意味では失われた約束の欠片と言えるだろう
#. de: Angeblich wurde diese Puppe in der Großen Leere entdeckt. Ihre Existenz dort ist eigentlich unvorstellbar, doch wenn man all die anderen unerklärlichen Ereignisse bedenkt, ist eine Hammer schwingenden Puppe vielleicht ganz normal.
#. fr: Supposément découverte dans le monde utopique de Mitron et Loghrif, l'origine de cette poupée miniature à l'effigie de Gaïa reste un grand mystère. Se pourrait-il qu'elle soit le symbole d'une promesse tenue<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gaia minion. Those who think the hammer is just for show had best watch their toes.
#. column 2: Let me get this straight.<br>You came to talk to me about<br><i>biscuits</i>?<br>   - Gaia
#. column 3: Hellacious Hammer
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 60%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:398:0:1"
msgid "Supposedly discovered by those investigating the Empty, its appearance there is both inexplicable and implausible. Considering all the other unlikely events that occurred there, however, perhaps the sudden materialization of a hammer-wielding mammet is not so unusual after all."
msgstr "Говорят, её нашли те, кто исследовал Пустоту. Как она там оказалась — совершенно непонятно. Но после всего, что там творилось, появление куклы с молотом уже не кажется таким уж невероятным."

#. ja: ……約束ヨ
#. de: Jetzt mal im Ernst. Du bist gekommen, um mit mir über Kekse zu reden?<br><i>Gaia</i>
#. fr: Promis, juré, craché<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gaia minion. Those who think the hammer is just for show had best watch their toes.
#. column 1: Supposedly discovered by those investigating the Empty, its appearance there is both inexplicable and implausible. Considering all the other unlikely events that occurred there, however, perhaps the sudden materialization of a hammer-wielding mammet is not so unusual after all.
#. column 3: Hellacious Hammer
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 60%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:398:0:2"
msgid "Let me get this straight.<br>You came to talk to me about<br><i>biscuits</i>?<br>   - Gaia"
msgstr "Так, погоди.<br>Ты пришёл поговорить со мной<br>о <i>печенье</i>?<br>   — Гайя"

#. ja: ハンマーチャンス
#. de: Schicksalshammer
#. fr: Marteau gothique
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gaia minion. Those who think the hammer is just for show had best watch their toes.
#. column 1: Supposedly discovered by those investigating the Empty, its appearance there is both inexplicable and implausible. Considering all the other unlikely events that occurred there, however, perhaps the sudden materialization of a hammer-wielding mammet is not so unusual after all.
#. column 2: Let me get this straight.<br>You came to talk to me about<br><i>biscuits</i>?<br>   - Gaia
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 60%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:398:0:3"
msgid "Hellacious Hammer"
msgstr "Адский молот"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のゲートに60%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Tor 60<nbsp>% Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls es schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 60% de sa solidité au portail ennemi le plus proche. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gaia minion. Those who think the hammer is just for show had best watch their toes.
#. column 1: Supposedly discovered by those investigating the Empty, its appearance there is both inexplicable and implausible. Considering all the other unlikely events that occurred there, however, perhaps the sudden materialization of a hammer-wielding mammet is not so unusual after all.
#. column 2: Let me get this straight.<br>You came to talk to me about<br><i>biscuits</i>?<br>   - Gaia
#. column 3: Hellacious Hammer
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:398:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 60%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable."
msgstr "Снижает прочность ближайших вражеских Врат на 60%. Не действует, если они уже выведены из строя."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・パロム」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。いくぞ、ポロム！
#. de: Du rufst deine Palom-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie ist einem Helden aus einer vergangenen Zeit nachempfunden, der eine Zwil<shy>lings<shy>schwes<shy>ter hatte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Palom miniature, une poupée magique à l'effigie d'un héros des temps anciens.
#. column 1: Based on one half of a pair of twin mages, this charming minion brings an air of mischief wherever it goes. The tales say that the real Palom mastered the dark arts by the age of five, though one has to question whether teaching dangerous magic to small children is such a good idea.
#. column 2: Something stinks.<br>   - Palom
#. column 3: Bluff
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:399:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your wind-up Palom minion. Try not to break it."
msgstr "Призовите заводного Палома. Только постарайтесь его не сломать."

#. ja: 古の英雄「パロム」を模した魔法人形。魔道士たちが暮らす里で生まれた天才児であり、5歳という幼さで黒魔法を操ったと伝えられる。双子であるポロムとともに冒険の旅に出て、命がけで仲間を守ったと語られている
#. de: Palom war der Zwil<shy>lings<shy>bru<shy>der von Porom. Angeblich soll er schon im Alter von fünf Jahren schwarze Magie erlernt haben. Da stellt sich bloß die Frage, wer so unverantwortlich war, einem kleinen Kind solch gefährlichen Künste beizubringen.
#. fr: Palom est originaire d'un village de mages où ses talents précoces ont rapidement été remarqués. Il a maîtrisé l'art de la magie noire à l'âge de cinq ans, puis s'est lancé à l'aventure à travers le monde avec sa sœur jumelle Porom.
#. column 0: Summon forth your wind-up Palom minion. Try not to break it.
#. column 2: Something stinks.<br>   - Palom
#. column 3: Bluff
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:399:0:1"
msgid "Based on one half of a pair of twin mages, this charming minion brings an air of mischief wherever it goes. The tales say that the real Palom mastered the dark arts by the age of five, though one has to question whether teaching dangerous magic to small children is such a good idea."
msgstr "Эта очаровательная кукла изображает одного из двух братьев-магов и повсюду приносит с собой озорство. Говорят, настоящий Палом освоил тёмную магию к пяти годам. Только вот кто додумался учить опасной магии маленького ребёнка?"

#. ja: ブレイク！
#. de: Irgendwas ist faul!<br><i>Palom</i>
#. fr: Ensemble<nbsp>! Maintenant<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your wind-up Palom minion. Try not to break it.
#. column 1: Based on one half of a pair of twin mages, this charming minion brings an air of mischief wherever it goes. The tales say that the real Palom mastered the dark arts by the age of five, though one has to question whether teaching dangerous magic to small children is such a good idea.
#. column 3: Bluff
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:399:0:2"
msgid "Something stinks.<br>   - Palom"
msgstr "Что-то тут воняет.<br>   — Палом"

#. ja: つよがる
#. de: Bluff
#. fr: Bluffer
#. column 0: Summon forth your wind-up Palom minion. Try not to break it.
#. column 1: Based on one half of a pair of twin mages, this charming minion brings an air of mischief wherever it goes. The tales say that the real Palom mastered the dark arts by the age of five, though one has to question whether teaching dangerous magic to small children is such a good idea.
#. column 2: Something stinks.<br>   - Palom
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:399:0:3"
msgid "Bluff"
msgstr "Блеф"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のDEFを20上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
#. de: Erhöht die ABW eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 20 la défense des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. column 0: Summon forth your wind-up Palom minion. Try not to break it.
#. column 1: Based on one half of a pair of twin mages, this charming minion brings an air of mischief wherever it goes. The tales say that the real Palom mastered the dark arts by the age of five, though one has to question whether teaching dangerous magic to small children is such a good idea.
#. column 2: Something stinks.<br>   - Palom
#. column 3: Bluff
