msgstr "Повышает ЗАЩ всех союзников в радиусе действия на 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ポロム」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。ブレイク！
#. de: Du rufst deine Porom-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie ist einer Heldin aus einer vergangenen Zeit nachempfunden, die einen Zwil<shy>lings<shy>bru<shy>der hatte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Porom miniature, une poupée magique à l'effigie d'une héroïne des temps anciens.
#. column 1: Created in the likeness of Porom, twin sister to Palom. According to legend, they were sent by the elder of their village to aid in an epic quest to save the world, which seems like a bit of a tall order for two five-year olds. Perhaps the other mages had more important matters to take care of?
#. column 2: This isn't a picnic we're going on, Palom.<br>   - Porom
#. column 3: Cry
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:400:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your wind-up Porom minion. The rosy cheeks and pronounced eyelashes indicate that this is the female half of a matching pair."
msgstr "Призовите заводную Полом. Румяные щёки и длинные ресницы сразу выдают, что это девочка из пары."

#. ja: 古の英雄「ポロム」を模した魔法人形。双子であるパロムと同様に、天才的な魔法の才能を示した。白魔法を得意とし、旅の仲間たちを癒やすことで大きく貢献。さらにパロムとふたり、命がけで仲間を救ったと語られている
#. de: Porom war eine Weißmagierin, die gemeinsam mit ihrem Zwil<shy>lings<shy>bru<shy>der Palom große Heldentaten vollbracht hat. Sie war auf Heilmagie spezialisiert und hatte ein großes Herz.
#. fr: À l'instar de Palom dont elle est la sœur jumelle, Porom a déployé ses grands talents de mage dès sa plus tendre enfance. Après avoir maîtrisé les sorts de magie blanche, elle est partie explorer le monde en compagnie de son frère.
#. column 0: Summon forth your wind-up Porom minion. The rosy cheeks and pronounced eyelashes indicate that this is the female half of a matching pair.
#. column 2: This isn't a picnic we're going on, Palom.<br>   - Porom
#. column 3: Cry
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:400:0:1"
msgid "Created in the likeness of Porom, twin sister to Palom. According to legend, they were sent by the elder of their village to aid in an epic quest to save the world, which seems like a bit of a tall order for two five-year olds. Perhaps the other mages had more important matters to take care of?"
msgstr "Кукла в виде Полом, сестры-близнеца Палома. Легенда гласит, что старейшина их селения отправил их на опасный путь спасать мир. Для двух пятилеток — задачка не из лёгких. Неужели у остальных магов нашлись дела поважнее?"

#. ja: ブレイク！
#. de: Und der mit dem frechen Mundwerk ist mein Zwil<shy>lings<shy>bru<shy>der Palom!<br><i>Porom</i>
#. fr: Pierre<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your wind-up Porom minion. The rosy cheeks and pronounced eyelashes indicate that this is the female half of a matching pair.
#. column 1: Created in the likeness of Porom, twin sister to Palom. According to legend, they were sent by the elder of their village to aid in an epic quest to save the world, which seems like a bit of a tall order for two five-year olds. Perhaps the other mages had more important matters to take care of?
#. column 3: Cry
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:400:0:2"
msgid "This isn't a picnic we're going on, Palom.<br>   - Porom"
msgstr "Мы не на пикник идём, Палом.<br>   — Полом"

#. ja: うそなき
#. de: Heulen
#. fr: Pleurer
#. column 0: Summon forth your wind-up Porom minion. The rosy cheeks and pronounced eyelashes indicate that this is the female half of a matching pair.
#. column 1: Created in the likeness of Porom, twin sister to Palom. According to legend, they were sent by the elder of their village to aid in an epic quest to save the world, which seems like a bit of a tall order for two five-year olds. Perhaps the other mages had more important matters to take care of?
