#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・エッジ」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。怒りってモンを……見せてやるぜえ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Edge-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie ist einem Helden aus einer vergangenen Zeit nachempfunden, der ein Prinz und ein Ninja war.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Edge miniature, une poupée magique à l'effigie d'un héros des temps anciens.
#. column 1: Legends tell of Edward Geraldine, the ninja prince who assumed the name Edge, presumably because it sounded more impressive. Rumors have it that “Edward” was already taken by another figure in the tale, and there cannot be two people sharing the same name─it just gets confusing.
#. column 2: You think our rage...a weakness?<br>Then let me show you how wrong you are!<br>   - Edge
#. column 3: Ninjutsu
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:401:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your wind-up Edge minion. Based on one of the few people who had the chance to be a prince <i>and</i> a ninja, which seems like too much fun to squeeze into one lifetime."
msgstr "Призовите заводного Эджа. Он успел побыть и принцем, <i>и</i> ниндзя — для одной жизни, пожалуй, слишком много веселья."

#. ja: 古の英雄「エッジ」を模した魔法人形。伝説によれば、とある国の第一王子であり、なおかつ忍術を用いた戦いのエキスパートであったという。王族らしからぬ振る舞いを示すこともあったが、熱血漢として民にも愛されたようだ
#. de: Edge soll nicht nur ein Prinz gewesen sein, sondern dazu noch ein talentierter Ninja. Das ist eine Kombination, die nur selten vorkommt, und um die ihn sicher viele junge Männer beneiden.
#. fr: La légende raconte que Edge, de son vrai nom Edward Geraldine, était un prince qui excellait également dans l'art du ninjutsu. Malgré ses manières indignes d'un membre de l'aristocratie, sa combativité et son enthousiasme le rendaient attachant aux yeux de son peuple.
#. column 0: Summon forth your wind-up Edge minion. Based on one of the few people who had the chance to be a prince <i>and</i> a ninja, which seems like too much fun to squeeze into one lifetime.
#. column 2: You think our rage...a weakness?<br>Then let me show you how wrong you are!<br>   - Edge
#. column 3: Ninjutsu
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:401:0:1"
msgid "Legends tell of Edward Geraldine, the ninja prince who assumed the name Edge, presumably because it sounded more impressive. Rumors have it that “Edward” was already taken by another figure in the tale, and there cannot be two people sharing the same name─it just gets confusing."
msgstr "Легенды гласят, что принц-ниндзя Эдвард Джеральдин взял себе имя Эдж, потому что оно звучало внушительнее. Говорят, имя «Эдвард» уже досталось другому герою этой истории, а двух Эдвардов в одной сказке быть не может — совсем запутаемся."

#. ja: 見セテヤルゼエ！
#. de: Du hältst Wut für eine Schwäche? Lass mich dir zeigen, wie sehr du dich täuschst!<br><i>Edge</i>
#. fr: Tu crois que ma colère... est une faiblesse<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon forth your wind-up Edge minion. Based on one of the few people who had the chance to be a prince <i>and</i> a ninja, which seems like too much fun to squeeze into one lifetime.
#. column 1: Legends tell of Edward Geraldine, the ninja prince who assumed the name Edge, presumably because it sounded more impressive. Rumors have it that “Edward” was already taken by another figure in the tale, and there cannot be two people sharing the same name─it just gets confusing.
#. column 3: Ninjutsu
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:401:0:2"
msgid "You think our rage...a weakness?<br>Then let me show you how wrong you are!<br>   - Edge"
msgstr "Думаешь, наша ярость... слабость?<br>Сейчас я покажу, как ты ошибаешься!<br>   — Эдж"

#. ja: にんじゅつ
#. de: Ninjutsu
#. fr: Ninjutsu
