#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:401:0:4"
msgid "Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s"
msgstr "Повышает АТК всех союзников в радиусе действия на 25.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・リディア」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。大事なのは……心
#. de: Du rufst deine Rydia-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie ist einer ebenso ehrgeizigen wie liebenswerten Heldin aus einer vergangenen Zeit nachempfunden.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Rydia miniature, une poupée magique à l'effigie d'une héroïne des temps anciens.
#. column 1: According to myth, Rydia went missing as a child only to reemerge a short while later as a woman grown. How she later came to be immortalized as a miniaturized mammet is unclear, though her voluminous bright green hair is said to be very true to life.
#. column 2: That was an awfully fast recovery.<br>   - Rydia
#. column 3: Summon
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:402:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your wind-up Rydia minion. Not to be confused with a sprig of broccoli."
msgstr "Призовите заводную Ридию. Не перепутайте с веточкой брокколи."

#. ja: 古の英雄「リディア」を模した魔法人形。希少とされる純粋なる召喚士であり、幼くして幻界に渡って幻獣たちに育てられたという逸話を持つ。それゆえに、心通わせた幻獣たちを召喚する術に長けていたらしい。大事なのは……心
#. de: Diese Puppe ist einer Beschwörerin nachempfunden, die vor langer Zeit gelebt haben soll. Der Legende nach verschwand Rydia als junges Mädchen und tauchte kurze Zeit später als erwachsene Frau wieder auf.
#. fr: Rydia est une invocatrice qui, alors qu'elle était encore très jeune, aurait été prise en charge et élevée à la lisière des mondes par les éons, ce qui ex<shy>pli<shy>que<shy>rait sa grande aisance à les contrôler.
#. column 0: Summon forth your wind-up Rydia minion. Not to be confused with a sprig of broccoli.
#. column 2: That was an awfully fast recovery.<br>   - Rydia
#. column 3: Summon
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:402:0:1"
msgid "According to myth, Rydia went missing as a child only to reemerge a short while later as a woman grown. How she later came to be immortalized as a miniaturized mammet is unclear, though her voluminous bright green hair is said to be very true to life."
msgstr "Согласно легенде, Ридия пропала ещё ребёнком, а вскоре вернулась уже взрослой. Как её превратили в крошечную куклу, неизвестно, но говорят, её пышные ярко-зелёные волосы очень похожи на настоящие."

#. ja: 大事ナノハ…心
#. de: Dieser Kampf ist unser aller Kampf.<br><i>Rydia</i>
#. fr: L'important, c'est le cœur.
#. column 0: Summon forth your wind-up Rydia minion. Not to be confused with a sprig of broccoli.
#. column 1: According to myth, Rydia went missing as a child only to reemerge a short while later as a woman grown. How she later came to be immortalized as a miniaturized mammet is unclear, though her voluminous bright green hair is said to be very true to life.
#. column 3: Summon
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:402:0:2"
msgid "That was an awfully fast recovery.<br>   - Rydia"
msgstr "Ну и быстро же он поправился.<br>   — Ридия"

#. ja: しょうかん
#. de: Beschwörung
#. fr: Invocation
#. column 0: Summon forth your wind-up Rydia minion. Not to be confused with a sprig of broccoli.
#. column 1: According to myth, Rydia went missing as a child only to reemerge a short while later as a woman grown. How she later came to be immortalized as a miniaturized mammet is unclear, though her voluminous bright green hair is said to be very true to life.
#. column 2: That was an awfully fast recovery.<br>   - Rydia
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:402:0:3"
msgid "Summon"
msgstr "Призыв"

#. ja: シールドが破壊されていた場合、復活させる。
#. de: Stellt einen zerstörten Schild wieder her.
#. fr: Rétablit votre bouclier s'il a été détruit.
#. column 0: Summon forth your wind-up Rydia minion. Not to be confused with a sprig of broccoli.
#. column 1: According to myth, Rydia went missing as a child only to reemerge a short while later as a woman grown. How she later came to be immortalized as a miniaturized mammet is unclear, though her voluminous bright green hair is said to be very true to life.
#. column 2: That was an awfully fast recovery.<br>   - Rydia
#. column 3: Summon
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:402:0:4"
msgid "Instantly restores damaged ally Shield."
msgstr "Мгновенно восстанавливает разрушенный щит союзника."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ローザ」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。いっしょに、たたかいましょう
#. de: Du rufst deine Rosa-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie ist einer freundlichen und gutherzigen Heldin aus einer vergangenen Zeit nachempfunden.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Rosa miniature, une poupée magique à l'effigie d'une héroïne des temps anciens.
#. column 1: Rosa is said to have been blessed with both powerful healing abilities and an unerring bow arm. Unfortunately, these were of little use on the occasion she came close to being either sliced by a guillotine or crushed by an iron ball, depending on which version of the tale one hears...
#. column 2: Please, Cecil...Be alive!<br>   - Rosa
#. column 3: Pray
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:403:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your wind-up Rosa minion. Based on the central corner of a one-sided love triangle, if such a thing is possible."
msgstr "Призовите заводную Розу. Она — центральная фигура любовного треугольника, в котором любит только она. Если такой треугольник вообще бывает."

#. ja: 古の英雄「ローザ」を模した魔法人形。さる王国の貴族令嬢であり、思いを寄せる人を助けるために白魔道士の道を歩むことに。また、弓術の腕前もかなりのものであったとも伝えられている。いっしょに、たたかいましょう
#. de: Die historische Weißmagierin, der diese Puppe nachempfunden ist, soll über große Heilkräfte verfügt haben und eine geschickte Bogenschützin gewesen sein.
#. fr: Grande altruiste par nature, Rosa joue en réalité un double jeu, puisque sous ses apparats de mage blanc veillant au bien-être de ses compagnons se trouve une archère redoutable qui fait toujours mouche.
#. column 0: Summon forth your wind-up Rosa minion. Based on the central corner of a one-sided love triangle, if such a thing is possible.
#. column 2: Please, Cecil...Be alive!<br>   - Rosa
#. column 3: Pray
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:403:0:1"
msgid "Rosa is said to have been blessed with both powerful healing abilities and an unerring bow arm. Unfortunately, these were of little use on the occasion she came close to being either sliced by a guillotine or crushed by an iron ball, depending on which version of the tale one hears..."
msgstr "Говорят, Роза была одарена и целительной магией, и меткой стрельбой из лука. Жаль, ни то ни другое не помогло, когда её едва не обезглавила гильотина или не раздавил железный шар — смотря какую версию истории слушать..."

#. ja: イッショニ、タタカイマショウ
#. de: Bitte, Cecil ... Sei am Leben!<br><i>Rosa</i>
#. fr: Battons-nous ensemble<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your wind-up Rosa minion. Based on the central corner of a one-sided love triangle, if such a thing is possible.
#. column 1: Rosa is said to have been blessed with both powerful healing abilities and an unerring bow arm. Unfortunately, these were of little use on the occasion she came close to being either sliced by a guillotine or crushed by an iron ball, depending on which version of the tale one hears...
#. column 3: Pray
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:403:0:2"
msgid "Please, Cecil...Be alive!<br>   - Rosa"
msgstr "Пожалуйста, Сесил... Живи!<br>   — Роза"

#. ja: いのり
#. de: Gebet
#. fr: Prière
#. column 0: Summon forth your wind-up Rosa minion. Based on the central corner of a one-sided love triangle, if such a thing is possible.
#. column 1: Rosa is said to have been blessed with both powerful healing abilities and an unerring bow arm. Unfortunately, these were of little use on the occasion she came close to being either sliced by a guillotine or crushed by an iron ball, depending on which version of the tale one hears...
#. column 2: Please, Cecil...Be alive!<br>   - Rosa
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:403:0:3"
msgid "Pray"
msgstr "Молитва"

