msgstr "Восстанавливает 100 ОЗ всем союзникам в радиусе действия (150, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>кукла</ui-edge-color></ui-color>)."

#. ja: ミニオン「セイブ・ザ・プリンセス」を呼び出す。<br>セイブ・ザ・クイーンに似た魔法仕掛けの玩具
#. de: Du rufst deine Prinzessinnewache als Begleiter herbei. Für alle, die schon immer eine langbeinige, trompetenblasende Marionette auf Rädern wollten: Hier ist sie.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Garde-la-Princesse, un jouet enchanté ressemblant à la divinité guerrière Garde-la-Reine.
#. column 1: Discovered deep in Delubrum Reginae, this bizarre contraption is believed to have been modeled after a much larger but equally bizarre contraption that once protected the ancient Bozjans from the Allagan Empire. The mystery of the trumpet, however, has yet to be solved.
#. column 2: How is our little princess doing?<br>   - Serendipity
#. column 3: By Not-so-royal Decree
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:404:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Save the Princess minion. For every person who has ever dreamed of owning a wheeled, spindly legged, trumpet-blowing mammet, there is this wheeled, spindly legged, trumpet-blowing mammet."
msgstr "Призовите куклу «Спаси принцессу». Для тех, кто мечтал завести заводную куклу на колёсах, с тонкими ножками и трубой. Да, именно такую."

#. ja: グンヒルド・ディルーブラムの地下遺跡群にて発見された魔法仕掛けの玩具。その姿は、闘神セイブ・ザ・クイーンに良く似ている。古代ボズヤ人が、アラグの軍勢から民を護った女王の姿を讃えて作ったものであろうか
#. de: Diese Absurdität wurde tief im Delubrum Reginae gefunden und es wird vermutet, dass sie nur das verkleinerte Abbild einer noch größeren Absurdität ist, welche die Bozianer des Altertums vor den Garlearn beschützte. Welche Rätsel die Trompete birgt, ist unbekannt.
#. fr: Cette figurine découverte dans les profondeurs de Delubrum Reginae, a été fabriquée à l'image de l'ancienne reine bozjienne, qui protégea son peuple contre les assauts de l'empire d'Allag.
#. column 0: Summon your Save the Princess minion. For every person who has ever dreamed of owning a wheeled, spindly legged, trumpet-blowing mammet, there is this wheeled, spindly legged, trumpet-blowing mammet.
#. column 2: How is our little princess doing?<br>   - Serendipity
#. column 3: By Not-so-royal Decree
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:404:0:1"
msgid "Discovered deep in Delubrum Reginae, this bizarre contraption is believed to have been modeled after a much larger but equally bizarre contraption that once protected the ancient Bozjans from the Allagan Empire. The mystery of the trumpet, however, has yet to be solved. "
msgstr "Эту странную штуковину нашли глубоко в Delubrum Reginae. Полагают, что её создали по образцу куда более крупной, но не менее странной машины, некогда защищавшей древних божан от Аллагской империи. А вот зачем ей труба, до сих пор загадка."

#. ja: コロコロ、キィ～！
#. de: Die Prinzessin ist also mal wieder auf eigene Faust unterwegs. Hoffentlich bringt sie uns nicht in Schwie<shy>rig<shy>keiten.<br><i>Jack</i>
#. fr: Roule, roule！
#. column 0: Summon your Save the Princess minion. For every person who has ever dreamed of owning a wheeled, spindly legged, trumpet-blowing mammet, there is this wheeled, spindly legged, trumpet-blowing mammet.
#. column 1: Discovered deep in Delubrum Reginae, this bizarre contraption is believed to have been modeled after a much larger but equally bizarre contraption that once protected the ancient Bozjans from the Allagan Empire. The mystery of the trumpet, however, has yet to be solved.
#. column 3: By Not-so-royal Decree
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:404:0:2"
msgid "How is our little princess doing?<br>   - Serendipity"
msgstr "Как там наша маленькая принцесса?<br>   — Серендипити"

#. ja: ゴッド・セイブ・ザ・プリンセス
#. de: Nicht ganz königliches Edikt
#. fr: Que les Dieux gardent la Princesse<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Save the Princess minion. For every person who has ever dreamed of owning a wheeled, spindly legged, trumpet-blowing mammet, there is this wheeled, spindly legged, trumpet-blowing mammet.
#. column 1: Discovered deep in Delubrum Reginae, this bizarre contraption is believed to have been modeled after a much larger but equally bizarre contraption that once protected the ancient Bozjans from the Allagan Empire. The mystery of the trumpet, however, has yet to be solved.
#. column 2: How is our little princess doing?<br>   - Serendipity
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:404:0:3"
msgid "By Not-so-royal Decree"
msgstr "Не слишком королевский указ"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your Save the Princess minion. For every person who has ever dreamed of owning a wheeled, spindly legged, trumpet-blowing mammet, there is this wheeled, spindly legged, trumpet-blowing mammet.
#. column 1: Discovered deep in Delubrum Reginae, this bizarre contraption is believed to have been modeled after a much larger but equally bizarre contraption that once protected the ancient Bozjans from the Allagan Empire. The mystery of the trumpet, however, has yet to be solved.
#. column 2: How is our little princess doing?<br>   - Serendipity
#. column 3: By Not-so-royal Decree
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:404:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Даёт 10 очков особых умений всем союзникам в радиусе действия, кроме тех, чьи умения имеют такой же эффект."

#. ja: ミニオン「ドリッピー」を呼び出す。<br>小さなノッケンの幼体。家出して、外の世界に旅立つ
#. de: Du rufst deinen Tröpfel als Begleiter herbei. Er vertraut darauf, dass du ihm nichts antust.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Drippy, une jeune nixe en voyage autour du monde.
#. column 1: This young nixie began life as rainwater that fell in Abalathia's Spine, and later found its way to Matoya's Relict via the Thaliak River. Having witnessed its elder kin summarily dispatched by the Warrior of Light, it decided to follow the age-old adage of “If one cannot beat them, one must needs join them.”
#. column 2: Is this water!?<br>Blah! Bluh! Bleh!<br>   - A Bewildered Amalj'aa
#. column 3: Drip Tide
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:405:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Drippy minion. With a will to wander the world, one wonders whether said world will welcome this well-meaning watery whelp. "
msgstr "Призовите Дриппи. Он мечтает повидать мир. Вот только рад ли мир встрече с этим добродушным водяным малышом?"

#. ja: ノッケンの幼体。アバラシア山脈に降り注ぐ雨水の中から生まれ、サリャク河を下り、マトーヤのアトリエにたどり着いた。しかし、冒険者とノッケンたちの戦いを見て、家出を決意。広い広い外の世界へと冒険の旅に出たのである
#. de: Ein junger Wassergeist. Geboren aus dem Regen, der auf Abalathias Rückgrat fällt, ließ er sich im Thaliak-Fluss mittreiben und strandete schließlich in Matoyas Atelier. Dein Kampf gegen seine Brüder bewog ihn jedoch dazu, in die weite Welt hinauszuziehen.
#. fr: Cette jeune nixe a fait son entrée dans le monde des vivants au milieu des montagnes d'Abalathia. Au gré de ses vagabondages, elle est arrivée à l'atelier de Matoya, où elle a rapidement compris qu'il valait mieux être l'alliée de la vieille ermite que son ennemie.
#. column 0: Summon your Drippy minion. With a will to wander the world, one wonders whether said world will welcome this well-meaning watery whelp.
#. column 2: Is this water!?<br>Blah! Bluh! Bleh!<br>   - A Bewildered Amalj'aa
#. column 3: Drip Tide
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:405:0:1"
msgid "This young nixie began life as rainwater that fell in Abalathia's Spine, and later found its way to Matoya's Relict via the Thaliak River. Having witnessed its elder kin summarily dispatched by the Warrior of Light, it decided to follow the age-old adage of “If one cannot beat them, one must needs join them.” "
msgstr "Этот юный водяной дух родился из дождевой воды, выпавшей на Хребте Абалатии, и добрался по реке Талиак до Реликвии Матойи. Увидев, как Воин Света расправился со старшими сородичами, он решил следовать старому правилу: «Не можешь победить — присоединяйся»."

#. ja: トゥルルル、アワワ～！
#. de: Sie beißen den Köder von der Angel ab und lachen dabei!<br><i>Zorniger Fischer</i>
#. fr: Turlututu et tralala~<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Drippy minion. With a will to wander the world, one wonders whether said world will welcome this well-meaning watery whelp.
#. column 1: This young nixie began life as rainwater that fell in Abalathia's Spine, and later found its way to Matoya's Relict via the Thaliak River. Having witnessed its elder kin summarily dispatched by the Warrior of Light, it decided to follow the age-old adage of “If one cannot beat them, one must needs join them.”
#. column 3: Drip Tide
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:405:0:2"
msgid "Is this water!?<br>Blah! Bluh! Bleh!<br>   - A Bewildered Amalj'aa"
msgstr "Это вода!?<br>Фу! Бля! Бле!<br>   — Замешавшийся амалджа"

#. ja: アワワ～！
#. de: Wasserstreich
#. fr: Tralala<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Drippy minion. With a will to wander the world, one wonders whether said world will welcome this well-meaning watery whelp.
#. column 1: This young nixie began life as rainwater that fell in Abalathia's Spine, and later found its way to Matoya's Relict via the Thaliak River. Having witnessed its elder kin summarily dispatched by the Warrior of Light, it decided to follow the age-old adage of “If one cannot beat them, one must needs join them.”
#. column 2: Is this water!?<br>Blah! Bluh! Bleh!<br>   - A Bewildered Amalj'aa
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:405:0:3"
msgid "Drip Tide"
msgstr "Водяная волна"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のアルカナストーンに、5%のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Arkana-Stein 5 % Schaden zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 5% de sa solidité à la pierre arcanique ennemie la plus proche.
#. column 0: Summon your Drippy minion. With a will to wander the world, one wonders whether said world will welcome this well-meaning watery whelp.
#. column 1: This young nixie began life as rainwater that fell in Abalathia's Spine, and later found its way to Matoya's Relict via the Thaliak River. Having witnessed its elder kin summarily dispatched by the Warrior of Light, it decided to follow the age-old adage of “If one cannot beat them, one must needs join them.”
#. column 2: Is this water!?<br>Blah! Bluh! Bleh!<br>   - A Bewildered Amalj'aa
#. column 3: Drip Tide
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:405:0:4"
msgid "Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone."
msgstr "Наносит 5% урона ближайшему вражескому камню арканы."

#. ja: ミニオン「トライク」を呼び出す。<br>トリケラトプスの幼体
#. de: Du rufst deinen Tricero als Begleiter herbei, ein Jungtier eines Triceratops.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Trike, un bébé tricératops nerveux mais affectueux.
#. column 1: Rescued from the Diadem by Aurvael de Haillenarte after falling sick from eating poisonous berries. The count's son would rather this tale not be discussed openly, particularly the part about him delving into a pile of fresh dung to ascertain the cause of the disease.
#. column 2: That is one big pile of shite.<br>   - Aurvael's Assistant
#. column 3: Trike Spike
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:406:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Trike minion. Very affectionate, but be prepared to make a quick sidestep if it comes running to greet you."
msgstr "Призовите трике. Он очень ласковый, но если побежит вас приветствовать, лучше успеть увернуться."

#. ja: トリケラトプスの幼体。有毒植物を食べてしまい倒れていたところを、ディアデム諸島を視察していたオールヴァエル・ド・アインハルトが発見。連れ帰って介抱したところ、人に懐いたという。心優しき者の後を付いて回る賢さを秘めている
#. de: Dieses Jungtier eines Triceratops wurde von Aurvael Haillenarte auf einer Diadem-Expedition entdeckt und nach Hause gebracht. Es soll die Weisheit besitzen, sich einzig Besitzer mit einem gütigen Herzen auszuwählen.
#. fr: Aurvael de Haillenarte a sauvé ce petit tricératops d'une mort certaine par empoisonnement lors d'une expédition au Diadème. Reconnaissant à l'extrême, l'animal a résolu de vouer son existence au bien-être des humains en les aidant durant leurs voyages.
#. column 0: Summon your Trike minion. Very affectionate, but be prepared to make a quick sidestep if it comes running to greet you.
#. column 2: That is one big pile of shite.<br>   - Aurvael's Assistant
#. column 3: Trike Spike
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:406:0:1"
msgid "Rescued from the Diadem by Aurvael de Haillenarte after falling sick from eating poisonous berries. The count's son would rather this tale not be discussed openly, particularly the part about him delving into a pile of fresh dung to ascertain the cause of the disease."
msgstr "Орваэль де Айнхарт спас его в Диадеме, когда тот заболел, наевшись ядовитых ягод. Сын графа предпочёл бы не рассказывать об этом всем подряд — особенно о том, как полез в свежую кучу навоза, чтобы выяснить причину болезни."

#. ja: トリ、ケラト、プス！
#. de: Auf dem Diadem findet man alle möglichen Schätze, aber <i>damit</i> hatte ich nicht gerechnet.<br><i>Aurvael Haillenarte</i>
#. fr: Triii... céraaa... tooops...
#. column 0: Summon your Trike minion. Very affectionate, but be prepared to make a quick sidestep if it comes running to greet you.
#. column 1: Rescued from the Diadem by Aurvael de Haillenarte after falling sick from eating poisonous berries. The count's son would rather this tale not be discussed openly, particularly the part about him delving into a pile of fresh dung to ascertain the cause of the disease.
#. column 3: Trike Spike
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:406:0:2"
msgid "That is one big pile of shite.<br>   - Aurvael's Assistant"
msgstr "Вот это куча дерьма.<br>   — Помощник Орваля"

#. ja: ぺたんこ
#. de: Trampelsaurier
#. fr: Trikorne
#. column 0: Summon your Trike minion. Very affectionate, but be prepared to make a quick sidestep if it comes running to greet you.
#. column 1: Rescued from the Diadem by Aurvael de Haillenarte after falling sick from eating poisonous berries. The count's son would rather this tale not be discussed openly, particularly the part about him delving into a pile of fresh dung to ascertain the cause of the disease.
#. column 2: That is one big pile of shite.<br>   - Aurvael's Assistant
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:406:0:3"
msgid "Trike Spike"
msgstr "Трике Спайк"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵にかかっている、強化効果をすべて打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle positiven Effekte von den gegnerischen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe tous les effets bénéfiques des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Trike minion. Very affectionate, but be prepared to make a quick sidestep if it comes running to greet you.
#. column 1: Rescued from the Diadem by Aurvael de Haillenarte after falling sick from eating poisonous berries. The count's son would rather this tale not be discussed openly, particularly the part about him delving into a pile of fresh dung to ascertain the cause of the disease.
#. column 2: That is one big pile of shite.<br>   - Aurvael's Assistant
#. column 3: Trike Spike
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:406:0:4"
msgid "Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все положительные эффекты со всех противников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「ゴールデンビーバー」を呼び出す。<br>謎の存在。なぜ金色なのか、深く考えてはいけない
#. de: Du rufst deinen Goldbiber als Begleiter herbei. Mit einem goldigen Gemüt gesegnet ist er innen wie außen goldig.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte castor doré, dont la couleur provoque toujours les plus profondes mais inutiles interrogations.
#. column 1: Whether this creature is a beaver turned into gold, or gold turned into a beaver is anyone's guess. It is said to appear in the passages of Lyhe Ghiah at the very moment one's heart's desire is fulfilled. Given the location, that would generally involve some sort of treasure.
#. column 2: No, anything but beavers!<br>   - Tyr Beq
#. column 3: Curse of the Golden Beaver
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:407:0:0"
msgid "Summon your golden beaver minion. Remember: all that glitters is not gold. Sometimes, it is a beaver."
msgstr "Призовите золотого бобра. Помните: не всё то золото, что блестит. Иногда это просто бобр."

#. ja: リェー・ギア・ダンジョンに現れる謎の存在。誰かが望む物を手に入れたとき、ビーバーが現れる。ならば、あなたが富を求めて宝の地図を手にした時、この出会いは約束されていたのだ。だから細かいことを、深く考えるのはやめておこう
#. de: Ein rätselhaftes Wesen aus purem Gold, das immer dann in den Verliesen von Lyhe Ghiah erscheint, wenn jemand findet, wonach er gesucht hat, zum Beispiel eine Schatzkarte. Warum das so ist, weiß der Biber.
#. fr: On raconte que cette étrange créature apparaît dans les donjons du Lyhe Ghiah lorsque le vœu d'un visiteur est exaucé. La plupart du temps, cela signifie que celui-ci a mis la main sur un trésor longtemps convoité.
#. column 0: Summon your golden beaver minion. Remember: all that glitters is not gold. Sometimes, it is a beaver.
#. column 2: No, anything but beavers!<br>   - Tyr Beq
#. column 3: Curse of the Golden Beaver
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:407:0:1"
msgid "Whether this creature is a beaver turned into gold, or gold turned into a beaver is anyone's guess. It is said to appear in the passages of Lyhe Ghiah at the very moment one's heart's desire is fulfilled. Given the location, that would generally involve some sort of treasure."
msgstr "Кто знает, то ли это бобр, обратившийся в золото, то ли золото, ставшее бобром. Говорят, он появляется в проходах Лихе Гиа ровно в тот миг, когда исполняется заветное желание. А уж там обычно речь о каком-нибудь сокровище."

#. ja: テケ、スタイシ、ルク…
#. de: Biber!<br><i>Versteck spielende Pixie</i>
#. fr: Graou<nbsp>! Graougraougraou<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your golden beaver minion. Remember: all that glitters is not gold. Sometimes, it is a beaver.
#. column 1: Whether this creature is a beaver turned into gold, or gold turned into a beaver is anyone's guess. It is said to appear in the passages of Lyhe Ghiah at the very moment one's heart's desire is fulfilled. Given the location, that would generally involve some sort of treasure.
#. column 3: Curse of the Golden Beaver
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:407:0:2"
msgid "No, anything but beavers!<br>   - Tyr Beq"
msgstr "Нет, только не бобры!<br>   — Тайр Бек"

#. ja: ガウ、ガウガウガウ！
#. de: Nagerlöcher
#. fr: Malédiction du castor doré
#. column 0: Summon your golden beaver minion. Remember: all that glitters is not gold. Sometimes, it is a beaver.
#. column 1: Whether this creature is a beaver turned into gold, or gold turned into a beaver is anyone's guess. It is said to appear in the passages of Lyhe Ghiah at the very moment one's heart's desire is fulfilled. Given the location, that would generally involve some sort of treasure.
#. column 2: No, anything but beavers!<br>   - Tyr Beq
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:407:0:3"
msgid "Curse of the Golden Beaver"
msgstr "Проклятие золотого бобра"

#. ja: 敵軍のシールドに70%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt einem gegnerischen Schild 70 % Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls er schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 70% de sa solidité au bouclier ennemi. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your golden beaver minion. Remember: all that glitters is not gold. Sometimes, it is a beaver.
#. column 1: Whether this creature is a beaver turned into gold, or gold turned into a beaver is anyone's guess. It is said to appear in the passages of Lyhe Ghiah at the very moment one's heart's desire is fulfilled. Given the location, that would generally involve some sort of treasure.
#. column 2: No, anything but beavers!<br>   - Tyr Beq
#. column 3: Curse of the Golden Beaver
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:407:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable."
msgstr "Наносит 70% урона прочности вражескому щиту. Не действует, если щит уже разрушен."

#. ja: ミニオン「ガル」を呼び出す。<br>ラノシア生まれのカモメ。魚の群れを見つけるのが上手い
#. de: Du rufst deine Möwe als Begleiter herbei. Fischschwärme und unbeaufsichtigte Mahlzeiten vermag sie aus weiter Distanz zu sichten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Goé, une mouette originaire de la Noscea, par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement douée pour repérer les bancs de poissons au large.
#. column 1: In a quest to find more food with less effort, this La Noscean gull took to following the fishing vessel <i>Endeavor</i>. Its resourcefulness earned it the respect of the ship's captain and crew, and it was made an honorary member of the Fishermen's Guild.
#. column 2: I swear, if another one takes<br>a shite on my hair, it'll be seagull<br>stew for dinner tonight!<br>   - V'kebbe
#. column 3: Fish Finder
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:408:0:0"
msgid "Summon your gull minion. Has a keen eye for finding schools of fish─and unguarded meals."
msgstr "Призовите чайку. Она зорко высматривает косяки рыб — и еду, оставленную без присмотра."

#. ja: ラノシア生まれのカモメ。より効率的に、ごちそうにありつくため、漁師ギルドの大型漁船「エンデバー号」を追うようになる。やがて、船長や冒険者たちに認められ、漁師ギルドの名誉会員と呼ばれるようになったのだった
#. de: Von der Aussicht auf leichte Beute verlockt, folgte diese Möwe dem Hochseefischkutter „Endeavor“. Der anfängliche Ärger des Kapitäns über den diebischen Vogel schlug nach und nach in Bewunderung um, und am Ende wurde sie gar zum Ehrenmitglied der Fischergilde ernannt.
#. fr: Cet oiseau s'est mis à suivre l'Ambition, ayant sûrement remarqué les quantités importantes de poissons pêchés par le vaisseau. Particulièrement apprécié pour son instinct de traqueur, il a été nommé membre honoraire de la guilde des pêcheurs.
#. column 0: Summon your gull minion. Has a keen eye for finding schools of fish─and unguarded meals.
#. column 2: I swear, if another one takes<br>a shite on my hair, it'll be seagull<br>stew for dinner tonight!<br>   - V'kebbe
#. column 3: Fish Finder
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:408:0:1"
msgid "In a quest to find more food with less effort, this La Noscean gull took to following the fishing vessel <i>Endeavor</i>. Its resourcefulness earned it the respect of the ship's captain and crew, and it was made an honorary member of the Fishermen's Guild."
msgstr "В поисках еды, которую можно добыть с меньшими усилиями, эта ланосийская чайка стала летать за рыболовным судном <i>«Эндевор»</i>. Капитан и команда оценили её смекалку, и птицу сделали почётным членом Гильдии рыбаков."

#. ja: キュッキュッ、キュー
#. de: Frischer Fisch ist köstlich. Etwas störend nur die vielen Vögel. Man muss sich in Acht nehmen, nicht <i>getroffen</i> zu werden.<br><i>Vkebbe</i>
#. fr: Ouèèk<nbsp>! Ouèèk<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your gull minion. Has a keen eye for finding schools of fish─and unguarded meals.
#. column 1: In a quest to find more food with less effort, this La Noscean gull took to following the fishing vessel <i>Endeavor</i>. Its resourcefulness earned it the respect of the ship's captain and crew, and it was made an honorary member of the Fishermen's Guild.
#. column 3: Fish Finder
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:408:0:2"
msgid "I swear, if another one takes<br>a shite on my hair, it'll be seagull<br>stew for dinner tonight!<br>   - V'kebbe"
msgstr "Клянусь, ещё одна нагадит<br>мне на волосы — и сегодня<br>на ужин будет чайка!<br>   — В'кеббе"

#. ja: 魚群探知
#. de: Fischfinder
#. fr: Détecteur ichtyen
#. column 0: Summon your gull minion. Has a keen eye for finding schools of fish─and unguarded meals.
#. column 1: In a quest to find more food with less effort, this La Noscean gull took to following the fishing vessel <i>Endeavor</i>. Its resourcefulness earned it the respect of the ship's captain and crew, and it was made an honorary member of the Fishermen's Guild.
#. column 2: I swear, if another one takes<br>a shite on my hair, it'll be seagull<br>stew for dinner tonight!<br>   - V'kebbe
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:408:0:3"
msgid "Fish Finder"
msgstr "Искатель рыбы"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の移動速度を35%上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Erhöht die GSW eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 35 %.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 35% la vitesse de déplacement des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
