#. ja: ミニオン「アントイーター」を呼び出す。<br>オオアリクイの子。蟻は食べるが夫は食べない
#. de: Du rufst deinen Ameisenbär als Begleiter herbei. Er frisst Ameisen und keine Abenteurer - jedenfalls nicht, soweit dir bekannt ist<nbsp>...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Tamandua, un fourmilier à l'appétit insatiable.
#. column 1: Thanks to its voracious appetite, this young anteater has grown to a size to rival an adult Lalafell. Though appearing to otherwise be harmless, in certain parts its kind is said to prey on seasonal workers─and the men specifically─thus earning it the moniker of the Widowmaker.
#. column 2: I'll never find a<br>wife at this rate.<br>   - Gales
#. column 3: Widowmaker
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:409:0:0"
msgid "Summon your anteater minion. Definitely not a man-eater, otherwise that's what it would be called...right?"
msgstr "Призовите муравьеда. Он точно не людоед, иначе так бы и назывался... верно?"

#. ja: オオアリクイの子。小さな蟻を大量に食べることで成長し、やがてララフェルを凌駕する巨体を手に入れることになる。ある地域では、頻繁に出稼ぎ労働者の男たちを殺害することから、ウィドウメイカーと呼ばれ恐れられているらしい
#. de: Ein Ameisenbär, der durch das Verschlingen von Unmengen an Ameisen seine stattliche Größe erreicht hat. In einigen Gegenden ist er auch unter dem Namen „Witwenmacher“ bekannt, da er mit dem Verschwinden von Wanderarbeitern in Zusammenhang gebracht wird.
#. fr: Ce jeune fourmilier femelle s'est tellement gorgé de fourmis qu'il a grandi au point de dépasser la taille d'un Lalafell adulte. Dans certaines régions, on dit qu'il est même capable de dévorer un homme, ce qui lui vaut le surnom d'“Endeuilleur”.
#. column 0: Summon your anteater minion. Definitely not a man-eater, otherwise that's what it would be called...right?
#. column 2: I'll never find a<br>wife at this rate.<br>   - Gales
#. column 3: Widowmaker
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:409:0:1"
msgid "Thanks to its voracious appetite, this young anteater has grown to a size to rival an adult Lalafell. Though appearing to otherwise be harmless, in certain parts its kind is said to prey on seasonal workers─and the men specifically─thus earning it the moniker of the Widowmaker."
msgstr "Из-за отменного аппетита этот муравьедёнок вырос почти с взрослого лалафелла. На вид он безобиден, но в некоторых краях говорят, что его сородичи охотятся на сезонных рабочих — и только на мужчин. Отсюда и прозвище «Вдоводел»."

#. ja: キシャアァァァ！
#. de: Ich schwöre, er hat mich angesehen, als sei ich eine Ameise.<br><i>Anonymer Wanderarbeiter</i>
#. fr: Slurp<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your anteater minion. Definitely not a man-eater, otherwise that's what it would be called...right?
#. column 1: Thanks to its voracious appetite, this young anteater has grown to a size to rival an adult Lalafell. Though appearing to otherwise be harmless, in certain parts its kind is said to prey on seasonal workers─and the men specifically─thus earning it the moniker of the Widowmaker.
#. column 3: Widowmaker
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:409:0:2"
msgid "I'll never find a<br>wife at this rate.<br>   - Gales"
msgstr "С такими темпами<br>мне жены не видать.<br>   — Гейлс"

#. ja: ウィドウメイカー
#. de: Witwenmacher
#. fr: Endeuilleur
#. column 0: Summon your anteater minion. Definitely not a man-eater, otherwise that's what it would be called...right?
#. column 1: Thanks to its voracious appetite, this young anteater has grown to a size to rival an adult Lalafell. Though appearing to otherwise be harmless, in certain parts its kind is said to prey on seasonal workers─and the men specifically─thus earning it the moniker of the Widowmaker.
#. column 2: I'll never find a<br>wife at this rate.<br>   - Gales
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:409:0:3"
msgid "Widowmaker"
msgstr "Вдоводел"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵のDEFを、50%低下させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>15秒
#. de: Verringert die ABW von Gegnern in der Nähe um 50 %.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 Sekunden
#. fr: Réduit de 50% la défense des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
