#. ja: ミニオン「ドルフィン・カフ」を呼び出す。<br>とても賢いイルカの子。おそらく、貴方よりも賢い
#. de: Du rufst dein Delphinkalb als Begleiter herbei. Es besitzt mit seinen jungen Jahren mehr Verstand, als du jemals haben wirst.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé dauphin. Un être délicat à l'intellect très développé, peut-être même encore plus qu'on ne le croit.
#. column 1: A Sharlayan biologist once stated that dolphins are the second-most intelligent species on the star. It was later noted that, regarding the most intelligent, the man made no comment. Sensing impending doom, this calf has attached itself to you in hopes of finding a way to flee to safety.
#. column 2: So long, and thanks<br>for all the fish.<br>   - Dolphinkind
#. column 3: So Long
#. column 4: Reduces movement speed of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:410:0:0"
msgid "Summon your dolphin calf minion. Has more intelligence in a single winsome flipper than you do in your whole body."
msgstr "Призовите детёныша дельфина. В одном его изящном плавнике ума больше, чем во всём вашем теле."

#. ja: とても賢いイルカの子。あるシャーレアンの生物学者によれば、イルカは、この星で2番目に高い知性を持つ生物だという。事実、この子も星に迫る危機を察知し、脱出方法を探して冒険者に付いていくことにしたようだ
#. de: Laut eines sharlayanischen Biologen sind Delphine die zweitklügsten Wesen auf diesem Planeten. Zu den klügsten Wesen hat sich derselbige Wissenschaftler niemals explizit geäußert.
#. fr: Un célèbre érudit sharlayanais a émis une théorie selon laquelle les dauphins étaient la deuxième espèce la plus intelligente de la planète. Sentant l'apocalypse arriver, ils quittèrent les lieux en laissant derrière eux un message cryptique.
#. column 0: Summon your dolphin calf minion. Has more intelligence in a single winsome flipper than you do in your whole body.
#. column 2: So long, and thanks<br>for all the fish.<br>   - Dolphinkind
#. column 3: So Long
#. column 4: Reduces movement speed of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:410:0:1"
msgid "A Sharlayan biologist once stated that dolphins are the second-most intelligent species on the star. It was later noted that, regarding the most intelligent, the man made no comment. Sensing impending doom, this calf has attached itself to you in hopes of finding a way to flee to safety."
msgstr "Однажды шаллаянский биолог заявил, что дельфины — второй по разуму вид на этой звезде. Позже заметили, что о самом разумном виде учёный умолчал. Почувствовав надвигающуюся беду, этот малыш привязался к вам в надежде найти способ спастись."

#. ja: いままで魚をありがとう
#. de: Adieu und danke für all die Fische.<br><i>Sprechender Delphin</i>
#. fr: Et encore merci pour tout le poisson<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your dolphin calf minion. Has more intelligence in a single winsome flipper than you do in your whole body.
#. column 1: A Sharlayan biologist once stated that dolphins are the second-most intelligent species on the star. It was later noted that, regarding the most intelligent, the man made no comment. Sensing impending doom, this calf has attached itself to you in hopes of finding a way to flee to safety.
#. column 3: So Long
#. column 4: Reduces movement speed of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:410:0:2"
msgid "So long, and thanks<br>for all the fish.<br>   - Dolphinkind"
msgstr "Прощайте, и спасибо<br>за всю рыбу.<br>   — Дельфин"

#. ja: さようなら
#. de: Adieu
#. fr: Salut<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your dolphin calf minion. Has more intelligence in a single winsome flipper than you do in your whole body.
#. column 1: A Sharlayan biologist once stated that dolphins are the second-most intelligent species on the star. It was later noted that, regarding the most intelligent, the man made no comment. Sensing impending doom, this calf has attached itself to you in hopes of finding a way to flee to safety.
#. column 2: So long, and thanks<br>for all the fish.<br>   - Dolphinkind
