#. ja: ミニオン「魔導プレデター追従型」を呼び出す。<br>魔導プレデターを模したからくり模型。帝国軍一般兵付き
#. de: Du rufst deinen A-Magitek-Prädator als Begleiter herbei. Er kommt mitsamt garleischem Piloten daher und ist bereit, Chaos und Verwüstung anzurichten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte prédateur magitek S1, un modèle réduit de l'armure du même nom. Fourni avec une figurine de soldat impérial.
#. column 1: This miniaturized model of an imperial warmachina was found among the forces of the Telophoroi laying siege to Paglth'an. By all appearances a toy of Garlean make, it is unclear how it managed to make its way to the southern reaches of Eorzea.
#. column 2: Smash and burn their<br>little toy, we will!<br>   - Ixali Chieftain
#. column 3: Melee Claws
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:411:0:0"
msgid "Summon your magitek predator F1 minion. Comes complete with pilot and stands ready to wreak havoc among the enemy's ranks."
msgstr "Призовите магитека-хищника F1. В комплекте пилот — готов сеять хаос во вражеских рядах."

#. ja: 魔導プレデターを模したからくり模型。テロフォロイの軍勢に混じって進撃してきたところを回収された。どうやら帝都ガレマルドで販売されていた玩具のようだが、いかにしてパガルザンまでやって来たのかは、わからない
#. de: Eine Miniaturausgabe des Magitek-Prädators. Sie hatte sich unter den Soldaten der Telophoroi befunden, als diese in Paglth'an eingefallen waren. Wie sie von einem Spielzeuggeschäft in Garlemald dorthin kam, ist ein Rätsel.
#. fr: Ce modèle réduit a été découvert à Paglth'an, parmi les effets des membres des forces télophores. Il semble que ce jouet vienne de la capitale impériale, mais personne ne sait comment il a atterri dans le Thanalan.
#. column 0: Summon your magitek predator F1 minion. Comes complete with pilot and stands ready to wreak havoc among the enemy's ranks.
#. column 2: Smash and burn their<br>little toy, we will!<br>   - Ixali Chieftain
#. column 3: Melee Claws
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:411:0:1"
msgid "This miniaturized model of an imperial warmachina was found among the forces of the Telophoroi laying siege to Paglth'an. By all appearances a toy of Garlean make, it is unclear how it managed to make its way to the southern reaches of Eorzea."
msgstr "Эту миниатюрную модель имперской боевой машины нашли среди войск телофорои, осаждавших Пагльт'ан. Судя по всему, это гарлеанская игрушка, но как она попала на юг Эорзеи — неизвестно."

#. ja: ガシャン、ガシャン！
#. de: Eine Magitek-Waffe ist kein Spielzeug!<br><i>Widargelt</i>
#. fr: Klonk... Klonk...
#. column 0: Summon your magitek predator F1 minion. Comes complete with pilot and stands ready to wreak havoc among the enemy's ranks.
#. column 1: This miniaturized model of an imperial warmachina was found among the forces of the Telophoroi laying siege to Paglth'an. By all appearances a toy of Garlean make, it is unclear how it managed to make its way to the southern reaches of Eorzea.
#. column 3: Melee Claws
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:411:0:2"
msgid "Smash and burn their<br>little toy, we will!<br>   - Ixali Chieftain"
msgstr "Разнесём их<br>игрушку в щепки!<br>   — Вождь иксалов"

#. ja: 格闘戦クロー
#. de: Kampfkrallen
#. fr: Griffes prédatrices
#. column 0: Summon your magitek predator F1 minion. Comes complete with pilot and stands ready to wreak havoc among the enemy's ranks.
#. column 1: This miniaturized model of an imperial warmachina was found among the forces of the Telophoroi laying siege to Paglth'an. By all appearances a toy of Garlean make, it is unclear how it managed to make its way to the southern reaches of Eorzea.
#. column 2: Smash and burn their<br>little toy, we will!<br>   - Ixali Chieftain
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable.
