msgid "Melee Claws"
msgstr "Боевые когти"

#. ja: 敵軍のサーチ・アイへ90%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt einem gegnerischen Suchenden Auge 90 % Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls es schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 90% de sa solidité à l'œil scrutateur ennemi. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your magitek predator F1 minion. Comes complete with pilot and stands ready to wreak havoc among the enemy's ranks.
#. column 1: This miniaturized model of an imperial warmachina was found among the forces of the Telophoroi laying siege to Paglth'an. By all appearances a toy of Garlean make, it is unclear how it managed to make its way to the southern reaches of Eorzea.
#. column 2: Smash and burn their<br>little toy, we will!<br>   - Ixali Chieftain
#. column 3: Melee Claws
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:411:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable."
msgstr "Наносит 90% урона прочности вражескому Оку наблюдения. Не действует, если оно уже разрушено."

#. ja: ミニオン「セニョリータ・サボテンダー」を呼び出す。<br>マンダヴィル・ゴールドソーサーの景品。愛らしさは針千本級
#. de: Du rufst deine Señorita Kaktor als Begleiterin herbei. So kuschelig wie ein Igel.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Señorita Pampa, un des joyaux du Gold Saucer des Manderville. Attention, les épines sont totalement authentiques<nbsp>!
#. column 1: One of the coveted prizes on offer at the Gold Saucer, the Senorita Sabotender is the charming niece of the iconic Senor Sabotender. Each example is said to be lovingly handcrafted by the realm-renowned goldsmith and park proprietor, Godbert Manderville.
#. column 2: Sabotenders do not shake!<br>   - Nanaphon
#. column 3: Senorita
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:412:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Senorita Sabotender minion. Like a thousand adorable needles piercing your eyeballs."
msgstr "Призовите мисс Саботендера. Тысяча очаровательных иголок — прямо в глаза."

#. ja: セニョール・サボテンダーの姪、という触れ込みの魔法人形。ゴールドソーサーのオーナーであり、エオルゼア最強の彫金師として知られるゴッドベルト氏の手により、ひとつひとつ手作りで作られているらしい
#. de: Einer der attraktiven Preise des Gold Saucers. Geschaffen von Godbert, dem Eigentümer des Gold Saucers, der als größter Goldschmied Thanalans gilt, stellt diese Puppe die Nichte des legendären Señors Kaktor dar.
#. fr: Cette poupée magique est la nièce du Señor Pampa. Elle a été façonnée mé<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>leu<shy>se<shy>ment par Godbert Manderville, “l'orfèvre le plus balèze d'Éorzéa” et pro<shy>prié<shy>taire du Gold Saucer.
#. column 0: Summon your Senorita Sabotender minion. Like a thousand adorable needles piercing your eyeballs.
#. column 2: Sabotenders do not shake!<br>   - Nanaphon
#. column 3: Senorita
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:412:0:1"
msgid "One of the coveted prizes on offer at the Gold Saucer, the Senorita Sabotender is the charming niece of the iconic Senor Sabotender. Each example is said to be lovingly handcrafted by the realm-renowned goldsmith and park proprietor, Godbert Manderville."
msgstr "Мисс Саботендер — один из желанных призов «Золотого блюдца» и очаровательная племянница знаменитого мсье Саботендера. Говорят, каждую такую куколку с любовью изготавливает сам Годберт Мандервиль, прославленный на весь мир ювелир и владелец парка."

#. ja: セニョリータ！
#. de: Diese Nadeln!<br><i>Nanaphon</i>
#. fr: Señorita<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Senorita Sabotender minion. Like a thousand adorable needles piercing your eyeballs.
#. column 1: One of the coveted prizes on offer at the Gold Saucer, the Senorita Sabotender is the charming niece of the iconic Senor Sabotender. Each example is said to be lovingly handcrafted by the realm-renowned goldsmith and park proprietor, Godbert Manderville.
#. column 3: Senorita
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:412:0:2"
msgid "Sabotenders do not shake!<br>   - Nanaphon"
msgstr "Саботендеры не трясутся!<br>   — Нанафон"

#. ja: セニョリータ！
#. de: Señorita
#. fr: Señorita<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Senorita Sabotender minion. Like a thousand adorable needles piercing your eyeballs.
#. column 1: One of the coveted prizes on offer at the Gold Saucer, the Senorita Sabotender is the charming niece of the iconic Senor Sabotender. Each example is said to be lovingly handcrafted by the realm-renowned goldsmith and park proprietor, Godbert Manderville.
