#. ja: ミニオン「ベンベン」を呼び出す。<br>海底で発見された謎めいた四角錐。なぜか動く
#. de: Du rufst deine Benben-Pyramide als Begleiter herbei. Sie wurde auf dem Meeresgrund entdeckt und kann sich bewegen. Jeder braucht so etwas.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Benben, une mystérieuse pyramide animée.
#. column 1: Long ago, the men of Meracydia built great stone monuments in the image of Benben, a mound of myth whose name means “eternity.” This object is the top piece of such a structure, but none can say how it came to be in the dark depths of a faraway sea─or why it has legs.
#. column 2: Our legends will<br>echo in eternity!<br>   - Dorys
#. column 3: On High
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:413:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Benben stone minion. For when you need the top stone of a pyramid scampering around after you."
msgstr "Призовите каменного Бенбена. Если вам нужен верхушечный камень пирамиды, который будет семенить за вами."

#. ja: この謎めいた四角錐の物体は、南方大陸の神話に登場する「永遠」を意味する古の丘「ベンベン」を象徴する記念物らしい。巨大石造墳墓の頂に据えられていたはずのシロモノだが、なぜか遠く離れた海の底で発見された
#. de: Die Bewohner Meracydias bauten einst ein Steinmonument in der Form des legendären Bergs Benben, dessen Name „Ewigkeit“ bedeutet. Die Pyramide bildete die Spitze. Wer sie zum Meeresgrund beförderte?  Na, ihre Beine, wer denn sonst?
#. fr: Cette étrange créature a été découverte dans les fonds marins. Nul ne sait comme elle est arrivée là, mais il semble qu'elle soit liée à Benben, un monument mythique du folklore méracydien dont le nom signifie “éternel” dans la langue de cette ancienne civilisation.
#. column 0: Summon your Benben stone minion. For when you need the top stone of a pyramid scampering around after you.
#. column 2: Our legends will<br>echo in eternity!<br>   - Dorys
#. column 3: On High
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:413:0:1"
msgid "Long ago, the men of Meracydia built great stone monuments in the image of Benben, a mound of myth whose name means “eternity.” This object is the top piece of such a structure, but none can say how it came to be in the dark depths of a faraway sea─or why it has legs."
msgstr "Давным-давно жители Мерацидии возводили огромные каменные памятники в форме Бенбена — легендарного холма, чьё имя означает «вечность». Этот предмет венчал такую постройку, но никто не знает, как он оказался на дне далёкого моря и откуда у него ноги."

#. ja: ベンベン！
#. de: Pyramiden brauchen Beine, um sich fortzubewegen.<br><i>Anonymer Monumentforscher</i>
#. fr: Benben<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Benben stone minion. For when you need the top stone of a pyramid scampering around after you.
#. column 1: Long ago, the men of Meracydia built great stone monuments in the image of Benben, a mound of myth whose name means “eternity.” This object is the top piece of such a structure, but none can say how it came to be in the dark depths of a faraway sea─or why it has legs.
#. column 3: On High
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:413:0:2"
msgid "Our legends will<br>echo in eternity!<br>   - Dorys"
msgstr "Наши легенды<br>будут жить вечно!<br>   — Дорис"

#. ja: ハーイ！
#. de: An der Spitze
#. fr: Coucouuu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Benben stone minion. For when you need the top stone of a pyramid scampering around after you.
#. column 1: Long ago, the men of Meracydia built great stone monuments in the image of Benben, a mound of myth whose name means “eternity.” This object is the top piece of such a structure, but none can say how it came to be in the dark depths of a faraway sea─or why it has legs.
#. column 2: Our legends will<br>echo in eternity!<br>   - Dorys
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:413:0:3"
msgid "On High"
msgstr "На вершине"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のアルカナストーンに、5%のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Arkana-Stein 5 % Schaden zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 5% de sa solidité à la pierre arcanique ennemie la plus proche.
#. column 0: Summon your Benben stone minion. For when you need the top stone of a pyramid scampering around after you.
#. column 1: Long ago, the men of Meracydia built great stone monuments in the image of Benben, a mound of myth whose name means “eternity.” This object is the top piece of such a structure, but none can say how it came to be in the dark depths of a faraway sea─or why it has legs.
#. column 2: Our legends will<br>echo in eternity!<br>   - Dorys
#. column 3: On High
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:413:0:4"
msgid "Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone."
msgstr "Наносит 5% урона ближайшему вражескому арканному камню."

#. ja: ミニオン「放浪者の焚き火」を呼び出す。<br>旅先で焚き火を熾すための石組み一式
#. de: Du rufst dein Reise-Lagerfeuer als Begleiter herbei. Sollte in keiner (feuerfesten) Reisehandtasche fehlen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte feu de camp de voyageur, parfaite pour vous éclairer en pleine nature, et surtout pour faire de bonnes grillades.
#. column 1: Couldn't strike a fire if your life depended on it? Sick of lugging around backbreaking loads of firewood on the off chance you need to camp out, but couldn't be bothered to gather the stuff at the end of a long, weary day? Introducing the wanderer's campfire!
#. column 2: Few things compare to the simple<br>pleasure of sitting beside a crackling<br>campfire of one's own making.<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Warmth
#. column 4: Restores 200 HP to all allies within range (250 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:414:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wanderer's campfire minion. Perfect for driving away the darkness and the chill and, most importantly, toasting marshmallows."
msgstr "Призовите походный костёр. Он прогонит тьму и холод, а главное — поможет поджарить зефир."

#. ja: 旅先で焚き火を熾すための石組み一式。焚き火は、夜の闇を払い人の心に安らぎをもたらし、寒さから逃れる術を与えてくれる。だが、焼きマシュマロを作ること以上に、重要な焚き火の使い道はないと考えられている
#. de: Ein Lagerfeuer zum Mitnehmen, das nicht nur wilde Tiere fernhält, sondern auch vor Kälte schützt. Natürlich lassen sich auch Marshmallows darüber rösten.
#. fr: Cette mascotte surprenante est parfaite pour tout aventurier qui se respecte. Au beau milieu de la nuit, si vous vous réveillez, elle est toujours là pour chasser les ténèbres et votre désespoir. Elle vous éclaire quand elle luit dans la nuit.
#. column 0: Summon your wanderer's campfire minion. Perfect for driving away the darkness and the chill and, most importantly, toasting marshmallows.
#. column 2: Few things compare to the simple<br>pleasure of sitting beside a crackling<br>campfire of one's own making.<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Warmth
#. column 4: Restores 200 HP to all allies within range (250 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:414:0:1"
msgid "Couldn't strike a fire if your life depended on it? Sick of lugging around backbreaking loads of firewood on the off chance you need to camp out, but couldn't be bothered to gather the stuff at the end of a long, weary day? Introducing the wanderer's campfire!"
msgstr "Не умеете разжечь огонь, даже если от этого зависит ваша жизнь? Надоело таскать на себе неподъёмную охапку дров на случай ночёвки под открытым небом, но после долгого дня совсем не хочется их собирать? Тогда вам нужен походный костёр!"

#. ja: めらめらめら……
#. de: Ah, die Wärme tut gut ... Und das Flackern der Flammen wirkt vertraut und beruhigend.<br><i>Alphinaud</i>
#. fr: Froushhh...
#. column 0: Summon your wanderer's campfire minion. Perfect for driving away the darkness and the chill and, most importantly, toasting marshmallows.
#. column 1: Couldn't strike a fire if your life depended on it? Sick of lugging around backbreaking loads of firewood on the off chance you need to camp out, but couldn't be bothered to gather the stuff at the end of a long, weary day? Introducing the wanderer's campfire!
#. column 3: Warmth
#. column 4: Restores 200 HP to all allies within range (250 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:414:0:2"
msgid "Few things compare to the simple<br>pleasure of sitting beside a crackling<br>campfire of one's own making.<br>   - Alphinaud"
msgstr "Мало что сравнится<br>с тихой радостью посидеть у<br>собственноручно разведённого костра.<br>   — Альфино"

#. ja: ぬくもり
#. de: Lagerfeuerromantik
#. fr: Chaleur
#. column 0: Summon your wanderer's campfire minion. Perfect for driving away the darkness and the chill and, most importantly, toasting marshmallows.
#. column 1: Couldn't strike a fire if your life depended on it? Sick of lugging around backbreaking loads of firewood on the off chance you need to camp out, but couldn't be bothered to gather the stuff at the end of a long, weary day? Introducing the wanderer's campfire!
#. column 2: Few things compare to the simple<br>pleasure of sitting beside a crackling<br>campfire of one's own making.<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 4: Restores 200 HP to all allies within range (250 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>gadget</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:414:0:3"
msgid "Warmth"
msgstr "Тепло"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のHPを、200回復する。味方のタイプが「ガジェット」の場合は、HPが250回復する。
#. de: Regeneriert 200 LP bei eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe, im Fall von Apparaten 250.
#. fr: Soigne 200 PV aux alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou 250 PV s'ils sont de type “Mécanisme”.
#. column 0: Summon your wanderer's campfire minion. Perfect for driving away the darkness and the chill and, most importantly, toasting marshmallows.
#. column 1: Couldn't strike a fire if your life depended on it? Sick of lugging around backbreaking loads of firewood on the off chance you need to camp out, but couldn't be bothered to gather the stuff at the end of a long, weary day? Introducing the wanderer's campfire!
#. column 2: Few things compare to the simple<br>pleasure of sitting beside a crackling<br>campfire of one's own making.<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Warmth
