msgstr "Восстанавливает 200 ОЗ всем союзникам в радиусе действия (250, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>механизм</ui-edge-color></ui-color>)."

#. ja: ミニオン「機械生命体」を呼び出す。<br>塔上層で発見された機械生命体に似た何か
#. de: Du rufst deine Maschinenwesen-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Die Miniaturausgabe eines Maschinenwesens, das im oberen Teil des Hauptquartiers von Baldesions Gelehrten gefunden wurde.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte forme de vie mécanique, une espèce d'automate un peu rouillé.
#. column 1: Discovered on the upper levels of the Tower, this tiny lifeform resembles the short-legged machines that occupied the selfsame structure. Though it follows you relentlessly, scans the area menacingly, and punches vigorously, it appears to mean you no harm.
#. column 2: Nothing but lumps<br>of rust if you ask me.<br>   - Moogle
#. column 3: Attack
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:415:0:0"
msgid "Summon your smaller stubby minion. A little rusted but still fit for purpose...whatever that may be."
msgstr "Призовите коротышку. Немного ржавый, но всё ещё на ходу... для чего — другой вопрос."

#. ja: 塔の上層で発見された機械仕掛けの人形。その姿は、小型短足の機械生命体によく似た姿を有しているが、サイズなどが明らかに異なる。ただひたすらに追従してくるだけで、害意はないように見えるが……
#. de: Obwohl dieses kurzbeinige Wesen dir überallhin folgt, dich mit seinen Leuchtaugen anstarrt und mit seinen dünnen Ärmchen hin und wieder in die Luft boxt, will es dir nicht schaden.
#. fr: Cette étrange machine anthropomorphique a été découverte au niveau supérieur de la tour de la Contingence. Elle vous suit partout, mais vous ne savez pas trop pourquoi. Elle n'a pas l'air méchante en tout cas.
#. column 0: Summon your smaller stubby minion. A little rusted but still fit for purpose...whatever that may be.
#. column 2: Nothing but lumps<br>of rust if you ask me.<br>   - Moogle
#. column 3: Attack
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:415:0:1"
msgid "Discovered on the upper levels of the Tower, this tiny lifeform resembles the short-legged machines that occupied the selfsame structure. Though it follows you relentlessly, scans the area menacingly, and punches vigorously, it appears to mean you no harm."
msgstr "Эту крошечную форму жизни нашли на верхних этажах Башни. Она похожа на коротконогие машины, обитавшие там же. Миньон неотступно следует за вами, угрожающе сканирует местность и энергично машет кулаками, но, похоже, зла не желает."

#. ja: …………
#. de: <i>Was</i> diese Maschinenwesen tatsächlich sind, ist ein Geheimnis, das ich zu lüften gedenke! <br><i>Anogg</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon your smaller stubby minion. A little rusted but still fit for purpose...whatever that may be.
#. column 1: Discovered on the upper levels of the Tower, this tiny lifeform resembles the short-legged machines that occupied the selfsame structure. Though it follows you relentlessly, scans the area menacingly, and punches vigorously, it appears to mean you no harm.
#. column 3: Attack
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:415:0:2"
msgid "Nothing but lumps<br>of rust if you ask me.<br>   - Moogle"
msgstr "Одна ржавчина<br>и больше ничего.<br>   — Мугл"

#. ja: 攻撃
#. de: Attacke
#. fr: Attaque
#. column 0: Summon your smaller stubby minion. A little rusted but still fit for purpose...whatever that may be.
#. column 1: Discovered on the upper levels of the Tower, this tiny lifeform resembles the short-legged machines that occupied the selfsame structure. Though it follows you relentlessly, scans the area menacingly, and punches vigorously, it appears to mean you no harm.
#. column 2: Nothing but lumps<br>of rust if you ask me.<br>   - Moogle
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:415:0:3"
msgid "Attack"
msgstr "Атака"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK30のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 30 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 30 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et les projette en arrière.
#. column 0: Summon your smaller stubby minion. A little rusted but still fit for purpose...whatever that may be.
#. column 1: Discovered on the upper levels of the Tower, this tiny lifeform resembles the short-legged machines that occupied the selfsame structure. Though it follows you relentlessly, scans the area menacingly, and punches vigorously, it appears to mean you no harm.
#. column 2: Nothing but lumps<br>of rust if you ask me.<br>   - Moogle
#. column 3: Attack
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:415:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия удар силой 30 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ライナ」を呼び出す。<br>ライナを模した魔法人形。返事は敬礼で！
#. de: Du rufst deine Lyna-Puppe als Begleiterin herbei. Wer sie ansieht, muss unwillkürlich salutieren.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Lyna miniature. N'oubliez pas de la saluer comme il faut<nbsp>!
#. column 1: In her cups at the tavern one night, Lyna agreed to let a dwarven craftsman create mammets in her likeness. Though she claims no memory of the incident, it can't be denied that the result is a masterful recreation of the good captain, down to the rousing salute.
#. column 2: Lyna does not strike me<br>as one who enjoys being<br>made to wait.<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Captain's Resolve
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:416:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Lyna minion. Don't forget to salute, or you're liable to receive a dressing-down."
msgstr "Призовите заводную Лину. Не забудьте отдать честь, а то она быстро приведёт вас в чувство."

#. ja: ライナを模した魔法人形。本人に記憶はないのだが、とある酒場でドワーフ族の職人と呑み交わしたときに、口が滑ってモデルとなる許可をしてしまったらしい。ともかく、敬意の払い方も含めて、再現度は抜群となっている
#. de: Ein Zwergenhandwerker bat Lyna einst, Modell für eine Puppe zu stehen. Nach ein paar Krügen Zwergenbräu schwand ihr anfänglicher Widerstand. Obwohl eine wahre Schnapsidee, lässt sich das Ergebnis durchaus sehen.
#. fr: Même si elle n'en a que peu de souvenirs, suite à une soirée bien arrosée, la capitaine de la garde a bien accepté de laisser des artisans nains créer cette poupée miniature à son effigie. Le résultat est époustouflant de réalisme.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Lyna minion. Don't forget to salute, or you're liable to receive a dressing-down.
#. column 2: Lyna does not strike me<br>as one who enjoys being<br>made to wait.<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Captain's Resolve
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:416:0:1"
msgid "In her cups at the tavern one night, Lyna agreed to let a dwarven craftsman create mammets in her likeness. Though she claims no memory of the incident, it can't be denied that the result is a masterful recreation of the good captain, down to the rousing salute."
msgstr "Однажды вечером Лина выпивала в таверне и согласилась позировать дварфскому мастеру для создания маггетов. Сама она уверяет, что ничего не помнит, но сходство с капитаном и впрямь поразительное — вплоть до эффектного приветствия."

#. ja: 返事ハ敬礼デ！
#. de: Jawohl, Frau Kommandatin!<br><i>Soldat der Stadtwache</i>
#. fr: On ne t'a pas appris à saluer, soldat<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>!?
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Lyna minion. Don't forget to salute, or you're liable to receive a dressing-down.
#. column 1: In her cups at the tavern one night, Lyna agreed to let a dwarven craftsman create mammets in her likeness. Though she claims no memory of the incident, it can't be denied that the result is a masterful recreation of the good captain, down to the rousing salute.
#. column 3: Captain's Resolve
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:416:0:2"
msgid "Lyna does not strike me<br>as one who enjoys being<br>made to wait.<br>   - Alphinaud"
msgstr "Не думаю, что Лина<br>любит, когда заставляют<br>себя ждать.<br>   — Альфино"

#. ja: 衛兵団長の決意
#. de: Führungserfahrung
#. fr: Détermination de la capitaine
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Lyna minion. Don't forget to salute, or you're liable to receive a dressing-down.
#. column 1: In her cups at the tavern one night, Lyna agreed to let a dwarven craftsman create mammets in her likeness. Though she claims no memory of the incident, it can't be denied that the result is a masterful recreation of the good captain, down to the rousing salute.
#. column 2: Lyna does not strike me<br>as one who enjoys being<br>made to wait.<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:416:0:3"
msgid "Captain's Resolve"
msgstr "Решимость капитана"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンのDEFを40上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
#. de: Erhöht die ABW der ausführenden Trabanten um 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 40 la défense des mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Lyna minion. Don't forget to salute, or you're liable to receive a dressing-down.
#. column 1: In her cups at the tavern one night, Lyna agreed to let a dwarven craftsman create mammets in her likeness. Though she claims no memory of the incident, it can't be denied that the result is a masterful recreation of the good captain, down to the rousing salute.
#. column 2: Lyna does not strike me<br>as one who enjoys being<br>made to wait.<br>   - Alphinaud
