#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ルナル」を呼び出す。<br>ルナルを模した魔法人形。姐さん……
#. de: Du rufst deine Runar-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Ihr achtsamer Blick schenkt dir inneren Frieden.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Runar miniature, et voilà qu'il s'inquiète déjà de la bonne santé de Matoya...
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of Runar, this mammet was created to celebrate the signing of a trade agreement between the Night's Blessed and the Crystarium. In its pocket is a single white blossom, that the man can express his undying devotion to his beloved even if he is a world away.
#. column 2: Please, Runar, dry your tears.<br>What would the others think<br>if they saw you like this?<br>   - Master Matoya
#. column 3: White Blossom
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:417:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Runar minion. Because a single Runar pining for Master Matoya isn't enough."
msgstr "Призовите заводного Рунара. Одного Рунара, тоскующего по госпоже Матое, явно недостаточно."

#. ja: ルナルを模した魔法人形。夜の民とクリスタリウムとの間で、正式な通商条約が結ばれたことを記念して作られた。その懐に小さな造花が仕込まれているのは、彼自身が世界を渡れなくとも、という職人の計らいなのかもしれない
#. de: Eine Puppe in der Gestalt von Runar, die zum Gedenken des Handelsvertrages zwischen den Untertanen der Nacht und den Bewohnern Crystariums angefertigt wurde. Die weiße Blume symbolisiert Runars Gefühle für eine bestimmte Dame.
#. fr: Cette poupée magique a été créée pour célébrer les accords commerciaux établis entre Cristarium et le peuple de la Nuit. Il possède une petite fleur blanche, symbole de son deuil pour celles et ceux partis vers un autre monde.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Runar minion. Because a single Runar pining for Master Matoya isn't enough.
#. column 2: Please, Runar, dry your tears.<br>What would the others think<br>if they saw you like this?<br>   - Master Matoya
#. column 3: White Blossom
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:417:0:1"
msgid "Designed in the likeness of Runar, this mammet was created to celebrate the signing of a trade agreement between the Night's Blessed and the Crystarium. In its pocket is a single white blossom, that the man can express his undying devotion to his beloved even if he is a world away."
msgstr "Этого маггета создали по образу Рунара в честь торгового соглашения между Благословенными Ночи и Кристариумом. В кармане у него лежит белый цветок — чтобы хозяин мог выразить любимой свою вечную преданность, даже находясь за целый мир от неё."

#. ja: 姐サン……
#. de: Ach Runar, wein doch nicht. Du bist doch der Stärkste von uns allen.<br><i>Y'shtola</i>
#. fr: Matoya...<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Runar minion. Because a single Runar pining for Master Matoya isn't enough.
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of Runar, this mammet was created to celebrate the signing of a trade agreement between the Night's Blessed and the Crystarium. In its pocket is a single white blossom, that the man can express his undying devotion to his beloved even if he is a world away.
#. column 3: White Blossom
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:417:0:2"
msgid "Please, Runar, dry your tears.<br>What would the others think<br>if they saw you like this?<br>   - Master Matoya"
msgstr "Ну же, Рунар, вытри слёзы.<br>Что подумают остальные,<br>увидев тебя таким?<br>   — госпожа Матоя"

#. ja: 白い花
#. de: Weiße Blume
#. fr: Pétale blanc
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Runar minion. Because a single Runar pining for Master Matoya isn't enough.
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of Runar, this mammet was created to celebrate the signing of a trade agreement between the Night's Blessed and the Crystarium. In its pocket is a single white blossom, that the man can express his undying devotion to his beloved even if he is a world away.
#. column 2: Please, Runar, dry your tears.<br>What would the others think<br>if they saw you like this?<br>   - Master Matoya
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:417:0:3"
msgid "White Blossom"
msgstr "Белый цветок"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Runar minion. Because a single Runar pining for Master Matoya isn't enough.
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of Runar, this mammet was created to celebrate the signing of a trade agreement between the Night's Blessed and the Crystarium. In its pocket is a single white blossom, that the man can express his undying devotion to his beloved even if he is a world away.
#. column 2: Please, Runar, dry your tears.<br>What would the others think<br>if they saw you like this?<br>   - Master Matoya
#. column 3: White Blossom
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:417:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Даёт 10 очков особого приёма всем союзникам в радиусе действия, кроме миньонов с таким же приёмом."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・グンヒルド」を呼び出す。<br>女王グンヒルドを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deine Gunnhildr-Puppe als Begleiterin herbei. Sie ist dir genauso treu ergeben, wie die echte Königin es ihrem Volk war.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Gunnhildr miniature, protectrice du peuple, quelle que soit sa taille.
#. column 1: Created in the likeness of Queen Gunnhildr, this mammet was found clutching a slip of paper bearing the words: “At journey's end, I discovered a new love...only to have it vanish with the ephemeral light.” In its mannerism, one cannot help but sense something familiar...
#. column 2: The will of Queen Gunnhildr<br>shall not be denied.<br>   - Misija
#. column 3: White Queen
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:418:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Gunnhildr minion. Protects her people as a queen, a god, and now a mammet."
msgstr "Призовите заводную Гуннхильд. Она защищала свой народ как королева, как богиня, а теперь — как маггет."

#. ja: 女王グンヒルドを模した魔法人形。その手には「放浪の末、私は新たな愛を知った。しかし、我が愛は儚い光と共に消えてしまった」と記された紙を握っていた。この偏執狂的な作り込みには、どことなく見覚えがあるが……
#. de: Diese Puppe in der Gestalt von Königin Gunnhildr trug ein Stück Papier bei sich, auf dem stand: „Am Ende der Reise fand ich Liebe ... doch sie verschwand zusammen mit dem Licht.“ Die schon fast krankhaft zu nennende Detailtreue kommt dir irgendwie bekannt vor<nbsp>...
#. fr: Cette poupée de la légendaire reine possède un bout de papier où est écrit ceci<nbsp>: “Mon errance touche à sa fin, mais mon amour rencontré en chemin, lui, s'est évaporé comme la plus diaphane des chimères.” Ces mots vous rappellent une personne rongée par le regret.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gunnhildr minion. Protects her people as a queen, a god, and now a mammet.
#. column 2: The will of Queen Gunnhildr<br>shall not be denied.<br>   - Misija
#. column 3: White Queen
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:418:0:1"
msgid "Created in the likeness of Queen Gunnhildr, this mammet was found clutching a slip of paper bearing the words: “At journey's end, I discovered a new love...only to have it vanish with the ephemeral light.” In its mannerism, one cannot help but sense something familiar..."
msgstr "Этого маггета создали по образу королевы Гуннхильд. В его руке нашли записку: «В конце странствий я обрела новую любовь... но она исчезла вместе с мимолётным светом». В его повадках чудится что-то знакомое..."

#. ja: 民ヲ護ルノガ、我ガ務メ
#. de: Ich halte das Schwert Gunnhildrs und gelobe, ihren Willen zu ehren.<br><i>Misija</i>
#. fr: Protéger le peuple... Tel est mon devoir<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gunnhildr minion. Protects her people as a queen, a god, and now a mammet.
#. column 1: Created in the likeness of Queen Gunnhildr, this mammet was found clutching a slip of paper bearing the words: “At journey's end, I discovered a new love...only to have it vanish with the ephemeral light.” In its mannerism, one cannot help but sense something familiar...
#. column 3: White Queen
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:418:0:2"
msgid "The will of Queen Gunnhildr<br>shall not be denied.<br>   - Misija"
msgstr "Воле королевы Гуннхильд<br>не сломить нас!<br>   — Мисия"

#. ja: ホワイトクイーン
#. de: Weiße Königin
#. fr: Reine blanche
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Gunnhildr minion. Protects her people as a queen, a god, and now a mammet.
#. column 1: Created in the likeness of Queen Gunnhildr, this mammet was found clutching a slip of paper bearing the words: “At journey's end, I discovered a new love...only to have it vanish with the ephemeral light.” In its mannerism, one cannot help but sense something familiar...
#. column 2: The will of Queen Gunnhildr<br>shall not be denied.<br>   - Misija
