msgctxt "CompanionTransient:418:0:4"
msgid "Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
msgstr "Устанавливает ловушку. Её можно активировать через 10 секунд. Снижает скорость передвижения всех противников в радиусе действия на 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 сек.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Задержка активации:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「オートマトン９Ｓ」を呼び出す。<br>塔上層で発見された黒い小型オートマトン
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-9S als Begleiter herbei, ein winziger Android ganz in Schwarz.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte automate 9S, un androïde miniature en short découvert au niveau supérieur de la tour de la Contingence.
#. column 1: Recovered from the upper levels of the Tower, this diminutive automaton bears a resemblance to the android known as YoRHa No.9 Type S. What thoughts drove him and his kind, and to what end did they risk all in their fight? The answers to such questions may never be found...
#. column 2: Not a boy, an android.<br>   - 2P
#. column 3: Fleeting Tenderness
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to all enemies within range while increasing action party ATK by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:419:0:0"
msgid "Summon your 9S automaton minion. For when you need the company of a compact version of an advanced combat android dressed in a distinctive subculture style."
msgstr "Призовите автоматона 9S. Для компании вам понадобится компактная версия боевого андроида в стиле одной весьма узнаваемой субкультуры."

#. ja: 塔の上層で発見された黒い小型オートマトン。その姿は「ヨルハ機体九号Ｓ型」を名乗るアンドロイドによく似ている。彼らは何を想い、何のために自らの犠牲も厭わずに戦い続けたのか。その答えを知る者はいない……
#. de: Diese kleine Marionette, die dem echten 9S aufs Haar gleicht, wurde im oberen Teil des Hauptquartiers von Baldesions Gelehrten entdeckt. Was in seinem kleinen Köpfchen vorgeht, weiß niemand.
#. fr: Cet automate miniature ressemble comme deux gouttes d'eau à l'androïde nommé “unité YoRHa numéro 9 modèle S”. Quelles sont les raisons qui le poussent à se battre à vos côtés<nbsp>? Nul ne le sait...
#. column 0: Summon your 9S automaton minion. For when you need the company of a compact version of an advanced combat android dressed in a distinctive subculture style.
#. column 2: Not a boy, an android.<br>   - 2P
#. column 3: Fleeting Tenderness
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to all enemies within range while increasing action party ATK by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:419:0:1"
msgid "Recovered from the upper levels of the Tower, this diminutive automaton bears a resemblance to the android known as YoRHa No.9 Type S. What thoughts drove him and his kind, and to what end did they risk all in their fight? The answers to such questions may never be found..."
msgstr "Этот крошечный автоматон нашли на верхних этажах Башни. Он похож на андроида, известного как «Йорха № 9, тип S». Что двигало им и ему подобными? Ради чего они сражались, не щадя себя? Возможно, ответа на эти вопросы мы не узнаем никогда..."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Er<nbsp>... ist ein Android. Eine automatische Kampfeinheit. Genau wie ich.<br><i>Aufzieh-2P</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon your 9S automaton minion. For when you need the company of a compact version of an advanced combat android dressed in a distinctive subculture style.
#. column 1: Recovered from the upper levels of the Tower, this diminutive automaton bears a resemblance to the android known as YoRHa No.9 Type S. What thoughts drove him and his kind, and to what end did they risk all in their fight? The answers to such questions may never be found...
#. column 3: Fleeting Tenderness
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to all enemies within range while increasing action party ATK by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:419:0:2"
msgid "Not a boy, an android.<br>   - 2P"
msgstr "Не мальчик, а андроид.<br>   — 2P"

#. ja: 儚い優しさ
#. de: Flüchtige Sanftheit
#. fr: Tendresse fugace
#. column 0: Summon your 9S automaton minion. For when you need the company of a compact version of an advanced combat android dressed in a distinctive subculture style.
#. column 1: Recovered from the upper levels of the Tower, this diminutive automaton bears a resemblance to the android known as YoRHa No.9 Type S. What thoughts drove him and his kind, and to what end did they risk all in their fight? The answers to such questions may never be found...
#. column 2: Not a boy, an android.<br>   - 2P
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to all enemies within range while increasing action party ATK by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:419:0:3"
msgid "Fleeting Tenderness"
msgstr "Мимолётная нежность"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK120のダメージを与える。さらに特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンのATKを20上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 120 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und erhöht die ATT der ausführenden Trabanten um 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 120 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet, et augmente de 20 l'attaque des mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your 9S automaton minion. For when you need the company of a compact version of an advanced combat android dressed in a distinctive subculture style.
#. column 1: Recovered from the upper levels of the Tower, this diminutive automaton bears a resemblance to the android known as YoRHa No.9 Type S. What thoughts drove him and his kind, and to what end did they risk all in their fight? The answers to such questions may never be found...
#. column 2: Not a boy, an android.<br>   - 2P
#. column 3: Fleeting Tenderness
