msgctxt "CompanionTransient:419:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to all enemies within range while increasing action party ATK by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s"
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия удар силой 120 и повышает АТК миньонов, применивших особый приём, на 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ルディ」を呼び出す。<br>ルディを模した魔法人形。イェーーイ！
#. de: Du rufst dein Rudy-Stofftier als Begleiter herbei. Seine violette Nase ist in ganz Eorzea bekannt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Rudy miniature, une poupée qui fait “Oué, oué, ouééé, oué<nbsp>!!”.
#. column 1: Having served dutifully as one of the saint's little helpers, Rudy returned to his home deep in the mountains. But thanks to a Starlight miracle, a wandering saint succeeded in recreating a minion of the fellow so lifelike, it breathes.
#. column 2: Why, it's a Starlight miracle!<br>   - Amh Garanjy
#. column 3: Starlight Present
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:420:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Rudy minion. Eager to help, though perhaps not suited to guiding sleighs."
msgstr "Призовите заводного Руди. Он готов помочь, хотя вести сани ему, пожалуй, не стоит доверять."

#. ja: ルディを模した魔法人形。聖人の従者となったルディは、星芒祭を終えて山へと帰っていったが、流れの聖人が神業によって、瓜二つな魔法人形を作り上げた。あまりにそっくりで、呼吸までするほどである
#. de: Nachdem Rudy seine Pflichten als Kleines Helferlein erfüllt hatte, kehrte er zur Enttäuschung aller Kinder nach Hause in die Berge zurück. Einem wandernden Pilger gelang es jedoch, eine exakte lebende Kopie des Rentiers zu erschaffen. Ein Sternenlichtwunder!
#. fr: La fête des étoiles terminée, Rudy s'en est retourné vivre dans la montagne. Pour que personne ne l'oublie, Nymeia a alors créé cette poupée lui ressemblant comme deux gouttes d'eau, et – miracle – lui a insufflé la vie.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Rudy minion. Eager to help, though perhaps not suited to guiding sleighs.
#. column 2: Why, it's a Starlight miracle!<br>   - Amh Garanjy
#. column 3: Starlight Present
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:420:0:1"
msgid "Having served dutifully as one of the saint's little helpers, Rudy returned to his home deep in the mountains. But thanks to a Starlight miracle, a wandering saint succeeded in recreating a minion of the fellow so lifelike, it breathes."
msgstr "Верно служив помощником Святого, Руди вернулся домой, высоко в горы. Но благодаря чуду Звёздного дня один странствующий Святой сумел создать такого живого миньона, что тот даже дышит."

#. ja: イェーーイ！！
#. de: Rudy, da hast du dich ja echt ins Zeug gelegt.<br><i>Amh Garanjy</i>
#. fr: Ouééé<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Rudy minion. Eager to help, though perhaps not suited to guiding sleighs.
#. column 1: Having served dutifully as one of the saint's little helpers, Rudy returned to his home deep in the mountains. But thanks to a Starlight miracle, a wandering saint succeeded in recreating a minion of the fellow so lifelike, it breathes.
#. column 3: Starlight Present
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:420:0:2"
msgid "Why, it's a Starlight miracle!<br>   - Amh Garanjy"
msgstr "Да это же чудо Звёздного дня!<br>   — Ам Гаранджи"

#. ja: 贈り物
#. de: Sternenlichtgeschenk
#. fr: Cadeau
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Rudy minion. Eager to help, though perhaps not suited to guiding sleighs.
#. column 1: Having served dutifully as one of the saint's little helpers, Rudy returned to his home deep in the mountains. But thanks to a Starlight miracle, a wandering saint succeeded in recreating a minion of the fellow so lifelike, it breathes.
