#. ja: ミニオン「幻栗斎」を呼び出す。<br>瑞獣リッサイが神通力で作り出した幻影体
#. de: Du rufst deinen Phantom-Rissai als Begleiter herbei. Erschaffen vom Tierheiligen Rissai höchst<shy>persön<shy>lich.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Rissai chimérique, un avatar magique créé par le Zuijû du même nom.
#. column 1: Fond of mortal children, the auspice Rissai once transformed himself into a learned man and taught the young ones their letters. Like the real auspice, this self-created avatar goes wherever the winds of philanthropy and delicious sweets blow.
#. column 2: Thanks to predation by other rodents,<br>only the fittest and most vicious of<br>squirrels survive to adulthood.<br>   - Hunter-scholar
#. column 3: Schneeball Eater
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:421:0:0"
msgid "Summon your squirrel emperor minion. At once more powerful and adorable than a certain simian king."
msgstr "Призовите миньона-беличьего императора. Он одновременно милее и могущественнее одного известного царя обезьян."

#. ja: 瑞獣リッサイが神通力で作り出した幻影体。若き頃、人の子を好んでいたリッサイは、しばしば神通力で人に化け、私塾を開いて子どもたちに読み書きを教えていたこともあるようだ。いまも義理と人情と甘味を愛する
#. de: Der kinderliebe Rissai verwandelte sich eines Tages in einen Sterblichen und erbaute eine Schule. Wie sein Erzeuger ist auch das Phantom-Modell süßen Kindern und Süßigkeiten äußerst zugetan.
#. fr: Plus jeune, le Zuijû Rissai aimait tant les enfants qu'il s'était transformé en humain pour ouvrir une école, et leur apprendre à lire et écrire. Aujourd'hui, il estime qu'il y a trois notions es<shy>sen<shy>tielles dans la vie<nbsp>: le sens du devoir, la compassion et les sucreries.
#. column 0: Summon your squirrel emperor minion. At once more powerful and adorable than a certain simian king.
#. column 2: Thanks to predation by other rodents,<br>only the fittest and most vicious of<br>squirrels survive to adulthood.<br>   - Hunter-scholar
#. column 3: Schneeball Eater
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:421:0:1"
msgid "Fond of mortal children, the auspice Rissai once transformed himself into a learned man and taught the young ones their letters. Like the real auspice, this self-created avatar goes wherever the winds of philanthropy and delicious sweets blow."
msgstr "Любивший смертных детей авспис Риссай однажды обернулся учёным мужем и обучал ребят грамоте. Как и настоящий авспис, эта созданная им копия следует заветам доброты и сладостей."

#. ja: アマアマ！
#. de: Süß!<br><i>Rissai</i>
#. fr: Vite, du sucre<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your squirrel emperor minion. At once more powerful and adorable than a certain simian king.
#. column 1: Fond of mortal children, the auspice Rissai once transformed himself into a learned man and taught the young ones their letters. Like the real auspice, this self-created avatar goes wherever the winds of philanthropy and delicious sweets blow.
#. column 3: Schneeball Eater
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:421:0:2"
msgid "Thanks to predation by other rodents,<br>only the fittest and most vicious of<br>squirrels survive to adulthood.<br>   - Hunter-scholar"
msgstr "Из-за охоты других грызунов<br>до взрослого возраста доживают<br>лишь самые сильные и свирепые белки.<br>   — Учёный-охотник"

#. ja: シュネーバルイーター
#. de: Schneeballfresser
#. fr: Mangeur de schneeball
#. column 0: Summon your squirrel emperor minion. At once more powerful and adorable than a certain simian king.
#. column 1: Fond of mortal children, the auspice Rissai once transformed himself into a learned man and taught the young ones their letters. Like the real auspice, this self-created avatar goes wherever the winds of philanthropy and delicious sweets blow.
