msgstr "Устанавливает ловушку. Её можно активировать через 10 секунд. Она наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия удар силой 180.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Задержка активации:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「フラッグ」を呼び出す。<br>愛らしい子鹿。とっても食いしん坊
#. de: Du rufst dein Fähnchen als Begleiter herbei. Ein kleines Rehkitz mit großem Appetit.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Drapo, un petit faon aussi mignon que glouton.
#. column 1: So named for its fluttering tail, this adorable reindeer calf boasts a prodigious appetite that belies its size. Especially partial to corn, it threatened to devour clean a farmer's entire harvest, forcing the man to beg your retainer to take it away.
#. column 2: I'm in no mood<br>to be fawned over.<br>   - Greinfarr
#. column 3: Glutton
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:422:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Flag minion. A little reindeer with a huge appetite."
msgstr "Призовите миньона Флаг. Маленький оленёнок с огромным аппетитом."

#. ja: 愛らしい子鹿。よく動く尻尾が風にはためく旗のように見えるため、フラッグと名付けられた。とっても食いしん坊で、トウモロコシが大好物。食料を食い尽くされそうになった農民からの依頼で、リテイナーが連れ帰ったらしい
#. de: Bei jeder Bewegung tanzt sein Wedel wie eine Fahne im Wind, was dem Rehkitz seinen Namen verliehen hat. Stets hungrig vermag es ganze Maisfelder kahlzufressen, weshalb ein Gehilfe es auf Bitte der Farmer zu sich nach Hause nahm.
#. fr: La queue de cet irrésistible petit faon ressemble, lorsqu'il l'agite, à un drapeau qui flotte au vent, d'où son nom. Il est très gourmand, et adore le maïs. Un fermier dont il vidait les silos a même été contraint de s'en séparer.
#. column 0: Summon your Flag minion. A little reindeer with a huge appetite.
#. column 2: I'm in no mood<br>to be fawned over.<br>   - Greinfarr
#. column 3: Glutton
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:422:0:1"
msgid "So named for its fluttering tail, this adorable reindeer calf boasts a prodigious appetite that belies its size. Especially partial to corn, it threatened to devour clean a farmer's entire harvest, forcing the man to beg your retainer to take it away."
msgstr "Этого очаровательного оленёнка назвали Флагом за хвостик, который так и мелькает, словно флажок на ветру. Аппетит у него не по размеру: особенно он любит кукурузу и чуть не съел весь урожай одного фермера. Тот и попросил вашего слугу забрать прожору."

#. ja: モグモグモグ……
#. de: Süß und unschuldig? Von wegen!<br><i>Maisanbauer</i>
#. fr: Miom, miom, miom...
#. column 0: Summon your Flag minion. A little reindeer with a huge appetite.
#. column 1: So named for its fluttering tail, this adorable reindeer calf boasts a prodigious appetite that belies its size. Especially partial to corn, it threatened to devour clean a farmer's entire harvest, forcing the man to beg your retainer to take it away.
#. column 3: Glutton
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:422:0:2"
msgid "I'm in no mood<br>to be fawned over.<br>   - Greinfarr"
msgstr "Не до того мне,<br>чтобы меня тискали.<br>   — Грейнфарр"

#. ja: 食いしん坊
#. de: Vielfraß
#. fr: Glouton
#. column 0: Summon your Flag minion. A little reindeer with a huge appetite.
#. column 1: So named for its fluttering tail, this adorable reindeer calf boasts a prodigious appetite that belies its size. Especially partial to corn, it threatened to devour clean a farmer's entire harvest, forcing the man to beg your retainer to take it away.
#. column 2: I'm in no mood<br>to be fawned over.<br>   - Greinfarr
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:422:0:3"
msgid "Glutton"
msgstr "Обжора"

