#. ja: ミニオン「プチイーア」を呼び出す。<br>小さなイーアの断片。小さいが考えている
#. de: Du rufst deinen Klein-Ea als Begleiter herbei. Klein, aber zu großen Gedanken fähig.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-Éa, un morceau d'Éa petit par la taille, mais grand par la profondeur d'esprit.
#. column 1: In order to rearrange their jumbled thoughts, the Ea are known to temporarily shed a small part of themselves. In this instance, however, said part took on a will of its own and embarked on a journey of contemplation.
#. column 2: My, how thoughtful!<br>   - Cirina
#. column 3: Epiphany
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:423:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wee Ea minion. Proof that you don't need to be big to think big."
msgstr "Призовите крошечного эа. Думать о великом можно и в маленьком теле."

#. ja: 精神体イーアから切り離された小さな断片。ときにイーアはこんがらかった思考を整理するために、自らの一部を切り離すことがあるが、どうやらそのまま漂い放浪してしまったらしい。小さいが何か難しいことを考えている
#. de: Die Ea pflegen Teile von sich abzuspalten, um ihre Gedanken zu ordnen. Diesem Ea-Teil gefiel seine neue Freiheit so sehr, dass er beschloss, nicht mehr zurückzukehren.
#. fr: Il arrive que les êtres d'esprit pur que sont les Éas se séparent d'une partie d'eux-mêmes afin d'ordonner leurs pensées. En l'occurrence, ce morceau semble s'être égaré... Malgré sa petite taille, il réfléchit à des choses très compliquées.
#. column 0: Summon your wee Ea minion. Proof that you don't need to be big to think big.
#. column 2: My, how thoughtful!<br>   - Cirina
#. column 3: Epiphany
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:423:0:1"
msgid "In order to rearrange their jumbled thoughts, the Ea are known to temporarily shed a small part of themselves. In this instance, however, said part took on a will of its own and embarked on a journey of contemplation."
msgstr "Чтобы привести мысли в порядок, эа порой временно отделяют от себя небольшую часть. Но на этот раз отделившийся фрагмент обрёл собственную волю и отправился в странствие на поиски истины."

#. ja: クー！
#. de: Alles ausräumen und wieder einräumen. So schafft man Ordnung, im Zimmer und im Kopf.<br><i>Anonymer Aufräumexperte</i>
#. fr: Coo<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wee Ea minion. Proof that you don't need to be big to think big.
#. column 1: In order to rearrange their jumbled thoughts, the Ea are known to temporarily shed a small part of themselves. In this instance, however, said part took on a will of its own and embarked on a journey of contemplation.
#. column 3: Epiphany
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:423:0:2"
msgid "My, how thoughtful!<br>   - Cirina"
msgstr "Вот это глубокомыслие!<br>   — Цирина"

#. ja: クー！
#. de: Epiphanie
#. fr: Coo<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wee Ea minion. Proof that you don't need to be big to think big.
#. column 1: In order to rearrange their jumbled thoughts, the Ea are known to temporarily shed a small part of themselves. In this instance, however, said part took on a will of its own and embarked on a journey of contemplation.
#. column 2: My, how thoughtful!<br>   - Cirina
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:423:0:3"
msgid "Epiphany"
msgstr "Озарение"

#. ja: ゲート内にいるミニオンのHP回復量を2倍にする。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>20秒
#. de: Verdoppelt die LP-Regeneration der Trabanten innerhalb eines Tors.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 Sekunden
#. fr: Double le montant de PV récupérés par les mascottes qui se trouvent à l'intérieur des portails.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
