#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・メーガス」を呼び出す。<br>メーガス三姉妹を模した魔法神像。デルタアターック！
#. de: Du rufst dein Magus-Schwestern-Puppentrio als Begleiter herbei. Nur im Dreierpack erhältlich.
#. fr: Vous appelez vos mascottes sœurs Magus miniatures, des idoles à l'effigie du célèbre trio divin. Attaque Delta<nbsp>!
#. column 1: The Magus Sisters are revered deities in Thavnair, and their images are popularly peddled in Radz-at-Han as talismans. Able to move about freely and perform impressive acrobatics, this set of the three divinities counts among the more premium offerings.
#. column 2: All right, teamwork!<br>   - Medrod
#. column 3: Delta Attack
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:424:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Magus Sisters minion. Essentially three minions for one, so it represents great value."
msgstr "Призовите заводных сестёр-магус. Три миньона по цене одного — отличное предложение."

#. ja: メーガス三姉妹を模した魔法神像。サベネア島では特に人気の神々であるため、ラザハンではこの種の神像が縁起物として売買されている。おそらく、ゾットの塔に監禁されていた敬虔な住民の持ち物だったのであろう
#. de: Die Magus-Schwestern werden auf Thavnair als Gottheiten verehrt und ihre Nachbildungen zählen zu den beliebtesten Glücksbringern. Mit frei beweglichen Puppen, die Turnübungen vorführen, gehört dieses Trio zu den exklusiveren Angeboten in den Souvenirläden.
#. fr: Les sœurs Magus comptent parmi les divinités thavnairoises les plus appréciées, et l'on trouve à Radz-at-Han nombre d'idoles à leur effigie. Celles-ci appartenaient sans doute à un de leurs adorateurs, enfermé dans la tour de Zott.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Magus Sisters minion. Essentially three minions for one, so it represents great value.
#. column 2: All right, teamwork!<br>   - Medrod
#. column 3: Delta Attack
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:424:0:1"
msgid "The Magus Sisters are revered deities in Thavnair, and their images are popularly peddled in Radz-at-Han as talismans. Able to move about freely and perform impressive acrobatics, this set of the three divinities counts among the more premium offerings."
msgstr "Сестёр-магус почитают в Тавнаире как божеств, а в Радз-ат-Хане их изображения повсюду продают как талисманы. Эта фигурка трёх богинь умеет свободно двигаться и выполнять впечатляющие акробатические трюки, поэтому и стоит недёшево."

#. ja: デルタアターック！
#. de: Ich könnte den Schwestern stundenlang zusehen.<br><i>Anonymer Turner</i>
#. fr: Attaque Delta<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Magus Sisters minion. Essentially three minions for one, so it represents great value.
#. column 1: The Magus Sisters are revered deities in Thavnair, and their images are popularly peddled in Radz-at-Han as talismans. Able to move about freely and perform impressive acrobatics, this set of the three divinities counts among the more premium offerings.
#. column 3: Delta Attack
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:424:0:2"
msgid "All right, teamwork!<br>   - Medrod"
msgstr "Ну-ка, дружно!<br>   — Медрод"

#. ja: デルタアターック！
#. de: Delta-Angriff
#. fr: Attaque Delta
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Magus Sisters minion. Essentially three minions for one, so it represents great value.
#. column 1: The Magus Sisters are revered deities in Thavnair, and their images are popularly peddled in Radz-at-Han as talismans. Able to move about freely and perform impressive acrobatics, this set of the three divinities counts among the more premium offerings.
#. column 2: All right, teamwork!<br>   - Medrod
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:424:0:3"
msgid "Delta Attack"
msgstr "Атака дельта"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Magus Sisters minion. Essentially three minions for one, so it represents great value.
#. column 1: The Magus Sisters are revered deities in Thavnair, and their images are popularly peddled in Radz-at-Han as talismans. Able to move about freely and perform impressive acrobatics, this set of the three divinities counts among the more premium offerings.
#. column 2: All right, teamwork!<br>   - Medrod
#. column 3: Delta Attack
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:424:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Даёт 10 очков особого приёма всем союзникам в радиусе действия, кроме миньонов с таким же приёмом."

#. ja: ミニオン「オプティマス・オミクロン」を呼び出す。<br>オミクロンの最新モデル。小さいが高機能！
#. de: Du rufst dein Optimus Omikron als Begleiter herbei. Minimale Proportionen, maximale Leistung.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Omicron Optimus. Encombrement minimal, performances maximales.
#. column 1: As part of an initiative to downsize themselves, the Omicrons created this miniaturized, full-featured unit as a test prototype. Alas, the siege matrix Stigma-4 ceased to function shortly thereafter, and it never reached the mass production stage.
#. column 2: I prefer foes to be more compact<br>like myself─tiny, puny, compact.<br>   - 269th Order Mendicant Da Za
#. column 3: Defense Protocol
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:425:0:0"
msgid "Summon your optimus Omicron minion. Minimum proportions, maximum performance."
msgstr "Призовите миньона «Оптимус Омикрон». Миниатюрный размер, максимальная мощность."

#. ja: オミクロンの最新モデル。これまでの機能をそのままに、小型化する目的で開発された。しかし、先行試作機である本機が完成した時点で、兵站戦略マトリクス「スティグマ・フォー」が機能を停止、量産されることはなかった
#. de: Ein Produkt des Versuchs der Omikron, kleine Versionen von sich selbst zu erschaffen. Aufgrund des Funktionsstillstands der Eroberungsmatrix Stigma-4 kam es leider niemals zur Massenproduktion.
#. fr: Le tout dernier modèle d'Omicron, aboutissement d'un remarquable travail de miniaturisation. À cause de la mise en hibernation de la matrice de logistique militaire Stigma-4, il n'a malheureusement jamais été produit en série.
#. column 0: Summon your optimus Omicron minion. Minimum proportions, maximum performance.
#. column 2: I prefer foes to be more compact<br>like myself─tiny, puny, compact.<br>   - 269th Order Mendicant Da Za
#. column 3: Defense Protocol
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:425:0:1"
msgid "As part of an initiative to downsize themselves, the Omicrons created this miniaturized, full-featured unit as a test prototype. Alas, the siege matrix Stigma-4 ceased to function shortly thereafter, and it never reached the mass production stage."
msgstr "В рамках программы по уменьшению размеров омикроны создали этот компактный прототип со всеми стандартными функциями. Увы, вскоре после его создания осадная матрица «Стигма-4» перестала работать, и серийного производства так и не началось."

#. ja: オプティマス！
#. de: Auf den Inhalt kommt es an, nicht auf die Größe.<br><i>Zwerg-Ingenieur</i>
#. fr: Optimus<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your optimus Omicron minion. Minimum proportions, maximum performance.
#. column 1: As part of an initiative to downsize themselves, the Omicrons created this miniaturized, full-featured unit as a test prototype. Alas, the siege matrix Stigma-4 ceased to function shortly thereafter, and it never reached the mass production stage.
#. column 3: Defense Protocol
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
