#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・アニマ」を呼び出す。<br>アニマを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Anima als Begleiter herbei. Achtung: Kann nicht dazu verwendet werden, um deine Waffe zum Leben zu erwecken.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Anima miniature, une poupée magique aux allures de cauchemar.
#. column 1: In old Garlean, the word “anima” means “soul,” though some philosophers have come to use it to refer to the hidden feminine side of men. Whether this explains why Anima's lower head appears feminine is debatable, but one thing is certain: no shins are safe from this mammet's fists of fury.
#. column 2: Distract me with your feminine<br>wiles, and then strike when<br>my guard is down?<br>   - Carvallain
#. column 3: Oblivion
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:426:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Anima minion. Warning: cannot be used to teleport or upgrade weapons."
msgstr "Призовите заводную Аниму. Внимание: не телепортирует и не улучшает оружие."

#. ja: 皇神アニマを模した魔法人形。アニマとはガレアン族の古語で「魂」を意味すると同時に、心理学的には「男性の無意識の中にある女性像の元型」であるとされる。下側の頭部が、どこか女性的なのはそのためだろうか
#. de: „Anima“ bedeutet „Seele“ in der Sprache der alten Garlear, während heutzutage das Wort benutzt wird, um die feminine Seite in Männern zu bezeichnen. Ob dies in irgendeiner Weise mit dem Aussehen des Primae zu tun hat, sei dahingestellt.
#. fr: Le terme “Anima” signifie “âme” en langue garlemaldaise ancienne. Il désigne aussi, en psychologie, la repré<shy>sen<shy>ta<shy>tion archétypale de la féminité dans l'imaginaire masculin. Ce n'est donc pas un hasard si le Primordial éponyme possède des traits plutôt féminins.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Anima minion. Warning: cannot be used to teleport or upgrade weapons.
#. column 2: Distract me with your feminine<br>wiles, and then strike when<br>my guard is down?<br>   - Carvallain
#. column 3: Oblivion
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:426:0:1"
msgid "In old Garlean, the word “anima” means “soul,” though some philosophers have come to use it to refer to the hidden feminine side of men. Whether this explains why Anima's lower head appears feminine is debatable, but one thing is certain: no shins are safe from this mammet's fists of fury."
msgstr "На древнегарлеанском «анима» означает «душа». Некоторые философы стали использовать это слово для обозначения скрытой женской стороны мужчины. Объясняет ли это, почему нижняя голова Анимы выглядит по-женски, — вопрос спорный. Но одно точно: коленям не поздоровится от кулачков этого маггета."

#. ja: カオティック！
#. de: Wer seine Anima unterdrückt, wird es schrecklich bereuen.<br><i>Psychologe</i>
#. fr: Chaotique<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Anima minion. Warning: cannot be used to teleport or upgrade weapons.
#. column 1: In old Garlean, the word “anima” means “soul,” though some philosophers have come to use it to refer to the hidden feminine side of men. Whether this explains why Anima's lower head appears feminine is debatable, but one thing is certain: no shins are safe from this mammet's fists of fury.
#. column 3: Oblivion
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:426:0:2"
msgid "Distract me with your feminine<br>wiles, and then strike when<br>my guard is down?<br>   - Carvallain"
msgstr "Хочешь отвлечь меня<br>женскими чарами, а потом<br>ударить, когда я потеряю бдительность?<br>   — Карваллен"

#. ja: カオティック・D
#. de: Chaos-D
#. fr: D chaotique
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Anima minion. Warning: cannot be used to teleport or upgrade weapons.
#. column 1: In old Garlean, the word “anima” means “soul,” though some philosophers have come to use it to refer to the hidden feminine side of men. Whether this explains why Anima's lower head appears feminine is debatable, but one thing is certain: no shins are safe from this mammet's fists of fury.
#. column 2: Distract me with your feminine<br>wiles, and then strike when<br>my guard is down?<br>   - Carvallain
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:426:0:3"
msgid "Oblivion"
msgstr "Забвение"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK30のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 30 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 30 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et les projette en arrière.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Anima minion. Warning: cannot be used to teleport or upgrade weapons.
#. column 1: In old Garlean, the word “anima” means “soul,” though some philosophers have come to use it to refer to the hidden feminine side of men. Whether this explains why Anima's lower head appears feminine is debatable, but one thing is certain: no shins are safe from this mammet's fists of fury.
#. column 2: Distract me with your feminine<br>wiles, and then strike when<br>my guard is down?<br>   - Carvallain
#. column 3: Oblivion
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:426:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия удар силой 30 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「スターバード」を呼び出す。<br>世にも美しい青い鳥。希望を求めて今日も謳う
#. de: Du rufst deinen Sternenvogel als Begleiter herbei. Sein hoffnungsvolles Zwitschern verspricht einen schönen Tag.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte oiseau stellaire, un bel oiseau bleu chantant l'espoir.
#. column 1: A beautiful blue bird whose features are reminiscent of the starfaring creation Meteion. So long as hope abides in its master's heart, never shall its plumage take on the black of despair.
#. column 2: Birds of a feather are we!<br>   - X'rhun Tia
#. column 3: Lucky Star
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:427:0:0"
msgid "Summon your starbird minion. Gazing up at the stars in the heavens, it ever sings a song of hope."
msgstr "Призовите звёздную птицу. Глядя на небесные звёзды, она поёт песню надежды."

#. ja: 世にも美しい青い鳥。その姿形は、星渡る創造生物、メーティオンの姿に似る。天に輝く星を見ては、希望を求めて今日も謳う。共にある冒険者の心に希望がある限り、その羽根が絶望の色に染まることはないだろう
#. de: Ein Vogel, dessen wunderschöne Gestalt Meteion gleichen soll. Solange die Hoffnung im Herzen nicht stirbt, soll sich sein Gefieder nicht schwarz verfärben.
#. fr: Cet oiseau, qui rappelle beaucoup Météion, passe son temps à observer les étoiles et à chanter l'espoir. Tant que les personnes autour de lui garderont la foi, jamais ses ailes ne se teinteront de noir.
#. column 0: Summon your starbird minion. Gazing up at the stars in the heavens, it ever sings a song of hope.
#. column 2: Birds of a feather are we!<br>   - X'rhun Tia
#. column 3: Lucky Star
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:427:0:1"
msgid "A beautiful blue bird whose features are reminiscent of the starfaring creation Meteion. So long as hope abides in its master's heart, never shall its plumage take on the black of despair."
msgstr "Прекрасная синяя птица, напоминающая Метеион, звёздное творение, странствовавшее между мирами. Пока в сердце её хозяина живёт надежда, перья птицы никогда не окрасятся в чёрный цвет отчаяния."

#. ja: ピューッ！
#. de: Dieser Vogel verkörpert Schönheit und Hoffnung.<br><i>Ornithologe</i>
#. fr: Piou<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your starbird minion. Gazing up at the stars in the heavens, it ever sings a song of hope.
#. column 1: A beautiful blue bird whose features are reminiscent of the starfaring creation Meteion. So long as hope abides in its master's heart, never shall its plumage take on the black of despair.
#. column 3: Lucky Star
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:427:0:2"
msgid "Birds of a feather are we!<br>   - X'rhun Tia"
msgstr "Мы с тобой одной крови!<br>   — Кс'рун Тиа"

#. ja: 星巡り
#. de: Glücksvogel
#. fr: Voyage interstellaire
#. column 0: Summon your starbird minion. Gazing up at the stars in the heavens, it ever sings a song of hope.
#. column 1: A beautiful blue bird whose features are reminiscent of the starfaring creation Meteion. So long as hope abides in its master's heart, never shall its plumage take on the black of despair.
#. column 2: Birds of a feather are we!<br>   - X'rhun Tia
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:427:0:3"
msgid "Lucky Star"
msgstr "Счастливая звезда"

#. ja: シールドが破壊されていた場合、復活させる。
#. de: Stellt einen zerstörten Schild wieder her.
#. fr: Rétablit votre bouclier s'il a été détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your starbird minion. Gazing up at the stars in the heavens, it ever sings a song of hope.
#. column 1: A beautiful blue bird whose features are reminiscent of the starfaring creation Meteion. So long as hope abides in its master's heart, never shall its plumage take on the black of despair.
#. column 2: Birds of a feather are we!<br>   - X'rhun Tia
#. column 3: Lucky Star
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:427:0:4"
msgid "Instantly restores damaged ally Shield."
msgstr "Мгновенно восстанавливает прочность повреждённого щита союзника."

#. ja: ミニオン「ナグサキャット」を呼び出す。<br>ナグサ地方原産の美しくも気高い猫
#. de: Du rufst deine nagxianische Katze als Begleiter herbei. Ein vornehmes Tier, schöner als alle ihre bisherigen Besitzer.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte chat nagxien, un félin racé par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement élégant.
#. column 1: In former times in Nagxia, the breeding of this graceful and noble cat was permitted only to royalty and high priests. Yet it was not only for these traits that it was coveted; legend holds that its blue eyes can discern the aether of all things, including departed souls.
#. column 2: I've never beheld such grace,<br>such elegance, such...<br>unfathomable beauty!<br>   - Stricken Traveler
#. column 3: Noble Ease
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:428:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Nagxian cat minion. The very soul of grace and nobility, and can see souls to boot."
msgstr "Призовите нагсийскую кошку. Само воплощение изящества и благородства. А ещё она видит души."

#. ja: ナグサ地方原産の美しくも気高い猫。かつて同地に栄えた王朝では、王侯貴族や高僧のみが飼育することを許されていた。また、伝承によれば、その青い瞳はエーテルを視ることができ、姿なき死者の魂すら見抜くのだという
#. de: In der Blütezeit des alten Nagxia durften nur Adlige und hochrangige Priester sie besitzen. Es heißt, dass sie mit ihren blauen Augen Äther und die Seelen von Verstorbenen zu sehen vermag.
#. fr: Il fut un temps où seuls les membres de la famille royale nagxienne et les moines de haut rang avaient la permission d'élever ce chat. On dit par ailleurs que ses yeux bleus seraient capables de distinguer l'éther, et même les âmes des défunts.
#. column 0: Summon your Nagxian cat minion. The very soul of grace and nobility, and can see souls to boot.
#. column 2: I've never beheld such grace,<br>such elegance, such...<br>unfathomable beauty!<br>   - Stricken Traveler
#. column 3: Noble Ease
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:428:0:1"
msgid "In former times in Nagxia, the breeding of this graceful and noble cat was permitted only to royalty and high priests. Yet it was not only for these traits that it was coveted; legend holds that its blue eyes can discern the aether of all things, including departed souls."
msgstr "Когда-то в Нагсии разводить эту грациозную и благородную кошку разрешалось лишь царственным особам и верховным жрецам. Ценили её не только за стать и нрав: по легендам, её синие глаза видят эфир всего сущего, даже души усопших."

#. ja: ナーゴ！
#. de: Die Katze ist das edelste Geschöpf dieser Welt!<br><i>Katzenfanatiker</i>
#. fr: Naago<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Nagxian cat minion. The very soul of grace and nobility, and can see souls to boot.
#. column 1: In former times in Nagxia, the breeding of this graceful and noble cat was permitted only to royalty and high priests. Yet it was not only for these traits that it was coveted; legend holds that its blue eyes can discern the aether of all things, including departed souls.
#. column 3: Noble Ease
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:428:0:2"
msgid "I've never beheld such grace,<br>such elegance, such...<br>unfathomable beauty!<br>   - Stricken Traveler"
msgstr "Такого изящества,<br>такой грации, такой...<br>непостижимой красоты<br>я ещё не видывал!<br>   — Потрясённый путник"

#. ja: 高貴なる余裕
#. de: Stolze Gelassenheit
#. fr: Aisance princière
#. column 0: Summon your Nagxian cat minion. The very soul of grace and nobility, and can see souls to boot.
#. column 1: In former times in Nagxia, the breeding of this graceful and noble cat was permitted only to royalty and high priests. Yet it was not only for these traits that it was coveted; legend holds that its blue eyes can discern the aether of all things, including departed souls.
#. column 2: I've never beheld such grace,<br>such elegance, such...<br>unfathomable beauty!<br>   - Stricken Traveler
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:428:0:3"
msgid "Noble Ease"
msgstr "Благородная невозмутимость"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵、味方すべてにかかっている、効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle Effekte von allen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe les effets de tous les alliés et ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Nagxian cat minion. The very soul of grace and nobility, and can see souls to boot.
#. column 1: In former times in Nagxia, the breeding of this graceful and noble cat was permitted only to royalty and high priests. Yet it was not only for these traits that it was coveted; legend holds that its blue eyes can discern the aether of all things, including departed souls.
#. column 2: I've never beheld such grace,<br>such elegance, such...<br>unfathomable beauty!<br>   - Stricken Traveler
#. column 3: Noble Ease
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:428:0:4"
msgid "Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все эффекты со всех противников и союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「ニュー・ウリエンジェ」を呼び出す。<br>ウリエンジェを模した魔法人形。占星術師の装い！
#. de: Du rufst deine neue Urianger-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Wer weiß, welche Gedanken sich hinter dieser hohen Stirn verbergen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte nouvel Urianger miniature, une poupée magique re<shy>pré<shy>sen<shy>tant l'énigmatique Élézen dans sa tenue d'astromancien.
#. column 1: While tidying up the solar at the Rising Stones, Tataru discovered a veritable army of wind-up Uriangers─the result of a misorder. Resourceful as ever, the Scions' coinkeeper altered their hair and attire, and marketed them as a limited edition model.
#. column 2: What thinkest thou...<br>of mine appearance?<br>   - Urianger
#. column 3: Sharlayan Astrology
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:429:0:0"
msgid "Summon your brave new Urianger minion. Despite its diminutive size, its arms are no less weapons than those of the man himself."
msgstr "Призовите отважного Урианже. Он хоть и крошечный, но руки у него не слабее, чем у самого Урианже."

#. ja: 「暁の血盟」の賢人、ウリエンジェを模した魔法人形。暁の間を整理していたタタルが、かつて誤発注によって大量生産されていたウリエンジェ人形の在庫を発見。自らの手で新たな衣装を作り、頭髪も再現して再販売したものらしい
#. de: Beim Aufräumen stieß Tataru auf eine ganze Armee dieser Puppen - das Ergebnis einer Fehlbestellung. Da ihr Verschwendung zuwider ist, verpasste sie den Puppen neue Kleidung und eine neue Frisur, um möglichst viele Exemplare absetzen zu können.
#. fr: En faisant du rangement dans le salon de l'Aube, Tataru est tombée sur un stock entier de poupées Urianger commandées par erreur. Ni une ni deux, elle les a rhabillées et recoiffées, avant de les mettre en vente avec l'étiquette “édition limitée”.
#. column 0: Summon your brave new Urianger minion. Despite its diminutive size, its arms are no less weapons than those of the man himself.
#. column 2: What thinkest thou...<br>of mine appearance?<br>   - Urianger
#. column 3: Sharlayan Astrology
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:429:0:1"
msgid "While tidying up the solar at the Rising Stones, Tataru discovered a veritable army of wind-up Uriangers─the result of a misorder. Resourceful as ever, the Scions' coinkeeper altered their hair and attire, and marketed them as a limited edition model."
msgstr "Убирая солнечную комнату в Возвышающихся камнях, Татару обнаружила целую армию заводных Урианже — результат ошибочного заказа. Не растерявшись, казначей Потомков сменила им причёски и наряды и выпустила как ограниченную серию."

#. ja: 月明輝ケドモ…
#. de: Vor dir steht Urianger, seines Zeichens Astrologe.<br><i>Urianger</i>
#. fr: La lumière de l'aube...
#. column 0: Summon your brave new Urianger minion. Despite its diminutive size, its arms are no less weapons than those of the man himself.
#. column 1: While tidying up the solar at the Rising Stones, Tataru discovered a veritable army of wind-up Uriangers─the result of a misorder. Resourceful as ever, the Scions' coinkeeper altered their hair and attire, and marketed them as a limited edition model.
#. column 3: Sharlayan Astrology
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:429:0:2"
msgid "What thinkest thou...<br>of mine appearance?<br>   - Urianger"
msgstr "Как тебе...<br>мой новый облик?<br>   — Урианже"

#. ja: シャーレアン式占星術
#. de: Sharlayanische Astrologie
#. fr: Astromancie sharlayanaise
#. column 0: Summon your brave new Urianger minion. Despite its diminutive size, its arms are no less weapons than those of the man himself.
#. column 1: While tidying up the solar at the Rising Stones, Tataru discovered a veritable army of wind-up Uriangers─the result of a misorder. Resourceful as ever, the Scions' coinkeeper altered their hair and attire, and marketed them as a limited edition model.
