msgctxt "CompanionTransient:429:0:3"
msgid "Sharlayan Astrology"
msgstr "Шарлайанская астрология"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のHPを、100回復する。味方のタイプが「ドール」の場合は、HPが150回復する。
#. de: Regeneriert bei den eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe 100 LP, im Fall von Puppen 150.
#. fr: Soigne 100 PV aux alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou 150 PV s'ils sont de type “Poupée”.
#. column 0: Summon your brave new Urianger minion. Despite its diminutive size, its arms are no less weapons than those of the man himself.
#. column 1: While tidying up the solar at the Rising Stones, Tataru discovered a veritable army of wind-up Uriangers─the result of a misorder. Resourceful as ever, the Scions' coinkeeper altered their hair and attire, and marketed them as a limited edition model.
#. column 2: What thinkest thou...<br>of mine appearance?<br>   - Urianger
#. column 3: Sharlayan Astrology
