msgstr "Восстанавливает 100 ОЗ всем союзникам в радиусе действия (150, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>кукла</ui-edge-color></ui-color>)."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ヴリトラ」を呼び出す。<br>七大天竜の一翼、星竜ヴリトラを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Vrtra als Begleiter herbei. Ein Miniaturmodell von einem der sieben Hohen Drachen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Vrtra miniature, une poupée magique à l'effigie du plus jeune des sept dragons anciens.
#. column 1: A mammet designed in the likeness of the great wyrm Vrtra, who is said to be possessed of a gentle heart despite his fearsome appearance. Though this recreation is somewhat less fearsome than the actual wyrm, it is not for want of effort on its part.
#. column 2: The hour is come, Vrtra.<br>   - Estinien
#. column 3: Sable Breath
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 110 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:430:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Vrtra minion. Last of his brood but certainly not least."
msgstr "Призвать заводного Вртру. Последний в своём роду, но ничуть не хуже остальных."

#. ja: 七大天竜の一翼、星竜ヴリトラを模した魔法人形。近東地域で語り継がれてきた伝承によれば、ヴリトラは天竜の中でも、もっとも遅く卵から孵った末の子であり、恐ろしげな容貌に反して心優しい存在であったとされている
#. de: Laut Legende soll Vrtra als letzter der sieben Hohen Drachen geschlüpft sein. Entgegen seines furcht<shy>er<shy>re<shy>gen<shy>den Aussehens wird ihm nachgesagt, von freundlichem Gemüt gewesen zu sein.
#. fr: Les légendes thavnairoises racontent que Vrtra serait le dragon ancien dont l'œuf a éclos en dernier, ce qui ex<shy>pli<shy>que<shy>rait son caractère empreint de douceur malgré sa terrifiante apparence.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Vrtra minion. Last of his brood but certainly not least.
#. column 2: The hour is come, Vrtra.<br>   - Estinien
#. column 3: Sable Breath
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 110 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:430:0:1"
msgid "A mammet designed in the likeness of the great wyrm Vrtra, who is said to be possessed of a gentle heart despite his fearsome appearance. Though this recreation is somewhat less fearsome than the actual wyrm, it is not for want of effort on its part."
msgstr "Эта кукла изображает великого дракона Вртру, который, несмотря на грозную внешность, слывёт добросердечным. Правда, копия куда менее устрашающая, чем настоящий дракон, хотя старается изо всех сил."

#. ja: ランペール！
#. de: Nicht alle Drachen bringen Tod und Zerstörung.<br><i>Lucia</i>
#. fr: Ranperre<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Vrtra minion. Last of his brood but certainly not least.
#. column 1: A mammet designed in the likeness of the great wyrm Vrtra, who is said to be possessed of a gentle heart despite his fearsome appearance. Though this recreation is somewhat less fearsome than the actual wyrm, it is not for want of effort on its part.
#. column 3: Sable Breath
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 110 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:430:0:2"
msgid "The hour is come, Vrtra.<br>   - Estinien"
msgstr "Час настал, Вртра.<br>   — Эстиниен"

#. ja: セイブルブレス
#. de: Sandhauch
#. fr: Souffle de sable
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Vrtra minion. Last of his brood but certainly not least.
#. column 1: A mammet designed in the likeness of the great wyrm Vrtra, who is said to be possessed of a gentle heart despite his fearsome appearance. Though this recreation is somewhat less fearsome than the actual wyrm, it is not for want of effort on its part.
#. column 2: The hour is come, Vrtra.<br>   - Estinien
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 110 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:430:0:3"
msgid "Sable Breath"
msgstr "Песчаное дыхание"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK110のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 110 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 110 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Vrtra minion. Last of his brood but certainly not least.
#. column 1: A mammet designed in the likeness of the great wyrm Vrtra, who is said to be possessed of a gentle heart despite his fearsome appearance. Though this recreation is somewhat less fearsome than the actual wyrm, it is not for want of effort on its part.
#. column 2: The hour is come, Vrtra.<br>   - Estinien
#. column 3: Sable Breath
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:430:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 110 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия удар силой 110."

#. ja: ミニオン「ヒッポカフ」を呼び出す。<br>小さいが重いカバの幼獣。実は南方大陸原産の種
#. de: Du rufst dein Flusspferdkalb als Begleiter herbei. Klein, aber sehr schwer.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé hippo, un petit mammifère qui pèse son poids.
#. column 1: Hippopotami are native to Meracydia, and scholars point to their presence in Thavnair as proof that trade thrived between the lands long ago. During the chaos of the Final Days, this calf became separated from its herd and strayed into your path in Vanaspati.
#. column 2: Thou shalt not lift<br>with thy back.<br>   - Ancient Wisdom
#. column 3: Big Yawn
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:431:0:0"
msgid "Summon your hippo calf minion. Heavy. Assisted lift may be required."
msgstr "Призовите детёныша бегемота. Тяжёлый. Возможно, понадобится помощь, чтобы поднять."

#. ja: 小さいが重いカバの幼獣。終末現象に襲われたヴァナスパティ樹海で逃げ惑っていたところを、冒険者に救われた。なお、カバは南方大陸の原産であり、それがサベネア島にいるのは大昔の交易を示す証拠だと主張する学者もいる
#. de: Ursprünglich auf dem südlichen Kontinent Meracydia beheimatet, gilt die Existenz von Flusspferden auf Thavnair als Beweis, dass zwischen den Kontinenten seit alters Handelskontakt besteht.
#. fr: Les hippopotames sont originaires de Méracydia, et leur présence à Thavnair attesterait, d'après les scien<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>ques, d'échanges commerciaux entre ces territoires à une époque reculée. L'apocalypse faisait rage à Vanaspati lorsque vous avez secouru ce bébé.
#. column 0: Summon your hippo calf minion. Heavy. Assisted lift may be required.
#. column 2: Thou shalt not lift<br>with thy back.<br>   - Ancient Wisdom
#. column 3: Big Yawn
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:431:0:1"
msgid "Hippopotami are native to Meracydia, and scholars point to their presence in Thavnair as proof that trade thrived between the lands long ago. During the chaos of the Final Days, this calf became separated from its herd and strayed into your path in Vanaspati."
msgstr "Бегемоты родом из Мерацидии, и учёные считают, что их присутствие на Тавнаире доказывает: в давние времена между землями шла бойкая торговля. Во время Хаоса Последних Дней этот детёныш отбился от стада и забрёл к вам в Ванаспати."

#. ja: カバディ、カバディ！
#. de: Ich glaub, mich tritt ein Flusspferd!<br><i>Händler aus Thavnair</i>
#. fr: Hippo... calypse...
#. column 0: Summon your hippo calf minion. Heavy. Assisted lift may be required.
#. column 1: Hippopotami are native to Meracydia, and scholars point to their presence in Thavnair as proof that trade thrived between the lands long ago. During the chaos of the Final Days, this calf became separated from its herd and strayed into your path in Vanaspati.
#. column 3: Big Yawn
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:431:0:2"
msgid "Thou shalt not lift<br>with thy back.<br>   - Ancient Wisdom"
msgstr "Поднимать надо<br>не спиной.<br>   — Мудрость предков"

#. ja: 大あくび
#. de: Großes Gähnen
#. fr: Gros bâillement
#. column 0: Summon your hippo calf minion. Heavy. Assisted lift may be required.
#. column 1: Hippopotami are native to Meracydia, and scholars point to their presence in Thavnair as proof that trade thrived between the lands long ago. During the chaos of the Final Days, this calf became separated from its herd and strayed into your path in Vanaspati.
#. column 2: Thou shalt not lift<br>with thy back.<br>   - Ancient Wisdom
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:431:0:3"
msgid "Big Yawn"
msgstr "Широкий зевок"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵を移動不可にする。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>5秒
#. de: Macht Gegner in der Nähe be<shy>we<shy>gungs<shy>un<shy>fäh<shy>ig.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5 Sekunden
#. fr: Immobilise les ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. column 0: Summon your hippo calf minion. Heavy. Assisted lift may be required.
#. column 1: Hippopotami are native to Meracydia, and scholars point to their presence in Thavnair as proof that trade thrived between the lands long ago. During the chaos of the Final Days, this calf became separated from its herd and strayed into your path in Vanaspati.
#. column 2: Thou shalt not lift<br>with thy back.<br>   - Ancient Wisdom
#. column 3: Big Yawn
