#. ja: ミニオン「カニカニ」を呼び出す。<br>サベネア島で発見された新種のカニ。樹上で暮らす
#. de: Du rufst deinen Krabbenkrebs als Begleiter herbei. Krabbelt sehr schnell mit seinen zehn Beinen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte crabe du crabe, une espèce de crabe arboricole récemment découverte.
#. column 1: Native to Thavnair, this tree-dwelling crab became known to foreign scholars when an Arkasodara clan pointed them out to a visiting crew. So exemplarily crab-like were its features, it was promptly identified as such and given a name to match.
#. column 2: If yer playin' us false, I'll be<br>back to feed the crabs with<br>yer lyin' tongue.<br>   - Rostnsthal
#. column 3: Crab Walk
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:432:0:0"
msgid "Summon your crabe de la crabe minion. If it were any crabbier, it would...probably still be a crab."
msgstr "Призовите краба из крабов. Будь он ещё более крабовым, он бы... всё равно остался крабом."

#. ja: サベネア島で発見された新種のカニ。現地で暮らすカニ族というアルカソーダラ族の氏族が、当地を訪れた生物学者に、樹上で暮らすカニがいると報せたことで発見された。それゆえ、カニ族のカニ……つまり、カニカニと呼ばれるのだ
#. de: Eine neue Krebsart, die nach ihren Entdeckern, den Krabben, einem Unterstamm der Arkasodara,  benannt wurde. Nicht zu verwechseln mit der Krabbe, die ebenfalls ein Krebstier ist.
#. fr: C'est un Arkasodara dont le nom de famille signifie lit<shy>té<shy>ra<shy>le<shy>ment “crabe” qui a découvert par hasard ce crustacé en haut d'un arbre, et l'a signalé à un biologiste de passage à Thavnair. De là lui vient ce nom qu'on pourra qualifier de prosaïque.
#. column 0: Summon your crabe de la crabe minion. If it were any crabbier, it would...probably still be a crab.
#. column 2: If yer playin' us false, I'll be<br>back to feed the crabs with<br>yer lyin' tongue.<br>   - Rostnsthal
#. column 3: Crab Walk
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:432:0:1"
msgid "Native to Thavnair, this tree-dwelling crab became known to foreign scholars when an Arkasodara clan pointed them out to a visiting crew. So exemplarily crab-like were its features, it was promptly identified as such and given a name to match."
msgstr "Этот древесный краб родом с Тавнаира стал известен чужеземным учёным благодаря одному из кланов аркасодара, показавшему его прибывшей экспедиции. На вид краб как краб, так его и назвали."

#. ja: カニカニカニ！
#. de: Da krabbelt was den Baum hoch!<br><i>Erstaunter Arkasodara</i>
#. fr: On se serre la pince<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your crabe de la crabe minion. If it were any crabbier, it would...probably still be a crab.
#. column 1: Native to Thavnair, this tree-dwelling crab became known to foreign scholars when an Arkasodara clan pointed them out to a visiting crew. So exemplarily crab-like were its features, it was promptly identified as such and given a name to match.
#. column 3: Crab Walk
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:432:0:2"
msgid "If yer playin' us false, I'll be<br>back to feed the crabs with<br>yer lyin' tongue.<br>   - Rostnsthal"
msgstr "Если ты нас обманываешь, я вернусь<br>и скормлю крабам твой лживый язык.<br>   — Ростнсталь"

#. ja: カニステップ
#. de: Krebsgang
#. fr: Pas de crabe
#. column 0: Summon your crabe de la crabe minion. If it were any crabbier, it would...probably still be a crab.
#. column 1: Native to Thavnair, this tree-dwelling crab became known to foreign scholars when an Arkasodara clan pointed them out to a visiting crew. So exemplarily crab-like were its features, it was promptly identified as such and given a name to match.
#. column 2: If yer playin' us false, I'll be<br>back to feed the crabs with<br>yer lyin' tongue.<br>   - Rostnsthal
