msgstr "Делает всех союзников в радиусе действия неуязвимыми для атак <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>монстров</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「ルナテンダー・プリンス」を呼び出す。<br>ルナテンダーの王子様。元観葉植物
#. de: Du rufst deinen Lunatender-Prinzen als Begleiter herbei. Nicht nur eine einfache Grünpflanze.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Prince pampa sélénien, une plante décorative éprise de liberté.
#. column 1: As part of their efforts to make Smileton into a paradise, the Loporrits caught this prince among lunatenders to use as an ornamental plant. However, it was disinclined to suffer the indignity, and slipped into your bag and fled.
#. column 2: This is sure to fetch a princely<br>sum from Master Gegeruju!<br>   - Zhloe Aliapoh
#. column 3: Moonbathe
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:433:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Prince Lunatender minion. Use as a decoration at risk of suffering puncture wounds─lots of them."
msgstr "Призовите принца лунного кактуса. Не используйте его как украшение, если не хотите исколоться. И не раз."

#. ja: ルナテンダーの王子様。スマイルトンを楽園都市として仕上げるための「観葉植物」としてレポリットたちが持ち込んだ物のようだが、その決定を不服として脱走。ちょうどやってきた冒険者のカバンに入り込み、自由を得たのだった
#. de: Zu einem Paradies gehören Pflanzen und so brachten die Loporrit diesen Lunatender nach Smileton. Der war nun aber keine gewöhnliche Grünpflanze, sondern ein Prinz, dem es nicht gefiel, nur Dekoration zu sein. Eines Tages sprang er in deine Tasche und ward frei.
#. fr: Les Loporrites avaient amené ce pampa à Risette-sur-lune afin d'enjoliver leur petit bout de paradis. C'était sans compter le libre arbitre du végétal, qui s'est empressé de se glisser dans votre besace pour échapper à son destin de plante décorative.
#. column 0: Summon your Prince Lunatender minion. Use as a decoration at risk of suffering puncture wounds─lots of them.
#. column 2: This is sure to fetch a princely<br>sum from Master Gegeruju!<br>   - Zhloe Aliapoh
#. column 3: Moonbathe
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:433:0:1"
msgid "As part of their efforts to make Smileton into a paradise, the Loporrits caught this prince among lunatenders to use as an ornamental plant. However, it was disinclined to suffer the indignity, and slipped into your bag and fled."
msgstr "Превращая Смайлтон в райский уголок, лопорриты поймали принца среди лунных кактусов и решили использовать его как декоративное растение. Но принц не пожелал терпеть такое унижение, забрался в вашу сумку и сбежал."

#. ja: プリンス！
#. de: Ein schönes Paradies ist das.<br><i>Alphinaud</i>
#. fr: Je m'en vais comme un prince<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Prince Lunatender minion. Use as a decoration at risk of suffering puncture wounds─lots of them.
#. column 1: As part of their efforts to make Smileton into a paradise, the Loporrits caught this prince among lunatenders to use as an ornamental plant. However, it was disinclined to suffer the indignity, and slipped into your bag and fled.
#. column 3: Moonbathe
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:433:0:2"
msgid "This is sure to fetch a princely<br>sum from Master Gegeruju!<br>   - Zhloe Aliapoh"
msgstr "Господину Гегеруджу<br>за него дадут целое<br>состояние!<br>   — Жло Алипох"

#. ja: 月光浴
#. de: Mondlichtbad
#. fr: Douche lunaire
#. column 0: Summon your Prince Lunatender minion. Use as a decoration at risk of suffering puncture wounds─lots of them.
#. column 1: As part of their efforts to make Smileton into a paradise, the Loporrits caught this prince among lunatenders to use as an ornamental plant. However, it was disinclined to suffer the indignity, and slipped into your bag and fled.
