msgctxt "CompanionTransient:433:0:4"
msgid "Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
msgstr "Устанавливает ловушку, которая при срабатывании наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия удар силой 260.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Задержка срабатывания:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「リトルトロル」を呼び出す。<br>トロルの幼獣。好奇心が旺盛
#. de: Du rufst dein Tröllchen als Begleiter herbei. Er grinst dich lieb an.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte petit troll, une jeune créature à la curiosité insatiable.
#. column 1: Originally an inhabitant of Labyrinthos, this inquisitive young troll snuck into the Aitiascope, where it fell into the aetherial sea. There it met the souls of its ancestors─an experience that saw it mature beyond its tender years.
#. column 2: I swear he's part forest troll...<br>   - Lightly Built Lab Assistant
#. column 3: Sneeze
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:434:0:0"
msgid "Summon your tiny troll minion. The good kind that makes constructive, well-thought-out comments."
msgstr "Призовите крошечного тролля. Из тех, что выдают конструктивные и хорошо обдуманные замечания."

#. ja: トロルの幼獣。ラヴィリンソスで暮らしていたが、好奇心からアイティオン星晶鏡に入り込み、そのまま星海に落ちてしまった。ここで死んだ父祖の魂と出会ったリトルトロルは、大きく成長し、大人への階段を登ったのである
#. de: Aus Neugier schlich sich dieses Trolljunge ins Aitiaskop und fiel hinab auf den Sternengrund. Dort traf es seine verstorbenen Ahnen, eine Begegnung, die seine geistige Entwicklung gehörig vorantrieb, auch wenn man ihm seine Reife nicht unbedingt ansieht.
#. fr: Ce jeune troll vivait dans le Labyrinthos, quand un beau jour, sa curiosité le poussa à s'introduire dans le Prisme de l'Aitia. Là-bas, il chuta accidentellement dans la mer des étoiles et croisa l'âme de ses ancêtres, une rencontre qui le bouleversa à jamais.
#. column 0: Summon your tiny troll minion. The good kind that makes constructive, well-thought-out comments.
#. column 2: I swear he's part forest troll...<br>   - Lightly Built Lab Assistant
#. column 3: Sneeze
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:434:0:1"
msgid "Originally an inhabitant of Labyrinthos, this inquisitive young troll snuck into the Aitiascope, where it fell into the aetherial sea. There it met the souls of its ancestors─an experience that saw it mature beyond its tender years."
msgstr "Этот любознательный юный тролль жил в Лабиринтосе, пока не пробрался в Аитиаскоп и не упал в эфирное море. Там он встретил души предков — и повзрослел куда раньше срока."

#. ja: トロリン…！
#. de: Grrr!<br><i>Flauschi</i>
#. fr: Trollolololère<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your tiny troll minion. The good kind that makes constructive, well-thought-out comments.
#. column 1: Originally an inhabitant of Labyrinthos, this inquisitive young troll snuck into the Aitiascope, where it fell into the aetherial sea. There it met the souls of its ancestors─an experience that saw it mature beyond its tender years.
#. column 3: Sneeze
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:434:0:2"
msgid "I swear he's part forest troll...<br>   - Lightly Built Lab Assistant"
msgstr "Клянусь, он наполовину лесной тролль...<br>   — Хрупкий лаборант"

#. ja: くしゃみ
#. de: Niesen
#. fr: Éternuement
#. column 0: Summon your tiny troll minion. The good kind that makes constructive, well-thought-out comments.
#. column 1: Originally an inhabitant of Labyrinthos, this inquisitive young troll snuck into the Aitiascope, where it fell into the aetherial sea. There it met the souls of its ancestors─an experience that saw it mature beyond its tender years.
