#. ja: ミニオン「アドベンチャーバスケット」を呼び出す。<br>食器と食料が詰め込まれたバスケット。さあ、冒険に出よう
#. de: Du rufst deinen Abenteurerkorb als Begleiter herbei. Weil niemand mit leerem Magen die Welt retten sollte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte malle d'aventure, le compagnon in<shy>dis<shy>pen<shy>sa<shy>ble des pique-niques.
#. column 1: Be it a frozen waste or a volcano's fiery bowels, no matter where your adventures take you, this basket laden with tasty morsels will nourish your body while lifting your spirit. Cutlery and crockery included for your consuming convenience.
#. column 2: This is a picnic compared<br>to my officer training...<br>   - Dancing Wolf
#. column 3: Picnic
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:436:0:0"
msgid "Summon your adventure basket minion. Because no one should have to save the world on an empty stomach."
msgstr "Призовите корзинку для приключений. Спасать мир на голодный желудок никому не стоит."

#. ja: 食器と食料が詰め込まれたバスケット。どんなに辛く厳しい旅路であっても、昼食くらい全力で愉しみたい。極寒の氷原でも、灼熱の火口でも、銃弾飛び交う戦場でも、このバスケットを開けば、気分はもうピクニックだ
#. de: Ein Korb voller Köstlichkeiten, der sowohl extreme Kälte als auch größte Hitze aushält und damit für Abenteurer ideal ist. Wenn dir die Kugeln um die Ohren fliegen, öffne den Korb und lass dich in Picknicklaune versetzen.
#. fr: Cette malle garnie de couverts et de victuailles nous rappelle l'importance de bien manger, même durant le plus rude des périples. Avec elle, n'importe quel glacier, volcan ou champ de bataille peut se transformer en aire de pique-nique.
#. column 0: Summon your adventure basket minion. Because no one should have to save the world on an empty stomach.
#. column 2: This is a picnic compared<br>to my officer training...<br>   - Dancing Wolf
#. column 3: Picnic
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:436:0:1"
msgid "Be it a frozen waste or a volcano's fiery bowels, no matter where your adventures take you, this basket laden with tasty morsels will nourish your body while lifting your spirit. Cutlery and crockery included for your consuming convenience."
msgstr "Куда бы ни завели вас приключения — в ледяную пустошь или огненные недра вулкана — эта корзинка с вкусной едой и душу согреет, и силы восстановит. Приборы и посуда в комплекте!"

#. ja: イタダキマス！
#. de: Es sind oft die kleinen Dinge im Leben, die das Leben schön machen, kupo!<br><i>Mogomo</i>
#. fr: Et bon appétit bien sûr<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your adventure basket minion. Because no one should have to save the world on an empty stomach.
#. column 1: Be it a frozen waste or a volcano's fiery bowels, no matter where your adventures take you, this basket laden with tasty morsels will nourish your body while lifting your spirit. Cutlery and crockery included for your consuming convenience.
#. column 3: Picnic
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:436:0:2"
msgid "This is a picnic compared<br>to my officer training...<br>   - Dancing Wolf"
msgstr "По сравнению с обучением<br>офицеров это пикник...<br>   — Танцующий Волк"

#. ja: ピクニック！
#. de: Picknick
#. fr: Pique-nique<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your adventure basket minion. Because no one should have to save the world on an empty stomach.
#. column 1: Be it a frozen waste or a volcano's fiery bowels, no matter where your adventures take you, this basket laden with tasty morsels will nourish your body while lifting your spirit. Cutlery and crockery included for your consuming convenience.
#. column 2: This is a picnic compared<br>to my officer training...<br>   - Dancing Wolf
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:436:0:3"
msgid "Picnic"
msgstr "Пикник"

