#. ja: ミニオン「黄金のチャタ号」を呼び出す。<br>古代の遺物、黄金のチャタ号の精巧なレプリカ
#. de: Du rufst deinen Goldenen Dhyata als Begleiter herbei. Er ist weder Fisch noch Vogel, sondern eine Übersetzungsmaschine.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Dhyata dorée, la réplique parfaite d'un artefact ancien.
#. column 1: A faithful replica of the artifact being studied by Professor Rurusha, this translation device is believed to have been created in the likeness of a catfish. However, none can say why the ancients chose such a whimsical form for it.
#. column 2: Something lost in<br>translation, perhaps?<br>   - Jenomis
#. column 3: Literal Translation
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:437:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Golden Dhyata minion. Is it a bird? Is it a fish? No, it's a translation device!"
msgstr "Призовите Золотого Дхьяту. Птица? Рыба? Нет, устройство для перевода!"

#. ja: ルルシャ考古学研究室において再生された古代の遺物、その姿は、鳥のようにも魚のようにも見える。ナマズを模したものではないかとも言われているが、なぜ古の民が翻訳機に、このような姿を与えたのかは定かでない
#. de: Ein von Professorin Rurusha restauriertes Artefakt, dem eine Ähnlichkeit zu einem Wels nachgesagt wird. Weshalb diese Form für eine Übersetzungsmaschine gewählt wurde, bleibt ein Rätsel.
#. fr: Ce drôle d'artefact conçu au sein du laboratoire de Rurusha est la réplique d'un traducteur automatique ancestral. Son apparence, à mi-chemin entre le volatile et le poisson, aurait été inspirée par les Namazu. Pourquoi<nbsp>? C'est un mystère.
#. column 0: Summon your Golden Dhyata minion. Is it a bird? Is it a fish? No, it's a translation device!
#. column 2: Something lost in<br>translation, perhaps?<br>   - Jenomis
#. column 3: Literal Translation
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:437:0:1"
msgid "A faithful replica of the artifact being studied by Professor Rurusha, this translation device is believed to have been created in the likeness of a catfish. However, none can say why the ancients chose such a whimsical form for it."
msgstr "Точная копия артефакта, который изучает профессор Руруша. Считается, что это устройство для перевода создано в виде сома. Но почему древние выбрали для него такую причудливую форму, никто не знает."

#. ja: ウ、ペ、ペ！
#. de: Kann mal jemand für mich übersetzen?<br><i>Sawney</i>
#. fr: O, yo, yo<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Golden Dhyata minion. Is it a bird? Is it a fish? No, it's a translation device!
#. column 1: A faithful replica of the artifact being studied by Professor Rurusha, this translation device is believed to have been created in the likeness of a catfish. However, none can say why the ancients chose such a whimsical form for it.
#. column 3: Literal Translation
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:437:0:2"
msgid "Something lost in<br>translation, perhaps?<br>   - Jenomis"
msgstr "Что-то потерялось<br>при переводе, а?<br>   — Дженомис"

#. ja: 超翻訳
#. de: Wörtliche Übersetzung
#. fr: Ultraduction
#. column 0: Summon your Golden Dhyata minion. Is it a bird? Is it a fish? No, it's a translation device!
#. column 1: A faithful replica of the artifact being studied by Professor Rurusha, this translation device is believed to have been created in the likeness of a catfish. However, none can say why the ancients chose such a whimsical form for it.
#. column 2: Something lost in<br>translation, perhaps?<br>   - Jenomis
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:437:0:3"
msgid "Literal Translation"
msgstr "Дословный перевод"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方にかかっている、弱体効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle negativen Effekte von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe toutes les altérations d'état des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Golden Dhyata minion. Is it a bird? Is it a fish? No, it's a translation device!
#. column 1: A faithful replica of the artifact being studied by Professor Rurusha, this translation device is believed to have been created in the likeness of a catfish. However, none can say why the ancients chose such a whimsical form for it.
#. column 2: Something lost in<br>translation, perhaps?<br>   - Jenomis
#. column 3: Literal Translation
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:437:0:4"
msgid "Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все отрицательные эффекты со всех союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「グリーングリーナー」を呼び出す。<br>ゲノーモスの幼体。茂みに紛れ込むのが得意
#. de: Du rufst deinen Laub-Klauber als Begleiter herbei. Gut im Verstecken, aber offensichtlich nicht gut genug.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte glaneur vert, un bébé génomos qui aime se camoufler dans les fourrés.
#. column 1: Though genomos are adept at hiding among foliage, this young specimen couldn't escape your retainer's keen eyes. Due to their predilection for small insects, Sharlayans have long bred the creatures to keep pests under control.
#. column 2: Waiting is boring,<br>like watching moss<br>grow on rocks.<br>   - Vanu Scout
#. column 3: Bloom
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:438:0:0"
msgid "Summon your greener gleaner minion. Good at hiding, but clearly not good enough."
msgstr "Призовите зелёного сборщика. Хорошо прячется, но, как видно, недостаточно хорошо."

#. ja: ゲノーモスの幼体。茂みに紛れ込むのが得意だが、熟練のリテイナーの目をごまかすことはできず、案の定、捕獲されてしまった。小さな虫を食べてくれるため、北洋では害虫駆除用に幼体を飼育する文化があるらしい
#. de: Dieses Genomos-Junge versteckte sich im grünen Laub und hielt sich für unsichtbar - bis es von einem Gehilfen eingefangen wurde. Genomos wurden von den Sharlayanern lange Zeit wegen ihrer Eigenschaft, Schädlinge zu fressen, als Nutztiere gezüchtet.
#. fr: Doué pour se camoufler dans les fourrés, ce bébé génomos a péché par excès de confiance et a fini dans les filets d'un servant à l'affût. Les habitants des mers du Nord élèvent de telles créatures pour leurs vertus insecticides.
#. column 0: Summon your greener gleaner minion. Good at hiding, but clearly not good enough.
#. column 2: Waiting is boring,<br>like watching moss<br>grow on rocks.<br>   - Vanu Scout
#. column 3: Bloom
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:438:0:1"
msgid "Though genomos are adept at hiding among foliage, this young specimen couldn't escape your retainer's keen eyes. Due to their predilection for small insects, Sharlayans have long bred the creatures to keep pests under control."
msgstr "Геномосы умеют прятаться среди листвы, но этому детёнышу не удалось скрыться от зоркого взгляда вашего слуги. Шарлайцы давно разводят геномосов, чтобы те уничтожали мелких вредителей."

#. ja: もぞもぞ…
#. de: Niemand ist wütend auf dich, komm doch bitte raus, falls du dich versteckst!<br><i>Yalana</i>
#. fr: Blork, blork...
#. column 0: Summon your greener gleaner minion. Good at hiding, but clearly not good enough.
#. column 1: Though genomos are adept at hiding among foliage, this young specimen couldn't escape your retainer's keen eyes. Due to their predilection for small insects, Sharlayans have long bred the creatures to keep pests under control.
#. column 3: Bloom
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:438:0:2"
msgid "Waiting is boring,<br>like watching moss<br>grow on rocks.<br>   - Vanu Scout"
msgstr "Ждать скучно,<br>как смотреть, как<br>растёт мох на камнях.<br>   — Разведчик вану"

#. ja: 開花
#. de: Aufblühen
#. fr: Floraison
#. column 0: Summon your greener gleaner minion. Good at hiding, but clearly not good enough.
#. column 1: Though genomos are adept at hiding among foliage, this young specimen couldn't escape your retainer's keen eyes. Due to their predilection for small insects, Sharlayans have long bred the creatures to keep pests under control.
#. column 2: Waiting is boring,<br>like watching moss<br>grow on rocks.<br>   - Vanu Scout
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:438:0:3"
msgid "Bloom"
msgstr "Цветение"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、1秒ごとに10の継続ダメージを与える。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>20秒
#. de: Fügt Gegnern in der Nähe im Sekundentakt 10 Schaden über Zeit zu.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 Sekunden
#. fr: Inflige 10 points de dégâts périodiques par seconde aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. column 0: Summon your greener gleaner minion. Good at hiding, but clearly not good enough.
#. column 1: Though genomos are adept at hiding among foliage, this young specimen couldn't escape your retainer's keen eyes. Due to their predilection for small insects, Sharlayans have long bred the creatures to keep pests under control.
#. column 2: Waiting is boring,<br>like watching moss<br>grow on rocks.<br>   - Vanu Scout
#. column 3: Bloom
