msgstr "Каждую секунду наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия 10 ед. периодического урона.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・グレビュオフ」を呼び出す。<br>正体不明の魔法人形。そこはかとなく磯の香りがする
#. de: Du rufst deine Grebuloff-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie verströmt einen leichten Duft nach Meer und Felsen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Grébuloff miniature, un pantin mystère qui fleure bon le large.
#. column 1: One day, a Namazu craftsman was swept away in the One River. As he tumbled along the riverbed, he had a vision of a mysterious being, which he recreated in the form of this mammet. Or so your retainer reports. Could such a life-form exist somewhere out there?
#. column 2: So you think yourself an<br>adept enough diver to brave<br>the depths of the sea?<br>   - Ajiro
#. column 3: Glub Glub
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:439:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Grebuloff minion. Smells vaguely like a rocky shore."
msgstr "Призвать заводного Гребулоффа. Пахнет чем-то вроде скалистого берега."

#. ja: 正体不明の魔法人形。回収してきたリテイナーによれば、とあるナマズオ族の職人が無二江上流で溺れかけたときに、朦朧とした意識の中で幻視した存在の姿を再現したものらしい。このような生物が、宇宙のどこかにいるのだろうか？
#. de: Ein Namazuo-Handwerker soll diese magische Puppe einer rätselhaften Gestalt nachgebildet haben, die vor ihm erschien, als er benommen an Land taumelte, nachdem er beinahe ertrunken wäre.
#. fr: D'après le servant qui l'a trouvé, ce pantin serait l'œuvre d'un artisan namazu qui, alors qu'il était sur le point de se noyer dans la Muni, aurait eu la vision d'un être mystérieux vêtu d'un scaphandre. Cette entité existe-t-elle vraiment<nbsp>? Nul ne le sait.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Grebuloff minion. Smells vaguely like a rocky shore.
#. column 2: So you think yourself an<br>adept enough diver to brave<br>the depths of the sea?<br>   - Ajiro
#. column 3: Glub Glub
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:439:0:1"
msgid "One day, a Namazu craftsman was swept away in the One River. As he tumbled along the riverbed, he had a vision of a mysterious being, which he recreated in the form of this mammet. Or so your retainer reports. Could such a life-form exist somewhere out there?"
msgstr "Однажды мастера-намазу унесло течением Единственной реки. Пока его волокло по дну, ему привиделось загадочное существо, и он воссоздал его в виде этой куклы. По крайней мере, так рассказывает ваш слуга. Неужели где-то во вселенной и правда водятся такие создания?"

#. ja: きゅきゅっ！
#. de: Hilfe! Da ertrinkt jemand!<br><i>Strandbesucher</i>
#. fr: Kyu, kyu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Grebuloff minion. Smells vaguely like a rocky shore.
#. column 1: One day, a Namazu craftsman was swept away in the One River. As he tumbled along the riverbed, he had a vision of a mysterious being, which he recreated in the form of this mammet. Or so your retainer reports. Could such a life-form exist somewhere out there?
#. column 3: Glub Glub
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:439:0:2"
msgid "So you think yourself an<br>adept enough diver to brave<br>the depths of the sea?<br>   - Ajiro"
msgstr "Думаешь, ты достаточно<br>хороший ныряльщик, чтобы<br>отправиться на морское дно?<br>   — Адзиро"

#. ja: プカプカ
#. de: Blubberblubber
#. fr: Plop, plop
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Grebuloff minion. Smells vaguely like a rocky shore.
#. column 1: One day, a Namazu craftsman was swept away in the One River. As he tumbled along the riverbed, he had a vision of a mysterious being, which he recreated in the form of this mammet. Or so your retainer reports. Could such a life-form exist somewhere out there?
#. column 2: So you think yourself an<br>adept enough diver to brave<br>the depths of the sea?<br>   - Ajiro
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
