#. ja: ミニオン「ノスフェラトゥ」を呼び出す。<br>血の匂いに敏感なコウモリ的な何か
#. de: Du rufst deine Nosferatu-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie besitzt einen genügend starken Charakter, um ihrer Schwäche für Blut nicht nachzugeben.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Nosferatu, une sorte de chauve-souris bien habillée.
#. column 1: Though understood to refer to vampires, the word “nosferatu” has an uncertain origin, and the same may be said of this bat-like creature. However, from the fact that it appears to be wearing a dinner suit and won't drink your blood without permission, it is clearly a gentlemanly sort.
#. column 2: Aren't bats just the cutest little<br>plague-bearers you ever did see?<br>   - Bat Enthusiast
#. column 3: Bloodsucker
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:440:0:0"
msgid "Summon your nosferatu minion. Nothing if not gentlemanly...and perhaps bloodthirsty."
msgstr "Призовите Носферату. Настоящий джентльмен... хотя, возможно, и любитель крови."

#. ja: 血の匂いに敏感なコウモリ的な何か。どうやら血を飲みたいらしいのだが、とても紳士的なので、他人から無理やり飲もうとはしない。ちなみに、ノスフェラトゥという名が何を示すものなのか、まったくの不明であるという
#. de: Ein fledermausähnliches Wesen, dem es zwar nach deinem Blut dürstet, aber ebenso nach deiner Liebe, weshalb es dir niemals Schaden zufügen wird. Woher sein Name stammt, ist nicht bekannt.
#. fr: Cette espèce de chauve-souris se distingue par ses manières très distinguées. En effet, elle ne sucera jamais le sang d'une personne contre son gré, quand bien même elle en aurait très envie. L'origine de son nom demeure à ce jour inconnue.
#. column 0: Summon your nosferatu minion. Nothing if not gentlemanly...and perhaps bloodthirsty.
#. column 2: Aren't bats just the cutest little<br>plague-bearers you ever did see?<br>   - Bat Enthusiast
#. column 3: Bloodsucker
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:440:0:1"
msgid "Though understood to refer to vampires, the word “nosferatu” has an uncertain origin, and the same may be said of this bat-like creature. However, from the fact that it appears to be wearing a dinner suit and won't drink your blood without permission, it is clearly a gentlemanly sort."
msgstr "Слово «носферату» обычно связывают с вампирами, хотя его происхождение неизвестно. То же можно сказать и об этом существе, похожем на летучую мышь. Судя по вечернему костюму и тому, что оно не станет пить вашу кровь без разрешения, перед нами настоящий джентльмен."

#. ja: ごくごくごく…
#. de: Ruhig Blut, mein Lieber!<br><i>Hildibrand</i>
#. fr: Le sang<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your nosferatu minion. Nothing if not gentlemanly...and perhaps bloodthirsty.
#. column 1: Though understood to refer to vampires, the word “nosferatu” has an uncertain origin, and the same may be said of this bat-like creature. However, from the fact that it appears to be wearing a dinner suit and won't drink your blood without permission, it is clearly a gentlemanly sort.
#. column 3: Bloodsucker
