#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ヘロイス」を呼び出す。<br>ある大英雄を模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deine heroische Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Komm schon, du weißt, wer sie ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte héroïne miniature, une poupée magique à l'effigie d'une grande dame des temps anciens.
#. column 1: There once was a woman who selflessly served her fellow man as Azem. Even after stepping down, she continued in this mission, and went on to become a divinity that hope may endure. This mammet was made in her honor.
#. column 2: 'Tis time for action.<br>   - Ancient Hero
#. column 3: Persona
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:441:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up herois minion. Come on, you know who this hero is."
msgstr "Призовите заводную Героиню. Ну же, вы знаете, кто она."

#. ja: かつてアゼムの座にあって、人々と世界のために駆け回り、また後任に座を譲ってなお活動を続けた者がいた。彼女は、終末の絶望を超えて、世界が希望に至るようにと神となった。これは、そのような大英雄を模した魔法人形である
#. de: Es war einmal eine Frau, die nicht müde wurde, sich für die Rettung anderer einzusetzen, selbst nachdem sie ihren Titel als Azem abgetreten hatte. Die Puppe wurde zu Ehren dieser Heldin geschaffen, die am Ende zu einer Göttin wurde.
#. fr: Cette poupée rend hommage à une grande dame qui consacra sa vie aux autres et à la planète, pendant et après sa carrière au Concile des Quatorze. Une véritable héroïne qui, pour vaincre le désespoir, devint une entité divine.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up herois minion. Come on, you know who this hero is.
#. column 2: 'Tis time for action.<br>   - Ancient Hero
#. column 3: Persona
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:441:0:1"
msgid "There once was a woman who selflessly served her fellow man as Azem. Even after stepping down, she continued in this mission, and went on to become a divinity that hope may endure. This mammet was made in her honor."
msgstr "Давным-давно одна женщина самоотверженно служила людям на посту Азема. Отрекшись от него, она продолжила своё дело, а впоследствии стала божеством, чтобы надежда не угасла. Эта кукла создана в её честь."

#. ja: 約束ヨ…
#. de: Gut. Machen wir uns also ans Werk.<br><i>Heroische Frau</i>
#. fr: Notre promesse...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up herois minion. Come on, you know who this hero is.
#. column 1: There once was a woman who selflessly served her fellow man as Azem. Even after stepping down, she continued in this mission, and went on to become a divinity that hope may endure. This mammet was made in her honor.
#. column 3: Persona
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
