msgid "Naught will escape my<br>all-seeing eyes, no, no.<br>   - Gyoka"
msgstr "От моих всевидящих глаз<br>ничего не скроется! Ни-че-го!<br>   — Гёка"

#. ja: 真眼
#. de: Göttliches Auge
#. fr: Œil pur
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Daivadipa minion. Can discern good and evil─so long as they are at knee height.
