#. ja: ミニオン「ルナテンダー・ロイヤル」を呼び出す。<br>ルナテンダーの王族。元景品植物
#. de: Du rufst deinen königlichen Lunatender als Begleiter herbei. Einst ein König, dann ein Sachpreis und jetzt läuft er dir hinterher.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Roi pampa sélénien, un pampa qui vaut lit<shy>té<shy>ra<shy>le<shy>ment de l'or.
#. column 1: A mutation caused this lunatender to be golden in color─a trait which, while accentuating its royal lineage, rendered it easy prey on the moon's grey surface. Seeking a less harrowing life, it chose instead to become an Excitatron prize.
#. column 2: The way she spoke, you'd think she<br>was bloody royalty or something...<br>   - Wiscar
#. column 3: Sunbathe
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:443:0:0"
msgid "Summon your royal lunatender minion. All that glitters is not gold. It could also be a lunatender."
msgstr "Призовите царственного лунного кактуса. Не всё то золото, что блестит. Иногда это просто лунный кактус."

#. ja: ルナテンダーの王族。突然変異で黄金色に生まれてしまったがために、灰色の月面では目立ってしまい、なにかと苦労してきた。そのため、安楽な生活を求めて宝物庫 エキサイトロンで観葉植物・兼・景品となる道を選んだのだった
#. de: Als dieser Lunatender aufgrund einer Mutation golden wurde, verließ er den grauen Mond, weil ihm seine auffällige Farbe nur Ärger bescherte. Er beschloss, von nun an als Sachpreis des Euphoratrons durchs Leben zu gehen.
#. fr: Né doré à la suite d'une anomalie génétique, ce pampa a beaucoup souffert de son clinquant, qui jure avec la surface grise de la lune. Il a finalement préféré vivre heureux et caché dans le Ludodrome, en tant que plante décorative et trophée.
#. column 0: Summon your royal lunatender minion. All that glitters is not gold. It could also be a lunatender.
#. column 2: The way she spoke, you'd think she<br>was bloody royalty or something...<br>   - Wiscar
#. column 3: Sunbathe
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:443:0:1"
msgid "A mutation caused this lunatender to be golden in color─a trait which, while accentuating its royal lineage, rendered it easy prey on the moon's grey surface. Seeking a less harrowing life, it chose instead to become an Excitatron prize."
msgstr "Из-за мутации этот лунный кактус стал золотым. Такая окраска подчёркивала его царское происхождение, но на серой поверхности луны он был лёгкой добычей. В поисках спокойной жизни он решил стать призом в сокровищнице «Экзитатрон»."

#. ja: ゴールデン！
#. de: So ist es, mein König.<br><i>Ihanashi</i>
#. fr: Que de l'or<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your royal lunatender minion. All that glitters is not gold. It could also be a lunatender.
#. column 1: A mutation caused this lunatender to be golden in color─a trait which, while accentuating its royal lineage, rendered it easy prey on the moon's grey surface. Seeking a less harrowing life, it chose instead to become an Excitatron prize.
#. column 3: Sunbathe
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:443:0:2"
msgid "The way she spoke, you'd think she<br>was bloody royalty or something...<br>   - Wiscar"
msgstr "Послушать её — так она<br>чуть ли не королевских кровей...<br>   — Уискар"

#. ja: 星光浴
#. de: Sonnenbad
#. fr: Douche solaire
#. column 0: Summon your royal lunatender minion. All that glitters is not gold. It could also be a lunatender.
#. column 1: A mutation caused this lunatender to be golden in color─a trait which, while accentuating its royal lineage, rendered it easy prey on the moon's grey surface. Seeking a less harrowing life, it chose instead to become an Excitatron prize.
