#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・カンガルー」を呼び出す。<br>リテイナーが拾ってきたカンガルーのぬいぐるみ。後ろ足で元気に跳ねる
#. de: Ein Gehilfe fand dieses winzige Känguru, in dessen Beutel sich ein noch winzigeres Känguru befindet.<br><br>Benutze diesen Gegenstand, um das Aufzieh-Känguru zu rufen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte kangourou miniature. Cette peluche trouvée par un servant aime sauter joyeusement sur ses pattes arrières.
#. column 1: This lifelike doll of a marsupial native to the southern continent of Meracydia was discovered by your retainer in an abandoned quarry village. The joey in its pouch seldom shows itself, but this is apparently all according to design.
#. column 2: I have faith that you'll<br>bounce back.<br>   - Hamon Holyfist
#. column 3: Kangaroo Kick
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 60 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:445:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up kangaroo minion. Always has a spring in its step."
msgstr "Призовите заводного кенгуру. Он всегда готов подпрыгнуть."

#. ja: 南方大陸原産の有袋類のぬいぐるみ。採掘現場近くの廃村にて、放置されていたものをリテイナーが発見、修復したらしい。取り外し可能な子どものぬいぐるみが付属しているが、なかなかポケットから出たがらないのは仕様である
#. de: Ein Beuteltier aus dem südlichen Kontinent Meracydia, das aus den Ruinen einer Ausgrabungs-<br>stätte geborgen wurde. Das kleine Babykänguru in seinem Beutel streckt äußerst selten seinen Kopf heraus und taucht dann direkt wieder ab.
#. fr: Une peluche du continent méridional. Elle a été trouvée dans des mines près d'un village en ruine par un servant, qui a pris le soin de la réparer. Elle est fournie avec un bébé kangourou que l'on peut retirer de sa poche, mais il a rarement envie d'en sortir.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up kangaroo minion. Always has a spring in its step.
#. column 2: I have faith that you'll<br>bounce back.<br>   - Hamon Holyfist
#. column 3: Kangaroo Kick
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 60 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:445:0:1"
msgid "This lifelike doll of a marsupial native to the southern continent of Meracydia was discovered by your retainer in an abandoned quarry village. The joey in its pouch seldom shows itself, but this is apparently all according to design."
msgstr "Правдоподобная кукла сумчатого животного с южного континента Мерацидия. Её нашёл ваш слуга в заброшенном посёлке у каменоломни. Детёныш в сумке показывается редко, но, похоже, так и задумано."

#. ja: ルル～♪
#. de: Ein Blick auf das Känguru im Beutel ist jedes Warten wert.<br><i>Känguruforscher</i>
#. fr: Kangouu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up kangaroo minion. Always has a spring in its step.
#. column 1: This lifelike doll of a marsupial native to the southern continent of Meracydia was discovered by your retainer in an abandoned quarry village. The joey in its pouch seldom shows itself, but this is apparently all according to design.
#. column 3: Kangaroo Kick
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 60 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:445:0:2"
msgid "I have faith that you'll<br>bounce back.<br>   - Hamon Holyfist"
msgstr "Верю, ты ещё<br>вскочишь на ноги.<br>   — Хамон Кулак"

#. ja: カンガルーキック
#. de: Kängurukick
#. fr: Coup de pied kangourou
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up kangaroo minion. Always has a spring in its step.
#. column 1: This lifelike doll of a marsupial native to the southern continent of Meracydia was discovered by your retainer in an abandoned quarry village. The joey in its pouch seldom shows itself, but this is apparently all according to design.
