#. ja: ミニオン「プロト・ドレッドノート」を呼び出す。<br>ドレッドノートの縮小実験機。小さいながらも力持ち
#. de: Eine Miniaturausgabe des Brummonauten.<br><br>Benutze diesen Gegenstand, um den Proto-Brummonauten zu rufen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte proto-Dreadnaught, un modèle d'essai miniature de Dreadnaught. Ne vous fiez pas à sa taille, il est plus fort qu'il en a l'air.
#. column 1: A miniaturized version of an Allagan construction machina, believed to have been created as a test prototype. Like the full-sized production models, it is remarkably strong relative to its proportions and can carry far more than its own weight.
#. column 2: Bigger is not necessarily better.<br>   - Man with a Familiar Voice
#. column 3: Steam Clean
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:446:0:0"
msgid "Summon your protonaught minion. The amount it can lift would put a full-grown Roegadyn to shame."
msgstr "Призовите протоната. Поднимет столько, что взрослый рогадин позавидует."

#. ja: 古代アラグ帝国の軍用工作機械の小型個体。試作段階で縮小実験機として作られたものと推察される。実用機が後に重機として用いられたのと同様、この機体も小さいながら力持ち。荷運びくらいなら、なんなくこなす
#. de: Als die alten Allager den Brummonauten als Kriegsmaschine entwickelten, fertigten sie zunächst einen Prototyp im Kleinformat an. So klein seine Maße sind, bezüglich Zer<shy>störungs<shy>kraft kann er es durchaus mit dem Endprodukt aufnehmen.
#. fr: Un modèle d'essai miniature de Dreadnaught de l'ancien empire d'Allag, construit comme modèle réduit dès son prototype. Aussi puissant que les modèles ac<shy>tu<shy>el<shy>le<shy>ment utilisés, il transportera vos affaires sans aucun mal.
#. column 0: Summon your protonaught minion. The amount it can lift would put a full-grown Roegadyn to shame.
#. column 2: Bigger is not necessarily better.<br>   - Man with a Familiar Voice
#. column 3: Steam Clean
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:446:0:1"
msgid "A miniaturized version of an Allagan construction machina, believed to have been created as a test prototype. Like the full-sized production models, it is remarkably strong relative to its proportions and can carry far more than its own weight."
msgstr "Миниатюрная версия аллаганской строительной машины, предположительно созданная как опытный образец. Как и полноразмерные серийные модели, эта крошка обладает удивительной для своих размеров силой и может нести груз тяжелее себя."

#. ja: ギュルギュル…
#. de: Ich gäbe alles dafür, mich den Erfinder einer solchen Maschine nennen zu dürfen.<br><i>Mechaniker</i>
#. fr: Brzzz brzzz...
#. column 0: Summon your protonaught minion. The amount it can lift would put a full-grown Roegadyn to shame.
#. column 1: A miniaturized version of an Allagan construction machina, believed to have been created as a test prototype. Like the full-sized production models, it is remarkably strong relative to its proportions and can carry far more than its own weight.
#. column 3: Steam Clean
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:446:0:2"
msgid "Bigger is not necessarily better.<br>   - Man with a Familiar Voice"
msgstr "Больше — не всегда лучше.<br>   — Мужчина со знакомым голосом"

#. ja: 蒸気洗浄
#. de: Dampfreinigung
#. fr: Vapeur nettoyante
#. column 0: Summon your protonaught minion. The amount it can lift would put a full-grown Roegadyn to shame.
#. column 1: A miniaturized version of an Allagan construction machina, believed to have been created as a test prototype. Like the full-sized production models, it is remarkably strong relative to its proportions and can carry far more than its own weight.
