#. ja: ミニオン「カププクル」を呼び出す。<br>アルザダール海底遺跡に封印されていた小型の魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deinen Kapipikulu als Begleiter herbei. Eine kleine magische Marionette geborgen aus Alzadaals Schatzkammer.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte kapipikulu, une poupée magique miniature qui était scellée dans les ruines sous-marines d'Alzadaal.
#. column 1: Though charged with the Kapikulu's maintenance in the depths of Alzadaal's Legacy, this mammet was largely idle. When trespassers finally appeared in the vault, it dared to hope that it could make itself useful again, but the Kapikulu's demise led to its unemployment.
#. column 2: I was deep in my teacups<br>at the time, but I know<br>what I saw!<br>   - Pungent Namazu
#. column 3: The Satrap's Authority
#. column 4: Renders action party immune to all attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:447:0:0"
msgid "Summon your teacup Kapikulu minion. Small but eager to work."
msgstr "Призовите чашечного Капикулу. Маленький, зато рвётся в бой."

#. ja: 海底遺跡の最深部を守っていたカプクル専属の従僕。主にカプクルの管理保全を任されていた魔法人形だが、正直なところ暇していた。久方ぶりに侵入者が現れ仕事ができると思ったが、カプクルが木っ端微塵に破壊され、失職したらしい
#. de: Ein Diener des Schatzkammerwächters Kapikulu. Ausschließlich zuständig für dessen Schutz war sein Arbeitsalltag von großer Monotonie geprägt. Eines Tages drang jemand in die Schatzkammer ein und zerschmetterte den Kapikulu, so dass der Diener arbeitslos wurde.
#. fr: Cette poupée magique trouvée dans les ruines sous-marines d'Alzadaal, chargée de la gestion de Kapikulu, avait beaucoup de temps libre. Elle pensait avoir enfin un peu de travail lors de l'arrivée d'intrus, mais se retrouva au chômage lorsque Kapikulu fut réduit en miettes.
#. column 0: Summon your teacup Kapikulu minion. Small but eager to work.
#. column 2: I was deep in my teacups<br>at the time, but I know<br>what I saw!<br>   - Pungent Namazu
#. column 3: The Satrap's Authority
#. column 4: Renders action party immune to all attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:447:0:1"
msgid "Though charged with the Kapikulu's maintenance in the depths of Alzadaal's Legacy, this mammet was largely idle. When trespassers finally appeared in the vault, it dared to hope that it could make itself useful again, but the Kapikulu's demise led to its unemployment."
msgstr "Эта магическая кукла следила за Капикулу в глубинах Наследия Альзадааля, но почти всё время бездельничала. Когда в сокровищнице наконец появились незваные гости, она надеялась снова пригодиться. Увы, Капикулу уничтожили, и кукла осталась без работы."

#. ja: カプ～！
#. de: Der Kapikulu der Schatzkammer wurde restlos zerstört.<br><i>Varshahn</i>
#. fr: Kapi<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your teacup Kapikulu minion. Small but eager to work.
#. column 1: Though charged with the Kapikulu's maintenance in the depths of Alzadaal's Legacy, this mammet was largely idle. When trespassers finally appeared in the vault, it dared to hope that it could make itself useful again, but the Kapikulu's demise led to its unemployment.
#. column 3: The Satrap's Authority
#. column 4: Renders action party immune to all attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:447:0:2"
msgid "I was deep in my teacups<br>at the time, but I know<br>what I saw!<br>   - Pungent Namazu"
msgstr "Я тогда был по уши в чашках,<br>но своими глазами всё видел!<br>   — Вонючий намадзу"

#. ja: 太守のちから
#. de: Schutz des Magistrats
#. fr: Barrière du satrape
#. column 0: Summon your teacup Kapikulu minion. Small but eager to work.
#. column 1: Though charged with the Kapikulu's maintenance in the depths of Alzadaal's Legacy, this mammet was largely idle. When trespassers finally appeared in the vault, it dared to hope that it could make itself useful again, but the Kapikulu's demise led to its unemployment.
