msgid "The Satrap's Authority"
msgstr "Власть сатрапа"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンはすべての攻撃に対して無敵になる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Macht die ausführenden Trabanten unempfindlich für alle Angriffe.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Rend les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT invulnérables à toutes les attaques.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your teacup Kapikulu minion. Small but eager to work.
#. column 1: Though charged with the Kapikulu's maintenance in the depths of Alzadaal's Legacy, this mammet was largely idle. When trespassers finally appeared in the vault, it dared to hope that it could make itself useful again, but the Kapikulu's demise led to its unemployment.
#. column 2: I was deep in my teacups<br>at the time, but I know<br>what I saw!<br>   - Pungent Namazu
#. column 3: The Satrap's Authority
