msgctxt "CompanionTransient:447:0:4"
msgid "Renders action party immune to all attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s"
msgstr "Делает отряд с активными умениями неуязвимым ко всем атакам.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「チワワン」を呼び出す。<br>愛らしい子犬。じゃれるのが大好き
#. de: Du rufst deinen Chiwauwau als Begleiter herbei. Er ist lieb und verspielt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte chihuaouaf, un chiot adorable qui adore faire le fou.
#. column 1: A small breed of dog native to the New World, this adorable critter was brought over to Eorzea by Lominsan sailors. Inquisitive and enthusiastic, it stands ever ready to embark on an adventure with you...but never says no to a spot of frolicking.
#. column 2: From a hound at his throat<br>to a puppy at his heel...<br>   - Hien
#. column 3: Winsome Woof
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:448:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Chewy minion. Take care not to drown in its literal puppy dog eyes."
msgstr "Призовите жующего щенка. Только осторожнее: в этих глазах можно утонуть."

#. ja: つぶらな瞳で見つめてくる、黒毛の子犬。新大陸の辺境で発見された小柄な犬種で、リムサ・ロミンサの船乗りによってエオルゼアに持ち込まれた……のだが、本人的には新たなる冒険に出た気分らしい。冒険の伴と共に元気に駆ける
#. de: Ein kleiner schwarz-weißer Welpe, der dich mit seinem Hundeblick um die Pfote wickeln wird. Er wurde in der Neuen Welt gefunden und von einem limsischen Matrosen nach Eorzea gebracht. In seinem freudigen Schwanzwedeln zeigt sich seine Abenteuerlust.
#. fr: Ce petit chien noir qui vous regarde de ses grands yeux ronds fut trouvé près du nouveau continent et voyagea jusqu'en Éorzéa aux côtés d'un marin de Limsa Lominsa. Ravi de cette nouvelle aventure, il n'hésitera pas à vous suivre avec entrain tel un fidèle compagnon.
#. column 0: Summon your Chewy minion. Take care not to drown in its literal puppy dog eyes.
#. column 2: From a hound at his throat<br>to a puppy at his heel...<br>   - Hien
#. column 3: Winsome Woof
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:448:0:1"
msgid "A small breed of dog native to the New World, this adorable critter was brought over to Eorzea by Lominsan sailors. Inquisitive and enthusiastic, it stands ever ready to embark on an adventure with you...but never says no to a spot of frolicking."
msgstr "Эта очаровательная собачка родом из Нового Света, а в Эорзею её привезли моряки из Лимсы Ломинсы. Любопытный и энергичный щенок всегда готов отправиться с вами в приключение... но и от весёлой возни никогда не откажется."

#. ja: ワワワン♪
#. de: Ein Blick aus seinen runden Augen lässt dich alle zerkauten Schuhe vergessen.<br><i>Chiwauwau-Halter</i>
#. fr: Ouaouaf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Chewy minion. Take care not to drown in its literal puppy dog eyes.
#. column 1: A small breed of dog native to the New World, this adorable critter was brought over to Eorzea by Lominsan sailors. Inquisitive and enthusiastic, it stands ever ready to embark on an adventure with you...but never says no to a spot of frolicking.
#. column 3: Winsome Woof
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:448:0:2"
msgid "From a hound at his throat<br>to a puppy at his heel...<br>   - Hien"
msgstr "От гончей у горла<br>до щенка у пяток...<br>   — Хиэн"

#. ja: ワンワワン！
#. de: Wauwau
#. fr: Ouaf ouaouaf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Chewy minion. Take care not to drown in its literal puppy dog eyes.
#. column 1: A small breed of dog native to the New World, this adorable critter was brought over to Eorzea by Lominsan sailors. Inquisitive and enthusiastic, it stands ever ready to embark on an adventure with you...but never says no to a spot of frolicking.
#. column 2: From a hound at his throat<br>to a puppy at his heel...<br>   - Hien
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:448:0:3"
msgid "Winsome Woof"
msgstr "Очаровательный пёс"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your Chewy minion. Take care not to drown in its literal puppy dog eyes.
#. column 1: A small breed of dog native to the New World, this adorable critter was brought over to Eorzea by Lominsan sailors. Inquisitive and enthusiastic, it stands ever ready to embark on an adventure with you...but never says no to a spot of frolicking.
#. column 2: From a hound at his throat<br>to a puppy at his heel...<br>   - Hien
#. column 3: Winsome Woof
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:448:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Даёт 10 очков умений всем союзникам в радиусе действия, кроме тех, чьи умения дают такой же эффект."

#. ja: ミニオン「クロックワーク・ノウスD」を呼び出す。<br>ブリキ製の車のおもちゃ。ガレアン人が運転している
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Novus D herbei. Ein Spielzeugauto aus Blech, das von einem Garlear gesteuert wird.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Novus D. mécanique, un jouet en forme de voiture conduite par un Garlemaldais.
#. column 1: Modeled upon the popular magitek passenger vehicle Novus D, this tin toy is a favorite of Garlean children, who never tire of winding it up and watching it rattle along. A certain master engineer is said to have created it for both profit and pleasure.
#. column 2: I must settle for crushing<br>the ironmen's toys.<br>   - Sadu
#. column 3: Accelerate
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:449:0:0"
msgid "Summon your clockwork Novus D minion. Deftly driven by an unspecified (but doubtless incomparably brilliant) man."
msgstr "Призовите заводной «Новус Д». За рулём — некий мужчина, несомненно, невероятно одарённый."

#. ja: 帝都ガレマルドでトップシェアを誇る、魔導車両「ノウスD」のブリキ製玩具。ゼンマイ仕掛けでカタカタと走る姿がガレアン人の子どもたちに愛されていた。とある天才機工師が趣味と実益を兼ねて製作・販売していたという
#. de: Ein Blechspielzeugauto, das bei den garleischen Kindern der Renner ist. Der Schöpfer dieses genialen Produkts ist ein gewisser Ingenieur, dem dieses Projekt ebenso viel Spaß wie auch Gil einbrachte.
#. fr: Ce jouet en forme de Novus D., une des meilleures voitures de Garlemald, était par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement apprécié des enfants garlemaldais, qui adoraient l'observer rouler. Il aurait été fabriqué et vendu par un certain inventeur de génie qui a su combiner loisirs et profits.
#. column 0: Summon your clockwork Novus D minion. Deftly driven by an unspecified (but doubtless incomparably brilliant) man.
#. column 2: I must settle for crushing<br>the ironmen's toys.<br>   - Sadu
#. column 3: Accelerate
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:449:0:1"
msgid "Modeled upon the popular magitek passenger vehicle Novus D, this tin toy is a favorite of Garlean children, who never tire of winding it up and watching it rattle along. A certain master engineer is said to have created it for both profit and pleasure."
msgstr "Эта жестяная игрушка сделана по образцу популярного магитехнического пассажирского экипажа «Новус Д». Дети Гарлемальда обожают заводить её и смотреть, как она тарахтит. Говорят, некий мастер-инженер создал её и ради прибыли, и для души."

#. ja: ブイ～ン
#. de: Brumm, brumm!<br><i>Garleisches Kind</i>
#. fr: Viouuum<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your clockwork Novus D minion. Deftly driven by an unspecified (but doubtless incomparably brilliant) man.
#. column 1: Modeled upon the popular magitek passenger vehicle Novus D, this tin toy is a favorite of Garlean children, who never tire of winding it up and watching it rattle along. A certain master engineer is said to have created it for both profit and pleasure.
#. column 3: Accelerate
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
