#. ja: ミニオン「ハッピーエッグバニー」を呼び出す。<br>ジリ・アリアポーの夢に現れた、変わったウサギを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst dein Wunderhäschen als Begleiter herbei.<br>Die rosarote Nachbildung eines frechen, kleinen Glücksboten. Und er ist so flauschig!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte laprœuf joyeux, une poupée magique à l'effigie d'un étrange lapin apparu dans un rêve de Jihli Aliapoh.
#. column 1: A mammet inspired by the peculiar rabbits in Jihli Aliapoh's vision. Initially missing a core, it sprung to life by the power of the crystal brought by an actual happy bunny, and will surely lead its owner to good fortune. Probably.
#. column 2: While I'm more of a “cat-lover,”<br>variety is, after all, the spice of life!<br>   - Gegeruju
#. column 3: Happiness
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:450:0:0"
msgid "Summon your hatching bunny minion. If happiness had form, it would look like this."
msgstr "Призовите вылупившегося кролика. Если бы у счастья был облик, он выглядел бы именно так."

#. ja: しあわせうさぎを模したピンク色の魔法人形。納品時からコアが抜けていたが、エッグハント会場に現れた本物のしあわせうさぎの輝石によって、無事動くようになった。冒険に連れ歩けば、次なる幸運が与えられる……かもしれない
#. de: Diese Marionette ist zwar nur die Nachbildung eines Glückshasen, doch der Kristall in ihrem Inneren war ein Geschenk des Originals selbst. Vielleicht färbt sein Glück ja etwas auf dich ab? Aber lass es bloß nicht unbeaufsichtigt mit Hühnern ...
#. fr: Cette poupée magique rose à l'effigie d'un étrange lapin, dont le noyau avait été perdu, a pu fonctionner grâce à la gemme d'un lapin du bonheur apparu lors de la chasse aux Prœufs. Elle vous portera peut-être chance si vous l'emmenez lors de vos aventures... Ou peut-être pas.
#. column 0: Summon your hatching bunny minion. If happiness had form, it would look like this.
#. column 2: While I'm more of a “cat-lover,”<br>variety is, after all, the spice of life!<br>   - Gegeruju
#. column 3: Happiness
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:450:0:1"
msgid "A mammet inspired by the peculiar rabbits in Jihli Aliapoh's vision. Initially missing a core, it sprung to life by the power of the crystal brought by an actual happy bunny, and will surely lead its owner to good fortune. Probably."
msgstr "Эта магическая кукла создана по образу странных кроликов из видения Джилли Алиапо. Сначала в ней не было ядра, но она ожила благодаря самоцвету, который принёс настоящий кролик счастья. Теперь она наверняка принесёт хозяину удачу. Наверное."

#. ja: キュッ～♪
#. de: Quiiiep～♪
#. fr: Kyu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your hatching bunny minion. If happiness had form, it would look like this.
#. column 1: A mammet inspired by the peculiar rabbits in Jihli Aliapoh's vision. Initially missing a core, it sprung to life by the power of the crystal brought by an actual happy bunny, and will surely lead its owner to good fortune. Probably.
#. column 3: Happiness
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:450:0:2"
msgid "While I'm more of a “cat-lover,”<br>variety is, after all, the spice of life!<br>   - Gegeruju"
msgstr "Я всё же больше люблю кошек,<br>но разнообразие — приправа жизни!<br>   — Гегеруджу"

#. ja: しあわせ
#. de: Glückseligkeit
#. fr: Pur bonheur
#. column 0: Summon your hatching bunny minion. If happiness had form, it would look like this.
#. column 1: A mammet inspired by the peculiar rabbits in Jihli Aliapoh's vision. Initially missing a core, it sprung to life by the power of the crystal brought by an actual happy bunny, and will surely lead its owner to good fortune. Probably.
