#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・アーゼマ」を呼び出す。<br>日神アーゼマを模した魔法人形。ちょっとおてんば
#. de: Du rufst deine Azeyma-Puppe herbei, eine Miniaturabbildung der Sonnengöttin Azeyma.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Azeyma miniature, une poupée magique à l'effigie d'Azeyma la Gardienne, qui agit un peu comme un garçon manqué.
#. column 1: While traveling through the desert in search of divine beauty, a goldsmith inadvertently wandered into the phantom realm. Though unsure if he was dreaming, he later crafted this automaton based on the woman he glimpsed within, imbuing it with her fiery grace.
#. column 2: Let the fires rage!<br>   - Azeyma
#. column 3: Fiery Fan
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:451:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Azeyma minion. For those who like it scorching hot."
msgstr "Призвать заводную Азейму. Для тех, кто любит погорячее."

#. ja: 日神アーゼマを模した魔法人形。とある彫金師が「神性を秘めた美」を求め砂漠を彷徨っていたところ、夢うつつに神域へ紛れ込み、そこで見た姿から衝動のままに造ったらしい。豪気さと人を深く慈しむ神性が映されているという
#. de: Einem gewissen Goldschmied soll nach langem Herumirren in der Wüste Azeyma erschienen sein. Überwältigt von dieser Begegnung griff er sogleich nach seinem Werkzeug, um ihre Schönheit festzuhalten.
#. fr: Cette poupée magique à l'effigie d'Azeyma la Gardienne fut créée par un orfèvre qui entra par mégarde dans son temple alors qu'il cherchait une beauté divine. Sous le charme, il se mit im<shy>mé<shy>dia<shy>te<shy>ment au travail et parvint à capturer sa noblesse et sa grâce envoûtante.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Azeyma minion. For those who like it scorching hot.
#. column 2: Let the fires rage!<br>   - Azeyma
#. column 3: Fiery Fan
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:451:0:1"
msgid "While traveling through the desert in search of divine beauty, a goldsmith inadvertently wandered into the phantom realm. Though unsure if he was dreaming, he later crafted this automaton based on the woman he glimpsed within, imbuing it with her fiery grace."
msgstr "В поисках божественной красоты один ювелир забрёл в мир призраков. Не зная, спал он или нет, он позже создал автоматон по образу женщины, которую там увидел, наделив его её пламенной грацией."

#. ja: アア、焦ガレル…！
#. de: In aller Herrlichkeit strahlt sie und wird dich reinwaschen von deinen Sünden.<br><i>Swaenhylt</i>
#. fr: Aah, quelle chaleur<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Azeyma minion. For those who like it scorching hot.
#. column 1: While traveling through the desert in search of divine beauty, a goldsmith inadvertently wandered into the phantom realm. Though unsure if he was dreaming, he later crafted this automaton based on the woman he glimpsed within, imbuing it with her fiery grace.
#. column 3: Fiery Fan
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
