#. ja: ミニオン「青足のカツォ」を呼び出す。<br>伝説的海賊団「霧髭一味」に名を連ねていた凶鳥。なかなかのワル
#. de: Du rufst deinen Blaufußtölpel herbei. Nicht weniger gefürchtet als Rauschebarts Zorn.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte fou à pattes bleues, un vilain oiseau qui appartenait à la bande de Barbe-Brume.
#. column 1: Formerly of Mistbeard's dread band, this merciless seabird was known for disarming its victims with its vacant gaze before pecking them into submission. But that's all in the past, and it has long since retired to a quiet life hopping between the isles of the southern seas.
#. column 2: I heard some sky pirates go so<br>far as to booby-trap their coffers.<br>   - Lyolf
#. column 3: Soar
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:453:0:0"
msgid "Summon your blue-footed booby minion. A terror from beak to tailfeather."
msgstr "Призовите голубоногую олушу. Гроза морей от клюва до хвоста."

#. ja: 伝説的海賊団「霧髭一味」に名を連ねていた凶鳥。つぶらな瞳で油断させた後、相手が泣くまでクチバシでの攻撃を止めない……というのも、今は昔の話。一味が解散した後は、南の島々を巡り、悠々自適の暮らしをしていたらしい
#. de: Das Wort „böse“ trifft wohl den Charakter dieses Vogels am besten. Wer sich von seinen lieblichen Augen in die Irre führen lässt, bereut es spätestens dann, wenn der Schnabel des Vogels auf einen einhackt.
#. fr: Ce vilain oiseau de la bande de Barbe-Brume utilisait ses grands yeux ronds pour amadouer ses proies avant de les picorer sans pitié jusqu'à ce qu'elles fondent en larmes... Mais c'est du passé. Après la séparation de l'équipage, il vivait une vie tranquille dans les îles du Sud.
#. column 0: Summon your blue-footed booby minion. A terror from beak to tailfeather.
#. column 2: I heard some sky pirates go so<br>far as to booby-trap their coffers.<br>   - Lyolf
#. column 3: Soar
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:453:0:1"
msgid "Formerly of Mistbeard's dread band, this merciless seabird was known for disarming its victims with its vacant gaze before pecking them into submission. But that's all in the past, and it has long since retired to a quiet life hopping between the isles of the southern seas."
msgstr "Эта беспощадная морская птица некогда состояла в грозной банде Туманной Бороды. Своим пустым взглядом она усыпляла бдительность жертв, а потом заклёвывала их до покорности. Но то было давно: после распада банды она поселилась на южных островах и зажила тихой жизнью."

#. ja: カッーカッカ！
#. de: Ein Tölpel ist, wer den Blaufußtölpel unterschätzt.<br><i>Anonymer Pirat</i>
#. fr: Kaa kaa<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your blue-footed booby minion. A terror from beak to tailfeather.
#. column 1: Formerly of Mistbeard's dread band, this merciless seabird was known for disarming its victims with its vacant gaze before pecking them into submission. But that's all in the past, and it has long since retired to a quiet life hopping between the isles of the southern seas.
#. column 3: Soar
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:453:0:2"
msgid "I heard some sky pirates go so<br>far as to booby-trap their coffers.<br>   - Lyolf"
msgstr "Слышал, некоторые небесные пираты<br>даже ловушки ставят в своих сундуках.<br>   — Лиольф"

#. ja: 滑翔
#. de: Höhenflug
#. fr: Envolée
