#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・コヨコヨ」を呼び出す。<br>宇宙より飛来したトモダチ、コヨコヨを模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Koyo-Koyo herbei. Lass ihn nur nicht aus den Augen, sonst hast du am Ende doch noch eine Invasion am Hals.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Koyo K, un ami qui n'est pas de notre galaxie, et encore moins du fond de la nuit.
#. column 1: This automaton was created in the likeness of the alien PuPu by Godbert Manderville, who was inspired by the interstellar visitor's exquisite curves. It is programmed to follow you on your adventures, and has a curious fondness for elixirs.
#. column 2: Pu...Pu?<br>   - Hildibrand
#. column 3: PuPu Salute
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:454:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up PuPu minion. Will bleed you dry of elixirs if you aren't careful."
msgstr "Призвать заводного Пупу. Если не уследишь, он разорит тебя на эликсирах."

#. ja: 宇宙より飛来したトモダチ、コヨコヨを模した魔法人形。その絶妙なシルエットにインスピレーションを得たゴッドベルトが即興で製作したもので、冒険者と行動を共にするよう設定されている。エリクサーの輝きを好むらしい
#. de: Es war Godbert Manderville, der diese kleine Marionette anfertigte. Der außerætherische Besucher hat den guten Godbert derart inspiriert, dass diese lebensechte Nachbildung dich nun auf all deinen Abenteuern begleiten kann.
#. fr: Cette poupée magique à l'effigie de Koyo K, l'extra-terrestre au grand cœur, a été façonnée de la main experte de Godbert, sou<shy>dai<shy>ne<shy>ment frappé par l'inspiration. Elle est programmée pour vous suivre dans toutes vos aventures et, étrangement, ses yeux semblent briller lorsqu'elle aperçoit un élixir...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up PuPu minion. Will bleed you dry of elixirs if you aren't careful.
#. column 2: Pu...Pu?<br>   - Hildibrand
#. column 3: PuPu Salute
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:454:0:1"
msgid "This automaton was created in the likeness of the alien PuPu by Godbert Manderville, who was inspired by the interstellar visitor's exquisite curves. It is programmed to follow you on your adventures, and has a curious fondness for elixirs."
msgstr "Годберт создал эту куклу по образу инопланетянина Пу-Пу, вдохновившись его изящными изгибами. Она будет сопровождать тебя в приключениях и питает странную любовь к эликсирам."

#. ja: コヨコヨコヨ…
#. de: Sein Name ist Koyo-Koyo.<br><i>Hildibrand</i>
#. fr: Koyo-koyo<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up PuPu minion. Will bleed you dry of elixirs if you aren't careful.
#. column 1: This automaton was created in the likeness of the alien PuPu by Godbert Manderville, who was inspired by the interstellar visitor's exquisite curves. It is programmed to follow you on your adventures, and has a curious fondness for elixirs.
#. column 3: PuPu Salute
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:454:0:2"
msgid "Pu...Pu?<br>   - Hildibrand"
msgstr "Пу... Пу?<br>   — Хильдибранд"

#. ja: コヨコヨ式ごあいさつ
#. de: Koyo-Koyo-Gruß
#. fr: Koyo-koyo K<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up PuPu minion. Will bleed you dry of elixirs if you aren't careful.
#. column 1: This automaton was created in the likeness of the alien PuPu by Godbert Manderville, who was inspired by the interstellar visitor's exquisite curves. It is programmed to follow you on your adventures, and has a curious fondness for elixirs.
#. column 2: Pu...Pu?<br>   - Hildibrand
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:454:0:3"
msgid "PuPu Salute"
msgstr "Приветствие Пупу"

#. ja: シールドが破壊されていた場合、復活させる。
#. de: Stellt einen zerstörten Schild wieder her.
#. fr: Rétablit votre bouclier s'il a été détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up PuPu minion. Will bleed you dry of elixirs if you aren't careful.
#. column 1: This automaton was created in the likeness of the alien PuPu by Godbert Manderville, who was inspired by the interstellar visitor's exquisite curves. It is programmed to follow you on your adventures, and has a curious fondness for elixirs.
#. column 2: Pu...Pu?<br>   - Hildibrand
#. column 3: PuPu Salute
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:454:0:4"
msgid "Instantly restores damaged ally Shield."
msgstr "Мгновенно восстанавливает повреждённый щит союзника."

#. ja: ミニオン「クロックワーク・ソル」を呼び出す。<br>ガレマール帝国初代皇帝ソルを模したからくり人形。行って滅せよ、平らげよ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Auzieh-Solus herbei, eine mechanische Puppe, die dem ersten Kaiser des Garleischen Kaiserreichs Solus nachgebildet ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Solus mécanique, une poupée mécanique à l'effigie de l'empereur Solus. Si une terre s'étend sous vos yeux, alors dévastez-la pour la subjuguer<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of Solus zos Galvus, founding father of the Garlean Empire, this automaton was created in the royal workshops to commemorate the ninth anniversary of his ascension. Several units were dispatched to the provinces as a show of the nation's technological prowess.
#. column 2: I should be the one to sigh.<br>   - Solus zos Galvus
#. column 3: Finger Snap
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:455:0:0"
msgid "Summon your clockwork Solus minion. No lands must remain beyond its grasp. Go forth. Conquer. Rule."
msgstr "Призовите заводного Солуса. Ни одна земля не должна ускользнуть от его власти. Вперёд. Завоюй. Правь."

#. ja: ガレマール帝国初代皇帝ソル・ゾス・ガルヴァスを模したからくり人形。皇室御用達の美術魔導工房において、ソル帝の即位9周年を記念して製作されたもの。同国の技術力を示すべく、各地の属州にも配布されたと伝えられている
#. de: Diese Puppe wurde anlässlich des neunten Jubiläums der Inthronisation von Solus angefertigt und soll zur Demonstration der garleischen Technologie auch an alle Haushalte in den Provinzen verteilt worden sein.
#. fr: Cette poupée à l'effigie de l'empereur Solus a été con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>née pour célébrer les neuf ans de l'arrivée au pouvoir de ce dernier. Elle fut également distribuée à d'autres provinces afin de faire étalage de la technologie de l'Empire.
#. column 0: Summon your clockwork Solus minion. No lands must remain beyond its grasp. Go forth. Conquer. Rule.
#. column 2: I should be the one to sigh.<br>   - Solus zos Galvus
#. column 3: Finger Snap
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:455:0:1"
msgid "Designed in the likeness of Solus zos Galvus, founding father of the Garlean Empire, this automaton was created in the royal workshops to commemorate the ninth anniversary of his ascension. Several units were dispatched to the provinces as a show of the nation's technological prowess."
msgstr "Эту куклу, изображающую Солуса зос Галвуса, основателя Гарлеанской империи, создали в императорской мастерской к девятой годовщине его восшествия на престол. Несколько экземпляров отправили в провинции, чтобы продемонстрировать технологическое могущество страны."

#. ja: アア、厭ダ…
#. de: Wenn doch bloß jemand wie Kaiser Solus auftauchen würde.<br><i>Dossennus</i>
#. fr: Aah, quel malheur...
#. column 0: Summon your clockwork Solus minion. No lands must remain beyond its grasp. Go forth. Conquer. Rule.
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of Solus zos Galvus, founding father of the Garlean Empire, this automaton was created in the royal workshops to commemorate the ninth anniversary of his ascension. Several units were dispatched to the provinces as a show of the nation's technological prowess.
#. column 3: Finger Snap
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:455:0:2"
msgid "I should be the one to sigh.<br>   - Solus zos Galvus"
msgstr "Вздыхать-то должен я.<br>   — Солус зос Галвус"

#. ja: フィンガースナップ
#. de: Fingerschnippen
#. fr: Claquement de doigts
#. column 0: Summon your clockwork Solus minion. No lands must remain beyond its grasp. Go forth. Conquer. Rule.
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of Solus zos Galvus, founding father of the Garlean Empire, this automaton was created in the royal workshops to commemorate the ninth anniversary of his ascension. Several units were dispatched to the provinces as a show of the nation's technological prowess.
#. column 2: I should be the one to sigh.<br>   - Solus zos Galvus
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:455:0:3"
msgid "Finger Snap"
msgstr "Щелчок пальцами"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンを自軍の中央ゲート内へワープさせる。
#. de: Versetzt die ausführenden Trabanten zurück zu Tor B.
#. fr: Téléporte les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT vers le portail central.
#. column 0: Summon your clockwork Solus minion. No lands must remain beyond its grasp. Go forth. Conquer. Rule.
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of Solus zos Galvus, founding father of the Garlean Empire, this automaton was created in the royal workshops to commemorate the ninth anniversary of his ascension. Several units were dispatched to the provinces as a show of the nation's technological prowess.
#. column 2: I should be the one to sigh.<br>   - Solus zos Galvus
#. column 3: Finger Snap
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:455:0:4"
msgid "Transports action party to the central summoning Gate."
msgstr "Перемещает отряд с активными умениями к центральным воротам."

#. ja: ミニオン「こねこみみさん」を呼び出す。<br>無人島開拓のため提供された小型魔法人形。よろしくお願いしますニャー
#. de: Du rufst deine Miaurizius-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Miezencharme-Alarm!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Madmiaouselle, une petite poupée magique con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>née spé<shy>cia<shy>le<shy>ment dans le but de ne rien faire si ce n'est quelques miaous et ronrons.
#. column 1: The latest model in Sharlayan automata, developed for island sanctuary labor. According to the research, one out of every five worker ants doesn't actually work, and thus came about the development of this chore-shirking mammet hooded in fur-lined, feline apathy. After all, statistics don't lie, and someone has to fill the slacker quotient.
#. column 2: Ba Go knew someone would be<br>shirking─dodging, malingering,<br>shirking.<br>   - Acolyte Ba Go
#. column 3: Tell
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:456:0:0"
msgid "Summon your felicitous fuzzball minion. Its presence is your present, and that's all the effort you're getting from this indolent island mammet."
msgstr "Призовите пушистого бездельника. Его присутствие — уже ваш подарок: большего от этой ленивой островной куклы не ждите."

#. ja: 無人島の労働力としてシャーレアンから提供された最新型魔法人形。働き蟻の約2割が働かないとの研究結果から、開拓現場でサボる役目として開発された。そのため、力も無ければ知恵もなく、グータラすることに長けている
#. de: Diese Miaurionetten-Puppe wurde von Sharlayan als Arbeitskraft für das Pionierprojekt Inselparadies zur Verfügung gestellt. Da sie jedoch weder besonders stark noch klug ist, besteht ihre vornehmliche Aufgabe darin, süß auszusehen.
#. fr: Au sein des fourmis, pourtant connues pour être travailleuses, 20% de la colonie ne fait strictement rien. Les savants sharlayanais ont donc répliqué ce modèle d'efficacité avec la Madmiaouselle, une poupée magique qui paresse, mais à la perfection.
#. column 0: Summon your felicitous fuzzball minion. Its presence is your present, and that's all the effort you're getting from this indolent island mammet.
#. column 2: Ba Go knew someone would be<br>shirking─dodging, malingering,<br>shirking.<br>   - Acolyte Ba Go
#. column 3: Tell
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:456:0:1"
msgid "The latest model in Sharlayan automata, developed for island sanctuary labor. According to the research, one out of every five worker ants doesn't actually work, and thus came about the development of this chore-shirking mammet hooded in fur-lined, feline apathy. After all, statistics don't lie, and someone has to fill the slacker quotient."
msgstr "Это новейшая модель магических кукол из Шарлаяна, созданная для работы на островном заповеднике. Исследования показали, что каждая пятая рабочая муравьиха на самом деле бездельничает. Так и появилась эта кукла в меховом капюшоне — чтобы уклоняться от работы. Статистика не врёт, а норму бездельников кому-то надо выполнять."

#. ja: ニャニャー♪
#. de: Einfach hinreißend!<br><i>Tataru</i>
#. fr: Ronronron...
#. column 0: Summon your felicitous fuzzball minion. Its presence is your present, and that's all the effort you're getting from this indolent island mammet.
#. column 1: The latest model in Sharlayan automata, developed for island sanctuary labor. According to the research, one out of every five worker ants doesn't actually work, and thus came about the development of this chore-shirking mammet hooded in fur-lined, feline apathy. After all, statistics don't lie, and someone has to fill the slacker quotient.
#. column 3: Tell
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:456:0:2"
msgid "Ba Go knew someone would be<br>shirking─dodging, malingering,<br>shirking.<br>   - Acolyte Ba Go"
msgstr "Ба Го знал, что кто-нибудь<br>будет отлынивать — увиливать,<br>бездельничать, отлынивать.<br>   — Послушник Ба Го"

#. ja: おしえる
#. de: Katzenlehre
#. fr: Mollassonne
