msgstr "Снижает очки умений всех противников в радиусе действия на 50% от максимального значения."

#. ja: ミニオン「ミニルオン」を呼び出す。<br>再受肉に失敗したイーアを模した可変人形。いつかいらなくなるかも、ならないかも
#. de: Du rufst deinen Lumini herbei. Einem Ea nachempfunden, der seine fleischliche Hülle wiederzuerlangen suchte. Der Versuch scheiterte kläglich<nbsp>...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte lumignon, une étrange poupée à l'image d'un Éa ayant échoué sa réincarnation.
#. column 1: A Stigma-4 product, manufactured as a warning for those Ea who might rush into attaining a fleshly vessel before properly recalling the shape of their corporeal form. For those yearning to experience the taste of ice cream, however, the reward may be worth the risks...
#. column 2: Oh, what I would not give to<br>don proper fleshy raiments<br>once more before I pass<br>into the void!<br>   - Envious Ea
#. column 3: Disassemble
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:457:0:0"
msgid "Summon your lumini minion. This floating ball of fleshy horror was modeled after an Ea who failed to regain full corporeality."
msgstr "Призовите Луминь. Этот парящий комок плоти и ужаса создан по образу эа, не сумевшего обрести полноценное тело."

#. ja: スティグマ・フォー謹製の可変人形。味覚への興味を取り戻したイーアの間で、肉体再取得ブームが生じることを危惧して作られた。真の姿を思い出すまでは再受肉槽の利用を控えるよう啓発するため、失敗作たるルミニオンを模している
#. de: Stigma-4 schuf diese magische Marionette als warnendes Exempel für jene Ea, deren wieder-<br>gewecktes Interesse am Essen und Geschmack dazu führte, dass sie sich nach einer fleischlichen Hülle zu sehnen begannen.
#. fr: Stigma-4 a créé cette poupée afin de mettre en garde les Éas contre les dangers d'une réincarnation ratée, une campagne de prévention nécessaire suite à l'engouement soudain de ces formes de vies immatérielles pour le sens du goût.
#. column 0: Summon your lumini minion. This floating ball of fleshy horror was modeled after an Ea who failed to regain full corporeality.
#. column 2: Oh, what I would not give to<br>don proper fleshy raiments<br>once more before I pass<br>into the void!<br>   - Envious Ea
#. column 3: Disassemble
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:457:0:1"
msgid "A Stigma-4 product, manufactured as a warning for those Ea who might rush into attaining a fleshly vessel before properly recalling the shape of their corporeal form. For those yearning to experience the taste of ice cream, however, the reward may be worth the risks..."
msgstr "Изделие Стигмы-4, созданное в назидание эа, которые могут поспешить обрести плоть, не вспомнив как следует её облик. А вот тем, кто мечтает ощутить вкус мороженого, награда, пожалуй, стоит риска..."

#. ja: ◎※★△…
#. de: ◎※★△ ...
#. fr: ◎※★△...
#. column 0: Summon your lumini minion. This floating ball of fleshy horror was modeled after an Ea who failed to regain full corporeality.
#. column 1: A Stigma-4 product, manufactured as a warning for those Ea who might rush into attaining a fleshly vessel before properly recalling the shape of their corporeal form. For those yearning to experience the taste of ice cream, however, the reward may be worth the risks...
