#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・スカルミリョーネ」を呼び出す。<br>大妖異スカルミリョーネを模した魔法人形。我が糧にしてくれる！
#. de: Du rufst deine Scarmiglione-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Die Puppenversion des Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>ten Scarmiglione.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Scarmiglione miniature, con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>née à l'image du puissant démon à la soif d'éther inextinguible.
#. column 1: The archfiend of earth commanded this likeness of himself be crafted that it might keep his underlings in a state of terrified subjugation. Needless to say, when this stunted and strangely adorable homunculus was unveiled, its creator was promptly devoured.
#. column 2: Hissssss...<br>Your aether is mine!<br>   - Scarmiglione
#. column 3: Tentacle Lash
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:460:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Scarmiglione minion. Is that hooded gaze regarding you with affection or insatiable hunger? Hard to tell."
msgstr "Призвать заводного Скармильоне. Он смотрит на тебя с любовью или голодом? Не разберёшь."

#. ja: ゴルベーザ四天王の一角、土のスカルミリョーネが、手下の下級妖異に命じて造らせた人形。自身の恐ろしさを知らしめんとの動機があったが、どことなくちんちくりんな出来に仕上がっている。なお、製作者は、彼の強さの糧となった
#. de: Der Elementarfürst der Erde ließ diese Puppe von einem niederen Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>ten anfertigen, um seine Schrecklichkeit zu demonstrieren. Obwohl von enttäuschend mickrigem Aussehen besitzt diese Puppe über ungeheure Kräfte, die sich aus der Stärke seines Erzeugers speisen.
#. fr: C'est Scarmiglione, le maître de la terre en personne, qui a commandé à un de ses sous-fifres la fabrication de cette mascotte. Il espérait ainsi afficher sa supériorité à tous. Force est de constater que le général de Golbez n'a pas dû apprécier le côté “miniature” du jouet, puisqu'il a ensuite dévoré son créateur.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Scarmiglione minion. Is that hooded gaze regarding you with affection or insatiable hunger? Hard to tell.
#. column 2: Hissssss...<br>Your aether is mine!<br>   - Scarmiglione
#. column 3: Tentacle Lash
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:460:0:1"
msgid "The archfiend of earth commanded this likeness of himself be crafted that it might keep his underlings in a state of terrified subjugation. Needless to say, when this stunted and strangely adorable homunculus was unveiled, its creator was promptly devoured."
msgstr "Повелитель земли приказал создать своё подобие, чтобы держать подчинённых в страхе и покорности. Когда показали этого низкорослого и странно очаровательного гомункула, его создателя, разумеется, тут же съели."

#. ja: フシュルル…
#. de: Nun lernt ihr unser wahres Wesen kennen!<br><i>Scarmiglione </i>
#. fr: Sssrrr...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Scarmiglione minion. Is that hooded gaze regarding you with affection or insatiable hunger? Hard to tell.
#. column 1: The archfiend of earth commanded this likeness of himself be crafted that it might keep his underlings in a state of terrified subjugation. Needless to say, when this stunted and strangely adorable homunculus was unveiled, its creator was promptly devoured.
#. column 3: Tentacle Lash
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:460:0:2"
msgid "Hissssss...<br>Your aether is mine!<br>   - Scarmiglione"
msgstr "Шшшшш...<br>Твой эфир — мой!<br>   — Скармильоне"

#. ja: ニョロニョロ
#. de: Tentakelhieb
#. fr: Ramper
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Scarmiglione minion. Is that hooded gaze regarding you with affection or insatiable hunger? Hard to tell.
#. column 1: The archfiend of earth commanded this likeness of himself be crafted that it might keep his underlings in a state of terrified subjugation. Needless to say, when this stunted and strangely adorable homunculus was unveiled, its creator was promptly devoured.
#. column 2: Hissssss...<br>Your aether is mine!<br>   - Scarmiglione
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:460:0:3"
msgid "Tentacle Lash"
msgstr "Удар щупальцем"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のアルカナストーンに、5%のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Arkana-Stein 5 % Schaden zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 5% de sa solidité à la pierre arcanique ennemie la plus proche.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Scarmiglione minion. Is that hooded gaze regarding you with affection or insatiable hunger? Hard to tell.
#. column 1: The archfiend of earth commanded this likeness of himself be crafted that it might keep his underlings in a state of terrified subjugation. Needless to say, when this stunted and strangely adorable homunculus was unveiled, its creator was promptly devoured.
