msgid "Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone."
msgstr "Наносит 5% урона ближайшему вражескому арканскому камню."

#. ja: ミニオン「辰チョコチョコボ」を呼び出す。<br>降神祭を祝うチョコボの子。辰の被り物がお気に入り
#. de: Du rufst dein Dragobo-Küken als Begleiter herbei. Ein putziges Andenken an das Fest zur Himmelswende.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte poussin dragon, un poussin chocobo affublé d'un adorable costume de dragon à l'occasion de la fête de la transition.
#. column 1: As part of her efforts to introduce the noble ryu, one of the totem animals to usher in a new year in the Far East, the ryu bugyo arranged for this chocobo hatchling to serve as a mascot. For its part, the creature seems to enjoy its role, and wears its outfit with adorable zeal.
#. column 2: Yes, I can feel the presence of<br>mighty dragons all around us!<br>   - Ohl Deeh
#. column 3: The Dragon's Blessing
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:461:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Ryunosuke minion. Awww, he thinks he's dragons!"
msgstr "Призвать прислужника Рюносукэ. Ути какой милый — думает, что он дракон!"

#. ja: 新米辰奉行が、新たな季節を司る「辰」を紹介すべく手配した「ますこっと」。ドラゴン族に似た被り物を纏っているが、これは東方の伝承上の存在、辰を模したもの。チョコボ自身も気に入っている様子で、愛嬌を振りまいている
#. de: Im Bestreben, den edlen Drachen vorzustellen, der diesmal im Fernen Osten das neue Jahr einläutet, hat die Delegation aus Hingashi dieses Chocobo-Küken als Maskottchen ausgewählt. Die Kreatur scheint ihre Rolle zu genießen und trägt ihr Kostüm mit bewundernswertem Eifer.
#. fr: La délégation orientale a choisi ce poussin comme mascotte, afin de célébrer une nouvelle année placée sous le signe du dragon. À noter que l'on parle ici du dragon oriental, un animal légendaire à la silhouette plus allongée que ses cousins du Coerthas. Le chocobo adore en tout cas son costume, et n'hésite pas à parader avec en pépiant gaiement.
#. column 0: Summon your Ryunosuke minion. Awww, he thinks he's dragons!
#. column 2: Yes, I can feel the presence of<br>mighty dragons all around us!<br>   - Ohl Deeh
#. column 3: The Dragon's Blessing
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:461:0:1"
msgid "As part of her efforts to introduce the noble ryu, one of the totem animals to usher in a new year in the Far East, the ryu bugyo arranged for this chocobo hatchling to serve as a mascot. For its part, the creature seems to enjoy its role, and wears its outfit with adorable zeal."
msgstr "Чтобы познакомить людей с благородным рю, одним из животных-символов наступающего года на Дальнем Востоке, распорядительница рю велела сделать этого птенца чокобо талисманом. Птенец, похоже, доволен своей ролью и с большим усердием носит костюм."

#. ja: クエックエッ！
#. de: Der erste aller Drachen. Der Herrscher über die Herren des Himmels.<br><i>Urianger</i>
#. fr: Kwé<nbsp>! Kwé<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon your Ryunosuke minion. Awww, he thinks he's dragons!
#. column 1: As part of her efforts to introduce the noble ryu, one of the totem animals to usher in a new year in the Far East, the ryu bugyo arranged for this chocobo hatchling to serve as a mascot. For its part, the creature seems to enjoy its role, and wears its outfit with adorable zeal.
#. column 3: The Dragon's Blessing
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:461:0:2"
msgid "Yes, I can feel the presence of<br>mighty dragons all around us!<br>   - Ohl Deeh"
msgstr "Да, я чувствую вокруг нас<br>присутствие могучих драконов!<br>   — Ол Дии"

#. ja: 辰の祝福
#. de: Segen des Drachen
#. fr: Grâce du dragon
#. column 0: Summon your Ryunosuke minion. Awww, he thinks he's dragons!
#. column 1: As part of her efforts to introduce the noble ryu, one of the totem animals to usher in a new year in the Far East, the ryu bugyo arranged for this chocobo hatchling to serve as a mascot. For its part, the creature seems to enjoy its role, and wears its outfit with adorable zeal.
#. column 2: Yes, I can feel the presence of<br>mighty dragons all around us!<br>   - Ohl Deeh
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:461:0:3"
msgid "The Dragon's Blessing"
msgstr "Благословение дракона"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方にかかっている、弱体効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle negativen Effekte von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe toutes les altérations d'état des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Ryunosuke minion. Awww, he thinks he's dragons!
#. column 1: As part of her efforts to introduce the noble ryu, one of the totem animals to usher in a new year in the Far East, the ryu bugyo arranged for this chocobo hatchling to serve as a mascot. For its part, the creature seems to enjoy its role, and wears its outfit with adorable zeal.
#. column 2: Yes, I can feel the presence of<br>mighty dragons all around us!<br>   - Ohl Deeh
#. column 3: The Dragon's Blessing
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:461:0:4"
msgid "Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все отрицательные эффекты со всех союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「モモンガ」を呼び出す。<br>飛膜を広げ滑空する小動物。わりと飛距離が長い
#. de: Du rufst dein Flughörnchen als Begleiter herbei. Ein kleiner Säuger, der durch die Lüfte gleiten kann.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte momonga, un écureuil capable de planer mine de rien assez loin grâce à la membrane reliant ses quatre membres.
#. column 1: A relative of the more common ground squirrel, the pterosquirrel can comfortably glide up to forty yalms through the air thanks to the membranes of skin attached between foreleg and hind limb. Useful for escaping predators or landing on unsuspecting faces.
#. column 2: Seven hells, did those accursed<br>squirrels leave any part of me<br>untouched?<br>   - Arold
#. column 3: Patagium Glide
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:462:0:0"
msgid "Summon your pterosquirrel minion. Despite its chubby appearance, this bright-eyed companion can glide a surprising distance."
msgstr "Призовите белку-летягу. Несмотря на пухленький вид, этот зоркий зверёк умеет планировать на удивительно большие расстояния."

#. ja: リスの仲間の小型哺乳類。モモンガの名はひんがしの国に由来し、当地の商人が交易とともにその名を広めたとされる。四肢の間に張られた飛膜で風やエーテル流に乗り、40ヤルムをも滑空する個体も珍しくない
#. de: Anders als sein Verwandter, das Eichhörnchen, kann dieses Säugetier yalmenweit in der Luft gleiten, indem es seine Flugmembrane ausbreitet und geschickt Wind- und Ätherströme ausnutzt.
#. fr: Ce petit mammifère est connu en Éorzéa sous le nom de polatouche. Toutefois, c'est momonga, le nom que lui ont donné les Orientaux, qui s'est imposé dans nos contrées. Son plus grand atout est d'être capable de voleter au gré du vent et des courants éthérés grâce à l'ample membrane qui relie ses quatre membres. Certains spécimens peuvent ainsi planer sur près de quarante yalms.
#. column 0: Summon your pterosquirrel minion. Despite its chubby appearance, this bright-eyed companion can glide a surprising distance.
#. column 2: Seven hells, did those accursed<br>squirrels leave any part of me<br>untouched?<br>   - Arold
#. column 3: Patagium Glide
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:462:0:1"
msgid "A relative of the more common ground squirrel, the pterosquirrel can comfortably glide up to forty yalms through the air thanks to the membranes of skin attached between foreleg and hind limb. Useful for escaping predators or landing on unsuspecting faces."
msgstr "Родственница обычной белки, белка-летяга может легко пролететь по воздуху до сорока ярдов благодаря перепонкам между передними и задними лапами. Она умеет удирать от хищников и приземляться прямо на ничего не подозревающие лица."

#. ja: ンガッ！
#. de: Fliege in die Welt hinaus wie ein Flughörnchen!<br><i>Hinganisches Sprichwort</i>
#. fr: Touk touk<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your pterosquirrel minion. Despite its chubby appearance, this bright-eyed companion can glide a surprising distance.
#. column 1: A relative of the more common ground squirrel, the pterosquirrel can comfortably glide up to forty yalms through the air thanks to the membranes of skin attached between foreleg and hind limb. Useful for escaping predators or landing on unsuspecting faces.
#. column 3: Patagium Glide
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:462:0:2"
msgid "Seven hells, did those accursed<br>squirrels leave any part of me<br>untouched?<br>   - Arold"
msgstr "Семь преисподних, неужели эти<br>проклятые белки облепили меня<br>весь целиком?<br>   — Аролд"

#. ja: 飛膜滑空
#. de: Flughautflug
#. fr: Patagium
#. column 0: Summon your pterosquirrel minion. Despite its chubby appearance, this bright-eyed companion can glide a surprising distance.
#. column 1: A relative of the more common ground squirrel, the pterosquirrel can comfortably glide up to forty yalms through the air thanks to the membranes of skin attached between foreleg and hind limb. Useful for escaping predators or landing on unsuspecting faces.
#. column 2: Seven hells, did those accursed<br>squirrels leave any part of me<br>untouched?<br>   - Arold
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:462:0:3"
msgid "Patagium Glide"
msgstr "Планирование на перепонках"

