#. column 3: Cleaning Time
#. column 4: Renders the action party immune to all attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
