#. ja: ミニオン「水道トカゲ」を呼び出す。<br>シラディハ水道に住み着いた小型爬虫類。水道の守護者ともされる
#. de: Du rufst deine Unterstadt-Echse als Begleiter herbei. Eine Echse, die in den sil'dhischen Kanälen haust und sie frei von Ungeziefern hält.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte laveur des canalisations, un reptile si ca<shy>rac<shy>té<shy>ris<shy>ti<shy>que des canalisations sildiennes qu'on le considère comme leur gardien.
#. column 1: Found dwelling deep in the Sil'dihn waterways, these skinks keep the stones clear of both mold and vilekin alike with quick lashes of their long, blue tongues─a service considered more valuable than that provided by any Sil'dihn royal guard's patrol.
#. column 2: Why, I'd rather hire a sewer<br>rat to mind my larder!<br>   - Milala
#. column 3: Flickering Lick
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:464:0:0"
msgid "Summon your sewer skink minion. When it comes to keeping aqueducts free of creepy-crawlies, this lightning-tongued lizard is the hero of the day."
msgstr "Призовите канализационного сцинка. Когда нужно очистить водоводы от всякой мерзости, этот быстроногий ящер с молниеносным языком — настоящий герой."

#. ja: シラディハ水道の深部に棲まう小型のトカゲ。青い舌を巧みに延ばし、害虫やカビを余さず食べ尽くすため水道の保守管理に役立っていた。その貢献によって、シラディハ王宮警護隊より水道の守護者として叙勲されたほどである
#. de: Mit ihrer blauen langen Zunge fängt diese kleine Echse nicht nur Insekten, sondern sorgt auch dafür, dass sich kein Schimmel an den Wänden der Unterstadt ansetzt. Für diese reinigenden Verdienste wurde sie sogar einmal mit dem sil'dhischen Stadtwächter-Orden ausgezeichnet.
#. fr: Ces reptiles habitent les plus profondes canalisations sildiennes. Leur langue protractile leur permet de chasser les insectes et les moisissures dont ils se nourrissent<nbsp>; un trait qui leur a valu de rejoindre la garde palatine à titre honoraire.
#. column 0: Summon your sewer skink minion. When it comes to keeping aqueducts free of creepy-crawlies, this lightning-tongued lizard is the hero of the day.
#. column 2: Why, I'd rather hire a sewer<br>rat to mind my larder!<br>   - Milala
#. column 3: Flickering Lick
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:464:0:1"
msgid "Found dwelling deep in the Sil'dihn waterways, these skinks keep the stones clear of both mold and vilekin alike with quick lashes of their long, blue tongues─a service considered more valuable than that provided by any Sil'dihn royal guard's patrol."
msgstr "Эти сцинки живут в глубине водоводов Силь'дина. Быстрыми взмахами длинного синего языка они очищают камни от плесени и вредителей. Их службу ценили выше, чем обходы королевской стражи Силь'дина."

#. ja: シーッ…
#. de: Ich würde eher eine Kanalratte anheuern, um meine Speisekammer zu bewachen!<br><i> Milala</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>. Clac<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your sewer skink minion. When it comes to keeping aqueducts free of creepy-crawlies, this lightning-tongued lizard is the hero of the day.
#. column 1: Found dwelling deep in the Sil'dihn waterways, these skinks keep the stones clear of both mold and vilekin alike with quick lashes of their long, blue tongues─a service considered more valuable than that provided by any Sil'dihn royal guard's patrol.
#. column 3: Flickering Lick
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:464:0:2"
msgid "Why, I'd rather hire a sewer<br>rat to mind my larder!<br>   - Milala"
msgstr "Да я бы скорее наняла канализационную<br>крысу стеречь свою кладовую!<br>   — Милала"

#. ja: ペロペロリ
#. de: Schlabberschleck
#. fr: Lasso lingual
