#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・フィロス」を呼び出す。<br>ある偉人を模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deine Philos-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie wird dir ein treuer Freund sein.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte ami miniature, une poupée magique à l'effigie d'un illustre prédécesseur.
#. column 1: There once was a man who shouldered a heavy responsibility in the capital of the star. In spite of this, he bore a name that made light of himself, and delighted in the simple things with his cherished friends. This mammet was made in his honor.
#. column 2: Believe, and walk in faith.<br>Let the light of your soul<br>shine for all to see.<br>   - Loyal Friend
#. column 3: Devotion
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:465:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up philos minion. By the by...you see it too, yes?"
msgstr "Призовите заводного философа. Кстати... вы ведь тоже это видите?"

#. ja: かつて星の首都にあって、計り知れぬ重責を担う者がいた。しかし、その男は冗談のような名を名乗り、友との過ごす日々に愉快な事象を見出しては、微笑み楽しんだという。これは、そのような偉人を模した魔法人形である
#. de: Es war einmal ein Mann, der eine große Verantwortung für den Stern schulterte. Trotzdem erfreute er sich mit seinen lieben Freunden an den einfachen Dingen. Diese Puppe wurde ihm zu Ehren angefertigt.
#. fr: Jadis, un homme portait un fardeau bien lourd pour ses pauvres épaules au sein d'une grande et prestigieuse cité. Cependant, malgré ses immenses res<shy>pon<shy>sa<shy>bi<shy>li<shy>tés, il gardait toujours le sourire et appréciait les choses simples de la vie en compagnie de ses amis. Cette poupée magique a été créée pour perpétuer son souvenir.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up philos minion. By the by...you see it too, yes?
#. column 2: Believe, and walk in faith.<br>Let the light of your soul<br>shine for all to see.<br>   - Loyal Friend
#. column 3: Devotion
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:465:0:1"
msgid "There once was a man who shouldered a heavy responsibility in the capital of the star. In spite of this, he bore a name that made light of himself, and delighted in the simple things with his cherished friends. This mammet was made in his honor."
msgstr "Жил-был человек, на плечи которого легла тяжёлая ноша в столице звезды. И всё же он носил имя, которое звучало шутливо, и радовался простым вещам в компании дорогих друзей. Эту куклу создали в его честь."

#. ja: マルデ無意味ダ！
#. de: Ja. Glaube an dich. Und deine Seele wird wieder erstrahlen.<br><i>Vertraut wirkender Mann</i>
#. fr: C'était de la folie<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up philos minion. By the by...you see it too, yes?
#. column 1: There once was a man who shouldered a heavy responsibility in the capital of the star. In spite of this, he bore a name that made light of himself, and delighted in the simple things with his cherished friends. This mammet was made in his honor.
#. column 3: Devotion
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:465:0:2"
msgid "Believe, and walk in faith.<br>Let the light of your soul<br>shine for all to see.<br>   - Loyal Friend"
msgstr "Верь и иди вперёд с верой.<br>Пусть свет твоей души<br>сияет для всех.<br>   — Верный друг"

#. ja: 献身
#. de: Hingabe
#. fr: Dévouement
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up philos minion. By the by...you see it too, yes?
#. column 1: There once was a man who shouldered a heavy responsibility in the capital of the star. In spite of this, he bore a name that made light of himself, and delighted in the simple things with his cherished friends. This mammet was made in his honor.
#. column 2: Believe, and walk in faith.<br>Let the light of your soul<br>shine for all to see.<br>   - Loyal Friend
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:465:0:3"
msgid "Devotion"
msgstr "Преданность"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up philos minion. By the by...you see it too, yes?
#. column 1: There once was a man who shouldered a heavy responsibility in the capital of the star. In spite of this, he bore a name that made light of himself, and delighted in the simple things with his cherished friends. This mammet was made in his honor.
#. column 2: Believe, and walk in faith.<br>Let the light of your soul<br>shine for all to see.<br>   - Loyal Friend
#. column 3: Devotion
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:465:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Даёт 10 очков умений всем союзникам в радиусе действия, кроме тех, чьи умения дают такой же эффект."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・エリクトニオス」を呼び出す。<br>エリクトニオスを模した魔法人形。きっとみんなを救いだせる……！
#. de: Du rufst deine Erichthonios-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie wird sie alle retten wollen ...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Érichthonios miniature. Avec lui, tout espoir n'est pas perdu<nbsp>!
#. column 1: This mammet depicting Erichthonios, a warder of Pandæmonium, was crafted in secret by a colleague impressed by his unyielding sense of duty. When one's workplace is overrun by the most violent manifestations of creation magicks, clutching tight to such a doll must keep the spark of hope alive.
#. column 2: I-I'll save them!<br>I...must...<br>   - Erichthonios
#. column 3: Point Out
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:466:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Erichthonios minion. He'll get them all out. He must."
msgstr "Призовите заводного Эрихтония. Он вытащит их всех. Он должен."

#. ja: パンデモニウムの獄卒エリクトニオスを模した魔法人形。責任感の強い彼を好ましく思っていた同僚が、密かに創っていたものらしい。凶暴な創造生物で囲まれた職場において、その姿を眺めることが安らぎとなったのだろう
#. de: Ein Kerkermeister des Pandæmoniums und Kollege von Erichthonios fertigte aus Hochachtung vor dessen Verantwortungsbewusstsein diese Puppe an. Umgeben von schrecklichen Kreaturen soll er sie hin und wieder an sich drücken, um sich zu beruhigen.
#. fr: Cette miniature du gardien du Pandæmonium aurait été con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>née en secret par un collègue qui apprécie son sens de la res<shy>pon<shy>sa<shy>bi<shy>li<shy>té. Rien de tel pour oublier ses soucis lorsqu'on travaille entouré de créatures plus violentes les unes que les autres.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Erichthonios minion. He'll get them all out. He must.
#. column 2: I-I'll save them!<br>I...must...<br>   - Erichthonios
#. column 3: Point Out
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:466:0:1"
msgid "This mammet depicting Erichthonios, a warder of Pandæmonium, was crafted in secret by a colleague impressed by his unyielding sense of duty. When one's workplace is overrun by the most violent manifestations of creation magicks, clutching tight to such a doll must keep the spark of hope alive."
msgstr "Эта кукла изображает Эрихтония, тюремщика Пандемониума. Один из коллег тайно создал её, восхищаясь его непреклонным чувством долга. Наверное, в месте, кишащем свирепыми созданиями, такая кукла помогала не терять надежду."

#. ja:  俺ガ…！
#. de: Ich muss sie schützen! Ich <i>werde</i> alle schützen!!<br><i>Erichthonios</i>
#. fr: À moi de faire mes preuves<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Erichthonios minion. He'll get them all out. He must.
#. column 1: This mammet depicting Erichthonios, a warder of Pandæmonium, was crafted in secret by a colleague impressed by his unyielding sense of duty. When one's workplace is overrun by the most violent manifestations of creation magicks, clutching tight to such a doll must keep the spark of hope alive.
#. column 3: Point Out
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:466:0:2"
msgid "I-I'll save them!<br>I...must...<br>   - Erichthonios"
msgstr "Я... я спасу их!<br>Я... должен...<br>   — Эрихтоний"

#. ja: 指し示す
#. de: Hinweisen
#. fr: Dénoncer
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Erichthonios minion. He'll get them all out. He must.
#. column 1: This mammet depicting Erichthonios, a warder of Pandæmonium, was crafted in secret by a colleague impressed by his unyielding sense of duty. When one's workplace is overrun by the most violent manifestations of creation magicks, clutching tight to such a doll must keep the spark of hope alive.
#. column 2: I-I'll save them!<br>I...must...<br>   - Erichthonios
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:466:0:3"
msgid "Point Out"
msgstr "Указать"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵にかかっている、強化効果をすべて打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle positiven Effekte von den gegnerischen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe tous les effets bénéfiques des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Erichthonios minion. He'll get them all out. He must.
#. column 1: This mammet depicting Erichthonios, a warder of Pandæmonium, was crafted in secret by a colleague impressed by his unyielding sense of duty. When one's workplace is overrun by the most violent manifestations of creation magicks, clutching tight to such a doll must keep the spark of hope alive.
#. column 2: I-I'll save them!<br>I...must...<br>   - Erichthonios
#. column 3: Point Out
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:466:0:4"
msgid "Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все положительные эффекты со всех противников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「コーギー」を呼び出す。<br>モフモフで短足の小型犬。いっぱい走るのが大好き
#. de: Du rufst deinen Corgi als Begleiter herbei. Nicht nur Lügen haben kurze Beine.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte corgi, un petit chien touffu qui adore gambader malgré ses courtes pattes.
#. column 1: A type of herding dog known for its short legs, the corgi is the result of breeding squat specimens that could avoid the hooves of livestock. In the old tongue of the northern seas, the name means “dwarf dog,” which, aside from the literal meaning, is a reference to a folktale that claims the creatures were once ridden by Lalafells.
#. column 2: As if I would trail along<br>behind you...like some<br>sniveling lapdog...<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva
#. column 3: Sit!
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:467:0:0"
msgid "Summon your corgi minion. Fluffy, full of beans, and fit for a queen."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника-корги. Пушистый, неугомонный — королеве под стать."

#. ja: 短い足が特徴的な犬。牧羊犬としての活躍のため、家畜に蹴られにくい体高の低い個体を繁殖した結果だという。名は北洋の古語で「小人の犬」を意味し、ララフェル族を背に乗せて走ったというフォークロアにちなむものらしい
#. de: Ein von Tierhütern eingesetzter Hund mit kurzen Beinen. So fällt es ihm leichter, den Hufen von Vieh auszuweichen. In der alten Sprache der nördlichen Meere bedeutet der Name „Zwergenhund“, was neben der wörtlichen Bedeutung auf ein Volksmärchen anspielt, das behauptet, die Kreaturen seien einst von Lalafells geritten worden.
#. fr: L'avantage pratique du corgi en tant que chien de garde du bétail est d'être de taille suf<shy>fi<shy>sam<shy>ment réduite pour se maintenir sans difficulté en dessous des sabots d'animaux parfois en colère. Son nom signifie “chien nain” dans une langue nordique ancienne, et d'aucuns prétendent qu'il était autrefois la monture préférée des Lalafells.
#. column 0: Summon your corgi minion. Fluffy, full of beans, and fit for a queen.
#. column 2: As if I would trail along<br>behind you...like some<br>sniveling lapdog...<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva
#. column 3: Sit!
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:467:0:1"
msgid "A type of herding dog known for its short legs, the corgi is the result of breeding squat specimens that could avoid the hooves of livestock. In the old tongue of the northern seas, the name means “dwarf dog,” which, aside from the literal meaning, is a reference to a folktale that claims the creatures were once ridden by Lalafells."
msgstr "Корги — пастушья собака с короткими лапами. Её вывели такой приземистой, чтобы она могла уворачиваться от копыт скота. На древнем языке северных морей её название означает «карликовая собака» и связано не только с её внешностью, но и с преданием о том, что когда-то на корги ездили верхом ларафели."

#. ja: ワフン♪
#. de: Wie brav der ist!<br><i>Nashu Mhakaracca</i>
#. fr: Ouaouf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your corgi minion. Fluffy, full of beans, and fit for a queen.
#. column 1: A type of herding dog known for its short legs, the corgi is the result of breeding squat specimens that could avoid the hooves of livestock. In the old tongue of the northern seas, the name means “dwarf dog,” which, aside from the literal meaning, is a reference to a folktale that claims the creatures were once ridden by Lalafells.
#. column 3: Sit!
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:467:0:2"
msgid "As if I would trail along<br>behind you...like some<br>sniveling lapdog...<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva"
msgstr "Будто я за тобой потащусь...<br>как какая-то жалкая болонка...<br>   — Неро тол Скаева"

#. ja: ふせ！
#. de: Sitz!
#. fr: Assis<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your corgi minion. Fluffy, full of beans, and fit for a queen.
#. column 1: A type of herding dog known for its short legs, the corgi is the result of breeding squat specimens that could avoid the hooves of livestock. In the old tongue of the northern seas, the name means “dwarf dog,” which, aside from the literal meaning, is a reference to a folktale that claims the creatures were once ridden by Lalafells.
#. column 2: As if I would trail along<br>behind you...like some<br>sniveling lapdog...<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:467:0:3"
msgid "Sit!"
msgstr "Лежать!"

