#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・カイナッツォ」を呼び出す。<br>大妖異カイナッツォを模した魔法人形。ガッカリさせてくれるなよ！？
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Cagnazzo als Begleiter herbei. Er herrscht über Pfützen und feuchte Aussprache.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Cagnazzo miniature. Vous n'avez pas intérêt à la décevoir<nbsp>!
#. column 1: In his single-minded pursuit of mighty foes, Cagnazzo tasked one of his minions with creating a being in his likeness. The result was this automaton, which, needless to say, disappointed the archfiend of water. Its maker was never seen again.
#. column 2: You'd best not disappoint!<br>   - Cagnazzo
#. column 3: Death Spin
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:471:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Cagnazzo minion. The puddles and ponds are his to command."
msgstr "Призвать заводного Каннаццо. Ему подвластны лужи и пруды."

#. ja: ゴルベーザ四天王の一角、水のカイナッツォが手下に命じて造らせた人形。強き対戦相手を求めて、自らの似姿を作らせたものの、こじんまりとしたサイズで仕上がってしまったらしい。その後、製作者はヴォイドの闇に消えたという
#. de: Während der blindwütigen Verfolgung mächtiger Feinde beauftragte Cagnazzo einen seiner Untergebenen damit, ein Wesen nach seinem Antlitz zu erschaffen. Das Ergebnis war diese Puppe, die den Fürsten des Wassers natürlich enttäuschte. Ihr Schöpfer wurde nie wieder gesehen.
#. fr: Cagnazzo, maître de l'eau et général de Golbez, a ordonné à ses sous-fifres de fabriquer cette poupée magique à son effigie. Toutefois, il ne pensait pas que le résultat serait aussi rabougri, ce qui est peut-être la raison pour laquelle ses créateurs ont disparu du jour au lendemain...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Cagnazzo minion. The puddles and ponds are his to command.
#. column 2: You'd best not disappoint!<br>   - Cagnazzo
#. column 3: Death Spin
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:471:0:1"
msgid "In his single-minded pursuit of mighty foes, Cagnazzo tasked one of his minions with creating a being in his likeness. The result was this automaton, which, needless to say, disappointed the archfiend of water. Its maker was never seen again."
msgstr "Стремясь найти достойных противников, Каннаццо поручил одному из прислужников создать куклу по своему подобию. Результат, само собой, разочаровал архидемона воды. Больше мастера никто не видел."

#. ja: グヘヘヘヘ！
#. de: Endlich darf ich euch in meinen Fluten ertränken!<br><i>Cagnazzo</i>
#. fr: Mouahaha<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Cagnazzo minion. The puddles and ponds are his to command.
#. column 1: In his single-minded pursuit of mighty foes, Cagnazzo tasked one of his minions with creating a being in his likeness. The result was this automaton, which, needless to say, disappointed the archfiend of water. Its maker was never seen again.
#. column 3: Death Spin
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:471:0:2"
msgid "You'd best not disappoint!<br>   - Cagnazzo"
msgstr "Смотри не разочаруй!<br>   — Каннаццо"

#. ja: ぐるぐるぐる
#. de: Todesdreher
#. fr: Maître de la glisse
