#. ja: ミニオン「ファインディングウェイ」を呼び出す。<br>弟分のレポリット。新しいことをたくさん見つけたい
#. de: Du rufst Findingway als Begleiter herbei. Dieser kleine Loporrit ist stets auf der Suche nach neuen Entdeckungen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Findingway. Ce petit Loporrite curieux fourre son nez partout<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Diminutive even among his brethren, this Loporrit was the last to awaken from his eons-long slumber. Although his mission was to survey the land, it has become his foremost passion to make new discoveries, and he shares the accounts of his journeys with everyone on the moon.
#. column 2: There's a whole world<br>out there to explore!<br>   - Shaggles
#. column 3: Discovery
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:472:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Findingway minion. Can find his own way without you, but chooses to tag along."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника Файндингвея. Он и сам найдёт дорогу, но всё равно решил идти с тобой."

#. ja: ほかの仲間よりも後から目覚めた、小柄な弟分レポリット。地上を探索してヒトの役に立つ情報を見つけることを使命としていたが、今はいろんな新しいコトを見つけるのが夢。旅で遭遇した素敵な出来事の情報は、月のみんなに共有される
#. de: Ein Loporrit von besonders kleiner Statur, der später als seine Artgenossen aus seinem Tiefschlaf erwachte. Seine ursprüngliche Aufgabe war es, Ætheris zu erkunden und hilfreiche Informationen zu sammeln, doch nun träumt er durchgehend davon, allerlei Neues zu entdecken. Alles, was er auf seinen Reisen erlebt, teilt er hinterher immer mit den restlichen Loporrit.
#. fr: Un Loporrite de petit gabarit, qui s'est réveillé plus tard que ses ainés. À l'origine, sa tâche était d'aider les humains à retrouver des objets perdus, mais son rêve est désormais de constamment découvrir des choses nouvelles. Il partage ré<shy>gu<shy>liè<shy>re<shy>ment avec ses semblables le fruit de ses voyages.
#. column 0: Summon your Findingway minion. Can find his own way without you, but chooses to tag along.
#. column 2: There's a whole world<br>out there to explore!<br>   - Shaggles
#. column 3: Discovery
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:472:0:1"
msgid "Diminutive even among his brethren, this Loporrit was the last to awaken from his eons-long slumber. Although his mission was to survey the land, it has become his foremost passion to make new discoveries, and he shares the accounts of his journeys with everyone on the moon."
msgstr "Этот лопоррит — крошка даже среди своих сородичей. Он последним пробудился от многовекового сна. Его задачей было исследовать землю, но теперь больше всего на свете он хочет находить что-нибудь новое. О своих приключениях он рассказывает всем на Луне."

#. ja: ファインディングマイウェイ！
#. de: Oh, was ist denn das da drüben?!<br><i>Findingway</i>
#. fr: Où ça<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your Findingway minion. Can find his own way without you, but chooses to tag along.
#. column 1: Diminutive even among his brethren, this Loporrit was the last to awaken from his eons-long slumber. Although his mission was to survey the land, it has become his foremost passion to make new discoveries, and he shares the accounts of his journeys with everyone on the moon.
#. column 3: Discovery
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:472:0:2"
msgid "There's a whole world<br>out there to explore!<br>   - Shaggles"
msgstr "Целый мир<br>ждёт, чтобы его исследовали!<br>   — Лохматик"

#. ja: はっけん
#. de: Entdeckung
#. fr: Trouvé<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Findingway minion. Can find his own way without you, but chooses to tag along.
#. column 1: Diminutive even among his brethren, this Loporrit was the last to awaken from his eons-long slumber. Although his mission was to survey the land, it has become his foremost passion to make new discoveries, and he shares the accounts of his journeys with everyone on the moon.
#. column 2: There's a whole world<br>out there to explore!<br>   - Shaggles
#. column 4: Instantly restores damaged ally Shield.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:472:0:3"
msgid "Discovery"
msgstr "Находка"

#. ja: シールドが破壊されていた場合、復活させる。
#. de: Stellt einen zerstörten Schild wieder her.
#. fr: Rétablit votre bouclier s'il a été détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your Findingway minion. Can find his own way without you, but chooses to tag along.
#. column 1: Diminutive even among his brethren, this Loporrit was the last to awaken from his eons-long slumber. Although his mission was to survey the land, it has become his foremost passion to make new discoveries, and he shares the accounts of his journeys with everyone on the moon.
#. column 2: There's a whole world<br>out there to explore!<br>   - Shaggles
#. column 3: Discovery
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:472:0:4"
msgid "Instantly restores damaged ally Shield. "
msgstr "Мгновенно восстанавливает повреждённый щит союзника."

#. ja: ミニオン「プライベート・パキポディウム」を呼び出す。<br>オルト・エウレカの地中深くに埋没していた小型のパキポディウム
#. de: Du rufst dein Privat-Pachypodium als Begleiter herbei. Ein kleines Exemplar einer bestimmten Art von Mandragora, welches sich im Boden von Eureka Orthos vergraben hatte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte soldate pachypodium, une mine souterraine autrefois enfouie dans les profondeurs d'Eurêka Orthos.
#. column 1: Underling to Gancanagh, this pachypodium mine had hidden itself for an ambush, but it burrowed too deep into the ground and missed its chance to detonate. Subsequently released from military service, it appears to be enjoying its newfound freedom.
#. column 2: Take care you are not<br>caught in blassst.<br>   - Eshana
#. column 3: ◆◎◎※☆!
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:473:0:0"
msgid "Summon your private pachypodium minion. Its detonating days are thankfully over."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника-солдата пахиподиума. К счастью, его взрывные деньки позади."

#. ja: ガンカナグー配下のマイン・パキポディウム。地雷として潜伏していたが、新米ゆえに深く地中に潜りすぎて爆発の好機を逸してしまった。かくして唯一の生き残りとなったのだが、軍務から解放され、むしろ自由を謳歌しているようだ
#. de: Eins von Gancanaghs Minen-Pachypodien. Es hatte sich im Eifer des Gefechts zu tief vergraben und war somit nie in der Lage, als Mine zu explodieren. Als einziges überlebendes Exemplar seiner Art genießt es nun seine neu gewonnene Freiheit.
#. fr: Obéissant aux directives de Gancanagh, cette mine pachypodium a voulu faire du zèle en s'enfonçant très pro<shy>fon<shy>dé<shy>ment dans le sol lors d'une embuscade, ce qui l'a mal<shy>en<shy>con<shy>treu<shy>se<shy>ment empêchée d'exploser. Réformée à la suite de cet incident, elle semble grandement apprécier l'air frais de la surface.
#. column 0: Summon your private pachypodium minion. Its detonating days are thankfully over.
#. column 2: Take care you are not<br>caught in blassst.<br>   - Eshana
#. column 3: ◆◎◎※☆!
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:473:0:1"
msgid "Underling to Gancanagh, this pachypodium mine had hidden itself for an ambush, but it burrowed too deep into the ground and missed its chance to detonate. Subsequently released from military service, it appears to be enjoying its newfound freedom."
msgstr "Этот пахиподиум-мина служил Ганканагу. Он затаился в засаде, но зарылся слишком глубоко и упустил шанс взорваться. Позже его уволили со службы, и теперь, похоже, он наслаждается обретённой свободой."

#. ja: ◎＃♭▲♪♪
#. de: ◎＃♭▲♪♪<br><i>Privat-Pachypodium</i>
#. fr: ◎＃♭▲♪♪
#. column 0: Summon your private pachypodium minion. Its detonating days are thankfully over.
#. column 1: Underling to Gancanagh, this pachypodium mine had hidden itself for an ambush, but it burrowed too deep into the ground and missed its chance to detonate. Subsequently released from military service, it appears to be enjoying its newfound freedom.
#. column 3: ◆◎◎※☆!
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:473:0:2"
msgid "Take care you are not<br>caught in blassst.<br>   - Eshana"
msgstr "Берегитесь, а то<br>БУМ!<br>   — Эшана"

#. ja: ◆◎◎※☆～！
#. de: ◆◎◎※☆!
#. fr: ◆◎◎※☆～！
#. column 0: Summon your private pachypodium minion. Its detonating days are thankfully over.
