msgid "Reduces HP of enemy Search Eye by 90%. No effect if Search Eye is already inoperable."
msgstr "Наносит 90% урона вражескому Сыщику. Не действует, если Сыщик уже выведен из строя."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ハルオーネ」を呼び出す。<br>戦神ハルオーネを模した魔法人形。ちょっと照れ屋さん
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-Halone als Begleiter herbei. Sorgt für Abkühlung.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Halone miniature. Contre toute attente, elle est d'une nature plutôt réservée.
#. column 1: While traveling through the snow in search of awe-inspiring beauty, a goldsmith inadvertently wandered into the phantom realm. Though unsure if the cold had addled his mind, he later crafted this automaton based on the woman he glimpsed within, imbuing it with her imposing grace.
#. column 2: You must do better<br>than that against me!<br>   - Halone
#. column 3: The Fury's Aegis
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:474:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Halone minion. For those who like it icy cold."
msgstr "Призвать заводного прислужника Халонне. Для тех, кто любит ледяную прохладу."

#. ja: 戦神ハルオーネを模した魔法人形。とある彫金師が「畏怖すら感じる美」を求め雪原を彷徨っていたところ、寒さで遠のく意識のなか神域へ紛れ込み、目にした姿から衝動のままに造ったらしい。凛とした闘志を貫く神性が映されているという
#. de: Auf der Suche nach Inspiration geriet ein Goldschmied versehentlich in das Schemenreich. Vielleicht war es die Kälte, die ihm den Verstand geraubt hatte, aber er sah dort eine Frau, die von solch imposanter Anmut war, dass er sie später als Automaton nachzubauen versuchte.
#. fr: Cette poupée magique est le produit de l'inspiration divine octroyée à un orfèvre qui se retrouva un jour, au cours d'un voyage dans les régions glaciaires, face à ce qu'il considéra être la beauté féminine absolue. Le résultat est époustouflant, plein de puissance brute et de grâce ondoyante à la fois.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Halone minion. For those who like it icy cold.
#. column 2: You must do better<br>than that against me!<br>   - Halone
#. column 3: The Fury's Aegis
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:474:0:1"
msgid "While traveling through the snow in search of awe-inspiring beauty, a goldsmith inadvertently wandered into the phantom realm. Though unsure if the cold had addled his mind, he later crafted this automaton based on the woman he glimpsed within, imbuing it with her imposing grace."
msgstr "В поисках захватывающей дух красоты ювелир забрёл в мир призраков. Не зная, не помутился ли его рассудок от холода, он позже создал автоматон по образу женщины, которую там увидел, наделив его величественной грацией."

#. ja: 手ヌルイ！
#. de: Ihr vergesst, wer euch gegenübersteht!<br><i>Halone</i>
#. fr: Bande de chiffes molles<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Halone minion. For those who like it icy cold.
#. column 1: While traveling through the snow in search of awe-inspiring beauty, a goldsmith inadvertently wandered into the phantom realm. Though unsure if the cold had addled his mind, he later crafted this automaton based on the woman he glimpsed within, imbuing it with her imposing grace.
#. column 3: The Fury's Aegis
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:474:0:2"
msgid "You must do better<br>than that against me!<br>   - Halone"
msgstr "Против меня надо<br>стараться лучше!<br>   — Халонне"

#. ja: 戦神の剣
#. de: Aegis der Furie
#. fr: Épée du destin
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Halone minion. For those who like it icy cold.
#. column 1: While traveling through the snow in search of awe-inspiring beauty, a goldsmith inadvertently wandered into the phantom realm. Though unsure if the cold had addled his mind, he later crafted this automaton based on the woman he glimpsed within, imbuing it with her imposing grace.
