#. ja: ミニオン「豆列車」を呼び出す。<br>海底で見つかった部品からできたおもちゃの列車。ひとりでに動いたりする、かも
#. de: Du rufst deine Modelleisenbahn als Begleiter herbei. Alles einsteigen!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte train petit mais costaud, un modèle réduit de train qui a la locomotive dure.
#. column 1: This model train was assembled from mysterious parts salvaged from the bottom of the sea. Who it was meant to carry is unknown, but it is somehow tinged with a phantasmal air. Curiously, despite having no mechanism for self-propulsion, it tirelessly chugs along after you.
#. column 2: Allow me to perform a locomotive<br>experiment with this body shape.<br>   - Envious Ea
#. column 3: Runaway Train
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:475:0:0"
msgid "Summon your bantam train minion. It choo-choo-chooses to haunt you."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника-игрушечный паровозик. Он выбрал тебя, чтобы преследовать!"

#. ja: 海底で見つかった不可思議なパーツを組み合わせ、いい感じに作られた列車のおもちゃ。誰を乗せて走る列車だったのか、どことなく儚い雰囲気をまとっている。自走する仕掛けは組み込まれていないはずだが、奇妙にもどこまでも付いてくる
#. de: Diese Modelleisenbahn wurde aus unbekannten Teilen zusammengebaut, die vom Meeresgrund geborgen wurden. Was sie transportieren soll, ist unbekannt, aber irgendwie hat sie etwas Fantastisches an sich. Seltsamerweise tuckert sie dir unermüdlich hinterher, obwohl sie keinen erkennbaren Antrieb hat.
#. fr: Ce modèle réduit a été assemblé avec des pièces découvertes au fond de la mer. Personne ne sait s'il était censé transporter des passagers, ce qui lui confère une aura des plus mys<shy>té<shy>rieu<shy>ses. En outre, il suit son pro<shy>prié<shy>taire partout alors qu'il ne contient pas de moteur...
#. column 0: Summon your bantam train minion. It choo-choo-chooses to haunt you.
#. column 2: Allow me to perform a locomotive<br>experiment with this body shape.<br>   - Envious Ea
#. column 3: Runaway Train
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:475:0:1"
msgid "This model train was assembled from mysterious parts salvaged from the bottom of the sea. Who it was meant to carry is unknown, but it is somehow tinged with a phantasmal air. Curiously, despite having no mechanism for self-propulsion, it tirelessly chugs along after you."
msgstr "Эту игрушечную модель поезда собрали из загадочных деталей, поднятых со дна моря. Неизвестно, кого он должен был возить, но от него веет чем-то призрачным. Странно, но он неустанно едет за тобой, хотя у него нет механизма для самостоятельного движения."

#. ja: シュシュポッポ
#. de: Wer hätte gedacht, dass sich so viele Männer mittleren Alters für eine alte Eisenbahn interessieren?<br><i>Ryne</i>
#. fr: Tchou-tchou<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your bantam train minion. It choo-choo-chooses to haunt you.
#. column 1: This model train was assembled from mysterious parts salvaged from the bottom of the sea. Who it was meant to carry is unknown, but it is somehow tinged with a phantasmal air. Curiously, despite having no mechanism for self-propulsion, it tirelessly chugs along after you.
#. column 3: Runaway Train
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:475:0:2"
msgid "Allow me to perform a locomotive<br>experiment with this body shape.<br>   - Envious Ea"
msgstr "Позвольте провести паровозный<br>эксперимент с этой формой тела.<br>   — Завистливый эа"

#. ja: 暴走
#. de: Entgleisung
#. fr: Course folle
#. column 0: Summon your bantam train minion. It choo-choo-chooses to haunt you.
#. column 1: This model train was assembled from mysterious parts salvaged from the bottom of the sea. Who it was meant to carry is unknown, but it is somehow tinged with a phantasmal air. Curiously, despite having no mechanism for self-propulsion, it tirelessly chugs along after you.
#. column 2: Allow me to perform a locomotive<br>experiment with this body shape.<br>   - Envious Ea
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:475:0:3"
msgid "Runaway Train"
msgstr "Неуправляемый поезд"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK30のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 30 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 30 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et les projette en arrière.
#. column 0: Summon your bantam train minion. It choo-choo-chooses to haunt you.
#. column 1: This model train was assembled from mysterious parts salvaged from the bottom of the sea. Who it was meant to carry is unknown, but it is somehow tinged with a phantasmal air. Curiously, despite having no mechanism for self-propulsion, it tirelessly chugs along after you.
#. column 2: Allow me to perform a locomotive<br>experiment with this body shape.<br>   - Envious Ea
#. column 3: Runaway Train
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:475:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Атакует всех противников в радиусе действия с силой 30 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ゴッドベルト」を呼び出す。<br>ゴッドベルトを模した魔法人形。善良な紳士ですぞ
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Godbert als Begleiter herbei. Regelmäßiges Einölen nicht vergessen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Godbert miniature, un gentleman orfèvre qui a de la bouteille.
#. column 1: Godbert Manderville, the realm's greatest goldsmith and distinguished proprietor of the Gold Saucer, created this automaton in his own likeness to serve as a prize for the Make It Rain event. It is guaranteed to enhance the gentlemanliness of anyone it accompanies.
#. column 2: Splendidly suplexed, Lord Godbert!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca
#. column 3: Manderville Drive
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:476:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Godbert minion. No less gentlemanly for its compact size, this mammet stands ever ready to do what only a Manderville can."
msgstr "Призвать заводного прислужника Годберта. Пусть он и мал, но ничуть не уступает в галантности и всегда готов исполнить то, на что способен лишь Мандервиль."

#. ja: 最強の彫金師にしてマンダヴィル・ゴールドソーサーのオーナー、ゴッドベルト氏が自らを模して作った魔法人形。ゴールドソーサーフェスティバルの土産品として用意された、持っているだけで紳士力向上間違いなしの逸品である
#. de: Godbert Manderville selbst schuf sich dieses Abbild, um es als Preis im Gold Saucer anzubieten. Verleiht seinem Eigentümer Noblesse +10.
#. fr: Godbert Manderville peut s'enorgueillir d'être à la fois un des plus grands orfèvres de tous les temps et le pro<shy>prié<shy>taire du Gold Saucer. Cette poupée magique à son effigie, offerte durant le festival organisé dans son célèbre éta<shy>blis<shy>se<shy>ment, donne l'occasion de s'approprier une pincée de sa classe légendaire.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Godbert minion. No less gentlemanly for its compact size, this mammet stands ever ready to do what only a Manderville can.
#. column 2: Splendidly suplexed, Lord Godbert!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca
#. column 3: Manderville Drive
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:476:0:1"
msgid "Godbert Manderville, the realm's greatest goldsmith and distinguished proprietor of the Gold Saucer, created this automaton in his own likeness to serve as a prize for the Make It Rain event. It is guaranteed to enhance the gentlemanliness of anyone it accompanies."
msgstr "Годберт Мандервиль, величайший ювелир мира и прославленный владелец «Золотого блюдца», создал этого автоматона по собственному образу и подобию для фестиваля «Заставь дождь лить». Он наверняка прибавит галантности каждому, кто будет с ним рядом."

#. ja: ホーーーウ！
#. de: I-Ich bin ein Kind! Ein echtes Kind! Habt vielen Dank, Herr Godbert!<br><i>Gigi</i>
#. fr: Ho ho ho<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Godbert minion. No less gentlemanly for its compact size, this mammet stands ever ready to do what only a Manderville can.
#. column 1: Godbert Manderville, the realm's greatest goldsmith and distinguished proprietor of the Gold Saucer, created this automaton in his own likeness to serve as a prize for the Make It Rain event. It is guaranteed to enhance the gentlemanliness of anyone it accompanies.
#. column 3: Manderville Drive
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:476:0:2"
msgid "Splendidly suplexed, Lord Godbert!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca"
msgstr "Вот это бросок через себя, лорд Годберт!<br>   — Нашу Мхакаррака"

#. ja: マンダヴィルドライブ
#. de: Macht des Manderville
#. fr: Prise des Manderville
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Godbert minion. No less gentlemanly for its compact size, this mammet stands ever ready to do what only a Manderville can.
#. column 1: Godbert Manderville, the realm's greatest goldsmith and distinguished proprietor of the Gold Saucer, created this automaton in his own likeness to serve as a prize for the Make It Rain event. It is guaranteed to enhance the gentlemanliness of anyone it accompanies.
#. column 2: Splendidly suplexed, Lord Godbert!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:476:0:3"
msgid "Manderville Drive"
msgstr "Приём Мандервиля"

#. ja: 敵軍のシールドに70%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt einem gegnerischen Schild 70<nbsp>% Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls er schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 70% de sa solidité au bouclier ennemi. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Godbert minion. No less gentlemanly for its compact size, this mammet stands ever ready to do what only a Manderville can.
#. column 1: Godbert Manderville, the realm's greatest goldsmith and distinguished proprietor of the Gold Saucer, created this automaton in his own likeness to serve as a prize for the Make It Rain event. It is guaranteed to enhance the gentlemanliness of anyone it accompanies.
#. column 2: Splendidly suplexed, Lord Godbert!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca
