#. ja: ミニオン「パフィン」を呼び出す。<br>オレンジ色の嘴と足が特徴的な北洋原産の海鳥
#. de: Du rufst deinen Papageientaucher als Begleiter herbei. Zusammen taucht es sich eben am besten!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte macareux, un charmant petit oiseau de la famille des alques au bec orangé.
#. column 1: Native to the northern seas, this seabird is distinguishable by its orange bill and feet. It swims effectively using its short wings in lieu of fins, and can catch several fish in a single dive. Having witnessed you vanquish fiends with ease, however, this creature decided to follow you in hopes of leading a comfortable life.
#. column 2: Adventurers, you see, are as<br>migratory birds in need of a<br>place to rest their weary wings.<br>  - Antoinaut
#. column 3: Wing Flap
#. column 4: Grants action party the ability to deal extra damage to Arcana Stones.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:478:0:0"
msgid "Summon your puffin minion. Wants to work smarter, not harder."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника-тупика. Хочет работать с умом, а не на износ."

#. ja: オレンジ色の嘴と足が特徴的な北洋原産の海鳥。短い翼をヒレ代わりに潜水し、一度に多量の魚を捕らえるという。しかし、この個体は魔物を軽々と倒してゆく冒険者を見て、その後をつければ労せずエサが手に入ると考えたようだ
#. de: Ein in nördlichen Regionen beheimateter Wasservogel. Seine Flügel mögen zwar klein sein, unter Wasser gibt es allerdings wenige Jäger, die mit ihm konkurrieren können. Dieses Exemplar scheint dich schon seit längerem beobachtet zu haben und ist wohl zu dem Entschluss gekommen, dass es in deiner Nähe ohne viel Arbeit an große Mengen Futter kommen sollte.
#. fr: Originaire des mers du Nord, cet adorable volatile sait normalement se servir de ses courtes ailes pour piquer une tête dans l'océan et attraper d'un coup un bon nombre de poissons frétillants. Celui-ci par contre a été témoin de vos exploits contre diverses créatures magiques, et s'est mis en tête de vous suivre, persuadé qu'il aurait ainsi accès à une source sans fin de nourriture<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your puffin minion. Wants to work smarter, not harder.
#. column 2: Adventurers, you see, are as<br>migratory birds in need of a<br>place to rest their weary wings.<br>  - Antoinaut
#. column 3: Wing Flap
#. column 4: Grants action party the ability to deal extra damage to Arcana Stones.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:478:0:1"
msgid "Native to the northern seas, this seabird is distinguishable by its orange bill and feet. It swims effectively using its short wings in lieu of fins, and can catch several fish in a single dive. Having witnessed you vanquish fiends with ease, however, this creature decided to follow you in hopes of leading a comfortable life."
msgstr "Эта морская птица родом из северных морей. Её легко узнать по оранжевым клюву и лапам. Она отлично плавает, работая короткими крыльями вместо ласт, и за одно погружение может поймать несколько рыб. Увидев, как легко ты расправляешься с чудовищами, она решила пойти за тобой и устроить себе жизнь без забот."

#. ja: パフィ～
#. de: Pwaaarrr～
#. fr: Piou<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your puffin minion. Wants to work smarter, not harder.
#. column 1: Native to the northern seas, this seabird is distinguishable by its orange bill and feet. It swims effectively using its short wings in lieu of fins, and can catch several fish in a single dive. Having witnessed you vanquish fiends with ease, however, this creature decided to follow you in hopes of leading a comfortable life.
#. column 3: Wing Flap
#. column 4: Grants action party the ability to deal extra damage to Arcana Stones.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
