#. ja: ミニオン「モサモサウルス」を呼び出す。<br>遠洋で発見された古代竜の幼体。まだまだ小さく愛らしい
#. de: Du rufst deinen Mosasaurus als Begleiter herbei. Der perfekte Begleiter für eine kleine Jagd unter Wasser.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mossasaure, une ancienne espèce de vouivre aquatique des mers lointaines.
#. column 1: Encountered in distant seas, this dinosaur young belongs to a species named for its unhurried disposition. Though the creature may look adorable, it will one day grow to be a monstrous predator. Even now it is on the lookout for potential prey, which thankfully does not include you. Yet.
#. column 2: Your eyes are starting to<br>have the sharpness of a<br>predator about them.<br>   - Hamon
#. column 3: Hunt
#. column 4: Increases caster ATK by 10 and DEF by 5 for every 5% of HP lost.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:479:0:0"
msgid "Summon your mossasaurus minion. It's adorable now, but wait till it grows up."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника-мозазавра. Пока он очарователен, но подожди, пока вырастет."

#. ja: 遠洋で発見された古代竜の幼体。成長すると獰猛な海の狩人となるが、まだまだ小さく愛らしい。しかし、気になる獲物を見つけると一変、一目散に大口で食らいつく。今も美味しそうな獲物を追い回し、好機を窺っているようだ
#. de: Ein noch junges Exemplar eines Meeressauriers, erstmalig in den Weiten des Ozeans entdeckt. Ausgewachsen gelten sie als wahre Bestien der Meere. Dieses Exemplar ist zwar noch jung und unerfahren, sobald es aber Beute erspäht, versucht es Hals über Kopf auch schon ein Stück abzubeißen. Es scheint stets auf der Suche nach Futter zu sein.
#. fr: Cette créature, encore loin d'avoir atteint sa maturité, peut paraître attachante pour l'instant... mais une fois adulte, elle se changera en terrible prédateur<nbsp>! L'un de ses grands plaisirs est d'avaler tout cru sa proie, mais pour l'instant, elle ne sait encore que penser de vous. Pour l'instant...
#. column 0: Summon your mossasaurus minion. It's adorable now, but wait till it grows up.
#. column 2: Your eyes are starting to<br>have the sharpness of a<br>predator about them.<br>   - Hamon
#. column 3: Hunt
#. column 4: Increases caster ATK by 10 and DEF by 5 for every 5% of HP lost.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:479:0:1"
msgid "Encountered in distant seas, this dinosaur young belongs to a species named for its unhurried disposition. Though the creature may look adorable, it will one day grow to be a monstrous predator. Even now it is on the lookout for potential prey, which thankfully does not include you. Yet."
msgstr "Этот молодой ящер был найден в далёких морях. Вид назвали за неторопливый нрав. Сейчас он кажется милым, но однажды вырастет в ужасного хищника. Уже теперь он высматривает добычу, и, к счастью, пока не тебя."

#. ja: もさもさ…
#. de: \<schmatz><nbsp>...
#. fr: Groumph...
#. column 0: Summon your mossasaurus minion. It's adorable now, but wait till it grows up.
#. column 1: Encountered in distant seas, this dinosaur young belongs to a species named for its unhurried disposition. Though the creature may look adorable, it will one day grow to be a monstrous predator. Even now it is on the lookout for potential prey, which thankfully does not include you. Yet.
#. column 3: Hunt
