msgstr "Повышает АТК и ЗАЩ прислужника, использующего приём: за каждые 5% потерянных ОЗ АТК повышается на 10, а ЗАЩ — на 5.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「オクリチョウチン」を呼び出す。<br>六根山で発見された小さなバケチョウチン
#. de: Du rufst deinen kleinen Laternengeist als Begleiter herbei. Erschreck dich aber nicht, er will nur spielen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte chôchin okuri, une variété de lanterne fantôme originaire du mont Rokkon.
#. column 1: This small lantern ghost found in Mount Rokkon was born when a child's well-loved paper lantern came to harbor a spirit. Possessed of a friendly nature, it happily follows its master everywhere rather than misleading hapless souls in the dark as its kind are wont to do.
#. column 2: You are the light that guidesss us, comrade.<br>As such, I would have you prepare the<br>lampsss we use for night patrol.<br>   - Eshana
#. column 3: Terrifying Tongue
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to all enemies within range while increasing action party ATK by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:480:0:0"
msgid "Summon your okuri chochin minion. For those who like a little fright with their light."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника-окури-тётина. Для тех, кто любит немного жути при свете фонаря."

#. ja: 六根山で発見された小さなバケチョウチン。元は子ども用の提灯だったようだが、長らく人に愛用され霊性を獲得し、付喪神が宿ったようだ。人懐っこい一面があり、主を見送るどころか、どこまでも付いてくるらしい
#. de: Dieser kleine Laternengeist wurde auf dem Rokkon gefunden. Man sagt, dass er in der Papierlaterne eines Kindes geboren wurde, das das warme Licht besonders lieb gewonnen hatte. Daher ist er auch von sonnigem Gemüt und sehr umgänglich, seinem Meister artig folgend, anstatt wie seine Artgenossen vom Weg abgekommene Wanderer in die Irre zu führen.
#. fr: Cette créature de la famille des “bake-chôchin” est née lorsqu'un esprit s'est logé dans une lanterne en papier fabriquée pour les enfants. Très affective, elle a l'habitude de suivre son maître absolument partout.
#. column 0: Summon your okuri chochin minion. For those who like a little fright with their light.
#. column 2: You are the light that guidesss us, comrade.<br>As such, I would have you prepare the<br>lampsss we use for night patrol.<br>   - Eshana
#. column 3: Terrifying Tongue
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to all enemies within range while increasing action party ATK by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:480:0:1"
msgid "This small lantern ghost found in Mount Rokkon was born when a child's well-loved paper lantern came to harbor a spirit. Possessed of a friendly nature, it happily follows its master everywhere rather than misleading hapless souls in the dark as its kind are wont to do."
msgstr "Этот маленький призрак-фонарь нашли на горе Роккон. Он появился, когда дух вселился в любимый детский бумажный фонарик. Добродушный дух с радостью следует за хозяином повсюду, а не сбивает заблудшие души с пути, как ему подобные."

#. ja: べろべろ～り
#. de: \<schleck!>
#. fr: Bleeeh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your okuri chochin minion. For those who like a little fright with their light.
#. column 1: This small lantern ghost found in Mount Rokkon was born when a child's well-loved paper lantern came to harbor a spirit. Possessed of a friendly nature, it happily follows its master everywhere rather than misleading hapless souls in the dark as its kind are wont to do.
#. column 3: Terrifying Tongue
