#. ja: ミニオン「スチームウソウソ」を呼び出す。<br>蒸気式飛翔翼を身にまとったウソウソ。スチーム！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Dampf-Otter als Begleiter herbei. Perfekt um Dampf abzulassen!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte loutre choute fringante, avec sa petite tenue, elle a un air par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement chic<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Believed to hail from the Far East, this otter was fishing out in the open sea when its boat capsized. Though it managed to find its way to a desert island, it was used as a test subject by automata and made to wear steam-powered wings and dapper attire.
#. column 2: Speaking of steam, I think I feel<br>some coming out my ears.<br>   - Regitt
#. column 3: Steam Jump
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:481:0:0"
msgid "Summon your posher otter minion. Part futuristic, part antiquated, all class."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника-вычурную выдру. В ней есть что-то и от будущего, и от прошлого — зато стиля хоть отбавляй."

#. ja: 蒸気式飛翔翼を身にまとったウソウソ。出身は東方らしいが、釣り船が転覆し漂流するうち無人島へとたどり着き、魔法人形たちによって最新装具の実験体とされてしまった。釣り道楽の彼にとっては、飛べてもさして意味は無い
#. de: Ein Otter, welcher mit dampfbetriebenen Flügeln ausgestattet ist. Dieser kleine Fratz wurde nach einem Schiffsunglück beim Angeln auf das Inselparadies angespült und von den magischen Marionetten prompt als Testsubjekt benutzt. Wer wollte nicht schon mal gleichzeitig fliegen und angeln?
#. fr: Originaire d'Orient, on raconte qu'elle aurait chuté d'un navire de pêche avant de s'échouer sur une île déserte... ou presque. Car les poupées magiques présentes sur les lieux sont tombées sous le charme de cette croquante loutre et l'ont habillée avec diverses tenues avant de s'accorder sur ce magnifique ensemble alliant classe et technologie.
#. column 0: Summon your posher otter minion. Part futuristic, part antiquated, all class.
#. column 2: Speaking of steam, I think I feel<br>some coming out my ears.<br>   - Regitt
#. column 3: Steam Jump
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:481:0:1"
msgid "Believed to hail from the Far East, this otter was fishing out in the open sea when its boat capsized. Though it managed to find its way to a desert island, it was used as a test subject by automata and made to wear steam-powered wings and dapper attire."
msgstr "Эта выдра, вероятно, родом из Дальнего Востока. Она рыбачила в открытом море, когда её лодка перевернулась. Добравшись до необитаемого острова, она стала подопытной у автоматонов: те снабдили её паровыми крыльями и щегольским нарядом."

#. ja: スチーム！
#. de: Pufff!
#. fr: Tchouuu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your posher otter minion. Part futuristic, part antiquated, all class.
#. column 1: Believed to hail from the Far East, this otter was fishing out in the open sea when its boat capsized. Though it managed to find its way to a desert island, it was used as a test subject by automata and made to wear steam-powered wings and dapper attire.
#. column 3: Steam Jump
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:481:0:2"
msgid "Speaking of steam, I think I feel<br>some coming out my ears.<br>   - Regitt"
msgstr "Раз уж заговорили о паре, кажется,<br>у меня из ушей тоже валит дым.<br>   — Регитт"

#. ja: スチームジャンプ！
#. de: Dunstsprung
#. fr: Salto vapeur
#. column 0: Summon your posher otter minion. Part futuristic, part antiquated, all class.
#. column 1: Believed to hail from the Far East, this otter was fishing out in the open sea when its boat capsized. Though it managed to find its way to a desert island, it was used as a test subject by automata and made to wear steam-powered wings and dapper attire.
#. column 2: Speaking of steam, I think I feel<br>some coming out my ears.<br>   - Regitt
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:481:0:3"
msgid "Steam Jump"
msgstr "Паровой прыжок"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATKの5倍のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt Gegnern in der Nähe Schaden in 5-facher Höhe des Attacke-Werts zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à cinq fois l'attaque aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your posher otter minion. Part futuristic, part antiquated, all class.
#. column 1: Believed to hail from the Far East, this otter was fishing out in the open sea when its boat capsized. Though it managed to find its way to a desert island, it was used as a test subject by automata and made to wear steam-powered wings and dapper attire.
#. column 2: Speaking of steam, I think I feel<br>some coming out my ears.<br>   - Regitt
#. column 3: Steam Jump
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:481:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK."
msgstr "Атакует всех противников в радиусе действия с силой, в пять раз превышающей АТК прислужника."

#. ja: ミニオン「ルベライトウェポン」を呼び出す。<br>帝国軍基地で発見された試作魔導兵器の縮小模型
#. de: Du rufst deine Rubellit-Waffe als Begleiter herbei. Zerstörung zum Mitnehmen!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Arme Rubellite, un modèle réduit d'un prototype d'arme magitek conçu par l'armée impériale.
#. column 1: Retrieved from an imperial base, this scale prototype of a warmachina appears to have been created for aerodynamics testing and carries no armaments. After completing their analysis, the Eorzean Alliance saw fit to bestow it upon members as a reward for exemplary service.
#. column 2: Feast your eyes on the likeness of the<br>Crimson Conqueror, the Vermilion Villain,<br>the Scarlet...Scoundrel, the one and only<br>Ruby Weapon!<br>   - Warmachina Fanatic
#. column 3: Rubellite Dynamics
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:482:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Rubellite Weapon minion. Scaled down or no, it can scratch you up good."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника — Рубеллитовое оружие. Пусть оно и уменьшенное, царапины всё равно оставит."

#. ja: 帝国軍基地で発見された試作魔導兵器の縮小模型。どうやら機体の空力特性などを検証するための模型であり、武装類は内蔵されていない。押収した都市軍事同盟は、解析の後、演習の成績優秀者向けの報奨としたようだ
#. de: Ein Modell der ähnlich aussehenden Waffe des Kaiserreichs, welches in einem ihrer Stützpunkte entdeckt wurde. Da es aus<shy>schließ<shy>lich zum Testen der Flugeigenschaften dienen sollte, ist es weder mit Waffen ausgerüstet noch auf andere Weise gefährlich. Nach der Beschlagnahme und Analyse durch die Allianz wurde es als Preis für herausragende Leistungen in Militärübungen ausgegeben.
#. fr: Découverte dans un entrepôt d'une base garlemaldaise, cette Arme semble avoir été avant tout un modèle d'essai servant à tester l'aérodynamisme de ce type d'engin en vol. Elle ne possède d'ailleurs aucun type d'armement. Après une analyse poussée, les dirigeants de l'Alliance éorzéenne ont choisi de l'offrir à ses membres les plus prestigieux, en guise de récompense pour leur service.
#. column 0: Summon your Rubellite Weapon minion. Scaled down or no, it can scratch you up good.
#. column 2: Feast your eyes on the likeness of the<br>Crimson Conqueror, the Vermilion Villain,<br>the Scarlet...Scoundrel, the one and only<br>Ruby Weapon!<br>   - Warmachina Fanatic
#. column 3: Rubellite Dynamics
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:482:0:1"
msgid "Retrieved from an imperial base, this scale prototype of a warmachina appears to have been created for aerodynamics testing and carries no armaments. After completing their analysis, the Eorzean Alliance saw fit to bestow it upon members as a reward for exemplary service."
msgstr "Эту уменьшенную модель прототипа боевой машины нашли на имперской базе. Судя по всему, её создали для испытания аэродинамики, а вооружения у неё нет. Эорзейский альянс закончил изучение и наградил ею отличившихся бойцов."

#. ja: ゴゥン…
#. de: Gwuuun<nbsp>...
#. fr: Clonk...
#. column 0: Summon your Rubellite Weapon minion. Scaled down or no, it can scratch you up good.
#. column 1: Retrieved from an imperial base, this scale prototype of a warmachina appears to have been created for aerodynamics testing and carries no armaments. After completing their analysis, the Eorzean Alliance saw fit to bestow it upon members as a reward for exemplary service.
#. column 3: Rubellite Dynamics
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
