#. ja: ミニオン「チンパンジー」を呼び出す。<br>黒い体毛を持つ小型のサル。とても頭がいい
#. de: Du rufst deinen Schimpansen als Begleiter herbei. Hoffentlich hast du genug Bananen parat<nbsp>...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte chimpanzé, un singe par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement intelligent.
#. column 1: A highly intelligent species of ape, the chimpanzee can be trained to use tools as well as simple language. Some naturalists believe them to be close relatives to mankind, but none have been able to determine an evolutionary process.
#. column 2: May the fortune of the<br>monkey attend you!<br>   - Saru Bugyo
#. column 3: Munch
#. column 4: Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:483:0:0"
msgid "This adorable critter will make you love every ape that you see, from chimpan-a to chimpan-z. Summon your chimpanzee minion."
msgstr "Эта милая обезьянка заставит тебя полюбить всех обезьян — от шимпан-а до шимпан-я. Призвать прислужника-шимпанзе."

#. ja: 黒い体毛を持つ小型のサル。知能が高く、教育すれば道具の使い方や簡単な言語の聞き分けも行えるという。ヒトの近縁種と考える博物学者もいるが、その進化過程については、未だに解明されていない部分が多い
#. de: Ein kleiner, schlauer Affe mit schwarzem Fell. Dank ihrer Intelligenz können diese Wesen mit ein bisschen Übung Werkzeuge benutzen und sogar Sprachen voneinander unterscheiden. So mancher Wissenschaftler behauptet, sie seien eng mit den Völkern Eorzeas verwandt, wirklich bewiesen ist aber nichts.
#. fr: Cet animal au pelage noir dispose de facultés cognitives très avancées, dont la capacité à utiliser des outils ou même à comprendre le langage humain. Certains scien<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>ques pensent qu'il s'agirait d'une espèce très proche de l'homme, mais ignorent encore son origine ainsi que son processus évolutif.
#. column 0: This adorable critter will make you love every ape that you see, from chimpan-a to chimpan-z. Summon your chimpanzee minion.
#. column 2: May the fortune of the<br>monkey attend you!<br>   - Saru Bugyo
#. column 3: Munch
#. column 4: Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:483:0:1"
msgid "A highly intelligent species of ape, the chimpanzee can be trained to use tools as well as simple language. Some naturalists believe them to be close relatives to mankind, but none have been able to determine an evolutionary process."
msgstr "Шимпанзе — очень умные обезьяны. Их можно обучить пользоваться инструментами и понимать простую речь. Некоторые натуралисты считают их близкими родственниками людей, но происхождение вида до сих пор остаётся загадкой."

#. ja: ウッキ～！
#. de: Uga uga!
#. fr: Ouh ouh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: This adorable critter will make you love every ape that you see, from chimpan-a to chimpan-z. Summon your chimpanzee minion.
#. column 1: A highly intelligent species of ape, the chimpanzee can be trained to use tools as well as simple language. Some naturalists believe them to be close relatives to mankind, but none have been able to determine an evolutionary process.
#. column 3: Munch
#. column 4: Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:483:0:2"
msgid "May the fortune of the<br>monkey attend you!<br>   - Saru Bugyo"
msgstr "Пусть удача обезьяны<br>будет с тобой!<br>   — Сару Бугё"

#. ja: ポリポリ
#. de: Mampfer
#. fr: Gratte gratte
#. column 0: This adorable critter will make you love every ape that you see, from chimpan-a to chimpan-z. Summon your chimpanzee minion.
#. column 1: A highly intelligent species of ape, the chimpanzee can be trained to use tools as well as simple language. Some naturalists believe them to be close relatives to mankind, but none have been able to determine an evolutionary process.
#. column 2: May the fortune of the<br>monkey attend you!<br>   - Saru Bugyo
#. column 4: Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:483:0:3"
msgid "Munch"
msgstr "Пожевать"

#. ja: 敵軍が配置したトラップがある場合、自軍のトラップとして発動させる。トラップがATKダメージの場合はダメージを1.5倍にする。
#. de: Wandelt gegnerische Fallen in eigene um. Wenn die Falle eine Attacke ausführt, wird der Attacke-Wert um das 1,5-fache erhöht.
#. fr: Augmente de 40 l'attaque des mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. column 0: This adorable critter will make you love every ape that you see, from chimpan-a to chimpan-z. Summon your chimpanzee minion.
#. column 1: A highly intelligent species of ape, the chimpanzee can be trained to use tools as well as simple language. Some naturalists believe them to be close relatives to mankind, but none have been able to determine an evolutionary process.
#. column 2: May the fortune of the<br>monkey attend you!<br>   - Saru Bugyo
#. column 3: Munch
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:483:0:4"
msgid "Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%."
msgstr "Если на поле есть ловушка противника, активирует её как свою. Если ловушка наносит физический урон, сила урона увеличивается на 150%."

#. ja: ミニオン「エキサイティング・ダイナマイト」を呼び出す。<br>エキサイティングなダイナマイトの幼体。あと一歩で爆発しそう
#. de: Du rufst deinen aufgeregten Dynamit als Begleiter herbei. Klein, aber potenziell explosiv<nbsp>...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte dynamite exaltante, car qui ne voudrait pas d'un compagnon prêt à exploser à n'importe quel moment<nbsp>?
#. column 1: While this dynamite young is determined to do what it was born to do─detonate spectacularly and engulf all in a fiery conflagration─it is thankfully some ways away from accomplishing the deed. According to Thrillingway, there is no thrill quite like using it in place of a pillow when sleeping.
#. column 2: Take care you are not caught in blassst.<br>I would be upssset to lose a helpful<br>adventurer sssuch as you.<br>   - Eshana
#. column 3: Play Detonate
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:484:0:0"
msgid "Summon your exciting dynamite minion. For those who love the threat of death or serious injury to follow their every step."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника-взрывчатку. Для тех, кто любит, когда за каждым шагом следует угроза смерти или серьёзной травмы."

#. ja: エキサイティングなダイナマイトの幼体。華麗に爆発しようと身を縮こませるが、あと一歩のところで上手くいかないようだ。好事家のスリリングウェイ氏によれば、これを枕代わりにして寝ると、格別なスリルを味わえるという
#. de: Ein aufgeregter Dynamit, welcher sich noch im Wachstum befindet. Er gibt sein Bestes, um möglichst prächtig zu explodieren, schafft es aber noch nicht ganz. Thrillingways bevorzugtes Kopfkissen.
#. fr: Cette jeune dynamite était toute prête à se faire exploser dans une déflagration de tous les diables, mais n'a pas réussi à y parvenir. D'après Thrillingway, il n'y aurait pas plus grand frisson dans ce monde que de s'en servir comme oreiller avant de dormir<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your exciting dynamite minion. For those who love the threat of death or serious injury to follow their every step.
#. column 2: Take care you are not caught in blassst.<br>I would be upssset to lose a helpful<br>adventurer sssuch as you.<br>   - Eshana
#. column 3: Play Detonate
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:484:0:1"
msgid "While this dynamite young is determined to do what it was born to do─detonate spectacularly and engulf all in a fiery conflagration─it is thankfully some ways away from accomplishing the deed. According to Thrillingway, there is no thrill quite like using it in place of a pillow when sleeping."
msgstr "Эта молодая динамитка изо всех сил пытается выполнить своё предназначение: эффектно взорваться и охватить всё вокруг огнём. К счастью, у неё пока ничего не выходит. По словам Триллингвея, нет ничего увлекательнее, чем использовать её вместо подушки."

#. ja: ３・２・１…
#. de: 3, 2, 1, <i>Bumm!</i>
#. fr: 3... 2... 1...
#. column 0: Summon your exciting dynamite minion. For those who love the threat of death or serious injury to follow their every step.
#. column 1: While this dynamite young is determined to do what it was born to do─detonate spectacularly and engulf all in a fiery conflagration─it is thankfully some ways away from accomplishing the deed. According to Thrillingway, there is no thrill quite like using it in place of a pillow when sleeping.
#. column 3: Play Detonate
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:484:0:2"
msgid "Take care you are not caught in blassst.<br>I would be upssset to lose a helpful<br>adventurer sssuch as you.<br>   - Eshana"
msgstr "Берегитесь, а то БУМ!<br>Не хотелось бы потерять такого<br>полезного искателя приключений, как ты.<br>   — Эшана"

#. ja: 爆発するフリ
#. de: Mumm zum Bumm
#. fr: Explosion simulée
#. column 0: Summon your exciting dynamite minion. For those who love the threat of death or serious injury to follow their every step.
#. column 1: While this dynamite young is determined to do what it was born to do─detonate spectacularly and engulf all in a fiery conflagration─it is thankfully some ways away from accomplishing the deed. According to Thrillingway, there is no thrill quite like using it in place of a pillow when sleeping.
#. column 2: Take care you are not caught in blassst.<br>I would be upssset to lose a helpful<br>adventurer sssuch as you.<br>   - Eshana
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:484:0:3"
msgid "Play Detonate"
msgstr "Притвориться взрывом"

#. ja: 敵が配置したトラップがある場合、解除する。
#. de: Entfernt eine vom Gegner aufgestellte Falle.
#. fr: Désamorce les pièges des ennemis.
#. column 0: Summon your exciting dynamite minion. For those who love the threat of death or serious injury to follow their every step.
#. column 1: While this dynamite young is determined to do what it was born to do─detonate spectacularly and engulf all in a fiery conflagration─it is thankfully some ways away from accomplishing the deed. According to Thrillingway, there is no thrill quite like using it in place of a pillow when sleeping.
#. column 2: Take care you are not caught in blassst.<br>I would be upssset to lose a helpful<br>adventurer sssuch as you.<br>   - Eshana
#. column 3: Play Detonate
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:484:0:4"
msgid "Disarms deployed enemy traps."
msgstr "Обезвреживает расставленные противником ловушки."

#. ja: ミニオン「ミクラ・リッサ」を呼び出す。<br>リッサを模した魔法人形。アクション技が得意
#. de: Du rufst deine Lyssa Mikra als Begleiterin herbei. Darf auch in dieser Form nicht unterschätzt werden!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mikra Lyssa une version miniature de la terrible louve.
#. column 1: Made in the likeness of the bipedal wolf Lyssa, this automaton was apparently used to test the creation's viability at smaller proportions. While it is skilled at various striking and grappling techniques, the effect is commensurate with its diminutive size.
#. column 2: Give us a hand and we'll get<br>out of your hair. Wolf's honor.<br>   - The Wolf Burglar
#. column 3: Rolling Sobat
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:485:0:0"
msgid "Summon your mikra Lyssa minion. Definitely meant to be a wolf─the ancients said so."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника-микру Лиссу. Древние говорили, что она волк, значит, точно волк."

#. ja: 二足歩行する狼こと、リッサを模した魔法人形。原型となった創造生物を、より小型化した場合にどうなるかという検証のため、この人形が造られたらしい。回転後ろ蹴りや寝技を得意とするようだが、身体が小さいため威力は控えめ
#. de: Eine magische Puppe, deren Aussehen Lyssa nachempfunden ist. Diese Puppe wurde angeblich als Experiment zur Erforschung von möglichen Größen für das Konzept Lyssa Mikra hergestellt. Sie ist in ver<shy>schie<shy>den<shy>sten Kampfkünsten versiert, kann durch ihre Größe aber nicht wirklich viel ausrichten.
#. fr: Cette poupée est basée sur la louve bipède Lyssa, dans le but d'étudier la capacité à reproduire les techniques de l'originale, mais à petite échelle. Si elle conserve le talent de sa “grande sœur” pour les coups de pied retournés et les clefs de bras, son petit corps ne lui permet pas d'infliger beaucoup de dégâts.
#. column 0: Summon your mikra Lyssa minion. Definitely meant to be a wolf─the ancients said so.
#. column 2: Give us a hand and we'll get<br>out of your hair. Wolf's honor.<br>   - The Wolf Burglar
#. column 3: Rolling Sobat
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:485:0:1"
msgid "Made in the likeness of the bipedal wolf Lyssa, this automaton was apparently used to test the creation's viability at smaller proportions. While it is skilled at various striking and grappling techniques, the effect is commensurate with its diminutive size."
msgstr "Этот автоматон создан по образу Лиссы — двуногой волчицы. Похоже, его сделали, чтобы проверить, как будет выглядеть творение меньшего размера. Он мастерски бьёт и борется в захвате, но из-за малых размеров урон невелик."

#. ja: ターッ！
#. de: Hyaaa!
#. fr: Yaaah<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your mikra Lyssa minion. Definitely meant to be a wolf─the ancients said so.
#. column 1: Made in the likeness of the bipedal wolf Lyssa, this automaton was apparently used to test the creation's viability at smaller proportions. While it is skilled at various striking and grappling techniques, the effect is commensurate with its diminutive size.
#. column 3: Rolling Sobat
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:485:0:2"
msgid "Give us a hand and we'll get<br>out of your hair. Wolf's honor.<br>   - The Wolf Burglar"
msgstr "Помоги нам — и мы<br>не будем тебе мешать. Честь волка.<br>   — Волк-грабитель"

#. ja: ローリングソバット
#. de: Rollstoß
#. fr: Coup de pied retourné
#. column 0: Summon your mikra Lyssa minion. Definitely meant to be a wolf─the ancients said so.
#. column 1: Made in the likeness of the bipedal wolf Lyssa, this automaton was apparently used to test the creation's viability at smaller proportions. While it is skilled at various striking and grappling techniques, the effect is commensurate with its diminutive size.
#. column 2: Give us a hand and we'll get<br>out of your hair. Wolf's honor.<br>   - The Wolf Burglar
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:485:0:3"
msgid "Rolling Sobat"
msgstr "Вращающийся собат"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のゲートに90%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Tor 90<nbsp>% Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls es schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 90% de sa solidité au portail ennemi le plus proche. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your mikra Lyssa minion. Definitely meant to be a wolf─the ancients said so.
#. column 1: Made in the likeness of the bipedal wolf Lyssa, this automaton was apparently used to test the creation's viability at smaller proportions. While it is skilled at various striking and grappling techniques, the effect is commensurate with its diminutive size.
#. column 2: Give us a hand and we'll get<br>out of your hair. Wolf's honor.<br>   - The Wolf Burglar
#. column 3: Rolling Sobat
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:485:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable."
msgstr "Наносит 90% урона ближайшим вражеским воротам. Не действует, если ворота уже разрушены."

#. ja: ミニオン「忍犬シロマル」を呼び出す。<br>ひんがしの国の忍犬。なかなかに義理堅い
#. de: Du rufst deinen Shiromaru als Begleiter herbei. Hoffentlich hast du genügend Leckerli eingesteckt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Shiromaru, un chien ninja venu de Hingashi.
#. column 1: This white ninja dog once served the Hingan kunoichi Yozakura. Driven by a keen sense of duty, he decided to follow you in gratitude for laying his mistress's soul to rest. Written upon the scroll he carries is an ancient ninjutsu technique for parting people from their treats.
#. column 2: Shinobi are trained to put<br>duty ahead of all else.<br>   - Oboro
#. column 3: Dogged Duty
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:486:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Shiromaru minion. Because the only thing that's better than a dog is a <i>ninja</i> dog."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника Сиромару. Ведь собака — это хорошо, а <i>собака-ниндзя</i> ещё лучше."

#. ja: ひんがしの国のくのいち、花遁のヨザクラに仕えていた白い忍犬。なかなかに義理堅い性格で、怪異に堕ちた主の魂を解放してくれた冒険者に恩義を感じ、同行することにした。咥えた巻物には、オヤツの口寄せ術が記されている
#. de: Dieser weiße Ninjahund war der treue Begleiter der Kunoichi Yozakura. Sein ausgeprägtes Pflichtgefühl gegenüber seiner Herrin hat ihn dazu bewogen, nun stattdessen dir zu folgen - als Dank, dass du ihre Seele zur wohlverdienten Ruhe gebettet hast. Auf der Schriftrolle, die er bei sich trägt, verbirgt sich eine uralte Kunst zur Beschaffung eines Leckerlis.
#. fr: Ancien compagnon de la shinobi Yozakura l'élusive, ce chien ninja au pelage blanc possède un sens du devoir très développé, et vous a offert sa loyauté sans faille pour avoir libéré l'âme de sa maîtresse. Le rouleau qu'il possède contient une technique capable d'attirer vers lui les friandises alentour.
#. column 0: Summon your Shiromaru minion. Because the only thing that's better than a dog is a <i>ninja</i> dog.
#. column 2: Shinobi are trained to put<br>duty ahead of all else.<br>   - Oboro
#. column 3: Dogged Duty
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:486:0:1"
msgid "This white ninja dog once served the Hingan kunoichi Yozakura. Driven by a keen sense of duty, he decided to follow you in gratitude for laying his mistress's soul to rest. Written upon the scroll he carries is an ancient ninjutsu technique for parting people from their treats."
msgstr "Этот белый пёс-ниндзя служил куноити из Хингаси Ёдзакуре. Верный долгу, он решил сопровождать тебя в благодарность за то, что ты упокоил душу его госпожи. На свитке, который он несёт, записана древняя техника ниндзюцу, позволяющая отбирать у людей лакомства."

#. ja: ワッフワッフ
#. de: Wuff!
#. fr: Wouf<nbsp>! Wouf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Shiromaru minion. Because the only thing that's better than a dog is a <i>ninja</i> dog.
#. column 1: This white ninja dog once served the Hingan kunoichi Yozakura. Driven by a keen sense of duty, he decided to follow you in gratitude for laying his mistress's soul to rest. Written upon the scroll he carries is an ancient ninjutsu technique for parting people from their treats.
#. column 3: Dogged Duty
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:486:0:2"
msgid "Shinobi are trained to put<br>duty ahead of all else.<br>   - Oboro"
msgstr "Синоби учат ставить<br>долг превыше всего.<br>   — Оборо"

#. ja: ワッフ！
#. de: Pfotenpflicht
#. fr: Ouaf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Shiromaru minion. Because the only thing that's better than a dog is a <i>ninja</i> dog.
#. column 1: This white ninja dog once served the Hingan kunoichi Yozakura. Driven by a keen sense of duty, he decided to follow you in gratitude for laying his mistress's soul to rest. Written upon the scroll he carries is an ancient ninjutsu technique for parting people from their treats.
#. column 2: Shinobi are trained to put<br>duty ahead of all else.<br>   - Oboro
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:486:0:3"
msgid "Dogged Duty"
msgstr "Собачий долг"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のDEFを10上昇させる。味方のタイプが「アニマル」の場合は、DEFが30上昇する。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Erhöht die ABW eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, im Fall von Tieren um 30.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 10 la défense des alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou de 30 s'ils sont de type “Créature”.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your Shiromaru minion. Because the only thing that's better than a dog is a <i>ninja</i> dog.
#. column 1: This white ninja dog once served the Hingan kunoichi Yozakura. Driven by a keen sense of duty, he decided to follow you in gratitude for laying his mistress's soul to rest. Written upon the scroll he carries is an ancient ninjutsu technique for parting people from their treats.
#. column 2: Shinobi are trained to put<br>duty ahead of all else.<br>   - Oboro
