msgid "Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s"
msgstr "Повышает ЗАЩ всех союзников в радиусе действия на 10 (на 30, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>зверь</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・アテナ」を呼び出す。<br>アテナを模した魔法人形。それこそが、私の望みよ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-Athena als Begleiter herbei. „Endlich wird mein Wunsch in Erfüllung gehen!“
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Athéna miniature, une poupée si pure et si belle, le voilà, votre rêve<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Boasting the likeness of Athena, the first chief keyward of Pandæmonium, this automaton was created in secret by a colleague who greatly admired her. That colleague later vanished without a trace, some days after which a peculiar dog with a man's face is said to have appeared in the facility.
#. column 2: Athena must be the sole<br>focus of your attention.<br>   - Lahabrea
#. column 3: Lure
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:487:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Athena minion. To follow you everywhere─<i>that</i> is her wish."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Афины. Быть с тобой повсюду — <i>вот</i> её желание."

#. ja: パンデモニウムの初代長官アテナを模した魔法人形。卓越した研究者であった彼女を崇拝していた職員が、密かに創っていたものらしい。彼が謎の失踪を遂げた数日後、大監獄に妙に人っぽい顔つきの犬が収監されたという
#. de: Eine magische Puppe, deren Aussehen der einstigen Leiterin des Pandæmoniums nachempfunden ist. Einer der Angestellten verehrte Athena wegen ihrer Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten als Forscherin wohl so sehr, dass er diese Puppe im Geheimen anfertigte. Gerüchten zufolge verschwand er kurz darauf und ein Hund mit verblüffender Ähnlichkeit tauchte in dem gigantischen Kerker auf.
#. fr: Cette poupée est basée sur la première directrice du Pandæmonium, elle aurait d'ailleurs été créée dans le plus grand secret par un des employés, grand admirateur d'Athéna. Cet homme disparut dans des cir<shy>cons<shy>tan<shy>ces étranges, quelques jours avant l'apparition d'un molosse au visage humain arpentant les couloirs de la prison.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Athena minion. To follow you everywhere─<i>that</i> is her wish.
#. column 2: Athena must be the sole<br>focus of your attention.<br>   - Lahabrea
#. column 3: Lure
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:487:0:1"
msgid "Boasting the likeness of Athena, the first chief keyward of Pandæmonium, this automaton was created in secret by a colleague who greatly admired her. That colleague later vanished without a trace, some days after which a peculiar dog with a man's face is said to have appeared in the facility."
msgstr "Этот автоматон изображает Афину, первую главу ключников Пандемониума. Его тайно создал один из её горячих поклонников. Вскоре тот бесследно исчез, а несколько дней спустя в учреждении, как говорят, появился странный пёс с человеческим лицом."

#. ja: モットヨク見セテ…！
#. de: Zeigt es mir!
#. fr: Montrez-moi l'éclat de votre âme<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Athena minion. To follow you everywhere─<i>that</i> is her wish.
#. column 1: Boasting the likeness of Athena, the first chief keyward of Pandæmonium, this automaton was created in secret by a colleague who greatly admired her. That colleague later vanished without a trace, some days after which a peculiar dog with a man's face is said to have appeared in the facility.
#. column 3: Lure
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:487:0:2"
msgid "Athena must be the sole<br>focus of your attention.<br>   - Lahabrea"
msgstr "Афина должна быть<br>единственным, о ком ты думаешь.<br>   — Лахабрея"

#. ja: いざなう
#. de: Einlullen
#. fr: Tentation
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Athena minion. To follow you everywhere─<i>that</i> is her wish.
#. column 1: Boasting the likeness of Athena, the first chief keyward of Pandæmonium, this automaton was created in secret by a colleague who greatly admired her. That colleague later vanished without a trace, some days after which a peculiar dog with a man's face is said to have appeared in the facility.
#. column 2: Athena must be the sole<br>focus of your attention.<br>   - Lahabrea
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:487:0:3"
msgid "Lure"
msgstr "Приманка"

#. ja: トラップを配置する。10秒後トラップ発動ボタンにより起爆可能。範囲内にいる敵の移動速度を70%低下させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>20秒
#. de: Stellt eine Falle auf, die nach 10 Sekunden ausgelöst werden kann. Bewirkt die Verlangsamung von Gegnern in der Nähe um 70<nbsp>%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 Sekunden
#. fr: Place un piège qui peut être déclenché 10 secondes plus tard.<br>Piège<nbsp>: réduit de 70% la vitesse de déplacement des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Athena minion. To follow you everywhere─<i>that</i> is her wish.
#. column 1: Boasting the likeness of Athena, the first chief keyward of Pandæmonium, this automaton was created in secret by a colleague who greatly admired her. That colleague later vanished without a trace, some days after which a peculiar dog with a man's face is said to have appeared in the facility.
#. column 2: Athena must be the sole<br>focus of your attention.<br>   - Lahabrea
#. column 3: Lure
