msgctxt "CompanionTransient:487:0:4"
msgid "Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
msgstr "Устанавливает ловушку. Когда она срабатывает, скорость передвижения всех противников в радиусе действия снижается на 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 сек.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Задержка срабатывания:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・バルバリシア」を呼び出す。<br>大妖異バルバリシアを模した魔法人形。ブッ飛ばす！！
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-Barbarizia als Begleiter herbei.<br>„Nicht ein Hauch Äther wird von euch übrig sein!“
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Barbariccia, prenez garde aux courants d'air<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Assuming the likeness of Barbariccia, one of Golbez's four archfiends, this automaton was made according to a blueprint devised by a goldsmith who chanced to witness her. Wishing to share the voidsent queen's unique beauty with others, the artisan focused on capturing her flowing hair and savage grace.
#. column 2: B-Barbariccia... She is come!<br>   - Ciriatto
#. column 3: Hair Raid
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:488:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Barbariccia minion. Will blow you away─figuratively."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Барбариччии. Снесёт с ног — в переносном смысле."

#. ja: ゴルベーザ四天王の一角、風のバルバリシアを模した魔法人形。ある彫金師が、放浪中に目撃した大妖異の美しさを世に知らしめるため、製作レシピを公開したもの。髪の動きと野性味と荒々しさを示す造形にこだわったらしい
#. de: Eine magische Puppe, deren Aussehen Golbez' Elementarfürstin des Windes nachempfunden ist. Ein Goldschmied auf Reisen war ganz hin und weg beim Anblick des mächtigen Nichtswesens und machte es sich zur Aufgabe, die Kunde von Barbarizias Schönheit in der Form dieser Puppe zu verbreiten. Er konzentrierte sich bei der Konzipierung wohl besonders auf die originalgetreue Darstellung der wehenden Mähne sowie des wilden Auftretens der Fürstin.
#. fr: Cette poupée est une réplique de l'un des quatre généraux de Golbez, Barbariccia, la maîtresse du vent. Conçue par un orfèvre fasciné par la beauté sauvage de cette créature du néant, il a fait en sorte de retranscrire son incroyable chevelure et sa férocité sans pareille.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Barbariccia minion. Will blow you away─figuratively.
#. column 2: B-Barbariccia... She is come!<br>   - Ciriatto
#. column 3: Hair Raid
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:488:0:1"
msgid "Assuming the likeness of Barbariccia, one of Golbez's four archfiends, this automaton was made according to a blueprint devised by a goldsmith who chanced to witness her. Wishing to share the voidsent queen's unique beauty with others, the artisan focused on capturing her flowing hair and savage grace."
msgstr "Этот автоматон изображает Барбариччию, одну из четырёх архидемонов Голбеза. Его изготовили по чертежу ювелира, которому довелось увидеть её своими глазами. Желая поделиться с другими неповторимой красотой царицы пустотников, мастер постарался передать её струящиеся волосы и дикую грацию."

#. ja: ホラホラホラァッ！
#. de: Hrrraaaah!
#. fr: Vous m'échapperez pas, pauvres larves<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Barbariccia minion. Will blow you away─figuratively.
#. column 1: Assuming the likeness of Barbariccia, one of Golbez's four archfiends, this automaton was made according to a blueprint devised by a goldsmith who chanced to witness her. Wishing to share the voidsent queen's unique beauty with others, the artisan focused on capturing her flowing hair and savage grace.
#. column 3: Hair Raid
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:488:0:2"
msgid "B-Barbariccia... She is come!<br>   - Ciriatto"
msgstr "Б-Барбаричча... Она пришла!<br>   — Чириатто"

#. ja: ヘアレイド
#. de: Haarstreich
#. fr: Raid capillaire
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Barbariccia minion. Will blow you away─figuratively.
#. column 1: Assuming the likeness of Barbariccia, one of Golbez's four archfiends, this automaton was made according to a blueprint devised by a goldsmith who chanced to witness her. Wishing to share the voidsent queen's unique beauty with others, the artisan focused on capturing her flowing hair and savage grace.
#. column 2: B-Barbariccia... She is come!<br>   - Ciriatto
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:488:0:3"
msgid "Hair Raid"
msgstr "Вихрь волос"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵、味方すべてにかかっている、効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle Effekte von allen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe les effets de tous les alliés et ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Barbariccia minion. Will blow you away─figuratively.
#. column 1: Assuming the likeness of Barbariccia, one of Golbez's four archfiends, this automaton was made according to a blueprint devised by a goldsmith who chanced to witness her. Wishing to share the voidsent queen's unique beauty with others, the artisan focused on capturing her flowing hair and savage grace.
#. column 2: B-Barbariccia... She is come!<br>   - Ciriatto
#. column 3: Hair Raid
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:488:0:4"
msgid "Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все эффекты со всех противников и союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「遮光器土偶」を呼び出す。<br>海底で見つかった不思議な土偶
#. de: Du rufst deinen Shakoki-Dogu als Begleiter herbei. Ist er nicht niedlich für eine einfache Tonfigur?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte dogû globuleux, une étrange poterie au regard insondable.
#. column 1: Retrieved from the bottom of the sea, this mysterious clay figurine is entirely hollow and moves by means of magic. While scholars believe that it was used in some manner of ritual during the Second Astral Era, others such as Delion of <i>The Thavnairian Truth</i> fame are convinced it was made in the image of an alien.
#. column 2: Who would have thought that the<br>answer to our prayers would be<br>found in ancient pottery of all places?<br>   - Zlatan
#. column 3: Dogu Power
#. column 4: Renders ally Gates, Shield, and Search Eye impervious to damage.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:489:0:0"
msgid "Summon your goggle-eyed dogu minion. Guaranteed to win any staring contest."
msgstr "Призвать миниатюру догу с выпученными глазами. В соревновании по пяленью победит любого."

#. ja: 海底で見つかった不思議な土偶。中は空洞だが、魔法仕掛けで動き回る。第二星暦時代に何らかの儀式のために作られたようだが、『月刊オカルトファン』のデリオン氏のように、宇宙人を象った偶像だと考える者もいるようだ
#. de: Eine ungewöhnliche Tonfigur, welche in den Tiefen des Meeres entdeckt wurde. Sie ist zwar hohl, bewegt sich aber mithilfe von Magie trotzdem. Ihre Beschaffenheit deutet darauf hin, dass sie wohl in der Zweiten Ära des Lichts für eine Art Zeremonie angefertigt wurde. Einige Affine für das Okkulte, darunter auch Delion von dem Klatschblatt „Okkultist“, gehen sogar so weit zu sagen, dass es sich um ein Abbild eines Außerætherischen handele.
#. fr: Découverte dans les fonds marins, cette statuette est totalement creuse et bouge grâce à un enchantement. Tout porte à croire qu'il s'agit d'une relique religieuse datant de la 2e ère astrale, toutefois certains comme Delion, le rédacteur en chef de L'Occultophile, voient dans cette poterie la repré<shy>sen<shy>ta<shy>tion d'un être d'origine extraterrestre.
#. column 0: Summon your goggle-eyed dogu minion. Guaranteed to win any staring contest.
#. column 2: Who would have thought that the<br>answer to our prayers would be<br>found in ancient pottery of all places?<br>   - Zlatan
#. column 3: Dogu Power
#. column 4: Renders ally Gates, Shield, and Search Eye impervious to damage.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:489:0:1"
msgid "Retrieved from the bottom of the sea, this mysterious clay figurine is entirely hollow and moves by means of magic. While scholars believe that it was used in some manner of ritual during the Second Astral Era, others such as Delion of <i>The Thavnairian Truth</i> fame are convinced it was made in the image of an alien."
msgstr "Эту загадочную глиняную фигурку нашли на морском дне. Она полая внутри и движется с помощью магии. Учёные считают, что во Вторую астральную эру её использовали в каком-то ритуале. А вот Делион из газеты <i>«Правда Тавнаира»</i> и ему подобные уверены, что фигурку сделали по образу инопланетянина."

#. ja: ドグ～
#. de: Dguuu<nbsp>...
#. fr: Dogûûû...
#. column 0: Summon your goggle-eyed dogu minion. Guaranteed to win any staring contest.
#. column 1: Retrieved from the bottom of the sea, this mysterious clay figurine is entirely hollow and moves by means of magic. While scholars believe that it was used in some manner of ritual during the Second Astral Era, others such as Delion of <i>The Thavnairian Truth</i> fame are convinced it was made in the image of an alien.
