#. ja: ミニオン「忍犬クロマル」を呼び出す。<br>ひんがしの国の忍犬。なかなかに情に厚い
#. de: Du rufst deinen Kuromaru als Begleiter herbei. Denn der beste Freund des Ninjas ist der Ninjahund.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Kuromaru, un chien ninja fidèle venu de Hingashi.
#. column 1: This black ninja dog once served the Hingan kunoichi Yozakura. As compassionate as he is loyal, he refused to forsake his mistress even after she had turned into an abomination, and chooses to travel with you as part of a pilgrimage dedicated to her soul.
#. column 2: Nothing short of death will cause<br>a shinobi to forsake his mission.<br>   - Oboro
#. column 3: Dogged Devotion
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 60 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:490:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Kuromaru minion. Because the only thing that's better than a dog is a <i>ninja</i> dog."
msgstr "Призвать миниатюру Куромару. Ведь собака лучше всего, когда она <i>ниндзя</i>."

#. ja: ひんがしの国のくのいち、花遁のヨザクラに仕えていた黒い忍犬。なかなかに情に厚い性格で、主が怪異に堕ちたと知りながらも見捨てることができないでいた。鎮魂の旅を兼ねて、冒険者に付き従うことにしたようだ
#. de: Dieser schwarze Ninjahund war der treue Begleiter der Kunoichi Yozakura. Er folgte seiner Herrin selbst dann noch, als sie sich in ein Ungeheuer verwandelt sah. Als Zeichen dieser Treue folgt er nun dir, um so dem Kampf zu gedenken, der Yozakura endlich Frieden brachte.
#. fr: Second compagnon canin de la shinobi Yozakura l'élusive, ce toutou au grand cœur et au pelage noir n'a pas pu se résoudre à abandonner sa maîtresse. Il choisit de vous accompagner tel un pèlerin en quête d'absolution.
#. column 0: Summon your Kuromaru minion. Because the only thing that's better than a dog is a <i>ninja</i> dog.
#. column 2: Nothing short of death will cause<br>a shinobi to forsake his mission.<br>   - Oboro
#. column 3: Dogged Devotion
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 60 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:490:0:1"
msgid "This black ninja dog once served the Hingan kunoichi Yozakura. As compassionate as he is loyal, he refused to forsake his mistress even after she had turned into an abomination, and chooses to travel with you as part of a pilgrimage dedicated to her soul."
msgstr "Этот чёрный пёс-ниндзя служил куноити Ёзакуре из Хингаси. Он был ей предан и при этом не лишён сострадания: даже когда хозяйка превратилась в чудовище, он не бросил её. Теперь он сопровождает тебя в паломничестве, посвящённом её душе."

#. ja: クゥ～ン♪
#. de: Rrruff! ♪
#. fr: Wouuuf<nbsp>!♪
#. column 0: Summon your Kuromaru minion. Because the only thing that's better than a dog is a <i>ninja</i> dog.
#. column 1: This black ninja dog once served the Hingan kunoichi Yozakura. As compassionate as he is loyal, he refused to forsake his mistress even after she had turned into an abomination, and chooses to travel with you as part of a pilgrimage dedicated to her soul.
#. column 3: Dogged Devotion
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 60 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:490:0:2"
msgid "Nothing short of death will cause<br>a shinobi to forsake his mission.<br>   - Oboro"
msgstr "Ничто, кроме смерти,<br>не заставит синоби бросить своё дело.<br>   — Оборо"

#. ja: ヤダヤダ
#. de: Pfotentreue
#. fr: Pas question<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Kuromaru minion. Because the only thing that's better than a dog is a <i>ninja</i> dog.
