#. ja: ミニオン「オーロサパ」を呼び出す。<br>南洋のアロアロ島に棲息する小鳥。とってもお利口
#. de: Du rufst deinen Uolosapa als Begleiter herbei. Ein Paradiesvögelchen für den Paradiesvogel.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte uolosapa, un petit oiseau très futé originaire des îles méridionales.
#. column 1: One cannot talk about the creatures of the south sea isles without mentioning this pink-beaked sparrow. Since ancient times, its kind have been revered as sacred, and legend speaks of an especially intelligent and friendly specimen that considered itself a servant of the Speaker.
#. column 2: I seem to have made<br>a feathered friend.<br>   - Fufucha
#. column 3: Southern Wind
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:491:0:0"
msgid "Summon your uolosapa minion. To fly after you and perch prettily on your head is its divine calling."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника уолосапа. Его божественное предназначение — лететь за тобой и красиво усаживаться на голове."

#. ja: ピンク色のくちばしが愛らしい小鳥。南洋諸島諸語で「文鳥」を意味する名を持ち、周辺地域を代表する種のひとつでもある。古くから神鳥として崇拝され、人に寄り添い「神子の使い」を名乗るとりわけ賢い個体の存在も伝承に残されている
#. de: Ein niedliches Vögelchen, das besonders mit seinem pinken Schnabel besticht. Diese Spezies wurde schon in alter Zeit als heilig verehrt, und die Legenden sprechen gar von einem besonders cleveren Exemplar, das der Bote der Sprecherin höchstselbst sein soll.
#. fr: Ce petit passereau se distingue par son bec d'un rose chatoyant. On lui attribue une grande in<shy>tel<shy>li<shy>gence, à tel point que les légendes des îles méridionales racontent que certains d'entre eux auraient été vénérés en tant que serviteurs de l'enfant divin.
#. column 0: Summon your uolosapa minion. To fly after you and perch prettily on your head is its divine calling.
#. column 2: I seem to have made<br>a feathered friend.<br>   - Fufucha
#. column 3: Southern Wind
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:491:0:1"
msgid "One cannot talk about the creatures of the south sea isles without mentioning this pink-beaked sparrow. Since ancient times, its kind have been revered as sacred, and legend speaks of an especially intelligent and friendly specimen that considered itself a servant of the Speaker."
msgstr "Говоря о животных южных островов, нельзя не упомянуть этого воробья с розовым клювом. С давних времён его сородичей почитают как священных птиц. В легендах рассказывают об особо умной и дружелюбной птичке, которая считала себя служанкой Говорящей."

#. ja: ぴぴぴ！
#. de: Zwitscher! ♪
#. fr: Pipipi<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your uolosapa minion. To fly after you and perch prettily on your head is its divine calling.
#. column 1: One cannot talk about the creatures of the south sea isles without mentioning this pink-beaked sparrow. Since ancient times, its kind have been revered as sacred, and legend speaks of an especially intelligent and friendly specimen that considered itself a servant of the Speaker.
#. column 3: Southern Wind
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:491:0:2"
msgid "I seem to have made<br>a feathered friend.<br>   - Fufucha"
msgstr "Кажется, я завёл<br>пернатого друга.<br>   — Фуфуча"

#. ja: 南風の癒やし
#. de: Südwind-Segen
#. fr: Brise méridionale
#. column 0: Summon your uolosapa minion. To fly after you and perch prettily on your head is its divine calling.
#. column 1: One cannot talk about the creatures of the south sea isles without mentioning this pink-beaked sparrow. Since ancient times, its kind have been revered as sacred, and legend speaks of an especially intelligent and friendly specimen that considered itself a servant of the Speaker.
#. column 2: I seem to have made<br>a feathered friend.<br>   - Fufucha
#. column 4: Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:491:0:3"
msgid "Southern Wind"
msgstr "Южный ветер"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵、味方すべてにかかっている、効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle Effekte von allen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe les effets de tous les alliés et ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your uolosapa minion. To fly after you and perch prettily on your head is its divine calling.
#. column 1: One cannot talk about the creatures of the south sea isles without mentioning this pink-beaked sparrow. Since ancient times, its kind have been revered as sacred, and legend speaks of an especially intelligent and friendly specimen that considered itself a servant of the Speaker.
#. column 2: I seem to have made<br>a feathered friend.<br>   - Fufucha
#. column 3: Southern Wind
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:491:0:4"
msgid "Removes all effects from all enemies and allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все эффекты со всех противников и союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「東方のツチノコ？」を呼び出す。<br>降神祭の季節に、東方でツチノコとして崇められるらしき何か。何かって何だっけ？
#. de: Du rufst deine Weiße Noko als Begleiter herbei. Wundervoll weich und dazu noch ein echter Glücksbringer.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte vénérable tsuchinoko blanc, un serpent légendaire vénéré durant la fête de la transition en Orient. Ou peut-être est-ce entièrement autre chose...<nbsp>?
#. column 1: Initially thought to be a mere ornament, the hebi bugyo was just as surprised as you were when this squat, snakelike creature began to move of its own accord. Revered in the Far East as a serpentine bringer of luck, it must have wriggled onboard a ship bound for the shores of Limsa Lominsa.
#. column 2: Mocheee!<br>   - The Great White Tsuchinoko
#. column 3: Glutinous Grace
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:492:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Great White Tsuchinoko minion. Delightfully squidgy, and a veritable fountain of good fortune to boot."
msgstr "Призвать миниатюру Великого белого цути-но-ко. Мягонький комочек и настоящий источник удачи!"

#. ja: 東方で幸運を象徴するとされる、白き蛇のような何か。巳奉行が新たな季節を司る「巳」を紹介すべく手配した置物かと思われたが、使節団の船と共にやってきた尊い存在らしい。もっちりの体におやつのみかんを乗せている
#. de: Zuerst wurde sie für eine bloße Dekoration gehalten, daher war die Schlangenministerin genauso überrascht wie du, als dieses gedrungene, schlangenartige Geschöpf sich plötzlich von alleine zu bewegen begann. Im Fernen Osten als Glücksbringer in Schlangengestalt verehrt, muss sie sich auf ein Schiff geschlichen haben, das nach Limsa Lominsa segelte.
#. fr: Cette créature ressemblant à un serpent blanc est vénérée comme un signe de chance en Orient. Cela aurait dû être juste une statuette remise par la maréchale des serpents pour honorer l'animal de l'année, mais il faut croire que celui-ci, bien vivant, est venu à bord du navire de la délégation. Son corps dodu est surmonté d'une mandarine.
#. column 0: Summon your Great White Tsuchinoko minion. Delightfully squidgy, and a veritable fountain of good fortune to boot.
#. column 2: Mocheee!<br>   - The Great White Tsuchinoko
#. column 3: Glutinous Grace
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:492:0:1"
msgid "Initially thought to be a mere ornament, the hebi bugyo was just as surprised as you were when this squat, snakelike creature began to move of its own accord. Revered in the Far East as a serpentine bringer of luck, it must have wriggled onboard a ship bound for the shores of Limsa Lominsa."
msgstr "Сначала хэби-бугё принял это приземистое змееподобное существо за простое украшение. Каково же было его удивление, когда фигурка сама собой зашевелилась! На Дальнем Востоке змеев почитают как вестников удачи, так что, должно быть, этот заполз на корабль, державший путь к берегам Лимсы Ломинсы."

#. ja: モチィっ？
#. de: Mochiii!
#. fr: Mochiii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Great White Tsuchinoko minion. Delightfully squidgy, and a veritable fountain of good fortune to boot.
#. column 1: Initially thought to be a mere ornament, the hebi bugyo was just as surprised as you were when this squat, snakelike creature began to move of its own accord. Revered in the Far East as a serpentine bringer of luck, it must have wriggled onboard a ship bound for the shores of Limsa Lominsa.
#. column 3: Glutinous Grace
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:492:0:2"
msgid "Mocheee!<br>   - The Great White Tsuchinoko"
msgstr "Мочиии!<br>   — Великий белый цути-но-ко"

#. ja: 鏡開き
#. de: Klebrige Eleganz
#. fr: Kagami-biraki
#. column 0: Summon your Great White Tsuchinoko minion. Delightfully squidgy, and a veritable fountain of good fortune to boot.
#. column 1: Initially thought to be a mere ornament, the hebi bugyo was just as surprised as you were when this squat, snakelike creature began to move of its own accord. Revered in the Far East as a serpentine bringer of luck, it must have wriggled onboard a ship bound for the shores of Limsa Lominsa.
#. column 2: Mocheee!<br>   - The Great White Tsuchinoko
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:492:0:3"
msgid "Glutinous Grace"
msgstr "Клейкая грация"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your Great White Tsuchinoko minion. Delightfully squidgy, and a veritable fountain of good fortune to boot.
#. column 1: Initially thought to be a mere ornament, the hebi bugyo was just as surprised as you were when this squat, snakelike creature began to move of its own accord. Revered in the Far East as a serpentine bringer of luck, it must have wriggled onboard a ship bound for the shores of Limsa Lominsa.
#. column 2: Mocheee!<br>   - The Great White Tsuchinoko
#. column 3: Glutinous Grace
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:492:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Даёт 10 очков особых приёмов всем союзникам в радиусе действия, кроме тех, у кого есть приём с таким же эффектом."

#. ja: ミニオン「トルマリンウェポン」を呼び出す。<br>帝国軍基地で発見された試作魔導兵器の縮小模型
#. de: Du rufst deine Turmalin-Waffe als Begleiter herbei. Glücklicherweise blieb diese hier ein Prototyp.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Arme Tourmaline, un modèle réduit d'un prototype d'arme magitek conçu par l'armée impériale.
#. column 1: Retrieved from an imperial base, this scale prototype of a warmachina appears to have been created for heat resistance testing and carries no armaments. After completing their analysis, the Eorzean Alliance saw fit to bestow it upon members as a reward for exemplary service.
#. column 2: Emeralds will do quite nicely.<br>   - Crystal Merchant
#. column 3: Tourmaline Beam
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:493:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Tourmaline Weapon minion. Stands ready to lend you a helping hand or six."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Оружие Турмалин». Готов подставить тебе руку или сразу шесть."

#. ja: 帝国軍基地で発見された試作魔導兵器の縮小模型。どうやら機体の熱源耐性などを検証するための模型であり、武装類は内蔵されていない。押収した都市軍事同盟は、解析の後、演習の成績優秀者向けの報奨としたようだ
#. de: Diese winzige Waffe wurde als Prototyp-Modell auf einer garleischen Militärbasis entdeckt. Allem Anschein nach diente es vor allem dazu, den Hitzewiderstand des Materials zu prüfen, und führt keinerlei Waffen. Die Eorzäische Allianz findet das Modell so drollig, dass es nun als Auszeichnung an die besten Streiter verliehen wird.
#. fr: Découverte dans un entrepôt d'une base garlemaldaise, cette Arme semble avoir été avant tout un modèle d'essai servant à tester l'aérodynamisme de ce type d'engin en vol. Elle ne possède d'ailleurs aucun type d'armement. Après une analyse poussée, les dirigeants de l'Alliance éorzéenne ont choisi de l'offrir à ses membres les plus prestigieux, en guise de récompense pour leur service.
#. column 0: Summon your Tourmaline Weapon minion. Stands ready to lend you a helping hand or six.
#. column 2: Emeralds will do quite nicely.<br>   - Crystal Merchant
#. column 3: Tourmaline Beam
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:493:0:1"
msgid "Retrieved from an imperial base, this scale prototype of a warmachina appears to have been created for heat resistance testing and carries no armaments. After completing their analysis, the Eorzean Alliance saw fit to bestow it upon members as a reward for exemplary service."
msgstr "Эту уменьшенную копию прототипа боевой машины нашли на имперской базе. Похоже, её создали для проверки жаростойкости, и оружия на ней нет. Альянс Эорзеи завершил исследование и решил наградить ею отличившихся в учениях."

#. ja: グォン…
#. de: Nächste Mal wird vorstellen Neuewaffe!<br><i>Brüllvolx</i>
#. fr: Gwon...
#. column 0: Summon your Tourmaline Weapon minion. Stands ready to lend you a helping hand or six.
#. column 1: Retrieved from an imperial base, this scale prototype of a warmachina appears to have been created for heat resistance testing and carries no armaments. After completing their analysis, the Eorzean Alliance saw fit to bestow it upon members as a reward for exemplary service.
#. column 3: Tourmaline Beam
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:493:0:2"
msgid "Emeralds will do quite nicely.<br>   - Crystal Merchant"
msgstr "Изумруды сгодятся.<br>   — Торговец кристаллами"

#. ja: エメラルドビーム
#. de: Smaragdstrahl
#. fr: Rayon émeraude
#. column 0: Summon your Tourmaline Weapon minion. Stands ready to lend you a helping hand or six.
#. column 1: Retrieved from an imperial base, this scale prototype of a warmachina appears to have been created for heat resistance testing and carries no armaments. After completing their analysis, the Eorzean Alliance saw fit to bestow it upon members as a reward for exemplary service.
#. column 2: Emeralds will do quite nicely.<br>   - Crystal Merchant
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:493:0:3"
msgid "Tourmaline Beam"
msgstr "Изумрудный луч"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵にかかっている、強化効果をすべて打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle positiven Effekte von den gegnerischen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe tous les effets bénéfiques des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Tourmaline Weapon minion. Stands ready to lend you a helping hand or six.
#. column 1: Retrieved from an imperial base, this scale prototype of a warmachina appears to have been created for heat resistance testing and carries no armaments. After completing their analysis, the Eorzean Alliance saw fit to bestow it upon members as a reward for exemplary service.
#. column 2: Emeralds will do quite nicely.<br>   - Crystal Merchant
#. column 3: Tourmaline Beam
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:493:0:4"
msgid "Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все положительные эффекты со всех противников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・オシュオン」を呼び出す。<br>旅神オシュオンを模した魔法人形。放浪癖はない
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Oschon als Begleiter herbei. Das Wandern ist des Windes Lust<nbsp>...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Oschon miniature, prête à vous accompagner sur la route toute la divine journée.
#. column 1: Upon seeing the man-made wind-up Halone, Nald'thal was taken by a bout of mischievousness and decided to create an automaton of his own using a jewel buried in the earth. While the resultant product assumes the likeness of Oschon, unlike the deity upon whom it is based, it follows its master faithfully rather than wandering freely.
#. column 2: He's fond of wandering<br>wheresoever his whims<br>take him...<br>   - Krile
#. column 3: Wanderlust
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:494:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Oschon minion. Guaranteed not to wander off on you."
msgstr "Призвать заводного Ошона. Теперь он точно от тебя не убежит."

#. ja: 旅神オシュオンを模した魔法人形。人の手による戦神ハルオーネの魔法人形を見た商神ナルザルが、悪戯心を発揮して大地に眠る宝石を起こして創り上げたもの。放浪癖のあるオシュオン本人と異なり、しっかり付いてきてくれる
#. de: Eine kleine Aufziehpuppe, die nach dem Bild des Wanderers gestaltet ist. Man munkelt, dass sie der zweigesichtige Nald'thal aus den seltensten Edelsteinen erschaffen hat, nachdem er von der kleinen Aufzieh-Halone so angetan war. Im Gegensatz zum echten Oschon wandert dieser hier auch nicht einfach davon.
#. fr: Jaloux du talent de l'orfèvre ayant donné vie à la poupée magique à l'effigie de Halone, Nald'thal a fabriqué cet Oschon miniature avec des pierres rarissimes. Con<shy>trai<shy>re<shy>ment à l'original, elle ne partira pas sans vous à l'aventure.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Oschon minion. Guaranteed not to wander off on you.
#. column 2: He's fond of wandering<br>wheresoever his whims<br>take him...<br>   - Krile
#. column 3: Wanderlust
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:494:0:1"
msgid "Upon seeing the man-made wind-up Halone, Nald'thal was taken by a bout of mischievousness and decided to create an automaton of his own using a jewel buried in the earth. While the resultant product assumes the likeness of Oschon, unlike the deity upon whom it is based, it follows its master faithfully rather than wandering freely."
msgstr "Увидев заводную куклу Халоне, созданную руками смертных, Налд'тал забавы ради решил сделать свою, используя драгоценный камень из недр земли. Так появилась кукла, изображающая Ошона. В отличие от самого божества, она не бродит где вздумается, а верно следует за хозяином."

#. ja: 追イ風ヲ…
#. de: Mögen eure Reisen stets von Rückenwind begleitet sein.<br><i>Oschon</i>
#. fr: Le vent nous appelle...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Oschon minion. Guaranteed not to wander off on you.
#. column 1: Upon seeing the man-made wind-up Halone, Nald'thal was taken by a bout of mischievousness and decided to create an automaton of his own using a jewel buried in the earth. While the resultant product assumes the likeness of Oschon, unlike the deity upon whom it is based, it follows its master faithfully rather than wandering freely.
#. column 3: Wanderlust
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:494:0:2"
msgid "He's fond of wandering<br>wheresoever his whims<br>take him...<br>   - Krile"
msgstr "Он любит странствовать,<br>куда только прихоть<br>его не заведёт...<br>   — Крилэ"

#. ja: 旅立ち
#. de: Aufbruch
#. fr: En route<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Oschon minion. Guaranteed not to wander off on you.
#. column 1: Upon seeing the man-made wind-up Halone, Nald'thal was taken by a bout of mischievousness and decided to create an automaton of his own using a jewel buried in the earth. While the resultant product assumes the likeness of Oschon, unlike the deity upon whom it is based, it follows its master faithfully rather than wandering freely.
#. column 2: He's fond of wandering<br>wheresoever his whims<br>take him...<br>   - Krile
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:494:0:3"
msgid "Wanderlust"
msgstr "Странствия"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンのATKを40上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>15秒
#. de: Erhöht die ATT der ausführenden Trabanten um 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 40 l'attaque des mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Oschon minion. Guaranteed not to wander off on you.
#. column 1: Upon seeing the man-made wind-up Halone, Nald'thal was taken by a bout of mischievousness and decided to create an automaton of his own using a jewel buried in the earth. While the resultant product assumes the likeness of Oschon, unlike the deity upon whom it is based, it follows its master faithfully rather than wandering freely.
#. column 2: He's fond of wandering<br>wheresoever his whims<br>take him...<br>   - Krile
