msgstr "Наносит всем противникам в радиусе действия урон силой 90."

#. ja: ミニオン「トルガル・パピー」を呼び出す。<br>クライヴの大切な相棒、トルガルの幼き姿
#. de: Du rufst deinen kleinen Torgal als Begleiter herbei. Wer ist ein braver Junge?!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Talgor louveteau, ressemblant comme deux gouttes d'eau au fidèle compagnon de Clive.
#. column 1: According to the wandering minstrel, the beast who appeared to aid the stranded Clive was a guiding spirit born of its master's memory. So impressed was the ever-insightful musician by the creature, he decided to recreate a young version of it, which, despite its diminutive size, already possesses the indomitable spirit of the fine hound it will one day become.
#. column 2: What an adorable little<br>puppy you have!<br>   - Hildibrand
#. column 3: Mighty Yip
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:498:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Torgal pup minion. Go on, you know you want to pet the adorable fellow. What could possibly go wrong...?"
msgstr "Призвать щенка Торгала. Ну же, ты ведь хочешь погладить этого милашку. Что может пойти не так?.."

#. ja: クライヴの記憶に基づいて、導き手として降臨したトルガルを見た異邦の詩人が、その幼き姿を夢想して創り上げた存在。身体は小さくとも、心意気は大狼にもひけをとらず、どんなに過酷な旅路にも付き添ってくれるだろう
#. de: Wenn man dem Fahrenden Sänger Glauben schenkt, ist der Vierbeiner, der dem verirrten Clive zur Seite stand, ein geisterhafter Wächter aus dessen Erinnerung. Der Liederschmied war so hingerissen von dem Anblick der mächtigen Kreatur, dass er eine Welpenversion des Tieres schuf. Er mag zwar kleiner als das Original sein, aber das heißt noch lange nicht, dass er nicht schon den starken Willen seines ausgewachsenen Vorbilds besitzt.
#. fr: Grâce à l'aide du ménestrel errant, les souvenirs de Clive ont donné vie à ce double de Talgor alors qu'il n'était encore qu'un louveteau. Malgré son petit gabarit, il vous suivra dans toutes vos aventures car c'est déjà un allié de taille<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Torgal pup minion. Go on, you know you want to pet the adorable fellow. What could possibly go wrong...?
#. column 2: What an adorable little<br>puppy you have!<br>   - Hildibrand
#. column 3: Mighty Yip
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:498:0:1"
msgid "According to the wandering minstrel, the beast who appeared to aid the stranded Clive was a guiding spirit born of its master's memory. So impressed was the ever-insightful musician by the creature, he decided to recreate a young version of it, which, despite its diminutive size, already possesses the indomitable spirit of the fine hound it will one day become."
msgstr "По словам странствующего менестреля, зверь, пришедший на помощь заблудившемуся Клайву, был духом-проводником, рождённым из памяти хозяина. Музыкант, всегда отличавшийся проницательностью, так впечатлился зверем, что решил воссоздать его в щенячьем возрасте. Пусть он и мал, духом он уже не уступает могучему псу, которым однажды станет."

#. ja: クン！
#. de: Na komm, kleines Hündchen, komm zu Papa!<br><i>Hildibrand</i>
#. fr: Ouaf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Torgal pup minion. Go on, you know you want to pet the adorable fellow. What could possibly go wrong...?
#. column 1: According to the wandering minstrel, the beast who appeared to aid the stranded Clive was a guiding spirit born of its master's memory. So impressed was the ever-insightful musician by the creature, he decided to recreate a young version of it, which, despite its diminutive size, already possesses the indomitable spirit of the fine hound it will one day become.
#. column 3: Mighty Yip
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:498:0:2"
msgid "What an adorable little<br>puppy you have!<br>   - Hildibrand"
msgstr "Какой очаровательный<br>щеночек у тебя!<br>   — Хильдибранд"

#. ja: 健気な咆哮
#. de: Kleines Knurren
#. fr: Hurlement fluet
