msgid "Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s"
msgstr "Накладывает на всех противников в радиусе действия слабость к <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>зверям</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「ジェリービーンズ・ピンク」を呼び出す。<br>ゴールドソーサーに現れた不思議な生き物。駆け回りレースをするのが大好き
#. de: Du rufst deine Pinke Bohne als Begleiter herbei. Stelle sie einfach wieder auf die Füße, wenn sie fällt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte haricot rose, une étrange créature apparue au Gold Saucer qui adore faire la course<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Little is known about these mysterious life-forms that suddenly appeared in the Gold Saucer apart from the fact that they love to race, and this specimen has apparently decided that it wants to race you without end. Rumor has it that underneath its rotund exterior is a skeleton that looks like a nightmarish amalgam of man and bird, but there is no ready way to determine the truth.
#. column 2: Let me guess. You've lost...no,<br>broken...no, <i>traded for magical<br>beans</i> the parts we need.<br>   - Jessie
#. column 3: Eliminate
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:499:0:0"
msgid "Summon your pink Bean minion. Three, two, one...GO!"
msgstr "Призвать розового Бобика. Три, два, один... Марш!"

#. ja: 突如としてゴールドソーサーに現れた不思議な生き物。遊技場を訪れた冒険者と、果てなきレースを楽しみたいと考えたようだ。ちなみに、内部にはヒューラン族の脊髄をS字に変形させたような骨格が収まっているとの噂だが……
#. de: Dieses ominöse Kreatürchen tauchte eines Tages im Gold Saucer auf und ist seither auch nicht mehr gegangen. Die Pinke Bohne verbringt ihre Tage damit, in verrückten Wettrennen gegen Abenteurer anzutreten<nbsp>- tagein, tagaus. Einige Gelehrte sind der Meinung, dass in ihrem runden Körper das Skelett eines Hyurans steckt, dessen S-Form extreme Kurven angenommen hat. Am besten denkt man nicht genauer darüber nach<nbsp>...
#. fr: Apparue pour la première fois au Gold Saucer, cette curieuse forme de vie passe le plus clair de son temps à inciter tous les aventuriers du coin à la rejoindre dans des courses insolites. On dit que sa colonne vertébrale ressemblerait à celle d'un Hyur, tordue en forme de S...
#. column 0: Summon your pink Bean minion. Three, two, one...GO!
#. column 2: Let me guess. You've lost...no,<br>broken...no, <i>traded for magical<br>beans</i> the parts we need.<br>   - Jessie
#. column 3: Eliminate
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:499:0:1"
msgid "Little is known about these mysterious life-forms that suddenly appeared in the Gold Saucer apart from the fact that they love to race, and this specimen has apparently decided that it wants to race you without end. Rumor has it that underneath its rotund exterior is a skeleton that looks like a nightmarish amalgam of man and bird, but there is no ready way to determine the truth."
msgstr "Об этих загадочных существах, внезапно появившихся в Золотом блюдце, известно мало. Зато точно известно, что они обожают бегать наперегонки. Этот экземпляр, похоже, готов состязаться с тобой до бесконечности. Ходят слухи, что под его круглым туловищем скрывается скелет — жуткая помесь человека и птицы. Проверить это, впрочем, непросто."

#. ja: ホーホー！
#. de: Wuu Wuu!
#. fr: Wou hou<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your pink Bean minion. Three, two, one...GO!
#. column 1: Little is known about these mysterious life-forms that suddenly appeared in the Gold Saucer apart from the fact that they love to race, and this specimen has apparently decided that it wants to race you without end. Rumor has it that underneath its rotund exterior is a skeleton that looks like a nightmarish amalgam of man and bird, but there is no ready way to determine the truth.
#. column 3: Eliminate
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
