msgctxt "CompanionTransient:499:0:2"
msgid "Let me guess. You've lost...no,<br>broken...no, <i>traded for magical<br>beans</i> the parts we need.<br>   - Jessie"
msgstr "Дай угадаю. Ты потерял... нет,<br>сломал... нет, <i>променял на волшебные<br>бобы</i> нужные нам детали.<br>   — Джесси"

#. ja: エリミネイト
#. de: Ausscheiden
#. fr: Élimination
#. column 0: Summon your pink Bean minion. Three, two, one...GO!
#. column 1: Little is known about these mysterious life-forms that suddenly appeared in the Gold Saucer apart from the fact that they love to race, and this specimen has apparently decided that it wants to race you without end. Rumor has it that underneath its rotund exterior is a skeleton that looks like a nightmarish amalgam of man and bird, but there is no ready way to determine the truth.
#. column 2: Let me guess. You've lost...no,<br>broken...no, <i>traded for magical<br>beans</i> the parts we need.<br>   - Jessie
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:499:0:3"
msgid "Eliminate"
msgstr "Выбывание"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵をノックバックさせる。
#. de: Schleudert die Gegner in der Nähe zurück.
#. fr: Projette en arrière les ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your pink Bean minion. Three, two, one...GO!
#. column 1: Little is known about these mysterious life-forms that suddenly appeared in the Gold Saucer apart from the fact that they love to race, and this specimen has apparently decided that it wants to race you without end. Rumor has it that underneath its rotund exterior is a skeleton that looks like a nightmarish amalgam of man and bird, but there is no ready way to determine the truth.
#. column 2: Let me guess. You've lost...no,<br>broken...no, <i>traded for magical<br>beans</i> the parts we need.<br>   - Jessie
#. column 3: Eliminate
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:499:0:4"
msgid "Knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Отбрасывает всех противников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「ペグウィン」を呼び出す。<br>ゴールドソーサーに現れた不思議なオートマトン。縦横無尽に走り回る
#. de: Du rufst deinen Pegwin als Begleiter herbei. Halte ihn bloß von Klippen fern, du Monster.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Pegwin, un étrange automate qui courait partout dans le Gold Saucer<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Suddenly appearing in the Gold Saucer alongside the Beans, these winsome little automata love nothing more than being in the thick of a race and chased around like a prize. Rumor has it they were created by a friend of the Beans, who was inspired by a penguin they had witnessed somewhere out there.
#. column 2: My, what charming little toys.<br>   - Kan-E-Senna
#. column 3: Scurry
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:500:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Pegwin minion. You chased after it; now it chases after you."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника Пегвина. Ты за ним гонялся, теперь он гоняется за тобой."

#. ja: ゴールドソーサーに現れたジェリービーンズが伴ってきた、鳥型のオートマトン。ジェリービーンズの仲間が、どこかで見かけたペンギンの姿を模して製作したもの。レースに紛れ込んでは、追いかけられるのを好む性分らしい
#. de: Eine kleine Marionette, die sich in Begleitung der ominösen Pinken Bohne befand, die eines Tages im Gold Saucer auftauchte. Scheinbar wurde sie gar von besagter Bohne gebaut, um einen Freund zu haben. So verwundert es kaum, dass sie der Bohne auf Schritt und Tritt folgt und sich ebenso waghalsig in Rennen stürzt, dies aber jedes Mal rasch zu bereuen scheint.
#. fr: Les haricots s'arrachent cet automate aviaire, qui serait inexplicablement apparu en même temps qu'eux au Gold Saucer. Fabriquée par un amateur de pingouins, cette poupée ne rate jamais une course, car elle adore être poursuivie.
#. column 0: Summon your Pegwin minion. You chased after it; now it chases after you.
#. column 2: My, what charming little toys.<br>   - Kan-E-Senna
#. column 3: Scurry
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:500:0:1"
msgid "Suddenly appearing in the Gold Saucer alongside the Beans, these winsome little automata love nothing more than being in the thick of a race and chased around like a prize. Rumor has it they were created by a friend of the Beans, who was inspired by a penguin they had witnessed somewhere out there."
msgstr "Эти милые автоматоны появились в Золотом блюдце вместе с бобиками. Они обожают участвовать в гонках и носиться за призом, словно сами они — ценный трофей. Говорят, их создал друг бобиков, вдохновившись пингвином, которого где-то повстречал."

#. ja: ペグ～
#. de: Pegwiii!
#. fr: Peg, peg<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Pegwin minion. You chased after it; now it chases after you.
#. column 1: Suddenly appearing in the Gold Saucer alongside the Beans, these winsome little automata love nothing more than being in the thick of a race and chased around like a prize. Rumor has it they were created by a friend of the Beans, who was inspired by a penguin they had witnessed somewhere out there.
#. column 3: Scurry
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
