msgctxt "CompanionTransient:500:0:2"
msgid "My, what charming little toys.<br>   - Kan-E-Senna"
msgstr "Какие милые игрушки!<br>   — Кан-Э-Сенна"

#. ja: 走り回る
#. de: Herumgewatschel
#. fr: Cavale
#. column 0: Summon your Pegwin minion. You chased after it; now it chases after you.
