msgid "Scurry"
msgstr "Суета"

#. ja: 敵が配置したトラップがある場合、解除する。
#. de: Entfernt eine vom Gegner aufgestellte Falle.
#. fr: Désamorce les pièges des ennemis.
#. column 0: Summon your Pegwin minion. You chased after it; now it chases after you.
#. column 1: Suddenly appearing in the Gold Saucer alongside the Beans, these winsome little automata love nothing more than being in the thick of a race and chased around like a prize. Rumor has it they were created by a friend of the Beans, who was inspired by a penguin they had witnessed somewhere out there.
#. column 2: My, what charming little toys.<br>   - Kan-E-Senna
