msgstr "Обезвреживает установленную противником ловушку."

#. ja: ミニオン「ハイデリン・アイドル」を呼び出す。<br>光の化身を模した魔法人形。鋭いキックが持ち味
#. de: Du rufst deinen Hydaelyn-Götzen als Begleiter herbei. Eine Miniaturversion der Verkörperung des Lichts. Ihr Tritt soll wohl Schicksale entscheiden können.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte idole Hydaelyn, ses coups de pieds sont stellaires<nbsp>!
#. column 1: This automaton was inspired by Hydaelyn as She was depicted in an ancient cave mural. Held to be the will of the star and the embodiment of Light, She guided many a mortal soul in Her age-old conflict with Her bitter rival Zodiark, whom She divided into fourteen parts with─if the artist is to be believed─a mighty kick.
#. column 2: Please, Mother Hydaelyn!<br>Hearken to our plea! Lend<br>us Your divine Light!<br>   - Minfilia
#. column 3: Blessing of Light
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:501:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Hydaelyn idol minion. When you ask your mother if you can have Hydaelyn, but she says you already have Hydaelyn at home."
msgstr "Призвать миниатюру-идол Хайделин. Когда просишь маму купить Хайделин, а она отвечает, что Хайделин уже есть дома."

#. ja: 古の災厄を描いた、とある洞窟壁画の図像をもとに製作された偶像。星の意思を司る光の化身として、多くの使徒や戦士たちを導いてきたとされる。闇の化身とは犬猿の仲であり、太古の戦いにおいては相手を十四分割する激しい蹴り技を披露したという
#. de: Dieser Götze basiert auf den Darstellungen einer Wand<shy>maler<shy>ei, welche in einer gewissen Höhle bestaunt werden kann. Angeblich soll das dargestellte Wesen als Verkörperung des Lichts den Willen des Planeten an seine Anhänger weitergegeben haben, um sie vor einer bevorstehenden Katastrophe zu bewahren. Mit dem die Dunkelheit verkörpernden Wesen lag es lange im Streit, wobei es seinen Rivalen mit einem gehörigen Tritt in vierzehn Teile zersplittert haben soll.
#. fr: Une statuette inspirée de peintures rupestres, relatant un fléau ancien sous la forme d'une pluie d'étoiles. Devenue la volonté de la planète, elle a guidé les pas de bien des générations d'aventuriers. Elle ne supporte pas l'incarnation des Ténèbres, qu'elle aurait brisée en quatorze fragments d'un coup de pied bien senti.
#. column 0: Summon your Hydaelyn idol minion. When you ask your mother if you can have Hydaelyn, but she says you already have Hydaelyn at home.
#. column 2: Please, Mother Hydaelyn!<br>Hearken to our plea! Lend<br>us Your divine Light!<br>   - Minfilia
#. column 3: Blessing of Light
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:501:0:1"
msgid "This automaton was inspired by Hydaelyn as She was depicted in an ancient cave mural. Held to be the will of the star and the embodiment of Light, She guided many a mortal soul in Her age-old conflict with Her bitter rival Zodiark, whom She divided into fourteen parts with─if the artist is to be believed─a mighty kick."
msgstr "Этот автоматон создан по образу Хайделин с древней пещерной фрески. Считается, что Хайделин воплощает Свет и волю звезды и вела за собой множество смертных в извечной борьбе со своим заклятым соперником Зодиарком. По словам художника, она разделила его на четырнадцать частей могучим пинком."

#. ja: パァァァ
#. de: Hwaah!
#. fr: Pah<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Hydaelyn idol minion. When you ask your mother if you can have Hydaelyn, but she says you already have Hydaelyn at home.
#. column 1: This automaton was inspired by Hydaelyn as She was depicted in an ancient cave mural. Held to be the will of the star and the embodiment of Light, She guided many a mortal soul in Her age-old conflict with Her bitter rival Zodiark, whom She divided into fourteen parts with─if the artist is to be believed─a mighty kick.
#. column 3: Blessing of Light
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:501:0:2"
msgid "Please, Mother Hydaelyn!<br>Hearken to our plea! Lend<br>us Your divine Light!<br>   - Minfilia"
msgstr "Матушка Хайделин, прошу!<br>Услышь нашу мольбу! Даруй<br>нам свой божественный Свет!<br>   — Минфилия"

#. ja: 光の加護
#. de: Gnade des Lichts
#. fr: Bénédiction de la Lumière
#. column 0: Summon your Hydaelyn idol minion. When you ask your mother if you can have Hydaelyn, but she says you already have Hydaelyn at home.
#. column 1: This automaton was inspired by Hydaelyn as She was depicted in an ancient cave mural. Held to be the will of the star and the embodiment of Light, She guided many a mortal soul in Her age-old conflict with Her bitter rival Zodiark, whom She divided into fourteen parts with─if the artist is to be believed─a mighty kick.
#. column 2: Please, Mother Hydaelyn!<br>Hearken to our plea! Lend<br>us Your divine Light!<br>   - Minfilia
