#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ジタン」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。おまえが行くって言ったからさ
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Zidane als Begleiter herbei. Dieser Held aus vergangenen Tagen hat eine ganz schön große Klappe.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Djidane miniature, elle est venue parce que vous le lui avez demandé<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Once upon a time, there lived a debonair youth who belonged to a band of thieves masquerading as a theater troupe. Legend holds that he and his fellows set out to kidnap a royal princess─an act that led him to embark upon a quest to ensure the very survival of the star.
#. column 2: You don't need a reason.<br>   - Zidane
#. column 3: What's That!?
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:504:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Zidane minion. Despite appearances, he isn't one for monkeying around."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Зидана. Не верь внешности: обезьянничать он не станет."

#. ja: 古の英雄「ジタン」を模した魔法人形。劇場艇を根城に活動する劇団の舞台役者だが、盗賊であったとも語られる。とある王女の誘拐事件を企てたことから、長き旅路に出ることになった。おまえが行くって言ったからさ
#. de: Dieser junge Held soll seinen Lebens<shy>unter<shy>halt wohl hauptsächlich als Mitglied einer berühmten Schau<shy>spieler<shy>gruppe verdient haben. Es gibt aber nicht wenige Anzeichen, dass er zugleich als Bandit tätig war. So soll seine Verwicklung in die Entführung einer gewissen Prinzessin der Beginn einer langen und fantastischen Reise gewesen sein.
#. fr: Un pantin créé à l'image de Djidane, un héros des temps anciens. On dit que ce voleur au grand cœur aurait enlevé une princesse et que ce méfait l'aurait entrainé dans une grande aventure... juste parce qu'elle le lui avait demandé<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Zidane minion. Despite appearances, he isn't one for monkeying around.
#. column 2: You don't need a reason.<br>   - Zidane
#. column 3: What's That!?
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:504:0:1"
msgid "Once upon a time, there lived a debonair youth who belonged to a band of thieves masquerading as a theater troupe. Legend holds that he and his fellows set out to kidnap a royal princess─an act that led him to embark upon a quest to ensure the very survival of the star."
msgstr "Жил-был обаятельный юноша из банды воров, прикрывавшейся театральной труппой. Легенда гласит, что он с товарищами задумал похитить принцессу. Так он отправился в путь, чтобы спасти саму звезду."

#. ja: 理由ガイルカイ？
#. de: Braucht es wirklich einen Grund?
#. fr: Il faut une raison<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Zidane minion. Despite appearances, he isn't one for monkeying around.
#. column 1: Once upon a time, there lived a debonair youth who belonged to a band of thieves masquerading as a theater troupe. Legend holds that he and his fellows set out to kidnap a royal princess─an act that led him to embark upon a quest to ensure the very survival of the star.
#. column 3: What's That!?
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
