#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ガーネット」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。私はひとりじゃないんだ
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-Garnet als Begleiter herbei. Diese Heldin aus vergangenen Tagen weiß ganz genau, wie wichtig Freunde sind.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Grenat miniature, elle se sent moins seule...
#. column 1: Once upon a time, there lived a princess who hailed from a long line of summoners. Legend holds that she was abducted by a band of thieves, whereupon she set out on a journey under an assumed identity. Possessed of an angelic voice, she often hummed beautiful songs that touched the heart.
#. column 2: Please come back.<br>   - Garnet
#. column 3: The Queen's Command
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:505:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Garnet minion. She's not alone─she's following you."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Гарнет. Она не одна — она следует за тобой."

#. ja: 古の英雄「ガーネット」を模した魔法人形。ある王国の次期王位継承者であったが、盗賊団との邂逅から偽名を使い旅したとされる召喚士。美しい歌声を持ち、記憶に残る歌をよく口ずさんでいたという。私はひとりじゃないんだ
#. de: Diese junge Heldin galt einst als Thronerbin eines mächtigen Königreiches. Ihre Entführung durch einen gewissen Banditen eröffnete ihr jedoch die Pforten zu einer Reise voller Freund<shy>schaft und Abenteuer. Auf dieser Reise hatte sie stets ein Lied auf den Lippen, welches für stundenlange Ohrwürmer bei allen Zuhörern gesorgt haben soll.
#. fr: Un pantin créé à l'image de Grenat, une héroïne des temps anciens. Invokeur émérite de sang royal, on dit que son enlèvement par un simple voleur l'aurait entrainée dans une grande aventure. Elle aime chanter de sa voix mélodieuse pour se sentir moins seule et être plus positive.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Garnet minion. She's not alone─she's following you.
#. column 2: Please come back.<br>   - Garnet
#. column 3: The Queen's Command
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:505:0:1"
msgid "Once upon a time, there lived a princess who hailed from a long line of summoners. Legend holds that she was abducted by a band of thieves, whereupon she set out on a journey under an assumed identity. Possessed of an angelic voice, she often hummed beautiful songs that touched the heart."
msgstr "Жила-была принцесса из древнего рода призывателей. По легенде, её похитила банда воров, и тогда она отправилась в путь под чужим именем. У неё был ангельский голос, и она часто напевала прекрасные песни, трогавшие сердца."

#. ja: 必ズ帰ッテキテ…
#. de: Bitte, komm zurück!
#. fr: Promets-moi de revenir...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Garnet minion. She's not alone─she's following you.
#. column 1: Once upon a time, there lived a princess who hailed from a long line of summoners. Legend holds that she was abducted by a band of thieves, whereupon she set out on a journey under an assumed identity. Possessed of an angelic voice, she often hummed beautiful songs that touched the heart.
#. column 3: The Queen's Command
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:505:0:2"
msgid "Please come back.<br>   - Garnet"
msgstr "Пожалуйста, возвращайся.<br>   — Гарнет"

#. ja: 王女の一声
#. de: Bezaubernder Gesang
#. fr: Injonction royale
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Garnet minion. She's not alone─she's following you.
#. column 1: Once upon a time, there lived a princess who hailed from a long line of summoners. Legend holds that she was abducted by a band of thieves, whereupon she set out on a journey under an assumed identity. Possessed of an angelic voice, she often hummed beautiful songs that touched the heart.
#. column 2: Please come back.<br>   - Garnet
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:505:0:3"
msgid "The Queen's Command"
msgstr "Приказ королевы"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵を移動不可にする。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>5秒
