#. ja: ミニオン「エアスピナーM9」を呼び出す。<br>新生アレクサンドリア連王国製の単座浮行機を模した玩具。かん高い音で飛び回る
#. de: Du rufst deinen kleinen Luftraser M9 als Begleiter herbei. Ein unüberhörbares Spielzeug, das einem einsitzigen Luftfahrzeug aus dem Königreich Neu-Alexandria nachempfunden ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte motodrone M9, un jouet à l'image d'un aéronef monoplace développé par le royaume de Néo-Alexandrie.
#. column 1: This toy model of the air-wheeler A9 electrope-powered vehicle is tremendously popular amongst the children of Solution Nine. It is said that, in the past, a fleet of these were fitted with lights and flown in formation as part of magnificent fireworks displays.
#. column 2: The wheels turn into wings<br>and it goes flying off into<br>the sky! It's amazing!<br>   - Wayward Child
#. column 3: Hyper Speed
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:508:0:0"
msgid "Summon your air-wheeler M9 minion. Will whoosh, vroom, and zoom its way into your inner's child heart."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Аэровелосипед М9». Его жужжание и рёв растопят сердце даже самого взрослого ребёнка."

#. ja: エレクトロープ製浮行機「エアスピナーA9」を模した玩具。ソリューション・ナインの子どもに高い人気を誇る。なお、かつて花火と共に、照明器具を搭載した本機の編隊を使って夜空を彩るショーが開かれたこともあったとか
#. de: Ein Spielzeug, das einem Flugzeug aus Elektrob nachempfunden ist, das sich besonders bei Kindern in Lösung Neun größter Beliebtheit erfreut<nbsp>- dem Luftraser M9. Früher wurden diese Fluggeräte mit Lampen ausgestattet, um bei Feuerwerksspektakeln am Himmel Pirouetten zu drehen.
#. fr: Ce jouet est une réplique du Motodrone A9, un aéronef en électrope. Il est très populaire auprès des enfants de Solution Neuf. Autrefois, de véritables escadres de ces appareils auraient été équipées de lampes afin d'effectuer des pirouettes dans le ciel lors de spectacles de feux d'artifice.
#. column 0: Summon your air-wheeler M9 minion. Will whoosh, vroom, and zoom its way into your inner's child heart.
#. column 2: The wheels turn into wings<br>and it goes flying off into<br>the sky! It's amazing!<br>   - Wayward Child
#. column 3: Hyper Speed
#. column 4: Increases movement speed of all allies within range by 35%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:508:0:1"
msgid "This toy model of the air-wheeler A9 electrope-powered vehicle is tremendously popular amongst the children of Solution Nine. It is said that, in the past, a fleet of these were fitted with lights and flown in formation as part of magnificent fireworks displays."
msgstr "Эта игрушечная модель аэровелосипеда А9 на электропах пользуется огромной популярностью у детей Решения Девять. Говорят, когда-то целый эскадрон таких машин оснастили огнями и запустили в небо строем, устроив великолепное шоу фейерверков."

#. ja: ゥィィィィィィィィ
#. de: Wruuumm!
#. fr: Vouiiiim<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your air-wheeler M9 minion. Will whoosh, vroom, and zoom its way into your inner's child heart.
#. column 1: This toy model of the air-wheeler A9 electrope-powered vehicle is tremendously popular amongst the children of Solution Nine. It is said that, in the past, a fleet of these were fitted with lights and flown in formation as part of magnificent fireworks displays.
