#. ja: 景気づけのペッ
#. de: Freudenspucker
#. fr: Crachat exaltant
#. column 0: Summon your alpaca cria minion. Rest assured its spit isn't smelly. Yet.
#. column 1: Born and raised at the ranch in Wachunpelo, this adolescent alpaca has a mild temperament and friendly disposition. Owing to its young age, its spit has yet to become smelly, so if you wish to indulge in its irresistible fluffiness, now is the ideal time.
