#. ja: ミニオン「ハニーサッカー」を呼び出す。<br>トラル大陸に棲まう吸血生物の幼体。実はまだ血の味が苦手
#. de: Du rufst deinen Nektarsauger als Begleiter herbei. Ernährt sich diese Art eigentlich auch von Blut, so bekommt diesem Exemplar der Geschmack noch nicht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte suce-nectar, un petit suce-sang originaire du Tural... qui n'aime pas le goût du sang et se contente de sucer le nectar des fleurs.
#. column 1: This juvenile creature belongs to a bloodsucking species native to Yok Tural known for preying upon livestock. Owing to their sanguine eyes, sharp fangs, protruding tongue, and spiky back, they have long been feared as demons, but they are harmless when young, feeding only on nectar until they are able to hunt.
#. column 2: Suck the life out of my<br>precious trees, will you!?<br>   - Gabineaux
#. column 3: Slurp
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:510:0:0"
msgid "Summon your honeysuckler minion. Doesn't have a taste for blood...yet."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Медосос». Кровь ему пока не по вкусу... пока что."

#. ja: ヨカ・トラルに棲息する吸血生物の幼体。家畜の血を吸う害獣で知られ、赤い眼と背筋に並んだトゲ、吸血用の牙と長く伸ばした舌から、古くより悪鬼と怖れられてきた。幼い頃は狩りができないため、花の蜜を吸って成長するらしい
#. de: Ein blutsaugendes Lebewesen heimisch auf Yok Tural. Besonders häufig fällt dieser Art Weidevieh zum Opfer, und aufgrund ihrer roten Augen, spitzen Rückenstacheln, scharfen Reißzähne und langen Zunge wird sie seit jeher als Dämon gefürchtet. Die jüngeren Exemplare begnügen sich anfangs mit Blumennektar, bis sie alt genug sind, ebenfalls auf die Jagd zu gehen.
#. fr: Originaires du Yok Tural, ces créatures sont tristement célèbres pour la manière dont elles sucent le sang du bétail. Par ailleurs, leurs yeux et épines dorsales rouges ainsi que leurs crocs pointus et leur langue pendante leur ont valu d'être considérées comme des démons. Toutefois, incapables d'aspirer le sang, les jeunes spécimens comme celui-ci se nourrissent uniquement du nectar des plantes.
#. column 0: Summon your honeysuckler minion. Doesn't have a taste for blood...yet.
#. column 2: Suck the life out of my<br>precious trees, will you!?<br>   - Gabineaux
#. column 3: Slurp
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:510:0:1"
msgid "This juvenile creature belongs to a bloodsucking species native to Yok Tural known for preying upon livestock. Owing to their sanguine eyes, sharp fangs, protruding tongue, and spiky back, they have long been feared as demons, but they are harmless when young, feeding only on nectar until they are able to hunt."
msgstr "Этот детёныш принадлежит к виду кровососущих существ, обитающих в Йок-Турале и охотящихся на скот. Из-за красных глаз, острых клыков, длинного языка и колючей спины их издавна считают демонами. Но пока они малы, эти существа безвредны и питаются лишь цветочным нектаром, пока не научатся охотиться."

#. ja: チュパチュパ…
#. de: \<schlürf>
#. fr: Slurp, slurp<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your honeysuckler minion. Doesn't have a taste for blood...yet.
#. column 1: This juvenile creature belongs to a bloodsucking species native to Yok Tural known for preying upon livestock. Owing to their sanguine eyes, sharp fangs, protruding tongue, and spiky back, they have long been feared as demons, but they are harmless when young, feeding only on nectar until they are able to hunt.
#. column 3: Slurp
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:510:0:2"
msgid "Suck the life out of my<br>precious trees, will you!?<br>   - Gabineaux"
msgstr "Не смей высасывать жизнь из<br>моих драгоценных деревьев!<br>   — Габино"

#. ja: チュパチュパ
#. de: Ausschlürfen
#. fr: Léchouille collante
#. column 0: Summon your honeysuckler minion. Doesn't have a taste for blood...yet.
#. column 1: This juvenile creature belongs to a bloodsucking species native to Yok Tural known for preying upon livestock. Owing to their sanguine eyes, sharp fangs, protruding tongue, and spiky back, they have long been feared as demons, but they are harmless when young, feeding only on nectar until they are able to hunt.
#. column 2: Suck the life out of my<br>precious trees, will you!?<br>   - Gabineaux
