msgstr "Чмок-чмок"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵にかかっている、強化効果をすべて打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle positiven Effekte von den gegnerischen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe tous les effets bénéfiques des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your honeysuckler minion. Doesn't have a taste for blood...yet.
#. column 1: This juvenile creature belongs to a bloodsucking species native to Yok Tural known for preying upon livestock. Owing to their sanguine eyes, sharp fangs, protruding tongue, and spiky back, they have long been feared as demons, but they are harmless when young, feeding only on nectar until they are able to hunt.
#. column 2: Suck the life out of my<br>precious trees, will you!?<br>   - Gabineaux
#. column 3: Slurp
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:510:0:4"
msgid "Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все положительные эффекты со всех врагов в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「ミドルホーン」を呼び出す。<br>荒野に棲まう羊の幼体。角の大きさは成長期待値
#. de: Du rufst dein Halblanghorn als Begleiter herbei. Die Horngröße entspricht dem erwarteten Wachstum. Es kommt eben doch manchmal auf die Größe an.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mouflon mignon, un jeune ovin originaire des plaines arides et dont la longueur des cornes indique la force future.
#. column 1: The horns of this Turali sheep can weigh as much as thirty-three ponzes, and the sound of their clashing in territorial battles is said to echo for malms around. Juvenile specimens that develop prominent horns are a rarity, held to be an elite among its kind.
#. column 2: They call me “the Ram that batters,”<br>not the “battered sheep”!<br>   - Isaudorel
#. column 3: Meadow Eyes
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:511:0:0"
msgid "Summon your not-so-bighorn minion. The bigger the horns, the brighter the future."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Не совсем большой баран». Чем больше рога, тем светлее будущее."

#. ja: 西方トラル大陸に棲まう、大柄な羊の幼体。大きな巻角を持ち、成体のものは33ポンズにもなる。縄張り争いのため同種同士で強靭な角をぶつけ合う音は、荒野に響くほど。幼体でも角が目立つ個体は、将来を約束されたエリートである
#. de: Dieses aus Tural stammende Wildschaf zeichnet sich durch seine gebogenen Hörner aus, die bis zu 33 Ponzen wiegen können. Es ist nicht ungewöhnlich, dass es zu Territorialstreitigkeiten kommt. Oft hört man über weite Distanzen hinweg das laute, dumpfe Geräusch, das entsteht, wenn sie ihre Köpfe gegeneinanderstoßen. Die Größe der Hörner gibt Aufschluss darüber, ob es später ein dominantes Tier werden wird.
#. fr: Cette espèce d'ovin originaire du Tural se caractérise par ses cornes incurvées qui peuvent peser jusqu'à trente-trois ponz. D'ailleurs, il n'est pas rare d'entendre à travers les plaines le bruit produit par deux mâles qui se battent en cognant leurs têtes l'une contre l'autre. La taille des cornes d'un jeune mouflon permet de savoir s'il deviendra plus tard un animal dominant.
#. column 0: Summon your not-so-bighorn minion. The bigger the horns, the brighter the future.
#. column 2: They call me “the Ram that batters,”<br>not the “battered sheep”!<br>   - Isaudorel
#. column 3: Meadow Eyes
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:511:0:1"
msgid "The horns of this Turali sheep can weigh as much as thirty-three ponzes, and the sound of their clashing in territorial battles is said to echo for malms around. Juvenile specimens that develop prominent horns are a rarity, held to be an elite among its kind."
msgstr "Рога этой туральской овцы могут весить до тридцати трёх понз. Говорят, грохот от схваток за территорию, когда бараны сталкиваются рогами, слышен за много миль. Детёныши с особенно крупными рогами встречаются редко и считаются элитой среди сородичей."

#. ja: ぶぉ～ん
#. de: Bäääh!
#. fr: Bêêêh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your not-so-bighorn minion. The bigger the horns, the brighter the future.
#. column 1: The horns of this Turali sheep can weigh as much as thirty-three ponzes, and the sound of their clashing in territorial battles is said to echo for malms around. Juvenile specimens that develop prominent horns are a rarity, held to be an elite among its kind.
