msgid "Well, well, look what<br>the coeurl drug in!<br>   - Baderon"
msgstr "Гляди-ка, кого коэрл<br>притащил!<br>   — Бадерон"

#. ja: 狩人の唸り
#. de: Raubtiergebrüll
#. fr: Rugissement de prédateur
#. column 0: Summon your Ilyikty'i minion. A little cub that has aspirations to be a great hunter.
#. column 1: A close cousin to the coeurl, this feline native to Yak T'el has long been revered by the Xbr'aal, who are known to take in lost cubs to raise as capable hunting beasts. This particular creature has taken to you, and seems intent on honing its skills at your side.
#. column 2: Well, well, look what<br>the coeurl drug in!<br>   - Baderon
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
