#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方にかかっている、弱体効果を打ち消す。
#. de: Entfernt alle negativen Effekte von eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe.
#. fr: Dissipe toutes les altérations d'état des alliés dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your Squeak the Coyote minion. Quiet as a cloud and swift as a lightning bolt when on the prowl.
#. column 1: Being on the small side for a coyote, this creature might be mistaken for a fox save for its distinct greyish brown coat. It was roaming the land in search of purpose when it stowed away on a merchantman to arrive at the Wolves' Den, but not before being named “Squeak” by the sailor who discovered it in the ship's hold.
