msgid "Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все отрицательные эффекты со всех союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「ロローロ・テー」を呼び出す。<br>ウォーコー・ゾーモーの小さな雪の精。まんまるの頭部が眩しい
#. de: Du rufst deinen Rororrlo Teh als Begleiter herbei. Seinen kugelrunden Kopf könnte man glatt für einen Schneeball halten!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte rororrlo teh, un petit esprit de la neige originaire des hauteurs de Worqor Zormor et dont la tête est éblouissante.
#. column 1: In the Yok Huy tongue, the name of this being means “a tiny little snow spirit that shines as if smiling in the moonlight.” They are born in the mountains of Urqopacha when the moon illuminates the snow, and when approximately four of them combine, they are said to become the larger Rorrlo Teh.
#. column 2: Now give me a Coerthan winter!<br>Enough ice and snow to bury a behemoth!<br>   - Pipin
#. column 3: Powder Snow
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:515:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Rororrlo Teh minion. Caution: staring directly at its head may result in temporary blindness."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника Ророррло Тех. Внимание: если смотреть прямо на его голову, можно временно ослепнуть."

#. ja: オルコ・パチャの高標高地で、月光を浴びた雪から生まれる妖精。名はヨカフイ族の言葉で「月光を受け微笑むように輝いた、小さな小さな白き雪の精」を意味する。数匹集め、丸めて捏ねるとひと回り大きいローロ・テーになるらしい
#. de: Diese kleine Fee wurde aus dem mondbeschienenen Schnee in den Bergen von Urqopacha geboren. In der Sprache der Yok Huy bedeutet ihr Name „kleiner Geist aus unberührtem Schnee, der lächelnd im Mondlicht leuchtet“. Fügt man mehrere dieser Wesen zu einem runden Ball zusammen, entsteht ein größeres Rorrlo Teh.
#. fr: Ce petit lutin est né du rayonnement de la lune sur la neige dans les hauteurs d'Urqopacha. Dans la langue des Yok Huy, son nom signifie “tout petit esprit de neige immaculée qui brille en souriant sous la lueur de la lune”. Rassembler plusieurs de ces êtres et les mélanger ensemble aura pour effet de créer un rorrlo teh, qui est plus grand.
#. column 0: Summon your Rororrlo Teh minion. Caution: staring directly at its head may result in temporary blindness.
#. column 2: Now give me a Coerthan winter!<br>Enough ice and snow to bury a behemoth!<br>   - Pipin
#. column 3: Powder Snow
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:515:0:1"
msgid "In the Yok Huy tongue, the name of this being means “a tiny little snow spirit that shines as if smiling in the moonlight.” They are born in the mountains of Urqopacha when the moon illuminates the snow, and when approximately four of them combine, they are said to become the larger Rorrlo Teh."
msgstr "На языке йок-хуй имя этого существа означает «маленький-маленький снежный дух, сияющий в лунном свете, будто улыбается». Они рождаются в горах Уркопачи, когда луна освещает снег. Говорят, если соединить примерно четверых таких духов, получится более крупный Роррло Тех."

#. ja: ろろ～ろ～♪
#. de: Rororoooh! ♪
#. fr: Rororrlooo<nbsp>!♪
#. column 0: Summon your Rororrlo Teh minion. Caution: staring directly at its head may result in temporary blindness.
#. column 1: In the Yok Huy tongue, the name of this being means “a tiny little snow spirit that shines as if smiling in the moonlight.” They are born in the mountains of Urqopacha when the moon illuminates the snow, and when approximately four of them combine, they are said to become the larger Rorrlo Teh.
#. column 3: Powder Snow
#. column 4: Binds all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:515:0:2"
msgid "Now give me a Coerthan winter!<br>Enough ice and snow to bury a behemoth!<br>   - Pipin"
msgstr "Вот бы сейчас зиму в Керте!<br>Столько льда и снега, чтоб<br>и бехемота завалило!<br>   — Пипин"

#. ja: ふかふか雪
#. de: Firnschnee
#. fr: Neige épaisse
