msgid "Well Fed"
msgstr "Сыт по горло"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方のHPを、100回復する。味方のタイプが「アニマル」の場合は、HPが150回復する。
#. de: Regeneriert 100 LP bei eigenen Trabanten in der Nähe, im Fall von Tieren 150.
#. fr: Soigne 100 PV aux alliés dans l'aire d'effet, ou 150 PV s'ils sont de type “Créature”.
#. column 0: Summon your Cornservant minion. Will never let you go hungry.
#. column 1: At the conclusion of your travels with the Cornservant, the corn-shaped spirit that provides sustenance to the hungry, the being quietly left one of its kernels in your bag. That kernel quickly grew into another Cornservant, which ever regards you anxiously, worried that you might require a feed.
