#. ja: ミニオン「マグテンダー」を呼び出す。<br>小ぶりなバレルテンダー。鍼打ち修行中
#. de: Du rufst deinen Murmelkaktor als Begleiter herbei. Eine kleinere Version von Kugelkaktor, die fleißig das Ziehen von Stacheln übt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte biscoto-pampa, une version miniature de maousse-pampa qui s'entraîne encore à tirer des épines.
#. column 1: Once this adolescent barreltender has fully matured, it will possess the size and strength to vanquish foes with a single strike. For now, however, its needles are of the perfect potency for use in acupuncture to relieve ailments such as stiff shoulders and back pain.
#. column 2: If it ain't worth a tankard o' mead,<br>I don't give two shites!<br>   - Gerolt
#. column 3: Hot Needles
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:517:0:0"
msgid "Summon your tankardtender minion. Rather more manageable than a barrel."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Кружечный кактуар». С ним куда легче управляться, чем с бочкой."

#. ja: 成長途中のバレルテンダー。その大きさは、樽には及ばずマグカップ程度。成長すれば、一撃で敵対者を殺める剛腕も今はほどよい強さであり、その針を受ければ肩コリ腰痛神経痛などを立ち所に改善するらしい
#. de: Dieser kleine Begleiter befindet sich noch im Wachstum, ist aber schon äußerst muskulös und stark genug, um jeden Gegner mit einem einzigen Schlag zu besiegen. Seine Stacheln sollen Muskelschmerzen, Nackenschmerzen und Hexenschuss lindern.
#. fr: Ce maousse-pampa en pleine croissance est encore très petit mais déjà très musclé et suf<shy>fi<shy>sam<shy>ment fort pour vaincre n'importe quel adversaire d'un seul coup. Être frappé par une de ses épines aurait pour effet de soigner instantanément et efficacement les douleurs musculaires, les torticolis ou encore les lumbagos.
#. column 0: Summon your tankardtender minion. Rather more manageable than a barrel.
#. column 2: If it ain't worth a tankard o' mead,<br>I don't give two shites!<br>   - Gerolt
#. column 3: Hot Needles
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:517:0:1"
msgid "Once this adolescent barreltender has fully matured, it will possess the size and strength to vanquish foes with a single strike. For now, however, its needles are of the perfect potency for use in acupuncture to relieve ailments such as stiff shoulders and back pain."
msgstr "Когда этот подрастающий бочкотуар повзрослеет, он будет достаточно велик и силён, чтобы с одного удара сокрушать врагов. А пока его иглы как раз подходят для иглоукалывания: снимают напряжение в плечах и боль в спине."

#. ja: ワイルド！
#. de: Piiieks!
#. fr: Mouaaah<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your tankardtender minion. Rather more manageable than a barrel.
#. column 1: Once this adolescent barreltender has fully matured, it will possess the size and strength to vanquish foes with a single strike. For now, however, its needles are of the perfect potency for use in acupuncture to relieve ailments such as stiff shoulders and back pain.
#. column 3: Hot Needles
#. column 4: Increases DEF of all allies within range by 10 (30 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monster</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:517:0:2"
msgid "If it ain't worth a tankard o' mead,<br>I don't give two shites!<br>   - Gerolt"
msgstr "Если за кружку медовухи<br>не сойдёт — мне плевать!<br>   — Герольт"

#. ja: アツい鍼
#. de: Mächtiger Stachel
#. fr: Épine épaisse
#. column 0: Summon your tankardtender minion. Rather more manageable than a barrel.
#. column 1: Once this adolescent barreltender has fully matured, it will possess the size and strength to vanquish foes with a single strike. For now, however, its needles are of the perfect potency for use in acupuncture to relieve ailments such as stiff shoulders and back pain.
