msgstr "Повышает ЗАЩ всех союзников в радиусе действия на 10 (на 30, если союзник — <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>монстр</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「ブルーキャット」を呼び出す。<br>青灰色の美しい毛並みの猫。意外と甘えん坊
#. de: Du rufst deine blaugraue Katze als Begleiter herbei. So einen bildhübschen, verschmusten Begleiter hat man selten an seiner Seite!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte chat gris bleuté, un petit animal de compagnie au magnifique pelage qui se montre très affectueux.
#. column 1: A handsome breed of cat prized for its beautiful, bluish grey coat. Though some believe that it hails from northern Aldenard, its origin is still the subject of dispute. In recent years, a breeding program at the Studium has led to the bluecoat being seen in those lands with ties to Sharlayan.
#. column 2: Why is your laboratory overrun with felines?<br>Did the stress finally break you?<br>   - Margrat
#. column 3: Noble Gaze
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:518:0:0"
msgid "Summon your bluecoat cat minion. Surprisingly sweet-tempered despite its regal bearing."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Голубошёрстная кошка». Несмотря на царственный вид, она удивительно ласкова."

#. ja: 絹のような淡い青灰色の毛並みを持つ、美しい猫。アルデナード小大陸北方に由来するとされるが、正確な原産地は定かでない。近年魔法大学にて繁殖が行われたため、シャーレアンとの縁から各地に持ち込まれているようだ
#. de: Es heißt, dass dieses niedliche Wesen mit seinem seidenweichen, blaugrauen Fell aus Aldenard stammt, aber ihr genauer Herkunftsort ist nicht bekannt. Sie wurde in den letzten Jahren vermehrt an der Magieakademie von Sharlayan gezüchtet und von dort aus in verschiedene Teile des Landes gebracht.
#. fr: Cet adorable chat au pelage bleu-gris aussi doux que de la soie serait originaire de l'Aldenard, mais rien ne permet de l'affirmer. L'élevage de cette espèce ayant été pratiqué à l'académie de magie, des spécimens seraient emmenés un peu partout dans le monde par le biais des relations avec Sharlayan.
#. column 0: Summon your bluecoat cat minion. Surprisingly sweet-tempered despite its regal bearing.
#. column 2: Why is your laboratory overrun with felines?<br>Did the stress finally break you?<br>   - Margrat
#. column 3: Noble Gaze
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:518:0:1"
msgid "A handsome breed of cat prized for its beautiful, bluish grey coat. Though some believe that it hails from northern Aldenard, its origin is still the subject of dispute. In recent years, a breeding program at the Studium has led to the bluecoat being seen in those lands with ties to Sharlayan."
msgstr "Эта красивая порода кошек славится чудесной серо-голубой шерстью. Одни считают, что она родом с севера Альденарда, но точное происхождение породы до сих пор вызывает споры. В последние годы этих кошек разводят в Студиуме, и благодаря связям с Шарлаяном они появились и в других краях."

#. ja: みゃ～ぅ
#. de: Maunz! ♪
#. fr: Miaou<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your bluecoat cat minion. Surprisingly sweet-tempered despite its regal bearing.
#. column 1: A handsome breed of cat prized for its beautiful, bluish grey coat. Though some believe that it hails from northern Aldenard, its origin is still the subject of dispute. In recent years, a breeding program at the Studium has led to the bluecoat being seen in those lands with ties to Sharlayan.
#. column 3: Noble Gaze
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:518:0:2"
msgid "Why is your laboratory overrun with felines?<br>Did the stress finally break you?<br>   - Margrat"
msgstr "Почему твоя лаборатория<br>кишит кошками?<br>Стресс тебя доконал?<br>   — Марграт"

#. ja: 高貴な目配せ
#. de: Bezirzender Blick
#. fr: Regard plein de noblesse
#. column 0: Summon your bluecoat cat minion. Surprisingly sweet-tempered despite its regal bearing.
#. column 1: A handsome breed of cat prized for its beautiful, bluish grey coat. Though some believe that it hails from northern Aldenard, its origin is still the subject of dispute. In recent years, a breeding program at the Studium has led to the bluecoat being seen in those lands with ties to Sharlayan.
#. column 2: Why is your laboratory overrun with felines?<br>Did the stress finally break you?<br>   - Margrat
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:518:0:3"
msgid "Noble Gaze"
msgstr "Царственный взгляд"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK90のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 90 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 90 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your bluecoat cat minion. Surprisingly sweet-tempered despite its regal bearing.
#. column 1: A handsome breed of cat prized for its beautiful, bluish grey coat. Though some believe that it hails from northern Aldenard, its origin is still the subject of dispute. In recent years, a breeding program at the Studium has led to the bluecoat being seen in those lands with ties to Sharlayan.
#. column 2: Why is your laboratory overrun with felines?<br>Did the stress finally break you?<br>   - Margrat
#. column 3: Noble Gaze
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:518:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 90 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 90."

#. ja: ミニオン「トーキング・ヘッド」を呼び出す。<br>ヨカフイ族の遺物。おしゃべり大好き
#. de: Du rufst deinen sprechenden Kopf als Begleiter herbei. Du fragst dich manchmal, ob sein Redefluss stoppen wird, bevor dir die Ohren abfallen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte tête bavarde, une sorte de pantin magique datant du temps où les Yok Huy régnaient sur le Tural et qui aime papoter.
#. column 1: This relic of the Yok Huy found in the Skydeep Cenote appears to be little more than a loud-mouthed mammet, but it is in fact the core of a stone golem. Having been divested of its shell, it now stalks you with a view to merge with the body of its destroyer.
#. column 2: Might be as ol' Bremondt's a chatterbox,<br>but he sure as hells ain't no busybody.<br>   - Bremondt
#. column 3: Chatterbox
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:519:0:0"
msgid "Summon your speaking stone minion. Don't even think about getting it started."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Говорящий камень». Даже не думай его разговорить."

#. ja: 天深きセノーテで出会ったヨカフイ族の遺物。やかましく喋るだけの魔法人形に見えて、その正体は大型岩兵の心核である。外殻「ヘヴィアームズ」を失ったため、それを破壊した冒険者の身体と合体しようと付け狙ってるらしい
#. de: Ein Relikt der Yok Huy, das im Himmelstiefen Cenote gefunden wurde. Auf den ersten Blick sieht der Kopf aus wie eine magische Marionette, aber tatsächlich handelt es sich um das Überbleibsel eines großen Steinwächters. Nachdem er seine äußere Hülle verloren hatte, war es scheinbar seine Mission, mit der Person zu verschmelzen, die ihn besiegt hat: mit dir.
#. fr: Cette espèce de petit pantin magique pour le moins loquace est un vestige de la civilisation ancienne des Yok Huy découvert dans le cénote des Cieux infinis. Il constituait le cœur d'un immense gardien de pierre, mais ayant perdu l'artilleur lourd qui lui servait d'enveloppe, il a choisi de s'allier à la personne qui a vaincu ce dernier, c'est-à-dire vous.
#. column 0: Summon your speaking stone minion. Don't even think about getting it started.
#. column 2: Might be as ol' Bremondt's a chatterbox,<br>but he sure as hells ain't no busybody.<br>   - Bremondt
#. column 3: Chatterbox
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:519:0:1"
msgid "This relic of the Yok Huy found in the Skydeep Cenote appears to be little more than a loud-mouthed mammet, but it is in fact the core of a stone golem. Having been divested of its shell, it now stalks you with a view to merge with the body of its destroyer."
msgstr "Эта реликвия йок-хуй найдена в Небесной бездне. На вид — всего лишь шумная кукла, а на деле — ядро каменного голема. Лишившись оболочки, она теперь преследует тебя, чтобы соединиться с телом того, кто её уничтожил."

#. ja: 覚醒セヨ！
#. de: Aufwachen!
#. fr: Bla-bla-bla<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your speaking stone minion. Don't even think about getting it started.
#. column 1: This relic of the Yok Huy found in the Skydeep Cenote appears to be little more than a loud-mouthed mammet, but it is in fact the core of a stone golem. Having been divested of its shell, it now stalks you with a view to merge with the body of its destroyer.
#. column 3: Chatterbox
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:519:0:2"
msgid "Might be as ol' Bremondt's a chatterbox,<br>but he sure as hells ain't no busybody.<br>   - Bremondt"
msgstr "Может, старина Бремондт и болтун,<br>но уж точно не суёт нос в чужие дела.<br>   — Бремондт"

#. ja: ノンストップトーキング
#. de: Endloses Geplapper
#. fr: Bavardage sans fin
#. column 0: Summon your speaking stone minion. Don't even think about getting it started.
#. column 1: This relic of the Yok Huy found in the Skydeep Cenote appears to be little more than a loud-mouthed mammet, but it is in fact the core of a stone golem. Having been divested of its shell, it now stalks you with a view to merge with the body of its destroyer.
#. column 2: Might be as ol' Bremondt's a chatterbox,<br>but he sure as hells ain't no busybody.<br>   - Bremondt
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:519:0:3"
msgid "Chatterbox"
msgstr "Без умолку"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、1秒ごとに10の継続ダメージを与える。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>20秒
#. de: Fügt Gegnern in der Nähe im Sekundentakt 10 Schaden über Zeit zu.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 Sekunden
#. fr: Inflige 10 points de dégâts périodiques par seconde aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
