#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・マムージャ」を呼び出す。<br>マムージャ族の子どもを模した魔法人形。鱗のぷにぷにも完全再現
#. de: Du rufst deine Mamool Ja-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Eine vollständig maßstabsgetreue magische Marionette in Form eines Mamool Ja-Kindes.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Mamool Ja miniature, une poupée magique à l'image d'un enfant mamool ja dont les écailles sont tendres.
#. column 1: Appearing to be a piece of local handicraft, this mammet designed in the likeness of a Mamool Ja child was picked up by your retainer during a venture. From the traditional garments to the supple scales, so true to life are the details, one can only assume it was made by a most exacting artisan.
#. column 2: Traditional Mamool Ja bathing dance<br>will be shunned no more!<br>   - Bugaal Ja
#. column 3: Mamool Jam
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:520:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Mamool Ja minion. Innocence never looked so adorable."
msgstr "Призвать заводного прислужника «Мамуджа». Милее этой невинности ничего не бывает."

#. ja: 西方トラル大陸風の衣服を着た、マムージャ族の子どもを模した魔法人形。土産として作られたものをリテイナーが拾ってきた。凝り性の職人が製作したことが窺われ、幼くまだ柔らかい鱗の触り心地も再現されている
#. de: Diese magische Marionette stellt ein Mamool Ja-Kind in traditioneller Kleidung dar und wurde von einem Reisenden entdeckt und als Andenken mitgenommen. Die Verarbeitung der Puppe, insbesondere die Geschmeidigkeit der Schuppen, zeugt von der Sorgfalt, mit der ein Handwerker sie angefertigt haben muss.
#. fr: Cette adorable poupée magique représente un enfant mamool ja revêtu de vêtements traditonnels turaliens. Ce souvenir du continent occidental a été découvert par l'un de vos servants pendant l'une de ses excursions. Sa finition, notamment au niveau de la souplesse des écailles, témoigne du soin avec lequel un artisan l'a conçu avec un souci de réalisme.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Mamool Ja minion. Innocence never looked so adorable.
#. column 2: Traditional Mamool Ja bathing dance<br>will be shunned no more!<br>   - Bugaal Ja
#. column 3: Mamool Jam
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:520:0:1"
msgid "Appearing to be a piece of local handicraft, this mammet designed in the likeness of a Mamool Ja child was picked up by your retainer during a venture. From the traditional garments to the supple scales, so true to life are the details, one can only assume it was made by a most exacting artisan."
msgstr "Эта кукла изображает ребёнка-мамуджа в традиционной одежде. Слуга нашёл её во время вылазки, будто бы обычную местную поделку. Каждая деталь — от наряда до мягких чешуек — удивительно точно передана. Видно, мастер постарался на славу."

#. ja: じゃじゃーん！
#. de: Ja-Ja!
#. fr: Ja<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Mamool Ja minion. Innocence never looked so adorable.
#. column 1: Appearing to be a piece of local handicraft, this mammet designed in the likeness of a Mamool Ja child was picked up by your retainer during a venture. From the traditional garments to the supple scales, so true to life are the details, one can only assume it was made by a most exacting artisan.
#. column 3: Mamool Jam
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:520:0:2"
msgid "Traditional Mamool Ja bathing dance<br>will be shunned no more!<br>   - Bugaal Ja"
msgstr "Традиционный танец мамуджа<br>больше не будут презирать!<br>   — Бугал Джа"

#. ja: じゃんじゃん！
#. de: Mamool-Schlag
#. fr: Mamour ja
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Mamool Ja minion. Innocence never looked so adorable.
#. column 1: Appearing to be a piece of local handicraft, this mammet designed in the likeness of a Mamool Ja child was picked up by your retainer during a venture. From the traditional garments to the supple scales, so true to life are the details, one can only assume it was made by a most exacting artisan.
