#. ja: ミニオン「ドリーマー・スキャンプ」を呼び出す。<br>とある遊園地の土産品らしきピエロ人形。どうしてか動き、微笑む
#. de: Du rufst deinen schelmischen Schreckschlingel als Begleiter herbei. Man weiß nie, was er gerade wieder im Schilde führt<nbsp>...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte chenapan fantoche, une poupée de clown vendue comme souvenir dans un parc d'attractions et qui bouge et rit de manière étrange.
#. column 1: This souvenir clown doll was found at the Strayborough Deadwalk. A demonstration of electrope's capabilities, it moves as if it were a living thing, but it is merely an object and therefore can neither harbor malicious intent nor act upon them...knock on wood.
#. column 2: I did not realize there was<br>another clown in town!<br>   - Papa Gruff
#. column 3: False Smile
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:521:0:0"
msgid "Summon your mischief maker minion. Should only make mischief and not do you one, if the name is to be believed..."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Проказник». Если верить имени, он будет проказничать, а не подложит тебе свинью..."

#. ja: 彷徨える遊園ストレイバローに残されていた、土産品らしきピエロ人形。エレクトロープ技術の粋を集めて、生物と見紛う動きをするが、もちろん人形である。当然、意思もなければ、悪意なんてあるはずもないのだが……
#. de: Diese Clownspuppe, offenbar ein Andenken, wurde in der Mahrlingen-Promenade zurückgelassen. Sie ist ein Meisterwerk der Elektrob-Technologie und bewegt sich so, dass man sie mit einem lebenden Wesen verwechseln könnte. Aber sie ist natürlich eine Marionette, die keine bösen Absichten haben und Streiche spielen kann<nbsp>... nicht wahr?
#. fr: Cette poupée de clown a été découverte parmi les souvenirs abandonnés dans le Parc-aux-Errants. La technologie de l'électrope lui confère la capacité de se déplacer comme un être vivant, et étant dépourvue de volonté, elle ne devrait théoriquement pas être capable de vous jouer de mauvais tours.
#. column 0: Summon your mischief maker minion. Should only make mischief and not do you one, if the name is to be believed...
#. column 2: I did not realize there was<br>another clown in town!<br>   - Papa Gruff
#. column 3: False Smile
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:521:0:1"
msgid "This souvenir clown doll was found at the Strayborough Deadwalk. A demonstration of electrope's capabilities, it moves as if it were a living thing, but it is merely an object and therefore can neither harbor malicious intent nor act upon them...knock on wood."
msgstr "Эту клоунскую куклу-сувенир нашли в Заброшенном парке «Стрейборо». Она демонстрирует возможности электропы: двигается как живая, хотя на самом деле это всего лишь предмет. Значит, злого умысла у неё быть не может... постучу по дереву."

#. ja: ヒヒヒ！
#. de: Hihihi!
#. fr: Hi hi hi<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your mischief maker minion. Should only make mischief and not do you one, if the name is to be believed...
#. column 1: This souvenir clown doll was found at the Strayborough Deadwalk. A demonstration of electrope's capabilities, it moves as if it were a living thing, but it is merely an object and therefore can neither harbor malicious intent nor act upon them...knock on wood.
#. column 3: False Smile
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:521:0:2"
msgid "I did not realize there was<br>another clown in town!<br>   - Papa Gruff"
msgstr "Не думал, что в городе<br>появился ещё один клоун!<br>   — Папа Груфф"

#. ja: 偽りの微笑み
#. de: Unheimliches Grinsen
#. fr: Sourire espiègle
#. column 0: Summon your mischief maker minion. Should only make mischief and not do you one, if the name is to be believed...
#. column 1: This souvenir clown doll was found at the Strayborough Deadwalk. A demonstration of electrope's capabilities, it moves as if it were a living thing, but it is merely an object and therefore can neither harbor malicious intent nor act upon them...knock on wood.
