#. ja: ミニオン「ニュー・クルル」を呼び出す。<br>クルルを模した魔法人形。それが私の……
#. de: Du rufst deine neue Krile-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Was so ein schickes neues Gewand alles ausmachen kann!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte nouvelle Krile miniature, une poupée à l'effige de Krile qui a retiré sa capuche<nbsp>!
#. column 1: On the occasion of the anniversary of Eorzea's rebirth, the Adventurers' Guild commissioned a new mammet designed in Krile's likeness. With the hood of her pictomancer's attire drawn back to reveal her precious earring, she exudes a spirit of adventure and discovery.
#. column 2: I'm eager to put my<br>pictomancy to the proof.<br>   - Krile
#. column 3: Fancy Flourish
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 30% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:525:0:0"
msgid "Summon your brushed-up Krile minion. She is not to be brushed off in the face of danger."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Обновлённая Крил». В опасности её уж точно не спишешь со счетов."

#. ja: 冒険者ギルドが、エオルゼアの新生を祝して用意したクルルの新しい魔法人形。心機一転ピクトマンサーの装いで、新たなる冒険と謎の探求に浮き立った気持ちを表している。フードを脱いだ耳元からは、大切な耳飾りがチラリ
#. de: Diese magische Marionette wurde von der Aben<shy>teurer<shy>gilde nach Kriles Abbild zum Fest der Wiedergeburt Eorzeas geschaffen. Sie trägt die Kleidung einer Piktomantin und scheint hoch motiviert zu sein, neue Abenteuer zu erleben und das Rätsel ihrer Herkunft zu lösen. Da sie ihre Kapuze abgenommen hat, kann man nun auch ihren funkelnden Ohrring sehen.
#. fr: Cette poupée magique créée par la guilde des aventuriers pour célébrer la renaissance d'Éorzéa s'inspire de Krile. Revêtue de sa tenue de pictomancienne, elle semble motivée à vivre de nouvelles péripéties et résoudre l'énigme de ses origines. Le fait qu'elle ait retiré sa capuche permet de voir sa précieuse boucle d'oreille.
#. column 0: Summon your brushed-up Krile minion. She is not to be brushed off in the face of danger.
#. column 2: I'm eager to put my<br>pictomancy to the proof.<br>   - Krile
#. column 3: Fancy Flourish
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 30% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:525:0:1"
msgid "On the occasion of the anniversary of Eorzea's rebirth, the Adventurers' Guild commissioned a new mammet designed in Krile's likeness. With the hood of her pictomancer's attire drawn back to reveal her precious earring, she exudes a spirit of adventure and discovery."
msgstr "К годовщине возрождения Эорзеи Гильдия искателей приключений заказала новую куклу в образе Крил. В одеянии пиктоманта, с откинутым капюшоном, открывающим любимую серьгу, она так и излучает дух приключений и жажду открытий."

#. ja: 私モ一緒ヨ
#. de: Ich bin bei dir.
#. fr: Je suis avec toi<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your brushed-up Krile minion. She is not to be brushed off in the face of danger.
#. column 1: On the occasion of the anniversary of Eorzea's rebirth, the Adventurers' Guild commissioned a new mammet designed in Krile's likeness. With the hood of her pictomancer's attire drawn back to reveal her precious earring, she exudes a spirit of adventure and discovery.
#. column 3: Fancy Flourish
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 30% of the maximum value.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:525:0:2"
msgid "I'm eager to put my<br>pictomancy to the proof.<br>   - Krile"
msgstr "Не терпится проверить,<br>на что годится моя пиктомантия.<br>   — Крил"

#. ja: かさね塗り
#. de: Kleiner Pinselstrich
#. fr: Petit coup de pinceau
#. column 0: Summon your brushed-up Krile minion. She is not to be brushed off in the face of danger.
#. column 1: On the occasion of the anniversary of Eorzea's rebirth, the Adventurers' Guild commissioned a new mammet designed in Krile's likeness. With the hood of her pictomancer's attire drawn back to reveal her precious earring, she exudes a spirit of adventure and discovery.
#. column 2: I'm eager to put my<br>pictomancy to the proof.<br>   - Krile
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 30% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:525:0:3"
msgid "Fancy Flourish"
msgstr "Яркий штрих"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵の特殊技ポイントを、最大値の30%減少させる。
#. de: Verringert die Technikpunkte der Gegner in der Nähe um 50 % des Maximalwerts.
#. fr: Réduit les PdT des ennemis dans l'aire d'effet de 30% de leur valeur maximale.
#. column 0: Summon your brushed-up Krile minion. She is not to be brushed off in the face of danger.
#. column 1: On the occasion of the anniversary of Eorzea's rebirth, the Adventurers' Guild commissioned a new mammet designed in Krile's likeness. With the hood of her pictomancer's attire drawn back to reveal her precious earring, she exudes a spirit of adventure and discovery.
