msgstr "Снижает очки действий всех врагов в радиусе действия на 30% от максимального значения."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ゼロ」を呼び出す。<br>ゼロを模した魔法人形。私は 戻ってきたのか――
#. de: Du rufst deine Zero-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie ist wieder da<nbsp>...!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Zero miniature, une poupée magique à l'effigie d'une habitante du treizième reflet qui a longtemps erré après le déluge de Ténèbres.
#. column 1: A mammet inspired by a hero of the Thirteenth, who wandered alone for millennia after her world was consumed by Darkness. Sharing her taste in cuisine, the Hannish artisan responsible poured their heart into its creation and ensured accuracy in every detail, such as the scythe she wields from her days as an avatar.
#. column 2: I will let it burn,<br>this fire in my breast.<br>   - Zero
#. column 3: Dark Scythe
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:526:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Zero minion. And thus she is returned."
msgstr "Призвать заводного прислужника «Зеро». И вот она вернулась."

#. ja: 「闇の氾濫」後に長い年月を彷徨い続けた、第十三世界の住人の魔法人形。食の好みが合い意気投合したラザハンの職人が、心を込めて製作したもの。背負った大鎌は、かつてアヴァターとして使役された過去に由来するらしい
#. de: Diese magische Marionette stellt Zero dar, eine Bewohnerin des dreizehnten Splitters, die nach der Flut der Dunkelheit viele Jahre lang umhergeirrt ist. Sie wurde mit großer Sorgfalt von einem Handwerker aus Radz-at-Han gefertigt, der offenbar die gleichen kulinarischen Vorlieben wie diese Figur hat. Die Sense, die sie auf ihrem Rücken trägt, stammt aus ihrer Zeit als Avatar.
#. fr: Cette poupée magique représente Zero, une habitante du treizième reflet qui a erré de nombreuses années après le déluge de Ténèbres. Elle a été réalisée avec grand soin par un artisan de Radz-at-Han partageant les mêmes goût culinaires que ce personnage. La faux qu'elle porte sur son dos vient du fait qu'elle a autrefois servi d'avatar.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Zero minion. And thus she is returned.
#. column 2: I will let it burn,<br>this fire in my breast.<br>   - Zero
#. column 3: Dark Scythe
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:526:0:1"
msgid "A mammet inspired by a hero of the Thirteenth, who wandered alone for millennia after her world was consumed by Darkness. Sharing her taste in cuisine, the Hannish artisan responsible poured their heart into its creation and ensured accuracy in every detail, such as the scythe she wields from her days as an avatar."
msgstr "Кукла, созданная по образу героини Тринадцатого отражения, которая тысячелетиями скиталась в одиночестве после того, как её мир поглотила Тьма. Ремесленник из Радз-ат-Хана, разделявший её любовь к еде, вложил в работу душу и тщательно воссоздал каждую деталь, в том числе косу, которой она владела, будучи аватаром."

#. ja: 熱イ…胸ノ奥ガ…！
#. de: Aus dem Weg!
#. fr: Hors de mon chemin<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Zero minion. And thus she is returned.
#. column 1: A mammet inspired by a hero of the Thirteenth, who wandered alone for millennia after her world was consumed by Darkness. Sharing her taste in cuisine, the Hannish artisan responsible poured their heart into its creation and ensured accuracy in every detail, such as the scythe she wields from her days as an avatar.
#. column 3: Dark Scythe
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:526:0:2"
msgid "I will let it burn,<br>this fire in my breast.<br>   - Zero"
msgstr "Пусть горит<br>огонь в моей груди.<br>   — Зеро"

#. ja: 闇世界の鎌
#. de: Sense der Dunkelheit
#. fr: Faux des ténèbres
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Zero minion. And thus she is returned.
#. column 1: A mammet inspired by a hero of the Thirteenth, who wandered alone for millennia after her world was consumed by Darkness. Sharing her taste in cuisine, the Hannish artisan responsible poured their heart into its creation and ensured accuracy in every detail, such as the scythe she wields from her days as an avatar.
#. column 2: I will let it burn,<br>this fire in my breast.<br>   - Zero
