msgctxt "CompanionTransient:527:0:2"
msgid "Don't try to fool an expert.<br>   - Erenville"
msgstr "Не пытайся обмануть знатока.<br>   — Эренвиль"

#. ja: グリーナーの知恵
#. de: Klauberinstinkt
#. fr: Expertise de glaneur
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Erenville minion. Happy to follow rather than guide you for a change.
#. column 1: A complementary companion to an illustrated encyclopedia, this automaton was commissioned by the Studium's publications department as part of a recruitment campaign for gleaners. Though designed in the likeness of Erenville, the man himself was not consulted on its creation on account of being afield at the time.
