#. ja: ミニオン「Nano Lord」を呼び出す。<br>闇の王の小さな似姿。人の子の終焉を告げようぞ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Nanolord als Begleiter herbei. Lass seine Klinge deine sterbliche Essenz trinken. Bitte!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Seigneur des ombres miniature, l'annonciateur des dernières heures de l'humanité rendu inoffensif<nbsp>!
#. column 1: A diminutive manifestation of the Shadow Lord, which arose from the core of his memories in the wake of battle. While the original Shadow Lord was a dreaded existence in the world of Vana'diel, where he led the Beastman Confederate in a war of conquest against the Enlightened Races, this entity thankfully appears to pose no danger.
#. column 2: Minions of the Shadow Lord!?<br>   - Iroha
#. column 3: Nano Slash
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:528:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Nano Lord minion. The land probably won't tremble before his might."
msgstr "Призвать миниатюру Нанолорда. Земля вряд ли содрогнётся от его мощи."

#. ja: 闇の王の小さな似姿。「エコーズの残滓」の核が戦いの後、この姿に変化し歩き出した。元となった闇の王とは、異界「ヴァナ・ディール」において、獣人連合軍を率いて諸国に侵攻し、人々を恐怖に陥れた存在だという
#. de: Das „etwas“ kleinere Ebenbild des Schattenlords. Überreste der Echos sollen sich nach dem Kampf in dieser Form manifestiert haben und von dannen geschritten sein. Der Schattenlord selbst, auf dem dieser Begleiter basiert, soll in der Welt Vana'diel ein wahrer Schrecken für alle dort lebenden Völker gewesen sein.
#. fr: Cette poupée magique n'est autre que l'Écho du Seigneur des ombres qui a rétréci après votre combat. On dit qu'à Vana'diel il sème la terreur à la tête de son armée d'hommes-bêtes.
#. column 0: Summon your Nano Lord minion. The land probably won't tremble before his might.
#. column 2: Minions of the Shadow Lord!?<br>   - Iroha
#. column 3: Nano Slash
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:528:0:1"
msgid "A diminutive manifestation of the Shadow Lord, which arose from the core of his memories in the wake of battle. While the original Shadow Lord was a dreaded existence in the world of Vana'diel, where he led the Beastman Confederate in a war of conquest against the Enlightened Races, this entity thankfully appears to pose no danger."
msgstr "Крошечное воплощение Повелителя Тьмы, возникшее из самой сути его воспоминаний после битвы. В мире Вана-д'иэль Повелитель Тьмы был грозным существом: он вёл союз зверолюдей в завоевательной войне против просвещённых народов. К счастью, это создание, похоже, не представляет опасности."

#. ja: 瞑目セヨ！
#. de: Eure Seelen sollen mein sein!
#. fr: Préparez-vous à mourir<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Nano Lord minion. The land probably won't tremble before his might.
#. column 1: A diminutive manifestation of the Shadow Lord, which arose from the core of his memories in the wake of battle. While the original Shadow Lord was a dreaded existence in the world of Vana'diel, where he led the Beastman Confederate in a war of conquest against the Enlightened Races, this entity thankfully appears to pose no danger.
#. column 3: Nano Slash
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:528:0:2"
msgid "Minions of the Shadow Lord!?<br>   - Iroha"
msgstr "Прислужники Повелителя Тьмы!?<br>   — Ироха"

#. ja: ナノスラッシュ
#. de: Nanohieb
#. fr: Mini-entaille
#. column 0: Summon your Nano Lord minion. The land probably won't tremble before his might.
#. column 1: A diminutive manifestation of the Shadow Lord, which arose from the core of his memories in the wake of battle. While the original Shadow Lord was a dreaded existence in the world of Vana'diel, where he led the Beastman Confederate in a war of conquest against the Enlightened Races, this entity thankfully appears to pose no danger.
#. column 2: Minions of the Shadow Lord!?<br>   - Iroha
#. column 4: Increases action party DEF by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
