#. ja: ミニオン「午のユニコルト」を呼び出す。<br>降神祭飾りを身に着けたユニコーンの幼獣。心の清らかな者と旅がしたい
#. de: Du rufst dein Kleinhörnchen als Begleiter herbei. Es will nur jene mit reinem Herzen auf ihren Reisen begleiten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé licorne de la transition. Cette petite licorne, parée des atours de la fête du passage à la nouvelle année, souhaite voyager avec quelqu'un de paisible.
#. column 1: On the occasion of the Heavensturn celebration, House Fortemps helped to secure the loan of this unicorn young to serve as the mascot for the visiting Far Eastern delegation. Though initially nervous to be away from home, the creature was able to find its stride at your side, and there it appears content to remain.
#. column 2: The unicorn must have<br>sensed kinship in you.<br>   - Braya
#. column 3: Blessed Bucking
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to all enemies within range while increasing action party ATK by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:529:0:0"
msgid "Summon your uma-no-unicolt minion. Wishes to embark on a journey with one who is pure of heart."
msgstr "Призвать миниатюру «Ума-уникорн». Мечтает отправиться в путь с тем, чьё сердце чисто."

#. ja: 午の季節の降神祭に、フォルタン家の協力で「ますこっと」として手配されたユニコーンの幼獣。皇都よりやってきた当初は緊張していたが、冒険者と共に御披露道中の催しを元気に駆け回った。まだまだ沢山走りたいらしい
#. de: Eine niedlichere Version des Kleinhorns, das anlässlich der Himmelswende von den Fortemps herbeigeordert wurde. Zu Beginn gab es sich zwar noch etwas nervös, dank deiner sanften Führung gewöhnte es sich aber schnell ein und galoppierte fröhlich durch die Straßen. Jetzt will es seine Hufen gar nicht mehr zum Stehen bringen.
#. fr: Une licorne apportée par la délégation orientale, avec l'aide de la maison Fortemps, pour fêter l'année du cheval en Éorzéa. Bien que nerveuse à son arrivée, elle prend désormais plaisir à trotter à vos côtés et ne renâcle pas à galoper dès que possible<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your uma-no-unicolt minion. Wishes to embark on a journey with one who is pure of heart.
#. column 2: The unicorn must have<br>sensed kinship in you.<br>   - Braya
#. column 3: Blessed Bucking
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to all enemies within range while increasing action party ATK by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:529:0:1"
msgid "On the occasion of the Heavensturn celebration, House Fortemps helped to secure the loan of this unicorn young to serve as the mascot for the visiting Far Eastern delegation. Though initially nervous to be away from home, the creature was able to find its stride at your side, and there it appears content to remain."
msgstr "К празднику Небесного рубежа дом Форто заимствовал этого жеребёнка-единорога для участия в торжествах дальневосточной делегации. Сперва малыш нервничал вдали от дома, но рядом с тобой освоился и, похоже, не прочь остаться."

#. ja: ヒヒ～ンっ！
#. de: \<wieher>
#. fr: Hihiiiiii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your uma-no-unicolt minion. Wishes to embark on a journey with one who is pure of heart.
#. column 1: On the occasion of the Heavensturn celebration, House Fortemps helped to secure the loan of this unicorn young to serve as the mascot for the visiting Far Eastern delegation. Though initially nervous to be away from home, the creature was able to find its stride at your side, and there it appears content to remain.
#. column 3: Blessed Bucking
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to all enemies within range while increasing action party ATK by 20.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:529:0:2"
msgid "The unicorn must have<br>sensed kinship in you.<br>   - Braya"
msgstr "Наверное, единорог<br>почувствовал родство душ.<br>   — Брайя"

#. ja: 駒競べ
#. de: Hufenscharren
#. fr: Au galop<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your uma-no-unicolt minion. Wishes to embark on a journey with one who is pure of heart.
#. column 1: On the occasion of the Heavensturn celebration, House Fortemps helped to secure the loan of this unicorn young to serve as the mascot for the visiting Far Eastern delegation. Though initially nervous to be away from home, the creature was able to find its stride at your side, and there it appears content to remain.
