#. ja: ミニオン「アダマンウェポン」を呼び出す。<br>帝国軍基地で発見された試作魔導兵器の縮小模型
#. de: Du rufst deine Adamantit-Waffe als Begleiter herbei. Die Miniaturversion eines Prototyps, welche in einer Militärbasis des Imperiums entdeckt wurde.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Arme Adamantium, un modèle réduit d'un prototype d'arme magitek conçu par l'armée impériale.
#. column 1: Retrieved from an imperial base, this scale prototype of a warmachina appears to have been created for counter G-Warrior testing and carries no armaments. After completing their analysis, the Eorzean Alliance saw fit to bestow it upon members as a reward for exemplary service.
#. column 2: 'Twould require a heart as hard as diamond<br>to raise one's voice in anger to beings<br>possessed of such profound...saccharinity.<br>   - Urianger
#. column 3: Adamant Salvo
#. column 4: Delivers 8% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:530:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Adamant Weapon minion. A diamond by any other name would shine as bright─at least when scale is accounted for."
msgstr "Призвать миниатюру адамантового оружия. Как ни назови алмаз, он всё равно будет сиять — ну, если не забывать о размере."

#. ja: 帝国軍基地で発見された試作魔導兵器の縮小模型。どうやら機体の耐G機構などを検証するための模型であり、武装類は内蔵されていない。押収した都市軍事同盟は、解析の後、演習の成績優秀者向けの報奨としたようだ
#. de: Ein Modell der ähnlich aussehenden Waffe des Kaiserreichs, welches in einem ihrer Stützpunkte entdeckt wurde. Da es aus<shy>schließ<shy>lich zum Testen der G-Krieger-Abwehr dienen sollte, ist es weder mit Waffen ausgerüstet noch auf andere Weise gefährlich. Nach der Beschlagnahme und Analyse durch die Allianz wurde es als Preis für herausragende Leistungen in Militärübungen ausgegeben.
#. fr: Découverte dans un entrepôt d'une base garlemaldaise, cette Arme semble avoir été avant tout un modèle d'essai servant à tester les armements anti-G. Elle ne possède d'ailleurs aucun type d'armement. Après une analyse poussée, les dirigeants de l'Alliance éorzéenne ont choisi de l'offrir à ses membres les plus prestigieux, en guise de récompense pour leur service.
#. column 0: Summon your Adamant Weapon minion. A diamond by any other name would shine as bright─at least when scale is accounted for.
#. column 2: 'Twould require a heart as hard as diamond<br>to raise one's voice in anger to beings<br>possessed of such profound...saccharinity.<br>   - Urianger
#. column 3: Adamant Salvo
#. column 4: Delivers 8% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:530:0:1"
msgid "Retrieved from an imperial base, this scale prototype of a warmachina appears to have been created for counter G-Warrior testing and carries no armaments. After completing their analysis, the Eorzean Alliance saw fit to bestow it upon members as a reward for exemplary service."
msgstr "Найденная на имперской базе уменьшенная модель боевой машины, по-видимому, предназначалась для испытаний защиты от G-воина и не имеет вооружения. Завершив анализ, Эорзейский альянс наградил ею отличившихся на службе."

#. ja: ドゥン…
#. de: \<Piepup>
#. fr: Gwon...
#. column 0: Summon your Adamant Weapon minion. A diamond by any other name would shine as bright─at least when scale is accounted for.
#. column 1: Retrieved from an imperial base, this scale prototype of a warmachina appears to have been created for counter G-Warrior testing and carries no armaments. After completing their analysis, the Eorzean Alliance saw fit to bestow it upon members as a reward for exemplary service.
#. column 3: Adamant Salvo
#. column 4: Delivers 8% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:530:0:2"
msgid "'Twould require a heart as hard as diamond<br>to raise one's voice in anger to beings<br>possessed of such profound...saccharinity.<br>   - Urianger"
msgstr "Пришлось бы иметь сердце твёрдое, как алмаз,<br>чтобы гневно повысить голос на создания<br>с такой поразительной... сладостью.<br>   — Урианже"

#. ja: アダマンバースト
#. de: Adamantit-Brenner
#. fr: Salve adamantium
