msgid "Delivers 8% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone."
msgstr "Наносит 8% урона ближайшему вражескому арканному камню."

#. ja: ミニオン「コトコトコ」を呼び出す。<br>鮮やかで大きなくちばしを持つ南国の鳥。鳴き声はちょっとうるさい
#. de: Du rufst deinen Tuka-Tukitu als Begleiter herbei. Ein großschnabliger Fiederfreund aus südlichen Gefilden.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte toucancan, un oiseau des îles du Sud que l'on reconnaît à son bec imposant, mais aussi surtout à son chant bruyant.
#. column 1: Inhabiting the tropical forests of Tural, the toco toquito is most notable for its prodigious beak, which is deceptively light on account of being hollow. Further identifiable by its blue-ringed eyes and the reddish emblazoning upon its hind, it is also fondly referred to as the jewel of the forest.
#. column 2: Why, this is it! The very<br>jewel I spoke of!<br>   - Sula
#. column 3: Jewel of the Forest
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:531:0:0"
msgid "Summon your toco toquito minion. A tropical bird that is all beak and has a squawk to match."
msgstr "Призвать миниатюрного туканчика. В тропиках эта птица славится огромным клювом и не менее громким криком."

#. ja: 熱帯雨林に棲息する中型の鳥。橙色の美しい嘴は体長の半分ほどを占めるが、内部は空洞になっており軽やかに飛ぶことができる。嘴や青い目元、赤褐色の尾羽などが総じて好まれ、森林の宝石とも称されることがある
#. de: Dieses Großmaul ist vor allem in feuchten Dschungelgebieten anzutreffen, wo es mit seinem gewaltigen, aber hohlen Schnabel federleicht durch die Lüfte segelt. Sein farbenfrohes Äußeres macht ihn zu einem der beliebtesten Vögel von allen, was ihm auch den Titel „Schatz des Waldes“ eingespielt hat.
#. fr: Un oiseau de taille moyenne, vivant dans les forêts tropicales. Son énorme bec est presque totalement vide, ce qui le rend très léger et ainsi ne le gêne pas pour s'envoler. Ses couleurs chatoyantes lui valent d'être surnommé le joyau de la forêt.
#. column 0: Summon your toco toquito minion. A tropical bird that is all beak and has a squawk to match.
#. column 2: Why, this is it! The very<br>jewel I spoke of!<br>   - Sula
#. column 3: Jewel of the Forest
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:531:0:1"
msgid "Inhabiting the tropical forests of Tural, the toco toquito is most notable for its prodigious beak, which is deceptively light on account of being hollow. Further identifiable by its blue-ringed eyes and the reddish emblazoning upon its hind, it is also fondly referred to as the jewel of the forest."
msgstr "Туканчик обитает в тропических лесах Турала и прежде всего известен своим внушительным клювом. На вид он тяжёлый, но внутри полый. Голубые кольца вокруг глаз и красноватые перья на хвосте тоже делают его приметным. За красоту птицу ласково зовут лесной драгоценностью."

#. ja: ガァ～ガァ～
#. de: Krah! Krah!
#. fr: Gaa, gaa<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your toco toquito minion. A tropical bird that is all beak and has a squawk to match.
#. column 1: Inhabiting the tropical forests of Tural, the toco toquito is most notable for its prodigious beak, which is deceptively light on account of being hollow. Further identifiable by its blue-ringed eyes and the reddish emblazoning upon its hind, it is also fondly referred to as the jewel of the forest.
#. column 3: Jewel of the Forest
#. column 4: Reduces minion summoning recast time by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
