msgctxt "CompanionTransient:531:0:2"
msgid "Why, this is it! The very<br>jewel I spoke of!<br>   - Sula"
msgstr "Вот он! Тот самый<br>самый лесной самоцвет!<br>   — Сула"

#. ja: 森の宝石
#. de: Schatz des Waldes
#. fr: Joyau de la forêt
#. column 0: Summon your toco toquito minion. A tropical bird that is all beak and has a squawk to match.
