#. ja: ミニオン「シャシュエ」を呼び出す。<br>ヤースラニ荒野原産のウサギ。黒く染まった尾と耳の先がチャームポイント
#. de: Du rufst deinen Shshuye als Begleiter herbei. Ein in Yyasulani heimisches Häschen, das mit seinen schwarzen Ohren und Bommel entzückt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte shshuye, un lapin originaire de Yyasulani connu pour avoir la pointe de sa queue et de ses oreilles colorées de noir.
#. column 1: Its name meaning “leaping sun” in the Shetona tongue, this variety of jackrabbit native to Yyasulani is held by the Shetona people to be a distant relative. In the past, a fearsome tural vidraal emerged from this otherwise harmless species and terrorized the people of Yuweyawata.
#. column 2: Clearly, you are at a complete loss as to<br>the identity of the virile gentle-rabbit<br>who stands before you!<br>   - Godbert
#. column 3: Jackrabbit Kick
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:532:0:0"
msgid "Summon your shshuye minion. One day it may become a dread tural vidraal, but it is not this day."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника шшуе. Может, однажды он и станет грозным туральским видраалом, но не сегодня."

#. ja: ヤースラニ荒野一帯に棲息するウサギ。同地のシャトナ族は「跳ねる太陽」と呼び、似た耳の形から同じ祖より分かたれた血族とも考えてきた。ユウェヤーワータ近郊では、かつてこの種から生じたトラルヴィドラールが目撃されたという
#. de: Diese in der Wildnis Yyasulanis heimische Hasenart verdankt ihren Namen den in der Gegend lebenden Shetona, welche sie als „hüpfende Sonne“ bezeichnen. Es wird auch gemunkelt, dass Shetona und Shshuye ferne Verwandte voneinander sind<nbsp>- so sehen sich ihre Löffel zum Verwechseln ähnlich. Außerdem wissenswert: ein Tural Vidraal, der eben dieser Leporidenart entsprungen ist, soll einst in der Siedlung Yuweyawata sein Unwesen getrieben haben.
#. fr: Cette espèce de lapins vit en Yyasulani. Les Shetona de la région les appellent les “soleils bondissants”. En raison de la forme de leurs oreilles ressemblant aux leurs, ils les considèrent comme de lointains parents. On dit qu'un Tural vidraal aux longues oreilles aurait été aperçu près de Yuweyawata.
#. column 0: Summon your shshuye minion. One day it may become a dread tural vidraal, but it is not this day.
#. column 2: Clearly, you are at a complete loss as to<br>the identity of the virile gentle-rabbit<br>who stands before you!<br>   - Godbert
#. column 3: Jackrabbit Kick
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:532:0:1"
msgid "Its name meaning “leaping sun” in the Shetona tongue, this variety of jackrabbit native to Yyasulani is held by the Shetona people to be a distant relative. In the past, a fearsome tural vidraal emerged from this otherwise harmless species and terrorized the people of Yuweyawata."
msgstr "Название этого зайца, обитающего в Яясулани, означает на языке шетона «прыгающее солнце». Шетона считают его дальним родственником. Когда-то из этой безобидной зверушки вырос грозный туральский видрал, терроризировавший жителей Ювеяваты."

#. ja: ぴょんぴょんっ
#. de: \<hoppel>
#. fr: Tap, tap<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your shshuye minion. One day it may become a dread tural vidraal, but it is not this day.
#. column 1: Its name meaning “leaping sun” in the Shetona tongue, this variety of jackrabbit native to Yyasulani is held by the Shetona people to be a distant relative. In the past, a fearsome tural vidraal emerged from this otherwise harmless species and terrorized the people of Yuweyawata.
#. column 3: Jackrabbit Kick
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:532:0:2"
msgid "Clearly, you are at a complete loss as to<br>the identity of the virile gentle-rabbit<br>who stands before you!<br>   - Godbert"
msgstr "Да ты, похоже, совсем не знаешь,<br>кто перед тобой —<br>мужчина-заяц с телом что надо!<br>   — Годберт"

#. ja: ラビットキック
#. de: Läuferschelle
#. fr: Patte de lapin
#. column 0: Summon your shshuye minion. One day it may become a dread tural vidraal, but it is not this day.
#. column 1: Its name meaning “leaping sun” in the Shetona tongue, this variety of jackrabbit native to Yyasulani is held by the Shetona people to be a distant relative. In the past, a fearsome tural vidraal emerged from this otherwise harmless species and terrorized the people of Yuweyawata.
#. column 2: Clearly, you are at a complete loss as to<br>the identity of the virile gentle-rabbit<br>who stands before you!<br>   - Godbert
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:532:0:3"
msgid "Jackrabbit Kick"
msgstr "Удар зайца"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your shshuye minion. One day it may become a dread tural vidraal, but it is not this day.
#. column 1: Its name meaning “leaping sun” in the Shetona tongue, this variety of jackrabbit native to Yyasulani is held by the Shetona people to be a distant relative. In the past, a fearsome tural vidraal emerged from this otherwise harmless species and terrorized the people of Yuweyawata.
#. column 2: Clearly, you are at a complete loss as to<br>the identity of the virile gentle-rabbit<br>who stands before you!<br>   - Godbert
#. column 3: Jackrabbit Kick
