msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「スピピサウルス」を呼び出す。<br>すばしっこい古代竜の幼体。背中のヒレ状の突起で風を受け走る
#. de: Du rufst deinen Spinettosaurus als Begleiter herbei. Eine flinke Urzeitechse, dessen Rückenfinne ihm eine gewisse Aerodynamik verleiht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte spitinosaure, un petit saurien très agile, dont les écailles dorsales fendent le vent.
#. column 1: The young of a prehistoric reptile, this creature possesses protruding spines that are likened to a sail, which it uses to regulate body temperature and perform courtship displays. In contrast to its stunted forelimbs, it is blessed with powerful legs that allow it to move quickly and snatch up prey in its elongated jaws.
#. column 2: So long, spiny whatever-you-are.<br>   - Languid Lominsan
#. column 3: Prehistoric Ruler
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:533:0:0"
msgid "Summon your spinettesaurus minion. Small though it may be, never let it be said that it has no spine."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника спинеттозавра. Хоть он и мал, но хребта ему не занимать."

#. ja: 長い口吻と背中の突起が特徴的な古代竜の幼体。前脚は短く退化した一方、後ろ脚で大地を蹴り俊敏に動き回る。ヒレは成長とともに大きく育ち、風を切るのに役立つほか、体温調整や繁殖期の誇示にも用いられるようだ
#. de: Dieses Lebewesen vergangener Zeiten zeichnet sich durch sein langes, schnabelähnliches Maul und das große Segel auf seinem Rücken aus. Im Gegensatz zu seinen kurzen Armen tragen seine starken und vor allem flinken Beine es schnurstracks durch die Lande. Sein Rückensegel hilft, den Wind zu schneiden, die Körpertemperatur anzupassen und spielt vor allem beim Balzverhalten eine wichtige Rolle. Je älter der Spinettosaurus, desto größer auch sein Segel.
#. fr: Reconnaissable à sa longue mâchoire et à son dos parcouru d'écailles acérées, ce saurien compense la petite taille de ses membres supérieurs par la puissance de ses jambes qui lui permettent de courir très vite. En plus de fendre le vent, ses écailles dorsales lui serviraient également à contrôler sa température corporelle.
#. column 0: Summon your spinettesaurus minion. Small though it may be, never let it be said that it has no spine.
#. column 2: So long, spiny whatever-you-are.<br>   - Languid Lominsan
#. column 3: Prehistoric Ruler
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:533:0:1"
msgid "The young of a prehistoric reptile, this creature possesses protruding spines that are likened to a sail, which it uses to regulate body temperature and perform courtship displays. In contrast to its stunted forelimbs, it is blessed with powerful legs that allow it to move quickly and snatch up prey in its elongated jaws."
msgstr "Детёныш древней рептилии с выступами на спине, похожими на парус. Они помогают регулировать температуру тела и привлекать партнёров. Передние лапы у него короткие, зато мощные ноги позволяют быстро бегать, а длинные челюсти — хватать добычу."

#. ja: スピ～ッ！
#. de: Spiiiinetto!
#. fr: Graouh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your spinettesaurus minion. Small though it may be, never let it be said that it has no spine.
#. column 1: The young of a prehistoric reptile, this creature possesses protruding spines that are likened to a sail, which it uses to regulate body temperature and perform courtship displays. In contrast to its stunted forelimbs, it is blessed with powerful legs that allow it to move quickly and snatch up prey in its elongated jaws.
#. column 3: Prehistoric Ruler
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:533:0:2"
msgid "So long, spiny whatever-you-are.<br>   - Languid Lominsan"
msgstr "Прощай, колючая ты штуковина.<br>   — Ленивый лимсиец"

#. ja: 太古の強者
#. de: Herrscher der Urzeit
#. fr: Saurien ancien
#. column 0: Summon your spinettesaurus minion. Small though it may be, never let it be said that it has no spine.
#. column 1: The young of a prehistoric reptile, this creature possesses protruding spines that are likened to a sail, which it uses to regulate body temperature and perform courtship displays. In contrast to its stunted forelimbs, it is blessed with powerful legs that allow it to move quickly and snatch up prey in its elongated jaws.
#. column 2: So long, spiny whatever-you-are.<br>   - Languid Lominsan
#. column 4: Renders all allies within range immune to attacks by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:533:0:3"
msgid "Prehistoric Ruler"
msgstr "Властелин древности"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方を、タイプ「モンスター」からの攻撃に対して無敵にする。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>5秒
#. de: Macht eigene Trabanten in der Nähe unempfindlich für Angriffe von Monstern.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5 Sekunden
#. fr: Rend les mascottes dans l'aire d'effet invulnérables aux attaques venant des ennemis de type “Monstre”.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. column 0: Summon your spinettesaurus minion. Small though it may be, never let it be said that it has no spine.
#. column 1: The young of a prehistoric reptile, this creature possesses protruding spines that are likened to a sail, which it uses to regulate body temperature and perform courtship displays. In contrast to its stunted forelimbs, it is blessed with powerful legs that allow it to move quickly and snatch up prey in its elongated jaws.
#. column 2: So long, spiny whatever-you-are.<br>   - Languid Lominsan
#. column 3: Prehistoric Ruler
