#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ペルペル」を呼び出す。<br>ペルペル族を模した魔法人形。おすすめですよ、お土産に！
#. de: Du rufst deine Pelupelu-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Eine echte Empfehlung. Also als Mitbringsel natürlich!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Pelupelu miniature, une poupée magique à l'effigie d'un membre de ce peuple de marchands. Idéal pour offrir comme souvenir !
#. column 1: A series of this automaton was crafted by a potsworn goldsmith to serve as a promotional souvenir for the Pelupelu-run Turali Travel Agency. While the use of Kozama'uka lumber lends it a homespun appearance, it moves in a highly lifelike manner thanks to the advanced mechanisms within.
#. column 2: The Pelupelu value the act of<br>spreading joy through trade.<br>   - Erenville
#. column 3: Coin Counting
#. column 4: Delivers 10% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:534:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Pelupelu minion. The perfect souvenir, if it does say so itself."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру пелупелу. Идеальный сувенир — уж она-то знает."

#. ja: ペルペル族が開業した旅行公司の土産品として、アースンシャイアの壺匠が製作した土産品の人形。コザマル・カの木材を用いた素朴な見た目になっているが、壺匠の彫金技術の粋を凝らした機構で元気に歩き回るようだ
#. de: Diese magische Marionette wurde von den Topfwerkern Irdehaldes als Mitbringsel für die Reiseagentur Tural angefertigt. Rein äußerlich betrachtet sticht vor allem das fein verarbeitete Kozama'uka-Holz hervor, für echtes Staunen sorgt aber der filigran verbaute Laufmechanismus, mithilfe dessen sie luftig-leicht über Stock und Stein watschelt.
#. fr: Cette poupée a été fabriquée par une main-du-pot de La Fournée dans l'optique d'être vendue comme souvenir à la boutique de l'agence Tural Voyages. Si sa conception à base de bois de Kozama'uka lui donne un aspect simpliste, ne vous y trompez pas : la réelle prouesse se situe dans la complexité de son mécanisme interne qui rend les mouvements de la poupée criants de vérité, montrant ainsi tout le talent d'orfèvrerie des mains-du-pot.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Pelupelu minion. The perfect souvenir, if it does say so itself.
#. column 2: The Pelupelu value the act of<br>spreading joy through trade.<br>   - Erenville
#. column 3: Coin Counting
#. column 4: Delivers 10% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:534:0:1"
msgid "A series of this automaton was crafted by a potsworn goldsmith to serve as a promotional souvenir for the Pelupelu-run Turali Travel Agency. While the use of Kozama'uka lumber lends it a homespun appearance, it moves in a highly lifelike manner thanks to the advanced mechanisms within."
msgstr "Эту серию автоматонов изготовил ювелир из гончаров в качестве сувениров для турального турагентства пелупелу. Дерево из Козамауки придаёт им простой, домашний вид, а благодаря сложному механизму внутри они двигаются почти как живые."

#. ja: ウイウイ～
#. de: Ja, ja!
#. fr: Hop hop<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Pelupelu minion. The perfect souvenir, if it does say so itself.
#. column 1: A series of this automaton was crafted by a potsworn goldsmith to serve as a promotional souvenir for the Pelupelu-run Turali Travel Agency. While the use of Kozama'uka lumber lends it a homespun appearance, it moves in a highly lifelike manner thanks to the advanced mechanisms within.
#. column 3: Coin Counting
#. column 4: Delivers 10% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:534:0:2"
msgid "The Pelupelu value the act of<br>spreading joy through trade.<br>   - Erenville"
msgstr "Пелупелу верят, что торговля<br>приносит радость людям.<br>   — Эренвиль"

#. ja: 金勘定
#. de: Finanzgenie
#. fr: Gestion des finances
