msgid "Delivers 10% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone."
msgstr "Наносит 10% урона ближайшему вражескому арканному камню."

#. ja: ミニオン「ティンソルジャーS3」を呼び出す。<br>古の王国の兵士をイメージして作られたらしい、古びた玩具人形
#. de: Du rufst deinen Spielzeugsoldaten S3 als Begleiter herbei. Eine alte Metallpuppe, welche Soldaten eines längst vergangenen Königreichs nachempfunden sein soll.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte soldat d'étain S3, une poupée magique à l'effigie d'un soldat d'un royaume ancien.
#. column 1: Boasting remarkably expressive movements despite its old-fashioned design, this tin soldier was brought to Limsa Lominsa on a vessel that plies the trade route west. According to the merchant who acquired it, such pieces were made in the likeness of a soldier of a bygone and faraway kingdom.
#. column 2: I shall have to examine one of<br>these mechanical soldiers later.<br>   - Y'shtola
#. column 3: Peace in the Realm
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:535:0:0"
msgid "Summon your tin soldier S3 minion. The toy with a body of tin and a heart of gold."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Оловянный солдатик S3». Игрушка из олова, да с золотым сердцем."

#. ja: 古びてはいるが、緻密な動作を見せる金属製の玩具人形。西方航路を往復する交易船がリムサ・ロミンサに持ち込んだ品とのこと。取り扱っていた商人によれば、古の王国の兵士をイメージして作られたものらしい
#. de: Wenn er auch alt und etwas verrostet erscheinen mag, so bewegt sich dieser metallene Spielzeugsoldat nach wie vor, als wäre er gestern erst zusammengesetzt worden. Er soll auf einem Handelsschiff von weit her im Westen seinen Weg nach Limsa Lominsa gefunden haben und will man seinem händereibenden Verkäufer glauben, basiert sein Aussehen auf dem einer Soldateneinheit eines erhabenen Königreichs längst vergangener Zeiten.
#. fr: Malgré son grand âge, cette poupée métallique n'a rien perdu de sa mobilité. Le négociant de Limsa Lominsa qui se l'est procurée auprès d'un long-courrier venu de l'ouest lointain raconte qu'elle serait la repré<shy>sen<shy>ta<shy>tion d'un soldat d'un royaume ancien.
#. column 0: Summon your tin soldier S3 minion. The toy with a body of tin and a heart of gold.
#. column 2: I shall have to examine one of<br>these mechanical soldiers later.<br>   - Y'shtola
#. column 3: Peace in the Realm
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:535:0:1"
msgid "Boasting remarkably expressive movements despite its old-fashioned design, this tin soldier was brought to Limsa Lominsa on a vessel that plies the trade route west. According to the merchant who acquired it, such pieces were made in the likeness of a soldier of a bygone and faraway kingdom."
msgstr "Несмотря на старомодный вид, этот оловянный солдатик двигается на удивление выразительно. Его привезли в Лимсу-Ломинсу на корабле, ходящем по западному торговому маршруту. По словам продавца, такие игрушки делали по образу солдат из давно исчезнувшего далёкого королевства."

#. ja: シュィーン
#. de: Wusch!
#. fr: Pshhhiii...
#. column 0: Summon your tin soldier S3 minion. The toy with a body of tin and a heart of gold.
#. column 1: Boasting remarkably expressive movements despite its old-fashioned design, this tin soldier was brought to Limsa Lominsa on a vessel that plies the trade route west. According to the merchant who acquired it, such pieces were made in the likeness of a soldier of a bygone and faraway kingdom.
#. column 3: Peace in the Realm
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:535:0:2"
msgid "I shall have to examine one of<br>these mechanical soldiers later.<br>   - Y'shtola"
msgstr "Надо будет потом изучить одного<br>из этих механических солдатиков.<br>   — Я'штола"

#. ja: 王国安泰
#. de: Frieden für das Reich
#. fr: Relève de la garde
#. column 0: Summon your tin soldier S3 minion. The toy with a body of tin and a heart of gold.
#. column 1: Boasting remarkably expressive movements despite its old-fashioned design, this tin soldier was brought to Limsa Lominsa on a vessel that plies the trade route west. According to the merchant who acquired it, such pieces were made in the likeness of a soldier of a bygone and faraway kingdom.
#. column 2: I shall have to examine one of<br>these mechanical soldiers later.<br>   - Y'shtola
#. column 4: Transports action party to the central summoning Gate.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:535:0:3"
msgid "Peace in the Realm"
msgstr "Мир в королевстве"

#. ja: 特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンを自軍の中央ゲート内へワープさせる。
#. de: Versetzt die ausführenden Trabanten zurück zu Tor B.
#. fr: Téléporte les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT vers le portail central.
#. column 0: Summon your tin soldier S3 minion. The toy with a body of tin and a heart of gold.
#. column 1: Boasting remarkably expressive movements despite its old-fashioned design, this tin soldier was brought to Limsa Lominsa on a vessel that plies the trade route west. According to the merchant who acquired it, such pieces were made in the likeness of a soldier of a bygone and faraway kingdom.
#. column 2: I shall have to examine one of<br>these mechanical soldiers later.<br>   - Y'shtola
#. column 3: Peace in the Realm
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:535:0:4"
msgid "Transports action party to the central summoning Gate."
msgstr "Переносит союзников, потративших очки особых умений, к центральным воротам призыва."

#. ja: ミニオン「イケニエ様」を呼び出す。<br>石製の短刀に宿った古き精霊。散りゆく生命が何よりのごちそう
#. de: Du rufst Meister Messer als Begleiter herbei. Ein meisterhafter Messergeist, dessen einzige Freude in dem Blut deiner Feinde zu finden ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Sire Sacrifice, un esprit ancien entré en possession d'un poignard de pierre et qui se repaît de l'énergie vitale environnante.
#. column 1: In the course of being used in ritual sacrifices to ward off famine, this ancient stone dagger awakened as a malevolent spirit driven by an insatiable hunger for life force. By journeying with you and absorbing the essence of felled fiends, it is hoped that it will be able to suppress its murderous urges.
#. column 2: Another sacrificial ritual!<br>   - X'rhun Tia
#. column 3: Sacrificial Stab
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:536:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Deathservant minion. Literally has a taste for life."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Слуга смерти». В буквальном смысле жаждет жизни."

#. ja: 最近、出土した古い石製の短刀。飢饉を払う供犠で数多の生贄を屠るうちに、底無しのはらへりを振りまく悪しき精霊と化してしまった。だが、冒険者と共に旅することで魔物の散りゆく生命を吸い続ければ、次第に満たされていくだろう
#. de: Vor Kurzem erst wurde dieses steinerne Messer ausgegraben und verwandelte sich aufgrund der vielen durch Hungersnot dahingerafften Seelen alsbald in einen bösartigen Geist. Allein die Aussicht, an deiner Seite seine Klinge in die Gedärme deiner Feinde tauchen zu können, hält es bei dir.
#. fr: Cet ancien poignard en pierre accomplissait de nombreux sacrifices pour conjurer la famine, jusqu'au moment où il s'est transformé en un esprit maléfique qui étend la faim sans fin. Voilà pourquoi il a décidé de suivre les aventuriers pourfendeurs de monstres, dans l'espoir de se rassasier en absorbant leur énergie vitale.
#. column 0: Summon your Deathservant minion. Literally has a taste for life.
#. column 2: Another sacrificial ritual!<br>   - X'rhun Tia
#. column 3: Sacrificial Stab
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:536:0:1"
msgid "In the course of being used in ritual sacrifices to ward off famine, this ancient stone dagger awakened as a malevolent spirit driven by an insatiable hunger for life force. By journeying with you and absorbing the essence of felled fiends, it is hoped that it will be able to suppress its murderous urges."
msgstr "Этот древний каменный кинжал использовали в жертвоприношениях, чтобы отвратить голод. От множества жертв он пробудился злым духом, ненасытно жаждущим жизненной силы. Путешествуя с тобой и впитывая сущность поверженных чудовищ, он, возможно, утихомирит свою тягу к убийствам."

#. ja: テケ、テケケ…
#. de: Kekekeke<nbsp>... Bluuut!
#. fr: Gnéhé<nbsp>! Gnéhéhéhé...
#. column 0: Summon your Deathservant minion. Literally has a taste for life.
#. column 1: In the course of being used in ritual sacrifices to ward off famine, this ancient stone dagger awakened as a malevolent spirit driven by an insatiable hunger for life force. By journeying with you and absorbing the essence of felled fiends, it is hoped that it will be able to suppress its murderous urges.
