#. ja: ミニオン「淡闇の雲」を呼び出す。<br>暗闇の雲を模した魔法人形。死すらも無への過程に過ぎぬと知れ……
#. de: Du rufst dein Dunstwölkchen der Dunkelheit als Begleiter herbei. Wer sich in seiner Nähe aufhält, sollte das Husten, Niesen und Herumwedeln tunlichst vermeiden, sonst ist das Dunstwölkchen für immer verschwunden.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte vapeur de Ténèbres, une poupée magique à l'effigie du Nuage de Ténèbres. Dans le néant, la mort n'est qu'un état passager...
#. column 1: In the course of recalling your ferocious battle with the Cloud of Darkness, this curious mammet somehow came to be in your possession. While its design is highly reminiscent of the works of the notorious goldsmith who crafted the wind-up succubus, there is no way to ascertain the truth of its origin.
#. column 2: I can't begin to imagine how<br>powerful it must have been.<br>   - Ryne
#. column 3: Trickle of Darkness
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:537:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wisp of Darkness minion. What it cannot smother, it nibbles. What it cannot nibble, it tickles."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Сгусток Тьмы». Чего не задушит, то погрызёт. А чего не погрызёт — защекочет."

#. ja: 暗闇の雲との激闘を想起するなかで、どこからともなく手元へ転がり込んでいた魔法人形。かつてマメット・サキュバスなどの優れた人形を創り出していた、失踪したはずの某彫金師の作風と似るが、その来歴は定かでない
#. de: Diese magische Marionette fand auf mysteriöse Weise ihren Weg zu dir, nachdem du deinen Kampf mit der Wolke der Dunkelheit erneut durchlebt hattest. Ihre Bauart ähnelt der einer gewissen Sukkubus-Puppe, obwohl der verantwortliche Goldschmied eigentlich schon längst verstorben sein sollte<nbsp>... oder etwa nicht?
#. fr: Cette effrayante poupée est tombée entre vos mains à l'issue de votre combat contre le Nuage de Ténèbres. Tout porte à croire que c'est une autre création de l'orfèvre à l'origine de la poupée succube. L'aurait-il façonnée au sein même du Monde des Ténèbres<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your wisp of Darkness minion. What it cannot smother, it nibbles. What it cannot nibble, it tickles.
#. column 2: I can't begin to imagine how<br>powerful it must have been.<br>   - Ryne
#. column 3: Trickle of Darkness
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:537:0:1"
msgid "In the course of recalling your ferocious battle with the Cloud of Darkness, this curious mammet somehow came to be in your possession. While its design is highly reminiscent of the works of the notorious goldsmith who crafted the wind-up succubus, there is no way to ascertain the truth of its origin."
msgstr "Пока ты вспоминал жестокую битву с Облаком Тьмы, эта странная кукла каким-то образом оказалась у тебя. Её облик напоминает работы печально известного ювелира, создавшего заводную суккубу, но откуда она взялась, неизвестно."

#. ja: 真ノ闇ニ溶ケルガイイ！
#. de: Das Nichts wird alles verschlingen!
#. fr: Plongez dans les Ténèbres<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wisp of Darkness minion. What it cannot smother, it nibbles. What it cannot nibble, it tickles.
#. column 1: In the course of recalling your ferocious battle with the Cloud of Darkness, this curious mammet somehow came to be in your possession. While its design is highly reminiscent of the works of the notorious goldsmith who crafted the wind-up succubus, there is no way to ascertain the truth of its origin.
#. column 3: Trickle of Darkness
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:537:0:2"
msgid "I can't begin to imagine how<br>powerful it must have been.<br>   - Ryne"
msgstr "И представить не могу,<br>насколько оно было могучим.<br>   — Райн"

#. ja: 闇の小氾濫
#. de: Versagt euch nicht der Dunkelheit!
#. fr: Vague de Ténèbres
#. column 0: Summon your wisp of Darkness minion. What it cannot smother, it nibbles. What it cannot nibble, it tickles.
#. column 1: In the course of recalling your ferocious battle with the Cloud of Darkness, this curious mammet somehow came to be in your possession. While its design is highly reminiscent of the works of the notorious goldsmith who crafted the wind-up succubus, there is no way to ascertain the truth of its origin.
#. column 2: I can't begin to imagine how<br>powerful it must have been.<br>   - Ryne
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:537:0:3"
msgid "Trickle of Darkness"
msgstr "Всплеск Тьмы"

