#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・テミス」を呼び出す。<br>テミスを模した魔法人形。思うがまま飛び給え
#. de: Du rufst deine Themis-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie ist so loyal wie kein Zweiter und unterliegt nicht den Fesseln dieser Welt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Thémis miniature, une poupée magique à l'effigie du médiateur du Concile des Quatorze. Avec l'infini pour seul horizon<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of Themis, two of these mammets were produced at Professor Claudien's behest, with one being delivered by your own hands to Erichthonios. Cutting-edge Sharlayan techniques were employed in its fabrication, that it might not look amiss in the world of the ancients.
#. column 2: Were my eyes mistaken?<br>Was that Themis?<br>   - Erichthonios
#. column 3: Conciliation
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:538:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Themis minion. A minion as loyal as your star is bright─a minion not bound by the confines of this world, or any other."
msgstr "Призвать заводного Фемиса. Верность ему под стать яркости твоей звезды. Он не скован пределами ни этого мира, ни любого другого."

#. ja: テミスを模した魔法人形。クローディエンの発案により合計2体が作られ、片方は冒険者の手でエリクトニオスに届けられた。古代世界にあっても違和感のないよう、シャーレアンの技術の粋を集めて偽装が施されているらしい
#. de: Professor Claudien ließ diese Puppe nach dem Abbild Themis' herstellen. Du selbst hast ein Exemplar an Erichthonios ausgeliefert. Bei der Herstellung wurden modernste Techniken aus Sharlayan angewandt, sodass die Puppen auch in der Welt der Alten nicht fehl am Platz wirken.
#. fr: Cette poupée magique représente Thémis. En plus de celui-ci, le professeur Claudien n'a fabriqué qu'un seul autre exemplaire, qu'il a offert à Érichthonios. Grâce à la technologie sharlayanaise, ce jouet ne devrait pas éveiller de soupçons dans l'ancien monde.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Themis minion. A minion as loyal as your star is bright─a minion not bound by the confines of this world, or any other.
#. column 2: Were my eyes mistaken?<br>Was that Themis?<br>   - Erichthonios
#. column 3: Conciliation
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:538:0:1"
msgid "Designed in the likeness of Themis, two of these mammets were produced at Professor Claudien's behest, with one being delivered by your own hands to Erichthonios. Cutting-edge Sharlayan techniques were employed in its fabrication, that it might not look amiss in the world of the ancients."
msgstr "По распоряжению профессора Клодиена создали две куклы, изображающие Фемиду. Одну из них ты сам доставил Эрихтонию. Чтобы кукла не выделялась в мире древних, при её создании применили новейшие технологии Шалланского университета."

#. ja: サセナイヨ…！
#. de: Es sind unsere Fehler, die uns klüger machen.
#. fr: Pas si vite<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Themis minion. A minion as loyal as your star is bright─a minion not bound by the confines of this world, or any other.
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of Themis, two of these mammets were produced at Professor Claudien's behest, with one being delivered by your own hands to Erichthonios. Cutting-edge Sharlayan techniques were employed in its fabrication, that it might not look amiss in the world of the ancients.
#. column 3: Conciliation
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppets</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:538:0:2"
msgid "Were my eyes mistaken?<br>Was that Themis?<br>   - Erichthonios"
msgstr "Я не обознался?<br>Это же Фемис?<br>   — Эрихтоний"

#. ja: 調停
#. de: Schlichtung
#. fr: Médiation
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Themis minion. A minion as loyal as your star is bright─a minion not bound by the confines of this world, or any other.
