#. ja: ミニオン「ローンブレイザー」を呼び出す。<br>XTRR社が製作した機関車の玩具。レールは不要
#. de: Du rufst deinen Dämmertuff als Begleiter herbei. Die kleine, aber genauso feine Miniaturausgabe des Dämmerbruchs, der legendären Erdseimlok der Xak Tural Eisenbahngesellschaft.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Exaltaurore, un jouet magique re<shy>pré<shy>sen<shy>tant un train de la compagnie de chemin de fer. Pas besoin de rails<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Created by Xak Tural Railing as part of a publicity campaign, this toy locomotive marries a simple and warm design with spirited movement. So well received was the product by staff members, the company is entertaining the possibility of venturing into toy manufacturing in earnest.
#. column 2: Behold, the pinnacle of<br>locomotive engineering!<br>   - Shenza
#. column 3: Express Train
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:539:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Lawnblazer minion. Railroad not required."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Газонокоситель». Рельсы не нужны."

#. ja: 広報活動の一環として、XTRR社が製作した機関車の玩具。あたたかみのある簡素な作りだが、走りっぷりは軽快であり社員一同には好評とのこと。そのため、同社では玩具業界に進出しようという動きもあるようだ
#. de: Die Xak Tural Eisenbahngesellschaft hat mit diesem Spielzeug ihren Dämmerbruch verewigt und plant nun aufgrund der vielen Anfragen interessierter Eltern und Großeltern nicht nur die Herzen von Kindern, sondern auch die Börsen der Modellbahnindustrie zu erobern.
#. fr: Ce modèle réduit a pour but de promouvoir la compagnie de chemin de fer. Malgré son apparence simpliste, cette locomotive a tout d'une grande quand il s'agit de parcourir de grandes distances. Son succès est si retentissant que des employés de la compagnie envisagent de concevoir et commercialiser d'autres jouets.
#. column 0: Summon your Lawnblazer minion. Railroad not required.
#. column 2: Behold, the pinnacle of<br>locomotive engineering!<br>   - Shenza
#. column 3: Express Train
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:539:0:1"
msgid "Created by Xak Tural Railing as part of a publicity campaign, this toy locomotive marries a simple and warm design with spirited movement. So well received was the product by staff members, the company is entertaining the possibility of venturing into toy manufacturing in earnest."
msgstr "Эту игрушечную паровозную машину создала компания железных дорог Хак Турал в рамках рекламной кампании. У неё простой, уютный вид, а движется она бойко. Игрушка так понравилась сотрудникам, что компания всерьёз подумывает заняться производством игрушек."

#. ja: シュポポ
#. de: Tuff tuff!
#. fr: Tchou-tchou-tchou<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Lawnblazer minion. Railroad not required.
#. column 1: Created by Xak Tural Railing as part of a publicity campaign, this toy locomotive marries a simple and warm design with spirited movement. So well received was the product by staff members, the company is entertaining the possibility of venturing into toy manufacturing in earnest.
#. column 3: Express Train
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
