msgid "Behold, the pinnacle of<br>locomotive engineering!<br>   - Shenza"
msgstr "Перед вами вершина<br>паровозостроения!<br>   — Шенза"

#. ja: 特急運転
#. de: Schnellzug
#. fr: Plein régime<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Lawnblazer minion. Railroad not required.
