#. ja: ミニオン「プサマテ」を呼び出す。<br>使い魔トライトンから剥落した存在。赤いやつ
#. de: Du rufst Psamathe als Begleiter herbei. Ein Wesen, das dem feueraffinen Familiar Triton entstammt. Du weißt schon: der Rote von den Dreien.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Psamathée, un fragment de couleur rouge du familier Tritonien.
#. column 1: This peculiar entity appears to have manifested from Triton, the fire-wielding familiar that served among the collective of three that controlled the weather on the Occult Crescent. Though its intelligence has faded over the course of long years, in this diminutive state, it should largely be harmless.
#. column 2: You would be well advised to ask<br>yourself: can I stand the heat?<br>   - Charlys
#. column 3: Flame Fest
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:540:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Psamathe minion. An entity born of the fire-wielding familiar Triton. That's the red one."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника Псамате. Он появился из огненного фамильяра Тритона. Это красный."

#. ja: 熱を操る使い魔、トライトンから剥落した存在。元はといえば、三体一組で三日月島の気象を制御する役目を担っていたが、長き時を経て知性が欠如してしまったらしい。とはいえ、小さくなった今では、おおむね無害
#. de: Dieses Wesen entstammt dem feurigen Triton, einem der drei Familiare, die es vermögen, das Wetter auf Kreszentia zu beeinflussen. Da es mit der Zeit immer mehr seiner Intelligenz einbüßen musste, stellt es nun keine Gefahr mehr dar - zur Erleichterung aller.
#. fr: Psamathée est un fragment de Tritonien, un familier capable de manipuler la chaleur. À l'origine, il travaillait de concert avec deux autres congénères pour contrôler les conditions météorologiques de l'île de Lunule, mais il semble avoir perdu l'esprit au fil du temps. Heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, sa dangerosité a diminué en même temps que sa taille.
#. column 0: Summon your Psamathe minion. An entity born of the fire-wielding familiar Triton. That's the red one.
#. column 2: You would be well advised to ask<br>yourself: can I stand the heat?<br>   - Charlys
#. column 3: Flame Fest
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:540:0:1"
msgid "This peculiar entity appears to have manifested from Triton, the fire-wielding familiar that served among the collective of three that controlled the weather on the Occult Crescent. Though its intelligence has faded over the course of long years, in this diminutive state, it should largely be harmless."
msgstr "Это странное существо, похоже, возникло из Тритона — огненного фамильяра, который вместе с двумя другими управлял погодой на Таинственном полумесяце. За долгие годы разум его угас, но теперь, в таком крошечном виде, он едва ли опасен."

#. ja: ぶい～っ！
#. de: Ihr solltet Euch im Klaren darüber sein, ob Ihr eine solche Hitze überhaupt ertragen könnt.<br><i>Charlys</i>
#. fr: Grouiiin<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Psamathe minion. An entity born of the fire-wielding familiar Triton. That's the red one.
#. column 1: This peculiar entity appears to have manifested from Triton, the fire-wielding familiar that served among the collective of three that controlled the weather on the Occult Crescent. Though its intelligence has faded over the course of long years, in this diminutive state, it should largely be harmless.
#. column 3: Flame Fest
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:540:0:2"
msgid "You would be well advised to ask<br>yourself: can I stand the heat?<br>   - Charlys"
msgstr "Тебе лучше хорошенько подумать:<br>выдержишь ли ты такую жару?<br>   — Чарлис"

#. ja: 火祭り
#. de: Flammenfest
#. fr: Festival du feu
#. column 0: Summon your Psamathe minion. An entity born of the fire-wielding familiar Triton. That's the red one.
#. column 1: This peculiar entity appears to have manifested from Triton, the fire-wielding familiar that served among the collective of three that controlled the weather on the Occult Crescent. Though its intelligence has faded over the course of long years, in this diminutive state, it should largely be harmless.
#. column 2: You would be well advised to ask<br>yourself: can I stand the heat?<br>   - Charlys
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
