#. ja: ミニオン「ナイアド」を呼び出す。<br>使い魔ネレゲイドから剥落した存在。紫のやつ
#. de: Du rufst Naiad als Begleiter herbei. Ein Wesen, das dem eisaffinen Familiar Nereid entstammt. Du weißt schon: der Lilane von den Dreien.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Naïade, un fragment de couleur violette du familier Néregat.
#. column 1: This peculiar entity appears to have manifested from Nereid, the ice-wielding familiar that served among the collective of three that controlled the weather on the Occult Crescent. Though its sense of morality has faded over the course of long years, in this diminutive state, it should largely be harmless.
#. column 2: I have no doubt that it is capable<br>of chilling victims to the bone!<br>   - The Impresario
#. column 3: Snow Fest
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:541:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Naiad minion. An entity born of the ice-wielding familiar Nereid. That's the purple one."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника Наиады. Она появилась из ледяного фамильяра Нереида. Это фиолетовая."

#. ja: 冷気を操る使い魔、ネレゲイドから剥落した存在。元はといえば、三体一組で三日月島の気象を制御する役目を担っていたが、長き時を経て倫理性が欠如してしまったらしい。とはいえ、小さくなった今では、おおよそ無害
#. de: Dieses Wesen entstammt dem eisigen Nereid, einem der drei Familiare, die es vermögen, das Wetter auf Kreszentia zu beeinflussen. Da es mit der Zeit immer mehr seiner Intelligenz einbüßen musste, stellt es nun keine Gefahr mehr dar - zur Erleichterung aller.
#. fr: Naïade est un fragment de Néregat, un familier capable de manipuler le froid. À l'origine, il travaillait de concert avec deux autres congénères pour contrôler les conditions météorologiques de l'île de Lunule, mais il semble avoir perdu son sens de l'éthique au fil du temps. Heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, sa dangerosité a diminué en même temps que sa taille.
#. column 0: Summon your Naiad minion. An entity born of the ice-wielding familiar Nereid. That's the purple one.
#. column 2: I have no doubt that it is capable<br>of chilling victims to the bone!<br>   - The Impresario
#. column 3: Snow Fest
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:541:0:1"
msgid "This peculiar entity appears to have manifested from Nereid, the ice-wielding familiar that served among the collective of three that controlled the weather on the Occult Crescent. Though its sense of morality has faded over the course of long years, in this diminutive state, it should largely be harmless."
msgstr "Это странное существо, похоже, возникло из Нереида — ледяного фамильяра, который вместе с двумя другими управлял погодой на Таинственном полумесяце. За долгие годы у него притупилось чувство морали, но теперь, в таком крошечном виде, он едва ли опасен."

#. ja: ぶいぶいぶいっ
#. de: Brrr ... Ist das kalt. Daran werde ich mich nie gewöhnen.<br><i>Lorens</i>
#. fr: Grouin, grouin, grouin<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Naiad minion. An entity born of the ice-wielding familiar Nereid. That's the purple one.
#. column 1: This peculiar entity appears to have manifested from Nereid, the ice-wielding familiar that served among the collective of three that controlled the weather on the Occult Crescent. Though its sense of morality has faded over the course of long years, in this diminutive state, it should largely be harmless.
#. column 3: Snow Fest
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:541:0:2"
msgid "I have no doubt that it is capable<br>of chilling victims to the bone!<br>   - The Impresario"
msgstr "Не сомневаюсь, он может<br>проморозить жертву до костей!<br>   — Импресарио"

#. ja: 雪祭り
#. de: Schneefest
#. fr: Festival de la neige
#. column 0: Summon your Naiad minion. An entity born of the ice-wielding familiar Nereid. That's the purple one.
#. column 1: This peculiar entity appears to have manifested from Nereid, the ice-wielding familiar that served among the collective of three that controlled the weather on the Occult Crescent. Though its sense of morality has faded over the course of long years, in this diminutive state, it should largely be harmless.
#. column 2: I have no doubt that it is capable<br>of chilling victims to the bone!<br>   - The Impresario
#. column 4: Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:541:0:3"
msgid "Snow Fest"
msgstr "Праздник снега"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる味方の特殊技ポイントを10上昇させる。ただし特殊技が同効果なミニオンを除く。
#. de: Erhöht die Technikpunkte eigener Trabanten in der Nähe um 10, außer wenn sie ebenfalls diesen Effekt verursachen können.
#. fr: Augmente de 10 les PdT des mascottes dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes dont la technique a le même effet ne sont pas concernées.
#. column 0: Summon your Naiad minion. An entity born of the ice-wielding familiar Nereid. That's the purple one.
#. column 1: This peculiar entity appears to have manifested from Nereid, the ice-wielding familiar that served among the collective of three that controlled the weather on the Occult Crescent. Though its sense of morality has faded over the course of long years, in this diminutive state, it should largely be harmless.
#. column 2: I have no doubt that it is capable<br>of chilling victims to the bone!<br>   - The Impresario
#. column 3: Snow Fest
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:541:0:4"
msgid "Grants 10 action points to all allies within range who do not have similar actions."
msgstr "Даёт 10 очков особых умений всем союзникам в радиусе действия, у которых нет похожего умения."

#. ja: ミニオン「ダイモス」を呼び出す。<br>使い魔フォーボスから剥落した存在。緑のやつ
#. de: Du rufst Deimos als Begleiter herbei. Ein Wesen, das dem giftaffinen Familiar Phobos entstammt. Du weißt schon: der Grüne von den Dreien.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Déimos, un fragment de couleur verte du familier Phobos.
#. column 1: This peculiar entity appears to have manifested from Phobos, the poison-wielding familiar that served among the collective of three that controlled the weather on the Occult Crescent. Though its sense of propriety has faded over the course of long years, in this diminutive state, it should largely be harmless.
#. column 2: Well, of course they'll be poisoned!<br>How else would I gauge the efficacy<br>of your work?<br>   - Severian
#. column 3: Poison Fest
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:542:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Deimos minion. An entity born of the poison-wielding familiar Phobos. That's the green one."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника Деймоса. Он появился из ядовитого фамильяра Фобоса. Это зелёный."

#. ja: 毒を操る使い魔、フォーボスから剥落した存在。元はといえば、三体一組で三日月島の気象を制御する役目を担っていたが、長き時を経て品性が欠如してしまったらしい。とはいえ、小さくなった今では、ほとんど無害
#. de: Dieses Wesen entstammt dem giftigen Phobos, einem der drei Familiare, die es vermögen, das Wetter auf Kreszentia zu beeinflussen. Da es mit der Zeit immer mehr seiner Intelligenz einbüßen musste, stellt es nun keine Gefahr mehr dar - zur Erleichterung aller.
#. fr: Déimos est un fragment de Phobos, un familier capable de manipuler le poison. À l'origine, il travaillait de concert avec deux autres congénères pour contrôler les conditions météorologiques de l'île de Lunule, mais il semble avoir perdu son caractère au fil du temps. Heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, sa dangerosité a diminué en même temps que sa taille.
#. column 0: Summon your Deimos minion. An entity born of the poison-wielding familiar Phobos. That's the green one.
#. column 2: Well, of course they'll be poisoned!<br>How else would I gauge the efficacy<br>of your work?<br>   - Severian
#. column 3: Poison Fest
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:542:0:1"
msgid "This peculiar entity appears to have manifested from Phobos, the poison-wielding familiar that served among the collective of three that controlled the weather on the Occult Crescent. Though its sense of propriety has faded over the course of long years, in this diminutive state, it should largely be harmless."
msgstr "Это странное существо, похоже, возникло из Фобоса — ядовитого фамильяра, который вместе с двумя другими управлял погодой на Таинственном полумесяце. За долгие годы оно утратило чувство приличий, но теперь, в таком крошечном виде, едва ли опасно."

#. ja: ぶゃははは
#. de: Hoffentlich wirkt das Gegengift ...<br><i>Yugiri</i>
#. fr: Grouahahaha<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Deimos minion. An entity born of the poison-wielding familiar Phobos. That's the green one.
#. column 1: This peculiar entity appears to have manifested from Phobos, the poison-wielding familiar that served among the collective of three that controlled the weather on the Occult Crescent. Though its sense of propriety has faded over the course of long years, in this diminutive state, it should largely be harmless.
#. column 3: Poison Fest
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:542:0:2"
msgid "Well, of course they'll be poisoned!<br>How else would I gauge the efficacy<br>of your work?<br>   - Severian"
msgstr "Ну конечно, они отравятся!<br>Как ещё я проверю, насколько<br>эффективна твоя работа?<br>   — Севериан"

#. ja: 毒祭り
#. de: Giftfest
#. fr: Festival du poison
#. column 0: Summon your Deimos minion. An entity born of the poison-wielding familiar Phobos. That's the green one.
#. column 1: This peculiar entity appears to have manifested from Phobos, the poison-wielding familiar that served among the collective of three that controlled the weather on the Occult Crescent. Though its sense of propriety has faded over the course of long years, in this diminutive state, it should largely be harmless.
#. column 2: Well, of course they'll be poisoned!<br>How else would I gauge the efficacy<br>of your work?<br>   - Severian
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:542:0:3"
msgid "Poison Fest"
msgstr "Праздник яда"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK120のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 120 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 120 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et les projette en arrière.
#. column 0: Summon your Deimos minion. An entity born of the poison-wielding familiar Phobos. That's the green one.
#. column 1: This peculiar entity appears to have manifested from Phobos, the poison-wielding familiar that served among the collective of three that controlled the weather on the Occult Crescent. Though its sense of propriety has faded over the course of long years, in this diminutive state, it should largely be harmless.
#. column 2: Well, of course they'll be poisoned!<br>How else would I gauge the efficacy<br>of your work?<br>   - Severian
#. column 3: Poison Fest
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:542:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 120 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「マントヒヒ」を呼び出す。<br>身体を覆うマントのような長い体毛が特徴的なサル。もふもふで暑い
#. de: Du rufst deinen manteligen Pavian als Begleiter herbei. Sein Fell umgibt diesen Affen wie ein Mantel. So gemütlich und warm<nbsp>...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte babouin hamadryas, un petit singe à poil très long et touffu.
#. column 1: The male of this species of baboon is identifiable by the luxurious growth of fur around its shoulders, which gives the impression of a mantle. In stark contrast, its buttocks are completely bare, with plump, red cheeks on display for all and sundry to see. In certain parts of the Far East, baboons are regarded fondly by avid readers due to their cry resembling the local name of a popular work of fantasy.
#. column 2: This clearing is currently as bare<br>as a white baboon's buttocks.<br>   - Felicitous Furball
#. column 3: Gummy Grin
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:543:0:0"
msgid "Summon your boon baboon minion. May sound like a generous creature, but don't expect any favors."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Щедрый бабуин». Звучит щедро, но на одолжения не рассчитывай."

#. ja: 腰丈のマントを羽織ったような長毛がオスの特徴。反面、ぷっくりとした赤い臀部は無毛で丸出しである。東方のとある地域では、人気の幻想小説の題とヒヒの音が似るとして、小説のファンの間で愛でられているようだ
#. de: Das hüftlange, mantelartige Fell dieses Affen ist eine Besonderheit der Männchen, welches in starkem Kontrast zu seinem völlig nackten, grellroten Hinterteil steht. Im Fernen Osten wird diese Affenart von Literaturliebhabern verehrt, da deren Ruf dem Titel einer Fantasiegeschichte ähnelt.
#. fr: Les babouins hamadryas mâles se distinguent par des poils très longs qui ressemblent à une cape tombant jusqu'aux hanches. À l'inverse, leur arrière-train écarlate bien dodu est dénué de toute pilosité. Certains amateurs de littérature orientale les apprécient beaucoup car leur cri ressemble au titre d'un célèbre roman fantastique.
#. column 0: Summon your boon baboon minion. May sound like a generous creature, but don't expect any favors.
#. column 2: This clearing is currently as bare<br>as a white baboon's buttocks.<br>   - Felicitous Furball
#. column 3: Gummy Grin
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:543:0:1"
msgid "The male of this species of baboon is identifiable by the luxurious growth of fur around its shoulders, which gives the impression of a mantle. In stark contrast, its buttocks are completely bare, with plump, red cheeks on display for all and sundry to see. In certain parts of the Far East, baboons are regarded fondly by avid readers due to their cry resembling the local name of a popular work of fantasy."
msgstr "Самца этого вида бабуинов легко узнать по густой шерсти на плечах, словно накинутой мантии. А вот ягодицы у него совсем голые, с пухлыми красными щёчками напоказ. На востоке эти обезьяны любимы читателями: их крик напоминает название популярного местного фэнтези."

#. ja: ヒッヒッ
#. de: Hihiii
#. fr: Hiii hiii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your boon baboon minion. May sound like a generous creature, but don't expect any favors.
#. column 1: The male of this species of baboon is identifiable by the luxurious growth of fur around its shoulders, which gives the impression of a mantle. In stark contrast, its buttocks are completely bare, with plump, red cheeks on display for all and sundry to see. In certain parts of the Far East, baboons are regarded fondly by avid readers due to their cry resembling the local name of a popular work of fantasy.
#. column 3: Gummy Grin
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:543:0:2"
msgid "This clearing is currently as bare<br>as a white baboon's buttocks.<br>   - Felicitous Furball"
msgstr "Эта поляна сейчас голая,<br>как белый бабуин задом.<br>   — Счастливый пушистик"

#. ja: 歯茎をむき出す
#. de: Zähne zeigen
#. fr: Grimace dentée
#. column 0: Summon your boon baboon minion. May sound like a generous creature, but don't expect any favors.
#. column 1: The male of this species of baboon is identifiable by the luxurious growth of fur around its shoulders, which gives the impression of a mantle. In stark contrast, its buttocks are completely bare, with plump, red cheeks on display for all and sundry to see. In certain parts of the Far East, baboons are regarded fondly by avid readers due to their cry resembling the local name of a popular work of fantasy.
#. column 2: This clearing is currently as bare<br>as a white baboon's buttocks.<br>   - Felicitous Furball
#. column 4: Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:543:0:3"
msgid "Gummy Grin"
msgstr "Оскал"

#. ja: 敵軍のシールドに70%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt einem gegnerischen Schild 70 % Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls er schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 70% de sa solidité au bouclier ennemi. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your boon baboon minion. May sound like a generous creature, but don't expect any favors.
#. column 1: The male of this species of baboon is identifiable by the luxurious growth of fur around its shoulders, which gives the impression of a mantle. In stark contrast, its buttocks are completely bare, with plump, red cheeks on display for all and sundry to see. In certain parts of the Far East, baboons are regarded fondly by avid readers due to their cry resembling the local name of a popular work of fantasy.
#. column 2: This clearing is currently as bare<br>as a white baboon's buttocks.<br>   - Felicitous Furball
#. column 3: Gummy Grin
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:543:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of enemy Shield by 70%. No effect if Shield is already inoperable."
msgstr "Снижает ОЗ вражеского щита на 70%. Не действует, если щит уже разрушен."

#. ja: ミニオン「クロックワーク・オプレッサー」を呼び出す。<br>演習用重機工兵器の合金模型。ずっしり重たい
#. de: Du rufst deinen Uhrwerk-Unterdrücker als Begleiter herbei. Diese Spielzeugvariante der auf Duelle spezialisierten Kampfmaschine ist schwerer, als sie aussieht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte oppresseur mécanique, un modèle réduit en alliage d'une arme <i>très</i> lourde.
#. column 1: An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the Astragalos oppressor in tiny, toylike form. On account of its considerable bulk and heft, however, it failed to find willing merchants for distribution, and was ultimately repurposed as an allied training trophy.
#. column 2: We shall cast down the oppressors!<br>   - Chalteaufite
#. column 3: Detonating Trap
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:544:0:0"
msgid "Summon your clockwork oppressor. Painted a rugged shade of green, this miniature machina is a scale replica of the full-size model deployed in military training exercises."
msgstr "Призвать заводного потрошителя. Эту миниатюрную боевую машину выкрашено в суровый зелёный цвет; она точно повторяет полноразмерную модель для военных учений."

#. ja: アストラガロスの演習場で用いられたずんぐりとした重機工兵器を、熱意あるガーロンド社の原型師が合金玩具化したもの。玩具問屋から製品の重量に難色を示され一般発売の販路確保に失敗、同盟演習の好成績者へ贈られることとなった
#. de: Ein Garlond-Modellbauer fertigte dieses Modell nach dem Vorbild einer Kampfmaschine an, die auf dem Trainingsgelände Astragalos zum Einsatz kommt. Weil als Spielzeug viel zu teuer, wird es als Trophäe an die erfolgreichsten Schlachtenteilnehmer vergeben.
#. fr: Un ingénieur enthousiaste des Forges de Garlond s'est mis en tête de fabriquer un modèle réduit de cette arme mécanique, ré<shy>gu<shy>liè<shy>re<shy>ment employée pour l'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment à Astragalos. Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, sa production de masse s'est révélée impossible en raison de son poids beaucoup trop élevé. Depuis, tous les exemplaires en circulation sont destinés aux plus grands champions et championnes des lieux.
#. column 0: Summon your clockwork oppressor. Painted a rugged shade of green, this miniature machina is a scale replica of the full-size model deployed in military training exercises.
#. column 2: We shall cast down the oppressors!<br>   - Chalteaufite
#. column 3: Detonating Trap
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:544:0:1"
msgid "An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the Astragalos oppressor in tiny, toylike form. On account of its considerable bulk and heft, however, it failed to find willing merchants for distribution, and was ultimately repurposed as an allied training trophy."
msgstr "Увлечённый магитехникой мастер Гарлондских мастерских воссоздал маленькую игрушечную копию подавителя «Астрагалоса». Но из-за внушительных размеров и веса найти продавцов не удалось, и игрушка в итоге стала наградой за успехи в учениях союзников."

#. ja: サーッ！
#. de: Mama, ich will das auch!<br><i> Anonymes Kind</i>
#. fr: Sah<nbsp>!
