msgctxt "CompanionTransient:544:0:2"
msgid "We shall cast down the oppressors!<br>   - Chalteaufite"
msgstr "Сокрушим угнетателей!<br>   — Шальтофит"

#. ja: 起爆トラップ
#. de: Explosivfalle
#. fr: Piège détonant
#. column 0: Summon your clockwork oppressor. Painted a rugged shade of green, this miniature machina is a scale replica of the full-size model deployed in military training exercises.
