#. ja: ミニオン「ジャティーカ・リフキン」を呼び出す。<br>ジャティーカ央森で暮らす小柄な魔物。森のエーテルを帯びた青い葉で覆われている
#. de: Du rufst deinen Ja Tiika-Blättrich als Begleiter herbei. Was auch immer hinter seiner blau-leuchtenden Blätterfassade stecken mag, bleibt wohl besser ein Geheimnis ...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte sangfeuille de Ja Tiika, une petite créature à feuilles bleues gorgées d'éther forestier.
#. column 1: Among the blue leafkin that inhabit Yak T'el, this particular creature is friendly to men, and dwelled near a settlement in the Ja Tiika Heartland. While superstition persists that that their kind are Mamool Ja who have been cursed, some believe that they are in fact pure souls who were reborn as guardians of the forest.
#. column 2: Have you heard of blue leafkin?<br>   - Prudent Hunter
#. column 3: Blue Leaf
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:545:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Ja Tiika leafkin minion. What lies beneath its glowing blue leaves is best left a mystery."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника-листокрова из леса Джа-Тиика. Что скрывается под его сияющими синими листьями, лучше не выяснять."

#. ja: ヤクテル樹海で見られる青いリフキンのうち、ジャティーカ央森の人里近くに暮らす人懐こい種。呪いを受けたマムージャ族ともされるリフキンだが、小柄なリフキンは森の植生を守護するべく純なる魂が転じた姿と考えられている
#. de: Dieses Exemplar eines blauen Blättrichs scheint ungewöhnlich zutraulich zu sein und scheut sich nicht an der Seite von Abenteurern die Wälder Ja Tiikas zu durchstreifen. In der Gegend existiert nach wie vor der Aberglaube, dass es sich bei den Wesen um verwunschene Mamool Ja handele, eine positivere Auslegung spricht derweil allerdings von Reinkarnationen gewissenhafter Seelen, die nun als Waldgeister Ja Tiikas Bewohner beschützen.
#. fr: Parmi les sangfeuilles bleus habitant dans la forêt de Yak T'el, cette sympathique espèce vit à proximité des hameaux et villages de la Sylve-mère de Ja Tiika. Bien que certains considèrent ces petites créatures comme des Mamool Ja ayant subi une malédiction, d'autres estiment que les plus petites d'entre elles sont l'incarnation d'esprits bien<shy>fai<shy>sants qui protègent la végétation.
#. column 0: Summon your Ja Tiika leafkin minion. What lies beneath its glowing blue leaves is best left a mystery.
#. column 2: Have you heard of blue leafkin?<br>   - Prudent Hunter
#. column 3: Blue Leaf
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:545:0:1"
msgid "Among the blue leafkin that inhabit Yak T'el, this particular creature is friendly to men, and dwelled near a settlement in the Ja Tiika Heartland. While superstition persists that that their kind are Mamool Ja who have been cursed, some believe that they are in fact pure souls who were reborn as guardians of the forest."
msgstr "Среди синих листокровов, обитающих в Яктеле, этот вид особенно дружелюбен к людям и селится рядом с поселениями в сердце леса Джа-Тиика. По суеверию, листокровы — проклятые мамул-джа, но некоторые считают их чистыми душами, переродившимися в хранителей леса."

#. ja: り～ふ～
#. de: Hast du schon mal von einem blauen Blättrich gehört?<br><i>Nachdenklicher Hoobigo</i>
#. fr: Saaangfeuuuiiille<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Ja Tiika leafkin minion. What lies beneath its glowing blue leaves is best left a mystery.
#. column 1: Among the blue leafkin that inhabit Yak T'el, this particular creature is friendly to men, and dwelled near a settlement in the Ja Tiika Heartland. While superstition persists that that their kind are Mamool Ja who have been cursed, some believe that they are in fact pure souls who were reborn as guardians of the forest.
#. column 3: Blue Leaf
#. column 4: Inflicts a weakness to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>monsters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:545:0:2"
msgid "Have you heard of blue leafkin?<br>   - Prudent Hunter"
msgstr "Слышал о синих листокровах?<br>   — Осторожный охотник"

#. ja: 青い葉
#. de: Blaublatt
#. fr: Feuilles bleues
#. column 0: Summon your Ja Tiika leafkin minion. What lies beneath its glowing blue leaves is best left a mystery.
#. column 1: Among the blue leafkin that inhabit Yak T'el, this particular creature is friendly to men, and dwelled near a settlement in the Ja Tiika Heartland. While superstition persists that that their kind are Mamool Ja who have been cursed, some believe that they are in fact pure souls who were reborn as guardians of the forest.
