#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・グルージャジャ」を呼び出す。<br>連王グルージャジャを模した魔法人形。楽しみに見届けさせてもらおう！
#. de: Du rufst deine Gulool Ja Ja-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Das Dämmerköniglein wird deine Reise mit großem Interesse verfolgen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Gulool Ja Ja miniature, une poupée magique à l'effigie du premier aurarque du Tuliyollal.
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of Gulool Ja Ja, this mammet was created to commemorate the seventieth anniversary of his ascension as Dawnservant. It would seem that those Mamool Ja who journeyed to Eorzea brought these units with them with the intent of impressing upon the locals the glory of their kind.
#. column 2: Gulool Ja Ja, mightiest<br>of the blessed...arise!<br>   - Zereel Ja
#. column 3: Dawnservant's Decree
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:546:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Gulool Ja Ja minion. It watches your progress with great interest."
msgstr "Призвать миниатюру Гулула Джа Джа. Он с живым интересом следит за твоими успехами."

#. ja: トラル大陸を統べし双頭の連王、グルージャジャを模した魔法人形。即位70周年を記念して現地で作られた品のようだが、エオルゼアに進出したマムージャ族たちが自部族の王の威光を示そうと、海を越え持ち込んだらしい
#. de: Diese putzige Version des allseits beliebten Herrschers von Tuliyollal wurde zum siebzigsten Jubiläum seiner Krönung angefertigt. Eifrige Mamool Ja-Anhänger brachten wohl einige Exemplare mit auf ihre Reise nach Eorzea, um die Glorie ihres Volkes auch außerhalb Turals zu verbreiten.
#. fr: Cette mascotte à l'air régalien a été créée pour célébrer le soixante-dixième anniversaire de la création du royaume fédéré du Tuliyollal, afin de rendre hommage à son fondateur et dirigeant. Il semblerait que les Mamool Ja partis à l'aventure en Éorzéa aient pris l'habitude d'en emporter une avec eux, pour impressionner les habitants en leur narrant les exploits de leur souverain.
#. column 0: Summon your Gulool Ja Ja minion. It watches your progress with great interest.
#. column 2: Gulool Ja Ja, mightiest<br>of the blessed...arise!<br>   - Zereel Ja
#. column 3: Dawnservant's Decree
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:546:0:1"
msgid "Designed in the likeness of Gulool Ja Ja, this mammet was created to commemorate the seventieth anniversary of his ascension as Dawnservant. It would seem that those Mamool Ja who journeyed to Eorzea brought these units with them with the intent of impressing upon the locals the glory of their kind."
msgstr "Этого автоматона создали по образу Гулула Джа Джа в честь семидесятой годовщины его восшествия на престол Рассветного слуги. Похоже, мамул-джа, отправившиеся в Эорзею, взяли с собой такие фигурки, чтобы впечатлить местных величием своего народа."

#. ja: グハハハハハ！
#. de: Erhöre uns, stärkster aller Zwillingsköpfe! Erhöre uns, Gulool Ja Ja!<br><i>Zereel Ja</i>
#. fr: Hahahahaha<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Gulool Ja Ja minion. It watches your progress with great interest.
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of Gulool Ja Ja, this mammet was created to commemorate the seventieth anniversary of his ascension as Dawnservant. It would seem that those Mamool Ja who journeyed to Eorzea brought these units with them with the intent of impressing upon the locals the glory of their kind.
#. column 3: Dawnservant's Decree
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 20 (40 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poppet</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:546:0:2"
msgid "Gulool Ja Ja, mightiest<br>of the blessed...arise!<br>   - Zereel Ja"
msgstr "Гулул Джа Джа, сильнейший<br>из благословенных... восстань!<br>   — Зерил Джа"

#. ja: 連王の統治
#. de: Dekret des Dämmerkönigs
#. fr: Gouvernance de l'Aurarque
#. column 0: Summon your Gulool Ja Ja minion. It watches your progress with great interest.
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of Gulool Ja Ja, this mammet was created to commemorate the seventieth anniversary of his ascension as Dawnservant. It would seem that those Mamool Ja who journeyed to Eorzea brought these units with them with the intent of impressing upon the locals the glory of their kind.
