#. ja: ミニオン「ミニミニローダー」を呼び出す。<br>コスモエクスプローラー計画用の工作機器を模した小型玩具。小石程度は運べる
#. de: Du rufst deinen Mini-Minimecha herbei. Ein voll funktionstüchtiges Miniaturmodell der kleinen Helfermaschine der Kosmo-Erkundung. Kommt besonders gut bei kleinen Kieseln zum Einsatz.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-ouvrier cosmique, un modèle réduit qui ne peut pas faire grand-chose d'autre que porter des cailloux.
#. column 1: This miniaturized model of a utility vehicle used in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative was produced for the amusement of young children. While it faithfully incorporates all the functions of the original machine and can perform various tasks, it lacks the power to move anything beyond pebbles.
#. column 2: Looking for a ride on<br>the burrow's best rover?<br>   - Drivingway
#. column 3: Forced Removal
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:547:0:0"
msgid "Summon your micro rover minion. Won't be moving mountains, but can handle pebbles with aplomb."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Микро-ровёр». Горы ему не по зубам, зато камешки перевезёт с ветерком."

#. ja: コスモエクスプローラー計画用の工作機器を、ヒトの子ども向けに小型化した玩具。原型機の機能を余すことなく盛り込んでいるため、非常に多機能であるはずなのだが、いかんせんパワーがなく小石程度を運ぶのが精一杯
#. de: Die kleine Helfermaschine der Kosmo-Erkundung wurde aus Jux und Tollerei in ein Miniaturmodell verwandelt, das nun vor allem Kinder bespaßt. Überraschenderweise ist es trotzdem vollfunktionstüchtig und bei kleineren Aufräumarbeiten und dergleichen durchaus nützlich. Seine Kraft reicht allerdings nicht für viel mehr als das Schleppen kleiner Kiesel.
#. fr: Une machine ha<shy>bi<shy>tuel<shy>le<shy>ment utilisée pour effectuer divers travaux au cours de l'exploration cosmique, miniaturisée à la taille d'un jouet. Elle dispose de toutes les fonctionnalités de son modèle mais ne peut hélas disposer de la même force, si bien qu'elle ne peut guère porter autre chose que des petits cailloux.
#. column 0: Summon your micro rover minion. Won't be moving mountains, but can handle pebbles with aplomb.
#. column 2: Looking for a ride on<br>the burrow's best rover?<br>   - Drivingway
#. column 3: Forced Removal
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:547:0:1"
msgid "This miniaturized model of a utility vehicle used in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative was produced for the amusement of young children. While it faithfully incorporates all the functions of the original machine and can perform various tasks, it lacks the power to move anything beyond pebbles."
msgstr "Эта уменьшенная копия рабочего ровера создана для забавы детей. В ней есть все функции настоящей машины, и она умеет выполнять разные задачи, но силёнок хватает разве что на перевозку камешков."

#. ja: うぃーん、ががー
#. de: Interessant. Derselbe Mechanismus also.<br><i>Fandaniel</i>
#. fr: Vuiiiii-bzzzt !
#. column 0: Summon your micro rover minion. Won't be moving mountains, but can handle pebbles with aplomb.
#. column 1: This miniaturized model of a utility vehicle used in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative was produced for the amusement of young children. While it faithfully incorporates all the functions of the original machine and can perform various tasks, it lacks the power to move anything beyond pebbles.
#. column 3: Forced Removal
#. column 4: Reduces action points of all enemies within range by 50% of the maximum value.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:547:0:2"
msgid "Looking for a ride on<br>the burrow's best rover?<br>   - Drivingway"
msgstr "Нужна поездка на<br>лучшем ровере норы?<br>   — Драйвингвей"

#. ja: 強制撤去
#. de: Beseitigungszwang
#. fr: Repli forcé
#. column 0: Summon your micro rover minion. Won't be moving mountains, but can handle pebbles with aplomb.
#. column 1: This miniaturized model of a utility vehicle used in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative was produced for the amusement of young children. While it faithfully incorporates all the functions of the original machine and can perform various tasks, it lacks the power to move anything beyond pebbles.
