#. ja: ミニオン「スカラ・オーロサパ」を呼び出す。<br>スカラで品種化された白い小鳥。とっても真っ白
#. de: Du rufst deinen Skalla-Uolosapa als Begleiter herbei. Ein kleines niedliches Vögelchen, das durch sein weißes Federkleid und einen rosa Schnabel besticht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte uolosapa de Skalla, un charmant petit oiseau d'un blanc immaculé absolument éblouissant.
#. column 1: In ages past, the uolosapa was brought from the south sea isles to the nation of Skalla, where it quickly gained popularity as a pet. In the course of being bred in captivity, a specimen emerged that possessed pure white feathers, the descendants of which have been treated as a variety unto themselves to this day.
#. column 2: I seem to have made<br>a feathered friend.<br>   - Fufucha
#. column 3: Relentless Pecking
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:550:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Skallic uolosapa minion. A winsome bird with pure white feathers and a pink beak."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Скаллийская улосапа». Очаровательная птичка с белоснежными перьями и розовым клювом."

#. ja: 白の体色と桃色のくちばしが愛らしい小鳥。南洋諸島原産のオーロサパが愛玩鳥として流通した結果、スカラの地において流行。飼育される中で生じた突然変異の白い個体が品種として固定化され、現代まで伝わることとなった
#. de: Uolosapa wurden ursprünglich von den Südinseln nach Skalla gebracht, wo sie sich als Haustiere äußerster Beliebtheit erfreuten. Nach einiger Zeit der Züchtung geschah es dann schließlich, dass weiße Exemplare schlüpften. Eine neue Unterart war geboren.
#. fr: Adorable petit oiseau au corps blanc et au bec rose, l'uolosapa originaire des îles méridionales est devenu populaire à Skalla après y avoir été vendu massivement en tant qu'animal de compagnie. Sa couleur blanche immaculée, reconnue ac<shy>tu<shy>el<shy>le<shy>ment comme la marque d'une race à part entière, est le résultat d'une mutation survenue au cours de l'élevage.
#. column 0: Summon your Skallic uolosapa minion. A winsome bird with pure white feathers and a pink beak.
#. column 2: I seem to have made<br>a feathered friend.<br>   - Fufucha
#. column 3: Relentless Pecking
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:550:0:1"
msgid "In ages past, the uolosapa was brought from the south sea isles to the nation of Skalla, where it quickly gained popularity as a pet. In the course of being bred in captivity, a specimen emerged that possessed pure white feathers, the descendants of which have been treated as a variety unto themselves to this day."
msgstr "Когда-то улосапу завезли с южных островов в Скаллу, где она быстро стала популярной домашней птицей. При разведении в неволе появилась особь с чисто-белыми перьями. Её потомков и по сей день считают отдельной разновидностью."

#. ja: ぴっぴぴ！
#. de: Zwitscher! ♪
#. fr: Piii pi piii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Skallic uolosapa minion. A winsome bird with pure white feathers and a pink beak.
#. column 1: In ages past, the uolosapa was brought from the south sea isles to the nation of Skalla, where it quickly gained popularity as a pet. In the course of being bred in captivity, a specimen emerged that possessed pure white feathers, the descendants of which have been treated as a variety unto themselves to this day.
#. column 3: Relentless Pecking
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:550:0:2"
msgid "I seem to have made<br>a feathered friend.<br>   - Fufucha"
msgstr "Кажется, у меня появился<br>пернатый друг.<br>   — Фуфуча"

#. ja: 容赦ないつつき
#. de: Wildes Gepiekse
#. fr: Cinquième lune
#. column 0: Summon your Skallic uolosapa minion. A winsome bird with pure white feathers and a pink beak.
#. column 1: In ages past, the uolosapa was brought from the south sea isles to the nation of Skalla, where it quickly gained popularity as a pet. In the course of being bred in captivity, a specimen emerged that possessed pure white feathers, the descendants of which have been treated as a variety unto themselves to this day.
#. column 2: I seem to have made<br>a feathered friend.<br>   - Fufucha
