#. column 1: In ages past, the uolosapa was brought from the south sea isles to the nation of Skalla, where it quickly gained popularity as a pet. In the course of being bred in captivity, a specimen emerged that possessed pure white feathers, the descendants of which have been treated as a variety unto themselves to this day.
