#. ja: ミニオン「ベビーセクレト」を呼び出す。<br>騎乗動物セクレトのひな鳥。淡い体色で丸々としている
#. de: Du rufst dein niedliches Saikrii-Küken herbei. Die kleinere und vor allem fluffigere Version des edlen Fährtensucher-Vogels.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé Seikret, un jeune volatile à la robe blanche.
#. column 1: The fluffy young of a Seikret, a beast of burden native to a faraway world. While full-grown creatures look imposing with their sharp countenance and bright plumage, chicks are plump and white in contrast, and cut a winsome figure scrambling after their masters as they train to become fully fledged mounts.
#. column 2: Is that a hint of melancholy I detect in thy<br>voice? Something akin to a pining mother<br>bird whose chicks have flown the nest...<br>   - Urianger
#. column 3: Full Tilt
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:551:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Seikret fledgling minion. Dreams of the day it attains rugged good looks and colorful feathers."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Птенец сейкрета». Мечтает о дне, когда у него появятся яркие перья и суровый вид."

#. ja: 遠き異界にて騎乗動物として親しまれる、セクレトのひな鳥。成体は精悍な顔つきと鮮やかな体色へと成長するが、白く丸みのある幼い体はモッフモフである。騎獣としての修行のため、懐いたハンターの背を追い走る
#. de: Das Küken eines Saikrii, jenem von Jägern aus aller Welt hochgeschätzten Fährtensucher-Wesen. Ausgewachsen stechen Saikrii zwar vor allem mit ihrer furchtlosen Art und schlank-muskulösen Körpern hervor, ihre Küken sind aufgrund ihres runden und fluffigen Aussehens dafür umso niedlicher. Als Teil seiner Ausbildung hat dieses Exemplar dich als seinen Jäger erwählt.
#. fr: Ce poussin est issu d'une espèce aviaire originaire d'un monde lointain, très réputée pour ses qualités en tant que monture. Alors que les spécimens adultes sont sveltes et imposants avec leur plumage bigarré, les jeunes possèdent un duvet blanc et une apparence rondouillarde absolument craquante. Avant de pouvoir être chevauchés, ils sont entraînés à suivre leur chasseur au pas de course.
#. column 0: Summon your Seikret fledgling minion. Dreams of the day it attains rugged good looks and colorful feathers.
#. column 2: Is that a hint of melancholy I detect in thy<br>voice? Something akin to a pining mother<br>bird whose chicks have flown the nest...<br>   - Urianger
#. column 3: Full Tilt
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:551:0:1"
msgid "The fluffy young of a Seikret, a beast of burden native to a faraway world. While full-grown creatures look imposing with their sharp countenance and bright plumage, chicks are plump and white in contrast, and cut a winsome figure scrambling after their masters as they train to become fully fledged mounts."
msgstr "Пушистый детёныш сейкрета — вьючного животного из далёкого мира. Взрослые особи выглядят внушительно: острые черты, яркое оперение. А птенцы кругленькие и белые, и так мило бегут следом за хозяевами, пока учатся быть верховыми животными."

#. ja: キュルル！
#. de: Ich wünsche dir und deinem Chocobo viele erlebnisreiche Jahre zusammen!<br><i>Fraegeim</i>
#. fr: Kyuuuuuu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Seikret fledgling minion. Dreams of the day it attains rugged good looks and colorful feathers.
#. column 1: The fluffy young of a Seikret, a beast of burden native to a faraway world. While full-grown creatures look imposing with their sharp countenance and bright plumage, chicks are plump and white in contrast, and cut a winsome figure scrambling after their masters as they train to become fully fledged mounts.
#. column 3: Full Tilt
#. column 4: Reduces DEF of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
