#. ja: ミニオン「回復ミツムシ」を呼び出す。<br>異界より迷い込んだと思しき虫。集めたミツを腹部に溜め込む
#. de: Du rufst deine verlässliche Vitalitätswespe herbei. Ein eigenartiges Insekt, welches heilende Sekrete in seinem Bauch ansammelt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte vitaguêpe, un insecte venu d'un autre monde qui accumule du nectar curatif dans sa poche abdominale.
#. column 1: Thought to have arrived from another world, this variety of wasp is unique for hoarding nectar in an impressively large sac on its abdomen. In its native land, it primarily harvests the nectar of Vitalilies, whose healing properties make the creature sought after among seasoned hunters out in the wilds.
#. column 2: So many ideas, like a swarm of<br>wasps...making the mind race.<br>   - Lost Chirurgeon
#. column 3: Honey Drop
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:552:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Vigorwasp minion. Rest assured it won't dump its sac of nectar on you."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Жизненная оса». Не волнуйся, она не выльет на тебя свой мёд."

#. ja: 異界より迷い込んだと思しき虫。体力回復効果を持つミツを腹部に溜め込む習性がある。異界では主に回復ツユクサという植物からミツを採取して飛ぶため、熟練のハンターはその高い効能を狩りに用いるという
#. de: Dieses wespenartige Insekt sammelt allerlei heilende Sekrete in seiner Bauchregion an, welche infolgedessen zu beachtlichen Maßen anschwillt. Gekonnte Jäger machen sich diesen Umstand in Notsituationen gerne mal zunutze.
#. fr: Cette espèce de guêpe stocke dans son abdomen du nectar pouvant restaurer la vitalité. Le breuvage offre des propriétés curatives ex<shy>cep<shy>tion<shy>nelles et toujours bienvenues, au point qu'il est devenu presque in<shy>dis<shy>pen<shy>sa<shy>ble à tout chasseur en mission.
#. column 0: Summon your Vigorwasp minion. Rest assured it won't dump its sac of nectar on you.
#. column 2: So many ideas, like a swarm of<br>wasps...making the mind race.<br>   - Lost Chirurgeon
#. column 3: Honey Drop
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:552:0:1"
msgid "Thought to have arrived from another world, this variety of wasp is unique for hoarding nectar in an impressively large sac on its abdomen. In its native land, it primarily harvests the nectar of Vitalilies, whose healing properties make the creature sought after among seasoned hunters out in the wilds."
msgstr "Считается, что эта разновидность осы попала к нам из другого мира. Её отличительная особенность — огромный мешок на брюшке, в котором она запасает нектар. На родине она собирает нектар в основном с целебных лилий. Благодаря их лечебным свойствам оса ценится опытными охотниками."

#. ja: ブンブン
#. de: Da hat dieser Dummkopf ja in ein Wespennest gestochen.<br><i>Y'shtola</i>
#. fr: Bzz<nbsp>! Bzz<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Vigorwasp minion. Rest assured it won't dump its sac of nectar on you.
#. column 1: Thought to have arrived from another world, this variety of wasp is unique for hoarding nectar in an impressively large sac on its abdomen. In its native land, it primarily harvests the nectar of Vitalilies, whose healing properties make the creature sought after among seasoned hunters out in the wilds.
#. column 3: Honey Drop
#. column 4: Restores 100 HP to all allies within range (150 if the ally is a <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>critter</ui-edge-color></ui-color>).
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:552:0:2"
msgid "So many ideas, like a swarm of<br>wasps...making the mind race.<br>   - Lost Chirurgeon"
msgstr "Столько мыслей роится, словно ос в улье...<br>Голова кругом.<br>   — Потерявшийся хирург"

#. ja: 蜜の雫
#. de: Nährender Nektar
#. fr: Goutte de miel
#. column 0: Summon your Vigorwasp minion. Rest assured it won't dump its sac of nectar on you.
#. column 1: Thought to have arrived from another world, this variety of wasp is unique for hoarding nectar in an impressively large sac on its abdomen. In its native land, it primarily harvests the nectar of Vitalilies, whose healing properties make the creature sought after among seasoned hunters out in the wilds.
#. column 2: So many ideas, like a swarm of<br>wasps...making the mind race.<br>   - Lost Chirurgeon
