#. ja: ミニオン「パワーレスローダー」を呼び出す。<br>パワーローダーを模した小型玩具。選抜されたパイロットも搭乗している
#. de: Du rufst deinen Zwergsternenläufer als Begleiter herbei. Selbst diese Miniatur-Version basierend auf den Mechas der Kosmo-Erkundung hat ihren eigenen Piloten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mécano cosmique factice, une maquette de mécano cosmique, avec pilote inclus<nbsp>!
#. column 1: This meticulously handcrafted toy is modeled on the vacuum suit developed for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. Rumor has it the initiative was approached by a certain machina enthusiast from Garlond Ironworks, whose unbridled passion for the suit paved the way for the production of these miniaturized units.
#. column 2: These vacuum suits are a sight to behold...<br>   - Cosmic Exploration Initiative Member
#. column 3: Remove All
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:553:0:0"
msgid "Summon your model suit minion. Comes complete with pocket-sized pilot."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Модель скафандра». В комплекте миниатюрный пилот."

#. ja: パワーローダーを模した小型玩具。原型機はコスモエクスプローラー計画の一環で開発したものだが、その存在を知ったガーロンド社の原型師からの熱量ある問い合わせが切っ掛けとなり、合金玩具化が果たされたらしい
#. de: Wurden die eigentlichen Sternenläufer zwar von Teilnehmern der Kosmo-Erkundung entwickelt, so stammt diese Spielzeug-Version aus der Schmiede eines gewissen Garlond-Modellbauers. Wie man sich erzählt, habe er wohl sofort, als er von den Mechas erfuhr, voller Aufregung Kontakt mit den Projektleitern der Kosmo-Erkundung aufgenommen und um Erlaubnis gebeten, eine Miniatur-Version anfertigen zu dürfen.
#. fr: Cette reproduction est fidèle aux machines utilisées dans l'exploration cosmique. La rumeur voudrait qu'un ingénieur des Forges de Garlond féru de modélisme se soit donné corps et âme pour recréer mi<shy>nu<shy>tieu<shy>se<shy>ment un mécano cosmique sous forme de figurine de métal.
#. column 0: Summon your model suit minion. Comes complete with pocket-sized pilot.
#. column 2: These vacuum suits are a sight to behold...<br>   - Cosmic Exploration Initiative Member
#. column 3: Remove All
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:553:0:1"
msgid "This meticulously handcrafted toy is modeled on the vacuum suit developed for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. Rumor has it the initiative was approached by a certain machina enthusiast from Garlond Ironworks, whose unbridled passion for the suit paved the way for the production of these miniaturized units."
msgstr "Эта игрушка ручной работы создана по образцу скафандра, разработанного для программы космических исследований. Говорят, один увлечённый магитехник из Гарлондских мастерских так загорелся этой разработкой, что обратился к участникам программы и добился выпуска миниатюрных моделей."

#. ja: パワーッ
#. de: \<stampf>
#. fr: Pawaaah<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your model suit minion. Comes complete with pocket-sized pilot.
#. column 1: This meticulously handcrafted toy is modeled on the vacuum suit developed for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. Rumor has it the initiative was approached by a certain machina enthusiast from Garlond Ironworks, whose unbridled passion for the suit paved the way for the production of these miniaturized units.
#. column 3: Remove All
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:553:0:2"
msgid "These vacuum suits are a sight to behold...<br>   - Cosmic Exploration Initiative Member"
msgstr "Эти скафандры просто загляденье...<br>   — Участник проекта «Космическое исследование»"

#. ja: 一斉除去
#. de: Ausradierung
#. fr: Suppression immédiate
#. column 0: Summon your model suit minion. Comes complete with pocket-sized pilot.
#. column 1: This meticulously handcrafted toy is modeled on the vacuum suit developed for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. Rumor has it the initiative was approached by a certain machina enthusiast from Garlond Ironworks, whose unbridled passion for the suit paved the way for the production of these miniaturized units.
#. column 2: These vacuum suits are a sight to behold...<br>   - Cosmic Exploration Initiative Member
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:553:0:3"
msgid "Remove All"
msgstr "Удалить всё"

#. ja: 敵が配置したトラップがある場合、解除する。
#. de: Entfernt eine vom Gegner aufgestellte Falle.
#. fr: Désamorce les pièges des ennemis.
#. column 0: Summon your model suit minion. Comes complete with pocket-sized pilot.
#. column 1: This meticulously handcrafted toy is modeled on the vacuum suit developed for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. Rumor has it the initiative was approached by a certain machina enthusiast from Garlond Ironworks, whose unbridled passion for the suit paved the way for the production of these miniaturized units.
#. column 2: These vacuum suits are a sight to behold...<br>   - Cosmic Exploration Initiative Member
