msgstr "Обезвреживает установленные врагами ловушки."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ヨカフイ」を呼び出す。<br>ヨカフイ族を模した魔法人形。つぶらな瞳で悠遠の時を見つめている
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Yok Huy als Begleiter herbei. Diese Miniaturversion eines Yok Huy starrt unaufhörlich in die Unendlichkeit, ohne jemals zu blinzeln.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Yok Huy miniature, la version réduite d'un bon gros géant au regard perdu dans l'éternité.
#. column 1: With the cooperation of the Pelupelu, their business-minded neighbors, the Yok Huy produced a series of this mammet as a souvenir for visitors to Zirgorteh the Open-armed. Boasting nimble movement ordinarily unseen on their stout physique, it has also proven popular among the Yok Huy themselves.
#. column 2: We shall soon come face-to-face─<br>or rather, face-to-knee─with those<br>enormous Yok Huy.<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Giant Stance
#. column 4: Reduces movement speed of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:554:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Yok Huy minion. Gazes out into eternity with eyes unblinking."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру йок-хуи. Не моргая, взирает в вечность."

#. ja: ジィゴーテー拝壇への来訪者向けに、ヨカフイ族たちがオルコ・パチャの隣人であるペルペル族商人の助けを借りて製作した土産物の魔法人形。ずんぐりとした体躯で俊敏に動く姿が、当人たちからも気に入られているようだ
#. de: Diese Puppe wurde von den Yok Huy mit der Unterstützung eines reisenden Pelupelu-Händlers als Souvenir für Besucher von Zirgorteh dem Grüßenden angefertigt. Aufgrund ihrer für ihren stämmigen Körperbau ungewöhnlichen Flinkheit ist sie auch unter den Yok Huy überaus beliebt.
#. fr: Afin de proposer des souvenirs aux visiteurs de l'Autel de Zirgorteh, les Yok Huy ont sollicité l'aide de leurs voisins, les Pelupelu, afin de con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>ner cette poupée magique. Son incroyable ressemblance aussi bien dans son aspect physique que dans ses manières a rendu cette mascotte tout aussi populaire chez les Yok Huy eux-mêmes.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Yok Huy minion. Gazes out into eternity with eyes unblinking.
#. column 2: We shall soon come face-to-face─<br>or rather, face-to-knee─with those<br>enormous Yok Huy.<br>   - Alphinaud
#. column 3: Giant Stance
#. column 4: Reduces movement speed of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:554:0:1"
msgid "With the cooperation of the Pelupelu, their business-minded neighbors, the Yok Huy produced a series of this mammet as a souvenir for visitors to Zirgorteh the Open-armed. Boasting nimble movement ordinarily unseen on their stout physique, it has also proven popular among the Yok Huy themselves."
msgstr "В сотрудничестве с деловыми соседями пелупелу йок-хуи создали серию таких кукол на память для посетителей святилища Зиргорте, Радушного. Несмотря на грузное телосложение, кукла двигается на удивление проворно и полюбилась даже самим йок-хуи."

#. ja: ヨーカーフィー
#. de: Wenn wir bald auf die gewaltigen Yok Huy treffen werden, kann man nie vorbereitet genug sein.<br><i>Alphinaud</i>
#. fr: Yoook-huyyyy<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Yok Huy minion. Gazes out into eternity with eyes unblinking.
#. column 1: With the cooperation of the Pelupelu, their business-minded neighbors, the Yok Huy produced a series of this mammet as a souvenir for visitors to Zirgorteh the Open-armed. Boasting nimble movement ordinarily unseen on their stout physique, it has also proven popular among the Yok Huy themselves.
#. column 3: Giant Stance
#. column 4: Reduces movement speed of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:554:0:2"
msgid "We shall soon come face-to-face─<br>or rather, face-to-knee─with those<br>enormous Yok Huy.<br>   - Alphinaud"
msgstr "Скоро мы увидим йок-хуи лицом к лицу —<br>точнее, лицом к коленям!<br>   — Альфино"

