#. ja: ミニオン「クロックワーク・レッドゴブリタンク」を呼び出す。<br>演習用ゴブ式戦闘車両の合金模型。赤くて俊敏
#. de: Du rufst deine rote Aufzieh-Gobmaschine als Begleiter herbei. Rot, rechtschaffen, rasendschnell.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte gobtank mécanique carmin, une figurine en métal d'un engin de guerre gobelin peinte d'un rouge éclatant.
#. column 1: An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the Ravens-colored Astragalos gobtank in tiny, toylike form. Though originally meant to be marketed with the permission of the goblins, negotiations broke down over the profit margin, and it was ultimately repurposed as an allied training trophy.
#. column 2: Pshhh... Gobbies whack<br>for Ravens muchly!<br>   - Goblin Mercenary
#. column 3: Hit and Run
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:555:0:0"
msgid "Summon your raven-red gobtank. Faster than the blue one."
msgstr "Призвать красного гоботанка. Быстрее синего."

#. ja: ヒドゥンゴージの演習場で用いられた赤き戦闘車両を、熱意あるガーロンド社の原型師が合金玩具化したもの。元車両の開発元であるゴブリン族と販売マージンについて交渉決裂し、同盟演習の好成績者に贈られることとなった
#. de: Ein Garlond-Modellbauer fertigte dieses Modell nach dem Vorbild der roten Kampfmaschine an, die auf dem Trainingsgelände Verborgene Schlucht zum Einsatz kommt. Als Produktidee gestartet, scheiterte das Projekt an dem Einverständnis der Goblins, welche den Großteil der Einnahmen für sich beanspruchen wollten. So ist es nun allein als Trophäe für erfolgreiche Schlachtenteilnehmer erhältlich.
#. fr: Cette figurine d'un des engins utilisés à la gorge dérobée a été réalisée par un ingénieur des Forges de Garlond passionné de modélisme. Après avoir échoué à négocier un prix de vente qui puisse satisfaire les Gobelins, auteurs du modèle original, la mascotte fut choisie en tant que récompense.
#. column 0: Summon your raven-red gobtank. Faster than the blue one.
#. column 2: Pshhh... Gobbies whack<br>for Ravens muchly!<br>   - Goblin Mercenary
#. column 3: Hit and Run
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:555:0:1"
msgid "An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the Ravens-colored Astragalos gobtank in tiny, toylike form. Though originally meant to be marketed with the permission of the goblins, negotiations broke down over the profit margin, and it was ultimately repurposed as an allied training trophy."
msgstr "Увлечённый магитехник мастер Гарлондских мастерских воссоздал маленький игрушечный гобтанк «Астрагалоса» в цветах Воронов. Игрушку собирались продавать с разрешения гоблинов, но стороны не сошлись в вопросе прибыли, и модель стала наградой за успехи в учениях союзников."

#. ja: ゴゴゴブ
#. de: Muahaaa! Wir kriegsbünden mit Raben!<br><i>Goblin-Söldner</i>
#. fr: Go-go-go-gob<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your raven-red gobtank. Faster than the blue one.
#. column 1: An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the Ravens-colored Astragalos gobtank in tiny, toylike form. Though originally meant to be marketed with the permission of the goblins, negotiations broke down over the profit margin, and it was ultimately repurposed as an allied training trophy.
#. column 3: Hit and Run
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:555:0:2"
msgid "Pshhh... Gobbies whack<br>for Ravens muchly!<br>   - Goblin Mercenary"
msgstr "Пшшш... Гоббики сильно<br>бить за Воронов!<br>   — Гоблин-наёмник"

#. ja: ひき逃げ
#. de: Fahrerflucht
#. fr: Délit de fuite
#. column 0: Summon your raven-red gobtank. Faster than the blue one.
#. column 1: An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the Ravens-colored Astragalos gobtank in tiny, toylike form. Though originally meant to be marketed with the permission of the goblins, negotiations broke down over the profit margin, and it was ultimately repurposed as an allied training trophy.
#. column 2: Pshhh... Gobbies whack<br>for Ravens muchly!<br>   - Goblin Mercenary
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
