msgstr "Наезд и бегство"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のアルカナストーンに、5%のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Arkana-Stein 5 % Schaden zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 5% de sa solidité à la pierre arcanique ennemie la plus proche.
#. column 0: Summon your raven-red gobtank. Faster than the blue one.
#. column 1: An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the Ravens-colored Astragalos gobtank in tiny, toylike form. Though originally meant to be marketed with the permission of the goblins, negotiations broke down over the profit margin, and it was ultimately repurposed as an allied training trophy.
#. column 2: Pshhh... Gobbies whack<br>for Ravens muchly!<br>   - Goblin Mercenary
#. column 3: Hit and Run
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:555:0:4"
msgid "Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone."
msgstr "Наносит 5% урона ближайшему вражескому арканному камню."

#. ja: ミニオン「クロックワーク・ブルーゴブリタンク」を呼び出す。<br>演習用ゴブ式戦闘車両の合金模型。青くて頑丈
#. de: Du rufst deine blaue Aufzieh-Gobmaschine als Begleiter herbei. Blau, besser, mit viel Bumms.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte gobtank mécanique céruléen, une figurine en métal d'un engin de guerre gobelin peinte d'un bleu profond.
#. column 1: An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the Falcons-colored Astragalos gobtank in tiny, toylike form. Though originally meant to be marketed with the permission of the goblins, negotiations broke down over the profit margin, and it was ultimately repurposed as an allied training trophy.
#. column 2: Pshhh... Gobbies whack<br> for Falcons muchly!<br>   - Goblin Mercenary
#. column 3: Bombardment
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:556:0:0"
msgid "Summon your falcon-blue gobtank. Stronger than the red one."
msgstr "Призвать синего гоботанка. Крепче красного."

#. ja: ヒドゥンゴージの演習場で用いられた青き戦闘車両を、熱意あるガーロンド社の原型師が合金玩具化したもの。元車両の開発元であるゴブリン族と販売マージンについて交渉決裂し、同盟演習の好成績者に贈られることとなった
#. de: Ein Garlond-Modellbauer fertigte dieses Modell nach dem Vorbild der blauen Kampfmaschine an, die auf dem Trainingsgelände Verborgene Schlucht zum Einsatz kommt. Als Produktidee gestartet, scheiterte das Projekt an dem Einverständnis der Goblins, welche den Großteil der Einnahmen für sich beanspruchen wollten. So ist es nun allein als Trophäe für erfolgreiche Schlachtenteilnehmer erhältlich.
#. fr: Cette figurine d'un des engins utilisés à la gorge dérobée a été réalisée par un ingénieur des Forges de Garlond passionné de modélisme. Après avoir échoué à négocier un prix de vente qui puisse satisfaire les Gobelins, auteurs du modèle original, la mascotte fut choisie en tant que récompense.
#. column 0: Summon your falcon-blue gobtank. Stronger than the red one.
#. column 2: Pshhh... Gobbies whack<br> for Falcons muchly!<br>   - Goblin Mercenary
#. column 3: Bombardment
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:556:0:1"
msgid "An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the Falcons-colored Astragalos gobtank in tiny, toylike form. Though originally meant to be marketed with the permission of the goblins, negotiations broke down over the profit margin, and it was ultimately repurposed as an allied training trophy."
msgstr "Увлечённый магитехник мастер Гарлондских мастерских воссоздал маленький игрушечный гобтанк «Астрагалоса» в цветах Соколов. Игрушку собирались продавать с разрешения гоблинов, но стороны не сошлись в вопросе прибыли, и модель стала наградой за успехи в учениях союзников."

#. ja: ゴブブブ
#. de: Muahaaa! Wir kriegsbünden mit Falken!<br><i>Goblin-Söldner</i>
#. fr: Gob-ob-ob-ob<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your falcon-blue gobtank. Stronger than the red one.
#. column 1: An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the Falcons-colored Astragalos gobtank in tiny, toylike form. Though originally meant to be marketed with the permission of the goblins, negotiations broke down over the profit margin, and it was ultimately repurposed as an allied training trophy.
#. column 3: Bombardment
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:556:0:2"
msgid "Pshhh... Gobbies whack<br> for Falcons muchly!<br>   - Goblin Mercenary"
msgstr "Пшшш... Гоббики сильно<br>бить за Соколов!<br>   — Гоблин-наёмник"

#. ja: 砲撃
#. de: Bombardement
#. fr: Feu de canon
#. column 0: Summon your falcon-blue gobtank. Stronger than the red one.
#. column 1: An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the Falcons-colored Astragalos gobtank in tiny, toylike form. Though originally meant to be marketed with the permission of the goblins, negotiations broke down over the profit margin, and it was ultimately repurposed as an allied training trophy.
#. column 2: Pshhh... Gobbies whack<br> for Falcons muchly!<br>   - Goblin Mercenary
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range.
