msgid "Bombardment"
msgstr "Обстрел"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK230のダメージを与える。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 230 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 230 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your falcon-blue gobtank. Stronger than the red one.
#. column 1: An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the Falcons-colored Astragalos gobtank in tiny, toylike form. Though originally meant to be marketed with the permission of the goblins, negotiations broke down over the profit margin, and it was ultimately repurposed as an allied training trophy.
#. column 2: Pshhh... Gobbies whack<br> for Falcons muchly!<br>   - Goblin Mercenary
#. column 3: Bombardment
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:556:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 230 to all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 230."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・エルドナーシュ」を呼び出す。<br>エルドナーシュの小さな似姿。おまえ達はここで終わっちゃえ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Eald'narche-Puppe herbei. Nach zehn langen Jahrtausenden endlich an deiner Seite!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Eald'narche miniature. Il a beau être plus petit que l'original, il reste tout aussi hargneux<nbsp>!
#. column 1: A diminutive manifestation of Eald'narche, which arose from the core of his memories in the wake of battle. While the original Eald'narche was a cunning mastermind who threatened the world of Vana'diel with his brother, Archduke Kam'lanaut, this entity thankfully appears to pose no danger.
#. column 2: Have you the strength to<br>find the answers you seek?<br>   - Eald'narche
#. column 3: Vortex
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s <br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:557:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Eald'narche minion. After ten long millennia, the dreams of the Zilart will become reality!"
msgstr "Призвать заводного Элд'нарше. Спустя десять тысяч лет мечты зилартов станут явью!"

#. ja: エルドナーシュの小さな似姿。「エコーズの残滓」の核が戦いの後、この姿に変化し歩き出した。元となったエルドナーシュは、異界「ヴァナ・ディール」においてジュノ大公カムラナートの弟として知られる人物だという
#. de: Das „etwas“ kleinere Ebenbild von Eald'narche. Überreste der Echos sollen sich nach dem Kampf in dieser Form manifestiert haben und von dannen geschritten sein. Der geniale Eald'narche selbst, auf dem dieser Begleiter basiert, soll in der Welt Vana'diel mit seinem Bruder, Erzherzog Kam'lanaut, einiges an Chaos gestiftet haben.
#. fr: Cette version réduite d'Eald'narche s'est manifestée depuis son Écho, après votre bataille. À l'origine, ce sinistre personnage était connu dans le monde de Vana'diel grâce à son lien de parenté avec son frère Kam'lanaut, l'archiduc de Jeuno.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Eald'narche minion. After ten long millennia, the dreams of the Zilart will become reality!
#. column 2: Have you the strength to<br>find the answers you seek?<br>   - Eald'narche
#. column 3: Vortex
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s <br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:557:0:1"
msgid "A diminutive manifestation of Eald'narche, which arose from the core of his memories in the wake of battle. While the original Eald'narche was a cunning mastermind who threatened the world of Vana'diel with his brother, Archduke Kam'lanaut, this entity thankfully appears to pose no danger."
msgstr "Эта крохотная копия Элд'нарше возникла из самой сердцевины его воспоминаний после битвы. Настоящий Элд'нарше был хитроумным злодеем, который вместе со своим братом, эрцгерцогом Кам'ланаутом, угрожал миру Вана-Диэля. К счастью, эта кукла, похоже, безобидна."

#. ja: 与エテアゲヨウ…
#. de: Seinen Bruder Eald'narche zu besiegen, grenzt an ein Wunder.<br><i>Alxaal</i>
#. fr: Je vais vous montrer la sapience des Zilarts<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Eald'narche minion. After ten long millennia, the dreams of the Zilart will become reality!
#. column 1: A diminutive manifestation of Eald'narche, which arose from the core of his memories in the wake of battle. While the original Eald'narche was a cunning mastermind who threatened the world of Vana'diel with his brother, Archduke Kam'lanaut, this entity thankfully appears to pose no danger.
#. column 3: Vortex
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s <br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:557:0:2"
msgid "Have you the strength to<br>find the answers you seek?<br>   - Eald'narche"
msgstr "Хватит ли тебе сил,<br>чтобы найти ответы?<br>   — Элд'нарше"

#. ja: ヴォーテクス
#. de: Vortex
#. fr: Vortex
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Eald'narche minion. After ten long millennia, the dreams of the Zilart will become reality!
#. column 1: A diminutive manifestation of Eald'narche, which arose from the core of his memories in the wake of battle. While the original Eald'narche was a cunning mastermind who threatened the world of Vana'diel with his brother, Archduke Kam'lanaut, this entity thankfully appears to pose no danger.
