msgid "Sets a trap that, when triggered, reduces the movement speed of all enemies within range by 70%.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s <br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
msgstr "Устанавливает ловушку, которая при срабатывании снижает скорость передвижения всех врагов в радиусе действия на 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 сек.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Задержка срабатывания:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「ベイビーロネーク」を呼び出す。<br>ロネークの幼獣。小さくても角は鋭い
#. de: Du rufst dein Rroneek-Kälbchen als Begleiter herbei und lass dich von seinen kleinen Hörnchen verzücken.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé rroneek. Attention, malgré son jeune âge, ses cornes restent très pointues<nbsp>!
#. column 1: The young of a hulking herbivore native to the continent of Tural. The patterns upon the faces of juveniles are pale and uneven, but gain in boldness and definition as they age. Even if they are still small, the creatures leave their parents' side when both their tusks and horns have sufficiently developed, as is the case with this calf.
#. column 2: Look at you all, shaking<br>like rroneek calves!<br>   - Nitowikwe
#. column 3: Pride of Tural
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:558:0:0"
msgid "Summon your rroneek calf minion. Has tusks and horns and isn't afraid to use them."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Теленок рронека». Бивни и рога есть, а пользоваться ими не боится."

#. ja: トラル大陸を代表する草食動物の幼獣。生まれたばかりの頃は顔面部の模様が淡く不揃いだが、成長するにつれはっきりと色濃くなるという。牙や角も生え揃うと、体躯は小さくともひとり立ちを許され、親元を離れて駆け回るようだ
#. de: Das Kalb der genügsamen Pflanzenfresser Turals. Kurz nach ihrer Geburt zeichnen sich die charakteristischen Muster auf ihren Gesichtern nur sehr blass und fade vom restlichen Fell ab. Jedoch je größer sie werden, desto ausgeprägter werden diese<nbsp>- eine Tatsache, die auch für ihre Hörner und Stoßzähne gilt. Erreichen sie eine bestimmte Größe, begeben sich Rroneek-Kälber ohne ihre Eltern in die weite Wildnis Turals<nbsp>- selbst wenn sie noch nicht voll ausgewachsen sind.
#. fr: Le rroneek est une espèce d'herbivore de taille imposante, et emblématique du continent turalien. Les motifs autour de sa tête sont encore pâles chez les plus jeunes, mais se dessinent plus précisément au fur et à mesure de la croissance de l'animal. Une fois que ses cornes et ses crocs ont atteint une taille raisonnable, même s'il est encore frêle, le rroneek quitte son cercle familial pour partir seul en quête de nourriture.
#. column 0: Summon your rroneek calf minion. Has tusks and horns and isn't afraid to use them.
#. column 2: Look at you all, shaking<br>like rroneek calves!<br>   - Nitowikwe
#. column 3: Pride of Tural
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:558:0:1"
msgid "The young of a hulking herbivore native to the continent of Tural. The patterns upon the faces of juveniles are pale and uneven, but gain in boldness and definition as they age. Even if they are still small, the creatures leave their parents' side when both their tusks and horns have sufficiently developed, as is the case with this calf."
msgstr "Детёныш рронека — огромного травоядного, обитающего в Турале. У малышей узоры на морде бледные и неровные, но с возрастом становятся ярче и чётче. Когда бивни и рога достаточно отрастают, детёныши покидают родителей, даже если ещё совсем малы. Вот и этот телёнок уже готов к самостоятельной жизни."

#. ja: ぷお～ん
#. de: Aber auf einem Rroneek zu reiten, klingt so viel spaßiger<nbsp>...<br><i>Krieger des Lichts</i>
#. fr: Mwoooh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your rroneek calf minion. Has tusks and horns and isn't afraid to use them.
#. column 1: The young of a hulking herbivore native to the continent of Tural. The patterns upon the faces of juveniles are pale and uneven, but gain in boldness and definition as they age. Even if they are still small, the creatures leave their parents' side when both their tusks and horns have sufficiently developed, as is the case with this calf.
#. column 3: Pride of Tural
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:558:0:2"
msgid "Look at you all, shaking<br>like rroneek calves!<br>   - Nitowikwe"
msgstr "Гляньте-ка, дрожите<br>как телята рронека!<br>   — Нитовикве"

#. ja: トラルの誇り
#. de: Stolz Turals
#. fr: Fierté du Tural
#. column 0: Summon your rroneek calf minion. Has tusks and horns and isn't afraid to use them.
