#. ja: ミニオン「タイニークロウ」を呼び出す。<br>とある研究施設内で飼育されていたカラス。賢く義理堅い
#. de: Du rufst deine Mini-Krähe als Begleiter herbei. So viel Hirnschmalz und Loyalität in so einem kleinen Körperchen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-corbeau, un volatile élevé dans un laboratoire. Il est par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement intelligent et fidèle.
#. column 1: This crow found at a laboratory within the Meso Terminal was formerly an experimental subject. After researchers vanished from the facility, it managed to survive thanks to its cage's emergency power supply and automatic feeding system. Possessed of great intelligence and a strong sense of duty, it has decided to follow its liberator.
#. column 2: This would solve all our<br>problems in one fell swoop!<br>   - Benathaire
#. column 3: Swoop
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:561:0:0"
msgid "Summon your micro crow minion. Clever and loyal─what more could one ask for?"
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Микро-ворон». Умная и верная — чего ещё желать?"

#. ja: メインターミナル内の研究施設で見つかった元実験動物。施設から研究者たちがいなくなった後も、飼育ケージ用の非常電源と自動給餌システムにより生きながらえたようだ。非常に賢く義理堅く、解放の恩人に付き従う
#. de: Diese kleine Krähe war ursprünglich Opfer zahlreicher Experimente und Tierversuche im Inneren des Meso-Systems. Zu ihrem Glück liefen auch nach dem Verschwinden der dort forschenden Wissenschaftler die lebenserhaltenden Systeme ihres Käfigs so wie die Fütterungsautomatik weiter, sodass sie bis heute überleben konnte. Mit ihrem gewaltigen Intellekt und ausgeprägtem Pflichtbewusstsein will sie dir nun zur Seite stehen.
#. fr: Découvert dans un ancien laboratoire du mésoterminal, ce corbeau est resté en vie même après la disparition des chercheurs, grâce au système d'urgence de sa cage qui a maintenu ses fonctions vitales. Il possède une in<shy>tel<shy>li<shy>gence hors norme comparé à ses congénères et fait preuve d'une loyauté sans faille envers la personne qui lui a rendu sa liberté.
#. column 0: Summon your micro crow minion. Clever and loyal─what more could one ask for?
#. column 2: This would solve all our<br>problems in one fell swoop!<br>   - Benathaire
#. column 3: Swoop
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:561:0:1"
msgid "This crow found at a laboratory within the Meso Terminal was formerly an experimental subject. After researchers vanished from the facility, it managed to survive thanks to its cage's emergency power supply and automatic feeding system. Possessed of great intelligence and a strong sense of duty, it has decided to follow its liberator."
msgstr "Этого ворона нашли в лаборатории Мезотерминала. Раньше он был подопытным. Когда исследователи исчезли, он выжил благодаря аварийному источнику питания клетки и автоматической кормушке. Ворон очень умён и обладает обострённым чувством долга. Теперь он решил следовать за тем, кто его освободил."

#. ja: カ～ッ
#. de: ... Wie eine Krähe in der Nacht.<br><i>Oboro</i>
#. fr: Croâââ<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your micro crow minion. Clever and loyal─what more could one ask for?
#. column 1: This crow found at a laboratory within the Meso Terminal was formerly an experimental subject. After researchers vanished from the facility, it managed to survive thanks to its cage's emergency power supply and automatic feeding system. Possessed of great intelligence and a strong sense of duty, it has decided to follow its liberator.
#. column 3: Swoop
#. column 4: Knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:561:0:2"
msgid "This would solve all our<br>problems in one fell swoop!<br>   - Benathaire"
msgstr "Вот бы одним махом решить<br>все наши проблемы!<br>   — Бенатер"

#. ja: 飛来
#. de: Landeflug
#. fr: Descente en piqué
#. column 0: Summon your micro crow minion. Clever and loyal─what more could one ask for?
