msgid "Knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Отбрасывает всех врагов в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・フェオ＝ウル」を呼び出す。<br>フェオ＝ウルを模した魔法人形。あなたの美しい枝が、力を貸してあげる！
#. de: Du rufst Feo Ul als Begleiter herbei. Die Marionette ist mindestens genauso anhänglich wie das Original.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Feo Ul miniature, une poupée magique à l'image de votre amie pixie. Cette jolie branchette est tout aussi dévouée que l'originale<nbsp>!
#. column 1: This automaton designed in likeness of Feo Ul, a pixie of the First, was brought into being through the magicks of none other than the newly crowned Titania themself, who desired that you might always have your beautiful branch at your side. Its irrepressible cuteness and charm are true to life.
#. column 2: Come what may, your beautiful<br>branch will ever be at your side.<br>   - Feo Ul
#. column 3: Fae Mischief
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:562:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Feo Ul. As your lovely branch, it will lend you its strength!"
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Фео Ул. Твоя прекрасная веточка поможет тебе своей силой!"

#. ja: 第一世界に棲まう妖精、『狂い咲き』のフェオ＝ウルを模した魔法人形。『かわいい若木』に呼ばれずともいつでも共にありたいと、妖精王が手ずから魔法で編み出した品らしい。愛くるしさは本物そっくり
#. de: Diese Marionette ist Feo Ul, einer Pixie des Ersten Splitters, nachempfunden. Die echte Pixie wurde von der frisch gekrönten Titania selbst ins Leben gerufen. In Sachen Charme und Niedlichkeit steht die Marionette dem Original in nichts nach.
#. fr: Façonnée à l'image de la pixie dite “Feo Fleuribonde”, cette poupée a été créée par Titania en personne. Elle souhaitait par son biais pouvoir être constamment aux côtés de son petit arbrisseau préféré. Quelle adorable petite créature<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Feo Ul. As your lovely branch, it will lend you its strength!
#. column 2: Come what may, your beautiful<br>branch will ever be at your side.<br>   - Feo Ul
#. column 3: Fae Mischief
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:562:0:1"
msgid "This automaton designed in likeness of Feo Ul, a pixie of the First, was brought into being through the magicks of none other than the newly crowned Titania themself, who desired that you might always have your beautiful branch at your side. Its irrepressible cuteness and charm are true to life."
msgstr "Этот автоматон создан по образу Фео Ул, пикси из Первого мира. Его сотворила сама новоизбранная королева пикси Титания, чтобы её прекрасная веточка всегда была рядом. Миловидностью и очарованием кукла ничуть не уступает оригиналу."

#. ja: ソバニイルノダワ！
#. de: Sorge dich nicht, Bäumchen. Ich werde immer an deiner Seite sein, um dir zu helfen.<br><i> Feo Ul</i>
#. fr: Je ne t'abandonne pas, mon petit arbrisseau<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Feo Ul. As your lovely branch, it will lend you its strength!
#. column 1: This automaton designed in likeness of Feo Ul, a pixie of the First, was brought into being through the magicks of none other than the newly crowned Titania themself, who desired that you might always have your beautiful branch at your side. Its irrepressible cuteness and charm are true to life.
#. column 3: Fae Mischief
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:562:0:2"
msgid "Come what may, your beautiful<br>branch will ever be at your side.<br>   - Feo Ul"
msgstr "Что бы ни случилось,<br>прекрасная веточка всегда будет рядом!<br>   — Фео Ул"

#. ja: 妖精のいたずら
#. de: Feenstreich
#. fr: Plaisanterie pixie
