#. ja: ミニオン「いただきキトン」を呼び出す。<br>翼の生えた子猫の魔物。なんでもいただきたい
#. de: Du rufst dein Bettelcätzchen als Begleiter herbei. Dieses geflügelte Katzenwesen will einfach alles in seinem Besitz wissen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte bébé chat-pardeur, une créature kleptomane à la forme de chaton avec des ailes.
#. column 1: This mischief-loving fiend said to mimic spirits in the Ninth is known to have a liking for precious stones, which it will brazenly demand from those it encounters. Though its mood will turn foul if refused, neither will satisfying its desire win you its gratitude, so there is little to be gained from knowing it...but here we are.
#. column 2: Gimme an elixir!<br>No, that's not right...<br>   - Magic Pot
#. column 3: Gimme
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:565:0:0"
msgid "Summon your gimme kitten minion. An ill-mannered winged feline fiend that wants everything."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Котёнок-дай». Крылатый бесёнок с дурными манерами, которому подавай всё и сразу."

#. ja: 第九世界の伝承にて、精霊の真似事をするといういたずら好きの魔物。稀に輝石を欲しがってくるようで、与えてやらないとすこぶる機嫌が悪くなる。しかし、与えてやっていただき欲を満たしても、何ら感謝が示されることはない
#. de: Im Neunten Splitter soll dieses hinterhältige Katzenwesen unwissenden Abenteurern vorspielen, ein Phantom zu sein, um an kostbare Edelsteine zu gelangen. Dafür bettelt es ein ums andere Mal und wird äußerst missmutig, sollte man ihm seinen Wunsch verwehren. Gibt man ihm dann doch die verlangten Steine, will es nur noch mehr<nbsp>... Es ist somit ratsam, ihm gar nicht erst zu begegnen<nbsp>- wofür es in deinem Fall leider schon zu spät ist.
#. fr: Dans le folklore du neuvième reflet, ce monstre facétieux adore imiter les esprits. Parfois, il réclame à ceux qu'il croise une pierre précieuse, et tombe dans une colère folle lorsqu'il n'en reçoit pas. Et même lorsque ses envies sont comblées, il n'est pas du genre à se montrer re<shy>con<shy>nais<shy>sant.
#. column 0: Summon your gimme kitten minion. An ill-mannered winged feline fiend that wants everything.
#. column 2: Gimme an elixir!<br>No, that's not right...<br>   - Magic Pot
#. column 3: Gimme
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:565:0:1"
msgid "This mischief-loving fiend said to mimic spirits in the Ninth is known to have a liking for precious stones, which it will brazenly demand from those it encounters. Though its mood will turn foul if refused, neither will satisfying its desire win you its gratitude, so there is little to be gained from knowing it...but here we are."
msgstr "Этот проказливый демон из легенд Девятого мира любит притворяться духом и выпрашивать у встречных драгоценные камни. Откажешь — разозлится. Угостишь — благодарности не дождёшься. Знать бы о нём поменьше... но вот так вышло."

#. ja: いただきニャっ！
#. de: Gib mir das Elixier!<br><i>Zauberpott</i>
#. fr: C'est pour miaouuu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your gimme kitten minion. An ill-mannered winged feline fiend that wants everything.
#. column 1: This mischief-loving fiend said to mimic spirits in the Ninth is known to have a liking for precious stones, which it will brazenly demand from those it encounters. Though its mood will turn foul if refused, neither will satisfying its desire win you its gratitude, so there is little to be gained from knowing it...but here we are.
#. column 3: Gimme
#. column 4: Removes all beneficial effects from all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:565:0:2"
msgid "Gimme an elixir!<br>No, that's not right...<br>   - Magic Pot"
msgstr "Дай эликсир!<br>Нет, не то...<br>   — Волшебный горшок"

#. ja: いただき
#. de: Rumgebettel
#. fr: Chapardage
#. column 0: Summon your gimme kitten minion. An ill-mannered winged feline fiend that wants everything.
#. column 1: This mischief-loving fiend said to mimic spirits in the Ninth is known to have a liking for precious stones, which it will brazenly demand from those it encounters. Though its mood will turn foul if refused, neither will satisfying its desire win you its gratitude, so there is little to be gained from knowing it...but here we are.
