#. ja: ミニオン「人魚姫」を呼び出す。<br>幻影によって紡がれた小さな人魚。泡になって消えはしない
#. de: Du rufst deine kleine Meerjungfrau als Begleiter herbei. Bei dir ist sie frei, bei dir ist sie froh!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte princesse des sirènes, une reproduction illusoire d'une petite sirène qui ne disparaîtra pas dans une tempête de bulles.
#. column 1: Legends pertaining to mermaids are common in the Corvos region, foremost among them the tale of a mermaid princess who falls in love with a man. Perhaps influenced by said tale, this diminutive entity born of an arcane pattern in an illuminated manuscript has chosen to accompany you on your journeys.
#. column 2: Are you a mermaid!?<br>   - Hokushin
#. column 3: Piercing Voice
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 60 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:567:0:0"
msgid "Summon your little mermaid minion. Wishes to be a little part of your world."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Русалочка». Хочет стать маленькой частью твоего мира."

#. ja: 装飾写本の魔紋から生じた小さな人魚。コルヴォ地方には、人魚に関する逸話が数多く伝わるが、なかには人に想いを寄せた姫君が地上を冒険する流れのものもあるという。その影響か、この姫は旅への同行を希望しているようだ
#. de: Zahlreiche Legenden in Corvos handeln von Meerjungfrauen, wobei die meisten von einer Prinzessin der Meere sprechen, welche sich in einen Mann verliebt und ihre Heimat im Wasser verlässt, um das Land zu bereisen. Geboren aus einem Äthergramm, scheint diese kleine Begleiterin an deiner Seite nun ähnliche Ambitionen zu haben.
#. fr: Cette petite sirène est née de la magie d'un ouvrage ancien de la région de Corvos. Contre toute attente, elle a décidé de quitter la mer pour vous suivre dans vos aventures sur la terre ferme.
#. column 0: Summon your little mermaid minion. Wishes to be a little part of your world.
#. column 2: Are you a mermaid!?<br>   - Hokushin
#. column 3: Piercing Voice
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 60 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:567:0:1"
msgid "Legends pertaining to mermaids are common in the Corvos region, foremost among them the tale of a mermaid princess who falls in love with a man. Perhaps influenced by said tale, this diminutive entity born of an arcane pattern in an illuminated manuscript has chosen to accompany you on your journeys."
msgstr "В Корвосе ходит немало легенд о русалках, и самая известная — о принцессе, влюбившейся в человека. Возможно, под впечатлением от этой истории крохотное существо, рождённое из магического узора в иллюминированной рукописи, решило сопровождать тебя в странствиях."

#. ja: アワアワアワ…
#. de: Bist du eine Meerjungfrau?<br><i>Hokushin</i>
#. fr: Ça bulle<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon your little mermaid minion. Wishes to be a little part of your world.
#. column 1: Legends pertaining to mermaids are common in the Corvos region, foremost among them the tale of a mermaid princess who falls in love with a man. Perhaps influenced by said tale, this diminutive entity born of an arcane pattern in an illuminated manuscript has chosen to accompany you on your journeys.
#. column 3: Piercing Voice
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 60 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:567:0:2"
msgid "Are you a mermaid!?<br>   - Hokushin"
msgstr "Ты русалка!?<br>   — Хокусин"

#. ja: つんざく歌声
#. de: Schrille Stimme
#. fr: Chant vindicatif
#. column 0: Summon your little mermaid minion. Wishes to be a little part of your world.
#. column 1: Legends pertaining to mermaids are common in the Corvos region, foremost among them the tale of a mermaid princess who falls in love with a man. Perhaps influenced by said tale, this diminutive entity born of an arcane pattern in an illuminated manuscript has chosen to accompany you on your journeys.
#. column 2: Are you a mermaid!?<br>   - Hokushin
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 60 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
