msgid "Piercing Voice"
msgstr "Пронзительный голос"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK60のダメージを与え、さらに移動速度を70%低下させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>10秒
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 60 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und verringert ihre GSW um 70 %.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 Sekunden
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 60 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et réduit leur vitesse de déplacement de 70%.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. column 0: Summon your little mermaid minion. Wishes to be a little part of your world.
#. column 1: Legends pertaining to mermaids are common in the Corvos region, foremost among them the tale of a mermaid princess who falls in love with a man. Perhaps influenced by said tale, this diminutive entity born of an arcane pattern in an illuminated manuscript has chosen to accompany you on your journeys.
#. column 2: Are you a mermaid!?<br>   - Hokushin
#. column 3: Piercing Voice
