msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 60 to all enemies within range while reducing movement speed by 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 60 и снижает их скорость передвижения на 70%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「魔法のランプ」を呼び出す。<br>幻影によって紡がれた魔法のランプ。宿った精は姿を見せない
#. de: Du rufst deine Wunderlampe als Begleiter herbei. Phänomenale kosmische Kräfte in einem winzig kleinen Lebensraum!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte lampe magique, une reproduction illusoire d'un objet magique dont l'esprit qui l'habite refuse de se montrer.
#. column 1: Manifesting from an arcane pattern in an illuminated manuscript, this oil lamp appears to be home to a genie. Unlike the lamp-dwelling spirit of Corvosi legend that grants wishes, however, this one is hesitant to show itself, perhaps needing more time to decide whether you are a worthy master.
#. column 2: It's probably some source of phenomenal<br>cosmic power that's key to his plans.<br>   - Cid Garlond
#. column 3: Heart's Desire
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:568:0:0"
msgid "Summon your magic lamp minion. Phenomenal cosmic powers in an itty-bitty living space."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Волшебная лампа». Космическая сила в крошечном жилище."

#. ja: 装飾写本の魔紋から生じた幻影のランプ。コルヴォ地方には、所有者の願いを叶えるランプの精の伝承があるが、このランプに宿った精は慎重派な様子。新たな主が尽くすに値するか、姿を見せずに思案を重ねているようだ
#. de: Diese Öllampe ist aus einem Äthergramm erschienen und wird von einem Lampengeist behaust. Im Gegensatz zu seinem Kollegen aus den Legenden Corvos ist der Gute aber eher verhalten und zeigt sich kaum. Vielleicht braucht er einfach noch etwas mehr Zeit, um abzuschätzen, ob du seiner Kräfte auch wirklich würdig bist.
#. fr: Cette étrange lampe est née de la magie d'un ouvrage ancien de la région de Corvos. L'esprit qui l'habite a décidé de vous suivre, mais vous avez beau frotter la lampe, il refuse de se montrer<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your magic lamp minion. Phenomenal cosmic powers in an itty-bitty living space.
#. column 2: It's probably some source of phenomenal<br>cosmic power that's key to his plans.<br>   - Cid Garlond
#. column 3: Heart's Desire
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:568:0:1"
msgid "Manifesting from an arcane pattern in an illuminated manuscript, this oil lamp appears to be home to a genie. Unlike the lamp-dwelling spirit of Corvosi legend that grants wishes, however, this one is hesitant to show itself, perhaps needing more time to decide whether you are a worthy master."
msgstr "Лампа будто бы служит домом джинну — он возник из магического узора в иллюстрированной рукописи. В отличие от духа из корвосских легенд, исполняющего желания, этот не спешит показываться. Возможно, ему нужно время, чтобы решить, достойны ли вы стать его хозяином."

#. ja: プワ～ン
#. de: Ein ruhiger Geist ist gerade umso wichtiger denn je.<br><i>Nidhana</i>
#. fr: Frottez-moi<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your magic lamp minion. Phenomenal cosmic powers in an itty-bitty living space.
#. column 1: Manifesting from an arcane pattern in an illuminated manuscript, this oil lamp appears to be home to a genie. Unlike the lamp-dwelling spirit of Corvosi legend that grants wishes, however, this one is hesitant to show itself, perhaps needing more time to decide whether you are a worthy master.
#. column 3: Heart's Desire
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:568:0:2"
msgid "It's probably some source of phenomenal<br>cosmic power that's key to his plans.<br>   - Cid Garlond"
msgstr "Похоже, в ней скрыта какая-то невероятная<br>космическая сила — она-то ему и нужна.<br>   — Сид Гарлонд"

#. ja: 心願成就
#. de: Tiefstes Verlangen
#. fr: Souhait exaucé
