#. ja: ミニオン「MGSD・Gウォリアー」を呼び出す。<br>ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社製マイスターグレード・スペシャルディフォルメモデル。Gウォリアー（光の戦士についていきます）
#. de: Du rufst deinen G-Krieger MGSD als Begleiter herbei. Das „MGSD“ steht angeblich für „Meister Garlond Super Design“ oder so etwas Ähnliches.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte figurine magitek SD Guerrier-G, un modèle réduit aux proportions déformées, conçu spé<shy>cia<shy>le<shy>ment par les Forges de Garlond.
#. column 1: An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the G-Warrior in tiny, toylike form. Boasting incredible detail despite their diminutive size, these units are being offered as an allied training trophy as part of a publicity campaign for the Garlond Ironworks.
#. column 2: I present Garlond Ironworks' adaptation<br>of the Ultima Warrior, the G-Warrior!<br>   - Cid Garlond
#. column 3: Guided Missile
#. column 4: Renders both ally and enemy Shields and Search Eyes inoperable. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:570:0:0"
msgid "Summon your G-Warrior MGSD minion. The “MGSD” part of its name supposedly stands for “Master Garlond Superior Design,” or something along those lines."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Миниатюрный G-воин». Говорят, «MGSD» расшифровывается как «Мастерская Гарлонда: Сверхдетальная модель» или что-то в этом роде."

#. ja: 人型対蛮神兵器「Gウォリアー」を特別にディフォルメ化したモデル。ガーロンド社の原型師が、小さな躯体に圧倒的なディテール表現を詰め込んだもので、同社の広報活動の一環として、同盟演習の好成績者に贈られることとなった
#. de: Ein Garlond-Modellbauer fertigte dieses Modell nach dem Vorbild der beliebten Kampfmaschine „G-Krieger“ an, welche den Maschinenspezialisten in so mancher Schlacht schon zu Ruhm verholfen hat. Als Teil der Öffentlichkeitsarbeit der Metallwerke wird es nun als Trophäe an die erfolgreichsten Schlachtenteilnehmer vergeben.
#. fr: Ce modèle miniature de votre fidèle Guerrier-G a été perfectionné par les Forges de Garlond afin de reproduire dans les moindres détails ses mécanismes complexes, tout en lui donnant une apparence aux proportions déformées. Seulement quelques exemplaires ont été offerts aux troupes de l'Alliance.
#. column 0: Summon your G-Warrior MGSD minion. The “MGSD” part of its name supposedly stands for “Master Garlond Superior Design,” or something along those lines.
#. column 2: I present Garlond Ironworks' adaptation<br>of the Ultima Warrior, the G-Warrior!<br>   - Cid Garlond
#. column 3: Guided Missile
#. column 4: Renders both ally and enemy Shields and Search Eyes inoperable. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:570:0:1"
msgid "An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the G-Warrior in tiny, toylike form. Boasting incredible detail despite their diminutive size, these units are being offered as an allied training trophy as part of a publicity campaign for the Garlond Ironworks."
msgstr "Увлечённый магитехник мастер Гарлондских мастерских создал крошечную игрушечную копию G-воина. Несмотря на миниатюрный размер, она невероятно детализирована. В рамках рекламной кампании Гарлондских мастерских такие модели дарят отличившимся на учениях союзников."

#. ja: ゴゥン…
#. de: Das ist eine Spe<shy>zial<shy>an<shy>fer<shy>ti<shy>gung des Ultima-Kriegers aus unseren Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ken. Wir nennen ihn kurz „G-Krieger“.<br><i>Cid Garlond</i>
#. fr: Gwon...
#. column 0: Summon your G-Warrior MGSD minion. The “MGSD” part of its name supposedly stands for “Master Garlond Superior Design,” or something along those lines.
#. column 1: An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the G-Warrior in tiny, toylike form. Boasting incredible detail despite their diminutive size, these units are being offered as an allied training trophy as part of a publicity campaign for the Garlond Ironworks.
#. column 3: Guided Missile
#. column 4: Renders both ally and enemy Shields and Search Eyes inoperable. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:570:0:2"
msgid "I present Garlond Ironworks' adaptation<br>of the Ultima Warrior, the G-Warrior!<br>   - Cid Garlond"
msgstr "Представляю вам детище Гарлондских мастерских,<br>новую версию воина Альтима — G-воина!<br>   — Сид"

#. ja: 誘導ミサイル
#. de: Lenkraketen
#. fr: Missile guidé
#. column 0: Summon your G-Warrior MGSD minion. The “MGSD” part of its name supposedly stands for “Master Garlond Superior Design,” or something along those lines.
#. column 1: An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the G-Warrior in tiny, toylike form. Boasting incredible detail despite their diminutive size, these units are being offered as an allied training trophy as part of a publicity campaign for the Garlond Ironworks.
#. column 2: I present Garlond Ironworks' adaptation<br>of the Ultima Warrior, the G-Warrior!<br>   - Cid Garlond
#. column 4: Renders both ally and enemy Shields and Search Eyes inoperable. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:570:0:3"
msgid "Guided Missile"
msgstr "Самонаводящаяся ракета"

#. ja: 自軍、敵軍のシールドとサーチ・アイを破壊する。特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンは強制撤退する。
#. de: Zerstört eigene und feindliche Schilde und Suchende Augen. Die ausführenden Trabanten werden weggeschickt.
#. fr: Détruit votre bouclier et votre œil scrutateur ainsi que ceux de l'ennemi. Les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT sont au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment renvoyées.
#. column 0: Summon your G-Warrior MGSD minion. The “MGSD” part of its name supposedly stands for “Master Garlond Superior Design,” or something along those lines.
#. column 1: An Ironworks machina enthusiast has replicated the G-Warrior in tiny, toylike form. Boasting incredible detail despite their diminutive size, these units are being offered as an allied training trophy as part of a publicity campaign for the Garlond Ironworks.
#. column 2: I present Garlond Ironworks' adaptation<br>of the Ultima Warrior, the G-Warrior!<br>   - Cid Garlond
#. column 3: Guided Missile
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:570:0:4"
msgid "Renders both ally and enemy Shields and Search Eyes inoperable. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution."
msgstr "Выводит из строя щиты и поисковые ока как союзников, так и врагов. После применения отряд прислужников немедленно покидает поле боя."

#. ja: ミニオン「ラノシアンショートヘア」を呼び出す。<br>バイルブランド島原産の短毛種の猫。辛抱強くおとなしい
#. de: Du rufst dein La Noscea-Kurzhaar als Begleiter herbei. Für ein wenig Katzenfutter löst es jedes Nagetierproblem.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte noscéen à poil court, un félin originaire de l'île de Vylbrand connu pour son calme et sa patience.
#. column 1: This variety of feline originating from Vylbrand is identifiable by its plush grey fur, and owing to their talent as rodent hunters, they have long been considered a sailor's best friend. Recently, they have been found inhabiting the Occult Crescent, perhaps the descendants of creatures that arrived aboard grounded vessels.
#. column 2: Heeere kitty, kitty, kitty, kitty, kitty!<br>   - Bakool Ja Ja the Mystic
#. column 3: Sharp Claws
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:571:0:0"
msgid "Summon your La Noscean shorthair minion. Will hunt rodents for board and lodging."
msgstr "Призвать короткошёрстного ла-ношийского кота. За еду и крышу над головой избавит от грызунов."

#. ja: 灰色の短い毛並みが美しい、ラノシアで広く親しまれる猫。古くからネズミ捕りの名人として船乗りたちの相棒ともされ、大洋を航海することもあった。漂着した船に乗っていた個体の子孫なのか、三日月島での繁殖が確認されている
#. de: Ursprünglich in Vylbrand beheimatet, sind diese grauhaarigen Fellbällchen besonders bei Seeleuten für ihr Talent bei der Mäusejagd in engen Schiffskajüten beliebt. Jüngst wurden auf Kreszentia ebenfalls Exemplare entdeckt, bei denen es sich wohl um die Nachkommen ihrer schiffbrüchigen Vormiezen handeln muss.
#. fr: Les marins noscéens apprécient ces chats au pelage gris court, car ils les utilisent pour chasser les souris de leurs navires. Cette espèce a pro<shy>ba<shy>ble<shy>ment a été introduite sur l'île de Lunule au gré d'un naufrage.
#. column 0: Summon your La Noscean shorthair minion. Will hunt rodents for board and lodging.
#. column 2: Heeere kitty, kitty, kitty, kitty, kitty!<br>   - Bakool Ja Ja the Mystic
#. column 3: Sharp Claws
#. column 4: Delivers 10 points of damage every second to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:571:0:1"
msgid "This variety of feline originating from Vylbrand is identifiable by its plush grey fur, and owing to their talent as rodent hunters, they have long been considered a sailor's best friend. Recently, they have been found inhabiting the Occult Crescent, perhaps the descendants of creatures that arrived aboard grounded vessels."
msgstr "Эта порода кошек родом с Вилбрандта. Её легко узнать по густой серой шерсти. Кошки отлично ловят грызунов, поэтому издавна считаются лучшими друзьями моряков. Недавно их заметили и на Оккультном полумесяце. Возможно, они произошли от кошек с потерпевших крушение кораблей."

#. ja: なぉ～ん
#. de: Miau, miau ♪<br><i>Schwarze Katze</i>
#. fr: Miaaaaou<nbsp>!
