#. ja: ミニオン「ブレイブ・シェパード」を呼び出す。<br>牧羊犬として親しまれる犬種。勇敢にして忠実
#. de: Du rufst deinen braven Schäferhund als Begleiter herbei. So mutig und loyal, wie man es sich von jedem Hund wünscht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte berger des Braves, un chien de troupeau qui se distingue par sa bravoure et sa loyauté.
#. column 1: Since olden times, this robust breed of canine has served men as sheep and guard dogs both, and sailors are known to take them on voyages for protection at ports of call. Recently, they have been found inhabiting the Occult Crescent, perhaps the descendants of creatures that arrived aboard grounded vessels.
#. column 2: As a shepherd leads his flock, I shall<br>guide you to my irrefutable conclusion!<br>   - Hildibrand
#. column 3: Shepherd
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:572:0:0"
msgid "Summon your gallant shepherd minion. Courageous and loyal, it does credit to caninekind."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Доблестная овчарка». Смелая и верная — достойная представительница собачьего рода."

#. ja: 立ち耳が特徴的な、牧羊犬や番犬としてヒトの暮らしに寄り添ってきた力強い犬。船乗りたちが、寄港先の島々での防犯用に船に乗せることもあるという。漂着した船に乗っていた個体の子孫なのか、三日月島での繁殖が確認されている
#. de: Diese äußerst robuste und verantwortungsbewusste Rasse dient seinen Frauchen und Herrchen seit Jahrhunderten sowohl als Wach- wie auch als Schäferhund. Und besonders Seeleute nehmen sie regelmäßig als treue Beschützer mit auf ihre Reisen. Jüngst wurden auf Kreszentia ebenfalls Exemplare entdeckt, bei denen es sich wohl um die Nachkommen ihrer schiffbrüchigen Vorwuffer handeln muss.
#. fr: Ce chien de berger est réputé pour son endurance et ses oreilles constamment dressées. On dit que des marins l'utilisent parfois pour protéger leurs navires après leur accostage, ce qui pourrait expliquer l'in<shy>tro<shy>duc<shy>tion passée de cette espèce sur l'île de Lunule.
#. column 0: Summon your gallant shepherd minion. Courageous and loyal, it does credit to caninekind.
#. column 2: As a shepherd leads his flock, I shall<br>guide you to my irrefutable conclusion!<br>   - Hildibrand
#. column 3: Shepherd
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:572:0:1"
msgid "Since olden times, this robust breed of canine has served men as sheep and guard dogs both, and sailors are known to take them on voyages for protection at ports of call. Recently, they have been found inhabiting the Occult Crescent, perhaps the descendants of creatures that arrived aboard grounded vessels."
msgstr "Эта крепкая порода с древних времён служит людям пастушьей и сторожевой собакой. Моряки берут таких псов в плавания, чтобы те охраняли их на стоянках. Недавно овчарок заметили и на Оккультном полумесяце. Возможно, они — потомки собак с потерпевших крушение кораблей."

#. ja: ワッフ！
#. de: Wuff, wuff!<br><i>Schwarzer Hund</i>
#. fr: Ouaf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your gallant shepherd minion. Courageous and loyal, it does credit to caninekind.
#. column 1: Since olden times, this robust breed of canine has served men as sheep and guard dogs both, and sailors are known to take them on voyages for protection at ports of call. Recently, they have been found inhabiting the Occult Crescent, perhaps the descendants of creatures that arrived aboard grounded vessels.
#. column 3: Shepherd
#. column 4: Increases action party ATK by 40.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:572:0:2"
msgid "As a shepherd leads his flock, I shall<br>guide you to my irrefutable conclusion!<br>   - Hildibrand"
msgstr "Как пастух ведёт стадо,<br>я приведу тебя к неопровержимому выводу!<br>   — Хильдибранд"

#. ja: 先導
#. de: Hüten
#. fr: Conduite
