#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ユフィ」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。アレもコレも、みんなみんなアタシのもの！
#. de: Du rufst deine Aufzieh-Yuffie als Begleiter herbei. Leibhaftig steht sie vor dir: die einzige weiße Rose Wutais - die fantastische Yuffie!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Yuffie miniature. Elle ne peut pas s'empêcher de dérober tout ce qu'elle trouve<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Legends tell of a sprightly shinobi maiden who wielded an enormous shuriken. A materia hunter by trade, she was not above stealing in order to acquire her prize, yet what she desired above all was to restore her nation to its former glory. You now have the honor of serving her mammet likeness.
#. column 2: It has been far too long since<br>I shared a shadow with a shinobi.<br>   - Thancred
#. column 3: All Creation
#. column 4: Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:573:0:0"
msgid "Before you stands a rare bloom: the single white rose of Wutai─the one and only Yuffie! Summon your wind-up Yuffie minion."
msgstr "Перед тобой редкий цветок — единственная белая роза Вутая, сама Юффи! Призвать заводную миниатюру Юффи."

#. ja: 古の英雄「ユフィ」を模した魔法人形。巨大な手裏剣を携えた忍者であり、また盗みすら働くマテリアハンターであったと語られる。その裏には故郷復興にかける強い想いがあったという。このアタシにいっしょに来てくれと！
#. de: Die Legenden sprechen von einer jungen und besonders lebhaften Ninja mit einem gewaltig großen Shuriken in der Hand, welche sich nicht zu schade war, auch zu unlauteren Methoden zu greifen, um möglichst viel Materia zu erbeuten und ihrer von Krieg gebrandmarkten Heimat zu altem Glanz zu verhelfen. Nun darfst du dich glücklich schätzen, ihrem Puppenabbild dienen zu dürfen.
#. fr: Cette poupée représente une célèbre chasseuse de matérias des temps anciens. Armée de son shuriken gigantesque, elle est prête à tout pour sa patrie<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Before you stands a rare bloom: the single white rose of Wutai─the one and only Yuffie! Summon your wind-up Yuffie minion.
#. column 2: It has been far too long since<br>I shared a shadow with a shinobi.<br>   - Thancred
#. column 3: All Creation
#. column 4: Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:573:0:1"
msgid "Legends tell of a sprightly shinobi maiden who wielded an enormous shuriken. A materia hunter by trade, she was not above stealing in order to acquire her prize, yet what she desired above all was to restore her nation to its former glory. You now have the honor of serving her mammet likeness."
msgstr "Легенды рассказывают о весёлой девушке-ниндзя с огромным сюрикеном. Она промышляла охотой за материей и не гнушалась воровством ради добычи. Но больше всего она мечтала вернуть своей родине былое величие. Теперь тебе выпала честь служить её кукольной копии."

#. ja: ミンナ大好キ、ユフィチャンダヨ！
#. de: Was ihnen fehlt, ist womöglich der Geist der Ninja ...<br><i>Gerolt</i>
#. fr: Je suis Yuffie, agent d'élite<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Before you stands a rare bloom: the single white rose of Wutai─the one and only Yuffie! Summon your wind-up Yuffie minion.
#. column 1: Legends tell of a sprightly shinobi maiden who wielded an enormous shuriken. A materia hunter by trade, she was not above stealing in order to acquire her prize, yet what she desired above all was to restore her nation to its former glory. You now have the honor of serving her mammet likeness.
#. column 3: All Creation
#. column 4: Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:573:0:2"
msgid "It has been far too long since<br>I shared a shadow with a shinobi.<br>   - Thancred"
msgstr "Давно я не делил тень<br>с ниндзя.<br>   — Танкрад"

#. ja: 森羅万象
#. de: Gesamtschaffung
#. fr: Tout-création
#. column 0: Before you stands a rare bloom: the single white rose of Wutai─the one and only Yuffie! Summon your wind-up Yuffie minion.
#. column 1: Legends tell of a sprightly shinobi maiden who wielded an enormous shuriken. A materia hunter by trade, she was not above stealing in order to acquire her prize, yet what she desired above all was to restore her nation to its former glory. You now have the honor of serving her mammet likeness.
#. column 2: It has been far too long since<br>I shared a shadow with a shinobi.<br>   - Thancred
#. column 4: Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:573:0:3"
msgid "All Creation"
msgstr "Всё сущее"

#. ja: 敵軍が配置したトラップがある場合、自軍のトラップとして発動させる。トラップがATKダメージの場合はダメージを1.5倍にする。
#. de: Wandelt gegnerische Fallen in eigene um. Wenn die Falle eine Attacke ausführt, wird der Attacke-Wert um das 1,5-fache erhöht.
#. fr: Déclenche un piège ennemi comme s'il vous appartenait. S'il inflige des dégâts d'attaque, sa puissance est multipliée par 1,5.
#. column 0: Before you stands a rare bloom: the single white rose of Wutai─the one and only Yuffie! Summon your wind-up Yuffie minion.
#. column 1: Legends tell of a sprightly shinobi maiden who wielded an enormous shuriken. A materia hunter by trade, she was not above stealing in order to acquire her prize, yet what she desired above all was to restore her nation to its former glory. You now have the honor of serving her mammet likeness.
#. column 2: It has been far too long since<br>I shared a shadow with a shinobi.<br>   - Thancred
#. column 3: All Creation
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:573:0:4"
msgid "Triggers an enemy trap as if it were your own. If the trap deals physical damage, then potency is increased by 150%."
msgstr "Активирует вражескую ловушку так, словно она ваша. Если ловушка наносит физический урон, сила атаки увеличивается на 150%."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ヴィンセント」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。私はまた罪を犯そうとしているのか……
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Vincent als Begleiter herbei. Auf eine Sünde mehr kommt es dem Kleinen auch nicht mehr an.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Vincent miniature. “Suis-je sur le point de commettre un nouveau péché<nbsp>?”
#. column 1: Legends tell of a man who was subjected to dark experiments and given preternatural abilities. Upon awakening from his years-long slumber in a sealed coffin, he was haunted by his sins of the past, and chose to set forth on a journey of redemption─as his mammet likeness does now with you.
#. column 2: His is an inspiring tale of redemption.<br>   - Makoto
#. column 3: Satan Slam
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:574:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Vincent. Hopefully not on the verge of committing another sin."
msgstr "Призвать заводного Винсента. Надеюсь, он не собирается совершить ещё один грех."

#. ja: 古の英雄「ヴィンセント」を模した魔法人形。廃村の古びた屋敷にて、地下室に封じられた棺桶の中で長き眠りについていたとされる改造人間。己の忌まわしき過去を嘆き、やがて贖罪の旅に出たという。ここは悪夢の始まりの場所だ
#. de: Die Legenden sprechen von einem Mann, der düsteren Experimenten unterzogen wurde und auf diese Weise übernatürliche Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten erlangte. Nach Jahren des Schlummers erwachte er zwar aus seinem Sarg, doch es fühlte sich für ihn an, als hielten ihn die Geister seiner Ver<shy>gangen<shy>heit nach wie vor in einem Albtraum gefangen. So entschied er sich, eine Reise der Sühne anzutreten<nbsp>- nun mit dir an seiner Seite.
#. fr: Cette poupée représente un célèbre sujet d'expériences génétiques des temps anciens. Après un long sommeil dans les sous-sols d'un manoir, il cherche désormais à expier ses fautes. Espérons que son cauchemar prendra fin un jour...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Vincent. Hopefully not on the verge of committing another sin.
#. column 2: His is an inspiring tale of redemption.<br>   - Makoto
#. column 3: Satan Slam
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:574:0:1"
msgid "Legends tell of a man who was subjected to dark experiments and given preternatural abilities. Upon awakening from his years-long slumber in a sealed coffin, he was haunted by his sins of the past, and chose to set forth on a journey of redemption─as his mammet likeness does now with you."
msgstr "Легенды рассказывают о человеке, над которым ставили тёмные опыты и наделили сверхъестественными способностями. Пробудившись после долгого сна в запечатанном гробу, он не мог забыть о грехах прошлого и отправился в путь, чтобы искупить их. Теперь его кукольная копия странствует вместе с вами."

#. ja: 永遠ニ眠レ…
#. de: Vergib mir meine Sünden ...<br><i>Ystride</i>
#. fr: Repose en paix...
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Vincent. Hopefully not on the verge of committing another sin.
#. column 1: Legends tell of a man who was subjected to dark experiments and given preternatural abilities. Upon awakening from his years-long slumber in a sealed coffin, he was haunted by his sins of the past, and chose to set forth on a journey of redemption─as his mammet likeness does now with you.
#. column 3: Satan Slam
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:574:0:2"
msgid "His is an inspiring tale of redemption.<br>   - Makoto"
msgstr "Его история искупления вдохновляет.<br>   — Макото"

#. ja: サタンインパクト
#. de: Satansschlag
#. fr: Bruit satanique
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Vincent. Hopefully not on the verge of committing another sin.
#. column 1: Legends tell of a man who was subjected to dark experiments and given preternatural abilities. Upon awakening from his years-long slumber in a sealed coffin, he was haunted by his sins of the past, and chose to set forth on a journey of redemption─as his mammet likeness does now with you.
#. column 2: His is an inspiring tale of redemption.<br>   - Makoto
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:574:0:3"
msgid "Satan Slam"
msgstr "Удар Сатаны"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATKの5倍のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt Gegnern in der Nähe Schaden in 5-facher Höhe des Attacke-Werts zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à cinq fois l'attaque aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Vincent. Hopefully not on the verge of committing another sin.
#. column 1: Legends tell of a man who was subjected to dark experiments and given preternatural abilities. Upon awakening from his years-long slumber in a sealed coffin, he was haunted by his sins of the past, and chose to set forth on a journey of redemption─as his mammet likeness does now with you.
#. column 2: His is an inspiring tale of redemption.<br>   - Makoto
#. column 3: Satan Slam
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:574:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон, равный пятикратной АТК."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・レッドXIII」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。オイラは、コスモキャニオンのナナキ
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Red XIII als Begleiter herbei. Er ist das Wesen, das du vor dir siehst. Akzeptiere ihn, wie er ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Red XIII miniature, aussi connu sous le nom de Nanaki de Cosmo Canyon<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Legends tell of a four-legged beast, one of the last of his long-lived kind, who was possessed of reason and capable of speech. After escaping his captivity at a research facility, he cast aside his specimen designation, and with his new comrades went on to fight for the fate of the very star.
#. column 2: I saw a flash of red in that instant.<br>   - Lalah Jinjahl
#. column 3: Lunatic High
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 13%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:575:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Red XIII. He is that which you see before you. Nothing less."
msgstr "Призвать заводного Реда XIII. Он именно тот, кем кажется. Ни больше ни меньше."

#. ja: 古の英雄「レッドXIII」を模した魔法人形。人語を解する長命種の生き残りである、四足歩行の獣。とある研究施設から逃れたのちは研究コードとは異なる名を名乗り、やがて星の運命を見届けたようだ。こわいけど、オイラ、がんばるよ
#. de: Die Legenden sprechen von einem vierbeinigen Freund, welcher einer der wenigen Übriggebliebenen seiner stolzen und langlebigen Art war. Mit Verstand gesegnet, verfügte er über die Fähigkeit, zu sprechen. Nachdem er grausamer Labor-Gefangenschaft entkommen war, begab er sich an der Seite seiner neu-gefundenen Kameraden auf eine Reise, um den Planeten höchstselbst vor einem düsteren Schicksal zu bewahren.
#. fr: Cette poupée représente un célèbre quadrupède des temps anciens. Après s'être échappé du laboratoire qui lui a donné son nom de code, il aspire désormais à être témoin de l'avenir de la planète.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Red XIII. He is that which you see before you. Nothing less.
#. column 2: I saw a flash of red in that instant.<br>   - Lalah Jinjahl
#. column 3: Lunatic High
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 13%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:575:0:1"
msgid "Legends tell of a four-legged beast, one of the last of his long-lived kind, who was possessed of reason and capable of speech. After escaping his captivity at a research facility, he cast aside his specimen designation, and with his new comrades went on to fight for the fate of the very star."
msgstr "Легенды рассказывают о четвероногом звере, одном из последних представителей долгоживущего народа. Он обладал разумом и умел говорить. Сбежав из исследовательской лаборатории, он отказался от своего подопытного имени и вместе с новыми товарищами вступил в борьбу за судьбу самой звезды."

#. ja: ジッチャン！
#. de: Mir ist so was auch noch nie untergekommen.<br><i>Erenville</i>
#. fr: Grand-père<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Red XIII. He is that which you see before you. Nothing less.
#. column 1: Legends tell of a four-legged beast, one of the last of his long-lived kind, who was possessed of reason and capable of speech. After escaping his captivity at a research facility, he cast aside his specimen designation, and with his new comrades went on to fight for the fate of the very star.
#. column 3: Lunatic High
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 13%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:575:0:2"
msgid "I saw a flash of red in that instant.<br>   - Lalah Jinjahl"
msgstr "В тот миг я увидела вспышку красного.<br>   — Лала Джинджал"

#. ja: ルナティックハイ
#. de: Lunares Tempo
#. fr: Ferveur lunaire
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Red XIII. He is that which you see before you. Nothing less.
#. column 1: Legends tell of a four-legged beast, one of the last of his long-lived kind, who was possessed of reason and capable of speech. After escaping his captivity at a research facility, he cast aside his specimen designation, and with his new comrades went on to fight for the fate of the very star.
#. column 2: I saw a flash of red in that instant.<br>   - Lalah Jinjahl
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 80 to all enemies within range while reducing DEF by 13%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:575:0:3"
msgid "Lunatic High"
msgstr "Безумный восторг"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK80のダメージを与え、さらにDEFを13%低下させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6秒
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 80 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und verringert ihre ABW um 13 %.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Dauer:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6 Sekunden
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 80 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et réduit leur défense de 13%.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Red XIII. He is that which you see before you. Nothing less.
#. column 1: Legends tell of a four-legged beast, one of the last of his long-lived kind, who was possessed of reason and capable of speech. After escaping his captivity at a research facility, he cast aside his specimen designation, and with his new comrades went on to fight for the fate of the very star.
#. column 2: I saw a flash of red in that instant.<br>   - Lalah Jinjahl
#. column 3: Lunatic High
