msgstr "Делает союзные ворота, щит и поисковое око неуязвимыми для атак.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「ミスティックコンドル」を呼び出す。<br>霧の大陸に古来棲息する小柄なコンドル。肉の味にうるさいグルメ
#. de: Du rufst deinen Nebelkondor als Begleiter herbei. Ein Feinschmeckervogel, dem du besser nur perfekt gebratenes Fleisch anbietest, sonst<nbsp>...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte condor mystique, un rapace de petite taille du Continent de la Brume qui est très regardant sur le goût de la viande qu'il consomme.
#. column 1: A large bird native to the Mist Continent that feeds on the flesh of dead animals. Formerly devouring only raw meat, the environment of the Ninth led its kind to develop a taste for lightning-seared morsels, and it is known to patiently wait for its prey to be struck by a lightning bolt.
#. column 2: I had to dodge some lightning<br>bolts, but I made it!<br>   - Trainee Hunter
#. column 3: Sudden Swoop
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:577:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Mistic condor minion. Feed it only perfectly cooked flesh, lest you incur its displeasure."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Мистический кондор». Корми его только идеально прожаренным мясом, а не то он рассердится."

#. ja: 霧の大陸の荒野に棲まう、動物の屍肉を喰らう怪鳥。元は生肉を好んだというが、第九世界が雷属性に傾いたのちは雷で打たれたウェルダンに目がない。美味しそうな獲物を見つけると、後をつけながら落雷に遭うのを待つという
#. de: Dieser Riesenvogel ist auf dem Kontinent des Nebels beheimatet und hat sich ursprünglich wie jeder andere Kondor von rohem Fleisch ernährt. Seit dem Anstieg des Blitzäthers im neunten Splitter hat sich seine Art jedoch an den Geschmack von blitzversengtem Bratfleisch gewöhnt. So stellt er lecker wirkender Beute nach, bis diese schließlich von einem Blitz auf etwa „medium“ durchgebraten worden ist, bevor er sie verzehrt.
#. fr: On raconte que cette espèce du Continent de la Brume se nourrissait autrefois de viande crue, mais qu'elle aurait changé ses habitudes alimentaires après avoir goûté la viande cuite à point d'animaux frappés par la foudre du neuvième reflet. Il n'est pas rare que ces oiseaux suivent leurs proies de loin, dans l'espoir qu'elles soient foudroyées.
#. column 0: Summon your Mistic condor minion. Feed it only perfectly cooked flesh, lest you incur its displeasure.
#. column 2: I had to dodge some lightning<br>bolts, but I made it!<br>   - Trainee Hunter
#. column 3: Sudden Swoop
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:577:0:1"
msgid "A large bird native to the Mist Continent that feeds on the flesh of dead animals. Formerly devouring only raw meat, the environment of the Ninth led its kind to develop a taste for lightning-seared morsels, and it is known to patiently wait for its prey to be struck by a lightning bolt."
msgstr "Крупная птица родом с Туманного континента, питается падалью. Раньше кондоры ели только сырое мясо, но на Девятом осколке полюбили мясо, поджаренное молнией. Увидев подходящую добычу, они терпеливо ждут, пока в неё не ударит молния."

#. ja: ガァ～ッ
#. de: Ich musste ein paar Blitzen mit Hechtsprüngen ausweichen, aber schlussendlich hab ich's geschafft!<br><i>Auszubildende Merzerin</i>
#. fr: Gaaaa<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Mistic condor minion. Feed it only perfectly cooked flesh, lest you incur its displeasure.
#. column 1: A large bird native to the Mist Continent that feeds on the flesh of dead animals. Formerly devouring only raw meat, the environment of the Ninth led its kind to develop a taste for lightning-seared morsels, and it is known to patiently wait for its prey to be struck by a lightning bolt.
#. column 3: Sudden Swoop
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:577:0:2"
msgid "I had to dodge some lightning<br>bolts, but I made it!<br>   - Trainee Hunter"
msgstr "Пришлось уворачиваться от молний,<br>но я справился!<br>   — Ученик-охотник"

#. ja: 滑空降下
#. de: Plötzlicher Sturz
#. fr: Plongeon céleste
#. column 0: Summon your Mistic condor minion. Feed it only perfectly cooked flesh, lest you incur its displeasure.
#. column 1: A large bird native to the Mist Continent that feeds on the flesh of dead animals. Formerly devouring only raw meat, the environment of the Ninth led its kind to develop a taste for lightning-seared morsels, and it is known to patiently wait for its prey to be struck by a lightning bolt.
#. column 2: I had to dodge some lightning<br>bolts, but I made it!<br>   - Trainee Hunter
#. column 4: Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:577:0:3"
msgid "Sudden Swoop"
msgstr "Стремительное пикирование"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のアルカナストーンに、5%のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Arkana-Stein 5 % Schaden zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 5% de sa solidité à la pierre arcanique ennemie la plus proche.
#. column 0: Summon your Mistic condor minion. Feed it only perfectly cooked flesh, lest you incur its displeasure.
#. column 1: A large bird native to the Mist Continent that feeds on the flesh of dead animals. Formerly devouring only raw meat, the environment of the Ninth led its kind to develop a taste for lightning-seared morsels, and it is known to patiently wait for its prey to be struck by a lightning bolt.
#. column 2: I had to dodge some lightning<br>bolts, but I made it!<br>   - Trainee Hunter
#. column 3: Sudden Swoop
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:577:0:4"
msgid "Delivers 5% damage to the nearest enemy Arcana Stone."
msgstr "Наносит ближайшему вражескому арканному камню урон в размере 5% прочности."

#. ja: ミニオン「柔らかそうな海獣」を呼び出す。<br>幻影によって紡がれた海獣の幼体。珊瑚の森を思わせるような体色と、ぷにぷにの肌を持つ
#. de: Du rufst dein entspannendes Meeresbiest als Begleiter herbei. Ein Blick genügt, und friedvolle Entspannung macht sich in den Herzen aller Bewunderer dieses Wesens breit.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte lamantin prismatique, une reproduction illusoire de l'immense créature marine.
#. column 1: Born of an arcane pattern in an illuminated manuscript, this entity assumes the likeness of the young of a sea creature native to the Corvosi coastline. The pastel hues of its iridescent skin allow it to blend in with the coral reefs it calls home, and it is believed to be kin to mermaids.
#. column 2: Pshhh... Your seabeast<br>sssteed awaits!<br>   - Novv
#. column 3: Soothing Strike
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:578:0:0"
msgid "Summon your soothing sea-beast minion. To simply behold its pleasing form is to be soothed to the soul."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Умиротворяющий морской зверёк». Стоит взглянуть на его прелестную мордашку — и на душе сразу станет спокойно."

#. ja: 装飾写本の魔紋から生じた幻影。コルヴォ地方の沿岸部に棲息する大型海獣の幼体を模したもので、その体表は珊瑚礁に溶け込むような淡い色合いをしている。当地では、この種の海獣は人魚の眷属と考えられているという
#. de: Dieses zärtliche Wesen ist einem Äthergramm entsprungen und hat die Form einer Meereskreatur angenommen, welche für gewöhnlich in den Küstengebieten Corvos anzutreffen ist. Seine pastellfarbene Haut lässt es mit den Korallenriffen, die es beheimatet, förmlich eins werden. Manche munkeln sogar, es wäre mit den Meerjungfrauen auf irgendeine Art und Weise verwandt.
#. fr: Cette placide créature est née de la magie d'un ouvrage ancien de la région de Corvos. Les légendes racontent que cette espèce aux couleurs arc-en-ciel était au service des sirènes.
#. column 0: Summon your soothing sea-beast minion. To simply behold its pleasing form is to be soothed to the soul.
#. column 2: Pshhh... Your seabeast<br>sssteed awaits!<br>   - Novv
#. column 3: Soothing Strike
#. column 4: Reduces ATK of all enemies within range by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:578:0:1"
msgid "Born of an arcane pattern in an illuminated manuscript, this entity assumes the likeness of the young of a sea creature native to the Corvosi coastline. The pastel hues of its iridescent skin allow it to blend in with the coral reefs it calls home, and it is believed to be kin to mermaids."
msgstr "Это существо возникло из магического узора в иллюстрированной рукописи. Оно похоже на детёныша крупного морского зверя, обитающего у берегов Корвоса. Пастельные переливы его кожи помогают ему сливаться с коралловыми рифами. Местные считают, что такие звери состоят в родстве с русалками."

