#. ja: ミニオン「オートマトン・ブルーバイキング」を呼び出す。<br>演習用のバイキング型魔法人形。かつては赤くて凶暴だった
#. de: Du rufst deine blaue Wikinger-Marionette als Begleiter herbei. War früher rot und gefährlich.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte automate viking bleu, un pantin mécanique autrefois rouge et agressif.
#. column 1: This automaton was deployed in Astragalos campaigns until it was inevitably incapacitated by adventurers. While such units are often damaged beyond repair, this example proved salvageable, and it was repurposed as an escort. Formerly red and vicious, it is now possessed of a calm temperament.
#. column 2: I borrowed this arena viking for<br>you to demonstrate a few spells.<br>   - Martyn
#. column 3: Axe Swing
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:580:0:0"
msgid "Summon your little blue viking minion. Formerly red and vicious."
msgstr "Призвать синего викинга. Раньше он был красным и свирепым."

#. ja: アストラガロスの演習場で用いられた青き魔法人形。近接戦闘用ともなれば損傷することも多いが、この個体は修理が可能であったため、随行員用として新たに活動を開始した。かつては凶暴だったが、今では落ち着いている
#. de: Ein Garlond-Modellbauer fertigte dieses Modell nach dem Vorbild einer roten Kampfmarionette an, die auf dem Trainingsgelände Astragalos zum Einsatz gekommen ist, bis sie kampfunfähig gemacht wurde. Normalerweise hätte dies das Ende für sie bedeutet, doch dieses spezielle Exemplar konnte repariert werden. Wo einst lodernder Kampfgeist im roten Gewand schlummerte, herrschen nun Ruhe und Zufriedenheit.
#. fr: L'un des automates vikings déployés durant les manœuvres militaires d'Astragalos. Parmi tous ceux qui ont été malmenés par des aventuriers, celui-ci était réparable et a donc été converti en assistant personnel. Sa couleur et son caractère ont été modifiés à cette occasion, passant respectivement de rouge à bleu, et d'agressif à calme.
#. column 0: Summon your little blue viking minion. Formerly red and vicious.
#. column 2: I borrowed this arena viking for<br>you to demonstrate a few spells.<br>   - Martyn
#. column 3: Axe Swing
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:580:0:1"
msgid "This automaton was deployed in Astragalos campaigns until it was inevitably incapacitated by adventurers. While such units are often damaged beyond repair, this example proved salvageable, and it was repurposed as an escort. Formerly red and vicious, it is now possessed of a calm temperament."
msgstr "Этот автоматон использовали на учениях в Астрагалосе, пока его не вывели из строя искатели приключений. Обычно такие машины уже не починить, но этот экземпляр удалось восстановить и превратить в сопровождающего. Раньше он был красным и свирепым, а теперь стал спокойным."

#. ja: バ～イバイキングッ！
#. de: Daher habe ich mir diesen Arena-Wikinger geliehen, damit du an ihm ein paar Zauber vorführen kannst.<br><i>Martyn</i>
#. fr: Grut<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your little blue viking minion. Formerly red and vicious.
#. column 1: This automaton was deployed in Astragalos campaigns until it was inevitably incapacitated by adventurers. While such units are often damaged beyond repair, this example proved salvageable, and it was repurposed as an escort. Formerly red and vicious, it is now possessed of a calm temperament.
#. column 3: Axe Swing
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:580:0:2"
msgid "I borrowed this arena viking for<br>you to demonstrate a few spells.<br>   - Martyn"
msgstr "Я одолжил этого аренного викинга,<br>чтобы ты показал на нём пару заклинаний.<br>   — Мартин"

#. ja: 斧の斬撃
#. de: Axthieb
#. fr: Coup de hache
#. column 0: Summon your little blue viking minion. Formerly red and vicious.
#. column 1: This automaton was deployed in Astragalos campaigns until it was inevitably incapacitated by adventurers. While such units are often damaged beyond repair, this example proved salvageable, and it was repurposed as an escort. Formerly red and vicious, it is now possessed of a calm temperament.
#. column 2: I borrowed this arena viking for<br>you to demonstrate a few spells.<br>   - Martyn
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:580:0:3"
msgid "Axe Swing"
msgstr "Взмах топором"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK30のダメージを与えノックバックさせる。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 30 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus und schleudert sie zurück.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 30 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet et les projette en arrière.
#. column 0: Summon your little blue viking minion. Formerly red and vicious.
#. column 1: This automaton was deployed in Astragalos campaigns until it was inevitably incapacitated by adventurers. While such units are often damaged beyond repair, this example proved salvageable, and it was repurposed as an escort. Formerly red and vicious, it is now possessed of a calm temperament.
#. column 2: I borrowed this arena viking for<br>you to demonstrate a few spells.<br>   - Martyn
#. column 3: Axe Swing
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:580:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 30 and knocks back all enemies within range."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 30 и отбрасывает их."

#. ja: ミニオン「オートマトン・レッドバイキング」を呼び出す。<br>演習用のバイキング型魔法人形。かつては青くて冷徹だった
#. de: Du rufst deine rote Wikinger-Marionette als Begleiter herbei. War früher blau und kaltherzig.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte automate viking rouge, un pantin mécanique autrefois bleu et impitoyable.
#. column 1: This automaton was deployed in Astragalos campaigns until it was inevitably incapacitated by adventurers. While such units are often damaged beyond repair, this example proved salvageable, and it was repurposed as an escort. Formerly blue and ruthless, it is now possessed of a gentle temperament.
