#. ja: ミニオン「ジンベェ」を呼び出す。<br>温暖な海域に棲息するジンベエザメの幼魚。おとなしくてのんびり
#. de: Du rufst Jinbei Jr. als Begleiter herbei. Ein kleiner Walhai, der friedfreudiger nicht sein könnte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte jinbei, un petit requin-baleine vivant dans les mers chaudes.
#. column 1: In the Far East, whale sharks are known as jinbei-zame on account of their markings, which resemble those typically seen on the jinbei, a traditional summer garment. This young creature is exceptionally placid by nature, and has taken to following you in hopes of being led to new waters.
#. column 2: The Navigator waits for<br>no man─or shark!<br>   - Foerzagyl
#. column 3: Deep Suction
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:582:0:0"
msgid "Summon your junior jinbei minion. A baby whale shark by any other name would be just as calm and carefree."
msgstr "Призвать юного джинбэя. Как ни назови детёныша китовой акулы, он всё равно будет таким же спокойным и беззаботным."

#. ja: 濃い灰色の背面に白色の斑点を持ち、ひんがしの国の民俗衣装に似るとして東方の船乗りたちより呼び名がつけられた鮫の幼体。極めて温厚な性格で、まだ見ぬ海へ導いてくれそうな漁師を見込み、後を追うことにしたようだ
#. de: Im Fernen Osten sind Walhaie aufgrund ihrer Muster unter dem Namen „Jinbei-Zame“ bekannt, welche an die traditionellen „Jinbei“-Kleider erinnern, die von den Leuten an heißen Sommertagen getragen werden. In der Hoffnung, an deiner Seite neue Ufer zu erreichen, begleitet dich dieses Jungtier nun auf Schritt und Tritt.
#. fr: Avec sa peau gris foncé constellée de taches blanches, ce requineau n'est pas sans rappeler le <i>jinbei</i>, un habit traditionnel hingashien, d'où son appellation. Pas méchant pour un sou, il se plaît à suivre les pêcheurs dont il espère qu'ils le mèneront vers des mers inconnues.
#. column 0: Summon your junior jinbei minion. A baby whale shark by any other name would be just as calm and carefree.
#. column 2: The Navigator waits for<br>no man─or shark!<br>   - Foerzagyl
#. column 3: Deep Suction
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:582:0:1"
msgid "In the Far East, whale sharks are known as jinbei-zame on account of their markings, which resemble those typically seen on the jinbei, a traditional summer garment. This young creature is exceptionally placid by nature, and has taken to following you in hopes of being led to new waters."
msgstr "На Дальнем Востоке китовых акул называют джинбэи-дзамэ из-за пятен на их спине, напоминающих узор традиционной летней одежды джинбэй. Этот детёныш необычайно миролюбив и увязался за вами, надеясь, что вы приведёте его в незнакомые воды."

#. ja: ベェ～？
#. de: Haaach, es gibt nichts Schöneres als die kühle Gischt an einem heißen Sommertag!<br><i>Ethelia</i>
#. fr: Doo, doo, doo doo...
#. column 0: Summon your junior jinbei minion. A baby whale shark by any other name would be just as calm and carefree.
#. column 1: In the Far East, whale sharks are known as jinbei-zame on account of their markings, which resemble those typically seen on the jinbei, a traditional summer garment. This young creature is exceptionally placid by nature, and has taken to following you in hopes of being led to new waters.
#. column 3: Deep Suction
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:582:0:2"
msgid "The Navigator waits for<br>no man─or shark!<br>   - Foerzagyl"
msgstr "Мореплавательница не станет<br>ждать ни человека, ни акулу!<br>   — Фоэрзагил"

#. ja: 吸い込み口
#. de: Tiefsog
#. fr: Grande gueule
#. column 0: Summon your junior jinbei minion. A baby whale shark by any other name would be just as calm and carefree.
#. column 1: In the Far East, whale sharks are known as jinbei-zame on account of their markings, which resemble those typically seen on the jinbei, a traditional summer garment. This young creature is exceptionally placid by nature, and has taken to following you in hopes of being led to new waters.
#. column 2: The Navigator waits for<br>no man─or shark!<br>   - Foerzagyl
#. column 4: Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:582:0:3"
msgid "Deep Suction"
msgstr "Глубокое всасывание"

#. ja: 最も近い敵軍のゲートに90%のダメージを与える。すでに破壊されている場合は効果はない。
#. de: Fügt dem nächstgelegenen gegnerischen Tor 90<nbsp>% Schaden zu. Kein Effekt, falls es schon zerstört ist.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à 90% de sa solidité au portail ennemi le plus proche. N'a aucun effet si ce dernier est déjà détruit.
#. column 0: Summon your junior jinbei minion. A baby whale shark by any other name would be just as calm and carefree.
#. column 1: In the Far East, whale sharks are known as jinbei-zame on account of their markings, which resemble those typically seen on the jinbei, a traditional summer garment. This young creature is exceptionally placid by nature, and has taken to following you in hopes of being led to new waters.
#. column 2: The Navigator waits for<br>no man─or shark!<br>   - Foerzagyl
#. column 3: Deep Suction
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:582:0:4"
msgid "Reduces HP of closest enemy Gate by 90%. No effect if Gate is already inoperable."
msgstr "Снижает прочность ближайших вражеских ворот на 90%. Не действует, если ворота уже разрушены."

#. ja: ミニオン「ホイットローダー」を呼び出す。<br>ホイールローダーを模した小型玩具。多少のものはほいっと運搬できる
#. de: Du rufst deinen Sternchenebner als Begleiter herbei. Ein Kraftpaket auf kleinem Fahrwerk.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte mini-déblayeuse cosmique, un engin de chantier miniature doté d'un godet articulé.
#. column 1: This meticulously handcrafted toy is inspired by the warp loader developed for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. Like the popular model suit, it was produced by the engineers of Garlond Ironworks, and is intended to form part of a collectable series of interstellar construction vehicles.
#. column 2: These spongoi don't stand a chance<br>against a warp loader going full throttle!<br>   - Cosmic Exploration Initiative Member
#. column 3: Bulk Hauling
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:583:0:0"
msgid "Summon your lite-loader minion. Can move huge loads, a little at a time."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Мини-погрузчик». За раз может перевезти лишь немного, зато груз ему по плечу любой."

#. ja: ホイールローダーを模した小型玩具。コスモエクスプローラー計画で開発された前方バケットのついたトラクターを、ガーロンド社が合金玩具化した。その他の重機類と合わせ、宇宙の働くメカたちとしてシリーズ化が狙われている
#. de: Diese unglaublich detaillierte Spielzeug-Version des kräftigen Sternenebners aus den Mecha-Einsätzen der Kosmo-Erkundung stammt genau wie der Zwergsternenläufer aus der Schmiede eines gewissen Garlond-Modellbauers. In der Hoffnung, weitere produzieren zu können, soll der Ebner zusammen mit den anderen bisher erschienenen Modellen nun zum Teil einer ganzen Serie an Miniatur-Mechas gemacht werden.
#. fr: Fabriqué par les Forges de Garlond, ce petit véhicule en métal est une reproduction fidèle des déblayeuses utilisées dans le cadre du projet d'exploration cosmique. L'entreprise a prévu de miniaturiser d'autres engins de chantier spatiaux, et de lancer une série de jouets à col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>ner.
#. column 0: Summon your lite-loader minion. Can move huge loads, a little at a time.
#. column 2: These spongoi don't stand a chance<br>against a warp loader going full throttle!<br>   - Cosmic Exploration Initiative Member
#. column 3: Bulk Hauling
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:583:0:1"
msgid "This meticulously handcrafted toy is inspired by the warp loader developed for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. Like the popular model suit, it was produced by the engineers of Garlond Ironworks, and is intended to form part of a collectable series of interstellar construction vehicles."
msgstr "Эта тщательно изготовленная игрушка создана по образцу гравитационного погрузчика, разработанного для проекта космических исследований. Как и популярный модельный костюм, её сделали инженеры «Гарлондских мастерских». Игрушка должна войти в коллекционную серию межзвёздной строительной техники."

#. ja: ホイットナ
#. de: Die Sternenebner sind der reinste Wahnsinn!<br><i>Projektteilnehmer</i>
#. fr: Pouet pouet<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your lite-loader minion. Can move huge loads, a little at a time.
#. column 1: This meticulously handcrafted toy is inspired by the warp loader developed for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. Like the popular model suit, it was produced by the engineers of Garlond Ironworks, and is intended to form part of a collectable series of interstellar construction vehicles.
#. column 3: Bulk Hauling
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:583:0:2"
msgid "These spongoi don't stand a chance<br>against a warp loader going full throttle!<br>   - Cosmic Exploration Initiative Member"
msgstr "Этим губкам не устоять,<br>если погрузчик даст полный газ!<br>   — Участник проекта космических исследований"

#. ja: 大量運搬
#. de: Transport im Bulk
#. fr: Gros chargement
#. column 0: Summon your lite-loader minion. Can move huge loads, a little at a time.
#. column 1: This meticulously handcrafted toy is inspired by the warp loader developed for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. Like the popular model suit, it was produced by the engineers of Garlond Ironworks, and is intended to form part of a collectable series of interstellar construction vehicles.
#. column 2: These spongoi don't stand a chance<br>against a warp loader going full throttle!<br>   - Cosmic Exploration Initiative Member
#. column 4: Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:583:0:3"
msgid "Bulk Hauling"
msgstr "Перевозка грузов"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATK300のダメージを与える。ただし、特殊技ポイントを使用したミニオンは強制帰還する。
#. de: Führt eine Attacke mit Attacke-Wert 300 auf die Gegner in der Nähe aus, aber die ausführenden Trabanten werden weggeschickt.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts d'attaque 300 aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet. Les mascottes qui ont utilisé des PdT sont au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment renvoyées.
#. column 0: Summon your lite-loader minion. Can move huge loads, a little at a time.
#. column 1: This meticulously handcrafted toy is inspired by the warp loader developed for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. Like the popular model suit, it was produced by the engineers of Garlond Ironworks, and is intended to form part of a collectable series of interstellar construction vehicles.
#. column 2: These spongoi don't stand a chance<br>against a warp loader going full throttle!<br>   - Cosmic Exploration Initiative Member
#. column 3: Bulk Hauling
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:583:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 300 to all enemies within range. The action party is immediately withdrawn from the playing field after execution."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 300. После применения отряд прислужников немедленно покидает поле боя."

#. ja: ミニオン「カプリーヌ」を呼び出す。<br>首にベルをつけたヤギの幼体。帝都ガレマルド付近で多く飼育される
#. de: Du rufst Caprino als Begleiter herbei. So niedlich, man kann ihm gar nicht böse sein.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte caprin, un chevreau tel qu'on en trouve dans les élevages autour de Garlemald.
#. column 1: Originating from the region of Corvos, this variety of goat spread north alongside Garlean migration, and products made with its milk were once common in the imperial capital. This young creature appears to have lost its master in the chaos of civil war, and it now looks to you to protect and pamper it.
#. column 2: The cranky old goat<br>will have my hide.<br>   - Theopauldin
#. column 3: Munch
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:584:0:0"
msgid "Summon your caprino minion. So adorable you'll let it get away with anything."
msgstr "Призвать козлёнка. Такой милашка — ему всё сойдёт с рук."

#. ja: ヤギの幼体。この種の家畜はコルヴォ地方の原産だが、ガレアン族の移動と共に北方にも広まり、かつての帝都ではヤギ乳を用いた乳製品も流通していた。内戦の混乱で飼い主を喪ったらしく、冒険者に保護を求めているようだ
#. de: Diese Ziegenart stammt ursprünglich aus Corvos, verbreitete sich mit der garleischen Umsiedlung aber schließlich weiter nördlich, woraufhin ihre Milch zu einem alltäglichen Nahrungsmittel für die Bewohner der Kaiserstadt wurde. Das Jungtier scheint sein Herrchen in den Wirren des Bürgerkrieges verloren zu haben und sehnt sich nun nach Schutz und Fürsorge.
#. fr: Originaire de la région de Corvos, cette race de chevreau s'est peu à peu répandue au nord, accompagnant les migrations des Garlemaldais. Les produits à base de lait de chèvre se sont ensuite démocratisés dans tout l'Empire. Ce pauvre petit a quant à lui perdu son berger durant la guerre civile, et compte désormais sur vous pour assurer sa protection.
#. column 0: Summon your caprino minion. So adorable you'll let it get away with anything.
#. column 2: The cranky old goat<br>will have my hide.<br>   - Theopauldin
#. column 3: Munch
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:584:0:1"
msgid "Originating from the region of Corvos, this variety of goat spread north alongside Garlean migration, and products made with its milk were once common in the imperial capital. This young creature appears to have lost its master in the chaos of civil war, and it now looks to you to protect and pamper it."
msgstr "Эта порода коз родом из Корвоса, но вместе с гарлеанцами распространилась на север. Когда-то в имперской столице было принято пить козье молоко и есть продукты из него. Похоже, в суматохе гражданской войны козлёнок потерял хозяина и теперь просит искателей приключений о защите и заботе."

#. ja: メェ～
#. de: Statt dreißig Pferden würde ich euch auch fünfzig Ziegen schenken.<br><i>Luvsan</i>
#. fr: Bêêêh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your caprino minion. So adorable you'll let it get away with anything.
#. column 1: Originating from the region of Corvos, this variety of goat spread north alongside Garlean migration, and products made with its milk were once common in the imperial capital. This young creature appears to have lost its master in the chaos of civil war, and it now looks to you to protect and pamper it.
#. column 3: Munch
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:584:0:2"
msgid "The cranky old goat<br>will have my hide.<br>   - Theopauldin"
msgstr "Сварливый старый козёл<br>мне ещё шкуру спустит.<br>   — Теопольден"

#. ja: むしゃむしゃ
#. de: Kauer
#. fr: Broutement
#. column 0: Summon your caprino minion. So adorable you'll let it get away with anything.
#. column 1: Originating from the region of Corvos, this variety of goat spread north alongside Garlean migration, and products made with its milk were once common in the imperial capital. This young creature appears to have lost its master in the chaos of civil war, and it now looks to you to protect and pamper it.
#. column 2: The cranky old goat<br>will have my hide.<br>   - Theopauldin
#. column 4: Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:584:0:3"
msgid "Munch"
msgstr "Жевание"

#. ja: 範囲内にいる敵に、ATKの5倍のダメージを与える。
#. de: Fügt Gegnern in der Nähe Schaden in 5-facher Höhe des Attacke-Werts zu.
#. fr: Inflige des dégâts équivalents à cinq fois l'attaque aux ennemis dans l'aire d'effet.
#. column 0: Summon your caprino minion. So adorable you'll let it get away with anything.
#. column 1: Originating from the region of Corvos, this variety of goat spread north alongside Garlean migration, and products made with its milk were once common in the imperial capital. This young creature appears to have lost its master in the chaos of civil war, and it now looks to you to protect and pamper it.
#. column 2: The cranky old goat<br>will have my hide.<br>   - Theopauldin
#. column 3: Munch
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:584:0:4"
msgid "Delivers an attack 5 times the potency of the caster's ATK."
msgstr "Наносит всем врагам в радиусе действия урон, равный пятикратной АТК."

#. ja: ミニオン「すべてをしおるもの」を呼び出す。<br>インデックスより生まれ出でた存在
#. de: Du rufst Register den Belesenen als Begleiter herbei. Er weiß genau, bis wohin du dein letztes Buch gelesen hast.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Naindex, un familier né d'Index.
#. column 1: This diminutive, bearded entity was born of the Index, master of the Occult Crescent and self-proclaimed knower of all things. A loyal familiar to those it chooses to serve, it excels at keeping track of one's reading progress in a book, but a lack of depth in its knowledge makes it useful for little else.
#. column 2: My uncle knows everything. So I do too!<br>   - Boisterous Boy
#. column 3: Wild Guess
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:585:0:0"
msgid "Summon your tiny omniscient minion. Knows a tiny little bit about all things."
msgstr "Призвать крошечного всезнайку. Он знает понемногу обо всём на свете."

#. ja: 三日月島の主こと、すべてを知るものインデックスより生まれ出でた存在。主人と認めた者に忠実な使い魔であり、読みかけの本をどこまで読んだのかを正確に記憶してくれる。ただし、それ以外のことは何も知らない
#. de: Dieses kleine Familiar wurde eigens von Index dem Allwissenden, dem Herrn von Kreszentia, erschaffen. Jenen, die es als seine Meister anerkennt, dient es mit Hingabe und Loyalität. Es kann sich auf den Buchstaben genau merken, bis wohin man ein Buch zuletzt gelesen hat, weiß darüber hinaus aber nichts.
#. fr: Né d'Index, le très omniscient maître de l'île de Lunule, ce familier a accepté de vous servir avec fidélité. Tel un marque-page vivant, il est capable de retenir exactement où vous en êtes dans la lecture de vos livres. Toutefois, c'est là son seul et unique talent.
#. column 0: Summon your tiny omniscient minion. Knows a tiny little bit about all things.
#. column 2: My uncle knows everything. So I do too!<br>   - Boisterous Boy
#. column 3: Wild Guess
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:585:0:1"
msgid "This diminutive, bearded entity was born of the Index, master of the Occult Crescent and self-proclaimed knower of all things. A loyal familiar to those it chooses to serve, it excels at keeping track of one's reading progress in a book, but a lack of depth in its knowledge makes it useful for little else."
msgstr "Это маленькое бородатое существо родилось из Индекса, хозяина Оккультного полумесяца и самопровозглашённого знатока всего на свете. Верный фамильяр тех, кому решит служить, он прекрасно помнит, на какой странице вы остановились. Но в остальном его познания весьма поверхностны, и толку от него немного."

#. ja: ココカラジャヨ…
#. de: Wer Wissen einzusperren gedenkt, ist ihm nicht würdig.<br><i>Index</i>
#. fr: Ici, tout commence...
#. column 0: Summon your tiny omniscient minion. Knows a tiny little bit about all things.
#. column 1: This diminutive, bearded entity was born of the Index, master of the Occult Crescent and self-proclaimed knower of all things. A loyal familiar to those it chooses to serve, it excels at keeping track of one's reading progress in a book, but a lack of depth in its knowledge makes it useful for little else.
#. column 3: Wild Guess
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 180 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:585:0:2"
msgid "My uncle knows everything. So I do too!<br>   - Boisterous Boy"
msgstr "Мой дядя всё знает. Значит, и я тоже!<br>   — Шумный мальчишка"

#. ja: あてずっぽう
#. de: Mutmaßung
#. fr: Au hasard
#. column 0: Summon your tiny omniscient minion. Knows a tiny little bit about all things.
#. column 1: This diminutive, bearded entity was born of the Index, master of the Occult Crescent and self-proclaimed knower of all things. A loyal familiar to those it chooses to serve, it excels at keeping track of one's reading progress in a book, but a lack of depth in its knowledge makes it useful for little else.
