#. ja: ミニオン「ピューニィメイジ」を呼び出す。<br>魔大戦末期に造られた超小型魔道士型ゴーレム
#. de: Du rufst deinen mickrigen Magier als Begleiter herbei. Kann zwar nicht zaubern, sorgt mit seiner Niedlichkeit aber immer für gute Laune.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte p'tit mage, un golem miniature fabriqué vers la fin de la Guerre de la magie.
#. column 1: The puny mage was created with the goal of further miniaturizing a spellcasting mammet developed in the nation of Mhach during the twilight of the War of the Magi. While looking the part, its diminutive core means it cannot channel sufficient aether to wield magicks, and it ended up as simply a toy.
#. column 2: Did the captain receive a blow<br>to the head while we were in Mhach?<br>   - Cait Sith
#. column 3: Crescent Cure
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:586:0:0"
msgid "Summon your puny mage minion. If you think it weak...you would be right."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Крошечный маг». Считаешь его слабым? Так и есть."

#. ja: 魔法国家マハにて開発された小型魔道士型ゴーレムを、さらに小型化する目的で製造された個体。ただし、心核まで小型化したため十分な魔力が放てず、魔法の行使が不可能になってしまった。結果、愛玩用となったらしい
#. de: Dieser Golem entsprang Experimenten der magischen Stadt Mhach, bei denen die Körper der dort entwickelten winzigen Magier auf ein Minimum reduziert werden sollten. Da sein Kern ebenfalls deutlich kleiner angefertigt werden musste, war in diesem schlussendlich keinerlei Platz für Magie. Auch ohne magische Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten erfreuten sich diese Exemplare aufgrund ihrer Niedlichkeit jedoch großer Beliebtheit.
#. fr: Ce pantin a été mis au point par des ingénieurs mhachois dans une tentative de réduire encore davantage la taille des golems mages existants. Hélas, son noyau a été tellement miniaturisé qu'il en devient incapable d'utiliser la magie – ce qui le rend par<shy>fai<shy>te<shy>ment inutile, sauf en tant que porte-bonheur.
#. column 0: Summon your puny mage minion. If you think it weak...you would be right.
#. column 2: Did the captain receive a blow<br>to the head while we were in Mhach?<br>   - Cait Sith
#. column 3: Crescent Cure
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:586:0:1"
msgid "The puny mage was created with the goal of further miniaturizing a spellcasting mammet developed in the nation of Mhach during the twilight of the War of the Magi. While looking the part, its diminutive core means it cannot channel sufficient aether to wield magicks, and it ended up as simply a toy."
msgstr "Этот крошечный маг — попытка ещё сильнее уменьшить магического маммета, созданного в Мхаче на закате Войны магов. Выглядит он как настоящий чародей, но ядро у него слишком мало, чтобы проводить достаточно эфира для сотворения заклинаний. В итоге из него вышла просто игрушка."

#. ja: ぴゅいん！
#. de: AlL mEinE kRaFt In MeTeO!<br><i>Winziger Magier</i>
#. fr: Abracad'bra<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your puny mage minion. If you think it weak...you would be right.
#. column 1: The puny mage was created with the goal of further miniaturizing a spellcasting mammet developed in the nation of Mhach during the twilight of the War of the Magi. While looking the part, its diminutive core means it cannot channel sufficient aether to wield magicks, and it ended up as simply a toy.
#. column 3: Crescent Cure
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:586:0:2"
msgid "Did the captain receive a blow<br>to the head while we were in Mhach?<br>   - Cait Sith"
msgstr "Капитану что, по голове<br>стукнули, пока мы были в Мхаче?<br>   — Кейт Сит"

#. ja: 三日月の癒やし
#. de: Heilender Halbmond
#. fr: Soin de Lunule
#. column 0: Summon your puny mage minion. If you think it weak...you would be right.
#. column 1: The puny mage was created with the goal of further miniaturizing a spellcasting mammet developed in the nation of Mhach during the twilight of the War of the Magi. While looking the part, its diminutive core means it cannot channel sufficient aether to wield magicks, and it ended up as simply a toy.
#. column 2: Did the captain receive a blow<br>to the head while we were in Mhach?<br>   - Cait Sith
#. column 4: Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range.
