msgid "Removes all detrimental effects from all allies within range."
msgstr "Снимает все отрицательные эффекты с союзников в радиусе действия."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・ウクラマト」を呼び出す。<br>トライヨラ連王国の王女、ウクラマトを模した魔法人形。お前、アタシとトライヨラまで来てくれ！
#. de: Du rufst deine Wuk Lamat-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Sie lässt dein Abenteurerherz zweifelsohne höherschlagen, nicht wahr?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Wuk Lamat miniature. “Viens avec moi à Tuliyollal<nbsp>!”
#. column 1: This automaton designed in the likeness of Wuk Lamat was commissioned by a certain member of the royal family to commemorate the anniversary of her father's ascension. When the celebrations were delayed due to the rite of succession, however, the units were exported to Eorzea instead.
#. column 2: There is no stopping the<br>Third Promise, is there?<br>   - Krile
#. column 3: Dawnlit Conviction
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:587:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Wuk Lamat minion. An adventurer like you could hardly resist, no?"
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Вук Ламат. Ну разве такой искатель приключений, как ты, устоит?"

#. ja: トライヨラ連王国の王女、ウクラマトを模した魔法人形。父王の即位記念行事に伴い、とある王族が職人に命じて作らせた品のようだが、継承の儀の開催が囁かれ頒布が延期されるうちエオルゼアへ輸出されたらしい
#. de: Diese drollige Puppe der einstmaligen Prinzessin wurde von einem gewissen Mitglied des Königshauses in Auftrag gegeben, um das Jubiläum der Thronbesteigung ihres Vaters zu feiern. Als jene Festivitäten aber aufgrund des Ritus der Thronfolge verschoben wurden, hat man diese Kreation heimlich, still und leise auf ein Schiff nach Eorzea gesetzt.
#. fr: Une poupée façonnée à l'effigie de Wuk Lamat, princesse du royaume fédéré de Tuliyollal. Commandée par un membre de la famille royale pour célébrer l'anniversaire d'intronisation de son père, elle devait être distribuée lors des festivités. Mais les rumeurs entourant le rite de succession ayant repoussé l'événement, les figurines ont finalement été exportées vers Éorzéa.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Wuk Lamat minion. An adventurer like you could hardly resist, no?
#. column 2: There is no stopping the<br>Third Promise, is there?<br>   - Krile
#. column 3: Dawnlit Conviction
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:587:0:1"
msgid "This automaton designed in the likeness of Wuk Lamat was commissioned by a certain member of the royal family to commemorate the anniversary of her father's ascension. When the celebrations were delayed due to the rite of succession, however, the units were exported to Eorzea instead."
msgstr "Этого автоматона создали по образу Вук Ламат. Кто-то из королевской семьи заказал его в честь годовщины восшествия на престол её отца. Но из-за обряда престолонаследия торжества отложили, и фигурки отправили на продажу в Эорзею."

#. ja: アンタヲ超エテミセル！
#. de: Ich musste mir einer Sache sicher sein: Ob ich dir mein Töchterchen wirklich überlassen kann.<br><i>Gulool Ja Ja</i>
#. fr: Je te surpasserai<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Wuk Lamat minion. An adventurer like you could hardly resist, no?
#. column 1: This automaton designed in the likeness of Wuk Lamat was commissioned by a certain member of the royal family to commemorate the anniversary of her father's ascension. When the celebrations were delayed due to the rite of succession, however, the units were exported to Eorzea instead.
#. column 3: Dawnlit Conviction
#. column 4: Doubles the amount of HP restored to allies stationed in Gates.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:587:0:2"
msgid "There is no stopping the<br>Third Promise, is there?<br>   - Krile"
msgstr "Третью наследницу<br>не остановить, да?<br>   — Крил"

#. ja: トラルの曙光
#. de: Wille der Morgensonne
#. fr: Aurore du Tural
