#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・プリッシュ」を呼び出す。<br>プリッシュの小さな似姿。人の想いは留まりゃしねぇ！！！
#. de: Du rufst deine Prishe-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Mach dich auf was gefasst!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Prishe miniature. Petite par la taille, grande par la vivacité.
#. column 1: This diminutive manifestation of Prishe arose from a fragment of electrope, which was left behind when her echo incarnation faded away. She had come to love this world as a second home, and this entity may well be the materialization of her desire to remain here.
#. column 2: Prishe has taken the lead, but<br>we won't be outdone, surely?<br>   - Alxaal
#. column 3: Dragon Kick
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:589:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Prishe minion. Ya ready for this?"
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Прис. Ну что, готов к делу?"

#. ja: プリッシュの小さな似姿。「エコーズの残滓」であったプリッシュが姿を消した際に遺ったエレクトロープの破片から生じた存在。彼女の心の中にあった、この世界で冒険を続けたいという願いが結実した姿なのかもしれない
#. de: Diese Manifestation von Prishe ist einem Elektrob-Fragment zu verdanken, welches zurückblieb, als ihr Echo verschwand. Durch ihr Abenteuer an deiner Seite hat sie diese Welt lieben gelernt. Wer weiß<nbsp>- vielleicht ist diese Manifestation ja ein Ausdruck eben dieser Liebe.
#. fr: Cette poupée magique est née d'un morceau d'électrope retrouvé après la disparition de l'Écho de Prishe. Elle incarne vraisemblablement la volonté de la jeune femme de continuer à vivre des aventures dans votre monde.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Prishe minion. Ya ready for this?
#. column 2: Prishe has taken the lead, but<br>we won't be outdone, surely?<br>   - Alxaal
#. column 3: Dragon Kick
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:589:0:1"
msgid "This diminutive manifestation of Prishe arose from a fragment of electrope, which was left behind when her echo incarnation faded away. She had come to love this world as a second home, and this entity may well be the materialization of her desire to remain here."
msgstr "Эта крошечная Прис появилась из осколка электропа, оставшегося после того, как исчезло её воплощение Эха. Она успела полюбить этот мир, словно второй дом, и, возможно, эта миниатюра воплотила её желание остаться здесь."

#. ja: ハラペコダゼ！
#. de: Oh, Prishe<nbsp>...<br><i>Alxaal</i>
#. fr: J'ai la daaalle<nbsp>!!!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Prishe minion. Ya ready for this?
#. column 1: This diminutive manifestation of Prishe arose from a fragment of electrope, which was left behind when her echo incarnation faded away. She had come to love this world as a second home, and this entity may well be the materialization of her desire to remain here.
#. column 3: Dragon Kick
#. column 4: Increases action party movement speed by 30%. <br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:589:0:2"
msgid "Prishe has taken the lead, but<br>we won't be outdone, surely?<br>   - Alxaal"
msgstr "Прише нас опередила, но<br>мы ведь не отстанем, правда?<br>   — Алхааль"

#. ja: 双竜脚
#. de: Drachentritt
#. fr: Tacle du dragon
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Prishe minion. Ya ready for this?
#. column 1: This diminutive manifestation of Prishe arose from a fragment of electrope, which was left behind when her echo incarnation faded away. She had come to love this world as a second home, and this entity may well be the materialization of her desire to remain here.
#. column 2: Prishe has taken the lead, but<br>we won't be outdone, surely?<br>   - Alxaal
