msgstr "Увеличивает скорость передвижения миниатюр, потративших очки особого приёма, на 30%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・コットル」を呼び出す。<br>コットル族を模した魔法人形
#. de: Du rufst deine Köttr-Puppe als Begleiter herbei. Ein Wollknäul mehr für das Abenteuer!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Köttr miniature. Le vent est son élément.
#. column 1: The catlike kettir are known for their mastery over wind magicks, but being as free-spirited as the winds they command, it can be a considerable trial to spur them to any sort of action. This being an automaton likeness, however, it should at least follow you obediently.
#. column 2: I am but an innocent traveler with<br>a fondness for our feline friends.<br>   - Feline Fanatic
#. column 3: Wisdom of the Wind
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:590:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up köttr minion. Because you can never have too many bipedal felines."
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру кёттр. Двуногих кошек много не бывает."

#. ja: コットル族を模した魔法人形。優れた風魔法の使い手として知られる彼らは、風のように自由な気風で知られており、言うことを聞かせるのは至難の業だという。だが、魔法人形であれば従順に付き従ってくれることだろう
#. de: Die katzenähnlichen Kettir sind für ihr Können auf dem Feld der Windmagien bekannt. Und ihre Eigensinnigkeit<nbsp>... So erfordert es einiges an Mühen, sie zu irgendetwas Produktivem zu bewegen. Aber sei dies, wie es ist, zumindest diese einfache Puppe sollte jeder deiner Anweisungen Folge leisten.
#. fr: Les Köttr sont connus pour leur excellente maîtrise de la magie de vent, mais aussi leur esprit très libertaire qui les rend souvent rétifs à toute demande... Heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, vous n'aurez pas besoin de convaincre cette poupée, puisqu'elle a décidé de vous accompagner de son plein gré.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up köttr minion. Because you can never have too many bipedal felines.
#. column 2: I am but an innocent traveler with<br>a fondness for our feline friends.<br>   - Feline Fanatic
#. column 3: Wisdom of the Wind
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:590:0:1"
msgid "The catlike kettir are known for their mastery over wind magicks, but being as free-spirited as the winds they command, it can be a considerable trial to spur them to any sort of action. This being an automaton likeness, however, it should at least follow you obediently."
msgstr "Кошачьи кёттр славятся мастерством в магии ветра. Но они свободны, как сам ветер, и заставить их хоть что-то сделать бывает непросто. Эта же кукла должна послушно следовать за тобой."

#. ja: ニャハハ！
#. de: Ich bin lediglich ein unschuldiger Reisender mit einer Vorliebe für unsere Katzenfreunde.<br><i>Katzenminister</i>
#. fr: Miahaha<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up köttr minion. Because you can never have too many bipedal felines.
#. column 1: The catlike kettir are known for their mastery over wind magicks, but being as free-spirited as the winds they command, it can be a considerable trial to spur them to any sort of action. This being an automaton likeness, however, it should at least follow you obediently.
#. column 3: Wisdom of the Wind
#. column 4: Sets a trap that, when triggered, delivers an attack with a potency of 260 to all enemies within range.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Activation Delay:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:590:0:2"
msgid "I am but an innocent traveler with<br>a fondness for our feline friends.<br>   - Feline Fanatic"
msgstr "Ня-ха-ха!<br>   — Фанат кошек"

#. ja: 風詠の知恵
#. de: Weisheit der Winde
#. fr: Fable de vent
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up köttr minion. Because you can never have too many bipedal felines.
#. column 1: The catlike kettir are known for their mastery over wind magicks, but being as free-spirited as the winds they command, it can be a considerable trial to spur them to any sort of action. This being an automaton likeness, however, it should at least follow you obediently.
