msgstr "Устанавливает ловушку. Через 10 секунд её можно активировать, и она нанесёт всем врагам в радиусе действия урон силой 260.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Задержка срабатывания:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10 сек."

#. ja: ミニオン「ナギュリィ・ジャーム」を呼び出す。<br>惑星アウクセシアの住人たちが遺した小型有機端末
#. de: Du rufst Nagy als Begleiter herbei. Ein mobiler Keimling der Nagylvi, durch den sein Volk die Welt erlebt, die du ihm zeigst.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Germylvi, un petit terminal végétal relié au peuple des Nagylvi.
#. column 1: This diminutive relic of the Nagylvi was brought forth by their knowledge construct, which had awakened with the reactivation of Auxesia's city systems. First introduced simply as a “terminal,” it was given its present name following consultation with Namingway, in the hope that it will see you through on your journeys.
#. column 2: Not only the “budvi,” but the forest,<br>the city...all of it is joined at the roots.<br>   - Mumukko
#. column 3: Whisper of the Trees
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:591:0:0"
msgid "Summon your budvi minion. A bud, buddy, and Nagylvi rolled into one."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Росточек». Росток, приятель и нагюльви — всё в одном."

#. ja: 惑星アウクセシアの都市システムを再稼働させたことで現れた小型端末。眠れるナギュルヴィの集合意識からは「芽」と呼称されたが、冒険者の旅路を見届けるべく、ネミングウェイと相談して新たな名を決めたようだ
#. de: Dieses Pflanzenwesen wurde dir von den Nagylvi als eine Art mobile Satelliteneinheit ihres Bewusstseins zur Seite gestellt, um Namingway und dich auf eurem Rundgang über Auxesia zu begleiten. Was euch zu Beginn noch als „Keimling“ vorgestellt wurde, wuchs euch schnell ans Herz, und so dauerte es nicht lange, bis Namingway einen passenden Spitznamen parat hatte: „Nagy“.
#. fr: Apparu à la suite de la réactivation du système central de la planète Auxesia, ce petit terminal végétal était à l'origine appelé “bourgeon” par la conscience collective des Nagylvi. Namingway lui a cependant offert un nom unique, afin d'en faire un compagnon de voyage à part entière.
#. column 0: Summon your budvi minion. A bud, buddy, and Nagylvi rolled into one.
#. column 2: Not only the “budvi,” but the forest,<br>the city...all of it is joined at the roots.<br>   - Mumukko
#. column 3: Whisper of the Trees
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:591:0:1"
msgid "This diminutive relic of the Nagylvi was brought forth by their knowledge construct, which had awakened with the reactivation of Auxesia's city systems. First introduced simply as a “terminal,” it was given its present name following consultation with Namingway, in the hope that it will see you through on your journeys."
msgstr "Этот крошечный артефакт нагюльви создало их хранилище знаний, пробудившееся после перезапуска городских систем Ауксезии. Сначала его просто называли «терминалом», но потом, посоветовавшись с Неймингвеем, дали ему нынешнее имя — пусть сопровождает тебя в странствиях."

#. ja: 樹幹ネットワークに接続中…
#. de: Dazu haben sie dir den Keimling zur Seite gestellt, der dich nun begleitet.<br><i>Mumukko</i>
#. fr: Connexion au réseau-tronc...
#. column 0: Summon your budvi minion. A bud, buddy, and Nagylvi rolled into one.
#. column 1: This diminutive relic of the Nagylvi was brought forth by their knowledge construct, which had awakened with the reactivation of Auxesia's city systems. First introduced simply as a “terminal,” it was given its present name following consultation with Namingway, in the hope that it will see you through on your journeys.
#. column 3: Whisper of the Trees
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:591:0:2"
msgid "Not only the “budvi,” but the forest,<br>the city...all of it is joined at the roots.<br>   - Mumukko"
msgstr "Не только «росточек», но и лес,<br>и город... всё связано корнями.<br>   — Мумукко"

#. ja: 樹木のざわめき
#. de: Flüstern der Bäume
#. fr: Tumulte sylvestre
#. column 0: Summon your budvi minion. A bud, buddy, and Nagylvi rolled into one.
#. column 1: This diminutive relic of the Nagylvi was brought forth by their knowledge construct, which had awakened with the reactivation of Auxesia's city systems. First introduced simply as a “terminal,” it was given its present name following consultation with Namingway, in the hope that it will see you through on your journeys.
#. column 2: Not only the “budvi,” but the forest,<br>the city...all of it is joined at the roots.<br>   - Mumukko
#. column 4: Changes action party auto-attacks to area of effect attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:591:0:3"
msgid "Whisper of the Trees"
msgstr "Шёпот деревьев"

