#. ja: ミニオン「マメット・バレット」を呼び出す。<br>古の英雄を模した魔法人形。途中下車はできねえぜ！
#. de: Du rufst deinen Aufzieh-Barret als Begleiter herbei, die Nachbildung eines legendären Helden. Manchmal ein wenig cholerisch, aber im Grunde ein netter Typ.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte Barret miniature. “Il n'y a aucun moyen de sauter de ce train en marche<nbsp>!”
#. column 1: Legends tell of a man who, driven by an unwavering sense of justice, led a resistance movement that sought to bring about lasting change in society. Despite being intimidating in appearance, he also possessed a kind-hearted side, and cherished his homeland and daughter above all else.
#. column 2: Watch the barrel, dodge the bullet.<br>   - Hardiboiled
#. column 3: Hammer Blow
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:592:0:0"
msgid "Summon your wind-up Barret minion. There ain't no gettin' offa this train we on!"
msgstr "Призвать заводную миниатюру Баррета. С этого поезда не соскочить!"

#. ja: 古の英雄「バレット」を模した魔法人形。非常に正義感が強い人物であり、社会に変革をもたらすため反抗勢力を率いて戦ったと伝えられている。また、故郷と娘を大切に思う心優しき一面も持ち合わせていたという
#. de: Eine Marionette, die einem legendären Helden aus einer weit entfernten Welt nachempfunden ist. Es heißt, dieser Held hatte einen extrem starken Ge<shy>rechtig<shy>keits<shy>sinn und setzte sich für die Umwelt ein. Sein bulliges Aussehen lässt anderes vermuten, aber angeblich war er ein herzensguter Kerl, dem seine Heimat und geliebte Tochter über alles gingen.
#. fr: Cette poupée représente un héros des temps anciens. Doué d'un grand sens de la justice, ce dernier aurait mené un groupuscule ré<shy>vo<shy>lu<shy>tion<shy>nai<shy>re dans une guerre visant à renverser l'ordre établi. On raconte également qu'il avait un côté tendre, perceptible à travers son attachement envers sa fille et son village natal.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Barret minion. There ain't no gettin' offa this train we on!
#. column 2: Watch the barrel, dodge the bullet.<br>   - Hardiboiled
#. column 3: Hammer Blow
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:592:0:1"
msgid "Legends tell of a man who, driven by an unwavering sense of justice, led a resistance movement that sought to bring about lasting change in society. Despite being intimidating in appearance, he also possessed a kind-hearted side, and cherished his homeland and daughter above all else."
msgstr "Легенды гласят, что этот человек, движимый непоколебимым чувством справедливости, возглавил сопротивление, добивавшееся глубоких перемен в обществе. Несмотря на грозную внешность, он был добрым сердцем и превыше всего ценил родину и дочь."

#. ja: オレハイクゼ！
#. de: Wenn man den Mündungswinkel im Auge behält, sollte man daraus die Flugbahn ablesen können.<br><i>Hildibrüh</i>
#. fr: Je pars, je pars, je suis parti<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Barret minion. There ain't no gettin' offa this train we on!
#. column 1: Legends tell of a man who, driven by an unwavering sense of justice, led a resistance movement that sought to bring about lasting change in society. Despite being intimidating in appearance, he also possessed a kind-hearted side, and cherished his homeland and daughter above all else.
#. column 3: Hammer Blow
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:592:0:2"
msgid "Watch the barrel, dodge the bullet.<br>   - Hardiboiled"
msgstr "Следи за стволом, уворачивайся от пули.<br>   — Хардивойлд"

#. ja: ハンマーブロウ
#. de: Hammerschlag
#. fr: Martelage
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Barret minion. There ain't no gettin' offa this train we on!
#. column 1: Legends tell of a man who, driven by an unwavering sense of justice, led a resistance movement that sought to bring about lasting change in society. Despite being intimidating in appearance, he also possessed a kind-hearted side, and cherished his homeland and daughter above all else.
#. column 2: Watch the barrel, dodge the bullet.<br>   - Hardiboiled
#. column 4: Disarms deployed enemy traps.
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:592:0:3"
msgid "Hammer Blow"
msgstr "Удар молотом"

#. ja: 敵が配置したトラップがある場合、解除する。
#. de: Entfernt eine vom Gegner aufgestellte Falle.
#. fr: Désamorce les pièges des ennemis.
#. column 0: Summon your wind-up Barret minion. There ain't no gettin' offa this train we on!
#. column 1: Legends tell of a man who, driven by an unwavering sense of justice, led a resistance movement that sought to bring about lasting change in society. Despite being intimidating in appearance, he also possessed a kind-hearted side, and cherished his homeland and daughter above all else.
#. column 2: Watch the barrel, dodge the bullet.<br>   - Hardiboiled
#. column 3: Hammer Blow
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:592:0:4"
msgid "Disarms deployed enemy traps."
msgstr "Обезвреживает установленные врагом ловушки."

#. ja: ミニオン「ニーム・オーロサパ」を呼び出す。<br>ニームで品種化された薄茶の小鳥。シナモンの色合い
#. de: Du rufst deinen Nym-Uolosapa als Begleiter herbei. Diese spezielle Art ist für ihr bräunliches Gefieder bekannt, das farblich an Zimt erinnert.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mascotte uolosapa de Nym, un petit oiseau couleur cannelle issu d'un élevage sélectif.
#. column 1: In ages past, the uolosapa was brought from the south sea isles to the nation of Nym, where it quickly gained popularity as a pet. During this time, an unusual specimen with light-brown markings arrived on a merchant vessel from Meracydia, and it became established as a distinct breed.
#. column 2: This soft, feathery vision!?<br>   - Growingway
#. column 3: Fluffy Down
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:593:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Nymian uolosapa minion. A winsome bird with cinnamon markings on a canvas of white."
msgstr "Призвать прислужника «Нимский уолосапа». Очаровательная птичка в белом оперении с коричными пятнышками."

#. ja: 薄茶色の羽毛が愛らしい小鳥。南洋諸島原産のオーロサパが愛玩鳥として流行した結果、ニームの地においても流行。メラシディアで生まれた珍しい羽毛の個体を海洋交易を通じて手に入れ、品種として固定化したものらしい
#. de: Uolosapa wurden ursprünglich von den Südinseln nach Nym gebracht, wo sie sich als Haustiere äußerster Beliebtheit erfreuten. Dabei gewann vor allem diese braungefiederte Art an Popularität, nachdem einige seltene Exemplare aus Meracydia durch den Handel ihren Weg über die Meere fanden.
#. fr: Originaires des îles méridionales, les uolosapas ont vu leur popularité dépasser les frontières de ces archipels pour s'étendre à travers le monde, notamment à Nym. Là-bas, des spécimens méracydiens au plumage atypique ont été importés par bateau, puis soigneusement élevés et sélectionnés afin de constituer une variété à part entière.
#. column 0: Summon your Nymian uolosapa minion. A winsome bird with cinnamon markings on a canvas of white.
#. column 2: This soft, feathery vision!?<br>   - Growingway
#. column 3: Fluffy Down
#. column 4: Increases ATK of all allies within range by 25.<br> <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s
msgctxt "CompanionTransient:593:0:1"
msgid "In ages past, the uolosapa was brought from the south sea isles to the nation of Nym, where it quickly gained popularity as a pet. During this time, an unusual specimen with light-brown markings arrived on a merchant vessel from Meracydia, and it became established as a distinct breed."
msgstr "В давние времена уолосапа завезли с островов Южного моря в Ним, где птица быстро стала популярным домашним любимцем. Однажды на торговом судне из Мерацидии прибыл необычный экземпляр со светло-коричневыми отметинами. От него и пошла отдельная порода."

